case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-1_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-1].judgeHint,이제 오피스텔 경비를 증인으로 불러 동선을 확정하실 수 있습니다.,You can now call the Officetel Security Guard as a witness to confirm the route.,これでオフィステル警備員を証人として呼び、動線を確定できます。,现在可以传唤韩式商住公寓保安作证，确认动线。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-1].label,dc-1 오피스텔의 사람들,dc-1 People at the Officetel,dc-1 オフィステルの人々,dc-1 韩式商住公寓里的人,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-1_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-1].noteText,오피스텔의 사람들,People at the Officetel,オフィステルの人々,韩式商住公寓里的人,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-1_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-1].summary,외도라는 첫 인상을 가족 쪽 사정으로 다시 보게 만드는 카드,A card that reframes the first impression of an affair as a Family Circumstances.,不倫という第一印象を、家族側の事情として見直させるカード。,这张卡会把“出轨”的第一印象重新导向家族方面的情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-2_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-2].judgeHint,이 감정 패턴을 이준호 씨에게 직접 추궁하시거나 발신자 미상 문자(e-4)를 제시하면 구체적 사연이 드러날 것입니다.,"Press Mr. Lee Jun-ho on this emotional pattern, or present the Text from Unknown Sender (e-4), and the details will emerge.",この感情パターンをイ・ジュノさんに直接追及するか、送信者不明のメッセージ（e-4）を提示すれば、具体的な事情が明らかになります。,直接追问李俊浩先生这种情绪模式，或出示未知发件人短信（e-4），具体缘由就会浮现。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-2].label,dc-2 시댁 얘기만 나오면 싸움,dc-2 Fights Whenever the In-Laws Come Up,dc-2 義実家の話になるたび争う,dc-2 一提婆家就争吵,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-2_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-2].noteText,시댁 얘기만 나오면 싸움,Fights Whenever the In-Laws Come Up,義実家の話になるたび争う,一提婆家就争吵,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-2_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-2].summary,B가 입을 닫게 만드는 두려움의 정체를 가늠하는 카드,A card that gauges the fear keeping B silent.,Bに口を閉ざさせている恐れの正体を見極めるカード。,这张卡用来判断让B闭口不言的恐惧究竟是什么。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-3_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-3].judgeHint,은행 직원을 증인으로 불러 공동 적금 해지 절차와 위임장 진위를 확인해 보십시오.,Call the Bank Clerk as a witness to verify the joint savings cancellation procedure and the power of attorney.,銀行職員を証人として呼び、共同積立預金の解約手続きと委任状の真偽を確認してください。,传唤银行职员作证，核实共同储蓄账户解约程序和委托书真伪。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-3_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-3].label,"dc-3 3,000만 원의 권한",dc-3 Authority over ₩30M,"dc-3 3,000万ウォンの権限",dc-3 3000万韩元的权限,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-3_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-3].noteText,"3,000만 원의 권한",Authority over ₩30M,"3,000万ウォンの権限",3000万韩元的权限,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-3_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-3].summary,"공동 적금 해지의 권한이 누구에게 있었는지, 위임장 처리가 정당했는지를 묻는 카드",A card asking who had authority to cancel the joint savings account and whether the power of attorney was handled properly.,共同積立預金を解約する権限が誰にあったのか、委任状の処理が正当だったのかを問うカード。,这张卡追问谁有权解约共同储蓄账户，以及委托书处理是否正当。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-4_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-4].judgeHint,"이제 이준호 씨 가족 쪽 상황을 직접 확인하거나, 동기 탐색으로 숨긴 이유를 물어볼 수 있습니다.","You can now check Mr. Lee Jun-ho's Family Circumstances directly, or use a motive probe to ask why he hid them.",これでイ・ジュノさんの家族側の事情を直接確認するか、動機探索で隠した理由を尋ねられます。,现在可以直接确认李俊浩先生家族方面的情况，或通过动机探查询问他隐瞒的原因。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-4_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-4].label,"dc-4 2,000만 원의 수치",dc-4 The ₩20M Issue,"dc-4 2,000万ウォンの問題",dc-4 2000万韩元的问题,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-4_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-4].noteText,"2,000만 원의 수치",The ₩20M Issue,"2,000万ウォンの問題",2000万韩元的问题,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-4_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-4].summary,"이준호 씨의 개인 자금이 어디로, 왜 빠져나갔는지 묻는 카드",A card asking where Mr. Lee Jun-ho's personal funds went and why.,イ・ジュノさんの個人資金がどこへ、なぜ流出したのかを問うカード。,这张卡追问李俊浩先生的个人资金流向何处、为何流出。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-5_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-5].judgeHint,박미라 증인이 투자방 가입 경로를 결정적으로 채워줄 것입니다.,Witness Park Mi-ra will decisively fill in how the investment chat was joined.,パク・ミラ証人が、投資チャットに入った経路を決定的に補ってくれるでしょう。,朴美罗证人会关键性地补上加入投资群的路径。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
