case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-5_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-5].summary,숨김의 시작과 실제 송금 실행을 분리하는 카드,A card separating the start of concealment from the actual transfer.,隠蔽の始まりと実際の送金実行を切り分けるカード。,这张卡用于区分隐瞒的开始与实际转账的执行。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-6_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-6].judgeHint,문자와 구매 품목이 같은 가족 쪽 정황을 가리킵니다. 누구와 관련된 일인지와 왜 숨겼는지를 따로 확인해야 합니다.,The text and purchased items point to the same Family Circumstances. Confirm separately who it involved and why it was hidden.,メッセージと購入品目は、同じ家族側の事情を指しています。誰に関わることなのか、なぜ隠したのかを別々に確認する必要があります。,短信和购买物品指向同一件家族方面的情况。需要分别确认与谁有关，以及为何隐瞒。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-6_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-6].label,dc-6 가족 쪽 정황,dc-6 Family Circumstances,dc-6 家族側の事情,dc-6 家族方面的情况,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-6_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-6].noteText,가족 쪽 정황,Family Circumstances,家族側の事情,家族方面的情况,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-6_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-6].summary,영수증의 참고서와 문자 속 학교 알림을 함께 보며 가족 쪽 정황을 분리하는 카드,A card that separates the Family Circumstances by reading the receipt's workbook together with the school notice in the texts.,レシートの参考書とメッセージ内の学校通知を合わせて見て、家族側の事情を切り分けるカード。,这张卡通过对照收据中的参考书和短信里的学校通知，分离出家族方面的情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-1_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-1].discoveryText,영수증 구매 위치와 블랙박스 정차 좌표가 일치한다. 오피스텔 근처에서만 구매한 패턴이 확정된다.,The receipt purchase locations match the dashcam stop coordinates. A pattern of buying only near the Officetel is confirmed.,レシートの購入場所とドライブレコーダーの停車座標が一致します。オフィステル付近でのみ購入していたパターンが確定します。,收据购买地点与行车记录仪停车坐标一致。只在韩式商住公寓附近购买的模式得到确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-2_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-2].discoveryText,영수증 묶음 속 중학교 참고서와 문자에 섞인 학교 알림이 가족 쪽 정황으로 맞물린다.,The middle-school workbook in the receipt bundle and the school notice mixed into the texts align as Family Circumstances.,レシートの束にある中学校の参考書と、メッセージに混ざった学校通知が、家族側の事情として噛み合います。,收据包里的中学参考书与短信中夹杂的学校通知相互吻合，指向家族方面的情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-3_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-3].discoveryText,새벽 통화와 큰돈 출금 기록이 같은 시간대에 겹칩니다. 돈의 이동처와 배우자에게 숨긴 이유를 직접 확인해야 합니다.,The early-morning call and large withdrawal records overlap in the same period. Confirm directly where the money went and why it was hidden from the spouse.,早朝の通話と高額出金記録が同じ時間帯に重なります。金の行き先と、配偶者に隠した理由を直接確認する必要があります。,凌晨通话与大额取款记录在同一时段重叠。需要直接确认钱去了哪里，以及为何瞒着配偶。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-4_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-4].discoveryText,공동 적금 해지액과 투자방 송금액이 정확히 일치한다. 빠져나간 돈의 행선지가 확정된다.,The joint savings cancellation amount exactly matches the transfer to the investment chat. The destination of the withdrawn money is confirmed.,共同積立預金の解約額と投資チャットへの送金額が正確に一致します。流出した金の行き先が確定します。,共同储蓄账户解约金额与投资群转账金额完全一致。流出资金的去向得到确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-5_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-5].discoveryText,박지연 씨의 '제 몫을 지키려 했다'는 말과 위임장 처리 정황이 같은 방향을 가리킨다. 공동 적금 해지가 우발이 아니라 자각된 행위였음이 드러난다.,"Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim that she ""tried to protect her share"" and the power-of-attorney handling point in the same direction. The joint savings cancellation was not accidental, but a deliberate act.",パク・ジヨンさんの「自分の分を守ろうとした」という言葉と委任状処理の状況は、同じ方向を指しています。共同積立預金の解約が偶発ではなく、自覚的な行為だったことが明らかになります。,朴智妍女士“想守住自己的那一份”的说法，与委托书处理情况指向同一方向。共同储蓄账户解约并非偶然，而是有意识的行为。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-6_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-6].discoveryText,가족 쪽 일이라는 해명이 문자 내용과 맞물립니다. 상대가 누구인지와 돌봄 범위를 직접 확인할 필요가 있습니다.,The explanation that it was a family matter aligns with the text messages. Confirm directly who the other person was and what care was provided.,家族側の用事だったという説明が、メッセージの内容と噛み合います。相手が誰なのか、世話の範囲がどこまでだったのかを直接確認する必要があります。,“家里的事”这一解释与短信内容吻合。需要直接确认对方是谁，以及照顾范围。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-7_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-7].discoveryText,"""가족 쪽 일""이라는 말과 ""제 몫을 지키려 했다""는 말을 나란히 놓으면, 서로에게 먼저 말하지 않은 이유가 겹친다.","Placed side by side, ""a family matter"" and ""I tried to protect my share"" reveal overlapping reasons for not telling each other first.",「家族側の用事」と「自分の分を守ろうとした」を並べると、互いに先に話さなかった理由が重なります。,把“家里的事”和“想守住自己的那一份”并排来看，双方没有先告诉对方的理由发生了重叠。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_context.caseName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,context.caseName,새벽 통화기록,Early-Morning Call Logs,早朝の通話記録,凌晨通话记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_context.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,context.description,매일 퇴근 후 같은 오피스텔에 들렀다 오는 남편. 차에서 발견된 여성용품 영수증. 새벽의 통화. 아내는 남편의 딴 살림을 확신한다.,A husband who stops at the same Officetel every day after work. Receipts for women's items found in his car. Calls in the early morning. His wife becomes convinced he has a secret household.,毎日退勤後に同じオフィステルへ立ち寄る夫。車内で見つかった女性用品のレシート。早朝の通話。妻は夫が別の家庭を持っていると確信する。,丈夫每天下班后都去同一处韩式商住公寓。车里发现了女性用品收据。凌晨的通话。妻子确信丈夫另立家室。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_context.triggerAmplifier,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,context.triggerAmplifier,"초반에는 영수증(머리끈/틴트), 오피스텔 GPS, 새벽 통화가 한 방향으로만 겹쳐 외도처럼 보인다. 그러나 단서를 더 들춰 볼수록 그 그림은 흔들리고, 양쪽 모두 말하지 못한 사정과 돈의 움직임이 차례로 드러나면서 사건의 중심은 외도 의심 너머로 뒤집힌다.","At first, the receipts (hair ties/lip tint), Officetel GPS, and early-morning calls all point in one direction: an affair. But as more clues surface, that picture falters. Unspoken circumstances on both sides and the movement of money come to light, shifting the case beyond suspicion of infidelity.",序盤では、レシート（ヘアゴム／リップティント）、オフィステルのGPS、早朝の通話が一方向に重なり、不倫のように見える。しかし手がかりを掘り下げるほどその構図は揺らぎ、双方が言えなかった事情と金の動きが順に明らかになり、事件の中心は不倫疑惑の先へと反転する。,一开始，收据（发圈/唇釉）、韩式商住公寓GPS和凌晨通话都指向同一个方向，看起来像是出轨。但线索越挖越多，这幅图景开始动摇。双方都没说出口的情况和金钱流向逐一浮现，案件核心也从出轨嫌疑翻转到更深处。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-1_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-1].judgmentStatement,오피스텔 방문의 실체는 외도가 아니라 가족 돌봄이었다.,"The Officetel visits were not an affair, but family care.",オフィステル訪問の実体は不倫ではなく、家族の世話だった。,韩式商住公寓探访的实质不是出轨，而是照顾家人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-1_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-1].mediationLink,외도 오해와 가족 돌봄,Misunderstood Affair and Family Care,不倫の誤解と家族の世話,出轨误会与照顾家人,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-1_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-1].name,오피스텔 방문과 새벽 전화,Officetel Visit and Early-Morning Call,オフィステル訪問と早朝の電話,韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨电话,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-1_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-1].truthDescription,오피스텔 방문은 친형 오피스텔에서 조카(중2)를 돌보는 것이었다. 새벽 전화는 형과의 긴급 연락.,"The Officetel visits were to care for his niece, a second-year middle-school student, at his older brother's Officetel. The early-morning calls were urgent contact with his brother.",オフィステル訪問は、実兄のオフィステルで姪（中2）の世話をするためだった。早朝の電話は兄との緊急連絡。,探访韩式商住公寓，是为了在亲哥哥的韩式商住公寓照顾侄女（初二）。凌晨电话则是与哥哥的紧急联系。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-1_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.defer,현재로서는 실체를 알 수 없다. 판단을 유보한다.,The substance is unclear for now. Judgment is deferred.,現時点では実体が分からない。判断を保留する。,目前无法判断实质。暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-1_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.partial,"오피스텔 방문은 딴집 살림까지는 아니지만, 외도일 가능성이 높다.","The Officetel visits do not prove a secret household, but they are likely an affair.",オフィステル訪問は別の家庭とまでは言えないが、不倫の可能性が高い。,探访韩式商住公寓还不能算另立家室，但很可能是出轨。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-1_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.truth,오피스텔 방문의 실체는 외도가 아니라 가족 돌봄이었다.,"The Officetel visits were not an affair, but family care.",オフィステル訪問の実体は不倫ではなく、家族の世話だった。,韩式商住公寓探访的实质不是出轨，而是照顾家人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-1_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.wrong,이준호의 오피스텔 방문은 딴집 살림 때문이었다.,Lee Jun-ho visited the Officetel because he had a secret household.,イ・ジュノのオフィステル訪問は、別の家庭のためだった。,李俊浩探访韩式商住公寓，是因为他另立家室。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].judgmentStatement,"개인 비자금 3,000만원 현금 전달은 남편 책임이 더 크다.",The husband bears greater responsibility for handing over ₩30M in personal hidden funds in cash.,"個人の隠し資金3,000万ウォンを現金で渡したことは、夫の責任がより大きい。",将3000万韩元个人私房钱以现金交付，丈夫责任更大。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].mediationLink,남편 측 현금 흐름의 사용처,Where the Husband-Side Cash Went,夫側の現金流の使途,丈夫方面现金流的用途,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].name,남편 명의 계좌의 목돈 출금,Large Withdrawal from the Husband's Account,夫名義口座からの高額出金,丈夫名下账户的大额取款,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].truthDescription,"이준호는 아내 몰래 10년 가까이 모아 둔 본인 명의 별도 계좌의 비자금 3,000만원을 최근 4개월 동안 500만원, 800만원, 700만원, 1,000만원 순서로 현금 출금했다. 형이 개인회생 중이라 계좌 입금이 곤란해 현금으로 전달했다는 설명이며, 공동 적금과는 무관한 개인 자금이다.","Without his wife knowing, Lee Jun-ho withdrew ₩30M in hidden funds from a separate account in his own name, saved over nearly ten years, in cash over the last four months: ₩5M, ₩8M, ₩7M, then ₩10M. His explanation is that his older brother was in personal debt rehabilitation, making account deposits difficult, so he handed over cash. The money was personal funds unrelated to the joint savings account.","イ・ジュノは妻に黙って、10年近く貯めていた本人名義の別口座の隠し資金3,000万ウォンを、最近4か月で500万ウォン、800万ウォン、700万ウォン、1,000万ウォンの順に現金出金した。兄が個人再生中で口座入金が難しく、現金で渡したという説明であり、共同積立預金とは無関係な個人資金である。",李俊浩瞒着妻子，从自己名下另设账户中提取了近10年攒下的3000万韩元私房钱，最近4个月依次以500万韩元、800万韩元、700万韩元、1000万韩元现金取出。他解释称，哥哥正在进行个人债务重整，不便账户入账，所以改用现金交付；这笔钱是与共同储蓄账户无关的个人资金。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,d-1 심문에서 오피스텔 방문의 진실이 무너지면 목돈 출금 발견으로 새 쟁점 부상,"d-1 questioning overturns the truth of the Officetel visits, and discovery of the large withdrawal raises a new issue.",d-1の尋問でオフィステル訪問の真実が崩れると、高額出金の発見により新たな争点が浮上する。,d-1询问推翻韩式商住公寓探访的真相后，因发现大额取款而出现新争议点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,d-1 S3 이상 도달 시 (목돈 출금 언급),d-1 reaches S3 or higher (large withdrawal mentioned),d-1がS3以上に到達時（高額出金への言及）,d-1达到S3以上时（提及大额取款）,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.defer,사용처를 단정할 수 없다. 판단을 유보한다.,Where the money went cannot be determined. Judgment is deferred.,使途を断定できない。判断を保留する。,无法断定用途。暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.partial,"비자금 출금은 사실이지만, 정확한 사용처는 불확실하다.","The hidden-fund withdrawal is real, but exactly where the money went is uncertain.",隠し資金の出金は事実だが、正確な使途は不確かである。,私房钱确实被取出，但具体用途尚不确定。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.truth,"개인 비자금 3,000만원은 개인회생 중인 형에게 현금으로 전달한 돈이었다.",The ₩30M in personal hidden funds was cash handed to his older brother during personal debt rehabilitation.,"個人の隠し資金3,000万ウォンは、個人再生中の兄へ現金で渡した金だった。",3000万韩元个人私房钱，是以现金交给正在进行个人债务重整的哥哥的钱。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_d-2_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.wrong,"개인 비자금 3,000만원은 이준호가 개인 유흥에 쓴 돈이다.",The ₩30M in personal hidden funds was money Lee Jun-ho spent on personal entertainment.,"個人の隠し資金3,000万ウォンは、イ・ジュノが個人的な遊興に使った金である。",3000万韩元个人私房钱，是李俊浩用于个人享乐的钱。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].judgmentStatement,"공동 적금 2,000만원 위임장 조작 해지는 아내 책임이 더 크다.",The wife bears greater responsibility for manipulating the power of attorney to cancel the ₩20M joint savings account.,"共同積立預金2,000万ウォンを委任状操作で解約したことは、妻の責任がより大きい。",通过操纵委托书解约2000万韩元共同储蓄账户，妻子责任更大。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].mediationLink,공동 자산 처분의 경위와 손실,Circumstances and Losses from Disposing of Joint Assets,共同資産処分の経緯と損失,共同资产处分经过与损失,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].name,"공동 적금 2,000만원 해지 경위",How the ₩20M Joint Savings Was Canceled,"共同積立預金2,000万ウォン解約の経緯",共同储蓄2000万韩元解约经过,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].truthDescription,"공동 적금이 만기 전에 해지된 흔적이 확인됐다. 해지 과정에서 배우자 동의 여부와 위임장 진위 문제가 남아 있으며, 해지금 2,000만원의 실제 행선지도 아직 확인해야 한다. 이제 공동 적금 해지 경위와 절차 책임을 별도 쟁점으로 추적한다.","Traces show the joint savings account was canceled before maturity. Questions remain over spousal consent and the authenticity of the power of attorney, and the actual destination of the ₩20M cancellation proceeds must still be confirmed. The circumstances and procedural responsibility for canceling the joint savings account are now tracked as a separate issue.","共同積立預金が満期前に解約された痕跡が確認された。解約過程では配偶者の同意の有無と委任状の真偽が問題として残っており、解約金2,000万ウォンの実際の行き先もまだ確認する必要がある。これから共同積立預金解約の経緯と手続き上の責任を、別の争点として追跡する。",已确认共同储蓄账户在到期前被解约的痕迹。解约过程中仍存在配偶是否同意、委托书真伪等问题，2000万韩元解约款的实际去向也仍需确认。现在将共同储蓄账户解约经过与程序责任作为独立争议点追踪。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.unlockCondition.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].unlockCondition.note,d-2 책임 전가 단계 후 어느 쪽이든 공동 적금 단서를 건드리면 해금,d-2 blame-shifting stage passed; unlocked if either side touches a joint savings clue.,d-2の責任転嫁段階後、どちらかが共同積立預金の手がかりに触れると解放。,d-2责任转嫁阶段后，任一方触及共同储蓄账户线索时解锁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,d-2 발견 뒤 어느 쪽 심문이든 공동 적금과 위임장 조작 단서가 드러나면 생성,d-2 discovered; generated if any questioning reveals clues about the joint savings account and power-of-attorney manipulation.,d-2発見後、どちらの尋問でも共同積立預金と委任状操作の手がかりが現れれば生成。,d-2发现后，任一方询问中出现共同储蓄账户和委托书操纵线索时生成。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,d-2 발견 후 공동 적금/위임장 단서 조사 시 해금,d-2 discovered; unlocked when the joint savings / power-of-attorney clues are investigated.,d-2発見後、共同積立預金／委任状の手がかりを調査すると解放。,d-2发现后，调查共同储蓄账户/委托书线索时解锁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].verdictOptions.defer,해지 경위가 불분명하다. 판단을 유보한다.,The cancellation circumstances are unclear. Judgment is deferred.,解約の経緯が不明である。判断を保留する。,解约经过不明。暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].verdictOptions.partial,"공동 적금이 해지된 건 맞지만, 누가 해지했는지는 불분명하다.","The joint savings account was canceled, but it is unclear who canceled it.",共同積立預金が解約されたのは確かだが、誰が解約したのかは不明である。,共同储蓄账户确实被解约，但不清楚是谁解约的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].verdictOptions.truth,"박지연이 위임장을 조작하여 해지했고, 그 돈을 투자 사기로 전액 잃었다.","Park Ji-yeon manipulated the power of attorney to cancel it, then lost all the money in an investment scam.",パク・ジヨンが委任状を操作して解約し、その金を投資詐欺で全額失った。,朴智妍操纵委托书完成解约，并将这笔钱在投资诈骗中全部损失。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d3_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d3].verdictOptions.wrong,"공동 적금 2,000만원은 이준호가 몰래 해지하여 비자금으로 빼돌렸다.",Lee Jun-ho secretly canceled the ₩20M joint savings account and diverted it into hidden funds.,"共同積立預金2,000万ウォンは、イ・ジュノが密かに解約して隠し資金に回した。",李俊浩偷偷解约2000万韩元共同储蓄账户，并转作私房钱。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].judgmentStatement,숨김의 선후와 범죄 행위의 유무는 서로 다른 차원이다.,The order of concealment and the existence of a criminal act are separate questions.,隠蔽の先後と犯罪行為の有無は、別の次元の問題である。,隐瞒的先后与是否存在犯罪行为，是两个不同层面的问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].mediationLink,숨김과 실행의 선후,Order of Concealment and Execution,隠蔽と実行の先後,隐瞒与执行的先后,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].name,은폐와 선제행동의 순서,Order of Concealment and First Moves,隠蔽と先手行動の順序,隐瞒与抢先行动的顺序,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].truthDescription,"숨김은 B가 먼저(개인 비자금 3천만+형 상황 은폐), 계좌 감시는 A가 먼저(신혼 초), 돈 실행은 동시기(B 4개월 전 3천만 현금 출금, A 6주 전 공동 적금 2천만 위임장 조작 해지), 범죄 행위는 A(위임장 조작).","B concealed first (₩30M in personal hidden funds + his brother's situation), while A began account monitoring first (early in the marriage). The money actions occurred around the same period: B withdrew ₩30M in cash four months ago, and A manipulated the power of attorney to cancel the ₩20M joint savings six weeks ago. The criminal act was A's power-of-attorney manipulation.","隠蔽はBが先（個人の隠し資金3,000万ウォン＋兄の状況の隠蔽）、口座監視はAが先（新婚当初）。金の実行は同時期（Bは4か月前に3,000万ウォンを現金出金、Aは6週間前に共同積立預金2,000万ウォンを委任状操作で解約）。犯罪行為はA（委任状操作）。",隐瞒方面，B在先（3000万韩元个人私房钱+隐瞒哥哥情况）；账户监控方面，A在先（新婚初期）。金钱执行发生在同期：B于4个月前提取3000万韩元现金，A于6周前操纵委托书解约2000万韩元共同储蓄账户。犯罪行为则是A的委托书操纵。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.unlockCondition.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].unlockCondition.note,d-2 + h-d3 모두 책임 전가 단계 후 자동,"d-2 + h-d3 both reach the blame-shifting stage, then automatic.",d-2とh-d3の両方が責任転嫁段階後に自動。,d-2与h-d3均到达责任转嫁阶段后自动触发。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,d-2와 h-d3 모두 공개된 후 자동 발현,"d-2 and h-d3 are both revealed, then automatically appears.",d-2とh-d3の両方が開示された後、自動的に発現。,d-2与h-d3均公开后自动出现。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,A/B 어느 쪽이든 d-2 S3 + h-d3 S3 모두 도달 시 자동 해금,Automatically unlocked when either A or B reaches both d-2 S3 and h-d3 S3.,A/Bのどちらでも、d-2 S3＋h-d3 S3の両方に到達すると自動解放。,A/B任一方同时达到d-2 S3与h-d3 S3时自动解锁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].verdictOptions.defer,누가 먼저인지 판단할 근거가 부족하다. 유보한다.,There is not enough basis to decide who acted first. Deferred.,誰が先だったかを判断する根拠が足りない。保留する。,缺乏判断谁先行动的依据。暂缓。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].verdictOptions.partial,"양쪽 모두 숨긴 것이 있지만, 선후 관계를 가리기 어렵다.","Both sides hid things, but the order is difficult to determine.",双方とも隠したことはあるが、先後関係を見極めにくい。,双方都有隐瞒，但难以判断先后关系。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].verdictOptions.truth,"숨김은 이준호가 먼저, 계좌 감시는 박지연이 먼저. 범죄 행위(위임장 조작)는 박지연 쪽이다.",Lee Jun-ho concealed first; Park Ji-yeon monitored the account first. The criminal act (power-of-attorney manipulation) is on Park Ji-yeon's side.,隠蔽はイ・ジュノが先、口座監視はパク・ジヨンが先。犯罪行為（委任状操作）はパク・ジヨン側である。,隐瞒是李俊浩在先，账户监控是朴智妍在先。犯罪行为（操纵委托书）在朴智妍一方。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_disputes_h-d4_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,disputes[h-d4].verdictOptions.wrong,"이준호가 먼저 비밀을 만들었으므로, 박지연의 행동은 자구책이었다.","Because Lee Jun-ho created the secret first, Park Ji-yeon's action was self-help.",イ・ジュノが先に秘密を作ったため、パク・ジヨンの行動は自力救済だった。,因为李俊浩先制造了秘密，所以朴智妍的行动是自救。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.callTerms.angry,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.angry,이준호!,Lee Jun-ho!,イ・ジュノ！,李俊浩！,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.callTerms.toJudge,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.toJudge,제 남편,my husband,私の夫,我的丈夫,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.callTerms.toPartner,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.toPartner,자기,honey,あなた,亲爱的,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.dailyRoutine,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.dailyRoutine,학원 마감 뒤 집에 돌아와 카드 내역과 통화기록을 반복해 확인하며 남편이 먼저 가정을 버릴지 모른다는 불안을 키웠다.,"After closing up at the academy, she returned home and repeatedly checked card statements and call logs, feeding her anxiety that her husband might abandon the family first.",塾の締め作業後に帰宅し、カード明細と通話記録を繰り返し確認しながら、夫が先に家庭を捨てるかもしれないという不安を募らせた。,补习班关门后，她回到家反复查看银行卡明细和通话记录，越来越担心丈夫会先抛弃家庭。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.fear,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.fear,위임장 조작이 범죄로 확정되는 것을 가장 두려워한다.,Her greatest fear is that the power-of-attorney manipulation will be confirmed as a crime.,委任状の操作が犯罪として確定することを最も恐れている。,她最害怕委托书操纵被认定为犯罪。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.name,박지연,Park Ji-yeon,パク・ジヨン,朴智妍,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.occupation,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.occupation,학원 데스크 직원,Academy front-desk staff,塾の受付スタッフ,补习班前台职员,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.sensitivePoints_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[0],오피스텔 방문과 새벽 전화는 딴살림 흔적인가,Are the Officetel visits and early-morning calls signs of a secret household?,オフィステル訪問と早朝の電話は、別の家庭の痕跡なのか,韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨电话是否是另立家室的迹象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.sensitivePoints_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[1],"위임장 조작으로 공동 적금 2,000만원을 해지한 것은 범죄인가",Was manipulating a power of attorney to cancel the ₩20M joint savings account a crime?,"委任状を操作して共同積立預金2,000万ウォンを解約したことは犯罪なのか",通过操纵委托书解约2000万韩元共同储蓄账户是否构成犯罪,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.sensitivePoints_2,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[2],은폐와 선제행동의 순서,Order of Concealment and First Moves,隠蔽と先手行動の順序,隐瞒与抢先行动的顺序,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.speechStyle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.speechStyle,"배신당한 사람이라는 위치를 먼저 잡고 말하지만, 동기 질문이 들어오면 수치심과 불안을 핑계로 설명 범위를 넓힌다.","She speaks first from the position of someone betrayed, but when motive questions come in, she expands her explanation by citing shame and anxiety.",裏切られた人という立場を先に取って話すが、動機に関する質問が入ると、羞恥心と不安を理由に説明の範囲を広げる。,她先站在“被背叛者”的位置上说话，但一旦被问到动机，就以羞耻和不安为由扩大解释范围。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.verbalTells_0_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[0].pattern,자신도 이미 배신당한 사람처럼 먼저 위치를 잡는다.,She positions herself first as if she has already been betrayed.,自分もすでに裏切られた人であるかのように、先に立場を取る。,她先把自己放在仿佛已经被背叛的位置上。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.verbalTells_1_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[1].pattern,그때는 다른 선택이 없었다는 말로 계산된 선택의 각도를 흐린다.,She blurs the calculated nature of her choice by saying she had no other option at the time.,その時は他に選択がなかったという言葉で、計算された選択という角度をぼかす。,她用“当时没有别的选择”来模糊其选择中的计算成分。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyA.verbalTells_2_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[2].pattern,작은 인정부터 꺼내고 가장 수치스러운 사실은 마지막에 말한다.,She starts with small admissions and saves the most shameful fact for last.,小さな認めから切り出し、最も恥ずかしい事実は最後に話す。,她先承认小事，把最羞耻的事实留到最后。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.callTerms.angry,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.callTerms.angry,박지연!,Park Ji-yeon!,パク・ジヨン！,朴智妍！,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.callTerms.toJudge,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.callTerms.toJudge,제 아내,my wife,私の妻,我的妻子,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.callTerms.toPartner,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.callTerms.toPartner,자기,honey,あなた,亲爱的,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.dailyRoutine,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.dailyRoutine,매장 마감 뒤 형네 오피스텔에 들러 조카 저녁과 생필품을 챙기고 새벽에는 형 사정을 확인한 뒤 집으로 돌아왔다.,"After closing the store, he stopped by his brother's Officetel to take care of his niece's dinner and daily necessities, then returned home after checking on his brother's situation in the early morning.",店の閉店後、兄のオフィステルに立ち寄って姪の夕食と日用品を用意し、早朝には兄の事情を確認してから家に戻った。,店铺打烊后，他去哥哥的韩式商住公寓照顾侄女的晚饭和生活用品，凌晨确认哥哥的情况后才回家。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.fear,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.fear,형 이야기를 꺼내면 시댁 갈등으로 이혼까지 갈 것이라는 공포.,Fear that bringing up his brother would turn into conflict with the in-laws and even divorce.,兄の話を出せば義実家との対立になり、離婚にまで至るという恐怖。,害怕一提到哥哥，就会演变成婆家矛盾，甚至走向离婚。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
