case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.sensitivePoints_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[0],오피스텔 방문과 새벽 전화는 딴살림 흔적인가,Are the Officetel visits and early-morning calls signs of a secret household?,オフィステル訪問と早朝の電話は、別の家庭の痕跡なのか,韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨电话是否是另立家室的迹象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.sensitivePoints_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[1],"개인 비자금에서 3,000만원을 현금으로 형에게 전달한 것은 배우자 동의 없는 독단인가",Was handing ₩30M in personal hidden funds to his brother in cash a unilateral act without spousal consent?,"個人の隠し資金から3,000万ウォンを現金で兄に渡したことは、配偶者の同意のない独断なのか",从个人私房钱中拿出3000万韩元现金交给哥哥，是否属于未经配偶同意的独断,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.sensitivePoints_2,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[2],은폐와 선제행동의 순서,Order of Concealment and First Moves,隠蔽と先手行動の順序,隐瞒与抢先行动的顺序,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.speechStyle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.speechStyle,"사실을 완전히 부정하기보다 중요한 이유를 뒤로 미루고, 모호어로 시간을 벌다가 압박이 누적되면 한꺼번에 털어놓는다.","Rather than deny facts completely, he postpones the important reasons, buys time with vague language, and reveals everything at once when pressure builds.",事実を完全に否定するより、重要な理由を後回しにし、曖昧な言葉で時間を稼ぎ、圧力が積み重なると一気に打ち明ける。,他并不完全否认事实，而是把重要原因往后推，用含糊说法拖延时间，压力累积后再一次性说出。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.verbalTells_0_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[0].pattern,질문을 바로 받지 않고 한 박자 늦게 받아 핵심어를 피한다.,"He takes questions a beat late, avoiding the key words.",質問をすぐに受けず、一拍遅れて受けることで核心語を避ける。,他不立刻接住问题，而是慢半拍回应，避开关键词。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.verbalTells_1_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[1].pattern,큰 사실은 인정하되 가장 아픈 이유는 마지막까지 자른다.,"He admits the major facts, but withholds the most painful reason until the end.",大きな事実は認めるが、最も痛い理由は最後まで切り離す。,他承认重大事实，但把最痛的理由一直留到最后。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.partyB.verbalTells_2_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[2].pattern,선의였다는 말로 절차 위반의 무게를 먼저 낮추려 한다.,He tries to reduce the weight of the procedural violation first by saying it was done in good faith.,善意だったという言葉で、手続き違反の重みを先に軽くしようとする。,他先用“出于善意”来减轻程序违规的分量。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].description,남편의 차에서 발견한 영수증 목록이다. 영수증 내역 중 여성용 물품이 있어 아내의 의심이 시작됐다.,A list of receipts found in the husband's car. Items for women on the receipts sparked the wife's suspicion.,夫の車で見つかったレシートの一覧。明細に女性用の品物があり、妻の疑いが始まった。,这是在丈夫车里发现的收据清单。收据明细中有女性用品，妻子的怀疑由此开始。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationResults.check_metadata,"머리끈, 손거울 등이 눈에 띈다. 샤프와 노트 같은 학용품도 함께 구매되어 있다.","Hair ties, a hand mirror, and similar items stand out. School supplies such as a mechanical pencil and notebook were also bought.",ヘアゴム、手鏡などが目立つ。シャープペンシルやノートのような学用品も一緒に購入されている。,发圈、手镜等物品很显眼。自动铅笔、笔记本等学习用品也一起购买了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationResults.request_original,"틴트, 헤어롤 등 여성용 물건들이 눈에 띈다.",Women's items such as lip tint and hair rollers stand out.,リップティント、ヘアローラーなど女性用の品物が目立つ。,唇釉、发卷等女性用品很显眼。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationResults.restore_context,중학생 대상 참고서를 구입한 것이 눈에 띈다.,The purchase of a workbook for middle-school students stands out.,中学生向けの参考書を購入している点が目立つ。,购买了面向中学生的参考书这一点很显眼。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[0].label,영수확인,Receipt Check,レシート確認,收据确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[0].question.text,"이 영수증들, 누가 무엇을 산 것입니까?",Who bought what on these receipts?,このレシートでは、誰が何を買ったのですか。,这些收据上是谁买了什么？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
