case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[1].question.text,이 품목들이 가리키는 상대는 누구입니까?,Who do these items point to?,これらの品目が指している相手は誰ですか。,这些物品指向的对象是谁？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,영수증을 한 번 더 조사하면 다른 매장 품목까지 대조할 수 있습니다.,Investigate the receipts again to compare items from the other stores as well.,レシートをもう一度調査すると、他の店舗の品目まで照合できます。,再次调查收据后，也可以对照其他店铺的物品。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[2].label,대상복원,Target Reconstruction,対象復元,对象复原,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[2].question.text,중학생용 참고서는 누구를 위해 산 것입니까?,Who was the middle-school workbook bought for?,中学生用の参考書は、誰のために買ったのですか。,这本中学生参考书是为谁买的？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,품목을 대조하면 이 구매가 누구를 위한 것이었는지 복원할 수 있습니다.,Compare the items to reconstruct who this purchase was for.,品目を照合すると、この購入が誰のためだったのかを復元できます。,对照物品后，可以复原这次购买是为了谁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
