case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.a.implication,머리끈/틴트가 외도 의심의 출발점이다.,The hair tie and lip tint are the starting point of the affair suspicion.,ヘアゴム／リップティントが不倫疑惑の出発点である。,发圈/唇釉是出轨怀疑的起点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 영수증들이 왜 딴살림 확신으로 이어졌는지 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why these receipts led you to believe there was a secret household.,これらのレシートがなぜ別の家庭への確信につながったのか、説明してください。,请说明这些收据为何让你确信对方另立家室。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
