case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.b.questionAngle,이 영수증의 물품들은 누구를 위해 구매한 것인지 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain who the items on this receipt were purchased for.,このレシートの品物は誰のために購入したのか、説明してください。,请说明这张收据上的物品是为谁购买的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
