case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.3.receipt_4_.storeName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.3.receipt[4].storeName,교보문고 강남점,Kyobo Bookstore Gangnam Branch,教保文庫江南店,教保文库江南店,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].description,매일 같은 좌표에 정차. 오피스텔 주소 확인. A가 B 차에서 확인.,Stops at the same coordinates every day. Officetel address confirmed. A found it in B's car.,毎日同じ座標に停車。オフィステルの住所を確認。AがBの車で確認。,每天停在同一坐标。确认韩式商住公寓地址。A在B的车里确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.check_metadata,좌표를 주소와 대조했다. 비슷한 시각에 같은 오피스텔로 반복 방문한 패턴이 드러난다.,The coordinates were checked against the address. A pattern of repeated visits to the same Officetel at similar times emerges.,座標を住所と照合した。似た時刻に同じオフィステルを繰り返し訪問していたパターンが現れる。,将坐标与地址对照后，显示出在相近时间反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的模式。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.request_original,매일 비슷한 시각에 동일한 좌표로 이동한 흔적이 보인다.,Traces show movement to the same coordinates at similar times each day.,毎日似た時刻に同じ座標へ移動した痕跡が見える。,可以看到每天在相近时间移动到同一坐标的痕迹。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.restore_context,한 가지 어긋난다. 외도로 보기에는 매번 체류 시간이 너무 짧다.,One detail does not fit: each stay is too short to look like an affair.,一つ食い違う。毎回の滞在時間が、不倫と見るには短すぎる。,有一点对不上：每次停留时间都太短，不像出轨。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[0].label,기록확인,Record Check,記録確認,记录确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[0].question.text,"이 GPS 기록, 본인 차 맞습니까?",Is this GPS record from your car?,このGPS記録は、ご本人の車のものですか。,这份GPS记录是你的车的吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[1].label,동선대조,Route Check,動線照合,动线对照,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[1].question.text,왜 같은 오피스텔에 반복해서 갔습니까?,Why did you repeatedly go to the same Officetel?,なぜ同じオフィステルへ繰り返し行ったのですか。,你为什么反复去同一处韩式商住公寓？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,기록을 한 번 더 조사하면 좌표가 어느 장소인지 연계할 수 있습니다.,Investigate the records again to link the coordinates to a specific location.,記録をもう一度調査すると、座標がどの場所かを関連付けられます。,再次调查记录后，可以把坐标关联到具体地点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[2].label,시간패턴,Time Pattern,時間パターン,时间模式,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[2].question.text,매번 2~3시간만 머물렀습니다. 어떤 목적의 방문이었습니까?,You stayed only two to three hours each time. What was the purpose of these visits?,毎回2〜3時間しか滞在していません。どのような目的の訪問でしたか。,你每次只停留2到3小时。这些探访的目的是什么？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,동선을 대조하면 체류 시간의 패턴이 드러납니다.,Compare the route to reveal the pattern in the length of each stay.,動線を照合すると、滞在時間のパターンが明らかになります。,对照动线后，会显示出停留时间的模式。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
