case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].partyContext.a.implication,장소와 빈도가 의심을 굳혔다.,The location and frequency hardened the suspicion.,場所と頻度が疑いを固めた。,地点和频率加深了怀疑。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 GPS 기록이 왜 외도 동선처럼 보였는지 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why this GPS record looked like an affair route.,このGPS記録がなぜ不倫の動線に見えたのか、説明してください。,请说明这份GPS记录为何看起来像出轨动线。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].partyContext.b.implication,침묵이 더 큰 오해를 만들었다.,Silence created a bigger misunderstanding.,沈黙がより大きな誤解を生んだ。,沉默造成了更大的误会。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
