case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,보통,Normal,通常,普通,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].description,새벽 시간대 같은 번호 반복. 낮에도 짧은 통화 다수. 통화 상대=1명.,Same number repeated in the early-morning hours. Many short calls during the day as well. Call counterpart = 1 person.,早朝時間帯に同じ番号が反復。昼にも短い通話が多数。通話相手＝1人。,凌晨时段反复出现同一号码。白天也有多次短通话。通话对象=1人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].investigationResults.check_metadata,저장된 연락처와 대조했다. 등록되지 않은 번호 한 곳과 자주 통화한 것으로 확인된다.,Compared against saved contacts. Frequent calls with one unsaved number are confirmed.,保存済みの連絡先と照合した。登録されていない番号1件と頻繁に通話していたことが確認される。,与已保存联系人对照后，确认其经常与一个未登记号码通话。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].investigationResults.request_original,통화 목록을 조회했다. 같은 시간대에 반복된 통화 흔적이 보인다.,The call list was checked. Traces of repeated calls in the same time period are visible.,通話一覧を照会した。同じ時間帯に繰り返された通話の痕跡が見える。,已查询通话列表。可以看到同一时段反复通话的痕迹。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].investigationResults.restore_context,한 가지 어긋난다. 외도로 보기에는 매번 통화 시간이 너무 짧다.,One detail does not fit: each call is too short to look like an affair.,一つ食い違う。不倫と見るには、毎回の通話時間が短すぎる。,有一点对不上：每次通话都太短，不像出轨。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
