case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[1].question.text,이 미등록 번호의 상대는 누구입니까?,Who is behind this unsaved number?,この未登録番号の相手は誰ですか。,这个未登记号码的对象是谁？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,기록을 한 번 더 조사하면 저장된 번호들과 대조해 상대를 특정할 수 있습니다.,Investigate the records again to compare them with saved numbers and identify the counterpart.,記録をもう一度調査すると、保存済みの番号と照合して相手を特定できます。,再次调查记录后，可以与已保存号码对照并确定对象。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
