case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.a.questionAngle,새벽 통화가 왜 외도 증거처럼 보였는지 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why the early-morning calls looked like evidence of an affair.,早朝の通話がなぜ不倫の証拠に見えたのか、説明してください。,请说明凌晨通话为何看起来像出轨证据。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
