case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.b.questionAngle,"이 통화 상대가 누구인지, 왜 새벽에 전화했는지 설명해 주십시오.",Please explain who the call counterpart was and why you called in the early morning.,この通話相手が誰なのか、なぜ早朝に電話したのか、説明してください。,请说明通话对象是谁，以及为什么凌晨打电话。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
