case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.log.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.log.note,"010-****-3847 번호로의 야간 통화가 반복적으로 확인됨. 다만 통화 시간은 대부분 3분 이하, 최장도 5분 미만.","Repeated nighttime calls to 010-****-3847 are confirmed. However, most calls were under three minutes, and even the longest was under five minutes.",010-****-3847番への夜間通話が繰り返し確認された。ただし通話時間はほとんど3分以下で、最長でも5分未満。,已确认反复拨打010-****-3847的夜间电话。但大多数通话少于3分钟，最长也不到5分钟。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
