case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.log.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.log.note,"010-****-3847 번호 통화가 반복적이지만, 통화 시간이 대부분 3분 이하. 외도로 보기에는 짧다.","Calls to 010-****-3847 repeat, but most are under three minutes. Too short to look like an affair.",010-****-3847番との通話は反復しているが、通話時間はほとんど3分以下。不倫と見るには短い。,反复拨打010-****-3847，但大多数通话不到3分钟。作为出轨来看时间太短。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
