case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.a.implication,오피스텔 방문의 실제 용건을 가늠하는 단서가 될 수 있다.,It may be a clue to the real purpose of the Officetel visits.,オフィステル訪問の実際の用件を見極める手がかりになり得る。,这可能成为判断韩式商住公寓探访真实目的的线索。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 문자를 처음 보십니까? 어떤 의미라고 생각하십니까?,Is this your first time seeing this text? What do you think it means?,このメッセージを初めて見ますか。どのような意味だと思いますか。,你第一次看到这条短信吗？你认为它是什么意思？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.b.implication,이 번호를 굳이 숨겨 온 이유에 가족 쪽 사정이 얽혀 있을 수 있다.,The reason he kept this number hidden may be tied to Family Circumstances.,この番号をあえて隠してきた理由には、家族側の事情が絡んでいる可能性がある。,他特意隐瞒这个号码的原因，可能与家族方面的情况有关。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
