case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[4].text,"응, 사갈께.","Yeah, I'll buy them on the way.",うん、買っていくよ。,嗯，我买过去。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[5].text,그런데 정말 매번 괜찮아? 집에서는 뭐라 안해?,But is it really okay every time? Don't they say anything at home?,でも、本当に毎回大丈夫？家では何も言われない？,可是每次都这样真的没关系吗？家里不会说什么吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_6_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[6].sender,이준호,Lee Jun-ho,イ・ジュノ,李俊浩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_6_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[6].text,어차피 요새 사이도 안좋아서 관심도 없어. 걱정 마.,"We are not getting along these days anyway, so there is no interest. Don't worry.",どうせ最近は仲も悪いし、関心もない。心配しないで。,反正最近关系也不好，根本没人关心。别担心。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
