case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_0_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[0].text,얘기 들었어. 고맙고 미안해.,"I heard what happened. Thank you, and I'm sorry.",話は聞いた。ありがとう、そしてごめん。,我听说了。谢谢，也对不起。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_1_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[1].sender,이준호,Lee Jun-ho,イ・ジュノ,李俊浩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[1].text,괜찮아. 그맘때 애들이 다 그렇지 뭘.,It's okay. Kids are all like that at that age.,大丈夫。その頃の子どもはみんなそんなものだよ。,没事。那个年纪的孩子都差不多。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[2].text,이번에 시험 성적 때문에 스트레스를 좀 받았나봐.,Looks like the test results stressed her out this time.,今回、試験の成績で少しストレスを受けたみたい。,看来这次考试成绩让她有些压力。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_3_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[3].sender,이준호,Lee Jun-ho,イ・ジュノ,李俊浩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[3].text,그럼 내가 공부를 좀 봐줄까?,Then should I help with the studying a bit?,じゃあ、俺が少し勉強を見ようか。,那我来稍微辅导一下学习？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[4].text,그럴 시간이 어딨어. 마음만으로도 고마워.,Where would you find the time? I'm grateful just for the thought.,そんな時間どこにあるの。気持ちだけでもありがたいよ。,哪有那个时间。你有这份心我就很感谢了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_5_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[5].sender,이준호,Lee Jun-ho,イ・ジュノ,李俊浩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[5].text,일단 참고서 좀 사갈께. 해보고 결정하지 뭐.,I'll pick up some workbooks for now. We can try them and decide.,とりあえず参考書を少し買っていくよ。やってみて決めればいい。,我先买点参考书过去。试试看再决定吧。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
