case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].description,이준호 본인 명의 별도 계좌의 거래 내역. 장기간 별도로 관리된 자금과 최근 큰 현금 출금 흔적이 남아 있다.,Transaction records for a separate account in Lee Jun-ho's own name. They show funds managed separately over a long period and traces of recent large cash withdrawals.,イ・ジュノ本人名義の別口座の取引履歴。長期間別に管理された資金と、最近の高額現金出金の痕跡が残っている。,李俊浩本人名下独立账户的交易记录。留下了长期单独管理资金以及近期大额现金取款的痕迹。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.check_metadata,"해당 계좌에는 10년 전부터 급여 잔액과 현금이 조금씩 모인 기록이 이어진다. 누적 보유액은 3,000만원을 조금 넘는다.",The account shows salary balances and cash accumulating little by little since ten years ago. The accumulated balance is slightly over ₩30M.,"当該口座には、10年前から給与残高と現金が少しずつ積み上がった記録が続いている。累積保有額は3,000万ウォンを少し超える。",该账户中有从10年前起工资余额和现金一点点积累的记录。累计持有额略高于3000万韩元。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.request_original,"이준호 명의의 별도 계좌가 확인된다. 배우자에게 공유된 생활비 계좌가 아니며, 현재 잔액은 수만 원만 남아 있다.","A separate account in Lee Jun-ho's name is confirmed. It is not a living-expense account shared with the spouse, and only tens of thousands of won remain in the current balance.",イ・ジュノ名義の別口座が確認される。配偶者と共有された生活費口座ではなく、現在残高は数万ウォンだけ残っている。,已确认李俊浩名下的独立账户。这不是与配偶共享的生活费账户，目前余额只剩数万韩元。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.restore_context,"최근 4개월 동안 총 3,000만원이 500만원, 800만원, 700만원, 1,000만원 순서로 현금 출금됐다. 은행 직원이 설명한 500만-800만-700만-1,000만원 분할 출금 패턴과 같고, 그 결과 현재 잔액은 수만 원만 남았다.","Over the last four months, a total of ₩30M was withdrawn in cash in the order of ₩5M, ₩8M, ₩7M, and ₩10M. This matches the split-withdrawal pattern described by the Bank Clerk, and as a result only tens of thousands of won remain in the current balance.","最近4か月で、合計3,000万ウォンが500万ウォン、800万ウォン、700万ウォン、1,000万ウォンの順に現金出金された。銀行職員が説明した500万－800万－700万－1,000万ウォンの分割出金パターンと同じで、その結果、現在残高は数万ウォンだけになった。",最近4个月内，共3000万韩元按500万韩元、800万韩元、700万韩元、1000万韩元的顺序以现金取出。该模式与银行职员说明的500万-800万-700万-1000万韩元分拆取款模式一致，结果目前余额只剩数万韩元。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[0].label,별도계좌확인,Separate Account Check,別口座確認,独立账户确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[0].question.text,이 별도 계좌는 배우자에게 숨긴 비밀 계좌가 맞습니까?,Is this separate account a secret account hidden from your spouse?,この別口座は、配偶者に隠した秘密口座で間違いありませんか。,这个独立账户是你瞒着配偶的秘密账户吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].label,장기축적확인,Long-Term Accumulation Check,長期蓄積確認,长期积累确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].question.text,"10년 동안 조금씩 모은 이 3,000만원대 자금을 왜 숨겼습니까?","Why did you hide this fund in the ₩30M range, saved little by little over ten years?","10年間少しずつ貯めたこの3,000万ウォン台の資金を、なぜ隠したのですか。",这笔10年来一点点攒下的3000万韩元左右资金，你为什么要隐瞒？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,"내역을 더 확인하면 10년 동안 소액을 모아 3,000만원대 별도 자금을 만든 흐름을 볼 수 있습니다.",Check the records further to see the flow of small amounts accumulated over ten years into a separate fund in the ₩30M range.,"内訳をさらに確認すると、10年間小額を貯めて3,000万ウォン台の別資金を作った流れが見られます。",进一步查看明细后，可以看到10年间小额积累形成3000万韩元左右独立资金的过程。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].label,분할출금추궁,Press Split Withdrawals,分割出金追及,追问分拆取款,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].question.text,"최근 4개월 동안 500만원, 800만원, 700만원, 1,000만원 순서로 현금을 뺀 이유를 말씀하십시오.","Explain why you withdrew cash over the last four months in the order of ₩5M, ₩8M, ₩7M, and ₩10M.","最近4か月で500万ウォン、800万ウォン、700万ウォン、1,000万ウォンの順に現金を引き出した理由を述べてください。",请说明你为何在最近4个月内按500万韩元、800万韩元、700万韩元、1000万韩元的顺序提取现金。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,"출금 패턴을 확인하면 은행 직원 증언과 같은 방식으로 500만원, 800만원, 700만원, 1,000만원이 순차 인출된 사실을 추궁할 수 있습니다.","Confirm the withdrawal pattern to press the fact that ₩5M, ₩8M, ₩7M, and ₩10M were withdrawn sequentially in the same manner described by the Bank Clerk.","出金パターンを確認すると、銀行職員の証言と同じ方式で500万ウォン、800万ウォン、700万ウォン、1,000万ウォンが順次引き出された事実を追及できます。",确认取款模式后，可以追问其按照银行职员证言所述方式，依次取出500万韩元、800万韩元、700万韩元、1000万韩元的事实。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
