case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].name,이준호의 개인 계좌 출금 내역,Lee Jun-ho's Personal Withdrawal Records,イ・ジュノの個人口座出金履歴,李俊浩个人账户取款记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.a.implication,배우자에게 공유되지 않은 계좌를 어떻게 알게 됐는지를 두고 A의 감시 경위가 흔들릴 수 있다.,A's monitoring history may be shaken by how she learned of an account not shared with the spouse.,配偶者に共有されていない口座をどのように知ったのかをめぐって、Aの監視経緯が揺らぐ可能性がある。,围绕A如何得知一个未与配偶共享的账户，她的监控经过可能受到动摇。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 별도 계좌의 존재를 언제 알게 되었습니까?,When did you learn this separate account existed?,この別口座の存在をいつ知りましたか。,你是什么时候知道这个独立账户存在的？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.b.implication,10년간 모은 돈이 왜 현금으로 빠졌는지 B의 설명이 필요하다.,B must explain why money saved over ten years was withdrawn in cash.,10年間貯めた金がなぜ現金で引き出されたのか、Bの説明が必要である。,B需要解释为什么10年来攒下的钱会以现金取出。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.b.questionAngle,"이 돈을 왜 500만원, 800만원, 700만원, 1,000만원 순서로 현금 출금했습니까?","Why did you withdraw this money in cash in the order of ₩5M, ₩8M, ₩7M, and ₩10M?","この金をなぜ500万ウォン、800万ウォン、700万ウォン、1,000万ウォンの順で現金出金したのですか。",你为什么按500万韩元、800万韩元、700万韩元、1000万韩元的顺序提取这笔现金？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].surfaceDescription,아내에게 공유되지 않은 별도 계좌와 현재 수만 원대 잔액이 보인다.,"A separate account not shared with the wife is shown, with a current balance of only tens of thousands of won.",妻に共有されていない別口座と、現在数万ウォン台の残高が見える。,显示出一个未与妻子共享的独立账户，目前余额仅数万韩元。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.surfaceName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].surfaceName,개인 계좌 출금 내역,Personal Account Withdrawal Records,個人口座出金履歴,个人账户取款记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,"은행 직원 증언과 같은 500만-800만-700만-1,000만원 분할 출금 패턴",Split-withdrawal pattern of ₩5M–₩8M–₩7M–₩10M matching the Bank Clerk's testimony.,"銀行職員の証言と同じ500万－800万－700万－1,000万ウォンの分割出金パターン",与银行职员证言一致的500万-800万-700万-1000万韩元分拆取款模式,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,현재 잔액이 수만 원만 남은 단계,Stage where only tens of thousands of won remain in the current balance.,現在残高が数万ウォンだけ残った段階,目前余额只剩数万韩元的阶段,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,"10년간 소액 적립된 3,000만원대 별도 자금 흐름",Flow of separate funds in the ₩30M range accumulated in small amounts over ten years.,"10年間小額で積み立てられた3,000万ウォン台の別資金の流れ",10年间小额积累形成3000万韩元左右独立资金的流向,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,"4개월 동안 500만원, 800만원, 700만원, 1,000만원 순서로 현금 출금된 기록","Record of cash withdrawals over four months in the order of ₩5M, ₩8M, ₩7M, and ₩10M.","4か月で500万ウォン、800万ウォン、700万ウォン、1,000万ウォンの順に現金出金された記録",4个月内按500万韩元、800万韩元、700万韩元、1000万韩元顺序现金取款的记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,별도 계좌와 현재 소액 잔액만 보임,Only a separate account and the current small balance are visible.,別口座と現在の少額残高のみ表示,仅显示独立账户和当前小额余额,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
