case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[authenticated].summary,10년간 적립과 4개월 분할 현금 출금 확인,Ten years of accumulation and four months of split cash withdrawals confirmed.,10年間の積立と4か月の分割現金出金を確認,确认10年积累与4个月分拆现金取款,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
