case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[challenged].summary,B가 형에게 준 돈이라며 사용처를 별도로 설명,B separately explains that it was money given to his brother.,Bが兄に渡した金だとして使途を別途説明,B另行说明用途，称这是给哥哥的钱,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
