case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_misread_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[misread].summary,기록 자체는 인증되지만 전달 목적은 심문과 증언으로 확정된다,"The record itself is authenticated, but the purpose of the handoff is established through questioning and testimony.",記録自体は認証されるが、渡した目的は尋問と証言で確定される,记录本身已认证，但交付目的需通过询问和证言确定,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
