case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].description,"박지연이 공동 적금 해지액 2,000만원을 투자방 안내 계좌로 송금한 뒤, 수익 인증과 출금 지연이 이어진 텔레그램 대화 기록.","Telegram conversation records showing Park Ji-yeon transferring the ₩20M joint savings cancellation proceeds to an account provided by the investment chat, followed by profit confirmations and withdrawal delays.","パク・ジヨンが共同積立預金の解約金2,000万ウォンを投資チャット案内口座へ送金した後、収益認証と出金遅延が続いたTelegramの会話記録。",朴智妍将共同储蓄账户解约款2000万韩元转入投资群指定账户后，随后出现收益认证和提现延迟的Telegram对话记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.check_metadata,"박지연이 투자방 안내 계좌로 2,000만원을 송금한 뒤 초기 수익 인증 메시지를 받았다는 흐름이 확인된다.",The flow confirms that Park Ji-yeon transferred ₩20M to the account provided by the investment chat and then received initial profit confirmation messages.,"パク・ジヨンが投資チャット案内口座へ2,000万ウォンを送金した後、初期収益認証メッセージを受け取った流れが確認される。",可确认朴智妍向投资群指定账户转入2000万韩元后，收到了初期收益认证消息。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.request_original,투자방 텔레그램에는 고수익을 보장한다는 홍보와 참여자들의 수익 인증이 남아 있다.,The investment chat Telegram contains promotions guaranteeing high returns and participants' profit confirmations.,投資チャットのTelegramには、高収益を保証する宣伝と参加者の収益認証が残っている。,投资群Telegram中留有保证高收益的宣传，以及参与者的收益认证。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.restore_context,"이후 운영자가 채팅방을 나가고 출금 요청이 막히면서 2,000만원이 회수되지 않은 사기 피해로 정리된다.","Afterward, the operator left the chat room and withdrawal requests were blocked, establishing the unrecovered ₩20M as scam damage.","その後、運営者がチャットルームを退出し、出金要請が阻まれたことで、2,000万ウォンが回収されない詐欺被害として整理される。",之后运营者退出聊天室，提现请求受阻，2000万韩元未能追回，被整理为诈骗损失。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[0].label,투자방 소개 및 수익 자랑,Investment Chat Introduction and Profit Bragging,投資チャット紹介と収益自慢,投资群介绍与收益炫耀,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[0].question.text,이 투자방 텔레그램이 어떤 방식으로 박지연 씨를 끌어들였는지 확인하겠습니다.,We will check how this investment chat Telegram drew Ms. Park Ji-yeon in.,この投資チャットのTelegramがどのようにパク・ジヨンさんを引き込んだのか確認します。,将确认这个投资群Telegram是如何吸引朴智妍女士的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].label,입금 및 초기 수익 인증,Deposit and Initial Profit Confirmation,入金と初期収益認証,入金及初期收益认证,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].question.text,박지연 씨가 실제로 얼마를 송금했고 어떤 수익 인증을 받았는지 확인하겠습니다.,We will check how much Ms. Park Ji-yeon actually transferred and what profit confirmations she received.,パク・ジヨンさんが実際にいくら送金し、どのような収益認証を受けたのか確認します。,将确认朴智妍女士实际转账了多少，以及收到了什么收益认证。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,투자방 대화와 송금 기록을 함께 확인해야 열린다.,Unlocked by checking the investment chat conversation together with the transfer record.,投資チャットの会話と送金記録を合わせて確認すると開く。,需要同时确认投资群对话和转账记录才会开启。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].label,먹튀 및 피해 확정,Exit Scam and Damage Confirmed,持ち逃げと被害確定,跑路及损失确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].question.text,"출금 요청 이후 운영자가 어떻게 대응했는지, 사기 피해가 확정되는 흐름을 확인하겠습니다.",We will check how the operator responded after the withdrawal request and how the scam damage became confirmed.,出金要請後に運営者がどう対応したのか、詐欺被害が確定する流れを確認します。,将确认提出提现请求后运营者如何回应，以及诈骗损失如何确定。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,초기 수익 인증 이후의 출금 지연과 운영자 이탈 정황을 확인해야 열린다.,Unlocked by confirming the withdrawal delays and operator disappearance after the initial profit confirmation.,初期収益認証後の出金遅延と運営者離脱の状況を確認すると開く。,需要确认初期收益认证后的提现延迟与运营者离开情况才会开启。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
