case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_6_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[6].sender,운영자(제이슨),Operator (Jason),運営者（ジェイソン）,运营者（杰森）,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-6_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_6_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-6].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[6].text,초기 수익 8% 반영됐습니다. 추가 입금하면 VIP 비율로 전환됩니다.,Initial profit of 8% has been reflected. Make an additional deposit to switch to the VIP rate.,初期収益8％が反映されました。追加入金するとVIP比率に切り替わります。,初期收益8%已反映。追加入金后将转为VIP比例。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
