case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].description,공동 적금 해지 서류와 처리 기록. A가 해지 절차를 어떻게 진행했는지 가리키는 자료.,Joint Savings Cancellation Papers and processing records. Materials indicating how A proceeded with the cancellation.,共同積立預金の解約書類と処理記録。Aが解約手続きをどのように進めたかを示す資料。,共同储蓄账户解约文件与处理记录。指向A如何推进解约程序的资料。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.check_metadata,위임장의 이준호 서명이 본인 필적이 아닌 것으로 의심된다. 박지연이 대필한 흔적이 있다.,Lee Jun-ho's signature on the power of attorney is suspected not to be in his own handwriting. There are traces suggesting Park Ji-yeon wrote it for him.,委任状のイ・ジュノの署名は本人の筆跡ではない疑いがある。パク・ジヨンが代筆した痕跡がある。,委托书上的李俊浩签名疑似并非本人笔迹。有朴智妍代笔的痕迹。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.request_original,"공동 적금 해지 서류와 위임장이다. 해지 금액은 2,000만원.",Joint Savings Cancellation Papers and a power of attorney. Cancellation amount: ₩20M.,"共同積立預金の解約書類と委任状。解約金額は2,000万ウォン。",共同储蓄账户解约文件与委托书。解约金额为2000万韩元。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.restore_context,"박지연이 위임장을 조작하여 이준호 동의 없이 공동 적금 2,000만원을 해지한 범죄 행위의 증거이다.",Evidence that Park Ji-yeon manipulated the power of attorney and committed the criminal act of canceling the ₩20M joint savings account without Lee Jun-ho's consent.,"パク・ジヨンが委任状を操作し、イ・ジュノの同意なく共同積立預金2,000万ウォンを解約した犯罪行為の証拠である。",这是朴智妍操纵委托书、未经李俊浩同意解约2000万韩元共同储蓄账户这一犯罪行为的证据。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[0].label,서류확인,Document Check,書類確認,文件确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[0].question.text,이 해지 서류에 있는 서명은 누구 것입니까?,Whose signature is on this cancellation document?,この解約書類にある署名は誰のものですか。,这份解约文件上的签名是谁的？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].label,필체대조,Handwriting Check,筆跡照合,笔迹对照,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].question.text,이 위임장의 서명이 본인 것이 아니라면 누가 쓴 것입니까?,"If the signature on this power of attorney is not his, who wrote it?",この委任状の署名が本人のものでないなら、誰が書いたのですか。,如果这份委托书上的签名不是本人所写，那是谁写的？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,서류를 확인하면 해지 기록과 위임장 서명을 함께 대조할 수 있습니다.,Check the documents to compare the cancellation record together with the power-of-attorney signature.,書類を確認すると、解約記録と委任状の署名を合わせて照合できます。,确认文件后，可以将解约记录与委托书签名一起对照。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].label,책임추궁,Press Responsibility,責任追及,追究责任,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].question.text,이 정도의 서류 처리는 중대한 법적 책임으로 이어집니다. 어떻게 설명하시겠습니까?,Paperwork at this level can lead to serious legal responsibility. How do you explain it?,この程度の書類処理は重大な法的責任につながります。どう説明しますか。,这种程度的文件处理会导致重大法律责任。你如何解释？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,필체를 대조하면 동의 없는 해지 여부를 정면으로 추궁할 수 있습니다.,Compare the handwriting to directly press whether the cancellation was done without consent.,筆跡を照合すると、同意のない解約だったかどうかを正面から追及できます。,对照笔迹后，可以正面追问是否未经同意解约。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
