case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerData.contract.signature,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,evidence[e-7].viewerData.contract.signature,신청인: 박지연 (인) ——— 위임인: 이준호 (대리서명 의심) ——— 담당: ○○은행 마포지점 김○○,"Applicant: Park Ji-yeon (seal) ——— Principal: Lee Jun-ho (proxy signature suspected) ——— Handler: Kim ○○, ○○ Bank Mapo Branch",申請人：パク・ジヨン（印）——— 委任人：イ・ジュノ（代理署名の疑い）——— 担当：○○銀行麻浦支店 キム○○,申请人：朴智妍（印）——— 委托人：李俊浩（疑似代理签名）——— 经办：○○银行麻浦支行 金○○,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
