case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.hiddenDisputes_h-d3_.unlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.hiddenDisputes[h-d3].unlockPlan.authoredRule,e-6이 Excerpt 이상이 되거나 A에게 동기탐색 2회가 누적되면 생성,"e-6 reaches Excerpt or higher, or A accumulates two motive probes, then generated.",e-6がExcerpt以上になるか、Aに動機探索が2回累積すると生成。,e-6达到Excerpt以上，或A累计2次动机探查时生成。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
