case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.hiddenDisputes_h-d4_.unlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.hiddenDisputes[h-d4].unlockPlan.authoredRule,h-d3 생성 후 e-7이 Original 이상이 되거나 e-5+e-6으로 Reframe Lead가 생기면 생성,"Generated after h-d3 is created if e-7 reaches Original or higher, or if e-5 + e-6 creates a Reframe Lead.",h-d3生成後、e-7がOriginal以上になるか、e-5＋e-6でReframe Leadが発生すると生成。,h-d3生成后，当e-7达到Original以上，或e-5+e-6产生Reframe Lead时生成。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.hiddenDisputes_h-d4_.unlockPlan.runtimeRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.hiddenDisputes[h-d4].unlockPlan.runtimeRule,h-d3 해금 + e-7 제시 시 해금,Unlocked when h-d3 is unlocked and e-7 is presented.,h-d3解放＋e-7提示時に解放,h-d3解锁并出示e-7时解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets_e-4_.risk,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-4].risk,미성년자 사생활을 너무 일찍 열면 인도성 점수 하락과 B의 추가 체념이 발생할 수 있다.,Opening the minor's private life too early may lower the Humaneness score and cause B to give up further.,未成年者の私生活を早すぎる段階で開くと、人道性スコアの低下とBのさらなる諦めが発生する可能性がある。,过早揭开未成年人的私生活，可能导致人道性分数下降，并让B进一步放弃。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
