case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets_e-4_.targets_3,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-4].targets[3],생리 관련 직접 표현,Direct menstruation-related wording,月経関連の直接表現,月经相关直接表述,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-1_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-1].description,"영수증(머리끈/틴트), 오피스텔 GPS, 새벽 통화가 겹치며 d-1은 외도 의심 프레임으로 굳어졌다.","Receipts (hair tie/lip tint), Officetel GPS, and early-morning calls overlap, fixing d-1 in an affair-suspicion frame.",レシート（ヘアゴム／リップティント）、オフィステルGPS、早朝の通話が重なり、d-1は不倫疑惑のフレームに固まっている。,收据（发圈/唇釉）、韩式商住公寓GPS和凌晨通话相互重叠，使d-1固定在出轨怀疑的框架中。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-1_.distortionDirection,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-1].distortionDirection,"A는 외도 쪽으로, B는 숨김 이유를 말하지 않은 채 생활 패턴만 분리해 기억한다.","A remembers it through the lens of an affair, while B separates only the routine pattern without stating the reason for hiding it.",Aは不倫の方向で記憶し、Bは隠した理由を語らないまま生活パターンだけを切り分けて記憶している。,A把它记成出轨方向，B则不说明隐瞒理由，只把生活模式单独分离出来记忆。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-2_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-2].description,시댁 이야기가 나오면 크게 부딪힌다는 기억 때문에 B는 형네 사정을 말하지 않는 쪽을 택했다.,"Because talks about the in-laws had led to major clashes before, B chose not to speak about his brother’s family situation.",義実家の話になると大きく衝突するという記憶から、Bは兄一家の事情を話さない方を選んだ。,因为记得一提婆家就会激烈冲突，B选择不说哥哥一家那边的情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-3_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-3].description,"B는 개인 비자금에서 3,000만원을 형에게 현금 전달했고, A는 위임장을 조작해 공동 적금 2,000만원을 해지한 뒤 전액을 투자방에 넣었다가 잃었다.","B handed ₩30M in cash from his personal hidden fund to his older brother. A manipulated a power of attorney, cancelled the ₩20M joint savings account, and lost the entire amount in an investment chat.","Bは個人の隠し資金から3,000万ウォンを兄に現金で渡した。Aは委任状を操作して共同積立預金2,000万ウォンを解約し、その全額を投資チャットに入れて失った。",B从个人私房钱中取出3000万韩元现金交给哥哥。A操纵委托书解约共同储蓄账户中的2000万韩元，并把全额投入投资群后损失。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-4_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-4].description,숨김의 시작과 실제 송금 실행의 순서는 서로 다르다.,The start of the concealment and the actual execution of the transfer happen in a different order.,隠蔽の始まりと実際の送金実行の順序は互いに異なる。,隐瞒的开始与实际转账执行的先后顺序并不相同。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-4_.distortionDirection,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-4].distortionDirection,각자 자기에게 유리한 선후만 먼저 강조한다.,Each side first emphasizes only the sequence that favors them.,双方とも、自分に有利な前後関係だけを先に強調する。,双方都先强调对自己有利的先后顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.socialGraph_w-1_.knowledgeScope,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].knowledgeScope,1주일에 2~3번 방문하는 차량을 기억한다. 정확한 호수는 모르지만 그 층에 여자 혼자 사는 집은 없는 것으로 안다.,"Remembers a car visiting two to three times a week. Does not know the exact unit, but understands that no woman lives alone on that floor.",週に2〜3回訪れる車を覚えている。正確な部屋番号は知らないが、その階に女性の一人暮らしの部屋はないと把握している。,记得有辆车每周来两到三次。不知道准确门牌号，但知道那一层没有女性独居的住户。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
