case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.socialGraph_w-2_.knowledgeScope,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].knowledgeScope,위임장으로 적금 해지한 건이 있었다. 절차상 이상한 점이 있었지만 처리됐다.,"There was a joint savings cancellation made through a power of attorney. Something seemed procedurally odd, but it was processed.",委任状によって積立預金が解約された件があった。手続き上おかしな点はあったが、処理された。,曾有一笔通过委托书办理的储蓄账户解约。程序上有可疑之处，但最终已办理。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
