case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.knowledgeScope,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].knowledgeScope,지연 씨가 '남편이 바람이면 내 돈부터 지키겠다'고 했다. 내가 투자방 링크를 보냈다.,"Ji-yeon said, 'If my husband is cheating, I’m protecting my money first.' I sent her the investment chat link.",ジヨンさんは「夫が浮気しているなら、まず自分のお金を守る」と言っていた。私が投資チャットのリンクを送った。,智妍说过：“如果我丈夫出轨，我要先保住自己的钱。”投资群链接是我发给她的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
