case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-5_.interpretationChoices_L-5-B_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-5].interpretationChoices[L-5-B].implication,실행 순서 기준 책임 서사다.,A responsibility narrative based on execution order.,実行順を基準にした責任の物語。,以执行顺序为标准的责任叙事。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-5_.interpretationChoices_L-5-B_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-5].interpretationChoices[L-5-B].text,아내가 먼저 돈을 움직여 신뢰를 깼다,The wife moved the money first and broke trust,妻が先に金を動かして信頼を壊した,妻子先动钱，破坏了信任,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-5_.interpretationChoices_L-5-C_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-5].interpretationChoices[L-5-C].implication,상호 붕괴와 대칭 구조를 본다.,Look at mutual collapse and mirrored structure.,相互崩壊と対称構造を見る。,观察相互崩塌与镜像结构。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-5_.interpretationChoices_L-5-C_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-5].interpretationChoices[L-5-C].text,거울형 거짓말 구조다,A mirrored lie structure,鏡写しの嘘の構造だ,这是镜像式谎言结构,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-5_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-5].name,Reframe Lead,Reframe Lead,リフレーム・リード,重构线索,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[0],B의 오피스텔 방문 대상은 형과 조카였다.,B’s Officetel visits were to his older brother and that brother’s child.,Bのオフィステル訪問先は兄とその子だった。,B去韩式商住公寓探访的对象是哥哥和哥哥的孩子。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[1],"B는 개인 비자금 3,000만 원을 배우자에게 숨기고 형에게 현금으로 전달했다.",B hid ₩30M in personal hidden funds from his spouse and handed it to his older brother in cash.,"Bは個人の隠し資金3,000万ウォンを配偶者に隠し、兄に現金で渡した。",B向配偶隐瞒了3000万韩元个人私房钱，并以现金交给哥哥。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_2,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[2],"A는 남편 외도를 확신한 뒤 위임장을 조작해 공동 적금 2,000만 원을 해지하고, 전액을 투자방에 송금했다.","After becoming convinced her husband was having an affair, A manipulated a power of attorney, cancelled the ₩20M joint savings account, and transferred the full amount to an investment chat.","Aは夫の不倫を確信した後、委任状を操作して共同積立預金2,000万ウォンを解約し、全額を投資チャットに送金した。",A确信丈夫出轨后，操纵委托书解约共同储蓄账户中的2000万韩元，并将全额转入投资群。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_3,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[3],숨김은 B가 먼저 시작했고 실제 비밀 송금은 A가 먼저 실행했다.,"B began the concealment first, while A executed the actual secret transfer first.",隠蔽はBが先に始め、実際の秘密送金はAが先に実行した。,隐瞒是B先开始，实际秘密转账则是A先执行。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_spouse-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_4,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,spouse-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[4],두 사람 모두 말 못할 이유가 있었지만 둘 다 공동 재산을 혼자 움직였다.,"Both had reasons they could not speak of, but both moved joint property on their own.",二人とも言えない理由があったが、二人とも共同財産を一人で動かした。,两人都有难以启齿的理由，但两人都独自挪动了共同财产。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 결론에 끌려간 마음을 인정하되 단정으로 굳어진 부분을 다시 점검하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 정황이 쌓이면서 외도라는 결론에 끌려간 마음은 이해할 수 있습니다. 그 결론으로 넘어가던 그 순간이 언제였는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the circumstances you read as proof of an affair could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解你解读为出轨证据的情况对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 결론에 끌려간 마음을 인정하되 단정으로 굳어진 부분을 다시 점검하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라는 단어를 꺼내기까지 직접 확인한 부분과 추정으로 채운 부분이 섞여 있었을 것입니다. 그 경계를 지금 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the circumstances you read as proof of an affair from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对你解读为出轨证据的情况直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 결론에 끌려간 마음을 인정하되 단정으로 굳어진 부분을 다시 점검하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라는 결론으로 굳어지기 전 마지막으로 흔들렸던 지점이 어디였습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among the confirmed facts and the inferences, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、確認した事実と推定の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在已确认的事实与推断之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 결론에 끌려간 마음을 인정하되 단정으로 굳어진 부분을 다시 점검하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라는 단정 자체에 본인이 다시 짚어 볼 수 있는 부분이 있었는지, 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 결론에 끌려간 마음을 인정하되 단정으로 굳어진 부분을 다시 점검하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-affair_denial-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 외도 여부를 다시 다투자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 외도라고 결론 내리기까지 가장 큰 무게로 작용한 한 정황을 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the circumstances you read as proof of an affair weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看你解读为出轨证据的情况对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화 알림이 의심으로 굳어진 흐름을 단정 없이 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 잠든 새벽에 진동음과 모르는 번호가 반복되면 배신감이 깊어지는 것은 자연스럽습니다. 그 통화들을 보며 의심이 확신으로 굳어진 시점이 언제였는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the early-morning calls and unknown numbers could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、早朝の通話と知らない番号はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解凌晨通话和陌生号码对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화 알림이 의심으로 굳어진 흐름을 단정 없이 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 직접 들은 통화와 화면으로만 본 알림이 섞여 있었을 것입니다. 그 사이에서 어떤 부분이 가장 단정의 근거가 되었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the early-morning calls and unknown numbers from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、早朝の通話と知らない番号について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对凌晨通话和陌生号码直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화 알림이 의심으로 굳어진 흐름을 단정 없이 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 새벽이라는 시간대, 미등록 번호, 짧은 통화 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 부분이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among the time of day, unregistered numbers, and brief calls, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、時間帯、未登録番号、短い通話の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在时间段、未登记号码和短通话之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화 알림이 의심으로 굳어진 흐름을 단정 없이 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 통화 자체는 의심거리지만 본인이 직접 발신자에게 확인하지 않은 채 결론으로 넘어간 부분을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화 알림이 의심으로 굳어진 흐름을 단정 없이 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-call_record-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 통화 기록 전부를 다시 다투자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 가장 마음이 흔들렸던 한 통의 통화를 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the early-morning calls and unknown numbers weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。早朝の通話と知らない番号が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看凌晨通话和陌生号码对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대의 침묵 정체를 묻지 않고 그 침묵을 지켜본 본인 마음과 단정 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the husband's silence, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편이 끝내 입을 열지 않는 시간이 길어지면 의심은 단정으로 굳어지기 마련입니다. 그 침묵을 지켜보는 동안 가장 견디기 어려웠던 부분을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how your husband's silence could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の沈黙はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解丈夫的沉默对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대의 침묵 정체를 묻지 않고 그 침묵을 지켜본 본인 마음과 단정 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the husband's silence, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 침묵이 길어지는 사이 직접 물어보지 못한 본인 마음과 의심으로 굳어지던 마음이 섞여 있었을 것입니다. 그 흐름을 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about your husband's silence from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の沈黙について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对丈夫的沉默直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대의 침묵 정체를 묻지 않고 그 침묵을 지켜본 본인 마음과 단정 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the husband's silence, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 남편의 침묵 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 한 시점이 언제였습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among the silence itself and your interpretation of it, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、沈黙そのものとその解釈の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在沉默本身及你对它的解读之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대의 침묵 정체를 묻지 않고 그 침묵을 지켜본 본인 마음과 단정 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the husband's silence, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 침묵 그 자체와 그 침묵 위에 외도라는 결론을 얹은 본인 부분을 분리해, 인정할 수 있는 만큼의 책임을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대의 침묵 정체를 묻지 않고 그 침묵을 지켜본 본인 마음과 단정 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the husband's silence, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-concealment_reason-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 침묵의 정체를 지금 캐려는 게 아닙니다. 그 침묵 동안 가장 마음이 흔들렸던 한 순간을 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when your husband's silence weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。夫の沈黙が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看丈夫的沉默对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건이 의심을 키운 흐름과 단정으로 넘어간 본인 마음을 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items found in the car, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕车内发现的收据物品的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 본인 것이 아닌 물건이 남편 차에서 나온 순간 외도라는 단어가 떠오르는 건 누구라도 막기 어렵습니다. 그 물건들을 보며 의심이 확신으로 굳어진 시점이 언제였는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the receipt items found in the car could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、車内で見つかったレシート品目はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解车内发现的收据物品对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건이 의심을 키운 흐름과 단정으로 넘어간 본인 마음을 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items found in the car, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕车内发现的收据物品的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 직접 본 물건과 영수증으로만 확인한 품목이 섞여 있었을 것입니다. 그 사이에서 어떤 품목이 가장 단정의 근거가 되었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the receipt items found in the car from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、車内で見つかったレシート品目について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对车内发现的收据物品直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건이 의심을 키운 흐름과 단정으로 넘어간 본인 마음을 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items found in the car, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕车内发现的收据物品的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 여성용품과 학용품 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 품목이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among hair ties, lip tint, school supplies, and daily necessities, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、ヘアゴム、リップティント、学用品、生活用品の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在发圈、唇釉、学习用品和生活用品之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건이 의심을 키운 흐름과 단정으로 넘어간 본인 마음을 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items found in the car, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕车内发现的收据物品的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 물건이 의심을 부른 건 사실이지만 그 사용처를 직접 묻지 않은 채 외도로 결론 내린 부분을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건이 의심을 키운 흐름과 단정으로 넘어간 본인 마음을 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items found in the car, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕车内发现的收据物品的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-family_items-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 영수증 전체를 다시 다루자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 의심이 가장 깊어진 한 품목에 대한 그날의 마음을 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the receipt items found in the car weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。車内で見つかったレシート品目が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看车内发现的收据物品对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 의심을 단정으로 만들지 않고 불안이 확신으로 굳어진 흐름을 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 설명 없는 방문과 새벽 통화가 반복되면서 외도라는 결론에 끌려갔다면 그 불안과 배신감은 이해할 수 있습니다. 그때 어떤 기록을 보며 의심이 확신으로 바뀌었는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートはご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 의심을 단정으로 만들지 않고 불안이 확신으로 굳어진 흐름을 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 본인이 직접 본 정황과 추정으로 메운 부분이 섞여 있었을 것입니다. 그 사이에서 어떤 마음으로 단정으로 넘어가게 되었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートについて、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
