judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 오피스텔 방문, 새벽 통화, 영수증 물건 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 한 가지가 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among Officetel visits, calls, and receipt items, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問、通話、レシート品目の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据物品之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
