judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라고 결론 내리는 과정에서 남편에게 직접 물어볼 기회를 두지 않은 부분이 있었는지 본인이 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 의심을 단정으로 만들지 않고 불안이 확신으로 굳어진 흐름을 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 단정의 옳고 그름을 따지자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 다만 의심이 가장 깊어진 그 시점을 다시 정리해 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートが最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 동선에서 직접 본 것과 추정한 것을 분리해 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated route to the same Officetel, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 같은 오피스텔로 향하는 동선이 반복되는 걸 본 순간 누구라도 의심이 커질 수 있습니다. 그 동선이 의심에서 확신으로 넘어간 시점이 언제였는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the repeated route to the same Officetel could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 동선에서 직접 본 것과 추정한 것을 분리해 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated route to the same Officetel, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 직접 따라가 본 동선과 기록으로만 추정한 부분이 섞여 있었을 것입니다. 그 사이에서 어떤 부분이 가장 단정의 근거가 되었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the repeated route to the same Officetel from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 동선에서 직접 본 것과 추정한 것을 분리해 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated route to the same Officetel, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 반복 방문의 시간대, 빈도, 체류 길이 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 지점이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among visit times, frequency, and length of stay, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、訪問時間帯、頻度、滞在時間の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在探访时间、频率和停留时长之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 동선에서 직접 본 것과 추정한 것을 분리해 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated route to the same Officetel, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 동선 자체는 의심거리지만 그 위에 외도라는 결론을 얹은 본인 몫을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 동선에서 직접 본 것과 추정한 것을 분리해 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated route to the same Officetel, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_route-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 모든 방문을 한 번에 정리하라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 의심이 가장 깊어진 그 한 차례 방문을 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the repeated route to the same Officetel weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 부정의 분노 옆에 본인 침묵의 책임을 인정하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 외도라는 단어로 의심받는 자리에 서면 억울함이 분노로 바뀌는 것은 이해할 수 있습니다. 다만 그 분노 옆에서 본인 침묵이 한몫한 부분은 없었는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that your denial of an affair and the silence beside it left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、不倫否定とその横にある沈黙はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你否认出轨及伴随的沉默对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 부정의 분노 옆에 본인 침묵의 책임을 인정하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 외도가 아니라고 말씀하시는 주장 옆에는 본인이 인정해야 할 설명 회피가 분명히 있습니다. 지금 자리에서 그 부분을 어디까지 인정할 수 있는지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、不倫否定とその横にある沈黙について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你否认出轨及伴随的沉默现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 부정의 분노 옆에 본인 침묵의 책임을 인정하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 외도라는 결론으로 굳어지는 데 가장 크게 작용한 본인 행동 한 가지가 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among the denial, the missing explanation, and the actions that looked suspicious, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、否定、欠けていた説明、疑われた行動の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在否认、缺失的说明和显得可疑的行为之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 부정의 분노 옆에 본인 침묵의 책임을 인정하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 외도가 아니라는 부정과 별개로, 의심을 키운 본인 침묵 부분에 대한 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외도 부정의 분노 옆에 본인 침묵의 책임을 인정하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-affair_denial-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 외도 여부 자체를 두고 입씨름하자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 외도로 비치게 만든 본인의 결정 한 토막부터 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of your denial of an affair and the silence beside it that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你否认出轨及伴随的沉默中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화에 대한 침묵 책임을 인정하게 하고 가능한 범위만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽에 걸려 온 짧은 통화와 미등록 번호 문자가 쌓이면 배우자 입장에서 불안이 커지는 게 당연합니다. 그 통화들을 미리 설명하지 못한 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the early-morning calls you left unexplained left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、説明しないままにした早朝の通話はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你没有说明的凌晨通话对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화에 대한 침묵 책임을 인정하게 하고 가능한 범위만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 통화 시점과 통화 상대의 성격 중 지금 단계에서 공개할 수 있는 범위가 어디까지인지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the early-morning calls you left unexplained, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、説明しないままにした早朝の通話について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你没有说明的凌晨通话现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화에 대한 침묵 책임을 인정하게 하고 가능한 범위만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 통화 중 가장 설명하기 곤란했던 한 통이 어느 날의 통화였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among call timing, caller, and what can be disclosed now, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、通話時点、相手、今話せる範囲の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在通话时间、对象以及现在可说明的范围之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화에 대한 침묵 책임을 인정하게 하고 가능한 범위만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 통화 자체보다 그 뒤로 한 번도 정리해 주지 않은 부분을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 통화에 대한 침묵 책임을 인정하게 하고 가능한 범위만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-call_record-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 통화 기록 전부를 풀라는 것은 아닙니다. 가장 자주 통화한 한 사람에 대해서라도 지금 어떤 연락이었는지 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the early-morning calls you left unexplained that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。説明しないままにした早朝の通話のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你没有说明的凌晨通话中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정을 캐지 않고 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 사정 범위와 첫 시점을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party kept silent about, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。黙っていた事情をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你保持沉默的事情的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 가족 사정으로 입을 다물었다 하더라도 그 침묵이 길어질수록 본인도 부담이 커졌을 것입니다. 그 부담을 어떤 마음으로 견디고 있었는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the circumstances you kept silent about left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、黙っていた事情はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你保持沉默的事情对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정을 캐지 않고 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 사정 범위와 첫 시점을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party kept silent about, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。黙っていた事情をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你保持沉默的事情的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 침묵의 사정을 전부 풀어 놓지 않더라도 지금 자리에서 말할 수 있는 이유만이라도 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the circumstances you kept silent about, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、黙っていた事情について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你保持沉默的事情现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정을 캐지 않고 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 사정 범위와 첫 시점을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party kept silent about, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。黙っていた事情をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你保持沉默的事情的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 끝까지 말하지 못하게 만든 가장 큰 부담이 어떤 종류의 부담이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among the beginning of the silence, its duration, and what can be said now, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、沈黙の始まり、長さ、今話せる範囲の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在沉默的开始、持续时间和现在可说的范围之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정을 캐지 않고 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 사정 범위와 첫 시점을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party kept silent about, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。黙っていた事情をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你保持沉默的事情的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 사정의 정체와 별개로 더 일찍 일부라도 말할 수 있었던 시점이 있었는지 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정을 캐지 않고 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 사정 범위와 첫 시점을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the circumstances the party kept silent about, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。黙っていた事情をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你保持沉默的事情的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-concealment_reason-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 사정 전부를 한 번에 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 침묵을 시작한 첫 시점의 마음만이라도 지금 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the circumstances you kept silent about that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。黙っていた事情のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你保持沉默的事情中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건의 사용처는 지금 캐지 않되 침묵의 마음과 책임 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items and their use, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕收据物品及其用途的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 차 안에 본인이 쓰지 않을 물건들이 쌓여 있었다면 배우자가 다른 사람을 떠올리는 건 자연스러운 흐름입니다. 그 물건들을 그대로 두고 설명하지 않은 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the receipt items and their use left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、レシート品目とその使途はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，收据物品及其用途对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건의 사용처는 지금 캐지 않되 침묵의 마음과 책임 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items and their use, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕收据物品及其用途的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 누가 쓸 물건이었는지 전부 밝히지 않더라도 지금 자리에서 풀 수 있는 사용처만이라도 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the receipt items and their use, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、レシート品目とその使途について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对收据物品及其用途现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건의 사용처는 지금 캐지 않되 침묵의 마음과 책임 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items and their use, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕收据物品及其用途的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 영수증 속 물건 중 본인이 가장 설명하기 곤란했던 한 가지가 어떤 품목이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among who needed the items, why they were bought, and what remains private, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、誰に必要だったか、購入理由、まだ話しにくい部分の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在物品所需对象、购买原因和仍难以说明的部分之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건의 사용처는 지금 캐지 않되 침묵의 마음과 책임 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items and their use, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕收据物品及其用途的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 물건 자체보다 그것을 보고도 뒤늦게라도 풀어 주지 않은 책임은 본인이 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 영수증 물건의 사용처는 지금 캐지 않되 침묵의 마음과 책임 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the receipt items and their use, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕收据物品及其用途的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-family_items-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 모든 영수증을 한 번에 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 가장 오해를 부른 한 품목이라도 지금 어떤 사정으로 산 것인지 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the receipt items and their use that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。レシート品目とその使途のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理收据物品及其用途中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 무게를 인정하되 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 방문·통화 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 설명 없이 반복된 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화가 겹쳤다면 배우자가 의심을 키울 수밖에 없었습니다. 그때 어떤 마음으로 입을 닫고 있었는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts you left unexplained left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 무게를 인정하되 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 방문·통화 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 방문과 통화 자체보다 침묵이 더 오해를 키운 부분이 있었습니다. 지금 자리에서 말씀하실 수 있는 방문 목적과 통화 사정을 그 범위만이라도 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts you left unexplained, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 무게를 인정하되 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 방문·통화 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 오피스텔 방문, 새벽 통화, 차 안 영수증 중 본인이 가장 늦게까지 말 못한 지점이 어디였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among visits, calls, and receipt items, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、訪問、通話、レシート品目の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在探访、通话和收据物品之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 무게를 인정하되 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 방문·통화 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 외도라는 단정에 책임을 돌리기 전에, 본인 침묵이 그 단정에 한 역할이 있었는지 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 무게를 인정하되 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 방문·통화 범위를 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 모든 사정을 한 번에 풀라는 것은 아닙니다. 다만 새벽 통화 한 건이라도 어떤 연락이었는지 지금 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts you left unexplained that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 방문에 대한 침묵을 인정하게 하고 지금 공개 가능한 동선만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated Officetel visits, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 같은 오피스텔을 반복해 들른 동선이 배우자에게 그대로 노출되면 의심이 커지는 것은 자연스럽습니다. 그때 그 방문을 미리 설명하지 못한 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the repeated Officetel visits left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，反复前往韩式商住公寓对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 방문에 대한 침묵을 인정하게 하고 지금 공개 가능한 동선만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated Officetel visits, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 방문 시간과 체류 길이 중 지금 단계에서 떳떳하게 말할 수 있는 범위가 어디까지인지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the repeated Officetel visits, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对反复前往韩式商住公寓现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 방문에 대한 침묵을 인정하게 하고 지금 공개 가능한 동선만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated Officetel visits, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 반복된 방문 중 가장 설명하기 곤란했던 한 차례가 어느 날의 방문이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among visit time, route, and length of stay, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、訪問時間、動線、滞在時間の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在探访时间、路线和停留时长之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 방문에 대한 침묵을 인정하게 하고 지금 공개 가능한 동선만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated Officetel visits, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 방문 자체보다 그 뒤에도 끝내 정리해 주지 않은 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 방문에 대한 침묵을 인정하게 하고 지금 공개 가능한 동선만 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the repeated Officetel visits, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_route-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 모든 동선을 한 번에 풀라는 것은 아닙니다. 가장 빈번했던 한 시간대의 방문 목적이라도 지금 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the repeated Officetel visits that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理反复前往韩式商住公寓中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v1].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 외도 결론에 닿기까지 본 자료와 추정을 분리하고, 다른 가능성 검토 여부를 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你解读为出轨证据的情况的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라고 단정하기까지 본인이 본 사실과 그 사실에 덧붙인 해석을 나눠 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the circumstances you read as proof of an affair.",パク・ジヨンさん、不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认你解读为出轨证据的情况的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v2].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 외도 결론에 닿기까지 본 자료와 추정을 분리하고, 다른 가능성 검토 여부를 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你解读为出轨证据的情况的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v2].text,"본인이 외도 단서로 보는 항목을 가장 결정적인 순서대로 세 가지만 꼽고, 각 항목을 어떤 자료로 확인했는지 답해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v3].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 외도 결론에 닿기까지 본 자료와 추정을 분리하고, 다른 가능성 검토 여부를 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你解读为出轨证据的情况的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v3].text,이준호 씨의 부정 진술과 본인의 의심 사이에서 사실 자체가 아니라 해석이 다른 지점은 어디입니까.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v4].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 외도 결론에 닿기까지 본 자료와 추정을 분리하고, 다른 가능성 검토 여부를 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你解读为出轨证据的情况的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v4].text,"외도라는 결론에 닿기 전, 다른 가능성(가족 사정, 업무, 지인 부탁)을 어떻게 검토하셨는지 자료 기준으로 답해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the circumstances you read as proof of an affair, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对你解读为出轨证据的情况的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v5].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 외도 결론에 닿기까지 본 자료와 추정을 분리하고, 다른 가능성 검토 여부를 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你解读为出轨证据的情况的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-affair_denial-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 의심을 굳히는 과정에서 직접 확인하지 못해 추정으로 남은 사실이 있다면 그 항목을 먼저 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the circumstances you read as proof of an affair remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于你解读为出轨证据的情况，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 확인한 통화기록 항목과 미등록 번호 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls and unknown numbers from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。早朝の通話と知らない番号について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于凌晨通话和陌生号码的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 새벽 통화 내역을 본인이 어떤 시점에, 어떤 자료에서 처음 확인했는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the early-morning calls and unknown numbers.",パク・ジヨンさん、早朝の通話と知らない番号をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认凌晨通话和陌生号码的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 확인한 통화기록 항목과 미등록 번호 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls and unknown numbers from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。早朝の通話と知らない番号について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于凌晨通话和陌生号码的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v2].text,그 통화기록에서 직접 보신 항목과 미등록 번호라서 추정에 머문 항목을 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 확인한 통화기록 항목과 미등록 번호 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls and unknown numbers from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。早朝の通話と知らない番号について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于凌晨通话和陌生号码的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v3].text,이준호 씨의 새벽 통화 설명과 본인이 본 통화기록 사이에 가장 크게 어긋나는 시간대는 언제입니까.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 확인한 통화기록 항목과 미등록 번호 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls and unknown numbers from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。早朝の通話と知らない番号について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于凌晨通话和陌生号码的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v4].text,"같은 시간대 반복 통화라는 판단이 통화 횟수, 통화 길이, 발신지 가운데 어느 자료에서 나왔는지 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",早朝の通話と知らない番号について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对凌晨通话和陌生号码的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 확인한 통화기록 항목과 미등록 번호 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls and unknown numbers from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。早朝の通話と知らない番号について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于凌晨通话和陌生号码的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-call_record-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 새벽 통화에 대해 본인이 아직 직접 확인하지 못한 사실이 있다면 그 부분부터 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the early-morning calls and unknown numbers remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、早朝の通話と知らない番号について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于凌晨通话和陌生号码，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 직접 묻고 답을 받지 못한 항목과 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the husband's silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편의 설명이 부족하다고 처음 느낀 날이 언제였고, 그날 어떤 질문을 하셨는지 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed your husband's silence.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の沈黙をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认丈夫的沉默的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 직접 묻고 답을 받지 못한 항목과 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the husband's silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v2].text,남편이 직접 답한 부분과 끝내 답하지 않은 부분을 본인이 본 그대로 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 직접 묻고 답을 받지 못한 항목과 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the husband's silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v3].text,침묵을 외도의 신호로 해석한 근거 가운데 직접 확인한 사실과 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 직접 묻고 답을 받지 못한 항목과 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the husband's silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v4].text,남편이 답을 피한 항목을 어떤 자료로 다시 확인하셨는지 시점별로 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize which records support your view of your husband's silence, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",夫の沈黙について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对丈夫的沉默的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 직접 묻고 답을 받지 못한 항목과 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the husband's silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_reason-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 의심을 키우는 동안 남편에게 직접 묻지 않은 사실이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about your husband's silence remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の沈黙について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于丈夫的沉默，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증을 외도 단서로 분류한 시점과 직접 확인한 항목을 나눠 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items found in the car from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。車内で見つかったレシート品目について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于车内发现的收据物品的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 차에서 영수증을 발견한 날과 그 영수증을 외도 단서로 분류한 시점을 따로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the receipt items found in the car.",パク・ジヨンさん、車内で見つかったレシート品目をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认车内发现的收据物品的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증을 외도 단서로 분류한 시점과 직접 확인한 항목을 나눠 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items found in the car from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。車内で見つかったレシート品目について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于车内发现的收据物品的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v2].text,영수증 다섯 장 가운데 본인이 직접 살펴본 항목과 의심 위주로 메모해 둔 항목을 나눠 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증을 외도 단서로 분류한 시점과 직접 확인한 항목을 나눠 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items found in the car from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。車内で見つかったレシート品目について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于车内发现的收据物品的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v3].text,이준호 씨의 영수증 설명과 본인이 외도로 본 해석이 가장 크게 부딪히는 항목은 무엇입니까. 그 한 줄부터 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증을 외도 단서로 분류한 시점과 직접 확인한 항목을 나눠 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items found in the car from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。車内で見つかったレシート品目について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于车内发现的收据物品的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v4].text,"머리끈, 틴트, 학용품, 생필품을 본인은 어떤 기준으로 외도 단서와 일상 구매로 나누었는지 항목별로 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the receipt items found in the car, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",車内で見つかったレシート品目について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对车内发现的收据物品的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증을 외도 단서로 분류한 시점과 직접 확인한 항목을 나눠 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items found in the car from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。車内で見つかったレシート品目について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于车内发现的收据物品的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-family_items-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 영수증을 보고 의심을 굳히기 전에 남편에게 직접 확인하지 않은 항목이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the receipt items found in the car remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、車内で見つかったレシート品目について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于车内发现的收据物品，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨가 직접 확인한 자료와 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 외도 의심을 굳히기까지 본인이 직접 본 기록과 다른 사람에게 들은 이야기를 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts.",パク・ジヨンさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨가 직접 확인한 자료와 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,"오피스텔 방문 기록, 새벽 통화 내역, 영수증 가운데 본인 손으로 직접 확인한 항목은 무엇입니까. 추정으로 이어진 부분과 분리해 답해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨가 직접 확인한 자료와 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,이준호 씨의 진술과 본인이 본 기록 사이에 어긋나는 부분이 있다면 그 한 지점부터 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨가 직접 확인한 자료와 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,"의심을 키운 단서를 카드 내역, 통화기록, 영수증 중 어떤 자료로 확인했는지 자료 단위로 다시 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートについて、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨가 직접 확인한 자료와 추정으로 메운 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라는 결론을 내리기 전에 직접 묻거나 확인하지 않은 사실이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートについて直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 본 출입 기록과 자료 누적으로 추정한 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated route to the same Officetel from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편의 오피스텔 출입을 본인이 직접 확인한 날과 카드 내역만으로 짐작한 날을 시간순으로 나눠 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the repeated route to the same Officetel.",パク・ジヨンさん、同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 본 출입 기록과 자료 누적으로 추정한 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated route to the same Officetel from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v2].text,"GPS 알림, 카드 결제, 매장 마감 이후 귀가 시간 가운데 어떤 자료로 동선을 정리하셨는지 답해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 본 출입 기록과 자료 누적으로 추정한 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated route to the same Officetel from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v3].text,이준호 씨가 말한 방문 사정과 본인이 본 출입 기록이 가장 크게 어긋나는 날짜는 언제입니까.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 본 출입 기록과 자료 누적으로 추정한 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated route to the same Officetel from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v4].text,"같은 오피스텔에 반복 방문이라는 판단이 직접 본 횟수에 근거한 것인지, 자료 누적으로 추정한 것인지 자료별로 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the repeated route to the same Officetel, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 직접 본 출입 기록과 자료 누적으로 추정한 부분을 분리해 답하게 한다. 외도 단정으로 결론을 끌어가지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated route to the same Officetel from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_route-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 동선만으로는 아직 풀리지 않는 의문이 있다면 어떤 기록에서 비롯되었는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the repeated route to the same Officetel remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 행동 인정과 외도 해석 부정을 사실관계 차원에서 분리해 답하게 한다. 가족 정체는 S5 전 직접 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your denial of an affair and the silence beside it from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open family identities before S5.",事実追及。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは家族の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨가 외도라고 주장하는 정황 가운데 본인이 사실로 인정하는 행동과 인정할 수 없는 해석을 나눠 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about your denial of an affair and the silence beside it in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、不倫否定とその横にある沈黙に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 행동 인정과 외도 해석 부정을 사실관계 차원에서 분리해 답하게 한다. 가족 정체는 S5 전 직접 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your denial of an affair and the silence beside it from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open family identities before S5.",事実追及。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは家族の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v2].text,"오피스텔 출입과 새벽 통화, 차 안 영수증이 모두 본인 쪽에서 비롯된 일이라는 점은 맞습니까. 그 가운데 외도와 무관하다고 보는 근거를 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 행동 인정과 외도 해석 부정을 사실관계 차원에서 분리해 답하게 한다. 가족 정체는 S5 전 직접 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your denial of an affair and the silence beside it from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open family identities before S5.",事実追及。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは家族の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v3].text,"외도라는 결론과 본인 설명이 어긋나는 가장 큰 지점을 한 가지만 짚어, 그 부분부터 사실관계로 답해 주십시오.",Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 행동 인정과 외도 해석 부정을 사실관계 차원에서 분리해 답하게 한다. 가족 정체는 S5 전 직접 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your denial of an affair and the silence beside it from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open family identities before S5.",事実追及。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは家族の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v4].text,본인의 행동이 외도가 아니라는 점을 뒷받침할 수 있는 기록이 있다면 어떤 자료부터 제출할 수 있는지 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 행동 인정과 외도 해석 부정을 사실관계 차원에서 분리해 답하게 한다. 가족 정체는 S5 전 직접 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your denial of an affair and the silence beside it from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open family identities before S5.",事実追及。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは家族の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你否认出轨及伴随的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-affair_denial-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 외도 부정의 근거 가운데 지금 자리에서 공개할 수 있는 범위와 아직 말하기 어려운 범위를 구분해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about your denial of an affair and the silence beside it you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、不倫否定とその横にある沈黙についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你否认出轨及伴随的沉默，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 새벽 통화의 발신·수신·시점을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 번호·조카 학교 알림은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's number and the niece/nephew's school notice before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにした早朝の通話について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の番号と甥・姪の学校通知を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的凌晨通话的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥号码和侄子/侄女的学校提醒。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 시간대에 걸려오거나 직접 건 통화의 시점과 길이를 통신 기록 순서대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about the early-morning calls you left unexplained in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、説明しないままにした早朝の通話に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于你没有说明的凌晨通话的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 새벽 통화의 발신·수신·시점을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 번호·조카 학교 알림은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's number and the niece/nephew's school notice before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにした早朝の通話について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の番号と甥・姪の学校通知を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的凌晨通话的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥号码和侄子/侄女的学校提醒。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v2].text,"그 통화 가운데 본인이 직접 응답한 것과 부재중으로 끝난 것, 발신과 수신을 나눠 답해 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 새벽 통화의 발신·수신·시점을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 번호·조카 학교 알림은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's number and the niece/nephew's school notice before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにした早朝の通話について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の番号と甥・姪の学校通知を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的凌晨通话的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥号码和侄子/侄女的学校提醒。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v3].text,박지연 씨는 새벽 통화를 외도 정황으로 보고 있습니다. 본인이 인정하는 통화 사실과 그 해석에 동의할 수 없는 부분을 사실관계로 분리해 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 새벽 통화의 발신·수신·시점을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 번호·조카 학교 알림은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's number and the niece/nephew's school notice before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにした早朝の通話について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の番号と甥・姪の学校通知を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的凌晨通话的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥号码和侄子/侄女的学校提醒。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v4].text,"미등록 번호로 들어온 문자와 짧은 통화 가운데, 이 자리에서 확인하실 수 있는 항목까지 기록을 기준으로 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 새벽 통화의 발신·수신·시점을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 번호·조카 학교 알림은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the early-morning calls the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's number and the niece/nephew's school notice before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにした早朝の通話について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の番号と甥・姪の学校通知を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的凌晨通话的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥号码和侄子/侄女的学校提醒。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-call_record-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 그 새벽 통화의 상대가 누구인지 아직 답하지 않으셨습니다. 지금 단계에서 밝힐 수 있는 범위까지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about the early-morning calls you left unexplained you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、説明しないままにした早朝の通話についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你没有说明的凌晨通话，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 시점과 답변 범위 변화를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형 개인회생·조카 돌봄 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party kept silent about from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's personal rehabilitation and the niece/nephew care arrangement before S5.",事実追及。黙っていた事情について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の個人再生と甥・姪の世話の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你保持沉默的事情的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥个人重整和侄子/侄女照护身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화에 대해 박지연 씨에게 처음 설명하지 않기로 한 시점이 언제였는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about the circumstances you kept silent about in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、黙っていた事情に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于你保持沉默的事情的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 시점과 답변 범위 변화를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형 개인회생·조카 돌봄 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party kept silent about from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's personal rehabilitation and the niece/nephew care arrangement before S5.",事実追及。黙っていた事情について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の個人再生と甥・姪の世話の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你保持沉默的事情的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥个人重整和侄子/侄女照护身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v2].text,그 뒤 박지연 씨의 질문이 들어왔을 때 본인이 어디까지 답하고 어디부터 말을 줄였는지 시간순으로 나눠 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 시점과 답변 범위 변화를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형 개인회생·조카 돌봄 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party kept silent about from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's personal rehabilitation and the niece/nephew care arrangement before S5.",事実追及。黙っていた事情について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の個人再生と甥・姪の世話の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你保持沉默的事情的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥个人重整和侄子/侄女照护身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v3].text,"박지연 씨가 묻기 전과 묻고 난 뒤, 본인이 같은 사실을 다르게 설명한 부분이 있다면 그 차이를 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.",Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 시점과 답변 범위 변화를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형 개인회생·조카 돌봄 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party kept silent about from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's personal rehabilitation and the niece/nephew care arrangement before S5.",事実追及。黙っていた事情について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の個人再生と甥・姪の世話の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你保持沉默的事情的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥个人重整和侄子/侄女照护身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v4].text,"방문, 통화, 영수증 가운데 끝까지 입을 다문 항목과 일부만 인정한 항목을 자료별로 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 시점과 답변 범위 변화를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형 개인회생·조카 돌봄 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the circumstances the party kept silent about from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's personal rehabilitation and the niece/nephew care arrangement before S5.",事実追及。黙っていた事情について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の個人再生と甥・姪の世話の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你保持沉默的事情的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥个人重整和侄子/侄女照护身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_reason-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 지금 자리에서 공개할 수 있는 사정과 아직 보류하고 싶은 사정을 구분해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about the circumstances you kept silent about you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、黙っていた事情についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你保持沉默的事情，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증 품목별 구매 사실을 시간순으로 정리하게 한다. 조카 학용품 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items and their use from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the niece/nephew school-supply context before S5.",事実追及。レシート品目とその使途について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは甥・姪の学用品の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于收据物品及其用途的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示侄子/侄女学习用品的背景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 차 안에서 발견된 영수증 다섯 장의 결제일과 매장을 본인이 기억하는 순서대로 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about the receipt items and their use in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、レシート品目とその使途に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于收据物品及其用途的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증 품목별 구매 사실을 시간순으로 정리하게 한다. 조카 학용품 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items and their use from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the niece/nephew school-supply context before S5.",事実追及。レシート品目とその使途について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは甥・姪の学用品の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于收据物品及其用途的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示侄子/侄女学习用品的背景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v2].text,"결제 내역 가운데 본인이 직접 산 물건, 다른 사람과 같이 있을 때 산 물건, 부탁받아 산 물건을 나눠 답해 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증 품목별 구매 사실을 시간순으로 정리하게 한다. 조카 학용품 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items and their use from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the niece/nephew school-supply context before S5.",事実追及。レシート品目とその使途について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは甥・姪の学用品の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于收据物品及其用途的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示侄子/侄女学习用品的背景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v3].text,"박지연 씨는 머리끈, 틴트, 손거울을 외도 정황으로 보고 있습니다. 본인이 인정하는 구매 사실과 그 해석을 받아들일 수 없는 부분을 사실관계로 분리해 주십시오.",Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증 품목별 구매 사실을 시간순으로 정리하게 한다. 조카 학용품 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items and their use from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the niece/nephew school-supply context before S5.",事実追及。レシート品目とその使途について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは甥・姪の学用品の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于收据物品及其用途的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示侄子/侄女学习用品的背景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v4].text,"같은 영수증 묶음에 들어 있는 학용품과 생필품이 누구에게 필요했던 물건인지, 영수증 기록에 따라 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 영수증 품목별 구매 사실을 시간순으로 정리하게 한다. 조카 학용품 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the receipt items and their use from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the niece/nephew school-supply context before S5.",事実追及。レシート品目とその使途について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは甥・姪の学用品の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于收据物品及其用途的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示侄子/侄女学习用品的背景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-family_items-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 영수증 속 품목 가운데 사용처를 아직 밝히지 않은 항목이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about the receipt items and their use you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、レシート品目とその使途についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于收据物品及其用途，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 이준호 씨의 방문·통화 행동을 외도 해석과 분리해 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형·조카 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open older brother and niece/nephew identities before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄・甥姪の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥及侄子/侄女身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 퇴근 후 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화는 본인 행동입니다. 어떤 날짜에 어디까지 들렀는지 시간순으로 먼저 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts you left unexplained in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 이준호 씨의 방문·통화 행동을 외도 해석과 분리해 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형·조카 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open older brother and niece/nephew identities before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄・甥姪の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥及侄子/侄女身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].text,"GPS 기록과 통화 내역에 남은 행적 중에서, 본인 행동으로 인정하는 것과 기억나지 않는 것을 나눠 답해 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 이준호 씨의 방문·통화 행동을 외도 해석과 분리해 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형·조카 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open older brother and niece/nephew identities before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄・甥姪の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥及侄子/侄女身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].text,박지연 씨의 외도 주장과 이준호 씨 설명이 가장 크게 어긋나는 사실이 무엇입니까. 그 지점부터 사실관계로 답해 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
