judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].text,"영수증, 통화기록, 방문 시간 가운데 지금 자리에서 인정하는 항목과 아직 다투고 싶은 항목을 구분해 말씀해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 이준호 씨의 방문·통화 행동을 외도 해석과 분리해 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 친형·조카 정체는 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open older brother and niece/nephew identities before S5.",事実追及。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄・甥姪の正体を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥及侄子/侄女身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 방문과 통화에 대해 본인이 아직 진술하지 않은 행동이 남아 있다면 먼저 꺼내 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts you left unexplained you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 오피스텔 동선과 체류 시간을 본인 행동 기준으로 답하게 한다. 친형 주소·조카 돌봄은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's address and niece/nephew care before S5.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の住所と甥・姪の世話を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往韩式商住公寓的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥地址和侄子/侄女照护。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 매장 마감 후 같은 오피스텔로 향한 동선과 체류 시간을 최근 한 달부터 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about the repeated Officetel visits in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于反复前往韩式商住公寓的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 오피스텔 동선과 체류 시간을 본인 행동 기준으로 답하게 한다. 친형 주소·조카 돌봄은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's address and niece/nephew care before S5.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の住所と甥・姪の世話を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往韩式商住公寓的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥地址和侄子/侄女照护。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v2].text,"GPS 기록과 본인 기억이 다른 날이 있다면 어떤 날이고, 본인이 인정하는 동선은 어디까지입니까.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 오피스텔 동선과 체류 시간을 본인 행동 기준으로 답하게 한다. 친형 주소·조카 돌봄은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's address and niece/nephew care before S5.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の住所と甥・姪の世話を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往韩式商住公寓的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥地址和侄子/侄女照护。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v3].text,박지연 씨가 동선만 보고 외도라고 주장하는 부분과 본인이 그날 실제로 한 행동이 어긋나는 지점을 먼저 짚어 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 오피스텔 동선과 체류 시간을 본인 행동 기준으로 답하게 한다. 친형 주소·조카 돌봄은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's address and niece/nephew care before S5.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の住所と甥・姪の世話を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往韩式商住公寓的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥地址和侄子/侄女照护。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v4].text,"그 오피스텔에서 본인이 만난 사람과 머문 시간이 어떤 기록에 남아 있는지, 자료 단위로 다시 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 오피스텔 동선과 체류 시간을 본인 행동 기준으로 답하게 한다. 친형 주소·조카 돌봄은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the repeated Officetel visits from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother's address and niece/nephew care before S5.",事実追及。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは実兄の住所と甥・姪の世話を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于反复前往韩式商住公寓的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示亲哥哥地址和侄子/侄女照护。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_route-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 그 오피스텔에 들렀던 이유 가운데 지금 자리에서 공개할 수 있는 범위는 어디까지입니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about the repeated Officetel visits you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于反复前往韩式商住公寓，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 결론을 손에서 놓지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편의 외도 부정을 거짓이라고 단정한 결정적 순간을 본인의 판단 기준으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the circumstances you read as proof of an affair.",パク・ジヨンさん、不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 결론을 손에서 놓지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v2].text,"외도가 아닐 가능성 쪽 정황을 따로 살펴본 적이 있었는지, 없었다면 그 이유가 무엇이었습니까.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 결론을 손에서 놓지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v3].text,"외도라는 결론을 손에서 놓지 않은 까닭이 정황의 무게 때문이었는지, 그 결론이 본인을 보호해 주는 측면 때문이었는지 나눠 답해 주십시오.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 결론을 손에서 놓지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v4].text,남편이 외도가 아니라고 답할 때마다 받아들이지 못한 이유가 어디에 있었는지 본인 마음 쪽에서 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 결론을 손에서 놓지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party read as proof of an affair, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。不倫の証拠だと読んだ状況をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你解读为出轨证据的情况作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-affair_denial-v5].text,"외도가 아니었다는 결론이 나올 가능성에 대해, 어느 시점부터 가능성을 닫기로 했는지 그 결정의 배경을 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 통화 상대를 직접 묻지 않고 의심을 모은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 새벽 통화 기록을 봤을 때 업무·가족 연락보다 다른 여자 쪽으로 먼저 무게를 둔 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers.",パク・ジヨンさん、早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 통화 상대를 직접 묻지 않고 의심을 모은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v2].text,미등록 번호의 문자 내역을 남편에게 직접 들이밀고 묻지 않은 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 통화 상대를 직접 묻지 않고 의심을 모은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v3].text,한 번이라도 통화 상대를 정면으로 확인할 기회가 있었음에도 그 자리를 미룬 본인 쪽 이유가 무엇이었습니까.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 통화 상대를 직접 묻지 않고 의심을 모은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v4].text,"확인을 미루는 동안 의심이 굳어졌다면, 그렇게 굳어지도록 둔 본인 결정에 어떤 두려움이나 자기 보호 판단이 있었습니까.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 통화 상대를 직접 묻지 않고 의심을 모은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls and unknown numbers, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。早朝の通話と知らない番号をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕凌晨通话和陌生号码作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-call_record-v5].text,"남편이 솔직히 답할 가능성과, 그 답이 본인이 듣고 싶은 답이 아닐 가능성 중 어느 쪽이 더 두려웠는지 설명해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면으로 묻지 않고 자료 모으기로 응한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the husband's silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편이 무언가 숨기고 있다고 판단한 시점에 그 사실을 정면으로 묻기보다 혼자 확인을 이어 간 결정의 동기가 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around your husband's silence.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の沈黙をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕丈夫的沉默作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면으로 묻지 않고 자료 모으기로 응한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the husband's silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v2].text,남편에게 바로 묻지 않고 의심을 자료로 모아 둔 본인 결정에 어떤 계산이나 두려움이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면으로 묻지 않고 자료 모으기로 응한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the husband's silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v3].text,"정면으로 물었다가 가장 두려워하던 답이 돌아올까 봐 미룬 측면이 있었는지, 있다면 그 답은 어떤 종류였는지 답해 주십시오.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면으로 묻지 않고 자료 모으기로 응한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the husband's silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v4].text,"남편의 숨김에 본인의 침묵으로 응한 부분이 있었다면, 그 선택의 동기를 따로 떼어 설명해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면으로 묻지 않고 자료 모으기로 응한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the husband's silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-concealment_reason-v5].text,그 모든 정황을 모아 두기만 하고 직접 대화 자리에 올리지 않은 본인 결정의 핵심 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.,"Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 사용처 가능성을 빨리 닫고 외도로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items found in the car, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕车内发现的收据物品作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 차에서 발견된 영수증 물건을 보고 다른 설명 가능성보다 외도 정황으로 먼저 해석한 본인 판단의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the receipt items found in the car.",パク・ジヨンさん、車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕车内发现的收据物品作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 사용처 가능성을 빨리 닫고 외도로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items found in the car, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕车内发现的收据物品作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v2].text,헤어롤·틴트 같은 항목을 봤을 때 가족이나 지인 쪽 사용처를 검토해 보지 않은 이유가 무엇이었습니까.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 사용처 가능성을 빨리 닫고 외도로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items found in the car, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕车内发现的收据物品作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v3].text,"남편에게 그 영수증을 직접 들이밀어 묻지 않고, 혼자 사진을 모아 두기로 한 본인 결정에 어떤 계산이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 사용처 가능성을 빨리 닫고 외도로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items found in the car, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕车内发现的收据物品作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v4].text,"그 영수증이 외도가 아니라는 답으로 돌아왔을 때 받아들일 준비가 되어 있었는지, 안 되어 있었다면 그 이유를 설명해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 사용처 가능성을 빨리 닫고 외도로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items found in the car, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。車内で見つかったレシート品目をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕车内发现的收据物品作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-family_items-v5].text,그 물건들을 외도의 결정적 정황으로 굳혀 간 판단이 단정으로 넘어간 시점이 언제였는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 묻지 않고 외도 의심으로 굳혀 간 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 같은 정황을 다른 식으로 해석할 여지가 있었는데도 외도라는 결론으로 먼저 기울게 된 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts.",パク・ジヨンさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 묻지 않고 외도 의심으로 굳혀 간 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,"차에 남은 영수증 물건을 봤을 때, 가족이나 동료 쪽 가능성보다 외도 쪽이 먼저 떠오른 배경에 어떤 경험이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 묻지 않고 외도 의심으로 굳혀 간 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,남편에게 직접 묻지 않고 혼자 확인을 이어 간 결정의 동기가 어디에 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 묻지 않고 외도 의심으로 굳혀 간 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,"의심을 흔들리지 않게 만든 것이 과거 어느 경험이었는지, 아니면 지금 보유한 기록 자체였는지 나눠 답해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 묻지 않고 외도 의심으로 굳혀 간 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, early-morning calls, and receipts, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复的韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,"외도가 아닐 가능성을 잠시라도 검토해 본 순간이 있었는지, 있었다면 왜 그 가능성을 빨리 닫았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 장소를 직접 확인하지 않고 외도 거점으로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated route to the same Officetel, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 오피스텔이 어떤 곳인지 직접 묻기 전부터 외도 거점일 거라고 무게를 둔 본인의 판단 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the repeated route to the same Officetel.",パク・ジヨンさん、同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 장소를 직접 확인하지 않고 외도 거점으로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated route to the same Officetel, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v2].text,"GPS와 방문 빈도를 모았을 때, 다른 설명을 함께 검토해 보지 않은 이유가 어디에 있었는지 답해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 장소를 직접 확인하지 않고 외도 거점으로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated route to the same Officetel, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v3].text,남편에게 그 장소가 무엇인지 직접 확인하지 않고 의심을 더 모아 간 본인 결정의 동기를 설명해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 장소를 직접 확인하지 않고 외도 거점으로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated route to the same Officetel, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v4].text,사실대로 들었다가 받아들이기 싫은 답이 나올 거라는 두려움이 있었습니까. 있었다면 어떤 답을 가장 피하고 싶었습니까.,Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 장소를 직접 확인하지 않고 외도 거점으로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated route to the same Officetel, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。同じオフィステルへ繰り返し向かう動線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往同一韩式商住公寓的路线作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_route-v5].text,그 동선을 정황 기록만으로 결론까지 굳혀 간 판단이 어느 시점에 단정으로 넘어갔는지 답해 주십시오.,"Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 부정 외에 추가 설명을 자른 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 외도가 아니라고 처음부터 말하면서도 외도가 아닌 이유 자체는 끝까지 설명하지 않은 까닭이 무엇입니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it.",イ・ジュノさん、不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 부정 외에 추가 설명을 자른 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v2].text,단순한 부정만으로는 의심이 풀리지 않을 걸 알면서도 더 구체적인 설명을 미룬 결정의 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 부정 외에 추가 설명을 자른 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v3].text,"외도라는 의심을 피하기 위해 침묵을 택했다면, 그 침묵이 결과적으로 의심을 키울 거라는 점은 어디까지 예상하고 있었는지 답해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 부정 외에 추가 설명을 자른 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v4].text,"외도가 아니라는 부정 한 마디와, 그 옆에 붙였어야 할 사정 한 가지 사이에서 뒤쪽을 끝까지 자른 동기가 무엇이었습니까.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 외도 부정 외에 추가 설명을 자른 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your denial of an affair and the silence beside it, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。不倫否定とその横にある沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你否认出轨及伴随的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-affair_denial-v5].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 외도 부정 외에 더 보태기 어려웠던 사정이 어떤 종류였는지 설명해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 새벽 통화와 미등록 번호를 둘러댄 침묵의 이유를 묻되 형 번호·학교 알림은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 시간대에 들어오는 짧은 통화를 배우자가 모르는 채로 두기로 한 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the early-morning calls you left unexplained.",イ・ジュノさん、説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 새벽 통화와 미등록 번호를 둘러댄 침묵의 이유를 묻되 형 번호·학교 알림은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v2].text,미등록 번호로 오는 연락이라는 걸 알면서도 잘못 걸린 전화라고 둘러댄 이유가 어디에 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 새벽 통화와 미등록 번호를 둘러댄 침묵의 이유를 묻되 형 번호·학교 알림은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v3].text,그 통화 자체보다 통화 상대를 묻는 질문이 더 부담스러웠던 까닭을 설명해 주십시오.,"If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 새벽 통화와 미등록 번호를 둘러댄 침묵의 이유를 묻되 형 번호·학교 알림은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v4].text,"긴급한 연락이었다면 한 줄이라도 알릴 수 있었을 텐데, 그 단계조차 생략한 판단의 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 새벽 통화와 미등록 번호를 둘러댄 침묵의 이유를 묻되 형 번호·학교 알림은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the early-morning calls the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。説明しないままにした早朝の通話をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的凌晨通话作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-call_record-v5].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 그 연락 내용을 끝까지 둘러대기로 한 마음이 어떤 두려움에서 비롯됐는지 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건을 모두 묻어두기로 한 본인 침묵의 핵심 동기를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party kept silent about, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。黙っていた事情をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你保持沉默的事情作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 방문, 통화, 물건 모두를 끝까지 설명하지 않은 일관된 이유가 어디에 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the circumstances you kept silent about.",イ・ジュノさん、黙っていた事情をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你保持沉默的事情作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건을 모두 묻어두기로 한 본인 침묵의 핵심 동기를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party kept silent about, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。黙っていた事情をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你保持沉默的事情作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v2].text,"조금만 풀어 말해도 의심이 줄어들었을 텐데, 그 한 발을 끝까지 내딛지 않게 만든 두려움이나 계산이 무엇이었습니까.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건을 모두 묻어두기로 한 본인 침묵의 핵심 동기를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party kept silent about, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。黙っていた事情をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你保持沉默的事情作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v3].text,"사실대로 말할 경우 따라올 가족 쪽 갈등과, 침묵으로 인한 부부 갈등 중 어느 쪽 부담을 더 크게 잡고 있었는지 답해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건을 모두 묻어두기로 한 본인 침묵의 핵심 동기를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party kept silent about, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。黙っていた事情をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你保持沉默的事情作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v4].text,그 침묵이 한 번의 상황 모면이 아니라 반복적 선택으로 굳어진 이유를 본인 기준에서 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건을 모두 묻어두기로 한 본인 침묵의 핵심 동기를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the circumstances the party kept silent about, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。黙っていた事情をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你保持沉默的事情作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-concealment_reason-v5].text,"지금까지 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 그 사정을 마지막까지 묻어두기로 한 결정의 핵심 동기를 한 가지로 정리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 영수증 물건 사용처를 모호하게 둔 침묵의 이유를 묻되 조카·형 가족은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items and their use, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕收据物品及其用途作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 차에서 발견된 영수증 물건의 사용처를 처음 추궁받았을 때 곧바로 정리해 답하지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the receipt items and their use.",イ・ジュノさん、レシート品目とその使途をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕收据物品及其用途作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 영수증 물건 사용처를 모호하게 둔 침묵의 이유를 묻되 조카·형 가족은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items and their use, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕收据物品及其用途作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v2].text,그 물건이 누구에게 필요한 것이었는지를 끝까지 모호하게 둔 결정의 동기가 어디에 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 영수증 물건 사용처를 모호하게 둔 침묵의 이유를 묻되 조카·형 가족은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items and their use, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕收据物品及其用途作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v3].text,"사실대로 답할 경우 따라 나올 또 다른 질문 쪽이 더 부담스러웠던 것은 아니었는지, 본인 기준으로 설명해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 영수증 물건 사용처를 모호하게 둔 침묵의 이유를 묻되 조카·형 가족은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items and their use, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕收据物品及其用途作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v4].text,"받는 사람을 직접 말하지 않고 ""필요한 사람이 있다""는 식으로 둘러댄 동기가 어디에서 왔습니까.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 영수증 물건 사용처를 모호하게 둔 침묵의 이유를 묻되 조카·형 가족은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the receipt items and their use, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。レシート品目とその使途をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕收据物品及其用途作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-family_items-v5].text,"지금 말씀하실 수 있는 범위 안에서, 그 물건의 사용처를 가장 늦게 꺼내기로 한 마음을 설명해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건 정황을 끝까지 설명하지 않은 본인 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화 정황이 쌓이는 동안 배우자에게 먼저 정리해 두지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts you left unexplained.",イ・ジュノさん、説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건 정황을 끝까지 설명하지 않은 본인 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,"외도로 오해받을 만한 상황이라는 걸 본인도 아셨다면, 그때 침묵을 택한 판단 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건 정황을 끝까지 설명하지 않은 본인 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,"방문과 통화를 따로 풀어 설명할 수도 있었는데, 둘 다 미루기로 한 동기가 무엇이었는지 답해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건 정황을 끝까지 설명하지 않은 본인 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,"그때 가장 피하고 싶었던 대화가 방문 장소 쪽이었는지, 통화 상대 쪽이었는지 답해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문·통화·물건 정황을 끝까지 설명하지 않은 본인 침묵의 이유를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the Officetel visits, calls, and receipts the party left unexplained, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。説明しないままにしたオフィステル訪問、通話、レシートをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你没有说明的韩式商住公寓探访、通话和收据作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,"지금 자리에서 말씀하실 수 있는 범위 안에서, 그 사정을 끝까지 묻어 두기로 한 마음이 어디에서 비롯됐는지 설명해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복 방문 동선을 알리지 않은 침묵의 이유를 묻되 친형·조카는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 같은 오피스텔에 반복해서 들르면서도 그 동선을 배우자에게 알리지 않은 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the repeated Officetel visits.",イ・ジュノさん、繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복 방문 동선을 알리지 않은 침묵의 이유를 묻되 친형·조카는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v2].text,"퇴근 후 곧장 그 장소로 가는 패턴이 굳어지는 동안, 들켜도 설명할 수 있게 미리 정리해 두지 않은 이유가 무엇이었습니까.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복 방문 동선을 알리지 않은 침묵의 이유를 묻되 친형·조카는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v3].text,방문 자체보다 그 장소의 성격을 묻는 질문이 더 부담스러웠던 까닭이 어디에 있는지 답해 주십시오.,"If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
