judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v4].text,"큰 사정만이라도 먼저 알릴 수 있었을 텐데, 그것조차 미루기로 한 판단 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복 방문 동선을 알리지 않은 침묵의 이유를 묻되 친형·조카는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the repeated Officetel visits, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。繰り返されたオフィステル訪問をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕反复前往韩式商住公寓作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_route-v5].text,"지금 말씀하실 수 있는 범위 안에서, 그 동선을 끝까지 비밀로 둔 것이 두려움이었는지 계산이었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록 발견 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사용처 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 4개월 전 3,000만원이 현금으로 빠져나간 기록을 보았을 때 부부 재정에 대한 신뢰가 크게 흔들렸을 것입니다. 그 순간의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the ₩30M cash withdrawal record could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.","パク・ジヨンさん、3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。",朴智妍女士，我理解3000万韩元现金取款记录对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록 발견 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사용처 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 출금 기록을 처음 마주한 자리가 어땠는지, 어디까지가 본인이 직접 본 부분이었는지 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the ₩30M cash withdrawal record from what you filled in by inference.","パク・ジヨンさん、3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。",朴智妍女士，请把你对3000万韩元现金取款记录直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록 발견 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사용처 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 금액의 크기와 현금이라는 방식 중 더 충격이었던 쪽이 어느 쪽이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among withdrawal date, amount, and source record, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、出金日、金額、根拠資料の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在取款日期、金额和依据资料之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록 발견 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사용처 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 본 뒤 본인 마음이 곧바로 어떤 결론으로 기울었는지, 그렇게 단정한 부분만이라도 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록 발견 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사용처 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-cash_withdrawal-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 사용처를 지금 묻자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그 기록을 처음 본 한 순간만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the ₩30M cash withdrawal record weighed most heavily on you.","パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。",朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看3000万韩元现金取款记录对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동의 배제로 무너진 신뢰의 마음을 인정하되 사후 단정 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around being left out of a major marital financial decision, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 부부의 큰돈 결정에서 본인이 빠져 있었다는 사실을 알게 된 순간 신뢰의 자리부터 흔들렸을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how being left out of a major marital financial decision could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことはご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동의 배제로 무너진 신뢰의 마음을 인정하되 사후 단정 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around being left out of a major marital financial decision, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 동의 없는 결정의 무게는 무게대로 두고, 본인이 그 사실을 어떻게 알게 됐는지부터 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about being left out of a major marital financial decision from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことについて、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동의 배제로 무너진 신뢰의 마음을 인정하되 사후 단정 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around being left out of a major marital financial decision, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 동의 배제 자체와 사후 침묵 중 더 받아들이기 어려웠던 쪽이 어느 쪽이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among notice, consent, and what you learned afterward, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、通知、同意、後から知った事実の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在告知、同意以及事后得知的事实之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동의 배제로 무너진 신뢰의 마음을 인정하되 사후 단정 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around being left out of a major marital financial decision, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 동의 없는 결정에 대한 분노와는 별개로, 본인이 사후에 곧바로 결론으로 기울었던 부분이 있었는지, 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동의 배제로 무너진 신뢰의 마음을 인정하되 사후 단정 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around being left out of a major marital financial decision, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-consent_boundary-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 동의 절차 자체를 지금 다시 정리하자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인이 그 결정에서 가장 깊게 배제됐다고 느낀 한 시점을 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when being left out of a major marital financial decision weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことが最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록을 본 충격을 인정하되 결론으로 단정해 옮긴 본인 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 부부 재정에서 큰돈이 사라진 기록을 발견했을 때의 충격은 누구라도 컸을 것입니다. 그 기록을 본 순간의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the large withdrawal from your husband’s personal account could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の個人口座からの大口出金はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解丈夫个人账户的大额取款对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록을 본 충격을 인정하되 결론으로 단정해 옮긴 본인 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 알게 된 경위와 그 안에서 직접 확인한 부분과 추정한 부분의 경계를 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the large withdrawal from your husband’s personal account from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の個人口座からの大口出金について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对丈夫个人账户的大额取款直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록을 본 충격을 인정하되 결론으로 단정해 옮긴 본인 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 금액, 시점, 현금 처리 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 부분이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among the withdrawal record, account details, and your notes, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、出金記録、口座情報、ご自身のメモの中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在取款记录、账户细节和你的记录之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록을 본 충격을 인정하되 결론으로 단정해 옮긴 본인 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록 자체와 그 위에 어떤 결론을 얹었는지 분리해, 본인이 다시 점검할 수 있는 부분을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출금 기록을 본 충격을 인정하되 결론으로 단정해 옮긴 본인 부분을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 사용처를 지금 따져 묻자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그 출금 기록을 발견한 한 시점을 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the large withdrawal from your husband’s personal account weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。夫の個人口座からの大口出金が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看丈夫个人账户的大额取款对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 부부 재정 신뢰가 흔들린 마음을 인정하되 자금 성격 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 부부 재정에 같이 묶여 있다고 믿어 온 입장에서 개인 자금이라는 말 자체가 무너지는 느낌으로 다가왔을 것입니다. 그 느낌을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the boundary between personal funds and marital property could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 부부 재정 신뢰가 흔들린 마음을 인정하되 자금 성격 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 돈이 공동 적금에서 나온 것인지 남편 개인 계좌에서 나온 것인지, 본인이 직접 눈으로 확인한 데까지만 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the boundary between personal funds and marital property from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 부부 재정 신뢰가 흔들린 마음을 인정하되 자금 성격 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 개인 돈과 공동 돈의 경계 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 부분이 어떤 부분이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among joint savings, personal accounts, and balance changes, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金、個人口座、残高変動の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在共同储蓄、个人账户和余额变动之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 부부 재정 신뢰가 흔들린 마음을 인정하되 자금 성격 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 자금의 성격을 떠나, 본인이 곧바로 결론으로 기울었던 부분만이라도 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 부부 재정 신뢰가 흔들린 마음을 인정하되 자금 성격 단정은 미루게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-private_fund_boundary-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 경계 자체를 지금 단정 짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그 경계 위에서 가장 흔들렸던 한 순간만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the boundary between personal funds and marital property weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인을 추정한 마음을 인정하되 본인이 직접 확인하지 않은 채 결론으로 옮긴 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕取出现金的去向的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 출금된 현금이 누구에게 갔을지 떠올리는 동안 의심은 점점 구체적인 대상으로 옮겨 갔을 것입니다. 그 흐름의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how where the withdrawn cash may have gone could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、引き出された現金の行き先はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解取出现金的去向对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인을 추정한 마음을 인정하되 본인이 직접 확인하지 않은 채 결론으로 옮긴 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕取出现金的去向的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 받는 사람을 떠올리는 과정에서 직접 확인한 정황과 짐작한 부분이 섞여 있었을 것입니다. 그 경계를 지금 한번 짚어 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about where the withdrawn cash may have gone from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、引き出された現金の行き先について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对取出现金的去向直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인을 추정한 마음을 인정하되 본인이 직접 확인하지 않은 채 결론으로 옮긴 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕取出现金的去向的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 현금이라는 방식 자체에서 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 부분이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among the funds flow you saw and the assumptions you made, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、確認した資金の流れと推測の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在你看到的资金流向和作出的推测之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인을 추정한 마음을 인정하되 본인이 직접 확인하지 않은 채 결론으로 옮긴 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕取出现金的去向的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 받는 사람을 직접 확인하지 못한 채 본인 안에서 어떤 결론을 먼저 얹어 두었는지, 그 부분을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인을 추정한 마음을 인정하되 본인이 직접 확인하지 않은 채 결론으로 옮긴 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕取出现金的去向的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-recipient_reason-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 받는 사람을 지금 추궁하자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 의심이 가장 깊어진 그 한 순간을 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when where the withdrawn cash may have gone weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。引き出された現金の行き先が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看取出现金的去向对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 인출 결심의 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 시점·방식 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕取出3000万韩元现金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 3,000만원을 한꺼번에 현금으로 인출하려면 본인 안에서도 결심이 필요했을 것입니다. 그 결심을 어떤 마음으로 했는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that withdrawing ₩30M in cash left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.","イ・ジュノさん、3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。",李俊浩先生，取出3000万韩元现金对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 인출 결심의 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 시점·방식 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕取出3000万韩元现金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 일자와 금액, 인출 방식 가운데 지금 자리에서 사실로 인정할 수 있는 부분만이라도 짚어 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about withdrawing ₩30M in cash, without going beyond what you can disclose.","イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことについて認められる部分を整理してください。",李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对取出3000万韩元现金现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 인출 결심의 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 시점·방식 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕取出3000万韩元现金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 직전과 직후 중 가장 무겁게 남은 한 순간이 언제였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among date, branch, amount, and number of withdrawals, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、日付、支店、金額、出金回数の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在日期、网点、金额和取款次数之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 인출 결심의 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 시점·방식 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕取出3000万韩元现金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 사용처는 미루더라도 인출 방식과 시점에 대해서는 본인이 인정할 수 있는 만큼이라도 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 인출 결심의 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 시점·방식 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.","共感アプローチ。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。",共情接近。承认围绕取出3000万韩元现金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-cash_withdrawal-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 통장 내역 전부를 다시 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 인출 직전 배우자에게 한마디라도 했어야 했다고 느낀 그 시점을 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of withdrawing ₩30M in cash that most easily led to misunderstanding.","イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。",李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理取出3000万韩元现金中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격 정당화 대신 동의 절차 회피 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 돈이라는 명분을 들어도 배우자 동의 없이 큰돈을 움직인 자리에는 본인도 부담이 남았을 것입니다. 그 부담을 어떤 마음으로 안고 있었는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that moving a large sum without your spouse’s consent left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，未经配偶同意动用大笔资金对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격 정당화 대신 동의 절차 회피 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 배우자 동의를 건너뛴 부분에 대해, 지금 자리에서 인정할 수 있는 책임만이라도 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about moving a large sum without your spouse’s consent, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对未经配偶同意动用大笔资金现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격 정당화 대신 동의 절차 회피 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 동의 절차를 가장 의식적으로 피해야 했던 한 순간이 언제였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among what was discussed before and after the withdrawal, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、出金前後に話したことの中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在取款前后谈过的内容之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격 정당화 대신 동의 절차 회피 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 자금의 성격을 떠나, 배우자 동의를 건너뛴 책임만이라도 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격 정당화 대신 동의 절차 회피 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-consent_boundary-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 동의 절차 전부를 다시 다루자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 가장 먼저 배우자에게 한마디 했어야 했던 그 시점만 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of moving a large sum without your spouse’s consent that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理未经配偶同意动用大笔资金中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 큰돈을 숨기고 옮긴 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 침묵의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 큰돈을 배우자 모르게 움직였다면 본인 마음에도 무게가 남았을 것입니다. 그 무게를 어떤 마음으로 안고 있었는지 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that moving a large sum without telling your spouse left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，未告知配偶就动用大笔资金对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 큰돈을 숨기고 옮긴 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 침묵의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 시점과 금액, 처리 방식 가운데 지금 자리에서 인정할 수 있는 부분이 어디까지인지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about moving a large sum without telling your spouse, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对未告知配偶就动用大笔资金现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 큰돈을 숨기고 옮긴 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 침묵의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 돈을 배우자에게 말하지 못하게 만든 가장 큰 이유 한 가지가 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among withdrawal date, amount, and handling method, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、出金日、金額、処理方法の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在取款日期、金额和处理方式之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
