judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 사용처와 별개로 배우자에게 말하지 않은 책임에 대해 본인이 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 큰돈을 숨기고 옮긴 무게를 인정하게 하고 사용처는 캐지 않되 침묵의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 돈의 행방을 한 번에 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 출금을 결심한 그날의 마음만이라도 지금 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of moving a large sum without telling your spouse that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理未告知配偶就动用大笔资金中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격을 정당화 도구로 쓰지 않게 하고 동의 회피의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around treating the money as one's own personal fund, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 돈이라도 결혼 후의 큰돈이라면 배우자에게 말해야 할 자리에 본인도 망설임이 있었을 것입니다. 그 망설임의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that treating the money as your own personal fund left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，把那笔钱当作个人资金处理对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격을 정당화 도구로 쓰지 않게 하고 동의 회피의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around treating the money as one's own personal fund, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 그 돈이 공동 재산이 아니더라도 배우자에게 알리지 않은 책임이 어디까지인지 본인이 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about treating the money as your own personal fund, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对把那笔钱当作个人资金处理现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격을 정당화 도구로 쓰지 않게 하고 동의 회피의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around treating the money as one's own personal fund, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 돈이라는 사실보다도 침묵을 선택한 부분이 본인에게 더 무거웠던 지점이 어디였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among the account source, deposit source, and marital boundary, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、口座の出どころ、入金元、夫婦間の境界の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在账户来源、入账来源和夫妻间边界之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격을 정당화 도구로 쓰지 않게 하고 동의 회피의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around treating the money as one's own personal fund, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 자금의 성격을 떠나, 배우자 동의를 건너뛴 책임만이라도 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 자금 성격을 정당화 도구로 쓰지 않게 하고 동의 회피의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around treating the money as one's own personal fund, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-private_fund_boundary-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 자금 성격 자체를 다시 다투자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그 돈을 침묵 속에 옮기기로 결심한 첫 시점만이라도 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of treating the money as your own personal fund that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理把那笔钱当作个人资金处理中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인 정체는 캐지 않고 사정의 무게와 침묵 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 누군가에게 현금으로 큰돈을 건네야 했다면 본인 안에서도 사정이 무거웠을 것입니다. 그 사정을 안고 있던 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that keeping the recipient of the cash unclear left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，让现金接收对象保持模糊对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인 정체는 캐지 않고 사정의 무게와 침묵 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 받는 사람의 정체를 모두 밝히지 않더라도, 지금 자리에서 말할 수 있는 사정만이라도 짚어 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对让现金接收对象保持模糊现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인 정체는 캐지 않고 사정의 무게와 침묵 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 계좌이체가 아니라 굳이 현금을 택해야 했던 그 결정에서 가장 무겁게 작용한 사정이 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among whether delivery occurred, when, and what can be disclosed, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、受け渡しの有無、時点、話せる範囲の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在是否交付、交付时间及可说明范围之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인 정체는 캐지 않고 사정의 무게와 침묵 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 받는 사람에 관한 부분을 미루더라도 배우자에게 사정을 일찍 말하지 않은 책임 부분은 본인이 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 수취인 정체는 캐지 않고 사정의 무게와 침묵 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-recipient_reason-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 사정을 한 번에 다 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그 돈이 누구를 위한 돈이었는지는 미루더라도 왜 배우자에게는 말 못 했는지의 첫 마음만 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of keeping the recipient of the cash unclear that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理让现金接收对象保持模糊中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 기록을 알게 된 경로와 본인이 본 통장 항목을 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the ₩30M cash withdrawal record from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。",事实追问。让当事人把关于3000万韩元现金取款记录的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 3,000만원 출금 기록을 어떤 경로로 알게 되었는지부터 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the ₩30M cash withdrawal record.","パク・ジヨンさん、3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。",朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认3000万韩元现金取款记录的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 기록을 알게 된 경로와 본인이 본 통장 항목을 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the ₩30M cash withdrawal record from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。",事实追问。让当事人把关于3000万韩元现金取款记录的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v2].text,"본인이 직접 본 출금 시점과 다른 자료(카드 알림, 가계부)를 통해 짐작한 시점을 나눠 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 기록을 알게 된 경로와 본인이 본 통장 항목을 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the ₩30M cash withdrawal record from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。",事实追问。让当事人把关于3000万韩元现金取款记录的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v3].text,이준호 씨의 사용처 설명과 본인이 본 통장 기록 사이에서 가장 크게 어긋나는 지점부터 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 기록을 알게 된 경로와 본인이 본 통장 항목을 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the ₩30M cash withdrawal record from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。",事实追问。让当事人把关于3000万韩元现金取款记录的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v4].text,"같은 시점에 다른 자금 흐름(공동 적금, 카드 결제)이 있었다면 함께 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.","3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。",请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对3000万韩元现金取款记录的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 기록을 알게 된 경로와 본인이 본 통장 항목을 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the ₩30M cash withdrawal record from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。",事实追问。让当事人把关于3000万韩元现金取款记录的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-cash_withdrawal-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 사실에 대해 남편에게 직접 묻지 않고 결론으로 옮겨간 부분이 있다면 그 항목을 먼저 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the ₩30M cash withdrawal record remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.","パク・ジヨンさん、3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。",朴智妍女士，关于3000万韩元现金取款记录，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 통보 시점·방식과 동의 의사 기회를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about being left out of a major marital financial decision from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 출금에 대해 남편으로부터 어떤 시점에, 어떤 방식으로 통보받았는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed being left out of a major marital financial decision.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 통보 시점·방식과 동의 의사 기회를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about being left out of a major marital financial decision from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v2].text,본인이 직접 들은 설명과 통장 기록을 보고 알게 된 사실을 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 통보 시점·방식과 동의 의사 기회를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about being left out of a major marital financial decision from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v3].text,이준호 씨가 사후라도 설명했다고 주장하는 부분과 본인이 받아들인 시점 사이에 어긋나는 지점은 어디입니까.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 통보 시점·방식과 동의 의사 기회를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about being left out of a major marital financial decision from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v4].text,"그 출금에 대해 본인이 동의 의사를 밝힐 기회가 있었는지, 어떤 대화 자료로 확인되는지 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of being left out of a major marital financial decision, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことについて、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 통보 시점·방식과 동의 의사 기회를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about being left out of a major marital financial decision from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-consent_boundary-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 동의 없는 출금이라는 판단을 굳히기 전에 본인이 직접 묻지 않은 부분이 있다면 그 항목부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about being left out of a major marital financial decision remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことについて直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 출금 사실 발견 경로와 직접 본 자료, 추정 항목을 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の個人口座からの大口出金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫个人账户的大额取款的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편의 개인 계좌에서 목돈이 빠진 사실을 어떤 시점에, 어떤 자료로 확인했는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the large withdrawal from your husband’s personal account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の個人口座からの大口出金をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认丈夫个人账户的大额取款的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 출금 사실 발견 경로와 직접 본 자료, 추정 항목을 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の個人口座からの大口出金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫个人账户的大额取款的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,본인이 직접 본 출금 내역과 의심 위주로 메모해 둔 부분을 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 출금 사실 발견 경로와 직접 본 자료, 추정 항목을 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の個人口座からの大口出金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫个人账户的大额取款的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,이준호 씨가 말한 사용처와 본인이 본 출금 기록이 가장 크게 어긋나는 항목은 무엇입니까.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 출금 사실 발견 경로와 직접 본 자료, 추정 항목을 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の個人口座からの大口出金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫个人账户的大额取款的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,그 출금 이후 가계 자금 흐름에서 본인이 추가로 확인한 자료가 있다면 자료 단위로 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize which records support your view of the large withdrawal from your husband’s personal account, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",夫の個人口座からの大口出金について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对丈夫个人账户的大额取款的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 출금 사실 발견 경로와 직접 본 자료, 추정 항목을 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。夫の個人口座からの大口出金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于丈夫个人账户的大额取款的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 경위에 대해 직접 확인하지 못해 추정으로 남은 부분이 있다면 그 항목부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the large withdrawal from your husband’s personal account remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の個人口座からの大口出金について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于丈夫个人账户的大额取款，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공동재산으로 보는 근거 자료와 직접 확인 범위를 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the boundary between personal funds and marital property from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 3,000만원을 공동재산으로 보는 근거가 어떤 자료에서 나왔는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the boundary between personal funds and marital property.",パク・ジヨンさん、個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공동재산으로 보는 근거 자료와 직접 확인 범위를 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the boundary between personal funds and marital property from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v2].text,공동 적금 계좌와 남편 개인 계좌의 잔액을 본인이 어디까지 직접 확인하셨는지 시점별로 나눠 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공동재산으로 보는 근거 자료와 직접 확인 범위를 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the boundary between personal funds and marital property from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v3].text,이준호 씨가 개인 자금이라고 말하는 부분과 본인이 본 자금 흐름이 가장 크게 어긋나는 항목은 무엇입니까.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공동재산으로 보는 근거 자료와 직접 확인 범위를 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the boundary between personal funds and marital property from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v4].text,가계부나 적금 통장 기록 가운데 두 자금이 섞였다고 보는 항목을 자료 단위로 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize which records support your view of the boundary between personal funds and marital property, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공동재산으로 보는 근거 자료와 직접 확인 범위를 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the boundary between personal funds and marital property from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-private_fund_boundary-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 공동재산 주장과 별도로, 본인이 직접 확인하지 못한 흐름이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the boundary between personal funds and marital property remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨에게는 전달 대상의 정체를 직접 묻지 않는다. 본인이 본 자금 흐름 단서와 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about where the withdrawn cash may have gone from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。引き出された現金の行き先について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于取出现金的去向的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 현금이 어디로 갔다고 본인이 짐작하셨는지, 그 짐작의 근거 자료부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed where the withdrawn cash may have gone.",パク・ジヨンさん、引き出された現金の行き先をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认取出现金的去向的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨에게는 전달 대상의 정체를 직접 묻지 않는다. 본인이 본 자금 흐름 단서와 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about where the withdrawn cash may have gone from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。引き出された現金の行き先について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于取出现金的去向的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v2].text,본인이 직접 본 자금 흐름과 다른 사람에게 들은 이야기를 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨에게는 전달 대상의 정체를 직접 묻지 않는다. 본인이 본 자금 흐름 단서와 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about where the withdrawn cash may have gone from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。引き出された現金の行き先について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于取出现金的去向的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v3].text,이준호 씨의 사용처 설명과 본인이 본 단서 사이에서 사실 자체가 어긋나는 지점이 있다면 그 부분부터 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨에게는 전달 대상의 정체를 직접 묻지 않는다. 본인이 본 자금 흐름 단서와 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about where the withdrawn cash may have gone from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。引き出された現金の行き先について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于取出现金的去向的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v4].text,"본인이 외도 자금으로 본 근거를 어떤 카드 내역, 카톡, 가계부 항목으로 확인했는지 자료별로 답해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of where the withdrawn cash may have gone, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",引き出された現金の行き先について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对取出现金的去向的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 박지연 씨에게는 전달 대상의 정체를 직접 묻지 않는다. 본인이 본 자금 흐름 단서와 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about where the withdrawn cash may have gone from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。引き出された現金の行き先について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于取出现金的去向的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-recipient_reason-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 전달 대상에 대해 직접 확인하지 못한 채 추정으로 남은 부분이 있다면 그 항목부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about where the withdrawn cash may have gone remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、引き出された現金の行き先について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于取出现金的去向，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금일·금액·횟수를 통장 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about withdrawing ₩30M in cash from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。",事实追问。让当事人把关于取出3000万韩元现金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 4개월 전 개인 계좌에서 3,000만원을 현금으로 빼낸 날의 시간, 지점, 출금 횟수를 사실관계 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about withdrawing ₩30M in cash in chronological order.","イ・ジュノさん、3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。",李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于取出3000万韩元现金的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금일·금액·횟수를 통장 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about withdrawing ₩30M in cash from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。",事实追问。让当事人把关于取出3000万韩元现金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v2].text,"그 금액이 한 번에 빠진 것인지 나눠 빠진 것인지, 영수증과 통장 인쇄 기준으로 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금일·금액·횟수를 통장 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about withdrawing ₩30M in cash from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。",事实追问。让当事人把关于取出3000万韩元现金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v3].text,박지연 씨가 그 출금을 외도 자금이나 비자금으로 보는 부분과 본인이 인정하는 사실 사이에서 가장 크게 어긋나는 항목은 무엇입니까.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금일·금액·횟수를 통장 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about withdrawing ₩30M in cash from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。",事实追问。让当事人把关于取出3000万韩元现金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v4].text,"출금 직전과 직후의 계좌 잔액, 카드 사용, 다른 입금 기록을 자료별로 다시 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금일·금액·횟수를 통장 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 노출 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about withdrawing ₩30M in cash from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.","事実追及。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。",事实追问。让当事人把关于取出3000万韩元现金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-cash_withdrawal-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 그 현금을 꼭 빼야 했던 직접적인 사정이 무엇이었는지, 지금 자리에서 공개할 수 있는 데까지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about withdrawing ₩30M in cash you have not yet stated, start with that point.","イ・ジュノさん、3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。",李俊浩先生，关于取出3000万韩元现金，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 전·후 배우자 대화 유무와 답변 범위를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 3,000만원 출금 전에 박지연 씨와 어떤 대화를 나누었는지, 또는 나누지 않았는지 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about moving a large sum without your spouse’s consent in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 전·후 배우자 대화 유무와 답변 범위를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v2].text,출금 직후 박지연 씨의 질문이 있었다면 어디까지 답하고 어디서부터 말을 줄였는지 사실관계로 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 전·후 배우자 대화 유무와 답변 범위를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v3].text,박지연 씨가 동의 없는 결정이라고 보는 부분과 본인이 인정하는 결정 과정이 어긋나는 지점은 어디입니까.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 전·후 배우자 대화 유무와 답변 범위를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v4].text,"출금 전·후의 대화 기록(문자, 통화)이 있다면 어느 자료까지 자리에서 확인할 수 있는지 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 전·후 배우자 대화 유무와 답변 범위를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未经配偶同意动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-consent_boundary-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 배우자에게 알리지 않고 결정한 부분에 대해, 본인이 인정할 수 있는 선과 아직 다투고 싶은 선을 나누어 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about moving a large sum without your spouse’s consent you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于未经配偶同意动用大笔资金，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 시점과 그 현금이 본인 손을 떠난 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without telling the spouse from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 명의 개인 계좌에서 큰 금액을 현금으로 뺀 경위를 출금일과 금액 기준으로 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about moving a large sum without telling your spouse in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 시점과 그 현금이 본인 손을 떠난 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without telling the spouse from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].text,출금 시점부터 그 현금이 본인 손을 떠난 시점까지 어떤 행동을 거쳤는지 시간순으로 나눠 답해 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 시점과 그 현금이 본인 손을 떠난 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without telling the spouse from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].text,박지연 씨의 개인 계좌 출금 주장과 본인이 인정하는 출금 사실 사이에 어긋나는 지점이 있다면 사실관계부터 짚어 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 시점과 그 현금이 본인 손을 떠난 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without telling the spouse from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].text,"출금 내역, 입금 흔적, 영수증 가운데 자리에서 인정할 수 있는 자료와 아직 보류하고 싶은 자료를 구분해 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 시점과 그 현금이 본인 손을 떠난 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. 형 전달·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about moving a large sum without telling the spouse from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄への受け渡しと個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于未告知配偶就动用大笔资金的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 경위에 대해 본인이 아직 말하지 않은 행동이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about moving a large sum without telling your spouse you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于未告知配偶就动用大笔资金，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 계좌 성격과 입금 출처를 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about treating the money as one's own personal fund from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 3,000만원이 어떤 계좌에서 나온 돈인지, 그 계좌의 입금 출처는 무엇인지부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about treating the money as your own personal fund in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 계좌 성격과 입금 출처를 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about treating the money as one's own personal fund from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v2].text,공동 적금 계좌와 개인 계좌가 따로 있었다면 두 계좌의 잔액 변동을 각각 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 계좌 성격과 입금 출처를 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about treating the money as one's own personal fund from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v3].text,박지연 씨가 공동재산이라고 주장하는 부분과 본인이 개인 자금이라고 보는 부분이 어디서 갈라지는지 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 계좌 성격과 입금 출처를 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about treating the money as one's own personal fund from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v4].text,"개인 자금이라고 보는 근거 자료(예: 입금 출처, 계약자 명의)를 자료 단위로 다시 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 출금 계좌 성격과 입금 출처를 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about treating the money as one's own personal fund from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把那笔钱当作个人资金处理的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-private_fund_boundary-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 자금이라 해도 배우자에게 알리지 않은 책임은 남습니다. 본인이 인정할 수 있는 선까지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about treating the money as your own personal fund you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于把那笔钱当作个人资金处理，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v1].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 전달 사실, 시점, 계좌이체 곤란 사정을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 정체·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about keeping the recipient of the cash unclear from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother’s identity and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の正体と個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于让现金接收对象保持模糊的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥身份及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 현금을 누구에게 전달했는지 답하기 어렵다면, 우선 전달이 있었는지 자체부터 사실관계로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about keeping the recipient of the cash unclear in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于让现金接收对象保持模糊的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v2].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 전달 사실, 시점, 계좌이체 곤란 사정을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 정체·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about keeping the recipient of the cash unclear from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother’s identity and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の正体と個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于让现金接收对象保持模糊的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥身份及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v2].text,출금 후 그 현금이 본인 손을 떠난 시점과 장소를 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v3].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 전달 사실, 시점, 계좌이체 곤란 사정을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 정체·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about keeping the recipient of the cash unclear from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother’s identity and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の正体と個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于让现金接收对象保持模糊的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥身份及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v3].text,박지연 씨의 외도 자금 주장과 본인이 인정하는 사용 사실 사이에서 가장 크게 어긋나는 부분을 짚어 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v4].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 전달 사실, 시점, 계좌이체 곤란 사정을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 정체·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about keeping the recipient of the cash unclear from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother’s identity and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の正体と個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于让现金接收对象保持模糊的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥身份及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v4].text,"은행 송금이 아니라 굳이 현금 전달을 택한 사정을, 어떤 이유로 계좌이체가 곤란했는지 자료를 기준으로 답해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v5].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 전달 사실, 시점, 계좌이체 곤란 사정을 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 형 정체·개인회생은 S5 전 직접 언급 금지.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about keeping the recipient of the cash unclear from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open the older brother’s identity and personal rehabilitation before S5.",事実追及。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは兄の正体と個人再生を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于让现金接收对象保持模糊的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示哥哥身份及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-recipient_reason-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 전달 대상에 대해 지금 자리에서 밝힐 수 있는 부분과 아직 미뤄두고 싶은 부분을 나누어 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about keeping the recipient of the cash unclear you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于让现金接收对象保持模糊，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금 사용처를 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가능성에 무게를 둔 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, without opening the final combined conclusion.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 현금 출금 기록을 본 순간 가장 먼저 떠오른 사용처가 무엇이었고, 그 추정에 어떤 근거가 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record.","パク・ジヨンさん、3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。",朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금 사용처를 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가능성에 무게를 둔 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, without opening the final combined conclusion.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v2].text,"출금 시점만으로 사용처를 단정하기 어렵다는 걸 알았을 텐데, 직접 묻기보다 의심 쪽으로 무게를 둔 본인 결정의 동기가 무엇입니까.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금 사용처를 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가능성에 무게를 둔 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, without opening the final combined conclusion.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v3].text,돈의 사용처를 모르는 상태에서 외도 자금 가능성에 비중을 둔 본인 판단의 과정을 설명해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금 사용처를 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가능성에 무게를 둔 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, without opening the final combined conclusion.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v4].text,"출금 사실을 알게 된 직후, 남편에게 직접 묻기보다 본인이 먼저 어떤 행동을 떠올렸는지 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금 사용처를 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가능성에 무게를 둔 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the ₩30M cash withdrawal record, without opening the final combined conclusion.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンの現金出金記録をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕3000万韩元现金取款记录作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-cash_withdrawal-v5].text,"그 출금이 다른 사정 때문일 가능성은 언제 검토했고, 왜 빨리 배제했는지 본인 기준에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면 대화 대신 자료 모으기·다른 행동으로 옮겨간 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around being left out of a major marital financial decision, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 사후라도 남편이 직접 사용처를 설명할 기회를 두지 않고 본인이 먼저 행동에 들어간 결정의 동기가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around being left out of a major marital financial decision.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면 대화 대신 자료 모으기·다른 행동으로 옮겨간 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around being left out of a major marital financial decision, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v2].text,"동의 없이 큰돈이 움직였다는 사실을 알게 됐을 때, 정면 대화 대신 다른 방법을 택한 본인 결정의 배경을 말씀해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면 대화 대신 자료 모으기·다른 행동으로 옮겨간 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around being left out of a major marital financial decision, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v3].text,그 시점에 본인이 무엇을 가장 두려워하고 있었기에 직접 묻기 대신 자료 모으기 쪽을 택했는지 답해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면 대화 대신 자료 모으기·다른 행동으로 옮겨간 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around being left out of a major marital financial decision, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v4].text,"동의 없는 출금이라는 점과, 사용처가 외도일 거라는 의심을 본인이 어떤 비중으로 묶어 두고 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정면 대화 대신 자료 모으기·다른 행동으로 옮겨간 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around being left out of a major marital financial decision, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫婦の大きな金銭決定から外されたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你被排除在夫妻大额财务决定之外作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-consent_boundary-v5].text,"남편의 침묵을 마주한 시점에서, 본인 쪽이 먼저 시도해 볼 수 있었던 대화를 미루기로 한 동기가 무엇이었습니까.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금을 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가설로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 발견한 시점에 남편에게 직접 묻지 않고 다른 정황과 묶어 본 결정의 동기가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the large withdrawal from your husband’s personal account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금을 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가설로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,그 돈의 사용처를 듣기 전인데도 외도 자금 가설로 먼저 기울인 본인 판단의 배경을 설명해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금을 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가설로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,출금 내역을 정면으로 묻지 않고 자료로 모아 두기로 한 결정에 어떤 계산이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금을 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가설로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,"그 시점에 다른 사용처 가능성도 검토했는지, 검토했다면 어떤 가능성이 가장 빨리 배제됐는지 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 출금을 직접 묻지 않고 외도 자금 가설로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the large withdrawal from the husband’s personal account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の個人口座からの大口出金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕丈夫个人账户的大额取款作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,"그 돈에 대해 가장 두려워하던 답이 무엇이었는지, 그 두려움이 의심의 방향에 어떤 영향을 주었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 답을 받아들이지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 개인 명의 자금이라는 답을 들었을 때도 그 답을 받아들이지 않은 본인 판단의 동기가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the boundary between personal funds and marital property.",パク・ジヨンさん、個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 답을 받아들이지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v2].text,"개인 자금과 공동 재산의 경계를 본인 기준에서는 어디까지로 잡고 있었고, 그 기준이 의심에 어떤 영향을 주었는지 답해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 답을 받아들이지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v3].text,공동 적금까지 무너졌다고 보기 전에 다른 자금 흐름과의 차이를 따로 확인하지 않은 이유를 설명해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 답을 받아들이지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v4].text,개인 돈이라는 답과 외도 자금이라는 의심 중 후자에 더 무게를 둔 본인 판단의 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.,Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 답을 받아들이지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the boundary between personal funds and marital property, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。個人資金と夫婦共同財産の境界をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕个人资金与夫妻共同财产的边界作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-private_fund_boundary-v5].text,그 경계 문제를 직접 대화로 풀지 않고 다른 형태의 행동으로 옮겨간 결정의 동기가 어디에 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 받는 쪽을 모르는 상태에서 외도 자금으로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻되 행위자의 내면을 사실처럼 묻지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出现金的去向作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 돈을 받는 사람이 다른 여자일 거라는 가설로 먼저 기울게 된 본인의 판단 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around where the withdrawn cash may have gone.",パク・ジヨンさん、引き出された現金の行き先をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕取出现金的去向作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 받는 쪽을 모르는 상태에서 외도 자금으로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻되 행위자의 내면을 사실처럼 묻지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出现金的去向作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v2].text,받는 쪽을 모르는 상태에서 외도 자금이라는 결론으로 좁혀 가는 데 어떤 정황을 핵심으로 잡고 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 받는 쪽을 모르는 상태에서 외도 자금으로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻되 행위자의 내면을 사실처럼 묻지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出现金的去向作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v3].text,남편에게 받는 쪽을 직접 묻지 않고 의심을 더 모으기로 한 본인 결정에 어떤 두려움이나 자기 보호 의도가 있었습니까.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 받는 쪽을 모르는 상태에서 외도 자금으로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻되 행위자의 내면을 사실처럼 묻지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出现金的去向作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v4].text,외도가 아닌 다른 사용처일 가능성을 검토할 시간이 있었음에도 그 가능성을 빨리 닫은 결정의 동기를 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 받는 쪽을 모르는 상태에서 외도 자금으로 묶은 본인 판단의 동기를 묻되 행위자의 내면을 사실처럼 묻지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around where the withdrawn cash may have gone, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。引き出された現金の行き先をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出现金的去向作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-recipient_reason-v5].text,그 사용처에 대해 본인이 가장 듣기 싫어했던 답이 어떤 종류의 답이었는지 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.,"Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 시점에 현금 인출 형식을 택한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出3000万韩元现金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 시점에 굳이 현금 형태로 큰돈을 인출한 동기가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around withdrawing ₩30M in cash.","イ・ジュノさん、3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。",李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕取出3000万韩元现金作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 시점에 현금 인출 형식을 택한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出3000万韩元现金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v2].text,계좌이체 대신 현금 인출 쪽을 택한 결정에 어떤 사정이나 계산이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 시점에 현금 인출 형식을 택한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出3000万韩元现金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v3].text,그 현금 흐름이 배우자에게 들킬 경우 가장 곤란해질 부분을 어떻게 보고 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.,"If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 시점에 현금 인출 형식을 택한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出3000万韩元现金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v4].text,"여러 번 나누어 빼는 방법도 있었을 텐데, 한 번에 큰 금액으로 인출한 쪽을 택한 이유가 무엇입니까.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 시점에 현금 인출 형식을 택한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around withdrawing ₩30M in cash, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.","動機探索。3,000万ウォンを現金で引き出したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。",动机探查。询问当事人围绕取出3000万韩元现金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-cash_withdrawal-v5].text,"지금 말할 수 있는 선에서, 그 출금을 더 뒤로 미루지 못한 사정이 무엇이었는지 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사전·사후 동의 단계를 모두 건너뛴 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 큰돈을 움직이는 일이라면 동의가 필요하다는 일반적 기준을 본인은 왜 따르지 않았는지 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around moving a large sum without your spouse’s consent.",イ・ジュノさん、配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사전·사후 동의 단계를 모두 건너뛴 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v2].text,사전에 한 번이라도 운을 띄울 수 있었음에도 그 단계조차 거치지 않은 판단의 근거를 답해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사전·사후 동의 단계를 모두 건너뛴 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v3].text,사후라도 알리지 않고 발각될 때까지 침묵을 유지한 본인 결정에 어떤 두려움이나 계산이 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.,"If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사전·사후 동의 단계를 모두 건너뛴 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v4].text,"동의를 구했을 경우 따라올 부담과, 동의 없이 처리한 뒤 들킬 위험 중 어느 쪽을 더 작게 잡고 있었는지 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사전·사후 동의 단계를 모두 건너뛴 본인 결정의 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without the spouse’s consent, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。配偶者の同意なしに大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未经配偶同意动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-consent_boundary-v5].text,"지금 말할 수 있는 선에서, 배우자에게 알리지 않은 결정의 핵심 동기를 한 가지만 짚어 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 큰돈 이동을 알리지 않은 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 명의 계좌라 해도 큰돈을 움직이면서 배우자에게 바로 알리지 않은 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around moving a large sum without telling your spouse.",イ・ジュノさん、配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 큰돈 이동을 알리지 않은 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,"돈 이야기 자체를 피하려 했던 것인지, 특정 사용처를 숨기려 했던 것인지 본인 기준에서 구분해 답해 주십시오.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 큰돈 이동을 알리지 않은 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,출금 사실이 드러났을 때 가장 곤란해질 부분이 무엇이라고 보고 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.,"If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 큰돈 이동을 알리지 않은 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,배우자가 외도 자금으로 오해할 수 있다는 점을 알면서도 설명을 미룬 결정의 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.,Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 큰돈 이동을 알리지 않은 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around moving a large sum without telling the spouse, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。配偶者に告げず大金を動かしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕未告知配偶就动用大笔资金作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 선에서, 그 돈을 본인 혼자 떠안고 처리해야 한다고 판단한 동기를 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 명분으로 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around treating the money as one's own personal fund, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 명의 계좌라 해도 큰돈을 움직였을 때 배우자에게 알릴 의무가 있다고 보지 않은 결정의 동기가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around treating the money as your own personal fund.",イ・ジュノさん、その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 명분으로 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around treating the money as one's own personal fund, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v2].text,"개인 자금이라는 선을 어디까지 본인 혼자 결정해도 된다고 판단했는지, 그 기준의 근거를 답해 주십시오.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 명분으로 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around treating the money as one's own personal fund, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v3].text,공동 적금이 아니라는 점만으로 설명을 미뤄도 된다고 판단한 근거가 어디에서 나왔는지 답해 주십시오.,"If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 명분으로 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around treating the money as one's own personal fund, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v4].text,"개인 돈이라는 명분과, 부부 신뢰의 손상 가능성 사이에서 전자를 우선한 본인 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 개인 자금이라는 명분으로 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around treating the money as one's own personal fund, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。その金を自分の個人資金として扱ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把那笔钱当作个人资金处理作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-private_fund_boundary-v5].text,"지금 말할 수 있는 선에서, 그 돈을 부부의 일이 아니라 본인 혼자 처리해야 한다고 결정한 사정을 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사용처를 모호하게 둔 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 돈의 사용처를 끝까지 모호하게 둔 결정의 동기가 어디에 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사용처를 모호하게 둔 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v2].text,받는 사람을 밝히면 뒤따를 또 다른 질문이 더 부담스러웠던 것은 아닙니까. 본인 입장에서 답해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사용처를 모호하게 둔 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v3].text,현금이라는 형태와 받는 쪽을 둘 다 비밀로 둔 결정에 어떤 계산이나 보호 의도가 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.,"If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사용처를 모호하게 둔 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v4].text,그 사용처가 외도와 무관하다는 한 마디조차 보태기 어려웠던 동기가 무엇이었습니까.,Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 사용처를 모호하게 둔 본인 침묵의 동기를 묻되 형 전달·개인회생은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around keeping the recipient of the cash unclear, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open delivery to the older brother and personal rehabilitation.",動機探索。現金の受取先を曖昧にしたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 兄への受け渡しと個人再生は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕让现金接收对象保持模糊作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启交给哥哥及个人重整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_d-2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-recipient_reason-v5].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 받는 쪽 사정 중 가장 알리고 싶지 않았던 부분이 어떤 성격의 일이었는지 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 행위자의 두려움과 결심을 인정하되 절차 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around handling the joint savings account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕处理共同储蓄账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 공동 적금을 본인 손으로 처리하기까지 본인 안에서도 두려움과 결심이 동시에 있었을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how handling the joint savings account could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金を処理したことはご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解处理共同储蓄账户对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 행위자의 두려움과 결심을 인정하되 절차 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around handling the joint savings account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕处理共同储蓄账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 적금 해지부터 송금까지 직접 손댄 부분과 나중에 알게 된 부분이 어디서 갈라지는지 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about handling the joint savings account from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金を処理したことについて、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对处理共同储蓄账户直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 행위자의 두려움과 결심을 인정하되 절차 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around handling the joint savings account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕处理共同储蓄账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 그 흐름 안에서 마음을 가장 무겁게 짓눌렀던 한 시점이 언제였습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among cancellation, documents, transfer, and loss, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、解約、書類、送金、損失の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在解约、文件、转账和损失之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 행위자의 두려움과 결심을 인정하되 절차 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around handling the joint savings account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕处理共同储蓄账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 동기가 어떻든 본인 손으로 처리한 절차에 남은 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 행위자의 두려움과 결심을 인정하되 절차 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around handling the joint savings account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕处理共同储蓄账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 모든 일을 한 번에 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그중 가장 먼저 결심하셨던 한 대목만이라도 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when handling the joint savings account weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。共同積立預金を処理したことが最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看处理共同储蓄账户对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 송금 직전의 망설임을 인정하되 큰돈을 옮긴 본인 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around sending money to the investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕向投资群转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 투자방으로 큰돈을 보내기까지 본인 안에서도 기대와 두려움이 동시에 있었을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how sending money to the investment chat could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、投資チャットに送金したことはご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解向投资群转账对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 송금 직전의 망설임을 인정하되 큰돈을 옮긴 본인 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around sending money to the investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕向投资群转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 방을 알게 된 경로, 가입 절차, 송금 단계 중 본인이 직접 한 부분의 경계를 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about sending money to the investment chat from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、投資チャットに送金したことについて、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对向投资群转账直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 송금 직전의 망설임을 인정하되 큰돈을 옮긴 본인 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around sending money to the investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕向投资群转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 송금 직전 가장 마지막까지 망설였던 한 지점이 어디였습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among how you learned of the room, joined it, and sent funds, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、その部屋を知った経路、参加手続き、送金段階の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在得知投资群、加入以及转账的过程之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 송금 직전의 망설임을 인정하되 큰돈을 옮긴 본인 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around sending money to the investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕向投资群转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 그 방이 어떤 곳이었는가는 잠시 미뤄 두고, 부부 재정에서 본인 손으로 큰돈을 옮긴 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 송금 직전의 망설임을 인정하되 큰돈을 옮긴 본인 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around sending money to the investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕向投资群转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-investment_room-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 송금 전부를 한 번에 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그 방에 처음 들어가기로 마음먹은 시점만이라도 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when sending money to the investment chat weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。投資チャットに送金したことが最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看向投资群转账对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 무게를 인정하되 절차 위반의 본인 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss that followed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その後に生じた損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕随后发生的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 본인 손에서 시작된 흐름이 결국 큰 손실로 끝났다면 그 무게는 본인 안에 가장 크게 남아 있을 것입니다. 그 무게를 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the loss that followed could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、その後に生じた損失はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解随后发生的损失对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 무게를 인정하되 절차 위반의 본인 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss that followed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その後に生じた損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕随后发生的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 손실의 결과와 별개로 그 결과를 만든 절차 안에서 본인이 직접 한 일의 범위를 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the loss that followed from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、その後に生じた損失について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对随后发生的损失直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 무게를 인정하되 절차 위반의 본인 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss that followed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その後に生じた損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕随后发生的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 결과를 마주한 순간 가장 견디기 어려웠던 부분이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among what you did directly and what happened afterward, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、ご自身が直接したこととその後の結果の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在你直接做的事和之后发生的结果之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 무게를 인정하되 절차 위반의 본인 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss that followed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。その後に生じた損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕随后发生的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 손실의 충격과 별개로, 절차 위반에 대한 본인 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
