judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-loss_responsibility-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 모든 책임을 한 번에 정리하라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 가장 먼저 본인 책임으로 인정할 수 있는 한 부분만 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the loss that followed weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。その後に生じた損失が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看随后发生的损失对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 서류를 손에 쥔 결심의 무게를 인정하되 명의 처리 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the power of attorney document, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。委任状の書類をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕委托书文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 부부 명의가 걸린 서류를 손에 쥐었을 때 본인 안에서도 무거운 결심이 있었을 것입니다. 그 결심을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the power of attorney document could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、委任状の書類はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解委托书文件对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 서류를 손에 쥔 결심의 무게를 인정하되 명의 처리 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the power of attorney document, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。委任状の書類をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕委托书文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 위임장 작성 과정에서 본인이 직접 한 부분과 다른 사람이 도운 부분의 경계를 지금 단계에서 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the power of attorney document from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、委任状の書類について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对委托书文件直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 서류를 손에 쥔 결심의 무게를 인정하되 명의 처리 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the power of attorney document, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。委任状の書類をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕委托书文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 서류 작성을 앞두고 가장 무겁게 망설였던 대목이 어느 부분이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among who prepared it, where, and how it was used, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、誰がどこで作成し、どう使われたかの中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在由谁在哪里制作并如何使用之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 서류를 손에 쥔 결심의 무게를 인정하되 명의 처리 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the power of attorney document, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。委任状の書類をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕委托书文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 동기가 어떻든 부부 명의의 서류 처리에 본인이 남긴 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 서류를 손에 쥔 결심의 무게를 인정하되 명의 처리 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the power of attorney document, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。委任状の書類をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕委托书文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-proxy_document-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 서류 전체 경위를 한 번에 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 서류를 직접 손에 쥔 그 첫 시점의 마음만이라도 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the power of attorney document weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。委任状の書類が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看委托书文件对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 결심의 망설임을 인정하되 부부 공동 적금을 끊은 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings cancellation, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄账户解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 공동 적금을 중도 해지하기까지 본인 안에서도 마지막 망설임이 있었을 것입니다. 그 망설임을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the joint savings cancellation could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解共同储蓄账户解约对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 결심의 망설임을 인정하되 부부 공동 적금을 끊은 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings cancellation, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄账户解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 신청 일자, 신청자 명의, 수령 계좌 가운데 직접 처리하신 부분이 어디까지였는지 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the joint savings cancellation from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对共同储蓄账户解约直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 결심의 망설임을 인정하되 부부 공동 적금을 끊은 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings cancellation, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄账户解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 직전 가장 무겁게 마음을 눌렀던 한 부분이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among application date, applicant name, and receiving account, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、申請日、申請者名義、受取口座の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在申请日期、申请人名义和收款账户之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
