judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 동기가 어떻든 부부 공동 적금을 본인 결정으로 끊은 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 결심의 망설임을 인정하되 부부 공동 적금을 끊은 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings cancellation, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄账户解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-a-savings_cancellation-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 절차 전부를 다시 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 해지를 결심한 그 한 시점의 마음만이라도 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the joint savings cancellation weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。共同積立預金の解約が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看共同储蓄账户解约对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 사라진 적금에 대한 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 공동 적금이 본인 모르는 사이에 사라졌다는 사실을 알게 된 순간의 충격은 컸을 것입니다. 그 순간의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，共同储蓄在你不知情时消失对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 사라진 적금에 대한 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 동의했거나 서명했다고 기억하는 부분과 그렇지 않은 부분이 어디서 갈라지는지 지금 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对共同储蓄在你不知情时消失现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 사라진 적금에 대한 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 적금이 사라진 사실 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 부분이 어떤 부분이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among what you remember consenting to and what you did not, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、同意した記憶がある部分とない部分の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在你记得同意的部分和未同意的部分之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 사라진 적금에 대한 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 동의 여부와는 별개로, 부부 재정 흐름을 더 일찍 들여다보지 못한 부분에 대한 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 사라진 적금에 대한 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 손실 전부를 한 번에 다투자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 사라진 사실을 처음 알아챈 그 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理共同储蓄在你不知情时消失中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외부로 흘러간 사실의 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕钱被转入外部投资群的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 부부의 돈이 본인도 모르는 사이에 외부 투자방으로 흘러간 사실을 알게 된 순간의 충격은 작지 않았을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the money being sent to an outside investment chat left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，钱被转入外部投资群对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외부로 흘러간 사실의 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕钱被转入外部投资群的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 그 방의 존재나 송금 사실을 본인이 어떤 경로로 알게 됐는지 그 흐름을 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the money being sent to an outside investment chat, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对钱被转入外部投资群现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외부로 흘러간 사실의 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕钱被转入外部投资群的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 송금 사실 가운데 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 지점은 어떤 부분이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among how you learned of the room and the transfer, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、その部屋と送金を知った経路の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在你得知该投资群和转账的经过之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외부로 흘러간 사실의 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕钱被转入外部投资群的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 송금 자체는 상대의 행위지만, 부부 재정 흐름을 더 일찍 들여다보지 못한 본인 부분의 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 외부로 흘러간 사실의 충격을 인정하되 부부 재정 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕钱被转入外部投资群的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-investment_room-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 송금 절차 전부를 지금 다투자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 외부로 돈이 빠져나갔음을 처음 알아챈 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the money being sent to an outside investment chat that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理钱被转入外部投资群中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss of the joint savings, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 부부의 돈이 사라진 결과를 마주한 순간 분노와 절망이 함께였을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the loss of the joint savings left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の損失はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，共同储蓄的损失对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss of the joint savings, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 손실의 결과와 별개로, 본인이 사후에 직접 확인한 부분이 어디까지였는지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the loss of the joint savings, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、共同積立預金の損失について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对共同储蓄的损失现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss of the joint savings, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 손실의 결과 가운데 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 부분은 어떤 것이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among how you confirmed the loss and responded afterward, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、損失を確認した方法とその後の対応の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在你如何确认损失及事后如何应对之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss of the joint savings, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 손실 책임의 중심이 상대 쪽에 있더라도, 부부 재정 흐름을 더 일찍 살피지 못한 본인 몫의 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 손실의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the loss of the joint savings, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕共同储蓄的损失的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-loss_responsibility-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 손실 책임을 한 번에 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 결과를 처음 알게 된 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the loss of the joint savings that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。共同積立預金の損失のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理共同储蓄的损失中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인 명의가 움직인 충격을 인정하되 동의 경계를 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your name being used on documents without consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 동의 없이 본인 명의 서류가 움직였다는 사실을 알게 된 순간의 충격은 작지 않았을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that your name being used on documents without consent left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你的名义在未同意下被用于文件对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인 명의가 움직인 충격을 인정하되 동의 경계를 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your name being used on documents without consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 직접 서명하거나 위임을 동의했다고 기억하는 부분과 그렇지 않은 부분의 경계를 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about your name being used on documents without consent, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你的名义在未同意下被用于文件现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인 명의가 움직인 충격을 인정하되 동의 경계를 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your name being used on documents without consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 서류 처리 가운데 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 대목이 어느 부분이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among the document, consent boundary, and response, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、書類、同意の境界、対応の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在文件、同意边界和应对之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
