judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 서류 처리 책임은 상대 쪽에 있더라도, 본인 명의 관리에서 본인이 더 일찍 점검하지 못한 부분이 있었는지 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인 명의가 움직인 충격을 인정하되 동의 경계를 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your name being used on documents without consent, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-proxy_document-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 서류 전체 경위를 지금 다투자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인 명의가 움직인 사실을 알게 된 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of your name being used on documents without consent that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你的名义在未同意下被用于文件中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 사실을 알게 된 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 모르는 사이에 공동 적금이 해지된 사실을 뒤늦게 알게 됐을 때 무엇보다 신뢰부터 무너졌을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that learning that the joint savings had been cancelled left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，得知共同储蓄账户已被解约对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 사실을 알게 된 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 해지 시점, 신청자, 수령 계좌 중 본인이 사후에 직접 확인한 부분이 어디까지였는지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对得知共同储蓄账户已被解约现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 사실을 알게 된 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 해지된 사실을 알게 된 흐름 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 한 지점이 어디였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among how you learned, whether you signed, and how you responded, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、知った経路、署名の有無、対応の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在得知经过、是否签名以及如何应对之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 사실을 알게 된 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 해지 자체에 대한 분노와 별개로, 부부 재정 흐름을 더 일찍 점검하지 못한 부분에 대한 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 해지 사실을 알게 된 순간의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-b-savings_cancellation-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 해지 절차 전부를 지금 다투자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 해지된 사실을 처음 의심하게 된 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of learning that the joint savings had been cancelled that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理得知共同储蓄账户已被解约中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지·서류·송금 단계를 직접 한 일과 위임 단계로 분리해 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about handling the joint savings account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss before S5.",事実追及。共同積立預金を処理したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于处理共同储蓄账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 공동 적금 해지 신청부터 돈이 다른 곳으로 옮겨가기까지, 본인이 직접 처리한 일과 기록으로만 확인되는 일을 나눠 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed handling the joint savings account.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金を処理したことをいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认处理共同储蓄账户的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지·서류·송금 단계를 직접 한 일과 위임 단계로 분리해 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about handling the joint savings account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss before S5.",事実追及。共同積立預金を処理したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于处理共同储蓄账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,"해지 신청, 서류 제출, 수령 계좌, 송금 가운데 본인이 직접 처리한 단계와 다른 사람에게 맡긴 단계를 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지·서류·송금 단계를 직접 한 일과 위임 단계로 분리해 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about handling the joint savings account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss before S5.",事実追及。共同積立預金を処理したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于处理共同储蓄账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,이준호 씨가 동의한 적이 없다고 말하는 부분과 본인이 동의를 받았다고 보는 부분이 어디서 갈라지는지 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지·서류·송금 단계를 직접 한 일과 위임 단계로 분리해 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about handling the joint savings account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss before S5.",事実追及。共同積立預金を処理したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于处理共同储蓄账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,은행에 제출한 서류와 본인이 보관 중인 사본 사이에 차이가 있다면 어느 항목인지 자료 단위로 답해 주십시오.,"Please organize which records support your view of handling the joint savings account, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",共同積立預金を処理したことについて、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对处理共同储蓄账户的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지·서류·송금 단계를 직접 한 일과 위임 단계로 분리해 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about handling the joint savings account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss before S5.",事実追及。共同積立預金を処理したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于处理共同储蓄账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 해지부터 송금까지 가운데 아직 본인이 말씀하지 않은 부분이 있다면 먼저 꺼내 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about handling the joint savings account remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金を処理したことについて直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于处理共同储蓄账户，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가입 경로·운영자 호칭·송금 시점을 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 사기 확정·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about sending money to the investment chat from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open confirmed scam and full loss before S5.",事実追及。投資チャットに送金したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは詐欺確定と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于向投资群转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示诈骗确认和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 투자방에 가입하게 된 경로, 운영자의 호칭, 가입 시점을 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed sending money to the investment chat.",パク・ジヨンさん、投資チャットに送金したことをいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认向投资群转账的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가입 경로·운영자 호칭·송금 시점을 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 사기 확정·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about sending money to the investment chat from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open confirmed scam and full loss before S5.",事実追及。投資チャットに送金したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは詐欺確定と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于向投资群转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示诈骗确认和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v2].text,"본인이 송금한 금액과 횟수, 송금 계좌를 자료 기준으로 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가입 경로·운영자 호칭·송금 시점을 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 사기 확정·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about sending money to the investment chat from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open confirmed scam and full loss before S5.",事実追及。投資チャットに送金したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは詐欺確定と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于向投资群转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示诈骗确认和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v3].text,이준호 씨가 그 송금을 본인 동의 없이 진행했다고 보는 부분과 본인이 본인 자금 결정으로 보는 부분이 어긋나는 지점부터 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가입 경로·운영자 호칭·송금 시점을 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 사기 확정·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about sending money to the investment chat from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open confirmed scam and full loss before S5.",事実追及。投資チャットに送金したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは詐欺確定と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于向投资群转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示诈骗确认和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v4].text,"투자방 카톡, 송금 화면, 입금 알림 가운데 자리에서 제시할 수 있는 자료가 무엇인지 답해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of sending money to the investment chat, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",投資チャットに送金したことについて、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对向投资群转账的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가입 경로·운영자 호칭·송금 시점을 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다. 사기 확정·전액 손실은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about sending money to the investment chat from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open confirmed scam and full loss before S5.",事実追及。投資チャットに送金したことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは詐欺確定と全額損失を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于向投资群转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示诈骗确认和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-investment_room-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 그 송금 결과에 대해 지금 어디까지 인정할 수 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about sending money to the investment chat remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、投資チャットに送金したことについて直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于向投资群转账，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 손실 확인 시점, 직접 확인 자료, 운영자 안내를 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the loss that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その後に生じた損失について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于随后发生的损失的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 자금이 줄어들거나 사라졌다는 사실을 본인이 처음 확인한 시점과 자료를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the loss that followed.",パク・ジヨンさん、その後に生じた損失をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认随后发生的损失的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 손실 확인 시점, 직접 확인 자료, 운영자 안내를 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the loss that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その後に生じた損失について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于随后发生的损失的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v2].text,손실 규모를 본인이 직접 확인한 부분과 운영자 측 안내로 알게 된 부분을 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 손실 확인 시점, 직접 확인 자료, 운영자 안내를 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the loss that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その後に生じた損失について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于随后发生的损失的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v3].text,이준호 씨가 본인의 책임이라고 말하는 부분과 본인이 외부 요인으로 보는 부분이 어디서 갈라지는지 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
