judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v4].text,"그 손실에 대한 신고, 상담, 회수 시도 등 본인이 취한 조치를 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the loss that followed, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",その後に生じた損失について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对随后发生的损失的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 손실 확인 시점, 직접 확인 자료, 운영자 안내를 분리해 답하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the loss that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。その後に生じた損失について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于随后发生的损失的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-loss_responsibility-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 손실 규모와 책임 범위에 대해 지금 단계에서 인정할 수 있는 한도를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the loss that followed remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、その後に生じた損失について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于随后发生的损失，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 장소·시점·작성자를 사실관계 그대로 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·서명 대필은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the power of attorney document from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and proxy signing before S5.",事実追及。委任状の書類について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と署名代筆を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于委托书文件的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和代签。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 위임 서류가 작성된 장소, 시점, 작성자가 누구인지부터 사실관계 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the power of attorney document.",パク・ジヨンさん、委任状の書類をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认委托书文件的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 장소·시점·작성자를 사실관계 그대로 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·서명 대필은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the power of attorney document from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and proxy signing before S5.",事実追及。委任状の書類について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と署名代筆を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于委托书文件的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和代签。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v2].text,"서류에 들어간 서명, 인감, 본인 확인 절차 가운데 본인이 직접 진행한 단계와 다른 사람에게 맡긴 단계를 나눠 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 장소·시점·작성자를 사실관계 그대로 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·서명 대필은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the power of attorney document from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and proxy signing before S5.",事実追及。委任状の書類について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と署名代筆を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于委托书文件的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和代签。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v3].text,이준호 씨가 서명한 적이 없다고 말하는 부분과 본인이 적법하게 처리했다고 보는 부분이 어디서 갈라지는지 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 장소·시점·작성자를 사실관계 그대로 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·서명 대필은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the power of attorney document from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and proxy signing before S5.",事実追及。委任状の書類について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と署名代筆を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于委托书文件的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和代签。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v4].text,"그 서류의 원본이 어디에 보관되어 있고, 본인이 가진 사본은 어떤 상태인지 자료 단위로 답해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the power of attorney document, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",委任状の書類について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对委托书文件的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 장소·시점·작성자를 사실관계 그대로 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작·서명 대필은 S5 전 직접 단정 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the power of attorney document from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and proxy signing before S5.",事実追及。委任状の書類について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作と署名代筆を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于委托书文件的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵和代签。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-proxy_document-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 서류 작성 단계에서 아직 진술하지 않은 사실이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the power of attorney document remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、委任状の書類について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于委托书文件，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지 신청 장소·시점·서명 절차를 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the joint savings cancellation from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。共同積立預金の解約について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于共同储蓄账户解约的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 공동 적금 해지 신청을 어느 지점, 어느 창구에서, 어느 날짜에 진행했는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the joint savings cancellation.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认共同储蓄账户解约的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지 신청 장소·시점·서명 절차를 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the joint savings cancellation from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。共同積立預金の解約について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于共同储蓄账户解约的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v2].text,해지 신청 당시 본인이 직접 서명한 항목과 대리로 처리한 항목을 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지 신청 장소·시점·서명 절차를 자료 기준으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the joint savings cancellation from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。共同積立預金の解約について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于共同储蓄账户解约的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-a-savings_cancellation-v3].text,이준호 씨가 모르는 사이 진행되었다고 말하는 부분과 본인이 적법하게 처리했다고 보는 부분이 어긋나는 지점부터 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
