judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-proxy_document-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-proxy_document-v4].text,"본인의 신분증, 인감, 비밀번호 가운데 박지연 씨가 접근할 수 있었던 항목과 그렇지 않은 항목을 자료 기준으로 답해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-proxy_document-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-proxy_document-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 명의가 들어간 서류와 동의 범위를 분리해 답하게 한다. 이준호 씨에게 박지연 씨의 위임 서류 처리 동기를 묻지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your name being used on documents without consent from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你的名义在未同意下被用于文件的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-proxy_document-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-proxy_document-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 서류 처리에 대해 본인이 아직 답하지 않은 사실이 있다면 그 부분부터 꺼내 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about your name being used on documents without consent you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你的名义在未同意下被用于文件，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 적금 가입·관리·해지 단계 가운데 본인이 인지한 범위를 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about learning that the joint savings had been cancelled from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 공동 적금 해지 사실을 본인이 처음 인지한 시점과 알게 된 경로를 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about learning that the joint savings had been cancelled in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 적금 가입·관리·해지 단계 가운데 본인이 인지한 범위를 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about learning that the joint savings had been cancelled from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v2].text,"그 적금에 본인이 직접 가입한 단계, 입금 단계, 해지 시점 가운데 어느 단계까지 본인이 인지하고 있었는지 나눠 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 적금 가입·관리·해지 단계 가운데 본인이 인지한 범위를 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about learning that the joint savings had been cancelled from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v3].text,박지연 씨의 해지 설명 가운데 본인 기억과 가장 크게 어긋나는 단계는 어디입니까.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 적금 가입·관리·해지 단계 가운데 본인이 인지한 범위를 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about learning that the joint savings had been cancelled from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v4].text,"해지 이후 통장 알림이나 은행 문자가 본인 휴대전화로 왔는지, 어떤 시점에 왔는지 자료 기준으로 답해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 적금 가입·관리·해지 단계 가운데 본인이 인지한 범위를 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about learning that the joint savings had been cancelled from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于得知共同储蓄账户已被解约的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-b-savings_cancellation-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 해지에 대한 입장을 동의냐 부동의냐로만 단순화하기 전에, 사실관계로 더 짚어야 할 부분이 있다면 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about learning that the joint savings had been cancelled you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于得知共同储蓄账户已被解约，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동의 단계를 건너뛰고 본인 단독으로 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around handling the joint savings account, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕处理共同储蓄账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편에게 확인하지 않고 공동 적금부터 먼저 손대야 한다고 판단한 그 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around handling the joint savings account.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕处理共同储蓄账户作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동의 단계를 건너뛰고 본인 단독으로 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around handling the joint savings account, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕处理共同储蓄账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,그 시점에 남편의 동의를 구하는 단계 자체를 건너뛰기로 한 결정에 어떤 두려움이나 계산이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동의 단계를 건너뛰고 본인 단독으로 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around handling the joint savings account, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕处理共同储蓄账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,공동 자산을 본인 단독으로 진행하면 발각될 위험이 큰데도 그 위험을 감수한 본인의 판단 근거를 설명해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동의 단계를 건너뛰고 본인 단독으로 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around handling the joint savings account, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕处理共同储蓄账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,"남편이 먼저 가정을 버릴지 모른다는 불안과, 자산을 먼저 손에 쥐어야겠다는 결정 사이에 어떤 연결이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동의 단계를 건너뛰고 본인 단독으로 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around handling the joint savings account, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金を処理したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕处理共同储蓄账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,"그 결정의 가장 큰 동기가 자산 보호였는지, 응징이었는지, 자기방어였는지 본인 기준으로 정리해 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 운용·송금 결정의 동기를 묻되 사기 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around sending money to the investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of scam loss.",動機探索。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 詐欺損失の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕向投资群转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启诈骗损失断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 그 자금을 가족 차원이 아니라 본인 혼자 운용 쪽으로 옮기기로 한 결정의 동기가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around sending money to the investment chat.",パク・ジヨンさん、投資チャットに送金したことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕向投资群转账作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 운용·송금 결정의 동기를 묻되 사기 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around sending money to the investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of scam loss.",動機探索。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 詐欺損失の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕向投资群转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启诈骗损失断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v2].text,투자방 가입 권유를 받았을 때 다른 검증 단계를 거치지 않고 빠르게 송금 쪽으로 간 본인 결정의 이유를 답해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 운용·송금 결정의 동기를 묻되 사기 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around sending money to the investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of scam loss.",動機探索。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 詐欺損失の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕向投资群转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启诈骗损失断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v3].text,"그 자금을 본인 명의로 다시 옮기는 데에 자기방어의 마음이 있었는지, 아니면 응징의 의도가 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 운용·송금 결정의 동기를 묻되 사기 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around sending money to the investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of scam loss.",動機探索。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 詐欺損失の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕向投资群转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启诈骗损失断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v4].text,"일이 잘못됐을 때 부담을 어떻게 분담할지 미리 계산해 두었는지, 했다면 그 계산은 어떤 모양이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 운용·송금 결정의 동기를 묻되 사기 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around sending money to the investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of scam loss.",動機探索。投資チャットに送金したことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 詐欺損失の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕向投资群转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启诈骗损失断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-investment_room-v5].text,"그 송금 결정의 가장 큰 동기가 자산 분리였는지, 더 빨리 키우고 싶다는 욕구였는지 본인 기준에서 정리해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손실 책임 중 본인 몫을 가장 늦게 꺼내려 한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위법성 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm illegality conclusion.",動機探索。その後に生じた損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 違法性の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕随后发生的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启违法性断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 손실이 발생한 뒤에도 그 책임을 본인 단독으로 인정하기까지 미룬 결정의 동기가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the loss that followed.",パク・ジヨンさん、その後に生じた損失をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕随后发生的损失作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손실 책임 중 본인 몫을 가장 늦게 꺼내려 한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위법성 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm illegality conclusion.",動機探索。その後に生じた損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 違法性の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕随后发生的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启违法性断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v2].text,"감정적 피해를 강조하면 절차상 책임이 가벼워질 수 있다는 생각이 있었다면, 그 생각을 어디까지 의식하고 있었는지 답해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손실 책임 중 본인 몫을 가장 늦게 꺼내려 한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위법성 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm illegality conclusion.",動機探索。その後に生じた損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 違法性の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕随后发生的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启违法性断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v3].text,본인 책임 중 가장 무거운 부분을 마지막까지 미루어 두고 싶었던 동기를 본인 기준으로 설명해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손실 책임 중 본인 몫을 가장 늦게 꺼내려 한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위법성 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm illegality conclusion.",動機探索。その後に生じた損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 違法性の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕随后发生的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启违法性断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v4].text,"손실의 원인을 다른 쪽으로 돌릴 수 있는 자리에서 그 시도를 한 적이 있다면, 그때의 동기가 무엇이었습니까.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손실 책임 중 본인 몫을 가장 늦게 꺼내려 한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위법성 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm illegality conclusion.",動機探索。その後に生じた損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 違法性の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕随后发生的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启违法性断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-loss_responsibility-v5].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 그 손실 책임 중 본인 쪽에 남는 부분을 가장 늦게 꺼내려 한 동기를 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정식 동의 절차를 거치지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the power of attorney document, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。委任状の書類をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕委托书文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 위임 서류를 본인 단독 판단으로 처리한 결정에 어떤 다급함 또는 계산이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the power of attorney document.",パク・ジヨンさん、委任状の書類をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕委托书文件作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정식 동의 절차를 거치지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the power of attorney document, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。委任状の書類をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕委托书文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v2].text,남편의 동의를 정식 절차로 받는 단계를 거치지 않은 본인의 판단 근거를 답해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정식 동의 절차를 거치지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the power of attorney document, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。委任状の書類をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕委托书文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v3].text,"그 서류가 정상 절차에서 벗어난다는 점을 본인이 어디까지 인지하고 있었는지, 그 인지가 결정에 어떤 영향을 주었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정식 동의 절차를 거치지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the power of attorney document, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。委任状の書類をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕委托书文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v4].text,사후에 그 서류 처리가 발각될 경우 어떻게 설명할 계획이었는지 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.,Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 정식 동의 절차를 거치지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the power of attorney document, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。委任状の書類をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕委托书文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-proxy_document-v5].text,"그 시점에 그 방식 외의 다른 선택지를 검토했는지, 검토했다면 왜 더 안전한 길을 택하지 않았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 적금 해지를 본인 단독으로 진행한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings cancellation, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄账户解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 공동 적금을 본인 혼자 해지 신청까지 진행해야 한다고 판단한 결정의 동기가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the joint savings cancellation.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕共同储蓄账户解约作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 적금 해지를 본인 단독으로 진행한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings cancellation, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄账户解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v2].text,중도 해지 손해를 감수하면서까지 그 시점에 처리한 결정에 어떤 다급함이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 적금 해지를 본인 단독으로 진행한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings cancellation, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄账户解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v3].text,남편 명의가 함께 들어간 자산이라는 점을 알면서도 본인 단독 진행 쪽을 택한 본인의 판단 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 적금 해지를 본인 단독으로 진행한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings cancellation, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄账户解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v4].text,그 해지가 발각될 시점에 어떻게 설명하려고 계획하고 있었는지 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.,Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 적금 해지를 본인 단독으로 진행한 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings cancellation, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。共同積立預金の解約をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄账户解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-a-savings_cancellation-v5].text,공동 적금이라는 형식의 무게보다 본인의 결정 권한 쪽을 더 크게 잡은 동기를 설명해 주십시오.,"Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름 이상을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피·신뢰의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 공동 적금 흐름에 이상을 느낀 시점에 더 빨리 확인하지 못한 본인 결정의 동기가 어디에 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge.",イ・ジュノさん、知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름 이상을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피·신뢰의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,"본인이 동의했다고 오해될 만한 행동이나 침묵이 있었다면, 그 시점에 명확히 선을 긋지 못한 이유를 답해 주십시오.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름 이상을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피·신뢰의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,"평소 그 자산 흐름을 살피지 않은 데에 어떤 신뢰가 있었는지, 어떤 회피가 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름 이상을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피·신뢰의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,"사정을 알게 된 뒤에도 즉시 문제 제기로 넘어가지 못한 부분이 있다면, 그 망설임의 동기를 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름 이상을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피·신뢰의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the joint savings disappearing without your knowledge, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。知らないうちに共同積立預金が消えたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄在你不知情时消失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,"본인의 침묵 또는 회피가 그 흐름을 가능하게 만든 부분이 있었다면, 그 침묵의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 송금 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕钱被转入外部投资群作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 자금이 외부로 옮겨진 흐름을 본인이 알 수 있었던 시점이 있었는지, 있었다면 그때 어떤 판단을 내렸는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the money being sent to an outside investment chat.",イ・ジュノさん、金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕钱被转入外部投资群作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 송금 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕钱被转入外部投资群作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v2].text,사후에 사정을 알게 됐을 때 즉시 회수 또는 문제 제기로 넘어가지 못한 동기가 있다면 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 송금 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕钱被转入外部投资群作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v3].text,"평소 자금에 대한 무관심이 그 흐름을 가능하게 만든 부분이 있다면, 그 무관심이 어디서 비롯됐는지 설명해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 송금 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕钱被转入外部投资群作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v4].text,"그 송금이 외도 자금 의혹과 함께 묶여 있다는 점을 알았을 때, 본인의 대응을 늦추거나 흐려지게 만든 마음이 있었습니까.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 늦게 알아챈 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 송금 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the money being sent to an outside investment chat, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。金が外部の投資チャットへ流れたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕钱被转入外部投资群作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-investment_room-v5].text,"답할 수 있는 부분이 본인의 인지 시점과 대응 시점뿐이라는 점을 전제로, 그 두 가지에 어떤 망설임이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 침묵·무관심이 손실에 기여한 부분의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss of the joint savings, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 손실 책임을 상대 한 사람에게 모두 돌리려는 마음이 있었다면, 그 마음의 동기를 본인 기준에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the loss of the joint savings.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の損失をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕共同储蓄的损失作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 침묵·무관심이 손실에 기여한 부분의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss of the joint savings, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v2].text,"본인의 침묵이나 자금 무관심이 손실 가능성을 키운 부분이 있었다면, 그 부분을 인정하기까지 망설인 동기가 어디에 있었는지 답해 주십시오.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 침묵·무관심이 손실에 기여한 부분의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss of the joint savings, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v3].text,"사정을 알게 된 시점에 더 빨리 멈출 수 있었음에도 멈추지 않은 부분이 있다면, 그 시점의 본인 판단 근거를 설명해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 침묵·무관심이 손실에 기여한 부분의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss of the joint savings, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v4].text,감정적 피해 호소와 본인 쪽 절차 책임 사이에서 어느 쪽을 먼저 꺼낼지 계산한 부분이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.,Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 침묵·무관심이 손실에 기여한 부분의 동기를 묻되 상대 행위를 대신 자백시키지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the loss of the joint savings, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them confess the other party’s act on that party’s behalf.",動機探索。共同積立預金の損失をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の行為を代わりに自白させない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕共同储蓄的损失作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方承认对方行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-loss_responsibility-v5].text,"본인이 답할 수 있는 범위는 본인의 동의와 인지, 대응뿐임을 전제로, 손실 책임 가운데 본인 몫의 동기를 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 명의 서류 관리에 대한 본인 인지·대응의 동기를 묻되 상대의 위임장 처리 동기를 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your name being used on documents without consent, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 명의 서류가 어떤 경위로 다뤄지고 있는지 평소 본인이 어디까지 확인하고 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around your name being used on documents without consent.",イ・ジュノさん、同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 명의 서류 관리에 대한 본인 인지·대응의 동기를 묻되 상대의 위임장 처리 동기를 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your name being used on documents without consent, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v2].text,본인 의사 없이 명의가 사용될 가능성을 사전에 차단할 장치를 두지 않은 본인 결정에 어떤 신뢰 또는 회피가 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 명의 서류 관리에 대한 본인 인지·대응의 동기를 묻되 상대의 위임장 처리 동기를 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your name being used on documents without consent, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v3].text,"그 서류 처리에 본인이 직접 동의했다는 오해가 생겼다면, 그 오해를 부르는 행동이나 침묵이 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 명의 서류 관리에 대한 본인 인지·대응의 동기를 묻되 상대의 위임장 처리 동기를 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your name being used on documents without consent, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v4].text,"사정을 알게 된 시점에 즉시 문제 제기로 가지 못한 부분이 있다면, 그 망설임의 동기를 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 명의 서류 관리에 대한 본인 인지·대응의 동기를 묻되 상대의 위임장 처리 동기를 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your name being used on documents without consent, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。同意なしに自分の名義が書類で使われたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的名义在未同意下被用于文件作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-proxy_document-v5].text,"이 사안에서 답할 수 있는 부분이 인지 시점과 대응 결정뿐이라는 점을 전제로, 그 두 가지의 사정을 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 자산 변동을 평소 살피지 않은 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 동의·서명 위반을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 공동 적금 변동에 대해 평소 본인이 어디까지 살피고 있었고, 살피지 않은 부분이 있었다면 그 이유가 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 자산 변동을 평소 살피지 않은 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 동의·서명 위반을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v2].text,"해지 신청 시점에 본인 의사를 묻는 단계가 있었다면 어떻게 답할 생각이었는지, 묻지 않았다면 그 사실을 알게 된 시점은 언제였는지 답해 주십시오.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 자산 변동을 평소 살피지 않은 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 동의·서명 위반을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v3].text,"본인의 동의 또는 묵인 쪽으로 오해될 만한 행동이 있었다면, 그 시점에 분명히 선을 긋지 못한 동기를 설명해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 자산 변동을 평소 살피지 않은 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 동의·서명 위반을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v4].text,공동 자산을 단독으로 처리할 수 없도록 미리 장치를 두지 않은 본인 쪽 결정에 어떤 회피 또는 신뢰 판단이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공동 자산 변동을 평소 살피지 않은 본인 회피의 동기를 묻되 상대 동의·서명 위반을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around learning that the joint savings had been cancelled, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。共同積立預金が解約されたと知ったことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕得知共同储蓄账户已被解约作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d3_.variants_judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-b-savings_cancellation-v5].text,"사후에 그 사실을 알았을 때 즉시 문제 제기 쪽으로 가지 못했다면, 그 망설임의 동기를 본인 기준으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시 행위의 불안과 죄책감을 인정하되 신뢰에 남긴 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around monitoring the husband’s account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕查看丈夫账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 결혼 초부터 남편 계좌를 들여다보던 그 오랜 시간 동안 본인 안에도 불안과 죄책감이 같이 있었을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how monitoring your husband’s account could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の口座を確認していたことはご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解查看丈夫账户对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시 행위의 불안과 죄책감을 인정하되 신뢰에 남긴 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around monitoring the husband’s account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕查看丈夫账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 계좌를 처음 들여다본 때와 그 일이 습관으로 굳어진 때를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about monitoring your husband’s account from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の口座を確認していたことについて、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对查看丈夫账户直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시 행위의 불안과 죄책감을 인정하되 신뢰에 남긴 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around monitoring the husband’s account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕查看丈夫账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 그 행위 중 가장 본인 마음에 남은 한 시점이 언제였습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among when it began, how often it happened, and why it continued, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、始まった時点、頻度、続いた理由の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在开始时间、频率和持续原因之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시 행위의 불안과 죄책감을 인정하되 신뢰에 남긴 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around monitoring the husband’s account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕查看丈夫账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 의심의 정당성과 별개로, 그 행위가 부부 신뢰에 남긴 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시 행위의 불안과 죄책감을 인정하되 신뢰에 남긴 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around monitoring the husband’s account, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕查看丈夫账户的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-account_monitoring-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 그 행위의 시작 자체를 지금 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 처음 들여다본 한 시점의 마음만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when monitoring your husband’s account weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。夫の口座を確認していたことが最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看查看丈夫账户对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대 침묵에 대한 분노를 인정하되 그 위에 시작한 본인 행동의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around what the party hid and when, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 상대의 침묵을 알아챘을 때 본인 안에서도 어떤 결심이 빠르게 굳어졌을 것입니다. 그때의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how what you hid and when could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、何をいつ隠したのかはご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解你在何时隐瞒了什么对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대 침묵에 대한 분노를 인정하되 그 위에 시작한 본인 행동의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around what the party hid and when, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 상대가 먼저 숨겼다고 본인이 판단한 근거와 그 판단을 직접 확인한 부분의 경계를 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about what you hid and when from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、何をいつ隠したのかについて、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对你在何时隐瞒了什么直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대 침묵에 대한 분노를 인정하되 그 위에 시작한 본인 행동의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around what the party hid and when, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 상대의 침묵을 알아챈 첫 시점의 감정과 그 후 본인 행동으로 옮겨진 시점 사이가 얼마나 가까웠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among your concealment and the other side’s silence, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、ご自身の隠し事と相手の沈黙の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在你的隐瞒和对方的沉默之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대 침묵에 대한 분노를 인정하되 그 위에 시작한 본인 행동의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around what the party hid and when, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 상대 침묵에 대한 분노는 잠시 두고, 그 분노 위에 본인이 시작한 일의 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 상대 침묵에 대한 분노를 인정하되 그 위에 시작한 본인 행동의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around what the party hid and when, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-concealment_sequence-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 침묵의 선후를 지금 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 상대 침묵을 본인이 처음 알아챈 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when what you hid and when weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。何をいつ隠したのかが最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看你在何时隐瞒了什么对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 두 번의 결정 사이 망설임을 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 지점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 본인 손으로 6주 전과 5주 전 두 번에 걸쳐 큰 결정을 내리던 그 시간에는 결심과 두려움이 함께 있었을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解6周前的解约和5周前的转账对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 두 번의 결정 사이 망설임을 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 지점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 6주 전 해지와 5주 전 송금 사이에 본인이 한 일을 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对6周前的解约和5周前的转账直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 두 번의 결정 사이 망설임을 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 지점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 그 일주일 사이 가장 마지막까지 망설였던 한 시점이 어디였습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among the cancellation date, transfer date, and account notice, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、解約日、送金日、通帳通知の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在解约日、转账日和账户提醒之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 두 번의 결정 사이 망설임을 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 지점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 그 두 번의 결정 사이 본인이 멈출 수 있었던 지점이 있었는지 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 두 번의 결정 사이 망설임을 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 지점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-execution_timeline-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 두 결정의 시점을 지금 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그중 가장 무겁게 남은 한 시점의 마음만이라도 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看6周前的解约和5周前的转账对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 신뢰 붕괴의 흐름을 인정하되 본인 행동의 책임을 비교 없이 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 부부 사이에서 신뢰가 무너진 시점부터 본인의 행동도 점점 절차를 넘어섰을 것입니다. 그때의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、口座確認、積立預金解約、送金はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解账户查看、储蓄解约和转账对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 신뢰 붕괴의 흐름을 인정하되 본인 행동의 책임을 비교 없이 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 계좌 확인과 적금 처리, 위임 서류 가운데 본인이 직접 한 일의 시간 순서를 따로 떼어 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、口座確認、積立預金解約、送金について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对账户查看、储蓄解约和转账直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 신뢰 붕괴의 흐름을 인정하되 본인 행동의 책임을 비교 없이 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 본인 행동이 절차의 선을 넘은 첫 시점이 언제였습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among account checking, document handling, transfer, and loss, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、口座確認、書類処理、送金、損失の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在账户查看、文件处理、转账和损失之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 신뢰 붕괴의 흐름을 인정하되 본인 행동의 책임을 비교 없이 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 누가 더 잘못했는가의 비교 대신, 본인의 행동에 남은 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 신뢰 붕괴의 흐름을 인정하되 본인 행동의 책임을 비교 없이 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 모든 책임을 한 번에 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인이 가장 먼저 인정할 수 있는 한 가지 책임을 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看账户查看、储蓄解约和转账对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동기의 무게를 인정하되 절차의 선을 넘은 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural line the party crossed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你越过的程序界限的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 이유가 어떻든 본인 손으로 절차의 선을 넘은 그 자리에는 본인 안에도 무거운 침묵이 남았을 것입니다. 그 침묵의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how the procedural line you crossed could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、越えた手続き上の線はご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解你越过的程序界限对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동기의 무게를 인정하되 절차의 선을 넘은 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural line the party crossed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你越过的程序界限的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 동기와 분리해 절차상 본인이 직접 처리한 부분의 범위를 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about the procedural line you crossed from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、越えた手続き上の線について、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对你越过的程序界限直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동기의 무게를 인정하되 절차의 선을 넘은 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural line the party crossed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你越过的程序界限的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 그 절차 처리 중 가장 망설인 한 단계가 어디였습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among document preparation, legality concerns, and what you admit, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、書類作成、適法性の疑い、認める範囲の中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在文件制作、合法性疑点和你承认的范围之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동기의 무게를 인정하되 절차의 선을 넘은 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural line the party crossed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你越过的程序界限的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 동기의 정당성과 별개로, 절차의 선을 넘은 부분에 대한 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동기의 무게를 인정하되 절차의 선을 넘은 책임을 분리해 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural line the party crossed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你越过的程序界限的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-illegal_boundary-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 절차 전체를 지금 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인이 가장 먼저 인정할 수 있는 한 단계를 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when the procedural line you crossed weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。越えた手続き上の線が最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看你越过的程序界限对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 행동만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 누가 더 나쁜가의 자리에 서지 않고 본인 책임만 따로 들여다보는 일은 누구에게나 무겁습니다. 그 무게를 안고 있던 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, I understand how separating your own responsibility from comparison could have weighed heavily on you. Please state what you felt at that moment.",パク・ジヨンさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることはご自身にも重くのしかかっていたはずです。その瞬間の心境を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，我理解把自己的责任从比较中分离出来对你也会很沉重。请说明那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 행동만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 침묵, 감시, 실행, 절차 처리 가운데 본인 책임으로 따로 떼어 말씀하실 수 있는 부분이 어디까지인지 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please separate what you directly confirmed about separating your own responsibility from comparison from what you filled in by inference.",パク・ジヨンさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、直接確認した部分と推定で補った部分を切り分けてください。,朴智妍女士，请把你对把自己的责任从比较中分离出来直接确认的部分，与凭推断补上的部分分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
