judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 그 분리된 책임 중 본인이 가장 먼저 인정할 수 있는 한 가지가 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, among silence, monitoring, execution, and procedure, which point was hardest for you to accept?",パク・ジヨンさん、沈黙、監視、実行、手続きの中で、最も受け入れがたかった点は何でしたか。,朴智妍女士，在沉默、监控、执行和程序之中，最难接受的是哪一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 행동만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 상대 책임의 크기와 비교하지 않고, 본인 행동만으로 남은 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, as far as you can admit, please state where you moved from suspicion to a firm conclusion.",パク・ジヨンさん、疑いから断定へ移った部分について、認められる範囲で述べてください。,朴智妍女士，对于自己从怀疑转向断定的部分，请在能够承认的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 행동만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-a-responsibility_split-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 책임 전체를 한 번에 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인 책임 한 가지만이라도 따로 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, this is not to decide everything at once. Please revisit the one moment when separating your own responsibility from comparison weighed most heavily on you.",パク・ジヨンさん、すべてを一度に結論づける意図ではありません。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることが最も重くのしかかった一つの瞬間を改めて振り返ってください。,朴智妍女士，这不是要一次性下结论。请重新回看把自己的责任从比较中分离出来对你最沉重的那一个瞬间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시받은 충격을 인정하되 침묵이 그 토양을 만든 부분의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 모르게 계좌가 들여다보이고 있었다는 사실을 알게 된 순간, 또 한 번 무너지는 마음이 있었을 것입니다. 그때의 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that your undisclosed funds and your spouse’s account monitoring left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시받은 충격을 인정하되 침묵이 그 토양을 만든 부분의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 그 사실을 본인이 어떤 경로로 알게 됐는지, 직접 확인한 부분이 어디까지였는지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about your undisclosed funds and your spouse’s account monitoring, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시받은 충격을 인정하되 침묵이 그 토양을 만든 부분의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 사실 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 부분이 어떤 부분이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among what you knew, what you hid, and what suspicion followed, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、知っていたこと、隠したこと、生じた疑いの中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在你知道的、隐瞒的以及随之产生的怀疑之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시받은 충격을 인정하되 침묵이 그 토양을 만든 부분의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 그 일에 대한 분노와는 별개로, 본인의 침묵이 그런 의심을 키울 빌미가 된 부분에 대한 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 감시받은 충격을 인정하되 침묵이 그 토양을 만든 부분의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-account_monitoring-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 그 행위 전체를 지금 다투자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 그 사실을 처음 알게 된 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of your undisclosed funds and your spouse’s account monitoring that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정은 캐지 않고 침묵이 부부 신뢰에 한 역할을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the silence the party began and repeated, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。始めて繰り返した沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你开始并反复维持的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 말씀하기 어려운 사정으로 입을 닫은 시간 동안 그 침묵이 부부 사이에 어떤 영향을 미칠지 본인 안에서도 무거웠을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the silence you began and repeated left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、始めて繰り返した沈黙はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你开始并反复维持的沉默对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정은 캐지 않고 침묵이 부부 신뢰에 한 역할을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the silence the party began and repeated, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。始めて繰り返した沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你开始并反复维持的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 침묵을 시작한 시점과 그 침묵이 길어진 구간의 경계를 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the silence you began and repeated, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、始めて繰り返した沈黙について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你开始并反复维持的沉默现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
