judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 침묵 중 가장 일찍 깰 수 있었던 시점이 언제였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among what you first chose not to say and what came after, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、最初に言わないと決めたこととその後の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在你最先决定不说的内容及其后续之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정은 캐지 않고 침묵이 부부 신뢰에 한 역할을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the silence the party began and repeated, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。始めて繰り返した沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你开始并反复维持的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 침묵의 사정은 잠시 미뤄 두고, 부부 신뢰가 무너지는 데 그 침묵이 한 역할을 본인이 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 사정은 캐지 않고 침묵이 부부 신뢰에 한 역할을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the silence the party began and repeated, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。始めて繰り返した沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你开始并反复维持的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-concealment_sequence-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 침묵의 내용을 지금 다 풀라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 침묵을 시작한 첫 시점의 마음만이라도 정리해 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the silence you began and repeated that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。始めて繰り返した沈黙のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你开始并反复维持的沉默中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인 결정의 선행 무게를 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 시점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인의 4개월 전 결정이 그 뒤 부부 재정의 다른 결정들에까지 영향을 미친 일이 본인에게도 무겁게 남았을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인 결정의 선행 무게를 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 시점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 4개월 전 출금과 그 뒤 이어진 침묵의 시간을 본인이 본 대로 나누어 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인 결정의 선행 무게를 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 시점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 시간 안에서 본인이 가장 일찍 말할 수 있었던 시점이 언제였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among your withdrawal date and Park Ji-yeon’s later fund execution, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、ご自身の出金日とパク・ジヨンのその後の資金実行の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在你的取款日和朴智妍后续资金执行之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
