judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 다른 결정들이 본인 결정과 무관하다고 보더라도, 본인 결정의 선후 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인 결정의 선행 무게를 인정하되 멈출 수 있던 시점의 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-execution_timeline-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 시간 순서 전부를 지금 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인이 가장 일찍 멈출 수 있었던 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 길이가 다음 일을 만든 부분을 인정하되 본인 책임을 비교 없이 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 부부 사이에서 침묵이 길어질수록 그 침묵 자체가 다음 일을 만든 부분이 본인에게도 남아 있을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙はご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
