judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 사정 은폐와 큰돈 출금, 사후 침묵 가운데 본인이 직접 한 일의 시간 순서를 따로 떼어 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙について認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
