judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 침묵이 가장 길게 이어진 한 구간이 어디였습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among family circumstances, funds movement, and silence, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、家族事情、資金移動、沈黙の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在家庭情况、资金流动和沉默之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 길이가 다음 일을 만든 부분을 인정하되 본인 책임을 비교 없이 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 누가 더 잘못했는가의 비교 대신, 본인 침묵에 남은 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 침묵의 길이가 다음 일을 만든 부분을 인정하되 본인 책임을 비교 없이 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 모든 책임을 한 번에 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인이 가장 먼저 인정할 수 있는 침묵 한 가지만 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙のうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 절차 위반의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 직접 그 선을 넘은 사람은 아니지만, 그 일이 진행되는 시간을 옆에서 지켜본 마음에도 무게가 남아 있을 것입니다. 그 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，你处理资金中的程序模糊性对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 절차 위반의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 직접 처리한 부분과 일이 끝난 뒤에야 알게 된 부분을 나누어 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对你处理资金中的程序模糊性现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 절차 위반의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 절차 위반 사실 중 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 한 부분이 어떤 부분이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among what you knew, what you consented to, and what you left unclear, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、知っていたこと、同意したこと、曖昧にしたことの中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在你知道的、同意的和未厘清的部分之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 절차 위반의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 절차 처리의 책임 중심은 상대 쪽에 있더라도, 본인이 부부 재정 흐름을 더 일찍 살피지 못한 부분의 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 절차 위반의 충격을 인정하되 사후 점검 책임 부분을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-illegal_boundary-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 절차 전체를 지금 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인이 처음 그 사실을 알게 된 한 시점만이라도 다시 짚어 주실 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理你处理资金中的程序模糊性中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 침묵·회피만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 누가 더 나쁜가의 자리에 서지 않고 본인 책임만 따로 들여다보는 일은 누구에게나 무겁습니다. 그 무게를 안고 있던 마음을 말씀해 주실 수 있습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, I understand that separating your own responsibility from comparison left a weight on you as well. Please state what you were feeling then.",イ・ジュノさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることはご自身にも重く残っていたはずです。その時の心境を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，把自己的责任从比较中分离出来对你自己也应当留下了重量。请说明当时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 침묵·회피만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 은폐, 침묵, 출금, 그 뒤의 회피 가운데 본인 책임으로 따로 떼어 말씀하실 수 있는 부분이 어디까지인지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please summarize what you can acknowledge now about separating your own responsibility from comparison, without going beyond what you can disclose.",イ・ジュノさん、今話せる範囲を超えずに、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて認められる部分を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请不要超出目前可公开范围，整理你对把自己的责任从比较中分离出来现在能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 침묵·회피만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 분리된 책임 중 본인이 가장 먼저 인정할 수 있는 한 가지가 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, among silence, concealment, withdrawal, and evasion, which part was hardest for you to explain?",イ・ジュノさん、沈黙、隠蔽、出金、回避の中で、最も説明しづらかった部分はどこでしたか。,李俊浩先生，在沉默、隐瞒、取款和回避之中，最难解释的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 침묵·회피만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 상대 책임의 크기와 비교하지 않고, 본인 행동만으로 남은 책임을 인정할 수 있는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, apart from defending yourself, please state the responsibility you can acknowledge for leaving this unclear.",イ・ジュノさん、弁明とは別に、曖昧なままにした責任として認められる部分を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，除开自我辩解，请说明你对一直未说明清楚这件事能够承认的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비교가 아닌 본인 침묵·회피만으로 분리된 책임을 받게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotional weight around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, while separating what the party can personally take responsibility for.",共感アプローチ。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる感情の重さを認めつつ、本人が引き受けられる責任を切り分ける。,共情接近。承认围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的情绪重量，同时分离当事人本人能够承担的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-b-responsibility_split-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 책임 전체를 한 번에 결론짓자는 뜻은 아닙니다. 본인 책임 한 가지만이라도 따로 정리해 줄 수 있겠습니까.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, this is not asking you to explain everything at once. Please clarify one part of separating your own responsibility from comparison that most easily led to misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、すべてを一度に説明させる意図ではありません。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることのうち、最も誤解を招きやすかった一点を整理してください。,李俊浩先生，这不是要求你一次性解释全部。请先整理把自己的责任从比较中分离出来中最容易造成误会的一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 시점·자료·빈도를 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 감시 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about monitoring the husband’s account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm monitoring conclusion before S5.",事実追及。夫の口座を確認していたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは監視の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于查看丈夫账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示监控断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편의 계좌 내역을 들여다보기 시작한 시점이 언제였고, 그 계기는 무엇이었는지 사실관계 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed monitoring your husband’s account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の口座を確認していたことをいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认查看丈夫账户的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 시점·자료·빈도를 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 감시 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about monitoring the husband’s account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm monitoring conclusion before S5.",事実追及。夫の口座を確認していたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは監視の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于查看丈夫账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示监控断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v2].text,"카드 알림, 가계부, 통장 인쇄 가운데 본인이 어떤 자료를, 어느 빈도로 확인했는지 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 시점·자료·빈도를 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 감시 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about monitoring the husband’s account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm monitoring conclusion before S5.",事実追及。夫の口座を確認していたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは監視の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于查看丈夫账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示监控断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v3].text,이준호 씨가 그 확인을 감시로 보는 부분과 본인이 가계 관리로 보는 부분이 어디서 갈라지는지 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 시점·자료·빈도를 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 감시 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about monitoring the husband’s account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm monitoring conclusion before S5.",事実追及。夫の口座を確認していたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは監視の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于查看丈夫账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示监控断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v4].text,신혼 초부터 지금까지 확인 빈도와 강도가 변한 시점을 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.,"Please organize which records support your view of monitoring your husband’s account, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",夫の口座を確認していたことについて、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对查看丈夫账户的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 시점·자료·빈도를 사실관계로 답하게 한다. 감시 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about monitoring the husband’s account from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm monitoring conclusion before S5.",事実追及。夫の口座を確認していたことについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは監視の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于查看丈夫账户的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示监控断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-account_monitoring-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 계좌 확인 가운데 본인이 아직 답하지 않은 행동이 있다면 그 부분부터 꺼내 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about monitoring your husband’s account remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の口座を確認していたことについて直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于查看丈夫账户，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 침묵과 들어 알게 된 침묵을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about what the party hid and when from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。何をいつ隠したのかについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你在何时隐瞒了什么的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편이 무엇을 가장 먼저 숨겼다고 보는지, 그 판단의 근거 자료부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed what you hid and when.",パク・ジヨンさん、何をいつ隠したのかをいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认你在何时隐瞒了什么的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 침묵과 들어 알게 된 침묵을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about what the party hid and when from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。何をいつ隠したのかについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你在何时隐瞒了什么的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v2].text,본인이 직접 확인한 침묵과 다른 사람에게 듣고 알게 된 침묵을 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
