judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v3].text,이준호 씨가 침묵의 출발점에 대해 다르게 설명하는 부분과 본인의 시점 사이에 어긋나는 지점을 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 침묵과 들어 알게 된 침묵을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about what the party hid and when from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。何をいつ隠したのかについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你在何时隐瞒了什么的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v4].text,"같은 시기 본인 쪽에서 말하지 않은 항목이 있었는지, 양쪽 침묵을 자료 기준으로 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of what you hid and when, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",何をいつ隠したのかについて、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对你在何时隐瞒了什么的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 침묵과 들어 알게 된 침묵을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about what the party hid and when from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。何をいつ隠したのかについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你在何时隐瞒了什么的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-concealment_sequence-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 본인이 직접 확인하지 못한 채 추정으로 남은 침묵이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about what you hid and when remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、何をいつ隠したのかについて直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于你在何时隐瞒了什么，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지일·송금일·통장 알림 시점을 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于6周前的解约和5周前的转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 6주 전 적금 해지일과 5주 전 송금일을 본인이 직접 확인한 시점과 함께 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago.",パク・ジヨンさん、6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认6周前的解约和5周前的转账的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지일·송금일·통장 알림 시점을 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于6周前的解约和5周前的转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v2].text,"본인의 자금 실행과 남편의 출금이 어느 쪽이 먼저였는지, 사실관계로만 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지일·송금일·통장 알림 시점을 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于6周前的解约和5周前的转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v3].text,"이준호 씨는 두 일을 별개로 보고, 본인은 같은 흐름으로 묶어 보고 있습니다. 어디서부터 견해가 갈리는지 짚어 주십시오.",Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지일·송금일·통장 알림 시점을 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于6周前的解约和5周前的转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v4].text,해지일·송금일·통장 알림 시점을 자료 단위로 다시 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize which records support your view of the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对6周前的解约和5周前的转账的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 해지일·송금일·통장 알림 시점을 자료 단위로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于6周前的解约和5周前的转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-execution_timeline-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 시간순 정리에 본인이 아직 포함하지 않은 행동이 있다면 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于6周前的解约和5周前的转账，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·해지·송금 단계를 본인 행동과 외부 사실로 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편의 계좌를 확인하기 시작한 시점과 본인이 자금을 움직인 시점을 시간순으로 나누어 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer.",パク・ジヨンさん、口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·해지·송금 단계를 본인 행동과 외부 사실로 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,"계좌 확인, 적금 해지, 송금 가운데 본인이 한 행동과 다른 사람의 행동을 나눠 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·해지·송금 단계를 본인 행동과 외부 사실로 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,이준호 씨가 은폐를 먼저 시작한 쪽이 본인이라고 말하는 부분과 본인이 보는 선후 관계가 어디서 갈라지는지 짚어 주십시오.,Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
