judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,"그 시기마다 본인이 어떤 자료에—카드 알림, 통장, 가계부 가운데—의지했는지 자료 별로 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",口座確認、積立預金解約、送金について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·해지·송금 단계를 본인 행동과 외부 사실로 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于账户查看、储蓄解约和转账的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 본인이 책임지는 부분과 외부 요인으로 보는 부분을 한 덩어리로 묶지 말고 따로 떼어 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、口座確認、積立預金解約、送金について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于账户查看、储蓄解约和转账，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 단계와 적법성 의심 단계를 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural line the party crossed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation before S5.",事実追及。越えた手続き上の線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你越过的程序界限的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 적금 해지에 들어간 서류 가운데 본인이 직접 작성한 부분과 본인 명의로 처리된 부분을 있는 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed the procedural line you crossed.",パク・ジヨンさん、越えた手続き上の線をいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认你越过的程序界限的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 단계와 적법성 의심 단계를 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural line the party crossed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation before S5.",事実追及。越えた手続き上の線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你越过的程序界限的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v2].text,"그 서류 처리에서 적법성 의심을 받을 수 있는 단계가 있는지, 본인이 인정하는 한도에서 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 단계와 적법성 의심 단계를 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural line the party crossed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation before S5.",事実追及。越えた手続き上の線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你越过的程序界限的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v3].text,"이준호 씨는 절차 위반으로 보고, 본인은 정당한 처리로 보고 있습니다. 어디서부터 견해가 갈리는지 짚어 주십시오.",Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 단계와 적법성 의심 단계를 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural line the party crossed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation before S5.",事実追及。越えた手続き上の線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你越过的程序界限的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v4].text,은행 직원과 주고받은 대화와 본인이 제출한 신분 자료를 하나씩 차례로 답해 주십시오.,"Please organize which records support your view of the procedural line you crossed, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",越えた手続き上の線について、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对你越过的程序界限的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서류 작성 단계와 적법성 의심 단계를 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 위임장 조작 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural line the party crossed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation before S5.",事実追及。越えた手続き上の線について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは委任状操作の断定を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你越过的程序界限的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-illegal_boundary-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 절차 위반 가능성에 대해 본인이 지금 단계에서 인정할 수 있는 한도를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about the procedural line you crossed remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、越えた手続き上の線について直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于你越过的程序界限，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·서류·송금·손실 단계를 본인이 한 일 기준으로 분리해 답하게 한다. 메타어 사용 금지(질문 분류명을 그대로 인용하지 않음).,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about separating one's own responsibility from comparison from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not quote the question-category meta label as-is.",事実追及。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 質問分類のメタ語をそのまま引用しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 不要原样引用问题分类元词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 계좌 확인, 위임 서류 처리, 송금, 손실까지 네 단계로 나누어 본인이 한 일을 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please answer first when and through which material you confirmed separating your own responsibility from comparison.",パク・ジヨンさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをいつ、どの資料で確認したのかから答えてください。,朴智妍女士，请先回答你是在何时、通过什么资料确认把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·서류·송금·손실 단계를 본인이 한 일 기준으로 분리해 답하게 한다. 메타어 사용 금지(질문 분류명을 그대로 인용하지 않음).,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about separating one's own responsibility from comparison from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not quote the question-category meta label as-is.",事実追及。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 質問分類のメタ語をそのまま引用しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 不要原样引用问题分类元词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v2].text,그 네 단계 가운데 본인이 직접 한 일과 다른 사람의 행동에 의지한 일을 분리해 주십시오.,Please separate the parts you directly confirmed from the parts that remained inference.,直接確認した部分と、推定のまま残っている部分を分けてください。,请把你直接确认的部分，与仍停留在推断中的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·서류·송금·손실 단계를 본인이 한 일 기준으로 분리해 답하게 한다. 메타어 사용 금지(질문 분류명을 그대로 인용하지 않음).,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about separating one's own responsibility from comparison from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not quote the question-category meta label as-is.",事実追及。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 質問分類のメタ語をそのまま引用しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 不要原样引用问题分类元词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v3].text,"이준호 씨의 침묵을 본인의 모든 단계를 정당화하는 근거로 묶지 말고, 어디서부터 본인 책임으로 보는지 짚어 주십시오.",Where is the largest gap between Mr. Lee Jun-ho's statement and the records or facts you saw?,イ・ジュノさんの陳述と、ご自身が見た記録または事実との間で最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,李俊浩先生的陈述与你看到的记录或事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·서류·송금·손실 단계를 본인이 한 일 기준으로 분리해 답하게 한다. 메타어 사용 금지(질문 분류명을 그대로 인용하지 않음).,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about separating one's own responsibility from comparison from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not quote the question-category meta label as-is.",事実追及。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 質問分類のメタ語をそのまま引用しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 不要原样引用问题分类元词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v4].text,"각 단계의 책임을 가르는 자료가 무엇인지 서류, 통장, 카톡으로 나누어 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize which records support your view of separating your own responsibility from comparison, without turning the answer into a final interpretation.",比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、ご自身の見方を支える資料を、最終解釈にせず記録単位で整理してください。,请按资料单位整理哪些记录支持你对把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的看法，不要把回答直接推进到最终解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 계좌 확인·서류·송금·손실 단계를 본인이 한 일 기준으로 분리해 답하게 한다. 메타어 사용 금지(질문 분류명을 그대로 인용하지 않음).,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about separating one's own responsibility from comparison from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not quote the question-category meta label as-is.",事実追及。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 質問分類のメタ語をそのまま引用しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 不要原样引用问题分类元词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-a-responsibility_split-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 본인이 인정하는 단계와 다투는 단계를 명확히 구분해 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, if any point about separating your own responsibility from comparison remains an inference rather than something directly confirmed, begin with that item.",パク・ジヨンさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて直接確認できず推定に残っている点があれば、その項目から始めてください。,朴智妍女士，关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来，若有尚未直接确认、仍属推断的项目，请从那里开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 인지 시점과 본인 대응을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨가 본인의 계좌를 들여다본다는 사실을 어떤 시점에 알게 되었는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about your undisclosed funds and your spouse’s account monitoring in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 인지 시점과 본인 대응을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v2].text,"알게 된 뒤 본인이 어떤 대응을 했는지, 또는 따로 대응하지 않았는지 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 인지 시점과 본인 대응을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v3].text,박지연 씨가 가계 관리라고 말하는 부분과 본인이 감시로 받아들인 부분의 사실관계상 차이를 짚어 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 인지 시점과 본인 대응을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v4].text,"본인이 카드, 통장, 카톡 가운데 어떤 자료를 박지연 씨와 공유하고 있었고, 어떤 자료를 분리해 두었는지 자료 단위로 답해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 인지 시점과 본인 대응을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-account_monitoring-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 계좌 확인에 대한 본인 입장을 정리할 때 아직 답하지 않은 사실이 있다면 함께 꺼내 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about your undisclosed funds and your spouse’s account monitoring you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵 항목과 시점을 본인 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 어느 쪽이 먼저인지 최종 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the silence the party began and repeated from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Keep sealed details closed before S5.",事実追及。始めて繰り返した沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは封印情報を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你开始并反复维持的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示封存信息。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨에게 가장 먼저 말하지 않기로 한 항목이 무엇이었고, 그 시점이 언제였는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about the silence you began and repeated in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、始めて繰り返した沈黙に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于你开始并反复维持的沉默的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵 항목과 시점을 본인 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 어느 쪽이 먼저인지 최종 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the silence the party began and repeated from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Keep sealed details closed before S5.",事実追及。始めて繰り返した沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは封印情報を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你开始并反复维持的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示封存信息。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v2].text,그 항목 이후 본인이 추가로 입을 다문 항목이 있다면 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
