judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v3].text,박지연 씨가 본인의 침묵을 모든 책임의 출발점으로 보는 부분과 본인이 인정하는 침묵의 범위가 어긋나는 지점부터 짚어 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵 항목과 시점을 본인 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 어느 쪽이 먼저인지 최종 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the silence the party began and repeated from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Keep sealed details closed before S5.",事実追及。始めて繰り返した沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは封印情報を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你开始并反复维持的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示封存信息。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v4].text,침묵을 깬 시점이 있다면 그 시점에 본인이 어디까지 답하고 어디서부터 말을 줄였는지 자료 기준으로 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵 항목과 시점을 본인 인정 한도 안에서 답하게 한다. 어느 쪽이 먼저인지 최종 단정은 S5 전 금지.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the silence the party began and repeated from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Keep sealed details closed before S5.",事実追及。始めて繰り返した沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 S5までは封印情報を開示しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你开始并反复维持的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 S5前不要揭示封存信息。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-concealment_sequence-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 숨김의 시작을 사실관계로 정리할 때, 아직 진술하지 않은 항목이 남아 있다면 그 부분부터 꺼내 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about the silence you began and repeated you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、始めて繰り返した沈黙についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你开始并反复维持的沉默，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 출금일과 박지연 씨 자금 실행일을 자료 기준으로 시간순 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 4개월 전 현금 출금 시점과 박지연 씨의 적금 해지·송금 시점을 본인이 아는 한 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 출금일과 박지연 씨 자금 실행일을 자료 기준으로 시간순 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v2].text,"본인의 출금이 박지연 씨의 자금 실행보다 앞섰는지 뒤였는지, 사실관계로만 정리해 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 출금일과 박지연 씨 자금 실행일을 자료 기준으로 시간순 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v3].text,"박지연 씨는 두 자금 이동을 한 흐름으로 묶고, 본인은 별개의 일로 보고 있습니다. 어디서부터 견해가 갈리는지 짚어 주십시오.",Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 출금일과 박지연 씨 자금 실행일을 자료 기준으로 시간순 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v4].text,출금일·해지일·송금일을 통장과 카톡 자료에서 어떻게 확인할 수 있는지 자료 단위로 답해 주십시오.,"Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 출금일과 박지연 씨 자금 실행일을 자료 기준으로 시간순 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-execution_timeline-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 시간순 정리에 본인이 아직 포함하지 않은 행동이 있다면 그 부분부터 꺼내 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵·확인·실행 단계를 한 덩어리로 묶지 말고 시간순으로 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 가족 사정과 자금 이동 가운데 본인이 어느 시점부터 박지연 씨에게 말하지 않기로 했는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙に関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵·확인·실행 단계를 한 덩어리로 묶지 말고 시간순으로 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].text,그 침묵의 시작과 그 사이 박지연 씨가 자금을 움직인 시점을 본인 기억대로 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵·확인·실행 단계를 한 덩어리로 묶지 말고 시간순으로 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].text,박지연 씨가 은폐의 시작이 동시였다고 말하는 부분과 본인이 보는 선후가 어긋나는 지점부터 짚어 주십시오.,Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
