judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].text,본인이 아직 인정하는 단계와 다투고 싶은 단계를 자료 단위로 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵·확인·실행 단계를 한 덩어리로 묶지 말고 시간순으로 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙について、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 침묵과 실행과 확인이 한 덩어리로 묶이지 않게, 본인이 책임지는 범위가 어디까지인지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙についてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 명의 서류 인지 시점과 동의·위임 범위를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你处理资金中的程序模糊性的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 적금 해지 서류에 본인 명의가 들어간 사실을 어떤 시점에 알게 되었는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于你处理资金中的程序模糊性的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 명의 서류 인지 시점과 동의·위임 범위를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你处理资金中的程序模糊性的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v2].text,본인이 동의하거나 위임한 적이 있는 절차와 그렇지 않은 절차를 사실관계로 분리해 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 명의 서류 인지 시점과 동의·위임 범위를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你处理资金中的程序模糊性的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v3].text,"박지연 씨는 적법한 처리로 보고, 본인은 절차 위반으로 보고 있습니다. 어디서부터 견해가 갈리는지 짚어 주십시오.",Where does Ms. Park Ji-yeon's claim diverge most from the facts as you know them?,パク・ジヨンさんの主張と、ご自身の把握する事実が最も大きく食い違う点はどこですか。,朴智妍女士的主张与你所掌握的事实之间，最大的出入在哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 명의 서류 인지 시점과 동의·위임 범위를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你处理资金中的程序模糊性的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v4].text,"본인이 보관해 온 서류, 신분증, 인감 가운데 박지연 씨가 가져다 쓴 것이 있는지 하나씩 답해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인 명의 서류 인지 시점과 동의·위임 범위를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level.",事実追及。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。,事实追问。让当事人把关于你处理资金中的程序模糊性的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-illegal_boundary-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 동기와 별개로 책임을 따져야 하는 단계가 어디까지라고 보는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于你处理资金中的程序模糊性，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵·확인·실행 단계를 한 줄씩 분리해 답하게 한다. 메타어 사용 금지(질문 분류명을 그대로 인용하지 않음).,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about separating one's own responsibility from comparison from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not quote the question-category meta label as-is.",事実追及。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 質問分類のメタ語をそのまま引用しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 不要原样引用问题分类元词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 침묵이 시작된 시점, 박지연 씨의 계좌 확인을 알게 된 시점, 본인이 현금을 움직인 시점, 박지연 씨가 적금을 움직인 시점을 각각 한 줄씩 시간순으로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state the facts about separating your own responsibility from comparison in chronological order.",イ・ジュノさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることに関する事実を時系列で述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请按时间顺序说明关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵·확인·실행 단계를 한 줄씩 분리해 답하게 한다. 메타어 사용 금지(질문 분류명을 그대로 인용하지 않음).,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about separating one's own responsibility from comparison from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not quote the question-category meta label as-is.",事実追及。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 質問分類のメタ語をそのまま引用しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 不要原样引用问题分类元词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v2].text,그 네 단계 가운데 본인이 한 일과 박지연 씨가 한 일을 사실관계로만 분리해 주십시오.,Please separate what you personally did from what you only learned afterward or do not remember.,ご自身が直接したことと、後から知ったこと、または覚えていないことを分けてください。,请把你本人直接做过的事，与事后才知道或记不清的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
