judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v4].text,"같은 사건을 한 덩어리로 묶지 말고, 어떤 자료가 어느 단계의 책임을 가르는지 자료별로 나누어 답해 주십시오.","Please organize what can be confirmed from records, without filling the gaps with interpretation.",記録で確認できることを整理し、空白を解釈で埋めないでください。,请整理记录能够确认的内容，不要用解读填补空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵·확인·실행 단계를 한 줄씩 분리해 답하게 한다. 메타어 사용 금지(질문 분류명을 그대로 인용하지 않음).,"Fact pursuit. Have the party separate confirmed facts about separating one's own responsibility from comparison from inference, and keep the answer at the fact level. Do not quote the question-category meta label as-is.",事実追及。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについて、確認済みの事実と推定を切り分け、事実関係の水準で答えさせる。 質問分類のメタ語をそのまま引用しない。,事实追问。让当事人把关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来的已确认事实与推断分开，并将回答限定在事实层面。 不要原样引用问题分类元词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-b-responsibility_split-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 인정하는 단계와 다투는 단계를 명확히 구분해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, if there is anything about separating your own responsibility from comparison you have not yet stated, start with that point.",イ・ジュノさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることについてまだ述べていない行動や事実があるなら、そこから始めてください。,李俊浩先生，关于把自己的责任从比较中分离出来，若还有尚未陈述的行为或事实，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 계좌 확인 행위가 시작·반복된 동기를 묻되 최종 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around monitoring the husband’s account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕查看丈夫账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 남편의 계좌를 본인이 들여다보기 시작한 시점의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around monitoring your husband’s account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕查看丈夫账户作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 계좌 확인 행위가 시작·반복된 동기를 묻되 최종 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around monitoring the husband’s account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕查看丈夫账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v2].text,한 번으로 끝내려던 확인이 습관처럼 굳어진 건 언제부터였습니까. 그 사이에 어떤 불안이 쌓였는지 말씀해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 계좌 확인 행위가 시작·반복된 동기를 묻되 최종 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around monitoring the husband’s account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕查看丈夫账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v3].text,부부 사이의 선을 넘는 행위라는 걸 어디까지 알고 있었습니까. 알면서도 멈추지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 계좌 확인 행위가 시작·반복된 동기를 묻되 최종 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around monitoring the husband’s account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕查看丈夫账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v4].text,"남편이 무언가 숨기고 있다고 가정하고 시작한 일이었습니까, 아니면 막연한 불안에서 시작했습니까.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 계좌 확인 행위가 시작·반복된 동기를 묻되 최종 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around monitoring the husband’s account, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。夫の口座を確認していたことをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕查看丈夫账户作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-account_monitoring-v5].text,그 일을 가장 마지막까지 꺼내기 어려웠던 이유가 무엇인지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 숨김의 시작 동기를 묻되 상대가 먼저 숨겼다는 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around what the party hid and when, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 본인이 어떤 부분을 가장 먼저 숨겼는지, 그 시점의 동기가 무엇이었는지 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around what you hid and when.",パク・ジヨンさん、何をいつ隠したのかをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 숨김의 시작 동기를 묻되 상대가 먼저 숨겼다는 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around what the party hid and when, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v2].text,"남편의 숨김을 마주한 뒤 본인 쪽 숨김을 시작했는지, 그보다 앞서 시작한 숨김이 따로 있었는지 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 숨김의 시작 동기를 묻되 상대가 먼저 숨겼다는 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around what the party hid and when, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v3].text,본인의 숨김에 어떤 자기방어 또는 응징의 측면이 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.,"Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 숨김의 시작 동기를 묻되 상대가 먼저 숨겼다는 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around what the party hid and when, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v4].text,그 숨김을 풀 수 있었던 시점이 있었음에도 풀지 않은 결정의 동기를 답해 주십시오.,Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 숨김의 시작 동기를 묻되 상대가 먼저 숨겼다는 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around what the party hid and when, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。何をいつ隠したのかをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你在何时隐瞒了什么作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-concealment_sequence-v5].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 본인이 가장 늦게 꺼낸 숨김이 어떤 종류였는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 행동이 그 시점에 몰린 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작·전액 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss.",動機探索。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作と全額損失は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 본인의 해지·송금이 그 시점에 몰린 동기가 어디에 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago.",パク・ジヨンさん、6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 행동이 그 시점에 몰린 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작·전액 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss.",動機探索。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作と全額損失は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v2].text,다른 시점으로 미룰 수 있었음에도 그 시점을 택한 결정에 어떤 다급함이나 계산이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 행동이 그 시점에 몰린 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작·전액 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss.",動機探索。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作と全額損失は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v3].text,"그때의 본인 행동이 남편의 4개월 전 출금에 대한 대응이었습니까, 아니면 그것과 상관없는 별도의 이유였습니까.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 행동이 그 시점에 몰린 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작·전액 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss.",動機探索。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作と全額損失は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v4].text,"그 시점에 본인 행동을 한꺼번에 처리한 데에 발각을 줄이려는 의도가 있었다면, 본인은 그 의도를 어떻게 받아들이고 있었습니까.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 행동이 그 시점에 몰린 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작·전액 손실 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the cancellation six weeks ago and the transfer five weeks ago, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open power of attorney manipulation and full loss.",動機探索。6週間前の解約と5週間前の送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作と全額損失は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕6周前的解约和5周前的转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵和全额损失。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-execution_timeline-v5].text,"지금 말씀하실 수 있는 선에서, 그 시점을 택한 가장 큰 이유 한 가지를 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 한 덩어리 서사로 묶으려 한 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 본인이 먼저 시작한 부분과 남편이 먼저 시작한 부분을 한 덩어리로 묶지 않고 따로 떼어 답하려면, 본인 쪽에서 가장 먼저 꺼내야 할 동기가 무엇인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer.",パク・ジヨンさん、口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 한 덩어리 서사로 묶으려 한 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,"감시·해지·송금 흐름 중 본인이 가장 늦게 꺼내고 싶었던 부분이 무엇이었고, 왜 그 부분을 마지막에 두려고 했는지 답해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 한 덩어리 서사로 묶으려 한 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,"본인 쪽 책임을 줄이기 위해 어떤 설명 방식을 써 왔는지, 그 방식을 고른 동기를 설명해 주십시오.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 한 덩어리 서사로 묶으려 한 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 본인이 인정하기 가장 어려운 책임 한 가지가 어떤 종류인지 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 한 덩어리 서사로 묶으려 한 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the account checking, savings cancellation, and transfer, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。口座確認、積立預金解約、送金をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕账户查看、储蓄解约和转账作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,그 모든 행동을 한꺼번에 정당화할 수 없다는 점을 알면서도 하나의 이야기로 묶어 설명하려 한 동기가 무엇이었습니까.,"Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 절차 이탈을 인지하면서도 멈추지 않은 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural line the party crossed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你越过的程序界限作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 본인 쪽 서류 처리가 정상 절차에서 벗어난다는 사실을 어디까지 알고 있었습니까. 알면서도 그 길을 택한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around the procedural line you crossed.",パク・ジヨンさん、越えた手続き上の線をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕你越过的程序界限作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 절차 이탈을 인지하면서도 멈추지 않은 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural line the party crossed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你越过的程序界限作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v2].text,법적 선을 넘는 부분이 있다는 점을 의식하면서도 멈추지 않은 결정에 어떤 계산이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 절차 이탈을 인지하면서도 멈추지 않은 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural line the party crossed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你越过的程序界限作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v3].text,"감정적 피해 호소로 그 절차상 책임이 상쇄될 수 있다고 본 부분이 있었다면, 그 기대의 동기를 설명해 주십시오.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 절차 이탈을 인지하면서도 멈추지 않은 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural line the party crossed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你越过的程序界限作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v4].text,"본인 행동을 정당화하기 위해 어떤 설명을 준비하고 있었는지, 그런 설명을 택한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 쪽 절차 이탈을 인지하면서도 멈추지 않은 결정의 동기를 묻되 위임장 조작 단정은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural line the party crossed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open a firm conclusion of power of attorney manipulation.",動機探索。越えた手続き上の線をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 委任状操作の断定は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你越过的程序界限作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启委托书操纵断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-illegal_boundary-v5].text,"지금 말씀하실 수 있는 선에서, 본인이 가장 인정하기 어려웠던 절차상 책임 한 가지와 그 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 누가 더 나쁜가가 아니라 본인 책임만 따로 떼어 본다면, 본인이 가장 인정하기 어려운 부분과 그 망설임의 동기가 무엇인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please state what motivated your decision around separating your own responsibility from comparison.",パク・ジヨンさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明你围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v2].text,"본인 책임을 줄이려고 상대 책임을 더 크게 그리는 식으로 말해 왔다면, 그렇게 말해 온 이유를 답해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v3].text,"감시, 해지, 송금, 서류 처리 가운데 본인 혼자 진 책임으로 남는 부분의 이유를 항목별로 짧게 정리해 주십시오.","Did you hold to that conclusion because of the weight of the circumstances, or because it protected you? Please separate the two.",その結論を手放さなかったのは、状況の重さのためでしたか。それともご自身を守る面があったためでしたか。二つを分けて答えてください。,你坚持那个结论，是因为情况本身的重量，还是因为那个结论在某种程度上保护了你？请分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v4].text,"각각 따로인 책임을 한 덩어리로 묶어 넘기고 싶었던 마음이 있었다면, 그 마음이 어디서 왔는지 설명해 주십시오.",Please explain why you delayed asking directly or accepting another possibility.,直接尋ねること、または別の可能性を受け入れることを先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,请说明你为何推迟直接询问，或为何没有接受其他可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-a-responsibility_split-v5].text,"지금 말씀하실 수 있는 선에서, 본인이 마지막에 꺼내려 했던 책임 한 가지가 무엇이었고 그 이유는 무엇이었는지 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can say now, please state the single strongest reason for that decision.",今話せる範囲で、その決定の最も大きな理由を一つ述べてください。,请在现在能说的范围内，说明那个决定最主要的一个理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 비공개 자금 운용이 상대 감시를 자극한 부분에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 자금이 들여다보일 수 있는 상황이라는 걸 어디까지 알고 있었습니까. 알면서도 따로 떼어 둔 자금을 알리지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around your undisclosed funds and your spouse’s account monitoring.",イ・ジュノさん、非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 비공개 자금 운용이 상대 감시를 자극한 부분에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v2].text,"본인이 자금을 숨겨 운용한 일이 상대의 의심을 더 키웠을 가능성을, 본인은 어떻게 보고 있었습니까.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 비공개 자금 운용이 상대 감시를 자극한 부분에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v3].text,"상대가 계좌를 들여다본 일에 대한 분노와, 본인이 자금을 감춘 책임 사이에 어느 쪽을 더 무겁게 두고 있었습니까.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 비공개 자금 운용이 상대 감시를 자극한 부분에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v4].text,본인이 답할 수 있는 건 자금을 어떻게 굴리고 어디까지 알릴지를 정한 본인의 결정뿐입니다. 그 결정의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.,Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 비공개 자금 운용이 상대 감시를 자극한 부분에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your undisclosed funds and the spouse’s account monitoring, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。非公開の資金運用と配偶者の口座確認をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你的未公开资金运用和配偶的账户查看作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-account_monitoring-v5].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 본인이 가장 늦게 꺼내고 싶었던 자금 결정이 어떤 종류였는지 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 숨김이 일회성에서 반복적 선택으로 굳어진 동기를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the silence the party began and repeated, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。始めて繰り返した沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你开始并反复维持的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 어떤 부분을 가장 먼저 숨겼는지, 그 숨김의 동기가 어디에서 시작됐는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the silence you began and repeated.",イ・ジュノさん、始めて繰り返した沈黙をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你开始并反复维持的沉默作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 숨김이 일회성에서 반복적 선택으로 굳어진 동기를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the silence the party began and repeated, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。始めて繰り返した沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你开始并反复维持的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v2].text,"그 숨김이 일회성 모면에서 반복적 선택으로 굳어진 시점은 언제였고, 그 전환에 어떤 계산이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 숨김이 일회성에서 반복적 선택으로 굳어진 동기를 묻되 가족 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the silence the party began and repeated, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open family identities.",動機探索。始めて繰り返した沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 家族の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你开始并反复维持的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启家庭身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v3].text,"숨김의 가장 큰 동기가 시댁 갈등 회피였는지, 부부 갈등 회피였는지, 다른 두려움이었는지 본인 기준으로 정리해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
