judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v4].text,"본인의 숨김이 상대의 의심을 키운다는 점을 어디까지 의식하고 있었는지, 의식하면서도 풀지 않은 결정의 동기를 설명해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
