judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-concealment_sequence-v5].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 본인이 가장 늦게 꺼내고 싶었던 사정이 어떤 종류였는지 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 이동을 그 시점에 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.",動機探索。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인의 4개월 전 자금 이동을 그 시점에 처리한 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed.",イ・ジュノさん、4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 이동을 그 시점에 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.",動機探索。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v2].text,다른 시점으로 미룰 수 있었음에도 그 시점을 택한 결정에 어떤 다급함이나 계산이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 이동을 그 시점에 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.",動機探索。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v3].text,"그 시점에 알리지 않고 처리한 부분이, 이후 상대 쪽 행동을 자극할 수 있다는 점을 어디까지 의식하고 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 이동을 그 시점에 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.",動機探索。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v4].text,"그 시점에 한 발만 알렸어도 흐름이 달라졌을 수 있는데, 한 발조차 알리지 않은 결정의 동기를 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 이동을 그 시점에 처리한 결정의 동기를 묻되 수취인 정체는 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around your cash withdrawal four months ago and the silence that followed, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not open recipient identity.",動機探索。4か月前の現金出金とその後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 受取人の正体は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你4个月前的现金取款及之后的沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要开启接收对象身份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-execution_timeline-v5].text,"지금 말씀하실 수 있는 선에서, 그때 작용한 두려움이나 누군가를 지키려는 마음을 정리해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 상대 의심으로 이어진 흐름에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 먼저 시작한 숨김과 상대가 먼저 시작한 부분을 한 덩어리로 묶지 않고 분리해 답하려면, 본인 쪽에서 가장 먼저 꺼내야 할 동기가 무엇인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 상대 의심으로 이어진 흐름에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,"본인의 숨김이 상대의 의심·감시로 이어진 흐름을 본인 책임 쪽에서 어디까지 인정할 수 있는지, 그 인정 범위를 좁힌 동기와 함께 답해 주십시오.","What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 상대 의심으로 이어진 흐름에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,"상대 쪽 책임이 더 무거워 보일 때 본인 책임이 가벼워진다고 느꼈다면, 그 느낌을 어떻게 다루고 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 상대 의심으로 이어진 흐름에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,"지금 공개할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 본인이 가장 늦게 꺼내고 싶었던 책임 한 가지가 어떤 종류인지 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 상대 의심으로 이어진 흐름에 대한 본인 인정 범위와 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the concealment, cash withdrawal, and later silence, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。隠蔽、現金出金、その後の沈黙をめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕隐瞒、现金取款和事后沉默作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,본인의 침묵이 부른 결과 중 가장 인정하기 어려웠던 부분의 동기를 본인 기준에서 답해 주십시오.,"Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 처리의 절차상 모호함을 그대로 둔 결정의 동기를 묻되 상대 위법성 단정을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 본인의 자금 처리 중 절차상 모호한 부분이 있었다면, 그 모호함을 그대로 두기로 한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds.",イ・ジュノさん、資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 처리의 절차상 모호함을 그대로 둔 결정의 동기를 묻되 상대 위법성 단정을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v2].text,본인 쪽 자금 흐름의 합법성을 정리해 두지 않은 결정에 어떤 신뢰 또는 회피가 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"What fear, burden, or calculation led you to leave that point unclear?",その点を曖昧なままにした背景には、どのような恐れ、負担、または計算がありましたか。,你让这一点保持模糊，背后有什么恐惧、负担或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 처리의 절차상 모호함을 그대로 둔 결정의 동기를 묻되 상대 위법성 단정을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v3].text,법적 책임을 더 무겁게 안을 가능성이 있는 쪽 서류에 대해 본인이 평소 어떤 거리감을 두고 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.,"If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 처리의 절차상 모호함을 그대로 둔 결정의 동기를 묻되 상대 위법성 단정을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v4].text,"본인이 답할 수 있는 건 본인이 무엇을 결정하고 무엇을 알고 있었는가뿐입니다. 절차상 본인 몫이라고 보는 책임이 무엇이고, 그 이유는 무엇인지 말씀해 주십시오.",Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금 처리의 절차상 모호함을 그대로 둔 결정의 동기를 묻되 상대 위법성 단정을 대신 답하게 하지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around the procedural ambiguity in your handling of funds, without opening the final combined conclusion. Do not make them answer for the other party’s motive or legal conclusion.",動機探索。資金処理における手続き上の曖昧さをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。 相手の動機や法的結論を代わりに答えさせない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕你处理资金中的程序模糊性作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。 不要让其代替对方回答动机或法律结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-illegal_boundary-v5].text,"지금 말씀하실 수 있는 선에서, 본인이 가장 마지막까지 꺼내기 어려웠던 절차상 책임이 어떤 것이었는지 답해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 누가 더 나쁜가가 아니라 본인 책임만 따로 떼어 보면, 본인이 가장 인정하기 어려웠던 부분과 그 망설임의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, please state what motivated your decision around separating your own responsibility from comparison.",イ・ジュノさん、比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐるご自身の決定の動機を述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明你围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v2].text,"본인 책임을 줄이려고 상대 책임을 더 크게 그리는 식으로 말해 왔다면, 그렇게 말해 온 이유를 답해 주십시오.",What fear or calculation led you to choose that course instead of a direct conversation?,正面から話すのではなく、その選択を取った背景にはどのような恐れや計算がありましたか。,你没有选择正面对话，而是选择那种做法，其背后有什么恐惧或计算？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v3].text,"숨김, 자금 운용, 동의 거부 가운데 본인 혼자 진 책임으로 남는 부분의 이유를 항목별로 짧게 정리해 주십시오.","If silence seemed safer than explaining, how far did you expect that silence to deepen suspicion?",説明するより沈黙の方が安全だと感じたなら、その沈黙が疑いを深めることをどこまで予想していましたか。,如果沉默看起来比解释更安全，你预料到这种沉默会把怀疑加深到什么程度？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v4].text,본인 침묵이 상대 행동의 명분으로 사용되는 흐름을 본인이 어디까지 의식하고 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,Please explain why even a partial explanation felt difficult at that stage.,その段階で一部だけでも説明することがなぜ難しかったのか説明してください。,请说明为什么在那个阶段连部分说明都显得困难。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 단독 책임 항목을 분리해 인정하기 어려워한 본인 결정의 동기를 묻되 최종 종합 결론은 열지 않는다.,"Motive probe. Ask what motivated the party’s decision around separating one's own responsibility from comparison, without opening the final combined conclusion.",動機探索。比較から切り離して自分の責任を分けることをめぐる本人の決定の動機を問い、最終総合結論は開かない。,动机探查。询问当事人围绕把自己的责任从比较中分离出来作出决定的动机，不开启最终综合结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_spouse-01_judgeQuestions_h-d4_.variants_judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,judgeQuestions[h-d4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-motive_search-b-responsibility_split-v5].text,"지금 말씀하실 수 있는 선에서, 본인이 가장 마지막까지 꺼내기 어려웠던 책임 한 가지가 무엇이고 그 이유는 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Within what you can disclose now, please state the main reason you kept this matter buried until the end.",今開示できる範囲で、この件を最後まで伏せた主な理由を述べてください。,请在现在可公开范围内，说明你把这件事一直埋到最后的主要理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,spouse-01,paths[conditional].judge,"각자의 책임을 따로 떼어 보는 조건부 조정안을 먼저 제시하겠습니다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 전화, 개인 비자금 출금, 공동 적금 해지 문제는 한꺼번에 묶어 다루지 않겠습니다.","I will first present a conditional mediation proposal that separates each person's responsibility. The Officetel visits and early-morning calls, the personal slush-fund withdrawal, and the joint savings cancellation will not be bundled into one issue.",各自の責任を切り分ける条件付きの調停案を先に提示します。オフィステル訪問と早朝の電話、個人の裏資金の出金、共同積立預金の解約問題を、ひとまとめには扱いません。,我先提出一份将各自责任分开看的条件式调解方案。韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨电话、个人秘密资金取款、共同储蓄账户解约问题，不会被合并为一个问题处理。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,spouse-01,paths[fact_first].judge,"해결책보다 사실관계부터 정리하겠습니다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 전화, 개인 비자금 3,000만원 출금, 공동 적금 해지의 시점 순서부터 분명히 하겠습니다.","Before discussing a solution, I will clarify the facts. We will first establish the order of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, the ₩30M personal slush-fund withdrawal, and the joint savings cancellation.","解決策より先に、事実関係を整理します。オフィステル訪問と早朝の電話、個人の裏資金3,000万ウォンの出金、共同積立預金の解約について、まず時点の順序を明確にします。",在讨论解决方案之前，先整理事实关系。韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨电话、个人秘密资金3000万韩元取款、共同储蓄账户解约的时间先后，要先明确。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,spouse-01,paths[immediate].judge,지금까지 정리된 사안을 기준으로 즉시 판단하겠습니다. 바로 판결로 넘어가겠습니다.,I will make an immediate judgment based on the matters clarified so far. We will proceed directly to the verdict.,ここまで整理された事案を基準に、ただちに判断します。このまま判決へ進みます。,我将以目前已经整理出的事项为依据，立即作出判断。现在直接进入裁决。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,spouse-01,paths[postpone].judge,지금 확정할 수 있는 사실만 먼저 정리하고 나머지는 보류하겠습니다. 숨긴 행동과 먼저 판단해 움직인 행동의 책임은 따로 구분해서 보겠습니다.,I will first settle only the facts that can be confirmed now and reserve the rest. I will separately assess responsibility for what was concealed and responsibility for acting first on one's own judgment.,今確定できる事実だけを先に整理し、残りは保留します。隠した行動と、先に判断して動いた行動の責任は、別々に区分して見ます。,现在能确定的事实先整理，剩下的暂且保留。隐瞒的行为，以及先行判断并采取行动的责任，将分开来看。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v1].text,"판결 뒤 박지연은 오래 고개를 들지 못했다. 이준호의 숨김이 가벼운 잘못은 아니었지만, 재판관은 위임장 조작과 투자 사기 송금을 더 무겁게 보았다. 이준호는 형과 조카 이야기를 더는 숨기지 않겠다고 했고, 박지연은 잃은 돈보다 먼저 무너진 신뢰를 어떻게 감당할지 마주하게 되었다.","After the verdict, Park Ji-yeon could not raise her head for a long time. Lee Jun-ho's concealment was not a minor wrong, but the Judge treated the power of attorney manipulation and the investment-scam transfer as heavier. Lee Jun-ho said he would no longer hide the matter of his older brother and nephew, and Park Ji-yeon had to face how she would bear the trust that had collapsed before the lost money.",判決の後、パク・ジヨンは長いあいだ顔を上げられなかった。イ・ジュノの隠蔽は軽い過ちではなかったが、裁判官は委任状の操作と投資詐欺への送金をより重く見た。イ・ジュノは兄と甥の話をこれ以上隠さないと言い、パク・ジヨンは失った金より先に崩れた信頼をどう受け止めるのかに向き合うことになった。,裁决之后，朴智妍很久都无法抬头。李俊浩的隐瞒并不是轻微过错，但法官把委托书操纵和向投资诈骗转账看得更重。李俊浩说不再隐瞒哥哥和侄子的事，朴智妍则不得不面对，比失去的钱更早崩塌的信任要如何承受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v2].text,"법정이 정리된 뒤에도 부부는 곧바로 서로를 보지 못했다. 재판관은 가족을 위한 침묵보다 문서를 조작하고 공동 적금을 빼낸 선택이 더 치명적이었다고 판단했다. 이준호는 형 문제를 공개적으로 정리하겠다고 했고, 박지연은 자신의 불안이 범죄가 된 순간을 되돌아보며 천천히 자리를 떴다.","Even after the courtroom was cleared, the couple could not look at each other right away. The Judge judged that manipulating documents and taking money out of the joint savings account was more fatal than silence kept for family. Lee Jun-ho said he would openly settle his older brother's matter, and Park Ji-yeon slowly left her seat while looking back on the moment when her anxiety became a crime.",法廷が片づいた後も、夫婦はすぐには互いを見ることができなかった。裁判官は、家族のための沈黙より、文書を操作して共同積立預金を引き出した選択のほうが致命的だったと判断した。イ・ジュノは兄の問題を公に整理すると言い、パク・ジヨンは自分の不安が犯罪になった瞬間を振り返りながら、ゆっくり席を立った。,法庭整理完毕后，这对夫妻仍无法立刻看向彼此。法官判断，比起为了家人的沉默，操纵文件并取走共同储蓄账户款项的选择更致命。李俊浩说会公开整理哥哥的问题，朴智妍则回望自己的不安变成犯罪的那一刻，慢慢离开了座位。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v3].text,"박지연은 위임장 조작과 투자방 송금 손실을 인정한 뒤 별도 처분 절차를 받아들였다. 뒤늦게 형과 조카 사정을 들은 그는 외도 의심이 전부였던 시간도 다시 보게 되었지만, 그 불안이 서류 조작으로 이어진 책임은 사라지지 않았다. 이준호는 침묵이 오해를 키운 단초였음을 인정했고, 두 사람은 관계를 다시 세울지 이혼 절차로 갈지 상담을 통해 정하기로 했다.","After admitting the power of attorney manipulation and the loss from the investment chat transfer, Park Ji-yeon accepted a separate disposition procedure. After belatedly hearing the circumstances of Lee Jun-ho's older brother and nephew, she also had to revisit the time when suspicion of an affair had been everything, but the responsibility for letting that anxiety lead to document manipulation did not disappear. Lee Jun-ho admitted that his silence had been the starting point that grew the misunderstanding, and the two decided through counseling whether to rebuild their relationship or move toward divorce proceedings.",パク・ジヨンは委任状の操作と投資チャットへの送金損失を認めた後、別途の処分手続きを受け入れた。遅れて兄と甥の事情を聞いた彼女は、不倫の疑いがすべてだった時間も見直すことになったが、その不安が文書操作につながった責任は消えなかった。イ・ジュノは沈黙が誤解を大きくした端緒だったと認め、二人は関係を立て直すのか離婚手続きへ進むのかを相談を通じて決めることにした。,朴智妍承认委托书操纵和投资群转账损失后，接受了另行处分程序。她迟迟听到哥哥和侄子的情况后，也重新审视了那段只剩出轨怀疑的时间，但那份不安走向文件操纵的责任并不会消失。李俊浩承认沉默是误会扩大的开端，两人决定通过咨询来决定是重建关系，还是走向离婚程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v4].text,"판결 뒤 박지연에게 남은 건 잃은 돈보다 서명 한 줄의 무게였다. 재판관은 이준호가 피한 점과 가족 사정을 숨긴 점을 짚었지만, 공동 적금을 해지하려고 위임장을 꾸민 선택을 더 무겁게 기록했다. 이준호는 형 문제를 더는 부부 밖에 숨기지 않겠다고 약속했고, 박지연은 사과와 피해 회복 계획을 먼저 내놓아야 했다.","After the verdict, what remained for Park Ji-yeon was the weight of one line of signature more than the money she had lost. The Judge pointed out Lee Jun-ho's avoidance and his concealment of family circumstances, but recorded as more serious the choice to fabricate a power of attorney to close the joint savings account. Lee Jun-ho promised not to keep the issue of his older brother hidden outside the marriage anymore, and Park Ji-yeon first had to present an apology and a plan to repair the harm.",判決の後、パク・ジヨンに残ったのは、失った金よりも署名一行の重みだった。裁判官はイ・ジュノが避けた点と家族の事情を隠した点を指摘したが、共同積立預金を解約するために委任状を作った選択をより重く記録した。イ・ジュノは兄の問題をこれ以上夫婦の外に隠さないと約束し、パク・ジヨンはまず謝罪と被害回復計画を示さなければならなかった。,裁决之后，留给朴智妍的不是失去的钱，而是一行签名的重量。法官指出李俊浩回避问题、隐瞒家人情况，但更重地记录了她为了取消共同储蓄账户而伪造委托书的选择。李俊浩承诺不再把哥哥的问题藏在夫妻关系之外，朴智妍则必须先提出道歉和损害恢复计划。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v5].text,"박지연은 끝까지 자신도 버림받을까 두려웠다고 말했지만, 판결은 그 두려움이 범죄의 방패가 될 수 없다고 정리했다. 이준호는 형과 조카 일을 숨긴 책임을 인정하며 시댁 갈등을 따로 정리하겠다고 했다. 부부는 한동안 별거하며 공동재산 회복과 형사 절차를 분리해 진행하기로 했다.","Park Ji-yeon said to the end that she had been afraid she too would be abandoned, but the verdict concluded that fear could not become a shield for crime. Lee Jun-ho acknowledged his responsibility for hiding the matter of his older brother and nephew, and said he would separately settle the conflict with his in-laws. The couple decided to live apart for a while and proceed with recovery of joint property separately from the criminal proceedings.",パク・ジヨンは最後まで、自分も見捨てられるのが怖かったと言ったが、判決はその恐れが犯罪の盾にはなりえないと整理した。イ・ジュノは兄と甥の件を隠した責任を認め、義実家との葛藤は別に整理すると言った。夫婦はしばらく別居し、共同財産の回復と刑事手続きを分けて進めることにした。,朴智妍直到最后都说，自己也害怕被抛弃，但裁决整理为那份恐惧不能成为犯罪的盾牌。李俊浩承认隐瞒哥哥和侄子之事的责任，并表示会另行整理与婆家的矛盾。这对夫妻决定暂时分居，把共同财产恢复和刑事程序分开推进。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v1].text,"재판관은 이준호가 비자금과 형 문제, 3,000만 원 출금을 계속 숨긴 점을 더 큰 파열로 판단했다. 박지연의 위임장 조작은 명백한 잘못이었지만, 그 이전부터 이어진 침묵이 가정을 무너뜨렸다고 본 것이다. 판결 뒤 이준호는 처음으로 형과 조카의 사정을 모두 설명했고, 박지연은 울음을 삼키며 그 말을 들었다.","The Judge treated Lee Jun-ho's continued concealment of his hidden fund, his older brother's issue, and the ₩30M withdrawal as the greater rupture. Park Ji-yeon's power of attorney manipulation was an obvious wrong, but the Judge viewed the silence that had continued before it as what broke the household. After the verdict, Lee Jun-ho explained for the first time all the circumstances of his older brother and nephew, and Park Ji-yeon listened while swallowing her tears.","裁判官は、イ・ジュノが隠し資金と兄の問題、3,000万ウォンの出金を隠し続けた点をより大きな亀裂と判断した。パク・ジヨンの委任状操作は明白な過ちだったが、それ以前から続いた沈黙が家庭を崩したと見たのである。判決の後、イ・ジュノは初めて兄と甥の事情をすべて説明し、パク・ジヨンは涙をのみ込みながらその言葉を聞いた。",法官把李俊浩继续隐瞒私房钱、哥哥的问题和3000万韩元取款一事，判断为更大的裂痕。朴智妍操纵委托书是明确的错误，但法官认为在那之前持续的沉默才让家庭崩塌。裁决之后，李俊浩第一次说明了哥哥和侄子的全部情况，朴智妍则忍住眼泪听着那些话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v2].text,"승패가 갈린 뒤에도 분위기는 무겁게 가라앉아 있었다. 재판관은 박지연의 범행을 꾸짖으면서도, 그 배경을 만든 것은 이준호의 오랜 비밀과 일방적인 자금 집행이라고 짚었다. 이준호는 늦게라도 모든 사정을 털어놓았고, 박지연은 그 설명을 듣고도 쉽게 용서하지 못한 채 한참을 침묵했다.","Even after the winner and loser were decided, the atmosphere remained heavily subdued. The Judge reprimanded Park Ji-yeon's crime, but also pointed out that the background had been created by Lee Jun-ho's long-held secrets and unilateral use of funds. Lee Jun-ho finally laid out all the circumstances, and Park Ji-yeon remained silent for a long time, unable to forgive him easily even after hearing the explanation.",勝敗が分かれた後も、空気は重く沈んだままだった。裁判官はパク・ジヨンの犯行を叱責しつつも、その背景を作ったのはイ・ジュノの長い秘密と一方的な資金執行だと指摘した。イ・ジュノは遅れてでもすべての事情を打ち明け、パク・ジヨンはその説明を聞いても簡単には許せないまま、長いあいだ沈黙した。,胜负分出之后，气氛仍然沉重地沉了下来。法官斥责了朴智妍的犯罪行为，同时也指出，造成背景的是李俊浩长期的秘密和单方面的资金执行。李俊浩迟来地吐露了所有情况，朴智妍听完说明后也无法轻易原谅，沉默了许久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v3].text,"이 결과에서 재판관은 사건의 시작을 이준호의 침묵과 비자금을 숨긴 것으로 보았다. 박지연의 적금 문제는 별도 책임으로 남았지만, 이준호가 형 사정과 현금 전달을 계속 숨기며 외도처럼 보이게 만든 점이 더 크게 잡혔다. 그는 뒤늦게 형과 조카 이야기를 모두 꺼냈고, 박지연은 그 설명을 들으면서도 이미 무너진 신뢰 앞에서 쉽게 고개를 들지 못했다.","In this result, the Judge saw the beginning of the case in Lee Jun-ho's silence and concealment of the hidden fund. Park Ji-yeon's savings issue remained a separate responsibility, but Lee Jun-ho's continued concealment of his older brother's circumstances and cash delivery, which made the situation look like an affair, weighed more heavily. He belatedly brought out the whole story of his older brother and nephew, and Park Ji-yeon, even as she listened to the explanation, could not easily raise her head before the trust that had already collapsed.",この結果で、裁判官は事件の始まりをイ・ジュノの沈黙と隠し資金の秘匿に見た。パク・ジヨンの積立預金問題は別の責任として残ったが、イ・ジュノが兄の事情と現金の受け渡しを隠し続け、不倫のように見せた点がより大きく扱われた。彼は遅れて兄と甥の話をすべて切り出し、パク・ジヨンはその説明を聞きながらも、すでに崩れた信頼の前で簡単には顔を上げられなかった。,在这个结果中，法官把案件的开端看作李俊浩的沉默和私房钱隐瞒。朴智妍的储蓄问题仍作为另行责任保留，但李俊浩持续隐瞒哥哥的情况和现金交付，让事情看起来像出轨，这一点被看得更重。他迟迟才把哥哥和侄子的故事全都说出来，朴智妍一边听着说明，一边仍在已经崩塌的信任面前难以抬头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v4].text,"법정은 박지연의 불안이 혼자 생겨난 것이 아니라고 보았다. 이준호가 오피스텔 방문, 새벽 통화, 3,000만 원 현금 전달을 모두 늦게 말한 탓에 의심이 결혼 전체를 삼켰다는 판단이었다. 판결 뒤 이준호는 집안 사정을 처리하는 일과 배우자에게 숨기는 일을 더는 같은 말로 묶지 않겠다고 했고, 박지연은 남은 절차를 지켜보며 이혼 여부를 따로 결정하기로 했다.","The court saw that Park Ji-yeon's anxiety had not arisen on its own. It was a judgment that suspicion swallowed the entire marriage because Lee Jun-ho disclosed the officetel visit, the early-morning call, and the ₩30M cash delivery all too late. After the verdict, Lee Jun-ho said he would no longer bundle handling household affairs and hiding things from his spouse into the same words, and Park Ji-yeon decided to watch the remaining procedures and decide separately whether to divorce.","法廷は、パク・ジヨンの不安がひとりで生まれたものではないと見た。イ・ジュノがオフィステル訪問、早朝の通話、3,000万ウォンの現金受け渡しをすべて遅れて話したために、疑いが結婚全体をのみ込んだという判断だった。判決の後、イ・ジュノは家の事情を処理することと配偶者に隠すことをこれ以上同じ言葉でまとめないと言い、パク・ジヨンは残る手続きを見守りながら離婚するかどうかを別に決めることにした。",法庭认为，朴智妍的不安并不是独自产生的。法庭判断，因为李俊浩把韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨通话和3000万韩元现金交付都说得太晚，怀疑才吞没了整段婚姻。裁决之后，李俊浩说不会再把处理家里事情和对配偶隐瞒这两件事混成同一句话，朴智妍则决定看完剩余程序后，再另行决定是否离婚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v5].text,"이준호에게 더 무거운 책임이 돌아간 결말에서도 박지연의 행동이 깨끗해진 것은 아니었다. 다만 재판관은 먼저 침묵을 만들고 돈의 행방을 감춘 사람이 이준호였다는 점을 선명하게 적었다. 그는 형을 돕는 선의만 내세우던 태도를 접고, 박지연 앞에서 자신이 무엇을 숨겼는지 순서대로 설명해야 했다.","Even in the ending where heavier responsibility returned to Lee Jun-ho, Park Ji-yeon's actions did not become clean. However, the Judge wrote clearly that the person who first created the silence and hid the whereabouts of the money was Lee Jun-ho. He had to drop the attitude of putting forward only the good will of helping his older brother, and explain to Park Ji-yeon in order exactly what he had hidden.",イ・ジュノにより重い責任が戻った結末でも、パク・ジヨンの行動が潔白になったわけではなかった。だが裁判官は、先に沈黙を作り、金の行方を隠した人間がイ・ジュノだった点を明確に記した。彼は兄を助ける善意だけを掲げる態度をやめ、パク・ジヨンの前で自分が何を隠したのかを順番に説明しなければならなかった。,即使在更重责任落到李俊浩身上的结局中，朴智妍的行为也并没有变得清白。只是法官清楚写下，先制造沉默并隐瞒钱款去向的人是李俊浩。他必须放下只强调帮助哥哥善意的态度，在朴智妍面前按顺序说明自己到底隐瞒了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v1].text,"재판관은 위임장 조작이 관계 다툼으로 덮일 수 없는 범죄라고 분명히 경고했다. 동시에 이준호의 침묵 역시 박지연을 벼랑 끝으로 몰았다는 점을 짚으며, 처벌과 별개로 관계 회복의 문은 닫지 않았다. 두 사람은 각자 잘못을 인정하는 서류보다 먼저, 서로에게 설명해야 할 말을 떠안고 돌아갔다.","The Judge clearly warned that power of attorney manipulation is a crime that cannot be covered over as a relationship dispute. At the same time, the Judge pointed out that Lee Jun-ho's silence had also driven Park Ji-yeon to the edge, and did not close the door to repairing the relationship apart from punishment. The two returned carrying words they had to explain to each other before any documents admitting their own wrongs.",裁判官は、委任状の操作は関係の争いとして覆い隠せない犯罪だと明確に警告した。同時に、イ・ジュノの沈黙もパク・ジヨンを崖の端へ追い込んだ点を指摘し、処罰とは別に関係回復の扉は閉ざさなかった。二人はそれぞれの過ちを認める書類より先に、互いへ説明すべき言葉を抱えて帰った。,法官明确警告，委托书操纵是不能用关系争执掩盖的犯罪。同时，法官也指出李俊浩的沉默把朴智妍逼到了悬崖边，除处罚之外，并没有关上关系恢复的门。两人回去时，背负的不是先承认各自错误的文件，而是必须向彼此说明的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v2].text,"법정의 마지막 말은 차가우면서도 완전히 닫혀 있지는 않았다. 위조 서류와 무단 인출은 각각 다른 법적 위험을 지니고 있었고, 재판관은 그 책임을 선명하게 나눠 경고했다. 그러나 판결문 너머에서 남은 숙제는 여전히 관계의 문제였고, 부부는 처음으로 그 사실을 같은 자리에서 들었다.","The court's final words were cold, yet not completely closed. Forged documents and unauthorized withdrawals each carried different legal risks, and the Judge clearly divided those responsibilities in the warning. But the homework remaining beyond the written verdict was still a matter of the relationship, and the couple heard that fact in the same place for the first time.",法廷の最後の言葉は冷たく、それでも完全に閉ざされてはいなかった。偽造書類と無断引き出しにはそれぞれ異なる法的リスクがあり、裁判官はその責任を明確に分けて警告した。しかし判決文の向こうに残った宿題は依然として関係の問題であり、夫婦は初めてその事実を同じ場所で聞いた。,法庭最后的话语冰冷，却并没有完全关闭。伪造文件和擅自取款各自带有不同的法律风险，法官清楚划分并警告了那些责任。然而裁决书之外留下的功课仍然是关系的问题，这对夫妻第一次在同一个地方听见了这个事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v3].text,"재판관은 곧바로 결론을 닫지 않고 추가 절차를 명했다. 위임장 조작은 별도로 확인되어야 하고, 형의 개인회생과 조카 보호 문제는 가족 상담 안에서 다뤄져야 한다는 판단이었다. 두 사람은 각자 책임을 인정했지만, 처분과 회복은 같은 속도로 진행될 수 없었다.","The Judge did not close the conclusion immediately and ordered additional procedures. The judgment was that the power of attorney manipulation had to be confirmed separately, and that the older brother's personal rehabilitation and the nephew's protection issue had to be handled within family counseling. The two each acknowledged responsibility, but disposition and recovery could not move at the same speed.",裁判官はすぐに結論を閉じず、追加手続きを命じた。委任状の操作は別途確認されるべきであり、兄の個人再生と甥の保護問題は家族カウンセリングの中で扱うべきだという判断だった。二人はそれぞれ責任を認めたが、処分と回復は同じ速度で進むことはできなかった。,法官没有立刻封闭结论，而是命令追加程序。法官判断，委托书操纵必须另行确认，哥哥的个人重整和侄子的保护问题则应在家庭咨询中处理。两人各自承认了责任，但处分和恢复不能以同样的速度推进。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v4].text,"이 사건은 판결문 한 장으로 끝나지 않았다. 박지연의 서류 조작, 이준호의 현금 전달, 조카 생활 정보가 서로 얽혀 있었기 때문이다. 재판관은 민감한 정보는 봉인하고, 부부에게는 공동재산 관리 기준과 집안 사정을 처리하는 절차를 다시 제출하라고 했다.","This case did not end with one written verdict. Park Ji-yeon's document manipulation, Lee Jun-ho's cash delivery, and information about the nephew's life were intertwined. The Judge sealed sensitive information, and ordered the couple to resubmit standards for managing joint property and procedures for handling household affairs.",この事件は判決文一枚で終わらなかった。パク・ジヨンの文書操作、イ・ジュノの現金受け渡し、甥の生活情報が互いに絡み合っていたからだ。裁判官は敏感な情報を封印し、夫婦には共同財産の管理基準と家の事情を処理する手続きを再提出するよう求めた。,这个案件并没有以一纸裁决书结束。因为朴智妍的文件操纵、李俊浩的现金交付，以及侄子的生活信息彼此纠缠在一起。法官封存敏感信息，并要求这对夫妻重新提交共同财产管理标准和处理家中情况的程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v5].text,"마지막 절차는 경고에 가까웠다. 가족 사정을 숨겼다는 이유로 돈을 몰래 움직일 수 없고, 배신당했다는 믿음만으로 위임장을 꾸밀 수도 없다는 정리였다. 재판관은 조카 보호와 형 사정 확인, 부부 상담을 나란히 두고 다음 절차로 넘겼다.","The final procedure was close to a warning. The conclusion was that money cannot be moved in secret just because family circumstances were hidden, and a power of attorney cannot be fabricated only on the belief of having been betrayed. The Judge placed protection of the nephew, confirmation of the older brother's circumstances, and counseling for the couple side by side, and passed them to the next procedure.",最後の手続きは警告に近かった。家族の事情を隠されたという理由で金をこっそり動かすことはできず、裏切られたという信念だけで委任状を作ることもできないという整理だった。裁判官は甥の保護、兄の事情確認、夫婦カウンセリングを並べて、次の手続きへ送った。,最后的程序更接近警告。结论是，不能因为家人的情况被隐瞒就偷偷挪动钱，也不能只凭被背叛的信念就伪造委托书。法官把侄子保护、哥哥情况确认和夫妻咨询并列起来，移交到下一步程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v1].text,"재판관은 승패보다 회복을 먼저 말했다. 형과 조카 문제는 더는 비밀로 둘 수 없고, 투자 사기 피해도 부부가 함께 수습해야 할 일이라고 했다. 법정을 나서는 두 사람 사이엔 여전히 서늘함이 남았지만, 처음으로 같은 방향을 봐야 한다는 말 앞에서는 둘 다 오래 침묵했다.","The Judge spoke first of recovery, not victory or defeat. The Judge said the issue of the older brother and nephew could no longer be kept secret, and that the harm from the investment scam was also something the couple had to deal with together. A chill still remained between the two as they left the courtroom, but both stayed silent for a long time before the words that they had to look in the same direction for the first time.",裁判官は勝敗より先に回復を語った。兄と甥の問題はこれ以上秘密にしておけず、投資詐欺の被害も夫婦が一緒に収拾すべきことだと言った。法廷を出る二人のあいだにはなお冷たさが残っていたが、初めて同じ方向を見るべきだという言葉の前では、二人とも長く沈黙した。,法官先谈的不是胜负，而是恢复。法官说，哥哥和侄子的问题不能再继续保密，投资诈骗的受害也必须由夫妻共同收拾。走出法庭时，两人之间仍有寒意，但在第一次必须看向同一个方向这句话面前，两人都沉默了很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v2].text,"결론은 단죄만으로 끝나지 않았다. 재판관은 이준호에게는 가족 문제를 투명하게 드러내라고, 박지연에게는 숨은 돈을 쫓는 대신 피해 회복 절차를 밟으라고 권했다. 형과 조카, 사기 피해, 무너진 부부 관계가 한꺼번에 놓인 자리에서 두 사람은 처음으로 함께 해결해야 할 문제를 마주했다.","The conclusion did not end with condemnation alone. The Judge advised Lee Jun-ho to reveal the family issue transparently, and advised Park Ji-yeon to follow the harm-recovery procedure instead of chasing hidden money. With the older brother and nephew, the scam loss, and the collapsed marital relationship all placed together, the two faced for the first time a problem they had to solve together.",結論は断罪だけで終わらなかった。裁判官はイ・ジュノには家族問題を透明に明らかにするよう、パク・ジヨンには隠れた金を追う代わりに被害回復手続きを踏むよう勧めた。兄と甥、詐欺被害、崩れた夫婦関係が一度に置かれた場で、二人は初めて一緒に解決すべき問題に向き合った。,结论并没有只停在定罪。法官建议李俊浩透明地说明家人问题，也建议朴智妍不要追逐隐藏的钱，而是走损害恢复程序。在哥哥和侄子、诈骗受害以及崩塌的夫妻关系同时摆在面前的地方，两人第一次面对了必须一起解决的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v3].text,"재판관은 조카와 형의 사정을 공개 기록에 모두 남기지 않기로 했다. 대신 이준호에게는 가족을 도운 내역을 박지연에게 투명하게 설명하게 하고, 박지연에게는 적금 해지와 투자방 손실 회복 절차를 별도로 밟게 했다. 두 사람은 책임을 가볍게 넘기지 않되, 아이의 생활이 더 흔들리지 않도록 절차를 단순화했다.","The Judge decided not to leave all the circumstances of the nephew and older brother in the public record. Instead, the Judge made Lee Jun-ho transparently explain to Park Ji-yeon the details of helping his family, and made Park Ji-yeon separately follow the procedures for the joint savings cancellation and recovery of the investment chat loss. The two did not pass over responsibility lightly, but simplified the procedure so the child's life would not be shaken further.",裁判官は、甥と兄の事情をすべて公開記録に残さないことにした。その代わり、イ・ジュノには家族を助けた内訳をパク・ジヨンへ透明に説明させ、パク・ジヨンには共同積立預金の解約と投資チャットの損失回復手続きを別に踏ませた。二人は責任を軽く流さない一方で、子どもの生活がこれ以上揺らがないよう手続きを単純化した。,法官决定不把侄子和哥哥的情况全部留在公开记录中。取而代之，法官让李俊浩向朴智妍透明说明帮助家人的明细，并让朴智妍另行办理共同储蓄账户解约和投资群损失恢复程序。两人不能轻轻带过责任，但为了不让孩子的生活继续动摇，程序被简化了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v4].text,"결론은 단죄보다 보호에 가까웠다. 형의 개인회생과 조카의 생활 정보는 필요한 범위에서만 다루고, 부부의 자금 문제는 별도 합의서로 정리하기로 했다. 이준호는 더는 가족 사정을 방패로 침묵하지 않겠다고 했고, 박지연은 자기 수치심 때문에 손실을 숨기지 않겠다고 말했다.","The conclusion was closer to protection than condemnation. The older brother's personal rehabilitation and the nephew's life information would be handled only within the necessary scope, and the couple's money issue would be settled in a separate agreement. Lee Jun-ho said he would no longer use family circumstances as a shield for silence, and Park Ji-yeon said she would not hide losses because of her own shame.",結論は断罪より保護に近かった。兄の個人再生と甥の生活情報は必要な範囲でのみ扱い、夫婦の資金問題は別途合意書で整理することになった。イ・ジュノは家族の事情を盾にしてこれ以上沈黙しないと言い、パク・ジヨンは自分の羞恥心のために損失を隠さないと言った。,结论比起定罪，更接近保护。哥哥的个人重整和侄子的生活信息只在必要范围内处理，夫妻的资金问题则以另行协议书整理。李俊浩说不会再把家人情况当作沉默的盾牌，朴智妍也说不会因为自己的羞耻心而隐瞒损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v5].text,"법정은 민감한 가족 사정을 모두 드러내는 대신, 확인된 책임만 남기는 방식을 택했다. 이준호의 현금 전달, 박지연의 적금 해지와 손실은 기록하되 조카의 일상은 보호했다. 부부는 공개 다툼을 더 키우기보다, 피해 회복과 집안 사정을 처리하는 기준을 같은 문서 안에서 다시 세우기로 했다.","Instead of revealing all sensitive family circumstances, the court chose a method that left only confirmed responsibilities. It recorded Lee Jun-ho's cash delivery and Park Ji-yeon's joint savings cancellation and loss, but protected the nephew's daily life. Rather than expand the public dispute further, the couple decided to rebuild in the same document the standards for harm recovery and handling household affairs.",法廷は敏感な家族事情をすべて明らかにする代わりに、確認された責任だけを残す方式を選んだ。イ・ジュノの現金受け渡し、パク・ジヨンの共同積立預金解約と損失は記録する一方で、甥の日常は保護した。夫婦は公開の争いをこれ以上大きくするより、被害回復と家の事情を処理する基準を同じ文書の中で立て直すことにした。,法庭没有把敏感的家庭情况全部揭开，而是选择只留下已确认责任的方式。李俊浩的现金交付、朴智妍的共同储蓄账户解约和损失会被记录，但侄子的日常生活受到保护。这对夫妻决定，与其继续扩大公开争执，不如在同一份文件中重新建立损害恢复和处理家中情况的标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v1].text,"두 사람은 각자 다른 방식으로 먼저 선을 넘었다. 이준호는 숨기고, 박지연은 들여다보고, 결국 둘은 돈으로 서로를 벌했다. 사라진 6,000만 원보다 무겁게 남은 것은 서로의 말보다 기록을 더 믿게 된 결혼의 흔적이었다.","The two crossed the line first in different ways. Lee Jun-ho hid, Park Ji-yeon searched, and in the end they punished each other with money. What remained heavier than the vanished ₩60M was the trace of a marriage that had come to trust records more than each other's words.","二人はそれぞれ別の形で先に一線を越えた。イ・ジュノは隠し、パク・ジヨンは覗き込み、結局二人は金で互いを罰した。消えた6,000万ウォンより重く残ったのは、互いの言葉より記録を信じるようになった結婚の痕跡だった。",两人各自以不同方式先越过了界线。李俊浩选择隐瞒，朴智妍选择窥探，最终两人用钱惩罚了彼此。比消失的6000万韩元更沉重地留下来的，是一段开始比起彼此的话更相信记录的婚姻痕迹。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v2].text,"판결은 한 사람의 상처만으로 끝나지 않았다. 한 사람은 가족을 이유로 진실을 가렸고, 다른 한 사람은 불안을 이유로 문서를 조작했다. 빠져나간 돈은 숫자로 남았지만, 법정을 나서는 두 사람에게 더 뼈아픈 손실은 이미 오래전에 깨져 있던 신뢰였다.","The verdict did not end with one person's wound. One person hid the truth in the name of family, and the other manipulated documents in the name of anxiety. The money that had flowed out remained as a number, but the more painful loss for the two leaving the courtroom was trust that had already been broken long before.",判決は一人の傷だけでは終わらなかった。一人は家族を理由に真実を隠し、もう一人は不安を理由に文書を操作した。流れ出た金は数字として残ったが、法廷を出る二人にとってより骨身にしみる損失は、すでにずっと前に壊れていた信頼だった。,裁决并没有以一个人的伤口结束。一个人以家人为由遮住真相，另一个人以不安为由操纵文件。流出去的钱以数字留下，但对走出法庭的两人来说，更刺痛骨头的损失是早已破裂的信任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v3].text,"판결은 두 사람 모두의 책임을 나눠 적었다. 이준호는 형과 조카를 숨기며 개인 비자금 3,000만 원을 혼자 움직였고, 박지연은 배신 공포를 이유로 위임장을 꾸며 공동 적금 2,000만 원을 해지했다. 법정을 나온 뒤 부부는 돈을 회복하는 문제보다, 서로에게 사실을 말하지 않았던 습관부터 끊어야 한다는 말을 오래 떠올렸다.","The verdict divided and recorded the responsibility of both people. Lee Jun-ho hid his older brother and nephew while moving ₩30M from his personal hidden fund alone, and Park Ji-yeon fabricated a power of attorney out of fear of betrayal and closed the ₩20M joint savings account. After leaving the courtroom, the couple thought for a long time about the words that, before recovering the money, they had to break the habit of not telling each other the facts.","判決は二人双方の責任を分けて記した。イ・ジュノは兄と甥を隠しながら個人の隠し資金3,000万ウォンを一人で動かし、パク・ジヨンは裏切られる恐怖を理由に委任状を作って共同積立預金2,000万ウォンを解約した。法廷を出た後、夫婦は金を回復する問題より先に、互いに事実を話さなかった習慣から断ち切らなければならないという言葉を長く思い出していた。",裁决把两个人的责任分别写下。李俊浩一边隐瞒哥哥和侄子，一边独自挪动个人私房钱3000万韩元；朴智妍则以害怕背叛为由伪造委托书，取消了2000万韩元的共同储蓄账户。走出法庭后，这对夫妻久久想起，比起追回钱款，他们更需要先切断彼此不说事实的习惯。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v4].text,"한 사람만 피해자라고 부르기 어려운 결말이었다. 이준호의 침묵은 외도 오해를 키웠고, 박지연의 선제행동은 범죄와 손실로 이어졌다. 두 사람은 합의 이혼과 관계 회복 상담을 모두 열어 둔 채, 먼저 형 가족을 도운 것과 공동재산 관리를 문서로 정리하기로 했다.","It was an ending in which it was hard to call only one person the victim. Lee Jun-ho's silence grew the misunderstanding of an affair, and Park Ji-yeon's preemptive action led to crime and loss. The two kept both agreed divorce and counseling for relationship recovery open, and decided first to put in writing the help given to the older brother's family and the management of joint property.",一人だけを被害者と呼ぶのは難しい結末だった。イ・ジュノの沈黙は不倫の誤解を大きくし、パク・ジヨンの先制行動は犯罪と損失につながった。二人は協議離婚と関係回復カウンセリングの両方を開いたまま、まず兄の家族を助けたことと共同財産の管理を書面で整理することにした。,这是一个很难只把某一个人称为受害者的结局。李俊浩的沉默扩大了出轨误会，朴智妍的先发行动则导致犯罪和损失。两人把协议离婚和关系恢复咨询都保留着，决定先把帮助哥哥一家和共同财产管理的问题整理成文件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v5].text,"재판관은 숨김의 시작, 자금 실행, 위임장 조작을 한 줄로 묶지 않았다. 그래서 결론도 한 사람의 승리로 끝나지 않았다. 이준호는 집안 사정을 처리한다는 말로 배우자를 배제한 책임을, 박지연은 버림받을까 두려웠다는 말로 서류 조작을 덮으려 한 책임을 각각 받아들였다.","The Judge did not tie the beginning of concealment, the movement of funds, and the power of attorney manipulation into one line. Therefore, the conclusion did not end as one person's victory. Lee Jun-ho accepted responsibility for excluding his spouse under the words that he was handling household affairs, and Park Ji-yeon accepted responsibility for trying to cover document manipulation with the words that she was afraid of being abandoned.",裁判官は、隠し始めたこと、資金の実行、委任状の操作を一行で結びつけなかった。そのため結論も一人の勝利では終わらなかった。イ・ジュノは家の事情を処理するという言葉で配偶者を排除した責任を、パク・ジヨンは見捨てられるのが怖かったという言葉で文書操作を覆おうとした責任を、それぞれ受け入れた。,法官没有把隐瞒的开始、资金执行和委托书操纵连成一条线。因此结论也没有以某一个人的胜利结束。李俊浩接受了以处理家中情况为由排除配偶的责任，朴智妍也接受了以害怕被抛弃为由试图掩盖文件操纵的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v1].text,그 일이 집안 쪽 사정인 건 맞습니다. 다만 제 아내가 다시 크게 상처받을까 봐 입을 닫았습니다.,"It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v10].text,한마디만 했으면 됐다는 것도 압니다. 그런데 그 한마디가 집을 깨뜨릴까 봐 못 했습니다.,"It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v2].text,말 못 한 건 제 잘못입니다. 그래도 그 얘기를 꺼내면 바로 시댁 싸움으로 번질 것 같았습니다.,"It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v3].text,그곳에 간 이유가 다른 사람 때문은 아닙니다. 하지만 가족 이야기를 여기서 다 여는 게 무서웠습니다.,"It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v4].text,"제 아내가 오해할 줄 알면서도, 설명하면 더 큰 싸움이 될 것 같아 피했습니다.","It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v5].text,사실을 말할 기회가 없었던 건 아닙니다. 제가 겁이 나서 계속 뒤로 미뤘습니다.,"It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v6].text,그쪽 사정을 말하면 집안 이야기까지 나와야 했습니다. 저는 그 순간을 감당할 자신이 없었습니다.,"It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v7].text,외도는 아닙니다. 다만 그렇게 보일 만큼 제가 말을 아꼈다는 건 인정합니다.,"It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v8].text,"재판관님, 질문을 피할 수 없다는 건 압니다. 그래도 그때는 개인적인 일을 꺼낼 용기가 없었습니다.","It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v9].text,"제 아내가 또 시댁 문제로만 들을까 봐, 저는 필요한 말까지 같이 삼켰습니다.","It was a family matter, and I kept silent because I was afraid my wife would be deeply hurt again.",家族側の事情でした。妻がまた深く傷つくのを恐れて、私は口を閉ざしました。,那是家人方面的情况。我担心妻子再次受到深重伤害，所以闭口不言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v1].text,"맞습니다. 외도는 절대 아니지만 말하기 어려운 사정이 있었고, 그 사정을 끝까지 숨겼습니다.","It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v10].text,"재판관님, 제가 두려워한 건 진실이 아니라 그 진실 뒤에 올 시댁 싸움이었습니다. 그래서 숨겼습니다.","It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v2].text,그 댁 오피스텔이었습니다. 그 아이 일로 다닌 걸 말하면 제 아내가 이혼까지 꺼낼까 봐 숨겼습니다.,"It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v3].text,형이 부모님 재산 문제로 이미 원망을 샀습니다. 그 형을 다시 돕고 있다는 말을 할 자신이 없었습니다.,"It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v4].text,제 아내보다 그 댁 사정을 먼저 지킨 꼴이 됐습니다. 그게 제 침묵의 가장 큰 잘못입니다.,"It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v5].text,"저는 외도라는 오해를 풀 기회가 있었는데도, 시댁 싸움이 두려워 그 기회를 버렸습니다.","It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v6].text,방문과 통화 관련 사실들을 숨겨온 것은 사실입니다. 아내에게 숨긴 것들 자체는 변명할 수 없습니다.,"It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v7].text,제 침묵 때문에 그 일을 맡은 것이 외도처럼 보였습니다. 그 책임은 제가 지겠습니다.,"It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v8].text,"그 아이 얘기를 꺼내면 제 아내가 무너질까 두려웠지만, 결국 더 크게 무너지게 만든 건 저였습니다.","It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v9].text,"외도는 아니었습니다. 그래도 의심받을 만한 모양을 제가 만들었고, 그걸 알면서도 멈추지 않았습니다.","It was not an affair. I concealed the Officetel visits and calls because of my brother and nephew, and I accept that responsibility.",不倫ではありませんでした。兄と甥の事情でオフィステル訪問と通話を隠しました。その責任は認めます。,那不是出轨。我因为哥哥和侄子的情况隐瞒了韩式商住公寓探访与通话，这份责任我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"그 댁 사정이 걸려 있었습니다. 제가 외면하기 어려운 일이 반복됐고, 그걸 말하지 못했습니다.",Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v10].text,그 일을 맡은 것과 아내를 속인 일은 다릅니다. 저는 그 둘을 구분하지 못하고 숨겼습니다.,Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"그 집안 얘기를 꺼내는 순간, 제 아내가 예전 시댁 일까지 다시 떠올릴까 봐 겁났습니다.",Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].text,그쪽을 돕는다고 말하면 제 아내가 바로 거부할 거라고 생각했습니다. 그래서 더 숨겼습니다.,Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].text,그 집 사정과 관련한 일이었습니다. 그런데 그 말 하나가 집안 싸움으로 번질까 봐 피했습니다.,Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"그쪽 사정이 좋지 않았고 제가 손을 보태야 한다고 생각했습니다. 말하자면 간단한데, 저한테는 그게 제일 어려웠습니다.",Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v6].text,저는 외도 의심보다 시댁 갈등이 다시 터지는 게 더 무서웠습니다. 그래서 말이 짧아졌습니다.,Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v7].text,제 아내가 그 집안 얘기를 견디기 힘들어하는 걸 알았습니다. 그걸 핑계로 제가 침묵했습니다.,Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v8].text,그 댁 일이 있었던 건 맞습니다. 다만 그 사실을 설명할수록 제 결혼이 더 흔들릴까 두려웠습니다.,Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v9].text,그 사정을 말하면 제 아내도 흔들릴 거라 알았습니다. 그래서 더 비겁하게 피했습니다.,Family circumstances were involved. I admit I hid them because I feared the in-laws conflict and damage to the marriage.,家族の事情が関わっていました。義実家との葛藤と結婚への影響を恐れて隠したことは認めます。,其中牵涉家人情况。我承认，我因为害怕婆家矛盾和婚姻受损而隐瞒了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v1].text,"그렇게 보일 수 있습니다. 다만 저는 제 아내를 덜 중요하게 여긴 게 아니라, 싸움이 커지는 것이 무서웠습니다.","It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v10].text,"시댁 문제로 다시 부딪히는 게 두려워서, 제가 설명해야 할 말을 자꾸 줄였습니다.","It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v2].text,시댁 얘기가 나오면 집이 바로 얼어붙었습니다. 그래서 설명을 시작하는 것부터 피했습니다.,"It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v3].text,아내보다 싸움을 더 두려워했다는 말은 아픕니다. 그래도 제가 두려워서 밀린 건 맞습니다.,"It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v4].text,그쪽 이야기를 꺼내면 예전 일까지 다 올라올 것 같았습니다. 그래서 말문이 막혔습니다.,"It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v5].text,제 아내가 싫어할 걸 알았습니다. 그걸 피하려다 오해를 더 키웠습니다.,"It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v6].text,외도를 숨긴 것은 아닙니다. 하지만 시댁 문제를 덮으려 한 건 사실입니다.,"It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v7].text,그 질문에 바로 답하기 어렵습니다. 제 겁이 제 아내의 불신보다 앞섰던 것 같습니다.,"It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v8].text,저는 싸움을 막는다고 생각했습니다. 지금 보니 그 침묵이 더 큰 싸움을 만들었습니다.,"It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v9].text,제 아내에게 말해야 했다는 건 압니다. 그런데 그 순간마다 그 얘기만은 피하고 싶었습니다.,"It may have looked that way, but I was afraid the in-laws conflict would flare up, not that I valued my wife less.",そう見えたかもしれませんが、妻を軽く見たのではなく、義実家との葛藤が再燃するのを恐れていました。,看起来或许如此，但我不是把妻子看得不重要，而是害怕婆家矛盾再次爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v1].text,맞습니다. 외도가 아니라 시댁 불화와 체면 공포가 제 침묵의 이유였습니다.,"I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v10].text,"재판관님, 이제는 분명히 말하겠습니다. 숨김의 이유는 시댁 불화와 제 체면 공포였습니다.","I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v2].text,저는 제 아내에게 먼저 말해야 했습니다. 그런데 형 얘기를 꺼낼 용기가 없어 거짓 침묵을 택했습니다.,"I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v3].text,아내보다 싸움을 더 두려워한 셈입니다. 그게 이 오해를 이렇게 키웠습니다.,"I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v4].text,"그 댁 사정이 알려지면 예전 시댁 상처가 다시 터질까 봐, 저는 진실을 피하는 쪽을 골랐습니다.","I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v5].text,"외도 의심을 풀 수 있었는데도, 시댁 문제로 번질까 봐 입을 닫았습니다. 제가 잘못했습니다.","I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v6].text,저는 아내의 불안을 낮추는 대신 형의 체면을 먼저 지켰습니다. 그 선택은 틀렸습니다.,"I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v7].text,"그때 제가 두려워한 건 아내의 질문이 아니라, 제가 또 가족 편에 섰다는 말을 듣는 일이었습니다.","I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v8].text,"네, 제가 비겁했습니다. 시댁 싸움을 피하려다 부부 사이의 진실을 더 망가뜨렸습니다.","I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v9].text,제가 숨긴 이유는 외도가 아니라 겁이었습니다. 하지만 겁이 있었다고 책임이 없어지진 않습니다.,"I admit the reason for my concealment was fear, saving face, and conflict with the in-laws—not an affair.",隠した理由は不倫ではなく、恐れと体面、そして義実家との葛藤だったと認めます。,我承认，我隐瞒的理由不是出轨，而是恐惧、体面以及婆家矛盾。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"네, 시댁 싸움이 다시 날까 봐 두려웠습니다. 형 얘기만 나오면 예전 상처가 바로 올라왔습니다.",I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v10].text,싸움이 무서워서 침묵을 택했습니다. 그 침묵이 제 아내에게는 배신으로 남았습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].text,제 아내가 그쪽을 믿지 않는다는 걸 알았습니다. 그래서 그 이름을 꺼내는 일 자체를 피했습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].text,숨긴 이유는 외도가 아니라 체면과 두려움이었습니다. 집안 사정을 말하면 집이 끝날 것 같았습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].text,제가 가족 문제를 먼저 잠갔습니다. 아내가 들으면 화낼 거라는 생각만 앞섰습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].text,그쪽 일이었습니다. 하지만 아내에게는 또 시댁이 끼어드는 일로 보일까 봐 숨겼습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v6].text,말하면 싸울 거라 단정했습니다. 그 단정 때문에 제 아내를 더 불안하게 만든 것도 맞습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v7].text,아내를 믿지 못한 것도 제 잘못입니다. 설명해도 안 될 거라고 제가 먼저 결론냈습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v8].text,시댁 불화가 두려워서 사실을 잘라서 말했습니다. 그러다 보니 외도처럼 보이는 빈칸이 생겼습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v9].text,저는 그쪽 체면과 집안 사정을 지키려 했습니다. 대신 제 아내에게는 가장 중요한 말을 숨겼습니다.,I feared the in-laws conflict and chose silence. That silence remained with my wife as betrayal.,義実家との葛藤を恐れて沈黙を選びました。その沈黙は妻にとって裏切りとして残りました。,我害怕婆家矛盾，于是选择沉默。那份沉默在妻子那里留下成了背叛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v1].text,권리라고 생각했다기보다 급한 불을 끄는 일이라고 여겼습니다. 그래도 혼자 판단한 건 맞습니다.,"I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v10].text,"재판관님, 혼자에게 권리가 있었다고 말하긴 어렵습니다. 제가 급했다는 말밖에 못 하겠습니다.","I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I Judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v2].text,"그때는 그쪽이 바로 무너질 것 같았습니다. 제 판단이 먼저였고, 제 아내 동의는 없었습니다.","I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v3].text,제가 할 수밖에 없다고 생각했습니다. 하지만 공동 적금을 혼자 움직인 건 변명하기 어렵습니다.,"I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v4].text,그쪽 사정이 너무 급했습니다. 그 말로 권리가 생기는 건 아니라는 것도 압니다.,"I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
