,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v5].text,혼자 결정해도 된다고 적힌 곳은 없습니다. 다만 그 순간에는 방법을 못 찾았습니다.,"I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v6].text,제 아내에게 말하면 막힐 거라고 생각했습니다. 그래서 제 판단만 더 믿었습니다.,"I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v7].text,집안 사정을 처리한다는 말에 기대서 절차를 가볍게 본 건 맞습니다.,"I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v8].text,공동 돈이라는 걸 모르지 않았습니다. 알면서도 그쪽 사정이 먼저 눈에 들어왔습니다.,"I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v9].text,권한이 있었다고 단정할 수는 없습니다. 그때는 책임보다 급한 상황만 눈에 들어왔습니다.,"I treated it as urgent family help, but I admit I judged alone without my wife’s consent.",急な家族支援だと考えましたが、妻の同意なく一人で判断したことは認めます。,我把它当成紧急的家人援助，但我承认，我没有妻子的同意就独自判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v1].text,"없었습니다. 공동 적금 2,000만 원을 형에게 넘길 권리는 저 혼자에게 없었습니다.","I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v10].text,형에게 돈이 필요했던 건 사실입니다. 하지만 그 사실이 제 혼자 결정할 권리를 만들지는 못합니다.,"I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v2].text,제가 잘못했습니다. 그쪽이 급하다고 해도 배우자 동의 없이 공동 돈을 처분하면 안 됐습니다.,"I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v3].text,그 돈은 제 돈처럼 쓸 수 있는 돈이 아니었습니다. 저는 그 경계를 알고도 넘었습니다.,"I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v4].text,아내가 반대할 걸 알면서도 말하지 않았습니다. 그래서 더 큰 책임이 제게 있습니다.,"I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v5].text,형을 살리겠다는 생각이 앞서 부부의 공동 재산을 제 결정으로 바꿔 버렸습니다.,"I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v6].text,선의였다고 말해도 월권은 월권입니다. 저는 공동 적금을 혼자 처분했습니다.,"I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v7].text,"재판관님, 급박함은 이유가 될 수 있어도 권한은 되지 않습니다. 그걸 이제 인정합니다.","I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v8].text,제 아내가 알면 막을 걸 알아서 숨겼습니다. 그래서 이건 단순한 착오가 아닙니다.,"I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v9].text,공동 적금은 함께 결정해야 했습니다. 저는 그 기본을 지키지 않았습니다.,"I had no sole authority over the joint savings or the ₩20M. Urgency was a reason, not authority.","共同積立預金にも2,000万ウォンにも、私一人の権限はありませんでした。急迫性は理由にはなっても、権限にはなりません。",我对共同储蓄账户和2000万韩元都没有单独权限。紧急只是理由，不是权限。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].text,그 댁이 당장 버티기 어려워 보여서 공동 적금을 먼저 깼습니다. 아내에게 말하지 않은 건 제 잘못입니다.,"I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v10].text,저는 급한 사정이라는 말로 동의 없는 처분을 덮으려 했습니다. 그 점은 인정합니다.,"I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].text,그쪽으로 보낼 돈이라고 스스로 정해 버렸습니다. 공동 적금인데도 제 판단으로 밀어붙였습니다.,"I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].text,제 아내가 반대할 걸 알고 설득을 미뤘습니다. 그래서 돈 문제를 혼자 안고 가려 했습니다.,"I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"그쪽 사정이 급하다는 이유로, 부부 돈의 경계를 제가 넘어섰습니다.","I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].text,공동으로 모은 돈이었습니다. 그런데 저는 집안 사정을 처리하는 일이라며 제 권한처럼 굴었습니다.,"I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v6].text,그 돈이 아니면 그쪽이 무너질 것 같았습니다. 하지만 그 판단을 제 아내와 나누지 않았습니다.,"I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v7].text,제가 먼저 막아야 한다고 생각했습니다. 지금 보면 그 생각이 월권이었습니다.,"I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v8].text,아내에게 묻지 않은 건 반대가 두려웠기 때문입니다. 선의만으로 설명할 수 없습니다.,"I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v9].text,"집안 사정을 돕는 마음은 있었지만, 공동 적금을 혼자 깰 권리는 없었습니다.","I moved the joint savings under urgent family circumstances, but I had no right to decide that alone.",急な家族事情で共同積立預金を動かしましたが、一人で決める権利はありませんでした。,我在紧急家人情况下动用了共同储蓄账户，但我没有独自决定的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v1].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v1].text,책임을 피하겠다는 건 아닙니다. 다만 그때는 가족을 살려야 한다는 생각이 너무 컸습니다.,"I will not dodge responsibility. The family emergency mattered, but I should have spoken to my wife first.",責任を避けるつもりはありません。家族の急な事情はありましたが、先に妻へ話すべきでした。,我不会逃避责任。家里的紧急情况确实存在，但我本该先告诉妻子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v10].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v10].text,"재판관님, 책임을 묻는다면 피하지 않겠습니다. 다만 급했던 사정도 같이 봐 주셨으면 합니다.","I will not dodge responsibility. The family emergency mattered, but I should have spoken to my wife first.",責任を避けるつもりはありません。家族の急な事情はありましたが、先に妻へ話すべきでした。,我不会逃避责任。家里的紧急情况确实存在，但我本该先告诉妻子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
