,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v2].text,배우자 동의가 없었다는 건 인정합니다. 그래도 그 순간엔 다른 길이 보이지 않았습니다.,"I will not dodge responsibility. The family emergency mattered, but I should have spoken to my wife first.",責任を避けるつもりはありません。家族の急な事情はありましたが、先に妻へ話すべきでした。,我不会逃避责任。家里的紧急情况确实存在，但我本该先告诉妻子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
