,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v7].text,집안 사정을 처리하려는 마음이 있었다고 해서 동의가 필요 없어진 건 아닙니다.,"I will not dodge responsibility. The family emergency mattered, but I should have spoken to my wife first.",責任を避けるつもりはありません。家族の急な事情はありましたが、先に妻へ話すべきでした。,我不会逃避责任。家里的紧急情况确实存在，但我本该先告诉妻子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v8].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v8].text,그때는 제가 감당하면 된다고 생각했습니다. 지금 보니 그게 제일 위험한 판단이었습니다.,"I will not dodge responsibility. The family emergency mattered, but I should have spoken to my wife first.",責任を避けるつもりはありません。家族の急な事情はありましたが、先に妻へ話すべきでした。,我不会逃避责任。家里的紧急情况确实存在，但我本该先告诉妻子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v9].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v9].text,제 아내에게 먼저 말하지 않은 돈 문제가 있습니다. 아직 그 선택을 어떻게 설명해야 할지 모르겠습니다.,"I will not dodge responsibility. The family emergency mattered, but I should have spoken to my wife first.",責任を避けるつもりはありません。家族の急な事情はありましたが、先に妻へ話すべきでした。,我不会逃避责任。家里的紧急情况确实存在，但我本该先告诉妻子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v1].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v1].text,"인정합니다. 제 아내가 반대할 걸 알았고, 그래서 더 숨긴 채 공동 적금을 처분했습니다.",I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v10].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v10].text,그 댁이 무너질까 봐 두려웠습니다. 그렇다고 부부 재산을 혼자 움직일 권리는 없었습니다.,I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v2].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v2].text,제가 배우자 동의 없이 깼습니다. 집안 사정을 처리하는 일이었다 해도 그 책임은 제게 있습니다.,I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v3].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v3].text,그쪽 사정을 앞세우겠다고 부부 신뢰를 깼습니다. 저는 그 둘 중 하나만 보려 했습니다.,I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v4].text,선의였다는 말로 숨길 수 없습니다. 공동 적금을 혼자 처분한 건 제 잘못입니다.,I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v5].text,반대가 무서워 설명을 피했습니다. 그 순간부터 저는 아내를 함께 결정할 사람으로 대하지 않았습니다.,I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v6].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v6].text,"네, 책임을 인정합니다. 저는 형을 돕기 전에 제 아내에게 말했어야 했습니다.",I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v7].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v7].text,"가족을 위한 선택이라고 믿었지만, 방법은 틀렸습니다. 동의 없는 처분은 제가 감당하겠습니다.",I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v8].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v8].text,"제가 결정하고, 제가 숨기고, 제가 형에게 보냈습니다. 그 순서 전부 제 책임입니다.",I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v9].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v9].text,"재판관님, 이제는 변명하지 않겠습니다. 배우자 동의 없이 공동 적금을 깬 사실을 인정합니다.",I admit I disposed of the joint savings without my spouse’s consent and sent the money to help my brother.,配偶者の同意なく共同積立預金を処分し、兄を助けるために送った事実を認めます。,我承认，我未经配偶同意处分了共同储蓄账户，并把钱送去帮助哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"아내가 반대할 걸 알았습니다. 그래서 말하지 않았고, 그게 제 책임의 핵심입니다.",I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v10].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v10].text,동의 없이 깬 책임은 있습니다. 그쪽 사정이 급하다는 말로 지워지지 않습니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v2].text,집안 사정을 처리하는 일이라는 이유로 공동 적금까지 혼자 깼습니다. 그 선을 넘은 건 맞습니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v3].text,그 댁 일을 그냥 두지 못했습니다. 하지만 제 아내에게 숨긴 채 한 선택은 잘못이었습니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v4].text,동의를 구하지 않은 건 단순 실수가 아닙니다. 제가 반대를 피하려고 한 겁니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v5].text,배우자가 반대할 걸 알았기 때문에 더 말하지 못했습니다. 그게 더 나쁜 선택이었습니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v6].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v6].text,집안 사정을 돕는 마음과 공동 재산 책임은 별개입니다. 이제 그걸 인정합니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v7].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v7].text,저는 선의라는 말로 절차 위반의 무게를 낮추려 했습니다. 그건 제 방어였습니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v8].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v8].text,공동 적금을 건드린 순간부터 제 아내에게 설명할 책임이 생겼습니다. 저는 그걸 피했습니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v9].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v9].text,가족을 돕겠다는 말만 앞세우면 제 아내 입장이 사라집니다. 제가 그렇게 만들었습니다.,I am responsible for cancelling the joint savings without consent. Family circumstances do not erase that.,同意なく共同積立預金を解約した責任はあります。家族の事情があっても、それは消えません。,未经同意解约共同储蓄账户，我有责任。家人情况不能抹去这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v1].text,이혼 대비라고만 말하면 너무 차갑게 들립니다. 그때는 제 몫이라도 지켜야겠다는 불안이 컸습니다.,It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v10].text,저도 제가 너무 빠르게 움직였다는 걸 압니다. 하지만 그때는 두려움이 먼저였습니다.,It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v2].text,제 남편이 먼저 가정을 버렸다고 믿었습니다. 그래서 돈을 붙잡아야 한다고 생각했습니다.,It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v3].text,제가 먼저 움직인 건 맞습니다. 다만 그때는 제가 버려질까 봐 너무 무서웠습니다.,It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v4].text,제 남편의 진실을 기다릴 마음의 여유가 없었습니다. 이미 저는 최악을 믿고 있었습니다.,It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v5].text,"이혼을 계산했다기보다, 끝날 결혼에서 빈손이 될까 봐 겁났습니다.",It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
