,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v6].text,그 순간엔 확인보다 방어가 먼저였습니다. 제가 너무 빨리 결론을 냈습니다.,It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v7].text,"제 남편이 바람이라고 믿으니, 제 몫이 사라질 것 같았습니다.",It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
