,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v8].text,돈을 움직인 이유가 예쁘진 않습니다. 그래도 그때는 살아남는 쪽으로 보였습니다.,It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v9].text,"재판관님, 제 선택이 앞선 건 맞습니다. 남편을 더 묻기 전에 제 안전부터 봤습니다.",It was not just cold divorce planning. Fear of being abandoned made me try to protect my share first.,冷静な離婚準備だけではありません。見捨てられる恐れから、自分の取り分を先に守ろうとしました。,那不只是冷静的离婚准备。害怕被抛弃的恐惧，让我先想保护自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v1].text,"맞습니다. 남편이 바람이라고 믿은 순간, 저는 이혼까지 계산하며 2,000만 원을 먼저 움직였습니다.","I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v10].text,"제가 먼저 송금했습니다. 그 이유에는 두려움도 있었고, 이혼을 대비한 마음도 있었습니다.","I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v2].text,"제 몫을 지킨다는 말로 포장했지만, 실제로는 끝날 결혼을 대비한 은닉 심리가 있었습니다.","I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v3].text,"제 남편에게 먼저 묻지 않았습니다. 저는 이미 결론을 냈고, 돈부터 옮겼습니다.","I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v4].text,제가 피해자라는 생각에 기대서 먼저 실행했습니다. 그게 제 잘못입니다.,"I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v5].text,이혼 대비였습니다. 인정하기 싫어서 불안이라는 말만 반복했습니다.,"I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v6].text,"남편의 진실을 확인하지도 않고, 제가 먼저 돈을 움직였습니다. 그 순서는 피할 수 없습니다.","I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v7].text,"재판관님, 그 선택은 방어이자 계산이었습니다. 저는 두 가지를 모두 숨기고 있었습니다.","I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v8].text,"저는 외도라고 믿었고, 그 믿음이 제 행동을 정당화한다고 착각했습니다.","I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v9].text,"2,000만 원을 먼저 옮긴 건 제 판단이었습니다. 남편이 숨겼다는 말로 다 덮을 수 없습니다.","I moved ₩20M first, partly out of fear and partly to prepare for divorce. I cannot hide behind my husband’s silence.","私は2,000万ウォンを先に動かしました。理由には恐れも離婚への備えもありました。夫の沈黙の後ろに隠れることはできません。",我先移动了2000万韩元，其中既有恐惧，也有为离婚做准备的心。我不能躲在丈夫的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v1].text,"네, 남편이 바람이라고 믿었고, 그래서 제 몫을 먼저 지켜야 한다는 생각이 들었습니다.","I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v10].text,제 선택에는 겁과 계산이 함께 있었습니다. 어느 하나만 있었다고 말할 수 없습니다.,"I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v2].text,이혼까지 떠올렸습니다. 그 말이 부끄러워서 방어라는 말로만 포장했습니다.,"I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v3].text,제 남편이 이미 다른 삶을 꾸린다고 믿었습니다. 그래서 돈부터 막아야 한다고 봤습니다.,"I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v4].text,그 돈을 움직인 건 자기방어였습니다. 그러나 동시에 이혼을 대비한 계산도 있었습니다.,"I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v5].text,제가 피해자라고만 생각했습니다. 그래서 제가 먼저 움직이는 건 괜찮다고 착각했습니다.,"I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v6].text,남편에게 묻는 것보다 돈을 빼놓는 게 빠르다고 생각했습니다. 그 판단이 문제였습니다.,"I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v7].text,"끝날 결혼이라고 믿었고, 그 믿음이 저를 무리한 선택 쪽으로 밀었습니다.","I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v8].text,그때는 정당한 방어처럼 느꼈습니다. 하지만 지금 말해 보니 이혼 대비였다는 걸 압니다.,"I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v9].text,제 남편의 진실보다 제 불안이 먼저였습니다. 그 불안이 돈을 움직였습니다.,"I believed my husband was having an affair, and self-defense became mixed with calculations for divorce.",夫が不倫していると信じ、自己防衛と離婚への計算が混ざりました。,我相信丈夫出轨，于是自我防卫和离婚打算混在了一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v1].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v1].text,수치심이 없었다고는 못 합니다. 돈을 보낸 뒤 일이 틀어지자 말할 용기가 더 사라졌습니다.,"After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v10].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v10].text,그 돈이 사라진 뒤에도 저는 인정하지 못했습니다. 제 선택을 제가 똑바로 보지 못했습니다.,"After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v2].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v2].text,숨긴 건 맞습니다. 다만 그때는 제가 얼마나 어리석었는지 들키는 게 너무 무서웠습니다.,"After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v3].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v3].text,사기당했다는 말을 입에 올리는 순간 제가 끝난 사람처럼 보일까 봐 피했습니다.,"After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
