,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v4].text,처음엔 다시 메울 수 있을 거라고 믿었습니다. 그래서 말하지 않고 버텼습니다.,"After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
