,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v5].text,"돈을 잃었다는 사실보다, 제가 그런 선택을 했다는 사실이 더 부끄러웠습니다.","After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
