,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v6].text,제 남편에게 말하면 바로 제 잘못만 남을까 봐 숨었습니다.,"After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v7].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v7].text,수치심도 있었고 겁도 있었습니다. 그래서 사실을 자꾸 늦췄습니다.,"After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v8].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v8].text,"재판관님, 숨긴 이유를 묻는다면 부끄러웠다는 말부터 할 수밖에 없습니다.","After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v9].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|early].variants[dc-4-a-q2-early-v9].text,"제가 피해자라고 말해 놓고, 제 손실까지 드러내는 게 무서웠습니다.","After the investment chat transfer went wrong, shame and fear made me hide the loss.",投資チャットへの送金が失敗したあと、羞恥心と恐れから損失を隠しました。,投资群转账出事之后，羞耻和恐惧让我隐瞒了损失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v1].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v1].text,"맞습니다. 2,000만 원을 보내고 사기당한 사실을 숨긴 건 수치심과 책임을 피하려 한 마음 때문이었습니다.",I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v10].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v10].text,"네, 결국 수치심 때문이었습니다. 그리고 그 수치심 뒤에는 이혼 대비로 돈을 숨긴 마음도 있었습니다.",I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v2].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v2].text,저는 제가 속았다는 걸 인정하기 싫었습니다. 그래서 제 남편의 숨김을 더 크게 말했습니다.,I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v3].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v3].text,돈을 잃고도 말하지 않았습니다. 제가 피해자라는 자리를 잃을까 봐 두려웠습니다.,I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v4].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v4].text,수치심이 저를 더 거짓말하게 만들었습니다. 하지만 그 수치심이 책임을 지워 주지는 않습니다.,I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v5].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v5].text,"제가 보낸 돈은 사라졌고, 저는 그 사실까지 숨겼습니다. 그건 제 잘못입니다.",I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v6].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v6].text,"재판관님, 저는 창피해서 숨겼습니다. 동시에 위임장 문제까지 드러날까 봐 겁났습니다.",I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v7].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v7].text,제 남편의 잘못을 앞세우면 제 손실이 가려질 거라고 생각했습니다. 비겁했습니다.,I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v8].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v8].text,사기당한 뒤에도 멈추지 않고 숨겼습니다. 그때부터는 제 책임도 분명해졌습니다.,I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v9].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|late].variants[dc-4-a-q2-late-v9].text,저는 제 선택이 틀렸다는 걸 알면서도 인정하지 않았습니다. 수치심에 매달렸습니다.,I admit I hid the fact that the ₩20M transfer was lost to a scam because I wanted to avoid shame and responsibility.,"2,000万ウォンの送金が詐欺で失われた事実を、羞恥と責任を避けたい思いから隠したと認めます。",我承认，我因为想逃避羞耻和责任，隐瞒了2000万韩元转账被骗走的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v1].text,"네, 수치심이 컸습니다. 제 남편이 바람이라고 몰아붙인 뒤에 제가 사기를 당했다는 걸 말할 수 없었습니다.","I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v10].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v10].text,제 남편을 의심한 이유와 제가 잃은 돈이 함께 드러나는 게 무서웠습니다.,"I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v2].text,제가 돈을 지키겠다고 해 놓고 잃었습니다. 그 말이 너무 부끄러워서 숨겼습니다.,"I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v3].text,사기 가능성을 말하면 서류와 돈 문제까지 같이 열릴까 봐 겁났습니다.,"I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v4].text,잃은 돈보다 제 판단이 들키는 게 더 무서웠습니다. 그래서 더 피해자처럼 굴었습니다.,"I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v5].text,제 남편 잘못을 앞세우면 제 손실이 덜 보일 거라고 생각했습니다.,"I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v6].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v6].text,수치심 때문에 사실을 늦췄습니다. 동시에 책임을 피하고 싶은 마음도 있었습니다.,"I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v7].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v7].text,"투자방에 보낸 돈이 사라졌을 때, 저는 바로 말하지 않고 더 깊이 숨었습니다.","I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v8].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v8].text,제가 잘못 선택했다는 걸 인정하면 모든 게 제 탓으로 돌아올까 봐 두려웠습니다.,"I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v9].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q2-mid-v9].text,그때는 창피해서 숨겼다고만 생각했습니다. 지금은 책임을 피하려는 마음도 있었다고 봅니다.,"I was ashamed to admit I had lost the money, and I was afraid the document and money issues would open together.",金を失ったと認めるのが恥ずかしく、書類と金の問題が一緒に開かれるのを恐れていました。,我羞于承认自己把钱亏掉，也害怕文件问题和金钱问题一起被揭开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v1].text,남편이 먼저 숨겼다는 건 빠질 수 없습니다. 그래도 제가 먼저 움직였다는 말까지는… 피하기 어렵습니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v10].text,남편이 먼저 숨겼다는 말만 붙잡고 싶었습니다. 실제 실행 순서는 저도 알고 있습니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v2].text,제가 먼저 송금한 부분은 있습니다. 하지만 그 선택은 남편의 숨김 때문에 시작됐습니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v3].text,실행만 보면 제가 앞섰을 수 있습니다. 다만 원인은 제 남편이 먼저 만들었습니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v4].text,그 말이 저만 나쁜 사람처럼 들려서 겁납니다. 그래도 돈을 움직인 건 제 손이었습니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v5].text,저는 남편이 먼저 배신했다고 믿었습니다. 그래서 제가 먼저 움직였다는 사실을 자꾸 밀어냈습니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v6].text,비밀 송금 실행은 제 쪽이 먼저였다는 말을 듣는 게 무섭습니다. 그래도 완전히 부정하진 못합니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v7].text,남편의 숨김이 없었다면 저는 안 움직였을 겁니다. 하지만 실행한 사람은 저였습니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v8].text,"재판관님, 선후를 따지면 저도 불리한 지점이 있습니다. 그걸 피하고 싶었습니다.","I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 먼저 세우며 자기 선택의 동기는 좁게 설명한다.,"Establish the victim position first, while narrowly explaining the motive for one's own choice.",被害者としての立場を先に立て、自分の選択の動機は狭く説明する。,先确立受害者位置，再狭窄说明自己选择的动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v9].text,제가 먼저 돈을 보낸 건 맞습니다. 다만 그때 제 마음은 이미 버림받은 쪽이었습니다.,"I wanted to hold onto my husband’s earlier concealment, but I cannot avoid that I moved the money first.",夫が先に隠したことだけを握っていたかったのですが、私が先に金を動かした事実は避けられません。,我想抓住丈夫先隐瞒这一点不放，但我无法回避是我先动了钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v1].text,"네. 남편이 먼저 숨긴 건 맞지만, 실제 비밀 송금 실행은 제가 먼저였습니다.","Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v10].text,선후를 제대로 적으면 제게도 책임이 큽니다. 그래서 그동안 남편의 숨김만 앞세웠습니다.,"Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v2].text,저는 남편이 숨긴 것을 이유로 제 송금을 덮으려 했습니다. 하지만 순서는 숨길 수 없습니다.,"Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v3].text,"비밀을 만든 시작은 남편 쪽이고, 돈을 옮긴 실행은 제 쪽이 먼저였습니다.","Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v4].text,제가 먼저 실행했습니다. 그 사실은 제 남편의 잘못과 따로 책임져야 합니다.,"Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v5].text,"재판관님, 저는 피해자라는 자리에 기대서 제 송금 순서를 흐렸습니다. 인정합니다.","Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v6].text,"남편이 숨긴 사실이 제 선택을 만들었지만, 송금 버튼을 먼저 누른 건 저였습니다.","Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v7].text,저는 그 차이를 알고도 말하지 않았습니다. 숨김과 실행을 일부러 한 덩어리로 묶었습니다.,"Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v8].text,"제 남편이 먼저 숨겼다고 해도, 제가 먼저 돈을 옮긴 책임은 사라지지 않습니다.","Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,작게 숨을 고른 뒤 계산된 선택과 후회를 함께 털어놓는다.,"Take a small breath, then reveal both the calculated choice and the regret.",小さく息を整えたあと、計算された選択と後悔をあわせて打ち明ける。,轻轻调整呼吸后，把经过计算的选择和后悔一起坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v9].text,제가 먼저 보냈습니다. 그리고 그 사실을 늦게 인정한 것까지 제 책임입니다.,"Yes. My husband concealed first, but I executed the secret transfer first, and that responsibility is mine.",はい。夫が先に隠しましたが、秘密送金を先に実行したのは私です。その責任は私にあります。,是的。丈夫先隐瞒，但先执行秘密转账的是我，那份责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].text,"인정합니다. 남편이 먼저 숨겼다고 해도, 비밀 송금을 실제로 먼저 한 건 제 쪽입니다.","Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v10].text,실행 순서에서는 제가 앞섰습니다. 그 점까지 인정해야 한다는 걸 압니다.,"Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].text,제가 먼저 돈을 옮겼습니다. 그 사실을 남편의 숨김 뒤에 숨기려고 했습니다.,"Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].text,"남편이 원인을 만들었다고 믿었지만, 실행은 제가 먼저 했습니다.","Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].text,송금 버튼을 누른 건 저였습니다. 그 부분은 더는 제 남편 탓만 할 수 없습니다.,"Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].text,숨김의 시작과 실행의 시작이 다르다는 말은 맞습니다. 저는 그 차이를 피해 왔습니다.,"Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v6].text,제가 피해자라고 생각했기 때문에 제 실행을 늦게 말했습니다. 그건 제 방어였습니다.,"Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v7].text,비밀 송금 실행은 제 쪽이 먼저였습니다. 그걸 인정하면 제 책임이 커질까 봐 겁났습니다.,"Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v8].text,남편이 먼저 숨겼다는 말은 사실입니다. 하지만 제 송금이 먼저였다는 말도 사실입니다.,"Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,수치심과 불안을 섞어 일부 사실을 인정한다.,Admit some facts while mixing shame with anxiety.,羞恥心と不安を交えながら、一部の事実を認める。,夹杂羞耻与不安，承认部分事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v9].text,"제가 먼저 움직였고, 나중에 그 이유를 남편의 숨김으로만 설명하려 했습니다.","Even if my husband concealed first, the first secret transfer was on my side. I tried to hide that behind his silence.",夫が先に隠したとしても、最初の秘密送金は私の側でした。私はそれを夫の沈黙の後ろに隠そうとしました。,即便丈夫先隐瞒，最初的秘密转账也是我这边做的。我试图把这一点藏在他的沉默后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v1].text,숨긴 시작은 저한테 있습니다. 다만 돈의 실행 순서는 한마디로 묶기 어렵습니다.,"The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v10].text,"제가 먼저 닫았고, 그 뒤 각자 돈을 움직였습니다. 한쪽 말로만 정리하긴 어렵습니다.","The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v2].text,제가 먼저 말하지 않은 건 맞습니다. 하지만 실제 송금이 누구 쪽에서 먼저였는지는 따로 봐야 합니다.,"The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v3].text,저는 그 댁 사정을 숨겼습니다. 그 부분은 피하지 않겠습니다. 돈은 다른 축입니다.,"The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v4].text,숨김과 송금은 같은 말이 아닙니다. 제가 먼저 숨긴 건 인정합니다.,"The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v5].text,제 침묵이 먼저였습니다. 그래도 돈이 움직인 순서는 기록을 보고 말해야 합니다.,"The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v6].text,제가 원인을 만들었다고 볼 수 있습니다. 다만 실행까지 모두 제 쪽이라고 하면 다릅니다.,"The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v7].text,숨김은 제가 열었습니다. 그 뒤 돈의 움직임은 제 아내 쪽도 봐야 합니다.,"The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v8].text,"재판관님, 선후를 하나로 묶으면 틀어집니다. 제가 숨긴 것부터 말하겠습니다.","The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,한 박자 늦게 답하고 핵심 이유는 아직 접어 둔다.,Answer a beat late and keep the central reason folded away for now.,一拍置いて答え、核心の理由はまだ伏せておく。,慢一拍回答，核心理由暂时收起不说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v9].text,시작은 제 침묵이었습니다. 하지만 비밀 송금 실행은 따로 따져야 합니다.,"The concealment began with me, but the order of the money actions must be separated from that.",隠蔽は私から始まりました。ただし、金の実行順序はそれとは切り分ける必要があります。,隐瞒从我开始，但资金行动的顺序必须与此分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v1].text,"인정합니다. 숨김은 제가 먼저였고, 실제 비밀 송금 실행은 박지연 씨 쪽이 먼저였습니다.","I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v10].text,"숨김은 저, 첫 비밀 송금은 박지연 씨. 그 두 줄을 함께 적어야 맞습니다.","I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v2].text,제가 그 사실들을 숨기면서 먼저 불신을 만든 것은 맞습니다. 하지만 돈을 먼저 옮긴 것은 제 아내였습니다.,"I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v3].text,제 침묵이 출발점입니다. 그래도 송금의 선후는 박지연 씨 쪽이 먼저라고 분리해 말해야 합니다.,"I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v4].text,"저는 숨겼고, 제 아내는 돈을 먼저 움직였습니다. 어느 하나가 다른 하나를 지워 주진 않습니다.","I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v5].text,"재판관님, 제가 먼저 숨긴 사람입니다. 동시에 비밀 송금 실행은 아내 쪽이 먼저였습니다.","I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v6].text,아내를 탓하려는 게 아닙니다. 다만 기록상 숨김의 시작과 송금의 시작은 서로 다릅니다.,"I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v7].text,제 책임은 사실을 숨기고 침묵한 것입니다. 아내 쪽 책임은 먼저 돈을 움직인 실행입니다.,"I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v8].text,선후를 섞으면 서로 피해자라고만 말하게 됩니다. 저는 제 숨김부터 인정하겠습니다.,"I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추고 숨김의 이유와 책임을 함께 인정한다.,Stop evading and admit both the reason for the concealment and the responsibility.,回避をやめ、隠した理由と責任をあわせて認める。,停止回避，同时承认隐瞒的理由与责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v9].text,"제가 만든 불신이 아내를 밀었다고 해도, 돈을 실행한 순서는 따로 남습니다.","I admit concealment began with me, and the first secret transfer was Park Ji-yeon’s. Both lines must be recorded together.",隠蔽は私から始まり、最初の秘密送金はパク・ジヨンさんの側だったと認めます。両方の線をあわせて記録する必要があります。,我承认，隐瞒从我开始，第一次秘密转账是朴智妍那边。两条线必须一起记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].text,숨김은 제가 먼저 시작했습니다. 하지만 실제 비밀 송금 실행은 제 아내 쪽이 먼저였습니다.,"I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v10].text,둘 다 잘못했습니다. 다만 숨김의 시작과 돈 실행의 시작은 다릅니다.,"I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].text,제가 그 댁 사정을 숨긴 건 맞습니다. 돈을 옮기는 실행은 박지연 씨가 먼저 했습니다.,"I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"제 침묵이 먼저였고, 제 아내의 송금이 먼저 실행됐습니다. 그 둘은 분리해야 합니다.","I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"저는 말하지 않았고, 제 아내는 먼저 돈을 움직였습니다. 서로 다른 종류의 잘못입니다.","I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].text,숨김의 책임은 제게 있습니다. 그러나 실행의 첫 단추는 아내 쪽 송금이었습니다.,"I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v6].text,제가 먼저 비밀을 만들었습니다. 그래도 실제 송금 순서까지 제게만 묶으면 사실과 다릅니다.,"I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v7].text,돈 문제를 보면 아내 쪽 송금이 먼저였습니다. 제 숨김과 같은 축으로 보면 안 됩니다.,"I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v8].text,"저는 원인을 만들었고, 제 아내는 먼저 실행했습니다. 그 순서를 함께 적어야 합니다.","I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,큰 사실은 인정하되 책임의 무게를 조심스럽게 좁혀 말한다.,"Admit the major facts, while carefully narrowing the weight of responsibility.",大きな事実は認めつつ、責任の重みを慎重に絞って話す。,承认大的事实，但谨慎缩小责任的分量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v9].text,그 댁 사정을 숨긴 건 저입니다. 그런데 비밀 송금이 먼저 나간 건 제 아내 쪽입니다.,"I started the concealment, while my wife’s transfer came first in the actual money execution. The two lines must be separated.",隠蔽は私が始め、実際の金の実行では妻の送金が先でした。この二つの線は分けなければなりません。,隐瞒是我先开始的，而实际资金执行中妻子的转账更早。这两条线必须分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 더는 숨김과 단정을 분리하지 못하게 몰아붙인다. 자기에게 불리한 부분부터 말하게 만드는 단호한 톤이다.,"The Judge pushes so the concealment and assumption can no longer be separated. The tone is firm, making them speak first to the parts that hurt their own case.",裁判官が、隠蔽と断定をこれ以上切り離せないよう追い込む。自分に不利な部分から話させる、断固としたトーン。,法官逼迫其不能再把隐瞒与断定分开。语气坚决，促使其先说出对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 오피스텔에 있던 사람이 다른 관련자라는 사실을 더 늦출 수 없습니다. 그 자리에 누가 있었는지 지금 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the contradiction on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 더는 숨김과 단정을 분리하지 못하게 몰아붙인다. 자기에게 불리한 부분부터 말하게 만드는 단호한 톤이다.,"The Judge pushes so the concealment and assumption can no longer be separated. The tone is firm, making them speak first to the parts that hurt their own case.",裁判官が、隠蔽と断定をこれ以上切り離せないよう追い込む。自分に不利な部分から話させる、断固としたトーン。,法官逼迫其不能再把隐瞒与断定分开。语气坚决，促使其先说出对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라고 단정한 이유를 밝히지 않으면 그 뒤의 행동을 피해자 입장으로만 내세울 수 없습니다. 왜 그렇게 확신했습니까.","Ms. Park, the contradiction on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 더는 숨김과 단정을 분리하지 못하게 몰아붙인다. 자기에게 불리한 부분부터 말하게 만드는 단호한 톤이다.,"The Judge pushes so the concealment and assumption can no longer be separated. The tone is firm, making them speak first to the parts that hurt their own case.",裁判官が、隠蔽と断定をこれ以上切り離せないよう追い込む。自分に不利な部分から話させる、断固としたトーン。,法官逼迫其不能再把隐瞒与断定分开。语气坚决，促使其先说出对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v3].text,"두 분, 더는 정황 해석으로 돌릴 수 없습니다. 숨긴 사람은 무엇을 숨겼고 단정한 사람은 왜 단정했는지 바로 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, the contradiction on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,两位，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 그곳에 다녀온 사정이라고 하시더라도 박지연 씨를 배제한 책임은 남습니다. 그 책임을 인정하고 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the contradiction on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 그 숨긴 사정이 드러난 뒤에도 외도라는 단정을 붙잡은 이유를 지금 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, the contradiction on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 덧붙은 해석을 직접 가른다. 더는 막연한 말로 넘기지 못하게 압박하는 단계다.,The Judge directly separates the missing explanation from the added interpretation. This stage presses them so vague wording can no longer carry the answer.,裁判官が抜けた説明と付け加えられた解釈を直接切り分ける。これ以上曖昧な言葉で逃げられないよう圧迫する段階。,法官直接区分缺失的说明与附加的解读。这一阶段施压，使其不能再用含糊说法带过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그곳에 다녀온 사정이라고 하려면 왜 그 가족 이야기를 끝까지 숨겼는지까지 함께 답하셔야 합니다. 숨긴 이유를 비워두지 마십시오.","Mr. Lee, your statements on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,李俊浩先生，您关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 덧붙은 해석을 직접 가른다. 더는 막연한 말로 넘기지 못하게 압박하는 단계다.,The Judge directly separates the missing explanation from the added interpretation. This stage presses them so vague wording can no longer carry the answer.,裁判官が抜けた説明と付け加えられた解釈を直接切り分ける。これ以上曖昧な言葉で逃げられないよう圧迫する段階。,法官直接区分缺失的说明与附加的解读。这一阶段施压，使其不能再用含糊说法带过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 정황 해석만으로 외도라고 확신했다면 그 근거와 행동을 함께 설명해야 합니다.","Ms. Park, your statements on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,朴智妍女士，您关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 덧붙은 해석을 직접 가른다. 더는 막연한 말로 넘기지 못하게 압박하는 단계다.,The Judge directly separates the missing explanation from the added interpretation. This stage presses them so vague wording can no longer carry the answer.,裁判官が抜けた説明と付け加えられた解釈を直接切り分ける。これ以上曖昧な言葉で逃げられないよう圧迫する段階。,法官直接区分缺失的说明与附加的解读。这一阶段施压，使其不能再用含糊说法带过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v3].text,"두 분, 숨김과 단정이 서로를 키웠다는 말만으로는 부족합니다. 누가 어떤 사실을 먼저 빼놓았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, your statements on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,两位，您关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 다른 관련자 이야기를 나중에 붙인 것처럼 보이지 않으려면 처음 침묵한 이유를 지금 밝혀야 합니다.","Mr. Lee, your statements on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,李俊浩先生，您关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 정황을 본 것과 외도라고 단정한 것은 다릅니다. 왜 그렇게 확신하고 밀어붙였습니까.","Ms. Park, your statements on the Officetel visits and early-morning calls no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,朴智妍女士，您关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 당사자가 스스로 정리해 말할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the words changed. The tone leaves room for the party to organize and speak for themselves.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。当事者が自分で整理して話す余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出措辞质感发生变化之处。语气保留当事人自行整理并说明的空间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 처음에는 오피스텔 방문을 생활 동선처럼 말씀하셨는데 지금은 다른 사정이었다고 말씀이 달라졌습니다. 그 사이를 차분히 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, your earlier and current accounts of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,李俊浩先生，您先前与现在关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 당사자가 스스로 정리해 말할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the words changed. The tone leaves room for the party to organize and speak for themselves.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。当事者が自分で整理して話す余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出措辞质感发生变化之处。语气保留当事人自行整理并说明的空间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 처음에는 외도라고 단정한 주장이었는데 지금은 정황을 그렇게 받아들였다는 의견으로 낮아졌습니다. 왜 판단이 달라졌습니까.","Ms. Park, your earlier and current accounts of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,朴智妍女士，您先前与现在关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 당사자가 스스로 정리해 말할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the words changed. The tone leaves room for the party to organize and speak for themselves.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。当事者が自分で整理して話す余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出措辞质感发生变化之处。语气保留当事人自行整理并说明的空间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v3].text,"두 분, 한쪽은 그곳에 다녀온 사정이라고 말하고 다른 한쪽은 외도 정황이라고 읽고 있습니다. 같은 자료를 왜 다르게 보게 됐는지 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, your earlier and current accounts of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，您先前与现在关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 통화와 오피스텔 방문을 따로 말하다가 이제는 형 사정과 한 흐름으로 묶고 있습니다. 빠진 부분을 밝혀 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, your earlier and current accounts of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,李俊浩先生，您先前与现在关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 처음 확신했던 표현이 지금은 확인 부족을 인정하는 방향으로 낮아졌습니다. 그 변화를 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, your earlier and current accounts of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,朴智妍女士，您先前与现在关于韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 용도와 열람 경로를 동시에 못 박는다. 더 미루면 안 된다는 신호를 강하게 주는 질문이다.,The Judge pins down both use and access route at the same time. The question strongly signals that it cannot be delayed any further.,裁判官が用途と閲覧経路を同時に釘付けにする。これ以上先送りできないという強い信号を出す質問。,法官同时钉住用途与阅览路径。这是强烈传达不能再拖延的提问。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 현금 출금의 목적을 계속 늦추고 있습니다. 누구에게 왜 전달했는지 지금 명확히 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the contradiction on the large withdrawal from the husband's account can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 용도와 열람 경로를 동시에 못 박는다. 더 미루면 안 된다는 신호를 강하게 주는 질문이다.,The Judge pins down both use and access route at the same time. The question strongly signals that it cannot be delayed any further.,裁判官が用途と閲覧経路を同時に釘付けにする。これ以上先送りできないという強い信号を出す質問。,法官同时钉住用途与阅览路径。这是强烈传达不能再拖延的提问。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 출금을 어떻게 알았는지를 밝히지 않으면 이 쟁점을 내세울 수 없습니다. 확인 경위를 숨기지 마십시오.","Ms. Park, the contradiction on the large withdrawal from the husband's account can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 용도와 열람 경로를 동시에 못 박는다. 더 미루면 안 된다는 신호를 강하게 주는 질문이다.,The Judge pins down both use and access route at the same time. The question strongly signals that it cannot be delayed any further.,裁判官が用途と閲覧経路を同時に釘付けにする。これ以上先送りできないという強い信号を出す質問。,法官同时钉住用途与阅览路径。这是强烈传达不能再拖延的提问。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v3].text,"두 분, 돈의 사용처와 확인 경위를 모두 빼놓은 채 상대 탓만 할 수는 없습니다. 각자 한 일을 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, the contradiction on the large withdrawal from the husband's account can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,两位，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 그 현금이 누구에게 어떤 사정으로 건너갔는지까지 지금 말씀해 주십시오. 이제 답하실 차례입니다.","Mr. Lee, the contradiction on the large withdrawal from the husband's account can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 출금만 말하면서 본인의 선제 행동을 가릴 수 없습니다. 관련 행동을 지금 밝히십시오.","Ms. Park, the contradiction on the large withdrawal from the husband's account can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,"재판관이 개인 돈, 가족 돈, 감시 경로라는 빠진 축을 하나씩 꺼내 놓는다. 회피를 줄이는 추궁 톤이다.","The Judge lays out the missing axes one by one: personal money, family money, and the monitoring route. The tone presses to reduce evasion.",裁判官が、個人の金、家族の金、監視経路という抜けた軸を一つずつ出す。回避を減らす追及のトーン。,法官逐一拿出缺失的轴线：个人的钱、家里的钱、监视路径。是减少回避的追问语气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 돈처럼 말한 뒤 집안 쪽으로 간 돈이라고 바꾸셨다면 그 사이를 비워둘 수 없습니다. 누구에게 왜 갔는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, your statements on the large withdrawal from the husband's account no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,李俊浩先生，您关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,"재판관이 개인 돈, 가족 돈, 감시 경로라는 빠진 축을 하나씩 꺼내 놓는다. 회피를 줄이는 추궁 톤이다.","The Judge lays out the missing axes one by one: personal money, family money, and the monitoring route. The tone presses to reduce evasion.",裁判官が、個人の金、家族の金、監視経路という抜けた軸を一つずつ出す。回避を減らす追及のトーン。,法官逐一拿出缺失的轴线：个人的钱、家里的钱、监视路径。是减少回避的追问语气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 한 번 본 것과 계속 들여다본 것은 다릅니다. 어느 수준까지 확인했는지 숨기지 마십시오.","Ms. Park, your statements on the large withdrawal from the husband's account no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,朴智妍女士，您关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,"재판관이 개인 돈, 가족 돈, 감시 경로라는 빠진 축을 하나씩 꺼내 놓는다. 회피를 줄이는 추궁 톤이다.","The Judge lays out the missing axes one by one: personal money, family money, and the monitoring route. The tone presses to reduce evasion.",裁判官が、個人の金、家族の金、監視経路という抜けた軸を一つずつ出す。回避を減らす追及のトーン。,法官逐一拿出缺失的轴线：个人的钱、家里的钱、监视路径。是减少回避的追问语气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v3].text,"두 분, 개인 비자금이라는 말과 부부 사이 신뢰 문제를 섞으면 책임이 흐려집니다. 각각의 행동을 따로 답하십시오.","Both of you, your statements on the large withdrawal from the husband's account no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,两位，您关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 집안 사정을 도운 것이라면 더더욱 현금으로 숨겨 처리한 이유가 필요합니다. 그 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, your statements on the large withdrawal from the husband's account no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,李俊浩先生，您关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 이 출금을 문제 삼으려면 본인이 그 기록을 어떻게 알았는지도 함께 밝혀야 합니다.","Ms. Park, your statements on the large withdrawal from the husband's account no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,朴智妍女士，您关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 돈의 이유와 돈을 본 경로가 함께 달라진 점을 차분히 짚는다.,The Judge calmly points out that both the reason for the money and the route by which it was seen have changed.,裁判官が、金の理由と金を見た経路がともに変わった点を落ち着いて指摘する。,法官冷静指出，资金理由与看到资金的路径都发生了变化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 처음에는 개인 돈의 출금처럼 말씀하셨는데 지금은 그쪽으로 전달한 돈이라고 하십니다. 빠진 설명을 차분히 이어 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, your earlier and current accounts of the large withdrawal from the husband's account differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,李俊浩先生，您先前与现在关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 돈의 이유와 돈을 본 경로가 함께 달라진 점을 차분히 짚는다.,The Judge calmly points out that both the reason for the money and the route by which it was seen have changed.,裁判官が、金の理由と金を見た経路がともに変わった点を落ち着いて指摘する。,法官冷静指出，资金理由与看到资金的路径都发生了变化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 출금을 우연히 본 일처럼 말하다가 반복 확인의 흐름이 함께 드러나고 있습니다. 어느 지점부터 계속 보셨습니까.","Ms. Park, your earlier and current accounts of the large withdrawal from the husband's account differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,朴智妍女士，您先前与现在关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 돈의 이유와 돈을 본 경로가 함께 달라진 점을 차분히 짚는다.,The Judge calmly points out that both the reason for the money and the route by which it was seen have changed.,裁判官が、金の理由と金を見た経路がともに変わった点を落ち着いて指摘する。,法官冷静指出，资金理由与看到资金的路径都发生了变化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v3].text,"두 분, 돈이 빠진 사실과 그 돈을 해석한 방식이 서로 다르게 움직였습니다. 먼저 사실관계부터 맞춰 주십시오.","Both of you, your earlier and current accounts of the large withdrawal from the husband's account differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，您先前与现在关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 현금 출금의 목적을 늦게 말한 이유가 그쪽 사정 때문인지, 박지연 씨 반응이 두려워서인지 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, your earlier and current accounts of the large withdrawal from the husband's account differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,李俊浩先生，您先前与现在关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 출금을 봤다는 사실과 그 뒤 더 확인한 행동은 다릅니다. 본인이 한 확인 범위를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, your earlier and current accounts of the large withdrawal from the husband's account differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,朴智妍女士，您先前与现在关于丈夫名下账户的大额取款的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v1].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 서류에 이준호 씨 이름을 쓴 사실을 인정하면서도 책임을 낮추고 있습니다. 왜 그 행동을 실행했습니까.","Ms. Park, the contradiction on the joint savings cancellation procedure can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きをめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v2].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 공동 적금이 어디로 어떻게 흘러갔는지, 그리고 그 결과까지 본인이 숨긴 부분을 지금 답하십시오. 이준호 씨 탓으로 돌리지 마십시오.","Ms. Park, the contradiction on the joint savings cancellation procedure can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きをめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v3].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 서류 조작이 확인된 지금 본인 동의가 없었다는 점을 명확히 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the contradiction on the joint savings cancellation procedure can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きをめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,李俊浩先生，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v4].text,"두 분, 숨김과 위법 소지가 있는 행위는 무게가 다릅니다. 해지 절차 문제의 책임을 다른 쟁점 뒤로 돌리지 마십시오.","Both of you, the contradiction on the joint savings cancellation procedure can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きをめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,两位，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|hard].variants[judgec-h-d3-hard-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 두려웠다는 말만으로 해지 절차 문제를 설명할 수 없습니다. 왜 그 선까지 넘어가는 행동을 했습니까.","Ms. Park, the contradiction on the joint savings cancellation procedure can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きをめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v1].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 이미 배신당한 사람이라는 위치가 서류를 꾸민 행동까지 덮어주지는 않습니다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Park, your statements on the joint savings cancellation procedure no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きに関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,朴智妍女士，您关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v2].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨가 먼저 숨겼다는 설명에서 본인이 직접 실행했다는 인정으로 옮겨왔습니다. 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, your statements on the joint savings cancellation procedure no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きに関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,朴智妍女士，您关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v3].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 동의가 없었다면 그 사실을 언제 어떻게 확인했는지 명확히 말해야 합니다.","Mr. Lee, your statements on the joint savings cancellation procedure no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きに関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,李俊浩先生，您关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v4].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v4].text,"두 분, 이준호 씨의 침묵이 박지연 씨의 해지 절차 문제를 정당화하지는 않습니다. 각자의 책임을 따로 답하십시오.","Both of you, your statements on the joint savings cancellation procedure no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きに関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,两位，您关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v5].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|mid].variants[judgec-h-d3-mid-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 이혼 대비였다는 생각이 있었다면 왜 정상 절차가 아니라 서명을 대신하는 방식으로 갔습니까.","Ms. Park, your statements on the joint savings cancellation procedure no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きに関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,朴智妍女士，您关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v1].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 처음에는 적금을 지키려 한 절차라고 하셨지만 지금은 이준호 씨 서명을 대신한 사실이 드러났습니다. 본래 사실을 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, your earlier and current accounts of the joint savings cancellation procedure differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,朴智妍女士，您先前与现在关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v2].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 단순한 방어였다는 설명에서 서류를 꾸민 행동을 인정하는 방향으로 넘어왔습니다. 판단이 달라진 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, your earlier and current accounts of the joint savings cancellation procedure differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,朴智妍女士，您先前与现在关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v3].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨가 서류를 준비한 사실을 알게 된 시점과 본인 동의가 없었다는 점을 구분해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, your earlier and current accounts of the joint savings cancellation procedure differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,李俊浩先生，您先前与现在关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v4].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v4].text,"두 분, 외도 의심과 적금 해지 절차 문제는 같은 감정에서 시작됐더라도 다른 행동입니다. 이 차이를 먼저 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, your earlier and current accounts of the joint savings cancellation procedure differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，您先前与现在关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v5].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d3|soft].variants[judgec-h-d3-soft-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 피해를 막으려 했다는 입장과 이준호 씨 이름을 서류에 쓴 행동이 함께 있습니다. 그 사이를 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, your earlier and current accounts of the joint savings cancellation procedure differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,朴智妍女士，您先前与现在关于共同储蓄账户解约程序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v1].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v1].text,두 분 모두 자기 책임을 분리하려 하고 있습니다. 숨김과 실행은 다른 축입니다. 누가 먼저 왜 그렇게 행동했는지 답하십시오.,"Both of you, the contradiction on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,两位，围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v2].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 침묵이 있었다 해도 해지 절차 문제는 본인의 행위입니다. 더 돌리지 말고 인정하십시오.","Ms. Park, the contradiction on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,朴智妍女士，围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v3].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 위법 소지가 드러났다 해도 그 개인적인 일을 먼저 숨긴 사실은 사라지지 않습니다. 인정하고 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the contradiction on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,李俊浩先生，围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v4].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v4].text,"두 분, 두 큰돈이 사라진 책임을 상대 쪽 순서만으로 덮을 수 없습니다. 각자의 실행을 지금 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, the contradiction on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,两位，围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v5].behaviorHint,회피를 멈추게 하고 불리한 부분까지 바로 답하게 한다.,Stop the evasion and make them answer even the unfavorable parts directly.,回避を止めさせ、不利な部分までただちに答えさせる。,让其停止回避，并立即回答不利部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|hard].variants[judgec-h-d4-hard-v5].text,"두 분, 순서를 밝히지 않으면 책임 판단도 없습니다. 숨김, 출금, 해지, 손실을 각각 답하십시오.","Both of you, the contradiction on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation can no longer be deferred. Answer directly and take responsibility for the part that hurts your position.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序をめぐる矛盾は、これ以上先送りできません。不利な部分の責任も含め、直接答えてください。,两位，围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的矛盾不能再拖延。请直接回答，并承担对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v1].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v1].text,"두 분, 숨김이 시작된 때와 돈이 실제로 움직인 때를 섞으면 책임이 흐려집니다. 각자 어느 축에서 먼저였는지 밝히십시오.","Both of you, your statements on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,两位，您关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v2].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 먼저 배신당했다는 감정이 해지 절차 문제의 책임을 없애지는 못합니다. 왜 두 문제를 하나로 묶으셨습니까.","Ms. Park, your statements on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,朴智妍女士，您关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v3].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 조작을 말하기 전에 본인이 먼저 만든 침묵의 책임도 함께 말해야 합니다.","Mr. Lee, your statements on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,李俊浩先生，您关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v4].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v4].text,"두 분, 상대의 잘못을 앞세워 본인의 행동 순서를 뒤로 미루고 있습니다. 실제 날짜와 행위를 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, your statements on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,两位，您关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v5].behaviorHint,달라진 입장과 누락된 이유를 분명히 맞대게 한다.,Make the changed position and the omitted reason confront each other clearly.,変わった立場と抜け落ちた理由を明確に突き合わせる。,让变化的立场与遗漏的理由明确对照。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|mid].variants[judgec-h-d4-mid-v5].text,"두 분, 누가 먼저 피해자인지보다 누가 먼저 무엇을 실행했는지가 중요합니다. 그 순서를 밝혀 주십시오.","Both of you, your statements on the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation no longer line up. Separate the missing facts from the interpretation and answer plainly.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序に関する陳述が前後で合っていません。抜けた事実と解釈を切り分け、端的に答えてください。,两位，您关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的陈述已经前后不合。请分开缺失的事实与解读，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v1].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v1].text,"두 분, 처음에는 서로 상대가 먼저였다고 했지만 지금은 숨김과 실행의 기준이 나뉩니다. 두 순서를 따로 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, your earlier and current accounts of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，您先前与现在关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v2].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨가 먼저 숨겼다는 말과 실제 서류 실행은 본인이 했다는 사실이 함께 있습니다. 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Park, your earlier and current accounts of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,朴智妍女士，您先前与现在关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v3].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 서류 조작과 별개로 본인이 먼저 그 개인적인 일을 숨긴 부분을 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, your earlier and current accounts of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,李俊浩先生，您先前与现在关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v4].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v4].text,"두 분, 먼저 상처받았다는 감정과 먼저 돈을 움직인 행동이 서로 다릅니다. 그 차이를 인정하고 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, your earlier and current accounts of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，您先前与现在关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v5].behaviorHint,진술 변화를 차분히 짚고 스스로 바로잡을 여지를 둔다.,Calmly point out the change in statement and leave room for self-correction.,陳述の変化を落ち着いて指摘し、自ら修正する余地を残す。,冷静指出陈述变化，并留下自行纠正的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[h-d4|soft].variants[judgec-h-d4-soft-v5].text,"두 분, 부부 합산 손실을 말하기 전에 각 돈이 어느 경로로 사라졌는지부터 차분히 맞춰 주십시오.","Both of you, your earlier and current accounts of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation differ. Please organize the gap calmly before we proceed.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、以前の説明と現在の説明に差があります。先へ進む前に、その間を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，您先前与现在关于隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序的说法存在差异。继续之前，请冷静整理其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v1].text,"이준호 씨, GPS와 발신자 미상 문자가 한 사실을 가리키고 있습니다. 그 오피스텔에 누가 있었는지 지금 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Officetel Entry Logs directly point to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル出入記録はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，韩式商住公寓出入记录直接指向韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 좌표와 문자 내용이 다른 관련자 방향으로 맞물립니다. 외도인지 그곳에 갔다는 설명인지 더 미루지 말고 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"이준호 씨, GPS 좌표와 발신자 미상 문자 앞에서는 장소만 말하고 사람을 빼둘 수 없습니다. 그 자리에 누가 있었는지 밝히십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 오피스텔 기록과 발신자 미상 문자가 동시에 놓였습니다. 숨긴 사람의 정체를 지금 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, Officetel Entry Logs directly point to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル出入記録はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，韩式商住公寓出入记录直接指向韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 두 자료가 같은 밤 한 자리를 가리킵니다. 그 안의 사정을 지금 인정해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"이준호 씨, GPS 좌표와 발신자 미상 문자 시각이 맞물립니다. 더는 가족 이야기를 빼두고 오피스텔 방문을 말할 수 없습니다.","Mr. Lee, Officetel Entry Logs narrow the issue to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル出入記録によって争点はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，韩式商住公寓出入记录把问题缩小到韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 차가 간 곳과 문자 속 그 개인적인 일정이 같은 생활권을 가리킵니다. 그곳에 있던 사람을 더 미룰 수 없습니다.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 오피스텔 기록만 따로 말하면 외도 의심이 남고, 발신자 미상 문자까지 보면 돌본 사람이 드러납니다. 이제 연결해서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, Officetel Entry Logs narrow the issue to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル出入記録によって争点はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，韩式商住公寓出入记录把问题缩小到韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"이준호 씨, GPS의 같은 주소와 발신자 미상 문자의 같은 시간대 앞에서 단순한 방문이라고만 할 수 없습니다. 누구를 위해 간 것인지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"이준호 씨, GPS 기록과 발신자 미상 문자는 오피스텔에 숨긴 생활이 있었음을 보여줍니다. 그 생활이 누구의 것이었는지 밝혀야 합니다.","Mr. Lee, Officetel Entry Logs narrow the issue to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル出入記録によって争点はオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，韩式商住公寓出入记录把问题缩小到韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v1].text,"이준호 씨, GPS 좌표와 발신자 미상 문자 내용을 함께 놓고 보겠습니다. 같은 시간대에 같은 오피스텔을 가리키는 만큼 그 안에 누가 있었는지 차분히 들려주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Officetel Entry Logs together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル出入記録を一緒に確認します。それがオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看韩式商住公寓出入记录。请冷静说明它们与韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"이준호 씨, GPS가 찍은 정차 주소와 발신자 미상 문자가 한 장소로 모입니다. 그날 그곳에서 누구를 챙기고 있었습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それがオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 방문 기록은 오피스텔을 가리키고 문자는 다른 관련자의 생활을 가리킵니다. 두 자료가 만나는 장면을 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Officetel Entry Logs together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル出入記録を一緒に確認します。それがオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看韩式商住公寓出入记录。请冷静说明它们与韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 좌표만 보면 외도처럼 보이지만 문자까지 열어 보면 다른 사람이 보입니다. 그 사람이 누구였는지 들려주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それがオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 오피스텔 출입 기록과 발신자 미상 문자를 나란히 보니 장소와 사람이 함께 좁혀집니다. 그렇게 이어진 정황을 처음부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Officetel Entry Logs together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the hidden family circumstances behind the Officetel visits and calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル出入記録を一緒に確認します。それがオフィステル訪問と通話の背後にあった家族事情とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看韩式商住公寓出入记录。请冷静说明它们与韩式商住公寓探访与通话背后的家人情况有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 통화기록과 발신자 미상 문자가 숨긴 사정을 직접 가리키고 있습니다. 집안 갈등을 이유로 무엇을 숨겼는지 지금 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Call Logs directly point to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れを直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，通话记录直接指向婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 전화의 상대와 문자 속 형 사정이 맞물렸습니다. 외도 의심을 부른 침묵의 책임을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れを直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 통화기록과 발신자 미상 문자 앞에서 그곳에 갔다는 설명이라고 하려면 그 가족을 왜 숨겼는지까지 밝혀야 합니다. 바로 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Call Logs directly point to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れを直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，通话记录直接指向婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 통화와 문자 앞에서 더 이상 모호하게 말할 수 없습니다. 형 사정을 숨긴 이유를 인정하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れを直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 새벽 통화기록이 놓인 지금 시댁 이야기가 두려웠다는 말만으로 은폐가 사라지지 않습니다. 무엇을 두려워했는지 지금 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, Call Logs directly point to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れを直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，通话记录直接指向婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 통화와 발신자 미상 문자가 같은 가족 문제를 가리킵니다. 가족 안의 갈등이 두려웠다는 이유로 계속 숨긴 부분을 말해야 합니다.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れへ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 통화 상대와 문자 내용이 집안 사정으로 모입니다. 더는 단순 연락이라고만 정리할 수 없습니다.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れへ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 통화기록의 새벽 연락이 발신자 미상 문자의 급한 사정과 맞물린다면 박지연 씨에게 감춘 이유가 핵심입니다. 그 이유를 밝히십시오.","Mr. Lee, Call Logs narrow the issue to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録によって争点は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れへ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，通话记录把问题缩小到婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 통화기록 앞에서 외도는 아니었다는 말만으로는 부족합니다. 왜 가족 이야기를 빼두셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, Call Logs narrow the issue to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録によって争点は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れへ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，通话记录把问题缩小到婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 통화기록과 발신자 미상 문자는 숨김의 이유가 가족 안의 갈등과 연결됐음을 보입니다. 두려웠다는 말이 설명을 대신할 수는 없습니다.","Mr. Lee, Call Logs narrow the issue to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録によって争点は義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れへ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，通话记录把问题缩小到婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 통화기록과 발신자 미상 문자를 함께 보겠습니다. 급한 연락이 외도보다 다른 사정에 가까웠다면 왜 그 말을 삼켰는지 들려주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Call Logs together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録を一緒に確認します。それが義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れとどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看通话记录。请冷静说明它们与婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 같은 번호의 새벽 통화와 다른 관련자 쪽 문자 내용이 맞닿아 있습니다. 시댁 이야기가 나오면 싸움이 커질까 두려웠던 흐름을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それが義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れとどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 통화 시간은 급한 연락을 보이고 문자는 그쪽 생활의 사정을 보입니다. 이 둘을 집에서 말하지 못한 이유가 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それが義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れとどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽 통화기록만 보면 의심스럽지만 발신자 미상 문자까지 보면 가족 문제가 보입니다. 그럼에도 박지연 씨에게 말하지 못한 마음을 들려주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Call Logs together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録を一緒に確認します。それが義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れとどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看通话记录。请冷静说明它们与婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 통화기록과 발신자 미상 문자를 나란히 놓으면 외도보다 가족 안의 갈등 공포가 먼저 보입니다. 그 공포가 어느 정도였습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Call Logs together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the in-laws conflict and the fear that led to concealment.",イ・ジュノさん、通話記録を一緒に確認します。それが義実家との葛藤と隠蔽につながった恐れとどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看通话记录。请冷静说明它们与婆家矛盾以及导致隐瞒的恐惧有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역이 같은 돈의 흐름을 가리킵니다. 그 돈이 누구에게 왜 갔는지 지금 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records directly point to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录直接指向共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역이 숨긴 사정을 보인다 해도 배우자 몰래 큰돈을 움직인 사실은 남습니다. 그 권한을 어떻게 보셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records directly point to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录直接指向共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 비자금이라는 말만으로 절차 위반을 덮을 수 없습니다. 현금 출금의 목적을 밝히십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역 앞에서 별도 사용처로 간 돈이라는 사실과 숨긴 책임을 분리하지 말고 함께 인정하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records directly point to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录直接指向共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 개인 계좌 출금 앞에서 더는 개인 돈이라는 말로 비켜갈 수 없습니다. 돈의 행선지를 바로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 기록이 가족 쪽 돈 흐름을 보입니다. 그렇다고 배우자에게 숨긴 권한 문제가 사라지는 것은 아닙니다.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 계좌에서 현금이 빠진 사실과 집안 사정이 연결됩니다. 이제 개인 돈이라는 말 뒤에 숨을 수 없습니다.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 집안 사정을 도운 것이라면 돈의 성격을 더 명확히 말해야 합니다. 공동 적금 의심과 섞이지 않게 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 문자와 출금이 맞물린 만큼 그 사정을 말하지 않은 책임도 함께 드러났습니다. 그 책임을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 개인 계좌 출금은 돈을 혼자 판단한 과정을 보여줍니다. 박지연 씨를 배제한 이유를 더 미룰 수 없습니다.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 개인 계좌 출금 내역을 함께 보겠습니다. 별도 사용처로 돈이 갔다는 흐름과 공동 적금 권한 문제를 어떻게 구분하셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Withdrawal Records together. Please calmly explain how they relate to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴を一緒に確認します。それが共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看取款记录。请冷静说明它们与共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 가족 쪽 사정이 드러난 문자와 큰돈 출금 기록이 맞물립니다. 그 돈이 개인 비자금이라는 점을 언제 어떻게 밝히려 했습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それが共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자에 보이는 숨긴 사정과 개인 계좌 출금은 부부가 함께 쌓은 돈의 권한 문제와 성격이 다릅니다. 이 차이를 왜 설명하지 못했습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それが共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 문자에는 가족 쪽 사정이 있고 출금 내역에는 현금 이동이 있습니다. 그렇게 이어진 정황이 공동 적금 해지 의심과 어떻게 엉켰는지 들려주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Withdrawal Records together. Please calmly explain how they relate to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴を一緒に確認します。それが共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看取款记录。请冷静说明它们与共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역을 보면 가족 쪽 급한 사정은 보이지만 큰돈을 혼자 움직인 문제도 남습니다. 그 경계를 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Withdrawal Records together. Please calmly explain how they relate to authority over the joint savings and the lack of spouse consent.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴を一緒に確認します。それが共同積立預金に対する権限と配偶者同意の欠如とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看取款记录。请冷静说明它们与共同储蓄账户的权限以及缺少配偶同意有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역이 숨긴 사정이라고 보여도 박지연 씨를 배제한 책임은 사라지지 않습니다. 왜 혼자 결정했는지 지금 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records directly point to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录直接指向未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역이 본인의 결정을 보여줍니다. 선의와 절차 위반을 분리해 인정하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records directly point to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录直接指向未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 개인 출금 앞에서 배우자 몰래 큰돈을 움직인 사실을 더는 가족 쪽 사정만으로 말할 수 없습니다. 본인 판단을 밝히십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역이 놓인 지금 그 일을 돕는다는 이유로 부부 사이 동의를 건너뛴 부분을 말해야 합니다.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records directly point to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录直接指向未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 기록은 본인이 알고 움직였다는 방향으로 모입니다. 책임을 낮추지 말고 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역은 집안 사정을 도운 흐름을 보이지만 배우자를 배제한 선택까지 설명하지는 못합니다. 그 부분을 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records narrow the issue to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴によって争点は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录把问题缩小到未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 문자와 출금 기록이 자금 처리 흐름을 뒷받침합니다. 그래서 더더욱 왜 혼자 처리했는지가 문제입니다.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역 앞에서 선의였다는 말만 반복하면 권한 문제는 남습니다. 박지연 씨에게 말하지 않은 이유를 밝히십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records narrow the issue to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴によって争点は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录把问题缩小到未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 기록이 숨긴 일을 보여도 부부 돈의 신뢰를 깬 것은 다른 문제입니다. 그 차이를 인정하고 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역이 집안 쪽으로 이어진 흐름을 보이는 만큼 숨김의 의도도 더 선명해졌습니다. 책임을 피해 가지 마십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records narrow the issue to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴によって争点は同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录把问题缩小到未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역을 함께 놓으면 숨긴 돈 흐름은 보입니다. 다만 박지연 씨를 배제한 책임을 어떻게 보시는지 들려주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Withdrawal Records together. Please calmly explain how they relate to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴を一緒に確認します。それが同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看取款记录。请冷静说明它们与未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 그쪽 사정과 현금 출금이 맞물리는 만큼 선의의 이유도 보입니다. 그럼에도 배우자에게 말하지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それが同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 출금 내역이 숨긴 돈 흐름을 보여도 부부 사이 큰돈 문제는 따로 남습니다. 그 선을 어디서 그으셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Withdrawal Records together. Please calmly explain how they relate to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴を一緒に確認します。それが同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看取款记录。请冷静说明它们与未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 문자 속 가족 쪽 사정과 출금 기록이 이어집니다. 그 순간 박지연 씨와 상의해야 한다는 생각은 없었습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それが同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 발신자 미상 문자와 현금 출금이 급한 사정을 챙기려는 마음을 보여준다면 그 마음이 왜 숨기는 방식으로 나갔는지 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at the submitted evidence together. Please calmly explain how they relate to responsibility for disposing of the joint savings without consent.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠を一緒に確認します。それが同意なく共同積立預金を処分した責任とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看提交的证据。请冷静说明它们与未经同意处分共同储蓄账户的责任有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q1-hard-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록이 본인의 실행을 가리키고 있습니다. 왜 먼저 돈을 움직였는지 지금 답하십시오.","Ms. Park, Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram directly point to the motive for moving ₩20M before confirming the truth. Answer without evasion.","パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramは真実を確認する前に2,000万ウォンを動かした動機を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。",朴智妍女士，转账记录、投资群Telegram直接指向在确认真相前先移动2000万韩元的动机。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
