,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q1-soft-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 남의 출금을 의심하던 흐름과 본인의 송금 기록이 함께 보입니다. 그 사이의 마음을 정리해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, let us look at Transfer Records together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the motive for moving ₩20M before confirming the truth.","パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録を一緒に確認します。それが真実を確認する前に2,000万ウォンを動かした動機とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。",朴智妍女士，我们一起看转账记录。请冷静说明它们与在确认真相前先移动2000万韩元的动机有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q1-soft-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록을 보면 두려움이 실제 돈 이동으로 바뀐 순간이 있습니다. 그 순간을 들려주십시오.","Ms. Park, let us look at Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the motive for moving ₩20M before confirming the truth.","パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それが真実を確認する前に2,000万ウォンを動かした動機とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。",朴智妍女士，我们一起看转账记录、投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与在确认真相前先移动2000万韩元的动机有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-hard-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록이 손실까지 이어진 본인 행동을 가리킵니다. 왜 숨겼는지 지금 답하십시오.","Ms. Park, Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram directly point to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed. Answer without evasion.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramは投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,朴智妍女士，转账记录、投资群Telegram直接指向投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-hard-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 손실을 감추고 이준호 씨의 출금만 문제 삼은 책임을 송금 기록 앞에서 인정해야 합니다. 바로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram directly point to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed. Answer without evasion.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramは投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,朴智妍女士，转账记录、投资群Telegram直接指向投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
