,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-mid-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록은 손실을 숨긴 시간이 있었다는 점까지 보여줍니다. 수치심만으로 설명할 수 없습니다.","Ms. Park, Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram narrow the issue to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed. Please explain the point clearly.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramによって争点は投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,朴智妍女士，转账记录、投资群Telegram把问题缩小到投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
