,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-mid-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 송금 기록이 남아 있는데도 이준호 씨의 출금만 앞세웠습니다. 본인의 손실을 왜 빼두셨습니까.","Ms. Park, Transfer Records narrow the issue to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed. Please explain the point clearly.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録によって争点は投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,朴智妍女士，转账记录把问题缩小到投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
