,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-mid-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록은 수치심 뒤에 감춘 돈의 흐름을 보여줍니다. 더는 감정만 말할 수 없습니다.","Ms. Park, Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram narrow the issue to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed. Please explain the point clearly.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramによって争点は投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,朴智妍女士，转账记录、投资群Telegram把问题缩小到投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록은 실행 뒤 손실까지 이어진 흐름을 보여줍니다. 그 사실을 숨긴 이유가 수치심이었는지 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, let us look at Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それが投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看转账记录、投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록이 나빠진 결과까지 이어졌을 때 이준호 씨에게 말하지 못한 마음을 차분히 들려주십시오.","Ms. Park, let us look at Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それが投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看转账记录、投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 대화가 계속 이어진 흔적과 송금 기록을 함께 보면 혼자 감당하려 한 시간이 보입니다. 왜 숨기셨습니까.","Ms. Park, let us look at Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それが投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看转账记录、投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록 앞에서 손실을 인정하기 어려웠던 마음과 피해자 위치에 서려는 마음이 함께 있었습니까.","Ms. Park, let us look at Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それが投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看转账记录、投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q2|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4-a-q2-soft-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 텔레그램과 송금 기록을 보면서 수치심과 두려움 중 어느 마음이 더 크게 남았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, let us look at Transfer Records and Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to the investment chat transfer, the loss, and the shame that followed.",パク・ジヨンさん、送金記録、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それが投資チャットへの送金、その損失、その後の羞恥心とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看转账记录、投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与投资群转账、损失以及随后的羞耻有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류가 본인의 실행을 가리키고 있습니다. 이준호 씨가 먼저 숨겼다는 말 뒤로 물러서지 마십시오.","Ms. Park, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers directly point to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows. Answer without evasion.",パク・ジヨンさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類はパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,朴智妍女士，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件直接指向朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 실제 송금과 해지 서류 절차 문제는 본인 행위입니다. 세 자료 앞에서 그 순서를 지금 인정하십시오.","Ms. Park, Joint Savings Cancellation Papers directly point to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows. Answer without evasion.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約書類はパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,朴智妍女士，共同储蓄账户解约文件直接指向朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류가 보여주는 두 큰돈의 순서는 감정이 아니라 기록으로 정해집니다. 본인이 먼저 실행한 돈을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers directly point to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows. Answer without evasion.",パク・ジヨンさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類はパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,朴智妍女士，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件直接指向朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
