,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류가 본인 실행을 명확히 보여줍니다. 이준호 씨가 먼저 숨겼다는 말로 그 실행을 덮을 수 없습니다.","Ms. Park, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers narrow the issue to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows. Please explain the point clearly.",パク・ジヨンさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類によって争点はパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,朴智妍女士，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件把问题缩小到朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류는 감정의 선후가 아니라 돈의 선후를 묻고 있습니다. 본인이 언제 왜 그렇게 행동했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers narrow the issue to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows. Please explain the point clearly.",パク・ジヨンさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類によって争点はパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,朴智妍女士，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件把问题缩小到朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 침묵이 있었다 해도 적금 해지 서류와 투자방 송금은 다른 줄입니다. 그 줄을 밝히십시오.","Ms. Park, Joint Savings Cancellation Papers and Investment Chat Telegram narrow the issue to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows. Please explain the point clearly.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約書類、投資チャットのTelegramによって争点はパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,朴智妍女士，共同储蓄账户解约文件、投资群Telegram把问题缩小到朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류가 모두 놓인 지금 피해자였다는 말만으로는 부족합니다. 실제 돈을 움직인 순서를 답하십시오.","Ms. Park, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers narrow the issue to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows. Please explain the point clearly.",パク・ジヨンさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類によって争点はパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,朴智妍女士，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件把问题缩小到朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 내역과 해지 서류가 두 큰돈 손실의 양쪽 흐름을 보여줍니다. 본인의 공동 적금 해지와 송금을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, Withdrawal Records and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers narrow the issue to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows. Please explain the point clearly.",パク・ジヨンさん、出金履歴、共同積立預金の解約書類によって争点はパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,朴智妍女士，取款记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件把问题缩小到朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 내역과 투자방 송금 기록, 적금 해지 서류를 함께 보겠습니다. 이준호 씨가 먼저 숨겼더라도 실제 서류 실행은 본인에게서 확인하겠습니다. 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Park, let us look at Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, Joint Savings Cancellation Papers, and Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows.",パク・ジヨンさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それがパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件、投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류를 나란히 놓으면 숨김의 시작과 돈의 실행이 분리됩니다. 본인이 먼저 한 실행을 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, let us look at Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers together. Please calmly explain how they relate to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows.",パク・ジヨンさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類を一緒に確認します。それがパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件。请冷静说明它们与朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v3].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 현금 출금과 본인의 적금 해지, 투자방 송금이 각각 보입니다. 어떤 순서로 움직였습니까.","Ms. Park, let us look at Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows.",パク・ジヨンさん、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それがパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
