,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 두 큰돈의 순서를 보려면 본인 송금과 해지 서류를 따로 놓아야 합니다. 그렇게 이어진 정황을 들려주십시오.","Ms. Park, let us look at Joint Savings Cancellation Papers together. Please calmly explain how they relate to Park Ji-yeon’s execution of the transfer and the order of the two money flows.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約書類を一緒に確認します。それがパク・ジヨンの送金実行と二つの金の流れの順序とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,朴智妍女士，我们一起看共同储蓄账户解约文件。请冷静说明它们与朴智妍执行转账以及两笔资金流的先后顺序有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류가 전체 순서를 드러냅니다. 먼저 숨긴 사실과 돈을 움직인 사실을 지금 나눠 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers directly point to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件直接指向李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 두 큰돈의 흐름 앞에서 박지연 씨 책임만 말할 수 없습니다. 본인의 현금 출금부터 인정하십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence directly point to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据直接指向李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류는 본인의 숨김이 먼저였다는 점과 박지연 씨의 실행이 별개라는 점을 함께 보입니다. 둘을 섞지 말고 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers directly point to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件直接指向李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 해지 서류가 놓인 지금 형을 도운 것이라는 이유로 순서를 흐릴 수 없습니다. 언제 숨겼고 언제 돈을 꺼냈는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers directly point to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、共同積立預金の解約書類はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件直接指向李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류가 돈의 시간표를 닫았습니다. 본인 책임을 뒤로 미루지 말고 지금 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers directly point to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Answer without evasion.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序を直接示しています。回避せず答えてください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件直接指向李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请不要回避，直接回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류가 서로 다른 실행을 보여줍니다. 본인이 먼저 숨긴 부분을 빼두고 말할 수 없습니다.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers narrow the issue to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類によって争点はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件把问题缩小到李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 해지 서류 절차 문제를 말하기 전에 본인이 그 사정을 먼저 숨긴 사실도 같은 시간표에 놓아야 합니다.","Mr. Lee, Joint Savings Cancellation Papers narrow the issue to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約書類によって争点はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，共同储蓄账户解约文件把问题缩小到李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류는 숨김의 시작과 돈의 실행이 다른 축이라는 점을 보입니다. 자기에게 유리한 순서만 말하지 마십시오.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers narrow the issue to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類によって争点はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件把问题缩小到李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
