,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 현금 출금과 공동 적금 해지는 따로 보아야 합니다. 본인 출금의 목적과 시점을 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, the submitted evidence narrow the issue to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、提出された証拠によって争点はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，提交的证据把问题缩小到李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록과 해지 서류 앞에서는 상대의 행동만 앞세울 수 없습니다. 본인 쪽 돈의 흐름도 밝혀야 합니다.","Mr. Lee, Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers narrow the issue to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements. Please explain the point clearly.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類によって争点はイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序へ絞られています。その点を明確に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件把问题缩小到李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序。请把这一点说明清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
