,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 형에게 간 현금과 박지연 씨의 투자방 송금, 공동 적금 해지가 서로 다른 줄에 놓입니다. 그 순서를 차분히 짚어 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements.",イ・ジュノさん、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それがイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 송금 기록, 해지 서류를 나란히 놓으면 먼저 숨긴 일과 먼저 실행한 돈이 다르게 보입니다. 본인이 먼저 인정할 부분은 무엇입니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, and Joint Savings Cancellation Papers together. Please calmly explain how they relate to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類を一緒に確認します。それがイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件。请冷静说明它们与李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 현금 출금은 이준호 씨 쪽에서, 적금 해지 서류는 박지연 씨 쪽에서 드러납니다. 두 흐름을 섞지 말고 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Joint Savings Cancellation Papers together. Please calmly explain how they relate to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約書類を一緒に確認します。それがイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看共同储蓄账户解约文件。请冷静说明它们与李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,사건카드 단서 확인 뒤 증거 조합의 의미를 재판관이 정리한다.,"After checking the case-card clue, the Judge summarizes the meaning of the evidence combination.",事件カードの手がかり確認後、証拠の組み合わせの意味を裁判官が整理する。,确认案件卡线索后，法官整理证据组合的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 출금 내역과 투자방 송금 기록, 적금 해지 서류를 보면 두 큰돈이 사라진 길이 나뉩니다. 각 돈의 길을 먼저 들려주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, let us look at Withdrawal Records, Transfer Records, Joint Savings Cancellation Papers, and Investment Chat Telegram together. Please calmly explain how they relate to Lee Jun-ho’s first concealment and the separate order of the money movements.",イ・ジュノさん、出金履歴、送金記録、共同積立預金の解約書類、投資チャットのTelegramを一緒に確認します。それがイ・ジュノの最初の隠蔽と、別軸での金の動きの順序とどう関わるのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,李俊浩先生，我们一起看取款记录、转账记录、共同储蓄账户解约文件、投资群Telegram。请冷静说明它们与李俊浩最先隐瞒，以及资金流动的另一条顺序有什么关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추고 안쪽 정서를 끌어내는 질문이다.,Ask for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. This question lowers defenses slightly and draws out the inner feeling.,判断よりも感情の最初の反応を問う。防御を少し下げ、内側の感情を引き出す質問。,询问的不是判断，而是情绪的第一反应。这个问题稍微降低防御，引出内在情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 오피스텔 일을 떠올릴 때 가장 먼저 마음에 걸리는 사람이 형인지 다른 관련자인지 박지연 씨인지 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추고 안쪽 정서를 끌어내는 질문이다.,Ask for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. This question lowers defenses slightly and draws out the inner feeling.,判断よりも感情の最初の反応を問う。防御を少し下げ、内側の感情を引き出す質問。,询问的不是判断，而是情绪的第一反应。这个问题稍微降低防御，引出内在情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 기록을 처음 본 순간 몸으로 먼저 올라온 감정이 무엇이었는지 차분히 들려주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 다른 관련자의 생활을 챙기던 장면과 집에 돌아와 침묵하던 장면 중 무엇이 더 무겁게 남습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 새벽 통화를 들은 뒤 혼자 견디던 시간이 어떤 감정으로 쌓였는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v5].text,"두 분, 그때 서로에게 말하지 못한 감정이 지금 어떤 오해로 남았는지 한 문장씩 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 기억하게 만드는 질문이다.,Ask about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. This question makes them recall where the emotion grew.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で問う。感情が大きくなった地点を思い出させる質問。,在时间流动中询问愧疚与不安。这个问题让其回忆情绪扩大之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 숨긴 뒤 집으로 돌아오면서 죄책감이 올라온 순간이 있었다면 언제였습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 기억하게 만드는 질문이다.,Ask about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. This question makes them recall where the emotion grew.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で問う。感情が大きくなった地点を思い出させる質問。,在时间流动中询问愧疚与不安。这个问题让其回忆情绪扩大之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 기록을 더 확인하면서도 스스로 멈추기 어렵다고 느낀 순간이 있었습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 가족을 도운 것이라는 마음과 박지연 씨를 속였다는 마음이 동시에 올라왔습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨에게 묻고 싶으면서도 대답이 더 무서울까 봐 물러선 적이 있었습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v5].text,"두 분, 상처를 줄까 봐 숨긴 마음과 상처받지 않으려 확인한 마음이 어떻게 엇갈렸는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계 붕괴를 무서워한 마음을 말하게 하는 단계다.,Directly touch the fear pressed down behind the facts. This stage makes them speak to the fear that the relationship would collapse.,事実の背後で押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の崩壊を怖がった思いを語らせる段階。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧。这一阶段促使其说出害怕关系崩塌的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 다른 관련자 이야기를 꺼내는 순간 부부 사이가 더 무너질까 봐 두려웠다는 뜻입니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계 붕괴를 무서워한 마음을 말하게 하는 단계다.,Directly touch the fear pressed down behind the facts. This stage makes them speak to the fear that the relationship would collapse.,事実の背後で押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の崩壊を怖がった思いを語らせる段階。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧。这一阶段促使其说出害怕关系崩塌的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 외도 정황보다 더 깊은 곳에서 삶이 무너질까 봐 겁났던 마음도 있었습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 가족을 두고 돌아서는 길에 박지연 씨에게 말해야 한다는 생각이 들지는 않았습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 증거를 붙잡고 있을수록 오히려 이준호 씨와 멀어지는 걸 느끼지는 않으셨습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v5].text,"두 분, 서로를 지키려 했다는 말이 실제로는 서로를 고립시킨 지점이 어디였는지 들려주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처 가운데 무엇이 더 크게 남는지 스스로 보게 하는 질문이다.,Make them choose the heaviest emotion. This question makes them see for themselves whether responsibility or hurt remains larger.,最も重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷のうち、何がより大きく残っているかを自分で見させる質問。,让其选择最沉重的情绪。这个问题让其自行看清责任与伤害中哪一个留下得更大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 가족을 지키려 한 마음과 박지연 씨를 다치게 한 죄책감 중 지금 더 무겁게 남는 것은 무엇입니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처 가운데 무엇이 더 크게 남는지 스스로 보게 하는 질문이다.,Make them choose the heaviest emotion. This question makes them see for themselves whether responsibility or hurt remains larger.,最も重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷のうち、何がより大きく残っているかを自分で見させる質問。,让其选择最沉重的情绪。这个问题让其自行看清责任与伤害中哪一个留下得更大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 진실을 찾으려던 마음과 버림받지 않으려 버틴 마음 중 무엇이 더 컸습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그때 그 가족을 먼저 떠올렸다면 지금은 박지연 씨에게 어떤 말을 먼저 해야 한다고 보십니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라고 단정했던 마음 뒤에 있던 불안까지 지금 이 자리에서 인정하실 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v5].text,"두 분, 오피스텔 문제를 두고 각자 가장 늦게 인정한 감정이 무엇인지 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실부터 고정한다. 누가 어디를 어떻게 봤는지 기초 순서를 세우는 질문이다.,"Fix the surface facts first. This question establishes the basic order of who saw what, where, and how.",表面上の事実から固定する。誰がどこをどのように見たのか、基礎の順序を立てる質問。,先固定表面事实。这个问题建立“谁、在哪里、如何看到”的基础顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 매장 마감 뒤 차가 오피스텔로 향한 날들을 먼저 시간순으로 들려주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실부터 고정한다. 누가 어디를 어떻게 봤는지 기초 순서를 세우는 질문이다.,"Fix the surface facts first. This question establishes the basic order of who saw what, where, and how.",表面上の事実から固定する。誰がどこをどのように見たのか、基礎の順序を立てる質問。,先固定表面事实。这个问题建立“谁、在哪里、如何看到”的基础顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 오피스텔 주소가 반복된 기록을 확인하고 처음 어떤 생각이 들었는지부터 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v3].text,"두 분, 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화가 처음 겹쳐 보인 시점을 각자 차분히 맞춰 주시겠습니까.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 같은 시간대에 같은 건물로 향한 동선이 왜 반복됐는지 먼저 밝혀 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 그 동선을 발견하고 바로 외도라고 굳히기 전 어떤 확인을 하셨는지 들려주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,정황을 구성하는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 시간과 연락 상대를 분리해 흔들림을 찾는다.,Narrow the question to the details that make up the context. Separate time from contact partner to find instability.,状況を構成する細部に絞って問う。時間と連絡相手を切り分け、揺らぎを探す。,缩小到构成情况的细节发问。分开时间与联系对象，寻找动摇点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 새벽마다 같은 번호와 짧게 이어진 통화가 누구의 사정과 연결돼 있었는지 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,정황을 구성하는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 시간과 연락 상대를 분리해 흔들림을 찾는다.,Narrow the question to the details that make up the context. Separate time from contact partner to find instability.,状況を構成する細部に絞って問う。時間と連絡相手を切り分け、揺らぎを探す。,缩小到构成情况的细节发问。分开时间与联系对象，寻找动摇点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 방문 기록을 보고 난 뒤 새벽 통화까지 같은 흐름으로 읽은 과정을 들려주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 통화 상대를 밝히지 않은 채 장소만 숨기면 오해가 커질 걸 생각하지 않으셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 통화 시간과 오피스텔 방문 기록을 맞춰 보면서 다른 방향의 생각을 해보시지는 않으셨습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v5].text,"두 분, 같은 번호와 같은 장소가 겹친 날짜를 하나씩 놓고 어디서 해석이 갈렸는지 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,"초반에는 핵심 인물을 직접 요구하지 않고, 물건 구입 사정의 빈틈만 좁힌다.","At first, do not directly demand the key person; narrow only the gap in the circumstances of the purchase.",序盤では核心人物を直接求めず、物品購入事情の隙間だけを絞る。,初期不直接要求核心人物，只缩小购买物品情形中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 가족에게 필요한 물건이라고 하셨습니다. 어떤 사정 때문에 직접 구입해야 했는지 설명해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,이제 핵심 인물과 현장의 실체를 직접 겨눈다. 추정이 아니라 대상과 목적을 말하게 만드는 단계다.,"Now aim directly at the key person and the reality of the scene. This stage makes them state the target and purpose, not a presumption.",ここで核心人物と現場の実体を直接狙う。推定ではなく、対象と目的を語らせる段階。,现在直接瞄准核心人物与现场实质。这一阶段让其说出对象与目的，而不是推定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그곳에 다른 여성이 있다고 확신하게 만든 장면과 자료를 구분해 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 가족에게 물건을 사다 주었다는 내용을 좀 더 자세히 설명해 주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 발신자 미상 문자 내용까지 확인하고도 왜 외도 가능성에서 생각이 벗어나지 않았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v5].text,"두 분, 물건 구입과 오피스텔 동선이 같은 의심으로 묶인 이유를 각자 알고 있는 범위에서만 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,더는 돌릴 수 없도록 결정적 이유를 묻는다. 숨김과 단정의 최종 근거를 바로 세우려는 질문이다.,Ask for the decisive reason so they can no longer deflect. This question sets the final basis for the concealment and the assumption straight.,これ以上そらせないよう、決定的な理由を問う。隠蔽と断定の最終根拠を正す質問。,询问决定性理由，使其不能再绕开。这是为了立正隐瞒与断定的最终依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 개인적인 이유로 오피스텔에 간 것이라면 왜 박지연 씨에게 끝까지 숨기셨는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,더는 돌릴 수 없도록 결정적 이유를 묻는다. 숨김과 단정의 최종 근거를 바로 세우려는 질문이다.,Ask for the decisive reason so they can no longer deflect. This question sets the final basis for the concealment and the assumption straight.,これ以上そらせないよう、決定的な理由を問う。隠蔽と断定の最終根拠を正す質問。,询问决定性理由，使其不能再绕开。这是为了立正隐瞒与断定的最终依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 오피스텔 방문과 새벽전화를 발견하고 다른 방향의 생각을 해보시지는 않으셨습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 가족 안의 갈등이 두려웠다 해도 숨기는 방식이 오히려 외도처럼 보일 수 있다는 점을 알고 계셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 확인되지 않은 정황을 확실한 외도로 굳힌 순간이 언제였는지 되짚어 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v5].text,"두 분, 한쪽의 숨김과 다른 한쪽의 단정이 어디서 서로를 밀어 올렸는지 지금 분리해서 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the Officetel visits and early-morning calls.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,사실 자체보다 왜 말을 못 했는지의 입구를 연다. 처음의 주저함을 자극하는 질문이다.,"Open the doorway to why they could not speak, rather than the fact itself. This question prods the initial hesitation.",事実そのものより、なぜ言えなかったのかへの入口を開く。最初のためらいを刺激する質問。,打开“为什么说不出口”的入口，而不是追问事实本身。这个问题刺激最初的犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 다른 관련자 이야기를 집에서 자연스럽게 꺼내지 못하게 만든 첫 부담이 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,사실 자체보다 왜 말을 못 했는지의 입구를 연다. 처음의 주저함을 자극하는 질문이다.,"Open the doorway to why they could not speak, rather than the fact itself. This question prods the initial hesitation.",事実そのものより、なぜ言えなかったのかへの入口を開く。最初のためらいを刺激する質問。,打开“为什么说不出口”的入口，而不是追问事实本身。这个问题刺激最初的犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 기록을 보고도 바로 묻지 않고 혼자 더 확인하게 된 마음의 순서를 들려주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 일을 그곳에 갔다는 설명이라고 생각하면서도 왜 가족 이야기 자체를 뒤로 미루셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 의심이 커지는 동안 이준호 씨에게 묻는 대신 자료를 더 보게 된 이유가 있었습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v5].text,"두 분, 말하지 못한 이유와 묻지 못한 이유가 각각 어디서 시작됐는지 먼저 짚어 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 이유를 한 단계 더 구체화하는 흐름이다.,Ask for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. This flow makes the reason one step more concrete.,隠蔽と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を問う。理由を一段階具体化する流れ。,询问隐瞒与怀疑扩大的直接原因。这个流程将理由进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 장소를 숨긴 것보다 형 이야기를 꺼내는 일이 더 두려웠던 이유를 들려주시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 이유를 한 단계 더 구체화하는 흐름이다.,Ask for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. This flow makes the reason one step more concrete.,隠蔽と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を問う。理由を一段階具体化する流れ。,询问隐瞒与怀疑扩大的直接原因。这个流程将理由进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 의심을 풀기보다 흔적을 더 찾는 방향으로 마음이 기운 이유를 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 시댁 이야기가 나오면 집이 흔들린다고 느낀 경험이 이번 침묵에 어떻게 이어졌습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 확인을 거듭할수록 외도라는 결론이 더 단단해진 이유가 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v5].text,"두 분, 한 사람은 말하지 않고 한 사람은 묻지 않은 시간이 왜 그렇게 길어졌는지 각각 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포를 직접 건드린다. 시댁 갈등과 버려질 불안을 각각 말하게 만드는 질문이다.,Directly touch the fear inside the relationship. This question makes them speak separately about in-laws conflict and the anxiety of being abandoned.,関係の内側にある恐怖に直接触れる。義実家との葛藤と見捨てられる不安を、それぞれ語らせる質問。,直接触及关系内部的恐惧。这个问题让其分别说出婆家矛盾与被抛弃的不安。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨가 시댁 이야기에 크게 반응할까 봐 다른 관련자의 사정을 아예 빼두셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포를 직접 건드린다. 시댁 갈등과 버려질 불안을 각각 말하게 만드는 질문이다.,Directly touch the fear inside the relationship. This question makes them speak separately about in-laws conflict and the anxiety of being abandoned.,関係の内側にある恐怖に直接触れる。義実家との葛藤と見捨てられる不安を、それぞれ語らせる質問。,直接触及关系内部的恐惧。这个问题让其分别说出婆家矛盾与被抛弃的不安。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 오피스텔 기록을 볼 때마다 가장 먼저 떠오른 두려움이 배신이었는지, 버려짐이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 가족을 챙기는 일이었다면 오히려 말해야 한다는 생각을 어느 순간에도 하지 않으셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 침묵을 보며 다른 설명을 기다리기보다 외도라고 확신한 이유를 들려주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v5].text,"두 분, 그 가족을 둘러싼 숨김이 부부 사이의 오래된 가족 안의 갈등과 어떻게 맞물렸는지 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그렇게까지 상대를 배제하거나 단정했는지를 정면으로 겨눈다.,"Ask for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. Aim squarely at why they went so far as to exclude or assume about the other person.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を問う。なぜそこまで相手を排除したり断定したりしたのかを正面から狙う。,问的不是借口，而是选择的理由。正面追问为何把对方排除或断定到那种程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그곳에 갔다는 설명이라고 해도 박지연 씨에게 끝까지 말하지 않은 책임까지 함께 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그렇게까지 상대를 배제하거나 단정했는지를 정면으로 겨눈다.,"Ask for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. Aim squarely at why they went so far as to exclude or assume about the other person.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を問う。なぜそこまで相手を排除したり断定したりしたのかを正面から狙う。,问的不是借口，而是选择的理由。正面追问为何把对方排除或断定到那种程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라고 믿어야만 그 시간을 버틸 수 있었다면 그 이유가 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 개인적인 사정을 우선한 판단이 배우자에게 설명하지 않는 선택으로 바뀐 지점을 밝혀 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 왜 그렇게 확신하고 외도 방향으로 밀어붙였는지 그 마음의 근거를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 오피스텔 방문과 새벽 통화의 의미를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the meaning of the Officetel visit and early-morning call; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話の意味を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话的意义范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v5].text,"두 분, 각자 두려웠다는 말만으로 상대를 밖에 둔 선택을 덮을 수 있는지 지금 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the Officetel visits and early-morning calls, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、オフィステル訪問と早朝の通話について、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕韩式商住公寓探访与凌晨通话，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,돈이 움직이던 순간의 감정 출발점을 묻는다. 사실보다 마음의 첫 반응을 먼저 끌어낸다.,Ask for the emotional starting point at the moment the money moved. Draw out the heart's first reaction before the facts.,金が動いた瞬間の感情の出発点を問う。事実より先に心の最初の反応を引き出す。,询问资金移动瞬间的情绪起点。先引出内心的第一反应，再看事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 돈을 꺼내던 순간 가장 먼저 떠오른 것은 급한 사정이었습니까, 집에 있는 박지연 씨였습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,돈이 움직이던 순간의 감정 출발점을 묻는다. 사실보다 마음의 첫 반응을 먼저 끌어낸다.,Ask for the emotional starting point at the moment the money moved. Draw out the heart's first reaction before the facts.,金が動いた瞬間の感情の出発点を問う。事実より先に心の最初の反応を引き出す。,询问资金移动瞬间的情绪起点。先引出内心的第一反应，再看事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 처음 봤을 때 분노보다 먼저 공포가 올라왔는지 말씀해 주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 현금을 들고 이동하던 때 마음이 무거워진 장면이 있었습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 그 기록을 본 뒤 손이 먼저 굳었는지 머릿속 계산이 먼저 돌았는지 들려주십시오.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v5].text,"두 분, 돈을 본 순간 각자 어떤 감정이 먼저 올라왔는지 판단보다 먼저 말해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,"책임감과 두려움, 확인 충동과 불안이 함께 있었는지를 묻는다.","Ask whether responsibility and fear, the urge to check and anxiety, were present together.",責任感と恐れ、確認衝動と不安が同時にあったのかを問う。,询问责任感与恐惧、确认冲动与不安是否同时存在。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 선택 뒤에 그 사정을 책임져야 한다는 마음과 박지연 씨에게 미안한 마음이 함께 있었습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,"책임감과 두려움, 확인 충동과 불안이 함께 있었는지를 묻는다.","Ask whether responsibility and fear, the urge to check and anxiety, were present together.",責任感と恐れ、確認衝動と不安が同時にあったのかを問う。,询问责任感与恐惧、确认冲动与不安是否同时存在。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 확인을 멈추면 더 큰 일이 날 것 같았던 순간이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 숨긴 사정이라고 스스로를 달래면서도 집에 돌아와 말문이 막힌 적이 있었습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 볼수록 이준호 씨를 믿고 싶은 마음까지 같이 흔들렸습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v5].text,"두 분, 돈을 둘러싼 두려움이 상대에게 말하는 힘보다 더 커진 순간을 각자 짚어 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,상대를 속였다는 죄책감과 삶이 무너질 공포를 각각 직접 말하게 하는 단계다.,This stage makes them speak directly and separately about the guilt of deceiving the other person and the fear that life would collapse.,相手を欺いた罪悪感と、生活が崩れる恐怖をそれぞれ直接語らせる段階。,这一阶段让其分别直接说出欺骗对方的愧疚，以及生活崩塌的恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 급한 사정을 챙기려는 마음과 박지연 씨를 속였다는 죄책감이 동시에 올라왔던 때가 있었습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,상대를 속였다는 죄책감과 삶이 무너질 공포를 각각 직접 말하게 하는 단계다.,This stage makes them speak directly and separately about the guilt of deceiving the other person and the fear that life would collapse.,相手を欺いた罪悪感と、生活が崩れる恐怖をそれぞれ直接語らせる段階。,这一阶段让其分别直接说出欺骗对方的愧疚，以及生活崩塌的恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 돈을 본 뒤 관계가 무너지는 불안과 생활이 무너지는 불안이 겹쳤습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 돈을 건넨 뒤에도 집에서는 평소처럼 행동해야 했던 시간이 어떻게 남아 있습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 붙잡고 있으면서도 이준호 씨에게 확인을 요구하지 못한 마음이 있었습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v5].text,"두 분, 서로에게 돈 이야기를 하지 못한 감정이 지금 어떤 후회로 남았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,가장 무겁게 남은 생각과 끝내 멈추지 못한 이유를 마음의 언어로 묻게 한다.,"Ask, in emotional language, for the thought that remains heaviest and the reason they ultimately could not stop.",最も重く残った考えと、最後まで止められなかった理由を、心の言葉で問わせる。,用内心语言询问留下最重的想法，以及最终没能停下的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 현금을 처리하고 집에 돌아오는 길에 가장 오래 남은 생각이 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,가장 무겁게 남은 생각과 끝내 멈추지 못한 이유를 마음의 언어로 묻게 한다.,"Ask, in emotional language, for the thought that remains heaviest and the reason they ultimately could not stop.",最も重く残った考えと、最後まで止められなかった理由を、心の言葉で問わせる。,用内心语言询问留下最重的想法，以及最终没能停下的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 출금이 드러난 뒤에도 확인을 멈추지 못했던 마음을 이제는 말할 수 있습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 사정을 살펴야 한다는 마음이 박지연 씨를 혼자 불안 속에 두었다는 점을 인정하십니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 출금을 본 뒤 내 돈부터 지키겠다는 마음이 언제 가장 강해졌습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v5].text,"두 분, 돈을 둘러싼 선택 중 지금 가장 무겁게 남는 장면을 하나씩 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,출금 사실과 인지 시점을 먼저 고정한다. 돈의 흐름이 언제 드러났는지 양쪽 입장을 세우는 질문이다.,First fix the fact of withdrawal and the timing of awareness. This question sets each side's position on when the money flow became known.,出金の事実と認知の時点を先に固定する。金の流れがいつ明らかになったのか、双方の立場を立てる質問。,先固定取款事实与认知时间点。这个问题确立双方对于资金流何时显露的立场。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 계좌에서 큰돈이 현금으로 빠져나간 사실부터 인정하시는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,출금 사실과 인지 시점을 먼저 고정한다. 돈의 흐름이 언제 드러났는지 양쪽 입장을 세우는 질문이다.,First fix the fact of withdrawal and the timing of awareness. This question sets each side's position on when the money flow became known.,出金の事実と認知の時点を先に固定する。金の流れがいつ明らかになったのか、双方の立場を立てる質問。,先固定取款事实与认知时间点。这个问题确立双方对于资金流何时显露的立场。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 출금 흔적을 처음 보고 어떤 경로로 확인을 이어갔는지 차례로 들려주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v3].text,"두 분, 개인 계좌 출금과 공동 재산 문제를 처음 어느 시점에 서로 알게 됐는지 맞춰 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v4].text,"이준호 씨, 그 돈이 공동 적금이 아니라 개인 계좌에서 나온 돈이라는 점을 언제 밝히려 하셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 보면서 단순 지출이 아니라 비밀 이동이라고 판단한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,"방식과 판단 근거를 구체화한다. 왜 현금이었는지, 왜 수상하다고 본 건지 따로 묻는다.",Make the method and basis of judgment concrete. Ask separately why it was cash and why it looked suspicious.,方式と判断根拠を具体化する。なぜ現金だったのか、なぜ怪しいと見たのかを別々に問う。,具体化方式与判断依据。分别询问为什么是现金、为什么认为可疑。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 계좌이체가 아니라 현금으로 꺼낸 이유가 그 입장 개인 사정 때문이었는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,"방식과 판단 근거를 구체화한다. 왜 현금이었는지, 왜 수상하다고 본 건지 따로 묻는다.",Make the method and basis of judgment concrete. Ask separately why it was cash and why it looked suspicious.,方式と判断根拠を具体化する。なぜ現金だったのか、なぜ怪しいと見たのかを別々に問う。,具体化方式与判断依据。分别询问为什么是现金、为什么认为可疑。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 현금 출금이라는 방식을 보고 이 돈이 다른 생활과 연결됐다고 보신 근거는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 현금으로 전달해야 했다는 사정이 있었다면 왜 그 사정을 박지연 씨에게 빼두셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 날짜와 오피스텔 기록을 맞춰 보면서 어떤 결론으로 마음이 기울었습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v5].text,"두 분, 돈이 빠진 방식과 그 돈을 해석한 방식이 어디서 갈라졌는지 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,돈의 최종 도착지와 확인 방식으로 좁혀 들어간다. 출금 뒤의 행선지와 추적 경로를 동시에 세우는 단계다.,Narrow in on the money's final destination and the method of verification. This stage sets both the destination after withdrawal and the tracking route.,金の最終到達先と確認方法へ絞り込む。出金後の行き先と追跡経路を同時に立てる段階。,缩小到资金最终去向与确认方式。这一阶段同时建立取款后的去向与追踪路径。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 그 현금이 실제로 누구에게 전달됐고 어떤 급한 사정에 쓰였는지 밝혀 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,돈의 최종 도착지와 확인 방식으로 좁혀 들어간다. 출금 뒤의 행선지와 추적 경로를 동시에 세우는 단계다.,Narrow in on the money's final destination and the method of verification. This stage sets both the destination after withdrawal and the tracking route.,金の最終到達先と確認方法へ絞り込む。出金後の行き先と追跡経路を同時に立てる段階。,缩小到资金最终去向与确认方式。这一阶段同时建立取款后的去向与追踪路径。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 출금을 본 뒤 계좌와 통화기록을 어떤 순서로 더 확인하셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 현금이 본인 손을 떠난 시점과 이동 경로를 날짜와 장소 중심으로 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 그 출금이 다른 관련자 쪽 사정일 수 있다는 가능성을 언제 처음 들으셨습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v5].text,"두 분, 개인 비자금 출금과 외도 의심을 같은 선에 놓게 된 과정이 무엇이었는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,금액과 목적을 숨길 수 없게 만든다. 독단 처리와 집요한 확인이 각각 어디까지 갔는지 묻는 질문이다.,Make it impossible to hide the amount and purpose. Ask how far unilateral handling and persistent checking each went.,金額と目的を隠せないようにする。独断処理と執拗な確認がそれぞれどこまで行ったのかを問う質問。,使其无法隐藏金额与目的。询问独断处理与执着确认分别到了什么程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 계좌의 목돈 출금을 배우자인 박지연 씨와 상의하지 않고 먼저 처리한 이유를 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,금액과 목적을 숨길 수 없게 만든다. 독단 처리와 집요한 확인이 각각 어디까지 갔는지 묻는 질문이다.,Make it impossible to hide the amount and purpose. Ask how far unilateral handling and persistent checking each went.,金額と目的を隠せないようにする。独断処理と執拗な確認がそれぞれどこまで行ったのかを問う質問。,使其无法隐藏金额与目的。询问独断处理与执着确认分别到了什么程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 출금을 쫓던 불안이 어디까지 번졌고 어떤 행동으로 이어졌는지 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 본인에게 급한 사정이 있었다고 해도 절차를 건너뛴 책임은 어떻게 보십니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 출금을 확인하고도 본인의 돈 이동을 숨긴 부분까지 함께 밝히시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v5].text,"두 분, 한쪽의 현금 출금과 다른 한쪽의 선제 대응이 어떻게 서로를 더 의심하게 만들었는지 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the large withdrawal from the husband's account.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理丈夫名下账户的大额取款。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,돈 문제를 열지 못한 직접 이유와 계속 확인한 직접 이유를 각각 묻는다.,Ask separately for the direct reason they could not open up the money issue and the direct reason they kept checking.,金の問題を開けなかった直接の理由と、確認し続けた直接の理由をそれぞれ問う。,分别询问无法开启金钱问题的直接理由，以及持续确认的直接理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 돈 문제를 박지연 씨에게 열지 못하게 만든 가장 직접적인 두려움이 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,돈 문제를 열지 못한 직접 이유와 계속 확인한 직접 이유를 각각 묻는다.,Ask separately for the direct reason they could not open up the money issue and the direct reason they kept checking.,金の問題を開けなかった直接の理由と、確認し続けた直接の理由をそれぞれ問う。,分别询问无法开启金钱问题的直接理由，以及持续确认的直接理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 큰돈이 빠져나간 걸 보고 바로 묻기보다 계속 확인하게 된 이유를 들려주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 별도 계좌의 목돈 출금을 배우자에게 말하지 않아도 된다고 판단한 근거가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 본 뒤 스스로를 지켜야 한다는 생각이 먼저 올라왔습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v5].text,"두 분, 돈을 숨긴 이유와 돈을 추적한 이유가 각각 어떤 불안에서 시작됐는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,가족 보호와 배신감이라는 두 축을 더 분명히 한다. 선택의 감정적 근거를 파고드는 단계다.,Clarify the two axes of family protection and betrayal. This stage digs into the emotional basis of the choice.,家族保護と裏切られた感覚という二つの軸をより明確にする。選択の感情的根拠を掘り下げる段階。,更明确家人保护与背叛感这两条轴线。这一阶段深入选择的情绪依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 급한 일이라고 판단했다면 더더욱 함께 말해야 한다는 생각을 왜 뒤로 미루셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,가족 보호와 배신감이라는 두 축을 더 분명히 한다. 선택의 감정적 근거를 파고드는 단계다.,Clarify the two axes of family protection and betrayal. This stage digs into the emotional basis of the choice.,家族保護と裏切られた感覚という二つの軸をより明確にする。選択の感情的根拠を掘り下げる段階。,更明确家人保护与背叛感这两条轴线。这一阶段深入选择的情绪依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 그 출금이 단순한 실수보다 배신처럼 느껴진 이유를 장면과 순서를 나눠 들려주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 사정을 말하는 순간 어떤 반응이 가장 두려웠습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 출금 기록을 보는 일이 언제부터 사실 확인보다 대비하는 마음에 가까워졌습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v5].text,"두 분, 숨긴 사정이라는 설명과 배우자를 배제한 행동 사이의 간격을 각자 어떻게 보십니까.","Both of you, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,"왜 숨김을 먼저 택했는지, 왜 확인을 멈추지 못했는지를 정면으로 묻는다.",Ask directly why concealment came first and why they could not stop checking.,なぜ先に隠蔽を選んだのか、なぜ確認を止められなかったのかを正面から問う。,正面询问为什么先选择隐瞒、为什么无法停止确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 선의였다는 말보다 먼저 숨김을 택한 이유를 지금은 어떻게 설명하시겠습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,"왜 숨김을 먼저 택했는지, 왜 확인을 멈추지 못했는지를 정면으로 묻는다.",Ask directly why concealment came first and why they could not stop checking.,なぜ先に隠蔽を選んだのか、なぜ確認を止められなかったのかを正面から問う。,正面询问为什么先选择隐瞒、为什么无法停止确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 돈을 확인하는 일이 스스로도 멈추기 어려운 일이 된 시점이 언제였습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 사정을 지키려다 박지연 씨의 신뢰를 잃을 수 있다는 점을 어느 정도 예상하셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 비밀 출금을 보면서 왜 상대에게 묻기보다 내 돈부터 지켜야 한다고 느끼셨습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v5].text,"두 분, 돈을 두고 각자 상대를 배제한 판단이 시작된 순간을 숨기지 말고 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,선택이 월권이나 집착이 될 걸 알면서도 밀어붙인 이유를 설명하게 만든다.,Make them explain why they pushed ahead despite knowing the choice could become overreach or obsession.,選択が越権や執着になり得ると知りながら押し通した理由を説明させる。,让其说明明知选择可能变成越权或执着，却仍强行推进的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v1].text,"이준호 씨, 가족을 돕겠다는 마음이 있었다 해도 배우자 동의 없이 밀어붙인 이유를 끝까지 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,선택이 월권이나 집착이 될 걸 알면서도 밀어붙인 이유를 설명하게 만든다.,Make them explain why they pushed ahead despite knowing the choice could become overreach or obsession.,選択が越権や執着になり得ると知りながら押し通した理由を説明させる。,让其说明明知选择可能变成越权或执着，却仍强行推进的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 제 몫을 지켜야 한다는 생각이 왜 이준호 씨를 추궁하는 선을 넘어가게 했습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 현금을 건넨 것이 필요했다고 해도 그 뒤 침묵까지 정당하다고 보십니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 왜 그렇게 확신하고 돈 문제를 배신의 증거로 밀어붙였는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 목돈 출금과 배우자 배제의 경위를 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the circumstances of the large withdrawal and the spouse's exclusion; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。高額出金と配偶者排除の経緯を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小大额取款与排除配偶的经过范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v5].text,"두 분, 선의와 두려움이 있었다는 말만으로 상대에게 숨긴 돈의 책임이 줄어드는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the large withdrawal from the husband's account, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、夫名義口座からの高額出金について、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕丈夫名下账户的大额取款，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 적금 해지 서류를 잡고 있던 날 가장 먼저 올라온 감정이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 은행 창구 앞에서 손이 떨렸는지, 아니면 이미 마음이 굳어 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 공동 적금이 사라졌다는 사실을 들었을 때 분노보다 먼저 어떤 감정이 올라왔습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v4].text,"두 분, 그 돈이 부부 사이에서 어떤 의미였는지 먼저 각자 말해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-1-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 그때 본인을 피해자라고 느낀 마음이 얼마나 강했는지 들려주시겠습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 버려질까 봐 두려웠던 마음을 먼저 말한 뒤 서류를 손댄 순간으로 넘어가 보겠습니다.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 서류를 준비하면서도 멈추고 싶었던 순간이 있었는지 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨가 불안 속에서 혼자 결론을 내리게 된 데 본인의 침묵이 영향을 줬다고 보십니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v4].text,"두 분, 서로에게 직접 묻지 못한 두려움이 돈 문제에서 어떻게 터졌는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-2-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 피해를 막는다고 느꼈던 행동이 다른 피해를 만들 수 있다는 생각은 들지 않았습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 송금 뒤 수치심이 가장 크게 올라온 순간이 언제였는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
