,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨에게 말하지 못한 말이 지금도 남아 있다면 무엇입니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 손실을 알게 됐을 때 배신감과 걱정 중 어느 감정이 먼저였습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v4].text,"두 분, 돈을 잃은 사실보다 서로에게 숨겼다는 사실이 더 아팠는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-3-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 기록을 보며 스스로도 잘못된 길이라는 걸 느낀 순간이 있었습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 서류에 이름을 적은 기억이 지금 어떤 감정으로 남아 있습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 돈을 잃은 뒤 가장 먼저 떠오른 사람이 이준호 씨였습니까, 본인 책임이었습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 행동을 알게 된 뒤에도 부부로 남아 있는 감정이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v4].text,"두 분, 이 사건에서 가장 부끄러워서 늦게 말한 사실이 무엇인지 각자 밝히십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-empathy_approach-4-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 수치심을 이유로 숨긴 시간이 이준호 씨에게 더 큰 상처가 됐다는 점을 어떻게 받아들이십니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 공동 적금 해지 절차가 시작된 날 은행에 누가 갔는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 서류를 손에 들기 전 본인 명의와 이준호 씨 명의를 어떻게 확인하셨습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 공동 적금 해지 연락을 언제 처음 들었고 그때 본인 동의가 있었습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v4].text,"두 분, 공동 적금이 해지된 날짜와 그 사실을 서로 안 시점을 먼저 맞춰 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-1-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 그 적금이 빠져나간 과정을 단순 절차로 보셨는지 본인 실행으로 보셨는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 서류를 준비한 사람이 본인인지, 그리고 이준호 씨 동의를 실제로 받았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 본인 동의가 있었다는 설명을 들은 적이 있는지 날짜와 상황을 구분해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v3].text,"두 분, 해지 서류와 해지 서류가 만들어진 과정에서 누가 무엇을 확인했는지 따로 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v4].text,"박지연 씨, 은행에 제출된 서류를 보면서 멈출 수 있었던 순간이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-2-v5].text,"이준호 씨, 공동 적금 해지 사실을 뒤늦게 알았을 때 가장 먼저 의심한 부분이 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 서류에 이준호 씨 이름이 들어간 경위와 본인이 쓴 부분을 숨기지 말고 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 해지된 돈이 투자방 송금으로 이어진 날짜와 금액을 차례로 밝혀 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 서명과 해지 절차가 본인 의사와 다르다는 점을 언제 확인하셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v4].text,"두 분, 해지 서류 절차 문제 의심과 투자방 송금 기록이 어디서 처음 맞물렸는지 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-3-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨 서명을 대신한 사실을 지금 이 자리에서 인정하십니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 해지 서류를 조작하는 일이 범죄가 될 수 있다는 점을 알고도 실행했습니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방 손실까지 난 뒤에도 왜 이준호 씨에게 밝히지 않았는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 서류 조작을 알게 된 뒤 어떤 사실을 먼저 확인하려 했습니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v4].text,"두 분, 이준호 씨의 침묵과 박지연 씨의 해지 서류 절차 문제를 같은 책임으로 볼 수 있는지 따로 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 확인한다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Confirm the surface facts; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,表面上の事実を確認する。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-fact_pursuit-4-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 피해자였다는 마음이 서명을 대신 쓰는 행동까지 허락했다고 보십니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the joint savings cancellation procedure.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理共同储蓄账户解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 공동 적금을 먼저 지켜야 한다고 느낀 이유가 외도 의심에서 어떻게 시작됐습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 해지를 떠올리게 만든 가장 직접적인 두려움이 버려짐이었는지 돈 문제였는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨가 그런 선택까지 하게 된 불안을 그때 어느 정도 알고 계셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v4].text,"두 분, 돈을 지킨다는 말이 언제부터 서로를 믿지 않는 행동으로 바뀌었는지 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; start with a basic question.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。基礎質問から始める。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-1-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 제 몫을 지키려 했다는 생각이 서류를 손대는 판단으로 이어진 과정을 들려주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 외도라고 믿은 마음이 공동 적금 해지로 이어진 과정을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 이혼을 대비해야 한다는 판단이 실제로 있었는지, 있었다면 언제 굳어졌는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 숨긴 사정이 박지연 씨의 선제 행동을 자극했다고 보는 부분이 있습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v4].text,"두 분, 외도 의심과 적금 해지를 한 사건처럼 묶게 된 이유를 각자 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-2-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨에게 묻는 길보다 돈을 먼저 움직이는 길을 택한 이유를 밝혀 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 자기 몫을 지켜야 한다는 생각이 왜 이준호 씨 서명까지 대신하는 행동으로 넘어갔습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 투자방에 보내면 상황을 되돌릴 수 있다고 믿은 근거가 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨가 돈을 빼기 전 이미 부부 재산을 불신하고 있었다는 신호를 보셨습니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v4].text,"두 분, 각자의 비밀이 상대의 더 큰 비밀을 부른 지점을 지금 어떻게 보십니까.","Both of you, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; draw out the concealed context.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-3-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 두려움이 있었다 해도 서류를 꾸민 선택은 본인 행동이라는 점을 어떻게 받아들이십니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨 이름을 서류에 쓰던 순간 무엇을 계산했고 무엇을 외면했습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 범죄가 될 수 있다는 걸 알면서도 멈추지 못한 마음을 변명 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v3].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 숨긴 사정이 있었다 해도 해지 서류 절차 문제까지 정당화될 수 없다는 점에 동의하십니까.","Mr. Lee, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",イ・ジュノさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,李俊浩先生，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v4].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v4].text,"두 분, 상대의 잘못을 이유로 본인의 선을 넘은 행동을 어디까지 설명할 수 있다고 보십니까.","Both of you, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please each explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",お二人とも、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、それぞれがなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,两位，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请各自说明为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v5].behaviorHint,행동 뒤의 판단과 두려움을 묻는다. 공동 적금 해지의 절차와 책임을 좁힌다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.,Ask about the judgment and fear behind the action; narrow the procedure and responsibility for the joint savings cancellation; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.,行動の背後にある判断と恐れを問う。共同積立預金の解約手続きと責任を絞り込む。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,询问行动背后的判断与恐惧。缩小共同储蓄账户解约程序与责任范围。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-h-d3-motive_search-4-v5].text,"박지연 씨, 왜 그렇게 확신하고 돈을 먼저 빼야 한다는 결론까지 밀어붙였습니까.","Ms. Park, in relation to the joint savings cancellation procedure, please explain why you acted as you did, without folding it into the other party’s fault.",パク・ジヨンさん、共同積立預金の解約手続きについて、相手の過ちにまとめず、ご自身がなぜその行動を取ったのか説明してください。,朴智妍女士，围绕共同储蓄账户解约程序，请说明您为什么那样行动，不要把它并入对方的过错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"두 분, 상대가 먼저였다고 말할 때 그 말 안에 가장 크게 섞인 감정이 무엇인지 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 계좌를 확인하던 날의 불안과 적금을 해지하던 날의 마음은 같았습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 가족을 숨기던 마음과 현금을 꺼내던 마음은 같은 책임감이었습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v4].text,"두 분, 돈의 순서보다 먼저 무너진 신뢰가 어디서 시작됐는지 각자 짚어 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-1-v5].text,"두 분, 서로를 향한 원망이 사실의 순서를 바꿔 기억하게 만들지는 않았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 먼저 버림받을까 두려웠던 마음이 나중에는 돈을 움직이는 용기로 바뀌었습니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 가족을 숨긴 시간이 길어질수록 박지연 씨에게 말할 수 없다는 마음도 커졌습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v3].text,"두 분, 각자 혼자 버티겠다고 생각한 시간이 어떻게 부부 돈의 손실로 이어졌는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v4].text,"두 분, 상처를 피하려 한 선택이 결국 더 큰 상처를 만든 순간을 각자 떠올려 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-2-v5].text,"두 분, 지금 가장 인정하기 어려운 순서가 무엇인지 숨기지 말고 말해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; draw out the concealed context.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 침묵을 떠올릴 때 아직도 본인 행동을 덜 무겁게 보게 됩니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; draw out the concealed context.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨의 서류 조작을 보면서도 본인이 먼저 만든 침묵이 떠오르지는 않았습니까.","Mr. Lee, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,李俊浩先生，请说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; draw out the concealed context.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-3-v3].text,"두 분, 각자 상대 탓을 먼저 말하고 나면 본인 책임을 말하기가 왜 더 어려워졌습니까.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
