,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-3-v4].text,"두 분, 부부 합산 손실이라는 결과 앞에서 가장 먼저 떠오르는 후회가 무엇입니까.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
