,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 적금 해지와 투자방 손실을 떠올릴 때 가장 먼저 드는 감정은 두려움입니까, 수치심입니까.","Ms. Park, please describe the feelings and fears that were hardest for you to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が最も認めにくかった感情と恐れを述べてください。,朴智妍女士，请说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序，您最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-4-v3].text,"두 분, 서로를 지키려 했다는 말이 왜 서로를 더 혼자 두는 결과가 됐는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-4-v4].text,"두 분, 먼저 잘못한 사람을 가리는 일보다 먼저 인정해야 할 본인 행동이 무엇인지 답하십시오.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,"감정의 압력을 열어 진술을 깊게 만든다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.","Open emotional pressure to deepen the statement; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.",感情の圧力を開き、陳述を深める。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,打开情绪压力，使陈述更深入。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-empathy_approach-4-v5].text,"두 분, 이 사건의 순서가 드러난 뒤에도 상대에게 꼭 전하고 싶은 말이 남아 있습니까.","Both of you, please each describe the feelings and fears that were hardest to admit regarding the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、認めにくかった感情と恐れをそれぞれ述べてください。,两位，请各自说明围绕隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序最难承认的情绪与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"두 분, 숨김이 시작된 순서와 실제 돈이 움직인 순서를 한 줄로 섞지 말고 따로 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 계좌를 먼저 확인하기 시작한 시점과 공동 적금을 해지한 시점을 구분해 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 그 개인적인 일을 숨긴 시점과 현금을 꺼낸 시점을 나눠서 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v4].text,"두 분, 누가 먼저 배신했는지라는 말보다 누가 먼저 무엇을 숨겼는지부터 맞춰 보겠습니다.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 기초 질문으로 출발한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; start with a basic question.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。基礎質問から始める。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。从基础问题开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-1-v5].text,"두 분, 오피스텔 숨김과 계좌 감시와 돈 실행을 각각 다른 줄에 놓고 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"두 분, 계좌 확인, 개인 현금 출금, 공동 적금 해지를 한데 묶지 말고 각각 날짜별로 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
