,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 실제 송금 실행이 언제였고 그 전부터 어떤 확인을 해왔는지 구분해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
