,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-2-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 개인 비자금 출금이 공동 적금 해지보다 어떤 순서에 있었는지 기억대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-2-v4].text,"두 분, 감정의 선후와 돈의 선후가 서로 다를 수 있다는 점을 전제로 다시 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 증거와 진술의 빈틈을 맞춘다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; line up the gaps between evidence and statements.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。証拠と陳述の隙間を照合する。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。对齐证据与陈述之间的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-2-v5].text,"두 분, 먼저 숨긴 사람과 먼저 서류를 조작한 사람을 같은 말로 처리하지 말고 나눠 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; draw out the concealed context.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"두 분, 개인 출금 내역과 투자방 송금 기록과 적금 해지 서류를 시간표에 놓고 다시 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; draw out the concealed context.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨가 먼저 숨겼어도 공동 적금 실행은 본인이 한 일인지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; draw out the concealed context.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v3].text,"이준호 씨, 본인이 먼저 숨긴 사정과 박지연 씨의 서류 조작을 같은 책임으로 돌릴 수 있다고 보십니까.","Mr. Lee, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",イ・ジュノさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,李俊浩先生，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; draw out the concealed context.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v4].text,"두 분, 부부 합산 손실이 어디서 각각 생겼는지 금액과 행위를 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 숨긴 맥락을 드러내게 한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; draw out the concealed context.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。隠した文脈を明らかにさせる。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。引出被隐瞒的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-3-v5].text,"두 분, 숨긴 사정은 누구에게서 먼저 시작됐고 돈을 빼낸 실행은 어디서 먼저 확인되는지 답하십시오.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,"표면 사실을 확인한다. 숨김, 감시, 실행, 조작을 분리해 시간순을 고정한다. 책임을 피하지 못하게 정리한다.","Confirm the surface facts; separate concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation, then fix the chronology; organize the point so responsibility cannot be avoided.",表面上の事実を確認する。隠蔽、監視、実行、操作を切り分け、時系列を固定する。責任を避けられないよう整理する。,确认表面事实。分开隐瞒、监视、执行、操纵，并固定时间顺序。整理到无法逃避责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"두 분, 지금은 상대가 먼저였다는 말보다 각자 먼저 한 행동의 이름을 차분히 말해야 합니다.","Both of you, please separate what each of you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",お二人とも、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、それぞれが見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,两位，请分开各自看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
