,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_question].entries[h-d4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-h-d4-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"박지연 씨, 이준호 씨의 침묵이 있었다 해도 해지 서류 절차 문제과 송금 실행은 본인 행동이라는 점을 인정하십니까.","Ms. Park, please separate what you saw, did, and assumed, and set out the chronology of the order of concealment, monitoring, execution, and manipulation.",パク・ジヨンさん、隠蔽・監視・実行・操作の順序について、ご自身が見たこと、したこと、推測したことを分け、時系列で整理してください。,朴智妍女士，请分开您看到的、做过的、推定的内容，并按时间顺序整理隐瞒、监视、执行与操纵的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
