,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewit-w-3-soft-v1].text,박미라 씨를 모시겠습니다. 투자방 링크가 어떻게 전달됐고 박지연 씨가 어떤 말을 했는지 차분히 듣겠습니다.,I will call Ms. Park Mi-ra. We will calmly hear how the investment chat link was delivered and what Ms. Park Ji-yeon said.,パク・ミラさんをお呼びします。投資チャットのリンクがどう渡され、パク・ジヨンさんがどんなことを言ったのか、落ち着いて聞きます。,传唤朴美罗女士。冷静听取投资群链接如何传递，以及朴智妍女士说了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewit-w-3-soft-v2].behaviorHint,박미라 증언이 투자방 링크 전달과 박지연의 선제 송금 발언에 미치는 영향을 재판관이 먼저 밝힌다.,The Judge first states how Park Mi-ra’s testimony will bear on the investment chat link and Park Ji-yeon’s prior statement about transferring money.,パク・ミラの証言が、投資チャットのリンク共有とパク・ジヨンの先行送金発言にどう関わるかを裁判官が先に示す。,法官先说明朴美罗的证言将如何影响投资群链接传递和朴智妍先行转账发言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewit-w-3-soft-v2].text,박미라 씨께 먼저 묻겠습니다. 송금 결심 전후의 대화를 순서대로 확인하겠습니다.,"I will first ask Ms. Park Mi-ra. We will confirm the conversation before and after the decision to transfer, in order.",まずパク・ミラさんに尋ねます。送金を決める前後の会話を順に確認します。,先询问朴美罗女士。按顺序确认决定转账前后的对话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
