,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewit-w-3-soft-v3].text,박미라 씨를 부르겠습니다. 투자방 텔레그램과 박지연 씨의 돈 지키기 발언 사이를 살펴보겠습니다.,I will call Ms. Park Mi-ra. We will examine the link between the investment chat on Telegram and Ms. Park Ji-yeon’s statement about protecting her money.,パク・ミラさんをお呼びします。投資チャットのテレグラムと、パク・ジヨンさんの「お金を守る」という発言の間を見ていきます。,传唤朴美罗女士。查看Telegram投资群与朴智妍女士“守住钱”的发言之间的关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewit-w-3-soft-v4].behaviorHint,박미라 증언이 투자방 링크 전달과 박지연의 선제 송금 발언에 미치는 영향을 재판관이 먼저 밝힌다.,The Judge first states how Park Mi-ra’s testimony will bear on the investment chat link and Park Ji-yeon’s prior statement about transferring money.,パク・ミラの証言が、投資チャットのリンク共有とパク・ジヨンの先行送金発言にどう関わるかを裁判官が先に示す。,法官先说明朴美罗的证言将如何影响投资群链接传递和朴智妍先行转账发言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewit-w-3-soft-v4].text,"박미라 씨, 들어와 주십시오. 링크 전달 경위와 그때 들은 말을 차분히 말씀해 주셔야 합니다.","Ms. Park Mi-ra, please come in. You must calmly state how the link was sent and what you heard at the time.",パク・ミラさん、入ってください。リンク共有の経緯と、その時に聞いた言葉を落ち着いて述べてください。,朴美罗女士，请进。请冷静说明链接传递经过和当时听到的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewit-w-3-soft-v5].behaviorHint,박미라 증언이 투자방 링크 전달과 박지연의 선제 송금 발언에 미치는 영향을 재판관이 먼저 밝힌다.,The Judge first states how Park Mi-ra’s testimony will bear on the investment chat link and Park Ji-yeon’s prior statement about transferring money.,パク・ミラの証言が、投資チャットのリンク共有とパク・ジヨンの先行送金発言にどう関わるかを裁判官が先に示す。,法官先说明朴美罗的证言将如何影响投资群链接传递和朴智妍先行转账发言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewit-w-3-soft-v5].text,박미라 씨의 기억을 통해 투자방 송금이 어떤 대화 뒤에 시작됐는지 확인하겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Park Mi-ra’s memory, we will confirm after what conversation the investment chat transfer began.",パク・ミラさんの記憶を通じて、どの会話の後に投資チャットへの送金が始まったのか確認します。,通过朴美罗女士的记忆，确认投资群转账是在怎样的对话之后开始的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v1].behaviorHint,조건을 받아들이면서도 자기 방어선을 분명히 세운다.,Accepts the conditions while clearly setting a defensive line.,条件を受け入れつつ、自分の防衛線をはっきり引く。,接受条件，同时明确设下自己的防线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v1].text,조건을 나누신다면 따르겠습니다. 남편의 침묵과 제 해지 서류 문제를 각각의 책임으로 봐주십시오.,"If the conditions are divided, I will follow them. Please treat my husband’s silence and my issue with the cancellation documents as separate responsibilities.",条件を分けるなら従います。夫の沈黙と私の解約書類の問題は、それぞれの責任として見てください。,如果分条件处理，我会服从。请把丈夫的沉默和我的解约文件问题分别看作各自的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v10].behaviorHint,재판관에게 양쪽 무게를 맡기려는 태도다.,A posture of leaving the weight on both sides to the Judge.,双方の重みを裁判官に委ねようとする態度。,表现出把双方分量交由法官衡量的态度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v10].text,"합의의 기준을 세워주십시오. 저는 제 잘못을 말하고, 남편도 먼저 숨긴 사실을 말해야 합니다.","Please set the standard for settlement. I will speak to what I did wrong, and my husband must also speak to what he hid first.",合意の基準を示してください。私は自分の過ちを話しますし、夫も先に隠した事実を話すべきです。,请定下和解标准。我会说明我的过错，丈夫也必须说明他先隐瞒的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v2].behaviorHint,자기 책임만 앞세워질까 경계한다.,Wary that only their own responsibility may be pushed to the front.,自分の責任だけが前面に出されることを警戒している。,警惕只有自己的责任被摆到前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v2].text,제가 인정할 부분은 인정하겠습니다. 대신 남편의 다른 큰돈 전달도 따로 기록되어야 합니다.,I will admit what I should. But my husband’s other large money handoff must also be recorded separately.,認めるべきところは認めます。ただ、夫の別の大金の受け渡しも別に記録されるべきです。,我该承认的会承认。但丈夫另外那笔大额交付也必须另行记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v3].behaviorHint,피해자 프레임을 낮추지만 완전히 내려놓지는 않는다.,Lowers the victim framing without fully letting it go.,被害者としての枠組みを弱めるが、完全には手放していない。,弱化受害者框架，但并未完全放下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v3].text,조건부라면 괜찮습니다. 외도 오해가 풀린 뒤에도 왜 제가 그렇게 몰렸는지는 남겨주셨으면 합니다.,"Conditional terms are acceptable. Even after the affair misunderstanding is cleared, I want it left on record why I was driven that far.",条件付きなら構いません。不倫の誤解が解けた後でも、なぜ私がそこまで追い込まれたのかは残してほしいです。,有条件的话可以。即便出轨误会解开，也请留下我为什么会被逼到那一步的记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v4].behaviorHint,선후를 붙잡으며 호흡을 고른다.,Regains breath while holding on to the sequence of events.,前後関係をつかみながら呼吸を整える。,抓住先后顺序，调整呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v4].text,제가 적금 쪽 책임을 듣겠습니다. 다만 남편이 가족 사정을 숨긴 것이 먼저였다는 점도 같이 봐주십시오.,I will hear the responsibility on the savings side. But please also consider that my husband hid the family circumstances first.,積立預金のほうの責任は受け止めます。ただ、夫が家族の事情を先に隠していた点も一緒に見てください。,我会听取储蓄账户方面的责任。但也请一并看清，丈夫隐瞒家庭情况在先。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v5].behaviorHint,말을 조심스럽게 고르며 책임 분리를 요청한다.,Chooses words carefully and asks to separate responsibility.,慎重に言葉を選び、責任の切り分けを求める。,谨慎措辞，请求分开责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v5].text,조건을 세워주시면 답하겠습니다. 제가 한 행동과 남편이 숨긴 이유를 한 문장으로 묶지 않았으면 합니다.,"If you set the conditions, I will answer. I do not want my actions and my husband’s reason for hiding things tied into one sentence.",条件を示してくだされば答えます。私がしたことと、夫が隠した理由を一つの文でまとめないでほしいです。,如果您设定条件，我会回答。请不要把我的行为和丈夫隐瞒的理由合成一句话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v6].behaviorHint,수치심을 드러내면서도 동기 설명을 요구한다.,Shows shame while asking that the motive be heard.,羞恥を見せながらも、動機の説明を求める。,显露羞耻，同时要求说明动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v6].text,"받겠습니다. 대신 제 수치심만 보지 말고, 제가 왜 제 몫을 지키려 했는지도 들어주십시오.",I accept. But please do not look only at my shame; hear why I tried to protect my share.,受け入れます。ただ、私の羞恥だけを見るのではなく、なぜ自分の分を守ろうとしたのかも聞いてください。,我接受。但请不要只看我的羞耻，也请听听我为什么想守住自己的那一份。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v7].behaviorHint,자기 인정과 상대 요구를 같은 무게로 놓는다.,Places self-admission and demands of the other side on equal weight.,自分の認めることと相手への要求を同じ重みで置く。,把自我承认与对对方的要求放在同等分量上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v7].text,"조건부 합의라면, 저는 공동 적금 문제를 인정하겠습니다. 남편도 비자금과 숨긴 사용처 이야기를 피하지 않아야 합니다.","If this is a conditional settlement, I will admit the issue with the joint savings account. My husband also must not avoid talking about the hidden funds and where they went.",条件付きの合意なら、共同積立預金の問題は認めます。夫も隠し資金とその使途の話から逃げてはいけません。,如果是有条件和解，我会承认共同储蓄账户的问题。丈夫也不能回避私房钱和隐瞒用途的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v8].behaviorHint,사건을 다시 정리하며 감정을 누른다.,Suppresses emotion while reorganizing the case.,事件を整理し直しながら感情を抑える。,重新整理案件，同时压住情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v8].text,"그 틀 안에서 말하겠습니다. 외도 의심, 비자금, 적금 해지는 순서대로 분리되어야 합니다.","I will speak within that framework. The affair suspicion, hidden funds, and savings cancellation need to be separated in order.",その枠の中で話します。不倫の疑い、隠し資金、積立預金の解約は順番に切り分けるべきです。,我会在这个框架内说明。出轨怀疑、私房钱、储蓄账户解约必须按顺序分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v9].behaviorHint,상처와 방어가 다시 올라온다.,Hurt and defensiveness rise again.,傷と防御が再び浮かび上がる。,伤痛和防御再次浮上来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v9].text,조건을 받겠습니다. 다만 저만 계산적인 사람으로 남는 조건이면 받아들이기 어렵습니다.,"I will accept the conditions. But if the conditions leave only me as the calculating one, I cannot accept them.",条件は受け入れます。ただ、私だけが計算高い人間として残る条件なら受け入れにくいです。,我接受条件。但如果条件只把我留下成一个算计的人，我很难接受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v1].behaviorHint,돈의 축을 정확히 가르며 방어선을 세운다.,Draws a defensive line by separating the money issues precisely.,金の軸を正確に分けながら防衛線を引く。,准确划分金钱问题，同时设下防线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v1].text,조건부로 가는 건 괜찮습니다. 대신 다른 큰돈 전달과 공동 적금 해지를 각각 따져야 합니다.,Conditional terms are fine. But the other large money handoff and the joint savings cancellation must be judged separately.,条件付きで進めるのは構いません。ただ、別の大金の受け渡しと共同積立預金の解約はそれぞれ検討すべきです。,走有条件处理可以。但另外那笔大额交付和共同储蓄账户解约必须分别审视。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v10].behaviorHint,양쪽 변명을 동시에 낮추는 어조다.,A tone that lowers both sides’ excuses at once.,双方の言い訳を同時に抑える口調。,语气同时压低双方的辩解。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v10].text,"조건이 분명하면 답하겠습니다. 제 선의가 면죄부가 아니듯, 아내의 공포도 면죄부가 아닙니다.","If the conditions are clear, I will answer. Just as my good intentions are not an excuse, my wife’s fear is not an excuse either.",条件が明確なら答えます。私の善意が免罪符ではないように、妻の恐怖も免罪符ではありません。,如果条件明确，我会回答。就像我的善意不是免罪符，妻子的恐惧也不是免罪符。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v2].behaviorHint,억울함을 누르고 절차 위반을 받아들인다.,Suppresses resentment and accepts the procedural violation.,悔しさを抑え、手続き違反を受け入れる。,压住委屈，接受程序违规。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v2].text,저도 조건을 받겠습니다. 외도가 아니었다는 사실 뒤에 숨김 책임까지 적어주시면 됩니다.,"I will accept the conditions too. It is enough if the record includes the responsibility I bear for hiding things, even though it was not an affair.",私も条件を受け入れます。不倫ではなかったという事実の後に、隠した責任まで記録してくだされば結構です。,我也接受条件。只要在不是出轨这一事实之后，也记录我隐瞒的责任即可。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v3].behaviorHint,월권과 범죄 축을 분리하려는 힘이 보인다.,Shows an effort to separate overreach from the criminal axis.,越権と犯罪の軸を切り分けようとする力が見える。,显出试图区分越权与犯罪轴线的力量。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v3].text,"조건을 세우신다면, 제 숨긴 사정과 제 아내의 해지 서류 문제를 같은 말로 섞지 말아주십시오.","If you set conditions, please do not mix my concealed circumstances and my wife’s cancellation-document issue into the same words.",条件を立てるなら、私が隠した事情と妻の解約書類の問題を同じ言葉で混ぜないでください。,如果您设定条件，请不要把我隐瞒的情况和我妻子的解约文件问题混在同一说法里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v4].behaviorHint,선후와 실행을 구분하려 한다.,Tries to separate sequence from execution.,前後関係と実行を区別しようとしている。,试图区分先后与执行。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v4].text,"괜찮습니다. 제가 먼저 숨긴 건 인정하되, 제 아내가 먼저 실행한 적금 해지도 함께 보셔야 합니다.","That is fine. I admit that I hid things first, but you must also consider that my wife was the one who first carried out the savings cancellation.",構いません。私が先に隠したことは認めますが、妻が先に実行した積立預金の解約も一緒に見ていただく必要があります。,可以。我承认是我先隐瞒，但也必须一并看清我妻子先执行了储蓄账户解约。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v5].behaviorHint,상대의 숨은 책임을 정면으로 올린다.,Puts the other side’s hidden responsibility squarely on the table.,相手の隠れた責任を正面から持ち出す。,正面提出对方隐藏的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v5].text,"조건부라면 따르겠습니다. 그 가족 일을 숨긴 책임은 듣고, 투자방 손실도 사실로 놓겠습니다.","If conditional, I will follow. Hear the responsibility for hiding that family matter, and treat the investment chat loss as a fact as well.",条件付きなら従います。その家族の件を隠した責任は受け止め、投資チャットの損失も事実として置きます。,如果是有条件处理，我会服从。请听取我隐瞒那件家庭事的责任，也把投资群损失作为事实摆出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v6].behaviorHint,차분하지만 단단한 반박이 섞인다.,"Calm, but with a firm rebuttal mixed in.",落ち着いているが、固い反論が混じる。,冷静中夹着坚定反驳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v6].text,"받겠습니다. 다만 저한테만 침묵 책임을 묻고, 제 아내의 서류 문제를 미루면 안 됩니다.",I accept. But you cannot ask only me to bear responsibility for silence and put off my wife’s document issue.,受け入れます。ただ、私にだけ沈黙の責任を問い、妻の書類問題を先送りしてはいけません。,我接受。但不能只追究我的沉默责任，却推迟处理我妻子的文件问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v7].behaviorHint,자기 잘못을 범위 안에서 인정하려 한다.,Tries to admit their own fault within a defined scope.,自分の過ちを範囲の中で認めようとしている。,试图在范围内承认自己的错误。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v7].text,조건을 나누면 말하겠습니다. 현금 전달의 이유와 배우자 배제의 잘못을 따로 듣겠습니다.,"If you divide the conditions, I will speak. I will hear separately the reason for the cash handoff and the fault in excluding my spouse.",条件を分けるなら話します。現金手渡しの理由と配偶者を排除した過ちを、別々に聞きます。,如果分开条件，我会说。请分别听取现金交付的理由和排除配偶的错误。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v8].behaviorHint,결론을 성급히 닫지 말라는 경계가 있다.,A caution not to close the conclusion too hastily.,結論を性急に閉じないでほしいという警戒がある。,带有不要仓促封闭结论的戒备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v8].text,조건부 합의는 가능합니다. 외도 오해를 거둔 뒤에도 돈 흐름은 끝까지 보셔야 합니다.,"A conditional settlement is possible. Even after the affair misunderstanding is withdrawn, you must follow the money flow to the end.",条件付きの合意は可能です。不倫の誤解を取り下げた後でも、金の流れは最後まで見ていただく必要があります。,有条件和解可以。即便撤回出轨误会，也必须把资金流向看到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v9].behaviorHint,책임의 순서를 붙잡으며 고개를 끄덕인다.,Nods while holding on to the order of responsibility.,責任の順序をつかみながらうなずく。,抓住责任顺序，点头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v9].text,그 틀이라면 따르겠습니다. 제가 숨긴 시작과 아내가 넘은 선을 따로 기록해 주십시오.,"If that is the framework, I will comply. Please record separately where I began hiding things and where my wife crossed the line.",その枠組みなら従います。私が隠し始めたところと、妻が越えた線を別々に記録してください。,如果是这个框架，我会遵从。请分别记录我开始隐瞒的起点和妻子越过的线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v1].behaviorHint,감정보다 사실을 붙잡으려 애쓴다.,Tries to hold on to facts rather than emotion.,感情より事実をつかもうとしている。,努力抓住事实而非情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v1].text,"사실부터 가주시면 좋겠습니다. 외도였는지, 비자금이 어디로 갔는지, 적금은 누가 깼는지 순서대로요.","I would like to start with the facts: whether it was an affair, where the hidden funds went, and who cancelled the savings account, in that order.",事実から進めていただけると助かります。不倫だったのか、隠し資金がどこへ行ったのか、積立預金は誰が解約したのか、その順番で。,希望先从事实开始：是不是出轨、私房钱去了哪里、储蓄账户是谁解约的，按这个顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v10].behaviorHint,받아들이기 어려운 두 사실을 동시에 놓는다.,Places two hard-to-accept facts side by side.,受け入れがたい二つの事実を同時に置く。,同时摆出两个难以接受的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v10].text,"차례대로 가겠습니다. 외도는 아니었다는 사실과, 제 적금 해지 책임을 둘 다 듣겠습니다.",I will proceed in order. I will hear both that it was not an affair and my responsibility for cancelling the savings account.,順番に進めます。不倫ではなかったという事実と、私の積立預金解約の責任をどちらも受け止めます。,我会按顺序来。不是出轨这一事实，以及我对储蓄账户解约的责任，我都会听取。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v2].behaviorHint,자기 책임이 뭉개지거나 과장되지 않길 바란다.,Wants their responsibility neither blurred nor exaggerated.,自分の責任が曖昧にされたり誇張されたりしないことを望んでいる。,希望自己的责任既不被模糊，也不被夸大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v2].text,먼저 사실을 놓겠습니다. 남편의 방문 이유와 제 공동 적금 해지는 같은 축이 아닙니다.,I will lay out the facts first. My husband’s reason for visiting and my joint savings cancellation are not the same axis.,まず事実を置きます。夫の訪問理由と私の共同積立預金の解約は、同じ軸ではありません。,先摆事实。丈夫的探访理由和我解约共同储蓄账户，并不是同一条轴线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v3].behaviorHint,오독의 지점을 받아들이려 한다.,Tries to accept the point of misreading.,誤読の地点を受け入れようとしている。,试图接受误读发生的点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v3].text,그렇게 해주십시오. 제가 본 정황과 실제 사용처가 어디서 갈라졌는지부터 봐야 합니다.,Please do. We need to begin by seeing where the circumstances I saw diverged from the actual use of the money.,そうしてください。私が見た状況と実際の使途がどこで分かれたのかから見るべきです。,请这样做。必须先看我看到的情况和实际用途是从哪里分开的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v4].behaviorHint,불리한 단어도 직접 올리며 목소리를 낮춘다.,Lowers the voice while bringing up even unfavorable words directly.,不利な言葉も自分で持ち出しながら声を落とす。,主动提起不利词语，同时压低声音。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v4].text,"사실을 먼저 보면 저도 피하지 않겠습니다. 비자금, 적금, 해지 서류 순서가 분명해야 합니다.","If we look at the facts first, I will not avoid them either. The order of hidden funds, savings, and cancellation documents must be clear.",事実を先に見るなら、私も逃げません。隠し資金、積立預金、解約書類の順序が明確でなければなりません。,如果先看事实，我也不会回避。私房钱、储蓄账户、解约文件的顺序必须清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v5].behaviorHint,해석과 사실을 분리하려는 노력이 보인다.,Shows an effort to separate interpretation from fact.,解釈と事実を切り分けようとする努力が見える。,显出试图区分解读与事实的努力。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v5].text,감정보다 기록을 먼저 보겠습니다. 제가 무서워서 붙인 해석과 실제 돈 흐름은 나눠야 합니다.,I will look at the records before emotion. The interpretation I attached out of fear and the actual money flow must be separated.,感情より先に記録を見ます。私が怖くて付けた解釈と、実際の金の流れは分けるべきです。,我会先看记录而非情绪。因害怕而加上的解读，必须和实际资金流向分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v6].behaviorHint,상처를 남기면서도 판단을 재판관에게 맡긴다.,Leaves hurt visible while entrusting judgment to the Judge.,傷を残しながらも判断を裁判官に委ねる。,留下伤痛，同时把判断交给法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v6].text,좋습니다. 외도 오해가 왜 생겼는지와 제가 어떤 선을 넘었는지를 따로 밝혀주십시오.,Good. Please separately reveal why the affair misunderstanding arose and what line I crossed.,結構です。不倫の誤解がなぜ生じたのかと、私がどの線を越えたのかを別々に明らかにしてください。,好。请分别查明出轨误会为什么产生，以及我越过了哪条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v7].behaviorHint,선후와 책임의 배열을 중시한다.,Places importance on sequence and the arrangement of responsibility.,前後関係と責任の並びを重視している。,重视先后顺序和责任排列。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v7].text,"사실부터라면 받아들이겠습니다. 남편의 숨김, 제 송금, 서류 문제가 순서대로 놓여야 합니다.","If we start with facts, I accept. My husband’s concealment, my transfer, and the document issue must be laid out in order.",事実からなら受け入れます。夫の隠蔽、私の送金、書類問題が順番に置かれるべきです。,如果从事实开始，我接受。丈夫的隐瞒、我的转账、文件问题必须按顺序摆出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v8].behaviorHint,스스로 감정을 누르고 사실 판단에 기대려 한다.,Suppresses emotion and tries to rely on factual judgment.,自分の感情を抑え、事実判断に頼ろうとしている。,压住自身情绪，试图依靠事实判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v8].text,그 방식이 맞습니다. 제가 억울하다고 말하기 전에 기록이 먼저 말해야 합니다.,"That is the right approach. Before I say I was wronged, the records should speak first.",その方式が正しいです。私が悔しいと言う前に、記録が先に語るべきです。,这个方式是对的。在我说委屈之前，记录应该先说话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v9].behaviorHint,말의 질서를 되찾으려 한다.,Tries to restore order to the words.,言葉の秩序を取り戻そうとしている。,试图找回话语的秩序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v9].text,사실을 먼저 보시면 제 말도 덜 흔들릴 것 같습니다. 제가 본 것과 제가 한 일을 분리하겠습니다.,"If you look at facts first, my own words may be less shaken. I will separate what I saw from what I did.",事実を先に見てくだされば、私の言葉も少し揺れずに済むと思います。私が見たことと私がしたことを分けます。,如果先看事实，我的话也许会少一些动摇。我会把我看到的和我做过的分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v1].behaviorHint,핵심 사실을 먼저 놓으며 회피를 줄인다.,Reduces evasion by putting the key facts first.,核心事実を先に置き、回避を減らす。,先摆核心事实，减少回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v1].text,"좋습니다. 사실부터 보겠습니다. 외도는 아니었고, 다른 큰돈은 별도 사용처로 간 돈입니다.","Good. We will look at the facts first. It was not an affair, and the other large sum went to a separate use.",結構です。事実から見ます。不倫ではなく、別の大金は別の使途へ行った金です。,好。先看事实。不是出轨，另一笔大额资金是去了单独用途的钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v10].behaviorHint,양쪽 심리를 사실 위에 올리려는 태도다.,A posture of placing both sides’ psychology on top of the facts.,双方の心理を事実の上に置こうとする態度。,表现出要把双方心理放到事实之上的态度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v10].text,"사실부터 듣겠습니다. 제 아내가 의심한 이유도, 제가 말하지 않은 이유도 따로 봐야 합니다.",I will hear the facts first. My wife’s reason for suspecting me and my reason for not speaking both need separate review.,事実から聞きます。妻が疑った理由も、私が言わなかった理由も、別々に見る必要があります。,先听事实。我妻子怀疑的理由，以及我没有说的理由，都需要分别查看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v2].behaviorHint,정황을 체계로 바꾸려는 태도다.,A posture of turning circumstances into a structure.,状況を体系に変えようとする態度。,表现出要把情况变成体系的态度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v2].text,"먼저 기록을 보셔야 합니다. 방문, 새벽 연락, 현금 전달, 적금 해지를 순서대로 따져주십시오.","You should look at the records first. Please examine the visits, early-morning contact, cash handoff, and savings cancellation in order.",まず記録を見るべきです。訪問、早朝の連絡、現金手渡し、積立預金の解約を順に検討してください。,应该先看记录。请按顺序审视探访、凌晨联系、现金交付、储蓄账户解约。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v3].behaviorHint,숨기던 축들을 한꺼번에 올려놓는다.,Places all the hidden axes on the table at once.,隠していた軸を一度に持ち出す。,一次性摆出一直隐瞒的轴线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v3].text,"사실부터라면 저도 피하지 않겠습니다. 그 가족 일, 비자금 전달, 아내의 서류 문제를 모두 보겠습니다.","If we start with facts, I will not avoid them. We will look at the family matter, the hidden-fund handoff, and my wife’s document issue.",事実からなら、私も逃げません。その家族の件、隠し資金の受け渡し、妻の書類問題をすべて見ます。,如果从事实开始，我也不会回避。那件家庭事、私房钱交付、妻子的文件问题，都要看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v4].behaviorHint,자기 잘못을 먼저 낮게 인정한다.,Quietly admits their own fault first.,自分の過ちを先に低く認める。,先低调承认自己的错误。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v4].text,그렇게 가주십시오. 외도 오해가 풀렸다고 제 침묵 책임이 없어지는 건 아닙니다.,Please proceed that way. The affair misunderstanding being cleared does not erase my responsibility for silence.,そのように進めてください。不倫の誤解が解けたからといって、私の沈黙の責任がなくなるわけではありません。,请这样进行。出轨误会解开，并不代表我的沉默责任就不存在。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v5].behaviorHint,숨겨진 돈의 흐름과 실제 실행 책임을 분리해 세운다.,Separates the hidden money flow from the responsibility for actual execution.,隠された金の流れと実際の実行責任を切り分けて立てる。,区分隐藏的资金流向和实际执行责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v5].text,사실을 먼저 놓으면 말하겠습니다. 누가 먼저 숨겼고 누가 실제로 돈을 움직였는지가 다릅니다.,"If we put facts first, I will speak. Who hid first and who actually moved the money are different matters.",事実を先に置くなら話します。誰が先に隠したのかと、誰が実際に金を動かしたのかは違います。,如果先摆事实，我会说。谁先隐瞒，和谁实际动了钱，是不同的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v6].behaviorHint,자기합리화보다 증거를 앞세운다.,Puts evidence before self-justification.,自己正当化より証拠を前に出す。,把证据放在自我合理化之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v6].text,좋습니다. 선의였다는 말보다 기록이 먼저입니다. 그 다음에 제 이유를 듣겠습니다.,"Good. Records come before claims of good intentions. After that, you can hear my reason.",結構です。善意だったという言葉より、記録が先です。その次に私の理由を聞いてください。,好。记录先于“我是善意”的说法。之后再听我的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v7].behaviorHint,금액과 출처를 분리해 말한다.,Speaks by separating the amount and the source.,金額と出どころを分けて話す。,把金额和来源分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v7].text,사실부터 정리하겠습니다. 별도로 건넨 돈과 공동 적금 손실은 같은 돈이 아닙니다.,I will organize the facts first. The money I handed over separately and the loss from the joint savings account are not the same money.,事実から整理します。別に渡した金と共同積立預金の損失は、同じ金ではありません。,先整理事实。单独交付的钱和共同储蓄账户的损失不是同一笔钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v8].behaviorHint,판의 중심이 바뀌는 걸 받아들인다.,Accepts that the center of the field is shifting.,場の中心が変わることを受け入れる。,接受局面的中心正在转移。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v8].text,기록을 먼저 보시면 저도 덜 숨기겠습니다. 외도 프레임에서 돈의 순서로 넘어가야 합니다.,"If you look at the records first, I will hide less. The frame must move from affair to the sequence of the money.",記録を先に見てくだされば、私も隠すことを減らします。不倫の枠組みから金の順序へ移るべきです。,如果先看记录，我也会少隐瞒一些。必须从出轨框架转向金钱顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v9].behaviorHint,책임 배열을 재판관에게 맡긴다.,Entrusts the arrangement of responsibility to the Judge.,責任の並びを裁判官に委ねる。,把责任排列交给法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v9].text,그 방식이면 됩니다. 제가 숨긴 시작과 제 아내가 실행한 선택을 차례대로 놓겠습니다.,"That approach is fine. I will lay out, in order, where I began hiding things and the choice my wife carried out.",その方式で構いません。私が隠し始めたところと、妻が実行した選択を順に置きます。,这个方式可以。我会按顺序摆出我开始隐瞒的起点和妻子执行的选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v1].behaviorHint,긴장한 채 수용하지만 자기 책임이 한 덩어리로 몰리는 건 막으려 한다.,"Tensely accepts, but tries to stop their own responsibility from being lumped together.",緊張したまま受け入れるが、自分の責任が一つにまとめられることは防ごうとする。,紧张地接受，但试图阻止自己的责任被归成一团。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v1].text,지금 정리하셔도 됩니다. 다만 외도 의심과 제가 공동 적금을 움직인 일은 따로 봐주셨으면 합니다.,You may organize it now. But I would like the affair suspicion and my moving the joint savings account to be viewed separately.,今整理していただいても構いません。ただ、不倫の疑いと私が共同積立預金を動かしたことは別に見てほしいです。,现在整理也可以。但请把出轨怀疑和我动用共同储蓄账户的事分开来看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v10].behaviorHint,결론을 받아들이며 마지막 방어를 남긴다.,Accepts the conclusion while leaving one last defense.,結論を受け入れながら、最後の防御を残す。,接受结论，同时留下最后的防御。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v10].text,지금 결정하셔도 저는 듣겠습니다. 다만 한쪽이 전부 나쁘다는 말로 끝나지 않았으면 합니다.,"If you decide now, I will listen. But I do not want this to end with one side being entirely at fault.",今決めていただいても、私は聞きます。ただ、片方がすべて悪いという言葉で終わってほしくありません。,现在决定，我也会听。但我不希望最后变成一方全错的说法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v2].behaviorHint,피해자 위치를 놓지 않으면서도 자기 행동을 따로 세운다.,Maintains the victim position while setting their own action apart.,被害者の位置を手放さずに、自分の行動を別に立てる。,不放下受害者位置，同时把自己的行为单独立起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v2].text,오늘 결론을 내리셔도 됩니다. 제 남편의 침묵과 제 적금 해지는 같은 말로 묶이지 않았으면 합니다.,You may reach a conclusion today. I do not want my husband’s silence and my savings cancellation tied together in the same words.,今日結論を出していただいても構いません。夫の沈黙と私の積立預金の解約を同じ言葉で結びつけないでほしいです。,今天作出结论也可以。请不要把我丈夫的沉默和我的储蓄账户解约用同一种说法捆在一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v3].behaviorHint,결론을 받아들이되 선후를 붙잡으려는 눈빛이다.,Accepts the conclusion but looks as though still clinging to sequence.,結論を受け入れつつも、前後関係をつかもうとする目つき。,接受结论，但眼神仍想抓住先后顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v3].text,"지금 판단하신다면, 제가 먼저 단정한 부분과 남편이 먼저 숨긴 부분을 순서대로 적어주셨으면 합니다.","If you judge now, please record in order the part I assumed first and the part my husband hid first.",今判断されるなら、私が先に断定した部分と夫が先に隠した部分を順番に記してください。,如果现在判断，请按顺序记录我先断定的部分和丈夫先隐瞒的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v4].behaviorHint,외도 오독을 인정하면서도 상대 책임을 남긴다.,Admits the affair misread while leaving the other side’s responsibility in place.,不倫の誤読を認めながらも、相手の責任を残す。,承认对出轨的误读，同时保留对方责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v4].text,바로 정리해도 괜찮습니다. 다만 외도 오해가 풀렸다고 제 남편의 숨김까지 사라지는 건 아니라고 봅니다.,It is fine to organize this now. But I believe that clearing the affair misunderstanding does not erase my husband’s concealment.,すぐ整理しても構いません。ただ、不倫の誤解が解けたからといって、夫の隠蔽まで消えるわけではないと思います。,现在整理也可以。但我认为出轨误会解开，并不代表我丈夫的隐瞒也随之消失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v5].behaviorHint,방어선이 낮아졌지만 책임 분리에는 단호하다.,"The defensive line has lowered, but remains firm about separating responsibility.",防衛線は低くなったが、責任の切り分けには断固としている。,防线已经降低，但对分开责任仍很坚决。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v5].text,저도 제 잘못을 피하지 않겠습니다. 대신 공동 적금 문제와 남편의 비자금 문제를 따로 판단해 주십시오.,I will not avoid what I did wrong. But please judge the joint savings issue and my husband’s hidden-fund issue separately.,私も自分の過ちから逃げません。その代わり、共同積立預金の問題と夫の隠し資金の問題は別に判断してください。,我也不会回避我的错误。但请分别判断共同储蓄账户问题和丈夫的私房钱问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v6].behaviorHint,수치심을 억누르며 오래된 불신을 꺼낸다.,Brings up old distrust while suppressing shame.,羞恥を抑えながら、古い不信を持ち出す。,压住羞耻，提出长久的不信。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v6].text,"오늘 끝내도 됩니다. 제가 돈을 움직인 건 사실이지만, 그 전에 집 안에서 쌓인 불신도 기록해 주셨으면 합니다.","You may end it today. It is true I moved the money, but I would like the distrust built up at home before that to be recorded as well.",今日終えても構いません。私が金を動かしたのは事実ですが、その前に家の中で積もった不信も記録してほしいです。,今天结束也可以。我动了钱是事实，但在那之前家里积累的不信也请记录下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v7].behaviorHint,자기 책임과 상대 책임을 동시에 붙잡는다.,Holds their own responsibility and the other side’s responsibility at the same time.,自分の責任と相手の責任を同時につかむ。,同时抓住自己的责任和对方的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v7].text,"결론을 미루지 않으셔도 됩니다. 저는 제 행동을 인정하되, 남편이 만든 오해의 출발도 같이 남기고 싶습니다.","You do not need to postpone the conclusion. I admit my actions, but I also want to preserve the beginning of the misunderstanding my husband created.",結論を先送りしなくても構いません。私は自分の行動を認めますが、夫が作った誤解の出発点も一緒に残したいです。,不必推迟结论。我承认自己的行为，但也想一并留下丈夫造成误会的起点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v8].behaviorHint,피해와 가해의 두 위치 사이에서 흔들린다.,Wavers between the positions of victim and wrongdoer.,被害と加害の二つの位置の間で揺れる。,在受害与加害两个位置之间动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v8].text,"지금 판을 닫으신다면, 제가 무너진 이유와 제가 넘은 선을 각각 적어주셨으면 합니다.","If you close the case now, please record separately why I broke down and what line I crossed.",今この場を閉じるなら、私が崩れた理由と私が越えた線をそれぞれ記してください。,如果现在收束局面，请分别记录我崩溃的理由和我越过的线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v9].behaviorHint,목소리는 낮지만 더 도망치지 않겠다는 기색이다.,"The voice is low, but there is a sign they will not run anymore.",声は低いが、これ以上逃げないという気配がある。,声音很低，但有不再逃避的迹象。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v9].text,"정리해 주십시오. 외도는 아니었다는 사실과, 제가 두려움으로 적금을 건드린 사실을 함께 보겠습니다.",Please organize it. I will consider both the fact that it was not an affair and the fact that I touched the savings out of fear.,整理してください。不倫ではなかったという事実と、私が恐怖から積立預金に手をつけた事実を一緒に見ます。,请整理。不是出轨这一事实，以及我因恐惧动了储蓄账户这一事实，我都会一起看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v1].behaviorHint,짧게 수용하며 더 이상 모호어로 버티지 않겠다는 태도다.,"Briefly accepts, showing they will no longer hold out with vague words.",短く受け入れ、これ以上曖昧な言葉で持ちこたえないという態度。,简短接受，表现出不再用含糊话语支撑的态度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v1].text,저도 지금 결론을 듣겠습니다. 외도는 아니었지만 제가 먼저 숨긴 책임까지 피하지 않겠습니다.,"I will hear the conclusion now as well. It was not an affair, but I will not avoid responsibility for hiding things first.",私も今、結論を聞きます。不倫ではありませんでしたが、私が先に隠した責任まで避けません。,我也现在听取结论。不是出轨，但我不会回避自己先隐瞒的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v10].behaviorHint,갈라진 책임을 분명히 하려는 목소리다.,A voice trying to make the divided responsibilities clear.,分かれた責任を明確にしようとする声。,声音试图明确分开的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v10].text,오늘 정리해도 좋습니다. 제가 숨긴 것과 제 아내가 실행한 것을 같은 덩어리로 보지 말아주십시오.,It is fine to organize it today. Please do not treat what I hid and what my wife carried out as one lump.,今日整理しても構いません。私が隠したことと妻が実行したことを、同じ塊として見ないでください。,今天整理也可以。请不要把我隐瞒的事和我妻子执行的事看成同一团。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v2].behaviorHint,핵심 사실을 말하며 시선을 아래에 둔다.,States the key fact while keeping their gaze lowered.,核心事実を話しながら視線を落とす。,说出核心事实，同时垂下视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v2].text,"바로 정리하셔도 됩니다. 그 가족 일은 사실이고, 제 아내에게 말하지 않은 것도 제 잘못입니다.","You may organize it right away. That family matter is real, and it is also my fault that I did not tell my wife.",すぐ整理していただいても構いません。その家族の件は事実で、妻に話さなかったことも私の過ちです。,可以立即整理。那件家庭事是真的，没有告诉妻子也是我的错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v3].behaviorHint,억울함과 책임 인정이 한 문장 안에 섞인다.,Resentment and admission of responsibility mix in one sentence.,悔しさと責任の認めが一つの文の中に混じる。,委屈和责任承认混在同一句话里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v3].text,오늘 판단하셔도 괜찮습니다. 다만 외도 오해와 다른 큰돈 전달 책임은 분리해서 봐주십시오.,You may judge today. But please view the affair misunderstanding and the responsibility for the other large money handoff separately.,今日判断していただいても構いません。ただ、不倫の誤解と別の大金の受け渡し責任は分けて見てください。,今天判断也可以。但请把出轨误会和另一笔大额交付责任分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v4].behaviorHint,선후와 범죄 축을 분리하려는 의지가 보인다.,Shows the will to separate sequence from the criminal axis.,前後関係と犯罪の軸を切り分けようとする意思が見える。,显出要区分先后与犯罪轴线的意志。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v4].text,"지금 결론을 내리신다면, 제가 숨긴 시작과 제 아내의 해지 서류 문제를 따로 적어주셨으면 합니다.","If you reach a conclusion now, please record separately where my concealment began and my wife’s cancellation-document issue.",今結論を出されるなら、私が隠し始めたところと妻の解約書類の問題を別々に記してください。,如果现在作出结论，请分别记录我开始隐瞒的起点和我妻子的解约文件问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v5].behaviorHint,오래 회피하던 태도를 거두려 애쓴다.,Tries to put away the evasive attitude held for so long.,長く回避していた態度を収めようと努める。,努力收起长期回避的态度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v5].text,저는 받을 준비가 됐습니다. 외도가 아니라는 사실만 앞세우고 돈 문제를 피하지는 않겠습니다.,I am ready to accept it. I will not put only the fact that it was not an affair first and avoid the money issue.,私は受け止める準備ができています。不倫ではないという事実だけを前に出して、金の問題を避けることはしません。,我已经准备好接受。不会只把不是出轨这一事实摆在前面，然后回避钱的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v6].behaviorHint,선의와 월권을 나눠 받아들이려 한다.,Tries to accept good intentions and overreach separately.,善意と越権を分けて受け入れようとしている。,试图分开接受善意与越权。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v6].text,바로 끝내도 됩니다. 그 돈의 사용처와 아내를 배제한 책임을 함께 듣겠습니다.,You may end it now. I will hear both where that money was used and my responsibility for excluding my wife.,すぐ終えても構いません。その金の使途と、妻を排除した責任を一緒に聞きます。,现在结束也可以。我会同时听取那笔钱的用途和排除妻子的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v7].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 시작점을 받아들이며 어깨가 내려앉는다.,Accepts the starting point of their silence as their shoulders drop.,自分の沈黙の出発点を受け入れ、肩を落とす。,接受自己沉默的起点，肩膀垂下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v7].text,"결론을 말씀해 주십시오. 제가 먼저 숨긴 건 맞고, 그 숨김이 오해를 키운 것도 인정합니다.","Please state the conclusion. It is true I hid it first, and I admit that concealment grew the misunderstanding.",結論を述べてください。私が先に隠したのは事実で、その隠蔽が誤解を大きくしたことも認めます。,请说明结论。确实是我先隐瞒，也承认那份隐瞒扩大了误会。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v8].behaviorHint,자기 책임을 인정하되 상대 책임도 세운다.,Admits their own responsibility while also setting up the other side’s responsibility.,自分の責任を認めつつ、相手の責任も立てる。,承认自己的责任，同时也立起对方责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v8].text,지금 판단하셔도 피하지 않겠습니다. 다만 제 아내의 적금 해지까지 같은 잣대로 보셔야 합니다.,"If you judge now, I will not avoid it. But you must apply the same standard to my wife’s savings cancellation.",今判断されても逃げません。ただ、妻の積立預金の解約まで同じ物差しで見ていただく必要があります。,现在判断，我也不会回避。但必须用同一标准看待我妻子的储蓄账户解约。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v9].behaviorHint,억울함을 절제하고 절차 위반을 받아들인다.,Restrains resentment and accepts the procedural violation.,悔しさを抑え、手続き違反を受け入れる。,克制委屈，接受程序违规。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v9].text,외도는 아니었습니다. 그래도 그 말만으로 제가 한 침묵과 현금 전달이 가벼워지진 않습니다.,"It was not an affair. Still, that alone does not make my silence and cash handoff lighter.",不倫ではありませんでした。それでも、その言葉だけで私の沈黙と現金手渡しが軽くなるわけではありません。,不是出轨。即便如此，仅凭这句话也不会让我的沉默和现金交付变轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v1].behaviorHint,감정이 차오르자 말을 멈추고 숨을 고른다.,Stops speaking and catches breath as emotion rises.,感情が込み上げ、言葉を止めて息を整える。,情绪涌上来，停住话语，调整呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v1].text,조금 시간을 주시면 정리해서 말하겠습니다. 지금은 남편의 숨김과 제 잘못이 한꺼번에 올라옵니다.,"If you give me a little time, I will organize my words. Right now my husband’s concealment and my own fault are rising at once.",少し時間をいただければ、整理して話します。今は夫の隠蔽と私の過ちが一度に込み上げています。,如果给我一点时间，我会整理后再说。现在丈夫的隐瞒和我的错误同时涌上来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v10].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 축을 예고하며 고개를 숙인다.,Lowers the head while foreshadowing the most painful axis.,最も痛い軸を予告しながら頭を下げる。,预告最痛的轴线，同时低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v10].text,조금 뒤에 답하겠습니다. 제가 숨긴 돈 문제까지 말하려면 숨을 고를 시간이 필요합니다.,I will answer in a little while. I need time to catch my breath before speaking about the money I hid too.,少し後で答えます。私が隠した金の問題まで話すには、息を整える時間が必要です。,我稍后回答。要说到我隐瞒的钱的问题，需要时间调整呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v2].behaviorHint,스스로의 말투가 흐트러질 걸 알고 물러난다.,"Steps back, knowing their own tone may fall apart.",自分の口調が乱れると分かって引く。,知道自己的语气会乱，于是后退。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v2].text,멈춰 주시면 좋겠습니다. 제가 더 말하면 또 제 상처만 앞세우게 될 것 같습니다.,"I would like you to stop for now. If I say more, I think I will put my hurt first again.",止めていただけると助かります。これ以上話すと、また自分の傷だけを前に出してしまいそうです。,希望先停一下。如果我继续说，可能又会只把自己的伤口摆在前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v3].behaviorHint,수치심이 표정에 드러나 시선을 피한다.,Avoids eye contact as shame shows on the face.,羞恥が表情に出て、視線を避ける。,羞耻显在脸上，避开视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v3].text,"시간을 두겠습니다. 제 적금 문제를 피하려는 건 아니지만, 지금은 너무 창피합니다.","I will take some time. I am not trying to avoid my savings issue, but right now I am too ashamed.",時間を置きます。私の積立預金の問題を避けようとしているわけではありませんが、今はあまりに恥ずかしいです。,我会留一点时间。并不是想回避我的储蓄账户问题，只是现在太羞愧了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v4].behaviorHint,책임을 분리하려는 의지는 있지만 감정이 앞선다.,"Has the will to separate responsibility, but emotion comes first.",責任を切り分けようとする意思はあるが、感情が先に立つ。,有意图区分责任，但情绪先行。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v4].text,잠시 미루면 더 차분히 답하겠습니다. 남편 탓과 제 책임이 뒤섞여서 말이 거칠어집니다.,"If we postpone briefly, I can answer more calmly. My husband’s fault and my responsibility are mixing together, and my words are getting harsh.",少し先送りすれば、もっと落ち着いて答えます。夫のせいにする気持ちと私の責任が混ざって、言葉が荒くなります。,如果暂时推迟，我会更冷静地回答。丈夫的错和我的责任混在一起，话会变得尖锐。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v5].behaviorHint,피해자 말투로 도망치려는 자신을 의식한다.,Is aware of trying to escape in the tone of a victim.,被害者の口調で逃げようとする自分に気づいている。,意识到自己正想用受害者口吻逃开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v5].text,"오늘 바로 말할 수도 있지만, 지금은 제가 또 방어만 할까 봐 겁납니다.","I could speak today, but I am afraid I will only defend myself right now.",今日すぐ話すこともできますが、今はまた防御ばかりしてしまいそうで怖いです。,今天也可以马上说，但我怕现在又只会防御。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v6].behaviorHint,용기를 내려고 애쓰지만 목소리가 떨린다.,"Tries to find courage, but the voice trembles.",勇気を出そうとするが、声が震える。,努力鼓起勇气，但声音发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v6].text,"조금만 시간을 주십시오. 제가 한 일을 말할 용기는 내겠지만, 감정부터 가라앉혀야 합니다.","Please give me a little time. I will find the courage to say what I did, but I need to calm my emotions first.",少しだけ時間をください。自分がしたことを話す勇気は出しますが、まず感情を落ち着かせる必要があります。,请给我一点时间。我会鼓起勇气说出自己做过的事，但要先平复情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v7].behaviorHint,도망이 아니라 정리를 요청하는 태도다.,"A posture of asking to organize, not to escape.",逃げではなく、整理を求める態度。,不是逃避，而是请求整理的态度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v7].text,미루는 게 숨는 뜻은 아닙니다. 제 몫을 말하려면 지금보다 덜 흔들려야 합니다.,"Postponing does not mean I am hiding. To speak for my part, I need to be less shaken than I am now.",先送りすることは隠れるという意味ではありません。自分の分を話すには、今より揺れていない状態でなければなりません。,推迟并不代表隐藏。要说出我的那一份，我必须比现在更少动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v8].behaviorHint,무너진 자존심을 붙잡고 있다.,Clings to collapsed pride.,崩れた自尊心をつかんでいる。,抓着已经崩塌的自尊心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v8].text,잠시 멈추면 좋겠습니다. 외도 오해가 풀린 뒤 제 잘못을 듣는 게 아직 너무 어렵습니다.,"I would like to stop for a moment. After the affair misunderstanding was cleared, hearing my own fault is still too difficult.",少し止めていただきたいです。不倫の誤解が解けた後で自分の過ちを聞くのは、まだとても難しいです。,希望暂时停一下。出轨误会解开后，再听自己的错误，对我来说仍然太难。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v9].behaviorHint,자기 방어 패턴을 알아차린 듯 말한다.,Speaks as if aware of their own defensive pattern.,自分の防御パターンに気づいたように話す。,说话时像是察觉了自己的防御模式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v9].text,시간을 두면 받아들이겠습니다. 지금 몰아붙이면 제가 또 남편 잘못만 꺼낼 것 같습니다.,"With time, I will accept it. If pressed now, I think I will bring up only my husband’s faults again.",時間を置けば受け入れます。今追い詰められると、また夫の過ちだけを持ち出してしまいそうです。,如果留点时间，我会接受。现在逼得太紧，我可能又只会提丈夫的错。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v1].behaviorHint,기다리되 핵심 쟁점이 사라질까 경계한다.,"Waits, but remains wary that the key issue may disappear.",待ちながらも、核心争点が消えることを警戒する。,愿意等待，但警惕核心争议点消失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v1].text,시간을 두는 건 알겠습니다. 다만 그 사이에 돈의 순서가 흐려지지 않게 해주십시오.,I understand taking time. But please make sure the sequence of the money does not blur in the meantime.,時間を置くことは分かりました。ただ、その間に金の順序がぼやけないようにしてください。,我理解需要时间。但请确保在此期间资金顺序不要变得模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v10].behaviorHint,도망치지 않겠다는 낮은 결심이 보인다.,Shows a quiet resolve not to run.,逃げないという低い決意が見える。,显出低沉但不逃避的决心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v10].text,시간을 받겠습니다. 다음에는 그 돈의 사용처와 아내를 배제한 잘못을 같이 말하겠습니다.,"I will take the time. Next time, I will speak about where the money went and my fault in excluding my wife together.",時間を受け取ります。次は、その金の使途と妻を排除した過ちを一緒に話します。,我接受这段时间。下次我会同时说明那笔钱的用途，以及排除妻子的错误。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v2].behaviorHint,억울함을 누르며 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,Lets out a long breath while suppressing resentment.,悔しさを抑えながら長く息を吐く。,压住委屈，长长吐气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v2].text,잠시 멈추겠습니다. 그 가족 이야기를 꺼낸 뒤로 저도 감정이 너무 올라왔습니다.,"I will pause for a moment. Since bringing up that family matter, my emotions have risen too.",少し止めます。その家族の話を出してから、私も感情が強く上がってきました。,我会暂时停一下。提起那件家庭事之后，我的情绪也太上来了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v3].behaviorHint,기다림이 회피로 바뀔까 조심한다.,Is cautious that waiting may turn into avoidance.,待つことが回避に変わらないよう慎重になる。,小心等待变成回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v3].text,미루는 데 동의합니다. 하지만 외도 오해만 풀고 나머지를 덮는 쪽이면 저는 불안합니다.,"I agree to postpone. But if this only clears the affair misunderstanding and covers the rest, I am uneasy.",先送りには同意します。ですが、不倫の誤解だけを解いて残りを覆う方向なら、私は不安です。,我同意推迟。但如果只是解开出轨误会、掩盖其他问题，我会不安。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v4].behaviorHint,양쪽 책임을 함께 올려두려 한다.,Tries to keep both sides’ responsibilities on the table.,双方の責任を一緒に載せておこうとしている。,试图把双方责任一起摆在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v4].text,"시간은 필요합니다. 저도 제가 숨긴 책임을 말해야 하고, 아내의 적금 문제도 들어야 합니다.","Time is needed. I also have to speak about what I hid, and my wife’s savings issue must be heard.",時間は必要です。私も自分が隠した責任を話さなければならず、妻の積立預金の問題も聞く必要があります。,确实需要时间。我也必须说明自己的隐瞒责任，妻子的储蓄账户问题也必须听取。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v5].behaviorHint,스스로의 방어를 알아차리고 한 발 물러난다.,Recognizes their own defense and takes a step back.,自分の防御に気づき、一歩引く。,察觉自己的防御，后退一步。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v5].text,조금 멈추겠습니다. 지금은 억울함이 먼저 나와서 제 잘못까지 작게 말할 것 같습니다.,"I will stop briefly. Right now my sense of being wronged comes out first, so I may minimize my own fault.",少し止めます。今は悔しさが先に出て、自分の過ちまで小さく話してしまいそうです。,我先停一下。现在委屈感先冒出来，可能会把自己的错也说小。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v6].behaviorHint,쟁점을 놓치지 않으려는 실무적인 어조다.,A practical tone that tries not to lose the issue.,争点を見失わないようにする実務的な口調。,是不想丢失争议点的务实口吻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v6].text,기다릴 수 있습니다. 다만 비자금 전달과 해지 서류 문제는 다음 자리에서 바로 이어가야 합니다.,I can wait. But the hidden-fund handoff and the cancellation-document issue must resume immediately at the next session.,待つことはできます。ただ、隠し資金の受け渡しと解約書類の問題は、次の場ですぐ続ける必要があります。,我可以等。但私房钱交付和解约文件问题，下一场必须马上接着处理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v7].behaviorHint,흥분을 인정하며 손을 접는다.,Folds the hands while admitting agitation.,興奮を認めながら手を重ねる。,承认激动，双手收拢。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v7].text,시간을 두겠습니다. 제 가족 일을 말하는 순간부터 제 목소리도 거칠어졌습니다.,"I will take time. From the moment I spoke about my family, my voice also became harsh.",時間を置きます。自分の家族のことを話した瞬間から、私の声も荒くなりました。,我会留点时间。从我说起自己的家庭事那一刻起，我的声音也变得粗暴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v8].behaviorHint,선후 책임을 붙잡는다.,Holds on to responsibility in sequence.,前後の責任をつかむ。,抓住先后责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v8].text,미루셔도 괜찮습니다. 대신 누가 먼저 무엇을 숨겼는지는 흐리지 말아주십시오.,Postponing is fine. But please do not blur who first hid what.,先送りしても構いません。その代わり、誰が先に何を隠したのかは曖昧にしないでください。,推迟也可以。但请不要模糊是谁先隐瞒了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v9].behaviorHint,자기합리화를 경계하는 태도다.,A posture wary of self-justification.,自己正当化を警戒する態度。,警惕自我合理化的态度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v9].text,조금 쉬면 더 차분히 말하겠습니다. 지금은 제 선의만 앞세우고 싶어집니다.,"If I rest a little, I will speak more calmly. Right now I want to put only my good intentions first.",少し休めば、もっと落ち着いて話します。今は自分の善意だけを前に出したくなっています。,稍微休息后，我会更冷静地说。现在我只想把自己的善意摆在前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v1].text,결정적 질문이 열린다. 숨은 이유를 찌를 때다.,A decisive question opens. It is time to press the hidden reason.,決定的な質問が開く。隠した理由を突く時だ。,关键问题已开启。该追问隐瞒的理由了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v2].text,맞물린 단서가 새 질문을 밀어 올린다.,Interlocking clues push a new question forward.,かみ合った手がかりが、新たな質問を押し上げる。,相互咬合的线索推动新的问题浮现。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v3].text,도망치던 핵심을 겨눌 질문이 준비된다.,A question is ready to target the core that kept slipping away.,逃げていた核心を狙う質問が用意される。,瞄准一直逃开的核心的问题已准备好。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v4].text,마지막 조건이 갖춰졌다. 이제 정면으로 물을 수 있다.,The final condition is met. You can now ask directly.,最後の条件が整った。これで正面から尋ねられる。,最后条件已经具备。现在可以正面询问。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v5].text,가려진 층이 열리며 더 깊은 추궁이 가능해진다.,"A hidden layer opens, making deeper pressure possible.",隠れていた層が開き、さらに深い追及が可能になる。,被遮蔽的一层打开，可以进行更深追问。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v1].text,두 증거가 맞물리며 숨은 그림이 앞으로 나온다.,"Two pieces of evidence interlock, bringing the hidden picture forward.",二つの証拠がかみ合い、隠れた絵が前に出る。,两项证据相互咬合，隐藏的图景浮到前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v2].text,따로 있던 기록이 하나의 장면으로 붙는다.,Separate records join into one scene.,別々だった記録が一つの場面につながる。,分散的记录拼成一个场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v3].text,증거 두 조각이 겹치자 가려진 순서가 보인다.,"As two pieces of evidence overlap, the hidden order comes into view.",証拠の二片が重なり、隠れていた順序が見えてくる。,两片证据重叠后，被遮蔽的顺序显现出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v4].text,카드가 맞물리며 사건의 안쪽이 열린다.,"The cards interlock, and the inner side of the case opens.",カードがかみ合い、事件の内側が開く。,卡牌相互咬合，案件内侧被打开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v5].text,흩어진 단서가 한 줄로 이어지며 추궁점이 생긴다.,"Scattered clues connect in a line, creating a point to press.",散らばった手がかりが一本につながり、追及点が生まれる。,散落的线索连成一线，形成可追问的点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v1].text,새 증거가 열린다. 진술의 순서가 흔들린다.,New evidence opens. The order of statements begins to shake.,新たな証拠が開く。陳述の順序が揺らぐ。,新证据已开启。陈述顺序开始动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v2].text,새 자료가 손에 들어왔다. 앞선 말을 다시 보자.,New material is in hand. Revisit the earlier words.,新たな資料が手に入った。先の言葉を見直そう。,新资料到手。重新查看先前的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v3].text,가려진 단서가 올라오며 판이 넓어진다.,"A hidden clue surfaces, widening the field.",隠れていた手がかりが浮かび、盤面が広がる。,被遮蔽的线索浮现，局面扩大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v4].text,새 기록이 붙었다. 말과 증거를 맞춰볼 때다.,A new record is attached. It is time to match words against evidence.,新たな記録が加わった。言葉と証拠を照合する時だ。,新记录已加入。该对照话语与证据了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v5].text,닫혀 있던 조각이 열리고 다음 질문이 생긴다.,"A closed piece opens, creating the next question.",閉じていた欠片が開き、次の質問が生まれる。,原本关闭的碎片打开，产生下一个问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v1].text,이 증거는 누구에게 내미느냐에 따라 칼끝이 달라진다.,This evidence changes its edge depending on who sees it.,この証拠は誰に突きつけるかで刃先が変わる。,这项证据递给谁，锋刃就会不同。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v2].text,같은 증거라도 상대가 바뀌면 반응이 갈린다.,Even the same evidence can draw different reactions from different sides.,同じ証拠でも、相手が変われば反応は分かれる。,即便是同一证据，对象不同，反应也会分化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v3].text,이 자료는 성급히 내밀면 다른 책임을 덮을 수 있다.,"If presented too soon, this material may cover another responsibility.",この資料は性急に突きつけると、別の責任を覆い隠すことがある。,这份资料若仓促递出，可能会遮盖另一项责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v4].text,증거의 방향을 고르자. 한쪽 말만 키울 수 있다.,Choose the direction of the evidence. It may strengthen only one side’s words.,証拠の向きを選ぼう。一方の言葉だけを大きくすることがある。,选择证据的方向。它可能只会放大一方的说法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v5].text,조심해서 제시하라. 이 증거는 오독의 틈도 품고 있다.,Present it carefully. This evidence also contains room for misreading.,慎重に提示せよ。この証拠には誤読の隙も含まれている。,谨慎出示。这项证据也包含误读的缝隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v1].text,양측 진술 사이에 갈라진 지점이 보인다.,A split appears between the two sides’ statements.,双方の陳述の間に割れた点が見える。,双方陈述之间出现了裂点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v2].text,앞선 말과 지금 말이 어긋나며 재판관이 멈춘다.,The Judge pauses as the earlier words and the current words no longer align.,先の言葉と今の言葉が食い違い、裁判官が立ち止まる。,先前的话与现在的话发生错位，法官停了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v3].text,진술의 틈이 벌어진다. 재판관이 그 지점을 짚는다.,A gap opens in the statements. The Judge points to it.,陳述の隙が広がる。裁判官がその点を指摘する。,陈述的缝隙扩大。法官指出那个点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v4].text,말의 방향이 달라졌다. 이제 그 이유를 물을 수 있다.,The direction of the words has changed. Now you can ask why.,言葉の方向が変わった。これでその理由を尋ねられる。,话语方向改变了。现在可以询问原因。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v5].text,서로 다른 기억이 같은 장면 위에서 충돌한다.,Different memories collide on the same scene.,異なる記憶が同じ場面の上で衝突する。,不同记忆在同一场景上碰撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v1].text,같은 질문이 맴돈다. 다른 틈을 찾아보자.,The same question circles back. Look for another gap.,同じ質問が巡っている。別の隙を探そう。,同一个问题在打转。寻找另一处缝隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v2].text,반복 추궁은 닫힌 문만 두드린다. 방향을 바꿔라.,Repeated pressure only knocks on a closed door. Change direction.,繰り返しの追及は閉じた扉を叩くだけだ。方向を変えよ。,反复追问只是在敲关闭的门。改变方向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v3].text,비슷한 질문이 이어져 진술이 굳어간다.,"Similar questions continue, and the statement begins to harden.",似た質問が続き、陳述が固まっていく。,相似问题持续，陈述开始固化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v4].text,같은 길은 막혔다. 증거나 동기로 옮겨가자.,That path is blocked. Move to evidence or motive.,同じ道は塞がった。証拠か動機へ移ろう。,同一条路已被堵住。转向证据或动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v5].text,되풀이된 질문 앞에서 상대가 더 잠긴다.,"Faced with repeated questions, the other side closes down further.",繰り返される質問の前で、相手はさらに閉じていく。,面对反复问题，对方更加封闭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v1].text,붙들던 표정이 무너지며 말의 결이 바뀐다.,"The expression they held together collapses, and the tone of the words changes.",保っていた表情が崩れ、言葉の肌理が変わる。,强撑的表情崩塌，话语的质感改变。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v2].text,감정이 한계에 닿고 진술의 속도가 흔들린다.,"Emotion reaches its limit, and the pace of the statement wavers.",感情が限界に達し、陳述の速度が揺らぐ。,情绪触及极限，陈述速度开始摇晃。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v3].text,버티던 목소리가 꺾이며 다른 말이 새어 나온다.,"The voice that had endured breaks, and different words slip out.",こらえていた声が折れ、別の言葉が漏れ出る。,一直支撑的声音折断，别的话漏了出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v4].text,분노 뒤에 있던 두려움이 앞으로 나온다.,Fear behind the anger comes forward.,怒りの後ろにあった恐れが前に出る。,愤怒背后的恐惧浮到前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v5].text,차갑던 대답이 흔들리고 속내가 드러나기 시작한다.,"The cold answer shakes, and inner feelings begin to show.",冷たかった答えが揺らぎ、本音が見え始める。,冰冷的回答开始动摇，内心逐渐显露。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v1].text,경계가 조금 풀리고 더 깊은 말이 따라붙는다.,"Guarding loosens slightly, and deeper words follow.",警戒が少し緩み、より深い言葉が続く。,戒备稍稍松动，更深的话随之出现。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v2].text,재판관을 향한 신뢰가 쌓이며 말문이 넓어진다.,"Trust toward the Judge builds, widening the room for words.",裁判官への信頼が積み重なり、話せる幅が広がる。,对法官的信任积累起来，话语空间变宽。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v3].text,상대의 방어가 내려가고 숨은 이유가 가까워진다.,"The other side’s defense lowers, and the hidden reason draws closer.",相手の防御が下がり、隠れた理由が近づく。,对方防御下降，隐藏的理由变得更近。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v4].text,조심스러운 신뢰가 생기며 고백의 문이 열린다.,"Cautious trust forms, opening the door to confession.",慎重な信頼が生まれ、告白の扉が開く。,谨慎的信任形成，告白之门打开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v5].text,날 선 대답 뒤에서 조금 더 솔직한 말이 나온다.,"Behind the sharp answer, more honest words appear.",刺のある答えの後ろから、少しだけ率直な言葉が出る。,尖锐回答背后，稍微更诚实的话出现了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v1].text,국면이 바뀐다. 흩어진 단서를 다시 엮을 때다.,The phase changes. Time to weave the scattered clues again.,局面が変わる。散らばった手がかりをもう一度結び直す時だ。,局面改变。该重新编织散落线索了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v2].text,새 국면이 열린다. 방금 나온 말이 새 길을 만든다.,A new phase opens. The words just spoken create a new path.,新たな局面が開く。今出た言葉が新しい道を作る。,新局面开启。刚刚出现的话创造了新的路。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v3].text,판의 중심이 옮겨간다. 질문의 순서도 달라진다.,The center of the field shifts. The order of questions changes too.,盤面の中心が移る。質問の順序も変わる。,局面的中心转移。问题顺序也随之改变。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v4].text,새 단계로 들어선다. 이전 진술이 다른 뜻을 얻는다.,You enter a new stage. Earlier statements gain a different meaning.,新たな段階に入る。以前の陳述が別の意味を得る。,进入新阶段。此前陈述获得了不同含义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v5].text,숨은 축이 올라오며 사건의 결이 바뀐다.,"A hidden axis surfaces, changing the texture of the case.",隠れた軸が浮かび、事件の肌理が変わる。,隐藏轴线浮现，案件质感改变。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v1].text,증인을 불러야 할 지점이 열린다.,A point opens where a witness must be called.,証人を呼ぶべき地点が開く。,需要传唤证人的点已开启。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v2].text,재판관이 바깥의 기억을 법정 안으로 부른다.,The Judge calls an outside memory into the courtroom.,裁判官が外の記憶を法廷の中へ呼び込む。,法官把外部记忆召入法庭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v3].text,당사자 말만으로는 모자라 증인을 부를 길이 열린다.,The parties’ words are not enough; a path to call a witness opens.,当事者の言葉だけでは足りず、証人を呼ぶ道が開く。,仅凭当事人的话还不够，传唤证人的路径已开启。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v4].text,제3자의 장면이 필요해진다. 소환이 가능하다.,A third-party scene is needed. A summons is now possible.,第三者の場面が必要になる。召喚が可能だ。,需要第三方场景。现在可以传唤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v5].text,증인 호출로 진술의 빈칸을 메울 수 있다.,A witness call can fill the blank in the statements.,証人呼び出しで陳述の空白を埋められる。,可通过传唤证人填补陈述空白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v1].text,증인을 부를 수 있다. 말의 빈틈이 밖에서 메워진다.,A witness can be called. A gap in the words is filled from outside.,証人を呼ぶことができる。言葉の隙が外から埋められる。,可以传唤证人。话语缝隙将从外部补上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v2].text,새 증인이 열린다. 부부의 말 밖에 있던 장면이 나온다.,A new witness opens. A scene outside the couple’s words emerges.,新たな証人が開く。夫婦の言葉の外にあった場面が出てくる。,新证人已开启。夫妻话语之外的场景浮现。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v3].text,제3자의 기억이 사건의 방향을 흔들 준비를 한다.,A third party’s memory prepares to shake the case’s direction.,第三者の記憶が事件の方向を揺らす準備をする。,第三方记忆准备撼动案件方向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v4].text,증인 호출이 가능하다. 숨은 사실이 다른 입으로 나온다.,Witness calling is possible. A hidden fact comes out through another mouth.,証人呼び出しが可能だ。隠れた事実が別の口から出る。,可以传唤证人。隐藏事实将通过另一张口说出。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v5].text,바깥의 눈이 들어오며 진술의 무게가 달라진다.,"Outside eyes enter, changing the weight of the statements.",外の目が入り、陳述の重みが変わる。,外部视角进入，陈述分量随之改变。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v1].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v1].text,그 층에 여자 혼자 사는 집은 없는 걸로 압니다. 가족이 사는 세대는 있습니다.,"As far as I know, there is no home on that floor where a woman lives alone. There are family households.",その階に女性が一人で暮らす部屋はないと認識しています。家族で住んでいる世帯はあります。,据我所知，那一层没有女性独居的住户。有家人同住的住户。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v10].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v10].text,여자 혼자 사는 집을 찾으려는 설명과는 제 기억이 맞지 않습니다. 가족 세대가 있습니다.,My memory does not match the explanation that this was a home where a woman lived alone. There are family households.,女性が一人で暮らす部屋を探すような説明とは、私の記憶が合いません。家族世帯があります。,那种要找女性独居住户的说法，与我的记忆不符。那里有家庭住户。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v2].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v2].text,제가 아는 그 라인에는 1인 여성 세대가 없습니다. 아이가 있는 집은 있습니다.,"In that line, as far as I know, there are no single-woman households. There are homes with children.",私の知るそのラインには、女性一人の世帯はありません。子どものいる家はあります。,据我所知，那一排没有女性单人住户。有带孩子的住户。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v3].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v3].text,외도 상대 집이라고 단정할 분위기는 아니었습니다. 그 층은 대체로 가족 세대입니다.,It was not an atmosphere where I would conclude it was an affair partner’s home. That floor is mostly family households.,不倫相手の家だと断定するような雰囲気ではありませんでした。その階はおおむね家族世帯です。,不能断定那是出轨对象的家。那一层大多是家庭住户。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v4].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v4].text,그 차 주인분이 가신 층에는 가족 단위 입주민이 있습니다. 혼자 사는 여성 집은 모릅니다.,There are family-unit residents on the floor where that car owner went. I do not know of a home where a woman lives alone.,その車の持ち主が行った階には、家族単位の入居者がいます。女性が一人で暮らす部屋は知りません。,那辆车的主人去的楼层有家庭住户。我不知道那里有女性独居的房子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v5].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v5].text,"정확한 호수까지 말하긴 조심스럽지만, 여자 혼자 사는 집으로 기억하진 않습니다.","I should be careful about giving the exact unit number, but I do not remember it as a home where a woman lives alone.",正確な号室まで言うのは慎重になりますが、女性が一人で暮らす部屋としては記憶していません。,具体房号我需要谨慎，但我不记得那是女性独居的住户。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v6].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v6].text,"제가 관리대장을 다 말할 순 없지만, 그 층에 혼자 사는 여성 세대는 없다고 봅니다.","I cannot disclose the whole management ledger, but I believe there are no women living alone on that floor.",管理台帳をすべて話すことはできませんが、その階に女性の一人世帯はないと見ています。,我不能把管理台账全都说出来，但我认为那一层没有女性独居住户。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v7].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v7].text,"방문 빈도는 있었지만, 그게 딴집 살림이라고 말할 근거는 제게 없습니다.","There was visit frequency, but I have no basis to say it was a secret second household.",訪問頻度はありましたが、それを別宅暮らしだと言える根拠は私にはありません。,探访频率确实存在，但我没有依据说那是另组家庭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v8].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v8].text,그 층에는 아이가 오가는 집이 있습니다. 여성 혼자 사는 세대라는 말은 맞지 않습니다.,There is a home on that floor where a child comes and goes. The claim that it is a woman living alone does not fit.,その階には子どもが出入りする家があります。女性が一人で暮らす世帯という話は合いません。,那一层有孩子出入的住户。说是女性独居住户并不符合。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v9].behaviorHint,오해를 바로잡을 사실을 중립적으로 또렷하게 말한다.,States the fact that corrects the misunderstanding neutrally and clearly.,誤解を正す事実を中立的にはっきり述べる。,中立而清楚地说明纠正误会的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v9].text,"경비원으로 본 사실만 말하면, 가족 세대 쪽 출입으로 보는 게 더 맞습니다.","Speaking only to what I saw as the guard, it is more accurate to view it as entry to a family household.",警備員として見た事実だけを言えば、家族世帯側への出入りと見るほうが合っています。,只说我作为保安看到的事实，更像是出入家庭住户。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v1].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v1].text,1주일에 2~3번 정도는 봤습니다. 보통 저녁에 들어와 한동안 머물렀습니다.,I saw him about two or three times a week. He usually came in during the evening and stayed for a while.,週に2、3回ほどは見ました。たいてい夕方に入って、しばらく滞在していました。,我大约每周见到他两三次。通常傍晚进去，停留一段时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v10].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v10].text,"호수는 말하기 어렵지만, 그 층 출입이 반복된 건 기억합니다.","It is hard to state the unit number, but I remember repeated entries to that floor.",号室は言いにくいですが、その階への出入りが繰り返されたことは覚えています。,房号不方便说，但我记得他反复出入那一层。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v2].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v2].text,짧게 물건만 놓고 가는 수준은 아니었습니다. 몇 시간 있다 나간 날도 있었습니다.,It was not just a quick drop-off of items. On some days he stayed a few hours before leaving.,短く物だけ置いて帰る程度ではありませんでした。数時間いてから出た日もありました。,不是短暂放下东西就走的程度。有些天他待了几个小时才离开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v3].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v3].text,퇴근 시간 뒤에 오는 일이 잦았습니다. 밤늦게 나가는 모습도 본 적 있습니다.,He often came after work hours. I also saw him leave late at night.,退勤時間の後に来ることが多かったです。夜遅く出ていく姿も見たことがあります。,他常在下班时间后过来。我也见过他深夜离开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v4].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v4].text,그 차 주인분은 반복해서 왔습니다. 정확한 호수는 몰라도 같은 층으로 올라갔습니다.,"The owner of that car came repeatedly. Even if I do not know the exact unit, he went up to the same floor.",その車の持ち主は繰り返し来ていました。正確な号室は分からなくても、同じ階へ上がっていました。,那辆车的主人反复来过。即使不知道具体房号，他也是上到同一层。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v5].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v5].text,평균으로 보면 주 2회 안팎은 출입했습니다. 시간대는 주로 저녁이었습니다.,"On average, he came and went around twice a week. The time was mostly evening.",平均で見ると週2回前後は出入りしていました。時間帯は主に夕方でした。,平均来看，每周出入两次左右。时间段主要是傍晚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v6].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v6].text,몇 번은 엘리베이터에서 같은 층을 눌렀습니다. 방문 시간이 짧지는 않았습니다.,"A few times, I saw him press the same floor in the elevator. The visits were not short.",何度か、エレベーターで同じ階を押していました。訪問時間は短くありませんでした。,有几次我看到他在电梯里按同一层。探访时间并不短。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v7].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v7].text,장기 방문처럼 보인 날이 있습니다. 잠깐 들르는 손님하고는 달랐습니다.,There were days that looked like long visits. It was different from someone just stopping by.,長めの訪問のように見えた日があります。少し立ち寄る客とは違いました。,有些天看起来像长时间探访。和短暂停留的客人不同。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v8].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v8].text,방문이 일정하게 반복됐습니다. 그래서 차량 번호도 눈에 익었습니다.,The visits repeated at a steady pace. That is why the license plate became familiar.,訪問が一定して繰り返されていました。だから車両番号も見覚えがありました。,探访稳定重复。所以车牌号也看熟了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v9].behaviorHint,근무 중 기억한 빈도와 체류 시간을 사무적으로 짚는다.,"Businesslike, points out the frequency and stay time remembered from duty.",勤務中に記憶した頻度と滞在時間を事務的に示す。,以业务口吻指出值勤时记住的频率和停留时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v9].text,제가 본 범위에서는 저녁에 들어와 밤에 나가는 패턴이 있었습니다.,"Within what I saw, there was a pattern of entering in the evening and leaving at night.",私が見た範囲では、夕方に入り夜に出るパターンがありました。,在我看到的范围内，有傍晚进去、夜里出来的模式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v1].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v1].text,그 차 주인분을 본 적은 있습니다. 다만 정확한 호수까지는 제가 확인하지 않습니다.,I have seen the owner of that car. But I do not verify the exact unit number.,その車の持ち主を見たことはあります。ただ、正確な号室までは私は確認しません。,我见过那辆车的主人。但具体房号我不会核实到那个程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v10].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v10].text,경비 입장에서는 출입 정도만 봅니다. 누구를 만나러 왔는지는 모릅니다.,"From a guard’s position, I only see the entry itself. I do not know whom he came to meet.",警備の立場では、出入りの程度だけを見ます。誰に会いに来たのかは分かりません。,从保安立场，只能看到出入程度。不知道他是来见谁的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v2].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v2].text,저녁 무렵 출입하는 모습은 몇 번 봤습니다. 어느 집인지 단정하긴 어렵습니다.,I saw him coming and going around evening a few times. It is hard to say which home.,夕方ごろに出入りする姿は何度か見ました。どの家か断定するのは難しいです。,我几次见到他傍晚时出入。很难断定是哪一家。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v3].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v3].text,얼굴은 익숙합니다. 경비실에서 지나가는 걸 본 정도로 말씀드릴 수 있습니다.,His face is familiar. I can only say I saw him pass by the security office.,顔には見覚えがあります。警備室から通り過ぎるのを見た程度だと申し上げられます。,脸是熟悉的。我只能说是在保安室看到他经过的程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v4].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v4].text,차량은 기억납니다. 다만 제가 사람 관계까지 알 수 있는 자리는 아닙니다.,I remember the vehicle. But I am not in a position to know personal relationships.,車両は覚えています。ただ、人間関係まで分かる立場ではありません。,车辆我记得。但我不是能知道人际关系的立场。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v5].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v5].text,출입한 적은 있습니다. 날짜를 하나하나 적어 둔 건 아니라 조심스럽습니다.,"He did come in and out. I did not write down each date, so I need to be careful.",出入りしたことはあります。日付を一つ一つ書き留めたわけではないので、慎重になります。,他确实出入过。但我没有逐一记下日期，所以需要谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v6].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v6].text,그분이 오간 건 본 적 있습니다. 정확한 방문 목적은 제가 알지 못합니다.,I have seen him come and go. I do not know the exact purpose of the visit.,その方が行き来するのを見たことはあります。正確な訪問目的は私には分かりません。,我见过他来往。具体探访目的我不知道。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v7].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v7].text,"자주까지는 말하기 조심스럽지만, 낯선 차량은 아니었습니다.","I hesitate to call it frequent, but it was not an unfamiliar vehicle.",頻繁とまで言うのは慎重になりますが、見慣れない車両ではありませんでした。,说频繁还需要谨慎，但那不是陌生车辆。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v8].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v8].text,저녁 시간대에 본 기억은 있습니다. 호실과 사정은 입주민 쪽 일입니다.,I remember seeing it during the evening. The unit and circumstances are resident matters.,夕方の時間帯に見た記憶はあります。号室と事情は入居者側のことです。,我记得在傍晚时间见过。房号和具体情况属于住户那边的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v9].behaviorHint,경비원답게 본 범위만 말하고 단정은 피한다.,"As a guard, states only what was seen and avoids conclusions.",警備員らしく、見た範囲だけを話して断定を避ける。,像保安一样只说自己看到的范围，避免断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v9].text,그 차가 들어오는 걸 몇 번 봤습니다. 그 이상은 제 기억 범위가 아닙니다.,I saw that car come in a few times. Beyond that is outside my memory.,その車が入ってくるのを何度か見ました。それ以上は私の記憶の範囲ではありません。,我见过那辆车进来几次。再多就不在我的记忆范围内了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v1].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v1].text,솔직히 서명 필체가 달라 보였습니다. 그때 본인 확인을 더 했어야 했습니다.,"Honestly, the handwriting on the signature looked different. I should have verified the account holder further then.",正直、署名の筆跡は違って見えました。その時、本人確認をもっとするべきでした。,老实说，签名笔迹看起来不一样。那时本应进一步确认本人身份。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v10].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v10].text,돌이켜 보면 그 자리에서 명의자분 확인을 더 요구했어야 합니다. 제가 너무 서류에만 의존했습니다.,"Looking back, I should have required more confirmation from the account holder on the spot. I relied too much on the documents.",振り返ると、その場で名義人本人の確認をもっと求めるべきでした。私は書類に頼りすぎました。,回头看，当场应该要求进一步确认名义人本人。我太依赖文件了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v2].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v2].text,그 서류가 있었지만 의심은 들었습니다. 저는 서류 요건이 맞다고 보고 진행했습니다.,"The documents were there, but I had doubts. I proceeded because the document requirements appeared to be met.",その書類はありましたが、疑いはありました。私は書類要件が合っていると見て進めました。,文件是有的，但我有过怀疑。我认为文件要件符合，所以进行了处理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v3].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v3].text,명의자분이 오지 않았고 서명도 어색했습니다. 지금 보면 확인을 한 단계 더 했어야 합니다.,"The account holder was not present, and the signature felt awkward. Looking back, I should have added one more verification step.",名義人本人は来ておらず、署名も不自然でした。今見ると、確認をもう一段階するべきでした。,名义人本人没有来，签名也显得别扭。现在看来，本应再加一道核验。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v4].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v4].text,신분증 사본과 그 서류가 있어서 진행했습니다. 하지만 필체 차이를 그냥 넘긴 건 제 부담입니다.,I proceeded because there was an ID copy and the document. But letting the handwriting difference pass is my burden.,身分証の写しとその書類があったので進めました。ですが、筆跡の違いをそのまま流したことは私の負担です。,因为有身份证复印件和那份文件，我进行了处理。但我直接放过笔迹差异，这一点是我的负担。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v5].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v5].text,그 해지 건은 절차상 더 조심했어야 합니다. 서류만 보고 진행한 제 판단도 남습니다.,"For that cancellation, I should have been more careful procedurally. My decision to proceed based only on the documents remains at issue.",その解約件は手続き上もっと慎重であるべきでした。書類だけを見て進めた私の判断も残ります。,那次解约在程序上本应更加谨慎。我只看文件就处理的判断也留下了问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v6].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v6].text,"고객님 설명을 들었지만, 명의자분 의사를 직접 확인하지 못했습니다. 그 점이 걸립니다.","I heard the customer’s explanation, but I could not confirm the account holder’s intent directly. That weighs on me.",お客様の説明は聞きましたが、名義人本人の意思を直接確認できませんでした。その点が引っかかります。,我听了客户的说明，但没有直接确认名义人的意愿。这一点让我介意。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v7].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v7].text,당시에는 거부할 만큼의 하자라고 보지 않았습니다. 그러나 지금은 확인 부족을 인정합니다.,"At the time, I did not see a defect serious enough to refuse. But now I admit the verification was lacking.",当時は拒否するほどの不備とは見ませんでした。しかし今は確認不足を認めます。,当时我不认为那是足以拒绝的瑕疵。但现在我承认核验不足。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v8].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v8].text,위임 서류는 있었고 해지는 진행됐습니다. 다만 서명 진정성 확인은 충분하지 않았습니다.,The authorization documents were there and the cancellation proceeded. But verification of the signature’s authenticity was not sufficient.,委任書類はあり、解約は進みました。ただし署名の真正性確認は十分ではありませんでした。,委托文件是有的，解约也进行了。但签名真实性核验并不充分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v9].behaviorHint,추궁 앞에서 확인 부족을 인정하되 업무 기준도 함께 설명한다.,"Under pressure, admits insufficient verification while also explaining work standards.",追及を前に確認不足を認めつつ、業務基準も説明する。,在追问面前承认核验不足，同时说明业务标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v9].text,"재판관님, 절차상 근거는 있었지만 안전한 절차는 아니었습니다. 그 점은 인정합니다.","Your Honor, there was procedural basis, but it was not a safe procedure. I admit that point.",裁判官、手続き上の根拠はありましたが、安全な手続きではありませんでした。その点は認めます。,法官，程序上有依据，但并不是安全的程序。这一点我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v1].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v1].text,그 서류가 첨부돼 있었습니다. 서명이 조금 낯설었지만 서류 형식은 맞아 보였습니다.,"That document was attached. The signature felt a little unfamiliar, but the document form looked proper.",その書類が添付されていました。署名は少し見慣れませんでしたが、書類の形式は合っているように見えました。,那份文件附在里面。签名有点陌生，但文件形式看起来是对的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v10].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v10].text,업무 기준으로는 진행 가능한 서류였습니다. 다만 서명 확인은 더 엄격했어야 합니다.,"By work standards, it was a document that could be processed. Still, signature verification should have been stricter.",業務基準では進められる書類でした。ただし署名確認はもっと厳格であるべきでした。,按业务标准，那是可以处理的文件。但签名核验本应更严格。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v2].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v2].text,본인 방문은 아니었습니다. 위임 서류와 신분증 사본이 들어와 절차대로 봤습니다.,"It was not an in-person visit by the account holder. A power of attorney and ID copy were submitted, so I reviewed them according to procedure.",本人の来店ではありませんでした。委任状と身分証の写しが提出され、手続き通りに確認しました。,不是本人到场。委托书和身份证复印件提交进来，我按程序查看了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v3].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v3].text,서명 부분이 마음에 걸렸습니다. 다만 창구에서는 제출 서류 기준으로 진행했습니다.,"The signature bothered me. But at the window, I proceeded based on the submitted documents.",署名部分が気になりました。ただ、窓口では提出書類を基準に進めました。,签名部分让我介意。但在柜台，我是按提交文件标准进行的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v4].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v4].text,"고객님이 직접 오셨고, 명의자분이 위임한 서류라고 설명했습니다. 저는 요건부터 확인했습니다.",The customer came in person and said it was a document authorized by the account holder. I checked the requirements first.,お客様が直接来店し、名義人本人が委任した書類だと説明しました。私はまず要件を確認しました。,客户本人到场，并说明这是名义人委托的文件。我先确认了要件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v5].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v5].text,필체가 아주 자연스럽진 않았습니다. 그래도 필요한 서류가 갖춰져 있어 바로 막기 어려웠습니다.,"The handwriting did not look entirely natural. Still, the required documents were complete, so it was hard to block immediately.",筆跡はとても自然とは言えませんでした。それでも必要書類がそろっていたので、すぐ止めるのは難しかったです。,笔迹并不十分自然。即便如此，必要文件齐全，很难立刻拦下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v6].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v6].text,그때 한 번 더 확인했어야 했나 싶습니다. 당시에는 서류상 하자가 뚜렷하진 않았습니다.,"I do wonder if I should have checked one more time then. At the time, there was no clear defect on the documents.",その時もう一度確認すべきだったのかもしれません。当時は書類上の不備が明確ではありませんでした。,我也觉得那时是不是应该再确认一次。当时文件上的瑕疵并不明显。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v7].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v7].text,그 서류와 사본이 같이 제출됐습니다. 저는 그 형식을 보고 해지 절차를 진행했습니다.,That document and the copy were submitted together. I looked at that form and proceeded with the cancellation.,その書類と写しが一緒に提出されました。私はその形式を見て解約手続きを進めました。,那份文件和复印件一起提交。我看了那个形式后进行了解约程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v8].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v8].text,서류가 완비돼 있다는 점을 먼저 봤습니다. 서명 차이는 조금 의식했습니다.,I first looked at the fact that the documents were complete. I did notice the signature difference a little.,書類がそろっている点をまず見ました。署名の違いは少し意識しました。,我首先看的是文件齐备这一点。签名差异我也稍微注意到了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v9].behaviorHint,절차 요건을 앞세우며 확인 미흡 책임은 조심스럽게 흐린다.,Emphasizes procedural requirements while cautiously blurring responsibility for weak verification.,手続き要件を前に出し、確認不足の責任は慎重にぼかす。,强调程序要件，同时谨慎淡化核验不足责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v9].text,명의자분이 직접 오지 않은 건 맞습니다. 대신 위임 서류가 있어서 접수했습니다.,"It is true the account holder did not come in person. Instead, there were authorization documents, so I accepted them.",名義人本人が直接来ていなかったのは事実です。代わりに委任書類があったので受け付けました。,名义人确实没有亲自来。但有委托文件，所以我接收了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v1].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v1].text,그 해지 건은 기억납니다. 다만 자세한 내용은 개인정보라 조심해서 말씀드려야 합니다.,"I remember that cancellation. But the details involve personal information, so I need to speak carefully.",その解約件は覚えています。ただ、詳しい内容は個人情報なので慎重に申し上げる必要があります。,那次解约我记得。不过详细内容涉及个人信息，必须谨慎说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v10].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v10].text,"재판관님, 은행 업무라 말을 아끼겠습니다. 해지 건이 있었다는 정도는 기억합니다.","Your Honor, this is bank business, so I will be careful with my words. I remember that there was a cancellation.",裁判官、銀行業務ですので言葉は控えます。解約件があったことは覚えています。,法官，这是银行业务，我会谨慎措辞。我记得有过一次解约。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v2].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v2].text,서류가 들어온 적은 있습니다. 지금 단계에서는 해지 사실 정도만 말씀드릴 수 있습니다.,"There was a document submitted. At this stage, I can only say that a cancellation occurred.",書類が入ったことはあります。今の段階では、解約の事実程度しか申し上げられません。,确实有文件提交过。现阶段我只能说有过解约这一事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v3].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v3].text,"비슷한 업무가 많았지만, 그 건은 창구에서 접수된 기억이 있습니다.","There were many similar tasks, but I remember that case being received at the counter.",似た業務は多かったですが、その件は窓口で受け付けた記憶があります。,类似业务很多，但我记得那件是在柜台接收的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v4].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v4].text,적금 해지 관련 서류를 본 기억은 있습니다. 구체 금액은 여기서 바로 말하기 어렵습니다.,I remember seeing documents related to a savings cancellation. It is difficult to state the exact amount here immediately.,積立預金の解約関連書類を見た記憶はあります。具体的な金額はここですぐには言いにくいです。,我记得见过储蓄账户解约相关文件。具体金额在这里很难马上说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v5].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v5].text,해지 업무가 있었습니다. 다만 누구 책임으로 단정할 자료는 더 봐야 합니다.,There was a cancellation task. But we need to see more materials before assigning responsibility.,解約業務はありました。ただし誰の責任かを断定する資料はもっと見る必要があります。,有过解约业务。但要断定是谁的责任，还需要看更多资料。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v6].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v6].text,창구에서 진행된 건으로 기억합니다. 당시 절차는 서류 중심으로 진행됐습니다.,"I remember it as a counter transaction. At the time, the procedure was document-centered.",窓口で進められた件として覚えています。当時の手続きは書類中心で進みました。,我记得那是在柜台进行的。当时程序以文件为中心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v7].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v7].text,"제가 담당한 건인지 확인이 필요하지만, 그런 해지 신청은 있었습니다.","I need to confirm whether I handled it, but such a cancellation request did exist.",私が担当した件か確認は必要ですが、そのような解約申請はありました。,需要确认是否由我负责，但确实有过那样的解约申请。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v8].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v8].text,서류 접수는 있었던 걸로 기억합니다. 개인 판단은 최대한 삼가겠습니다.,I remember that documents were received. I will refrain from personal judgment as much as possible.,書類受付はあったと記憶しています。個人的な判断はできるだけ控えます。,我记得有接收过文件。我会尽量避免个人判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v9].behaviorHint,개인정보와 자신의 절차 책임을 의식해 말을 아낀다.,"Chooses words carefully, aware of privacy and personal procedural responsibility.",個人情報と自分の手続き上の責任を意識し、言葉を控える。,顾及个人信息和自己的程序责任，谨慎少言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v9].text,그 시기 위임 관련 서류가 들어온 건 맞습니다. 세부는 조심스럽습니다.,It is true that authorization-related documents came in around that time. The details are sensitive.,その時期に委任関連書類が入ったのは事実です。細部は慎重になります。,那个时期确实有委托相关文件进来。细节需要谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v1].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v1].text,"투자방 링크는 제가 보냈습니다. 사기인 줄 몰랐지만, 지연 씨를 그 방으로 보낸 건 저입니다.","I sent the investment chat link. I did not know it was a scam, but I was the one who sent Ji-yeon into that room.",投資チャットのリンクは私が送りました。詐欺だとは知りませんでしたが、ジヨンさんをそのチャットへ送ったのは私です。,投资群链接是我发的。我不知道那是诈骗，但把智妍送进那个群的人是我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v10].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v10].text,"재판관님, 저는 출입 동선 증인이 아닙니다. 제가 아는 건 지연 씨의 송금 전 말과 제가 보낸 링크입니다.","Your Honor, I am not a witness to the entry route. What I know is what Ji-yeon said before the transfer and the link I sent.",裁判官、私は出入りの動線の証人ではありません。私が知っているのは、ジヨンさんの送金前の言葉と、私が送ったリンクです。,法官，我不是出入动线的证人。我知道的是智妍转账前说的话，以及我发送的链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v2].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v2].text,"지연 씨가 돈을 지키겠다고 했고, 제가 링크를 넘겼습니다. 그 출발점에 제 책임이 있습니다.","Ji-yeon said she would protect her money, and I passed along the link. I have responsibility at that starting point.",ジヨンさんが「お金を守る」と言い、私がリンクを渡しました。その出発点に私の責任があります。,智妍说要守住钱，我把链接递了过去。那个起点上有我的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v3].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v3].text,저는 친구를 돕는다고 생각했습니다. 하지만 결과적으로 지연 씨가 돈을 보내는 길을 열어 줬습니다.,"I thought I was helping a friend. But in the end, I opened the path for Ji-yeon to send the money.",私は友人を助けているつもりでした。ですが結果的に、ジヨンさんがお金を送る道を開いてしまいました。,我以为是在帮朋友。但结果上，我给智妍打开了把钱转出去的路。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v4].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v4].text,그 방을 믿어도 된다고 말한 사람은 저입니다. 지연 씨가 잃은 뒤에도 너무 겁나서 바로 말 못 했습니다.,"I was the one who said that room could be trusted. After Ji-yeon lost the money, I was too scared to speak up right away.",そのチャットを信じてもいいと言ったのは私です。ジヨンさんが失った後も、怖くてすぐには言えませんでした。,说那个群可以相信的人是我。智妍亏掉钱之后，我也太害怕了，没能马上说出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v5].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v5].text,"준호 씨 일과 별개로, 투자방 연결은 제 손에서 시작됐습니다. 그건 숨기지 않겠습니다.","Separate from Mr. Lee Jun-ho’s issue, the connection to the investment chat began in my hands. I will not hide that.",イ・ジュノさんの件とは別に、投資チャットへのつながりは私の手から始まりました。それは隠しません。,与李俊浩先生的事无关，投资群的连接是从我手里开始的。这一点我不会隐瞒。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v6].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v6].text,지연 씨가 무너져 있을 때 제가 판단을 잘못했습니다. 링크를 보낸 책임은 제게도 있습니다.,"When Ji-yeon was falling apart, I judged badly. I share responsibility for sending the link.",ジヨンさんが崩れていた時、私の判断が誤っていました。リンクを送った責任は私にもあります。,智妍崩溃的时候，我判断错了。发送链接的责任我也有。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v7].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v7].text,제가 보낸 정보가 사기였습니다. 몰랐다고 해도 친구에게 위험한 길을 열어 준 건 사실입니다.,"The information I sent was a scam. Even if I did not know, it is true I opened a dangerous path for my friend.",私が送った情報は詐欺でした。知らなかったとしても、友人に危険な道を開いたのは事実です。,我发送的信息是诈骗。即使我不知道，给朋友打开危险的路也是事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v8].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v8].text,지연 씨 편을 들고 싶어서 가볍게 말했습니다. 돈이 실제로 넘어갈 줄 알았다면 막았어야 합니다.,"I spoke lightly because I wanted to take Ji-yeon’s side. If I had known the money would actually move, I should have stopped her.",ジヨンさんの味方をしたくて軽く言いました。実際にお金が動くと分かっていたなら止めるべきでした。,我想站在智妍这边，所以说得很轻。如果知道钱真的会转出去，我本该阻止她。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v9].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸면서도 자신이 링크를 보낸 사실을 끝까지 인정한다.,Protects her friend while fully admitting that she sent the link.,友人をかばいながらも、自分がリンクを送った事実は最後まで認める。,维护朋友，同时始终承认自己发送了链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v9].text,그 링크를 제가 보내지 않았다면 적어도 같은 방식으로 돈이 나가진 않았을 겁니다.,"If I had not sent that link, at least the money would not have gone out in the same way.",私がそのリンクを送っていなければ、少なくとも同じ形でお金が出ていくことはなかったと思います。,如果我没有发送那个链接，至少钱不会以同样方式流出去。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v1].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v1].text,지연 씨가 남편이 바람이면 자기 돈부터 지키겠다고 했습니다. 제가 아는 투자방 링크를 보냈습니다.,"Ji-yeon said that if her husband was cheating, she would protect her own money first. I sent an investment chat link I knew.",ジヨンさんは、夫が浮気しているなら自分のお金を先に守ると言いました。私が知っている投資チャットのリンクを送りました。,智妍说，如果丈夫出轨，就要先守住自己的钱。我发送了自己知道的投资群链接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v10].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v10].text,제가 알고 있던 방이어서 소개했습니다. 지연 씨가 그렇게 큰 결정을 할 줄은 몰랐습니다.,I introduced it because it was a room I knew. I did not know Ji-yeon would make such a big decision.,私が知っていたチャットだったので紹介しました。ジヨンさんがそこまで大きな決断をするとは思いませんでした。,因为是我知道的群，所以介绍给她。我不知道智妍会做那么大的决定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v2].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v2].text,준호 씨를 못 믿겠다고 하면서 돈을 먼저 잡아야겠다고 했습니다. 그때 제가 링크를 넘겼습니다.,She said she could not trust Jun-ho and needed to secure the money first. That was when I passed her the link.,ジュノさんを信じられないと言い、お金を先に押さえなければと言っていました。その時、私がリンクを渡しました。,她说不能相信俊浩，得先抓住钱。那时我把链接给了她。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v3].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v3].text,저는 큰일 날 줄 몰랐습니다. 지연 씨가 불안해해서 참고하라고 투자방 정보를 보낸 겁니다.,"I did not think it would become a major problem. Ji-yeon was anxious, so I sent the investment chat information for reference.",大ごとになるとは思いませんでした。ジヨンさんが不安がっていたので、参考にするよう投資チャットの情報を送っただけです。,我没想到会出大事。智妍很不安，所以我把投资群信息发给她参考。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v4].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v4].text,지연 씨가 먼저 돈 얘기를 꺼냈습니다. 저는 수익이 난다는 방을 알려 준 정도라고 생각했습니다.,Ji-yeon brought up money first. I thought I was only telling her about a room that supposedly made returns.,ジヨンさんが先にお金の話を出しました。私は利益が出るというチャットを教えた程度だと思っていました。,智妍先提起了钱。我以为只是告诉她有个据说能盈利的群。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v5].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v5].text,제가 링크를 보낸 건 맞습니다. 다만 지연 씨에게 송금하라고 강하게 민 건 아닙니다.,It is true I sent the link. But I did not strongly push Ji-yeon to transfer money.,私がリンクを送ったのは事実です。ただ、ジヨンさんに送金しろと強く押したわけではありません。,链接确实是我发的。但我没有强烈催促智妍转账。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v6].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v6].text,지연 씨가 제 몫을 지키겠다는 말을 했습니다. 저는 그 마음이 이해돼서 정보를 보냈습니다.,Ji-yeon said she would protect her share. I understood that feeling and sent her the information.,ジヨンさんが自分の分を守ると言いました。私はその気持ちが分かったので情報を送りました。,智妍说要守住自己的那一份。我理解那种心情，所以发了信息。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v7].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v7].text,친구라서 도와준다고 생각했습니다. 지금 보면 그 링크를 보낸 것부터 조심했어야 합니다.,"I thought I was helping because she was my friend. Looking back, I should have been careful from the moment I sent that link.",友人だから助けているつもりでした。今見ると、そのリンクを送るところから慎重であるべきでした。,因为是朋友，我以为是在帮她。现在看来，从发送那个链接开始就应该谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v8].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v8].text,"준호 씨 일로 지연 씨가 흔들렸고, 저는 돈을 묶어 두지 말라는 식으로 말했습니다.","Ji-yeon was shaken over Jun-ho’s matter, and I spoke as if she should not leave the money tied up.",ジュノさんの件でジヨンさんが揺れていて、私はお金を縛ったままにしないほうがいいというように話しました。,智妍因俊浩的事动摇，我说得像是不该把钱继续绑在那里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v9].behaviorHint,지연 씨의 불안을 먼저 세우고 링크 전달 책임은 작게 말한다.,Puts Ji-yeon’s anxiety first and downplays responsibility for passing on the link.,ジヨンさんの不安を先に立て、リンク共有の責任は小さく話す。,先强调智妍的不安，把传递链接的责任说得较轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v9].text,투자방 링크는 제 휴대폰에서 보냈습니다. 그게 문제가 될 줄은 몰랐습니다.,The investment chat link was sent from my phone. I did not know that would become a problem.,投資チャットのリンクは私の携帯から送りました。それが問題になるとは思いませんでした。,投资群链接是从我手机发出的。我不知道那会成为问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v1].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v1].text,지연 씨가 많이 불안해한 건 봤습니다. 저는 친구로서 걱정이 됐습니다.,"I saw that Ji-yeon was very anxious. As a friend, I was worried.",ジヨンさんがとても不安がっていたのは見ました。友人として心配でした。,我看到智妍非常不安。作为朋友，我很担心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v10].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v10].text,"재판관님, 저는 부부 동선은 모릅니다. 제가 아는 건 지연 씨의 불안한 말들입니다.","Your Honor, I do not know the couple’s movements. What I know are Ji-yeon’s anxious words.",裁判官、私は夫婦の動線は知りません。私が知っているのは、ジヨンさんの不安な言葉です。,法官，我不知道夫妻的动线。我知道的是智妍那些不安的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v2].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v2].text,지연 씨가 준호 씨 일을 두고 힘들어했습니다. 자세한 돈 얘기는 그때 크게 하지 않았습니다.,Ji-yeon was having a hard time over Jun-ho. We did not talk in much detail about money then.,ジヨンさんはジュノさんの件でつらそうでした。その時、詳しいお金の話はあまりしていません。,智妍因为俊浩的事很难受。当时并没有详细谈太多钱的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v3].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v3].text,그 시기 지연 씨가 마음을 못 잡았습니다. 저는 옆에서 들어준 정도였습니다.,"During that period, Ji-yeon could not steady herself. I only listened from beside her.",その時期、ジヨンさんは気持ちを保てていませんでした。私はそばで聞いていた程度です。,那个时期智妍无法稳定心情。我只是陪在旁边听她说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v4].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v4].text,준호 씨를 믿기 어렵다는 말을 여러 번 했습니다. 저는 친구라서 편을 들어주고 싶었습니다.,"She said many times that it was hard to trust Jun-ho. As her friend, I wanted to take her side.",ジュノさんを信じるのが難しいと何度も言っていました。私は友人なので味方をしたかったのです。,她多次说很难相信俊浩。我是朋友，所以想站在她这边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v5].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v5].text,지연 씨가 무너져 보였습니다. 그래서 뭔가 방법을 찾고 싶어 했습니다.,Ji-yeon looked like she was falling apart. So she wanted to find some way through it.,ジヨンさんは崩れているように見えました。だから何か方法を見つけたがっていました。,智妍看起来快崩溃了。所以她想找个办法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v6].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v6].text,남편 문제로 힘들다는 이야기를 들었습니다. 구체적인 금액은 기억에 기대 말하기 어렵습니다.,I heard that she was struggling because of her husband. I cannot rely on memory to state a specific amount.,夫の問題でつらいという話は聞きました。具体的な金額は記憶に頼って言いにくいです。,我听她说过因为丈夫的问题很痛苦。具体金额很难只凭记忆来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v7].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v7].text,친구 입장에서 지연 씨가 먼저 다친 사람처럼 보였습니다. 그래서 조심스럽습니다.,"From a friend’s point of view, Ji-yeon looked like the one who was hurt first. That is why I am cautious.",友人の立場では、ジヨンさんが先に傷ついた人のように見えました。だから慎重になります。,从朋友立场看，智妍像是先受伤的人。所以我很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v8].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v8].text,그때 지연 씨는 겁이 많아져 있었습니다. 저는 별일 아니라고 달래려 했습니다.,"At that time, Ji-yeon had become very fearful. I tried to soothe her, saying it was probably nothing.",その時、ジヨンさんはとても怖がるようになっていました。私は大したことではないと慰めようとしました。,那时智妍变得很害怕。我试着安慰她，说可能没什么大事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v9].behaviorHint,친구를 감싸며 자신의 링크 책임은 아직 드러내지 않는다.,Protects her friend and does not yet reveal her own responsibility for the link.,友人をかばい、自分のリンク責任はまだ明かさない。,维护朋友，尚未揭示自己在链接上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,spouse-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v9].text,지연 씨가 혼자 버티기 힘들어했습니다. 제가 들은 건 그런 감정이 먼저였습니다.,Ji-yeon was struggling to hold out alone. What I heard first were those emotions.,ジヨンさんは一人で耐えるのがつらそうでした。私が先に聞いたのは、そういう感情でした。,智妍很难独自撑下去。我先听到的是这些情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[0].system.text,결혼 10년차 부부 박지연·이준호. 8개월째 각방을 쓰고 있다. 아내 박지연이 남편의 딴살림을 주장하며 재판을 신청했다.,"Park Ji-yeon and Lee Jun-ho have been married for ten years. They have slept in separate rooms for eight months. Park Ji-yeon, the wife, filed for trial claiming her husband is maintaining a secret second household.",結婚10年目の夫婦、パク・ジヨンとイ・ジュノ。8か月間、寝室を別にしている。妻のパク・ジヨンは、夫が別宅暮らしをしていると主張して裁判を申し立てた。,结婚十年的夫妻朴智妍与李俊浩，已分房八个月。妻子朴智妍主张丈夫另组家庭，申请审理。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[33].system.text,"오피스텔 방문, 새벽 전화, 영수증 — 남편은 모두 인정했지만 상대가 누구인지 끝내 밝히지 않았다. 양측의 주장이 정면으로 엇갈리고 있다. 심문을 통해 진실을 확인해야 한다.","Officetel visits, early-morning calls, receipts—the husband admitted all of them but never revealed who was involved. The two sides’ claims are in direct conflict. The truth must be confirmed through questioning.",オフィステル訪問、早朝の電話、レシート――夫はすべて認めたが、相手が誰なのかは最後まで明かさなかった。双方の主張は正面から食い違っている。尋問を通じて真実を確認しなければならない。,韩式商住公寓探访、凌晨电话、收据——丈夫全部承认，却始终没有说明对方是谁。双方主张正面冲突。必须通过询问确认真相。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_calm].text,양측 모두 진정하십시오. 순서대로 듣겠습니다.,"Both sides, calm down. I will hear you in order.",双方とも落ち着いてください。順番に伺います。,双方都请冷静。我会按顺序听取。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_let_a].text,"박지연 씨, 좀 더 말씀해 보십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, please continue.",パク・ジヨンさん、もう少し話してください。,朴智妍女士，请继续说。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_press_b].text,"이준호 씨, '오해'라고 하셨는데 — 어떤 부분이 오해라고 하시는 건지 구체적으로 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, you called it a 'misunderstanding'—please explain specifically which part is a misunderstanding.",イ・ジュノさん、「誤解」だとおっしゃいましたが――どの部分が誤解だというのか、具体的に説明してください。,李俊浩先生，你说这是“误会”——请具体说明哪一部分是误会。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_allow].text,계속 말씀하십시오.,Please continue.,続けてください。,请继续。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_ask_b].text,"이준호 씨, 박지연 씨가 말씀하신 시댁 문제가 사실입니까?","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, is the in-laws issue Ms. Park Ji-yeon mentioned true?",イ・ジュノさん、パク・ジヨンさんが話した義実家の問題は事実ですか。,李俊浩先生，朴智妍女士所说的婆家问题属实吗？,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_stop_a].text,"박지연 씨, 시댁 문제는 지금 사안과 다릅니다. 오피스텔 건에 집중해 주십시오.","Ms. Park Ji-yeon, the in-laws issue is not the matter before us. Please focus on the officetel issue.",パク・ジヨンさん、義実家の問題は今の事案とは異なります。オフィステルの件に集中してください。,朴智妍女士，婆家问题与当前事项不同。请集中在韩式商住公寓一事上。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_defer].text,이 부분은 심문에서 자세히 확인하겠습니다.,I will confirm this part in detail during questioning.,この部分は尋問で詳しく確認します。,这一部分将在询问中详细确认。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_empathy].text,"이준호 씨, 말하기 어려운 사정이 있는 것 같습니다. 하지만 이 자리에서 밝히는 게 좋겠습니다.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, it seems there are circumstances that are difficult to discuss. But it would be better to disclose them here.",イ・ジュノさん、話しにくい事情があるようです。ですが、この場で明かしたほうがよいでしょう。,李俊浩先生，看来有难以开口的情况。但最好在这里说明。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,spouse-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_press].text,"이준호 씨, '아는 사람'이 누구입니까. 구체적으로 답하십시오.","Mr. Lee Jun-ho, who is this 'person you know'? Answer specifically.",イ・ジュノさん、「知っている人」とは誰ですか。具体的に答えてください。,李俊浩先生，“认识的人”是谁？请具体回答。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,angles[d-1].description,"왜 방문, 전화, 물건을 배우자에게 설명하지 않았는지 확인한다.","Confirm why the visits, calls, and items were not explained to the spouse.",訪問、電話、物をなぜ配偶者に説明しなかったのか確認する。,确认为何没有向配偶说明探访、电话和物品。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,angles[d-1].label,숨긴 이유,Reason for Hiding,隠した理由,隐瞒的理由,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,angles[d-2].description,개인 돈이라도 배우자에게 말하지 않고 큰돈을 움직인 책임을 묻는다.,"Ask about the responsibility for moving a large sum without telling the spouse, even if it was personal money.",個人の金であっても、配偶者に告げず大金を動かした責任を問う。,追问即使是个人资金，也未告知配偶就动用大笔钱的责任。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,angles[d-2].label,배우자 동의 배제,Spouse Consent Excluded,配偶者同意の排除,排除配偶同意,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,angles[h-d3].description,돈이 사라진 결과와 서류 처리 책임을 감정적 피해 주장과 분리한다.,Separate the result of the missing money and responsibility for document handling from claims of emotional harm.,金が失われた結果と書類処理の責任を、感情的被害の主張から切り分ける。,将钱款消失的结果和文件处理责任，与情绪受害主张分开。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,angles[h-d3].label,손실과 법적 책임,Loss and Legal Responsibility,損失と法的責任,损失与法律责任,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,angles[h-d4].description,"누가 더 나쁜가가 아니라 숨김, 감시, 실행, 위법성을 각각 따로 기록한다.","Record concealment, monitoring, execution, and illegality separately, rather than deciding who is worse.",どちらがより悪いかではなく、隠蔽、監視、実行、違法性をそれぞれ別に記録する。,不是判断谁更坏，而是分别记录隐瞒、监控、执行和违法性。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,spouse-01,angles[h-d4].label,분리된 책임 기록,Separated Responsibility Record,切り分けられた責任記録,分项责任记录,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-core].behaviorHint,조심스럽지만 확신,cautious but certain,慎重だが確信している,谨慎但确定,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-core].question,302호에 사는 분에 대해 좀 더 자세히 알려주시겠습니까?,Can you tell us more about the person living in unit 302?,302号室に住んでいる方について、もう少し詳しく話していただけますか。,能再详细说说住在302号的人吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-core].testimony,"302호는 남자분 혼자 사시는데, 가끔 이준호 씨가 오시면 그 집에서 아이 웃음소리가 들렸어요. 밥 냄새도 나고요. 그래서 저는 친구 분이나 친척 분인가보다 생각하고 있었습니다.","Unit 302 is occupied by a man living alone, but when Mr. Lee Jun-ho came by, I sometimes heard a child laughing from that home. I could smell food too. I assumed he was a friend or relative.",302号室は男性が一人で住んでいますが、イ・ジュノさんが来ると、その部屋から子どもの笑い声が聞こえることがありました。食事の匂いもしました。だから友人か親戚なのだろうと思っていました。,302号是一位男性独居，但李俊浩先生来的时候，我有时会听到那家传出孩子的笑声，也会闻到饭菜味。所以我以为是朋友或亲戚。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-core].topic,302호 거주자에 대해 묻는다,Ask about the resident of unit 302,302号室の居住者について尋ねる,询问302号住户,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-kid-spotted].behaviorHint,기억을 떠올리며 천천히,slowly recalling the memory,ゆっくり記憶をたどりながら,慢慢回忆,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-kid-spotted].question,이준호 씨가 항상 혼자 왔습니까? 누군가와 함께 나오는 걸 본 적은요?,Did Mr. Lee Jun-ho always come alone? Have you ever seen him come out with someone?,イ・ジュノさんはいつも一人で来ていましたか。誰かと一緒に出てくるのを見たことはありますか。,李俊浩先生一直是一个人来的吗？你见过他和谁一起出来吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-kid-spotted].testimony,가끔 중학생 정도 되는 아이와 같이 나오는 걸 봤어요. 아이가 교복을 입고 있을 때도 있었습니다.,I sometimes saw him come out with a child about middle-school age. The child was wearing a school uniform at times.,時々、中学生くらいの子どもと一緒に出てくるのを見ました。その子が制服を着ている時もありました。,我有时看到他和一个中学生年纪的孩子一起出来。那孩子有时还穿着校服。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-kid-spotted].topic,방문 시 동행인이 있었는지 묻는다,Ask whether anyone accompanied him during visits,訪問時に同行者がいたか尋ねる,询问探访时是否有同行者,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-no-single-woman].behaviorHint,확신을 가지고,with conviction,確信を持って,带着确信,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-no-single-woman].question,방문 빈도는 알겠습니다. 그런데 그 층에 혼자 사는 여성이 있습니까?,I understand the visit frequency. But is there a woman living alone on that floor?,訪問頻度は分かりました。ですが、その階に一人で暮らす女性はいますか。,探访频率我明白了。那么那一层有独居女性吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-no-single-woman].testimony,"아뇨, 그 층에 여자 혼자 사는 집은 없어요. 가족들이 사는 집이 대부분이고, 302호는 남자분 혼자 사시는 걸로 알고 있습니다.","No, there is no home on that floor where a woman lives alone. Most are family households, and I understand that unit 302 is occupied by a man living alone.",いいえ、その階に女性が一人で暮らす家はありません。家族で住んでいる家がほとんどで、302号室は男性が一人で住んでいると認識しています。,没有，那一层没有女性独居的住户。大多是家庭住户，302号我知道是一位男性独居。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-no-single-woman].topic,그 층 거주자 구성을 묻는다,Ask about the resident makeup of that floor,その階の居住者構成について尋ねる,询问该楼层住户构成,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-resident-info].behaviorHint,기억을 떠올리며,recalling the memory,記憶をたどりながら,回忆着,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-resident-info].question,이준호 씨가 방문하는 층에는 어떤 분들이 살고 있습니까?,What kind of residents live on the floor Mr. Lee Jun-ho visits?,イ・ジュノさんが訪問する階には、どのような方々が住んでいますか。,李俊浩先生探访的那一层住着什么样的人？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-resident-info].testimony,그 층은 대부분 가족 세대예요. 여자 혼자 사는 집은 없는 걸로 알고 있습니다.,"That floor is mostly family households. As far as I know, there is no home where a woman lives alone.",その階はほとんどが家族世帯です。女性が一人で暮らす家はないと認識しています。,那一层大多是家庭住户。据我所知，没有女性独居的住户。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-resident-info].topic,해당 층 거주자를 묻는다,Ask about the residents of that floor,該当階の居住者について尋ねる,询问该楼层住户,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-visit-freq].behaviorHint,사실대로 담담하게,calmly and truthfully,事実どおり淡々と,如实而平静地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-visit-freq].question,이준호 씨가 이 오피스텔에 얼마나 자주 방문했습니까?,How often did Mr. Lee Jun-ho visit this officetel?,イ・ジュノさんはこのオフィステルにどれくらい頻繁に訪問しましたか。,李俊浩先生多久来一次这处韩式商住公寓？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-visit-freq].testimony,일주일에 두세 번은 오셨어요. 보통 저녁 7시쯤 들어오셔서 밤 10시쯤 나가셨습니다. 꽤 규칙적이었어요.,He came two or three times a week. Usually he entered around 7 p.m. and left around 10 p.m. It was fairly regular.,週に二、三回は来ていました。たいてい午後7時ごろに入り、夜10時ごろに出ていました。かなり規則的でした。,他每周会来两三次。通常晚上7点左右进去，晚上10点左右离开。相当规律。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-visit-freq].topic,방문 빈도를 묻는다,Ask about visit frequency,訪問頻度について尋ねる,询问探访频率,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-cash-pattern].behaviorHint,기록을 확인하듯 정확하게,"precisely, as if checking records",記録を確認するように正確に,像确认记录一样准确地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-cash-pattern].question,현금 출금의 패턴이 어땠습니까? 한꺼번에? 나눠서?,What was the cash withdrawal pattern? All at once? In parts?,現金出金のパターンはどうでしたか。一度にですか、分けてですか。,现金取款的模式是怎样的？一次性？还是分开取？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-cash-pattern].testimony,"4개월에 걸쳐 나눠서 출금하셨어요. 500, 800, 700, 1000만 원. 전부 같은 지점 ATM이었고, 계좌 이체를 안 하시는 게 좀 특이했습니다.","He withdrew it in parts over four months: ₩5M, ₩8M, ₩7M, and ₩10M. All were from ATMs at the same branch, and it was unusual that he did not use bank transfers.","4か月にわたって分けて出金していました。500万、800万、700万、1,000万ウォンです。すべて同じ支店のATMで、振込を使わないのが少し珍しかったです。",他在4个月里分开取款：500万、800万、700万、1000万韩元。全部是同一支行ATM，而且不做转账这一点有些特别。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-cash-pattern].topic,출금 패턴에 대해 묻는다,Ask about the withdrawal pattern,出金パターンについて尋ねる,询问取款模式,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-cash-withdrawal].behaviorHint,업무적으로 정확하게,professionally and precisely,業務的に正確に,业务性而准确地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-cash-withdrawal].question,이준호 씨의 계좌에서 큰 금액이 출금된 적이 있습니까?,Was a large amount ever withdrawn from Mr. Lee Jun-ho’s account?,イ・ジュノさんの口座から大きな金額が出金されたことはありますか。,李俊浩先生的账户里曾经有大额取款吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-cash-withdrawal].testimony,"네, 수개월에 걸쳐 여러 차례 큰 금액을 현금으로 출금하셨어요. 계좌 이체가 아니라 전부 현금이었기 때문에 기억합니다. 총 3천만 원 정도였습니다.","Yes. Over several months, he withdrew large sums in cash several times. I remember because it was all cash, not bank transfers. It totaled about ₩30M.","はい。数か月にわたり、何度も大きな金額を現金で出金していました。振込ではなくすべて現金だったので覚えています。合計で3,000万ウォンほどでした。",有。几个月里，他多次以现金取出大额款项。我记得是因为不是转账，全部都是现金。总共约3000万韩元。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-cash-withdrawal].topic,이준호의 현금 출금에 대해 묻는다,Ask about Lee Jun-ho’s cash withdrawals,イ・ジュノの現金出金について尋ねる,询问李俊浩的现金取款,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-core].behaviorHint,기억이 선명하게,with a clear memory,記憶が鮮明に,记忆清晰地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-core].question,이준호 씨가 나중에 적금 해지 건으로 은행에 온 적이 있습니까?,Did Mr. Lee Jun-ho later come to the bank about the savings cancellation?,イ・ジュノさんは後で積立預金の解約件で銀行に来たことがありますか。,李俊浩先生后来有没有因为储蓄账户解约一事来过银行？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-core].testimony,"네, 몇 주 뒤에 오셔서 ""적금을 해지한 적이 없다""고 하셨어요. 상당히 놀라신 표정이었습니다. 그때 저도 ""아, 위임장이 문제였구나"" 싶었습니다.","Yes. He came a few weeks later and said, ""I never cancelled the savings account."" He looked very surprised. That was when I thought, ""Ah, the power of attorney was the problem.""",はい。数週間後に来られて、「積立預金を解約したことはない」と言いました。かなり驚いた表情でした。その時、私も「ああ、委任状が問題だったのか」と思いました。,有。几周后他来银行，说“我从来没有解约过储蓄账户”。他表情相当震惊。那时我也觉得，“啊，问题出在委托书上”。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-core].topic,이후 남편의 반응을 묻는다,Ask about the husband’s later reaction,その後の夫の反応について尋ねる,询问之后丈夫的反应,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-savings-cancel-known].behaviorHint,약간 불안해하며,slightly anxious,少し不安そうに,略显不安地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-savings-cancel-known].question,적금 해지 시 위임장에 문제는 없었습니까?,Was there any issue with the power of attorney when the savings account was cancelled?,積立預金の解約時、委任状に問題はありませんでしたか。,储蓄账户解约时，委托书没有问题吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-savings-cancel-known].testimony,"사실 위임장 서명이 좀 달라 보였습니다. 한번 더 확인하려고 했는데, 급하다고 하셔서 그냥 처리했어요.","Honestly, the signature on the power of attorney looked a little different. I tried to check once more, but she said it was urgent, so I processed it.",実は委任状の署名が少し違って見えました。もう一度確認しようとしたのですが、急いでいると言われ、そのまま処理しました。,其实委托书上的签名看起来有些不一样。我想再确认一次，但她说很急，所以就处理了。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-savings-cancel-known].topic,적금 해지 위임장에 대해 묻는다,Ask about the power of attorney for the savings cancellation,積立預金解約の委任状について尋ねる,询问储蓄账户解约委托书,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-savings-cancel].behaviorHint,신중하게,carefully,慎重に,谨慎地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-savings-cancel].question,이 부부의 공동 적금이 해지된 적이 있습니까?,Was this couple’s joint savings account ever cancelled?,この夫婦の共同積立預金が解約されたことはありますか。,这对夫妻的共同储蓄账户曾被解约吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-savings-cancel].testimony,"네, 공동명의 정기적금이 중도 해지됐습니다. 박지연 씨가 위임장을 가져오셔서 처리했어요.","Yes. A joint-name installment savings account was cancelled early. Ms. Park Ji-yeon brought a power of attorney, so I processed it.",はい、共同名義の定期積立預金が中途解約されました。パク・ジヨンさんが委任状を持って来られたので処理しました。,有，共同名义的定期储蓄账户被提前解约了。朴智妍女士带来委托书，所以我办理了。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-savings-cancel].topic,공동 적금 해지 건에 대해 묻는다,Ask about the joint savings cancellation,共同積立預金の解約件について尋ねる,询问共同储蓄账户解约一事,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-signature-doubt].behaviorHint,조심스럽게,carefully,慎重に,谨慎地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-signature-doubt].question,서명이 달랐다는 게 구체적으로 어떤 부분이었습니까?,"Specifically, what was different about the signature?",署名が違ったというのは、具体的にどの部分でしたか。,签名不同，具体是哪里不同？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-signature-doubt].testimony,"남편 분의 원래 서명은 좀 더 또박또박한 편인데, 위임장의 서명은 흘려 쓴 느낌이었어요. 하지만 저는 필적 감정사가 아니니까 확신은 못 했습니다.","The husband’s original signature was more neat and deliberate, but the signature on the power of attorney felt scribbled. But I am not a handwriting expert, so I could not be certain.",ご主人の元の署名はもう少しはっきりしたものですが、委任状の署名は崩して書いたように見えました。ただ、私は筆跡鑑定人ではないので確信はできませんでした。,丈夫原本的签名更工整一些，但委托书上的签名像是潦草写成的。不过我不是笔迹鉴定专家，所以不能确定。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w2-hd3-signature-doubt].topic,위임장 서명의 문제를 묻는다,Ask about the issue with the power-of-attorney signature,委任状の署名の問題について尋ねる,询问委托书签名的问题,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-aftermath-call].behaviorHint,친구를 안타까워하며 눈물을 참으며,"holding back tears, pained for her friend",友人を痛ましく思い、涙をこらえながら,为朋友心疼，强忍泪水,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-aftermath-call].question,투자 결과는 어떻게 됐습니까?,What happened with the investment?,投資の結果はどうなりましたか。,投资结果如何？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-aftermath-call].testimony,"지연이가 새벽에 울면서 전화했어요. ""돈이 다 날아갔다""고. 운영자가 채팅방을 나가버렸대요. 남편한테는 절대 말 못 한다고... 저한테 ""제발 비밀로 해달라""고 하더라고요.","Jiyeon called me at dawn, crying. She said, ""All the money is gone."" The operator had left the chat room. She said she could never tell her husband... and asked me, ""Please keep it secret.""",ジヨンが明け方に泣きながら電話してきました。「お金が全部なくなった」と。運営者がチャットルームを出てしまったそうです。夫には絶対言えないと……私に「お願いだから秘密にして」と言いました。,智妍凌晨哭着给我打电话。她说“钱全没了”。运营者已经退出了聊天群。她说绝对不能告诉丈夫……还对我说“拜托你帮我保密”。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-aftermath-call].topic,투자 결과를 묻는다,Ask about the investment result,投資結果について尋ねる,询问投资结果,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-investment-link].behaviorHint,미안해하며 머뭇거리며,hesitant and apologetic,申し訳なさそうにためらいながら,带着歉意犹豫地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-investment-link].question,"투자방 이야기가 나왔는데, 박지연 씨가 어떻게 투자방에 들어가게 됐습니까?",The investment chat has come up. How did Ms. Park Ji-yeon end up joining it?,投資チャットの話が出ましたが、パク・ジヨンさんはどうやって投資チャットに入ることになったのですか。,提到了投资群，朴智妍女士是怎么进入投资群的？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-investment-link].testimony,그게... 제가 링크를 보내긴 했어요. 수익이 좋다고 소문이 나서. 근데 그렇게 큰 돈을 넣을 줄은 정말 몰랐습니다.,Well... I did send her the link. People said the returns were good. But I really did not know she would put in that much money.,それは……私がリンクを送ったのは事実です。収益が良いと噂になっていたので。でも、あんな大金を入れるとは本当に思いませんでした。,那个……链接确实是我发给她的。因为大家都说收益不错。但我真的不知道她会投入那么大一笔钱。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-investment-link].topic,투자방에 대해 묻는다,Ask about the investment chat,投資チャットについて尋ねる,询问投资群,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-money-amount].behaviorHint,충격받은 표정으로,with a shocked expression,衝撃を受けた表情で,表情震惊地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-money-amount].question,박지연 씨가 얼마를 투자했는지 알고 있습니까?,Do you know how much Ms. Park Ji-yeon invested?,パク・ジヨンさんがいくら投資したか知っていますか。,你知道朴智妍女士投资了多少钱吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-money-amount].testimony,나중에 들으니 2천만 원이었대요. 적금을 깨서 넣었다고... 저도 그 말 듣고 깜짝 놀랐어요.,I heard later it was ₩20M. She said she broke the savings account to put it in... I was shocked when I heard that too.,"後で聞いたら2,000万ウォンだったそうです。積立預金を崩して入れたと……私もそれを聞いて本当に驚きました。",后来听说是2000万韩元。她说是解了储蓄账户投进去的……我听到后也吓了一跳。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-money-amount].topic,투자 금액에 대해 묻는다,Ask about the investment amount,投資額について尋ねる,询问投资金额,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-motive-suspicion].behaviorHint,친구를 걱정하며,worried for her friend,友人を心配しながら,担心朋友地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-motive-suspicion].question,박지연 씨가 남편에 대해 어떤 이야기를 하던가요?,What did Ms. Park Ji-yeon say about her husband?,パク・ジヨンさんは夫についてどんな話をしていましたか。,朴智妍女士对丈夫说过什么？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-motive-suspicion].testimony,"지연이가 ""남편이 바람피면 내 돈부터 지키겠다""고 했어요. 남편 통장에서 큰 돈이 빠지는 걸 보고 되게 불안해하더라고요.","Jiyeon said, ""If my husband is cheating, I will protect my money first."" She became very anxious after seeing a large sum leave her husband’s bankbook.",ジヨンは「夫が浮気しているなら、まず自分のお金を守る」と言っていました。夫の通帳から大金が出ていくのを見て、とても不安がっていました。,智妍说过：“如果我丈夫出轨，我要先守住我的钱。”她看到丈夫存折里大笔钱流出后，非常不安。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/spouse-01.ts,spouse-01,witnessTestimony[w3-motive-suspicion].topic,박지연의 심리 상태를 묻는다,Ask about Park Ji-yeon’s state of mind,パク・ジヨンの心理状態について尋ねる,询问朴智妍的心理状态,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
