case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.nodes_stmt-a-heir_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.nodes[stmt-a-heir].label,"윤태성의 발언 ""모시고 산 건 나인데 왜 40이냐""",Yoon Tae-seong's statement: “I was the one who cared for her. Why only 40?”,ユン・テソンの発言「世話をしてきたのは私なのに、なぜ40なのか」,尹泰成的发言：“照顾母亲的是我，为什么只有40？”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.nodes_stmt-b-mother_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.nodes[stmt-b-mother].label,"윤정후의 발언 ""어머니가 그렇게 하고 싶어 하셨습니다""",Yoon Jeong-hu's statement: “Mother wanted it that way.”,ユン・ジョンフの発言「母がそうしたがっていました」,尹正厚的发言：“母亲就是想这样做。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
