case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-1_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-1].judgeHint,"유서 작성 당시 판단 능력과 개입 경계를 더 깊이 추궁하거나, 요양보호사 증언으로 보강할 수 있습니다.","You can press further on capacity at the time the will was written and the boundary of involvement, or reinforce it with the caregiver's testimony.",遺言書作成時の判断能力と関与の境界をさらに追及するか、介護職員の証言で補強できます。,可以进一步追问立遗嘱时的判断能力和介入边界，也可以用护理员证言补强。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-1].label,dc-1 유서 작성 개입 정황,dc-1 Signs of Involvement in the Will,dc-1 遺言書作成への関与の状況,dc-1 介入遗嘱制作的迹象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-1_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-1].noteText,유서 작성 개입 정황,Signs of Involvement in the Will,遺言書作成への関与の状況,介入遗嘱制作的迹象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-1_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-1].summary,유서 비율과 방문 기록이 함께 움직입니다. 작성 과정에서 누가 곁에 있었는지 확인해야 합니다.,The will ratio and the visit logs move together. You need to confirm who was beside her during the drafting process.,遺言書の比率と訪問記録が連動しています。作成過程で誰がそばにいたのか確認する必要があります。,遗嘱比例和探访记录同步变化。需要确认制作过程中谁在她身边。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-2_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-2].judgeHint,공증 당일 어머니 상태와 자필 연습본의 비율을 분리해 확인하십시오.,Check the mother's condition on the day of notarization separately from the ratio in the handwritten draft.,公証当日の母の状態と、自筆下書きの比率を切り分けて確認してください。,请分别确认公证当天母亲的状态，以及亲笔草稿中的比例。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-2].label,dc-2 유언장에 손댄 경위,dc-2 How the Will Was Altered,dc-2 遺言書に手を加えた経緯,dc-2 遗嘱被改动的经过,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-2_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-2].noteText,유언장에 손댄 경위,How the Will Was Altered,遺言書に手を加えた経緯,遗嘱被改动的经过,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-2_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-2].summary,"공증인 메모와 자필 연습본을 함께 보면, 공증본 60:40 뒤에 별도 연습본이 있었고 유언장에 손댄 경위가 쟁점이 됩니다.","Read with the notary's memo, the handwritten draft shows there was a separate draft behind the 60:40 notarized copy. How the will was altered becomes the issue.",公証人のメモと自筆下書きを合わせて見ると、60:40の公証本の背後に別の下書きがあったことが分かり、遺言書に手を加えた経緯が争点になります。,结合公证人备忘和亲笔草稿来看，60:40公证本背后另有草稿，遗嘱被改动的经过成为争议点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-3_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-3].judgeHint,새 쟁점 '오래된 지원의 출처'가 드러났습니다. 돈의 출처와 전달 순서를 확인하십시오.,A new issue has emerged: “Source of Old Support.” Check the source of the money and the order in which it was passed on.,新たな争点「古い支援の出どころ」が明らかになりました。金の出どころと受け渡しの順序を確認してください。,新的争议点“旧日支援的来源”已浮现。请确认资金来源和传递顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-3_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-3].label,dc-3 오래된 지원의 출처,dc-3 Source of Old Support,dc-3 古い支援の出どころ,dc-3 旧日支援的来源,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-3_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-3].noteText,오래된 지원의 출처,Source of Old Support,古い支援の出どころ,旧日支援的来源,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-3_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-3].summary,자필 연습본의 비율과 오래된 계좌 흐름이 이어집니다. 어머니 통장을 거친 돈의 출처를 확인해야 합니다.,The ratio in the handwritten draft connects to an old account trail. You need to confirm the source of the money that passed through the mother's account.,自筆下書きの比率と古い口座の流れがつながっています。母の口座を経由した金の出どころを確認する必要があります。,亲笔草稿中的比例与旧账户流水相连。需要确认经由母亲账户的资金来源。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-4_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-4].judgeHint,새 쟁점 '가족 기록과 침묵의 이유'가 드러났습니다. 기록의 의미와 침묵의 범위를 확인하십시오.,A new issue has emerged: “Family Records and Reasons for Silence.” Check what the records mean and how far the silence reached.,新たな争点「家族の記録と沈黙の理由」が明らかになりました。記録の意味と沈黙の範囲を確認してください。,新的争议点“家庭记录与沉默的理由”已浮现。请确认记录的含义和沉默的范围。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-4_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-4].label,dc-4 가족 기록과 침묵의 이유,dc-4 Family Records and Reasons for Silence,dc-4 家族の記録と沈黙の理由,dc-4 家庭记录与沉默的理由,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-4_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-4].noteText,가족 기록과 침묵의 이유,Family Records and Reasons for Silence,家族の記録と沈黙の理由,家庭记录与沉默的理由,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-4_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-4].summary,오래된 계좌 흐름과 일기장이 형제의 침묵을 같은 방향으로 가리킵니다. 민감한 가족 사정을 확인해야 합니다.,The old account trail and the diary point to the brothers' silence in the same direction. You need to confirm the sensitive family circumstances.,古い口座の流れと日記が、兄弟の沈黙を同じ方向に示しています。繊細な家族事情を確認する必要があります。,旧账户流水和日记都指向兄弟二人的沉默。需要确认敏感的家庭情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-5_.judgeHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-5].judgeHint,새 쟁점 '어머니의 숨겨진 마음'이 드러났습니다. 각자의 해석과 개입을 분리하십시오.,A new issue has emerged: “Mother's Hidden Feelings.” Separate each person's interpretation from their involvement.,新たな争点「母の隠された思い」が明らかになりました。それぞれの解釈と関与を切り分けてください。,新的争议点“母亲隐藏的心意”已浮现。请区分各自的解读和介入。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-5_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-5].label,dc-5 어머니의 숨겨진 마음,dc-5 Mother's Hidden Feelings,dc-5 母の隠された思い,dc-5 母亲隐藏的心意,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-5_.noteText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-5].noteText,어머니의 숨겨진 마음,Mother's Hidden Feelings,母の隠された思い,母亲隐藏的心意,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.outputs_dc-5_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.outputs[dc-5].summary,유서 비율과 어머니 기록이 함께 흔들립니다. 두 형제가 각자 어머니 뜻을 어떻게 움직였는지 확인해야 합니다.,The will ratio and the mother's records both come into question. You need to confirm how each brother moved the mother's wishes.,遺言書の比率と母の記録がともに揺らいでいます。兄弟それぞれが母の意思をどう動かしたのか確認する必要があります。,遗嘱比例和母亲记录都开始动摇。需要确认两兄弟各自如何影响了母亲的意愿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-1_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-1].discoveryText,유서의 60:40 비율과 말년 방문 기록이 겹친다. 유서 작성 과정에 윤정후가 곁에 있었는지 다시 확인해야 한다.,The will's 60:40 ratio overlaps with the late-life visit logs. Reconfirm whether Yoon Jeong-hu was beside her during the drafting process.,遺言書の60:40の比率と晩年の訪問記録が重なります。遺言書作成過程でユン・ジョンフがそばにいたのか、改めて確認する必要があります。,遗嘱中的60:40比例与晚年探访记录重叠。需要重新确认尹正厚是否在立遗嘱过程中陪在身边。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-10_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-10].discoveryText,"형의 '모시고 산 건 나인데'라는 말과 오래된 계좌 흐름을 합치면, 돈과 침묵을 함께 떠안은 동생의 동기가 보인다.","Put the older brother's “I was the one who cared for her” together with the old account trail, and the younger brother's motive for carrying both the money and the silence comes into view.",兄の「世話をしてきたのは私だ」という言葉と古い口座の流れを合わせると、金と沈黙を共に背負った弟の動機が見えてきます。,把哥哥“照顾母亲的是我”这句话与旧账户流水放在一起，就能看见弟弟同时背负金钱与沉默的动机。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-11_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-11].discoveryText,요양원 방문기록의 증가 시점과 전 요양보호사가 종이를 읽어드린 시점이 겹친다.,The timing of the increase in the Care Home Visit Logs overlaps with when the former caregiver says the paper was read aloud to the mother.,介護施設の訪問記録が増えた時期と、元介護職員が紙を読み聞かせた時期が重なります。,疗养院探访记录增加的时期，与前护理员所说读纸张给母亲听的时期相重叠。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-12_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-12].discoveryText,"'모시고 산 건 나인데 왜 40이냐'와 윤정후의 차단 발언을 맞대면, 비율 뒤에 숨은 사정이 있다는 흐름이 보인다.","Set “I cared for her, so why only 40?” against Yoon Jeong-hu's blocking statement, and a hidden story behind the ratio starts to show.",「世話をしてきたのは私なのに、なぜ40なのか」とユン・ジョンフの遮る発言を突き合わせると、比率の背後に隠れた事情がある流れが見えてきます。,将“照顾母亲的是我，为什么只有40”与尹正厚的回避发言对照，就能看出比例背后另有隐情。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-2_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-2].discoveryText,공증인 메모와 자필 연습본의 내용이 어긋난다. 공증본 60:40과 별도 연습본의 관계를 본인에게 물어야 한다.,The notary's memo and the handwritten draft do not align. Ask him about the relationship between the 60:40 notarized copy and the separate draft.,公証人のメモと自筆下書きの内容が食い違っています。60:40の公証本と別の下書きの関係を本人に尋ねる必要があります。,公证人备忘与亲笔草稿内容不一致。应向本人询问60:40公证本与另行草稿的关系。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-3_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-3].discoveryText,자필 연습본의 비율과 오래된 계좌 흐름이 같은 손에서 만난다. 어머니 통장을 거친 돈의 출처를 다시 짚어야 한다.,The ratio in the handwritten draft and the old account trail meet in the same hands. Revisit the source of the money that passed through the mother's account.,自筆下書きの比率と古い口座の流れが同じ手元で交わります。母の口座を経由した金の出どころを改めて確認する必要があります。,亲笔草稿的比例与旧账户流水在同一人手中汇合。需要重新追问经由母亲账户的资金来源。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-4_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-4].discoveryText,오래된 계좌 흐름과 일기장 기록이 같은 침묵을 가리킨다. 윤정후가 무엇을 떠안고 있었는지 물어야 한다.,The old account trail and the diary point to the same silence. Ask what Yoon Jeong-hu had been carrying.,古い口座の流れと日記の記録が同じ沈黙を指しています。ユン・ジョンフが何を背負っていたのか問う必要があります。,旧账户流水和日记记录指向同一种沉默。应询问尹正厚一直背负着什么。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-5_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-5].discoveryText,윤정후의 차단 발언과 공증인 메모 기록이 맞물린다. 유언장에 손댄 경위를 따져야 한다.,Yoon Jeong-hu's blocking statement lines up with Notary's Memo Notes. Examine how the will was altered.,ユン・ジョンフの遮る発言と公証人のメモ記録がかみ合っています。遺言書に手を加えた経緯を問いただす必要があります。,尹正厚的回避发言与公证人备忘记录相互扣合。需要追究遗嘱被改动的经过。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-6_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-6].discoveryText,어머니 뜻이라는 말 뒤에 오래된 지원 흐름이 있다. 어머니 통장을 거친 돈의 출처를 짚어야 한다.,Behind the claim of “Mother's wishes” is a pattern of old support. Trace the source of the money that passed through the mother's account.,「母の意思」という言葉の背後に、古い支援の流れがあります。母の口座を経由した金の出どころを確認する必要があります。,“母亲的意愿”这句话背后有旧日支援的流向。需要追查经由母亲账户的资金来源。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-7_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-7].discoveryText,자필 연습본과 어머니 일기장의 시점이 한 흐름으로 묶인다. 비율을 낮춰 가면서까지 막으려 한 것이 무엇인지 물어야 한다.,"The timing of the handwritten draft and the mother's diary falls into one sequence. Ask what he tried to stop, even by lowering his own share.",自筆下書きと母の日記の時期が一つの流れとして結びつきます。比率を下げてまで何を止めようとしたのか問う必要があります。,亲笔草稿和母亲日记的时间点连成一条线。需要询问他甚至降低自己份额也想阻止的是什么。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-8_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-8].discoveryText,유서 비율과 어머니 일기장의 기록이 겹친다. 장남 당연시와 보호 명분이 같은 구조 위에 서 있다.,The will ratio overlaps with entries in the mother's diary. The older son's sense of entitlement and the younger son's claim of protection rest on the same structure.,遺言書の比率と母の日記の記録が重なります。長男として当然視する思いと、保護という名分が同じ構造の上に立っています。,遗嘱比例与母亲日记记录重叠。长子理所当然的想法和以保护为名的行为，立在同一结构上。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_combinationLab.recipes_combine-9_.discoveryText,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-9].discoveryText,형의 '모시고 산 건 나인데'라는 말과 어머니 일기장의 기록이 충돌한다. 두 사람이 각자 어머니 뜻을 어떻게 받아 적었는지 짚어야 한다.,The older brother's “I was the one who cared for her” conflicts with the mother's diary. Examine how each brother wrote down the mother's wishes in his own way.,兄の「世話をしてきたのは私だ」という言葉と母の日記の記録が衝突しています。二人がそれぞれ母の意思をどう受け止め、書き取ったのか確認する必要があります。,哥哥“照顾母亲的是我”这句话与母亲日记记录冲突。需要指出两人各自如何记录了母亲的意愿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_context.caseName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,context.caseName,치매 어머니의 유서,The Dementia Mother's Will,認知症の母の遺言書,认知障碍母亲的遗嘱,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_context.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,context.description,"치매 어머니가 남긴 유서에서 동생 60%, 형 40%로 적혀 있다. 평생 어머니를 모시고 살았다고 자부하는 윤태성은 분노하고, 동생은 끝까지 담담하다.","A will left by a mother with dementia gives 60% to the younger brother and 40% to the older brother. Yoon Tae-seong, who prides himself on having cared for his mother all his life, is furious; his younger brother remains calm to the end.",認知症の母が残した遺言書には、弟60％、兄40％と記されています。生涯母を世話してきたと自負するユン・テソンは怒り、弟は最後まで淡々としています。,患有认知障碍的母亲留下的遗嘱写着弟弟60%、哥哥40%。自认为一生照顾母亲的尹泰成愤怒不已，而弟弟始终平静。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_context.triggerAmplifier,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,context.triggerAmplifier,"초반에는 유서 비율과 요양원 방문 기록이 윤정후의 개입처럼 보인다. 그러나 공증인 메모와 자필 연습본, 오래된 계좌 흐름, 어머니 일기장이 차례로 열리면 사건의 중심은 단순한 유산 다툼을 넘어선다.","At first, the will ratio and the care home visit logs make Yoon Jeong-hu's involvement look likely. But as the notary's memo, handwritten draft, old account trail, and mother's diary open one by one, the center of the case moves beyond a simple inheritance dispute.",序盤では、遺言書の比率と介護施設の訪問記録がユン・ジョンフの関与を示すように見えます。しかし公証人のメモ、自筆下書き、古い口座の流れ、母の日記が順に開くと、事件の中心は単なる遺産争いを越えていきます。,起初，遗嘱比例和疗养院探访记录看起来像是尹正厚介入的痕迹。但随着公证人备忘、亲笔草稿、旧账户流水和母亲日记依次解锁，案件核心将超越单纯的遗产纠纷。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-1_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-1].judgmentStatement,"어머니의 판단 능력은 완전히 상실되지 않았으나, 윤정후의 개입은 적법성 문제를 남긴다.","The mother's capacity was not completely lost, but Yoon Jeong-hu's involvement leaves questions of legality.",母の判断能力が完全に失われていたわけではありませんが、ユン・ジョンフの関与には適法性の問題が残ります。,母亲的判断能力并未完全丧失，但尹正厚的介入留下了合法性问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-1_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-1].mediationLink,말년 유서 작성 과정의 적법성,Legality of the Late-Life Will Drafting Process,晩年の遺言書作成過程の適法性,晚年立遗嘱过程的合法性,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-1_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-1].name,유서 작성과 판단 능력,Will Drafting and Capacity,遺言書作成と判断能力,遗嘱制作与判断能力,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-1_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-1].truthDescription,"윤정후는 어머니 말년에 자주 방문하며 유서 내용을 논의했다. 요양보호사 교체와 공증 시점이 겹치지만, 어머니 의사를 완전히 무시한 것은 아니었다.","Yoon Jeong-hu visited often in his mother's final years and discussed the contents of the will. The caregiver change overlaps with the timing of notarization, but he did not completely disregard the mother's wishes.",ユン・ジョンフは母の晩年に頻繁に訪問し、遺言書の内容を話し合っていました。介護職員の交代と公証の時期は重なりますが、母の意思を完全に無視したわけではありません。,尹正厚在母亲晚年频繁探访并讨论遗嘱内容。护理员更换与公证时间重合，但他并非完全无视母亲意愿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-1_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.defer,어머니의 판단 능력 여부를 확인할 수 없다. 유보한다.,The mother's capacity cannot be confirmed. Defer judgment.,母の判断能力の有無は確認できません。判断を保留します。,无法确认母亲是否具备判断能力。暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-1_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.partial,"어머니의 인지 능력에 의문이 있지만, 완전히 무효라고 단정하긴 어렵다.","There are doubts about the mother's cognitive capacity, but it is hard to declare the will completely invalid.",母の認知能力には疑問がありますが、完全に無効だと断定するのは困難です。,母亲的认知能力存在疑问，但很难断定遗嘱完全无效。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-1_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.truth,"윤정후는 말년에 자주 방문하며 유서를 논의했지만, 어머니 의사를 완전히 무시한 건 아니었다.","Yoon Jeong-hu visited often in her final years and discussed the will, but he did not completely disregard the mother's wishes.",ユン・ジョンフは晩年に頻繁に訪問して遺言書について話し合っていましたが、母の意思を完全に無視したわけではありません。,尹正厚在晚年频繁探访并讨论遗嘱，但并非完全无视母亲意愿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-1_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.wrong,"어머니는 동생의 압박으로 유서를 작성했고, 제대로 판단할 수 없는 상태였다.",The mother wrote the will under pressure from the younger brother and was in no condition to judge properly.,母は弟の圧力で遺言書を作成し、適切に判断できる状態ではありませんでした。,母亲是在弟弟施压下立下遗嘱，当时处于无法正常判断的状态。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].judgmentStatement,공증본 60:40과 별도 자필 연습본의 비율 차이는 유언장에 손댄 책임과 그 동기를 분리해서 보게 만든다.,The difference between the 60:40 notarized copy and the separate handwritten draft forces a separate look at responsibility for altering the will and the motive behind it.,60:40の公証本と別の自筆下書きの比率差は、遺言書に手を加えた責任とその動機を切り分けて見ることを求めます。,60:40公证本与另行亲笔草稿的比例差异，使人必须区分改动遗嘱的责任与其动机。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].mediationLink,공증 유서와 자필 연습본의 관계,Relationship Between the Notarized Will and the Handwritten Draft,公証遺言書と自筆下書きの関係,公证遗嘱与亲笔草稿的关系,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].name,공증 유서와 별도 문서의 차이,Notarized Will vs. Separate Document,公証遺言書と別文書の違い,公证遗嘱与另行文件的差异,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].truthDescription,"공증본은 처음부터 60:40으로 남아 있었고, 별도 자필 유언장 연습본에서 공증본과 다른 비율을 고민한 흔적이 확인된다. 윤정후가 유언장에 손댄 책임은 남지만, 더 많이 받으려 한 조작은 아니었다.","The notarized copy had remained 60:40 from the start, while the separate handwritten will draft shows traces of considering a different ratio. Yoon Jeong-hu remains responsible for altering the will, but it was not manipulation meant to increase his own share.",公証本は当初から60:40のまま残っており、別の自筆遺言書下書きには公証本と異なる比率を検討した痕跡が確認されます。ユン・ジョンフが遺言書に手を加えた責任は残りますが、より多く受け取るための操作ではありませんでした。,公证本从一开始就是60:40，另行亲笔遗嘱草稿中则可确认曾考虑与公证本不同的比例。尹正厚仍需承担改动遗嘱的责任，但那并不是为了多拿份额的操纵。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,공증인 메모와 자필 연습본을 분리해 확인하게 한다.,Have them check the notary's memo and the handwritten draft separately.,公証人のメモと自筆下書きを切り分けて確認させます。,引导其分别确认公证人备忘和亲笔草稿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,d-1에서 공증 절차와 어머니 상태의 균열이 드러나면 해금,Unlock when d-1 reveals cracks in the notarization procedure and the mother's condition,d-1で公証手続きと母の状態のほころびが明らかになると解放,d-1中显露公证程序与母亲状态的裂痕时解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.v3UnlockPlan.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].v3UnlockPlan.summary,공증본 60:40 자체와 별도 자필 연습본의 내용 차이를 확인한다.,Confirm the 60:40 notarized copy itself and how it differs from the separate handwritten draft.,60:40の公証本そのものと、別の自筆下書きの内容差を確認します。,确认60:40公证本本身，以及其与另行亲笔草稿的内容差异。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.defer,공증본과 별도 문서의 관계를 아직 판단하기 어렵다. 유보한다.,It is still difficult to judge the relationship between the notarized copy and the separate document. Defer judgment.,公証本と別文書の関係はまだ判断しにくいです。判断を保留します。,尚难判断公证本与另行文件的关系。暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.partial,"공증본과 별도 문서의 차이는 있지만, 동기와 책임은 더 확인해야 한다.","There is a difference between the notarized copy and the separate document, but motive and responsibility need further confirmation.",公証本と別文書には違いがありますが、動機と責任はさらに確認する必要があります。,公证本与另行文件存在差异，但动机和责任仍需进一步确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.truth,"공증본은 60:40이었고, 정확한 비율 정보는 별도 자필 연습본에서만 확인된다. 윤정후가 손댄 책임과 조작 방향은 분리해 판단해야 한다.","The notarized copy was 60:40, and the exact ratio information is confirmed only in the separate handwritten draft. Yoon Jeong-hu's responsibility for altering it must be judged separately from the direction of the manipulation.",公証本は60:40で、正確な比率情報は別の自筆下書きでのみ確認されます。ユン・ジョンフが手を加えた責任と、操作の方向は切り分けて判断する必要があります。,公证本为60:40，准确比例信息只能在另行亲笔草稿中确认。尹正厚动手改动的责任与操纵方向必须分开判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-2_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.wrong,동생이 자기 몫을 늘리기 위해 공증본을 조작했다.,The younger brother manipulated the notarized copy to increase his own share.,弟が自分の取り分を増やすために公証本を操作しました。,弟弟为了增加自己的份额而操纵了公证本。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].judgmentStatement,어머니 돈으로 알았던 지원 중 핵심 흐름은 윤정후 돈이 어머니 통장을 거쳐 전달된 것이었다.,The key support that was believed to be the mother's money was actually Yoon Jeong-hu's money passed through the mother's account.,母の金だと思われていた支援の核心は、ユン・ジョンフの金が母の口座を経由して渡されたものです。,被认为是母亲钱的支援中，核心流向其实是尹正厚的钱经由母亲账户转交。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].mediationLink,어머니 통장을 거친 지원의 출처와 전달 순서,Source and Transfer Order of Support Through the Mother's Account,母の口座を経由した支援の出どころと受け渡し順序,经由母亲账户的支援来源与传递顺序,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].name,오래된 지원의 출처,Source of Old Support,古い支援の出どころ,旧日支援的来源,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].truthDescription,"윤정후는 어머니 통장으로 월 단위 정기 지원금을 보냈고, 형의 공장 위기 때 3억원도 어머니 통장을 거쳐 전달했다. 윤태성은 그 돈이 어머니 돈이라고 믿고 있었다.","Yoon Jeong-hu sent regular monthly support to the mother's account, and during his brother's factory crisis he also passed ₩300M through that account. Yoon Tae-seong believed the money was his mother's.",ユン・ジョンフは母の口座へ月単位の定期支援金を送り、兄の工場危機の際には3億ウォンも母の口座を経由して渡しました。ユン・テソンはその金を母の金だと信じていました。,尹正厚每月向母亲账户汇入定期支援金，并在哥哥工厂危机时也通过母亲账户转交了3亿韩元。尹泰成一直相信那是母亲的钱。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,유서 비율의 배경을 오래된 계좌 흐름으로 확인하게 한다.,Have them confirm the background to the will ratio through the old account trail.,遺言書の比率の背景を古い口座の流れで確認させます。,引导其通过旧账户流水确认遗嘱比例的背景。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,d-2에서 유서 변경 경위가 드러나면 해금,Unlock when d-2 reveals how the will was changed,d-2で遺言書変更の経緯が明らかになると解放,d-2中显露遗嘱变更经过时解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.v3UnlockPlan.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].v3UnlockPlan.summary,어머니 통장을 거친 지원의 출처와 전달 순서를 확인한다.,Confirm the source and transfer order of the support that passed through the mother's account.,母の口座を経由した支援の出どころと受け渡し順序を確認します。,确认经由母亲账户的支援来源与传递顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].verdictOptions.defer,계좌 흐름의 출처와 성격을 판단하기 어렵다. 유보한다.,It is difficult to judge the source and nature of the account flow. Defer judgment.,口座の流れの出どころと性質は判断しにくいです。判断を保留します。,难以判断账户流水的来源和性质。暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].verdictOptions.partial,"입금 흐름은 보이지만, 출처와 전달 목적은 일부만 확인됐다.","The deposit flow is visible, but the source and purpose of the transfer are only partly confirmed.",入金の流れは見えますが、出どころと受け渡しの目的は一部しか確認されていません。,可以看到账款入账流向，但来源和传递目的仅部分得到确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].verdictOptions.truth,윤정후 돈이 어머니 통장을 거쳐 윤태성 쪽으로 전달된 흐름이 확인된다.,A flow is confirmed in which Yoon Jeong-hu's money passed through the mother's account to Yoon Tae-seong's side.,ユン・ジョンフの金が母の口座を経由してユン・テソン側へ渡った流れが確認されます。,已确认尹正厚的钱经由母亲账户流向尹泰成一方。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-3_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-3].verdictOptions.wrong,동생이 정기 지원금을 빌미로 어머니를 통제했다.,The younger brother used regular support payments as a pretext to control the mother.,弟が定期支援金を口実に母を支配しました。,弟弟以定期支援金为借口控制了母亲。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].judgmentStatement,윤정후의 침묵에는 가족 기록 속 민감한 사정을 형에게 곧장 드러내지 않으려는 이유가 있었다.,Yoon Jeong-hu's silence had a reason: he did not want to immediately reveal the sensitive family circumstances recorded in the family records to his brother.,ユン・ジョンフの沈黙には、家族の記録にある繊細な事情を兄へすぐに明かしたくない理由がありました。,尹正厚的沉默有其理由：他不想立刻向哥哥揭开家庭记录中的敏感情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].mediationLink,어머니 일기장과 형제의 침묵,Mother's Diary and the Brothers' Silence,母の日記と兄弟の沈黙,母亲日记与兄弟的沉默,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].name,가족 기록과 침묵의 이유,Family Records and Reasons for Silence,家族の記録と沈黙の理由,家庭记录与沉默的理由,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].truthDescription,"어머니 일기장에는 윤정후가 배다른 자식이라는 사실과, 그래도 똑같은 자식으로 더 마음이 갔다는 기록이 남아 있다. 윤정후는 이 사실이 형을 무너뜨릴까 봐 침묵했다.","The mother's diary records that Yoon Jeong-hu is a half-sibling, and that she still saw him as an equal child and felt even more drawn to him. Yoon Jeong-hu stayed silent for fear that this truth would break his brother.",母の日記には、ユン・ジョンフが腹違いの子であること、それでも同じ子としてむしろより心を寄せていたことが記されています。ユン・ジョンフは、この事実が兄を打ちのめすことを恐れて沈黙しました。,母亲日记中留下记录：尹正厚是同母异父的孩子，但母亲仍把他当作同样的孩子，甚至更挂心他。尹正厚担心这一事实会击垮哥哥，因此选择沉默。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,돈의 출처를 숨긴 이유가 어머니 일기장 쪽으로 이어진다.,The reason the source of the money was hidden leads toward the mother's diary.,金の出どころを隠した理由は、母の日記へとつながります。,隐瞒资金来源的理由，指向母亲日记。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,오래된 지원의 출처가 확인되면 해금,Unlock when the source of old support is confirmed,古い支援の出どころが確認されると解放,旧日支援的来源确认后解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.v3UnlockPlan.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].v3UnlockPlan.summary,가족 기록 속 민감한 사정과 침묵의 이유를 확인한다.,Confirm the sensitive family circumstances in the records and the reason for the silence.,家族の記録にある繊細な事情と沈黙の理由を確認します。,确认家庭记录中的敏感情况和沉默的理由。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].verdictOptions.defer,가족 기록과 침묵의 관계를 판단하기 어렵다. 유보한다.,It is difficult to judge the relationship between the family records and the silence. Defer judgment.,家族の記録と沈黙の関係は判断しにくいです。判断を保留します。,难以判断家庭记录与沉默的关系。暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].verdictOptions.partial,민감한 가족 사정은 보이지만 유서 변경과의 관계는 더 확인해야 한다.,"Sensitive family circumstances are visible, but their relationship to the will change needs further confirmation.",繊細な家族事情は見えていますが、遺言書変更との関係はさらに確認する必要があります。,可以看到敏感的家庭情况，但其与遗嘱变更的关系仍需进一步确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].verdictOptions.truth,"어머니 일기장 속 가족 사정 때문에 윤정후는 형에게 곧장 말하지 못했고, 침묵이 유서 변경의 동기와 연결됐다.","Because of the family circumstances in the mother's diary, Yoon Jeong-hu could not tell his brother right away, and that silence connected to the motive for changing the will.",母の日記にある家族事情のため、ユン・ジョンフは兄にすぐ話せず、その沈黙が遺言書変更の動機につながりました。,由于母亲日记中的家庭情况，尹正厚无法立刻告诉哥哥，而这份沉默与变更遗嘱的动机相连。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-4_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-4].verdictOptions.wrong,동생이 가족 사정을 이용해 형을 유산에서 배제하려 했다.,The younger brother tried to use the family circumstances to exclude his brother from the inheritance.,弟が家族事情を利用して兄を遺産から排除しようとしました。,弟弟试图利用家庭情况把哥哥排除在遗产之外。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.judgmentStatement,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].judgmentStatement,두 형제는 서로 다른 방식으로 어머니 뜻을 자기 기준에 맞춰 움직였다.,The two brothers each moved the mother's wishes to fit their own standards in different ways.,兄弟二人は、それぞれ違う形で母の意思を自分の基準に合わせて動かしました。,两兄弟以不同方式让母亲的意愿符合自己的标准。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.mediationLink,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].mediationLink,어머니 뜻과 두 아들의 책임,Mother's Wishes and the Two Sons' Responsibility,母の意思と二人の息子の責任,母亲意愿与两个儿子的责任,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].name,어머니의 숨겨진 마음,Mother's Hidden Feelings,母の隠された思い,母亲隐藏的心意,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.truthDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].truthDescription,"윤태성은 유산을 돌봄의 보상처럼 당연시했고, 윤정후는 형을 보호한다는 이유로 어머니 뜻과 문서를 대신 정리하려 했다. 두 사람 모두 어머니 뜻을 있는 그대로 두지 못했다.","Yoon Tae-seong took the inheritance for granted as if it were compensation for care, while Yoon Jeong-hu tried to arrange the mother's wishes and documents in her place under the reason of protecting his brother. Neither man left the mother's wishes as they were.",ユン・テソンは遺産を世話の報酬のように当然視し、ユン・ジョンフは兄を守るという理由で母の意思と文書を代わりに整理しようとしました。二人とも母の意思をそのままにしておけませんでした。,尹泰成把遗产视作照顾母亲应得的补偿，尹正厚则以保护哥哥为由，试图代母亲整理意愿和文件。两人都没能让母亲的意愿保持原样。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,오래된 지원과 가족 기록이 모두 드러난 뒤 최종 책임 구조가 열린다.,"After both the old support and the family records are revealed, the final structure of responsibility opens.",古い支援と家族の記録がすべて明らかになった後、最終的な責任構造が開きます。,旧日支援和家庭记录全部显露后，最终责任结构将开启。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,d-3과 d-4가 모두 충분히 드러나면 해금,Unlock when both d-3 and d-4 are sufficiently revealed,d-3とd-4がどちらも十分に明らかになると解放,d-3和d-4均充分显露后解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.v3UnlockPlan.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].v3UnlockPlan.summary,어머니 뜻을 누가 어떻게 움직였는지 최종 책임을 비교한다.,Compare final responsibility for who moved the mother's wishes and how.,母の意思を誰がどのように動かしたのか、最終責任を比較します。,比较是谁、如何影响了母亲意愿的最终责任。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.verdictOptions.defer,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].verdictOptions.defer,어머니의 숨겨진 마음을 판단하기 어렵다. 유보한다.,It is difficult to judge the mother's hidden feelings. Defer judgment.,母の隠された思いは判断しにくいです。判断を保留します。,难以判断母亲隐藏的心意。暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.verdictOptions.partial,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].verdictOptions.partial,양쪽 모두 어머니와의 관계에서 문제가 있었다.,Both sides had problems in their relationship with their mother.,双方とも母との関係に問題がありました。,双方在与母亲的关系中都存在问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.verdictOptions.truth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].verdictOptions.truth,"윤태성은 유산을 당연시했고, 윤정후는 형을 보호한다며 어머니 뜻을 고쳐 쓰려 했다. 둘 다 어머니 뜻을 있는 그대로 두지 못했다.","Yoon Tae-seong took the inheritance for granted, and Yoon Jeong-hu tried to rewrite the mother's wishes while claiming to protect his brother. Neither left the mother's wishes as they were.",ユン・テソンは遺産を当然視し、ユン・ジョンフは兄を守ると言って母の意思を書き換えようとしました。二人とも母の意思をそのままにしておけませんでした。,尹泰成把遗产视为理所当然，尹正厚则称要保护哥哥而试图改写母亲的意愿。两人都没能让母亲的意愿保持原样。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_disputes_d-5_.verdictOptions.wrong,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,disputes[d-5].verdictOptions.wrong,동생이 어머니를 이용해 유산을 독점하려 했다.,The younger brother tried to use the mother to monopolize the inheritance.,弟が母を利用して遺産を独占しようとしました。,弟弟试图利用母亲独占遗产。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.callTerms.angry,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.angry,윤정후!,Yoon Jeong-hu!,ユン・ジョンフ！,尹正厚！,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.callTerms.toJudge,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.toJudge,제 동생,My younger brother,私の弟,我弟弟,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.callTerms.toPartner,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.toPartner,정후야,Jeong-hu,ジョンフ,正厚啊,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.dailyRoutine,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.dailyRoutine,공장에서 주문을 처리하고 저녁엔 어머니 집에 들러 자신이 돌봤다는 생활을 유지해왔다.,"He handled orders at the factory and stopped by his mother's home in the evenings, maintaining a life built around the claim that he cared for her.",工場で注文を処理し、夜には母の家に立ち寄り、自分が世話をしてきたという生活を続けてきました。,他白天在工厂处理订单，晚上去母亲家，维持着“由自己照顾母亲”的生活。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.fear,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.fear,평생 장남이라 믿었던 자기 정체성이 무너지는 것 — 그것이 두렵다.,He fears the collapse of the identity he has believed in all his life: being the eldest son.,生涯信じてきた「長男」としての自己認識が崩れること――それを恐れています。,他害怕自己一生深信的长子身份崩塌。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.name,윤태성,Yoon Tae-seong,ユン・テソン,尹泰成,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.occupation,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.occupation,주방가구 공장 대표,Kitchen Furniture Factory Owner,キッチン家具工場代表,厨房家具工厂负责人,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.sensitivePoints_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[0],장남 정체성,Eldest-Son Identity,長男としての自己認識,长子身份,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.sensitivePoints_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[1],공장 위기와 3억원 지원 이력,Factory Crisis and ₩300M Support History,工場危機と3億ウォン支援の経緯,工厂危机与3亿韩元支援记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.sensitivePoints_2,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[2],출생 비밀,Birth Secret,出生の秘密,出生秘密,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.speechStyle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.speechStyle,"목소리를 높여 상대를 누르고, 형이라는 위치를 먼저 내세운다. 불리해지면 동생의 인격을 깎아내리며 질문 자체를 무력화하려 든다.","He raises his voice to overpower the other side and puts his position as older brother first. When cornered, he attacks his younger brother's character and tries to neutralize the question itself.",声を荒げて相手を押さえつけ、まず兄という立場を前面に出します。不利になると弟の人格を貶め、質問そのものを無力化しようとします。,他会提高音量压制对方，并先摆出哥哥的地位。不利时便贬低弟弟人格，试图让问题本身失效。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.verbalTells_0_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[0].pattern,불리해지면 '형인 내가 모시고 살았다'며 서열을 내세워 논점을 돌린다.,"When cornered, he says, “I, the older brother, lived with her and cared for her,” using hierarchy to deflect the issue.",不利になると「兄である私が世話して暮らした」と序列を持ち出し、論点をそらします。,一旦不利，就以“我是哥哥，是我和母亲一起生活照顾她”为由摆出辈分，转移论点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.verbalTells_1_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[1].pattern,동생의 성격이나 과거를 꺼내며 상대 신뢰도를 먼저 깎으려 한다.,He brings up his younger brother's personality or past to undermine his credibility first.,弟の性格や過去を持ち出し、まず相手の信頼性を下げようとします。,他会提起弟弟的性格或过去，先削弱对方可信度。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyA.verbalTells_2_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[2].pattern,감정이 올라오면 목소리부터 커지며 상대가 말을 잇지 못하게 만든다.,"When emotions rise, his voice gets louder first, preventing the other side from continuing.",感情が高ぶるとまず声が大きくなり、相手が言葉を続けられないようにします。,情绪上来时，他会先提高音量，让对方无法继续说下去。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.callTerms.angry,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.callTerms.angry,윤태성!,Yoon Tae-seong!,ユン・テソン！,尹泰成！,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.callTerms.toJudge,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.callTerms.toJudge,저희 형,My older brother,私の兄,我哥哥,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.dailyRoutine,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.dailyRoutine,"가게를 운영하며 틈틈이 어머니에게 송금하고, 형 몰래 정기 지원금과 병원비를 대 왔다.","He runs a shop and sends money to his mother whenever he can, secretly covering regular support payments and medical bills without his brother knowing.",店を営みながら合間に母へ送金し、兄に内緒で定期支援金と病院費を負担してきました。,他经营店铺，抽空给母亲转账，并瞒着哥哥持续支付定期支援金和医疗费。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.fear,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.fear,형이 출생 비밀을 알게 되는 것 — 그것이 두렵다.,He fears his brother learning the birth secret.,兄が出生の秘密を知ること――それを恐れています。,他害怕哥哥知道出生秘密。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
