case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.sensitivePoints_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[0],유서 조작 사실,Fact of Will Manipulation,遺言書操作の事実,遗嘱操纵事实,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.sensitivePoints_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[1],오래된 비밀 지원,Old Secret Support,古い秘密の支援,旧日秘密支援,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.sensitivePoints_2,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[2],형의 출생 비밀,Brother's Birth Secret,兄の出生の秘密,哥哥的出生秘密,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.speechStyle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.speechStyle,감정을 최대한 억누르며 사실만 짧게 말한다. 담담해 보이지만 그 담담함이 오히려 의심을 산다. 진짜 감정은 마지막까지 드러내지 않으려 한다.,"He suppresses his emotions as much as possible and states only the facts, briefly. He appears calm, but that calmness itself raises suspicion. He tries not to reveal his true feelings until the end.",感情をできる限り抑え、事実だけを短く話します。淡々として見えますが、その淡々さがかえって疑いを招きます。本当の感情は最後まで見せまいとします。,他尽量压抑情绪，只简短陈述事实。看似平静，但这份平静反而引人怀疑。他试图到最后都不暴露真正情感。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.verbalTells_0_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[0].pattern,핵심 질문을 받으면 답변 범위를 좁히며 감정을 드러내지 않고 방어한다.,"When asked a key question, he narrows the scope of his answer and defends himself without revealing emotion.",核心的な質問を受けると回答範囲を絞り、感情を見せずに防御します。,面对核心问题时，他会缩小回答范围，不露情绪地防御。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.verbalTells_1_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[1].pattern,"거짓보다는 침묵을 택하며, 말하지 않는 것으로 진실을 숨긴다.","He chooses silence over lies, hiding the truth by not speaking.",嘘よりも沈黙を選び、語らないことで真実を隠します。,他比起说谎更选择沉默，通过不说来隐藏真相。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.partyB.verbalTells_2_.pattern,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[2].pattern,상대가 무너질까 봐 그랬다는 말이 먼저 새어 나온다.,The words “I did it because I thought he might break” slip out first.,「相手が崩れてしまうと思ったから」という言葉が先に漏れます。,“我是怕对方会崩溃才那样做”这句话会先脱口而出。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-1_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-1].description,"어머니가 생전에 누구를 더 아꼈는지, 두 형제의 기억이 정반대다.",The brothers remember completely opposite things about whom their mother favored more while she was alive.,母が生前どちらをより大切にしていたのか、兄弟の記憶は正反対です。,关于母亲生前更疼爱谁，两兄弟的记忆完全相反。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-1_.distortionDirection,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-1].distortionDirection,"윤태성은 자신이 모셨으니 당연히 더 받아야 한다고 기억하고, 윤정후는 어머니가 원래 자기에게 90을 남기려 했다는 사실을 알면서 말하지 않는다.","Yoon Tae-seong remembers that he cared for her and therefore should naturally receive more, while Yoon Jeong-hu knows the mother had originally intended to leave him 90 but says nothing.",ユン・テソンは自分が世話したのだから当然より多く受け取るべきだと記憶し、ユン・ジョンフは母が本来は自分に90を残そうとしていた事実を知りながら話しません。,尹泰成记得自己照顾了母亲，所以理应多拿；尹正厚明知母亲原本打算给自己90，却没有说出口。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-2_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-2].description,"윤정후가 오래 어머니 통장으로 보낸 정기 지원금과, 윤태성의 공장 위기 때 어머니 통장을 거쳐 전달된 3억원의 존재를 윤태성은 전혀 모른다.","Yoon Tae-seong knows nothing about the regular support Yoon Jeong-hu long sent to the mother's account, or the ₩300M passed through that account during Yoon Tae-seong's factory crisis.",ユン・ジョンフが長く母の口座へ送っていた定期支援金と、ユン・テソンの工場危機の際に母の口座を経由して渡された3億ウォンの存在を、ユン・テソンはまったく知りません。,尹泰成完全不知道尹正厚长期汇入母亲账户的定期支援金，也不知道自己工厂危机时经由母亲账户转交的3亿韩元。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-3_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-3].description,윤태성의 출생 비밀 — 아버지의 친자가 아니라는 사실을 B만 알고 있다.,Yoon Tae-seong's birth secret: only B knows that he is not the father's biological child.,ユン・テソンの出生の秘密――父の実子ではないという事実をBだけが知っています。,尹泰成的出生秘密——只有B知道他并非父亲亲生。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-4_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-4].description,유서가 60:40으로 손대어진 사실 자체는 양측 다 안다. 하지만 별도 자필 연습본의 정확한 비율은 윤태성이 아직 모른다.,Both sides know that the will itself was altered to 60:40. But Yoon Tae-seong still does not know the exact ratio in the separate handwritten draft.,遺言書が60:40に手を加えられた事実自体は双方とも知っています。しかし別の自筆下書きの正確な比率を、ユン・テソンはまだ知りません。,双方都知道遗嘱被改成60:40这一事实。但尹泰成尚不知道另行亲笔草稿中的准确比例。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.relationshipLedger_ledger-4_.distortionDirection,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-4].distortionDirection,윤태성은 60:40이 윤정후가 자기 몫을 늘린 결과라고 단정한다.,Yoon Tae-seong assumes the 60:40 ratio is the result of Yoon Jeong-hu increasing his own share.,ユン・テソンは、60:40はユン・ジョンフが自分の取り分を増やした結果だと断定しています。,尹泰成断定60:40是尹正厚增加自己份额的结果。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-1_.knowledgeScope,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].knowledgeScope,"요양보호사로 일하며 윤정후가 어머니에게 종이를 읽어드리고, 형 오기 전에 끝내자고 조심스러워하던 모습을 직접 봤다.","While working as a caregiver, she directly saw Yoon Jeong-hu reading papers aloud to the mother and acting cautious, saying they should finish before the older brother arrived.",介護職員として働く中で、ユン・ジョンフが母に紙を読み聞かせ、兄が来る前に終えようと慎重にしていた様子を直接見ました。,她任护理员期间，亲眼看到尹正厚给母亲读纸张，并小心地说要在哥哥来之前结束。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-1_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].name,최복순,Choi Bok-sun,チェ・ボクスン,崔福顺,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-1_.surfaceKnowledge,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].surfaceKnowledge,말년 어머니 곁에서 유서 관련 행동을 직접 목격한 제3자 증인이다.,A third-party witness who directly saw will-related actions beside the mother in her final years.,母の晩年、そばで遺言書関連の行動を直接目撃した第三者証人です。,第三方证人，曾在母亲晚年身边直接目击与遗嘱相关的行为。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
