case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-1_.witnessProfile.occupation,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].witnessProfile.occupation,전 요양보호사,Former Caregiver,元介護職員,前护理员,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-1_.witnessProfile.relationToA,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].witnessProfile.relationToA,모르는 사이다.,They do not know each other.,面識はありません。,彼此不认识。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-1_.witnessProfile.relationToB,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].witnessProfile.relationToB,어머니를 통해 안면이 있다.,She knows him through the mother.,母を通じて顔見知りです。,通过母亲认识。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-1_.witnessProfile.speechStyle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].witnessProfile.speechStyle,조심스럽게 기억을 더듬으며 본 것만 말하려 한다.,She cautiously searches her memory and tries to speak only about what she saw.,慎重に記憶をたどり、見たことだけを話そうとします。,她谨慎回忆，只想说自己亲眼所见。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-2_.knowledgeScope,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].knowledgeScope,"공증 당일 공증인 메모에 어머니 상태와 숫자 혼선, 윤정후가 절차를 서두른 듯한 관찰이 남은 사실을 안다.","He knows that the notary's memo from the day of notarization recorded the mother's condition, confusion over numbers, and an observation that Yoon Jeong-hu seemed to hurry the procedure.",公証当日の公証人メモに、母の状態、数字の混乱、ユン・ジョンフが手続きを急がせたように見えた観察が残っていることを知っています。,他知道公证当天的公证人备忘中记有母亲状态、数字混乱，以及尹正厚似乎催促程序的观察。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
