case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-2_.surfaceKnowledge,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].surfaceKnowledge,공증 당일 메모 기록을 직접 확인한 제3자 증인이다.,A third-party witness who directly checked the memo notes from the day of notarization.,公証当日のメモ記録を直接確認した第三者証人です。,第三方证人，直接确认过公证当天的备忘记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
