case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-2_.witnessProfile.relationToB,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].witnessProfile.relationToB,서류 제출자로만 안다.,He knows him only as the document submitter.,書類提出者としてだけ知っています。,只知道他是文件提交人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-2_.witnessProfile.speechStyle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].witnessProfile.speechStyle,업무적으로 정확하게 말하며 기록에 근거해 답한다.,He speaks with professional precision and answers based on records.,業務上の正確さで話し、記録に基づいて答えます。,他说话职业而准确，并依据记录回答。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.knowledgeScope,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].knowledgeScope,"어머니의 오래된 친구로, 어머니가 생전에 '정후가 매달 돈을 보내준다', '태성이 공장이 어려울 때 정후 돈으로 막았다'고 말한 적 있다.","An old friend of the mother, who once heard her say, “Jeong-hu sends money every month” and “when Tae-seong's factory was in trouble, we covered it with Jeong-hu's money.”",母の古い友人で、母が生前「ジョンフが毎月お金を送ってくれる」「テソンの工場が大変な時、ジョンフのお金でしのいだ」と話したことがあります。,母亲的老朋友，曾听母亲生前说过：“正厚每个月给我寄钱”，“泰成工厂困难时，是用正厚的钱撑过去的。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].name,박순애,Park Sun-ae,パク・スネ,朴顺爱,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.surfaceKnowledge,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].surfaceKnowledge,어머니로부터 두 아들에 대한 속마음을 들은 지인 증인이다.,An acquaintance witness who heard the mother's true feelings about her two sons.,母から二人の息子についての本音を聞いた知人証人です。,熟人证人，曾从母亲那里听到她对两个儿子的真实想法。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.witnessProfile.addressA,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.addressA,태성이,Tae-seong,テソン,泰成,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.witnessProfile.addressB,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.addressB,정후,Jeong-hu,ジョンフ,正厚,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.witnessProfile.addressJudge,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.addressJudge,재판관님,Your Honor,裁判官,法官,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.witnessProfile.occupation,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.occupation,퇴직,Retired,退職,退休,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.witnessProfile.relationToA,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.relationToA,어머니 친구로 태성이를 어릴 때부터 안다.,"As the mother's friend, she has known Tae-seong since he was young.",母の友人として、テソンを幼い頃から知っています。,作为母亲的朋友，她从泰成小时候就认识他。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.witnessProfile.relationToB,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.relationToB,어머니 입을 통해서만 안다.,She knows him only through what the mother said.,母の話を通じてだけ知っています。,只通过母亲的讲述认识他。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_duo.socialGraph_w-3_.witnessProfile.speechStyle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.speechStyle,"어머니 이야기를 하면 감정이 올라오며, 기억을 더듬을 때 과장이 섞일 수 있다.","When she talks about the mother, her emotions rise, and some exaggeration may enter as she searches her memory.",母の話をすると感情が高ぶり、記憶をたどる際に誇張が混じることがあります。,谈到母亲时她会情绪激动，回忆时可能夹杂夸张。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].description,"어머니 사망 두 달 전 작성된 유서 사본. 윤정후 60%, 윤태성 40%로 적혀 있고 공증 도장이 찍혀 있다.","A copy of the will written two months before the mother's death. It gives Yoon Jeong-hu 60% and Yoon Tae-seong 40%, and bears a notary seal.",母の死亡二か月前に作成された遺言書コピー。ユン・ジョンフ60％、ユン・テソン40％と記され、公証印が押されています。,母亲去世前两个月写成的遗嘱副本。写明尹正厚60%、尹泰成40%，并盖有公证印章。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationResults.check_metadata,공증일은 2025.11.05이고 어머니의 말기 요양 시점과 가깝다. 판단 능력과 작성 절차가 함께 쟁점이다.,"The notarization date is 2025.11.05, close to the mother's terminal care period. Capacity and the drafting procedure are both at issue.",公証日は2025.11.05で、母の末期療養時期に近いです。判断能力と作成手続きがともに争点です。,公证日期为2025.11.05，接近母亲晚期疗养时间。判断能力与制作程序同时成为争议点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationResults.request_original,"공증 도장이 있는 유서 사본이다. 상속 비율은 윤정후 60%, 윤태성 40%로 적혀 있다.",This is a copy of the will with a notary seal. The inheritance ratio is listed as Yoon Jeong-hu 60% and Yoon Tae-seong 40%.,公証印のある遺言書コピーです。相続比率はユン・ジョンフ60％、ユン・テソン40％と記されています。,这是带有公证印章的遗嘱副本。继承比例写为尹正厚60%、尹泰成40%。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationResults.restore_context,이 사본만 보면 최종 유서처럼 보인다. 같은 날 전후로 다른 문서가 있었는지 추적해야 한다.,"Taken alone, this copy looks like the final will. Trace whether any other documents existed around the same day.",このコピーだけを見ると最終遺言書のように見えます。同じ日の前後に別の文書があったか追跡する必要があります。,单看这份副本，像是最终遗嘱。需要追查同日前后是否存在其他文件。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[0].label,원본확인,Original Check,原本確認,原件确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[0].question.text,이 유서 사본의 공증 기록을 확인해 주십시오.,Please check the notarization record for this will copy.,この遺言書コピーの公証記録を確認してください。,请确认这份遗嘱副本的公证记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[1].label,시점대조,Timing Cross-Check,時点照合,时间点对照,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[1].question.text,작성일과 어머니 상태를 대조해 주십시오.,Please compare the drafting date with the mother's condition.,作成日と母の状態を照合してください。,请对照制作日期与母亲状态。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,공증 날짜를 확인하면 요양 시점과 작성 절차를 함께 볼 수 있습니다.,Checking the notarization date lets you view the care period and drafting procedure together.,公証日を確認すれば、療養時期と作成手続きを合わせて見ることができます。,确认公证日期后，可以同时查看疗养时间点和制作程序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[2].label,이전본추적,Prior Version Trace,以前の版を追跡,追查前一版本,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[2].question.text,이 유서 이전의 문서가 있었는지 찾아 주십시오.,Please look for any document that existed before this will.,この遺言書以前の文書があったか探してください。,请查找这份遗嘱之前是否存在其他文件。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,시점을 대조하면 이 사본이 왜 최종본처럼 보였는지 따질 수 있습니다.,"By comparing timing, you can examine why this copy appeared to be the final version.",時点を照合すれば、このコピーがなぜ最終版のように見えたのかを検討できます。,对照时间点后，可以判断这份副本为什么看起来像最终版本。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
