case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].name,60:40 유서 사본,60:40 Will Copy,60:40遺言書コピー,60:40遗嘱副本,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.a.implication,윤태성은 장남인 자신이 40%라는 사실을 윤정후의 개입 흔적으로 본다.,"Yoon Tae-seong sees the fact that he, the eldest son, received 40% as a sign of Yoon Jeong-hu's involvement.",ユン・テソンは、長男である自分が40％である事実をユン・ジョンフの関与の痕跡と見ています。,尹泰成认为自己作为长子只得40%，就是尹正厚介入的痕迹。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 유서를 처음 봤을 때 무엇이 가장 억울했는지 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain what felt most unfair when you first saw this will.,この遺言書を初めて見た時、何が最も悔しかったのか説明してください。,请说明您第一次看到这份遗嘱时，最觉得委屈的是什么。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.b.implication,윤정후가 유서 작성 과정에 가까이 있었는지 따져야 한다.,Determine whether Yoon Jeong-hu was close to the will-drafting process.,ユン・ジョンフが遺言書作成過程に近い位置にいたのか検討する必要があります。,需要判断尹正厚是否接近遗嘱制作过程。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.b.questionAngle,이 유서의 비율과 작성 절차를 어떻게 이해하고 있었는지 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain how you understood this will's ratio and drafting procedure.,この遺言書の比率と作成手続きをどのように理解していたのか説明してください。,请说明您如何理解这份遗嘱的比例和制作程序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].surfaceDescription,어머니의 유서 사본이 존재한다.,A copy of the mother's will exists.,母の遺言書コピーが存在します。,存在母亲的遗嘱副本。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.surfaceName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].surfaceName,분배 비율이 적힌 서류 사본,Copy of a Document Listing Distribution Ratios,分配比率が記された書類コピー,写有分配比例的文件副本,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,요양 시점과 공증 절차를 맞춰 보며 의심의 방향을 좁힌다.,Match the care period against the notarization procedure to narrow the direction of suspicion.,療養時期と公証手続きを照らし合わせ、疑いの方向を絞ります。,将疗养时间点与公证程序对照，缩小怀疑方向。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,공증 사본의 효력과 다른 문서 존재 여부를 분리해 판단한다.,Judge the validity of the notarized copy separately from whether another document existed.,公証コピーの効力と別文書の存在有無を切り分けて判断します。,将公证副本的效力与是否存在其他文件分开判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,정해진 비율과 두 상속인 역할이 보인다.,The stated ratio and the roles of the two heirs are visible.,定められた比率と二人の相続人の役割が見えます。,可以看到既定比例和两名继承人的角色。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,"작성일, 공증인, 재산 항목, 문구 전문을 확인한다.","Confirm the drafting date, notary, property items, and full wording.",作成日、公証人、財産項目、文言全文を確認します。,确认制作日期、公证人、财产项目和完整措辞。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,유서 사본의 존재와 공증 도장만 보인다.,Only the existence of the will copy and the notary seal are visible.,遺言書コピーの存在と公証印だけが見えます。,只能看到遗嘱副本存在以及公证印章。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
