case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.3.meta.stageLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.stageLabel,3단계 — 전문과 공증 정보,Stage 3 — Full Text and Notarization Details,3段階 — 全文と公証情報,第3阶段 — 全文与公证信息,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,보통,Medium,普通,普通,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].description,"윤정후가 말년에 유독 자주 드나든 기록과, 공증 3주 전 담당 요양보호사가 바뀐 날짜가 같이 확인된다.","The records confirm that Yoon Jeong-hu visited unusually often in her final years, and that the caregiver in charge changed three weeks before notarization.",ユン・ジョンフが晩年に特に頻繁に出入りした記録と、公証の3週間前に担当介護職員が交代した日付が合わせて確認されます。,记录同时确认尹正厚在晚年异常频繁出入，以及负责护理员在公证前三周更换的日期。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.check_metadata,공증 3주 전 담당 요양보호사 교체와 윤정후의 장시간 방문이 같은 기간에 겹친다. 변화의 이유는 추가 확인이 필요하다.,The caregiver change three weeks before notarization overlaps with Yoon Jeong-hu's long visits. The reason for the change needs further confirmation.,公証3週間前の担当介護職員交代と、ユン・ジョンフの長時間訪問が同じ時期に重なっています。変化の理由は追加確認が必要です。,公证前三周负责护理员更换，与尹正厚长时间探访发生在同一时期。变化原因需进一步确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.request_original,윤정후의 말년 방문 횟수와 체류 시간이 일부 늘어난 기록이다. 돌봄 방문인지 서류 논의인지는 아직 구분되지 않는다.,These records show that Yoon Jeong-hu's number of late-life visits and his stay time increased in part. It is not yet clear whether they were care visits or document discussions.,ユン・ジョンフの晩年の訪問回数と滞在時間が一部増えた記録です。介護訪問なのか書類の話し合いなのかは、まだ区別されていません。,记录显示尹正厚晚年探访次数和停留时间有所增加。尚无法区分是照护探访还是文件讨论。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.restore_context,"방문 증가, 담당자 교체, 공증인 동행이 하나의 흐름으로 맞물린다. 유서 작성 과정에 누가 개입했는지 추궁할 단계다.","The increase in visits, staff change, and notary accompaniment fit into one sequence. It is time to press who was involved in the will-drafting process.",訪問の増加、担当者交代、公証人同行が一つの流れとしてかみ合っています。遺言書作成過程に誰が関与したのか追及する段階です。,探访增加、负责人更换、公证人同行形成同一条线。现在是追问谁介入遗嘱制作过程的阶段。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[0].label,기록확인,Record Check,記録確認,记录确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[0].question.text,말년 방문 기록의 원본을 확인해 주십시오.,Please check the original late-life visit logs.,晩年の訪問記録の原本を確認してください。,请确认晚年探访记录的原件。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[1].label,빈도대조,Frequency Cross-Check,頻度照合,频率对照,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[1].question.text,방문 증가 시점과 공증일을 대조해 주십시오.,Please compare the timing of increased visits with the notarization date.,訪問増加の時点と公証日を照合してください。,请对照探访增加的时间点与公证日期。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,방문 기록을 확인하면 공증 전후의 빈도 변화를 볼 수 있습니다.,Checking the visit logs shows how visit frequency changed before and after notarization.,訪問記録を確認すれば、公証前後の頻度変化を見ることができます。,确认探访记录后，可以看到公证前后的频率变化。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[2].label,개입추궁,Press on Involvement,関与追及,追问介入,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[2].question.text,담당자 교체가 유서 작성에 영향을 줬는지 밝혀 주십시오.,Please determine whether the staff change affected the drafting of the will.,担当者交代が遺言書作成に影響したのか明らかにしてください。,请查明负责人更换是否影响了遗嘱制作。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,빈도와 교체 시점을 맞춰 보면 누가 유서 작성 흐름을 만들었는지 물을 수 있습니다.,"By matching frequency with the timing of the change, you can ask who shaped the flow of will drafting.",頻度と交代時点を照らし合わせると、誰が遺言書作成の流れを作ったのか問うことができます。,将频率与更换时间点对应起来，就可以询问是谁造成了遗嘱制作流程。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.meta.legalLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].meta.legalLabel,적법,Legal,適法,合法,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
