case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.meta.trustLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].meta.trustLabel,높음,High,高い,高,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].name,요양원 방문기록,Care Home Visit Logs,介護施設の訪問記録,疗养院探访记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].partyContext.a.implication,윤태성은 서류 절차 전 잦은 방문을 어머니 압박의 단서로 본다.,Yoon Tae-seong sees the frequent visits before the paperwork procedure as a clue that his mother was pressured.,ユン・テソンは、書類手続き前の頻繁な訪問を母への圧力の手がかりと見ています。,尹泰成把文件程序前频繁探访视为母亲受到施压的线索。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].partyContext.a.questionAngle,동생의 방문이 왜 유서 개입 의심으로 이어졌는지 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why your younger brother's visits led to suspicion of involvement in the will.,弟の訪問がなぜ遺言書への関与疑惑につながったのか説明してください。,请说明弟弟的探访为何会引向对其介入遗嘱的怀疑。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].partyContext.b.implication,윤정후는 돌봄과 유서 논의를 구분해 설명해야 한다.,Yoon Jeong-hu must explain the difference between care and discussions about the will.,ユン・ジョンフは、介護と遺言書の話し合いを区別して説明する必要があります。,尹正厚必须区分照护与遗嘱讨论并作出说明。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].partyContext.b.questionAngle,그 시기에 어머니를 자주 찾아간 이유를 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why you visited your mother often during that period.,その時期に母を頻繁に訪ねた理由を説明してください。,请说明那段时期您频繁探望母亲的理由。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].surfaceDescription,요양원 방문 기록이 존재한다.,Care home visit logs exist.,介護施設の訪問記録が存在します。,存在疗养院探访记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.surfaceName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].surfaceName,요양원 방문기록,Care Home Visit Logs,介護施設の訪問記録,疗养院探访记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,요양보호사 교체와 공증일을 함께 놓고 흐름을 본다.,View the flow by placing the caregiver change and notarization date side by side.,介護職員の交代と公証日を合わせて置き、流れを見ます。,将护理员更换与公证日期并置，观察其流程。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,유서 작성 과정에 윤정후가 가까이 있었던 사실을 판단 자료로 삼는다.,Use the fact that Yoon Jeong-hu was close to the will-drafting process as material for judgment.,遺言書作成過程にユン・ジョンフが近い位置にいた事実を判断資料とします。,将尹正厚接近遗嘱制作过程这一事实作为判断资料。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,윤정후의 방문 빈도가 말년에 늘어난 점이 보인다.,It shows that Yoon Jeong-hu's visit frequency increased in her final years.,ユン・ジョンフの訪問頻度が晩年に増えた点が見えます。,可以看到尹正厚晚年探访频率增加。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,"날짜별 방문자, 시간, 공증 방문 항목을 확인한다.","Confirm visitors by date, times, and notarization-visit entries.",日付別の訪問者、時間、公証訪問項目を確認します。,确认各日期的访客、时间和公证探访项目。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,요양원 방문기록 존재만 보인다.,Only the existence of care home visit logs is visible.,介護施設の訪問記録の存在だけが見えます。,只能看到疗养院探访记录存在。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[authenticated].label,인증됨,Authenticated,認証済み,已认证,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[authenticated].summary,기관 기록과 방문 서명이 일치한다.,Institutional records and visit signatures match.,機関記録と訪問署名が一致しています。,机构记录与探访签名一致。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[challenged].label,이의 제기됨,Challenged,異議あり,已提出异议,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[challenged].summary,윤정후 측은 방문 목적이 돌봄이었다며 의미를 다툰다.,"Yoon Jeong-hu's side disputes the meaning, saying the visits were for care.",ユン・ジョンフ側は、訪問目的は介護だったとして意味を争っています。,尹正厚一方称探访目的是照护，并对其意义提出争议。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_misread_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[misread].label,조작/오독 판정,Manipulation/Misread Determination,操作／誤読判定,操纵/误读判定,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_misread_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[misread].summary,기록은 진짜지만 방문 목적 해석은 다른 증거와 함께 판단한다.,"The records are genuine, but the purpose of the visits should be interpreted together with other evidence.",記録は本物ですが、訪問目的の解釈は他の証拠と合わせて判断します。,记录真实，但探访目的的解释需结合其他证据判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_submitted_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[submitted].label,제출됨,Submitted,提出済み,已提交,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_submitted_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[submitted].summary,요양원에서 방문대장을 제출했다.,The care home submitted the visit register.,介護施設が訪問台帳を提出しました。,疗养院提交了探访登记簿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_verifying_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[verifying].label,검증 중,Verifying,検証中,验证中,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.v3TrustStates_verifying_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].v3TrustStates[verifying].summary,방문자 서명과 요양원 전산 기록을 대조한다.,Compare visitor signatures against the care home's electronic records.,訪問者署名と介護施設の電算記録を照合します。,将访客签名与疗养院电子记录对照。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerData.log.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].viewerData.log.note,"10월 이후 B 방문이 급증했다. 요양보호사 교체(10.14)와 공증(11.05) 사이 장시간 방문이 이어졌고, 윤태성의 방문은 같은 기간 2회에 그쳤다.","After October, B's visits increased sharply. Long visits continued between the caregiver change (10.14) and notarization (11.05), while Yoon Tae-seong visited only twice in the same period.",10月以降、Bの訪問が急増しました。介護職員交代（10.14）と公証（11.05）の間に長時間訪問が続き、同期間のユン・テソンの訪問は2回にとどまりました。,10月以后，B的探访激增。护理员更换（10.14）至公证（11.05）之间持续出现长时间探访，而尹泰成同期仅探访2次。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
