case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.1.log.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.1.log.note,차남의 방문 시간이 10월 초부터 길어진다. 돌봄 때문인지 서류 논의 때문인지는 이 단계만으로 단정하기 어렵다.,"The second son's visit times lengthen from early October. At this stage alone, it is hard to say whether this was for care or document discussions.",次男の訪問時間は10月初旬から長くなります。介護のためか書類の話し合いのためかは、この段階だけでは断定しにくいです。,次子的探访时间从10月初开始变长。仅凭这一阶段，难以断定是为了照护还是讨论文件。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
