case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.log.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.log.note,"공증 전 3주 동안 방문 빈도, 담당자 교체, 공증인 동행 항목이 같은 기간에 모인다. 아직 방문 목적 자체는 확정되지 않는다.","In the three weeks before notarization, visit frequency, staff change, and notary-accompaniment entries cluster in the same period. The purpose of the visits themselves is not yet established.",公証前の3週間、訪問頻度、担当者交代、公証人同行の項目が同じ時期に集まっています。訪問目的そのものはまだ確定していません。,公证前三周，探访频率、负责人更换、公证人同行项目集中在同一时期。探访目的本身尚未确定。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
