case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].name,전 요양보호사 음성증언,Former Caregiver Audio Testimony,元介護職員の音声証言,前护理员语音证言,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.a.implication,윤태성은 '형님 오기 전'이라는 말을 배제 의도로 받아들인다.,Yoon Tae-seong takes “before the older brother arrives” as an intent to exclude him.,ユン・テソンは「兄上が来る前」という言葉を、排除の意図として受け取っています。,尹泰成把“哥哥来之前”理解为排除自己的意图。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 증언이 동생의 어떤 의도를 보여준다고 보십니까?,What intent of your younger brother do you think this testimony shows?,この証言は弟のどのような意図を示していると思いますか。,您认为这份证言显示了弟弟的什么意图？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.b.implication,윤정후는 압박과 설명의 차이를 밝혀야 한다.,Yoon Jeong-hu must clarify the difference between pressure and explanation.,ユン・ジョンフは、圧力と説明の違いを明らかにする必要があります。,尹正厚必须说明施压与解释之间的区别。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.b.questionAngle,어머니에게 종이를 읽어드린 이유와 그 자리의 분위기를 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why you read the paper aloud to your mother and what the atmosphere was like.,母に紙を読み聞かせた理由と、その場の雰囲気を説明してください。,请说明您给母亲读纸张的理由以及当时的气氛。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].surfaceDescription,전 요양보호사의 증언이 존재한다.,Testimony from the former caregiver exists.,元介護職員の証言が存在します。,存在前护理员的证言。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.surfaceName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].surfaceName,전 요양보호사 음성증언,Former Caregiver Audio Testimony,元介護職員の音声証言,前护理员语音证言,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,방문기록과 공증일을 대조해 발언 맥락을 복원한다.,Compare the visit logs with the notarization date to reconstruct the context of the statement.,訪問記録と公証日を照合し、発言の文脈を復元します。,对照探访记录与公证日期，复原发言语境。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,목격 사실은 인정하고 의도는 다른 증거와 함께 판단한다.,"Acknowledge the witnessed fact, and judge intent together with other evidence.",目撃事実は認め、意図は他の証拠と合わせて判断します。,承认目击事实，意图则结合其他证据判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,종이를 읽어드렸다는 핵심 문장만 보인다.,Only the key statement that he read the paper aloud is visible.,紙を読み聞かせたという核心文だけが見えます。,只能看到“读纸张给她听”这一核心句子。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,"증언자 신원, 근무 기간, 전체 진술을 확인한다.","Confirm the witness's identity, work period, and full statement.",証言者の身元、勤務期間、全体陳述を確認します。,确认证人身份、工作期间和完整陈述。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,증언 녹취가 있다는 사실만 보인다.,Only the existence of a testimony recording is visible.,証言録音がある事実だけが見えます。,只能看到存在证言录音这一事实。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
