case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].v3TrustStates[challenged].summary,윤태성과 윤정후가 '조심스러움'의 의미를 다르게 해석한다.,Yoon Tae-seong and Yoon Jeong-hu interpret the meaning of “caution” differently.,ユン・テソンとユン・ジョンフは「慎重さ」の意味を異なって解釈しています。,尹泰成和尹正厚对“小心谨慎”的含义有不同解释。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
