case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.testimony.biasLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.testimony.biasLabel,중립,Neutral,中立,中立,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.testimony.confidenceLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.testimony.confidenceLabel,보통,Medium,普通,普通,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.testimony.quote,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.testimony.quote,"정후 씨가 어머님한테 종이를 자주 읽어드렸어요. 내용은 또렷이 못 들었지만, 형님 오기 전에는 끝내자고 조심스러워하셨어요. 어머님이 힘들어하시면 그만하자고 했고, 어머님이 먼저 물으시면 그때 더 설명했어요. 그런데 저는 10월에 갑자기 교체됐습니다. 이유는 듣지 못했습니다.","Mr. Jeong-hu often read papers aloud to his mother. I couldn't clearly hear the contents, but he was careful and said they should finish before his older brother came. When his mother looked tired, he said they should stop; when she asked first, he explained more. But I was suddenly replaced in October. I was never told why.",ジョンフさんは母君に紙をよく読み聞かせていました。内容ははっきり聞こえませんでしたが、兄上が来る前には終えようと慎重にしていました。母君がつらそうにするとやめようと言い、母君が先に尋ねるとその時はさらに説明していました。ですが私は10月に突然交代になりました。理由は聞いていません。,正厚先生经常给母亲读纸张。内容我没听清，但他很小心，说要在哥哥来之前结束。母亲觉得累时，他就说先停下；如果母亲先问，他就再解释。可是我在10月突然被换掉了，没听说原因。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
