case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.testimony.quote,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.testimony.quote,정후 씨가 어머님한테 종이를 자주 읽어드렸어요. 형님 오기 전에는 끝내자고 조심스러워하셨습니다.,Mr. Jeong-hu often read papers aloud to his mother. He was careful and said they should finish before his older brother came.,ジョンフさんは母君に紙をよく読み聞かせていました。兄上が来る前には終えようと慎重にしていました。,正厚先生经常给母亲读纸张。他很小心，说要在哥哥来之前结束。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
