case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.confidenceLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.confidenceLabel,보통,Medium,普通,普通,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.quote,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.quote,"정후 씨가 어머님한테 종이를 자주 읽어드렸어요. 내용은 또렷이 못 들었지만, 형님 오기 전에는 끝내자고 조심스러워하셨어요. 어머님이 힘들어하시면 그만하자고 했고, 어머님이 먼저 물으시면 그때 더 설명했어요. 그런데 저는 10월에 갑자기 교체됐습니다. 이유는 듣지 못했습니다.","Mr. Jeong-hu often read papers aloud to his mother. I couldn't clearly hear the contents, but he was careful and said they should finish before his older brother came. When his mother looked tired, he said they should stop; when she asked first, he explained more. But I was suddenly replaced in October. I was never told why.",ジョンフさんは母君に紙をよく読み聞かせていました。内容ははっきり聞こえませんでしたが、兄上が来る前には終えようと慎重にしていました。母君がつらそうにするとやめようと言い、母君が先に尋ねるとその時はさらに説明していました。ですが私は10月に突然交代になりました。理由は聞いていません。,正厚先生经常给母亲读纸张。内容我没听清，但他很小心，说要在哥哥来之前结束。母亲觉得累时，他就说先停下；如果母亲先问，他就再解释。可是我在10月突然被换掉了，没听说原因。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.relatedRef,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.relatedRef,요양보호사 교체 2025.10.14 / 공증 2025.11.05,Caregiver change 2025.10.14 / Notarization 2025.11.05,介護職員交代 2025.10.14／公証 2025.11.05,护理员更换 2025.10.14 / 公证 2025.11.05,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.witnessDesc,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.witnessDesc,전 담당 요양보호사 (2024.03~2025.10.14 근무),Former caregiver in charge (worked 2024.03–2025.10.14),元担当介護職員（2024.03〜2025.10.14勤務）,前负责护理员（2024.03–2025.10.14任职）,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.witnessName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.testimony.witnessName,최복순,Choi Bok-sun,チェ・ボクスン,崔福顺,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].description,"공증 당일 공증인이 남긴 진행 메모. 접수 비율과 일반 절차가 먼저 확인되고, 추가 조사로 상태와 진행 방식이 드러난다.",Procedure notes left by the notary on the day of notarization. The submitted ratio and standard procedure are confirmed first; further investigation reveals the condition and method of proceeding.,公証当日に公証人が残した進行メモ。受付比率と一般手続きが先に確認され、追加調査で状態と進行方式が明らかになります。,公证当天公证人留下的流程备忘。先确认受理比例和一般程序，再通过追加调查揭示状态与推进方式。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationResults.check_metadata,"공증인은 어머니가 피로하고 답변이 느렸으며, 숫자 확인 때 한 차례 쉬어 갔다고 남겼다.","The notary recorded that the mother was tired, slow to answer, and took a break once during the number check.",公証人は、母が疲れており、回答が遅く、数字確認の際に一度休んだと記録しました。,公证人记录称，母亲疲惫、回答较慢，并在确认数字时休息过一次。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationResults.request_original,"공증 당일 유언장 공증 절차가 진행됐고, 접수된 공증본은 60:40으로 정리되어 있다.","The will notarization procedure was carried out that day, and the submitted notarized copy is organized as 60:40.",公証当日に遺言書公証手続きが進行し、受付された公証本は60:40で整理されています。,公证当天进行了遗嘱公证程序，受理的公证本整理为60:40。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationResults.restore_context,"메모에는 어머니가 숫자를 몇 번 오락가락했고, 윤정후가 절차를 밀어붙이는 듯했다는 관찰이 붙어 있다.","The memo notes that the mother wavered over the numbers several times, and adds the observation that Yoon Jeong-hu seemed to push the procedure forward.",メモには、母が数字を何度か行き来し、ユン・ジョンフが手続きを押し進めるように見えたという観察が添えられています。,备忘中记载母亲几次在数字上反复，并附有“尹正厚似乎在推动程序”的观察。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[0].label,일반 기록,General Record,一般記録,一般记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[0].question.text,공증 당일 일반 기록을 확인해 주십시오.,Please check the general records from the day of notarization.,公証当日の一般記録を確認してください。,请确认公证当天的一般记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[1].label,상태 메모,Condition Memo,状態メモ,状态备忘,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[1].question.text,어머니 상태가 좋지 않았다는 메모를 확인해 주십시오.,Please check the memo stating that the mother's condition was poor.,母の状態が良くなかったというメモを確認してください。,请确认关于母亲状态不佳的备忘。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,공증 당일 어머니 상태와 답변 속도를 볼 수 있습니다.,You can view the mother's condition and response speed on the day of notarization.,公証当日の母の状態と回答速度を見ることができます。,可以查看公证当天母亲的状态和回答速度。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[2].label,절차 압박,Procedural Pressure,手続き圧迫,程序压力,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[2].question.text,숫자 혼선과 절차를 밀어붙인 정황을 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm the confusion over numbers and the signs that the procedure was pushed forward.,数字の混乱と手続きを押し進めた状況を確認してください。,请确认数字混乱和推动程序的迹象。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,공증인 메모로 절차 진행 방식의 문제를 물을 수 있습니다.,The notary's memo lets you question problems in how the procedure was conducted.,公証人メモから、手続き進行方式の問題を問うことができます。,可以通过公证人备忘询问程序推进方式的问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
