case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].name,공증인 메모 기록,Notary's Memo Notes,公証人のメモ記録,公证人备忘记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.a.implication,윤태성의 절차 문제 제기는 공증 당일 상태 기록으로 보강된다.,Yoon Tae-seong's procedural challenge is supported by condition records from the day of notarization.,ユン・テソンの手続き上の問題提起は、公証当日の状態記録で補強されます。,尹泰成提出的程序问题，由公证当天的状态记录得到补强。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.a.questionAngle,공증인 메모에서 공증 당일 절차와 진행 순서를 확인해야 합니다.,The notary's memo should be used to confirm the procedure and order of events on the day of notarization.,公証人メモで、公証当日の手続きと進行順序を確認する必要があります。,需要从公证人备忘中确认公证当天的程序和推进顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.b.implication,윤정후는 공증본 60:40과 절차 개입 책임을 분리해 답해야 한다.,Yoon Jeong-hu must answer separately about the 60:40 notarized copy and responsibility for procedural involvement.,ユン・ジョンフは、60:40の公証本と手続き関与の責任を切り分けて答える必要があります。,尹正厚必须分别回答60:40公证本与程序介入责任。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.b.questionAngle,공증 당일 절차를 왜 서둘렀는지 설명해야 합니다.,He must explain why the procedure was hurried on the day of notarization.,公証当日の手続きをなぜ急いだのか説明する必要があります。,必须说明为何在公证当天催促程序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].surfaceDescription,공증 당일 절차 메모가 존재한다.,Procedure notes from the day of notarization exist.,公証当日の手続きメモが存在します。,存在公证当天的程序备忘。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.surfaceName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].surfaceName,공증인 메모 기록,Notary's Memo Notes,公証人のメモ記録,公证人备忘记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,숫자 혼선과 윤정후의 절차 압박 정황을 맞춰 본다.,Compare the confusion over numbers with signs of procedural pressure from Yoon Jeong-hu.,数字の混乱とユン・ジョンフの手続き圧迫の状況を照らし合わせます。,对照数字混乱与尹正厚施加程序压力的迹象。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,공증 당일 상태와 절차 문제를 판단 자료로 정리한다.,Organize the mother's condition that day and the procedural issues as material for judgment.,公証当日の状態と手続き問題を判断資料として整理します。,将公证当天状态与程序问题整理为判断资料。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,접수 비율과 일반 절차 기록이 보인다.,The submitted ratio and general procedure records are visible.,受付比率と一般手続き記録が見えます。,可以看到受理比例和一般程序记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,어머니 상태가 좋지 않았다는 공증인 메모를 확인한다.,Confirm the notary's memo stating that the mother's condition was poor.,母の状態が良くなかったという公証人メモを確認します。,确认关于母亲状态不佳的公证人备忘。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,공증 당일 메모의 존재만 보인다.,Only the existence of the memo from the day of notarization is visible.,公証当日のメモの存在だけが見えます。,只能看到公证当天备忘存在。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3TrustStates[authenticated].label,인증됨,Authenticated,認証済み,已认证,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3TrustStates[authenticated].summary,기관 보관 메모와 접수 대장이 일치한다.,The institution-held memo matches the intake register.,機関保管メモと受付台帳が一致しています。,机构保存的备忘与受理台账一致。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3TrustStates[challenged].label,이의 제기됨,Challenged,異議あり,已提出异议,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3TrustStates[challenged].summary,윤정후 측은 메모가 강요를 곧장 뜻하지는 않는다고 다툰다.,Yoon Jeong-hu's side disputes that the memo does not directly mean coercion.,ユン・ジョンフ側は、メモが直ちに強要を意味するわけではないと争っています。,尹正厚一方主张备忘并不直接意味着强迫。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3TrustStates_misread_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3TrustStates[misread].label,조작/오독 판정,Manipulation/Misread Determination,操作／誤読判定,操纵/误读判定,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3TrustStates_misread_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3TrustStates[misread].summary,메모는 절차 문제를 보여 주지만 별도 자필 연습본의 비율과 구분해야 한다.,"The memo shows procedural problems, but it must be separated from the ratio in the separate handwritten draft.",メモは手続き上の問題を示しますが、別の自筆下書きの比率とは区別する必要があります。,备忘显示程序问题，但必须与另行亲笔草稿中的比例区分开来。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3TrustStates_submitted_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3TrustStates[submitted].label,제출됨,Submitted,提出済み,已提交,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.v3TrustStates_submitted_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].v3TrustStates[submitted].summary,공증인 메모 기록이 제출됐다.,The notary's memo notes were submitted.,公証人のメモ記録が提出されました。,已提交公证人备忘记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
