case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.meta.stageLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.stageLabel,3단계 — 숫자 혼선과 절차 압박,Stage 3 — Number Confusion and Procedural Pressure,3段階 — 数字の混乱と手続き圧迫,第3阶段 — 数字混乱与程序压力,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,높음,High,高い,高,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].description,"어머니 서랍에서 나온 흰 봉투 속 자필 유언장 연습본. 공증본과 별도로 작성된 연습본이며, 구체 비율은 최종 단계에서 확인된다.","A handwritten will draft in a white envelope found in the mother's drawer. It was written separately from the notarized copy, and the exact ratio is confirmed at the final stage.",母の引き出しから出た白い封筒の中の自筆遺言書下書き。公証本とは別に作成された下書きで、具体的な比率は最終段階で確認されます。,在母亲抽屉中发现的白色信封里的亲笔遗嘱草稿。它是与公证本分开写成的草稿，具体比例在最终阶段确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.check_metadata,여러 번 고쳐 쓴 흔적과 공증 전 작성일이 확인된다. 공증본 60:40과 별도의 초안임이 드러난다.,Multiple revisions and a pre-notarization drafting date are confirmed. It becomes clear that this is a draft separate from the 60:40 notarized copy.,何度も書き直した痕跡と、公証前の作成日が確認されます。60:40の公証本とは別の草案であることが明らかになります。,可确认多次修改痕迹和公证前制作日期。由此可知它是与60:40公证本分开的草稿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.request_original,서랍에서 발견된 자필 유언장 연습본이다. 재산 항목과 두 아들 이름이 보이지만 비율 숫자는 일부 가려져 있다.,"This is a handwritten will draft found in a drawer. Asset items and the names of the two sons are visible, but some ratio numbers are obscured.",引き出しから見つかった自筆遺言書下書きです。財産項目と二人の息子の名前は見えますが、比率の数字は一部隠されています。,这是在抽屉中发现的亲笔遗嘱草稿。可以看到财产项目和两个儿子的名字，但比例数字有部分被遮住。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.restore_context,"연습본 마지막 장에는 윤정후 90%, 윤태성 10%라고 적혀 있다. 이 비율 정보는 공증인 메모가 아니라 이 자필 연습본에서만 확인된다.","The last page of the draft says Yoon Jeong-hu 90% and Yoon Tae-seong 10%. This ratio is confirmed only in this handwritten draft, not in the notary's memo.",下書きの最後のページには、ユン・ジョンフ90％、ユン・テソン10％と記されています。この比率情報は公証人メモではなく、この自筆下書きでのみ確認されます。,草稿最后一页写着尹正厚90%、尹泰成10%。该比例信息不是在公证人备忘中，而只能在这份亲笔草稿中确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[0].label,자필 확인,Handwriting Check,自筆確認,亲笔确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[0].question.text,자필 유언장 연습본의 존재를 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm the existence of the handwritten will draft.,自筆遺言書下書きの存在を確認してください。,请确认亲笔遗嘱草稿的存在。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].label,초안 대조,Draft Comparison,草案照合,草稿对照,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].question.text,공증본과 별도 초안인지 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm whether it is a draft separate from the notarized copy.,公証本とは別の草案か確認してください。,请确认它是否为与公证本分开的草稿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,자필과 작성 시점을 확인하면 공증본과 별도 문서임을 볼 수 있습니다.,Checking the handwriting and drafting time shows that it is separate from the notarized copy.,自筆と作成時点を確認すれば、公証本とは別文書であることが分かります。,确认笔迹和制作时间点后，可以看出它是与公证本分开的文件。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].label,비율 확인,Ratio Check,比率確認,比例确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].question.text,연습본 마지막 장의 비율을 확인해 주십시오.,Please check the ratio on the last page of the draft.,下書き最後のページの比率を確認してください。,请确认草稿最后一页的比例。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,구체 비율은 이 자필 연습본 최종 단계에서만 열립니다.,The exact ratio opens only at the final stage of this handwritten draft.,具体的な比率は、この自筆下書きの最終段階でのみ開きます。,具体比例只会在这份亲笔草稿的最终阶段解锁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
