case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].name,어머니 자필 유언장 연습본,Mother's Handwritten Will Draft,母の自筆遺言書下書き,母亲亲笔遗嘱草稿,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.a.implication,윤태성의 조작 주장은 비율 방향과 문서 성격을 분리해 다시 보게 된다.,Yoon Tae-seong's manipulation claim must be revisited by separating the direction of the ratio from the nature of the document.,ユン・テソンの操作主張は、比率の方向と文書の性格を切り分けて見直すことになります。,尹泰成的操纵主张需要将比例方向与文件性质分开重新审视。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.a.questionAngle,공증본과 다른 자필 연습본이 무엇을 뜻하는지 확인해야 합니다.,You need to confirm what a handwritten draft different from the notarized copy means.,公証本と異なる自筆下書きが何を意味するのか確認する必要があります。,需要确认与公证本不同的亲笔草稿意味着什么。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.b.implication,윤정후는 유언장에 손댄 책임과 더 받으려 한 조작이 아니었다는 점을 함께 설명해야 한다.,Yoon Jeong-hu must explain both his responsibility for altering the will and the fact that it was not manipulation to receive more.,ユン・ジョンフは、遺言書に手を加えた責任と、より多く受け取るための操作ではなかった点を合わせて説明する必要があります。,尹正厚必须同时说明自己改动遗嘱的责任，以及那并不是为了多拿份额的操纵。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.b.questionAngle,공증본과 다른 연습본을 왜 알고도 말하지 않았는지 설명해야 합니다.,He must explain why he knew about the draft that differed from the notarized copy but did not say so.,公証本と異なる下書きを知りながら、なぜ話さなかったのか説明する必要があります。,必须说明为何明知有与公证本不同的草稿，却没有说出来。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].surfaceDescription,어머니가 남긴 자필 유언장 연습본이 존재한다.,A handwritten will draft left by the mother exists.,母が残した自筆遺言書下書きが存在します。,存在母亲留下的亲笔遗嘱草稿。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.surfaceName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].surfaceName,어머니 자필 유언장 연습본,Mother's Handwritten Will Draft,母の自筆遺言書下書き,母亲亲笔遗嘱草稿,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,연습본의 비율과 공증본 60:40을 비교한다.,Compare the draft's ratio with the 60:40 notarized copy.,下書きの比率と公証本60:40を比較します。,比较草稿比例与60:40公证本。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,90:10 정보가 자필 연습본에서만 확인됨을 정리한다.,Establish that the 90:10 information is confirmed only in the handwritten draft.,90:10の情報が自筆下書きでのみ確認されることを整理します。,整理出90:10信息只能在亲笔草稿中确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,공증본과 별도 문서라는 점이 보인다.,It shows that this is a document separate from the notarized copy.,公証本とは別文書である点が見えます。,可以看出它是与公证本分开的文件。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,"작성일, 자필, 보관 상태, 전문을 확인한다.","Confirm the drafting date, handwriting, storage condition, and full text.",作成日、自筆、保管状態、全文を確認します。,确认制作日期、笔迹、保管状态和全文。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,자필 유언장 연습본 존재만 보인다.,Only the existence of the handwritten will draft is visible.,自筆遺言書下書きの存在だけが見えます。,只能看到亲笔遗嘱草稿存在。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[authenticated].label,인증됨,Authenticated,認証済み,已认证,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[authenticated].summary,어머니 필적과 보관 경위가 확인됐다.,The mother's handwriting and storage history have been confirmed.,母の筆跡と保管経緯が確認されました。,已确认母亲笔迹和保管经过。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[challenged].label,이의 제기됨,Challenged,異議あり,已提出异议,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[challenged].summary,윤태성 측은 말기 판단 능력과 문서 효력을 다툰다.,Yoon Tae-seong's side disputes late-stage capacity and the document's legal effect.,ユン・テソン側は、末期の判断能力と文書効力を争っています。,尹泰成一方对晚期判断能力和文件效力提出争议。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_misread_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[misread].label,조작/오독 판정,Manipulation/Misread Determination,操作／誤読判定,操纵/误读判定,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-5_.v3TrustStates_misread_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-5].v3TrustStates[misread].summary,자필은 인정되지만 법적 효력은 판단 능력과 함께 본다.,"The handwriting is accepted, but legal effect must be considered together with capacity.",自筆は認められますが、法的効力は判断能力と合わせて見ます。,亲笔可被承认，但法律效力需与判断能力一并考量。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
