case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].description,어머니 통장을 거친 반복 입금과 큰돈 이동 기록. 단계별로 출처와 전달 순서가 분리되어 열린다.,Records of repeated deposits and a large transfer through the mother's account. The source and transfer order open separately by stage.,母の口座を経由した反復入金と大金移動の記録。段階ごとに出どころと受け渡し順序が切り分けて開きます。,经由母亲账户的重复入账和大额资金移动记录。来源与传递顺序会按阶段分开解锁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.check_metadata,어머니 통장에서 윤태성 또는 공장 쪽으로 3억원이 입금된 기록이 확인된다.,Records confirm that ₩300M was deposited from the mother's account to Yoon Tae-seong or the factory side.,母の口座からユン・テソンまたは工場側へ3億ウォンが入金された記録が確認されます。,记录确认有3亿韩元从母亲账户汇入尹泰成或工厂一方。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.request_original,윤정후가 어머니 통장으로 월 단위 입금을 이어 온 흐름이 보인다.,It shows a pattern of Yoon Jeong-hu making monthly deposits into the mother's account.,ユン・ジョンフが母の口座へ月単位の入金を続けてきた流れが見えます。,可以看到尹正厚持续每月向母亲账户入款的流向。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.restore_context,"윤정후가 어머니 통장에 3억원 목돈을 넣었고, 이후 어머니 통장에서 윤태성 쪽으로 같은 규모의 돈이 전달됐다.","Yoon Jeong-hu deposited a lump sum of ₩300M into the mother's account, and later the same amount was passed from that account to Yoon Tae-seong's side.",ユン・ジョンフが母の口座に3億ウォンのまとまった金を入れ、その後、母の口座からユン・テソン側へ同規模の金が渡されました。,尹正厚向母亲账户存入3亿韩元大额款项，之后同等规模的钱从母亲账户转交给尹泰成一方。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[0].label,월 입금,Monthly Deposits,月次入金,每月入款,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[0].question.text,월 단위 입금 흐름을 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm the monthly deposit flow.,月単位の入金の流れを確認してください。,请确认每月入款流向。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].label,3억원 전달,₩300M Transfer,3億ウォン受け渡し,3亿韩元转交,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].question.text,어머니 통장에서 윤태성 쪽으로 간 3억원을 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm the ₩300M that went from the mother's account to Yoon Tae-seong's side.,母の口座からユン・テソン側へ渡った3億ウォンを確認してください。,请确认从母亲账户转至尹泰成一方的3亿韩元。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,어머니 통장에서 공장 쪽으로 간 큰돈을 볼 수 있습니다.,You can view the large sum that went from the mother's account to the factory side.,母の口座から工場側へ渡った大金を見ることができます。,可以看到从母亲账户流向工厂一方的大笔资金。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].label,출처 확인,Source Check,出どころ確認,来源确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].question.text,3억원 목돈의 출처와 전달 순서를 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm the source and transfer order of the ₩300M lump sum.,3億ウォンのまとまった金の出どころと受け渡し順序を確認してください。,请确认3亿韩元大额款项的来源和传递顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,윤정후의 목돈 입금 뒤 어머니 통장을 거쳐 전달된 순서를 확인할 수 있습니다.,You can confirm the order in which Yoon Jeong-hu's lump-sum deposit was later passed through the mother's account.,ユン・ジョンフのまとまった入金後、母の口座を経由して渡された順序を確認できます。,可以确认尹正厚存入大额款项后，经由母亲账户转交的顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
