case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].name,오래된 계좌 흐름,Old Account Trail,古い口座の流れ,旧账户流水,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].partyContext.a.implication,윤태성은 지원의 출처와 자존심 문제를 분리해 받아들여야 한다.,Yoon Tae-seong must accept the source of the support separately from his pride.,ユン・テソンは、支援の出どころと自尊心の問題を切り分けて受け止める必要があります。,尹泰成必须将支援来源与自尊心问题分开接受。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].partyContext.a.questionAngle,어머니가 준 줄 알았던 돈의 출처를 다시 확인해야 합니다.,You need to recheck the source of the money you thought your mother had given.,母がくれたと思っていた金の出どころを改めて確認する必要があります。,需要重新确认您以为是母亲给的钱，其来源究竟是什么。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].partyContext.b.implication,윤정후는 지원 사실과 은폐 이유를 함께 설명해야 한다.,Yoon Jeong-hu must explain both the support itself and the reason it was concealed.,ユン・ジョンフは、支援の事実と隠した理由を合わせて説明する必要があります。,尹正厚必须同时说明支援事实和隐瞒理由。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].partyContext.b.questionAngle,왜 어머니 통장을 거쳐 지원했는지 설명해야 합니다.,He must explain why he provided support through the mother's account.,なぜ母の口座を経由して支援したのか説明する必要があります。,必须说明为何要经由母亲账户提供支援。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].surfaceDescription,오래된 계좌 흐름 기록이 존재한다.,Records of the old account trail exist.,古い口座の流れの記録が存在します。,存在旧账户流水记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.surfaceName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].surfaceName,오래된 계좌 흐름,Old Account Trail,古い口座の流れ,旧账户流水,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,윤정후의 3억원 목돈 입금과 이후 전달 순서를 맞춰 본다.,Match Yoon Jeong-hu's ₩300M lump-sum deposit with the later transfer order.,ユン・ジョンフの3億ウォンのまとまった入金と、その後の受け渡し順序を照らし合わせます。,对照尹正厚3亿韩元大额入款与之后的传递顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,어머니 돈처럼 보였던 지원의 실제 출처를 판단한다.,Judge the actual source of support that appeared to be the mother's money.,母の金のように見えた支援の実際の出どころを判断します。,判断看似母亲出的钱，实际来源为何。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,윤정후가 어머니 통장으로 월 단위 입금한 패턴이 보인다.,It shows the pattern of Yoon Jeong-hu making monthly deposits into the mother's account.,ユン・ジョンフが母の口座へ月単位で入金したパターンが見えます。,可以看到尹正厚每月向母亲账户入款的模式。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,어머니 통장에서 윤태성/공장 쪽으로 3억원이 간 기록을 확인한다.,Confirm records of ₩300M going from the mother's account to Yoon Tae-seong/the factory side.,母の口座からユン・テソン／工場側へ3億ウォンが渡った記録を確認します。,确认3亿韩元从母亲账户流向尹泰成/工厂一方的记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,계좌 흐름 존재만 보인다.,Only the existence of the account trail is visible.,口座の流れの存在だけが見えます。,只能看到存在账户流水。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3TrustStates[authenticated].label,인증됨,Authenticated,認証済み,已认证,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3TrustStates_authenticated_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3TrustStates[authenticated].summary,은행 원장과 제출 내역이 일치한다.,The bank ledger matches the submitted transaction details.,銀行元帳と提出内訳が一致しています。,银行总账与提交明细一致。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3TrustStates[challenged].label,이의 제기됨,Challenged,異議あり,已提出异议,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3TrustStates[challenged].summary,윤태성 측은 정기 지원금과 공장 자금의 성격을 다툰다.,Yoon Tae-seong's side disputes the nature of the regular support and factory funds.,ユン・テソン側は、定期支援金と工場資金の性格を争っています。,尹泰成一方对定期支援金和工厂资金的性质提出争议。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
