case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-6_.v3TrustStates_misread_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-6].v3TrustStates[misread].summary,거래 자체는 확정되고 돈의 의미는 심문으로 정리한다.,The transaction itself is established; the meaning of the money is clarified through questioning.,取引自体は確定し、金の意味は尋問で整理します。,交易本身已确定，钱的意义通过询问整理。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
