case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].description,흰색/아이보리 공책에 남은 어머니 자필 기록. 두 아들을 걱정하는 말에서 시작해 오래된 가족 사정과 윤정후에게 남긴 미안함으로 이어진다.,Handwritten notes left by the mother in a white/ivory notebook. They begin with concern for her two sons and lead into old family circumstances and an apology left for Yoon Jeong-hu.,白／アイボリーのノートに残された母の自筆記録。二人の息子を心配する言葉から始まり、古い家族事情とユン・ジョンフに残した申し訳なさへと続きます。,母亲留在白色/象牙色笔记本中的亲笔记录。从担心两个儿子的话开始，延伸到旧日家庭情况以及留给尹正厚的歉意。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.check_metadata,"윤정후를 걱정하는 문장과, 두 형제가 모든 면에서 같지는 않다는 암시가 보인다.",It contains a sentence worrying about Yoon Jeong-hu and a hint that the two brothers are not the same in every respect.,ユン・ジョンフを心配する文と、兄弟二人があらゆる面で同じではないという暗示が見えます。,可以看到担心尹正厚的句子，以及暗示两兄弟并非在所有方面都相同的内容。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.request_original,흰색/아이보리 공책에 남은 자필 일기다. 두 아들 걱정과 윤태성이 아직 정신을 못 차린다는 한탄이 보인다.,A handwritten diary left in a white/ivory notebook. It shows concern for her two sons and a lament that Yoon Tae-seong still has not come to his senses.,白／アイボリーのノートに残された自筆日記です。二人の息子への心配と、ユン・テソンがまだ目を覚まさないという嘆きが見えます。,这是留在白色/象牙色笔记本中的亲笔日记。可以看到对两个儿子的担心，以及感叹尹泰成仍不清醒的话。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.restore_context,"윤정후에게 미안하다는 문장, 윤정후가 배다른 자식이라는 확정 문장, 그래도 똑같은 자식이었고 오히려 더 아꼈다는 뉘앙스가 함께 남아 있다.","It includes a sentence apologizing to Yoon Jeong-hu, a definitive statement that Yoon Jeong-hu is a half-sibling, and a nuance that he was still an equal child and perhaps loved even more.",ユン・ジョンフに申し訳ないという文、ユン・ジョンフが腹違いの子であるという確定文、それでも同じ子であり、むしろより大切にしていたというニュアンスが共に残っています。,其中同时留下了对尹正厚感到抱歉的句子、尹正厚是同母异父孩子的明确句子，以及即便如此他仍是同样的孩子、甚至更被疼爱的语气。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[0].label,자필 확인,Handwriting Check,自筆確認,亲笔确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[0].question.text,어머니 일기장의 자필과 첫 기록을 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm the handwriting and first entry in the mother's diary.,母の日記の自筆と最初の記録を確認してください。,请确认母亲日记的笔迹和第一条记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].label,암시 확인,Hint Check,暗示確認,暗示确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].question.text,윤정후 걱정과 가족 사정 암시를 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm the concern for Yoon Jeong-hu and the hint about family circumstances.,ユン・ジョンフへの心配と家族事情の暗示を確認してください。,请确认对尹正厚的担心以及关于家庭情况的暗示。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,자필을 확인하면 두 형제에 대한 어머니의 다른 걱정이 보입니다.,Checking the handwriting reveals the mother's different worries about the two brothers.,自筆を確認すれば、兄弟二人に対する母の異なる心配が見えます。,确认笔迹后，可以看到母亲对两兄弟不同的担心。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].label,핵심 문장,Key Sentence,核心文,核心句子,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].question.text,가족 사정 확정 기록과 어머니의 뉘앙스를 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm the definitive record of the family circumstances and the mother's nuance.,家族事情の確定記録と母のニュアンスを確認してください。,请确认家庭情况的明确记录以及母亲的语气。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,일기장 마지막 단계에서 가족 사정과 어머니의 마음이 함께 열립니다.,"At the diary's final stage, the family circumstances and the mother's feelings open together.",日記の最後の段階で、家族事情と母の思いが共に開きます。,日记的最后阶段会同时解锁家庭情况和母亲的心意。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
