case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].partyContext.a.implication,윤태성의 장남 정체성과 어머니에 대한 기억이 흔들린다.,Yoon Tae-seong's eldest-son identity and his memories of his mother are shaken.,ユン・テソンの長男としての自己認識と母への記憶が揺らぎます。,尹泰成的长子身份认同和对母亲的记忆受到动摇。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].partyContext.a.questionAngle,어머니가 자신을 어떻게 기록했는지 어디까지 받아들일 수 있는지 답해야 합니다.,He must answer how much he can accept of how his mother recorded him.,母が自分をどのように記録していたのか、どこまで受け入れられるのか答える必要があります。,必须回答他能在多大程度上接受母亲对自己的记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].partyContext.b.implication,윤정후의 침묵과 오래된 자금 흐름의 이유가 하나로 이어질 수 있다.,The reason for Yoon Jeong-hu's silence and the old fund flow may connect as one.,ユン・ジョンフの沈黙と古い資金の流れの理由が一つにつながる可能性があります。,尹正厚沉默的理由与旧日资金流向可能连为一体。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].partyContext.b.questionAngle,이 기록을 언제 알았고 왜 형에게 말하지 않았는지 설명해야 합니다.,He must explain when he learned of this record and why he did not tell his brother.,この記録をいつ知り、なぜ兄に話さなかったのか説明する必要があります。,必须说明他何时知道这份记录，以及为何没有告诉哥哥。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].surfaceDescription,어머니의 흰색 자필 공책 사진이 존재한다.,A photo of the mother's white handwritten notebook exists.,母の白い自筆ノートの写真が存在します。,存在母亲白色亲笔笔记本的照片。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.surfaceName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].surfaceName,어머니 일기장,Mother's Diary,母の日記,母亲日记,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,배다른 자식 확정 문장과 어머니의 미안함을 연결한다.,Connect the definitive half-sibling sentence with the mother's apology.,腹違いの子という確定文と母の申し訳なさを結びつけます。,将明确说明同母异父的句子与母亲的歉意联系起来。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,윤정후의 침묵 동기와 두 형제의 책임 구조를 판단한다.,Judge Yoon Jeong-hu's motive for silence and the responsibility structure of the two brothers.,ユン・ジョンフの沈黙の動機と兄弟二人の責任構造を判断します。,判断尹正厚沉默的动机以及两兄弟的责任结构。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,두 아들 걱정과 윤태성에 대한 한탄이 보인다.,Concern for the two sons and a lament about Yoon Tae-seong are visible.,二人の息子への心配とユン・テソンへの嘆きが見えます。,可以看到对两个儿子的担心和对尹泰成的叹息。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,윤정후 걱정과 배다른 자식 암시를 확인한다.,Confirm the concern for Yoon Jeong-hu and the hint that he is a half-sibling.,ユン・ジョンフへの心配と腹違いの子という暗示を確認します。,确认对尹正厚的担心以及同母异父的暗示。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,일기장 사진 존재만 보인다.,Only the existence of the diary photo is visible.,日記写真の存在だけが見えます。,只能看到日记照片存在。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
