case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.v3TrustStates_challenged_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].v3TrustStates[challenged].summary,윤태성 측은 치매 시기 기록의 신뢰성을 다툰다.,Yoon Tae-seong's side disputes the reliability of records from the dementia period.,ユン・テソン側は、認知症時期の記録の信頼性を争っています。,尹泰成一方质疑认知障碍时期记录的可信度。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
