case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.v3TrustStates_submitted_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].v3TrustStates[submitted].summary,윤정후가 어머니 일기장 사진을 제출했다.,Yoon Jeong-hu submitted photos of the mother's diary.,ユン・ジョンフが母の日記写真を提出しました。,尹正厚提交了母亲日记照片。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
