case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.v3TrustStates_verifying_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].v3TrustStates[verifying].summary,자필 감정과 사진 촬영 경위를 확인한다.,Confirm the handwriting analysis and the circumstances of the photo capture.,筆跡鑑定と写真撮影の経緯を確認します。,确认笔迹鉴定和照片拍摄经过。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerData.device.ownerName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerData.device.ownerName,어머니의 아이보리 공책,Mother's ivory notebook,母のアイボリーのノート,母亲的象牙色笔记本,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerData.device.sections_diary-2024-spring_.items_0_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerData.device.sections[diary-2024-spring].items[0].text,태성이도 정후도 내 마음을 알까. 둘 다 걱정인데 서로를 더 모른다.,"Do Tae-seong and Jeong-hu know my heart? I worry about them both, but they understand each other even less.",テソンもジョンフも私の心を分かっているだろうか。二人とも心配なのに、互いのことをもっと分かっていない。,泰成和正厚会懂我的心吗？两个我都担心，可他们更不了解彼此。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerData.device.sections_diary-2024-spring_.items_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerData.device.sections[diary-2024-spring].items[1].text,"태성이는 아직도 정신을 못 차린다. 공장 일도, 제 마음도 남 탓부터 하려 한다.","Tae-seong still hasn't come to his senses. With the factory and with his own heart, he tries to blame others first.",テソンはまだ目を覚まさない。工場のことも、自分の心のことも、まず人のせいにしようとする。,泰成到现在还没清醒。无论工厂的事，还是自己的心，他都先想怪别人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
