case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.2.device.ownerName,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.2.device.ownerName,어머니의 아이보리 공책,Mother's ivory notebook,母のアイボリーのノート,母亲的象牙色笔记本,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections_diary-2024-spring_.items_0_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections[diary-2024-spring].items[0].text,태성이도 정후도 내 마음을 알까. 둘 다 걱정인데 서로를 더 모른다.,"Do Tae-seong and Jeong-hu know my heart? I worry about them both, but they understand each other even less.",テソンもジョンフも私の心を分かっているだろうか。二人とも心配なのに、互いのことをもっと分かっていない。,泰成和正厚会懂我的心吗？两个我都担心，可他们更不了解彼此。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections_diary-2024-spring_.items_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections[diary-2024-spring].items[1].text,"태성이는 아직도 정신을 못 차린다. 공장 일도, 제 마음도 남 탓부터 하려 한다.","Tae-seong still hasn't come to his senses. With the factory and with his own heart, he tries to blame others first.",テソンはまだ目を覚まさない。工場のことも、自分の心のことも、まず人のせいにしようとする。,泰成到现在还没清醒。无论工厂的事，还是自己的心，他都先想怪别人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections_diary-2024-spring_.title,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections[diary-2024-spring].title,"2024년 봄, 흰 공책","Spring 2024, white notebook",2024年春、白いノート,2024年春，白色笔记本,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections_diary-2024-winter_.items_0_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections[diary-2024-winter].items[0].text,정후는 어려서부터 말이 적다. 자기가 다 짊어지려는 얼굴이라 더 마음이 쓰인다.,"Jeong-hu has spoken little since he was young. He has a face like he is trying to carry everything alone, and that worries me more.",ジョンフは幼い頃から口数が少ない。自分がすべて背負おうとする顔をしていて、余計に気にかかる。,正厚从小话就少。他总是一副想把一切都自己扛下来的表情，所以我更挂心。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections_diary-2024-winter_.items_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.2.device.sections[diary-2024-winter].items[1].text,둘이 똑같은 형제라고만 말하기 어려운 사정이 있다. 그래도 내게는 둘 다 아들이다.,"There are circumstances that make it hard to simply call the two of them the same kind of brothers. Still, to me, both are my sons.",二人をただ同じ兄弟だと言い切りにくい事情がある。それでも私にとっては、二人とも息子だ。,有些情况让我很难只说他们是一样的兄弟。可对我来说，他们两个都是儿子。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
