case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections_diary-2024-winter_.items_0_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections[diary-2024-winter].items[0].text,정후는 어려서부터 말이 적다. 자기가 다 짊어지려는 얼굴이라 더 마음이 쓰인다.,"Jeong-hu has spoken little since he was young. He has a face like he is trying to carry everything alone, and that worries me more.",ジョンフは幼い頃から口数が少ない。自分がすべて背負おうとする顔をしていて、余計に気にかかる。,正厚从小话就少。他总是一副想把一切都自己扛下来的表情，所以我更挂心。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
