case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections_diary-2024-winter_.title,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections[diary-2024-winter].title,"2024년 겨울, 아이보리 공책","Winter 2024, ivory notebook",2024年冬、アイボリーのノート,2024年冬，象牙色笔记本,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections_diary-2025-spring_.items_0_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections[diary-2025-spring].items[0].text,정후에게 미안하다. 그 애가 알면 혼자 덮으려 할까 두렵다.,"I am sorry to Jeong-hu. I am afraid that if he knows, he will try to cover it up alone.",ジョンフに申し訳ない。あの子が知ったら、一人で覆い隠そうとするのではないかと怖い。,我对不起正厚。我怕那孩子知道后，会想一个人把事情盖过去。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections_diary-2025-spring_.items_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections[diary-2025-spring].items[1].text,태성이는 정후와 아버지가 다른 자식이다. 이 문장을 쓰는 손이 떨린다.,Tae-seong is a child with a different father from Jeong-hu. My hand trembles as I write this sentence.,テソンはジョンフとは父親が違う子だ。この文を書く手が震える。,泰成是和正厚父亲不同的孩子。写下这句话时，我的手在发抖。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections_diary-2025-spring_.items_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections[diary-2025-spring].items[2].text,"그래도 태성이도 똑같이 내 자식이었다. 약한 곳이 보여서, 어쩌면 더 마음이 가고 더 챙겼다.","Still, Tae-seong was just as much my child. I saw his weakness, and perhaps that made me care for him even more.",それでもテソンも同じように私の子だった。弱いところが見えて、もしかするとより心が向き、より世話をした。,即便如此，泰成也同样是我的孩子。我看见他的脆弱，或许因此更挂心，也更照顾他。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_evidence_e-7_.viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections_diary-2025-spring_.title,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.3.device.sections[diary-2025-spring].title,"2025년 봄, 접힌 장","Spring 2025, folded page",2025年春、折られたページ,2025年春，折起的页,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
