case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_meta.anchorTruth,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,meta.anchorTruth,"공증본 60:40은 처음부터 그 비율로 남아 있었지만, 별도 자필 연습본과 오래된 계좌 흐름, 어머니 일기장이 유서 변경의 맥락을 다시 세운다.","The 60:40 notarized copy had held that ratio from the start, but the separate handwritten draft, old account trail, and mother's diary rebuild the context for the will change.",公証本60:40は最初からその比率で残っていましたが、別の自筆下書き、古い口座の流れ、母の日記が遺言書変更の文脈を改めて組み立てます。,60:40公证本从一开始就保持该比例，但另行亲笔草稿、旧账户流水和母亲日记重新构建了遗嘱变更的语境。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_meta.emotionalBait,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,meta.emotionalBait,"동생을 평생 못마땅해하던 윤태성은, 치매 어머니가 남긴 유서에서 자기 몫이 40퍼센트라는 걸 보고 무너진다. 동생은 끝까지 담담하다. 그래서 더 수상해 보인다.","Yoon Tae-seong, who has resented his younger brother all his life, breaks when he sees that the will left by his mother with dementia gives him only 40%. His brother stays calm to the end. That makes him look even more suspicious.",生涯弟を快く思っていなかったユン・テソンは、認知症の母が残した遺言書で自分の取り分が40％だと知り、崩れ落ちます。弟は最後まで淡々としています。だから余計に怪しく見えます。,一生都看不惯弟弟的尹泰成，看到患有认知障碍的母亲留下的遗嘱中自己只有40%时崩溃了。弟弟却始终平静，因此显得更加可疑。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_meta.resolutionDilemma,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,meta.resolutionDilemma,"유언장에 손댄 책임, 어머니의 판단 능력, 형제 사이에 숨겨진 오래된 부담을 함께 판단해야 한다.","You must judge responsibility for altering the will, the mother's capacity, and the old burden hidden between the brothers together.",遺言書に手を加えた責任、母の判断能力、兄弟の間に隠された古い重荷を合わせて判断する必要があります。,必须同时判断改动遗嘱的责任、母亲的判断能力，以及兄弟之间隐藏已久的负担。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_meta.title,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,meta.title,치매 어머니의 유서,The Dementia Mother's Will,認知症の母の遺言書,认知障碍母亲的遗嘱,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_meta.triggerAmplifier,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,meta.triggerAmplifier,"초반에는 유서 비율과 요양원 방문 기록이 윤정후의 개입처럼 보인다. 그러나 공증인 메모와 자필 연습본, 오래된 계좌 흐름, 어머니 일기장이 차례로 열리면 사건의 중심은 단순한 유산 다툼을 넘어선다.","At first, the will ratio and the care home visit logs make Yoon Jeong-hu's involvement look likely. But as the notary's memo, handwritten draft, old account trail, and mother's diary open one by one, the center of the case moves beyond a simple inheritance dispute.",序盤では、遺言書の比率と介護施設の訪問記録がユン・ジョンフの関与を示すように見えます。しかし公証人のメモ、自筆下書き、古い口座の流れ、母の日記が順に開くと、事件の中心は単なる遺産争いを越えていきます。,起初，遗嘱比例和疗养院探访记录看起来像是尹正厚介入的痕迹。但随着公证人备忘、亲笔草稿、旧账户流水和母亲日记依次解锁，案件核心将超越单纯的遗产纠纷。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_solutions.가족관계회복_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,solutions.가족관계회복[0],"출생 비밀의 공개 범위를 당사자 동의 하에 결정하고, 형제 관계 복원을 위한 조율 절차를 마련한다.","Decide the scope of disclosure for the birth secret with the parties' consent, and establish a coordination process to restore the brothers' relationship.",出生の秘密の公開範囲を当事者の同意の下で決定し、兄弟関係を回復するための調整手続きを整えます。,在当事人同意下决定出生秘密的公开范围，并安排用于修复兄弟关系的协调程序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_solutions.가족관계회복_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,solutions.가족관계회복[1],어머니의 진정한 뜻을 두 아들이 함께 이해하는 과정을 중재한다.,Mediate a process in which the two sons understand their mother's true wishes together.,母の真の意思を二人の息子が共に理解する過程を仲裁します。,调解两个儿子共同理解母亲真实意愿的过程。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_solutions.유서적법성판단_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,solutions.유서적법성판단[0],"치매 어머니의 유서 작성 당시 판단 능력을 전문 감정으로 확인하고, 공증 절차의 적법성을 다시 판단한다.","Confirm the mother's capacity at the time the will was written through expert evaluation, and reassess the legality of the notarization procedure.",認知症の母が遺言書を作成した当時の判断能力を専門鑑定で確認し、公証手続きの適法性を改めて判断します。,通过专业鉴定确认患有认知障碍的母亲在立遗嘱当时的判断能力，并重新判断公证程序的合法性。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_solutions.유서적법성판단_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,solutions.유서적법성판단[1],윤정후의 유서 조작 행위는 위법이지만 동기를 참작하여 별도 자필 연습본의 법적 효력을 함께 검토한다.,"Yoon Jeong-hu's act of manipulating the will is unlawful, but his motive should be considered while also reviewing the legal effect of the separate handwritten draft.",ユン・ジョンフの遺言書操作行為は違法ですが、動機を酌量し、別の自筆下書きの法的効力も合わせて検討します。,尹正厚操纵遗嘱的行为违法，但应酌情考虑其动机，并一并审查另行亲笔草稿的法律效力。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_solutions.재산분배재조정_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,solutions.재산분배재조정[0],"자필 연습본과 공증본 60:40의 법적 효력을 비교하고, 오래된 지원 내역을 참작한 공정한 분배를 재산정한다.","Compare the legal effect of the handwritten draft and the 60:40 notarized copy, and recalculate a fair distribution that considers the old support history.",自筆下書きと公証本60:40の法的効力を比較し、古い支援内訳を考慮した公正な分配を再算定します。,比较亲笔草稿与60:40公证本的法律效力，并将旧日支援明细纳入考量，重新计算公平分配。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_solutions.재산분배재조정_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,solutions.재산분배재조정[1],윤정후가 어머니 통장으로 넣고 윤태성의 공장 자금으로 전달된 3억원은 별도 정산 대상으로 분리한다.,The ₩300M that Yoon Jeong-hu deposited into the mother's account and that was passed to Yoon Tae-seong's factory funds is separated as a separate settlement item.,ユン・ジョンフが母の口座に入れ、ユン・テソンの工場資金として渡された3億ウォンは、別途精算対象として切り分けます。,尹正厚存入母亲账户并转作尹泰成工厂资金的3亿韩元，将作为单独结算对象分离。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_truthTable_t-1_.fact,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,truthTable[t-1].fact,"어머니는 말년에 판단 능력이 완전히 상실되지는 않았으나, 윤정후의 개입이 유서 작성에 영향을 미쳤다.","The mother had not completely lost capacity in her final years, but Yoon Jeong-hu's involvement affected the drafting of the will.",母は晩年に判断能力を完全には失っていませんでしたが、ユン・ジョンフの関与が遺言書作成に影響しました。,母亲晚年并未完全丧失判断能力，但尹正厚的介入影响了遗嘱制作。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_truthTable_t-2_.fact,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,truthTable[t-2].fact,"공증본은 60:40이었고, 별도 자필 유언장 연습본에서 공증본과 다른 정확한 비율이 확인된다. 윤정후는 유언장에 손댔지만 더 받으려 한 조작은 아니었다.","The notarized copy was 60:40, and a different exact ratio is confirmed in the separate handwritten will draft. Yoon Jeong-hu altered the will, but it was not manipulation intended to receive more.",公証本は60:40で、別の自筆遺言書下書きから公証本とは異なる正確な比率が確認されます。ユン・ジョンフは遺言書に手を加えましたが、より多く受け取るための操作ではありませんでした。,公证本为60:40，而另行亲笔遗嘱草稿中确认了与公证本不同的准确比例。尹正厚确实改动了遗嘱，但那并不是为了多拿份额的操纵。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_truthTable_t-3_.fact,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,truthTable[t-3].fact,"윤정후 돈이 어머니 통장을 거쳐 월 단위로 들어갔고, 공장 위기 때 3억원도 같은 경로로 전달됐다.","Yoon Jeong-hu's money entered the mother's account monthly, and during the factory crisis ₩300M was also passed along the same route.",ユン・ジョンフの金が母の口座を経由して月単位で入り、工場危機の際には3億ウォンも同じ経路で渡されました。,尹正厚的钱按月经由母亲账户入账，工厂危机时3亿韩元也通过同一路径转交。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_truthTable_t-4_.fact,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,truthTable[t-4].fact,"어머니 일기장은 윤정후가 배다른 자식이라는 사실과, 그래도 똑같은 자식으로 더 아꼈던 뉘앙스를 함께 남긴다.","The mother's diary records that Yoon Jeong-hu is a half-sibling, along with the nuance that she still saw him as an equal child and cherished him even more.",母の日記には、ユン・ジョンフが腹違いの子である事実と、それでも同じ子としてより大切にしていたニュアンスが共に残っています。,母亲日记同时留下了尹正厚是同母异父孩子这一事实，以及即便如此仍把他当作同样的孩子、甚至更加疼爱的语气。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_truthTable_t-5_.fact,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,truthTable[t-5].fact,"둘 다 어머니 뜻을 있는 그대로 두지 못했다. 윤태성은 유산을 당연시했고, 윤정후는 형을 보호하려 유언장에 손댔다.","Neither left the mother's wishes as they were. Yoon Tae-seong took the inheritance for granted, and Yoon Jeong-hu altered the will to protect his brother.",二人とも母の意思をそのままにしておけませんでした。ユン・テソンは遺産を当然視し、ユン・ジョンフは兄を守るために遺言書に手を加えました。,两人都没能让母亲的意愿保持原样。尹泰成把遗产视为理所当然，尹正厚则为了保护哥哥而改动遗嘱。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
