case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_0_.purpose,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[0].purpose,유서 사본과 요양보호사 증언의 원본 확보,Secure originals of the will copy and caregiver testimony,遺言書コピーと介護職員証言の原本確保,取得遗嘱副本和护理员证言的原件,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_0_.recommendedMoment,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[0].recommendedMoment,d-1 초반 e-1/e-3 Excerpt 시점,"d-1 early, e-1/e-3 Excerpt point",d-1序盤 e-1/e-3 Excerpt時点,d-1前期 e-1/e-3 Excerpt时间点,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
