case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_1_.purpose,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[1].purpose,공증인 메모 기록 원본 확보,Secure the original notary's memo notes,公証人のメモ記録原本を確保,取得公证人备忘记录原件,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_1_.recommendedMoment,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[1].recommendedMoment,e-4 등장 직후,e-4 immediately after appearance,e-4登場直後,e-4出现后立即,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_10_.action,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[10].action,발언 제지 / 기록 제외,Stop Statement / Exclude from Record,発言制止／記録除外,制止发言 / 排除记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_10_.purpose,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[10].purpose,프레임 싸움을 줄이고 공식기록과 가설을 분리,Reduce framing battles and separate official records from hypotheses,フレーム争いを減らし、公式記録と仮説を切り分ける,减少框架争执，并区分正式记录与假设,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_10_.recommendedMoment,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[10].recommendedMoment,윤태성이 동생 인격 공격만 반복하거나 윤정후가 침묵으로 일관할 때,"When Yoon Tae-seong only repeats personal attacks on his brother, or Yoon Jeong-hu remains consistently silent",ユン・テソンが弟への人格攻撃ばかり繰り返す時、またはユン・ジョンフが沈黙で一貫する時,当尹泰成只反复攻击弟弟人格，或尹正厚始终沉默时,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_11_.action,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[11].action,민감정보 봉인 해제,Unseal Sensitive Information,機微情報の封印解除,解除敏感信息封印,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_11_.purpose,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[11].purpose,출생 비밀을 확실히 열되 윤태성의 정체성 충격 리스크 관리,Clearly reveal the birth secret while managing the risk of identity shock for Yoon Tae-seong,出生の秘密を確実に開示しつつ、ユン・テソンの自己認識への衝撃リスクを管理,明确揭示出生秘密，同时管理尹泰成身份冲击的风险,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_11_.recommendedMoment,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[11].recommendedMoment,출생 비밀 해석을 택했지만 실체가 부족할 때 또는 dc-3 직전,"When the birth-secret interpretation is chosen but substance is lacking, or just before dc-3",出生の秘密の解釈を選んだが実体が不足している時、またはdc-3直前,选择出生秘密解读但实体不足时，或dc-3之前,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_2_.action,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[2].action,원본 제출 명령,Order to Submit Originals,原本提出命令,命令提交原件,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_2_.purpose,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[2].purpose,오래된 계좌 흐름을 은행 기록으로 확보,Secure the old account trail through bank records,古い口座の流れを銀行記録で確保,用银行记录取得旧账户流水,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_2_.recommendedMoment,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[2].recommendedMoment,오래된 지원의 출처 등장 직후 e-6 축,"Immediately after Source of Old Support appears, e-6 axis",古い支援の出どころ登場直後、e-6軸,旧日支援的来源出现后立即，e-6轴,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.authorityPlacements_3_.action,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.authorityPlacements[3].action,정확히 답변하십시오,Answer Precisely,正確に答えてください,请准确回答,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
