case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-1_.interpretationChoices_L-1-A_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-1].interpretationChoices[L-1-A].text,윤정후가 치매 어머니를 이용해 유서를 조작했다,Yoon Jeong-hu used his mother with dementia to manipulate the will,ユン・ジョンフが認知症の母を利用して遺言書を操作した,尹正厚利用患认知障碍的母亲操纵了遗嘱,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-1_.interpretationChoices_L-1-B_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-1].interpretationChoices[L-1-B].implication,요양보호사 증언과 잘 이어진다.,Connects well with the caregiver testimony.,介護職員の証言とうまくつながる。,与护理员证言衔接良好。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-1_.interpretationChoices_L-1-B_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-1].interpretationChoices[L-1-B].text,윤정후는 어머니 뜻을 확인하며 조심스럽게 진행했다,Yoon Jeong-hu carefully proceeded while confirming his mother's wishes,ユン・ジョンフは母の意思を確認しながら慎重に進めた,尹正厚一边确认母亲意愿，一边谨慎推进,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-1_.interpretationChoices_L-1-C_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-1].interpretationChoices[L-1-C].implication,판단을 유보한다.,Defer judgment.,判断を保留する。,暂缓判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-1_.interpretationChoices_L-1-C_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-1].interpretationChoices[L-1-C].text,치매 정도를 더 확인해야 한다,Need to confirm the degree of dementia further,認知症の程度をさらに確認する必要がある,需要进一步确认认知障碍程度,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
