case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-2_.interpretationChoices_L-2-A_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-2].interpretationChoices[L-2-A].implication,윤정후의 법적 책임을 먼저 본다.,Look first at Yoon Jeong-hu's legal responsibility.,まずユン・ジョンフの法的責任を見る。,先看尹正厚的法律责任。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-2_.interpretationChoices_L-2-A_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-2].interpretationChoices[L-2-A].text,"조작은 조작이다, 동기와 무관하게 위법이다",Manipulation is manipulation; it is unlawful regardless of motive,操作は操作だ、動機に関係なく違法だ,操纵就是操纵，与动机无关，均属违法,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-2_.interpretationChoices_L-2-B_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-2].interpretationChoices[L-2-B].implication,조작 방향의 의미를 연다.,Open the meaning of the manipulation's direction.,操作方向の意味を開く。,开启对操纵方向意义的解读。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-2_.interpretationChoices_L-2-B_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-2].interpretationChoices[L-2-B].text,자기 몫을 줄인 조작이라면 동기가 다르다,"If the manipulation reduced his own share, the motive is different",自分の取り分を減らす操作なら、動機が違う,如果操纵是减少自己的份额，动机就不同,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-2_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-2].name,Forgery Lead,Forgery Lead,偽造リード,伪造线索,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-3_.interpretationChoices_L-3-A_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-3].interpretationChoices[L-3-A].implication,윤정후의 희생을 먼저 본다.,Look first at Yoon Jeong-hu's sacrifice.,まずユン・ジョンフの犠牲を見る。,先看尹正厚的牺牲。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-3_.interpretationChoices_L-3-A_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-3].interpretationChoices[L-3-A].text,오래 몰래 도운 것은 선의다,Helping secretly for a long time was goodwill,長く密かに助けたことは善意だ,长期暗中帮助是出于善意,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-3_.interpretationChoices_L-3-B_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-3].interpretationChoices[L-3-B].implication,윤태성의 자존심과 알 권리를 본다.,Look at Yoon Tae-seong's pride and right to know.,ユン・テソンの自尊心と知る権利を見る。,看尹泰成的自尊心和知情权。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-3_.interpretationChoices_L-3-B_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-3].interpretationChoices[L-3-B].text,어머니 돈으로 위장한 것 자체가 기만이다,Disguising it as the mother's money was itself deception,母の金に見せかけたこと自体が欺瞞だ,伪装成母亲的钱本身就是欺骗,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-3_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-3].name,Support Lead,Support Lead,支援リード,支援线索,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-4_.interpretationChoices_L-4-A_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-4].interpretationChoices[L-4-A].implication,윤정후의 전체 행동이 형 보호로 재맥락화된다.,Yoon Jeong-hu's entire behavior is recontextualized as protecting his brother.,ユン・ジョンフの行動全体が、兄を守るためのものとして再文脈化される。,尹正厚的全部行为会被重新置于保护哥哥的语境中。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-4_.interpretationChoices_L-4-A_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-4].interpretationChoices[L-4-A].text,출생 비밀을 지키려 한 보호였다,It was protection meant to keep the birth secret,出生の秘密を守ろうとした保護だった,这是为了守住出生秘密的保护,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-4_.interpretationChoices_L-4-B_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-4].interpretationChoices[L-4-B].implication,출생 비밀 은폐 자체의 문제를 본다.,Look at the problem of concealing the birth secret itself.,出生の秘密を隠したこと自体の問題を見る。,看隐瞒出生秘密本身的问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-4_.interpretationChoices_L-4-B_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-4].interpretationChoices[L-4-B].text,형에게 알 권리가 있다,The older brother has a right to know,兄には知る権利がある,哥哥有知情权,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-4_.interpretationChoices_L-4-C_.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-4].interpretationChoices[L-4-C].implication,상호 책임 구조를 본다.,Look at the mutual responsibility structure.,相互責任の構造を見る。,看相互责任结构。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-4_.interpretationChoices_L-4-C_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-4].interpretationChoices[L-4-C].text,어머니의 뜻을 두 아들 모두 왜곡했다,Both sons distorted their mother's wishes,二人の息子がともに母の意思を歪めた,两个儿子都扭曲了母亲的意愿,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.leadLines_L-4_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.leadLines[L-4].name,Secret Lead,Secret Lead,秘密リード,秘密线索,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[0],어머니는 말년에 판단 능력이 완전히 상실되지 않았으나 윤정후의 개입이 있었다.,"The mother had not completely lost capacity in her final years, but Yoon Jeong-hu was involved.",母は晩年に判断能力を完全には失っていませんでしたが、ユン・ジョンフの関与がありました。,母亲晚年并未完全丧失判断能力，但确有尹正厚介入。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[1],60:40 유서는 윤정후가 별도 자필 연습본의 비율에서 자기 몫을 줄여 손댄 결과다.,The 60:40 will resulted from Yoon Jeong-hu altering the separate handwritten draft's ratio to reduce his own share.,60:40の遺言書は、ユン・ジョンフが別の自筆下書きの比率から自分の取り分を減らして手を加えた結果です。,60:40遗嘱是尹正厚从另行亲笔草稿的比例中减少自己份额并加以改动的结果。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_2,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[2],"윤정후는 오랫동안 어머니에게 정기 지원금을 보냈고, 윤태성의 공장 위기 때 3억원을 어머니 통장으로 넣어 윤태성 쪽에 전달되게 했다.","Yoon Jeong-hu sent regular support to his mother for a long time, and during Yoon Tae-seong's factory crisis he deposited ₩300M into the mother's account so it would be passed to Yoon Tae-seong's side.",ユン・ジョンフは長い間母へ定期支援金を送り、ユン・テソンの工場危機の際には3億ウォンを母の口座に入れ、ユン・テソン側へ渡るようにしました。,尹正厚长期向母亲提供定期支援，并在尹泰成工厂危机时将3亿韩元存入母亲账户，使其转交至尹泰成一方。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_3,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[3],윤태성은 아버지의 친자가 아니며 윤정후는 이 사실을 알고 형을 보호하기 위해 유서를 조작했다.,"Yoon Tae-seong is not the father's biological child, and Yoon Jeong-hu knew this and manipulated the will to protect his brother.",ユン・テソンは父の実子ではなく、ユン・ジョンフはこの事実を知った上で兄を守るために遺言書を操作しました。,尹泰成并非父亲亲生，尹正厚知道这一事实，并为了保护哥哥而操纵遗嘱。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations_4,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[4],둘 다 어머니를 있는 그대로 두지 못했다. 윤태성은 유산을 당연시했고 윤정후는 어머니 뜻을 고쳐 형을 보호하려 했다.,"Neither could leave the mother as she was. Yoon Tae-seong took the inheritance for granted, and Yoon Jeong-hu tried to protect his brother by changing the mother's wishes.",二人とも母をそのままにしておけませんでした。ユン・テソンは遺産を当然視し、ユン・ジョンフは母の意思を変えて兄を守ろうとしました。,两人都没能让母亲保持原样。尹泰成把遗产视为理所当然，尹正厚则试图改动母亲意愿来保护哥哥。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets_e-7_.risk,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-7].risk,출생 비밀을 너무 일찍 열면 윤태성의 정체성 붕괴와 재판 진행 불가 상태가 발생할 수 있다.,"If the birth secret is opened too early, Yoon Tae-seong may suffer an identity collapse and the trial may become unable to proceed.",出生の秘密を早く開きすぎると、ユン・テソンの自己認識崩壊と裁判進行不能状態が発生する可能性があります。,如果过早揭开出生秘密，可能导致尹泰成身份崩溃，并使审理无法继续推进。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets_e-7_.targets_0,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-7].targets[0],아버지 실명,Father's real name,父の実名,父亲实名,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets_e-7_.targets_1,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-7].targets[1],출생 비밀 구체적 경위,Specific circumstances of the birth secret,出生の秘密の具体的経緯,出生秘密的具体经过,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_family-01_v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets_e-7_.targets_2,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,family-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-7].targets[2],어머니 일기장 사적 기록,Mother's diary private records,母の日記の私的記録,母亲日记私人记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체 인지에서 형이 느낀 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's helplessness on learning of the caregiver change, but have him separate what he saw, what he heard, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。介護職員交代を知ったことで兄が感じた無力感を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥得知护理员更换时感到的无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니를 가까이서 본 사람이 공증을 앞두고 바뀌었다는 사실을 뒤늦게 알면 누구라도 의심이 들 수 있습니다. 본인이 그 교체를 알게 된 경위를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, anyone could become suspicious after belatedly learning that the person who saw your mother up close changed just before notarization. Please state how you learned of that change.",ユン・テソンさん、公証を前に母を間近で見ていた人が交代したと後から知れば、誰でも疑いを抱き得ます。ご自身がその交代を知った経緯を述べてください。,尹泰成先生，如果事后才知道公证前近距离照看母亲的人被更换，任何人都可能起疑。请说明您得知这次更换的经过。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체 인지에서 형이 느낀 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's helplessness on learning of the caregiver change, but have him separate what he saw, what he heard, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。介護職員交代を知ったことで兄が感じた無力感を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥得知护理员更换时感到的无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v2].text,어머니의 일상을 가장 잘 아는 사람의 자리가 바뀐 일이 형으로서 답답하게 느껴졌을 수 있습니다. 교체 전후로 본인이 본 어머니의 변화가 있었다면 그 장면부터 들려주십시오.,"As the older son, you may have felt frustrated that the person who knew your mother's daily life best was replaced. If you personally saw any change in your mother before or after the replacement, start with that scene.",母の日常を最もよく知る人の立場が変わったことを、兄としてもどかしく感じたかもしれません。交代の前後でご自身が見た母の変化があったなら、その場面から話してください。,作为哥哥，最了解母亲日常的人被更换，您可能感到焦躁。如果更换前后您亲眼看到母亲有什么变化，请先从那个场景说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체 인지에서 형이 느낀 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's helplessness on learning of the caregiver change, but have him separate what he saw, what he heard, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。介護職員交代を知ったことで兄が感じた無力感を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥得知护理员更换时感到的无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 교체가 의도된 것인지 우연인지를 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 직접 들은 설명과 다른 사람을 통해 짐작한 부분을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide now whether the replacement was intentional or coincidental. Just separate what you heard directly from what you inferred through others.",ユン・テソンさん、交代が意図されたものか偶然かを今断定する必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が直接聞いた説明と、他人を通じて推測した部分を分けて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定这次更换是有意还是偶然。只请区分您直接听到的说明，以及通过他人推测出的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체 인지에서 형이 느낀 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's helplessness on learning of the caregiver change, but have him separate what he saw, what he heard, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。介護職員交代を知ったことで兄が感じた無力感を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥得知护理员更换时感到的无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v4].text,본인이 더 일찍 알았더라면 막을 수 있었을 거라는 후회가 있다면 그 마음을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 본인의 책임감인지 동생에 대한 의심인지를 갈라야 다음 이야기가 가능합니다.,"If you regret that you might have stopped it had you known earlier, please speak to that feeling. We need to distinguish whether it comes from your sense of responsibility or suspicion of your brother before we can proceed.",もっと早く知っていれば止められたかもしれないという後悔があるなら、その気持ちを話してください。それがご自身の責任感なのか、弟への疑いなのかを分けなければ、次の話に進めません。,如果您后悔自己若早点知道或许能阻止，请说出那份心情。必须区分那是您的责任感，还是对弟弟的怀疑，才能继续往下谈。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체 인지에서 형이 느낀 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's helplessness on learning of the caregiver change, but have him separate what he saw, what he heard, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。介護職員交代を知ったことで兄が感じた無力感を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥得知护理员更换时感到的无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-caregiver_change-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 요양보호사가 바뀐 사실과 그 결정에 누가 어떻게 관여했는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 확인한 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that the caregiver changed and who took part in that decision are separate issues. Please separate them and state only what you have confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、介護職員が変わった事実と、その決定に誰がどう関与したのかは別の問題です。ご自身が確認した範囲だけを切り分けて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，护理员被更换这一事实，与谁如何参与该决定，是不同的问题。请只按您已确认的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 평생 모셨다는 자부심과 결과에 대한 혼란을 인정하고, 직접 본 장면과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge his pride in having cared for her all his life and his confusion over the result, and have him separate scenes he saw directly from inferences.",共感アプローチ。生涯世話をしてきたという自負と結果への混乱を認め、直接見た場面と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其一生照顾母亲的自豪感和对结果的困惑，并引导其区分亲眼所见的场景与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 평생 어머니를 모셨다고 자부했는데 그 유서가 예상과 달랐다면 배신감과 혼란이 컸을 수 있습니다. 어머니 모습 중 본인이 직접 본 장면부터, 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you took pride in caring for your mother all your life and the will differed from what you expected, the sense of betrayal and confusion may have been great. Start with the scenes of your mother that you personally saw, as much as you can say now.",ユン・テソンさん、生涯母を世話してきたと自負していたのに、その遺言書が予想と違っていたなら、裏切られた思いと混乱は大きかったはずです。母の姿のうち、ご自身が直接見た場面から、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹泰成先生，如果您自认为一生照顾母亲，而那份遗嘱却与预期不同，您可能有很强的背叛感和混乱感。请先从您亲眼见到的母亲的样子说起，在现在能说的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 평생 모셨다는 자부심과 결과에 대한 혼란을 인정하고, 직접 본 장면과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge his pride in having cared for her all his life and his confusion over the result, and have him separate scenes he saw directly from inferences.",共感アプローチ。生涯世話をしてきたという自負と結果への混乱を認め、直接見た場面と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其一生照顾母亲的自豪感和对结果的困惑，并引导其区分亲眼所见的场景与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,어머니가 유서를 제대로 이해하셨는지 확신할 수 없을 때 형으로서 무력감이 깊었을 수 있습니다. 그 무렵 어머니가 보인 말과 행동 중 가장 마음에 남은 장면을 짚어 주십시오.,"When you could not be sure whether your mother properly understood the will, you may have felt deep helplessness as the older son. Please point out the words or actions from that period that remain most strongly in your mind.",母が遺言書を正しく理解していたのか確信できなかった時、兄として深い無力感があったかもしれません。その頃の母の言動の中で、最も心に残っている場面を指摘してください。,当您无法确定母亲是否真正理解遗嘱时，作为哥哥可能深感无力。请指出那段时期母亲言行中最留在您心里的场景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 평생 모셨다는 자부심과 결과에 대한 혼란을 인정하고, 직접 본 장면과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge his pride in having cared for her all his life and his confusion over the result, and have him separate scenes he saw directly from inferences.",共感アプローチ。生涯世話をしてきたという自負と結果への混乱を認め、直接見た場面と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其一生照顾母亲的自豪感和对结果的困惑，并引导其区分亲眼所见的场景与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생을 의심하는 일이 가족을 무너뜨릴까 망설이셨을 수 있습니다. 단정하지 않아도 됩니다. 어머니에 대한 본인 기억과 동생 행동에 대한 추측을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you may have hesitated because suspecting your brother could tear the family apart. You do not need to make a conclusion. Please separate your own memories of your mother from your guesses about your brother's actions.",ユン・テソンさん、弟を疑うことが家族を壊すのではないかとためらったかもしれません。断定しなくて構いません。母についてのご自身の記憶と、弟の行動についての推測を分けて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，您可能曾犹豫，担心怀疑弟弟会让家人崩裂。不必断定。请把您对母亲的记忆和对弟弟行为的推测分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 평생 모셨다는 자부심과 결과에 대한 혼란을 인정하고, 직접 본 장면과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge his pride in having cared for her all his life and his confusion over the result, and have him separate scenes he saw directly from inferences.",共感アプローチ。生涯世話をしてきたという自負と結果への混乱を認め、直接見た場面と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其一生照顾母亲的自豪感和对结果的困惑，并引导其区分亲眼所见的场景与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,형이라는 자리 때문에 더 일찍 따져 묻지 못한 후회가 있다면 그 마음을 말씀해 주십시오. 그래야 무엇이 본인이 직접 겪은 일이고 무엇이 나중에 알게 된 일인지 가려낼 수 있습니다.,"If you regret not challenging things sooner because of your position as the older brother, please speak to that feeling. Only then can we distinguish what you experienced directly from what you learned later.",兄という立場のためにもっと早く問いただせなかった後悔があるなら、その気持ちを話してください。そうしてこそ、何がご自身が直接経験したことで、何が後から知ったことなのかを見分けられます。,如果您因哥哥的身份而后悔没能更早追问，请说出那份心情。这样才能分清哪些是您亲身经历的事，哪些是后来得知的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 평생 모셨다는 자부심과 결과에 대한 혼란을 인정하고, 직접 본 장면과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge his pride in having cared for her all his life and his confusion over the result, and have him separate scenes he saw directly from inferences.",共感アプローチ。生涯世話をしてきたという自負と結果への混乱を認め、直接見た場面と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其一生照顾母亲的自豪感和对结果的困惑，并引导其区分亲眼所见的场景与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 뜻과 본인이 바라던 결과는 같은 자리가 아닐 수 있습니다. 두 가지를 분리해서, 어머니가 실제로 보이신 모습부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, your mother's wishes and the result you hoped for may not be the same. Please separate the two and begin with how your mother actually appeared to you.",ユン・テソンさん、母の意思とご自身が望んだ結果は同じものではないかもしれません。二つを切り分け、母が実際に見せた姿から述べてください。,尹泰成先生，母亲的意愿和您希望的结果未必相同。请区分两者，先从母亲实际表现出的样子说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 의사에 대한 형의 불안을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's anxiety about the mother's intent, but have him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。母の意思に対する兄の不安を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对母亲意思的不安，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 유서 내용을 이해하셨다고 믿고 싶은 마음과 그렇지 않았을지 모른다는 두려움이 함께 있었을 수 있습니다. 어머니가 무엇에 어떻게 반응하셨는지 본인이 직접 본 장면을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you may have had both the wish to believe your mother understood the will and the fear that she may not have. Please state the scenes you personally saw: what your mother reacted to and how.",ユン・テソンさん、母が遺言書の内容を理解していたと信じたい気持ちと、そうではなかったかもしれないという恐れが共にあったかもしれません。母が何にどう反応したのか、ご自身が直接見た場面を述べてください。,尹泰成先生，您可能既想相信母亲理解遗嘱内容，又害怕她其实并未理解。请说明您亲眼见到的场景：母亲对什么作出了怎样的反应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 의사에 대한 형의 불안을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's anxiety about the mother's intent, but have him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。母の意思に対する兄の不安を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对母亲意思的不安，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v2].text,"어머니의 작은 표정이나 한마디를 어떻게 받아들이셨는지에 형의 마음이 많이 실렸을 것입니다. 지금 떠오르는 가장 분명한 어머니 모습부터, 무리 없이 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Your feelings as the older son were likely bound up in how you took your mother's small expressions or brief words. Start with the clearest image of your mother that comes to mind now, as much as you can comfortably say.",母の小さな表情や一言をどう受け止めたかには、兄としての気持ちが多く乗っていたはずです。今思い浮かぶ最もはっきりした母の姿から、無理なく話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,母亲细微的表情或一句话，您如何理解，其中大概承载了许多作为哥哥的心情。请先从现在最清晰想起的母亲形象说起，在不勉强的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 의사에 대한 형의 불안을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's anxiety about the mother's intent, but have him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。母の意思に対する兄の不安を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对母亲意思的不安，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 판단 능력 전체를 단정하는 자리는 아닙니다. 다만 어머니가 유서 이야기를 들으셨다고 본인이 느낀 근거를, 본 것과 들은 것 중심으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, this is not the place to decide your mother's capacity as a whole. Just state, focusing on what you saw and heard, the basis for your feeling that she heard the discussion of the will.",ユン・テソンさん、母の判断能力全体を断定する場ではありません。ただ、母が遺言書の話を聞いていたとご自身が感じた根拠を、見たことと聞いたことを中心に述べてください。,尹泰成先生，这里不是断定母亲整体判断能力的场合。请以您所见所闻为中心，说明您认为母亲听到了遗嘱相关话题的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 의사에 대한 형의 불안을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's anxiety about the mother's intent, but have him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。母の意思に対する兄の不安を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对母亲意思的不安，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v4].text,어머니가 어떤 뜻을 가지셨는지 끝내 묻지 못한 부분이 있다면 그 후회부터 말씀해 주십시오. 그래야 본인이 본 어머니와 동생이 전한 어머니가 같은 분이었는지 가릴 수 있습니다.,"If there is anything you regret never asking your mother about her wishes, begin with that regret. Only then can we tell whether the mother you saw and the mother your brother described were the same person.",母がどのような意思を持っていたのか最後まで聞けなかった部分があるなら、その後悔から話してください。そうしてこそ、ご自身が見た母と弟が伝えた母が同じ人だったのか見極められます。,如果您有最终没能问清母亲意愿的遗憾，请先从那份后悔说起。这样才能判断您看到的母亲和弟弟转述的母亲是否是同一个人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 의사에 대한 형의 불안을 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's anxiety about the mother's intent, but have him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。母の意思に対する兄の不安を認めつつ、見たこと／聞いたこと／推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对母亲意思的不安，但引导其区分亲眼所见、听说内容和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-mother_intent-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 보이신 뜻과 본인이 그렇게 믿고 싶은 뜻을 분리해 주십시오. 두 가지가 같은 결인지 다른 결인지부터 짚어 주시면 됩니다.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please separate the wishes your mother showed from the wishes you wanted to believe she had. Start by pointing out whether those two run in the same direction or different directions.",ユン・テソンさん、母が示した意思と、ご自身がそう信じたい意思を切り分けてください。二つが同じ流れなのか違う流れなのかから指摘していただければ結構です。,尹泰成先生，请区分母亲表现出的意愿和您希望相信的意愿。先指出两者是同一脉络还是不同脉络即可。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 공증을 사후에 확인한 형의 상실감을 인정하되, 직접 본 서류와 전해 들은 정황을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's sense of loss after learning of the notarization later, but have him separate documents he saw directly from circumstances he heard about.",共感アプローチ。公証を事後に確認した兄の喪失感を認めつつ、直接見た書類と伝え聞いた状況を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥事后才确认公证一事的失落感，但引导其区分亲眼见过的文件和听来的情况。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증이라는 단어가 형 앞에서 어떻게 다가왔을지 짐작이 갑니다. 공증이 진행된 사실을 처음 알게 된 경위와, 그때 본 어머니 상태를 함께 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, I can imagine what the word “notarization” felt like to you as the older brother. Please state how you first learned that notarization had taken place, along with your mother's condition as you saw it then.",ユン・テソンさん、兄であるあなたにとって「公証」という言葉がどう響いたのか想像できます。公証が行われた事実を初めて知った経緯と、その時に見た母の状態を合わせて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，我能想象“公证”这个词在您作为哥哥面前是怎样的感受。请说明您第一次得知公证已经进行的经过，以及当时您看到的母亲状态。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 공증을 사후에 확인한 형의 상실감을 인정하되, 직접 본 서류와 전해 들은 정황을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's sense of loss after learning of the notarization later, but have him separate documents he saw directly from circumstances he heard about.",共感アプローチ。公証を事後に確認した兄の喪失感を認めつつ、直接見た書類と伝え聞いた状況を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥事后才确认公证一事的失落感，但引导其区分亲眼见过的文件和听来的情况。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v2].text,본인이 모르는 사이 절차가 마무리된 부분이 있다면 그 자체로 깊은 상처가 됐을 수 있습니다. 본인이 사후에 확인한 서류 흐름과 그때 가진 의문을 정리해 주십시오.,"If any part of the procedure was completed without your knowledge, that alone may have been a deep wound. Please organize the document flow you confirmed afterward and the questions you had at the time.",ご自身が知らない間に手続きが終わっていた部分があれば、それ自体が深い傷になったかもしれません。事後に確認した書類の流れと、その時抱いた疑問を整理してください。,如果有程序在您不知情的情况下完成，这本身可能就是深深的伤害。请整理您事后确认的文件流程，以及当时产生的疑问。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 공증을 사후에 확인한 형의 상실감을 인정하되, 직접 본 서류와 전해 들은 정황을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's sense of loss after learning of the notarization later, but have him separate documents he saw directly from circumstances he heard about.",共感アプローチ。公証を事後に確認した兄の喪失感を認めつつ、直接見た書類と伝え聞いた状況を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥事后才确认公证一事的失落感，但引导其区分亲眼见过的文件和听来的情况。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증 절차의 적법성 전체를 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 직접 본 서류와 동생을 통해 들은 설명을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide the legality of the entire notarization procedure right now. Just separate the documents you personally saw from the explanations you heard through your brother.",ユン・テソンさん、公証手続き全体の適法性を今断定する必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が直接見た書類と、弟を通じて聞いた説明を分けて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定整个公证程序是否合法。请只区分您亲眼见到的文件，以及通过弟弟听到的说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 공증을 사후에 확인한 형의 상실감을 인정하되, 직접 본 서류와 전해 들은 정황을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's sense of loss after learning of the notarization later, but have him separate documents he saw directly from circumstances he heard about.",共感アプローチ。公証を事後に確認した兄の喪失感を認めつつ、直接見た書類と伝え聞いた状況を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥事后才确认公证一事的失落感，但引导其区分亲眼见过的文件和听来的情况。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v4].text,공증일에 본인이 함께하지 못한 점이 후회로 남아 있다면 그 마음을 말씀해 주십시오. 그래야 본인 추정과 본인이 사후에 확인한 사실을 가릴 수 있습니다.,"If you regret not being present on the day of notarization, please speak to that feeling. Only then can we separate your inferences from facts you confirmed afterward.",公証日にご自身が同席できなかったことが後悔として残っているなら、その気持ちを話してください。そうしてこそ、ご自身の推測と事後に確認した事実を見分けられます。,如果您对公证当天未能在场仍有后悔，请说出那份心情。这样才能区分您的推测和您事后确认的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 공증을 사후에 확인한 형의 상실감을 인정하되, 직접 본 서류와 전해 들은 정황을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's sense of loss after learning of the notarization later, but have him separate documents he saw directly from circumstances he heard about.",共感アプローチ。公証を事後に確認した兄の喪失感を認めつつ、直接見た書類と伝え聞いた状況を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥事后才确认公证一事的失落感，但引导其区分亲眼见过的文件和听来的情况。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-notarization_flow-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증이 있었다는 사실과 그 안에서 어머니가 어떤 모습이셨는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 확인한 범위에서 두 가지를 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that notarization took place and how your mother appeared within it are separate issues. Please separate the two within the range you have confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、公証があったという事実と、その中で母がどのような様子だったのかは別の問題です。ご自身が確認した範囲で二つを切り分けてください。,尹泰成先生，公证曾经进行这一事实，与母亲在其中是什么样子，是不同的问题。请在您已确认的范围内区分两者。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 자리에 없었다는 박탈감을 인정하되, 들은 것/짐작/직접 확인한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the deprivation he felt from not being present, but have him separate what he heard, guessed, and directly confirmed.",共感アプローチ。その場にいなかったことによる喪失感を認めつつ、聞いたこと／推測／直接確認したことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其因不在场而感到的被剥夺感，但引导其区分听说、猜测和直接确认的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니에게 누군가 종이를 읽어드렸다는 이야기를 들었을 때 의심과 분노가 함께 일었을 수 있습니다. 본인이 어떤 경로로 그 이야기를 알게 됐는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you heard that someone read papers aloud to your mother, suspicion and anger may have risen together. Please begin with how you came to hear that story.",ユン・テソンさん、母に誰かが紙を読み聞かせたという話を聞いた時、疑いと怒りが同時に湧いたかもしれません。ご自身がどの経路でその話を知ったのかから述べてください。,尹泰成先生，当您听说有人给母亲读纸张时，怀疑和愤怒可能同时涌起。请先说明您是通过什么渠道知道这件事的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 자리에 없었다는 박탈감을 인정하되, 들은 것/짐작/직접 확인한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the deprivation he felt from not being present, but have him separate what he heard, guessed, and directly confirmed.",共感アプローチ。その場にいなかったことによる喪失感を認めつつ、聞いたこと／推測／直接確認したことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其因不在场而感到的被剥夺感，但引导其区分听说、猜测和直接确认的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v2].text,형이 그 자리에 없었다는 사실 자체가 더 큰 박탈감을 만들었을 수 있습니다. 본인이 사후에 어머니에게 그 종이에 대해 물었을 때 어머니가 어떻게 답하셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"The very fact that you, the older brother, were not there may have made the sense of deprivation stronger. When you later asked your mother about that paper, how did she answer?",兄であるあなたがその場にいなかったという事実自体が、より大きな喪失感を生んだかもしれません。事後に母へその紙について尋ねた時、母がどう答えたのか述べてください。,您作为哥哥不在那个场合，这一事实本身可能带来更大的被剥夺感。您事后向母亲询问那张纸时，母亲是如何回答的？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 자리에 없었다는 박탈감을 인정하되, 들은 것/짐작/직접 확인한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the deprivation he felt from not being present, but have him separate what he heard, guessed, and directly confirmed.",共感アプローチ。その場にいなかったことによる喪失感を認めつつ、聞いたこと／推測／直接確認したことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其因不在场而感到的被剥夺感，但引导其区分听说、猜测和直接确认的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 장면 전체를 본인이 본 것처럼 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 들은 이야기와 본인 추측을 나눠, 어디까지가 들은 것이고 어디부터가 짐작인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to speak as if you saw that entire scene yourself. Just separate what you heard from what you guessed, and state where the heard account ends and your inference begins.",ユン・テソンさん、その場面全体を自分で見たかのように断定する必要はありません。ただ、聞いた話とご自身の推測を分け、どこまでが聞いたことで、どこからが推測なのか述べてください。,尹泰成先生，不必像亲眼看到整个场景一样断定。请区分您听到的说法和自己的推测，说明哪里为止是听说，哪里开始是猜测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 자리에 없었다는 박탈감을 인정하되, 들은 것/짐작/직접 확인한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the deprivation he felt from not being present, but have him separate what he heard, guessed, and directly confirmed.",共感アプローチ。その場にいなかったことによる喪失感を認めつつ、聞いたこと／推測／直接確認したことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其因不在场而感到的被剥夺感，但引导其区分听说、猜测和直接确认的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v4].text,그 자리에 함께하지 못한 후회가 있다면 그 마음부터 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 본인이 분노로 떠올린 그림과 실제 들은 사실을 가릴 수 있습니다.,"If you regret not being there, begin by giving voice to that feeling. Only then can we separate the picture your anger created from the facts you actually heard.",その場に同席できなかった後悔があるなら、その気持ちから解いてください。そうしてこそ、怒りによって浮かんだ絵と実際に聞いた事実を見分けられます。,如果您后悔没能在场，请先把那份心情说开。这样才能分清您因愤怒想象出的画面和实际听到的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 자리에 없었다는 박탈감을 인정하되, 들은 것/짐작/직접 확인한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the deprivation he felt from not being present, but have him separate what he heard, guessed, and directly confirmed.",共感アプローチ。その場にいなかったことによる喪失感を認めつつ、聞いたこと／推測／直接確認したことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其因不在场而感到的被剥夺感，但引导其区分听说、猜测和直接确认的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-paper_reading-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 누군가 종이를 읽어드렸다는 사실과 그 종이가 무엇이었는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 확인한 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that someone read a paper aloud and what that paper was are separate issues. Please separate them only as far as you have confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、誰かが紙を読み聞かせた事実と、その紙が何だったのかは別の問題です。ご自身が確認した範囲だけを切り分けて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，有人读纸张这一事实，与那张纸究竟是什么，是不同的问题。请只按您已确认的部分分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 동생 방문에 대한 형의 의심과 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's suspicion and helplessness about his younger brother's visits, but have him separate what he saw from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。弟の訪問に対する兄の疑いと無力感を認めつつ、見たことと推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对弟弟探访的怀疑和无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생의 잦아진 방문이 어머니를 위한 것이라 믿고 싶다가도 다른 의도가 있을지 모른다는 의심이 함께 있었을 수 있습니다. 본인이 그 무렵 직접 본 동생의 방문 모습부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you may have wanted to believe your brother's more frequent visits were for your mother, while also suspecting another intent. Start with what you personally saw of his visits around that time.",ユン・テソンさん、弟の増えた訪問が母のためだと信じたい一方で、別の意図があるのではないかという疑いもあったかもしれません。その頃ご自身が直接見た弟の訪問の様子から述べてください。,尹泰成先生，您可能一方面想相信弟弟频繁探访是为了母亲，另一方面又怀疑是否另有意图。请先说说那段时期您亲眼看到的弟弟探访情形。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 동생 방문에 대한 형의 의심과 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's suspicion and helplessness about his younger brother's visits, but have him separate what he saw from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。弟の訪問に対する兄の疑いと無力感を認めつつ、見たことと推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对弟弟探访的怀疑和无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v2].text,형이 직장이나 사정으로 자주 가지 못하는 동안 동생이 곁에 있는 모습을 보며 고마움과 불편함이 섞였을 수 있습니다. 그 시기 어머니의 일과를 알게 된 경로를 짚어 주십시오.,"While you could not visit often because of work or other circumstances, seeing your brother by her side may have mixed gratitude with discomfort. Please identify how you came to know your mother's routine during that period.",仕事や事情で兄であるあなたが頻繁に行けない間、弟がそばにいる姿を見て、感謝と居心地の悪さが混ざったかもしれません。その時期の母の日課をどの経路で知ったのか指摘してください。,在您因工作或其他情况无法常去时，看到弟弟在母亲身边，您可能既感激又不适。请指出那段时期您是通过什么渠道了解母亲日常的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 동생 방문에 대한 형의 의심과 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's suspicion and helplessness about his younger brother's visits, but have him separate what he saw from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。弟の訪問に対する兄の疑いと無力感を認めつつ、見たことと推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对弟弟探访的怀疑和无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생의 방문 의도를 단정하라는 자리는 아닙니다. 다만 본인이 직접 들은 어머니 말씀과 다른 사람을 통해 전해 들은 이야기를 나눠 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, this is not asking you to decide your brother's intent. Just separate the words you heard directly from your mother from accounts you heard through others.",ユン・テソンさん、弟の訪問意図を断定しろという場ではありません。ただ、ご自身が母から直接聞いた言葉と、他人を通じて伝え聞いた話を分けてください。,尹泰成先生，这里不是要求您断定弟弟的探访意图。请只区分您直接从母亲那里听到的话，以及通过他人转述听到的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 동생 방문에 대한 형의 의심과 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's suspicion and helplessness about his younger brother's visits, but have him separate what he saw from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。弟の訪問に対する兄の疑いと無力感を認めつつ、見たことと推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对弟弟探访的怀疑和无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v4].text,동생의 방문 빈도를 늦게 알게 된 데 대한 서운함이 있다면 그 마음부터 말씀해 주십시오. 그래야 본인 추정과 직접 본 일을 가릴 수 있습니다.,"If you felt hurt that you learned of your brother's visit frequency late, begin with that feeling. Only then can we separate your inferences from what you directly saw.",弟の訪問頻度を遅れて知ったことへの寂しさがあるなら、その気持ちから話してください。そうしてこそ、ご自身の推測と直接見たことを見分けられます。,如果您因为很晚才知道弟弟探访频率而感到难过，请先说出那份心情。这样才能区分您的推测和亲眼所见。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 동생 방문에 대한 형의 의심과 무력감을 인정하되, 본 것과 추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's suspicion and helplessness about his younger brother's visits, but have him separate what he saw from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。弟の訪問に対する兄の疑いと無力感を認めつつ、見たことと推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认哥哥对弟弟探访的怀疑和无力感，但引导其区分亲眼所见与推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-visit_pattern-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생이 자주 갔다는 사실과 그 자리에서 무슨 이야기가 오갔는지는 다른 문제입니다. 두 가지를 분리해, 본인이 확인한 만큼만 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that your brother visited often and what was discussed during those visits are separate issues. Please separate the two and state only what you have confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、弟が頻繁に行った事実と、その場でどんな話が交わされたのかは別の問題です。二つを切り分け、ご自身が確認した範囲だけを述べてください。,尹泰成先生，弟弟经常探访这一事实，与探访时具体谈了什么，是不同的问题。请区分两者，只说明您已确认的范围。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체를 본인이 진행한 부담을 인정하되, 의논 경위와 본인이 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having carried out the caregiver change, but have him separate how it was discussed from what he personally did.",共感アプローチ。本人が介護職員交代を進めた負担を認めつつ、相談の経緯と本人が行ったことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其本人推进护理员更换所背负的负担，但引导其区分商议经过和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호사 교체가 본인 결정이었다면 형 앞에서 그 이유를 풀어 두기 어려웠을 수 있습니다. 어떤 사정으로 교체를 진행했는지 본인이 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if the caregiver change was your decision, explaining the reason to your brother may have been difficult. Tell us, as much as you can, what circumstances led you to proceed with the change.",ユン・ジョンフさん、介護職員の交代がご自身の決定だったなら、兄の前でその理由を説明しておくのは難しかったかもしれません。どのような事情で交代を進めたのか、ご自身が話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，如果更换护理员是您的决定，在哥哥面前说明理由可能很困难。请在您能说的范围内说明，是出于什么情况推进了更换。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체를 본인이 진행한 부담을 인정하되, 의논 경위와 본인이 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having carried out the caregiver change, but have him separate how it was discussed from what he personally did.",共感アプローチ。本人が介護職員交代を進めた負担を認めつつ、相談の経緯と本人が行ったことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其本人推进护理员更换所背负的负担，但引导其区分商议经过和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v2].text,"어머니에게 더 맞는 사람으로 바꾸려 했다고 해도, 그 시점이 공증과 가까웠다면 본인 마음에도 무거움이 남았을 수 있습니다. 결정 직전 어머니가 보이신 모습을 짚어 주십시오.","Even if you meant to change to someone better suited for your mother, the timing being close to notarization may have weighed on you. Please point out how your mother appeared immediately before the decision.",母により合う人へ変えようとしたのだとしても、その時点が公証に近かったなら、ご自身の心にも重さが残ったかもしれません。決定直前に母が見せた様子を指摘してください。,即便您是想换成更适合母亲的人，如果时间点接近公证，您心里也可能留下沉重感。请指出决定前母亲表现出的样子。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체를 본인이 진행한 부담을 인정하되, 의논 경위와 본인이 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having carried out the caregiver change, but have him separate how it was discussed from what he personally did.",共感アプローチ。本人が介護職員交代を進めた負担を認めつつ、相談の経緯と本人が行ったことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其本人推进护理员更换所背负的负担，但引导其区分商议经过和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 교체의 모든 동기를 한 번에 말할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 누구와 의논했고 어머니에게는 어떻게 알렸는지부터 차근히 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to state every motive for the replacement at once. Start by calmly organizing whom you discussed it with and how you informed your mother.",ユン・ジョンフさん、交代のすべての動機を一度に話す必要はありません。ただ、誰と相談し、母にはどのように伝えたのかから順に整理してください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说出更换的所有动机。请先按顺序整理，您与谁商量过，又是如何告知母亲的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체를 본인이 진행한 부담을 인정하되, 의논 경위와 본인이 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having carried out the caregiver change, but have him separate how it was discussed from what he personally did.",共感アプローチ。本人が介護職員交代を進めた負担を認めつつ、相談の経緯と本人が行ったことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其本人推进护理员更换所背负的负担，但引导其区分商议经过和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v4].text,형에게 미리 상의하지 못한 데 본인 나름의 이유가 있다면 그 마음을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 보호인지 회피인지에 따라 책임의 무게가 달라집니다.,"If you had your own reason for not discussing it with your brother in advance, please speak to that feeling. The weight of responsibility changes depending on whether it was protection or avoidance.",兄に事前に相談できなかったことにご自身なりの理由があるなら、その気持ちを話してください。それが保護なのか回避なのかによって、責任の重みが変わります。,如果您没有提前与哥哥商量有自己的理由，请说出那份心情。那究竟是保护还是回避，会影响责任的重量。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호사 교체를 본인이 진행한 부담을 인정하되, 의논 경위와 본인이 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having carried out the caregiver change, but have him separate how it was discussed from what he personally did.",共感アプローチ。本人が介護職員交代を進めた負担を認めつつ、相談の経緯と本人が行ったことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其本人推进护理员更换所背负的负担，但引导其区分商议经过和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-caregiver_change-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호사를 바꾼 사실과 새 보호사 앞에서 어머니에게 무엇을 했는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 직접 한 일부터 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that the caregiver was changed and what you did with your mother in front of the new caregiver are separate issues. Begin by separating what you personally did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、介護職員を変えた事実と、新しい介護職員の前で母に何をしたのかは別の問題です。ご自身が直接したことから切り分けて述べてください。,尹正厚先生，更换护理员这一事实，与您在新护理员面前对母亲做了什么，是不同的问题。请先区分您亲自做过的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차에 가까웠던 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인이 한 일을 구체적으로 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of being close to the procedure, but have him specifically separate the mother's reactions from what he did.",共感アプローチ。手続きに近い位置にいた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人が行ったことを具体的に切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其接近程序所背负的负担，但引导其具体区分母亲的反应和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 곁에서 절차를 챙겼다는 사실 자체가 형에게 어떻게 비칠지 부담이 컸을 수 있습니다. 그 시기 어머니에게 무엇을 어떻게 설명했는지 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the very fact that you handled the procedure by your mother's side may have weighed on you, knowing how it would look to your brother. Tell us, as much as you can now, what you explained to your mother and how during that period.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母のそばで手続きを見ていたという事実自体が、兄にどう見えるか大きな負担だったかもしれません。その時期、母に何をどのように説明したのか、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，您在母亲身边处理程序这一事实本身，想到哥哥会如何看待，可能给您很大负担。请在现在能说的范围内说明，那段时期您向母亲解释了什么、如何解释。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차에 가까웠던 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인이 한 일을 구체적으로 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of being close to the procedure, but have him specifically separate the mother's reactions from what he did.",共感アプローチ。手続きに近い位置にいた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人が行ったことを具体的に切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其接近程序所背负的负担，但引导其具体区分母亲的反应和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,형보다 어머니 곁에 더 자주 있었던 쪽으로서 책임감과 외로움이 동시에 있었을 수 있습니다. 유서 이야기를 어머니에게 처음 꺼낸 장면을 기억나는 대로 말씀해 주십시오.,"As the one who was beside your mother more often than your brother, you may have felt responsibility and loneliness at the same time. Please describe, as you remember it, the first time you brought up the will with your mother.",兄より母のそばに頻繁にいた側として、責任感と孤独が同時にあったかもしれません。遺言書の話を母に初めて切り出した場面を、覚えているままに述べてください。,作为比哥哥更常在母亲身边的人，您可能同时感到责任和孤独。请按记忆说明第一次向母亲提起遗嘱话题的场景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차에 가까웠던 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인이 한 일을 구체적으로 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of being close to the procedure, but have him specifically separate the mother's reactions from what he did.",共感アプローチ。手続きに近い位置にいた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人が行ったことを具体的に切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其接近程序所背负的负担，但引导其具体区分母亲的反应和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금 단계에서 모든 것을 단정하라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 다만 어머니가 종이를 들으시고 어떤 반응을 보이셨는지, 본인이 보고 들은 만큼만 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, this is not asking you to decide everything at this stage. Just state, only as far as you saw and heard, how your mother reacted after hearing the paper read aloud.",ユン・ジョンフさん、今の段階ですべてを断定しろという意味ではありません。ただ、母が紙を聞いてどのような反応を見せたのか、ご自身が見聞きした範囲だけ述べてください。,尹正厚先生，这并不是要求您在当前阶段断定一切。请只按您亲眼所见、亲耳所闻说明，母亲听了纸张内容后有什么反应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차에 가까웠던 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인이 한 일을 구체적으로 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of being close to the procedure, but have him specifically separate the mother's reactions from what he did.",共感アプローチ。手続きに近い位置にいた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人が行ったことを具体的に切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其接近程序所背负的负担，但引导其具体区分母亲的反应和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,"형이 오기 전에 일을 마무리하려 했다는 정황이 있는 만큼, 그때 마음이 어떤 결로 움직였는지 본인이 정리할 수 있는 범위에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Given the circumstances suggesting you tried to finish before your brother arrived, please state, as far as you can organize it, what current of feeling moved you then.",兄が来る前に事を終えようとした状況がある以上、その時の心がどのような流れで動いたのか、ご自身が整理できる範囲で述べてください。,既然有迹象显示您试图在哥哥到来前把事情结束，请在您能整理的范围内说明，当时您的心情是以什么脉络在动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차에 가까웠던 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인이 한 일을 구체적으로 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of being close to the procedure, but have him specifically separate the mother's reactions from what he did.",共感アプローチ。手続きに近い位置にいた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人が行ったことを具体的に切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其接近程序所背负的负担，但引导其具体区分母亲的反应和自己所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니를 위했다는 마음과 본인이 절차를 끌고 갔다는 사실은 다른 차원의 문제입니다. 두 가지를 나누어, 절차에서 본인이 직접 한 일부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your feeling that you acted for your mother and the fact that you led the procedure are issues on different levels. Separate the two and begin with what you personally did in the procedure.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母のためだったという気持ちと、ご自身が手続きを引っ張った事実は別の次元の問題です。二つを分け、手続きでご自身が直接したことから述べてください。,尹正厚先生，您认为自己是为了母亲的心意，与您主导程序这一事实，是不同层面的问题。请区分两者，先说明程序中您亲自做了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 곁에서 본 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인의 판단을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having watched from close by, but have him separate the mother's reactions from his own judgment.",共感アプローチ。そばで見ていた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人の判断を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其在身边观察所背负的负担，但引导其区分母亲反应和本人判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 작은 신호를 가까이서 보았다는 책임감이 무거웠을 수 있습니다. 어머니가 유서 내용에 대해 보이신 말이나 표정 중 본인이 기억하는 장면을 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the responsibility of having seen your mother's small signals up close may have weighed heavily on you. Tell us the words or expressions your mother showed about the will that you remember.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の小さなサインを間近で見ていたという責任感は重かったかもしれません。母が遺言書の内容について見せた言葉や表情のうち、ご自身が覚えている場面を聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，近距离看到母亲细微信号所带来的责任感，可能很沉重。请说说您记得的、母亲就遗嘱内容表现出的言语或表情场景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 곁에서 본 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인의 판단을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having watched from close by, but have him separate the mother's reactions from his own judgment.",共感アプローチ。そばで見ていた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人の判断を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其在身边观察所背负的负担，但引导其区分母亲反应和本人判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v2].text,"어머니 상태가 좋고 나쁜 날을 가장 가까이서 본 쪽이라면, 그때마다 다르게 들렸을 어머니의 뜻이 본인 안에서 정리되기 어려웠을 수 있습니다. 가장 또렷이 남은 어머니의 모습을 말씀해 주십시오.","If you were the one who saw your mother's good and bad days most closely, your mother's wishes may have sounded different each time and been difficult for you to organize. Please state the clearest image of your mother that remains with you.",母の状態が良い日も悪い日も最も近くで見ていた側なら、そのたびに違って聞こえた母の意思を自分の中で整理するのは難しかったかもしれません。最もはっきり残っている母の姿を述べてください。,如果您是最近距离看到母亲状态好坏变化的人，那么每次听来都不同的母亲的意愿，可能很难在心中整理。请说明您记忆中最清晰的母亲形象。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 곁에서 본 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인의 판단을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having watched from close by, but have him separate the mother's reactions from his own judgment.",共感アプローチ。そばで見ていた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人の判断を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其在身边观察所背负的负担，但引导其区分母亲反应和本人判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니가 모든 것을 이해하셨다고 단정하지 않아도 됩니다. 다만 본인이 어머니에게 무엇을 묻고 어머니가 어떻게 답하셨는지, 본인이 본 만큼만 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to say your mother understood everything. Just state what you asked her and how she answered, only as far as you saw it.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母がすべてを理解していたと断定しなくても構いません。ただ、ご自身が母に何を尋ね、母がどう答えたのか、ご自身が見た範囲だけ述べてください。,尹正厚先生，不必断定母亲理解了一切。请只按您所见，说明您问了母亲什么，母亲又如何回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 곁에서 본 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인의 판단을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having watched from close by, but have him separate the mother's reactions from his own judgment.",共感アプローチ。そばで見ていた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人の判断を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其在身边观察所背负的负担，但引导其区分母亲反应和本人判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v4].text,"어머니의 의사가 흔들리던 시기였다면 동생으로서 어디까지 끌어가도 되는지 망설이셨을 수 있습니다. 그 망설임의 결을, 어머니 반응과 함께 말씀해 주십시오.","If this was a period when your mother's wishes wavered, you may have hesitated over how far you could carry things as her younger son. Please describe the texture of that hesitation along with your mother's reactions.",母の意思が揺れていた時期だったなら、弟としてどこまで進めてよいのか迷ったかもしれません。その迷いの流れを、母の反応と合わせて述べてください。,如果那是母亲意愿摇摆的时期，您作为弟弟可能犹豫过自己能推进到什么程度。请结合母亲反应，说明那份犹豫的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 곁에서 본 부담을 인정하되, 어머니 반응과 본인의 판단을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having watched from close by, but have him separate the mother's reactions from his own judgment.",共感アプローチ。そばで見ていた負担を認めつつ、母の反応と本人の判断を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其在身边观察所背负的负担，但引导其区分母亲反应和本人判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-mother_intent-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 뜻과 본인이 어머니를 위해 결정한 일은 다른 차원입니다. 두 가지를 나누어, 어머니가 직접 보이신 반응부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your mother's wishes and what you decided for her are different matters. Separate the two and begin with the reactions your mother showed directly.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思と、ご自身が母のために決めたことは別の次元です。二つを分け、母が直接見せた反応から述べてください。,尹正厚先生，母亲的意愿与您为母亲作出的决定，是不同层面的问题。请区分两者，先从母亲直接表现出的反应说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차를 끌고 간 부담을 인정하되, 일정 결정과 자리에서 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having led the procedure, but have him separate the scheduling decision from what he did at the scene.",共感アプローチ。手続きを引っ張った負担を認めつつ、日程決定とその場でしたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其推动程序所背负的负担，但引导其区分日程决定和现场所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증을 누가 챙겼는지 묻는 것이 본인을 모는 자리처럼 느껴질 수 있습니다. 그래도 공증 일정이 잡힌 경위와 어머니에게 어떻게 알렸는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, being asked who handled the notarization may feel like you are being cornered. Even so, begin by stating how the notarization was scheduled and how you informed your mother.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証を誰が手配したのか問われることが、ご自身を追い込む場のように感じられるかもしれません。それでも、公証日程が決まった経緯と、母にどう知らせたのかから述べてください。,尹正厚先生，询问是谁负责公证，您可能会觉得像是在逼问自己。即便如此，请先说明公证日程是如何确定的，以及您如何告知母亲。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차를 끌고 간 부담을 인정하되, 일정 결정과 자리에서 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having led the procedure, but have him separate the scheduling decision from what he did at the scene.",共感アプローチ。手続きを引っ張った負担を認めつつ、日程決定とその場でしたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其推动程序所背负的负担，但引导其区分日程决定和现场所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v2].text,"형이 함께하지 못한 자리에서 절차를 끌고 갔다면, 본인 마음에도 부담이 남았을 수 있습니다. 공증 직전 어머니가 보이신 표정과 말씀을 기억나는 만큼 들려주십시오.","If you led the procedure in a place where your brother could not be present, that may have left a burden on your own heart. Tell us, as you remember them, your mother's expression and words just before notarization.",兄が同席できなかった場で手続きを引っ張ったのなら、ご自身の心にも負担が残ったかもしれません。公証直前に母が見せた表情と言葉を、覚えている範囲で聞かせてください。,如果您在哥哥无法在场的情况下推进程序，您心里也可能留下负担。请按记忆说明公证前母亲表现出的表情和话语。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차를 끌고 간 부담을 인정하되, 일정 결정과 자리에서 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having led the procedure, but have him separate the scheduling decision from what he did at the scene.",共感アプローチ。手続きを引っ張った負担を認めつつ、日程決定とその場でしたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其推动程序所背负的负担，但引导其区分日程决定和现场所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 절차의 모든 단계에 대해 한 번에 해명할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 직접 처리한 일과 사무실 사람이 처리한 일을 차근히 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every step of the procedure at once. Just separate, step by step, what you handled personally and what the office staff handled.",ユン・ジョンフさん、手続きのすべての段階を一度に釈明する必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が直接処理したことと、事務所の人が処理したことを順に切り分けてください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次解释程序的所有阶段。请按顺序区分您亲自处理的事和事务所人员处理的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차를 끌고 간 부담을 인정하되, 일정 결정과 자리에서 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having led the procedure, but have him separate the scheduling decision from what he did at the scene.",共感アプローチ。手続きを引っ張った負担を認めつつ、日程決定とその場でしたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其推动程序所背负的负担，但引导其区分日程决定和现场所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v4].text,"형이 오기 전에 마무리하려 했다는 정황이 사실이라면, 그 시점에 어떤 마음이었는지 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 보호인지 회피인지에 따라 책임의 결이 갈라집니다.","If it is true that you tried to finish before your brother arrived, please state what you felt at that moment. Whether it was protection or avoidance changes the nature of responsibility.",兄が来る前に終えようとした状況が事実なら、その時点でどのような気持ちだったのか述べてください。それが保護なのか回避なのかによって、責任の質が分かれます。,如果您确实试图在哥哥到来前结束，请说明当时是什么心情。那究竟是保护还是回避，会区分责任的性质。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 절차를 끌고 간 부담을 인정하되, 일정 결정과 자리에서 한 일을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of having led the procedure, but have him separate the scheduling decision from what he did at the scene.",共感アプローチ。手続きを引っ張った負担を認めつつ、日程決定とその場でしたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其推动程序所背负的负担，但引导其区分日程决定和现场所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-notarization_flow-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증을 진행했다는 사실과 그 자리에서 어머니에게 무엇을 어떻게 말했는지는 다른 문제입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you proceeded with notarization and what you said to your mother there, and how, are separate issues. Please separate the two.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証を進めた事実と、その場で母に何をどう言ったのかは別の問題です。二つを分けて述べてください。,尹正厚先生，推进公证这一事实，与您在现场对母亲说了什么、怎么说，是不同的问题。请分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 종이를 읽어드린 정황의 무게를 인정하되, 그 자리의 발화와 내용 결정 관여를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the circumstances in which he read the paper aloud, but have him separate what was said there from involvement in deciding the contents.",共感アプローチ。紙を読み聞かせた状況の重みを認めつつ、その場での発話と内容決定への関与を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认读纸张这一情形的分量，但引导其区分当场发言和对内容决定的参与。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니에게 종이를 읽어드린 일이 형에게는 결정적 의심으로 보일 수 있다는 것을 본인도 느끼셨을 것입니다. 그 자리에서 무엇을 어떻게 읽었는지 본인이 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you must have felt that reading papers aloud to your mother could look like decisive suspicion to your brother. Tell us, as much as you can say, what you read there and how.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母に紙を読み聞かせたことが、兄には決定的な疑いに見え得るとご自身も感じていたはずです。その場で何をどのように読んだのか、話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，您自己也应当感觉到，给母亲读纸张这件事在哥哥看来可能是决定性的疑点。请在您能说的范围内说明，当时读了什么、如何读的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 종이를 읽어드린 정황의 무게를 인정하되, 그 자리의 발화와 내용 결정 관여를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the circumstances in which he read the paper aloud, but have him separate what was said there from involvement in deciding the contents.",共感アプローチ。紙を読み聞かせた状況の重みを認めつつ、その場での発話と内容決定への関与を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认读纸张这一情形的分量，但引导其区分当场发言和对内容决定的参与。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v2].text,어머니가 글을 직접 읽기 어려운 상태였다면 누군가는 곁에서 읽어드려야 했을 수 있습니다. 그 필요와 그 자리에서 본인이 한 말을 함께 말씀해 주십시오.,"If your mother was in a state where reading on her own was difficult, someone may have needed to read beside her. Please state both that need and what you said there.",母が自分で文字を読むのが難しい状態だったなら、誰かがそばで読み聞かせる必要があったかもしれません。その必要性と、その場でご自身が言った言葉を合わせて述べてください。,如果母亲当时难以自己阅读文字，或许确实需要有人在身边读给她听。请同时说明这种必要性，以及您当场说过的话。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 종이를 읽어드린 정황의 무게를 인정하되, 그 자리의 발화와 내용 결정 관여를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the circumstances in which he read the paper aloud, but have him separate what was said there from involvement in deciding the contents.",共感アプローチ。紙を読み聞かせた状況の重みを認めつつ、その場での発話と内容決定への関与を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认读纸张这一情形的分量，但引导其区分当场发言和对内容决定的参与。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 그날의 모든 발화를 한 번에 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 어머니에게 무엇을 묻고 어머니가 어떤 반응을 보이셨는지 본 만큼만 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to recount every word spoken that day at once. Just state what you asked your mother and how she reacted, as far as you saw.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その日のすべての発話を一度に明かす必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が母に何を尋ね、母がどのような反応を見せたのか、見た範囲だけ述べてください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次讲清那天的所有发言。请只按您看到的，说明您问了母亲什么，母亲有什么反应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 종이를 읽어드린 정황의 무게를 인정하되, 그 자리의 발화와 내용 결정 관여를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the circumstances in which he read the paper aloud, but have him separate what was said there from involvement in deciding the contents.",共感アプローチ。紙を読み聞かせた状況の重みを認めつつ、その場での発話と内容決定への関与を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认读纸张这一情形的分量，但引导其区分当场发言和对内容决定的参与。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v4].text,"형이 오기 전에 마무리하려 했다면, 그 마음이 어디에서 왔는지 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 어머니를 위한 것인지 본인을 위한 것인지에 따라 책임의 결이 달라집니다.","If you tried to finish before your brother arrived, state where that feeling came from. Whether it was for your mother or for yourself changes the nature of responsibility.",兄が来る前に終えようとしたなら、その気持ちがどこから来たのか述べてください。それが母のためなのか自分のためなのかによって、責任の質が変わります。,如果您试图在哥哥到来前结束，请说明那份心情来自哪里。那究竟是为了母亲还是为了自己，会影响责任的性质。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 종이를 읽어드린 정황의 무게를 인정하되, 그 자리의 발화와 내용 결정 관여를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the circumstances in which he read the paper aloud, but have him separate what was said there from involvement in deciding the contents.",共感アプローチ。紙を読み聞かせた状況の重みを認めつつ、その場での発話と内容決定への関与を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认读纸张这一情形的分量，但引导其区分当场发言和对内容决定的参与。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-paper_reading-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 종이를 읽어드린 사실과 그 종이의 내용 결정에 본인이 어디까지 관여했는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 한 일부터 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you read the paper aloud and how far you were involved in deciding its contents are separate issues. Begin by separating what you did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、紙を読み聞かせた事実と、その紙の内容決定にご自身がどこまで関与したのかは別の問題です。ご自身がしたことから切り分けて述べてください。,尹正厚先生，读纸张这一事实，与您对纸张内容决定参与到什么程度，是不同的问题。请先区分您所做的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 잦은 방문이 의심으로 비치는 부담을 인정하되, 자리에서 한 일과 어머니 반응을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of frequent visits appearing suspicious, but have him separate what he did during those visits from the mother's reactions.",共感アプローチ。頻繁な訪問が疑いとして見える負担を認めつつ、その場でしたことと母の反応を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认频繁探访看起来像疑点所造成的负担，但引导其区分现场所做的事和母亲反应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 곁에 자주 갔다는 일이 형에게는 의심의 근거가 된다는 것이 억울하실 수 있습니다. 그 시기 어머니에게 무엇이 필요해 자주 가셨는지 본인 입장에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, it may feel unfair that visiting your mother often became grounds for suspicion to your brother. Please explain, from your perspective, what your mother needed during that period that made you visit often.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母のそばに頻繁に行ったことが兄には疑いの根拠になるという点は、不当だと感じるかもしれません。その時期、母に何が必要で頻繁に行ったのか、ご自身の立場から述べてください。,尹正厚先生，您可能觉得委屈：常去母亲身边竟成了哥哥怀疑的依据。请从您的立场说明，那段时期母亲需要什么，导致您频繁前往。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 잦은 방문이 의심으로 비치는 부담을 인정하되, 자리에서 한 일과 어머니 반응을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of frequent visits appearing suspicious, but have him separate what he did during those visits from the mother's reactions.",共感アプローチ。頻繁な訪問が疑いとして見える負担を認めつつ、その場でしたことと母の反応を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认频繁探访看起来像疑点所造成的负担，但引导其区分现场所做的事和母亲反应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v2].text,"형이 모르는 어머니의 일상을 본인이 더 가까이서 본 만큼, 그 무게도 혼자 지셨을 수 있습니다. 어머니와 가장 길게 머문 날의 장면을 기억나는 대로 들려주십시오.","Since you saw your mother's daily life more closely than your brother did, you may also have carried that weight alone. Please describe, as you remember it, the day you stayed with your mother the longest.",兄が知らない母の日常をより近くで見ていた分、その重みも一人で背負っていたかもしれません。母と最も長く過ごした日の場面を、覚えているままに聞かせてください。,由于您比哥哥更近距离地看到母亲不为哥哥所知的日常，也可能独自承受了那份重量。请按记忆讲述与母亲相处时间最长的那一天的场景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 잦은 방문이 의심으로 비치는 부담을 인정하되, 자리에서 한 일과 어머니 반응을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of frequent visits appearing suspicious, but have him separate what he did during those visits from the mother's reactions.",共感アプローチ。頻繁な訪問が疑いとして見える負担を認めつつ、その場でしたことと母の反応を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认频繁探访看起来像疑点所造成的负担，但引导其区分现场所做的事和母亲反应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 모든 방문에 대해 한 번에 해명할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 유서 이야기와 가까운 시기의 방문에서 어머니에게 무엇을 어떻게 말했는지부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every visit at once. Start by organizing what you said to your mother, and how, during visits close to the will discussions.",ユン・ジョンフさん、すべての訪問について一度に釈明する必要はありません。ただ、遺言書の話に近い時期の訪問で、母に何をどのように話したのかから整理してください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次解释所有探访。请先整理在接近遗嘱话题时期的探访中，您对母亲说了什么、如何说的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 잦은 방문이 의심으로 비치는 부담을 인정하되, 자리에서 한 일과 어머니 반응을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of frequent visits appearing suspicious, but have him separate what he did during those visits from the mother's reactions.",共感アプローチ。頻繁な訪問が疑いとして見える負担を認めつつ、その場でしたことと母の反応を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认频繁探访看起来像疑点所造成的负担，但引导其区分现场所做的事和母亲反应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v4].text,자주 간 사실을 형 앞에서 분명히 말하지 못한 시기가 있다면 그 마음의 결을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 본인의 불안인지 형에 대한 배려인지에 따라 책임의 모양이 달라집니다.,"If there was a time when you could not clearly tell your brother that you visited often, please describe the nature of that feeling. Responsibility takes a different shape depending on whether it was your anxiety or consideration for your brother.",頻繁に行っていた事実を兄の前ではっきり言えなかった時期があるなら、その心の流れを述べてください。それがご自身の不安なのか兄への配慮なのかによって、責任の形が変わります。,如果有一段时期您没能在哥哥面前明确说出自己常去，请说明那份心情的脉络。那究竟是您自己的不安还是对哥哥的顾虑，会改变责任的样貌。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 잦은 방문이 의심으로 비치는 부담을 인정하되, 자리에서 한 일과 어머니 반응을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the burden of frequent visits appearing suspicious, but have him separate what he did during those visits from the mother's reactions.",共感アプローチ。頻繁な訪問が疑いとして見える負担を認めつつ、その場でしたことと母の反応を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认频繁探访看起来像疑点所造成的负担，但引导其区分现场所做的事和母亲反应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-visit_pattern-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 곁에 있었다는 사실과 그 자리에서 어떤 이야기가 오갔는지는 다른 문제입니다. 두 가지를 나누어, 본인이 한 일부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you were beside your mother and what was discussed there are separate issues. Separate the two and begin with what you did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母のそばにいた事実と、その場でどのような話が交わされたのかは別の問題です。二つを分け、ご自身がしたことから述べてください。,尹正厚先生，您在母亲身边这一事实，与当时谈了什么，是不同的问题。请区分两者，先从您做过的事说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 요양보호사 교체에 대해 윤태성이 들은 경로와 직접 본 사실을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate the route by which Yoon Tae-seong heard about the caregiver change from the facts he saw directly.,事実追及。介護職員の交代について、ユン・テソンが聞いた経路と直接見た事実を切り分ける。,事实追问。区分尹泰成听说护理员更换的渠道与他亲眼所见的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증을 앞두고 어머니 담당 요양보호사가 교체된 사실을 본인이 언제 어디서 알게 되셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state when and where you learned that the caregiver assigned to your mother had been replaced ahead of the notarization.",ユン・テソンさん、公証を前に母担当の介護職員が交代した事実を、ご自身がいつどこで知ったのか述べてください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您是在何时何地得知母亲的负责护理员在公证前被更换这一事实的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 요양보호사 교체에 대해 윤태성이 들은 경로와 직접 본 사실을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate the route by which Yoon Tae-seong heard about the caregiver change from the facts he saw directly.,事実追及。介護職員の交代について、ユン・テソンが聞いた経路と直接見た事実を切り分ける。,事实追问。区分尹泰成听说护理员更换的渠道与他亲眼所见的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v2].text,교체와 관련해 본인이 들은 이야기와 본인이 직접 확인한 사실을 따로 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately what you heard about the change and what you personally confirmed.,交代に関してご自身が聞いた話と、ご自身が直接確認した事実を分けて答えてください。,请分别回答您听说的关于更换的说法，以及您亲自确认的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 요양보호사 교체에 대해 윤태성이 들은 경로와 직접 본 사실을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate the route by which Yoon Tae-seong heard about the caregiver change from the facts he saw directly.,事実追及。介護職員の交代について、ユン・テソンが聞いた経路と直接見た事実を切り分ける。,事实追问。区分尹泰成听说护理员更换的渠道与他亲眼所见的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v3].text,"전 요양보호사의 음성 증언과 본인이 들은 교체 이유가 다르다면, 그 차이를 사실관계만으로 짚어 주십시오.","If the previous caregiver's voice testimony differs from the reason for the change that you heard, point out that difference using only the facts.",前任の介護職員の音声証言と、ご自身が聞いた交代理由が異なるなら、その違いを事実関係だけで指摘してください。,如果前护理员的语音证言与您听说的更换理由不同，请只根据事实关系指出其中差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 요양보호사 교체에 대해 윤태성이 들은 경로와 직접 본 사실을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate the route by which Yoon Tae-seong heard about the caregiver change from the facts he saw directly.,事実追及。介護職員の交代について、ユン・テソンが聞いた経路と直接見た事実を切り分ける。,事实追问。区分尹泰成听说护理员更换的渠道与他亲眼所见的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v4].text,본인이 기록으로 본 교체 시점과 당시 가족이 들은 설명이 어긋나는지 정리해 주십시오.,Please organize whether the timing of the change you saw in the records conflicts with the explanation the family heard at the time.,ご自身が記録で見た交代時期と、当時家族が聞いた説明が食い違うのか整理してください。,请整理您从记录中看到的更换时间，是否与当时家人听到的说明不一致。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 요양보호사 교체에 대해 윤태성이 들은 경로와 직접 본 사실을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate the route by which Yoon Tae-seong heard about the caregiver change from the facts he saw directly.,事実追及。介護職員の交代について、ユン・テソンが聞いた経路と直接見た事実を切り分ける。,事实追问。区分尹泰成听说护理员更换的渠道与他亲眼所见的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-caregiver_change-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 교체 경위에 대해 본인이 추정으로 채운 부분이 있다면 그 부분부터 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there are parts of the circumstances of the change that you filled in by inference, separate those parts first in your answer.",ユン・テソンさん、交代の経緯についてご自身が推測で補った部分があるなら、まずその部分を切り分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，关于更换经过，如果有您用推测补上的部分，请先把这些部分区分出来回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 직접 본 사실과 전해 들은 사실을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate the facts he saw directly from what he heard from others.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが直接見た事実と伝え聞いた事実を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分亲眼所见的事实和转述听来的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 유서에 서명할 무렵 본인이 직접 입회한 자리는 어디까지였습니까. 본인이 본 장면과 들어서 알게 된 장면을 시간순으로 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, how much of the setting were you personally present for around the time your mother signed the will? Please separate, in chronological order, the scenes you saw from the scenes you learned about by hearing them.",ユン・テソンさん、母が遺言書に署名した頃、ご自身が直接立ち会った場はどこまででしたか。ご自身が見た場面と、聞いて知った場面を時系列で分けて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，在母亲签署遗嘱前后，您亲自到场的范围到哪里为止？请按时间顺序区分您亲眼看到的场景和听说后才知道的场景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 직접 본 사실과 전해 들은 사실을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate the facts he saw directly from what he heard from others.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが直接見た事実と伝え聞いた事実を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分亲眼所见的事实和转述听来的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,"어머니가 유서 내용을 듣거나 읽으신 자리에 본인이 함께 있었다면 그 장면을 먼저 말씀하시고, 그렇지 않다면 누구로부터 어떻게 전해 들으셨는지 분리해 답해 주십시오.","If you were present when your mother heard or read the contents of the will, describe that scene first. If not, answer separately who told you about it and how.",母が遺言書の内容を聞いたり読んだりした場にご自身が同席していたなら、その場面を先に述べてください。そうでないなら、誰からどのように伝え聞いたのか分けて答えてください。,如果母亲听取或阅读遗嘱内容时您在场，请先说明那个场景；如果不在场，请区分说明您是从谁那里、如何听说的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 직접 본 사실과 전해 들은 사실을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate the facts he saw directly from what he heard from others.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが直接見た事実と伝え聞いた事実を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分亲眼所见的事实和转述听来的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,동생은 어머니가 유서 내용을 이해하고 뜻을 표시하셨다고 진술합니다. 본인이 같은 시기에 본 어머니 모습과 어긋나는 부분이 있다면 사실관계 중심으로 짚어 주십시오.,"Your younger brother states that your mother understood the contents of the will and expressed her wishes. If that conflicts with your own view of your mother during the same period, point out the discrepancy with a focus on the facts.",弟は、母が遺言書の内容を理解し意思を示したと述べています。同じ時期にご自身が見た母の様子と食い違う部分があるなら、事実関係を中心に指摘してください。,弟弟陈述称母亲理解了遗嘱内容并表达了意愿。如果这与您同一时期看到的母亲状态有不一致之处，请以事实关系为中心指出。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 직접 본 사실과 전해 들은 사실을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate the facts he saw directly from what he heard from others.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが直接見た事実と伝え聞いた事実を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分亲眼所见的事实和转述听来的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,공증된 서류에 남은 절차와 본인이 기억하는 어머니 상태가 어디에서 갈리는지 기록 쪽과 본인 기억 쪽을 따로 정리해 주십시오.,"Please separately organize where the procedure recorded in the notarized documents diverges from the condition of your mother as you remember it, distinguishing the records from your own memory.",公証された書類に残った手続きと、ご自身が記憶している母の状態がどこで分かれるのか、記録の側とご自身の記憶の側を分けて整理してください。,请分别从记录一方和您记忆一方，整理公证文件中留下的程序与您记忆中的母亲状态在哪里出现分歧。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 직접 본 사실과 전해 들은 사실을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate the facts he saw directly from what he heard from others.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが直接見た事実と伝え聞いた事実を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分亲眼所见的事实和转述听来的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 의심의 근거 가운데 본인이 직접 확인한 사실과 추정으로 채워 둔 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, among the grounds for your suspicion, separate what you personally confirmed from what you filled in by inference.",ユン・テソンさん、疑いの根拠のうち、ご自身が直接確認した事実と推測で補った部分を切り分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，在您怀疑的依据中，请区分您亲自确认的事实和用推测补上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 자발 의사를 윤태성이 직접 본 범위로 한정해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong limit his answer about the mother's voluntary intent to what he directly saw.,事実追及。母の自発的な意思について、ユン・テソンが直接見た範囲に限って答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成将关于母亲自愿意愿的回答限定在他亲眼所见的范围内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 유서 내용을 이해하고 스스로 뜻을 표시하셨다고 볼 만한 장면 가운데 본인이 직접 목격한 것이 있다면 어느 자리였는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you personally witnessed any scene suggesting that your mother understood the contents of the will and expressed her wishes on her own, please state where that was.",ユン・テソンさん、母が遺言書の内容を理解し、自ら意思を示したと見られる場面のうち、ご自身が直接目撃したものがあるなら、それがどの場だったのか述べてください。,尹泰成先生，如果您亲眼见过能看出母亲理解遗嘱内容并自行表达意愿的场景，请说明那是在什么场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 자발 의사를 윤태성이 직접 본 범위로 한정해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong limit his answer about the mother's voluntary intent to what he directly saw.,事実追及。母の自発的な意思について、ユン・テソンが直接見た範囲に限って答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成将关于母亲自愿意愿的回答限定在他亲眼所见的范围内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v2].text,어머니가 보이신 반응 가운데 본인이 본 부분과 가족이나 요양원 직원에게서 옮겨 들은 부분을 따로 정리해 주십시오.,Please separately organize the parts of your mother's reactions that you saw and the parts you heard from family members or care home staff.,母が見せた反応のうち、ご自身が見た部分と、家族や介護施設の職員から伝え聞いた部分を分けて整理してください。,请分别整理母亲表现出的反应中，您亲眼看到的部分，以及从家人或疗养院工作人员那里转述听来的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 자발 의사를 윤태성이 직접 본 범위로 한정해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong limit his answer about the mother's voluntary intent to what he directly saw.,事実追及。母の自発的な意思について、ユン・テソンが直接見た範囲に限って答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成将关于母亲自愿意愿的回答限定在他亲眼所见的范围内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v3].text,동생은 어머니가 고개를 끄덕이거나 짧게 답을 남기셨다고 진술합니다. 같은 시기에 본인이 본 어머니 상태와 어긋나는 지점이 있다면 사실관계만 답해 주십시오.,"Your younger brother states that your mother nodded or gave brief answers. If that conflicts with the condition of your mother you saw at the same time, answer only with the facts.",弟は、母がうなずいたり短く返答を残したりしたと述べています。同じ時期にご自身が見た母の状態と食い違う点があるなら、事実関係だけを答えてください。,弟弟陈述称母亲曾点头或留下简短回答。如果这与同一时期您看到的母亲状态有不一致之处，请只回答事实关系。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 자발 의사를 윤태성이 직접 본 범위로 한정해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong limit his answer about the mother's voluntary intent to what he directly saw.,事実追及。母の自発的な意思について、ユン・テソンが直接見た範囲に限って答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成将关于母亲自愿意愿的回答限定在他亲眼所见的范围内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v4].text,"의무기록과 본인이 기억하는 어머니 모습이 다른 부분이 있다면, 기록 쪽과 본인 기억 쪽을 따로 답해 주십시오.","If the medical records differ from how you remember your mother, answer separately for the records and for your own memory.",医療記録とご自身が記憶している母の様子が異なる部分があるなら、記録の側とご自身の記憶の側を分けて答えてください。,如果医疗记录与您记忆中的母亲状态有不同之处，请分别从记录一方和您记忆一方作答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 자발 의사를 윤태성이 직접 본 범위로 한정해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong limit his answer about the mother's voluntary intent to what he directly saw.,事実追及。母の自発的な意思について、ユン・テソンが直接見た範囲に限って答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成将关于母亲自愿意愿的回答限定在他亲眼所见的范围内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-mother_intent-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 의사라고 단정하는 부분 가운데 본인이 추정으로 채운 부분이 섞여 있다면 그 부분부터 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if any part of what you assert to be your mother's wishes includes something you filled in by inference, separate that part first.",ユン・テソンさん、母の意思だと断定している部分の中に、ご自身が推測で補った部分が混じっているなら、まずその部分を切り分けてください。,尹泰成先生，在您断定为母亲意愿的部分中，如果混有您用推测补上的内容，请先区分出那部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 일정 동안 윤태성의 위치와 정보 공백을 사실로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong organize, as facts, where he was during the notarization schedule and what information gaps existed.",事実追及。公証日程の間のユン・テソンの所在と情報の空白を、事実として整理させる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成以事实整理公证日程期间自己的位置与信息空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증일 전후로 본인이 어머니를 뵌 마지막 날짜와 그날 어머니 상태를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state, in chronological order, the last date you saw your mother around the notarization date and her condition that day.",ユン・テソンさん、公証日の前後でご自身が母に会った最後の日付と、その日の母の状態を時系列で述べてください。,尹泰成先生，请按时间顺序说明公证日前后您最后一次见到母亲的日期，以及当天母亲的状态。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 일정 동안 윤태성의 위치와 정보 공백을 사실로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong organize, as facts, where he was during the notarization schedule and what information gaps existed.",事実追及。公証日程の間のユン・テソンの所在と情報の空白を、事実として整理させる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成以事实整理公证日程期间自己的位置与信息空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v2].text,공증 절차와 관련해 본인이 직접 들은 일과 다른 사람으로부터 옮겨 들은 일을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,"Regarding the notarization procedure, separate what you heard directly from what you heard secondhand from others.",公証手続きに関して、ご自身が直接聞いたことと、他の人から伝え聞いたことを分けて答えてください。,关于公证程序，请区分您直接听到的事和从他人那里转述听来的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 일정 동안 윤태성의 위치와 정보 공백을 사실로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong organize, as facts, where he was during the notarization schedule and what information gaps existed.",事実追及。公証日程の間のユン・テソンの所在と情報の空白を、事実として整理させる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成以事实整理公证日程期间自己的位置与信息空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v3].text,공증 서류에 남은 일자와 본인이 그 시기에 본 어머니 상태가 어긋난다면 어느 부분에서 어긋나는지 답해 주십시오.,"If the dates left in the notarization documents conflict with the condition of your mother you saw at that time, answer where they conflict.",公証書類に残った日付と、その時期にご自身が見た母の状態が食い違うなら、どの部分で食い違うのか答えてください。,如果公证文件中留下的日期与您在那个时期看到的母亲状态不一致，请回答具体在哪里不一致。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 일정 동안 윤태성의 위치와 정보 공백을 사실로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong organize, as facts, where he was during the notarization schedule and what information gaps existed.",事実追及。公証日程の間のユン・テソンの所在と情報の空白を、事実として整理させる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成以事实整理公证日程期间自己的位置与信息空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v4].text,"공증 전후 일정 가운데 본인이 함께 있지 못한 시간이 있다면, 그 공백 동안 누가 어머니 곁에 있었는지 알고 있는 사실만 정리해 주십시오.","If there were times around the notarization when you could not be present, organize only the facts you know about who was beside your mother during those gaps.",公証前後の日程の中でご自身が同席できなかった時間があるなら、その空白の間に誰が母のそばにいたのか、知っている事実だけを整理してください。,如果公证前后日程中有您无法在场的时间，请只整理您知道的事实：那段空白期间谁在母亲身边。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 일정 동안 윤태성의 위치와 정보 공백을 사실로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong organize, as facts, where he was during the notarization schedule and what information gaps existed.",事実追及。公証日程の間のユン・テソンの所在と情報の空白を、事実として整理させる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成以事实整理公证日程期间自己的位置与信息空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-notarization_flow-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증 절차에 본인이 빠져 있던 이유보다, 그날 본인의 일정부터 사실 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, before explaining why you were absent from the notarization procedure, please state your own schedule that day exactly as it was.",ユン・テソンさん、公証手続きにご自身が加わっていなかった理由よりも、まずその日のご自身の日程を事実どおりに述べてください。,尹泰成先生，比起说明您缺席公证程序的理由，请先如实说明您当天的日程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 종이 읽기 장면에 대해 윤태성이 직접 본 부분과 옮겨 들은 부분을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate what Yoon Tae-seong directly saw and what he heard secondhand regarding the scene where the paper was read aloud.,事実追及。紙を読み聞かせた場面について、ユン・テソンが直接見た部分と伝え聞いた部分を切り分ける。,事实追问。关于读纸张的场景，区分尹泰成亲眼看到的部分和转述听来的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생이 어머니께 종이를 읽어드렸다는 장면을 본인이 직접 보았다면 그 장면을 말씀하시고, 보지 못했다면 누구에게서 들으셨는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you personally saw the scene where your younger brother read the paper aloud to your mother, describe it. If you did not see it, answer who you heard it from.",ユン・テソンさん、弟が母に紙を読み聞かせたという場面をご自身が直接見たならその場面を述べ、見ていないなら誰から聞いたのか答えてください。,尹泰成先生，如果您亲眼看到弟弟给母亲读纸张的场景，请说明那个场景；如果没有看到，请回答您是从谁那里听说的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 종이 읽기 장면에 대해 윤태성이 직접 본 부분과 옮겨 들은 부분을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate what Yoon Tae-seong directly saw and what he heard secondhand regarding the scene where the paper was read aloud.,事実追及。紙を読み聞かせた場面について、ユン・テソンが直接見た部分と伝え聞いた部分を切り分ける。,事实追问。关于读纸张的场景，区分尹泰成亲眼看到的部分和转述听来的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v2].text,본인이 그 자리에 도착하기 전과 후에 무엇이 달라져 있었는지 본인 기억대로 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize, as you remember it, what had changed before and after you arrived at that place.",ご自身がその場に到着する前と後で何が変わっていたのか、ご自身の記憶どおりに整理してください。,请按照您的记忆，整理您到达那个场所前后有什么变化。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 종이 읽기 장면에 대해 윤태성이 직접 본 부분과 옮겨 들은 부분을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate what Yoon Tae-seong directly saw and what he heard secondhand regarding the scene where the paper was read aloud.,事実追及。紙を読み聞かせた場面について、ユン・テソンが直接見た部分と伝え聞いた部分を切り分ける。,事实追问。关于读纸张的场景，区分尹泰成亲眼看到的部分和转述听来的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v3].text,전 요양보호사 증언과 본인이 들은 동생의 설명이 어긋나는 지점을 사실관계 중심으로 짚어 주십시오.,"Please point out, with a focus on the facts, where the previous caregiver's testimony conflicts with the explanation you heard from your younger brother.",前任の介護職員の証言と、ご自身が聞いた弟の説明が食い違う点を、事実関係を中心に指摘してください。,请以事实关系为中心，指出前护理员证言与您听到的弟弟说明之间不一致的地方。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 종이 읽기 장면에 대해 윤태성이 직접 본 부분과 옮겨 들은 부분을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate what Yoon Tae-seong directly saw and what he heard secondhand regarding the scene where the paper was read aloud.,事実追及。紙を読み聞かせた場面について、ユン・テソンが直接見た部分と伝え聞いた部分を切り分ける。,事实追问。关于读纸张的场景，区分尹泰成亲眼看到的部分和转述听来的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v4].text,"종이를 읽어드린 자리에 누가 입회했고 누가 입회하지 못했는지, 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize, within what you know, who was present and who was not present when the paper was read aloud.",紙を読み聞かせた場に誰が立ち会い、誰が立ち会えなかったのか、ご自身が知っている範囲で整理してください。,请在您知道的范围内，整理读纸张时谁在场、谁未能在场。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 종이 읽기 장면에 대해 윤태성이 직접 본 부분과 옮겨 들은 부분을 분리한다.,Fact probing. Separate what Yoon Tae-seong directly saw and what he heard secondhand regarding the scene where the paper was read aloud.,事実追及。紙を読み聞かせた場面について、ユン・テソンが直接見た部分と伝え聞いた部分を切り分ける。,事实追问。关于读纸张的场景，区分尹泰成亲眼看到的部分和转述听来的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-paper_reading-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 종이 읽기 장면에 대해 본인이 추정으로 채운 부분이 있다면 그 부분부터 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there are parts of the scene where the paper was read that you filled in by inference, separate those parts first in your answer.",ユン・テソンさん、紙を読む場面についてご自身が推測で補った部分があるなら、まずその部分を切り分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，关于读纸张的场景，如果有您用推测补上的部分，请先把这些部分区分出来回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 빈도에 대한 윤태성의 직접 관찰과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate his direct observations about visit frequency from his inferences.,事実追及。訪問頻度について、ユン・テソンの直接観察と推測を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分关于探访频率的直接观察和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 그 시기에 어머니를 뵌 횟수와 동생이 다녀갔다고 들은 횟수를 본인 일정 중심으로 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please organize, centered on your own schedule, how many times you saw your mother during that period and how many times you heard your younger brother had visited.",ユン・テソンさん、その時期にご自身が母に会った回数と、弟が訪ねたと聞いた回数を、ご自身の日程を中心に整理してください。,尹泰成先生，请以您自己的日程为中心，整理那段时期您见母亲的次数，以及听说弟弟探访的次数。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 빈도에 대한 윤태성의 직접 관찰과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate his direct observations about visit frequency from his inferences.,事実追及。訪問頻度について、ユン・テソンの直接観察と推測を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分关于探访频率的直接观察和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v2].text,본인이 직접 본 동생의 방문 장면과 요양원 직원에게서 옮겨 들은 방문 빈도를 따로 답해 주십시오.,Answer separately for the scenes of your younger brother's visits that you saw directly and the visit frequency you heard about from care home staff.,ご自身が直接見た弟の訪問場面と、介護施設の職員から伝え聞いた訪問頻度を分けて答えてください。,请分别回答您亲眼看到的弟弟探访场景，以及从疗养院工作人员那里转述听来的探访频率。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 빈도에 대한 윤태성의 직접 관찰과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate his direct observations about visit frequency from his inferences.,事実追及。訪問頻度について、ユン・テソンの直接観察と推測を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分关于探访频率的直接观察和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v3].text,요양원 방문기록은 동생의 출입이 늘어난 시기를 보여 줍니다. 같은 시기에 본인이 본 동생의 모습과 기록의 빈도가 어긋나는 지점이 있는지 답해 주십시오.,The Care Home Visit Logs show when your younger brother's entries increased. Answer whether that frequency in the records conflicts with what you saw of your younger brother during the same period.,介護施設の訪問記録は、弟の出入りが増えた時期を示しています。同じ時期にご自身が見た弟の様子と記録上の頻度に食い違う点があるのか答えてください。,疗养院探访记录显示弟弟出入增加的时期。请回答同一时期您看到的弟弟情况与记录中的频率是否有不一致之处。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 빈도에 대한 윤태성의 직접 관찰과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate his direct observations about visit frequency from his inferences.,事実追及。訪問頻度について、ユン・テソンの直接観察と推測を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分关于探访频率的直接观察和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v4].text,"본인이 기억하는 방문 빈도와 방문기록에 남은 빈도를 그대로 비교해, 본인이 채우지 못한 공백이 어디인지 짚어 주십시오.","Compare the visit frequency you remember with the frequency left in the visit records as they are, and point out where the gaps are that you cannot fill.",ご自身が記憶している訪問頻度と、訪問記録に残った頻度をそのまま比較し、ご自身が埋められない空白がどこなのか指摘してください。,请如实比较您记忆中的探访频率与探访记录中留下的频率，并指出您无法填补的空白在哪里。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 빈도에 대한 윤태성의 직접 관찰과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Tae-seong separate his direct observations about visit frequency from his inferences.,事実追及。訪問頻度について、ユン・テソンの直接観察と推測を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成区分关于探访频率的直接观察和推测。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-visit_pattern-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생 방문이 잦아진 이유에 대한 본인의 추정과 본인이 본 사실을 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, separate your inference about why your younger brother's visits became more frequent from the facts you saw.",ユン・テソンさん、弟の訪問が増えた理由についてのご自身の推測と、ご自身が見た事実を分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请区分您对弟弟探访变频繁原因的推测，以及您亲眼看到的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 교체에 윤정후가 관여한 행동과 단순 의견 제출을 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish actions through which he was involved in the change from merely giving an opinion.,事実追及。交代にユン・ジョンフが関与した行動と、単に意見を出したことを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己参与更换的具体行为和单纯提出意见。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증 직전 어머니 담당 요양보호사가 바뀐 경위를 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state, in chronological order and within what you know, the circumstances under which the caregiver assigned to your mother changed just before notarization.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証直前に母担当の介護職員が変わった経緯を、ご自身が知っている範囲で時系列に述べてください。,尹正厚先生，请在您知道的范围内，按时间顺序说明公证前母亲负责护理员更换的经过。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 교체에 윤정후가 관여한 행동과 단순 의견 제출을 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish actions through which he was involved in the change from merely giving an opinion.,事実追及。交代にユン・ジョンフが関与した行動と、単に意見を出したことを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己参与更换的具体行为和单纯提出意见。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v2].text,교체에 본인이 관여했다면 본인이 직접 한 행동과 단순히 의견을 낸 것을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,"If you were involved in the change, separate the actions you personally took from simply giving an opinion.",交代にご自身が関与したなら、ご自身が直接した行動と、単に意見を出したことを分けて答えてください。,如果您参与了更换，请区分您亲自做出的行为和只是提出意见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 교체에 윤정후가 관여한 행동과 단순 의견 제출을 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish actions through which he was involved in the change from merely giving an opinion.,事実追及。交代にユン・ジョンフが関与した行動と、単に意見を出したことを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己参与更换的具体行为和单纯提出意见。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v3].text,전 요양보호사의 증언과 본인이 진술해 온 교체 이유가 어긋나는 지점이 있는지 답해 주십시오.,Answer whether there is any point where the previous caregiver's testimony conflicts with the reason for the change that you have stated.,前任の介護職員の証言と、ご自身が述べてきた交代理由が食い違う点があるのか答えてください。,请回答前护理员的证言与您一直陈述的更换理由是否有不一致之处。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 교체에 윤정후가 관여한 행동과 단순 의견 제출을 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish actions through which he was involved in the change from merely giving an opinion.,事実追及。交代にユン・ジョンフが関与した行動と、単に意見を出したことを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己参与更换的具体行为和单纯提出意见。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v4].text,요양원 측 기록과 본인이 기억하는 교체 시점을 나란히 놓고 다른 부분을 짚어 주십시오.,"Place the care home's records beside the timing of the change as you remember it, and point out any differences.",介護施設側の記録と、ご自身が記憶している交代時期を並べ、異なる部分を指摘してください。,请将疗养院方面记录与您记忆中的更换时间并列比较，指出不同之处。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 교체에 윤정후가 관여한 행동과 단순 의견 제출을 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish actions through which he was involved in the change from merely giving an opinion.,事実追及。交代にユン・ジョンフが関与した行動と、単に意見を出したことを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己参与更换的具体行为和单纯提出意见。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-caregiver_change-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 교체가 공증 일정과 맞물린 사정에 대해 본인이 직접 알고 있는 사실만 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, regarding the circumstances in which the change coincided with the notarization schedule, answer only with facts you personally know.",ユン・ジョンフさん、交代が公証日程と重なった事情について、ご自身が直接知っている事実だけを答えてください。,尹正厚先生，关于更换与公证日程相互重叠的情况，请只回答您亲自知道的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 절차에서 직접 한 행동과 어머니 자발 행위를 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish what he personally did in the procedure from the mother's voluntary actions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手続きで直接した行動と、母の自発的な行為を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己在程序中亲自做的行为和母亲自愿的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 유서 작성 자리에서 어머니께 내용을 누가 어떻게 설명했고 어머니가 어떤 반응을 보이셨는지 그 자리를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, at the will-writing scene, who explained the contents to your mother, how, and how did your mother react? Please describe that scene in chronological order.",ユン・ジョンフさん、遺言書作成の場で母に内容を誰がどのように説明し、母がどのような反応を見せたのか、その場を時系列で述べてください。,尹正厚先生，在遗嘱订立现场，是谁如何向母亲说明内容，母亲又有什么反应？请按时间顺序说明那个场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 절차에서 직접 한 행동과 어머니 자발 행위를 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish what he personally did in the procedure from the mother's voluntary actions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手続きで直接した行動と、母の自発的な行為を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己在程序中亲自做的行为和母亲自愿的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].text,본인이 직접 한 행동과 옆에서 도왔을 뿐이라고 진술해 온 행동을 분리해 답해 주십시오. 종이를 들고 읽어드린 일과 펜을 쥐여 드린 일을 따로 답하시면 됩니다.,Please separate actions you took directly from actions you have described as merely helping beside her. You may answer separately about holding and reading the paper aloud and about placing the pen in her hand.,ご自身が直接した行動と、そばで手伝っただけだと述べてきた行動を分けて答えてください。紙を持って読み聞かせたことと、ペンを握らせたことを別々に答えれば結構です。,请区分您亲自做的行为，以及您一直称只是从旁协助的行为。可以分别回答拿着纸读给她听，以及把笔交到她手里的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 절차에서 직접 한 행동과 어머니 자발 행위를 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish what he personally did in the procedure from the mother's voluntary actions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手続きで直接した行動と、母の自発的な行為を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己在程序中亲自做的行为和母亲自愿的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].text,형은 본인이 어머니 의사를 대신 정한 것으로 보이는 대목이 있다고 진술합니다. 그날 본인이 직접 한 일 가운데 형이 잘못 옮겼다고 보는 부분이 있다면 짚어 주십시오.,"Your brother states that some parts appear as though you decided your mother's wishes on her behalf. If there is any part of what you personally did that day that you believe your brother has misrepresented, point it out.",兄は、ご自身が母の意思を代わりに決めたように見える部分があると述べています。その日ご自身が直接したことのうち、兄が誤って伝えていると見る部分があるなら指摘してください。,哥哥陈述称，有些部分看起来像是您代替母亲决定了意愿。在您当天亲自做的事中，如果您认为哥哥转述错误，请指出。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 절차에서 직접 한 행동과 어머니 자발 행위를 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish what he personally did in the procedure from the mother's voluntary actions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手続きで直接した行動と、母の自発的な行為を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己在程序中亲自做的行为和母亲自愿的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].text,공증 서류에 남은 절차와 그 자리에 있던 사람들의 기억이 어떻게 다른지 기록 기준으로 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize, based on the records, how the procedure left in the notarization documents differs from the memories of the people who were present.",公証書類に残った手続きと、その場にいた人々の記憶がどのように異なるのか、記録を基準に整理してください。,请以记录为基准，整理公证文件中留下的程序与在场人员的记忆有何不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 절차에서 직접 한 행동과 어머니 자발 행위를 갈라 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu distinguish what he personally did in the procedure from the mother's voluntary actions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手続きで直接した行動と、母の自発的な行為を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己在程序中亲自做的行为和母亲自愿的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 어머니께 설명한 말과 어머니께서 스스로 꺼내신 말을 구분해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please distinguish the words you explained to your mother from the words your mother brought up herself.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身が母に説明した言葉と、母が自ら口にした言葉を区別して答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请区分您向母亲说明的话，以及母亲自己说出的话。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후의 해석과 어머니의 자발 표현을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate his interpretation from the mother's voluntary expressions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフの解釈と母の自発的な表現を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己的解读和母亲的自发表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니가 유서 내용을 이해하셨다고 본인이 판단한 근거가 그 자리에서 어떤 말과 행동이었는지 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order what words and actions at that scene led you to judge that your mother understood the contents of the will.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母が遺言書の内容を理解していたとご自身が判断した根拠が、その場のどのような言葉と行動だったのか、時系列で述べてください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明，在那个场合有哪些话语和行为让您判断母亲理解了遗嘱内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후의 해석과 어머니의 자발 표현을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate his interpretation from the mother's voluntary expressions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフの解釈と母の自発的な表現を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己的解读和母亲的自发表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v2].text,어머니가 직접 보이신 반응과 본인이 그 의미를 풀어 설명한 부분을 따로 정리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separately organize your mother's direct reactions and the parts where you explained what those reactions meant.,母が直接見せた反応と、ご自身がその意味を解いて説明した部分を分けて整理し、答えてください。,请分别整理母亲直接表现出的反应，以及您解释其含义的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후의 해석과 어머니의 자발 표현을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate his interpretation from the mother's voluntary expressions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフの解釈と母の自発的な表現を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己的解读和母亲的自发表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v3].text,형은 그 무렵 어머니 판단이 흐려져 있었다고 봅니다. 같은 시기에 본인이 어머니께 설명한 내용 가운데 어머니가 스스로 답하신 부분만 짚어 주십시오.,"Your brother believes your mother's judgment was clouded around that time. From what you explained to your mother during the same period, point out only the parts your mother answered on her own.",兄は、その頃母の判断が曇っていたと見ています。同じ時期にご自身が母に説明した内容のうち、母が自ら答えた部分だけを指摘してください。,哥哥认为那时母亲的判断已经变得不清晰。请只指出同一时期您向母亲说明的内容中，母亲自行回答的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후의 해석과 어머니의 자발 표현을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate his interpretation from the mother's voluntary expressions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフの解釈と母の自発的な表現を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己的解读和母亲的自发表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v4].text,의무기록과 본인이 어머니의 반응으로 진술해 온 내용을 나란히 놓고 어디가 어긋나는지 답해 주십시오.,"Place the medical records alongside what you have stated as your mother's reactions, and answer where they conflict.",医療記録と、ご自身が母の反応として述べてきた内容を並べ、どこが食い違うのか答えてください。,请将医疗记录与您一直陈述为母亲反应的内容并列比较，回答哪里不一致。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후의 해석과 어머니의 자발 표현을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate his interpretation from the mother's voluntary expressions.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフの解釈と母の自発的な表現を切り分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分自己的解读和母亲的自发表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-mother_intent-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 의사라고 진술한 항목 가운데 본인 해석이 들어간 부분을 먼저 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, among the points you have stated as your mother's wishes, first separate the parts that include your own interpretation.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思だと述べた項目のうち、ご自身の解釈が入った部分を先に切り分けてください。,尹正厚先生，在您陈述为母亲意愿的事项中，请先区分出包含您本人解读的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 절차의 단계와 윤정후가 직접 처리한 작업을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer, in chronological order, the stages of the notarization procedure and the tasks he handled personally.",事実追及。公証手続きの段階と、ユン・ジョンフが直接処理した作業を時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答公证程序的阶段，以及他亲自处理的工作。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증을 받기까지 서류 준비, 공증인 방문, 어머니 동행을 누가 어떤 순서로 진행했는지 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order who handled document preparation, the notary's visit, and accompanying your mother, and in what sequence, up to the notarization.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証を受けるまでの書類準備、公証人の訪問、母の同行を、誰がどの順序で進めたのか時系列で述べてください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明在完成公证之前，文件准备、公证人到访、陪同母亲分别由谁以什么顺序进行。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 절차의 단계와 윤정후가 직접 처리한 작업을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer, in chronological order, the stages of the notarization procedure and the tasks he handled personally.",事実追及。公証手続きの段階と、ユン・ジョンフが直接処理した作業を時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答公证程序的阶段，以及他亲自处理的工作。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v2].text,본인이 직접 처리한 절차와 외부에 맡긴 절차를 따로 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately for the procedures you handled personally and the procedures you entrusted to someone outside.,ご自身が直接処理した手続きと、外部に任せた手続きを分けて答えてください。,请分别回答您亲自处理的程序，以及委托外部人员处理的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 절차의 단계와 윤정후가 직접 처리한 작업을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer, in chronological order, the stages of the notarization procedure and the tasks he handled personally.",事実追及。公証手続きの段階と、ユン・ジョンフが直接処理した作業を時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答公证程序的阶段，以及他亲自处理的工作。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v3].text,공증 서류에 남은 절차와 본인이 진술해 온 흐름이 다르다면 어느 단계에서 갈라지는지 짚어 주십시오.,"If the procedure left in the notarization documents differs from the flow you have stated, point out at which stage they diverge.",公証書類に残った手続きと、ご自身が述べてきた流れが異なるなら、どの段階で分かれるのか指摘してください。,如果公证文件中留下的程序与您一直陈述的流程不同，请指出从哪个阶段开始出现分歧。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 절차의 단계와 윤정후가 직접 처리한 작업을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer, in chronological order, the stages of the notarization procedure and the tasks he handled personally.",事実追及。公証手続きの段階と、ユン・ジョンフが直接処理した作業を時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答公证程序的阶段，以及他亲自处理的工作。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v4].text,공증 당일 어머니 상태를 본인이 어떻게 확인하고 어떻게 기록했는지 말씀해 주십시오.,Please state how you checked your mother's condition on the day of notarization and how you recorded it.,公証当日に母の状態をどのように確認し、どのように記録したのか述べてください。,请说明公证当天您如何确认母亲的状态，又如何记录。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 절차의 단계와 윤정후가 직접 처리한 작업을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer, in chronological order, the stages of the notarization procedure and the tasks he handled personally.",事実追及。公証手続きの段階と、ユン・ジョンフが直接処理した作業を時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答公证程序的阶段，以及他亲自处理的工作。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-notarization_flow-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 형에게 공증 일정을 알리지 않은 이유보다, 일정을 통보한 시점과 방식부터 사실 그대로 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, before explaining why you did not tell your brother the notarization schedule, organize the timing and method by which you notified him, exactly as the facts stand.",ユン・ジョンフさん、兄に公証日程を知らせなかった理由よりも、まず日程を通知した時点と方法を事実どおりに整理してください。,尹正厚先生，比起说明为什么没有告知哥哥公证日程，请先如实整理您通知日程的时间点和方式。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 자리를 마무리한 시각과 그 자리에서 한 행동을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer with the facts about when he concluded the meeting and what he did there.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフがその場を終えた時刻と、その場でした行動を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答他结束该场合的时间，以及在现场所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니께 종이를 읽어드린 자리에 본인이 들어간 시각과 자리를 마무리한 시각을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order the time you entered the place where you read the paper aloud to your mother and the time you concluded it.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母に紙を読み聞かせた場にご自身が入った時刻と、その場を終えた時刻を時系列で述べてください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明您进入给母亲读纸张的场合的时间，以及结束该场合的时间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 자리를 마무리한 시각과 그 자리에서 한 행동을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer with the facts about when he concluded the meeting and what he did there.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフがその場を終えた時刻と、その場でした行動を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答他结束该场合的时间，以及在现场所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v2].text,그 자리에서 본인이 직접 읽은 부분과 어머니께서 스스로 보신 부분을 따로 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately for the parts you read aloud yourself and the parts your mother viewed on her own.,その場でご自身が直接読んだ部分と、母が自分で見た部分を分けて答えてください。,请分别回答在那个场合中您亲自读出的部分，以及母亲自行查看的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 자리를 마무리한 시각과 그 자리에서 한 행동을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer with the facts about when he concluded the meeting and what he did there.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフがその場を終えた時刻と、その場でした行動を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答他结束该场合的时间，以及在现场所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v3].text,전 요양보호사는 본인이 형이 오기 전에 자리를 마치려 했다고 진술합니다. 같은 시각의 본인 행동을 사실관계만으로 설명해 주십시오.,The previous caregiver states that you tried to finish before your brother arrived. Please explain your actions at that same time using only the facts.,前任の介護職員は、ご自身が兄が来る前にその場を終えようとしたと述べています。同じ時刻のご自身の行動を、事実関係だけで説明してください。,前护理员陈述称，您试图在哥哥到来前结束该场合。请只根据事实关系说明同一时间您的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 자리를 마무리한 시각과 그 자리에서 한 행동을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer with the facts about when he concluded the meeting and what he did there.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフがその場を終えた時刻と、その場でした行動を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答他结束该场合的时间，以及在现场所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v4].text,"종이를 읽어드릴 때 어머니가 보이신 반응을 본인이 어떻게 확인했는지, 어떤 말이나 표정을 근거로 삼았는지 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize how you confirmed your mother's reactions while reading the paper aloud, and which words or expressions you used as the basis.",紙を読み聞かせるとき、母が見せた反応をご自身がどのように確認したのか、どのような言葉や表情を根拠にしたのか整理してください。,请整理您在读纸张时如何确认母亲的反应，以及以哪些话语或表情作为依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 자리를 마무리한 시각과 그 자리에서 한 행동을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer with the facts about when he concluded the meeting and what he did there.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフがその場を終えた時刻と、その場でした行動を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答他结束该场合的时间，以及在现场所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-paper_reading-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 형이 도착하기 전에 자리를 마치려 한 그 시각의 본인 일정부터 사실 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please begin by answering, exactly as the facts stand, your own schedule at the time you tried to finish before your brother arrived.",ユン・ジョンフさん、兄が到着する前にその場を終えようとしたその時刻のご自身の日程から、事実どおりに答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请先如实回答您试图在哥哥到来前结束该场合时的本人日程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 시점·체류·대화 화제를 윤정후 본인 기억으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer from his own memory about visit timing, length of stay, and topics of conversation.",事実追及。訪問時点、滞在、会話の話題について、ユン・ジョンフ本人の記憶で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚根据本人记忆回答探访时间、停留情况和谈话话题。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 시기에 어머니를 찾아간 날짜와 평균 체류 시간을 본인 일정 중심으로 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order, centered on your own schedule, the dates you visited your mother during that period and your average length of stay.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その時期に母を訪ねた日付と平均滞在時間を、ご自身の日程を中心に時系列で述べてください。,尹正厚先生，请以您自己的日程为中心，按时间顺序说明那段时期您探望母亲的日期和平均停留时间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 시점·체류·대화 화제를 윤정후 본인 기억으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer from his own memory about visit timing, length of stay, and topics of conversation.",事実追及。訪問時点、滞在、会話の話題について、ユン・ジョンフ本人の記憶で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚根据本人记忆回答探访时间、停留情况和谈话话题。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v2].text,"방문기록과 본인 기억이 다르다면, 본인 일정 쪽에서 다시 정리한 사실만 답해 주십시오.","If the visit records differ from your memory, answer only with the facts reorganized from your own schedule.",訪問記録とご自身の記憶が異なるなら、ご自身の日程の側から改めて整理した事実だけを答えてください。,如果探访记录与您的记忆不同，请只回答从您本人日程一方重新整理出的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 시점·체류·대화 화제를 윤정후 본인 기억으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer from his own memory about visit timing, length of stay, and topics of conversation.",事実追及。訪問時点、滞在、会話の話題について、ユン・ジョンフ本人の記憶で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚根据本人记忆回答探访时间、停留情况和谈话话题。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v3].text,형은 본인의 방문이 유서 이야기를 위한 것이었다고 봅니다. 같은 시기에 어머니와 나눈 대화 가운데 유서와 관련된 자리와 그렇지 않은 자리를 분리해 주십시오.,"Your brother believes your visits were for discussing the will. Among the conversations you had with your mother during that same period, separate the occasions related to the will from those that were not.",兄は、ご自身の訪問が遺言書の話のためだったと見ています。同じ時期に母と交わした会話のうち、遺言書に関係する場とそうでない場を分けてください。,哥哥认为您的探访是为了谈遗嘱。请在同一时期您与母亲的对话中，区分与遗嘱有关的场合和无关的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 시점·체류·대화 화제를 윤정후 본인 기억으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer from his own memory about visit timing, length of stay, and topics of conversation.",事実追及。訪問時点、滞在、会話の話題について、ユン・ジョンフ本人の記憶で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚根据本人记忆回答探访时间、停留情况和谈话话题。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v4].text,"방문기록의 빈도와 본인 기억이 어긋난다면, 본인이 더 자주 갔거나 덜 갔다고 기억하는 시점을 짚어 주십시오.","If the frequency in the visit records conflicts with your memory, point out when you remember visiting more often or less often.",訪問記録の頻度とご自身の記憶が食い違うなら、ご自身がより頻繁に行った、あるいは少なく行ったと記憶している時点を指摘してください。,如果探访记录中的频率与您的记忆不一致，请指出您记得自己去得更多或更少的时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 방문 시점·체류·대화 화제를 윤정후 본인 기억으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact probing. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer from his own memory about visit timing, length of stay, and topics of conversation.",事実追及。訪問時点、滞在、会話の話題について、ユン・ジョンフ本人の記憶で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚根据本人记忆回答探访时间、停留情况和谈话话题。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-visit_pattern-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 방문이 늘어난 시기에 본인이 어머니께 꺼낸 화제를 사실 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state exactly as facts the topics you brought up with your mother during the period when your visits increased.",ユン・ジョンフさん、訪問が増えた時期にご自身が母に持ち出した話題を、事実どおりに述べてください。,尹正厚先生，请如实说明您在探访增加的时期向母亲提起的话题。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v1].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 보호사 교체 자체를 의심으로 끌어들인 본인 판단 동기와, 형으로서 직접 묻지 않은 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the motive behind his own judgment in treating the caregiver change itself as suspicious from the reason he did not ask directly as the older brother.,動機探索。介護職員の交代そのものを疑いに結びつけた本人の判断の動機と、兄として直接尋ねなかった理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把护理员更换本身视为疑点的本人判断动机，以及作为哥哥没有直接询问的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 요양보호사 교체 자체를 의심의 근거로 본 데에는 본인의 어떤 기억이 작용했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state what memory of yours played into viewing the caregiver change itself as grounds for suspicion.",ユン・テソンさん、介護職員の交代そのものを疑いの根拠と見たことには、ご自身のどのような記憶が作用したのか述べてください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您把护理员更换本身视为怀疑依据时，是您本人的哪段记忆起了作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v2].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 보호사 교체 자체를 의심으로 끌어들인 본인 판단 동기와, 형으로서 직접 묻지 않은 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the motive behind his own judgment in treating the caregiver change itself as suspicious from the reason he did not ask directly as the older brother.,動機探索。介護職員の交代そのものを疑いに結びつけた本人の判断の動機と、兄として直接尋ねなかった理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把护理员更换本身视为疑点的本人判断动机，以及作为哥哥没有直接询问的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v2].text,"교체 시점에 형으로서 본인은 어디까지 알고 있었는지, 알면서도 묻지 않았다면 그 이유는 무엇입니까.","At the time of the change, how much did you know as the older brother, and if you knew but did not ask, what was the reason?",交代の時点で、兄としてご自身はどこまで知っていたのか、知っていながら尋ねなかったならその理由は何ですか。,在更换发生时，作为哥哥，您知道到什么程度？如果知道却没有询问，理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v3].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 보호사 교체 자체를 의심으로 끌어들인 본인 판단 동기와, 형으로서 직접 묻지 않은 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the motive behind his own judgment in treating the caregiver change itself as suspicious from the reason he did not ask directly as the older brother.,動機探索。介護職員の交代そのものを疑いに結びつけた本人の判断の動機と、兄として直接尋ねなかった理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把护理员更换本身视为疑点的本人判断动机，以及作为哥哥没有直接询问的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v3].text,새로 온 보호사에게 본인이 직접 어머니의 상태를 묻지 않고 동생의 행위로 의심을 돌린 이유가 있었습니까.,Was there a reason you did not ask the newly assigned caregiver directly about your mother's condition and instead turned your suspicion toward your younger brother's actions?,新しく来た介護職員にご自身で直接母の状態を尋ねず、弟の行動へ疑いを向けた理由がありましたか。,您没有直接向新来的护理员询问母亲的状态，而是把怀疑转向弟弟的行为，有什么理由吗？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v4].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 보호사 교체 자체를 의심으로 끌어들인 본인 판단 동기와, 형으로서 직접 묻지 않은 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the motive behind his own judgment in treating the caregiver change itself as suspicious from the reason he did not ask directly as the older brother.,動機探索。介護職員の交代そのものを疑いに結びつけた本人の判断の動機と、兄として直接尋ねなかった理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把护理员更换本身视为疑点的本人判断动机，以及作为哥哥没有直接询问的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v4].text,"교체가 공증 가까운 시점이라는 점이 본인의 의심을 굳히게 했다면, 그 연결을 만든 본인의 판단 과정을 설명하십시오.","If the fact that the change occurred close to the notarization strengthened your suspicion, explain your own judgment process that created that connection.",交代が公証に近い時点だったことがご自身の疑いを固めたのなら、その結びつきを作ったご自身の判断過程を説明してください。,如果更换发生在接近公证的时间点这一点加深了您的怀疑，请说明您本人如何作出这种关联判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v5].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 보호사 교체 자체를 의심으로 끌어들인 본인 판단 동기와, 형으로서 직접 묻지 않은 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the motive behind his own judgment in treating the caregiver change itself as suspicious from the reason he did not ask directly as the older brother.,動機探索。介護職員の交代そのものを疑いに結びつけた本人の判断の動機と、兄として直接尋ねなかった理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把护理员更换本身视为疑点的本人判断动机，以及作为哥哥没有直接询问的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-caregiver_change-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 보호사 교체에 대한 본인의 의심 가운데 직접 본 사실에 근거한 부분과 사후 추정에 의한 부분을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, among your suspicions about the caregiver change, please separate the parts based on facts you directly saw from the parts based on after-the-fact inference.",ユン・テソンさん、介護職員の交代に対するご自身の疑いのうち、直接見た事実に基づく部分と、事後の推測による部分を分けて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，关于您对护理员更换的怀疑，请区分基于亲眼所见事实的部分和基于事后推测的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 사실과 추정의 경계, 의심을 단정으로 키운 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.","Motive exploration. Have him answer about the boundary between facts he directly saw and inference, and the motive behind his own judgment in turning suspicion into certainty.",動機探索。直接見た事実と推測の境界、疑いを断定へ膨らませた本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答亲眼所见事实与推测之间的界限，以及将怀疑发展成断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 작성 자리에 본인이 직접 있었던 것이 아닌데도 어머니가 그 뜻이 아니었다고 단정한 본인 판단의 근거를 무엇에 두셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, although you were not personally present at the drafting scene, you concluded that this was not what your mother wanted. Please state what you based that judgment on.",ユン・テソンさん、作成の場にご自身が直接いたわけではないのに、母はその意思ではなかったと断定したご自身の判断の根拠を何に置いたのか述べてください。,尹泰成先生，您并未亲自在订立现场，却断定那并非母亲的意愿。请说明您作出这一判断的依据是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 사실과 추정의 경계, 의심을 단정으로 키운 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.","Motive exploration. Have him answer about the boundary between facts he directly saw and inference, and the motive behind his own judgment in turning suspicion into certainty.",動機探索。直接見た事実と推測の境界、疑いを断定へ膨らませた本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答亲眼所见事实与推测之间的界限，以及将怀疑发展成断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,"동생이 절차에 들어가 있다는 사실을 들은 뒤, 곧바로 어머니께 직접 확인하지 않고 의심으로 키워 간 이유는 무엇입니까.","After hearing that your younger brother was involved in the procedure, why did you let it grow into suspicion instead of confirming it directly with your mother right away?",弟が手続きに関わっている事実を聞いた後、すぐに母へ直接確認せず、疑いとして膨らませていった理由は何ですか。,听说弟弟参与了程序之后，您为什么没有立即直接向母亲确认，而是让它发展成怀疑？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 사실과 추정의 경계, 의심을 단정으로 키운 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.","Motive exploration. Have him answer about the boundary between facts he directly saw and inference, and the motive behind his own judgment in turning suspicion into certainty.",動機探索。直接見た事実と推測の境界、疑いを断定へ膨らませた本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答亲眼所见事实与推测之间的界限，以及将怀疑发展成断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,"형으로서 평생 모셨다는 위치가 유서에 대한 기대로 이어진 부분이 있다면, 그 마음의 흐름을 본인 선에서 설명해 주십시오.","If your position as the older brother who cared for her all your life led to expectations about the will, please explain that emotional progression from your own perspective.",兄として一生支えてきたという立場が遺言書への期待につながった部分があるなら、その心の流れをご自身の範囲で説明してください。,如果您作为哥哥、一生照料母亲的立场与对遗嘱的期待有所联系，请从您本人角度说明这份心情的流动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 사실과 추정의 경계, 의심을 단정으로 키운 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.","Motive exploration. Have him answer about the boundary between facts he directly saw and inference, and the motive behind his own judgment in turning suspicion into certainty.",動機探索。直接見た事実と推測の境界、疑いを断定へ膨らませた本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答亲眼所见事实与推测之间的界限，以及将怀疑发展成断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,"작성 과정 가운데 본인이 직접 보지 못한 부분과 들어서 짐작한 부분이 섞였다면, 어느 쪽을 더 무겁게 말하기로 결정한 이유가 있었습니까.","If the drafting process mixed parts you did not see directly with parts you guessed from what you heard, was there a reason you chose to give more weight to one side?",作成過程の中で、ご自身が直接見ていない部分と、聞いて推測した部分が混じっていたなら、どちらをより重く語ると決めた理由がありましたか。,如果订立过程中混有您没有亲眼看到的部分和听说后推测的部分，您决定更重视哪一方时，有什么理由吗？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 사실과 추정의 경계, 의심을 단정으로 키운 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.","Motive exploration. Have him answer about the boundary between facts he directly saw and inference, and the motive behind his own judgment in turning suspicion into certainty.",動機探索。直接見た事実と推測の境界、疑いを断定へ膨らませた本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答亲眼所见事实与推测之间的界限，以及将怀疑发展成断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 판단 능력을 거론하기 전에 본인 안에서 정리되지 않았던 의심의 출발점이 있었다면, 그것을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, before raising your mother's capacity for judgment, if there was a starting point of suspicion that remained unresolved within you, state that first.",ユン・テソンさん、母の判断能力を持ち出す前に、ご自身の中で整理されていなかった疑いの出発点があったなら、それを先に述べてください。,尹泰成先生，在提到母亲判断能力之前，如果您心中有尚未整理清楚的怀疑起点，请先说明那一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니가 보인 뜻을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 단정한 본인의 동기를 본인 기대와 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for making a conclusion about the mother's wishes without directly seeing the scene from his own expectations.,動機探索。母が示した意思を直接見ていない場で断定した本人の動機を、本人の期待と切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分在没有亲眼看到现场的情况下断定母亲意愿的本人动机，以及他本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 그 뜻이 아니었다고 본인이 결론지은 근거를 직접 본 장면과 전해 들은 이야기로 나누어 말씀해 주십시오. 그 결론을 단정으로 옮긴 본인 판단의 이유도 함께 답해 주시면 됩니다.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please separate the basis for your conclusion that this was not your mother's wish into scenes you saw directly and stories you heard secondhand. Also answer why your own judgment turned that conclusion into certainty.",ユン・テソンさん、母はその意思ではなかったとご自身が結論づけた根拠を、直接見た場面と伝え聞いた話に分けて述べてください。その結論を断定へ移したご自身の判断の理由も合わせて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请将您得出“那不是母亲意愿”这一结论的依据，分为亲眼所见的场景和转述听来的说法说明。也请一并回答您为何将这个结论转为断定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니가 보인 뜻을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 단정한 본인의 동기를 본인 기대와 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for making a conclusion about the mother's wishes without directly seeing the scene from his own expectations.,動機探索。母が示した意思を直接見ていない場で断定した本人の動機を、本人の期待と切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分在没有亲眼看到现场的情况下断定母亲意愿的本人动机，以及他本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v2].text,어머니의 반응을 본인이 본 적이 없는 자리의 일까지 의심으로 끌어들인 이유는 무엇입니까.,Why did you draw even scenes where you had never seen your mother's reactions into your suspicion?,母の反応をご自身が見たことのない場のことまで疑いに取り込んだ理由は何ですか。,您为什么连自己从未见过母亲反应的场合也纳入怀疑？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니가 보인 뜻을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 단정한 본인의 동기를 본인 기대와 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for making a conclusion about the mother's wishes without directly seeing the scene from his own expectations.,動機探索。母が示した意思を直接見ていない場で断定した本人の動機を、本人の期待と切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分在没有亲眼看到现场的情况下断定母亲意愿的本人动机，以及他本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v3].text,"평소 어머니가 본인에게 보였던 말과 행동 가운데, 유서와 어긋난다고 느낀 부분이 있다면 그 판단의 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.","If there were words or actions your mother usually showed you that you felt conflicted with the will, please state the basis for that judgment.",普段、母がご自身に見せていた言葉や行動の中で、遺言書と食い違うと感じた部分があるなら、その判断の根拠を述べてください。,平时母亲对您表现出的话语和行为中，如果有您觉得与遗嘱不一致的部分，请说明这一判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니가 보인 뜻을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 단정한 본인의 동기를 본인 기대와 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for making a conclusion about the mother's wishes without directly seeing the scene from his own expectations.,動機探索。母が示した意思を直接見ていない場で断定した本人の動機を、本人の期待と切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分在没有亲眼看到现场的情况下断定母亲意愿的本人动机，以及他本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v4].text,어머니의 뜻을 본인이 알고 있다고 믿게 만든 가장 큰 사정은 무엇이었습니까.,What was the biggest circumstance that made you believe you knew your mother's wishes?,母の意思をご自身が知っていると信じるようになった最大の事情は何でしたか。,是什么最重要的情况让您相信自己知道母亲的意愿？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니가 보인 뜻을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 단정한 본인의 동기를 본인 기대와 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for making a conclusion about the mother's wishes without directly seeing the scene from his own expectations.,動機探索。母が示した意思を直接見ていない場で断定した本人の動機を、本人の期待と切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分在没有亲眼看到现场的情况下断定母亲意愿的本人动机，以及他本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-mother_intent-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 의사를 본인의 기대와 분리해 설명할 수 있는 부분이 있다면, 먼저 그것부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there is any part of your mother's wishes that you can explain separately from your own expectations, please begin with that.",ユン・テソンさん、母の意思を、ご自身の期待と分けて説明できる部分があるなら、まずそれから述べてください。,尹泰成先生，如果有任何部分能将母亲的意愿与您本人的期待区分开来说明，请先从那里说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증을 사후에 알게 된 사실 자체를 의심으로 굳힌 본인 판단의 출발점을 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer about the starting point of his own judgment in turning the fact that he learned of the notarization after the fact into firm suspicion.,動機探索。公証を事後に知った事実そのものを疑いとして固めた本人の判断の出発点を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将事后才得知公证这一事实本身固化为怀疑的本人判断起点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증 사실을 늦게 알았다는 점이 본인의 의심을 더 굳히게 했는지, 그 흐름의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state whether learning of the notarization late further strengthened your suspicion, and explain the reason for that progression.",ユン・テソンさん、公証の事実を遅れて知ったことがご自身の疑いをさらに固めたのか、その流れの理由を述べてください。,尹泰成先生，请说明较晚得知公证事实是否进一步加深了您的怀疑，以及这一过程的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증을 사후에 알게 된 사실 자체를 의심으로 굳힌 본인 판단의 출발점을 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer about the starting point of his own judgment in turning the fact that he learned of the notarization after the fact into firm suspicion.,動機探索。公証を事後に知った事実そのものを疑いとして固めた本人の判断の出発点を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将事后才得知公证这一事实本身固化为怀疑的本人判断起点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v2].text,"형으로서 어머니 가까이에 있었다고 하시면서, 공증 일정을 본인이 미리 확인하지 못한 이유는 무엇입니까.",You say you were close to your mother as the older brother. Why were you unable to confirm the notarization schedule in advance yourself?,兄として母の近くにいたとおっしゃりながら、公証日程をご自身が事前に確認できなかった理由は何ですか。,您说自己作为哥哥一直在母亲身边，却为什么没能提前亲自确认公证日程？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증을 사후에 알게 된 사실 자체를 의심으로 굳힌 본인 판단의 출발점을 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer about the starting point of his own judgment in turning the fact that he learned of the notarization after the fact into firm suspicion.,動機探索。公証を事後に知った事実そのものを疑いとして固めた本人の判断の出発点を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将事后才得知公证这一事实本身固化为怀疑的本人判断起点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v3].text,공증 자체가 절차로 남아 있는데도 그 절차를 인정하지 않기로 한 본인의 판단 과정을 설명하십시오.,"Even though the notarization itself remains as a procedure, explain your own judgment process in deciding not to accept that procedure.",公証そのものが手続きとして残っているにもかかわらず、その手続きを認めないとしたご自身の判断過程を説明してください。,尽管公证本身作为程序留下了记录，请说明您决定不认可该程序的本人判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증을 사후에 알게 된 사실 자체를 의심으로 굳힌 본인 판단의 출발점을 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer about the starting point of his own judgment in turning the fact that he learned of the notarization after the fact into firm suspicion.,動機探索。公証を事後に知った事実そのものを疑いとして固めた本人の判断の出発点を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将事后才得知公证这一事实本身固化为怀疑的本人判断起点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v4].text,공증 시점을 두고 본인이 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 대목이 어디였습니까.,"Regarding the timing of the notarization, what part was the hardest for you to accept?",公証の時点をめぐって、ご自身が最も受け入れがたかった点はどこでしたか。,关于公证时间点，您最难接受的是哪一部分？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증을 사후에 알게 된 사실 자체를 의심으로 굳힌 본인 판단의 출발점을 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer about the starting point of his own judgment in turning the fact that he learned of the notarization after the fact into firm suspicion.,動機探索。公証を事後に知った事実そのものを疑いとして固めた本人の判断の出発点を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将事后才得知公证这一事实本身固化为怀疑的本人判断起点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-notarization_flow-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증 절차에 대해 본인이 직접 확인한 부분과 들은 이야기를 나눠 말씀해 주시고, 들은 이야기를 의심으로 굳힌 본인 판단의 이유를 함께 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please separate what you personally confirmed about the notarization procedure from what you heard, and also answer why your own judgment turned what you heard into firm suspicion.",ユン・テソンさん、公証手続きについてご自身が直接確認した部分と聞いた話を分けて述べ、聞いた話を疑いとして固めたご自身の判断の理由も合わせて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请区分说明您亲自确认的公证程序部分和听来的说法，并一并回答您为何把听来的说法固化为怀疑。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v1].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 게 아닌 장면을 의심으로 끌어들인 본인의 동기와, 그 자리에 본인이 빠진 사실을 동생 책임으로만 옮긴 판단을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for drawing a scene he did not directly see into suspicion from his judgment in shifting the fact that he was absent from that scene solely onto his younger brother's responsibility.,動機探索。直接見ていない場面を疑いに取り込んだ本人の動機と、その場に本人がいなかった事実を弟の責任だけに移した判断を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把并非亲眼所见的场景纳入怀疑的本人动机，以及将自己缺席该场合的事实只转为弟弟责任的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 종이를 어머니께 읽어드린 장면을 본인이 직접 본 적이 없다면, 그 이야기를 들은 경로와 그것을 의심으로 받아들인 본인 판단을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you never personally saw the scene where the paper was read aloud to your mother, please state how you heard that story and the judgment by which you accepted it as suspicious.",ユン・テソンさん、紙を母に読み聞かせた場面をご自身が直接見たことがないなら、その話を聞いた経路と、それを疑いとして受け止めたご自身の判断を述べてください。,尹泰成先生，如果您从未亲眼见过把纸读给母亲听的场景，请说明您听到这个说法的渠道，以及您如何判断并将其视为怀疑。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v2].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 게 아닌 장면을 의심으로 끌어들인 본인의 동기와, 그 자리에 본인이 빠진 사실을 동생 책임으로만 옮긴 판단을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for drawing a scene he did not directly see into suspicion from his judgment in shifting the fact that he was absent from that scene solely onto his younger brother's responsibility.,動機探索。直接見ていない場面を疑いに取り込んだ本人の動機と、その場に本人がいなかった事実を弟の責任だけに移した判断を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把并非亲眼所见的场景纳入怀疑的本人动机，以及将自己缺席该场合的事实只转为弟弟责任的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v2].text,그 장면에서 본인이 빠진 자리에 본인이 알고 있어야 할 정보가 빠져 있었다고 본 이유는 무엇입니까.,"Why did you believe that, in the place where you were absent from that scene, information you should have known was missing?",その場面でご自身がいなかった場に、ご自身が知っているべき情報が欠けていたと見た理由は何ですか。,在那个您缺席的场景中，您为什么认为缺少了您本应知道的信息？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v3].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 게 아닌 장면을 의심으로 끌어들인 본인의 동기와, 그 자리에 본인이 빠진 사실을 동생 책임으로만 옮긴 판단을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for drawing a scene he did not directly see into suspicion from his judgment in shifting the fact that he was absent from that scene solely onto his younger brother's responsibility.,動機探索。直接見ていない場面を疑いに取り込んだ本人の動機と、その場に本人がいなかった事実を弟の責任だけに移した判断を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把并非亲眼所见的场景纳入怀疑的本人动机，以及将自己缺席该场合的事实只转为弟弟责任的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v3].text,"형으로서 함께 있어야 할 자리에 본인이 없었다는 사실을 두고, 책임을 동생 쪽으로만 옮긴 본인의 판단 과정을 설명하십시오.","Regarding the fact that you were not present where you believe you should have been as the older brother, explain your own judgment process in shifting responsibility only toward your younger brother.",兄として同席すべき場にご自身がいなかったという事実について、責任を弟の側だけへ移したご自身の判断過程を説明してください。,关于您作为哥哥本应在场却并未在场这一事实，请说明您将责任只转向弟弟一方的本人判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v4].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 게 아닌 장면을 의심으로 끌어들인 본인의 동기와, 그 자리에 본인이 빠진 사실을 동생 책임으로만 옮긴 판단을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for drawing a scene he did not directly see into suspicion from his judgment in shifting the fact that he was absent from that scene solely onto his younger brother's responsibility.,動機探索。直接見ていない場面を疑いに取り込んだ本人の動機と、その場に本人がいなかった事実を弟の責任だけに移した判断を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把并非亲眼所见的场景纳入怀疑的本人动机，以及将自己缺席该场合的事实只转为弟弟责任的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v4].text,"그 장면을 듣고 가장 견디기 어려웠던 대목이 어디였는지, 본인 마음의 출발점을 말씀해 주십시오.","After hearing about that scene, what part was hardest for you to endure? Please state the starting point of your own feelings.",その場面を聞いて最も耐えがたかった点がどこだったのか、ご自身の心の出発点を述べてください。,听到那个场景后，您最难承受的是哪一部分？请说明您本人心情的起点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v5].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 직접 본 게 아닌 장면을 의심으로 끌어들인 본인의 동기와, 그 자리에 본인이 빠진 사실을 동생 책임으로만 옮긴 판단을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate his motive for drawing a scene he did not directly see into suspicion from his judgment in shifting the fact that he was absent from that scene solely onto his younger brother's responsibility.,動機探索。直接見ていない場面を疑いに取り込んだ本人の動機と、その場に本人がいなかった事実を弟の責任だけに移した判断を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把并非亲眼所见的场景纳入怀疑的本人动机，以及将自己缺席该场合的事实只转为弟弟责任的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-paper_reading-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 장면에 대해 본인이 직접 본 사실과 들은 이야기를 나눠 답하시고, 들은 이야기를 동생 책임으로 옮긴 본인 판단의 동기를 함께 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, answer separately about what you directly saw and what you heard regarding that scene, and also state the motive behind your judgment in shifting what you heard onto your younger brother's responsibility.",ユン・テソンさん、その場面についてご自身が直接見た事実と聞いた話を分けて答え、聞いた話を弟の責任へ移したご自身の判断の動機も合わせて述べてください。,尹泰成先生，请区分回答关于那个场景您亲眼看到的事实和听来的说法，并一并说明您将听来的说法转为弟弟责任的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v1].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 동생의 방문 증가를 의심으로 본 출발점과, 어머니에게 직접 확인하지 않은 본인의 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the starting point for viewing his younger brother's increased visits as suspicious from his own reason for not confirming directly with his mother.,動機探索。弟の訪問増加を疑いと見た出発点と、母に直接確認しなかった本人の理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把弟弟探访增加视为疑点的起点，以及本人没有直接向母亲确认的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생의 방문이 늘어난 시기를 의심의 단서로 본 본인 판단의 출발점은 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what was the starting point of your own judgment in treating the period when your younger brother's visits increased as a clue for suspicion?",ユン・テソンさん、弟の訪問が増えた時期を疑いの手がかりと見たご自身の判断の出発点は何でしたか。,尹泰成先生，您把弟弟探访增加的时期视为怀疑线索，这一本人判断的起点是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v2].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 동생의 방문 증가를 의심으로 본 출발점과, 어머니에게 직접 확인하지 않은 본인의 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the starting point for viewing his younger brother's increased visits as suspicious from his own reason for not confirming directly with his mother.,動機探索。弟の訪問増加を疑いと見た出発点と、母に直接確認しなかった本人の理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把弟弟探访增加视为疑点的起点，以及本人没有直接向母亲确认的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v2].text,"본인이 어머니를 자주 들렀다고 말씀하시는 만큼, 그 자리에서 동생의 방문에 대해 어머니께 직접 확인해 보지 않으신 이유가 무엇입니까.","Since you say you visited your mother often, why did you not directly ask her about your younger brother's visits there?",ご自身が母を頻繁に訪ねたとおっしゃるのであれば、その場で弟の訪問について母に直接確認しなかった理由は何ですか。,既然您说自己经常探望母亲，为什么没有当场直接向母亲确认弟弟探访的事？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v3].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 동생의 방문 증가를 의심으로 본 출발점과, 어머니에게 직접 확인하지 않은 본인의 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the starting point for viewing his younger brother's increased visits as suspicious from his own reason for not confirming directly with his mother.,動機探索。弟の訪問増加を疑いと見た出発点と、母に直接確認しなかった本人の理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把弟弟探访增加视为疑点的起点，以及本人没有直接向母亲确认的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v3].text,동생의 방문이 늘어난 사실을 곧바로 형으로서 묻지 않고 묻어둔 이유가 있었다면 답하십시오.,"If there was a reason you did not immediately ask as the older brother about the fact that your younger brother's visits had increased and instead left it buried, answer it.",弟の訪問が増えた事実を、すぐに兄として尋ねずに伏せておいた理由があったなら答えてください。,弟弟探访增加这一事实，您没有立即作为哥哥询问而是搁置下来，如果有理由，请回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v4].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 동생의 방문 증가를 의심으로 본 출발점과, 어머니에게 직접 확인하지 않은 본인의 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the starting point for viewing his younger brother's increased visits as suspicious from his own reason for not confirming directly with his mother.,動機探索。弟の訪問増加を疑いと見た出発点と、母に直接確認しなかった本人の理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把弟弟探访增加视为疑点的起点，以及本人没有直接向母亲确认的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v4].text,"형으로서 모셨다는 자긍심이 동생의 방문 증가를 의심으로 받아들이게 한 부분이 있다면, 그 마음의 흐름을 말씀해 주십시오.","If pride in having cared for her as the older brother made you take your younger brother's increased visits as suspicious, please describe that emotional progression.",兄として支えてきたという自負が、弟の訪問増加を疑いとして受け止めさせた部分があるなら、その心の流れを述べてください。,如果您作为哥哥照料母亲的自豪感，使您把弟弟探访增加视为怀疑，请说明这份心情的流动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v5].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 동생의 방문 증가를 의심으로 본 출발점과, 어머니에게 직접 확인하지 않은 본인의 이유를 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive exploration. Have him separate the starting point for viewing his younger brother's increased visits as suspicious from his own reason for not confirming directly with his mother.,動機探索。弟の訪問増加を疑いと見た出発点と、母に直接確認しなかった本人の理由を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分把弟弟探访增加视为疑点的起点，以及本人没有直接向母亲确认的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-visit_pattern-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인의 방문이 어머니에게 어떤 의미였는지를 본인 입장에서 정리해 보신 적이 있는지, 있다면 그 결과를 말씀하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, have you ever considered, from your own perspective, what your visits meant to your mother? If so, state the result.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身の訪問が母にとってどのような意味だったのか、ご自身の立場から整理してみたことがありますか。あるなら、その結果を述べてください。,尹泰成先生，您是否曾从自己的立场整理过您的探访对母亲意味着什么？如果有，请说明结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 교체 시점에 본인이 형에게 알리지 않은 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother at the time of the change.",動機探索。交代の時点で本人が兄に知らせなかった決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答在更换发生时没有告知哥哥这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증 가까운 시점에 보호사 교체가 있었다는 점을 본인이 알고 있었다면, 그 사실을 형에게 말하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you knew that the caregiver changed close to the notarization, why did you not tell your brother that fact?",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証に近い時点で介護職員の交代があったことをご自身が知っていたなら、その事実を兄に話さなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，如果您知道在接近公证的时间点发生了护理员更换，为什么没有把这一事实告诉哥哥？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 교체 시점에 본인이 형에게 알리지 않은 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother at the time of the change.",動機探索。交代の時点で本人が兄に知らせなかった決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答在更换发生时没有告知哥哥这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v2].text,"본인이 교체 결정에 어떤 의견을 더한 부분이 있었다면, 그 의견을 낸 동기를 답하십시오.","If there was any part where you added an opinion to the decision to change caregivers, answer what motivated you to give that opinion.",ご自身が交代決定に何らかの意見を加えた部分があるなら、その意見を出した動機を答えてください。,如果您在更换决定中提出过某些意见，请回答您提出该意见的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 교체 시점에 본인이 형에게 알리지 않은 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother at the time of the change.",動機探索。交代の時点で本人が兄に知らせなかった決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答在更换发生时没有告知哥哥这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v3].text,"보호사 교체와 어머니의 상태에 대한 본인 판단을 어떻게 분리하셨는지, 분리하지 않으셨다면 그 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Please state how you separated the caregiver change from your own judgment about your mother's condition. If you did not separate them, explain why.",介護職員の交代と母の状態に対するご自身の判断をどのように切り分けたのか、切り分けなかったならその理由を述べてください。,请说明您如何区分护理员更换与您对母亲状态的本人判断；如果没有区分，请说明理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 교체 시점에 본인이 형에게 알리지 않은 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother at the time of the change.",動機探索。交代の時点で本人が兄に知らせなかった決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答在更换发生时没有告知哥哥这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v4].text,"어머니에게 익숙한 사람을 바꾸는 일이 형에게 거슬릴 수 있다고 미리 가늠하신 부분이 있다면, 그 우려가 본인의 침묵에 어떻게 작용했는지 설명해 주십시오.","If you anticipated that replacing someone familiar to your mother might bother your brother, explain how that concern affected your silence.",母にとって慣れた人を変えることが兄の気に障るかもしれないと前もって見込んだ部分があるなら、その懸念がご自身の沈黙にどう作用したのか説明してください。,如果您曾预想到更换母亲熟悉的人可能会让哥哥介意，请说明这种担忧如何影响了您的沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 교체 시점에 본인이 형에게 알리지 않은 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother at the time of the change.",動機探索。交代の時点で本人が兄に知らせなかった決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答在更换发生时没有告知哥哥这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-caregiver_change-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 교체 직후 형의 방문이나 확인을 굳이 막지 않으셨다면, 그 사실은 본인 선택과 어떻게 이어집니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you did not deliberately block your brother's visit or confirmation right after the change, how does that fact connect to your own choice?",ユン・ジョンフさん、交代直後の兄の訪問や確認をあえて妨げなかったのなら、その事実はご自身の選択とどうつながりますか。,尹正厚先生，如果您并未刻意阻止哥哥在更换后探访或确认，这一事实与您的选择如何相连？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 절차에 깊이 들어간 결정과 형에게의 지연 통보 동기를 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within the range for which he can take responsibility, about the decision to become deeply involved in the procedure and the motive for delayed notice to his brother.",動機探索。手続きに深く関わった決定と兄への遅れた通知の動機を、本人が責任を負える範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人能够承担责任的范围内，回答深入参与程序的决定，以及延迟通知哥哥的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 유서 작성 자리에 가까이 있었던 것은 인정하셨습니다. 그 자리에 본인이 들어가게 된 결정 과정을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you have acknowledged that you were close to the scene where your mother's will was drafted. First, please state the decision process by which you came to be involved there.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の遺言書作成の場に近くいたことは認めています。まず、その場にご自身が入ることになった決定過程を述べてください。,尹正厚先生，您承认自己就在母亲遗嘱订立现场附近。请先说明您进入那个场合的决定过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 절차에 깊이 들어간 결정과 형에게의 지연 통보 동기를 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within the range for which he can take responsibility, about the decision to become deeply involved in the procedure and the motive for delayed notice to his brother.",動機探索。手続きに深く関わった決定と兄への遅れた通知の動機を、本人が責任を負える範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人能够承担责任的范围内，回答深入参与程序的决定，以及延迟通知哥哥的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,"작성과 공증 일정이 진행되는 동안, 형에게 곧바로 알리지 않고 본인 선에서 정리해 두기로 한 이유가 무엇입니까.","While the drafting and notarization schedule proceeded, why did you decide to organize matters on your own instead of telling your brother immediately?",作成と公証日程が進む間、兄にすぐ知らせず、ご自身の範囲で整理しておくことにした理由は何ですか。,在订立与公证日程推进期间，您为什么没有立即告知哥哥，而是决定先在自己这边整理？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 절차에 깊이 들어간 결정과 형에게의 지연 통보 동기를 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within the range for which he can take responsibility, about the decision to become deeply involved in the procedure and the motive for delayed notice to his brother.",動機探索。手続きに深く関わった決定と兄への遅れた通知の動機を、本人が責任を負える範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人能够承担责任的范围内，回答深入参与程序的决定，以及延迟通知哥哥的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,"어머니의 의사를 본인이 정리해 옮긴 대목이 있다면, 그렇게 옮긴 본인 판단의 동기를 알 수 있는 범위에서 설명하십시오.","If there was any part where you organized and conveyed your mother's wishes, explain as far as you know the motive behind your judgment in conveying them that way.",母の意思をご自身が整理して伝えた部分があるなら、そのように伝えたご自身の判断の動機を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,如果有您整理并转达母亲意愿的部分，请在您知道的范围内说明您这样转达的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 절차에 깊이 들어간 결정과 형에게의 지연 통보 동기를 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within the range for which he can take responsibility, about the decision to become deeply involved in the procedure and the motive for delayed notice to his brother.",動機探索。手続きに深く関わった決定と兄への遅れた通知の動機を、本人が責任を負える範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人能够承担责任的范围内，回答深入参与程序的决定，以及延迟通知哥哥的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,"절차를 본인 손에 두는 편이 어머니에게 낫다고 본 부분이 있었다면, 그 판단의 배경에 어떤 우려가 있었는지 답하십시오.","If there was any part where you believed keeping the procedure in your own hands was better for your mother, answer what concern lay behind that judgment.",手続きをご自身の手に置くほうが母にとってよいと見た部分があるなら、その判断の背景にどのような懸念があったのか答えてください。,如果您认为把程序掌握在自己手中对母亲更好，请回答这一判断背后有什么担忧。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 절차에 깊이 들어간 결정과 형에게의 지연 통보 동기를 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within the range for which he can take responsibility, about the decision to become deeply involved in the procedure and the motive for delayed notice to his brother.",動機探索。手続きに深く関わった決定と兄への遅れた通知の動機を、本人が責任を負える範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人能够承担责任的范围内，回答深入参与程序的决定，以及延迟通知哥哥的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 작성 과정 안에서 형이 알면 곤란하리라 본 대목이 있었다면, 그 판단의 이유를 단정 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was any part of the drafting process that you thought would be difficult if your brother learned of it, state the reason for that judgment without making conclusions.",ユン・ジョンフさん、作成過程の中で、兄が知れば困るだろうと見た部分があったなら、その判断の理由を断定せずに述べてください。,尹正厚先生，在订立过程中，如果有您认为哥哥知道后会有麻烦的部分，请不作断定地说明您这样判断的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 표시를 본인이 정리해 옮긴 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision to organize and convey the mother's expressions.",動機探索。母の表示を本人が整理して伝えた決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答整理并转达母亲表达这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 뜻을 본인이 정리해 전달한 부분이 있다면, 본인이 정리하기로 결정한 이유를 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was any part where you organized and conveyed your mother's wishes, first state why you decided to organize them yourself.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思をご自身が整理して伝えた部分があるなら、ご自身が整理することに決めた理由を先に述べてください。,尹正厚先生，如果有您整理并转达母亲的意愿的部分，请先说明您决定亲自整理的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 표시를 본인이 정리해 옮긴 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision to organize and convey the mother's expressions.",動機探索。母の表示を本人が整理して伝えた決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答整理并转达母亲表达这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v2].text,"어머니가 직접 표한 부분과 본인이 해석한 부분의 경계가 흐려졌다면, 그 경계를 본인 선에서 정리한 동기는 무엇입니까.","If the boundary between what your mother expressed directly and what you interpreted became blurred, what motivated you to organize that boundary on your own?",母が直接示した部分とご自身が解釈した部分の境界が曖昧になったなら、その境界をご自身の範囲で整理した動機は何ですか。,如果母亲直接表达的部分与您解读的部分之间的界限变得模糊，您在自己这边整理这一界限的动机是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 표시를 본인이 정리해 옮긴 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision to organize and convey the mother's expressions.",動機探索。母の表示を本人が整理して伝えた決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答整理并转达母亲表达这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v3].text,"어머니의 표시를 형에게 곧바로 그대로 옮기지 않고 본인 선에서 다듬은 자리가 있었다면, 그 판단의 이유를 답하십시오.","If there was an occasion when you did not convey your mother's expressions to your brother immediately and exactly as they were, but instead refined them on your own, answer the reason for that judgment.",母の表示を兄にすぐそのまま伝えず、ご自身の範囲で整えた場があったなら、その判断の理由を答えてください。,如果有某个场合您没有立即把母亲的表达原样转告哥哥，而是在自己这边加以整理，请回答这一判断的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 표시를 본인이 정리해 옮긴 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision to organize and convey the mother's expressions.",動機探索。母の表示を本人が整理して伝えた決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答整理并转达母亲表达这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v4].text,"어머니가 본인 앞에서 보이신 뜻을 형이 의심할 수 있다고 미리 가늠하신 적이 있다면, 그 우려가 본인의 행동에 어떻게 작용했는지 설명해 주십시오.","If you ever anticipated that your brother might doubt the wishes your mother showed in front of you, explain how that concern affected your actions.",母がご自身の前で示した意思を兄が疑うかもしれないと前もって見込んだことがあるなら、その懸念がご自身の行動にどう作用したのか説明してください。,如果您曾预想到哥哥可能会怀疑母亲在您面前表达的意愿，请说明这种担忧如何影响了您的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 표시를 본인이 정리해 옮긴 결정의 동기를 본인 선택의 차원에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, as a matter of his own choice, the motive behind his decision to organize and convey the mother's expressions.",動機探索。母の表示を本人が整理して伝えた決定の動機を、本人の選択の次元で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其从本人选择的层面，回答整理并转达母亲表达这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-mother_intent-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 뜻과 본인 판단 사이에서 본인 판단을 우선한 자리가 있었다면, 그 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was any occasion when you prioritized your own judgment over your mother's wishes, please state the reason.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思とご自身の判断の間で、ご自身の判断を優先した場があったなら、その理由を述べてください。,尹正厚先生，如果在母亲的意愿与您本人判断之间，有您优先自己判断的场合，请说明理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증 일정을 형에게 사전에 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 책임 영역 안에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within his sphere of responsibility, the motive behind his own decision not to tell his brother the notarization schedule in advance.",動機探索。公証日程を兄に事前に知らせなかった本人の決定の動機を、責任領域の中で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在责任范围内回答自己没有事先告知哥哥公证日程这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증 일정을 형에게 사전에 알리지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you not tell your brother the notarization schedule in advance?",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証日程を兄に事前に知らせなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，您为什么没有事先告知哥哥公证日程？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증 일정을 형에게 사전에 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 책임 영역 안에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within his sphere of responsibility, the motive behind his own decision not to tell his brother the notarization schedule in advance.",動機探索。公証日程を兄に事前に知らせなかった本人の決定の動機を、責任領域の中で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在责任范围内回答自己没有事先告知哥哥公证日程这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v2].text,절차를 본인 손에서 마무리하기로 한 결정에 어떤 우려가 작용했는지 말씀해 주십시오.,Please state what concerns influenced your decision to finish the procedure in your own hands.,手続きをご自身の手で終えることにした決定に、どのような懸念が作用したのか述べてください。,请说明有哪些担忧影响了您决定由自己手中完成程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증 일정을 형에게 사전에 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 책임 영역 안에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within his sphere of responsibility, the motive behind his own decision not to tell his brother the notarization schedule in advance.",動機探索。公証日程を兄に事前に知らせなかった本人の決定の動機を、責任領域の中で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在责任范围内回答自己没有事先告知哥哥公证日程这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v3].text,"공증 자리에서 어머니의 상태에 대해 공증인에게 본인이 어떻게 설명했는지, 그 설명을 본인 선에서 정리한 이유는 무엇입니까.","At the notarization scene, how did you explain your mother's condition to the notary, and why did you organize that explanation on your own?",公証の場で、母の状態について公証人にご自身がどのように説明したのか、その説明をご自身の範囲で整理した理由は何ですか。,在公证现场，您如何向公证人说明母亲的状态？您在自己这边整理这一说明的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증 일정을 형에게 사전에 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 책임 영역 안에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within his sphere of responsibility, the motive behind his own decision not to tell his brother the notarization schedule in advance.",動機探索。公証日程を兄に事前に知らせなかった本人の決定の動機を、責任領域の中で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在责任范围内回答自己没有事先告知哥哥公证日程这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v4].text,"형이 자리에 함께 있었더라면 어땠을지 미리 가늠해 본 적이 있다면, 그 가늠이 본인의 통보 시점에 어떻게 작용했는지 답하십시오.","If you ever anticipated what might happen if your brother were present, answer how that anticipation affected when you notified him.",兄がその場に同席していたらどうだったかを前もって見込んだことがあるなら、その見込みがご自身の通知時点にどう作用したのか答えてください。,如果您曾预想过哥哥若在场会怎样，请回答这种预想如何影响了您通知他的时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증 일정을 형에게 사전에 알리지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 책임 영역 안에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive exploration. Have him answer, within his sphere of responsibility, the motive behind his own decision not to tell his brother the notarization schedule in advance.",動機探索。公証日程を兄に事前に知らせなかった本人の決定の動機を、責任領域の中で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在责任范围内回答自己没有事先告知哥哥公证日程这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-notarization_flow-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증 절차의 적법성과 별개로 형에게의 지연이 본인의 어떤 판단에서 비롯됐는지 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, apart from the legality of the notarization procedure, please explain what judgment of yours led to the delay in informing your brother.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証手続きの適法性とは別に、兄への遅れがご自身のどのような判断から生じたのか説明してください。,尹正厚先生，撇开公证程序的合法性不谈，请说明延迟告知哥哥源于您本人的何种判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형이 오기 전에 그 자리를 마치는 편이 낫다고 본 본인의 우려를 단정 없이 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer without conclusions about the concern that led him to think it would be better to finish the scene before his brother arrived.,動機探索。兄が来る前にその場を終えるほうがよいと見た本人の懸念を、断定せずに答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其不作断定地回答他认为在哥哥到来前结束该场合更好时的本人担忧。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니께 종이를 읽어드린 자리가 있었다면, 그 자리에 형을 부르지 않은 이유를 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was a scene where you read the paper aloud to your mother, please state, as far as you know, why you did not call your brother to that place.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母に紙を読み聞かせた場があったなら、その場に兄を呼ばなかった理由を、ご自身が分かる範囲で述べてください。,尹正厚先生，如果有您给母亲读纸张的场合，请在您知道的范围内说明为什么没有叫哥哥到场。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형이 오기 전에 그 자리를 마치는 편이 낫다고 본 본인의 우려를 단정 없이 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer without conclusions about the concern that led him to think it would be better to finish the scene before his brother arrived.,動機探索。兄が来る前にその場を終えるほうがよいと見た本人の懸念を、断定せずに答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其不作断定地回答他认为在哥哥到来前结束该场合更好时的本人担忧。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v2].text,"형이 오기 전에 그 자리를 마치는 편이 낫다고 본 부분이 있다면, 그 판단의 이유는 무엇입니까.","If there was any part where you thought it would be better to finish that scene before your brother arrived, what was the reason for that judgment?",兄が来る前にその場を終えるほうがよいと見た部分があるなら、その判断の理由は何ですか。,如果有您认为在哥哥到来前结束该场合更好的部分，这一判断的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형이 오기 전에 그 자리를 마치는 편이 낫다고 본 본인의 우려를 단정 없이 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer without conclusions about the concern that led him to think it would be better to finish the scene before his brother arrived.,動機探索。兄が来る前にその場を終えるほうがよいと見た本人の懸念を、断定せずに答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其不作断定地回答他认为在哥哥到来前结束该场合更好时的本人担忧。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v3].text,"본인이 어머니께 읽어드린 내용과 어머니가 그것에 보인 반응을 본인 선에서 어떻게 정리하셨는지, 그렇게 정리하기로 한 동기를 답하십시오.","Please answer how you organized, on your own, the contents you read aloud to your mother and her reactions to them, and what motivated you to organize them that way.",ご自身が母に読み聞かせた内容と、それに母が見せた反応を、ご自身の範囲でどのように整理したのか、そう整理することにした動機を答えてください。,请回答您如何在自己这边整理读给母亲听的内容和母亲对此表现出的反应，以及这样整理的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형이 오기 전에 그 자리를 마치는 편이 낫다고 본 본인의 우려를 단정 없이 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer without conclusions about the concern that led him to think it would be better to finish the scene before his brother arrived.,動機探索。兄が来る前にその場を終えるほうがよいと見た本人の懸念を、断定せずに答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其不作断定地回答他认为在哥哥到来前结束该场合更好时的本人担忧。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v4].text,"그 자리를 두고 본인 안에서 떳떳함과 미루고 싶은 마음이 함께 있었다면, 어떤 쪽이 더 크게 작용했는지 설명하십시오.","If, regarding that scene, both a clear conscience and a desire to put it off existed within you, explain which one had the greater influence.",その場をめぐって、ご自身の中に後ろめたさのなさと先送りしたい気持ちが共にあったなら、どちらがより大きく作用したのか説明してください。,如果围绕那个场合，您心中同时有坦然和想要拖延的心情，请说明哪一方作用更大。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형이 오기 전에 그 자리를 마치는 편이 낫다고 본 본인의 우려를 단정 없이 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer without conclusions about the concern that led him to think it would be better to finish the scene before his brother arrived.,動機探索。兄が来る前にその場を終えるほうがよいと見た本人の懸念を、断定せずに答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其不作断定地回答他认为在哥哥到来前结束该场合更好时的本人担忧。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-paper_reading-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 장면을 형에게 곧바로 알리지 않은 결정의 이유를 단정 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state without making conclusions the reason for your decision not to tell your brother about that scene immediately.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その場面を兄にすぐ知らせなかった決定の理由を、断定せずに述べてください。,尹正厚先生，请不作断定地说明您没有立即把那个场景告知哥哥这一决定的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문이 늘어난 시기에 본인이 형에게 그 사실을 강조하지 않은 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer why he did not emphasize to his brother that his visits had increased during that period.,動機探索。訪問が増えた時期に、本人が兄へその事実を強調しなかった理由を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在探访增加的时期，自己没有向哥哥强调这一事实的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 말년에 방문 빈도가 늘어난 시기에 본인이 어머니께 무엇을 더 자주 말씀드리게 됐는지, 그 이유를 본인 선에서 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, during the late period when your visit frequency increased, what did you come to tell your mother more often? Answer the reason from your own perspective.",ユン・ジョンフさん、晩年に訪問頻度が増えた時期、ご自身が母に何をより頻繁に話すようになったのか、その理由をご自身の範囲で答えてください。,尹正厚先生，在晚年探访频率增加的时期，您更常对母亲说些什么？请从您本人角度回答理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문이 늘어난 시기에 본인이 형에게 그 사실을 강조하지 않은 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer why he did not emphasize to his brother that his visits had increased during that period.,動機探索。訪問が増えた時期に、本人が兄へその事実を強調しなかった理由を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在探访增加的时期，自己没有向哥哥强调这一事实的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v2].text,자주 들른 사실을 형에게 굳이 강조하지 않은 이유는 무엇입니까.,Why did you not make a point of emphasizing to your brother that you had visited often?,頻繁に訪ねた事実を、あえて兄に強調しなかった理由は何ですか。,您为什么没有特意向哥哥强调自己经常探访这一事实？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문이 늘어난 시기에 본인이 형에게 그 사실을 강조하지 않은 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer why he did not emphasize to his brother that his visits had increased during that period.,動機探索。訪問が増えた時期に、本人が兄へその事実を強調しなかった理由を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在探访增加的时期，自己没有向哥哥强调这一事实的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v3].text,"방문이 늘어난 시기와 유서 이야기가 자연스레 겹친 자리가 있었다면, 본인이 그 자리에서 형의 부재를 활용한 부분이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","If there was an occasion when the period of increased visits naturally overlapped with talk of the will, please state whether you made use of your brother's absence there.",訪問が増えた時期と遺言書の話が自然に重なった場があったなら、その場でご自身が兄の不在を利用した部分があったのか述べてください。,如果探访增加的时期与遗嘱话题自然重叠的场合，请说明您是否在那个场合利用了哥哥不在这一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문이 늘어난 시기에 본인이 형에게 그 사실을 강조하지 않은 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer why he did not emphasize to his brother that his visits had increased during that period.,動機探索。訪問が増えた時期に、本人が兄へその事実を強調しなかった理由を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在探访增加的时期，自己没有向哥哥强调这一事实的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v4].text,"어머니께 자주 가는 일이 형에게 어떻게 보일지를 미리 가늠한 적이 있다면, 그 가늠이 본인 행동에 어떻게 작용했는지 답하십시오.","If you ever anticipated how your frequent visits to your mother would look to your brother, answer how that anticipation affected your actions.",母のもとへ頻繁に行くことが兄にどう見えるかを前もって見込んだことがあるなら、その見込みがご自身の行動にどう作用したのか答えてください。,如果您曾预想过频繁去母亲那里在哥哥看来会是什么样，请回答这种预想如何影响了您的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 방문이 늘어난 시기에 본인이 형에게 그 사실을 강조하지 않은 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive exploration. Have him answer why he did not emphasize to his brother that his visits had increased during that period.,動機探索。訪問が増えた時期に、本人が兄へその事実を強調しなかった理由を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在探访增加的时期，自己没有向哥哥强调这一事实的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_family-01_judgeQuestions_d-1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-visit_pattern-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 방문을 늘린 데에 어머니의 상태에 대한 우려 외에 다른 동기가 섞였는지, 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state, as far as you know, whether any motive other than concern for your mother's condition was mixed into your increased visits.",ユン・ジョンフさん、訪問を増やしたことに、母の状態への懸念以外の動機が混じっていたのか、ご自身が分かる範囲で述べてください。,尹正厚先生，请在您知道的范围内说明，您增加探访是否混有对母亲状态的担忧以外的其他动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 의심하던 그림과 문서 차이가 맞지 않는다고 느꼈다면 마음이 더 어지러웠을 수 있습니다. 그 혼란을 사실과 감정으로 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if the picture you suspected did not fit the document discrepancy, your mind may have grown even more unsettled. Please separate that confusion into facts and emotions as you speak.",ユン・テソンさん、疑っていた構図と文書の差異がかみ合わないと感じたなら、心はさらに乱れたかもしれません。その混乱を事実と感情に分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果您觉得原先怀疑的图景与文件差异对不上，心里可能更加混乱。请把这份混乱分成事实和情绪来说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v2].text,처음 믿었던 설명이 흔들리는 자리는 쉽지 않았을 것입니다. 문서 차이를 마주한 순간의 생각부터 말씀해 주십시오.,It could not have been easy when the explanation you first trusted began to falter. Please start with what you thought the moment you faced the document discrepancy.,最初に信じていた説明が揺らぐ場面は、容易ではなかったはずです。文書の差異に向き合った瞬間の考えからお話しください。,起初相信的说明发生动摇，那样的处境并不容易。请先说明您面对文件差异那一刻的想法。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 결과의 의미 전체를 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 본 사실과 떠올린 추정을 구분해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide the full meaning of the result right now. For now, distinguish the facts you saw from the inferences you drew.",ユン・テソンさん、結果の意味を今すべて断定する必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が見た事実と、思い浮かべた推測を分けてください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定结果的全部意义。只需先区分您亲眼所见的事实和您想到的推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v4].text,의심을 거두기 어려웠던 마음과 문서 차이를 받아들이기 어려웠던 마음 중 어느 쪽이 더 컸는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Please tell me which was stronger: the feeling that made suspicion hard to release, or the feeling that made the document discrepancy hard to accept.",疑いを手放しがたかった思いと、文書の差異を受け入れがたかった思いのうち、どちらが大きかったのかお話しください。,请说明，对您而言更强烈的是难以放下怀疑的心情，还是难以接受文件差异的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-changed_direction-v5].text,비율이 어떻게 달라졌는지와 그 변경의 동기가 무엇이었는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 확인한 사실부터 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.,How the ratio changed and what motivated that change are separate issues. Please start by separating out the facts you personally confirmed.,比率がどのように変わったのかと、その変更の動機が何だったのかは別の問題です。まず、ご自身が確認した事実を切り分けてお話しください。,比例如何变化，和变化的动机是什么，是两个不同的问题。请先分开说明您已确认的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 문서 문제를 가족 안에서 꺼내는 일 자체가 무거웠을 것입니다. 그 말을 책임 문제로 꺼낸 순간의 마음을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, raising the issue of your mother's document within the family must have been heavy in itself. Please tell me how you felt when you brought it up as a matter of responsibility.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の文書の問題を家族の中で持ち出すこと自体、重かったはずです。それを責任の問題として口にした瞬間の思いをお話しください。,尹泰成先生，在家人之间提起母亲文件的问题，本身就很沉重。请说明您把它作为责任问题说出口那一刻的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v2].text,의심을 말하는 일과 가족을 고발하는 일 사이에서 본인이 망설인 지점이 있었다면 그 결을 들려주십시오.,"If there was a point where you hesitated between voicing suspicion and accusing family, please tell me what that hesitation felt like.",疑いを口にすることと、家族を告発することの間でためらった点があったなら、その感触を聞かせてください。,如果您在说出怀疑与指控家人之间曾有犹豫，请说明那份犹豫是什么样的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v3].text,"어머니의 문서가 다르게 남았다는 사실이 본인에게 어떤 배신감으로 닿았는지, 사실과 감정을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.",Please separate fact from emotion and tell me what kind of betrayal you felt when your mother's document was left in a different form.,お母様の文書が違う形で残されたという事実が、ご本人にどのような裏切られた思いとして届いたのか、事実と感情を分けてお話しください。,母亲的文件以不同形式留下这件事，让您感到怎样的背叛？请分开事实和情绪来说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v4].text,동생의 책임을 묻는 말이 본인에게도 쉽지 않았을 수 있습니다. 그래도 그 말을 하게 된 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.,"It may not have been easy for you to ask your younger brother to bear responsibility. Still, please explain why you came to say it.",弟さんの責任を問う言葉は、ご本人にとっても容易ではなかったかもしれません。それでも、その言葉を口にした理由をお話しください。,要求弟弟承担责任，对您来说也可能并不容易。即便如此，请说明您为什么会说出这句话。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-forgery_responsibility-v5].text,"어머니 문서 앞에서 분노가 먼저였는지, 확인해야 한다는 마음이 먼저였는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Please start by telling me whether anger came first before your mother's document, or the feeling that it had to be checked.",お母様の文書を前にして、怒りが先だったのか、確認しなければならないという思いが先だったのか、そこからお話しください。,请先说明，面对母亲的文件时，先出现的是愤怒，还是必须确认的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 결과에 대한 형의 허망함을 인정하되, 본 것/짐작/기대를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's emptiness over the result, while having him separate what he saw, inferred, and expected.",共感アプローチ。結果に対する兄の虚しさを認めつつ、見たこと、推測したこと、期待していたことを切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥面对结果的空虚感，同时引导其区分所见、推定和期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 평생을 어머니께 쏟았는데 유서가 다르게 나왔다면 분노 이전에 깊은 허망함이 있었을 수 있습니다. 그 유서를 처음 본 자리와, 무엇이 가장 받아들이기 어려웠는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you devoted your whole life to your mother and the will came out differently, there may have been deep emptiness before anger. Please start with where you first saw that will and what was hardest to accept.",ユン・テソンさん、生涯をお母様に注いできたのに遺言書が違う形で出てきたなら、怒りの前に深い虚しさがあったかもしれません。その遺言書を初めて見た場と、何が最も受け入れがたかったのかからお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果您一生都倾注在母亲身上，而遗嘱却以不同形式出现，愤怒之前也许先有深深的空虚。请先说明您第一次看到那份遗嘱的场合，以及最难接受的是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 결과에 대한 형의 허망함을 인정하되, 본 것/짐작/기대를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's emptiness over the result, while having him separate what he saw, inferred, and expected.",共感アプローチ。結果に対する兄の虚しさを認めつつ、見たこと、推測したこと、期待していたことを切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥面对结果的空虚感，同时引导其区分所见、推定和期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,"동생이 손을 댔을지 모른다는 의심이 가족이라는 단어를 흔들어 두렵게 했을 수 있습니다. 본인이 직접 본 것과 짐작한 것을 분리해, 본 것부터 말씀해 주십시오.","The suspicion that your younger brother may have touched it may have shaken the word family and made you afraid. Separate what you personally saw from what you inferred, and start with what you saw.",弟さんが手を加えたかもしれないという疑いは、「家族」という言葉を揺るがし、恐れを生んだかもしれません。ご自身が直接見たことと推測したことを分けて、見たことからお話しください。,怀疑弟弟可能动过手，也许动摇了“家人”这个词，让您感到害怕。请把亲眼所见和推定分开，先从所见说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 결과에 대한 형의 허망함을 인정하되, 본 것/짐작/기대를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's emptiness over the result, while having him separate what he saw, inferred, and expected.",共感アプローチ。結果に対する兄の虚しさを認めつつ、見たこと、推測したこと、期待していたことを切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥面对结果的空虚感，同时引导其区分所见、推定和期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 누가 어떤 방향으로 바꿨는지 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 기대했던 분배와 실제로 본 분배 사이에서 어디가 달랐는지부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide now who changed what or in which direction. Just begin by organizing where the distribution you expected differed from the one you actually saw.",ユン・テソンさん、誰がどの方向へ変えたのかを今断定する必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が期待していた分配と実際に見た分配のどこが違っていたのか、そこから整理してください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定是谁朝哪个方向改变了什么。请先整理您期待的分配与实际看到的分配之间哪里不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 결과에 대한 형의 허망함을 인정하되, 본 것/짐작/기대를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's emptiness over the result, while having him separate what he saw, inferred, and expected.",共感アプローチ。結果に対する兄の虚しさを認めつつ、見たこと、推測したこと、期待していたことを切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥面对结果的空虚感，同时引导其区分所见、推定和期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,어머니의 진짜 뜻이 무엇이었는지 끝내 묻지 못한 후회가 남아 있다면 그 마음부터 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 의심과 사실을 분리해 따질 수 있습니다.,"If you still regret never asking what your mother's true wishes were, begin by speaking about that feeling. Only then can we separate suspicion from fact.",お母様の本当の意思が何だったのか、最後まで聞けなかった後悔が残っているなら、まずその思いをほどいてください。そうして初めて、疑いと事実を切り分けて考えることができます。,如果您仍后悔最终没能询问母亲真正的意愿，请先说明那份心情。这样才能把怀疑和事实分开判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 결과에 대한 형의 허망함을 인정하되, 본 것/짐작/기대를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the older brother's emptiness over the result, while having him separate what he saw, inferred, and expected.",共感アプローチ。結果に対する兄の虚しさを認めつつ、見たこと、推測したこと、期待していたことを切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥面对结果的空虚感，同时引导其区分所见、推定和期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 유서가 달라졌다는 사실과 그 변경의 방향이 누구에게 유리했는지는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 확인한 범위에서 두 가지를 나눠 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that the will changed and who benefited from the direction of that change are different matters. Please separate the two within the scope you personally confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、遺言書が変わったという事実と、その変更の方向が誰に有利だったのかは別の次元です。ご自身が確認した範囲で、その二つを分けてください。,尹泰成先生，遗嘱发生变化这一事实，与变化方向对谁有利，是不同层面的问题。请在您确认的范围内把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 자필 원본 앞의 감정을 인정하되, 본 인상과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotions before the mother's handwritten original, while having him separate the impression he saw from his inferences.",共感アプローチ。お母様の自筆原本を前にした感情を認めつつ、見た印象と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其面对母亲亲笔原件时的情绪，同时引导其区分所见印象与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 직접 쓴 원본을 떠올리는 일 자체가 본인에게 무겁게 다가올 수 있습니다. 본인이 본 원본의 방향과 공증본 사이에서 가장 받아들이기 어려웠던 지점을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, even recalling the original your mother wrote herself may feel heavy to you. Please state the point between the direction you saw in the original and the notarized version that was hardest to accept.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様が直接書いた原本を思い出すこと自体、ご本人には重く感じられるかもしれません。ご自身が見た原本の方向と公証済みの文書の間で、最も受け入れがたかった点をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，回想母亲亲手写下的原件本身，对您而言可能就很沉重。请说明您看到的原件方向与公证文本之间，最难接受的点是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 자필 원본 앞의 감정을 인정하되, 본 인상과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotions before the mother's handwritten original, while having him separate the impression he saw from his inferences.",共感アプローチ。お母様の自筆原本を前にした感情を認めつつ、見た印象と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其面对母亲亲笔原件时的情绪，同时引导其区分所见印象与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v2].text,"어머니의 글씨를 마주한 자리에서 어머니가 다시 그리워졌을 수도 있습니다. 그 감정과 별개로, 본인이 원본에서 직접 본 흐름을 차근히 들려주십시오.","Facing your mother's handwriting may have made you miss her again. Apart from that emotion, please calmly tell me the flow you directly saw in the original.",お母様の筆跡を前にして、お母様をまた懐かしく思ったかもしれません。その感情とは別に、ご自身が原本で直接見た流れを落ち着いてお話しください。,面对母亲的字迹，您也许再次想念起母亲。请先把这份情绪放在一旁，冷静说明您在原件中亲眼看到的流向。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 자필 원본 앞의 감정을 인정하되, 본 인상과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotions before the mother's handwritten original, while having him separate the impression he saw from his inferences.",共感アプローチ。お母様の自筆原本を前にした感情を認めつつ、見た印象と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其面对母亲亲笔原件时的情绪，同时引导其区分所见印象与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 원본이 정확히 무엇을 말하고 있었는지 지금 단정하실 필요는 없습니다. 본인이 본 인상과 본인이 짐작으로 채운 부분을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide now what exactly the original was saying. Please separate the impression you saw from the parts you filled in by inference.",ユン・テソンさん、原本が正確に何を語っていたのかを今断定する必要はありません。ご自身が見た印象と、推測で補った部分を分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定原件确切表达了什么。请把您看到的印象和您用推定补上的部分分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 자필 원본 앞의 감정을 인정하되, 본 인상과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotions before the mother's handwritten original, while having him separate the impression he saw from his inferences.",共感アプローチ。お母様の自筆原本を前にした感情を認めつつ、見た印象と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其面对母亲亲笔原件时的情绪，同时引导其区分所见印象与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v4].text,원본을 더 일찍 꺼내 보지 않은 후회가 있다면 그 마음부터 말씀해 주십시오. 그래야 본인이 본 것과 본인이 바라던 것을 가릴 수 있습니다.,"If you regret not taking out the original sooner, please begin with that feeling. Only then can we distinguish what you saw from what you hoped for.",原本をもっと早く取り出して見なかった後悔があるなら、まずその思いをお話しください。そうして初めて、ご自身が見たことと望んでいたことを見分けられます。,如果您后悔没有更早拿出原件查看，请先说明那份心情。这样才能区分您看到的内容和您期待的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 자필 원본 앞의 감정을 인정하되, 본 인상과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the emotions before the mother's handwritten original, while having him separate the impression he saw from his inferences.",共感アプローチ。お母様の自筆原本を前にした感情を認めつつ、見た印象と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认其面对母亲亲笔原件时的情绪，同时引导其区分所见印象与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-original_gap-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 원본이 있었다는 사실과 그 원본이 정확히 어떤 방향이었는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 확인한 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that an original existed and the exact direction of that original are separate issues. Please state only what you confirmed, separately.",ユン・テソンさん、原本が存在したという事実と、その原本が正確にどのような方向だったのかは別の問題です。ご自身が確認した分だけを切り分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，原件存在这一事实，与原件确切是什么方向，是不同的问题。请只按您确认的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 어머니 상태 기록을 본 윤태성의 충격과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's shock at seeing the record of his mother's condition from his inference.,共感アプローチ。お母様の状態記録を見たユン・テソンの衝撃と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。引导其区分尹泰成看到母亲状态记录时的冲击与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증인 메모에 어머니 상태가 좋지 않았다는 말이 남은 것을 보며 어떤 마음이 먼저 들었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what feeling came first when you saw the notary's memo stating that your mother's condition was not good?",ユン・テソンさん、公証人のメモにお母様の状態がよくなかったという言葉が残っているのを見て、どのような思いが先に浮かびましたか。,尹泰成先生，看到公证人的备忘中留下母亲状态不佳的说法时，您最先产生了什么心情？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 어머니 상태 기록을 본 윤태성의 충격과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's shock at seeing the record of his mother's condition from his inference.,共感アプローチ。お母様の状態記録を見たユン・テソンの衝撃と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。引导其区分尹泰成看到母亲状态记录时的冲击与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v2].text,"어머니가 숫자를 혼동했다는 기록을 본 충격과, 동생에게 향한 분노를 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.",Please separate the shock of seeing the record that your mother had confused the numbers from the anger directed at your younger brother.,お母様が数字を混同していたという記録を見た衝撃と、弟さんへ向かった怒りを分けてお話しください。,请把看到母亲混淆数字记录时的冲击，和指向弟弟的愤怒分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 어머니 상태 기록을 본 윤태성의 충격과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's shock at seeing the record of his mother's condition from his inference.,共感アプローチ。お母様の状態記録を見たユン・テソンの衝撃と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。引导其区分尹泰成看到母亲状态记录时的冲击与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v3].text,그 메모를 본 뒤 어머니 뜻을 다시 생각하게 된 지점이 있다면 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.,"If there was a point after seeing that memo where you reconsidered Mother's Wishes, please state that first.",そのメモを見た後、母の意思をあらためて考えるようになった点があるなら、まずそこをお話しください。,如果看到那份备忘后，有让您重新思考母亲的意愿的地方，请先说明那里。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 어머니 상태 기록을 본 윤태성의 충격과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's shock at seeing the record of his mother's condition from his inference.,共感アプローチ。お母様の状態記録を見たユン・テソンの衝撃と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。引导其区分尹泰成看到母亲状态记录时的冲击与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 기록을 보며 본인이 놓친 시간까지 떠올랐다면 그 마음부터 차분히 설명하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if the record brought back even the time you had missed, please calmly explain that feeling first.",ユン・テソンさん、記録を見ながらご自身が見落としていた時間まで思い浮かんだなら、まずその思いを落ち着いて説明してください。,尹泰成先生，如果看着记录时连自己错过的时间也浮现出来，请先冷静说明那份心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 어머니 상태 기록을 본 윤태성의 충격과 추정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's shock at seeing the record of his mother's condition from his inference.,共感アプローチ。お母様の状態記録を見たユン・テソンの衝撃と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。引导其区分尹泰成看到母亲状态记录时的冲击与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-a-scan_sequence-v5].text,"공증인 메모가 본인에게 어떤 상처로 읽혔는지, 사실과 감정을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.",Please separate fact from emotion and tell me what kind of wound the notary's memo became for you when you read it.,公証人のメモがご本人にとってどのような傷として読めたのか、事実と感情を分けてお話しください。,请把事实和情绪分开，说明公证人的备忘在您看来成了怎样的伤害。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서 차이가 형에게 어떤 의심으로 보일지 본인도 느꼈을 것입니다. 그 부담을 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you must have felt what kind of suspicion the document discrepancy would look like to your brother. Please tell me as much of that burden as you can now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書の差異がお兄様にどのような疑いとして見えるか、ご自身も感じていたはずです。その負担を、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，您应该也能感受到文件差异在哥哥眼中会变成怎样的怀疑。请把这份负担在现在能说的范围内讲出来。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v2].text,"어머니의 뜻을 정리해야 한다고 느낀 시기가 있었다면, 그 정리의 결을 말씀해 주십시오. 정당함은 뒤에 따지겠습니다.","If there was a time when you felt you had to organize your mother's wishes, please state the texture of that organizing. We will address its legitimacy later.",お母様の意思を整理しなければならないと感じた時期があったなら、その整理の感触をお話しください。正当性は後で扱います。,如果您曾觉得必须整理母亲的意愿，请说明那次整理的脉络。正当性之后再判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 모든 동기를 한 번에 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 그 차이를 설명하지 못한 이유부터 차근히 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every motive at once. Just start by calmly organizing why you could not explain that discrepancy.",ユン・ジョンフさん、すべての動機を一度にほどく必要はありません。ただ、その差異を説明できなかった理由から落ち着いて整理してください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说明所有动机。请先从为什么没能解释那处差异开始，慢慢整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v4].text,문서 차이가 의심을 비껴가지 못한다는 점을 알면서도 말하지 않은 시간의 결을 말씀해 주십시오.,"Please tell me about the time when you knew the document discrepancy could not avoid suspicion, yet still did not speak.",文書の差異が疑いを避けられないと知りながら、語らなかった時間の感触をお話しください。,请说明，您明知文件差异无法避开怀疑，却仍未开口的那段时间是什么样的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-changed_direction-v5].text,변경의 방향과 어머니 문서를 본인이 다시 정리했다는 책임은 다른 차원입니다. 지금 말할 수 있는 범위부터 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.,The direction of the change and your responsibility for reorganizing your mother's document are different matters. Please start by separating what you can say now.,変更の方向と、お母様の文書をご自身が整理し直した責任は別の次元です。今話せる範囲から切り分けてお話しください。,变更的方向，和您重新整理母亲文件的责任，是不同层面的问题。请先在现在能说的范围内分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 문서에 대한 책임이라는 말이 본인에게도 가볍지 않을 것입니다. 그 무게를 피하지 말고 지금 말할 수 있는 범위부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the word responsibility regarding your mother's document cannot feel light to you either. Do not avoid that weight; answer first within the scope you can speak to now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の文書に対する責任という言葉は、ご本人にとっても軽くないはずです。その重みを避けず、今話せる範囲から答えてください。,尹正厚先生，关于母亲文件的责任这个词，对您来说也不会轻。请不要回避这份分量，先在现在能说的范围内回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v2].text,형 앞에서 문서 책임을 말해야 하는 자리가 본인에게 어떤 부담으로 남았는지 들려주십시오.,Please tell me what kind of burden remains for you in having to speak about document responsibility in front of your brother.,お兄様の前で文書の責任を語らなければならない場が、ご本人にどのような負担として残っているのか聞かせてください。,请说明，在哥哥面前谈文件责任这件事，对您留下了怎样的负担。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v3].text,"어머니 뜻을 담은 문서를 둘러싼 책임을 인정하는 일이 왜 늦어졌는지, 그 감정의 결부터 말씀해 주십시오.",Why was it delayed to acknowledge responsibility around the document containing your mother's wishes? Please start with the texture of that emotion.,お母様の意思を込めた文書をめぐる責任を認めることが、なぜ遅れたのか。その感情の感触からお話しください。,围绕承载母亲意愿的文件承认责任，为什么会拖延？请先说明那份情绪的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v4].text,"책임을 인정하는 말이 변명으로 들릴까 두려웠다면, 그 두려움이 어떤 침묵으로 이어졌는지 답해 주십시오.","If you feared that acknowledging responsibility would sound like an excuse, please answer what kind of silence that fear led to.",責任を認める言葉が言い訳に聞こえることを恐れていたなら、その恐れがどのような沈黙につながったのか答えてください。,如果您害怕承认责任听起来像辩解，请回答这份恐惧如何变成了沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-forgery_responsibility-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서 차이를 설명하지 못한 시간이 본인에게 어떻게 남아 있는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please begin by saying how the time when you could not explain the document discrepancy remains with you.",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書の差異を説明できなかった時間が、ご本人の中にどのように残っているのかからお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先说明那段没能解释文件差异的时间，在您心里留下了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 의심의 무게를 인정하되, 동기 단정 없이 본인이 직접 처리한 단계와 침묵을 정리하게 한다. 90:10 직접 언급 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of suspicion, while having them organize the steps they handled directly and their silence without assuming motive. Do not directly mention 90:10.",共感アプローチ。疑いの重さを認めつつ、動機を断定せずに本人が直接処理した段階と沈黙を整理させる。90:10を直接言及しない。,共情接近。承认怀疑的分量，但不断定动机，引导其整理本人直接处理的阶段与沉默。禁止直接提及90:10。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서에 손댔다는 의심은 본인 입장에서도 무겁게 느껴질 것입니다. 지금 단계에서 말할 수 있는 범위 안에서, 왜 형에게 설명을 미뤘는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the suspicion that you touched the document must feel heavy even from your position. Within what you can say at this stage, please begin with why you delayed explaining it to your brother.",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書に手を加えたという疑いは、ご本人の立場からも重く感じられるはずです。今の段階で話せる範囲の中で、なぜお兄様への説明を後回しにしたのかからお話しください。,尹正厚先生，被怀疑动过文件，对您来说也应当很沉重。请在现阶段能说的范围内，先说明为什么推迟向哥哥解释。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 의심의 무게를 인정하되, 동기 단정 없이 본인이 직접 처리한 단계와 침묵을 정리하게 한다. 90:10 직접 언급 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of suspicion, while having them organize the steps they handled directly and their silence without assuming motive. Do not directly mention 90:10.",共感アプローチ。疑いの重さを認めつつ、動機を断定せずに本人が直接処理した段階と沈黙を整理させる。90:10を直接言及しない。,共情接近。承认怀疑的分量，但不断定动机，引导其整理本人直接处理的阶段与沉默。禁止直接提及90:10。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,어머니의 뜻을 본인이 정리해야 한다고 생각한 시기가 있었다면 그 부담이 컸을 수 있습니다. 그 자리에서 무엇을 본인이 직접 처리했는지 차근히 들려주십시오.,"If there was a time when you thought you had to organize your mother's wishes yourself, the burden may have been great. Please calmly tell me what you handled directly there.",お母様の意思をご自身で整理しなければならないと思った時期があったなら、その負担は大きかったかもしれません。その場でご自身が直接処理したことを落ち着いて聞かせてください。,如果您曾认为必须由自己整理母亲的意愿，那份负担可能很大。请冷静说明您在那个位置上亲自处理了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 의심의 무게를 인정하되, 동기 단정 없이 본인이 직접 처리한 단계와 침묵을 정리하게 한다. 90:10 직접 언급 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of suspicion, while having them organize the steps they handled directly and their silence without assuming motive. Do not directly mention 90:10.",共感アプローチ。疑いの重さを認めつつ、動機を断定せずに本人が直接処理した段階と沈黙を整理させる。90:10を直接言及しない。,共情接近。承认怀疑的分量，但不断定动机，引导其整理本人直接处理的阶段与沉默。禁止直接提及90:10。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 동기를 한 번에 다 풀어내지 않아도 됩니다. 다만 최종본에 이른 경로 가운데, 본인이 손에 쥐고 있던 단계와 사무실이 처리한 단계를 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not have to lay out all motives at once. But in the path to the final version, separate the steps you held in your hands from the steps the office handled.",ユン・ジョンフさん、動機を一度にすべてほどく必要はありません。ただ、最終版に至る経路の中で、ご自身が手に持っていた段階と事務所が処理した段階を分けてください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说清所有动机。但请在形成最终版本的路径中，区分您自己掌握的阶段和事务所处理的阶段。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 의심의 무게를 인정하되, 동기 단정 없이 본인이 직접 처리한 단계와 침묵을 정리하게 한다. 90:10 직접 언급 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of suspicion, while having them organize the steps they handled directly and their silence without assuming motive. Do not directly mention 90:10.",共感アプローチ。疑いの重さを認めつつ、動機を断定せずに本人が直接処理した段階と沈黙を整理させる。90:10を直接言及しない。,共情接近。承认怀疑的分量，但不断定动机，引导其整理本人直接处理的阶段与沉默。禁止直接提及90:10。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,"형이 받아들이기 어려운 결과가 됐다는 점을 본인도 모르지 않았을 것입니다. 그 사실을 알면서도 말하지 않은 시간이 있었다면, 그때 마음의 결을 말씀해 주십시오.","You must have known that the result would be hard for your brother to accept. If there was a time when you knew that fact and still did not speak, please state the texture of your feelings then.",お兄様が受け入れがたい結果になったことを、ご本人も知らなかったわけではないはずです。その事実を知りながら語らなかった時間があったなら、その時の心の感触をお話しください。,您应该也知道，这样的结果会让哥哥难以接受。如果有一段您明知如此却没有开口的时间，请说明当时心情的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 의심의 무게를 인정하되, 동기 단정 없이 본인이 직접 처리한 단계와 침묵을 정리하게 한다. 90:10 직접 언급 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of suspicion, while having them organize the steps they handled directly and their silence without assuming motive. Do not directly mention 90:10.",共感アプローチ。疑いの重さを認めつつ、動機を断定せずに本人が直接処理した段階と沈黙を整理させる。90:10を直接言及しない。,共情接近。承认怀疑的分量，但不断定动机，引导其整理本人直接处理的阶段与沉默。禁止直接提及90:10。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서를 쥐었다는 사실과 그 문서를 어떤 방향으로 정리했는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 직접 한 일부터 말씀해 주십시오. 결론은 뒤에 따로 다루겠습니다.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you held the document and the direction in which you organized it are different issues. Please start with what you personally did. We will address the conclusion separately later.",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書を手にしていた事実と、その文書をどの方向に整理したのかは別の問題です。ご自身が直接したことからお話しください。結論は後で別に扱います。,尹正厚先生，您握有文件这一事实，与您把文件整理成什么方向，是不同的问题。请先说明您亲自做过的事。结论之后另行处理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 원본 존재의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 그 종이를 다룬 시점과 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the original's existence, while having them separate when they handled that paper from what they did.",共感アプローチ。原本の存在の重みを認めつつ、本人がその紙を扱った時点と行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认原件存在的分量，同时引导其区分接触那张纸的时间点与行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 자필이 따로 남아 있다는 사실 자체가 본인에게 부담이 될 수 있습니다. 본인이 그 원본을 어디에서 어떻게 보았는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the very fact that your mother's handwriting remained separately could be a burden to you. Please start with where and how you saw that original.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の自筆が別に残っていたという事実自体が、ご本人には負担になり得ます。その原本をどこで、どのように見たのかからお話しください。,尹正厚先生，母亲亲笔内容另有留存这一事实本身，可能对您成为负担。请先说明您在哪里、如何看到那份原件。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 원본 존재의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 그 종이를 다룬 시점과 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the original's existence, while having them separate when they handled that paper from what they did.",共感アプローチ。原本の存在の重みを認めつつ、本人がその紙を扱った時点と行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认原件存在的分量，同时引导其区分接触那张纸的时间点与行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v2].text,"본인이 어머니의 뜻이라고 생각한 방향과 원본에 적힌 방향이 달랐다면, 그 자리에서 어떤 마음이 들었는지 말씀해 주십시오. 옳고 그름은 뒤에 따지겠습니다.","If the direction you thought was your mother's wishes differed from the direction written in the original, please state what you felt at that moment. We will consider right and wrong later.",ご自身がお母様の意思だと思った方向と原本に書かれた方向が違っていたなら、その場でどのような気持ちになったのかお話しください。是非は後で判断します。,如果您认为是母亲意愿的方向，与原件上写的方向不同，请说明您当时的心情。对错之后再判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 원본 존재의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 그 종이를 다룬 시점과 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the original's existence, while having them separate when they handled that paper from what they did.",共感アプローチ。原本の存在の重みを認めつつ、本人がその紙を扱った時点と行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认原件存在的分量，同时引导其区分接触那张纸的时间点与行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 그 원본을 어떻게 처리했는지 지금 한 번에 다 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 그 종이를 본 시점과 공증본을 챙긴 시점 사이에 본인이 한 일부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain everything now about how you handled that original. Just start by organizing what you did between the time you saw that paper and the time you took care of the notarized version.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その原本をどう処理したのかを今一度にすべてほどく必要はありません。ただ、その紙を見た時点と公証済みの文書を手配した時点の間に、ご自身がしたことから整理してください。,尹正厚先生，现在不必一次说清您如何处理那份原件。请先整理从看到那张纸到准备公证文本之间，您做了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 원본 존재의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 그 종이를 다룬 시점과 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the original's existence, while having them separate when they handled that paper from what they did.",共感アプローチ。原本の存在の重みを認めつつ、本人がその紙を扱った時点と行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认原件存在的分量，同时引导其区分接触那张纸的时间点与行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v4].text,원본을 형에게 보여주지 않은 데 이유가 있다면 그 마음을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 보호인지 회피인지에 따라 책임의 결이 달라집니다.,"If you had a reason for not showing the original to your brother, please state that feeling. Whether it was protection or avoidance changes the texture of responsibility.",原本をお兄様に見せなかったことに理由があるなら、その思いをお話しください。それが保護なのか回避なのかによって、責任の感触は変わります。,如果您没有把原件给哥哥看有理由，请说明那份心情。那是保护还是回避，会改变责任的性质。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 원본 존재의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 그 종이를 다룬 시점과 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the original's existence, while having them separate when they handled that paper from what they did.",共感アプローチ。原本の存在の重みを認めつつ、本人がその紙を扱った時点と行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认原件存在的分量，同时引导其区分接触那张纸的时间点与行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-original_gap-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 원본과 공증본의 차이가 있다는 사실과 그 차이가 어떤 방향이었는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 본 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that there is a difference between the original and the notarized version, and the direction of that difference, are separate issues. Please separate only what you saw.",ユン・ジョンフさん、原本と公証済みの文書に差異があるという事実と、その差異がどの方向だったのかは別の問題です。ご自身が見た分だけを切り分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，原件与公证文本存在差异这一事实，与差异的方向是什么，是不同的问题。请只按您看到的部分分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 공증인 메모 앞에서 윤정후가 피하려는 책임을 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Have Yoon Jeong-hu speak to the responsibility he is trying to avoid in front of the notary's memo.,共感アプローチ。公証人のメモを前に、ユン・ジョンフが避けようとする責任を語らせる。,共情接近。引导尹正厚面对公证人备忘，说明其试图回避的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증인 메모에 남은 어머니 상태 기록을 지금 다시 보며 가장 피하고 싶은 대목이 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, looking again now at the record of your mother's condition in the notary's memo, what part do you most want to avoid?",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証人のメモに残ったお母様の状態記録を今あらためて見て、最も避けたい箇所はどこですか。,尹正厚先生，现在重新看公证人备忘中关于母亲状态的记录，您最想回避的是哪一段？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 공증인 메모 앞에서 윤정후가 피하려는 책임을 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Have Yoon Jeong-hu speak to the responsibility he is trying to avoid in front of the notary's memo.,共感アプローチ。公証人のメモを前に、ユン・ジョンフが避けようとする責任を語らせる。,共情接近。引导尹正厚面对公证人备忘，说明其试图回避的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v2].text,어머니께서 숫자를 혼동하셨다는 기록 앞에서 본인이 느끼는 책임을 말씀해 주십시오.,"Before the record that your mother confused the numbers, please state the responsibility you feel.",お母様が数字を混同されたという記録を前に、ご自身が感じている責任をお話しください。,面对母亲混淆数字的记录，请说明您感受到的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 공증인 메모 앞에서 윤정후가 피하려는 책임을 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Have Yoon Jeong-hu speak to the responsibility he is trying to avoid in front of the notary's memo.,共感アプローチ。公証人のメモを前に、ユン・ジョンフが避けようとする責任を語らせる。,共情接近。引导尹正厚面对公证人备忘，说明其试图回避的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v3].text,"그날 절차를 멈췄어야 했다는 생각이 있다면, 그 마음을 먼저 설명해 주십시오.","If you think you should have stopped the procedure that day, please explain that feeling first.",その日の手続きを止めるべきだったという思いがあるなら、まずその気持ちを説明してください。,如果您认为那天本该停止程序，请先说明那份心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 공증인 메모 앞에서 윤정후가 피하려는 책임을 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Have Yoon Jeong-hu speak to the responsibility he is trying to avoid in front of the notary's memo.,共感アプローチ。公証人のメモを前に、ユン・ジョンフが避けようとする責任を語らせる。,共情接近。引导尹正厚面对公证人备忘，说明其试图回避的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 형을 보호하려 했다는 말과 공증 당일 메모에 남은 절차 진행 사이의 간격을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please explain the gap between saying you meant to protect your brother and the procedure going forward as recorded in the memo from the day of notarization.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様を守ろうとしたという言葉と、公証当日のメモに残る手続き進行との間の隔たりをお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请说明“想保护哥哥”的说法，与公证当日备忘中留下的程序推进之间的距离。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 공증인 메모 앞에서 윤정후가 피하려는 책임을 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Have Yoon Jeong-hu speak to the responsibility he is trying to avoid in front of the notary's memo.,共感アプローチ。公証人のメモを前に、ユン・ジョンフが避けようとする責任を語らせる。,共情接近。引导尹正厚面对公证人备忘，说明其试图回避的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-b-scan_sequence-v5].text,공증인 메모를 보면 본인도 변명하기 어려운 대목이 있을 것입니다. 그 부분부터 답해 주십시오.,"Looking at the notary's memo, there must be a part that is hard for you to excuse. Please answer from that part.",公証人のメモを見ると、ご本人も言い訳しにくい箇所があるはずです。その部分から答えてください。,看公证人的备忘，应该有您也难以辩解的部分。请从那部分开始回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증본과 별도 문서가 다르게 보인다는 점을 언제 확인했는지, 본인이 직접 본 문서와 전해 들은 문서를 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when did you confirm that the notarized version and the separate document appeared different? Please separate the documents you personally saw from those you only heard about.",ユン・テソンさん、公証済みの文書と別の文書が違って見える点をいつ確認したのか、ご自身が直接見た文書と伝え聞いた文書を分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，您是在什么时候确认公证文本与另一份文件看起来不同的？请把您亲眼看到的文件和听说的文件分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v2].text,"비율 차이에 대한 해석은 잠시 미루고, 본인이 확인한 문서의 종류와 확인 경로부터 정리해 주십시오.","Set aside interpretation of the ratio difference for a moment, and first organize the types of documents you confirmed and the paths by which you confirmed them.",比率の差についての解釈はいったん置き、ご自身が確認した文書の種類と確認経路から整理してください。,请先暂时放下对比例差异的解读，整理您确认过的文件种类和确认路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v3].text,문서마다 숫자가 다르게 남아 있다는 점을 본인이 어떤 순서로 알게 됐는지 사실관계만 말씀해 주십시오.,Please state only the facts of the order in which you learned that the numbers were recorded differently in each document.,文書ごとに数字が違って残っている点を、ご自身がどの順序で知ることになったのか、事実関係だけをお話しください。,请只说明事实：您是按什么顺序得知各份文件中数字记录不同的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 처음 의심한 방향과 실제 문서 차이가 어떻게 어긋나는지, 지금 단계에서 확인된 범위만 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, answer only within what has been confirmed at this stage: how does the direction you first suspected diverge from the actual document discrepancy?",ユン・テソンさん、最初に疑った方向と実際の文書の差異がどのように食い違うのか、今の段階で確認された範囲だけを答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请只在现阶段已确认的范围内回答：您最初怀疑的方向与实际文件差异如何不一致？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-changed_direction-v5].text,문서 차이가 의미하는 결론은 뒤에 보겠습니다. 먼저 본인이 본 숫자와 들은 설명을 구분해 주십시오.,"We will look at the conclusion implied by the document discrepancy later. First, distinguish the numbers you saw from the explanation you heard.",文書の差異が意味する結論は後で見ます。まず、ご自身が見た数字と聞いた説明を区別してください。,文件差异意味着什么结论，之后再看。请先区分您看到的数字和听到的说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 문서가 다르게 남은 책임을 누구에게 묻고 있는지, 직접 본 사실과 추정을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, whom are you holding responsible for your mother's document being left differently? Please separate the facts you directly saw from your inferences.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の文書が違う形で残った責任を誰に問うているのか、直接見た事実と推測を分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，关于母亲的文件以不同形式留下，您在追究谁的责任？请把亲眼所见的事实和推定分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v2].text,문서 차이를 책임 문제로 보게 된 근거를 본인이 확인한 순서대로 정리해 주십시오.,"Please organize, in the order you confirmed them, the grounds that led you to see the document discrepancy as a responsibility issue.",文書の差異を責任の問題として見るようになった根拠を、ご自身が確認した順序で整理してください。,请按您确认的顺序，整理您为何把文件差异视为责任问题的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v3].text,동생이 문서 처리에 관여했다고 판단한 근거 중 기록으로 확인되는 부분만 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.,"Among the grounds for judging that your younger brother was involved in handling the document, please state first only the parts confirmed by records.",弟さんが文書処理に関与したと判断した根拠のうち、記録で確認できる部分だけを先にお話しください。,在您判断弟弟参与文件处理的依据中，请先说明能由记录确认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v4].text,어머니 문서 문제를 법적 책임으로 옮긴 본인의 판단 과정을 차근차근 설명해 주십시오.,Please calmly explain the process by which you moved the issue of your mother's document into legal responsibility.,お母様の文書問題を法的責任へ移したご自身の判断過程を、順を追って説明してください。,请按顺序说明，您如何把母亲文件的问题转为法律责任判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-forgery_responsibility-v5].text,문서 차이에 대한 감정과 책임 판단을 분리해서 말씀해 주십시오.,Please separate your emotions about the document discrepancy from your judgment of responsibility.,文書の差異に対する感情と責任判断を分けてお話しください。,请把对文件差异的情绪和责任判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 비율에 대한 윤태성의 직접 확인과 추정을 분리한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's direct confirmation of the ratio from his inference. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。比率についてユン・テソンが直接確認したことと推測を切り分ける。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。区分尹泰成对比例的直接确认与推定。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 본 유서의 비율 표기를 처음 확인한 시점과 출처를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state in chronological order when and from what source you first confirmed the ratio notation in the will you saw.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が見た遺言書の比率表記を初めて確認した時点と出どころを、時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请按时间顺序说明，您第一次确认所见遗嘱中的比例标记是在何时、通过什么来源。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 비율에 대한 윤태성의 직접 확인과 추정을 분리한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's direct confirmation of the ratio from his inference. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。比率についてユン・テソンが直接確認したことと推測を切り分ける。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。区分尹泰成对比例的直接确认与推定。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,본인이 직접 본 문서와 가족에게 들어 알고 있던 문서를 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the document you personally saw from the document you knew about through family.,ご自身が直接見た文書と、家族から聞いて知っていた文書を分けて答えてください。,请把您亲眼看到的文件，和您从家人那里听说而知道的文件分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 비율에 대한 윤태성의 직접 확인과 추정을 분리한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's direct confirmation of the ratio from his inference. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。比率についてユン・テソンが直接確認したことと推測を切り分ける。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。区分尹泰成对比例的直接确认与推定。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,동생은 비율이 그대로 작성됐다고 진술합니다. 본인이 그 진술과 다르게 보는 사실관계가 있다면 짚어 주십시오.,"Your younger brother states that the ratio was written as it was. If you see facts differently from that statement, please point them out.",弟さんは比率がそのまま作成されたと陳述しています。その陳述と異なると見ている事実関係があるなら、指摘してください。,弟弟陈述称比例是照原样写成的。如果您认为有与该陈述不同的事实，请指出。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 비율에 대한 윤태성의 직접 확인과 추정을 분리한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's direct confirmation of the ratio from his inference. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。比率についてユン・テソンが直接確認したことと推測を切り分ける。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。区分尹泰成对比例的直接确认与推定。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,"서랍에서 나온 종이와 공증본을 본인이 비교해 본 적이 있다면, 어느 부분이 달라 보였는지 본인이 본 그대로 답해 주십시오.","If you have compared the paper found in the drawer with the notarized version, answer exactly which part appeared different to you.",引き出しから出てきた紙と公証済みの文書をご自身で比較したことがあるなら、どの部分が違って見えたのか、見たまま答えてください。,如果您曾将抽屉里找到的纸张与公证文本进行比较，请按您所见回答哪一部分看起来不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 비율에 대한 윤태성의 직접 확인과 추정을 분리한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Tae-seong's direct confirmation of the ratio from his inference. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。比率についてユン・テソンが直接確認したことと推測を切り分ける。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。区分尹泰成对比例的直接确认与推定。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 비율이 바뀌었다는 의심의 근거 가운데 본인이 직접 확인한 부분과 추정한 부분을 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, among the grounds for suspecting that the ratio changed, separate what you personally confirmed from what you inferred.",ユン・テソンさん、比率が変わったという疑いの根拠の中で、ご自身が直接確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,尹泰成先生，在怀疑比例被改变的依据中，请区分您亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서랍 종이의 존재와 차이에 대한 윤태성의 인지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the drawer paper's existence and discrepancy.,事実追及。引き出しの紙の存在と差異について、ユン・テソンの認知を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对抽屉纸张存在及差异的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 서랍에서 종이가 나왔다는 사실을 본인이 언제 누구에게서 들으셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state when and from whom you heard that a paper had come out of your mother's drawer.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の引き出しから紙が出てきたという事実を、いつ誰から聞いたのかお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您是在什么时候、从谁那里听说母亲抽屉里找到了纸张。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서랍 종이의 존재와 차이에 대한 윤태성의 인지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the drawer paper's existence and discrepancy.,事実追及。引き出しの紙の存在と差異について、ユン・テソンの認知を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对抽屉纸张存在及差异的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v2].text,"그 종이를 본인이 직접 보았다면 본 장면을 말씀하시고, 보지 못했다면 어떤 경로로 그 내용을 알게 되었는지 분리해 주십시오.","If you personally saw that paper, describe the scene you saw; if you did not, separate out the route by which you came to know its contents.",その紙をご自身が直接見たなら見た場面をお話しください。見ていないなら、その内容をどの経路で知ったのか切り分けてください。,如果您亲眼看过那张纸，请说明所见场景；如果没有，请区分您通过什么路径得知其内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서랍 종이의 존재와 차이에 대한 윤태성의 인지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the drawer paper's existence and discrepancy.,事実追及。引き出しの紙の存在と差異について、ユン・テソンの認知を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对抽屉纸张存在及差异的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v3].text,"그 종이와 공증본 사이에 차이가 있다고 들으셨다면, 본인이 들은 차이와 본인이 직접 확인한 차이를 따로 답해 주십시오.","If you heard there was a difference between that paper and the notarized version, answer separately the difference you heard about and the difference you personally confirmed.",その紙と公証済みの文書の間に差異があると聞いたなら、ご自身が聞いた差異と直接確認した差異を別々に答えてください。,如果您听说那张纸与公证文本之间存在差异，请分别回答您听说的差异和亲自确认的差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서랍 종이의 존재와 차이에 대한 윤태성의 인지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the drawer paper's existence and discrepancy.,事実追及。引き出しの紙の存在と差異について、ユン・テソンの認知を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对抽屉纸张存在及差异的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v4].text,"종이의 글씨와 어머니의 평소 글씨를 비교해 본 적이 있다면, 비교한 시점과 사용한 자료를 정리해 주십시오.","If you have compared the handwriting on the paper with your mother's usual handwriting, organize when you compared them and what materials you used.",紙の筆跡とお母様の普段の筆跡を比較したことがあるなら、比較した時点と使用した資料を整理してください。,如果您曾将纸上的字迹与母亲平时的字迹作比较，请整理比较的时间点和使用的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 서랍 종이의 존재와 차이에 대한 윤태성의 인지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the drawer paper's existence and discrepancy.,事実追及。引き出しの紙の存在と差異について、ユン・テソンの認知を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对抽屉纸张存在及差异的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-original_gap-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 서랍 종이의 내용에 대한 본인의 추정과 직접 확인한 사실을 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please separate your inferences about the drawer paper's contents from the facts you directly confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、引き出しの紙の内容に対するご自身の推測と、直接確認した事実を分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请把您对抽屉纸张内容的推定和亲自确认的事实分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 공증인 메모를 본 경로와 메모에 적힌 사실, 윤태성의 해석을 분리하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have him separate the route by which he saw the notary's memo, the facts written in it, and Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.",事実追及。公証人のメモを見た経路、メモに記された事実、ユン・テソンの解釈を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分看到公证人备忘的路径、备忘中记载的事实，以及尹泰成的解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증인 메모 기록을 언제 어떤 경로로 확인했는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, first state when and through what route you confirmed the Notary's Memo Notes.",ユン・テソンさん、まず公証人のメモ記録をいつ、どのような経路で確認したのかお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请先说明您是在什么时候、通过什么路径确认公证人备忘记录的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 공증인 메모를 본 경로와 메모에 적힌 사실, 윤태성의 해석을 분리하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have him separate the route by which he saw the notary's memo, the facts written in it, and Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.",事実追及。公証人のメモを見た経路、メモに記された事実、ユン・テソンの解釈を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分看到公证人备忘的路径、备忘中记载的事实，以及尹泰成的解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v2].text,그 메모에서 본인이 직접 확인한 문장과 다른 사람에게 들은 설명을 따로 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the sentences you personally confirmed in that memo and the explanations you heard from other people.,そのメモでご自身が直接確認した文と、他の人から聞いた説明を別々に答えてください。,请分别回答您在那份备忘中亲自确认的句子，以及从他人那里听到的说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 공증인 메모를 본 경로와 메모에 적힌 사실, 윤태성의 해석을 분리하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have him separate the route by which he saw the notary's memo, the facts written in it, and Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.",事実追及。公証人のメモを見た経路、メモに記された事実、ユン・テソンの解釈を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分看到公证人备忘的路径、备忘中记载的事实，以及尹泰成的解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v3].text,공증본 60:40 기록과 어머니 상태 메모 사이에서 본인이 의심한 지점을 사실 중심으로 말씀해 주십시오.,"Between the notarized 60:40 record and the memo on your mother's condition, state factually the point that raised your suspicion.",公証済みの60:40記録とお母様の状態メモの間で、ご自身が疑った点を事実中心にお話しください。,请以事实为中心说明，在公证的60:40记录与母亲状态备忘之间，您怀疑的点是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 공증인 메모를 본 경로와 메모에 적힌 사실, 윤태성의 해석을 분리하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have him separate the route by which he saw the notary's memo, the facts written in it, and Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.",事実追及。公証人のメモを見た経路、メモに記された事実、ユン・テソンの解釈を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分看到公证人备忘的路径、备忘中记载的事实，以及尹泰成的解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v4].text,메모에 남은 숫자 혼동이나 절차 진행 표현 중 본인이 직접 본 대목을 짚어 주십시오.,Please point out the passages you personally saw among the memo's expressions about number confusion or the procedure going forward.,メモに残った数字の混同や手続き進行の表現のうち、ご自身が直接見た箇所を指摘してください。,请指出备忘中关于数字混淆或程序推进的表述里，您亲眼看到的段落。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,"사실 추궁. 공증인 메모를 본 경로와 메모에 적힌 사실, 윤태성의 해석을 분리하게 한다.","Fact pursuit. Have him separate the route by which he saw the notary's memo, the facts written in it, and Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.",事実追及。公証人のメモを見た経路、メモに記された事実、ユン・テソンの解釈を切り分けさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分看到公证人备忘的路径、备忘中记载的事实，以及尹泰成的解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-a-scan_sequence-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 해석은 잠시 미뤄 두고 공증인 메모에 적힌 사실부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set interpretation aside for the moment and state the facts written in the notary's memo first.",ユン・テソンさん、解釈はいったん置いて、公証人のメモに記された事実からお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请先放下解读，从公证人备忘中记载的事实说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증본과 별도 문서가 다르게 남은 경위를 본인이 아는 범위에서 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, within what you know, please state in chronological order how the notarized version and the separate document came to remain different.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証済みの文書と別の文書が違う形で残った経緯を、ご自身が知る範囲で時系列にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请在您所知范围内按时间顺序说明，公证文本与另一份文件为何会以不同形式留下。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v2].text,문서 차이가 생긴 과정에서 본인이 맡았던 절차와 직접 보지 못한 부분을 나눠 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the procedures you handled in the process that produced the document discrepancy from the parts you did not directly see.,文書の差異が生じた過程でご自身が担当した手続きと、直接見ていない部分を分けて答えてください。,请把文件差异产生过程中您负责的程序，和您没有亲眼看到的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v3].text,"형의 의심과 별개로, 문서가 서로 다르게 남은 이유를 지금 말할 수 있는 범위 안에서 정리해 주십시오.","Apart from your brother's suspicion, please organize within what you can say now why the documents came to remain different.",お兄様の疑いとは別に、文書が互いに違う形で残った理由を、今話せる範囲で整理してください。,请先不看哥哥的怀疑，在现在能说的范围内整理文件为何彼此留下了不同形式。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v4].text,"비율 차이의 의미를 단정하기 전에, 본인이 그 문서를 언제 어떤 상태로 보았는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Before assuming the meaning of the ratio difference, please first state when and in what condition you saw that document.",比率の差の意味を断定する前に、ご自身がその文書をいつ、どのような状態で見たのかからお話しください。,在断定比例差异的意义之前，请先说明您是在什么时候、以什么状态看到那份文件的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-changed_direction-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서 차이를 설명하지 않고 둔 시간이 있었다면 그 경위를 먼저 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was a period when you left the document discrepancy unexplained, please answer first about those circumstances.",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書の差異を説明しないままにした時間があったなら、その経緯から先に答えてください。,尹正厚先生，如果有一段时间您把文件差异放着没有说明，请先回答那段经过。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 문서 처리 과정에서 본인이 맡았던 범위와 설명하지 않은 범위를 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please separate the scope you handled and the scope you did not explain in the process of handling your mother's document.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の文書処理過程でご自身が担った範囲と、説明しなかった範囲を分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把您在处理母亲文件过程中承担的范围，和未作说明的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v2].text,"문서 차이에 본인 책임이 있다면 어느 단계부터인지, 지금 말할 수 있는 범위 안에서 정리해 주십시오.","If you bear responsibility for the document discrepancy, organize within what you can now say from which stage that responsibility begins.",文書の差異にご自身の責任があるなら、それがどの段階からなのか、今話せる範囲で整理してください。,如果文件差异中有您的责任，请在现在能说的范围内整理这份责任从哪个阶段开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v3].text,어머니 문서가 다르게 남은 과정에서 본인이 한 일과 하지 않은 일을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate what you did from what you did not do in the process by which your mother's document remained different.,お母様の文書が違う形で残った過程で、ご自身がしたこととしていないことを分けて答えてください。,请把母亲文件以不同形式留下的过程中，您做过的事和没有做的事分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 동기와 별개로 문서 차이에 대한 책임을 어디까지 인정할 수 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, apart from motive, please state how far you can acknowledge responsibility for the document discrepancy.",ユン・ジョンフさん、動機とは別に、文書の差異に対する責任をどこまで認められるのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先不谈动机，说明您能在多大范围内承认对文件差异的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-forgery_responsibility-v5].text,문서 처리 경위를 미룬 이유와 그 책임을 나눠 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain separately why you delayed the account of how the document was handled and the responsibility for that delay.,文書処理の経緯を後回しにした理由と、その責任を分けて説明してください。,请分开说明您推迟交代文件处理经过的理由，以及其中的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 손댄 절차의 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the procedural steps he touched. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手を加えた手続きの段階を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答其经手的程序阶段。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 60:40 유서가 최종본이 되기까지 어떤 절차를 거쳤는지, 본인이 직접 처리한 단계를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order what procedures the 60:40 will went through to become the final version, focusing on the steps you handled directly.",ユン・ジョンフさん、60:40の遺言書が最終版になるまでどのような手続きを経たのか、ご自身が直接処理した段階を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明60:40遗嘱成为最终版本前经过了哪些程序，重点是您亲自处理的阶段。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 손댄 절차의 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the procedural steps he touched. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手を加えた手続きの段階を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答其经手的程序阶段。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].text,본인이 손을 댄 작업과 공증인이 처리한 작업을 따로 정리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separately organize the work you touched and the work the notary handled.,ご自身が手を加えた作業と、公証人が処理した作業を別々に整理して答えてください。,请分别整理您经手的工作和公证人处理的工作。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 손댄 절차의 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the procedural steps he touched. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手を加えた手続きの段階を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答其经手的程序阶段。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].text,형은 비율이 어머니 뜻과 다르게 작성됐다고 봅니다. 본인이 직접 확인한 어머니의 비율 표시가 무엇이었는지 사실관계만으로 답해 주십시오.,Your brother believes the ratio was written differently from your mother's wishes. Please answer only with the facts of the ratio notation by your mother that you personally confirmed.,お兄様は、比率がお母様の意思と違う形で作成されたと見ています。ご自身が直接確認したお母様の比率表示が何だったのか、事実関係だけで答えてください。,哥哥认为比例是以不同于母亲意愿的方式写成的。请只按事实回答，您亲自确认的母亲比例标记是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 손댄 절차의 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the procedural steps he touched. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手を加えた手続きの段階を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答其经手的程序阶段。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].text,공증본이 60:40으로 정리되는 과정에서 본인이 손댄 부분이 있는지 답해 주십시오.,Please answer whether there was any part you touched in the process by which the notarized version was organized as 60:40.,公証済みの文書が60:40として整理される過程で、ご自身が手を加えた部分があるのか答えてください。,请回答，在公证文本整理为60:40的过程中，是否有您经手的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 손댄 절차의 단계를 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 원본 비율 직접 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the procedural steps he touched. Before S5, avoid directly stating the original ratio.",事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが手を加えた手続きの段階を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は原本の比率を直接表現しない。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答其经手的程序阶段。S5前避免直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 형에게 최종본을 미리 보여 주지 않은 사정보다, 그 무렵의 본인 일정과 절차 순서부터 사실 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, rather than the circumstances behind not showing your brother the final version in advance, first state truthfully your schedule and the procedural order around that time.",ユン・ジョンフさん、最終版をお兄様に事前に見せなかった事情より、その頃のご自身の予定と手続きの順序から事実どおりにお話しください。,尹正厚先生，先不要谈为什么没有提前给哥哥看最终版本，请先如实说明那段时间您的日程和程序顺序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 종이의 차이에 대한 윤정후의 직접 확인을 사실로 정리한다.,Fact pursuit. Organize as fact Yoon Jeong-hu's direct confirmation of the difference between the two papers.,事実追及。二つの紙の差異について、ユン・ジョンフの直接確認を事実として整理する。,事实追问。将尹正厚对两张纸差异的直接确认整理为事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 서랍에 다른 유서가 들어 있다는 사실을 본인이 언제 알게 되었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state when you came to know that another will was in your mother's drawer.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の引き出しに別の遺言書が入っているという事実をいつ知ったのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请说明您是在什么时候知道母亲抽屉里还有另一份遗嘱的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 종이의 차이에 대한 윤정후의 직접 확인을 사실로 정리한다.,Fact pursuit. Organize as fact Yoon Jeong-hu's direct confirmation of the difference between the two papers.,事実追及。二つの紙の差異について、ユン・ジョンフの直接確認を事実として整理する。,事实追问。将尹正厚对两张纸差异的直接确认整理为事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v2].text,"그 종이를 본인이 직접 보았는지, 누군가에게서 옮겨 들었는지 분리해 답해 주십시오.",Please answer separately whether you saw that paper yourself or heard about it from someone else.,その紙をご自身が直接見たのか、誰かから伝え聞いたのかを分けて答えてください。,请分别回答您是亲眼看到那张纸，还是从别人那里转述得知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 종이의 차이에 대한 윤정후의 직접 확인을 사실로 정리한다.,Fact pursuit. Organize as fact Yoon Jeong-hu's direct confirmation of the difference between the two papers.,事実追及。二つの紙の差異について、ユン・ジョンフの直接確認を事実として整理する。,事实追问。将尹正厚对两张纸差异的直接确认整理为事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v3].text,"서랍에 들어 있던 종이와 공증본 사이에 차이가 있다면, 본인이 그 차이를 알면서도 공증을 진행한 것인지 사실관계만으로 답해 주십시오.","If there is a difference between the paper in the drawer and the notarized version, answer only as fact whether you proceeded with notarization knowing that difference.",引き出しに入っていた紙と公証済みの文書の間に差異があるなら、その差異を知りながら公証を進めたのか、事実関係だけで答えてください。,如果抽屉里的纸张与公证文本之间存在差异，请只按事实回答，您是否在知道差异的情况下推进了公证。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 종이의 차이에 대한 윤정후의 직접 확인을 사실로 정리한다.,Fact pursuit. Organize as fact Yoon Jeong-hu's direct confirmation of the difference between the two papers.,事実追及。二つの紙の差異について、ユン・ジョンフの直接確認を事実として整理する。,事实追问。将尹正厚对两张纸差异的直接确认整理为事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v4].text,"서랍 종이의 존재를 형에게 알리지 않았다면, 알리지 않은 시점에 본인이 어떤 절차를 진행 중이었는지 정리해 주십시오.","If you did not tell your brother about the drawer paper, organize what procedure you were in the middle of at the time you did not tell him.",引き出しの紙の存在をお兄様に知らせなかったなら、知らせなかった時点でご自身がどの手続きを進めていたのか整理してください。,如果您没有告知哥哥抽屉纸张的存在，请整理在没有告知的那个时间点，您正在推进什么程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 종이의 차이에 대한 윤정후의 직접 확인을 사실로 정리한다.,Fact pursuit. Organize as fact Yoon Jeong-hu's direct confirmation of the difference between the two papers.,事実追及。二つの紙の差異について、ユン・ジョンフの直接確認を事実として整理する。,事实追问。将尹正厚对两张纸差异的直接确认整理为事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-original_gap-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 두 종이의 차이에 대한 해석은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 직접 본 차이만 사실 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside interpretation of the difference between the two papers, and state only the difference you personally saw as fact.",ユン・ジョンフさん、二つの紙の差異についての解釈はいったん置き、ご自身が直接見た差異だけを事実どおりにお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先放下对两张纸差异的解读，只如实说明您亲眼看到的差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 당일 어머니 상태와 윤정후의 절차 개입을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer in chronological order about the mother's condition on the day of notarization and Yoon Jeong-hu's procedural involvement.,事実追及。公証当日のお母様の状態とユン・ジョンフの手続きへの関与を、時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其按时间顺序回答公证当天母亲的状态与尹正厚的程序介入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증인 메모에 남은 당일 절차와 본인의 설명 과정을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order the procedure on that day as recorded in the notary's memo and your own explanation process.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証人のメモに残った当日の手続きと、ご自身の説明過程を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明公证人备忘中记录的当天程序，以及您自己的说明过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 당일 어머니 상태와 윤정후의 절차 개입을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer in chronological order about the mother's condition on the day of notarization and Yoon Jeong-hu's procedural involvement.,事実追及。公証当日のお母様の状態とユン・ジョンフの手続きへの関与を、時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其按时间顺序回答公证当天母亲的状态与尹正厚的程序介入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v2].text,어머니께서 숫자를 오락가락하셨다는 기록을 본인이 당시 어떻게 받아들였는지 답해 주십시오.,Please answer how you understood at the time the record that your mother was going back and forth on the numbers.,お母様が数字を行き来していたという記録を、当時ご自身がどのように受け止めたのか答えてください。,请回答，对于母亲当时在数字上反复不定的记录，您当时是如何理解的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 당일 어머니 상태와 윤정후의 절차 개입을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer in chronological order about the mother's condition on the day of notarization and Yoon Jeong-hu's procedural involvement.,事実追及。公証当日のお母様の状態とユン・ジョンフの手続きへの関与を、時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其按时间顺序回答公证当天母亲的状态与尹正厚的程序介入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v3].text,메모에 본인이 절차를 밀어붙인 듯 보였다는 대목이 있다면 그날 실제 행동을 사실대로 말씀해 주십시오.,"If the memo contains a passage suggesting you pushed the procedure forward, please state truthfully what you actually did that day.",メモに、ご自身が手続きを押し進めたように見える箇所があるなら、その日の実際の行動を事実どおりにお話しください。,如果备忘中有看起来像是您推动程序前进的段落，请如实说明那天的实际行动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 당일 어머니 상태와 윤정후의 절차 개입을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer in chronological order about the mother's condition on the day of notarization and Yoon Jeong-hu's procedural involvement.,事実追及。公証当日のお母様の状態とユン・ジョンフの手続きへの関与を、時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其按时间顺序回答公证当天母亲的状态与尹正厚的程序介入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v4].text,공증 당일 어머니 상태와 본인이 옆에서 한 말을 분리해 설명해 주십시오.,Please separate your mother's condition on the day of notarization from what you said beside her.,公証当日のお母様の状態と、そばでご自身がした言葉を分けて説明してください。,请把公证当天母亲的状态，和您在旁边说过的话分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 공증 당일 어머니 상태와 윤정후의 절차 개입을 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer in chronological order about the mother's condition on the day of notarization and Yoon Jeong-hu's procedural involvement.,事実追及。公証当日のお母様の状態とユン・ジョンフの手続きへの関与を、時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其按时间顺序回答公证当天母亲的状态与尹正厚的程序介入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-b-scan_sequence-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증본이 60:40으로 접수된 사실과 본인의 절차 개입을 나눠 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please separate the fact that the notarized version was received as 60:40 from your procedural involvement.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証済みの文書が60:40として受け付けられた事実と、ご自身の手続きへの関与を分けて答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请把公证文本以60:40受理的事实，和您的程序介入分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 문서 차이를 보면서도 동생의 책임이라고 본 판단 과정을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please explain the judgment process by which you saw the document discrepancy yet still treated it as your younger brother's responsibility.",ユン・テソンさん、文書の差異を見ながらも弟さんの責任だと見た判断過程をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您在看到文件差异的情况下，仍判断为弟弟责任的过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v2].text,"처음 떠올린 의심과 새로 확인된 문서 차이가 어긋난다면, 그 어긋남을 어떻게 받아들이고 있는지 답하십시오.","If your first suspicion and the newly confirmed document discrepancy do not align, answer how you are taking in that misalignment.",最初に浮かべた疑いと新たに確認された文書の差異が食い違うなら、その食い違いをどう受け止めているのか答えてください。,如果最初想到的怀疑与新确认的文件差异不一致，请回答您如何接受这份不一致。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v3].text,"결과의 방향을 단정하기 전에, 본인이 동생의 의도를 의심하게 된 출발점을 설명해 주십시오.","Before deciding the direction of the result, please explain the starting point from which you came to suspect your younger brother's intent.",結果の方向を断定する前に、ご自身が弟さんの意図を疑うようになった出発点を説明してください。,在断定结果方向之前，请说明您开始怀疑弟弟意图的起点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v4].text,본인이 기대한 유서와 실제로 확인한 문서 사이의 차이가 의심으로 옮겨간 이유는 무엇입니까.,What caused the difference between the will you expected and the document you actually confirmed to move into suspicion?,ご自身が期待した遺言書と実際に確認した文書の間の差が、疑いへ移っていった理由は何ですか。,您期待的遗嘱与实际确认的文件之间的差异，为什么会转为怀疑？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이의 의미를 단정하지 말고 확인 경로와 추정을 분리하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Do not let them assume what the document discrepancy means; have them separate the verification path from their inference. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異の意味を断定させず、確認経路と推測を切り分けさせる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,不要让其断定文件差异的意义；引导其区分确认路径与推定。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-changed_direction-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 문서 차이와 동생의 동기를 한꺼번에 묶은 부분이 있다면 그 판단부터 풀어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there is a part where you tied the document discrepancy and your younger brother's motive together at once, please untangle that judgment and state it.",ユン・テソンさん、文書の差異と弟さんの動機を一度に結びつけた部分があるなら、その判断をほどいてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果有把文件差异和弟弟动机一并捆在一起的部分，请先解开这项判断来说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 문서 차이를 동생의 책임으로 판단하게 된 본인 쪽 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please explain your own reasons for judging the document discrepancy to be your younger brother's responsibility.",ユン・テソンさん、文書の差異を弟さんの責任だと判断するようになった、ご自身側の理由を説明してください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您为什么会从自己这边判断文件差异是弟弟的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v2].text,직접 본 장면이 부족한 상태에서도 책임을 단정하게 된 판단의 출발점은 무엇이었습니까.,"Even with few scenes you personally saw, what was the starting point of the judgment that led you to decide responsibility?",直接見た場面が不足している状態でも責任を断定するようになった、その判断の出発点は何でしたか。,即便亲眼看到的场景不足，您仍断定责任的判断起点是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v3].text,문서 차이를 본 뒤 분노와 법적 책임 판단이 한꺼번에 움직인 지점이 있다면 말씀해 주십시오.,"If there was a point after seeing the document discrepancy where anger and legal responsibility moved together, please state it.",文書の差異を見た後、怒りと法的責任判断が一度に動いた点があるならお話しください。,如果看到文件差异后，愤怒与法律责任判断曾同时推动，请说明那一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v4].text,"동생의 동기를 탐욕으로 읽은 이유와, 지금 새로 확인되는 문서 차이를 어떻게 나누고 있는지 답하십시오.",Please answer how you are separating the reason you read your younger brother's motive as greed from the newly confirmed document discrepancy.,弟さんの動機を欲として読んだ理由と、今新たに確認される文書の差異を、どのように分けているのか答えてください。,请回答，您如何区分把弟弟动机解读为贪欲的理由，以及现在新确认的文件差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 책임 판단으로 옮긴 근거를 기록 중심으로 분리하게 한다.,"Have them separate the basis for turning the document discrepancy into a judgment of responsibility, focusing on records.",文書の差異を責任判断へ移した根拠を、記録中心に切り分けさせる。,引导其以记录为中心，区分把文件差异转为责任判断的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-forgery_responsibility-v5].text,어머니 문서 문제를 가족 감정이 아니라 책임 문제로 본 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.,Please state why you saw the issue of your mother's document as a matter of responsibility rather than family emotion.,お母様の文書問題を、家族感情ではなく責任の問題として見た理由をお話しください。,请说明您为什么把母亲文件的问题视为责任问题，而不是家人情绪问题。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 비율 의심의 출발과 본인 기대의 섞임을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the start of the ratio suspicion from the mixing in of his own expectations.,動機探索。比率への疑いの出発点と本人の期待の混在を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分比例怀疑的起点与本人期待的混入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 60:40 비율을 두고 본인이 처음 의심을 품게 된 단서를, 직접 본 부분과 들어서 추정한 부분으로 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state the clue that first led you to doubt the 60:40 ratio, separating what you saw directly from what you inferred after hearing about it.",ユン・テソンさん、60:40の比率をめぐってご自身が最初に疑いを抱いた手がかりを、直接見た部分と聞いて推測した部分に分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您最初对60:40比例产生怀疑的线索，并区分亲眼所见的部分和听说后推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 비율 의심의 출발과 본인 기대의 섞임을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the start of the ratio suspicion from the mixing in of his own expectations.,動機探索。比率への疑いの出発点と本人の期待の混在を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分比例怀疑的起点与本人期待的混入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,의심을 품은 뒤 동생이나 공증인에게 즉시 묻지 않고 본인 안에서 더 키워 간 이유는 무엇입니까.,"After you had doubts, why did you not immediately ask your younger brother or the notary, but instead let those doubts grow within you?",疑いを抱いた後、弟さんや公証人にすぐ尋ねず、ご自身の中でさらに大きくしていった理由は何ですか。,产生怀疑之后，您为什么没有立即询问弟弟或公证人，而是在自己心里继续放大？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 비율 의심의 출발과 본인 기대의 섞임을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the start of the ratio suspicion from the mixing in of his own expectations.,動機探索。比率への疑いの出発点と本人の期待の混在を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分比例怀疑的起点与本人期待的混入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,"본인이 받게 될 몫을 두고 형으로서 기대한 비율이 있었다면, 그 기대가 의심의 출발과 어떻게 섞였는지 답하십시오.","If there was a ratio you expected to receive as the older brother, answer how that expectation mixed with the starting point of your suspicion.",ご自身が受け取る分をめぐり、兄として期待した比率があったなら、その期待が疑いの出発点とどう混ざったのか答えてください。,如果对于自己将获得的份额，您作为哥哥曾期待某种比例，请回答那份期待如何与怀疑的起点交织在一起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 비율 의심의 출발과 본인 기대의 섞임을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the start of the ratio suspicion from the mixing in of his own expectations.,動機探索。比率への疑いの出発点と本人の期待の混在を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分比例怀疑的起点与本人期待的混入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,"문서 차이를 단정으로 옮기는 동안, 본인이 알지 못하는 부분이 더 있을 수 있다는 가능성을 어떻게 다루셨는지 설명하십시오.","As you moved the document discrepancy toward certainty, how did you handle the possibility that there might be parts you did not know?",文書の差異を断定へ移していく間、ご自身が知らない部分がさらにあるかもしれない可能性をどのように扱いましたか。,在您把文件差异转向断定的过程中，您如何处理“可能还有自己不知道的部分”这一可能性？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 비율 의심의 출발과 본인 기대의 섞임을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the start of the ratio suspicion from the mixing in of his own expectations.,動機探索。比率への疑いの出発点と本人の期待の混在を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分比例怀疑的起点与本人期待的混入。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 들고 있는 의심 가운데 본인이 직접 확인할 수 있는 부분과 그렇지 않은 부분을 분리해 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, among the suspicions you hold, answer separately what you can personally confirm and what you cannot.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が抱いている疑いのうち、ご自身で直接確認できる部分とそうでない部分を分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，在您持有的怀疑中，请区分哪些是您能亲自确认的，哪些不是。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 원본을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 차이를 단정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind assuming a discrepancy without directly seeing the original.,動機探索。原本を直接見ていない場で差異を断定した本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在未亲眼见到原件的情况下断定存在差异的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 원본을 본인이 직접 본 적이 없다면, 원본과 공증본의 차이를 단정한 본인 판단의 근거가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you have never personally seen the original, what is the basis for your judgment that the original and notarized version differed?",ユン・テソンさん、原本をご自身が直接見たことがないなら、原本と公証済みの文書の差異を断定したご自身の判断の根拠は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，如果您从未亲眼看过原件，您断定原件与公证文本存在差异的判断依据是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 원본을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 차이를 단정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind assuming a discrepancy without directly seeing the original.,動機探索。原本を直接見ていない場で差異を断定した本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在未亲眼见到原件的情况下断定存在差异的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v2].text,"차이가 있다는 정보를 들은 직후, 동생에게 직접 묻지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","After hearing that there was a difference, please state why you did not ask your younger brother directly.",差異があるという情報を聞いた直後、弟さんに直接尋ねなかった理由をお話しください。,听到存在差异的信息后，请说明您为什么没有直接询问弟弟。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 원본을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 차이를 단정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind assuming a discrepancy without directly seeing the original.,動機探索。原本を直接見ていない場で差異を断定した本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在未亲眼见到原件的情况下断定存在差异的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v3].text,본인이 알지 못하는 원본의 방향이 본인의 의심과 다를 수 있다는 가능성을 본인 안에서 어떻게 다루셨는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how you handled within yourself the possibility that the direction of an original you did not know might differ from your suspicion.,ご自身が知らない原本の方向がご自身の疑いと異なる可能性を、ご自身の中でどのように扱いましたか。,对于自己不了解的原件方向可能与自己的怀疑不同这一可能性，您在心里是如何处理的？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 원본을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 차이를 단정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind assuming a discrepancy without directly seeing the original.,動機探索。原本を直接見ていない場で差異を断定した本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在未亲眼见到原件的情况下断定存在差异的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v4].text,"본인이 의심하는 방향과 본인에게 유리한 방향이 같았다면, 그 일치를 본인은 어떻게 설명하시겠습니까.","If the direction you suspected and the direction favorable to you were the same, how would you explain that coincidence?",ご自身が疑っている方向とご自身に有利な方向が同じだったなら、その一致をご本人はどのように説明しますか。,如果您怀疑的方向与对自己有利的方向一致，您会如何解释这种一致？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 원본을 직접 보지 못한 자리에서 차이를 단정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind assuming a discrepancy without directly seeing the original.,動機探索。原本を直接見ていない場で差異を断定した本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在未亲眼见到原件的情况下断定存在差异的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-original_gap-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 차이라는 사실에 본인이 어디까지 직접 다가갈 수 있었는지, 그 한계 안에서 본인 단정의 동기를 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, answer how far you could personally approach the fact of a difference, and within that limit, what motivated your certainty.",ユン・テソンさん、「差異」という事実にご自身がどこまで直接近づくことができたのか、その限界の中でご自身の断定の動機を答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请回答您能在多大程度上亲自接近“差异”这一事实，并在这个限制内说明自己作出断定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증인 메모를 근거로 윤태성이 어떤 결론으로 넘어갔는지 확인한다.,Motive probe. Confirm what conclusion Yoon Tae-seong moved toward based on the notary's memo.,動機探索。公証人のメモを根拠に、ユン・テソンがどの結論へ移ったのかを確認する。,动机探查。确认尹泰成以公证人备忘为依据转向了什么结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증인 메모를 보고 동생의 책임을 어떻게 판단하게 됐는지 그 흐름을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state the flow by which the notary's memo led you to judge your younger brother's responsibility.",ユン・テソンさん、公証人のメモを見て弟さんの責任をどのように判断するようになったのか、その流れをお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您看到公证人备忘后，是如何判断弟弟责任的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증인 메모를 근거로 윤태성이 어떤 결론으로 넘어갔는지 확인한다.,Motive probe. Confirm what conclusion Yoon Tae-seong moved toward based on the notary's memo.,動機探索。公証人のメモを根拠に、ユン・テソンがどの結論へ移ったのかを確認する。,动机探查。确认尹泰成以公证人备忘为依据转向了什么结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v2].text,"어머니 상태가 좋지 않았다는 기록을 본 뒤, 본인이 곧바로 어떤 결론으로 넘어갔는지 설명하십시오.","After seeing the record that your mother's condition was not good, explain what conclusion you immediately moved to.",お母様の状態がよくなかったという記録を見た後、ご自身がすぐにどのような結論へ移ったのか説明してください。,看到母亲状态不佳的记录后，请说明您立即转向了什么结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증인 메모를 근거로 윤태성이 어떤 결론으로 넘어갔는지 확인한다.,Motive probe. Confirm what conclusion Yoon Tae-seong moved toward based on the notary's memo.,動機探索。公証人のメモを根拠に、ユン・テソンがどの結論へ移ったのかを確認する。,动机探查。确认尹泰成以公证人备忘为依据转向了什么结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v3].text,메모에 남은 절차 진행 표현을 두고 본인이 추정한 부분과 확인한 부분을 나눠 주십시오.,"Regarding the memo's expression that the procedure went forward, separate what you inferred from what you confirmed.",メモに残った手続き進行の表現をめぐり、ご自身が推測した部分と確認した部分を分けてください。,关于备忘中留下的程序推进表述，请区分您推定的部分和确认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증인 메모를 근거로 윤태성이 어떤 결론으로 넘어갔는지 확인한다.,Motive probe. Confirm what conclusion Yoon Tae-seong moved toward based on the notary's memo.,動機探索。公証人のメモを根拠に、ユン・テソンがどの結論へ移ったのかを確認する。,动机探查。确认尹泰成以公证人备忘为依据转向了什么结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v4].text,"그 메모가 본인의 분노를 키웠다면, 기록 자체와 본인의 해석을 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","If that memo increased your anger, please separate the record itself from your interpretation of it.",そのメモがご自身の怒りを強めたなら、記録そのものとご自身の解釈を分けてお話しください。,如果那份备忘加深了您的愤怒，请把记录本身和您的解读分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 공증인 메모를 근거로 윤태성이 어떤 결론으로 넘어갔는지 확인한다.,Motive probe. Confirm what conclusion Yoon Tae-seong moved toward based on the notary's memo.,動機探索。公証人のメモを根拠に、ユン・テソンがどの結論へ移ったのかを確認する。,动机探查。确认尹泰成以公证人备忘为依据转向了什么结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-a-scan_sequence-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증인 메모가 왜 유서 전체를 의심하게 만든 근거가 됐는지 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, answer why the notary's memo became grounds for suspecting the entire will.",ユン・テソンさん、公証人のメモがなぜ遺言書全体を疑う根拠になったのか答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请回答为什么公证人的备忘会成为您怀疑整份遗嘱的依据。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v1].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서 차이를 처음부터 설명하지 않은 이유가 무엇인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state why you did not explain the document discrepancy from the beginning.",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書の差異を最初から説明しなかった理由をお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请说明您为什么一开始没有解释文件差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v2].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v2].text,그 차이를 말하지 않고 둔 결정에 본인이 어떤 부담을 느꼈는지 답하십시오.,Please answer what burden you felt in deciding to leave that discrepancy unspoken.,その差異を語らずに置いた決定に、ご自身がどのような負担を感じたのか答えてください。,请回答，对于把那处差异放着不说的决定，您感到了怎样的负担。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v3].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v3].text,형이 오해할 수 있다는 것을 알면서도 설명을 미룬 이유를 본인이 말할 수 있는 범위에서 말씀해 주십시오.,"Knowing your brother could misunderstand, please state within what you can say why you delayed the explanation.",お兄様が誤解し得ると知りながら説明を先延ばしにした理由を、ご自身が話せる範囲でお話しください。,明知哥哥可能误会，您仍推迟说明的理由是什么？请在能说的范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v4].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v4].text,문서 차이가 단순한 절차 문제로만 남지 않을 수 있다는 점을 언제부터 알고 있었는지 답하십시오.,When did you know that the document discrepancy might not remain merely a procedural issue?,文書の差異が単なる手続きの問題だけでは済まないかもしれないと、いつから知っていましたか。,您从什么时候知道，文件差异可能不只是单纯的程序问题？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v5].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 설명하지 않은 경위와 본인 책임을 분리해 말하게 한다. 원본 비율 직접 표현 금지.,Have them separate the circumstances of not explaining the document discrepancy from their own responsibility. Do not state the original ratio directly.,文書の差異を説明しなかった経緯と本人の責任を切り分けて話させる。原本の比率を直接表現しない。,引导其区分未说明文件差异的经过与本人责任。禁止直接表述原件比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-changed_direction-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 동기와 별개로 문서 차이를 숨긴 책임을 어디까지 인정할 수 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, apart from motive, please state how far you can acknowledge responsibility for hiding the document discrepancy.",ユン・ジョンフさん、動機とは別に、文書の差異を隠した責任をどこまで認められるのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先不谈动机，说明您能在多大范围内承认隐瞒文件差异的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서 차이를 알고도 바로 설명하지 않은 이유가 무엇인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state why you knew about the document discrepancy yet did not explain it right away.",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書の差異を知りながらすぐ説明しなかった理由をお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请说明您明知文件差异却没有立即解释的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v2].text,그 책임을 인정하는 일과 그때의 동기를 설명하는 일이 본인 안에서 어떻게 달랐는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how acknowledging that responsibility and explaining your motive at the time differed within you.,その責任を認めることと、その時の動機を説明することが、ご自身の中でどのように違っていたのか答えてください。,请回答，对您而言，承认那份责任与说明当时动机之间有什么不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v3].text,어머니 문서를 둘러싼 책임을 미루게 만든 가장 큰 이유가 무엇이었습니까.,What was the greatest reason you postponed taking responsibility around your mother's document?,お母様の文書をめぐる責任を先延ばしにさせた最も大きな理由は何でしたか。,让您推迟承担围绕母亲文件责任的最大理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v4].text,형에게 말하지 않은 시간이 길어진 이유와 그 사이 본인이 두려워한 결과를 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.,Please separate why the time without telling your brother grew longer from the outcome you feared during that time.,お兄様に話さない時間が長くなった理由と、その間ご自身が恐れていた結果を分けてお話しください。,请把没有告诉哥哥的时间变长的原因，和那期间您害怕的结果分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,어머니 문서 처리 과정의 본인 역할과 책임을 단계적으로 답하게 한다.,Have them answer step by step about their own role and responsibility in handling their mother's document.,お母様の文書処理過程における本人の役割と責任を、段階的に答えさせる。,引导其分阶段回答自己在处理母亲文件过程中的角色与责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-forgery_responsibility-v5].text,동기와 별개로 책임을 받아들여야 한다는 점을 언제부터 알았는지 답하십시오.,"Please answer when you first knew that, apart from motive, you would have to accept responsibility.",動機とは別に、責任を受け入れなければならないという点をいつから知っていたのか答えてください。,请回答，您从什么时候知道，即便不谈动机，也必须接受责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 결과가 남은 사실을 형이나 공증인에게 즉시 설명하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their decision not to immediately explain to the brother or notary that a different result remained.,動機探索。別の結果が残った事実を兄や公証人にすぐ説明しなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答未立即向哥哥或公证人说明留下了不同结果这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서가 다르게 남았다는 사실 자체를 형이나 공증인에게 곧바로 설명하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you not immediately explain to your brother or the notary the fact that the documents remained different?",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書が違う形で残ったという事実そのものを、お兄様や公証人にすぐ説明しなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，为什么您没有立即向哥哥或公证人说明文件以不同形式留下这一事实？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 결과가 남은 사실을 형이나 공증인에게 즉시 설명하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their decision not to immediately explain to the brother or notary that a different result remained.,動機探索。別の結果が残った事実を兄や公証人にすぐ説明しなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答未立即向哥哥或公证人说明留下了不同结果这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,"본인이 그 결과에 가까이 있었다는 점은 인정하셨으니, 가까이 있게 된 본인의 판단 과정을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","You have acknowledged that you were close to that result, so please first state the judgment process that brought you close to it.",ご自身がその結果に近いところにいたことは認められました。近くにいることになったご自身の判断過程を先にお話しください。,您已经承认自己接近那个结果，请先说明让自己接近那个结果的判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 결과가 남은 사실을 형이나 공증인에게 즉시 설명하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their decision not to immediately explain to the brother or notary that a different result remained.,動機探索。別の結果が残った事実を兄や公証人にすぐ説明しなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答未立即向哥哥或公证人说明留下了不同结果这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,"비율을 두고 본인 몫이 줄어든 결과가 나왔다 하더라도, 그 결과를 본인이 정리해 둔 이유를 형에게 미리 말하지 않은 동기를 답하십시오.","Even if the ratio resulted in your share decreasing, answer why you did not tell your brother in advance that you had organized that result.",比率をめぐってご自身の取り分が減る結果になったとしても、その結果をご自身が整理しておいた理由をお兄様に事前に話さなかった動機を答えてください。,即使比例结果让您的份额减少，请回答您为什么没有提前告诉哥哥，是由您整理好了这个结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 결과가 남은 사실을 형이나 공증인에게 즉시 설명하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their decision not to immediately explain to the brother or notary that a different result remained.,動機探索。別の結果が残った事実を兄や公証人にすぐ説明しなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答未立即向哥哥或公证人说明留下了不同结果这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,"어머니의 뜻을 본인이 다듬어 옮긴 자리가 있었다면, 그렇게 다듬어야 한다고 본 우려는 무엇이었습니까.","If there was a place where you refined and transferred your mother's wishes yourself, what concern made you think it had to be refined that way?",お母様の意思をご自身が整えて移した場があったなら、そう整えるべきだと見た懸念は何でしたか。,如果您曾亲自润饰并转移母亲的意愿，那么是什么担忧让您认为必须这样润饰？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 다른 결과가 남은 사실을 형이나 공증인에게 즉시 설명하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their decision not to immediately explain to the brother or notary that a different result remained.,動機探索。別の結果が残った事実を兄や公証人にすぐ説明しなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答未立即向哥哥或公证人说明留下了不同结果这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 결과의 형식적인 비율과 본인이 한 행위를 분리해 책임질 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first state the part for which you can take responsibility by separating the formal ratio of the result from your own act.",ユン・ジョンフさん、結果の形式的な比率とご自身がした行為を分けて、責任を負える部分から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把结果的形式比例与您自己的行为分开，先说明您能承担责任的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 문서가 다르게 남은 경위에 대한 본인 침묵의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their silence about how the two documents came to remain different.,動機探索。二つの文書が違う形で残った経緯に対する本人の沈黙の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对于两份文件为何留下不同形式而保持沉默的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 두 문서가 다르게 남게 된 경위에 대해 침묵한 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you remain silent about how the two documents came to remain different?",ユン・ジョンフさん、二つの文書が違う形で残ることになった経緯について、なぜ沈黙したのですか。,尹正厚先生，关于两份文件为何会以不同形式留下，您为什么保持沉默？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 문서가 다르게 남은 경위에 대한 본인 침묵의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their silence about how the two documents came to remain different.,動機探索。二つの文書が違う形で残った経緯に対する本人の沈黙の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对于两份文件为何留下不同形式而保持沉默的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v2].text,"본인이 차이를 알고 있었다면, 그 차이의 원인을 형에게 먼저 설명하지 않은 결정의 동기를 답하십시오.","If you knew about the difference, answer the motive behind the decision not to explain its cause to your brother first.",ご自身が差異を知っていたなら、その差異の原因をお兄様に先に説明しなかった決定の動機を答えてください。,如果您知道差异，请回答没有先向哥哥说明差异原因这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 문서가 다르게 남은 경위에 대한 본인 침묵의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their silence about how the two documents came to remain different.,動機探索。二つの文書が違う形で残った経緯に対する本人の沈黙の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对于两份文件为何留下不同形式而保持沉默的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v3].text,본인의 몫이 줄어든 방향이라는 사실이 본인 침묵의 정당성을 만들어 준다고 본 부분이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.,Please state whether there was any part where you thought the fact that your share decreased gave legitimacy to your silence.,ご自身の取り分が減った方向だという事実が、ご自身の沈黙の正当性を作ってくれると見た部分があったのかお話しください。,请说明，您是否有过认为“自己的份额减少了”这一事实能使自己的沉默正当化的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 문서가 다르게 남은 경위에 대한 본인 침묵의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their silence about how the two documents came to remain different.,動機探索。二つの文書が違う形で残った経緯に対する本人の沈黙の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对于两份文件为何留下不同形式而保持沉默的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v4].text,"차이를 그대로 두는 편이 어머니에게 낫다고 본 부분이 있었다면, 그 판단의 우려는 무엇이었습니까.","If you thought leaving the difference as it was would be better for your mother, what concern lay behind that judgment?",差異をそのままにしておく方がお母様にとってよいと見た部分があったなら、その判断の懸念は何でしたか。,如果您曾认为保持差异原样对母亲更好，那么该判断背后的担忧是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 문서가 다르게 남은 경위에 대한 본인 침묵의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have them answer the motive behind their silence about how the two documents came to remain different.,動機探索。二つの文書が違う形で残った経緯に対する本人の沈黙の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对于两份文件为何留下不同形式而保持沉默的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-original_gap-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 차이의 결과와 그 결과를 만든 본인 행위를 분리해 인정할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, separate the result of the difference from your act that produced that result, and state first what you can acknowledge.",ユン・ジョンフさん、差異の結果とその結果を作ったご自身の行為を分けて、認められる部分から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把差异的结果与造成该结果的您的行为分开，先说明您能承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 좋지 않은 상태 기록을 알고도 절차를 진행한 윤정후의 판단을 묻는다.,Motive probe. Ask about Yoon Jeong-hu's judgment in proceeding with the procedure despite knowing the record of poor condition.,動機探索。よくない状態の記録を知りながら手続きを進めたユン・ジョンフの判断を問う。,动机探查。询问尹正厚明知存在状态不佳记录仍推进程序的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 상태가 좋지 않았다는 메모가 남은 상황에서도 절차를 진행한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state why you proceeded with the procedure even though a memo remained saying your mother's condition was not good.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の状態がよくなかったというメモが残る状況でも、手続きを進めた理由をお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请说明在留下母亲状态不佳备忘的情况下，您仍推进程序的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 좋지 않은 상태 기록을 알고도 절차를 진행한 윤정후의 판단을 묻는다.,Motive probe. Ask about Yoon Jeong-hu's judgment in proceeding with the procedure despite knowing the record of poor condition.,動機探索。よくない状態の記録を知りながら手続きを進めたユン・ジョンフの判断を問う。,动机探查。询问尹正厚明知存在状态不佳记录仍推进程序的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v2].text,공증 당일 숫자 혼동이 있었는데도 본인이 절차를 멈추지 않은 판단 과정을 설명하십시오.,Please explain the judgment process by which you did not stop the procedure despite number confusion on the day of notarization.,公証当日に数字の混同があったにもかかわらず、ご自身が手続きを止めなかった判断過程を説明してください。,请说明公证当天存在数字混淆，您仍没有停止程序的判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 좋지 않은 상태 기록을 알고도 절차를 진행한 윤정후의 판단을 묻는다.,Motive probe. Ask about Yoon Jeong-hu's judgment in proceeding with the procedure despite knowing the record of poor condition.,動機探索。よくない状態の記録を知りながら手続きを進めたユン・ジョンフの判断を問う。,动机探查。询问尹正厚明知存在状态不佳记录仍推进程序的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v3].text,메모에 남은 절차 진행 표현이 본인에게 불리하게 보이는 이유를 알고 있다면 답해 주십시오.,"If you know why the memo's expression that the procedure went forward looks unfavorable to you, please answer.",メモに残った手続き進行の表現がご本人に不利に見える理由を分かっているなら、答えてください。,如果您知道备忘中程序推进的表述为什么对您不利，请回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 좋지 않은 상태 기록을 알고도 절차를 진행한 윤정후의 판단을 묻는다.,Motive probe. Ask about Yoon Jeong-hu's judgment in proceeding with the procedure despite knowing the record of poor condition.,動機探索。よくない状態の記録を知りながら手続きを進めたユン・ジョンフの判断を問う。,动机探查。询问尹正厚明知存在状态不佳记录仍推进程序的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v4].text,그날 형에게 바로 말하지 않은 이유가 보호였는지 회피였는지 본인 말로 구분해 주십시오.,Please distinguish in your own words whether your reason for not telling your brother that day was protection or avoidance.,その日お兄様にすぐ話さなかった理由が保護だったのか回避だったのか、ご自身の言葉で区別してください。,请用您自己的话区分，那天没有立即告诉哥哥的理由是保护还是回避。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 좋지 않은 상태 기록을 알고도 절차를 진행한 윤정후의 판단을 묻는다.,Motive probe. Ask about Yoon Jeong-hu's judgment in proceeding with the procedure despite knowing the record of poor condition.,動機探索。よくない状態の記録を知りながら手続きを進めたユン・ジョンフの判断を問う。,动机探查。询问尹正厚明知存在状态不佳记录仍推进程序的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-b-scan_sequence-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증인 메모에 남은 불편한 대목을 지금까지 낮춰 말한 이유를 설명하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please explain why you have minimized the uncomfortable parts left in the notary's memo until now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証人のメモに残った不都合な箇所を、今まで低く言ってきた理由を説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明您为什么至今一直淡化公证人备忘中那些不舒服的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기의 무력감을 인정하되, 받은 사실/들은 설명/짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge helplessness during the crisis, while having him separate what he received, what he was told, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の無力感を認めつつ、受け取った事実、聞いた説明、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认危机时期的无力感，同时引导其区分收到的事实、听到的说明和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공장이 흔들리던 시기 자체가 본인에게는 가장 무너진 시간이었을 수 있습니다. 그때 들어온 큰돈을 어떻게 받아들였는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the period when the factory was shaking may have been the time you felt most broken. Please begin with how you accepted the large sum that came in then.",ユン・テソンさん、工場が揺らいでいた時期そのものが、ご本人にとって最も崩れた時間だったかもしれません。その時に入ってきた大金をどう受け止めたのかからお話しください。,尹泰成先生，工厂动摇的那段时期本身，可能是您最崩溃的时间。请先说明当时进来的那笔大钱，您是如何接受的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기의 무력감을 인정하되, 받은 사실/들은 설명/짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge helplessness during the crisis, while having him separate what he received, what he was told, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の無力感を認めつつ、受け取った事実、聞いた説明、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认危机时期的无力感，同时引导其区分收到的事实、听到的说明和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v2].text,"그 큰돈을 어머니가 보내주셨다고 믿었다면, 그 안에는 어머니에 대한 죄송함이 함께 있었을 것입니다. 그 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.","If you believed your mother had sent that large sum, there must also have been guilt toward her within it. Please honestly explain that feeling.",その大金をお母様が送ってくださったと信じていたなら、その中にはお母様への申し訳なさもあったはずです。その感触を率直にほどいてください。,如果您相信那笔大钱是母亲送来的，其中也会有对母亲的歉意。请坦诚说明这份心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기의 무력감을 인정하되, 받은 사실/들은 설명/짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge helplessness during the crisis, while having him separate what he received, what he was told, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の無力感を認めつつ、受け取った事実、聞いた説明、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认危机时期的无力感，同时引导其区分收到的事实、听到的说明和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 돈이 누구에게서 나왔는지 지금 단정하실 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 그때 그 돈에 대해 직접 들은 말과 본인이 짐작으로 채운 부분을 나눠 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide now where that money came from. Just separate what you directly heard about it at the time from the parts you filled in by inference.",ユン・テソンさん、そのお金が誰から出たのかを今断定する必要はありません。ただ、その時そのお金について直接聞いた言葉と、ご自身が推測で補った部分を分けてください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定那笔钱来自谁。请只把当时您直接听到的关于那笔钱的话，和您用推定补上的部分分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기의 무력감을 인정하되, 받은 사실/들은 설명/짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge helplessness during the crisis, while having him separate what he received, what he was told, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の無力感を認めつつ、受け取った事実、聞いた説明、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认危机时期的无力感，同时引导其区分收到的事实、听到的说明和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v4].text,위기 직후에는 출처를 따질 여력이 없었을 수 있습니다. 시간이 지난 지금 그 돈을 다시 떠올렸을 때 가장 먼저 든 의문이 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Right after the crisis, you may not have had the strength to question the source. Looking back at that money now, what question first comes to mind?",危機の直後には、出どころを問う余裕がなかったかもしれません。時間が経った今、そのお金をあらためて思い出した時、最初に浮かんだ疑問は何でしたか。,危机刚过时，您可能没有余力追问来源。如今再回想那笔钱时，最先出现的疑问是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기의 무력감을 인정하되, 받은 사실/들은 설명/짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge helplessness during the crisis, while having him separate what he received, what he was told, and what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の無力感を認めつつ、受け取った事実、聞いた説明、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认危机时期的无力感，同时引导其区分收到的事实、听到的说明和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-factory_crisis_support-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 큰돈이 들어왔다는 사실과 그 돈이 어디에서 출발했는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 확인한 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that a large sum came in and where that money started are separate issues. Please separate only what you confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、大金が入ってきたという事実と、そのお金がどこから出発したのかは別の問題です。ご自身が確認した分だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，大笔钱进来这一事实，和那笔钱从哪里出发，是不同的问题。请只按您确认的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출처 오인의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 입금/들은 입금/추정을 분리하게 한다. 오래된 지원 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of a mistaken source, while having him separate deposits he saw, deposits he heard about, and inference. Do not directly confirm old support.",共感アプローチ。出どころの誤認の重さを認めつつ、本人が見た入金、聞いた入金、推測を切り分けさせる。古い支援を直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认误认来源的沉重，同时引导其区分亲眼看到的入账、听说的入账和推定。禁止直接确认旧日支持。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 형으로서 어머니 돈이라고 믿어 온 돈의 출처가 다를 수 있다는 말을 듣는 것이 작은 일이 아닐 것입니다. 본인이 그 돈을 어머니 돈이라고 믿게 된 근거부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, hearing that money you long believed was your mother's may have had a different source cannot be a small matter for you as the older brother. Please begin with why you came to believe it was your mother's money.",ユン・テソンさん、兄としてお母様のお金だと信じてきたお金の出どころが違うかもしれないと聞くことは、小さなことではないはずです。そのお金をお母様のお金だと信じるようになった根拠からお話しください。,尹泰成先生，作为哥哥，听说自己长期相信是母亲的钱可能另有来源，这不是小事。请先说明您为什么会相信那是母亲的钱。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출처 오인의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 입금/들은 입금/추정을 분리하게 한다. 오래된 지원 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of a mistaken source, while having him separate deposits he saw, deposits he heard about, and inference. Do not directly confirm old support.",共感アプローチ。出どころの誤認の重さを認めつつ、本人が見た入金、聞いた入金、推測を切り分けさせる。古い支援を直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认误认来源的沉重，同时引导其区分亲眼看到的入账、听说的入账和推定。禁止直接确认旧日支持。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,"어머니가 챙겨주셨다고 받아들인 시간이 길었다면, 그 안에 어머니에 대한 미안함과 고마움이 함께 있었을 것입니다. 그 감정과 별개로, 본인이 직접 본 입금과 들어서 안 입금을 나눠 주십시오.","If you spent a long time accepting it as something your mother took care of, there must have been both apology and gratitude toward her in that time. Apart from that emotion, please separate deposits you personally saw from deposits you only knew about through others.",お母様が気にかけてくださったものとして受け止めた時間が長かったなら、その中にはお母様への申し訳なさと感謝が共にあったはずです。その感情とは別に、ご自身が直接見た入金と聞いて知った入金を分けてください。,如果长期把它理解为母亲照顾您的钱，那段时间里应该既有歉意也有感谢。请先把这份情绪放在一旁，区分您亲眼看到的入账和听说得知的入账。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출처 오인의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 입금/들은 입금/추정을 분리하게 한다. 오래된 지원 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of a mistaken source, while having him separate deposits he saw, deposits he heard about, and inference. Do not directly confirm old support.",共感アプローチ。出どころの誤認の重さを認めつつ、本人が見た入金、聞いた入金、推測を切り分けさせる。古い支援を直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认误认来源的沉重，同时引导其区分亲眼看到的入账、听说的入账和推定。禁止直接确认旧日支持。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 돈의 진짜 출처를 지금 단정하실 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 어머니 통장에서 보고 받은 것과 다른 경로로 받은 것을 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide the true source of the money now. Just separate what you saw and received from your mother's account from what you received through other routes.",ユン・テソンさん、お金の本当の出どころを今断定する必要はありません。ただ、お母様の通帳から見て受け取ったものと、別の経路で受け取ったものを分けてください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定钱的真正来源。请只把您从母亲账户看到并收到的部分，和通过其他路径收到的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출처 오인의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 입금/들은 입금/추정을 분리하게 한다. 오래된 지원 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of a mistaken source, while having him separate deposits he saw, deposits he heard about, and inference. Do not directly confirm old support.",共感アプローチ。出どころの誤認の重さを認めつつ、本人が見た入金、聞いた入金、推測を切り分けさせる。古い支援を直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认误认来源的沉重，同时引导其区分亲眼看到的入账、听说的入账和推定。禁止直接确认旧日支持。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,더 묻지 않은 채 받았던 시간에 대한 머쓱함이나 후회가 있다면 그 마음을 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 본인 짐작과 사실을 가려 따질 수 있습니다.,"If there is awkwardness or regret over the time you received it without asking further, please speak about that feeling. Only then can we distinguish your inference from fact.",深く尋ねないまま受け取っていた時間への気まずさや後悔があるなら、その思いをほどいてください。そうして初めて、ご自身の推測と事実を見分けられます。,如果您对不再追问就收下的那段时间感到尴尬或后悔，请说明那份心情。这样才能区分您的推定和事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출처 오인의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 입금/들은 입금/추정을 분리하게 한다. 오래된 지원 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of a mistaken source, while having him separate deposits he saw, deposits he heard about, and inference. Do not directly confirm old support.",共感アプローチ。出どころの誤認の重さを認めつつ、本人が見た入金、聞いた入金、推測を切り分けさせる。古い支援を直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认误认来源的沉重，同时引导其区分亲眼看到的入账、听说的入账和推定。禁止直接确认旧日支持。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 돈이 어머니 이름으로 들어왔다는 사실과 그 돈이 어디에서 출발했는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 확인한 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that the money came in under your mother's name and where that money began are separate issues. Please separate only what you confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、お金がお母様の名前で入ってきたという事実と、そのお金がどこから出発したのかは別の問題です。ご自身が確認した分だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，钱以母亲名义进来这一事实，和那笔钱从哪里出发，是不同的问题。请只按您确认的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 입금에 묶인 어머니에 대한 감정을 인정하되, 들은 말과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the feelings tied to the mother through long-term deposits, while having him separate what he was told from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。長期の入金に結びついたお母様への感情を認めつつ、聞いた言葉と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期入账所牵连的对母亲的情绪，同时引导其区分听到的话和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 보내주신 줄 알았던 돈이 길게 이어졌다면, 그 시간 자체가 형에게는 어머니에 대한 기억이 됐을 것입니다. 본인이 그 돈을 어떤 주기로 받아 왔는지 기억나는 만큼 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if the money you thought your mother sent continued for a long time, that time itself must have become a memory of her for you as the older brother. Please tell me, as far as you remember, at what intervals you received it.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様が送ってくださったと思っていたお金が長く続いたなら、その時間自体が兄にとってお母様の記憶になったはずです。そのお金をどのような周期で受け取ってきたのか、覚えている範囲でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果您以为是母亲送来的钱持续了很久，那段时间本身就会成为哥哥对母亲的记忆。请在记得的范围内说明您是以什么周期收到那些钱的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 입금에 묶인 어머니에 대한 감정을 인정하되, 들은 말과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the feelings tied to the mother through long-term deposits, while having him separate what he was told from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。長期の入金に結びついたお母様への感情を認めつつ、聞いた言葉と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期入账所牵连的对母亲的情绪，同时引导其区分听到的话和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v2].text,"묻지 않고 받아 온 시간이 길수록, 그 안의 의문도 함께 깊어졌을 수 있습니다. 본인이 그 입금에 대해 한 번이라도 따져봤던 시점이 있다면 그 장면을 짚어 주십시오.","The longer you received it without asking, the deeper the questions within it may have grown. If there was ever a time you examined those deposits, please point to that scene.",尋ねずに受け取ってきた時間が長いほど、その中の疑問も深くなっていたかもしれません。その入金について一度でも確かめた時点があるなら、その場面を指摘してください。,不问就收下的时间越久，其中的疑问也可能越深。如果您曾经核对过那些入账，请指出那个场景。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 입금에 묶인 어머니에 대한 감정을 인정하되, 들은 말과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the feelings tied to the mother through long-term deposits, while having him separate what he was told from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。長期の入金に結びついたお母様への感情を認めつつ、聞いた言葉と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期入账所牵连的对母亲的情绪，同时引导其区分听到的话和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 돈의 출처를 지금 단정하실 필요는 없습니다. 다만 어머니에게 들었다고 기억하는 말과 본인이 그 자리에서 채운 짐작을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide the source of that money now. Just separate what you remember hearing from your mother from the inferences you filled in there.",ユン・テソンさん、そのお金の出どころを今断定する必要はありません。ただ、お母様から聞いたと記憶している言葉と、その場でご自身が補った推測を分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定那笔钱的来源。请把您记得从母亲那里听到的话，和您当时自己补上的推定分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 입금에 묶인 어머니에 대한 감정을 인정하되, 들은 말과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the feelings tied to the mother through long-term deposits, while having him separate what he was told from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。長期の入金に結びついたお母様への感情を認めつつ、聞いた言葉と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期入账所牵连的对母亲的情绪，同时引导其区分听到的话和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v4].text,어머니의 손을 거쳐 들어온 돈에 어머니에 대한 죄송함이 같이 묶여 있었다면 그 결부터 말씀해 주십시오. 그래야 다음 이야기로 들어갈 수 있습니다.,"If guilt toward your mother was tied to the money that came through her hands, please start with that feeling. Then we can move to the next account.",お母様の手を経て入ってきたお金に、お母様への申し訳なさが結びついていたなら、その感触からお話しください。そうすれば次の話に進めます。,如果经母亲之手进来的钱与对母亲的歉意绑在一起，请先说明那份心情。这样才能进入下一段说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 입금에 묶인 어머니에 대한 감정을 인정하되, 들은 말과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the feelings tied to the mother through long-term deposits, while having him separate what he was told from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。長期の入金に結びついたお母様への感情を認めつつ、聞いた言葉と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期入账所牵连的对母亲的情绪，同时引导其区分听到的话和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-long_support_flow-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 정기적으로 들어왔다는 사실과 그 돈이 어디에서 출발했는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 본 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that money came in regularly and where that money started are separate issues. Please separate only what you saw.",ユン・テソンさん、定期的に入ってきたという事実と、そのお金がどこから出発したのかは別の問題です。ご自身が見た分だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，定期进账这一事实，和那些钱从哪里出发，是不同的问题。请只按您看到的部分分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 명의가 만든 묻기 어려움을 인정하되, 본 자료와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge how the mother's name made it hard to ask, while having him separate materials he saw from inference.",共感アプローチ。お母様名義が尋ねにくさを作ったことを認めつつ、本人が見た資料と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认母亲名义造成了难以追问的处境，同时引导其区分所见资料与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 통장이라는 통로를 거쳐 들어온 돈에 대해 의심하기보다 어머니 마음으로 받아들였던 시간이 길었을 것입니다. 그 통로를 처음 알게 된 경위부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, for a long time you may have accepted the money that came through the channel of your mother's passbook as her heart rather than something to suspect. Please begin with how you first came to know that channel.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の通帳という通路を経て入ってきたお金について、疑うよりもお母様の心として受け止めていた時間が長かったはずです。その通路を初めて知った経緯からお話しください。,尹泰成先生，对于经由母亲存折这个通道进来的钱，您长期可能不是怀疑，而是把它当作母亲的心意接受。请先说明您最初是如何知道这个通道的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 명의가 만든 묻기 어려움을 인정하되, 본 자료와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge how the mother's name made it hard to ask, while having him separate materials he saw from inference.",共感アプローチ。お母様名義が尋ねにくさを作ったことを認めつつ、本人が見た資料と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认母亲名义造成了难以追问的处境，同时引导其区分所见资料与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v2].text,"어머니 명의로 보였다는 사실 자체가, 형으로 하여금 더 묻기 어렵게 만든 면이 있었을 수 있습니다. 그 결을 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.","The fact that it appeared under your mother's name may itself have made it harder for you, as the older brother, to ask further. Please state that honestly.",お母様名義に見えたという事実自体が、兄としてさらに尋ねにくくさせた面があったかもしれません。その感触を率直にお話しください。,它看起来是母亲名义这一事实本身，可能让作为哥哥的您更难追问。请坦诚说明这份感觉。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 명의가 만든 묻기 어려움을 인정하되, 본 자료와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge how the mother's name made it hard to ask, while having him separate materials he saw from inference.",共感アプローチ。お母様名義が尋ねにくさを作ったことを認めつつ、本人が見た資料と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认母亲名义造成了难以追问的处境，同时引导其区分所见资料与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 통장 안의 모든 돈의 출처를 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 입금 알림을 본 자리와 통장을 직접 본 자리를 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide the source of all the money in that account now. Just separate the moment you saw deposit notices from the moment you saw the passbook directly.",ユン・テソンさん、その通帳の中のすべてのお金の出どころを今断定する必要はありません。ただ、入金通知を見た場と通帳を直接見た場を分けてください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定那个账户里所有钱的来源。请只区分您看到入账通知的场合和直接看到存折的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 명의가 만든 묻기 어려움을 인정하되, 본 자료와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge how the mother's name made it hard to ask, while having him separate materials he saw from inference.",共感アプローチ。お母様名義が尋ねにくさを作ったことを認めつつ、本人が見た資料と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认母亲名义造成了难以追问的处境，同时引导其区分所见资料与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v4].text,어머니 이름으로 들어온 돈을 따져 묻지 않은 시간에 대한 머쓱함이 있다면 그 마음을 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 본인 짐작과 사실을 가릴 수 있습니다.,"If there is awkwardness over the time you did not question money that came under your mother's name, please speak about that feeling. Only then can we distinguish your inference from fact.",お母様の名前で入ってきたお金を問いたださなかった時間への気まずさがあるなら、その思いをほどいてください。そうして初めて、ご自身の推測と事実を見分けられます。,如果您对没有追问以母亲名义进来的钱感到尴尬，请说明那份心情。这样才能区分您的推定和事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 명의가 만든 묻기 어려움을 인정하되, 본 자료와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge how the mother's name made it hard to ask, while having him separate materials he saw from inference.",共感アプローチ。お母様名義が尋ねにくさを作ったことを認めつつ、本人が見た資料と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认母亲名义造成了难以追问的处境，同时引导其区分所见资料与推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-mother_account_mask-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 통장이 통로였다는 사실과 그 통로에 들어간 돈의 주인이 누구였는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 본 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that your mother's passbook was the channel and who owned the money that entered through that channel are separate issues. Please separate only what you saw.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の通帳が通路だったという事実と、その通路に入ったお金の持ち主が誰だったのかは別の問題です。ご自身が見た分だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，母亲的存折是通道这一事实，和进入这个通道的钱属于谁，是不同的问题。请只按您看到的部分分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형의 자리 무게를 인정하되, 묻지 못한 책임을 본인 입장에서 정리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the older brother's position, while having him organize from his own side the responsibility for not asking.",共感アプローチ。兄という立場の重さを認めつつ、尋ねられなかった責任を本人の立場で整理させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥位置的分量，同时引导其从本人立场整理未能追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 형이라는 자리가 도움을 받기 어렵게 만드는 면이 있다는 점을 본인도 알고 계실 것입니다. 그 자리의 무게가 어떻게 본인에게 작용했는지 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you know that the position of older brother can make it difficult to accept help. Please first state how the weight of that position affected you.",ユン・テソンさん、兄という立場が助けを受けにくくする面があることは、ご本人も分かっていらっしゃるはずです。その立場の重みがご自身にどう作用したのか、まずお話しください。,尹泰成先生，您也知道哥哥这个位置有时会让人难以接受帮助。请先说明这个位置的分量如何作用在您身上。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형의 자리 무게를 인정하되, 묻지 못한 책임을 본인 입장에서 정리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the older brother's position, while having him organize from his own side the responsibility for not asking.",共感アプローチ。兄という立場の重さを認めつつ、尋ねられなかった責任を本人の立場で整理させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥位置的分量，同时引导其从本人立场整理未能追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v2].text,도움이 들어오는 모양 자체가 자존심을 건드릴 때 우선 받아들이고 묻지 않은 시간이 있었을 수 있습니다. 그 시간의 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,"When the very shape of receiving help touched your pride, there may have been a time you accepted it first and did not ask. Please honestly explain that time.",助けが入ってくる形そのものが自尊心に触れた時、まず受け入れて尋ねなかった時間があったかもしれません。その時間の感触を率直にほどいてください。,当帮助进入的形式本身触动自尊时，您可能先接受了，却没有追问。请坦诚说明那段时间的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형의 자리 무게를 인정하되, 묻지 못한 책임을 본인 입장에서 정리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the older brother's position, while having him organize from his own side the responsibility for not asking.",共感アプローチ。兄という立場の重さを認めつつ、尋ねられなかった責任を本人の立場で整理させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥位置的分量，同时引导其从本人立场整理未能追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생의 침묵을 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 동생의 도움이라고 한 번이라도 의심해 본 시점이 있었는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide your younger brother's silence now. Please begin with whether there was any time when you suspected it might be your younger brother's help.",ユン・テソンさん、弟さんの沈黙を今断定する必要はありません。ただ、それが弟さんの助けかもしれないと一度でも疑った時点があったのかからお話しください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定弟弟的沉默。请先说明您是否曾有过哪怕一次怀疑那可能是弟弟的帮助。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형의 자리 무게를 인정하되, 묻지 못한 책임을 본인 입장에서 정리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the older brother's position, while having him organize from his own side the responsibility for not asking.",共感アプローチ。兄という立場の重さを認めつつ、尋ねられなかった責任を本人の立場で整理させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥位置的分量，同时引导其从本人立场整理未能追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v4].text,"묻지 않은 채 시간이 흘렀다면, 그 안에 어떤 두려움이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오. 그래야 형으로서 어떤 책임을 본인이 졌어야 했는지 가릴 수 있습니다.","If time passed without your asking, please tell me what fear was inside it. Only then can we distinguish what responsibility you should have borne as the older brother.",尋ねないまま時間が流れたなら、その中にどのような恐れがあったのかお話しください。そうして初めて、兄としてどの責任を負うべきだったのか見分けられます。,如果时间在您没有追问中流逝，请说明其中有什么恐惧。这样才能区分您作为哥哥原本应承担什么责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형의 자리 무게를 인정하되, 묻지 못한 책임을 본인 입장에서 정리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of the older brother's position, while having him organize from his own side the responsibility for not asking.",共感アプローチ。兄という立場の重さを認めつつ、尋ねられなかった責任を本人の立場で整理させる。,共情接近。承认哥哥位置的分量，同时引导其从本人立场整理未能追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-a-silence_over_pride-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 형으로서의 자리와 그 자리 때문에 묻지 못한 일은 다른 문제입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, your position as the older brother and the things you could not ask because of that position are separate issues. Please speak about the two separately.",ユン・テソンさん、兄としての立場と、その立場のために尋ねられなかったことは別の問題です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，作为哥哥的位置，和因为这个位置而没能追问的事情，是不同的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기 결단의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of decisions made during the crisis, while having him separate the transfer act from the silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の決断の重さを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认危机时期决断的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递的来源。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 위기를 두고만 볼 수 없었던 시기가 있었다면, 그때 본인이 어떤 결단을 했는지를 본인이 가장 잘 알고 계실 것입니다. 그 결단의 결을 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was a time when you could not simply watch your brother's crisis, you know best what decision you made then. Please tell me as much of that decision as you can now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の危機をただ見ていることができなかった時期があったなら、その時ご自身がどのような決断をしたのか、ご自身が最もよく分かっているはずです。その決断の感触を、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，如果曾有一段时间您无法只是看着哥哥陷入危机，那么您最清楚自己当时做了什么决定。请在现在能说的范围内讲述那份决定的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기 결단의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of decisions made during the crisis, while having him separate the transfer act from the silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の決断の重さを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认危机时期决断的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递的来源。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v2].text,큰돈을 보내고도 본인 이름을 앞에 두지 못한 데 형에 대한 마음이 깊이 작용했을 수 있습니다. 그 마음의 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,Sending a large sum yet not putting your name forward may have been deeply shaped by your feelings toward your brother. Please explain that feeling honestly.,大金を送ってもご自身の名前を前に出せなかったことには、お兄様への思いが深く作用していたかもしれません。その心の感触を率直にほどいてください。,送出大笔钱却无法把自己的名字放到前面，这其中可能深受您对哥哥的心情影响。请坦诚说明这份心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기 결단의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of decisions made during the crisis, while having him separate the transfer act from the silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の決断の重さを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认危机时期决断的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递的来源。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 자금의 사용처를 한 번에 다 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 그 큰돈을 어떤 경로로 어디에 보냈는지부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every use of those funds at once. Just start by organizing through what route and where you sent that large sum.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その資金の使途を一度にすべてほどく必要はありません。ただ、その大金をどの経路でどこへ送ったのかから整理してください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说明那笔资金的全部用途。请先整理您通过什么路径把那笔大钱送到了哪里。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기 결단의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of decisions made during the crisis, while having him separate the transfer act from the silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の決断の重さを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认危机时期决断的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递的来源。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v4].text,위기 이후에도 그 일을 입에 올리지 않은 시간이 있다면 그 결을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 형의 자존심을 위한 침묵인지 본인의 거리 두기인지에 따라 무게가 달라집니다.,"If there was time after the crisis when you still did not mention it, please state its texture. The weight differs depending on whether it was silence for your brother's pride or your own distance.",危機の後にもそのことを口にしなかった時間があるなら、その感触をお話しください。それが兄の自尊心のための沈黙なのか、ご自身の距離置きなのかによって重みは変わります。,如果危机之后您仍有一段没有提起那件事的时间，请说明那段时间的脉络。那是为了哥哥自尊的沉默，还是您自己的保持距离，分量会不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 위기 시기 결단의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of decisions made during the crisis, while having him separate the transfer act from the silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。危機の時期の決断の重さを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认危机时期决断的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递的来源。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-factory_crisis_support-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 큰돈을 보냈다는 사실과 보낸 사실을 말하지 않은 일은 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 한 일과 한 침묵을 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you sent a large sum and the fact that you did not say you sent it are different matters. Please separate what you did from the silence you kept.",ユン・ジョンフさん、大金を送ったという事実と、それを送ったと話さなかったことは別の次元です。ご自身がしたことと、ご自身がした沈黙を分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，送出大笔钱这一事实，与没有说出自己送了这笔钱，是不同层面的问题。请把您做的事和您保持的沉默分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 침묵으로 보낸 돈의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵의 책임을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 등 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of money sent in silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the responsibility for silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。沈黙のまま送ったお金の重みを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の責任を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころなどを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认沉默中送出金钱的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默责任。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递来源等内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 오랜 시간 말하지 않고 보낸 돈에 대해 한 번에 다 풀어내야 할 자리는 아닙니다. 다만 그 돈을 어머니 이름 앞으로 보낸 이유부터 본인이 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, this is not a place where you must explain all at once the money you sent without speaking for a long time. Just begin with why you sent that money in your mother's name, as much as you can say.",ユン・ジョンフさん、長い時間語らずに送ったお金について、一度にすべてほどかなければならない場ではありません。ただ、そのお金をお母様の名前の前に送った理由から、話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，对于长期没有说明就送出的钱，这里不是要求您一次说清全部。请先在能说的范围内说明，为什么把那笔钱送到母亲名义前面。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 침묵으로 보낸 돈의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵의 책임을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 등 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of money sent in silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the responsibility for silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。沈黙のまま送ったお金の重みを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の責任を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころなどを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认沉默中送出金钱的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默责任。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递来源等内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,형에게 직접 건넸을 때 형의 자존심을 다칠까 봐 망설인 시간이 있었을 수 있습니다. 그 결을 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.,There may have been a time when you hesitated because handing it directly to your brother might hurt his pride. Please state that honestly.,お兄様に直接渡した時にお兄様の自尊心を傷つけるのではないかとためらった時間があったかもしれません。その感触を率直にお話しください。,您可能曾因为担心直接交给哥哥会伤到他的自尊而犹豫。请坦诚说明这份感觉。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 침묵으로 보낸 돈의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵의 책임을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 등 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of money sent in silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the responsibility for silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。沈黙のまま送ったお金の重みを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の責任を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころなどを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认沉默中送出金钱的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默责任。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递来源等内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 보낸 돈의 모든 사용처를 지금 다 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 직접 보낸 돈과 어머니 손을 거쳐 형에게 간 돈을 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every use of the money you sent now. Just separate the money you sent directly from the money that passed through your mother's hands to your brother.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身が送ったお金のすべての使途を今ほどく必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が直接送ったお金と、お母様の手を経てお兄様に渡ったお金を分けてください。,尹正厚先生，现在不必说明您所送钱款的全部用途。请只区分您直接送出的钱，以及经母亲之手到达哥哥的钱。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 침묵으로 보낸 돈의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵의 책임을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 등 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of money sent in silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the responsibility for silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。沈黙のまま送ったお金の重みを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の責任を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころなどを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认沉默中送出金钱的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默责任。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递来源等内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,보낸 돈을 두고 본인 안에 남은 부담이 있다면 그 마음을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 형에 대한 보호인지 본인을 위한 거리 두기인지에 따라 책임의 결이 달라집니다.,"If a burden remains in you over the money you sent, please speak about that feeling. The texture of responsibility changes depending on whether it was protection for your brother or distance for yourself.",送ったお金をめぐってご自身の中に残った負担があるなら、その思いをお話しください。それがお兄様への保護なのか、ご自身のための距離置きなのかによって、責任の感触は変わります。,如果围绕您送出的钱，心里还留有负担，请说明那份心情。那是对哥哥的保护，还是为自己保持距离，会改变责任的性质。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 침묵으로 보낸 돈의 무게를 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵의 책임을 분리하게 한다. 3억원 전달 출처 등 직접 확정 금지.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of money sent in silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the responsibility for silence. Do not directly confirm the source of the ₩300M transfer.",共感アプローチ。沈黙のまま送ったお金の重みを認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の責任を切り分けさせる。3億ウォン伝達の出どころなどを直接確定しない。,共情接近。承认沉默中送出金钱的分量，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默责任。禁止直接确认3亿韩元传递来源等内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 돈을 보냈다는 사실과 보낸 사실을 말하지 않은 일은 다른 차원입니다. 두 가지를 나누어, 본인이 한 일부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, sending the money and not saying that you sent it are different matters. Separate the two, and begin with what you did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お金を送ったという事実と、送った事実を言わなかったことは別の次元です。二つを分けて、ご自身がしたことからお話しください。,尹正厚先生，送钱这一事实，和没有说出送钱这一事实，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开，从您做过的事说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵 동기를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of long-term silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the motive for silence.",共感アプローチ。長期の沈黙の感触を認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の動機を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 오랜 시간 정기적으로 보낸 돈을 한 번도 본인 이름으로 알리지 않은 데 본인 나름의 이유가 있을 것입니다. 그 결을 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you must have had your own reason for regularly sending money for a long time without ever announcing it in your own name. Please tell me that as far as you can now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、長い時間、定期的に送ったお金を一度もご自身の名前で知らせなかったことには、ご自身なりの理由があったはずです。その感触を、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，长期定期送钱却一次也没有以自己的名义告知，您应该有自己的理由。请在现在能说的范围内说明这份脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵 동기를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of long-term silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the motive for silence.",共感アプローチ。長期の沈黙の感触を認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の動機を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v2].text,형의 사정이 어렵게 보일 때마다 매번 망설였을 본인의 마음을 짐작합니다. 그 망설임이 어디에서 멈추고 어디에서 입금으로 바뀌었는지 말씀해 주십시오.,I can imagine your hesitation each time your brother's circumstances looked difficult. Please tell me where that hesitation stopped and where it turned into a deposit.,お兄様の事情が苦しく見えるたびに、毎回迷ったご自身の気持ちは想像できます。その迷いがどこで止まり、どこで入金に変わったのかお話しください。,每次看到哥哥处境困难，您心里的犹豫可以想象。请说明这份犹豫在哪里停下，又在哪里变成了入账。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵 동기를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of long-term silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the motive for silence.",共感アプローチ。長期の沈黙の感触を認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の動機を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 모든 입금의 사용처를 한 번에 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 직접 보낸 입금과 어머니 손을 거쳤다고 인지한 입금을 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every deposit's use at once. Just separate deposits you personally sent from deposits you understood had passed through your mother's hands.",ユン・ジョンフさん、すべての入金の使途を一度にほどく必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が直接送った入金と、お母様の手を経たと認識していた入金を分けてください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说明全部入账的用途。请只区分您亲自转出的入账，和您认知中经过母亲之手的入账。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵 동기를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of long-term silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the motive for silence.",共感アプローチ。長期の沈黙の感触を認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の動機を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v4].text,본인 이름을 숨긴 시간의 어떤 결이 형의 체면을 위한 것이었고 어떤 결이 본인의 거리 두기였는지 말씀해 주십시오. 그 차이에 따라 책임의 결이 달라집니다.,"Please state which texture in the time you hid your name was for your brother's face, and which was your own distancing. The texture of responsibility changes with that difference.",ご自身の名前を隠した時間のどの感触が、お兄様の体面のためだったのか、どの感触がご自身の距離置きだったのかお話しください。その違いによって責任の感触は変わります。,请说明，在隐藏自己名字的那段时间里，哪一部分是为了哥哥的体面，哪一部分是您自己的保持距离。这一差异会改变责任的性质。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장기 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 송금 행위와 침묵 동기를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of long-term silence, while having him separate the transfer act from the motive for silence.",共感アプローチ。長期の沈黙の感触を認めつつ、送金行為と沈黙の動機を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认长期沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分转账行为与沉默动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-long_support_flow-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 정기적으로 보냈다는 사실과 그 사실을 형에게 말하지 않은 일은 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 한 일과 한 침묵을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you sent it regularly and the fact that you did not tell your brother are different matters. Separate what you did from the silence you kept.",ユン・ジョンフさん、定期的に送っていたという事実と、その事実をお兄様に話さなかったことは別の次元です。ご自身がしたことと、ご自身がした沈黙を分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，定期转账这一事实，和没有把这个事实告诉哥哥，是不同层面的问题。请把您做过的事和您保持的沉默分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 통로 설계의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 한 일과 어머니의 인지를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of designing the channel, while having him separate what he did from what his mother knew.",共感アプローチ。通路設計の重みを認めつつ、本人がしたこととお母様の認知を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认设计通道的分量，同时引导其区分本人行为与母亲的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인 돈을 어머니 이름으로 보이게 한 구조를 한 번에 다 설명할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 그 통로를 처음 쓰게 된 자리를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain all at once the structure that made your money appear under your mother's name. Just tell me when you first used that channel.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身のお金をお母様の名前に見えるようにした構造を、一度にすべて説明する必要はありません。ただ、その通路を初めて使うことになった場をお話しください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说明让您的钱看起来像母亲名义的整个结构。请先说明您第一次使用这个通道的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 통로 설계의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 한 일과 어머니의 인지를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of designing the channel, while having him separate what he did from what his mother knew.",共感アプローチ。通路設計の重みを認めつつ、本人がしたこととお母様の認知を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认设计通道的分量，同时引导其区分本人行为与母亲的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v2].text,"어머니 이름이 앞에 서면 형이 받기 더 편할 것이라는 마음이 있었다면, 그 마음의 결을 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","If you thought your brother would receive it more easily with your mother's name in front, please state that feeling as it was.",お母様の名前が前に立てばお兄様が受け取りやすいという思いがあったなら、その心の感触をそのままお話しください。,如果您认为母亲的名字摆在前面会让哥哥更容易接受，请如实说明那份心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 통로 설계의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 한 일과 어머니의 인지를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of designing the channel, while having him separate what he did from what his mother knew.",共感アプローチ。通路設計の重みを認めつつ、本人がしたこととお母様の認知を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认设计通道的分量，同时引导其区分本人行为与母亲的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 통장을 통로로 쓴 모든 동기를 한 번에 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 누가 그 흐름을 알고 있었고 어머니에게는 어떻게 설명했는지부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every motive for using your mother's passbook as a channel at once. First organize who knew the flow and how you explained it to your mother.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の通帳を通路として使ったすべての動機を一度にほどく必要はありません。まず、誰がその流れを知っていたのか、お母様にはどのように説明したのかから整理してください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说明使用母亲存折作为通道的所有动机。请先整理谁知道这条流向，以及您如何向母亲说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 통로 설계의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 한 일과 어머니의 인지를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of designing the channel, while having him separate what he did from what his mother knew.",共感アプローチ。通路設計の重みを認めつつ、本人がしたこととお母様の認知を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认设计通道的分量，同时引导其区分本人行为与母亲的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v4].text,그 구조를 형에게 알리지 않은 데 본인 나름의 이유가 있다면 그 마음을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 보호인지 회피인지에 따라 무게가 달라집니다.,"If you had your own reason for not telling your brother about that structure, please state that feeling. Its weight changes depending on whether it was protection or avoidance.",その構造をお兄様に知らせなかったことにご自身なりの理由があるなら、その思いをお話しください。それが保護なのか回避なのかによって重みは変わります。,如果没有把这个结构告诉哥哥有您自己的理由，请说明那份心情。那是保护还是回避，会让分量不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 통로 설계의 무게를 인정하되, 본인이 한 일과 어머니의 인지를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the weight of designing the channel, while having him separate what he did from what his mother knew.",共感アプローチ。通路設計の重みを認めつつ、本人がしたこととお母様の認知を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。承认设计通道的分量，同时引导其区分本人行为与母亲的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-mother_account_mask-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 이름으로 보이게 했다는 사실과 그 흐름을 어머니가 어디까지 알고 계셨는지는 다른 문제입니다. 본인이 한 일부터 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, making it appear under your mother's name and how much your mother knew about that flow are separate issues. Please separate what you did first.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の名前に見えるようにしたという事実と、その流れをお母様がどこまで知っていらしたのかは別の問題です。ご自身がしたことから切り分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，让它看起来是母亲名义这一事实，与母亲对这条流向知道多少，是不同的问题。请先分开说明您做过的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호적 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 보호와 회피를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of protective silence, while having him separate protection from avoidance.",共感アプローチ。保護的な沈黙の感触を認めつつ、保護と回避を切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认保护性沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分保护与回避。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 자존심을 다칠까 봐 본인 이름을 숨겨 온 시간이 본인에게도 가벼웠을 리 없습니다. 그 침묵의 결을 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the time you hid your name for fear of hurting your brother's pride could not have been light for you either. Please tell me the texture of that silence as far as you can now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の自尊心を傷つけるのではないかとご自身の名前を隠してきた時間は、ご本人にとっても軽かったはずがありません。その沈黙の感触を、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，因为怕伤到哥哥的自尊而隐藏自己名字的那段时间，对您来说也不可能轻。请在现在能说的范围内讲述这份沉默的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호적 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 보호와 회피를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of protective silence, while having him separate protection from avoidance.",共感アプローチ。保護的な沈黙の感触を認めつつ、保護と回避を切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认保护性沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分保护与回避。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v2].text,보호하려 한 침묵이 시간이 흐르면서 다른 모양으로 변해 갔을 수 있습니다. 어느 시점부터 침묵의 의미가 본인 안에서 달라졌는지 말씀해 주십시오.,A silence that began as protection may have changed shape as time passed. Please tell me from what point its meaning changed within you.,守ろうとした沈黙が、時間が流れる中で別の形に変わっていったかもしれません。どの時点から沈黙の意味がご自身の中で変わったのかお話しください。,原本为了保护的沉默，随着时间流逝可能变成了另一种形态。请说明从什么时候起，这份沉默在您心中的意义发生了变化。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호적 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 보호와 회피를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of protective silence, while having him separate protection from avoidance.",共感アプローチ。保護的な沈黙の感触を認めつつ、保護と回避を切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认保护性沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分保护与回避。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 침묵의 모든 동기를 한 번에 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 한 번이라도 형에게 말하려 했던 자리가 있었는지부터 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every motive for that silence at once. Just start by pointing out whether there was ever a place where you tried to tell your brother.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その沈黙のすべての動機を一度にほどく必要はありません。ただ、お兄様に話そうとした場が一度でもあったのかから指摘してください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说明那份沉默的所有动机。请先指出您是否曾有过哪怕一次想告诉哥哥的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호적 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 보호와 회피를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of protective silence, while having him separate protection from avoidance.",共感アプローチ。保護的な沈黙の感触を認めつつ、保護と回避を切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认保护性沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分保护与回避。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v4].text,침묵이 길어지면서 본인 안에 거리감이 자리 잡았다면 그 결을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 보호의 끝인지 회피의 시작인지에 따라 책임의 모양이 달라집니다.,"If distance took root inside you as the silence grew longer, please state its texture. The shape of responsibility changes depending on whether that was the end of protection or the beginning of avoidance.",沈黙が長くなるにつれて、ご自身の中に距離感が根づいたなら、その感触をお話しください。それが保護の終わりなのか回避の始まりなのかによって、責任の形は変わります。,如果沉默变长后，您心里生出了距离感，请说明那份脉络。那是保护的终点还是回避的起点，会改变责任的形态。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호적 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 보호와 회피를 분리해 말하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the texture of protective silence, while having him separate protection from avoidance.",共感アプローチ。保護的な沈黙の感触を認めつつ、保護と回避を切り分けて話させる。,共情接近。承认保护性沉默的脉络，同时引导其区分保护与回避。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-b-silence_over_pride-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 체면을 위한 침묵과 본인의 거리 두기는 다른 차원의 문제입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, silence for your brother's face and your own distancing are issues on different levels. Please separate the two.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の体面のための沈黙と、ご自身の距離置きは別の次元の問題です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，为哥哥体面而沉默，和您自己的保持距离，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 받은 큰돈에 대한 윤태성 본인 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he personally recognized the large sum received during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on his behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期に受け取った大金について、ユン・テソン本人の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对危机时期收到的大笔钱的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공장 자금 위기가 있던 시기에 본인이 받은 큰돈에 대해 본인이 알고 있던 출처를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state in chronological order the source you understood for the large sum you received during the factory funding crisis.",ユン・テソンさん、工場の資金危機があった時期にご自身が受け取った大金について、ご自身が知っていた出どころを時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请按时间顺序说明，在工厂资金危机时期您收到的大笔钱，您当时认知的来源是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 받은 큰돈에 대한 윤태성 본인 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he personally recognized the large sum received during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on his behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期に受け取った大金について、ユン・テソン本人の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对危机时期收到的大笔钱的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v2].text,본인이 직접 받았다고 기억하는 회차와 자금 흐름만으로 알고 있는 회차를 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the instances you remember receiving directly from the instances you knew only through the flow of funds.,ご自身が直接受け取ったと記憶している回次と、資金の流れだけで知っている回次を分けて答えてください。,请把您记得自己直接收到的次数，和只是通过资金流向得知的次数分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 받은 큰돈에 대한 윤태성 본인 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he personally recognized the large sum received during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on his behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期に受け取った大金について、ユン・テソン本人の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对危机时期收到的大笔钱的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v3].text,공장 위기 시점의 송금 내역과 본인이 그 무렵 어머니께 들은 설명이 어긋나는 지점이 있다면 짚어 주십시오.,"If the transfer details from the time of the factory crisis diverge from the explanation you heard from your mother around then, please point out where they diverge.",工場危機の時点の送金内訳と、その頃お母様から聞いた説明が食い違う点があるなら指摘してください。,如果工厂危机时点的转账明细与当时从母亲那里听到的说明不一致，请指出不一致之处。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 받은 큰돈에 대한 윤태성 본인 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he personally recognized the large sum received during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on his behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期に受け取った大金について、ユン・テソン本人の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对危机时期收到的大笔钱的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v4].text,"그 큰돈을 받은 시점에 본인이 어머니께 어떤 감사 인사를 드렸는지, 또는 동생에게 어떤 인사를 했는지 본인이 기억하는 그대로 정리해 주십시오.","At the time you received that large sum, what thanks did you give your mother, or what thanks did you give your younger brother? Organize it as you remember.",その大金を受け取った時点で、ご自身がお母様にどのような感謝の言葉を伝えたのか、または弟さんにどのような挨拶をしたのか、ご自身の記憶どおりに整理してください。,在收到那笔大钱时，您向母亲表达过什么感谢，或者向弟弟说过什么？请按自己的记忆整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 받은 큰돈에 대한 윤태성 본인 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he personally recognized the large sum received during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on his behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期に受け取った大金について、ユン・テソン本人の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对危机时期收到的大笔钱的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-factory_crisis_support-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 자금의 실제 출처에 대한 본인의 추정과 본인이 들은 사실을 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please separate your inferences about the actual source of those funds from the facts you were told.",ユン・テソンさん、その資金の実際の出どころについてのご自身の推測と、ご自身が聞いた事実を分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请把您对那笔资金实际来源的推定，和您听到的事实分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 출처에 대한 윤태성의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the funding source. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on his behalf.",事実追及。資金の出どころに対するユン・テソンの認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对资金来源的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 어머니 통장에서 나오는 돈이라고 알고 있던 자금을 어떤 경로로 알게 되셨는지 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state in chronological order through what route you came to know the funds as money coming from your mother's account.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身がお母様の通帳から出るお金だと知っていた資金を、どのような経路で知ることになったのか、時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请按时间顺序说明，您是通过什么路径得知那笔资金是从母亲账户出来的钱。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 출처에 대한 윤태성의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the funding source. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on his behalf.",事実追及。資金の出どころに対するユン・テソンの認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对资金来源的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,"어머니 돈이라고 본인이 직접 확인한 부분과, 단순히 그렇게 알고 있던 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.",Please separate what you personally confirmed as your mother's money from what you simply understood that way.,お母様のお金だとご自身が直接確認した部分と、単にそう知っていた部分を分けて答えてください。,请把您亲自确认是母亲的钱的部分，和只是这样认知的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 출처에 대한 윤태성의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the funding source. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on his behalf.",事実追及。資金の出どころに対するユン・テソンの認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对资金来源的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,"동생의 진술과 본인의 기억이 다른 부분이 있다면, 어느 시점의 어떤 자금에 대해 다른지 짚어 주십시오.","If your younger brother's statement and your memory differ, please point out at what time and about which funds they differ.",弟さんの陳述とご自身の記憶が異なる部分があるなら、どの時点のどの資金について異なるのか指摘してください。,如果弟弟的陈述和您的记忆有不同，请指出是在什么时间点、关于哪笔资金不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 출처에 대한 윤태성의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the funding source. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on his behalf.",事実追及。資金の出どころに対するユン・テソンの認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对资金来源的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,"본인이 어머니께 도움을 받았다고 알고 있던 일이 있다면, 그 자금을 본인이 누구의 돈으로 알고 있었는지 사실 그대로 정리해 주십시오.","If you knew of an instance where you received help from your mother, organize truthfully whose money you understood those funds to be.",ご自身がお母様から助けを受けたと知っていたことがあるなら、その資金を誰のお金として知っていたのか、事実どおりに整理してください。,如果您知道有过从母亲那里获得帮助的事，请如实整理您当时认为那笔资金是谁的钱。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 출처에 대한 윤태성의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the funding source. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on his behalf.",事実追及。資金の出どころに対するユン・テソンの認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。让尹泰成以事实回答其对资金来源的认知路径。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 자금의 출처에 대해 본인이 직접 확인한 사실과 추정으로 채워 둔 부분을 따로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please answer separately the facts you personally confirmed and the parts you filled in by inference about the source of the funds.",ユン・テソンさん、資金の出どころについてご自身が直接確認した事実と、推測で補っていた部分を別々に答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请分别回答关于资金来源，您亲自确认的事实和用推定补上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 받은 회차와 사용처를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as facts the installments received and their uses.,事実追及。受け取った回次と使途を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答收到的次数与用途。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니로부터 받았다고 본인이 알고 있던 정기 지원금이 어느 시기부터 어느 시기까지 들어왔는지 본인이 기억하는 흐름대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state, in the flow you remember, from when to when the regular support money you understood as coming from your mother came in.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様から受け取ったとご自身が知っていた定期支援金が、どの時期からどの時期まで入ってきたのか、ご自身が記憶する流れどおりにお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请按您记得的流向说明，您认为来自母亲的定期支援金，是从什么时候到什么时候进来的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 받은 회차와 사용처를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as facts the installments received and their uses.,事実追及。受け取った回次と使途を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答收到的次数与用途。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v2].text,그 돈을 본인이 직접 받은 회차와 가족 명의로 받은 회차를 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the instances where you personally received the money from the instances received under a family member's name.,そのお金をご自身が直接受け取った回次と、家族名義で受け取った回次を分けて答えてください。,请把您亲自收到的钱款次数，和以家人名义收到的次数分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 받은 회차와 사용처를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as facts the installments received and their uses.,事実追及。受け取った回次と使途を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答收到的次数与用途。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v3].text,송금 내역과 본인의 기억이 다른 부분이 있다면 어느 시기의 어떤 송금에 대해 다른지 짚어 주십시오.,"If transfer records and your memory differ, please point out which transfer in which period differs.",送金内訳とご自身の記憶が異なる部分があるなら、どの時期のどの送金について異なるのか指摘してください。,如果转账明细和您的记忆有不同，请指出是哪一时期的哪笔转账不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 받은 회차와 사용처를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as facts the installments received and their uses.,事実追及。受け取った回次と使途を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答收到的次数与用途。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v4].text,"본인이 받은 돈을 어디에 사용했고 누구와 그 사용처를 의논했는지, 알고 있는 사실만 정리해 주십시오.",Please organize only the facts you know: where you used the money you received and with whom you discussed that use.,ご自身が受け取ったお金をどこに使い、誰とその使途を相談したのか、知っている事実だけを整理してください。,请只整理您知道的事实：您把收到的钱用在了哪里，以及和谁商量过用途。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 받은 회차와 사용처를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as facts the installments received and their uses.,事実追及。受け取った回次と使途を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答收到的次数与用途。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-long_support_flow-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 돈의 출처에 대한 본인의 추정은 잠시 미뤄 두고, 본인이 받은 사실 자체부터 사실 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside your inference about the source of that money for the moment, and first state truthfully the fact that you received it.",ユン・テソンさん、そのお金の出どころに対するご自身の推測はいったん置き、まずご自身が受け取った事実そのものから事実どおりにお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请暂时放下对那笔钱来源的推定，先如实说明您收到这笔钱这一事实本身。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 입금자명 그대로의 인지를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the depositor name exactly as shown.,事実追及。入金者名そのままの認知を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答其对入账人姓名原样的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 계좌에서 들어왔다고 본인이 알고 있던 돈이 실제로 어떤 절차로 본인 계좌에 닿았는지 본인이 기억하는 흐름대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state in the flow you remember how the money you understood as coming from your mother's account actually reached your account through procedures.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の口座から入ったとご自身が知っていたお金が、実際にどのような手続きでご自身の口座に届いたのか、ご自身が記憶する流れどおりにお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请按您记得的流向说明，您认为来自母亲账户的钱，实际上是通过什么程序到达您账户的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 입금자명 그대로의 인지를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the depositor name exactly as shown.,事実追及。入金者名そのままの認知を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答其对入账人姓名原样的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v2].text,어머니로부터 직접 들으신 사정과 어머니 통장 입금 내역으로만 알고 있던 사정을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the circumstances you heard directly from your mother from the circumstances you knew only through deposit details in your mother's passbook.,お母様から直接聞いた事情と、お母様の通帳の入金内訳だけで知っていた事情を分けて答えてください。,请把您从母亲那里直接听到的情况，和仅通过母亲存折入账明细知道的情况分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 입금자명 그대로의 인지를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the depositor name exactly as shown.,事実追及。入金者名そのままの認知を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答其对入账人姓名原样的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v3].text,입금자명이 어머니로 표시되어 있던 회차에 대해 본인이 그 자금을 어떻게 받아들였는지 사실관계만으로 답해 주십시오.,"Regarding the instances where the depositor name was displayed as your mother, answer only with the facts of how you understood those funds.",入金者名がお母様として表示されていた回次について、ご自身がその資金をどのように受け止めたのか、事実関係だけで答えてください。,关于入账人姓名显示为母亲的次数，请只按事实回答您当时如何理解那些资金。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 입금자명 그대로의 인지를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the depositor name exactly as shown.,事実追及。入金者名そのままの認知を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答其对入账人姓名原样的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v4].text,본인이 어머니 통장 잔고를 직접 확인하거나 통장 사본을 본 적이 있다면 그 시점과 자료를 정리해 주십시오.,"If you ever directly checked your mother's passbook balance or saw a copy of the passbook, organize when and what material you saw.",ご自身がお母様の通帳残高を直接確認したり通帳の写しを見たりしたことがあるなら、その時点と資料を整理してください。,如果您曾直接确认母亲存折余额，或看过存折复印件，请整理时间点和资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 입금자명 그대로의 인지를 윤태성이 본 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact his awareness of the depositor name exactly as shown.,事実追及。入金者名そのままの認知を、ユン・テソンが見た事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让尹泰成以所见事实回答其对入账人姓名原样的认知。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-mother_account_mask-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 이름과 실제 출처가 다를 가능성에 대한 해석은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 본 입금자명 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside interpretation of the possibility that the name and actual source differed, and answer exactly the depositor name you saw.",ユン・テソンさん、名前と実際の出どころが異なる可能性についての解釈はいったん置き、ご自身が見た入金者名そのままで答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请先放下对姓名与实际来源可能不同的解读，按您看到的入账人姓名原样回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 침묵한 자리를 시점·상대 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer about the places of silence by time and counterpart.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが沈黙した場を、時点と相手単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按时间点和对象回答其沉默的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 자금 사정에 대해 본인이 가족에게 말하지 않은 시기가 있다면 그 시기를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there were times when you did not tell your family about your financial circumstances, please state those times in chronological order.",ユン・テソンさん、資金事情についてご自身が家族に話さなかった時期があるなら、その時期を時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果您有过没有把资金情况告诉家人的时期，请按时间顺序说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 침묵한 자리를 시점·상대 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer about the places of silence by time and counterpart.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが沈黙した場を、時点と相手単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按时间点和对象回答其沉默的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v2].text,"본인이 침묵을 지킨 자리와, 다른 사람이 대신 침묵을 지켜 준 자리를 분리해 주십시오.",Please separate the places where you kept silence yourself from the places where someone else kept silence on your behalf.,ご自身が沈黙を守った場と、他の人が代わりに沈黙を守ってくれた場を分けてください。,请把您自己保持沉默的场合，和他人替您保持沉默的场合分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 침묵한 자리를 시점·상대 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer about the places of silence by time and counterpart.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが沈黙した場を、時点と相手単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按时间点和对象回答其沉默的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v3].text,동생은 본인의 자존심 때문에 자금 이야기가 미뤄졌다고 봅니다. 본인이 직접 화제를 막은 자리가 있었는지 사실관계만으로 답해 주십시오.,Your younger brother believes the money issue was delayed because of your pride. Answer only as fact whether there was a place where you personally blocked that topic.,弟さんは、ご本人の自尊心のために資金の話が先延ばしになったと見ています。ご自身が直接その話題を止めた場があったのか、事実関係だけで答えてください。,弟弟认为资金的话题是因为您的自尊而被推迟的。请只按事实回答，是否有您亲自阻止这个话题的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 침묵한 자리를 시점·상대 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer about the places of silence by time and counterpart.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが沈黙した場を、時点と相手単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按时间点和对象回答其沉默的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v4].text,"본인이 도움을 받았는데도 인사를 미룬 자리가 있다면, 그 자리의 상대와 시점을 정리해 주십시오.","If there was a place where you received help yet delayed thanks, organize the counterpart and timing of that place.",ご自身が助けを受けたにもかかわらず挨拶を後回しにした場があるなら、その場の相手と時点を整理してください。,如果有您获得帮助却推迟致谢的场合，请整理该场合的对象和时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤태성이 침묵한 자리를 시점·상대 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer about the places of silence by time and counterpart.,事実追及。ユン・テソンが沈黙した場を、時点と相手単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按时间点和对象回答其沉默的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-a-silence_over_pride-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 자존심 문제에 대한 본인의 평가는 잠시 미뤄 두고, 어느 자리에서 어떤 말을 하지 않았는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside your own assessment of the pride issue for the moment, and answer first where and what words you did not say.",ユン・テソンさん、自尊心の問題についてのご自身の評価はいったん置き、どの場でどの言葉を言わなかったのかから答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请暂时放下对自尊问题的自我评价，先回答您在哪个场合没有说哪些话。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 자금 처리에서 윤정후가 직접 처리한 부분을 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the parts he directly handled in funding during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期の資金処理でユン・ジョンフが直接処理した部分を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答危机时期资金处理中他亲自处理的部分。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 공장 자금 위기 시기에 큰돈이 흘러간 경로 가운데 본인이 관여한 부분을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, during your brother's factory funding crisis, please state in chronological order the parts in the route of the large sum where you were involved.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の工場資金危機の時期に大金が流れた経路の中で、ご自身が関与した部分を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，在哥哥工厂资金危机时期，大笔钱流动的路径中，请按时间顺序说明您参与的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 자금 처리에서 윤정후가 직접 처리한 부분을 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the parts he directly handled in funding during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期の資金処理でユン・ジョンフが直接処理した部分を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答危机时期资金处理中他亲自处理的部分。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v2].text,본인이 직접 처리한 자금과 어머니 명의를 거치게 둔 자금을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the funds you handled directly from the funds you allowed to pass through your mother's name.,ご自身が直接処理した資金と、お母様名義を経るようにした資金を分けて答えてください。,请把您亲自处理的资金，和您让其经过母亲名义的资金分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 자금 처리에서 윤정후가 직접 처리한 부분을 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the parts he directly handled in funding during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期の資金処理でユン・ジョンフが直接処理した部分を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答危机时期资金处理中他亲自处理的部分。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v3].text,형은 그 돈을 어머니께서 마련해 주신 것으로 알고 있었다고 진술합니다. 본인이 형에게 출처를 알리지 않은 시점이 언제인지 사실관계만으로 답해 주십시오.,Your brother states that he understood that money was prepared by your mother. Answer only as fact when you did not tell him the source.,お兄様は、そのお金をお母様が用意してくださったものとして知っていたと陳述しています。ご自身がお兄様に出どころを知らせなかった時点がいつなのか、事実関係だけで答えてください。,哥哥陈述称他以为那笔钱是母亲准备的。请只按事实回答，您没有向哥哥告知来源的时间点是什么时候。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 자금 처리에서 윤정후가 직접 처리한 부분을 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the parts he directly handled in funding during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期の資金処理でユン・ジョンフが直接処理した部分を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答危机时期资金处理中他亲自处理的部分。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v4].text,"그 시기에 본인이 어머니와 자금 처리에 대해 나눈 대화가 있었다면, 본인이 어머니께 동의를 어떻게 받아 두었는지 정리해 주십시오.","If you had a conversation with your mother about handling the funds during that period, organize how you obtained her consent.",その時期にご自身がお母様と資金処理について交わした会話があったなら、お母様の同意をどのように得ておいたのか整理してください。,如果那段时期您曾与母亲就资金处理交谈，请整理您如何取得了母亲的同意。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 위기 시기 자금 처리에서 윤정후가 직접 처리한 부분을 시간순으로 답하게 한다. S5 전 대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order the parts he directly handled in funding during the crisis. Before S5, avoid directly confirming payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。危機の時期の資金処理でユン・ジョンフが直接処理した部分を時系列で答えさせる。S5前は立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答危机时期资金处理中他亲自处理的部分。S5前避免直接确认代付表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-factory_crisis_support-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 돈을 보낸 동기에 대한 진술은 미뤄 두고, 어떤 시각에 어떤 계좌로 돈이 움직였는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside testimony about your motive for sending the money, and first answer what time and to what account the money moved.",ユン・ジョンフさん、そのお金を送った動機についての陳述はいったん置き、どの時刻にどの口座へお金が動いたのかから答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请先放下关于送钱动机的陈述，先回答钱是在什么时间、流向了哪个账户。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 흐름의 단계와 윤정후 송금 회차를 사실로 정리한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Organize as fact the stages of the fund flow and the installments Yoon Jeong-hu transferred. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。資金の流れの段階とユン・ジョンフの送金回次を事実として整理する。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。将资金流向的阶段与尹正厚的转账次数整理为事实。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형에게 들어간 자금에 본인이 관여한 부분이 있다면 시점과 경로를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there were parts where you were involved in funds entering your brother's side, please state the timing and route in chronological order.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様に入った資金にご自身が関与した部分があるなら、時点と経路を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，如果进入哥哥那边的资金有您参与的部分，请按时间顺序说明时间点和路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 흐름의 단계와 윤정후 송금 회차를 사실로 정리한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Organize as fact the stages of the fund flow and the installments Yoon Jeong-hu transferred. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。資金の流れの段階とユン・ジョンフの送金回次を事実として整理する。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。将资金流向的阶段与尹正厚的转账次数整理为事实。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].text,본인이 직접 보낸 돈과 어머니 명의로 보이게 둔 돈을 따로 정리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separately organize the money you sent directly and the money you allowed to appear under your mother's name.,ご自身が直接送ったお金と、お母様名義に見えるようにしたお金を別々に整理して答えてください。,请分别整理您直接送出的钱，以及您让其看起来像母亲名义的钱。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 흐름의 단계와 윤정후 송금 회차를 사실로 정리한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Organize as fact the stages of the fund flow and the installments Yoon Jeong-hu transferred. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。資金の流れの段階とユン・ジョンフの送金回次を事実として整理する。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。将资金流向的阶段与尹正厚的转账次数整理为事实。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].text,형은 그 돈을 어머니 돈으로 알고 있었습니다. 본인이 형에게 출처를 알리지 않은 사실에 대해 본인이 직접 한 행동만 답해 주십시오.,Your brother understood that money as your mother's money. Answer only the actions you personally took regarding the fact that you did not tell him the source.,お兄様はそのお金をお母様のお金として知っていました。ご自身がお兄様に出どころを知らせなかった事実について、ご自身が直接した行動だけを答えてください。,哥哥把那笔钱理解为母亲的钱。关于您没有向哥哥告知来源这一事实，请只回答您亲自做过的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 흐름의 단계와 윤정후 송금 회차를 사실로 정리한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Organize as fact the stages of the fund flow and the installments Yoon Jeong-hu transferred. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。資金の流れの段階とユン・ジョンフの送金回次を事実として整理する。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。将资金流向的阶段与尹正厚的转账次数整理为事实。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].text,송금 기록 가운데 본인이 직접 처리한 회차와 다른 경로를 거친 회차를 분리해 주십시오.,"Among the transfer records, please separate the installments you handled directly from those that passed through other routes.",送金記録のうち、ご自身が直接処理した回次と別の経路を経た回次を分けてください。,请在转账记录中，区分您亲自处理的次数和经过其他路径的次数。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자금 흐름의 단계와 윤정후 송금 회차를 사실로 정리한다. S5 전 20년·대납 직접 확정 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Organize as fact the stages of the fund flow and the installments Yoon Jeong-hu transferred. Before S5, avoid directly confirming 20 years or payment on another's behalf.",事実追及。資金の流れの段階とユン・ジョンフの送金回次を事実として整理する。S5前は20年や立替払いを直接確定する表現を避ける。,事实追问。将资金流向的阶段与尹正厚的转账次数整理为事实。S5前避免直接确认20年、代付等表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 자금 흐름의 의미에 대한 진술은 잠시 미뤄 두고, 본인이 어떤 계좌에서 어떤 계좌로 돈을 보냈는지 사실 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside testimony about what the fund flow means, and state truthfully which account you sent money from and which account you sent it to.",ユン・ジョンフさん、資金の流れの意味についての陳述はいったん置き、ご自身がどの口座からどの口座へお金を送ったのか、事実どおりにお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请暂时放下关于资金流向意义的陈述，如实说明您从哪个账户向哪个账户转了钱。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송금 회차의 출처와 경로를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the source and route of transfer installments by his own actions.,事実追及。送金回次の出どころと経路を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答转账次数的来源和路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형에게 보내진 정기 지원금 가운데 본인이 직접 송금에 관여한 회차를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, among the regular support funds sent to your brother, please state in chronological order the installments where you were directly involved in the transfer.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様に送られた定期支援金のうち、ご自身が直接送金に関与した回次を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，在送给哥哥的定期支援金中，请按时间顺序说明您直接参与转账的次数。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송금 회차의 출처와 경로를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the source and route of transfer installments by his own actions.,事実追及。送金回次の出どころと経路を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答转账次数的来源和路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v2].text,본인이 직접 보낸 회차와 어머니 명의로 옮겨 보낸 회차를 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the installments you sent directly and the installments you transferred onward under your mother's name.,ご自身が直接送った回次と、お母様名義で移して送った回次を分けて答えてください。,请把您直接转出的次数，和以母亲名义转出的次数分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송금 회차의 출처와 경로를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the source and route of transfer installments by his own actions.,事実追及。送金回次の出どころと経路を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答转账次数的来源和路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v3].text,"송금 내역과 본인이 진술해 온 흐름 사이에 차이가 있다면, 어떤 회차에서 차이가 나는지 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","If there is a difference between the transfer records and the flow you have testified to, please point out as fact which installment differs.",送金記録とご自身が陳述してきた流れの間に差があるなら、どの回次で差が出るのか事実関係で指摘してください。,如果转账记录与您一直陈述的流向之间有差异，请按事实指出是哪一次存在差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송금 회차의 출처와 경로를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the source and route of transfer installments by his own actions.,事実追及。送金回次の出どころと経路を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答转账次数的来源和路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v4].text,"그 송금이 본인 계좌에서 시작되었는지, 다른 경로를 거쳤는지 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 정리해 주십시오.",Organize within what you know whether that transfer started from your account or passed through another route.,その送金がご自身の口座から始まったのか、別の経路を経たのか、ご自身が知っている範囲で整理してください。,请在您所知范围内整理，那笔转账是从您的账户开始，还是经过了其他路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송금 회차의 출처와 경로를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the source and route of transfer installments by his own actions.,事実追及。送金回次の出どころと経路を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答转账次数的来源和路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-long_support_flow-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 송금 빈도의 의미에 대한 진술은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 직접 송금한 사실 자체부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside testimony about the meaning of the transfer frequency, and first answer the fact that you personally transferred money.",ユン・ジョンフさん、送金頻度の意味についての陳述はいったん置き、ご自身が直接送金した事実そのものから答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请暂时放下关于转账频率意义的陈述，先回答您亲自转账这一事实本身。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer by his own actions the procedure that allowed money to pass through his mother's account.,事実追及。お母様の口座を経由させた手続きを、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答让资金经过母亲账户的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 어머니 계좌를 거쳐 형에게 자금을 닿게 한 일이 있다면 시점과 횟수를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you ever had funds reach your brother through your mother's account, please state the timing and number of times in chronological order.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身がお母様の口座を経てお兄様に資金を届かせたことがあるなら、時点と回数を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，如果您曾让资金经由母亲账户到达哥哥，请按时间顺序说明时间点和次数。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer by his own actions the procedure that allowed money to pass through his mother's account.,事実追及。お母様の口座を経由させた手続きを、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答让资金经过母亲账户的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v2].text,"어머니 계좌에 본인 자금을 입금했다가 다시 송금된 회차와, 어머니 자금이 그대로 송금된 회차를 분리해 주십시오.",Please separate the installments where you deposited your own funds into your mother's account and then transferred them again from the installments where your mother's funds were transferred as they were.,お母様の口座にご自身の資金を入金してから再び送金された回次と、お母様の資金がそのまま送金された回次を分けてください。,请把您先将自己的资金存入母亲账户再转出的次数，和母亲资金原样转出的次数分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer by his own actions the procedure that allowed money to pass through his mother's account.,事実追及。お母様の口座を経由させた手続きを、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答让资金经过母亲账户的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v3].text,입금자명을 어머니로 표시되게 둔 사실에 대해 본인이 직접 한 절차와 단순히 알고만 있던 절차를 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.,"Regarding the fact that the depositor name was allowed to appear as your mother, point out as facts the procedures you personally carried out and the procedures you merely knew about.",入金者名がお母様として表示されるようにした事実について、ご自身が直接した手続きと、単に知っていただけの手続きを事実関係で指摘してください。,关于让入账人姓名显示为母亲这一事实，请按事实指出您亲自进行的程序，以及只是知情的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer by his own actions the procedure that allowed money to pass through his mother's account.,事実追及。お母様の口座を経由させた手続きを、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答让资金经过母亲账户的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v4].text,"형에게 자금 출처를 어머니로 알도록 둔 결정이 누구의 판단이었는지, 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 정리해 주십시오.",Organize within what you know whose judgment it was to allow your brother to understand the fund source as your mother.,お兄様に資金の出どころをお母様だと知るようにしておいた決定が、誰の判断だったのか、ご自身が知っている範囲で整理してください。,请在您所知范围内整理，让哥哥以为资金来源是母亲这一决定是谁的判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer by his own actions the procedure that allowed money to pass through his mother's account.,事実追及。お母様の口座を経由させた手続きを、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以本人行为为单位回答让资金经过母亲账户的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-mother_account_mask-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 출처를 가린 이유에 대한 진술은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 어떤 계좌에서 어떤 절차로 돈을 흘려보냈는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside testimony about why the source was obscured, and first answer from which account and through what procedure you let the money flow.",ユン・ジョンフさん、出どころを隠した理由についての陳述はいったん置き、ご自身がどの口座からどの手続きでお金を流したのかから答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请暂时放下关于为什么遮蔽来源的陈述，先回答您从哪个账户、通过什么程序让钱流转。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 출처를 알리지 않은 시점과 자리를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the point and place where he did not disclose the source.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが出どころを知らせなかった時点と場を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其未告知来源的时间点与场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형에게 자금 출처를 알리지 않기로 한 시점부터 그 결정을 유지한 시기까지 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order from when you decided not to disclose the source of the funds to your brother through the period you maintained that decision.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様に資金の出どころを知らせないと決めた時点から、その決定を維持した時期までを時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明，从您决定不向哥哥告知资金来源的时间点，到您维持该决定的期间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 출처를 알리지 않은 시점과 자리를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the point and place where he did not disclose the source.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが出どころを知らせなかった時点と場を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其未告知来源的时间点与场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v2].text,본인이 직접 침묵을 선택한 자리와 다른 가족이 같이 침묵을 지킨 자리를 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the places where you personally chose silence and the places where other family members also kept silence.,ご自身が直接沈黙を選んだ場と、他の家族も一緒に沈黙を守った場を分けて答えてください。,请分别回答您亲自选择沉默的场合，以及其他家人一同保持沉默的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 출처를 알리지 않은 시점과 자리를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the point and place where he did not disclose the source.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが出どころを知らせなかった時点と場を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其未告知来源的时间点与场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v3].text,형의 체면을 지킨다는 본인의 진술과 출처를 가린 행동이 어디에서 분리되는지 사실관계만으로 답해 주십시오.,Answer only as fact where your statement about protecting your brother's face separates from the act of obscuring the source.,お兄様の体面を守るというご自身の陳述と、出どころを隠した行動がどこで分かれるのか、事実関係だけで答えてください。,请只按事实回答，您关于维护哥哥体面的陈述，与遮蔽来源的行为在哪里分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 출처를 알리지 않은 시점과 자리를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the point and place where he did not disclose the source.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが出どころを知らせなかった時点と場を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其未告知来源的时间点与场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v4].text,"자금 이야기를 꺼낼 수 있었던 자리가 있었는지, 그 자리에서 본인이 무엇을 말하고 무엇을 말하지 않았는지 정리해 주십시오.","Organize whether there was a place where you could have brought up the money, and what you said and did not say there.",資金の話を持ち出せた場があったのか、その場でご自身が何を言い、何を言わなかったのか整理してください。,请整理是否曾有能够提起资金话题的场合，以及您在那个场合说了什么、没有说什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 출처를 알리지 않은 시점과 자리를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the point and place where he did not disclose the source.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが出どころを知らせなかった時点と場を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其未告知来源的时间点与场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-b-silence_over_pride-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵의 의미에 대한 진술은 미뤄 두고, 어느 자리에서 어떤 사실을 알리지 않았는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside testimony about the meaning of the silence, and first answer which facts you did not disclose at which place.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙の意味についての陳述はいったん置き、どの場でどの事実を知らせなかったのかから答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请暂时放下关于沉默意义的陈述，先回答您在哪个场合没有告知哪些事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기 큰돈의 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택과 본인 자존심의 작용을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate his choice not to ask about the source of the large sum during the crisis from the working of his pride.,動機探索。危機の時期の大金の出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択と、本人の自尊心の作用を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分危机时期没有追问大笔钱来源的本人选择，与本人自尊心的作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 공장이 어려웠던 시기에 들어온 큰돈을 어머니의 힘만으로 설명하기에 부족하다고 느낀 자리가 있었다면, 그 자리에서 묻지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there was a moment during the factory's difficulty when you felt it was insufficient to explain the large sum solely by your mother's power, why did you not ask then?",ユン・テソンさん、工場が苦しかった時期に入ってきた大金を、お母様の力だけで説明するには足りないと感じた場があったなら、その場で尋ねなかった理由は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，在工厂困难时期收到那笔大钱时，如果您曾觉得仅靠母亲的力量难以解释，为什么当时没有追问？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기 큰돈의 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택과 본인 자존심의 작용을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate his choice not to ask about the source of the large sum during the crisis from the working of his pride.,動機探索。危機の時期の大金の出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択と、本人の自尊心の作用を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分危机时期没有追问大笔钱来源的本人选择，与本人自尊心的作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v2].text,"위기 시기의 도움이 본인의 자존심을 건드렸다면, 그 자존심이 본인의 침묵에 어떻게 작용했는지 답하십시오.","If the help during the crisis touched your pride, answer how that pride affected your silence.",危機の時期の助けがご自身の自尊心を刺激したなら、その自尊心がご自身の沈黙にどのように作用したのか答えてください。,如果危机时期的帮助触动了您的自尊，请回答这份自尊如何作用于您的沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기 큰돈의 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택과 본인 자존심의 작용을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate his choice not to ask about the source of the large sum during the crisis from the working of his pride.,動機探索。危機の時期の大金の出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択と、本人の自尊心の作用を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分危机时期没有追问大笔钱来源的本人选择，与本人自尊心的作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v3].text,"그 시기의 자금에 대해 본인이 가장 알고 싶지 않았던 사실이 있었다면, 그것을 회피한 본인의 동기를 설명하십시오.","If there was a fact about the funds from that period that you most did not want to know, explain your motive for avoiding it.",その時期の資金について、ご自身が最も知りたくなかった事実があったなら、それを回避したご自身の動機を説明してください。,如果那段时期的资金中有您最不想知道的事实，请说明您回避它的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기 큰돈의 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택과 본인 자존심의 작용을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate his choice not to ask about the source of the large sum during the crisis from the working of his pride.,動機探索。危機の時期の大金の出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択と、本人の自尊心の作用を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分危机时期没有追问大笔钱来源的本人选择，与本人自尊心的作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v4].text,공장 위기 직후에 본인의 태도가 어머니에게 어떤 모양이었는지 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 답하십시오.,Please answer within the range for which you can take responsibility what shape your attitude took toward your mother right after the factory crisis.,工場危機の直後にご自身の態度がお母様にどのような形だったのか、ご自身が責任を負える範囲で答えてください。,请在您能够负责的范围内回答，工厂危机刚过后，您对母亲的态度呈现出什么样子。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기 큰돈의 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택과 본인 자존심의 작용을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate his choice not to ask about the source of the large sum during the crisis from the working of his pride.,動機探索。危機の時期の大金の出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択と、本人の自尊心の作用を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分危机时期没有追问大笔钱来源的本人选择，与本人自尊心的作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-factory_crisis_support-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 큰돈을 두고 본인이 직접 확인한 사실과 그저 받아온 사실을 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please separate the facts you directly confirmed about that large sum from the fact that you simply accepted it.",ユン・テソンさん、その大金をめぐってご自身が直接確認した事実と、ただ受け取ってきた事実を分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请把围绕那笔大钱您亲自确认的事实，和只是接受下来的事实分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 돈으로 받아온 시간 동안 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to ask about the source during the time he accepted the money as his mother's.,動機探索。お母様のお金として受け取ってきた時間の間、出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在把钱当作母亲的钱接受期间，选择不追问来源的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 통장에서 나오는 돈을 어머니의 돈으로 받아온 시간 동안 한 번도 출처를 묻지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you never ask about the source during the time you accepted money coming from your mother's passbook as her money?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の通帳から出るお金をお母様のお金として受け取ってきた時間の間、なぜ一度も出どころを尋ねなかったのですか。,尹泰成先生，在您把从母亲存折出来的钱当作母亲的钱接受的那段时间里，为什么一次也没有追问来源？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 돈으로 받아온 시간 동안 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to ask about the source during the time he accepted the money as his mother's.,動機探索。お母様のお金として受け取ってきた時間の間、出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在把钱当作母亲的钱接受期间，选择不追问来源的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,"받은 돈에 대해 형으로서 묻지 않는 편이 편했다면, 그 편함의 이유를 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답하십시오.","If it was easier for you as the older brother not to ask about the money you received, answer the reason for that ease within what you can know.",受け取ったお金について、兄として尋ねない方が楽だったなら、その楽さの理由をご自身が分かる範囲で答えてください。,如果作为哥哥，不追问收到的钱对您来说更轻松，请在自己能理解的范围内回答这种轻松的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 돈으로 받아온 시간 동안 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to ask about the source during the time he accepted the money as his mother's.,動機探索。お母様のお金として受け取ってきた時間の間、出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在把钱当作母亲的钱接受期间，选择不追问来源的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,어머니 통장이라는 형식만 보고도 충분하다고 본 본인의 판단 과정을 설명하십시오.,Please explain your judgment process in seeing only the form of your mother's passbook and considering that enough.,お母様の通帳という形式だけを見ても十分だと見た、ご自身の判断過程を説明してください。,请说明您只看到母亲存折这一形式便认为足够的判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 돈으로 받아온 시간 동안 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to ask about the source during the time he accepted the money as his mother's.,動機探索。お母様のお金として受け取ってきた時間の間、出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在把钱当作母亲的钱接受期间，选择不追问来源的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,"본인이 받은 도움 가운데, 어머니 혼자만의 힘으로는 어렵다고 느낀 자리가 있었습니까. 있었다면 그 느낌을 어디로 옮기셨습니까.","Among the help you received, was there a moment when you felt it would have been difficult for your mother alone? If so, where did you take that feeling?",ご自身が受けた助けの中で、お母様一人の力だけでは難しいと感じた場がありましたか。あったなら、その感じをどこへ移しましたか。,在您接受的帮助中，是否有过觉得单靠母亲一个人难以做到的时刻？如果有，您把这种感觉转向了哪里？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 돈으로 받아온 시간 동안 출처를 묻지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to ask about the source during the time he accepted the money as his mother's.,動機探索。お母様のお金として受け取ってきた時間の間、出どころを尋ねなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在把钱当作母亲的钱接受期间，选择不追问来源的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 자금의 출처에 대해 알기를 미룬 본인의 선택이 동생에 대한 의심과 어떻게 이어지는지 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, answer how your own choice to postpone knowing the source of the funds connects to suspicion toward your younger brother.",ユン・テソンさん、資金の出どころについて知ることを先延ばしにしたご自身の選択が、弟さんへの疑いとどのようにつながるのか答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请回答，您推迟了解资金来源的选择，如何与对弟弟的怀疑相连。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 매달 반복되는 입금에 대해 형으로서 출처를 정리하지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to organize the source as the older brother despite repeated monthly deposits.,動機探索。毎月繰り返される入金について、兄として出どころを整理しなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答面对每月重复入账，作为哥哥却没有整理来源的本人选择动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 매달 반복되는 입금을 어머니의 형편으로 설명하기에 부족하다고 느낀 자리가 있었다면, 그 자리에서 묻지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there was a place where repeated monthly deposits seemed insufficient to explain by your mother's circumstances, why did you not ask there?",ユン・テソンさん、毎月繰り返される入金をお母様の事情だけで説明するには足りないと感じた場があったなら、その場で尋ねなかった理由は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，如果曾有某个时刻让您觉得每月重复入账难以只用母亲的经济状况解释，为什么当时没有追问？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 매달 반복되는 입금에 대해 형으로서 출처를 정리하지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to organize the source as the older brother despite repeated monthly deposits.,動機探索。毎月繰り返される入金について、兄として出どころを整理しなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答面对每月重复入账，作为哥哥却没有整理来源的本人选择动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v2].text,같은 패턴의 돈을 오래 받으면서 형으로서 출처를 정리해 두려 하지 않은 이유를 답하십시오.,"Please answer why, while receiving money in the same pattern for a long time, you did not try to organize the source as the older brother.",同じパターンのお金を長く受け取りながら、兄として出どころを整理しておこうとしなかった理由を答えてください。,请回答，长期收到同样模式的钱，您作为哥哥为什么没有试图整理来源。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 매달 반복되는 입금에 대해 형으로서 출처를 정리하지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to organize the source as the older brother despite repeated monthly deposits.,動機探索。毎月繰り返される入金について、兄として出どころを整理しなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答面对每月重复入账，作为哥哥却没有整理来源的本人选择动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v3].text,본인이 묻지 않은 시간만큼 본인의 판단이 어머니 한 사람에게 기대 있었다는 점을 어떻게 보고 계셨는지 설명하십시오.,Please explain how you viewed the fact that your judgment leaned on your mother alone for as long as you did not ask.,ご自身が尋ねなかった時間の分だけ、ご自身の判断がお母様一人に寄りかかっていたという点をどう見ていたのか説明してください。,请说明，您如何看待自己没有追问的那段时间里，自己的判断一直依赖于母亲一人的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 매달 반복되는 입금에 대해 형으로서 출처를 정리하지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to organize the source as the older brother despite repeated monthly deposits.,動機探索。毎月繰り返される入金について、兄として出どころを整理しなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答面对每月重复入账，作为哥哥却没有整理来源的本人选择动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v4].text,"매달 들어온 돈이 본인의 생활을 어디까지 지탱했는지, 그 사실 위에서 본인이 가장 받아들이기 어려운 가능성이 무엇이었는지 답하십시오.","Please answer how far the monthly money supported your life, and on top of that fact, what possibility was hardest for you to accept.",毎月入ってきたお金がご自身の生活をどこまで支えていたのか、その事実の上でご自身が最も受け入れがたい可能性は何だったのか答えてください。,请回答，每月进来的钱在多大程度上支撑了您的生活；在这个事实之上，您最难接受的可能性是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 매달 반복되는 입금에 대해 형으로서 출처를 정리하지 않은 본인 선택의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his choice not to organize the source as the older brother despite repeated monthly deposits.,動機探索。毎月繰り返される入金について、兄として出どころを整理しなかった本人の選択の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答面对每月重复入账，作为哥哥却没有整理来源的本人选择动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-long_support_flow-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 송금이라는 본인의 믿음과 실제로 본인이 확인한 사실 사이의 거리를 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please first state the distance between your belief that it was your mother's transfer and the facts you actually confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の送金だというご自身の信念と、実際にご自身が確認した事実との距離をまずお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请先说明您相信那是母亲转账，与您实际确认的事实之间的距离。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 계좌라는 형식 뒤를 한 번도 의심하지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in never suspecting what lay behind the form of his mother's account.,動機探索。お母様の口座という形式の背後を一度も疑わなかった本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未怀疑母亲账户这一形式背后的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 계좌라는 형식만 보고 출처를 의심하지 않은 본인의 판단 과정을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state the judgment process by which you saw only the form of your mother's account and did not suspect the source.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の口座という形式だけを見て出どころを疑わなかった、ご自身の判断過程をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您只看母亲账户这一形式而没有怀疑来源的判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 계좌라는 형식 뒤를 한 번도 의심하지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in never suspecting what lay behind the form of his mother's account.,動機探索。お母様の口座という形式の背後を一度も疑わなかった本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未怀疑母亲账户这一形式背后的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v2].text,"어머니 한 사람의 형편으로는 어렵다고 느낀 순간이 있었다면, 그 순간 본인이 한 일과 하지 않은 일을 답하십시오.","If there was a moment when you felt it would be difficult for your mother's circumstances alone, answer what you did and did not do then.",お母様一人の事情では難しいと感じた瞬間があったなら、その瞬間ご自身がしたこととしなかったことを答えてください。,如果曾有一刻您觉得单靠母亲一人的情况难以做到，请回答当时您做了什么、没有做什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 계좌라는 형식 뒤를 한 번도 의심하지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in never suspecting what lay behind the form of his mother's account.,動機探索。お母様の口座という形式の背後を一度も疑わなかった本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未怀疑母亲账户这一形式背后的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v3].text,본인이 출처를 캐묻기 어렵게 만든 본인의 자긍심이 어떤 부분이었는지 설명하십시오.,Please explain which part of your own pride made it difficult for you to press the source.,ご自身が出どころを問い詰めることを難しくした、ご自身の自負がどの部分だったのか説明してください。,请说明，是您自身自尊的哪一部分让您难以追问来源。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 계좌라는 형식 뒤를 한 번도 의심하지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in never suspecting what lay behind the form of his mother's account.,動機探索。お母様の口座という形式の背後を一度も疑わなかった本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未怀疑母亲账户这一形式背后的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v4].text,어머니 계좌라는 형식 뒤에 다른 출처가 있을 가능성을 본인 안에서 한 번도 다루지 않은 이유는 무엇입니까.,Why did you never address within yourself the possibility that another source might be behind the form of your mother's account?,お母様の口座という形式の背後に別の出どころがある可能性を、ご自身の中で一度も扱わなかった理由は何ですか。,为什么您在心里从未处理过“母亲账户这一形式背后可能另有来源”的可能性？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니 계좌라는 형식 뒤를 한 번도 의심하지 않은 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in never suspecting what lay behind the form of his mother's account.,動機探索。お母様の口座という形式の背後を一度も疑わなかった本人の判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未怀疑母亲账户这一形式背后的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-mother_account_mask-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 그 형식 뒤에 묻고 싶지 않았던 사실이 있었다면, 그것을 묻지 않기로 한 동기를 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there was a fact behind that form that you did not want to ask about, answer the motive for choosing not to ask.",ユン・テソンさん、その形式の背後にご自身が尋ねたくなかった事実があったなら、それを尋ねないことにした動機を答えてください。,尹泰成先生，如果在那个形式背后有您不想追问的事实，请回答您决定不追问的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 도움받은 사실을 인정하기 어렵게 만든 본인 자존심의 작용을 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer how his pride worked in making it difficult to acknowledge the fact of being helped.,動機探索。助けを受けた事実を認めにくくした本人の自尊心の作用を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让自己难以承认受过帮助这一事实的自尊心作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 도움받은 사실을 인정하기 어렵게 만든 본인의 자존심이 어떤 부분이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state which part of your pride made it difficult to acknowledge that you were helped.",ユン・テソンさん、助けを受けた事実を認めにくくしたご自身の自尊心がどの部分だったのかお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明，是您自尊的哪一部分让您难以承认自己受过帮助。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 도움받은 사실을 인정하기 어렵게 만든 본인 자존심의 작용을 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer how his pride worked in making it difficult to acknowledge the fact of being helped.,動機探索。助けを受けた事実を認めにくくした本人の自尊心の作用を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让自己难以承认受过帮助这一事实的自尊心作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v2].text,형이라는 위치가 본인의 침묵에 어떻게 작용했는지 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답하십시오.,Please answer within what you can know how the position of older brother affected your silence.,兄という位置がご自身の沈黙にどのように作用したのか、ご自身が分かる範囲で答えてください。,请在您能了解的范围内回答，哥哥这个位置如何作用于您的沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 도움받은 사실을 인정하기 어렵게 만든 본인 자존심의 작용을 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer how his pride worked in making it difficult to acknowledge the fact of being helped.,動機探索。助けを受けた事実を認めにくくした本人の自尊心の作用を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让自己难以承认受过帮助这一事实的自尊心作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v3].text,도움이 있었을 가능성을 본인이 본인 안에서 한 번도 정리하지 않은 이유를 설명하십시오.,Please explain why you never organized within yourself the possibility that there had been help.,助けがあった可能性を、ご自身の中で一度も整理しなかった理由を説明してください。,请说明，您为什么从未在自己心里整理过“曾有帮助”这一可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 도움받은 사실을 인정하기 어렵게 만든 본인 자존심의 작용을 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer how his pride worked in making it difficult to acknowledge the fact of being helped.,動機探索。助けを受けた事実を認めにくくした本人の自尊心の作用を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让自己难以承认受过帮助这一事实的自尊心作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v4].text,본인이 받은 도움을 사라지게 만든 본인 침묵이 동생의 침묵을 비난할 자격을 흐린다는 점을 어떻게 보고 계셨는지 답하십시오.,"How did you view the fact that your own silence, which erased the help you received, blurs your qualification to blame your younger brother's silence?",ご自身が受けた助けを消してしまったご自身の沈黙が、弟さんの沈黙を非難する資格を曇らせるという点をどう見ていましたか。,您如何看待：您自己的沉默抹去了自己受过帮助的事实，也让您指责弟弟沉默的资格变得模糊？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 도움받은 사실을 인정하기 어렵게 만든 본인 자존심의 작용을 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer how his pride worked in making it difficult to acknowledge the fact of being helped.,動機探索。助けを受けた事実を認めにくくした本人の自尊心の作用を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让自己难以承认受过帮助这一事实的自尊心作用。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-a-silence_over_pride-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인의 체면과 어머니의 형편 가운데 어느 쪽을 더 무겁게 두었는지 본인 선에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, within your own limits, please state which weighed more for you: your face, or your mother's circumstances.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身の体面とお母様の事情のうち、どちらをより重く置いていたのか、ご自身の範囲でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请在您自己的范围内说明，您更看重的是自己的体面，还是母亲的处境。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기의 큰 도움을 형에게 직접 말하지 않고 우회한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to route major help during the crisis instead of telling his brother directly.,動機探索。危機の時期の大きな助けを兄に直接言わず、迂回させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答危机时期没有直接告诉哥哥，而是绕道提供重大帮助这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 위기 시기의 큰 도움을 형에게 직접 말하지 않고 우회한 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you route the major help during the crisis instead of telling your brother directly?",ユン・ジョンフさん、危機の時期の大きな助けを、お兄様に直接言わず迂回した理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，危机时期的重大帮助，您为什么没有直接告诉哥哥，而是绕道处理？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기의 큰 도움을 형에게 직접 말하지 않고 우회한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to route major help during the crisis instead of telling his brother directly.,動機探索。危機の時期の大きな助けを兄に直接言わず、迂回させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答危机时期没有直接告诉哥哥，而是绕道提供重大帮助这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v2].text,본인이 그 자리에서 도움을 보냈다고 말할 수 있었던 자리를 보낸 직후 한 번도 만들지 않은 이유를 답하십시오.,Please answer why you never created a place immediately after sending it where you could say that you had sent help.,ご自身がその場で助けを送ったと言える場を、送った直後に一度も作らなかった理由を答えてください。,请回答，为什么您在送出帮助后，一次也没有马上创造一个可以说明是自己送出帮助的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기의 큰 도움을 형에게 직접 말하지 않고 우회한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to route major help during the crisis instead of telling his brother directly.,動機探索。危機の時期の大きな助けを兄に直接言わず、迂回させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答危机时期没有直接告诉哥哥，而是绕道提供重大帮助这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v3].text,"형의 체면을 본인 침묵의 명분으로 둔 부분이 있다면, 그 명분이 본인에게 준 편의가 무엇이었는지 설명하십시오.","If you used your brother's face as the justification for your silence, explain what convenience that justification gave you.",お兄様の体面をご自身の沈黙の名分に置いた部分があるなら、その名分がご本人に与えた便宜が何だったのか説明してください。,如果您把哥哥的体面作为自己沉默的名义，请说明这个名义给您带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기의 큰 도움을 형에게 직접 말하지 않고 우회한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to route major help during the crisis instead of telling his brother directly.,動機探索。危機の時期の大きな助けを兄に直接言わず、迂回させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答危机时期没有直接告诉哥哥，而是绕道提供重大帮助这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v4].text,그 도움이 형에게 부담으로 돌아갈 위험을 본인이 어디까지 가늠하셨는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how far you considered the risk that the help would return to your brother as a burden.,その助けがお兄様に負担として返っていく危険を、ご自身がどこまで見積もっていたのか答えてください。,请回答，您在多大程度上衡量过这份帮助会反过来成为哥哥负担的风险。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 위기 시기의 큰 도움을 형에게 직접 말하지 않고 우회한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to route major help during the crisis instead of telling his brother directly.,動機探索。危機の時期の大きな助けを兄に直接言わず、迂回させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答危机时期没有直接告诉哥哥，而是绕道提供重大帮助这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-factory_crisis_support-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 큰돈에 대해 본인이 형에게 말하지 않은 결정이 형의 의심을 키운 부분이 있다면, 그 인과를 인정해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if your decision not to tell your brother about that large sum played a part in increasing his suspicion, please acknowledge that causation.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その大金についてご自身がお兄様に話さなかった決定が、お兄様の疑いを大きくした部分があるなら、その因果を認めてください。,尹正厚先生，如果您没有把那笔大钱告诉哥哥的决定，确实加深了哥哥的怀疑，请承认这一因果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 형에게 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother directly about the flow of funds.,動機探索。資金の流れを兄に直接話さなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答没有直接向哥哥说明资金流向这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 자금 흐름을 형에게 직접 말하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you not tell your brother directly about the flow of funds?",ユン・ジョンフさん、資金の流れをお兄様に直接話さなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，您为什么没有直接把资金流向告诉哥哥？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 형에게 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother directly about the flow of funds.,動機探索。資金の流れを兄に直接話さなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答没有直接向哥哥说明资金流向这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,"본인 선에서 정리해 두는 편이 형에게 낫다고 본 부분이 있었다면, 그 판단의 우려는 무엇이었습니까.","If there was a part you judged it was better for your brother to organize on your own, what concern lay behind that judgment?",ご自身の側で整理しておく方がお兄様にとってよいと見た部分があったなら、その判断の懸念は何でしたか。,如果您曾认为由自己这边整理好对哥哥更好，那么这个判断背后的担忧是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 형에게 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother directly about the flow of funds.,動機探索。資金の流れを兄に直接話さなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答没有直接向哥哥说明资金流向这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,"형이 알게 됐을 때의 반응을 미리 가늠한 부분이 있었다면, 그 가늠이 본인 침묵에 어떻게 작용했는지 답하십시오.","If you anticipated how your brother would react when he learned of it, answer how that anticipation affected your silence.",お兄様が知った時の反応をあらかじめ見積もった部分があったなら、その見積もりがご自身の沈黙にどのように作用したのか答えてください。,如果您曾预先估量哥哥知道后的反应，请回答这种估量如何作用于您的沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 형에게 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother directly about the flow of funds.,動機探索。資金の流れを兄に直接話さなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答没有直接向哥哥说明资金流向这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,어머니의 이름으로 보이게 둔 형식이 본인에게 어떤 편의를 주었는지 알 수 있는 범위에서 설명하십시오.,Explain within what you can know what convenience the form made to appear under your mother's name gave you.,お母様の名前に見えるようにしておいた形式が、ご本人にどのような便宜を与えたのか、分かる範囲で説明してください。,请在您能知道的范围内说明，让形式看起来是母亲名义给您带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 자금 흐름을 형에게 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell his brother directly about the flow of funds.,動機探索。資金の流れを兄に直接話さなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答没有直接向哥哥说明资金流向这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵을 보호로 부른 본인의 결정 안에서 본인 자신의 부담을 줄이려는 부분이 차지한 비율이 있었다면 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, in your decision to call the silence protection, answer whether any portion of it served to reduce your own burden.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙を保護と呼んだご自身の決定の中で、ご自身の負担を減らそうとする部分が占めた割合があったなら答えてください。,尹正厚先生，在您把沉默称为保护的决定中，是否有一部分是为了减轻您自己的负担？如有，请回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복적으로 보내온 사실을 한 번도 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision never to directly say that he repeatedly sent money.,動機探索。繰り返し送ってきた事実を一度も直接言わなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未直接说明自己反复送钱这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 매달 보낸 사실을 형에게 한 번도 직접 말하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you never directly tell your brother that you sent money every month?",ユン・ジョンフさん、毎月送った事実をお兄様に一度も直接話さなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，您为什么一次也没有直接告诉哥哥，钱是您每月送出的？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복적으로 보내온 사실을 한 번도 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision never to directly say that he repeatedly sent money.,動機探索。繰り返し送ってきた事実を一度も直接言わなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未直接说明自己反复送钱这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v2].text,본인이 보낸 돈이 어머니의 이름으로 형에게 닿게 둔 결정에 어떤 의도가 있었는지 답하십시오.,Please answer what intention there was in the decision to let the money you sent reach your brother under your mother's name.,ご自身が送ったお金がお母様の名前でお兄様に届くようにした決定に、どのような意図があったのか答えてください。,请回答，您让自己送出的钱以母亲名义到达哥哥，这个决定中有什么意图。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복적으로 보내온 사실을 한 번도 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision never to directly say that he repeatedly sent money.,動機探索。繰り返し送ってきた事実を一度も直接言わなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未直接说明自己反复送钱这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v3].text,"오래 이어진 침묵이 형에게 어떤 의미였을지 미리 가늠한 부분이 있었다면, 그 가늠이 본인 결정에 어떻게 작용했는지 설명하십시오.","If you anticipated what the long silence would mean to your brother, explain how that anticipation affected your decision.",長く続いた沈黙がお兄様にどのような意味だったのかをあらかじめ見積もった部分があったなら、その見積もりがご自身の決定にどう作用したのか説明してください。,如果您曾预估长期沉默对哥哥意味着什么，请说明这种预估如何作用于您的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복적으로 보내온 사실을 한 번도 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision never to directly say that he repeatedly sent money.,動機探索。繰り返し送ってきた事実を一度も直接言わなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未直接说明自己反复送钱这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v4].text,"본인이 그 침묵을 보호라고 부르고 싶은 마음과, 그 침묵이 만들어 낸 형의 오해를 본인 안에서 어떻게 다뤘는지 답하십시오.",Please answer how you handled within yourself the wish to call the silence protection and the misunderstanding by your brother that the silence produced.,その沈黙を保護と呼びたい気持ちと、その沈黙が作り出したお兄様の誤解を、ご自身の中でどのように扱ったのか答えてください。,请回答，您如何在心里处理“想把沉默称为保护”的心情，以及这份沉默造成的哥哥的误会。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 반복적으로 보내온 사실을 한 번도 직접 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision never to directly say that he repeatedly sent money.,動機探索。繰り返し送ってきた事実を一度も直接言わなかった本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答从未直接说明自己反复送钱这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-long_support_flow-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 송금을 본인이 멈추지 않은 이유를 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state within the range you can take responsibility for why you did not stop those transfers.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その送金をご自身が止めなかった理由を、ご自身が責任を負える範囲でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请在您能够负责的范围内说明，您为什么没有停止那些转账。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금이 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to let his own funds pass through his mother's account.,動機探索。本人の資金をお母様の口座を経由させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让本人资金经过母亲账户这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인의 자금이라면 왜 어머니 계좌를 거치게 두었는지 그 결정의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if it was your own funds, why did you let them pass through your mother's account? Please state the reason for that decision.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身の資金であるなら、なぜお母様の口座を経由させたのか、その決定の理由をお話しください。,尹正厚先生，如果那是您的资金，为什么要让它经过母亲账户？请说明这个决定的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금이 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to let his own funds pass through his mother's account.,動機探索。本人の資金をお母様の口座を経由させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让本人资金经过母亲账户这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v2].text,"어머니의 이름이 앞에 보이는 편이 형에게 낫다고 본 부분이 있다면, 그 판단의 우려는 무엇이었습니까.","If there was a part you judged it would be better for your brother for your mother's name to appear in front, what concern lay behind that judgment?",お母様の名前が前に見える方がお兄様にとってよいと見た部分があるなら、その判断の懸念は何でしたか。,如果您认为让母亲的名字出现在前面对哥哥更好，那么这个判断背后的担忧是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금이 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to let his own funds pass through his mother's account.,動機探索。本人の資金をお母様の口座を経由させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让本人资金经过母亲账户这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v3].text,"본인이 보낸 돈이 어머니의 돈으로 보이는 동안 본인이 얻은 편의가 있었다면, 알 수 있는 범위에서 답하십시오.","If you gained any convenience while the money you sent appeared to be your mother's, answer within what you can know.",ご自身が送ったお金がお母様のお金に見えている間、ご自身が得た便宜があったなら、分かる範囲で答えてください。,如果您在自己送出的钱看起来像母亲的钱期间获得了什么便利，请在能知道的范围内回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금이 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to let his own funds pass through his mother's account.,動機探索。本人の資金をお母様の口座を経由させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让本人资金经过母亲账户这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v4].text,본인이 그 형식을 한 번도 정정하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.,Why did you never correct that form?,ご自身がその形式を一度も訂正しなかった理由は何ですか。,您为什么一次也没有纠正这种形式？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 자금이 어머니 계좌를 거치게 둔 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to let his own funds pass through his mother's account.,動機探索。本人の資金をお母様の口座を経由させた本人の決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答让本人资金经过母亲账户这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-mother_account_mask-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 형식이 본인 책임을 흐리게 한다는 점을 어디까지 본인 안에서 정리하고 계셨는지 설명하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain how far you had organized within yourself the fact that this form blurs your responsibility.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その形式がご自身の責任を曖昧にするという点を、どこまでご自身の中で整理していたのか説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明，对于这种形式会模糊您责任这一点，您在心里整理到了什么程度。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 체면을 명분으로 둔 본인 침묵이 본인에게 준 편의를 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer what convenience his silence, justified by his brother's face, gave him.",動機探索。兄の体面を名分に置いた本人の沈黙が、本人に与えた便宜を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以哥哥体面为名义的沉默给本人带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 체면을 보호한다는 명분이 본인에게 어떤 편의를 주었는지 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, answer what convenience the justification of protecting your brother's face gave you.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の体面を守るという名分が、ご自身にどのような便宜を与えたのか答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请回答，以保护哥哥体面为名义，给您带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 체면을 명분으로 둔 본인 침묵이 본인에게 준 편의를 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer what convenience his silence, justified by his brother's face, gave him.",動機探索。兄の体面を名分に置いた本人の沈黙が、本人に与えた便宜を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以哥哥体面为名义的沉默给本人带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v2].text,"본인의 침묵이 형의 자존심을 위한 것이 아니라 본인의 부담을 줄이기 위한 부분이 섞였다면, 그 비율을 본인 선에서 말씀해 주십시오.","If your silence mixed a part that reduced your own burden rather than only protecting your brother's pride, please state that proportion within your own limits.",ご自身の沈黙に、お兄様の自尊心のためではなくご自身の負担を減らすための部分が混ざっていたなら、その割合をご自身の範囲でお話しください。,如果您的沉默中混有不是为了哥哥自尊，而是为了减轻自己负担的部分，请在您自己的范围内说明其比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 체면을 명분으로 둔 본인 침묵이 본인에게 준 편의를 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer what convenience his silence, justified by his brother's face, gave him.",動機探索。兄の体面を名分に置いた本人の沈黙が、本人に与えた便宜を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以哥哥体面为名义的沉默给本人带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v3].text,형이 도움받은 사실을 인정하기 어려워하리라는 가늠이 본인 침묵의 면죄가 되지 않는다는 점을 어떻게 정리하고 계셨는지 설명하십시오.,Please explain how you had organized the point that anticipating your brother would struggle to acknowledge receiving help did not excuse your silence.,お兄様が助けを受けた事実を認めにくいだろうという見積もりが、ご自身の沈黙の免罪にならないという点をどう整理していたのか説明してください。,请说明，您如何整理“预估哥哥难以承认受过帮助，并不能免除您沉默责任”这一点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 체면을 명분으로 둔 본인 침묵이 본인에게 준 편의를 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer what convenience his silence, justified by his brother's face, gave him.",動機探索。兄の体面を名分に置いた本人の沈黙が、本人に与えた便宜を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以哥哥体面为名义的沉默给本人带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v4].text,"본인이 그 침묵을 풀고 싶었던 순간이 있었다면, 그 순간 본인이 다시 미룬 이유는 무엇입니까.","If there was a moment when you wanted to break that silence, why did you postpone again at that moment?",ご自身がその沈黙を解きたいと思った瞬間があったなら、その瞬間にご自身が再び先延ばしにした理由は何ですか。,如果您曾有想打破沉默的瞬间，为什么那一刻又再次推迟？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 체면을 명분으로 둔 본인 침묵이 본인에게 준 편의를 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer what convenience his silence, justified by his brother's face, gave him.",動機探索。兄の体面を名分に置いた本人の沈黙が、本人に与えた便宜を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以哥哥体面为名义的沉默给本人带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-b-silence_over_pride-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵의 명분과 본인의 실질적인 동기를 분리해 답할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first state the parts where you can separate the justification for the silence from your actual motive.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙の名分とご自身の実質的な動機を分けて答えられる部分から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先说明哪些部分可以把沉默的名义和您实际的动机分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사적인 기록을 사후에 안 박탈감을 인정하되, 본 것과 들은 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the deprivation of learning after the fact that private records were handled, while having him separate what he saw from what he heard.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。私的な記録が死後に扱われたことを後から知った剥奪感を認めつつ、見たことと聞いたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其事后得知私人记录被处理的被剥夺感，同时引导其区分所见与所闻。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 일기장이 누군가의 손에 먼저 들렸다는 사실을 뒤늦게 알게 됐다면, 어머니에 대한 사적인 기록이 본인 모르게 다뤄졌다는 점이 따로 무겁게 다가올 수 있습니다. 본인이 그 일기장을 알게 된 경위부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you learned late that your mother's diary had first passed into someone else's hands, it may have felt separately heavy that a private record about your mother was handled without your knowledge. Please begin with how you came to know about that diary.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の日記が誰かの手に先に渡っていたことを後から知ったなら、お母様に関する私的な記録がご自身の知らないところで扱われた点が、別の重さとして迫ったかもしれません。その日記を知ることになった経緯からお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果您后来才知道母亲日记先落到别人手里，那么关于母亲的私人记录在您不知情的情况下被处理，这一点可能另有沉重。请先说明您是如何知道那本日记的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사적인 기록을 사후에 안 박탈감을 인정하되, 본 것과 들은 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the deprivation of learning after the fact that private records were handled, while having him separate what he saw from what he heard.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。私的な記録が死後に扱われたことを後から知った剥奪感を認めつつ、見たことと聞いたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其事后得知私人记录被处理的被剥夺感，同时引导其区分所见与所闻。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v2].text,본인이 직접 보지 못한 일기장에 대해 짐작이 자라났을 수 있습니다. 본인이 들은 이야기와 본인이 채워 넣은 추정을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.,Inferences may have grown around a diary you did not personally see. Please separate the account you heard from the inference you filled in.,ご自身が直接見ていない日記について、推測が大きくなっていったかもしれません。ご自身が聞いた話と、ご自身が補った推測を分けてお話しください。,对于您没有亲眼看到的日记，推定可能逐渐扩大。请把您听到的说法和您补上的推定分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사적인 기록을 사후에 안 박탈감을 인정하되, 본 것과 들은 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the deprivation of learning after the fact that private records were handled, while having him separate what he saw from what he heard.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。私的な記録が死後に扱われたことを後から知った剥奪感を認めつつ、見たことと聞いたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其事后得知私人记录被处理的被剥夺感，同时引导其区分所见与所闻。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 발견 시점의 모든 정황을 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 어디에서 어떻게 그 이야기를 들었는지, 본인이 본 흔적이 있는지부터 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide all the circumstances around that discovery now. Just begin by pointing out where and how you heard the story, and whether there are traces you personally saw.",ユン・テソンさん、その発見時点のすべての状況を今断定する必要はありません。ただ、どこでどのようにその話を聞いたのか、ご自身が見た痕跡があるのかから指摘してください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定发现当时的全部情况。请先指出您在哪里、如何听到这个说法，以及是否有您亲眼看到的痕迹。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사적인 기록을 사후에 안 박탈감을 인정하되, 본 것과 들은 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the deprivation of learning after the fact that private records were handled, while having him separate what he saw from what he heard.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。私的な記録が死後に扱われたことを後から知った剥奪感を認めつつ、見たことと聞いたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其事后得知私人记录被处理的被剥夺感，同时引导其区分所见与所闻。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v4].text,어머니의 사적인 기록 앞에서 형으로서 더 일찍 닿지 못한 후회가 있다면 그 마음을 말씀해 주십시오. 그래야 짐작과 사실을 가릴 수 있습니다.,"If you regret not having reached your mother's private records sooner as the older brother, please state that feeling. Only then can we distinguish inference from fact.",お母様の私的な記録に兄としてもっと早く触れられなかった後悔があるなら、その思いをお話しください。そうして初めて、推測と事実を見分けられます。,如果您作为哥哥，对没有更早接触母亲的私人记录感到后悔，请说明那份心情。这样才能区分推定和事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사적인 기록을 사후에 안 박탈감을 인정하되, 본 것과 들은 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the deprivation of learning after the fact that private records were handled, while having him separate what he saw from what he heard.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。私的な記録が死後に扱われたことを後から知った剥奪感を認めつつ、見たことと聞いたことを切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其事后得知私人记录被处理的被剥夺感，同时引导其区分所见与所闻。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-diary_discovery-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 일기장이 발견되었다는 사실과 그 일기장에 무엇이 적혀 있었는지는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 확인한 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that the diary was discovered and what was written in it are different matters. Please separate only what you confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、日記が発見されたという事実と、その日記に何が書かれていたのかは別の次元です。ご自身が確認した分だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，日记被发现这一事实，和日记里写了什么，是不同层面的问题。请只按您确认的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 일기장의 무게를 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the diary, while having him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。日記の重みを認めつつ、見たこと、聞いたこと、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认日记的分量，同时引导其区分所见、所闻和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 일기장에 가족에게 큰 영향을 줄 사정이 적혀 있다는 사실을 가까이서 듣는 일이 작은 일이 아닐 것입니다. 그 일기장에 대해 본인이 무엇을 어디까지 알고 있는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, hearing up close that your mother's diary contains circumstances that could greatly affect the family cannot be a small matter. Please begin with what and how much you know about that diary.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の日記に家族へ大きな影響を与える事情が記されていると近くで聞くことは、小さなことではないはずです。その日記についてご自身が何をどこまで知っているのかからお話しください。,尹泰成先生，近距离听说母亲日记里写有会对家人产生重大影响的情况，这不是小事。请先说明您对那本日记知道什么、知道到什么程度。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 일기장의 무게를 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the diary, while having him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。日記の重みを認めつつ、見たこと、聞いたこと、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认日记的分量，同时引导其区分所见、所闻和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,"가족이 함께 살아온 시간 위에 새로 얹히는 사실이 있다면, 받아들이는 데 시간이 필요할 수 있습니다. 본인이 어떤 경로로 그 일기장의 존재를 알게 됐는지 짚어 주십시오.","If there is a newly added fact on top of the years the family lived together, it may take time to accept. Please point out through what route you came to know of that diary's existence.",家族が共に生きてきた時間の上に新しく加わる事実があるなら、受け入れるには時間が必要かもしれません。その日記の存在をどのような経路で知ったのか指摘してください。,如果在家人共同生活的时间之上，又添上新的事实，接受它可能需要时间。请指出您通过什么路径知道那本日记的存在。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 일기장의 무게를 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the diary, while having him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。日記の重みを認めつつ、見たこと、聞いたこと、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认日记的分量，同时引导其区分所见、所闻和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 일기장의 모든 내용을 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 직접 본 페이지가 있다면 어떤 부분이었는지, 본인이 동생을 통해 들은 것은 무엇인지 나눠 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide all the diary's contents now. If there are pages you personally saw, tell me which parts they were; separate that from what you heard through your younger brother.",ユン・テソンさん、日記のすべての内容を今断定する必要はありません。ご自身が直接見たページがあるならどの部分だったのか、弟さんを通じて聞いたことは何なのか、分けてください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定日记的全部内容。如果您亲眼看过某些页，请说明是哪一部分；也请分开说明您通过弟弟听到的是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 일기장의 무게를 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the diary, while having him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。日記の重みを認めつつ、見たこと、聞いたこと、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认日记的分量，同时引导其区分所见、所闻和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,어머니가 평생 혼자 안고 가신 사정이 있었다면 그 사실 자체가 본인에게도 무거울 것입니다. 그 무거움부터 풀어 주시면 다음 이야기로 갈 수 있습니다.,"If there were circumstances your mother carried alone all her life, that fact itself must be heavy for you as well. If you speak first about that weight, we can move to the next account.",お母様が生涯ひとりで抱えていらした事情があったなら、その事実自体がご本人にも重いはずです。その重さからほどいてくだされば、次の話に進めます。,如果母亲一生独自背负过某种情况，这个事实本身对您也会很沉重。请先说明这份沉重，这样才能进入下一段说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 일기장의 무게를 인정하되, 본 것/들은 것/추정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the diary, while having him separate what he saw, heard, and inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。日記の重みを認めつつ、見たこと、聞いたこと、推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认日记的分量，同时引导其区分所见、所闻和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 일기장이 있다는 사실과 그 일기장이 가족에 대해 무엇을 적고 있는지는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 본 범위에서 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that a diary exists and what that diary says about the family are different matters. Please separate them within the scope you saw.",ユン・テソンさん、日記があるという事実と、その日記が家族について何を記しているのかは別の次元です。ご自身が見た範囲で分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，日记存在这一事实，和日记关于家人写了什么，是不同层面的问题。请在您看到的范围内分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 본인이 들은 범위와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate what he heard from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、本人が聞いた範囲と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，并引导其区分听到的范围和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 가족 안에 봉인된 기록이 있다는 말 자체가 본인을 흔드는 단어일 것입니다. 그 단어를 본인이 어떻게 받아들이고 있는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the phrase that there is a sealed record within the family itself must be a word that shakes you. Please begin with how you are accepting that word.",ユン・テソンさん、家族の中に封印された記録があるという言葉自体が、ご本人を揺さぶる言葉でしょう。その言葉をどのように受け止めているのかからお話しください。,尹泰成先生，家里有一份被封存的记录，这句话本身就可能动摇您。请先说明您如何接受这个词。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 본인이 들은 범위와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate what he heard from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、本人が聞いた範囲と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，并引导其区分听到的范围和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v2].text,그 기록이 본인 자신과도 관계될 수 있다는 두려움이 함께 있을 수 있습니다. 그 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오. 본인이 본 것과 짐작은 뒤에 따로 다루겠습니다.,There may also be fear that the record could relate to you yourself. Please explain that honestly. What you saw and what you inferred will be addressed separately later.,その記録がご自身とも関係し得るという恐れも一緒にあるかもしれません。その感触を率直にほどいてください。ご自身が見たことと推測は後で別に扱います。,那份记录可能也与您本人有关，这份恐惧也可能同时存在。请坦诚说明这份心情。您看到的和推定的内容，之后再分别处理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 본인이 들은 범위와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate what he heard from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、本人が聞いた範囲と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，并引导其区分听到的范围和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 기록의 내용 전체를 지금 마주할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 어떤 경로로 그 봉인의 존재를 듣게 되었는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to face the full contents of that record now. Just begin with the route through which you heard that the seal existed.",ユン・テソンさん、その記録の内容全体に今向き合う必要はありません。ただ、その封印の存在をどのような経路で聞くことになったのかからお話しください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必面对那份记录的全部内容。请先说明您是通过什么路径听说那个封存存在的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 본인이 들은 범위와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate what he heard from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、本人が聞いた範囲と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，并引导其区分听到的范围和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v4].text,어머니가 그 기록을 평생 혼자 안고 가신 무게를 떠올리는 것이 본인을 더 흔들 수 있습니다. 그 무거움부터 풀어 주시면 다음 이야기로 갈 수 있습니다.,"Thinking of the weight your mother carried alone all her life may shake you further. If you first speak about that weight, we can move to the next account.",お母様がその記録を生涯ひとりで抱えていらした重みを思い浮かべることが、ご本人をさらに揺らすかもしれません。その重さからほどいてくだされば、次の話に進めます。,想到母亲一生独自背负那份记录的分量，可能会让您更加动摇。请先说明这份沉重，这样才能进入下一段说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 본인이 들은 범위와 짐작을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate what he heard from what he inferred.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、本人が聞いた範囲と推測を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，并引导其区分听到的范围和推定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-sealed_family_record-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 봉인된 기록이 있다는 사실과 그 기록이 가족 안에서 누구를 향하는지는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 들은 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that there is a sealed record and whom that record concerns within the family are different matters. Please separate only what you heard.",ユン・テソンさん、封印された記録があるという事実と、その記録が家族の中で誰に向けられているのかは別の次元です。ご自身が聞いた分だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，存在被封存的记录这一事实，和那份记录在家人之中指向谁，是不同层面的问题。请只按您听到的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 배제됐다는 의심을 인정하되, 짐작과 확인을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the suspicion that he was excluded, while having him separate inference from confirmation.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。排除されたという疑いを認めつつ、推測と確認を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其怀疑自己被排除，同时引导其区分推定与确认。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인을 빼고 도는 침묵이 있었다는 의심은 가족이라는 단어를 다시 흔들었을 것입니다. 그 의심을 가지게 된 자리부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the suspicion that there was a silence moving around without you must have shaken the word family again. Please begin with the place where that suspicion arose.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身を抜きにして回る沈黙があったという疑いは、「家族」という言葉を再び揺らしたはずです。その疑いを抱くことになった場からお話しください。,尹泰成先生，怀疑存在绕开您的沉默，应该再次动摇了“家人”这个词。请先说明您产生这种怀疑的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 배제됐다는 의심을 인정하되, 짐작과 확인을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the suspicion that he was excluded, while having him separate inference from confirmation.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。排除されたという疑いを認めつつ、推測と確認を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其怀疑自己被排除，同时引导其区分推定与确认。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v2].text,동생이나 어머니가 본인을 보호하려 했을 수도 있고 배제했을 수도 있습니다. 그 두 가능성을 본인은 지금 어떻게 가늠하고 있는지 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,"Your younger brother or your mother may have been trying to protect you, or may have been excluding you. Please honestly explain how you are weighing those two possibilities now.",弟さんやお母様がご本人を守ろうとしていたのかもしれず、排除していたのかもしれません。その二つの可能性を今ご本人がどのように見積もっているのか、率直にほどいてください。,弟弟或母亲可能是在保护您，也可能是在排除您。请坦诚说明您现在如何衡量这两种可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 배제됐다는 의심을 인정하되, 짐작과 확인을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the suspicion that he was excluded, while having him separate inference from confirmation.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。排除されたという疑いを認めつつ、推測と確認を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其怀疑自己被排除，同时引导其区分推定与确认。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 침묵의 동기를 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 직접 들은 말과 들리지 않았던 자리를 나눠, 어디에서 의심이 자랐는지부터 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide the motive behind that silence now. Separate what you directly heard from the places where nothing was heard, and begin by pointing out where the suspicion grew.",ユン・テソンさん、その沈黙の動機を今断定する必要はありません。ご自身が直接聞いた言葉と、聞こえなかった場を分けて、どこで疑いが育ったのかから指摘してください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定那份沉默的动机。请把您直接听到的话和没有听到的场合分开，先指出怀疑是从哪里滋长的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 배제됐다는 의심을 인정하되, 짐작과 확인을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the suspicion that he was excluded, while having him separate inference from confirmation.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。排除されたという疑いを認めつつ、推測と確認を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其怀疑自己被排除，同时引导其区分推定与确认。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v4].text,본인이 더 일찍 따져 묻지 않은 데 대한 머쓱함이 있다면 그 마음부터 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 본인이 진짜 묻고 싶은 것이 무엇인지 정리됩니다.,"If there is awkwardness over not having asked sooner, please begin with that feeling. Only then will what you truly want to ask become clear.",もっと早く問いたださなかったことへの気まずさがあるなら、その思いからほどいてください。そうして初めて、ご自身が本当に尋ねたいことが何なのか整理されます。,如果您对没有更早追问感到尴尬，请先说明那份心情。这样才能整理出您真正想问的是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 배제됐다는 의심을 인정하되, 짐작과 확인을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the suspicion that he was excluded, while having him separate inference from confirmation.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。排除されたという疑いを認めつつ、推測と確認を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其怀疑自己被排除，同时引导其区分推定与确认。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-silence_reason-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 침묵이 있었다는 사실과 그 침묵이 누구를 향한 것이었는지는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 확인한 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that there was silence and whom that silence was directed toward are different matters. Please separate only what you confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、沈黙があったという事実と、その沈黙が誰に向けられたものだったのかは別の次元です。ご自身が確認した分だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，存在沉默这一事实，和这份沉默指向谁，是不同层面的问题。请只按您确认的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 가족 사정과 유서의 연결 짐작을 인정하되, 짐작과 사실을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge his inference connecting family circumstances to the will, while having him separate inference from fact.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。家族の事情と遺言書のつながりについての推測を認めつつ、推測と事実を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其关于家族情况与遗嘱之间关联的猜测，同时引导其区分猜测与事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 가족 안의 민감한 사정이 유서의 모양과 이어진다는 짐작을 처음 떠올렸을 때 마음이 더 무너졌을 수 있습니다. 그 짐작이 어디에서 시작됐는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you first thought that sensitive family circumstances might be tied to the shape of the will, your heart may have broken further. Please begin with where that inference started.",ユン・テソンさん、家族の中の繊細な事情が遺言書の形とつながるという推測を初めて思い浮かべた時、心がさらに崩れたかもしれません。その推測がどこから始まったのかお話しください。,尹泰成先生，当您第一次想到家中敏感情况可能与遗嘱形式相连时，心里可能更加崩塌。请先说明这个猜测从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 가족 사정과 유서의 연결 짐작을 인정하되, 짐작과 사실을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge his inference connecting family circumstances to the will, while having him separate inference from fact.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。家族の事情と遺言書のつながりについての推測を認めつつ、推測と事実を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其关于家族情况与遗嘱之间关联的猜测，同时引导其区分猜测与事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v2].text,어머니의 결정 뒤에 본인은 모르는 다른 사정이 있었을지 모른다는 가정 자체가 본인을 흔들었을 것입니다. 그 가정과 본인이 직접 본 사실을 나눠 주십시오.,The very assumption that there may have been circumstances behind your mother's decision that you did not know must have shaken you. Please separate that assumption from the facts you directly saw.,お母様の決定の背後に、ご自身の知らない別の事情があったのかもしれないという仮定自体が、ご本人を揺らしたはずです。その仮定とご自身が直接見た事実を分けてください。,母亲的决定背后可能有您不知道的其他情况，这个假设本身应该动摇了您。请把这个假设和您亲眼看到的事实分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 가족 사정과 유서의 연결 짐작을 인정하되, 짐작과 사실을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge his inference connecting family circumstances to the will, while having him separate inference from fact.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。家族の事情と遺言書のつながりについての推測を認めつつ、推測と事実を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其关于家族情况与遗嘱之间关联的猜测，同时引导其区分猜测与事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 연결의 모든 내용을 지금 단정할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 어머니에게 들은 단편적인 말과 본인이 그 위에 채운 짐작을 분리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to decide all the details of that connection now. Just separate the fragmentary words you heard from your mother from the inferences you built on them.",ユン・テソンさん、そのつながりのすべての内容を今断定する必要はありません。ただ、お母様から聞いた断片的な言葉と、その上にご自身が補った推測を分けてください。,尹泰成先生，现在不必断定那种关联的全部内容。请只把从母亲那里听到的零星话语，和您在其上补出的推定分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 가족 사정과 유서의 연결 짐작을 인정하되, 짐작과 사실을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge his inference connecting family circumstances to the will, while having him separate inference from fact.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。家族の事情と遺言書のつながりについての推測を認めつつ、推測と事実を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其关于家族情况与遗嘱之间关联的猜测，同时引导其区分猜测与事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v4].text,어머니가 본인 모르게 결정을 내리셨을 수도 있다는 무거움이 있다면 그 마음부터 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 본인이 정말 따져야 할 자리가 보입니다.,"If there is a heaviness in the thought that your mother may have made decisions without your knowledge, please begin with that feeling. Only then will the place you truly need to examine be visible.",お母様がご本人の知らないところで決定を下されたのかもしれないという重さがあるなら、その思いからほどいてください。そうすれば、ご自身が本当に問うべき場が見えてきます。,如果想到母亲可能在您不知情的情况下做出决定，让您感到沉重，请先说明这份心情。这样才能看见您真正需要追问的地方。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 가족 사정과 유서의 연결 짐작을 인정하되, 짐작과 사실을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge his inference connecting family circumstances to the will, while having him separate inference from fact.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。家族の事情と遺言書のつながりについての推測を認めつつ、推測と事実を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认其关于家族情况与遗嘱之间关联的猜测，同时引导其区分猜测与事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-a-will_link-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 가족 안 사정이 있다는 짐작과 그 사정이 유서에 어떻게 작용했는지는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 확인한 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, suspecting that family circumstances existed and how those circumstances affected the will are different matters. Please separate only what you confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、家族の中の事情があるという推測と、その事情が遺言書にどのように作用したのかは別の次元です。ご自身が確認した分だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，猜测家中存在某些情况，与这些情况如何作用于遗嘱，是不同层面的问题。请只按您确认的范围分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 발견 자리의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 행위와 이후 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the discovery scene, while having him separate the act he saw from subsequent actions.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。発見の場の重さを認めつつ、本人の行為とその後の行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认发现现场的沉重，同时引导其区分本人行为与之后行动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 일기장을 본인이 먼저 마주한 자리는 본인 안에서도 정리되지 않은 채 시간이 흘렀을 수 있습니다. 그 자리를 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the moment you first faced your mother's diary may have passed within you without being sorted. Please tell me as much as you can now about that place.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の日記に最初に向き合った場は、ご自身の中でも整理されないまま時間が流れたかもしれません。その場を、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，您最先面对母亲日记的那个场合，可能在您心里也没有整理清楚就随着时间过去了。请在现在能说的范围内讲述那个场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 발견 자리의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 행위와 이후 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the discovery scene, while having him separate the act he saw from subsequent actions.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。発見の場の重さを認めつつ、本人の行為とその後の行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认发现现场的沉重，同时引导其区分本人行为与之后行动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v2].text,본인이 그 페이지에서 무엇을 보았는지를 지금 다 옮길 필요는 없습니다. 다만 그 시점이 유서 일과 어떻게 가까웠는지부터 정리해 주십시오.,You do not need to transfer everything you saw on that page now. Just begin by organizing how close that timing was to the matter of the will.,ご自身がそのページで何を見たのかを、今すべて移す必要はありません。ただ、その時点が遺言書の件とどのように近かったのかから整理してください。,现在不必把您在那一页看到的全部转述出来。请先整理那个时间点与遗嘱一事有多接近。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 발견 자리의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 행위와 이후 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the discovery scene, while having him separate the act he saw from subsequent actions.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。発見の場の重さを認めつつ、本人の行為とその後の行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认发现现场的沉重，同时引导其区分本人行为与之后行动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 발견 직후 본인이 한 행동을 한 번에 다 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 그 일기장을 어떻게 보관했는지, 누구에게 어디까지 말했는지를 나눠 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every action you took immediately after the discovery at once. Just separate how you kept the diary and whom you told, and how far.",ユン・ジョンフさん、発見直後にご自身がした行動を一度にすべてほどく必要はありません。ただ、その日記をどう保管したのか、誰にどこまで話したのかを分けてください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说明发现之后您做的所有行为。请只分开说明您如何保管那本日记，以及告诉了谁、到什么程度。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 발견 자리의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 행위와 이후 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the discovery scene, while having him separate the act he saw from subsequent actions.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。発見の場の重さを認めつつ、本人の行為とその後の行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认发现现场的沉重，同时引导其区分本人行为与之后行动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v4].text,"보고 난 뒤 형에게 알리지 않기로 한 결정이 있었다면, 그 결정의 결을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 보호인지 회피인지에 따라 무게가 달라집니다.","If you made a decision after seeing it not to tell your brother, please state the texture of that decision. Whether it was protection or avoidance changes the weight.",見た後でお兄様に知らせないと決めたことがあるなら、その決定の感触をお話しください。それが保護なのか回避なのかによって重みは変わります。,如果您看过之后决定不告诉哥哥，请说明那项决定的脉络。那是保护还是回避，会让分量不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 발견 자리의 무거움을 인정하되, 본 행위와 이후 행동을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the weight of the discovery scene, while having him separate the act he saw from subsequent actions.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。発見の場の重さを認めつつ、本人の行為とその後の行動を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认发现现场的沉重，同时引导其区分本人行为与之后行动。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-diary_discovery-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 그 페이지를 보았다는 사실과 본 뒤에 본인이 한 일은 다른 차원의 문제입니다. 본인이 한 일부터 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you saw that page and what you did after seeing it are issues on different levels. Please begin by separating what you did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身がそのページを見たという事実と、見た後にご自身がしたことは別の次元の問題です。ご自身がしたことから分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您看过那一页这一事实，和看过之后您做了什么，是不同层面的问题。请先分开说明您做过的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 알고 숨긴 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 발견과 침묵을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the texture of knowing and hiding, while having him separate discovery from silence.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。知って隠した沈黙の感触を認めつつ、発見と沈黙を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认知情却隐瞒的沉默脉络，同时引导其区分发现与沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 가족에게 큰 영향을 줄 일기장을 본인이 먼저 마주했다면, 그 자리에서 무엇을 해야 할지 결정하는 일이 무거웠을 것입니다. 일기장을 처음 보았을 때의 결을 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you were the first to face a diary that could greatly affect the family, deciding what to do there must have been heavy. Please tell me as much as you can now about when you first saw the diary.",ユン・ジョンフさん、家族に大きな影響を与える日記に最初に向き合ったなら、その場で何をすべきか決めることは重かったはずです。日記を初めて見た時の感触を、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，如果您最先面对一本会对家人产生重大影响的日记，那么在那个场合决定该怎么做一定很沉重。请在现在能说的范围内讲述第一次看到日记时的心情。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 알고 숨긴 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 발견과 침묵을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the texture of knowing and hiding, while having him separate discovery from silence.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。知って隠した沈黙の感触を認めつつ、発見と沈黙を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认知情却隐瞒的沉默脉络，同时引导其区分发现与沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,형에게 알리는 일이 어떤 결과를 부를지 떠올리면서 망설인 시간이 있었을 수 있습니다. 그 망설임이 어디에서 멈추고 침묵으로 굳어졌는지 말씀해 주십시오.,There may have been a time when you hesitated while imagining what would happen if you told your brother. Please tell me where that hesitation stopped and hardened into silence.,お兄様に知らせることがどのような結果を招くかを思い浮かべながら、ためらった時間があったかもしれません。そのためらいがどこで止まり、沈黙として固まったのかお話しください。,您可能曾想到告诉哥哥会带来什么结果，并因此犹豫。请说明这份犹豫在哪里停下，又在哪里凝固成沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 알고 숨긴 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 발견과 침묵을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the texture of knowing and hiding, while having him separate discovery from silence.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。知って隠した沈黙の感触を認めつつ、発見と沈黙を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认知情却隐瞒的沉默脉络，同时引导其区分发现与沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 일기장의 내용을 지금 모두 옮길 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 어떤 페이지를 보고 어떤 결정을 내렸는지부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to transfer all the diary's contents now. Just begin by organizing what page you saw and what decision you made.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その日記の内容を今すべて移す必要はありません。ただ、ご自身がどのページを見てどのような決定を下したのかから整理してください。,尹正厚先生，现在不必转述那本日记的全部内容。请先整理您看了哪一页，并做出了什么决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 알고 숨긴 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 발견과 침묵을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the texture of knowing and hiding, while having him separate discovery from silence.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。知って隠した沈黙の感触を認めつつ、発見と沈黙を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认知情却隐瞒的沉默脉络，同时引导其区分发现与沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,침묵을 형을 위한 보호로 시작했더라도 시간이 지나면서 결이 달라졌을 수 있습니다. 어느 시점부터 그 침묵이 본인을 위한 자리로 옮겨갔는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Even if the silence began as protection for your brother, its texture may have changed with time. Please tell me from what point that silence moved into a place for yourself.",沈黙をお兄様のための保護として始めたとしても、時間が経つにつれて感触が変わっていったかもしれません。どの時点からその沈黙がご自身のための場へ移っていったのかお話しください。,即便沉默是从保护哥哥开始的，随着时间过去也可能改变了脉络。请说明从什么时候起，这份沉默转移成了为了您自己的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 알고 숨긴 침묵의 결을 인정하되, 발견과 침묵을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the texture of knowing and hiding, while having him separate discovery from silence.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。知って隠した沈黙の感触を認めつつ、発見と沈黙を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认知情却隐瞒的沉默脉络，同时引导其区分发现与沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 일기장을 보았다는 사실과 그 내용을 형에게 알리지 않은 일은 다른 차원의 문제입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you saw the diary and the fact that you did not tell your brother its contents are matters on different levels. Please speak about the two separately.",ユン・ジョンフさん、日記を見たという事実と、その内容をお兄様に知らせなかったことは別の次元の問題です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您看过日记这一事实，和没有把内容告诉哥哥，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 침묵 결정과 그로 인한 다른 결정을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate the silence decision from other decisions that followed from it.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、沈黙の決定とそれに伴う別の決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，引导其区分沉默决定和由此产生的其他决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 봉인된 기록을 본인이 안다는 사실을 형 앞에서 한 번도 풀어 두지 않은 시간이 있었다면, 그 시간 자체가 본인에게도 무거웠을 것입니다. 그 결을 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was a time when you never disclosed to your brother that you knew of the sealed record, that time itself must have been heavy for you as well. Please tell me as much of it as you can now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、封印された記録をご自身が知っているという事実をお兄様の前で一度もほどいておかなかった時間があるなら、その時間自体がご本人にも重かったはずです。その感触を今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，如果有一段时间您从未在哥哥面前说明自己知道那份被封存的记录，那么那段时间本身对您也一定很沉重。请在现在能说的范围内说明这份脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 침묵 결정과 그로 인한 다른 결정을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate the silence decision from other decisions that followed from it.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、沈黙の決定とそれに伴う別の決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，引导其区分沉默决定和由此产生的其他决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v2].text,그 기록이 형의 삶을 흔들 수 있다는 짐작이 침묵의 첫 자리였을 수 있습니다. 그 짐작의 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,The inference that the record could shake your brother's life may have been the first place of silence. Please explain that inference honestly.,その記録がお兄様の人生を揺るがし得るという推測が、沈黙の最初の場だったかもしれません。その推測の感触を率直にほどいてください。,那份记录可能动摇哥哥的人生，这一推定可能就是沉默最初的位置。请坦诚说明这份推定的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 침묵 결정과 그로 인한 다른 결정을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate the silence decision from other decisions that followed from it.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、沈黙の決定とそれに伴う別の決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，引导其区分沉默决定和由此产生的其他决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 봉인의 내용을 지금 옮길 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 어떤 결정을 내려 그 기록을 그대로 두기로 했는지부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to transfer the contents of the seal now. Just begin by organizing what decision you made to leave that record as it was.",ユン・ジョンフさん、封印の内容を今移す必要はありません。ただ、その記録をそのままにしておくために、ご自身がどのような決定を下したのかから整理してください。,尹正厚先生，现在不必转述封存的内容。请先整理您做了什么决定，才让那份记录保持原样。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 침묵 결정과 그로 인한 다른 결정을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate the silence decision from other decisions that followed from it.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、沈黙の決定とそれに伴う別の決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，引导其区分沉默决定和由此产生的其他决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v4].text,"시간이 지나면서 침묵이 보호 이상의 무엇이 됐다면, 그 변화의 결을 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 본인이 가진 다른 판단과 어떻게 묶여 있었는지에 따라 책임의 모양이 달라집니다.","If the silence became something beyond protection as time passed, please state the texture of that change. The shape of responsibility depends on how it was tied to other judgments you held.",時間が経つにつれて沈黙が保護以上の何かになったなら、その変化の感触をお話しください。それがご自身の持つ他の判断とどう結びついていたのかによって、責任の形は変わります。,如果随着时间过去，沉默变成了超出保护的某种东西，请说明这种变化的脉络。它如何与您其他判断捆绑在一起，会决定责任的形态。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. '봉인된 가족 기록' 단어로 다루며 침묵 결정과 그로 인한 다른 결정을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Handle it with the words sealed family record, and have him separate the silence decision from other decisions that followed from it.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。「封印された家族記録」という言葉で扱い、沈黙の決定とそれに伴う別の決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。以“被封存的家族记录”这一说法处理，引导其区分沉默决定和由此产生的其他决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-sealed_family_record-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 봉인을 본인이 안다는 사실과 그 사실로 본인이 한 다른 결정들은 다른 차원입니다. 두 가지를 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you knew of the seal and the other decisions you made because of that fact are different matters. Please separate the two.",ユン・ジョンフさん、封印をご自身が知っているという事実と、その事実によってご自身がした別の決定は別の次元です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您知道封存这一事实，和您因这一事实做出的其他决定，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 보호와 회피의 경계를 인정하되, 침묵 결정과 결과를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the boundary between protection and avoidance, while having him separate the silence decision from the result.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。保護と回避の境界を認めつつ、沈黙の決定と結果を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认保护与回避的边界，同时引导其区分沉默决定与结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 형을 보호한다는 마음으로 시작한 침묵이 시간이 지나면서 본인 자신을 위한 자리로 옮겨갔을 수 있습니다. 그 두 자리 가운데 어디에 본인이 더 오래 서 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the silence you began with a wish to protect your brother may, over time, have moved into a place for yourself. Please tell me where between those two places you stood longer.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身がお兄様を守る気持ちで始めた沈黙が、時間が経つにつれてご自身のための場へ移っていったかもしれません。その二つの場のうち、どちらにより長く立っていたのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您以保护哥哥之心开始的沉默，随着时间过去可能转移成了为了您自己的位置。请说明在这两个位置之间，您站在哪一边更久。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 보호와 회피의 경계를 인정하되, 침묵 결정과 결과를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the boundary between protection and avoidance, while having him separate the silence decision from the result.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。保護と回避の境界を認めつつ、沈黙の決定と結果を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认保护与回避的边界，同时引导其区分沉默决定与结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v2].text,형이 충격을 받을까 두려운 마음과 본인이 흔들리는 가족을 그대로 두고 싶지 않은 마음이 같이 있었을 수 있습니다. 그 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,There may have been both fear that your brother would be shocked and a wish not to leave a shaken family as it was. Please honestly explain that texture.,お兄様が衝撃を受けるのではないかという恐れと、揺らいだ家族をそのままにしたくない思いが一緒にあったかもしれません。その感触を率直にほどいてください。,您可能既害怕哥哥受到冲击，也不想让动摇的家人保持原样。请坦诚说明这份脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 보호와 회피의 경계를 인정하되, 침묵 결정과 결과를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the boundary between protection and avoidance, while having him separate the silence decision from the result.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。保護と回避の境界を認めつつ、沈黙の決定と結果を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认保护与回避的边界，同时引导其区分沉默决定与结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵의 모든 이유를 한 번에 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 누구를 보호하기 위해 시작했는지, 그 결정 시점부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every reason for the silence at once. Just begin by organizing whom you started by trying to protect and when that decision was made.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙のすべての理由を一度にほどく必要はありません。ただ、誰を守るために始めたのか、その決定時点から整理してください。,尹正厚先生，不必一次说明沉默的所有理由。请先整理这份沉默最初是为了保护谁，以及决定的时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 보호와 회피의 경계를 인정하되, 침묵 결정과 결과를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the boundary between protection and avoidance, while having him separate the silence decision from the result.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。保護と回避の境界を認めつつ、沈黙の決定と結果を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认保护与回避的边界，同时引导其区分沉默决定与结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v4].text,침묵이 길어지면서 본인이 한 다른 결정들과 묶여 갔을 수 있습니다. 그 묶임의 결을 말씀해 주십시오. 묶음의 모양에 따라 책임의 모양이 달라집니다.,"As the silence grew longer, it may have become tied to other decisions you made. Please state the texture of that tying. The shape of the bundle changes the shape of responsibility.",沈黙が長くなるにつれて、ご自身がした別の決定と結びついていったかもしれません。その結びつきの感触をお話しください。まとまりの形によって責任の形は変わります。,随着沉默变长，它可能与您做出的其他决定绑在了一起。请说明这种捆绑的脉络。捆绑的形态会改变责任的形态。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 보호와 회피의 경계를 인정하되, 침묵 결정과 결과를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Acknowledge the boundary between protection and avoidance, while having him separate the silence decision from the result.",共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。保護と回避の境界を認めつつ、沈黙の決定と結果を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。承认保护与回避的边界，同时引导其区分沉默决定与结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-silence_reason-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵으로 보호하려 한 일과 침묵으로 만들어진 결과는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 한 침묵부터 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what you tried to protect through silence and the results created by that silence are different matters. Please begin by separating the silence you chose.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙で守ろうとしたことと、沈黙によって作られた結果は別の次元です。ご自身がした沈黙から切り分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您试图用沉默保护的事，和沉默造成的结果，是不同层面的问题。请先分开说明您做出的沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사정 인지와 유서 절차에 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Have him separate his awareness of the circumstances from the decisions he added to the will procedure.,共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。事情の認知と遺言書手続きに加えた決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。引导其区分对情况的认知与其添加到遗嘱程序中的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 가족 안의 사정을 본인이 먼저 알게 된 자리에서 유서 결정에 그 사정이 어떻게 들어갔는지를 본인이 가장 잘 알고 계실 것입니다. 그 결을 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you were the first to learn the family circumstances, you know best how those circumstances entered the decision on the will. Please tell me as much of that as you can now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、家族の中の事情をご自身が先に知った場で、その事情が遺言書の決定にどう入っていったのかは、ご自身が最もよく分かっているはずです。その感触を今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，如果您先知道家中的情况，那么这些情况如何进入遗嘱决定，您应该最清楚。请在现在能说的范围内说明其中脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사정 인지와 유서 절차에 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Have him separate his awareness of the circumstances from the decisions he added to the will procedure.,共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。事情の認知と遺言書手続きに加えた決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。引导其区分对情况的认知与其添加到遗嘱程序中的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v2].text,형을 지키려는 마음과 어머니의 뜻을 따르려는 마음이 한 자리에서 부딪쳤을 수 있습니다. 그 부딪침을 어느 쪽으로 정리하셨는지 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,The wish to protect your brother and the wish to follow your mother's will may have collided in one place. Please honestly explain which side you settled on.,お兄様を守ろうとする心と、お母様の意思に従おうとする心が一つの場でぶつかったかもしれません。そのぶつかりをどちらへ整理したのか、率直にほどいてください。,想保护哥哥的心，与想遵从母亲意愿的心，可能在同一处发生碰撞。请坦诚说明您把这次碰撞整理向哪一边。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사정 인지와 유서 절차에 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Have him separate his awareness of the circumstances from the decisions he added to the will procedure.,共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。事情の認知と遺言書手続きに加えた決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。引导其区分对情况的认知与其添加到遗嘱程序中的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 사정의 내용을 지금 옮길 필요는 없습니다. 다만 그 사정을 알고 난 뒤 본인이 유서 절차에 어떤 결정을 더하셨는지부터 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to transfer the contents of those circumstances now. Just begin by organizing what decision you added to the will procedure after learning them.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その事情の内容を今移す必要はありません。ただ、その事情を知った後、ご自身が遺言書の手続きにどのような決定を加えたのかから整理してください。,尹正厚先生，现在不必转述那些情况的内容。请先整理知道那些情况后，您给遗嘱程序添加了什么决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사정 인지와 유서 절차에 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Have him separate his awareness of the circumstances from the decisions he added to the will procedure.,共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。事情の認知と遺言書手続きに加えた決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。引导其区分对情况的认知与其添加到遗嘱程序中的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v4].text,본인이 한 결정이 형을 위한 보호였는지 본인이 흔들리는 가족을 정리하려는 손짓이었는지에 따라 책임의 결이 달라집니다. 그 결을 본인 안에서 갈라 주십시오.,The texture of responsibility changes depending on whether your decision was protection for your brother or an attempt to organize a shaking family. Please separate that texture within yourself.,ご自身の決定が、お兄様のための保護だったのか、揺らぐ家族を整理しようとする手つきだったのかによって、責任の感触は変わります。その感触をご自身の中で分けてください。,您的决定是为了保护哥哥，还是试图整理摇晃的家庭，会改变责任的性质。请在自己心里分开这份脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 출생 비밀 직접 언급 금지. 사정 인지와 유서 절차에 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not directly mention the birth secret. Have him separate his awareness of the circumstances from the decisions he added to the will procedure.,共感アプローチ。出生の秘密を直接言及しない。事情の認知と遺言書手続きに加えた決定を切り分けさせる。,共情接近。禁止直接提及出生秘密。引导其区分对情况的认知与其添加到遗嘱程序中的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-b-will_link-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 가족 안 사정을 안다는 사실과 그 사정 위에 본인이 더한 결정들은 다른 차원입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you knew family circumstances and the decisions you added on top of those circumstances are different matters. Please separate the two.",ユン・ジョンフさん、家族の中の事情を知っていたという事実と、その事情の上にご自身が加えた決定は別の次元です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您知道家中情况这一事实，和您在这些情况之上添加的决定，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 사실의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the diary's discovery.,事実追及。日記発見の事実の認知経路を、事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对日记发现这一事实的认知路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 일기장이 동생에게 발견되었다는 사실을 본인이 언제 알게 되셨는지 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state in chronological order when you learned that the diary had been discovered by your younger brother.",ユン・テソンさん、日記が弟さんに発見されたという事実をいつ知ったのか、時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请按时间顺序说明，您是在什么时候知道日记被弟弟发现的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 사실의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the diary's discovery.,事実追及。日記発見の事実の認知経路を、事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对日记发现这一事实的认知路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v2].text,"본인이 그 자리에 있었다면 본 장면을 말씀하시고, 그렇지 않다면 누구에게서 어떤 경로로 들으셨는지 분리해 답해 주십시오.","If you were present, describe what you saw; if not, answer separately from whom and through what route you heard about it.",ご自身がその場にいたなら見た場面をお話しください。そうでないなら、誰からどのような経路で聞いたのかを分けて答えてください。,如果您当时在场，请说明您看到的场景；如果不在，请分开回答您从谁那里、通过什么路径听说。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 사실의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the diary's discovery.,事実追及。日記発見の事実の認知経路を、事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对日记发现这一事实的认知路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v3].text,동생의 진술과 본인이 알고 있는 발견 시점이 다르다면 어디에서 차이가 나는지 짚어 주십시오.,"If your younger brother's statement and what you know about the time of discovery differ, please point out where they differ.",弟さんの陳述とご自身が知っている発見時点が異なるなら、どこで差が出るのか指摘してください。,如果弟弟的陈述与您所知的发现时间点不同，请指出差异在哪里。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 사실의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the diary's discovery.,事実追及。日記発見の事実の認知経路を、事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对日记发现这一事实的认知路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v4].text,"발견 이후 일기장이 어디에 보관됐고 누가 다뤘는지, 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 정리해 주십시오.","After the discovery, where was the diary kept and who handled it? Organize this within what you know.",発見後、日記がどこに保管され、誰が扱ったのか、ご自身が知っている範囲で整理してください。,发现之后，日记被存放在哪里、由谁处理？请在您所知范围内整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 사실의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the diary's discovery.,事実追及。日記発見の事実の認知経路を、事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对日记发现这一事实的认知路径。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-diary_discovery-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 무렵 어머니께서 본인에게 보이신 표정이나 말투에 변화가 있었는지 본인이 본 사실 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please answer truthfully whether around that time you saw any change in your mother's expression or tone toward you.",ユン・テソンさん、その頃、お母様がご本人に見せた表情や口調に変化があったのか、ご自身が見た事実どおりに答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请如实回答，那段时间母亲对您的表情或语气是否有变化。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the family circumstances. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对家族情况的认知路径。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 일기장이 존재한다는 사실을 본인이 언제 누구에게서 알게 되셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state when and from whom you learned that Mother's Diary existed.",ユン・テソンさん、母の日記が存在するという事実を、いつ誰から知ったのかお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您是在什么时候、从谁那里知道母亲日记存在的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the family circumstances. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对家族情况的认知路径。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,일기장 내용 가운데 본인이 직접 본 부분과 다른 사람이 옮겨 준 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the parts of the diary's contents that you personally saw and the parts someone else relayed to you.,日記の内容のうち、ご自身が直接見た部分と他の人が伝えてくれた部分を分けて答えてください。,请把日记内容中您亲眼看到的部分，和他人转述给您的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the family circumstances. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对家族情况的认知路径。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,동생은 일기장을 통해 가족에 관한 어떤 사정을 알게 되었다고 진술합니다. 본인이 들은 범위에서 사실관계만 답해 주십시오.,Your younger brother states that he learned certain family circumstances through the diary. Answer only the facts within the range you heard.,弟さんは、日記を通じて家族に関する何らかの事情を知ったと陳述しています。ご自身が聞いた範囲で、事実関係だけを答えてください。,弟弟陈述称他通过日记得知了有关家人的某些情况。请在您听到的范围内只回答事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the family circumstances. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对家族情况的认知路径。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,"일기장에 적힌 사정이 본인 가족 안에서 어떻게 다뤄졌는지, 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.","Organize in chronological order, within what you know, how the circumstances written in the diary were handled within your family.",日記に記された事情がご自身の家族の中でどのように扱われたのか、ご自身が知っている範囲で時系列に整理してください。,请在您所知范围内按时间顺序整理，日记中写到的情况在您家中是如何被处理的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정의 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he became aware of the family circumstances. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情の認知経路を事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对家族情况的认知路径。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 기록의 구체 내용에 대한 본인의 추정은 미뤄 두고, 일기장의 존재를 알게 된 경로부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside your inference about the specific content of that record, and first answer the route by which you came to know of the diary's existence.",ユン・テソンさん、その記録の具体的内容についてのご自身の推測はいったん置き、日記の存在を知ることになった経路から答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请先放下对那份记录具体内容的推定，先回答您是通过什么路径知道日记存在的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록의 존재 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he learned of the sealed family record's existence. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録の存在認知経路を事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对被封存的家族记录存在的认知路径。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 가족에게 큰 영향을 줄 사정이 어머니 기록 안에 있다는 이야기를 본인이 언제 처음 들으셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state when you first heard that circumstances with major impact on the family were contained in your mother's records.",ユン・テソンさん、家族に大きな影響を与える事情がお母様の記録の中にあるという話を、いつ初めて聞いたのかお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您第一次听说母亲记录中有会对家人产生重大影响的情况，是在什么时候。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록의 존재 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he learned of the sealed family record's existence. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録の存在認知経路を事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对被封存的家族记录存在的认知路径。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v2].text,그 사정에 대해 본인이 직접 들은 부분과 옮겨 들은 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the parts you heard directly about those circumstances and the parts you heard secondhand.,その事情についてご自身が直接聞いた部分と、伝え聞いた部分を分けて答えてください。,请把关于那种情况您直接听到的部分，和转述听来的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록의 존재 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he learned of the sealed family record's existence. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録の存在認知経路を事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对被封存的家族记录存在的认知路径。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v3].text,"같은 사정에 대해 동생과 본인의 인지 시점이 다르다면, 그 차이를 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","If you and your younger brother became aware of the same circumstances at different times, please point out the difference as fact.",同じ事情について弟さんとご自身の認知時点が異なるなら、その差を事実関係で指摘してください。,如果您和弟弟对同一情况的认知时间点不同，请按事实指出这个差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록의 존재 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he learned of the sealed family record's existence. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録の存在認知経路を事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对被封存的家族记录存在的认知路径。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v4].text,"그 사정과 관련해 본인이 가족 중 누구에게 어디까지 물어보셨는지, 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.",Organize in chronological order whom in the family you asked about those circumstances and how far you asked.,その事情に関連して、ご自身が家族のうち誰にどこまで尋ねたのか、時系列で整理してください。,请按时间顺序整理，关于那种情况，您向家人中的谁问到什么程度。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록의 존재 인지 경로를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact the route by which he learned of the sealed family record's existence. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録の存在認知経路を事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让其以事实回答对被封存的家族记录存在的认知路径。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-sealed_family_record-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 사정의 구체 내용에 대한 추정은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 인지하게 된 경로부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside inference about the specific content of those circumstances, and answer first the route by which you became aware of them.",ユン・テソンさん、その事情の具体的内容についての推測はいったん置き、ご自身が認知することになった経路から答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请暂时放下对那种情况具体内容的推定，先回答您是通过什么路径得知的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 의미보다 어떤 자리에서 무엇이 빠졌는지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Rather than the meaning of the silence, have him answer as fact what was missing in which place.",事実追及。沈黙の意味よりも、どの場で何が欠けていたのかを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。与其追问沉默的意义，不如让其以事实回答在哪个场合缺失了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 가족이 그 사정에 대해 말하지 않은 자리들이 있었다면, 본인이 기억하는 자리를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there were occasions when the family did not speak about those circumstances, please state the occasions you remember in chronological order.",ユン・テソンさん、家族がその事情について話さなかった場があるなら、ご自身が記憶する場を時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果家人有过不谈那种情况的场合，请按时间顺序说明您记得的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 의미보다 어떤 자리에서 무엇이 빠졌는지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Rather than the meaning of the silence, have him answer as fact what was missing in which place.",事実追及。沈黙の意味よりも、どの場で何が欠けていたのかを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。与其追问沉默的意义，不如让其以事实回答在哪个场合缺失了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v2].text,"본인이 그 자리에서 화제를 꺼냈다가 멈춘 적이 있다면, 멈춘 시점을 본인 행동 중심으로 답해 주십시오.","If you ever brought up the topic and then stopped, answer around your own actions when you stopped.",ご自身がその場で話題を出してから止まったことがあるなら、止まった時点をご自身の行動中心に答えてください。,如果您曾在某个场合提出话题后又停下，请以您自己的行为为中心回答停下的时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 의미보다 어떤 자리에서 무엇이 빠졌는지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Rather than the meaning of the silence, have him answer as fact what was missing in which place.",事実追及。沈黙の意味よりも、どの場で何が欠けていたのかを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。与其追问沉默的意义，不如让其以事实回答在哪个场合缺失了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v3].text,동생이 알고도 말하지 않은 사실이 있다고 본인이 의심하게 된 시점과 그 근거를 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.,"Please point out as fact when you came to suspect that your younger brother knew something and did not say it, and what grounds led to that suspicion.",弟さんが知っていても言わなかった事実があるとご自身が疑うようになった時点と、その根拠を事実関係で指摘してください。,请按事实指出，您是在什么时候怀疑弟弟知道却没有说，以及怀疑的依据是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 의미보다 어떤 자리에서 무엇이 빠졌는지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Rather than the meaning of the silence, have him answer as fact what was missing in which place.",事実追及。沈黙の意味よりも、どの場で何が欠けていたのかを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。与其追问沉默的意义，不如让其以事实回答在哪个场合缺失了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v4].text,"그 침묵 안에서 본인이 누구에게서도 듣지 못한 부분이 어디까지인지, 알고 있는 범위에서 정리해 주십시오.","Within what you know, organize how far the parts you did not hear from anyone extended within that silence.",その沈黙の中で、ご自身が誰からも聞けなかった部分がどこまでなのか、知っている範囲で整理してください。,请在您所知范围内整理，在这份沉默之中，您从任何人那里都没听到的部分到哪里为止。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 침묵의 의미보다 어떤 자리에서 무엇이 빠졌는지를 사실로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Rather than the meaning of the silence, have him answer as fact what was missing in which place.",事実追及。沈黙の意味よりも、どの場で何が欠けていたのかを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。与其追问沉默的意义，不如让其以事实回答在哪个场合缺失了什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-silence_reason-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 침묵의 의미에 대한 본인의 해석은 미뤄 두고, 어느 자리에서 어떤 사실이 빠져 있었는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside your interpretation of the silence's meaning, and first answer which facts were missing in which place.",ユン・テソンさん、沈黙の意味についてのご自身の解釈はいったん置き、どの場でどの事実が抜けていたのかから答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请暂时放下您对沉默意义的解读，先回答在哪个场合缺少了哪些事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실의 연결 결론보다 윤태성이 본 사실을 먼저 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer first the facts he saw, rather than a conclusion linking the two facts.",事実追及。二つの事実のつながりの結論より、ユン・テソンが見た事実を先に答えさせる。,事实追问。与其让其得出两个事实之间的连接结论，不如先让尹泰成回答其看到的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 가족 사정과 유서 변경이 연결되어 있을 수 있다는 의심이 본인에게 든 시점을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state when you first suspected that those family circumstances and the change in the will could be connected.",ユン・テソンさん、その家族事情と遺言書の変更がつながっているかもしれないという疑いが、ご自身に生じた時点をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您是在什么时候开始怀疑那种家族情况可能与遗嘱变更有关的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실의 연결 결론보다 윤태성이 본 사실을 먼저 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer first the facts he saw, rather than a conclusion linking the two facts.",事実追及。二つの事実のつながりの結論より、ユン・テソンが見た事実を先に答えさせる。,事实追问。与其让其得出两个事实之间的连接结论，不如先让尹泰成回答其看到的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v2].text,본인이 직접 본 자료와 추정으로 그렇게 보고 있는 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the materials you personally saw and the parts you are viewing that way by inference.,ご自身が直接見た資料と、推測でそう見ている部分を分けて答えてください。,请把您亲眼看到的资料，和您通过推定这样看待的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실의 연결 결론보다 윤태성이 본 사실을 먼저 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer first the facts he saw, rather than a conclusion linking the two facts.",事実追及。二つの事実のつながりの結論より、ユン・テソンが見た事実を先に答えさせる。,事实追问。与其让其得出两个事实之间的连接结论，不如先让尹泰成回答其看到的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v3].text,동생의 설명에서 두 사실이 따로 다뤄진 자리와 함께 다뤄진 자리가 있다면 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.,"If your younger brother's explanation treated the two facts separately in some places and together in others, please point that out as fact.",弟さんの説明で、二つの事実が別々に扱われた場と一緒に扱われた場があるなら、事実関係で指摘してください。,如果弟弟的说明中，有些地方把两个事实分开处理，有些地方一起处理，请按事实指出。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실의 연결 결론보다 윤태성이 본 사실을 먼저 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer first the facts he saw, rather than a conclusion linking the two facts.",事実追及。二つの事実のつながりの結論より、ユン・テソンが見た事実を先に答えさせる。,事实追问。与其让其得出两个事实之间的连接结论，不如先让尹泰成回答其看到的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v4].text,"그 사정을 알았다면 어머니께서 유서를 다르게 정리하셨을지, 본인이 어머니께 직접 들었던 표현이 있는지 정리해 주십시오.","If your mother would have organized the will differently had she known those circumstances, organize whether there was any expression you heard directly from her.",その事情を知っていたならお母様が遺言書を違う形で整理されたのか、ご自身がお母様から直接聞いた表現があるのか整理してください。,如果母亲知道那种情况是否会以不同方式整理遗嘱，请整理您是否曾直接从母亲那里听到相关表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실의 연결 결론보다 윤태성이 본 사실을 먼저 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer first the facts he saw, rather than a conclusion linking the two facts.",事実追及。二つの事実のつながりの結論より、ユン・テソンが見た事実を先に答えさせる。,事实追问。与其让其得出两个事实之间的连接结论，不如先让尹泰成回答其看到的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-will_link-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 두 사실의 연결에 대한 본인의 결론은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 직접 본 사실부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside your conclusion about the connection between the two facts, and answer first the facts you personally saw.",ユン・テソンさん、二つの事実のつながりについてのご自身の結論はいったん置き、ご自身が直接見た事実から答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请暂时放下您关于两个事实之间关联的结论，先回答您亲眼看到的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 직후 윤정후 본인 행동과 보관 절차를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order his actions immediately after discovering the diary and the storage procedure.,事実追及。日記発見直後のユン・ジョンフ本人の行動と保管手続きを時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答发现日记后自己的行动和保管程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 일기장을 본인이 발견한 날짜와 그날 어떤 사진이나 메모까지 함께 보았는지 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order the date you discovered Mother's Diary and what photos or memos you saw with it that day.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の日記を発見した日付と、その日どのような写真やメモまで一緒に見たのか、時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明您发现母亲日记的日期，以及那天还一起看到了哪些照片或备忘。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 직후 윤정후 본인 행동과 보관 절차를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order his actions immediately after discovering the diary and the storage procedure.,事実追及。日記発見直後のユン・ジョンフ本人の行動と保管手続きを時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答发现日记后自己的行动和保管程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v2].text,발견 직후 본인이 직접 한 행동과 그 자리를 그대로 둔 행동을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately what you did directly after the discovery and what you left as it was.,発見直後にご自身が直接した行動と、その場をそのままにした行動を分けて答えてください。,请把发现后您亲自做的行为，和让现场保持原样的行为分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 직후 윤정후 본인 행동과 보관 절차를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order his actions immediately after discovering the diary and the storage procedure.,事実追及。日記発見直後のユン・ジョンフ本人の行動と保管手続きを時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答发现日记后自己的行动和保管程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v3].text,그 시점부터 본인이 형에게 알리지 않기로 한 결정 사이에 어떤 절차가 있었는지 사실관계만으로 짚어 주십시오.,Please point out only as fact what procedures existed between that point and your decision not to tell your brother.,その時点から、ご自身がお兄様に知らせないと決めたことの間に、どのような手続きがあったのか、事実関係だけで指摘してください。,请只按事实指出，从那个时间点到您决定不告诉哥哥之间，有过哪些程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 직후 윤정후 본인 행동과 보관 절차를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order his actions immediately after discovering the diary and the storage procedure.,事実追及。日記発見直後のユン・ジョンフ本人の行動と保管手続きを時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答发现日记后自己的行动和保管程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v4].text,"발견 이후 일기장을 누가 어디에 보관했는지, 본인이 직접 처리한 일과 다른 가족에게 맡긴 일을 정리해 주십시오.","After the discovery, who kept the diary and where? Organize the work you handled directly and the work you entrusted to other family members.",発見後、日記を誰がどこに保管したのか、ご自身が直接処理したことと他の家族に任せたことを整理してください。,发现之后，日记由谁存放在哪里？请整理您亲自处理的事和交给其他家人的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 일기장 발견 직후 윤정후 본인 행동과 보관 절차를 시간순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer in chronological order his actions immediately after discovering the diary and the storage procedure.,事実追及。日記発見直後のユン・ジョンフ本人の行動と保管手続きを時系列で答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按时间顺序回答发现日记后自己的行动和保管程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-diary_discovery-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 발견 직후 어머니께 같은 사정을 직접 여쭌 자리가 있었는지 사실 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please answer truthfully whether, immediately after the discovery, there was any place where you directly asked your mother about the same circumstances.",ユン・ジョンフさん、発見直後、お母様に同じ事情を直接尋ねた場があったのか、事実どおりに答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请如实回答，发现后您是否曾直接向母亲询问同样的情况。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정을 알게 된 시점과 다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact when he learned the family circumstances and the procedure by which he handled them. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情を知った時点と扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答得知家族情况的时间点，以及处理这些情况的程序。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 일기장을 본인이 처음 본 시점과 그 자리에서 본 분량을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order when you first saw Mother's Diary and how much you saw there.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の日記を初めて見た時点と、その場で見た分量を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明您第一次看到母亲日记的时间点，以及当场看了多少内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정을 알게 된 시점과 다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact when he learned the family circumstances and the procedure by which he handled them. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情を知った時点と扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答得知家族情况的时间点，以及处理这些情况的程序。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].text,본인이 직접 읽어서 알게 된 부분과 어머니께서 직접 말씀해 주신 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the parts you learned by reading directly and the parts your mother told you directly.,ご自身が直接読んで知った部分と、お母様が直接話してくださった部分を分けて答えてください。,请把您直接阅读后得知的部分，和母亲直接告诉您的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정을 알게 된 시점과 다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact when he learned the family circumstances and the procedure by which he handled them. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情を知った時点と扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答得知家族情况的时间点，以及处理这些情况的程序。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].text,일기장에 적힌 가족에 관한 사정 가운데 본인이 알게 된 시점부터 형에게 알리지 않은 기간을 사실관계로 답해 주십시오.,"Regarding the family circumstances written in the diary, answer as fact the period from when you learned them until when you did not tell your brother.",日記に記された家族に関する事情のうち、ご自身が知った時点からお兄様に知らせなかった期間を、事実関係で答えてください。,关于日记中写到的家族情况，请按事实回答您从得知到没有告诉哥哥之间的期间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정을 알게 된 시점과 다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact when he learned the family circumstances and the procedure by which he handled them. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情を知った時点と扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答得知家族情况的时间点，以及处理这些情况的程序。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].text,일기장을 본 뒤 본인이 어머니께 같은 사정을 직접 여쭙거나 확인한 자리가 있었는지 정리해 주십시오.,"After seeing the diary, organize whether there was a place where you directly asked or confirmed the same circumstances with your mother.",日記を見た後、ご自身がお母様に同じ事情を直接尋ねたり確認したりした場があったのか整理してください。,看过日记后，请整理您是否曾直接向母亲询问或确认同样的情况。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 가족 사정을 알게 된 시점과 다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. S5 전 출생 비밀 구체 표현은 피한다.,"Fact pursuit. Have him answer as fact when he learned the family circumstances and the procedure by which he handled them. Before S5, avoid specific expressions of the birth secret.",事実追及。家族事情を知った時点と扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。S5前は出生の秘密の具体表現を避ける。,事实追问。让其以事实回答得知家族情况的时间点，以及处理这些情况的程序。S5前避免出生秘密的具体表述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 알게 된 내용의 구체 표현은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 그 사실을 어떻게 다뤘는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside specific wording of what you learned, and first answer how you handled that fact.",ユン・ジョンフさん、知ることになった内容の具体表現はいったん置き、ご自身がその事実をどのように扱ったのかから答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请暂时放下所知内容的具体表述，先回答您如何处理了那个事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록을 윤정후가 보관·다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the procedure by which he stored and handled the sealed family record. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録をユン・ジョンフが保管し扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让尹正厚以事实回答其保管和处理被封存的家族记录的程序。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 가족에게 큰 영향을 줄 사정이 어머니 기록 안에 들어 있다는 사실을 본인이 언제 알게 되었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state when you came to know that circumstances with major impact on the family were inside your mother's records.",ユン・ジョンフさん、家族に大きな影響を与える事情がお母様の記録の中に入っているという事実を、いつ知ることになったのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请说明您是在什么时候知道母亲记录中包含会对家人产生重大影响的情况。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록을 윤정후가 보관·다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the procedure by which he stored and handled the sealed family record. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録をユン・ジョンフが保管し扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让尹正厚以事实回答其保管和处理被封存的家族记录的程序。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v2].text,그 사정과 관련해 본인이 직접 확인한 자료와 어머니께 들어서 알고 있던 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the materials you personally confirmed regarding those circumstances and the parts you knew by hearing from your mother.,その事情に関してご自身が直接確認した資料と、お母様から聞いて知っていた部分を分けて答えてください。,请把关于那种情况您亲自确认的资料，和从母亲那里听到后知道的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록을 윤정후가 보관·다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the procedure by which he stored and handled the sealed family record. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録をユン・ジョンフが保管し扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让尹正厚以事实回答其保管和处理被封存的家族记录的程序。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v3].text,그 사정을 본인이 알고 있던 기간 동안 형에게 알리지 않은 시점을 사실관계만으로 답해 주십시오.,"During the period you knew those circumstances, answer as fact the times when you did not tell your brother.",その事情をご自身が知っていた期間の間、お兄様に知らせなかった時点を事実関係だけで答えてください。,在您知道那种情况的期间，请只按事实回答没有告诉哥哥的时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록을 윤정후가 보관·다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the procedure by which he stored and handled the sealed family record. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録をユン・ジョンフが保管し扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让尹正厚以事实回答其保管和处理被封存的家族记录的程序。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v4].text,"본인이 그 사정을 다루기 위해 누구와 의논하거나 누구에게 보관을 맡겼는지, 본인이 직접 한 일을 정리해 주십시오.","Organize what you personally did to handle those circumstances, including whom you consulted or to whom you entrusted storage.",ご自身がその事情を扱うために誰と相談したり、誰に保管を任せたりしたのか、ご自身が直接したことを整理してください。,请整理为了处理那种情况，您与谁商量过、或将保管交给了谁，以及您亲自做过的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 봉인된 가족 기록을 윤정후가 보관·다룬 절차를 사실로 답하게 한다. 출생 비밀 직접 표현은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact the procedure by which he stored and handled the sealed family record. Avoid direct expression of the birth secret.,事実追及。封印された家族記録をユン・ジョンフが保管し扱った手続きを事実として答えさせる。出生の秘密を直接表現しない。,事实追问。让尹正厚以事实回答其保管和处理被封存的家族记录的程序。避免直接表述出生秘密。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-sealed_family_record-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 사정의 구체 표현은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 사실을 어떻게 보관하고 다뤘는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside specific wording of those circumstances, and first answer how you stored and handled the fact.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その事情の具体表現はいったん置き、ご自身が事実をどのように保管し扱ったのかから答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请暂时放下那种情况的具体表述，先回答您如何保管并处理了这个事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 침묵을 정한 시점과 유지한 기간을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact when he decided on silence and how long he maintained it.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが沈黙を決めた時点と維持した期間を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其决定沉默的时间点及维持期间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 그 사정에 대해 형에게 말하지 않기로 정한 시점과 유지한 기간을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order when you decided not to tell your brother about those circumstances and how long you maintained that decision.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その事情についてお兄様に話さないと決めた時点と維持した期間を、時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明，您决定不把那种情况告诉哥哥的时间点，以及维持这个决定的期间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 침묵을 정한 시점과 유지한 기간을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact when he decided on silence and how long he maintained it.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが沈黙を決めた時点と維持した期間を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其决定沉默的时间点及维持期间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v2].text,본인이 침묵을 직접 선택한 자리와 어머니의 부탁으로 침묵한 자리를 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please answer separately the places where you personally chose silence and the places where you remained silent because of your mother's request.,ご自身が直接沈黙を選んだ場と、お母様の頼みで沈黙した場を分けて答えてください。,请分别回答您亲自选择沉默的场合，和因母亲请求而沉默的场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 침묵을 정한 시점과 유지한 기간을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact when he decided on silence and how long he maintained it.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが沈黙を決めた時点と維持した期間を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其决定沉默的时间点及维持期间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v3].text,"보호 명분과 침묵 사이에서, 본인이 직접 한 결정과 가족이 함께 합의한 결정이 어떻게 다른지 사실관계로 답해 주십시오.","Between the justification of protection and silence, answer as fact how the decisions you personally made differed from decisions agreed upon by the family together.",保護の名分と沈黙の間で、ご自身が直接下した決定と、家族が共に合意した決定がどう異なるのか、事実関係で答えてください。,在保护名义与沉默之间，请按事实回答您亲自做出的决定，与家人共同合意的决定有何不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 침묵을 정한 시점과 유지한 기간을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact when he decided on silence and how long he maintained it.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが沈黙を決めた時点と維持した期間を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其决定沉默的时间点及维持期间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v4].text,"그 침묵이 형에게 어떤 정보 공백을 남겼는지, 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 정리해 주십시오.",Organize within what you know what information gap that silence left for your brother.,その沈黙がお兄様にどのような情報の空白を残したのか、ご自身が知っている範囲で整理してください。,请在您所知范围内整理，这份沉默给哥哥留下了怎样的信息空白。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 윤정후가 침묵을 정한 시점과 유지한 기간을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact when he decided on silence and how long he maintained it.,事実追及。ユン・ジョンフが沈黙を決めた時点と維持した期間を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其决定沉默的时间点及维持期间。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-silence_reason-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵의 이유에 대한 진술은 미뤄 두고, 어느 자리에서 어떤 사실을 알리지 않았는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside testimony about why you stayed silent, and first answer which facts you did not disclose in which place.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙の理由についての陳述はいったん置き、どの場でどの事実を知らせなかったのかから答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请暂时放下关于沉默理由的陈述，先回答在哪个场合没有告知哪些事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실에 대한 윤정후의 절차 시각을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact his procedural timing regarding the two facts.,事実追及。二つの事実に対するユン・ジョンフの手続き上の時点を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其针对两个事实的程序时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 사정을 안 시점과 유서 절차를 본인이 마무리한 시점을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order when you learned those circumstances and when you completed the will procedure.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その事情を知った時点と、遺言書の手続きをご自身が終えた時点を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明您知道那种情况的时间点，以及您完成遗嘱程序的时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실에 대한 윤정후의 절차 시각을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact his procedural timing regarding the two facts.,事実追及。二つの事実に対するユン・ジョンフの手続き上の時点を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其针对两个事实的程序时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v2].text,"본인이 그 사정을 알고 유서 절차를 진행한 자리와, 그 사정과 무관하게 진행한 자리를 분리해 답해 주십시오.",Please answer separately the place where you proceeded with the will procedure knowing those circumstances and the place where you proceeded unrelated to them.,ご自身がその事情を知って遺言書の手続きを進めた場と、その事情と無関係に進めた場を分けて答えてください。,请把您知道那种情况后推进遗嘱程序的场合，和与那种情况无关地推进的场合分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실에 대한 윤정후의 절차 시각을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact his procedural timing regarding the two facts.,事実追及。二つの事実に対するユン・ジョンフの手続き上の時点を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其针对两个事实的程序时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v3].text,형은 그 사정이 비율 변경의 직접 동기였다고 의심합니다. 같은 시기에 본인이 직접 처리한 절차만 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.,Your brother suspects those circumstances were the direct motive for the ratio change. Please point out as fact only the procedure you directly handled during the same period.,お兄様は、その事情が比率変更の直接動機だったと疑っています。同じ時期にご自身が直接処理した手続きだけを、事実関係で指摘してください。,哥哥怀疑那种情况是比例变更的直接动机。请只按事实指出同一时期您亲自处理的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실에 대한 윤정후의 절차 시각을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact his procedural timing regarding the two facts.,事実追及。二つの事実に対するユン・ジョンフの手続き上の時点を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其针对两个事实的程序时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v4].text,그 사정과 유서 절차 사이의 연결을 본인이 어머니께 직접 확인한 자리가 있었다면 그 자리를 정리해 주십시오.,"If there was a place where you directly confirmed with your mother the connection between those circumstances and the will procedure, please organize that place.",その事情と遺言書手続きの間のつながりを、ご自身がお母様に直接確認した場があったなら、その場を整理してください。,如果您曾直接向母亲确认那种情况与遗嘱程序之间的关联，请整理那个场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사실에 대한 윤정후의 절차 시각을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer as fact his procedural timing regarding the two facts.,事実追及。二つの事実に対するユン・ジョンフの手続き上の時点を事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚以事实回答其针对两个事实的程序时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-will_link-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 두 사실의 연결을 어떻게 보는지에 대한 진술은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 처리한 절차의 시각부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside testimony about how you see the connection between the two facts, and first answer the timing of the procedure you handled.",ユン・ジョンフさん、二つの事実のつながりをどのように見るのかについての陳述はいったん置き、ご自身が処理した手続きの時点から答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请暂时放下关于您如何看待两个事实关联的陈述，先回答您处理程序的时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 보지 못한 일기장에 대해 짐작을 단정으로 옮긴 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in moving from inference to certainty about a diary he did not personally see.,動機探索。直接見ていない日記について、推測を断定へ移した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对未亲眼看到的日记从推定转为断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 일기장을 본인이 직접 보신 적이 없다면, 그 안에 무엇이 있으리라는 짐작을 본인이 어떻게 만들었는지 그 과정을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you have never personally seen your mother's diary, please state the process by which you formed the inference about what might be inside it.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の日記をご自身が直接見たことがないなら、その中に何があるだろうという推測を、ご自身がどのように作ったのか、その過程をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果您从未亲眼看过母亲日记，请说明您是如何形成“里面会有什么”这一推定的过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 보지 못한 일기장에 대해 짐작을 단정으로 옮긴 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in moving from inference to certainty about a diary he did not personally see.,動機探索。直接見ていない日記について、推測を断定へ移した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对未亲眼看到的日记从推定转为断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v2].text,본인이 짐작에 머무는 사실을 두고도 동생을 단정한 본인의 판단 동기는 무엇입니까.,"Even though the fact remained an inference, what was your motive in deciding your younger brother's role there?",ご自身が推測にとどまる事実をめぐっても、弟さんを断定したご自身の判断動機は何ですか。,即便事实仍停留在推定阶段，您仍断定弟弟，对此您的判断动机是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 보지 못한 일기장에 대해 짐작을 단정으로 옮긴 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in moving from inference to certainty about a diary he did not personally see.,動機探索。直接見ていない日記について、推測を断定へ移した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对未亲眼看到的日记从推定转为断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v3].text,일기장을 본인이 먼저 본 적이 없는 이유를 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 설명하십시오.,Please explain within what you can know why you never saw the diary first yourself.,ご自身が日記を先に見たことがない理由を、ご自身が分かる範囲で説明してください。,请在您能知道的范围内说明，为什么您没有先看到那本日记。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 보지 못한 일기장에 대해 짐작을 단정으로 옮긴 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in moving from inference to certainty about a diary he did not personally see.,動機探索。直接見ていない日記について、推測を断定へ移した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对未亲眼看到的日记从推定转为断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v4].text,"본인이 그 안에 무엇이 있을지 묻지 않기로 한 자리가 있었다면, 그 묻지 않은 이유를 답하십시오.","If there was a place where you decided not to ask what might be inside it, answer why you did not ask.",ご自身がその中に何があるのか尋ねないことにした場があったなら、その尋ねなかった理由を答えてください。,如果曾有场合让您决定不问里面有什么，请回答您没有追问的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 보지 못한 일기장에 대해 짐작을 단정으로 옮긴 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment in moving from inference to certainty about a diary he did not personally see.,動機探索。直接見ていない日記について、推測を断定へ移した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答对未亲眼看到的日记从推定转为断定的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-diary_discovery-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 일기장을 둘러싼 본인의 의심 가운데 본인이 직접 확인할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please first state the parts of your suspicion around the diary that you could personally confirm.",ユン・テソンさん、日記をめぐるご自身の疑いのうち、ご自身が直接確認できる部分から先にお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请先说明围绕日记的怀疑中，您能亲自确认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 모르는 영역과 본인이 단정한 영역을 분리해 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 봉인된 가족 기록/민감한 사정으로 완충.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment by separating what he did not know from what he assumed. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; buffer with sealed family record or sensitive circumstances.,動機探索。本人が知らない領域と本人が断定した領域を切り分け、本人判断の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、封印された家族記録や繊細な事情で緩衝する。,动机探查。引导其区分本人不知道的领域和本人断定的领域，并回答本人判断的动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，用被封存的家族记录或敏感情况缓冲。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 일기장에 본인이 모르는 가족 사정이 있었다는 가능성을 들은 뒤, 그것을 본인이 어떻게 받아들이기로 했는지 그 판단의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, after hearing that your mother's diary might contain family circumstances you did not know, please state why you chose to accept it as you did.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の日記にご自身の知らない家族事情があった可能性を聞いた後、それをどのように受け止めることにしたのか、その判断の理由をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，听说母亲日记中可能有您不知道的家族情况之后，请说明您决定如何接受它，以及这样判断的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 모르는 영역과 본인이 단정한 영역을 분리해 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 봉인된 가족 기록/민감한 사정으로 완충.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment by separating what he did not know from what he assumed. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; buffer with sealed family record or sensitive circumstances.,動機探索。本人が知らない領域と本人が断定した領域を切り分け、本人判断の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、封印された家族記録や繊細な事情で緩衝する。,动机探查。引导其区分本人不知道的领域和本人断定的领域，并回答本人判断的动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，用被封存的家族记录或敏感情况缓冲。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,본인이 알지 못하는 부분을 두고도 그 자리에서 동생을 단정한 본인의 동기는 무엇입니까.,What was your motive in deciding your younger brother's role there even though parts were unknown to you?,ご自身が知らない部分をめぐっても、その場で弟さんを断定したご自身の動機は何ですか。,即便有您不知道的部分，您仍在那个场合断定弟弟，动机是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 모르는 영역과 본인이 단정한 영역을 분리해 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 봉인된 가족 기록/민감한 사정으로 완충.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment by separating what he did not know from what he assumed. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; buffer with sealed family record or sensitive circumstances.,動機探索。本人が知らない領域と本人が断定した領域を切り分け、本人判断の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、封印された家族記録や繊細な事情で緩衝する。,动机探查。引导其区分本人不知道的领域和本人断定的领域，并回答本人判断的动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，用被封存的家族记录或敏感情况缓冲。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,"어머니 곁에서 막연히 이상하다고 느낀 자리가 있었다면, 그 느낌을 본인 안에서 어떻게 다뤘는지 답하십시오.","If there was a place beside your mother where you vaguely felt something was strange, answer how you handled that feeling within yourself.",お母様のそばで、漠然とおかしいと感じた場があったなら、その感じをご自身の中でどのように扱ったのか答えてください。,如果在母亲身边曾有某个场合让您隐约觉得奇怪，请回答您在心里如何处理这种感觉。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 모르는 영역과 본인이 단정한 영역을 분리해 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 봉인된 가족 기록/민감한 사정으로 완충.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment by separating what he did not know from what he assumed. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; buffer with sealed family record or sensitive circumstances.,動機探索。本人が知らない領域と本人が断定した領域を切り分け、本人判断の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、封印された家族記録や繊細な事情で緩衝する。,动机探查。引导其区分本人不知道的领域和本人断定的领域，并回答本人判断的动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，用被封存的家族记录或敏感情况缓冲。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,"본인이 알게 될까 봐 두려운 사정이 있었다면, 그 두려움이 본인의 의심에 어떻게 작용했는지 본인 선에서 설명하십시오.","If there were circumstances you feared you might come to know, explain within your limits how that fear affected your suspicion.",ご自身が知ることになるのを恐れた事情があったなら、その恐れがご自身の疑いにどのように作用したのか、ご自身の範囲で説明してください。,如果有某种情况是您害怕自己会知道的，请在您的范围内说明这份恐惧如何作用于您的怀疑。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 모르는 영역과 본인이 단정한 영역을 분리해 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 봉인된 가족 기록/민감한 사정으로 완충.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his judgment by separating what he did not know from what he assumed. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; buffer with sealed family record or sensitive circumstances.,動機探索。本人が知らない領域と本人が断定した領域を切り分け、本人判断の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、封印された家族記録や繊細な事情で緩衝する。,动机探查。引导其区分本人不知道的领域和本人断定的领域，并回答本人判断的动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，用被封存的家族记录或敏感情况缓冲。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 알 수 없었던 영역과 본인이 직접 본 영역을 나눠 답해 주시고, 알 수 없었던 영역에 본인의 의심을 끌어들인 본인 판단의 동기를 함께 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please answer separately what you could not know and what you directly saw, and state the motive behind your judgment in bringing your suspicion into the area you could not know.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が知り得なかった領域とご自身が直接見た領域を分けて答え、知り得なかった領域へご自身の疑いを引き込んだ判断の動機も併せてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请区分您无法知晓的领域和亲眼看到的领域，并一并说明您把自己的怀疑带入无法知晓领域的判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 모르는 영역의 무게를 본인 판단으로 끌어들인 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for bringing the weight of an unknown area into his own judgment.,動機探索。知らない領域の重みをご自身の判断へ引き込んだ本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将未知领域的分量带入本人判断的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 직접 모르는 봉인된 가족 기록의 영향을 본인의 판단 안으로 끌어들인 본인의 결정 과정을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state the decision process by which you brought the influence of a sealed family record you did not personally know into your judgment.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が直接知らない封印された家族記録の影響を、ご自身の判断の中へ引き込んだ決定過程をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您把自己并不直接了解的被封存家族记录的影响带入自己判断的决定过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 모르는 영역의 무게를 본인 판단으로 끌어들인 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for bringing the weight of an unknown area into his own judgment.,動機探索。知らない領域の重みをご自身の判断へ引き込んだ本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将未知领域的分量带入本人判断的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v2].text,"본인이 모르는 영역을 두고 그 영역의 무게를 본인이 어떻게 가늠하기로 했는지, 그 가늠의 근거를 답하십시오.","Regarding the area you did not know, answer how you chose to weigh the weight of that area, and on what basis.",ご自身が知らない領域をめぐり、その領域の重さをご自身がどう見積もることにしたのか、その見積もりの根拠を答えてください。,关于您不了解的领域，请回答您决定如何衡量该领域的分量，以及衡量的依据是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 모르는 영역의 무게를 본인 판단으로 끌어들인 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for bringing the weight of an unknown area into his own judgment.,動機探索。知らない領域の重みをご自身の判断へ引き込んだ本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将未知领域的分量带入本人判断的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v3].text,봉인된 영역이 본인 자신과 관련 있을 가능성을 본인 안에서 어떻게 다뤘는지 설명하십시오.,Please explain how you handled within yourself the possibility that the sealed area might relate to you.,封印された領域がご自身と関わる可能性を、ご自身の中でどのように扱ったのか説明してください。,请说明，对于被封存领域可能与您本人有关这一可能性，您在心里如何处理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 모르는 영역의 무게를 본인 판단으로 끌어들인 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for bringing the weight of an unknown area into his own judgment.,動機探索。知らない領域の重みをご自身の判断へ引き込んだ本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将未知领域的分量带入本人判断的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v4].text,"그 영역을 알게 될 일을 본인이 회피한 자리가 있다면, 그 회피의 이유는 무엇입니까.","If there was a place where you avoided coming to know that area, what was the reason for that avoidance?",その領域を知ることになるのをご自身が回避した場があったなら、その回避の理由は何ですか。,如果曾有场合让您回避去了解那个领域，请回答回避的理由是什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 모르는 영역의 무게를 본인 판단으로 끌어들인 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for bringing the weight of an unknown area into his own judgment.,動機探索。知らない領域の重みをご自身の判断へ引き込んだ本人の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答将未知领域的分量带入本人判断的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-sealed_family_record-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 봉인된 부분과 본인이 직접 확인한 부분을 분리해 답할 수 있는 자리부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please begin with any place where you can separately answer about the sealed portion and the parts you directly confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、封印された部分とご自身が直接確認した部分を分けて答えられる場からお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请先从能把被封存的部分和您直接确认的部分分开回答的地方说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v1].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 알 수 없었던 영역에 대해 누군가의 침묵을 단정한 본인 판단의 동기와, 본인이 묻지 않은 책임을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive probe. Have him separate the motive behind assuming someone's silence about an area he could not know from his own responsibility for not asking.,動機探索。本人が知り得なかった領域について誰かの沈黙を断定した本人判断の動機と、本人が尋ねなかった責任を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分对自己无法知晓的领域断定有人沉默的判断动机，以及本人没有追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 알 수 없었던 정보를 두고 누군가 침묵했다고 단정한 근거가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what grounds led you to decide that someone was silent about information you could not know?",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が知り得なかった情報をめぐって、誰かが沈黙していたと断定した根拠は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，对于您无法知晓的信息，您凭什么断定有人保持了沉默？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v2].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 알 수 없었던 영역에 대해 누군가의 침묵을 단정한 본인 판단의 동기와, 본인이 묻지 않은 책임을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive probe. Have him separate the motive behind assuming someone's silence about an area he could not know from his own responsibility for not asking.,動機探索。本人が知り得なかった領域について誰かの沈黙を断定した本人判断の動機と、本人が尋ねなかった責任を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分对自己无法知晓的领域断定有人沉默的判断动机，以及本人没有追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v2].text,본인의 단정 안에 본인이 묻지 않은 책임이 함께 들어 있다는 점을 어떻게 보고 계셨는지 답하십시오.,How did you view the fact that your own decision not to ask was also inside your certainty?,ご自身の断定の中に、ご自身が尋ねなかった責任も入っているという点をどう見ていましたか。,您如何看待，在您的断定之中，也包含了您自己没有追问的责任这一点？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v3].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 알 수 없었던 영역에 대해 누군가의 침묵을 단정한 본인 판단의 동기와, 본인이 묻지 않은 책임을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive probe. Have him separate the motive behind assuming someone's silence about an area he could not know from his own responsibility for not asking.,動機探索。本人が知り得なかった領域について誰かの沈黙を断定した本人判断の動機と、本人が尋ねなかった責任を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分对自己无法知晓的领域断定有人沉默的判断动机，以及本人没有追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v3].text,침묵의 이유를 동생 한 사람에게로 좁힌 본인의 판단 과정을 설명하십시오.,Please explain the judgment process by which you narrowed the reason for the silence to your younger brother alone.,沈黙の理由を弟さん一人へ狭めたご自身の判断過程を説明してください。,请说明您把沉默的理由缩小到弟弟一个人身上的判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v4].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 알 수 없었던 영역에 대해 누군가의 침묵을 단정한 본인 판단의 동기와, 본인이 묻지 않은 책임을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive probe. Have him separate the motive behind assuming someone's silence about an area he could not know from his own responsibility for not asking.,動機探索。本人が知り得なかった領域について誰かの沈黙を断定した本人判断の動機と、本人が尋ねなかった責任を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分对自己无法知晓的领域断定有人沉默的判断动机，以及本人没有追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v4].text,"본인이 듣게 될까 봐 미루었던 질문이 있었다면, 그 질문을 미룬 이유는 무엇입니까.","If there was a question you postponed because you feared hearing the answer, what was the reason for postponing that question?",ご自身が聞くことになるのを恐れて先延ばしにした質問があったなら、その質問を先延ばしにした理由は何ですか。,如果有问题是您因为害怕听到答案而推迟的，请回答推迟该问题的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v5].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 본인이 알 수 없었던 영역에 대해 누군가의 침묵을 단정한 본인 판단의 동기와, 본인이 묻지 않은 책임을 분리해 답하게 한다.",Motive probe. Have him separate the motive behind assuming someone's silence about an area he could not know from his own responsibility for not asking.,動機探索。本人が知り得なかった領域について誰かの沈黙を断定した本人判断の動機と、本人が尋ねなかった責任を切り分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分对自己无法知晓的领域断定有人沉默的判断动机，以及本人没有追问的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-silence_reason-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 알아야 했던 부분과 본인이 알지 않기로 한 부분을 분리해 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please answer separately what you should have known and what you chose not to know.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が知るべきだった部分と、ご自身が知ろうとしなかった部分を分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请把您本应知道的部分，和您选择不去了解的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 사안의 연결을 본인이 가정 위에서 단정한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for deciding the connection between the two matters on an assumption.,動機探索。二つの事案のつながりを、本人が仮定の上で断定した動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在假设之上断定两个事项相连的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 알지 못하는 가족 사정과 유서 변경 사이의 연결을 직접 본 게 아니라면, 그 연결을 만든 본인의 가정이 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you did not directly see the connection between family circumstances you did not know and the will change, what assumption of yours created that connection?",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が知らない家族事情と遺言書の変更の間のつながりを直接見たのではないなら、そのつながりを作ったご自身の仮定は何でしたか。,尹泰成先生，如果您并没有亲眼看到自己不知道的家族情况与遗嘱变更之间的关联，那么创造这个关联的是您的什么假设？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 사안의 연결을 본인이 가정 위에서 단정한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for deciding the connection between the two matters on an assumption.,動機探索。二つの事案のつながりを、本人が仮定の上で断定した動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在假设之上断定两个事项相连的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v2].text,그 가정 위에서 동생을 단정한 본인의 동기는 무엇입니까.,What was your motive in deciding your younger brother's role on top of that assumption?,その仮定の上で弟さんを断定したご自身の動機は何ですか。,在这个假设之上断定弟弟，您的动机是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 사안의 연결을 본인이 가정 위에서 단정한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for deciding the connection between the two matters on an assumption.,動機探索。二つの事案のつながりを、本人が仮定の上で断定した動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在假设之上断定两个事项相连的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v3].text,본인이 모르는 영역이 유서 비율과 닿아 있을 가능성을 본인 안에서 어떻게 다뤘는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how you handled within yourself the possibility that an area you did not know touched the will ratio.,ご自身が知らない領域が遺言書の比率と接している可能性を、ご自身の中でどのように扱ったのか答えてください。,请回答，您在心里如何处理自己不了解的领域可能触及遗嘱比例这一可能性。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 사안의 연결을 본인이 가정 위에서 단정한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for deciding the connection between the two matters on an assumption.,動機探索。二つの事案のつながりを、本人が仮定の上で断定した動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在假设之上断定两个事项相连的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v4].text,"본인이 그 연결을 더 알게 되는 일을 회피한 자리가 있었다면, 그 회피의 이유를 설명하십시오.","If there was a place where you avoided learning more about that connection, explain why you avoided it.",ご自身がそのつながりをさらに知ることを回避した場があったなら、その回避の理由を説明してください。,如果曾有场合让您回避进一步了解这种关联，请说明回避的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 사안의 연결을 본인이 가정 위에서 단정한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for deciding the connection between the two matters on an assumption.,動機探索。二つの事案のつながりを、本人が仮定の上で断定した動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在假设之上断定两个事项相连的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-will_link-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 직접 확인한 부분과 가정으로 잇댄 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please answer separately what you personally confirmed and what you connected by assumption.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が直接確認した部分と、仮定でつなげた部分を分けて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请把您亲自确认的部分和用假设连接起来的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 일기장을 본 직후 즉시 다른 사람에게 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell anyone immediately after seeing the diary.,動機探索。日記を見た直後にすぐ他の人へ話さなかった本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答看到日记后没有立即告诉他人的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 일기장을 본인이 본 시점을 먼저 말씀해 주시고, 본 직후 그 자리에서 다른 사람에게 즉시 말하지 않은 이유를 함께 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first state when you saw your mother's diary, and also answer why you did not immediately tell someone else there afterward.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の日記をご自身が見た時点を先にお話しいただき、見た直後その場で他の人にすぐ話さなかった理由も併せて答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请先说明您看到母亲日记的时间点，并同时回答看完后为什么没有当场立即告诉别人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 일기장을 본 직후 즉시 다른 사람에게 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell anyone immediately after seeing the diary.,動機探索。日記を見た直後にすぐ他の人へ話さなかった本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答看到日记后没有立即告诉他人的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v2].text,본인이 그 기록을 본인 안에 두기로 한 결정의 우려는 무엇이었습니까.,What concern lay behind your decision to keep that record within yourself?,その記録をご自身の中に置いておくことにした決定の懸念は何でしたか。,您决定把那份记录留在自己心里，背后的担忧是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 일기장을 본 직후 즉시 다른 사람에게 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell anyone immediately after seeing the diary.,動機探索。日記を見た直後にすぐ他の人へ話さなかった本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答看到日记后没有立即告诉他人的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v3].text,"일기장을 본 직후 본인의 행동이 어머니나 형에게 어떻게 보였을지 미리 가늠한 부분이 있다면, 그 가늠이 본인의 침묵에 어떻게 작용했는지 설명하십시오.","If you anticipated how your actions right after seeing the diary would appear to your mother or brother, explain how that anticipation affected your silence.",日記を見た直後のご自身の行動が、お母様やお兄様にどう見えるかをあらかじめ見積もった部分があるなら、その見積もりがご自身の沈黙にどのように作用したのか説明してください。,如果您曾预估看完日记后的行动会在母亲或哥哥眼中如何呈现，请说明这种预估如何作用于您的沉默。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 일기장을 본 직후 즉시 다른 사람에게 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell anyone immediately after seeing the diary.,動機探索。日記を見た直後にすぐ他の人へ話さなかった本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答看到日记后没有立即告诉他人的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v4].text,"본인이 그 기록의 무게를 줄여 보려고 한 자리가 있다면, 그 노력의 동기를 답하십시오.","If there was a place where you tried to lessen the weight of that record, answer the motive behind that effort.",ご自身がその記録の重みを減らしてみようとした場があるなら、その努力の動機を答えてください。,如果您曾试图减轻那份记录的分量，请回答这种努力的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 일기장을 본 직후 즉시 다른 사람에게 말하지 않은 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell anyone immediately after seeing the diary.,動機探索。日記を見た直後にすぐ他の人へ話さなかった本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答看到日记后没有立即告诉他人的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-diary_discovery-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 그 기록을 본 사실 자체를 형에게 알리지 않은 결정의 이유를 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state within the range for which you can take responsibility why you decided not to tell your brother that you had seen that record.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身がその記録を見た事実そのものをお兄様に知らせなかった決定の理由を、ご自身が責任を負える範囲でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请在您能够负责的范围内说明，您为什么决定不把自己看过那份记录这一事实告诉哥哥。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 알게 된 사정을 가족에게 말하지 않기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 완충 표현만 사용.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell the family about the circumstances he learned. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; use only buffered wording.,動機探索。知ることになった事情を家族に話さないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、緩衝表現のみを使う。,动机探查。引导其回答得知某种情况后决定不告诉家人的本人动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，仅使用缓冲表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 알게 된 사정을 가족에게 말하지 않기로 한 본인의 결정 과정을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, first state the decision process by which you chose not to tell the family about the circumstances you learned.",ユン・ジョンフさん、知ることになった事情を家族に話さないことにしたご自身の決定過程から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先说明您决定不把得知的情况告诉家人的过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 알게 된 사정을 가족에게 말하지 않기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 완충 표현만 사용.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell the family about the circumstances he learned. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; use only buffered wording.,動機探索。知ることになった事情を家族に話さないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、緩衝表現のみを使う。,动机探查。引导其回答得知某种情况后决定不告诉家人的本人动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，仅使用缓冲表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,그 사정을 본인 선에서 묻어두기로 한 결정이 누구를 위한 것이었는지 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답하십시오.,Please answer within what you can know whom your decision to bury those circumstances on your own was for.,その事情をご自身の側で伏せておくことにした決定が誰のためだったのか、ご自身が分かる範囲で答えてください。,请在您能知道的范围内回答，您决定由自己这边埋下那种情况，是为了谁。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 알게 된 사정을 가족에게 말하지 않기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 완충 표현만 사용.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell the family about the circumstances he learned. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; use only buffered wording.,動機探索。知ることになった事情を家族に話さないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、緩衝表現のみを使う。,动机探查。引导其回答得知某种情况后决定不告诉家人的本人动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，仅使用缓冲表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,"침묵을 보호로 부르는 동안 본인이 형에게서 가져간 결정의 자리가 있었다면, 그 자리를 본인이 어떻게 보고 계셨는지 설명하십시오.","While calling the silence protection, if there was a place where you took a decision away from your brother, explain how you view that place.",沈黙を保護と呼ぶ間に、ご自身がお兄様から決定の場を奪ったことがあるなら、その場をどのように見ているのか説明してください。,在把沉默称为保护的过程中，如果有您从哥哥那里拿走决定位置的地方，请说明您如何看待那个位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 알게 된 사정을 가족에게 말하지 않기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 완충 표현만 사용.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell the family about the circumstances he learned. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; use only buffered wording.,動機探索。知ることになった事情を家族に話さないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、緩衝表現のみを使う。,动机探查。引导其回答得知某种情况后决定不告诉家人的本人动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，仅使用缓冲表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,그 사정을 다른 결정과 분리해 두려고 한 본인의 노력이 어디서 한계에 부딪혔는지 답하십시오.,Please answer where your effort to keep those circumstances separate from other decisions hit its limit.,その事情を他の決定と切り離しておこうとしたご自身の努力が、どこで限界にぶつかったのか答えてください。,请回答，您试图把那种情况与其他决定分开保存的努力，是在哪里遇到极限的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,"동기 탐색. 알게 된 사정을 가족에게 말하지 않기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다. 민감 가족 기록의 핵심 내용은 직접 표현 X, 완충 표현만 사용.",Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to tell the family about the circumstances he learned. Do not directly express the core content of the sensitive family record; use only buffered wording.,動機探索。知ることになった事情を家族に話さないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。敏感な家族記録の核心内容は直接表現せず、緩衝表現のみを使う。,动机探查。引导其回答得知某种情况后决定不告诉家人的本人动机。敏感家族记录的核心内容不直接表述，仅使用缓冲表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 그 사정을 알게 된 직후 본인이 한 행동과 본인이 미룬 행동을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please separate what you did immediately after learning those circumstances from what you postponed.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その事情を知ることになった直後、ご自身がした行動とご自身が先延ばしにした行動を分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把得知那种情况后您立即做的行为，和您推迟的行为分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 기록을 본인 혼자 봉인된 채로 두기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to keep the record sealed on his own.,動機探索。その記録を本人ひとりで封印されたままにしておくことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答决定由本人独自让那份记录保持封存状态的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 기록을 본인 선에서 봉인된 채로 두기로 한 결정의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state the motive behind your decision to keep that record sealed on your own.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その記録をご自身の側で封印されたままにしておくことにした決定の動機をお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请说明您决定由自己这边让那份记录保持封存状态的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 기록을 본인 혼자 봉인된 채로 두기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to keep the record sealed on his own.,動機探索。その記録を本人ひとりで封印されたままにしておくことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答决定由本人独自让那份记录保持封存状态的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v2].text,"그 결정을 본인 혼자 내리지 않고 다른 가족과 함께 의논할 수도 있었던 자리가 있었다면, 그 자리를 만들지 않은 이유를 답하십시오.","If there was a place where you could have discussed that decision with other family members instead of making it alone, answer why you did not create that place.",その決定をご自身ひとりで下さず、他の家族と一緒に相談することもできた場があったなら、その場を作らなかった理由を答えてください。,如果曾有机会不由您独自做出决定，而是与其他家人共同商量，请回答您为什么没有创造那个场合。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 기록을 본인 혼자 봉인된 채로 두기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to keep the record sealed on his own.,動機探索。その記録を本人ひとりで封印されたままにしておくことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答决定由本人独自让那份记录保持封存状态的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v3].text,봉인을 본인 책임으로 하기로 한 결정이 본인에게 준 부담이 무엇이었는지 알 수 있는 범위에서 설명하십시오.,Explain within what you can know what burden you took on by deciding to make the seal your responsibility.,封印をご自身の責任にすることにした決定が、ご自身に与えた負担が何だったのか、分かる範囲で説明してください。,请在您能知道的范围内说明，决定把封存作为自己的责任，给您带来了什么负担。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 기록을 본인 혼자 봉인된 채로 두기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to keep the record sealed on his own.,動機探索。その記録を本人ひとりで封印されたままにしておくことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答决定由本人独自让那份记录保持封存状态的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v4].text,"그 봉인이 다른 사람의 결정 자리를 좁힌 부분이 있다면, 그 좁힘을 본인이 어떻게 보고 계셨는지 답하십시오.","If that seal narrowed someone else's place to decide, answer how you view that narrowing.",その封印が他の人の決定の場を狭めた部分があるなら、その狭めをご自身がどう見ているのか答えてください。,如果那个封存缩窄了其他人的决定空间，请回答您如何看待这种缩窄。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 그 기록을 본인 혼자 봉인된 채로 두기로 한 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to keep the record sealed on his own.,動機探索。その記録を本人ひとりで封印されたままにしておくことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答决定由本人独自让那份记录保持封存状态的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-sealed_family_record-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 봉인의 무게와 본인 자신의 안전을 분리해 본인 선에서 인정할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first state the parts you can acknowledge within your own limits by separating the weight of the seal from your own safety.",ユン・ジョンフさん、封印の重みとご自身の安全を分けて、ご自身の範囲で認められる部分から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把封存的分量和您自身的安全分开，先说明您在自己范围内能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 보호한 대상과 동시에 결정 자리를 가져간 대상을 본인 선에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer, within his own limits, who his silence protected and whose place to decide it simultaneously took away.",動機探索。本人の沈黙が守った対象と、同時に決定の場を奪った対象を、本人の範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人范围内回答其沉默保护了谁，同时又夺走了谁的决定位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 침묵으로 보호하려 한 대상이 누구였는지, 그 결정 과정을 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state within what you can know whom you tried to protect through your silence and the process of that decision.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身が沈黙で守ろうとした対象が誰だったのか、その決定過程をご自身が分かる範囲でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请在您能知道的范围内说明，您试图用沉默保护的对象是谁，以及该决定的过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 보호한 대상과 동시에 결정 자리를 가져간 대상을 본인 선에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer, within his own limits, who his silence protected and whose place to decide it simultaneously took away.",動機探索。本人の沈黙が守った対象と、同時に決定の場を奪った対象を、本人の範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人范围内回答其沉默保护了谁，同时又夺走了谁的决定位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v2].text,그 침묵이 동시에 누구에게서 결정의 자리를 가져갔는지 본인이 책임질 수 있는 범위에서 답하십시오.,Please answer within the range for which you can take responsibility from whom that silence also took away the place to decide.,その沈黙が同時に誰から決定の場を奪ったのか、ご自身が責任を負える範囲で答えてください。,请在您能够负责的范围内回答，这份沉默同时从谁那里夺走了决定的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 보호한 대상과 동시에 결정 자리를 가져간 대상을 본인 선에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer, within his own limits, who his silence protected and whose place to decide it simultaneously took away.",動機探索。本人の沈黙が守った対象と、同時に決定の場を奪った対象を、本人の範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人范围内回答其沉默保护了谁，同时又夺走了谁的决定位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v3].text,"본인이 침묵을 풀 수 있었던 자리가 있었다면, 그 자리를 본인이 다시 미룬 이유를 설명하십시오.","If there was a place where you could have broken the silence, please explain why you postponed that place again.",ご自身が沈黙を解くことができた場があったなら、その場をご自身が再び先延ばしにした理由を説明してください。,如果曾有能够打破沉默的场合，请说明您为什么又把那个场合推迟了。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 보호한 대상과 동시에 결정 자리를 가져간 대상을 본인 선에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer, within his own limits, who his silence protected and whose place to decide it simultaneously took away.",動機探索。本人の沈黙が守った対象と、同時に決定の場を奪った対象を、本人の範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人范围内回答其沉默保护了谁，同时又夺走了谁的决定位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v4].text,침묵의 명분과 본인 자신의 부담을 분리해 본인 선에서 인정할 수 있는 부분을 답하십시오.,Please answer the parts you can acknowledge within your own limits by separating the justification for the silence from your own burden.,沈黙の名分とご自身の負担を分けて、ご自身の範囲で認められる部分を答えてください。,请把沉默的名义和您自己的负担分开，回答您在自己范围内能承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 침묵이 보호한 대상과 동시에 결정 자리를 가져간 대상을 본인 선에서 답하게 한다.,"Motive probe. Have him answer, within his own limits, who his silence protected and whose place to decide it simultaneously took away.",動機探索。本人の沈黙が守った対象と、同時に決定の場を奪った対象を、本人の範囲で答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其在本人范围内回答其沉默保护了谁，同时又夺走了谁的决定位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-silence_reason-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 침묵이 형의 의심을 키운 인과를 본인이 어디까지 받아들일 수 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state how far you can accept the causal link by which that silence increased your brother's suspicion.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その沈黙がお兄様の疑いを大きくした因果を、ご自身がどこまで受け入れられるのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请说明，您能在多大程度上接受这份沉默加深哥哥怀疑的因果关系。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 민감한 사정과 비율 결정을 본인이 한 사람으로 동시에 다루기로 한 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to handle the sensitive circumstances and the ratio decision simultaneously as one person.,動機探索。敏感な事情と比率の決定を、本人が一人の人間として同時に扱うことにした決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答由本人一人同时处理敏感情况与比例决定这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 민감한 가족 사정이 유서 판단에 작용한 사실을 굳이 분리해 설명하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you not specifically explain separately the fact that sensitive family circumstances affected the will judgment?",ユン・ジョンフさん、敏感な家族事情が遺言書の判断に作用した事実を、あえて分けて説明しなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，敏感的家族情况曾作用于遗嘱判断这一事实，您为什么没有特意分开说明？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 민감한 사정과 비율 결정을 본인이 한 사람으로 동시에 다루기로 한 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to handle the sensitive circumstances and the ratio decision simultaneously as one person.,動機探索。敏感な事情と比率の決定を、本人が一人の人間として同時に扱うことにした決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答由本人一人同时处理敏感情况与比例决定这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v2].text,그 사정과 비율 결정을 본인 안에서 한 사람이 동시에 다루기로 한 결정의 동기를 답하십시오.,Please answer the motive behind your decision to handle those circumstances and the ratio decision simultaneously within yourself as one person.,その事情と比率の決定を、ご自身の中で一人の人間が同時に扱うことにした決定の動機を答えてください。,请回答，您决定由自己一个人在内心同时处理那种情况和比例决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 민감한 사정과 비율 결정을 본인이 한 사람으로 동시에 다루기로 한 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to handle the sensitive circumstances and the ratio decision simultaneously as one person.,動機探索。敏感な事情と比率の決定を、本人が一人の人間として同時に扱うことにした決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答由本人一人同时处理敏感情况与比例决定这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v3].text,"형이 그 연결을 알게 되었을 때를 미리 가늠한 부분이 있었다면, 그 가늠이 본인 결정에 어떻게 작용했는지 설명하십시오.","If you anticipated the time when your brother would learn of that connection, explain how that anticipation affected your decision.",お兄様がそのつながりを知ることになる時をあらかじめ見積もった部分があるなら、その見積もりがご自身の決定にどのように作用したのか説明してください。,如果您曾预估哥哥得知这种关联时的情形，请说明这种预估如何作用于您的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 민감한 사정과 비율 결정을 본인이 한 사람으로 동시에 다루기로 한 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to handle the sensitive circumstances and the ratio decision simultaneously as one person.,動機探索。敏感な事情と比率の決定を、本人が一人の人間として同時に扱うことにした決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答由本人一人同时处理敏感情况与比例决定这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v4].text,본인이 그 연결을 본인 선에서 정리해 둔 결정이 다른 가족의 알 권리와 어디서 부딪히는지 답하십시오.,Please answer where your decision to organize that connection on your own collides with another family member's right to know.,そのつながりをご自身の側で整理しておいた決定が、他の家族の知る権利とどこでぶつかるのか答えてください。,请回答，您自行整理这种关联的决定，在何处与其他家人的知情权发生冲突。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 민감한 사정과 비율 결정을 본인이 한 사람으로 동시에 다루기로 한 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to handle the sensitive circumstances and the ratio decision simultaneously as one person.,動機探索。敏感な事情と比率の決定を、本人が一人の人間として同時に扱うことにした決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答由本人一人同时处理敏感情况与比例决定这一决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-will_link-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 결정의 동기와 결정의 형식을 분리해 본인 책임으로 인정할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please separate the motive for the decision from the form of the decision, and first state the part you can acknowledge as your own responsibility.",ユン・ジョンフさん、決定の動機と決定の形式を分けて、ご自身の責任として認められる部分から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把决定的动机和决定的形式分开，先说明您能承认为自己责任的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장남 자리의 의무와 기대의 섞임을 인정하되, 의무와 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the mix of duty and expectation in the eldest-son role, while having him separate duty from expectation.",共感アプローチ。長男という立場の義務と期待が混ざっていることを認めつつ、義務と期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认长子位置中义务与期待的混合，同时引导其区分义务与期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 장남이라는 자리가 어머니에 대한 의무로 시작해서 어느 사이 권리처럼 자리 잡는 일은 본인이 의식하기 어려운 결로 일어났을 수 있습니다. 그 변화의 첫 자리를 본인은 어디라고 보십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the position of eldest son may have begun as a duty toward your mother and, at some point, settled in like a right in a way that was hard for you to notice. Where do you see the first point of that change?",ユン・テソンさん、長男という立場は、お母様への義務として始まり、いつの間にか権利のように定着することが、ご本人には意識しにくい感触で起きたのかもしれません。その変化の最初の場所を、あなたはどこだと見ていますか。,尹泰成先生，长子这个位置也许一开始是对母亲的义务，却在不知不觉间像权利一样落定，而且这种变化可能以本人难以察觉的脉络发生。您认为这种变化最早出现在什么地方？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장남 자리의 의무와 기대의 섞임을 인정하되, 의무와 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the mix of duty and expectation in the eldest-son role, while having him separate duty from expectation.",共感アプローチ。長男という立場の義務と期待が混ざっていることを認めつつ、義務と期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认长子位置中义务与期待的混合，同时引导其区分义务与期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v2].text,평생 곁을 지킨 시간이 어떤 보상으로 돌아오리라는 기대가 자연스럽게 자랐을 수 있습니다. 그 기대의 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,The years you spent staying by her side may naturally have grown into an expectation that some reward would come back to you. Please speak honestly about the shape of that expectation.,生涯そばを守ってきた時間が、何らかの報いとして返ってくるという期待へ自然に育ったのかもしれません。その期待の感触を率直に解きほぐしてください。,一生守在身边的时间，也许自然长成了会以某种回报回到自己身上的期待。请坦诚说明那份期待的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장남 자리의 의무와 기대의 섞임을 인정하되, 의무와 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the mix of duty and expectation in the eldest-son role, while having him separate duty from expectation.",共感アプローチ。長男という立場の義務と期待が混ざっていることを認めつつ、義務と期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认长子位置中义务与期待的混合，同时引导其区分义务与期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 기대 자체가 잘못이라는 자리는 아닙니다. 다만 그 기대가 어머니의 뜻을 듣는 일을 어떻게 가렸는지부터 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, this is not a place to say that expectation itself was wrong. But please begin by examining how that expectation obscured the work of hearing your mother's wishes.",ユン・テソンさん、その期待そのものが間違いだったと言う場ではありません。ただ、その期待がお母様の意思を聞くことをどのように覆い隠したのか、そこから先に確認してください。,尹泰成先生，这里不是要说那份期待本身是错的。只是请先指出，那份期待如何遮住了聆听母亲意愿这件事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장남 자리의 의무와 기대의 섞임을 인정하되, 의무와 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the mix of duty and expectation in the eldest-son role, while having him separate duty from expectation.",共感アプローチ。長男という立場の義務と期待が混ざっていることを認めつつ、義務と期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认长子位置中义务与期待的混合，同时引导其区分义务与期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v4].text,어머니께 더 깊이 묻지 못한 후회가 있다면 그 마음부터 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 본인이 짊어진 의무와 본인이 기대한 몫을 분리할 수 있습니다.,"If you regret not asking your mother more deeply, please start by speaking about that feeling. Only then can you separate the duty you carried from the share you expected.",お母様にもっと深く尋ねられなかった後悔があるなら、まずその気持ちからお話しください。そうしてこそ、ご自身が背負った義務と、ご自身が期待した取り分を分けることができます。,如果您后悔没有更深入地询问母亲，请先说出那份心情。只有这样，才能把您背负的义务和您期待的份额区分开来。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 장남 자리의 의무와 기대의 섞임을 인정하되, 의무와 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the mix of duty and expectation in the eldest-son role, while having him separate duty from expectation.",共感アプローチ。長男という立場の義務と期待が混ざっていることを認めつつ、義務と期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认长子位置中义务与期待的混合，同时引导其区分义务与期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-a_entitlement-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 장남으로서의 자리와 그 자리 위에 본인이 얹은 기대는 다른 차원의 문제입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, your position as eldest son and the expectations you placed on top of that position are issues on different levels. Please speak about the two separately.",ユン・テソンさん、長男としての立場と、その立場の上にご自身が乗せた期待は、別の次元の問題です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，作为长子的位置，与您叠加在那个位置上的期待，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생의 보호-통제 경계를 형 입장에서 본 만큼 정리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him organize the protection-control boundary he saw from the older brother's position.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟の保護と統制の境界を、兄の立場から見た範囲で整理させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从哥哥的立场整理他所看到的弟弟的保护与控制之间的边界。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생이 어머니를 보호한다는 명분으로 결정을 끌어간 모양을 가까이서 본 입장이라면, 어디부터가 보호이고 어디부터가 통제였는지 본인이 가장 먼저 느끼셨을 수 있습니다. 그 느낌의 첫 자리를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you watched up close as your brother drew decisions forward under the justification of protecting your mother, you may have been the first to feel where protection ended and control began. Please state the first point where you felt that.",ユン・テソンさん、弟さんがお母様を保護するという名分で決定を引っ張っていく形を近くで見た立場なら、どこまでが保護で、どこからが統制だったのか、あなたが最初に感じたのかもしれません。その感覚の最初の場所をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果您是近距离看着弟弟以保护母亲为名推动决定的人，也许最先感到哪里是保护、哪里开始变成控制的人就是您。请说明这种感受最早出现的地方。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생의 보호-통제 경계를 형 입장에서 본 만큼 정리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him organize the protection-control boundary he saw from the older brother's position.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟の保護と統制の境界を、兄の立場から見た範囲で整理させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从哥哥的立场整理他所看到的弟弟的保护与控制之间的边界。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v2].text,동생을 의심하면서도 동생의 무거움을 짐작하는 마음이 같이 있었을 수 있습니다. 그 두 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,"Even while you suspected your brother, you may also have sensed the weight he was carrying. Please speak honestly about those two strands.",弟さんを疑いながらも、弟さんの重さを察する気持ちも同時にあったのかもしれません。その二つの筋を率直に解きほぐしてください。,您在怀疑弟弟的同时，也许也有揣测他所承受重量的心情。请坦诚说明这两条脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생의 보호-통제 경계를 형 입장에서 본 만큼 정리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him organize the protection-control boundary he saw from the older brother's position.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟の保護と統制の境界を、兄の立場から見た範囲で整理させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从哥哥的立场整理他所看到的弟弟的保护与控制之间的边界。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생을 단순한 통제자로 단정하라는 자리는 아닙니다. 다만 본인이 본 동생의 결정 중 어디까지가 어머니를 위한 것이었는지 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, this is not a place to reduce your brother to a mere controller. But please identify how much of the decisions you saw from him were for your mother.",ユン・テソンさん、弟さんを単なる統制者だと断定する場ではありません。ただ、あなたが見た弟さんの決定のうち、どこまでがお母様のためだったのかを確認してください。,尹泰成先生，这里不是要把弟弟简单断定为控制者。只是请指出，在您看到的弟弟的决定中，哪些程度是为了母亲。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생의 보호-통제 경계를 형 입장에서 본 만큼 정리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him organize the protection-control boundary he saw from the older brother's position.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟の保護と統制の境界を、兄の立場から見た範囲で整理させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从哥哥的立场整理他所看到的弟弟的保护与控制之间的边界。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v4].text,본인이 형으로서 더 일찍 끼어들지 못한 후회가 있다면 그 마음부터 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 동생의 통제와 본인의 부재를 분리해 따질 수 있습니다.,"If you regret not stepping in sooner as the older brother, please begin with that feeling. Only then can we separate your brother's control from your absence.",兄としてもっと早く入り込めなかった後悔があるなら、まずその気持ちから解きほぐしてください。そうしてこそ、弟さんの統制とご自身の不在を分けて問うことができます。,如果您后悔自己作为哥哥没能更早介入，请先说出那份心情。只有这样，才能把弟弟的控制和您的缺席分开追问。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생의 보호-통제 경계를 형 입장에서 본 만큼 정리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him organize the protection-control boundary he saw from the older brother's position.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟の保護と統制の境界を、兄の立場から見た範囲で整理させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从哥哥的立场整理他所看到的弟弟的保护与控制之间的边界。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-b_protection_control-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생이 보호라는 단어를 썼다는 사실과 그 보호 안에서 어떤 결정이 이뤄졌는지는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 본 만큼만 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that your brother used the word protection and the decisions made within that protection are issues on different levels. Please separate them only as far as you personally saw.",ユン・テソンさん、弟さんが保護という言葉を使った事実と、その保護の中でどのような決定がなされたのかは、別の次元の問題です。ご自身が見た範囲だけを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，弟弟使用了“保护”这个词这一事实，与在那份保护之中做出了什么决定，是不同层面的问题。请只在您亲眼所见的范围内分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the older brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明哥哥位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 한쪽만 잘못했다는 결말이 가장 손쉬운 길이지만 그 길이 가장 어머니를 잃는 길이라는 점을 본인이 짐작하실 것입니다. 그래도 본인이 형으로서 진 잘못이 있다면 어디부터인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, ending with only one side at fault may be the easiest path, but you likely understand that it is also the path that loses your mother most completely. Even so, if there is fault you bear as the older brother, please state where it begins.",ユン・テソンさん、どちらか一方だけが悪かったという結末は最も簡単な道ですが、その道が最もお母様を失う道でもあることを、あなたは察しているはずです。それでも兄としてご自身が負った過ちがあるなら、どこからなのかお話しください。,尹泰成先生，把结局归为只有一方有错，是最容易的路，但您也应当明白，那也是最彻底失去母亲的路。即便如此，如果您作为哥哥有自己承担的过错，请说明它从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the older brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明哥哥位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v2].text,동생을 끝내 잃지 않으려는 마음과 본인이 진 책임을 가벼이 두지 않으려는 마음이 같이 있을 수 있습니다. 그 두 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,You may have both the wish not to lose your brother in the end and the wish not to treat your own responsibility lightly. Please speak honestly about those two strands.,弟さんを最後まで失いたくない気持ちと、ご自身が負った責任を軽く置きたくない気持ちが、同時にあるのかもしれません。その二つの筋を率直に解きほぐしてください。,您也许同时有着不愿最终失去弟弟的心情，以及不想轻看自己所负责任的心情。请坦诚说明这两条脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the older brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明哥哥位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 모든 책임을 한 번에 정리할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 본인 자리에서 했어야 했는데 하지 못한 일을 한 가지부터 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you do not need to settle every responsibility at once. But please begin with one thing you should have done in your position and did not.",ユン・テソンさん、すべての責任を一度に整理する必要はありません。ただ、ご自身の立場で本来すべきだったのにできなかったことを、一つから確認してください。,尹泰成先生，您不需要一次整理所有责任。只是请先指出一件您在自己的位置上本应去做、却没有做到的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the older brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明哥哥位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v4].text,어머니에게 더 깊이 묻지 못한 일과 동생을 더 일찍 마주하지 못한 일 중 본인 안에서 더 무거운 것은 어느 쪽인지 말씀해 주십시오. 무게의 결이 책임의 결을 만듭니다.,"Between not asking your mother more deeply and not facing your brother sooner, please state which weighs more heavily inside you. The texture of that weight shapes the texture of responsibility.",お母様にもっと深く尋ねられなかったことと、弟さんともっと早く向き合えなかったことのうち、ご自身の中でより重いのはどちらかお話しください。重みの感触が責任の感触を作ります。,没有更深入地询问母亲，以及没有更早面对弟弟，这两件事中哪一件在您心里更重，请说明。重量的脉络会形成责任的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the older brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明哥哥位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-dual_responsibility-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 진 책임의 결과 동생이 진 책임의 결은 모양이 다를 수 있습니다. 본인 자리에서 본 무게부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the result of the responsibility you bear and the texture of the responsibility your brother bears may have different shapes. Please begin with the weight as seen from your own position.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が負った責任の結果と、弟さんが負った責任の感触は、形が異なることがあります。ご自身の立場から見た重みからお話しください。,尹泰成先生，您所承担责任的结果，与弟弟所承担责任的脉络，形态可能不同。请先从您自己位置上看到的重量说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 후회를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the regret in the older brother's position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from his own expectations.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄の立場の後悔を認めつつ、母の意思と本人の期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认哥哥位置上的后悔，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니를 두고 형제가 갈라섰다는 결말 자체가 본인에게 가장 깊은 상실일 것입니다. 그 갈라짐의 첫 자리를 지금 본인은 어디라고 보고 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the very ending in which two brothers split apart over your mother may be the deepest loss for you. Please state where you now see the first point of that split.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様をめぐって兄弟が裂かれたという結末そのものが、あなたにとって最も深い喪失でしょう。その分かれ目の最初の場所を、今ご自身はどこだと見ているのかお話しください。,尹泰成先生，兄弟围绕母亲而分裂这一结局本身，也许就是您最深的失去。请说明现在您认为这道裂痕最早出现在什么地方。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 후회를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the regret in the older brother's position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from his own expectations.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄の立場の後悔を認めつつ、母の意思と本人の期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认哥哥位置上的后悔，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v2].text,동생을 의심한 본인의 마음과 동생을 끝내 잃고 싶지 않은 마음이 같이 있었을 수 있습니다. 그 두 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,You may have had both the heart that suspected your brother and the heart that did not want to lose him in the end. Please speak honestly about those two strands.,弟さんを疑ったご自身の心と、それでも弟さんを最後まで失いたくない心が、同時にあったのかもしれません。その二つの筋を率直に解きほぐしてください。,您也许同时有怀疑弟弟的心情，以及最终仍不想失去弟弟的心情。请坦诚说明这两条脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 후회를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the regret in the older brother's position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from his own expectations.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄の立場の後悔を認めつつ、母の意思と本人の期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认哥哥位置上的后悔，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 한쪽이 모든 잘못을 졌다고 단정할 자리는 아닙니다. 다만 본인이 형으로서 했어야 했는데 하지 못한 일이 있다면 어디부터인지 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, this is not a place to decide that one side bore all the fault. But if there was something you should have done as the older brother and did not, please identify where that begins.",ユン・テソンさん、片方がすべての過ちを負ったと断定する場ではありません。ただ、兄としてご自身がすべきだったのにできなかったことがあるなら、どこからなのか確認してください。,尹泰成先生，这里不是要断定所有错误都由一方承担。只是，如果有您作为哥哥本应去做却没有做到的事，请指出它从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 후회를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the regret in the older brother's position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from his own expectations.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄の立場の後悔を認めつつ、母の意思と本人の期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认哥哥位置上的后悔，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v4].text,"어머니의 뜻과 본인이 기대한 몫이 같은 자리에 놓여 있던 시간이 길었다면, 그 자리에 어떤 무게가 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오. 후회와 책임을 분리하는 데서 다음 이야기가 시작됩니다.","If Mother's Wishes and the share you expected stood in the same place for a long time, please state what weight was present there. The next part begins with separating regret from responsibility.",母の意思とご自身が期待した取り分が同じ場所に長く置かれていたのなら、その場所にどのような重みがあったのかお話しください。後悔と責任を分けるところから、次の話が始まります。,如果母亲的意愿和您期待的份额曾长久放在同一个位置，请说明那个位置上有什么重量。下一段叙述，要从区分后悔与责任开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 형 자리의 후회를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인 기대를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the regret in the older brother's position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from his own expectations.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。兄の立場の後悔を認めつつ、母の意思と本人の期待を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认哥哥位置上的后悔，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人的期待。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 형으로서 본인이 진 책임의 결과 동생이 진 책임의 결은 모양이 다를 수 있습니다. 본인 자리에서 본 무게부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the result of the responsibility you bear as the older brother and the texture of the responsibility your brother bears may have different shapes. Please begin with the weight as seen from your own position.",ユン・テソンさん、兄としてご自身が負った責任の結果と、弟さんが負った責任の感触は、形が異なることがあります。ご自身の立場から見た重みからお話しください。,尹泰成先生，您作为哥哥所承担责任的结果，与弟弟所承担责任的脉络，形态可能不同。请先从您自己位置上看到的重量说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻을 형이 들고 있는 부분을 인정하되, 들은 것과 채운 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the parts of Mother's Wishes that the older brother holds, while having him separate what he heard from what he filled in.",共感アプローチ。母の意思を兄が持っている部分を認めつつ、聞いたことと補ったことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认哥哥手中握有母亲意愿的一部分，同时引导其区分听到的内容与自行补入的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 실제 뜻이 두 아들의 해석 사이에서 사라져 갔다는 자리에 형으로서 가장 큰 상실이 있을 것입니다. 그 사라짐의 첫 자리를 본인은 어디라고 보고 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the greatest loss for you as the older brother may lie in the place where your mother's actual wishes disappeared between the two sons' interpretations. Where do you see the first point of that disappearance?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の実際の意思が二人の息子の解釈の間で消えていったという場所に、兄として最も大きな喪失があるのでしょう。その消失の最初の場所を、ご自身はどこだと見ていますか。,尹泰成先生，母亲真实的意愿在两个儿子的解释之间逐渐消失，作为哥哥，您最大的失去也许就在这里。您认为这种消失最早出现在什么地方？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻을 형이 들고 있는 부분을 인정하되, 들은 것과 채운 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the parts of Mother's Wishes that the older brother holds, while having him separate what he heard from what he filled in.",共感アプローチ。母の意思を兄が持っている部分を認めつつ、聞いたことと補ったことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认哥哥手中握有母亲意愿的一部分，同时引导其区分听到的内容与自行补入的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v2].text,"어머니의 작은 말씀을 본인이 다르게 들었을 수 있다는 가능성이 있다면, 그 가능성을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오. 단정으로 가는 자리는 아닙니다.","If there is a possibility that you heard your mother's small words differently, please speak honestly about that possibility. This is not a place to move toward certainty.",お母様の小さなお言葉を、ご自身が違う形で聞いた可能性があるなら、その可能性を率直に解きほぐしてください。断定へ向かう場ではありません。,如果存在一种可能：母亲细微的话语被您听成了不同的意思，请坦诚说明这种可能。这里不是走向断定的地方。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻을 형이 들고 있는 부분을 인정하되, 들은 것과 채운 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the parts of Mother's Wishes that the older brother holds, while having him separate what he heard from what he filled in.",共感アプローチ。母の意思を兄が持っている部分を認めつつ、聞いたことと補ったことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认哥哥手中握有母亲意愿的一部分，同时引导其区分听到的内容与自行补入的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생의 해석을 모두 부정할 자리는 아닙니다. 다만 어머니의 뜻 가운데 본인이 직접 들었다고 분명히 말할 수 있는 부분과 본인이 채워 넣은 부분을 나눠 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, this is not a place to deny all of your brother's interpretation. But please separate the parts of Mother's Wishes that you can clearly say you heard directly from the parts you filled in yourself.",ユン・テソンさん、弟さんの解釈をすべて否定する場ではありません。ただ、母の意思のうち、ご自身が直接聞いたとはっきり言える部分と、ご自身が補った部分を分けてください。,尹泰成先生，这里不是要否定弟弟的全部解释。只是请把母亲意愿中您能明确说是亲耳听到的部分，和您自行补入的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻을 형이 들고 있는 부분을 인정하되, 들은 것과 채운 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the parts of Mother's Wishes that the older brother holds, while having him separate what he heard from what he filled in.",共感アプローチ。母の意思を兄が持っている部分を認めつつ、聞いたことと補ったことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认哥哥手中握有母亲意愿的一部分，同时引导其区分听到的内容与自行补入的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v4].text,어머니께 더 분명히 묻지 못한 시간이 있다면 그 마음부터 풀어 주십시오. 그래야 본인이 어머니의 뜻으로 들고 있는 것이 어디까지인지 정리됩니다.,"If there was a time when you could not ask your mother more clearly, please begin with that feeling. Only then can we organize how far what you hold as Mother's Wishes truly goes.",お母様にもっとはっきり尋ねられなかった時間があるなら、まずその気持ちから解きほぐしてください。そうしてこそ、ご自身が母の意思として持っているものがどこまでなのか整理されます。,如果曾有一段时间您没能更明确地询问母亲，请先说出那份心情。只有这样，才能整理出您作为母亲意愿所持有的内容究竟到哪里为止。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻을 형이 들고 있는 부분을 인정하되, 들은 것과 채운 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the parts of Mother's Wishes that the older brother holds, while having him separate what he heard from what he filled in.",共感アプローチ。母の意思を兄が持っている部分を認めつつ、聞いたことと補ったことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认哥哥手中握有母亲意愿的一部分，同时引导其区分听到的内容与自行补入的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-mother_voice-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 뜻이 있었다는 사실과 본인이 그 뜻을 본인 안에서 어떻게 정리했는지는 다른 차원입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the fact that Mother's Wishes existed and the way you organized those wishes within yourself are issues on different levels. Please speak about the two separately.",ユン・テソンさん、母の意思があったという事実と、その意思をご自身の中でどのように整理したのかは、別の次元の問題です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，母亲的意愿曾经存在这一事实，与您在自己心里如何整理那份意愿，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형 entitlement에 대한 본인의 반응을 묻되, 한쪽 악역 단정 없이 본인의 응답을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Ask about his response to the older brother's entitlement, while having him separate his own response without casting one side as the sole villain.",共感アプローチ。兄の権利意識に対する本人の反応を問いつつ、一方を悪役と断定せず本人の応答を分けさせる。,共情切入。询问其对哥哥权利意识的反应，同时不把某一方断定为恶人，引导其区分本人的回应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 자리가 어떻게 의무와 권리 사이에서 흔들렸는지를 본인이 가까이서 본 입장이라는 점을 짐작합니다. 그 흔들림을 본인은 언제부터 의식하셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, I understand that you were in a position to see up close how your brother's place wavered between duty and right. Please state when you first became aware of that wavering.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の立場が義務と権利の間でどのように揺れていたのかを、近くで見ていた立場だったのだと察します。その揺れを、いつから意識していたのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，我理解您是近距离看到哥哥的位置如何在义务与权利之间摇摆的人。请说明您从什么时候开始意识到这种摇摆。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형 entitlement에 대한 본인의 반응을 묻되, 한쪽 악역 단정 없이 본인의 응답을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Ask about his response to the older brother's entitlement, while having him separate his own response without casting one side as the sole villain.",共感アプローチ。兄の権利意識に対する本人の反応を問いつつ、一方を悪役と断定せず本人の応答を分けさせる。,共情切入。询问其对哥哥权利意识的反应，同时不把某一方断定为恶人，引导其区分本人的回应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v2].text,형의 기대가 본인 안에 어떤 답답함이나 분노로 자랐을 수 있습니다. 그 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오. 형의 자리 자체를 잘못으로 단정하라는 것은 아닙니다.,Your brother's expectations may have grown inside you as frustration or anger. Please speak honestly about that texture. This is not to declare your brother's position itself wrong.,お兄様の期待が、ご自身の中で息苦しさや怒りとして育ったのかもしれません。その感触を率直に解きほぐしてください。兄の立場そのものを誤りだと断定するわけではありません。,哥哥的期待也许在您心里长成了憋闷或愤怒。请坦诚说明这种脉络。这并不是要把哥哥的位置本身断定为错误。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형 entitlement에 대한 본인의 반응을 묻되, 한쪽 악역 단정 없이 본인의 응답을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Ask about his response to the older brother's entitlement, while having him separate his own response without casting one side as the sole villain.",共感アプローチ。兄の権利意識に対する本人の反応を問いつつ、一方を悪役と断定せず本人の応答を分けさせる。,共情切入。询问其对哥哥权利意识的反应，同时不把某一方断定为恶人，引导其区分本人的回应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 기대가 어머니 뜻과 어떻게 부딪쳤는지를 본인이 본 만큼 말씀해 주십시오. 그 부딪침에 본인이 어떻게 반응했는지가 다음 자리입니다.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state, as far as you saw, how your brother's expectations collided with Mother's Wishes. How you responded to that collision is the next place to examine.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の期待が母の意思とどのようにぶつかったのか、ご自身が見た範囲でお話しください。そのぶつかりにご自身がどう反応したのかが、次の場です。,尹正厚先生，请在您看到的范围内说明，哥哥的期待如何与母亲的意愿发生碰撞。您如何回应这种碰撞，是下一步要看的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형 entitlement에 대한 본인의 반응을 묻되, 한쪽 악역 단정 없이 본인의 응답을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Ask about his response to the older brother's entitlement, while having him separate his own response without casting one side as the sole villain.",共感アプローチ。兄の権利意識に対する本人の反応を問いつつ、一方を悪役と断定せず本人の応答を分けさせる。,共情切入。询问其对哥哥权利意识的反应，同时不把某一方断定为恶人，引导其区分本人的回应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v4].text,형의 기대가 본인의 결정에 어떤 무게로 작용했는지 말씀해 주십시오. 그것이 보호인지 거리 두기인지에 따라 본인이 한 일의 결이 달라집니다.,"Please state what kind of weight your brother's expectations placed on your decision. Depending on whether that was protection or distancing, the texture of what you did changes.",お兄様の期待がご自身の決定にどのような重みとして作用したのか、お話しください。それが保護なのか距離を置くことなのかによって、ご自身がしたことの感触は変わります。,请说明哥哥的期待以怎样的重量作用于您的决定。那是保护还是保持距离，会改变您所做之事的性质。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 형 entitlement에 대한 본인의 반응을 묻되, 한쪽 악역 단정 없이 본인의 응답을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Ask about his response to the older brother's entitlement, while having him separate his own response without casting one side as the sole villain.",共感アプローチ。兄の権利意識に対する本人の反応を問いつつ、一方を悪役と断定せず本人の応答を分けさせる。,共情切入。询问其对哥哥权利意识的反应，同时不把某一方断定为恶人，引导其区分本人的回应。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-a_entitlement-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 기대가 있었다는 사실과 그 기대를 본인이 어떻게 받아들이고 어떻게 응답했는지는 다른 차원입니다. 본인이 한 일부터 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that your brother had expectations and the way you accepted and answered those expectations are issues on different levels. Please separate them, beginning with what you did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の期待があったという事実と、その期待をご自身がどう受け止め、どう応答したのかは、別の次元の問題です。ご自身がしたことから分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，哥哥有期待这一事实，与您如何接受并回应那份期待，是不同层面的问题。请先从您所做的事情开始分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호 명분 출발을 인정하되, 보호와 결정 주체화를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the start in a justification of protection, while having him separate protection from taking over as the decision-maker.",共感アプローチ。保護という名分から出発したことを認めつつ、保護と決定主体化を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认其出发点是保护这一名义，同时引导其区分保护与把自己变成决定主体。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호한다는 마음으로 시작한 일이 결정의 손을 잡는 자리로 옮겨갔다면, 그 이동을 본인이 가장 가까이서 보셨을 것입니다. 그 자리에서 무엇이 결정을 본인 손에 쥐게 했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if something that began as a wish to protect moved into a place where you held the hand of decision, you would have seen that movement most closely. Please state what, in that place, put the decision in your hands.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護したいという気持ちで始まったことが決定の手を握る場へ移っていったのなら、その移動を最も近くで見ていたのはご自身でしょう。その場で何が決定をご自身の手に握らせたのか、お話しください。,尹正厚先生，如果一件以保护之心开始的事，后来移动到由您握住决定之手的位置，那么最接近地看到这种移动的人应当就是您。请说明在那个位置上，是什么让决定落到您手里。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호 명분 출발을 인정하되, 보호와 결정 주체화를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the start in a justification of protection, while having him separate protection from taking over as the decision-maker.",共感アプローチ。保護という名分から出発したことを認めつつ、保護と決定主体化を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认其出发点是保护这一名义，同时引导其区分保护与把自己变成决定主体。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v2].text,어머니를 흔들리지 않게 하고 싶은 마음이 결국 어머니의 뜻을 본인이 대신 정리하는 자리로 가게 했을 수 있습니다. 그 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,The wish to keep your mother from being shaken may ultimately have led to the place where you organized Mother's Wishes on her behalf. Please speak honestly about that texture.,お母様を揺らがせたくない気持ちが、結局は母の意思をご自身が代わりに整理する場へ向かわせたのかもしれません。その感触を率直に解きほぐしてください。,想让母亲不要动摇的心情，也许最终把您带到了替母亲整理其意愿的位置。请坦诚说明这种脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호 명분 출발을 인정하되, 보호와 결정 주체화를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the start in a justification of protection, while having him separate protection from taking over as the decision-maker.",共感アプローチ。保護という名分から出発したことを認めつつ、保護と決定主体化を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认其出发点是保护这一名义，同时引导其区分保护与把自己变成决定主体。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 모든 결정의 동기를 한 번에 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 보호로 시작했다고 기억하는 자리와, 본인이 결정의 주체가 됐다고 인정하는 자리를 나눠 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to explain every motive for every decision at once. But please separate the place you remember as beginning in protection from the place where you acknowledge becoming the decision-maker.",ユン・ジョンフさん、すべての決定の動機を一度に解く必要はありません。ただ、ご自身が保護として始めたと記憶している場所と、ご自身が決定の主体になったと認める場所を分けてください。,尹正厚先生，您不需要一次解释所有决定的动机。只是请把您记得是以保护开始的位置，和您承认自己成为决定主体的位置分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호 명분 출발을 인정하되, 보호와 결정 주체화를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the start in a justification of protection, while having him separate protection from taking over as the decision-maker.",共感アプローチ。保護という名分から出発したことを認めつつ、保護と決定主体化を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认其出发点是保护这一名义，同时引导其区分保护与把自己变成决定主体。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v4].text,"어머니의 뜻을 본인이 가장 잘 안다고 믿게 된 시점이 있다면, 그 시점의 결을 말씀해 주십시오. 그 믿음이 어디서 생겼는지에 따라 책임의 결이 달라집니다.","If there was a point when you came to believe that you knew Mother's Wishes best, please state the texture of that point. Where that belief arose changes the texture of responsibility.",母の意思をご自身が最もよく知っていると信じるようになった時点があるなら、その時点の感触をお話しください。その信頼がどこで生じたのかによって、責任の感触が変わります。,如果曾有某个时间点，您开始相信自己最了解母亲的意愿，请说明那个时间点的脉络。那份相信从何处产生，会改变责任的性质。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 보호 명분 출발을 인정하되, 보호와 결정 주체화를 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge the start in a justification of protection, while having him separate protection from taking over as the decision-maker.",共感アプローチ。保護という名分から出発したことを認めつつ、保護と決定主体化を分けさせる。,共情切入。承认其出发点是保护这一名义，同时引导其区分保护与把自己变成决定主体。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-b_protection_control-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호하려 한 일과 결정을 끌어간 일은 같은 단어로 묶을 수 없습니다. 두 가지를 나누어, 본인이 한 일부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the effort to protect and the act of drawing decisions forward cannot be bound together under the same word. Please separate the two and begin with what you did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護しようとしたことと、決定を引っ張っていったことは、同じ言葉でくくることはできません。二つを分けて、ご自身がしたことからお話しください。,尹正厚先生，试图保护这件事，和推动决定这件事，不能用同一个词捆在一起。请把两者分开，先从您所做的事说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the younger brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明弟弟位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형이 모든 잘못을 졌다는 결말이나 본인이 모든 잘못을 졌다는 결말 중 어느 쪽도 어머니에게 답이 되지 않는다는 점을 본인이 짐작하실 것입니다. 그래도 본인이 동생으로서 진 잘못이 있다면 어디부터인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you likely understand that neither an ending where your brother bore all the fault nor an ending where you bore all the fault would be an answer for your mother. Even so, if there is fault you bear as the younger brother, please state where it begins.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様がすべての過ちを負ったという結末も、ご自身がすべての過ちを負ったという結末も、お母様への答えにはならないことを、ご本人は察しているはずです。それでも弟としてご自身が負った過ちがあるなら、どこからなのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，哥哥承担全部错误的结局，或您承担全部错误的结局，哪一边都无法成为给母亲的答案，这一点您应当明白。即便如此，如果您作为弟弟有自己承担的过错，请说明它从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the younger brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明弟弟位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v2].text,형을 지키려 한 마음과 본인이 진 책임을 본인 자리에 두려는 마음이 같이 있을 수 있습니다. 그 두 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,You may have both the wish to protect your brother and the wish to place the responsibility you bear in your own seat. Please speak honestly about those two strands.,お兄様を守ろうとした気持ちと、ご自身が負った責任を自分の席に置こうとする気持ちが、同時にあるのかもしれません。その二つの筋を率直に解きほぐしてください。,您也许同时有保护哥哥的心情，以及把自己承担的责任放回自己位置上的心情。请坦诚说明这两条脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the younger brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明弟弟位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 모든 책임을 한 번에 정리할 필요는 없습니다. 다만 본인이 본인 자리에서 하지 않았어야 했는데 한 일을 한 가지부터 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you do not need to settle every responsibility at once. But please begin with one thing you should not have done in your own position and did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、すべての責任を一度に整理する必要はありません。ただ、ご自身の立場で本来すべきではなかったのにしたことを、一つから確認してください。,尹正厚先生，您不需要一次整理所有责任。只是请先指出一件您在自己的位置上本不该做却做了的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the younger brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明弟弟位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v4].text,본인이 한 보호의 모양 중 시간이 지난 지금 다시 본다면 다르게 했을 자리가 있다면 그 자리부터 말씀해 주십시오. 그 자리에서 본인의 책임이 정리됩니다.,"If, looking back now, there is a place in the shape of protection you created where you would have acted differently, please begin there. Your responsibility can be organized from that place.",ご自身が行った保護の形のうち、時間が過ぎた今もう一度見れば違う形にしただろう場所があるなら、そこからお話しください。その場所でご自身の責任が整理されます。,在您所做出的保护形式中，如果以现在的眼光回看，有某个位置您会选择不同做法，请先从那里说起。您的责任会在那个位置得到整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 동생 자리의 책임을 본인 입장에서 분리해 말하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Have him separate the responsibility of the younger brother's position from his own perspective.,共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。弟という立場の責任を本人の立場から分けて話させる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。引导其从本人立场分开说明弟弟位置上的责任。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-dual_responsibility-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 진 책임의 결과 형이 진 책임의 결은 모양이 다를 수 있습니다. 본인 자리에서 본 무게부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the result of the responsibility you bear and the texture of the responsibility your brother bears may have different shapes. Please begin with the weight as seen from your own position.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身が負った責任の結果と、お兄様が負った責任の感触は、形が異なることがあります。ご自身の立場から見た重みからお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您所承担责任的结果，与哥哥所承担责任的脉络，形态可能不同。请先从您自己位置上看到的重量说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 보호 자리의 무게를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인이 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the weight of the protective position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from the decisions he added.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。保護する立場の重みを認めつつ、母の意思と本人が加えた決定を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认保护位置的重量，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人添加的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 곁에 가까이 있었다는 사실이 본인을 모든 책임의 한복판으로 모는 자리가 되어 가는 것이 답답하실 수 있습니다. 그 자리를 본인은 지금 어떻게 보고 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you were close by your mother's side may now be becoming a place that drives you into the center of every responsibility, and that may feel stifling. Please state how you see that place now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様のそばに近くいたという事実が、ご自身をすべての責任の真ん中へ追い込む場所になっていくことに、息苦しさがあるのかもしれません。その場所を、今ご自身はどのように見ているのかお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您曾近在母亲身边这一事实，如今也许正变成把您推到所有责任中心的位置，您可能会因此感到憋闷。请说明现在您如何看待这个位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 보호 자리의 무게를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인이 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the weight of the protective position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from the decisions he added.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。保護する立場の重みを認めつつ、母の意思と本人が加えた決定を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认保护位置的重量，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人添加的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v2].text,보호하려 한 마음과 본인이 결정의 손을 잡았다는 사실이 같이 묶여 있을 수 있습니다. 그 두 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.,The wish to protect and the fact that you took hold of the hand of decision may be bound together. Please speak honestly about those two strands.,保護しようとした気持ちと、ご自身が決定の手を握ったという事実が、一緒に結ばれているのかもしれません。その二つの筋を率直に解きほぐしてください。,试图保护的心情，与您握住决定之手这一事实，也许被绑在了一起。请坦诚说明这两条脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 보호 자리의 무게를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인이 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the weight of the protective position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from the decisions he added.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。保護する立場の重みを認めつつ、母の意思と本人が加えた決定を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认保护位置的重量，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人添加的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 한쪽만 잘못했다는 그림으로 가지 않을 것입니다. 다만 본인이 동생으로서 하지 않았어야 했는데 한 일이 있다면 어디부터인지 짚어 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, we will not move toward a picture where only one side is at fault. But if there was something you should not have done as the younger brother and did, please identify where that begins.",ユン・ジョンフさん、片方だけが悪かったという絵には進みません。ただ、弟としてご自身がすべきではなかったのにしたことがあるなら、どこからなのか確認してください。,尹正厚先生，我们不会走向只有一方有错的图景。只是，如果有您作为弟弟本不该做却做了的事，请指出它从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 보호 자리의 무게를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인이 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the weight of the protective position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from the decisions he added.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。保護する立場の重みを認めつつ、母の意思と本人が加えた決定を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认保护位置的重量，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人添加的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v4].text,어머니의 뜻을 본인이 정리했다는 자리와 본인 자신을 위한 어떤 마음이 그 자리에 섞이지 않았는지 말씀해 주십시오. 그 분리 위에서 책임의 결이 정해집니다.,"Please state whether, in the place where you organized Mother's Wishes, there was any feeling for yourself mixed into that place. Responsibility will be set on that separation.",母の意思をご自身が整理したという場所に、ご自身のための何らかの気持ちが混ざっていなかったのか、お話しください。その分離の上で責任の感触が定まります。,请说明，在您整理母亲意愿的位置上，是否掺入了某种为您自己的心情。责任的性质会建立在这种区分之上。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 한쪽 악역 단정 금지. 보호 자리의 무게를 인정하되, 어머니 뜻과 본인이 더한 결정을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Do not cast one side as the sole villain. Acknowledge the weight of the protective position, while having him separate Mother's Wishes from the decisions he added.",共感アプローチ。一方を悪役と断定しない。保護する立場の重みを認めつつ、母の意思と本人が加えた決定を分けさせる。,共情切入。不要断定某一方为恶人。承认保护位置的重量，同时引导其区分母亲的意愿与本人添加的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 어머니를 위했다는 마음과 본인이 어머니 뜻을 고친 행위는 다른 차원의 문제입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your feeling that you did it for your mother and your act of changing Mother's Wishes are issues on different levels. Please speak about the two separately.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身がお母様のためだったと思う気持ちと、ご自身が母の意思を変えた行為は、別の次元の問題です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，您认为自己是为了母亲的心情，与您改变母亲意愿的行为，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻 정리에 본인 판단이 섞일 수 있음을 인정하되, 들은 것과 정돈한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge that his own judgment may have mixed into how he organized Mother's Wishes, while having him separate what he heard from what he arranged.",共感アプローチ。母の意思の整理に本人の判断が混ざった可能性を認めつつ、聞いたことと整えたことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认在整理母亲意愿时可能混入了本人的判断，同时引导其区分听到的内容与整理后的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 뜻을 가까이서 정리한 자리에 있었다면, 어디에서부터 어머니의 말씀이고 어디에서부터 본인의 정리였는지를 본인이 가장 잘 가릴 수 있는 자리에 계실 것입니다. 그 경계를 지금 말할 수 있는 만큼 들려주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you were in the place of organizing Mother's Wishes up close, you are likely in the best position to distinguish where her words ended and where your arrangement began. Please tell us that boundary as far as you can now state it.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の意思を近くで整理する場にいたのなら、どこまでがお母様の言葉で、どこからがご自身の整理だったのかを、ご自身が最もよく見分けられる場所にいるはずです。その境界を、今話せる範囲で聞かせてください。,尹正厚先生，如果您曾在近处整理母亲的意愿，那么最能分辨哪里是母亲的话、哪里开始是您自己的整理的人，应当就是您。请在现在能说的范围内告诉我们这条边界。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v2].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻 정리에 본인 판단이 섞일 수 있음을 인정하되, 들은 것과 정돈한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge that his own judgment may have mixed into how he organized Mother's Wishes, while having him separate what he heard from what he arranged.",共感アプローチ。母の意思の整理に本人の判断が混ざった可能性を認めつつ、聞いたことと整えたことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认在整理母亲意愿时可能混入了本人的判断，同时引导其区分听到的内容与整理后的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v2].text,"어머니의 흔들리는 말씀을 본인이 대신 정돈한 시기가 있었다면, 그 정돈의 결을 솔직히 풀어 주십시오.","If there was a time when you arranged your mother's wavering words on her behalf, please speak honestly about the texture of that arrangement.",お母様の揺れる言葉を、ご自身が代わりに整えた時期があるなら、その整え方の感触を率直に解きほぐしてください。,如果曾有一段时间，是您代替母亲整理她摇摆的话语，请坦诚说明那种整理的脉络。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻 정리에 본인 판단이 섞일 수 있음을 인정하되, 들은 것과 정돈한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge that his own judgment may have mixed into how he organized Mother's Wishes, while having him separate what he heard from what he arranged.",共感アプローチ。母の意思の整理に本人の判断が混ざった可能性を認めつつ、聞いたことと整えたことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认在整理母亲意愿时可能混入了本人的判断，同时引导其区分听到的内容与整理后的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 뜻을 모두 본인이 알고 있다고 단정할 자리는 아닙니다. 다만 어머니에게 본인이 직접 물은 자리와 본인이 짐작으로 채운 자리를 나눠 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, this is not a place to decide that you know all of Mother's Wishes. But please separate the places where you asked your mother directly from the places you filled in by assumption.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思をすべてご自身が知っていると断定する場ではありません。ただ、お母様にご自身が直接尋ねた場所と、ご自身が推測で補った場所を分けてください。,尹正厚先生，这里不是要断定您了解母亲的全部意愿。只是请把您直接询问母亲的位置，和您以推测补入的位置分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻 정리에 본인 판단이 섞일 수 있음을 인정하되, 들은 것과 정돈한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge that his own judgment may have mixed into how he organized Mother's Wishes, while having him separate what he heard from what he arranged.",共感アプローチ。母の意思の整理に本人の判断が混ざった可能性を認めつつ、聞いたことと整えたことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认在整理母亲意愿时可能混入了本人的判断，同时引导其区分听到的内容与整理后的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v4].text,어머니의 뜻으로 자리 잡은 결정 가운데 본인의 판단이 더 컸던 부분이 있다면 그 자리부터 말씀해 주십시오. 그 분리 위에서 책임의 결이 정해집니다.,"If there was a part of the decision that took root as Mother's Wishes where your own judgment was larger, please begin there. Responsibility will be set on that separation.",母の意思として定着した決定の中に、ご自身の判断の方が大きかった部分があるなら、そこからお話しください。その分離の上で責任の感触が定まります。,如果在已经作为母亲意愿落定的决定中，有某个部分您的判断占得更大，请先从那里说起。责任的性质会建立在这种区分之上。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 어머니 뜻 정리에 본인 판단이 섞일 수 있음을 인정하되, 들은 것과 정돈한 것을 분리하게 한다.","Empathy approach. Acknowledge that his own judgment may have mixed into how he organized Mother's Wishes, while having him separate what he heard from what he arranged.",共感アプローチ。母の意思の整理に本人の判断が混ざった可能性を認めつつ、聞いたことと整えたことを分けさせる。,共情切入。承认在整理母亲意愿时可能混入了本人的判断，同时引导其区分听到的内容与整理后的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-mother_voice-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 뜻이 있었다는 사실과 그 뜻을 본인이 어떻게 정리했는지는 다른 차원입니다. 두 가지를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that Mother's Wishes existed and the way you organized those wishes are issues on different levels. Please speak about the two separately.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思があったという事実と、その意思をご自身がどのように整理したのかは、別の次元の問題です。二つを分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，母亲的意愿曾经存在这一事实，与您如何整理那份意愿，是不同层面的问题。请把两者分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 장남 자리에서 윤태성이 보태 둔 몫과 어머니가 인정한 몫을 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate the share Yoon Tae-seong added from the eldest-son position from the share his mother acknowledged.,事実追及。長男の立場でユン・テソンが上乗せしておいた取り分と、母が認めた取り分を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹泰成基于长子位置自行添加的份额，与母亲认可的份额。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 장남으로서 당연하다고 받아들인 몫에 대해 어떤 행동이 거기에서 비롯됐는지 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state in chronological order what actions arose from the share you accepted as natural because you were the eldest son.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が長男として当然だと受け止めた取り分について、どのような行動がそこから生じたのか、時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请按时间顺序说明，对于您作为长子认为理所当然的份额，有哪些行为是由此产生的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 장남 자리에서 윤태성이 보태 둔 몫과 어머니가 인정한 몫을 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate the share Yoon Tae-seong added from the eldest-son position from the share his mother acknowledged.,事実追及。長男の立場でユン・テソンが上乗せしておいた取り分と、母が認めた取り分を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹泰成基于长子位置自行添加的份额，与母亲认可的份额。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v2].text,어머니께서 직접 인정해 주신 몫과 본인이 장남이라는 자리에서 보태어 둔 몫을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the share your mother directly acknowledged from the share you added on from your position as eldest son.,お母様が直接認めてくださった取り分と、ご自身が長男という立場から上乗せしておいた取り分を分けて答えてください。,请把母亲直接认可的份额，与您基于长子位置自行添加的份额分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 장남 자리에서 윤태성이 보태 둔 몫과 어머니가 인정한 몫을 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate the share Yoon Tae-seong added from the eldest-son position from the share his mother acknowledged.,事実追及。長男の立場でユン・テソンが上乗せしておいた取り分と、母が認めた取り分を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹泰成基于长子位置自行添加的份额，与母亲认可的份额。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v3].text,"동생의 진술 가운데 본인의 당연시가 결정에 영향을 주었다고 보는 부분이 있다면, 같은 자리에서 본인이 한 행동을 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","If there is a part of your brother's statement that says your sense of entitlement affected the decision, please identify the action you took in that same place as a matter of fact.",弟さんの陳述の中に、ご自身の当然視が決定に影響したと見る部分があるなら、同じ場所でご自身がした行動を事実関係として確認してください。,如果弟弟的陈述中有认为您的理所当然感影响了决定的部分，请按事实关系指出您在同一位置所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 장남 자리에서 윤태성이 보태 둔 몫과 어머니가 인정한 몫을 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate the share Yoon Tae-seong added from the eldest-son position from the share his mother acknowledged.,事実追及。長男の立場でユン・テソンが上乗せしておいた取り分と、母が認めた取り分を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹泰成基于长子位置自行添加的份额，与母亲认可的份额。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v4].text,"돌봄을 맡은 자리와 상속을 기대한 자리가 본인 안에서 언제부터 겹쳤는지, 본인이 기억하는 그대로 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize, exactly as you remember it, when the place where you took on care and the place where you expected inheritance began to overlap within you.",介護を引き受けた場所と相続を期待した場所が、ご自身の中でいつから重なったのか、記憶している通りに整理してください。,请按照您的记忆整理，承担照护的位置与期待继承的位置，是从什么时候开始在您心里重叠的。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 장남 자리에서 윤태성이 보태 둔 몫과 어머니가 인정한 몫을 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate the share Yoon Tae-seong added from the eldest-son position from the share his mother acknowledged.,事実追及。長男の立場でユン・テソンが上乗せしておいた取り分と、母が認めた取り分を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹泰成基于长子位置自行添加的份额，与母亲认可的份额。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-a_entitlement-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 당연하다는 본인의 평가는 잠시 미뤄 두고, 그 마음에서 본인이 한 행동부터 사실 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside for a moment your own evaluation that it was natural, and first answer as fact what actions you took from that feeling.",ユン・テソンさん、当然だというご自身の評価はしばらく脇に置き、その気持ちからご自身がした行動を、まず事実のまま答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请先把您认为理所当然的评价暂时放下，直接按事实回答您出于那种心情所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분의 작동 절차에 대한 윤태성의 직접 목격을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact what he directly witnessed about how the justification of protection operated.,事実追及。保護という名分の作動手続について、ユン・テソンが直接目撃したことを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按事实回答，他对保护名义运作程序的直接目击。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생이 보호라는 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 정리한 자리들이 있다면, 본인이 직접 본 자리부터 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there were places where your brother organized Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection, please state first the places you directly saw, in chronological order.",ユン・テソンさん、弟さんが保護という名分で母の意思を整理した場所があるなら、ご自身が直接見た場所から時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果弟弟曾以保护为名整理母亲的意愿，请先按时间顺序说明您亲眼看到的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분의 작동 절차에 대한 윤태성의 직접 목격을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact what he directly witnessed about how the justification of protection operated.,事実追及。保護という名分の作動手続について、ユン・テソンが直接目撃したことを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按事实回答，他对保护名义运作程序的直接目击。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v2].text,본인이 직접 목격한 절차와 가족에게서 옮겨 들은 절차를 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the procedures you directly witnessed from the procedures you heard about from family.,ご自身が直接目撃した手続と、家族から伝え聞いた手続を分けて答えてください。,请把您亲眼目击的程序，与从家人那里转听来的程序分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분의 작동 절차에 대한 윤태성의 직접 목격을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact what he directly witnessed about how the justification of protection operated.,事実追及。保護という名分の作動手続について、ユン・テソンが直接目撃したことを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按事实回答，他对保护名义运作程序的直接目击。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v3].text,"동생의 보호 명분과 어머니께서 본인에게 직접 표시하신 의사 사이에 차이가 있다면, 그 차이를 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","If there is a difference between your brother's justification of protection and the wishes your mother directly expressed to you, please identify that difference as a matter of fact.",弟さんの保護という名分と、お母様がご自身に直接示した意思との間に違いがあるなら、その違いを事実関係として確認してください。,如果弟弟的保护名义与母亲直接向您表示的意愿之间存在差异，请按事实关系指出这种差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분의 작동 절차에 대한 윤태성의 직접 목격을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact what he directly witnessed about how the justification of protection operated.,事実追及。保護という名分の作動手続について、ユン・テソンが直接目撃したことを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按事实回答，他对保护名义运作程序的直接目击。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v4].text,"보호라는 이름으로 어머니 곁의 자리에서 무엇이 바뀌었는지, 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize, within what you know, what changed around your mother's place under the name of protection.",保護という名のもとで、お母様のそばの場所で何が変わったのか、ご自身が知っている範囲で整理してください。,请在您知道的范围内整理，在保护之名下，母亲身边的位置发生了什么变化。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분의 작동 절차에 대한 윤태성의 직접 목격을 사실로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Tae-seong answer as fact what he directly witnessed about how the justification of protection operated.,事実追及。保護という名分の作動手続について、ユン・テソンが直接目撃したことを事実として答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹泰成按事实回答，他对保护名义运作程序的直接目击。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-b_protection_control-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 보호의 의도에 대한 본인의 평가는 잠시 미뤄 두고, 본인이 본 절차부터 사실 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside for a moment your evaluation of the intent to protect, and answer the procedures you saw exactly as facts.",ユン・テソンさん、保護の意図に対するご自身の評価はしばらく脇に置き、ご自身が見た手続から事実のまま答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请先把您对保护意图的评价暂时放下，直接按事实回答您所看到的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤태성 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Tae-seong answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・テソン本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹泰成只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 한 행동과 동생이 한 행동을 한 묶음으로 보지 말고, 본인이 한 행동만 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, do not view what you did and what your brother did as one bundle. Please state only the actions you took, in chronological order.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身がした行動と弟さんがした行動を一括りに見ず、ご自身がした行動だけを時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请不要把您所做的行为和弟弟所做的行为看成一组，只按时间顺序说明您所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤태성 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Tae-seong answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・テソン本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹泰成只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v2].text,본인이 직접 한 행동과 동생이 한 행동을 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 분리해 답해 주십시오.,"Please separate the actions you directly took from the actions your brother took, within what you know.",ご自身が直接した行動と弟さんがした行動を、ご自身が知っている範囲で分けて答えてください。,请在您知道的范围内，把您亲自做的行为与弟弟做的行为分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤태성 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Tae-seong answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・テソン本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹泰成只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v3].text,"두 사람의 행동이 같은 결과로 모였다고 보더라도, 어느 시점의 어느 행동이 본인 몫인지 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","Even if the two people's actions gathered into the same result, please identify as fact which action at which point was your own share.",二人の行動が同じ結果に集まったと見えるとしても、どの時点のどの行動がご自身の分なのか、事実関係として確認してください。,即便两个人的行为汇聚成同一个结果，也请按事实关系指出，哪个时间点的哪个行为属于您本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤태성 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Tae-seong answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・テソン本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹泰成只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v4].text,"본인이 한 행동 가운데 동생의 행동을 보고 따라간 부분이 있다면, 그 시점을 정리해 주십시오.","If there was a part of your actions where you followed after seeing your brother's actions, please organize that point in time.",ご自身がした行動の中に、弟さんの行動を見て従った部分があるなら、その時点を整理してください。,如果您所做的行为中有看到弟弟的行动后跟随的部分，请整理那个时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤태성 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Tae-seong answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・テソン本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹泰成只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-dual_responsibility-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 두 사람의 책임 배분에 대한 본인의 결론은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 한 행동의 사실관계부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside your conclusion about the distribution of responsibility between the two of you, and first answer the facts of what you did.",ユン・テソンさん、二人の責任配分に関するご自身の結論は脇に置き、ご自身がした行動の事実関係から答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请先把您关于两人责任分配的结论暂时放下，先回答您所做行为的事实关系。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 뜻 해석에서 윤태성이 직접 한 행동과 가족 합의를 분리해 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate Yoon Tae-seong's own actions in interpreting Mother's Wishes from family consensus. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。母の意思の解釈においてユン・テソンが直接した行動と家族の合意を分けて答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导其区分尹泰成在解释母亲意愿时亲自做的行为与家族合意。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 뜻을 두고 본인이 직접 한 해석과 가족에게 들어 합쳐 둔 해석을 분리해 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please separate your direct interpretation of Mother's Wishes from the interpretation you assembled from what you heard from family, and state them in chronological order.",ユン・テソンさん、母の意思をめぐってご自身が直接した解釈と、家族から聞いて合わせておいた解釈を分けて、時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请把您对母亲意愿亲自做出的解释，与您从家人处听来后整合出的解释分开，并按时间顺序说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 뜻 해석에서 윤태성이 직접 한 행동과 가족 합의를 분리해 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate Yoon Tae-seong's own actions in interpreting Mother's Wishes from family consensus. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。母の意思の解釈においてユン・テソンが直接した行動と家族の合意を分けて答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导其区分尹泰成在解释母亲意愿时亲自做的行为与家族合意。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v2].text,"본인이 어머니 곁에서 직접 보고 받아들인 의사와, 본인이 장남으로서 당연하다고 보아 보태어 둔 부분을 분리해 답해 주십시오.",Please separate the wishes you directly saw and accepted beside your mother from the parts you added because you considered them natural as the eldest son.,お母様のそばでご自身が直接見て受け止めた意思と、ご自身が長男として当然だと見て上乗せしておいた部分を分けて答えてください。,请把您在母亲身边亲自看到并接受的意愿，与您作为长子认为理所当然而添加的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 뜻 해석에서 윤태성이 직접 한 행동과 가족 합의를 분리해 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate Yoon Tae-seong's own actions in interpreting Mother's Wishes from family consensus. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。母の意思の解釈においてユン・テソンが直接した行動と家族の合意を分けて答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导其区分尹泰成在解释母亲意愿时亲自做的行为与家族合意。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v3].text,동생의 해석과 본인의 해석이 갈리는 자리에서 어머니가 실제로 보이신 반응이 어디까지였는지 사실관계만으로 짚어 주십시오.,"At the point where your brother's interpretation and yours diverge, please identify as fact how far your mother's actual reaction went.",弟さんの解釈とご自身の解釈が分かれる場所で、お母様が実際に示した反応がどこまでだったのか、事実関係だけで確認してください。,在弟弟的解释与您的解释发生分歧的位置，请只按事实关系指出母亲实际表现出的反应到哪里为止。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 뜻 해석에서 윤태성이 직접 한 행동과 가족 합의를 분리해 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate Yoon Tae-seong's own actions in interpreting Mother's Wishes from family consensus. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。母の意思の解釈においてユン・テソンが直接した行動と家族の合意を分けて答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导其区分尹泰成在解释母亲意愿时亲自做的行为与家族合意。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v4].text,가족이 함께 책임져야 할 부분과 본인이 혼자 책임져야 할 부분을 미리 묶지 말고 사실 단위로 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please do not pre-bundle what the family must bear together with what you alone must bear. Organize them separately in units of fact.,家族が共に責任を負うべき部分と、ご自身が一人で責任を負うべき部分をあらかじめまとめず、事実単位で分けて整理してください。,请不要预先把家族共同负责的部分和您单独负责的部分捆在一起，而是按事实单位分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 뜻 해석에서 윤태성이 직접 한 행동과 가족 합의를 분리해 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate Yoon Tae-seong's own actions in interpreting Mother's Wishes from family consensus. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。母の意思の解釈においてユン・テソンが直接した行動と家族の合意を分けて答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导其区分尹泰成在解释母亲意愿时亲自做的行为与家族合意。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 책임의 결론은 잠시 미뤄 두고, 본인이 직접 한 행동부터 사실 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside the conclusion on responsibility for a moment, and first answer exactly as fact what you personally did.",ユン・テソンさん、責任の結論はしばらく脇に置き、ご自身が直接した行動から事実のまま答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请先把责任结论暂时放下，从您亲自做的行为开始，按事实回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 직접 표현과 윤태성의 해석을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's direct expressions from Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.,事実追及。母の直接の表現とユン・テソンの解釈を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的直接表达与尹泰成的解释。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니께서 본인에게 직접 보이신 의사 가운데 본인이 분명히 기억하는 것을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state in chronological order the parts of the wishes your mother directly showed you that you clearly remember.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様がご自身に直接示した意思のうち、ご自身がはっきり記憶しているものを時系列でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请按时间顺序说明，母亲直接向您表现出的意愿中，您清楚记得的内容。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 직접 표현과 윤태성의 해석을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's direct expressions from Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.,事実追及。母の直接の表現とユン・テソンの解釈を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的直接表达与尹泰成的解释。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v2].text,"어머니께서 보이신 표현 자체와, 본인이 그 표현을 풀어 둔 해석을 분리해 답해 주십시오.",Please separate the expressions your mother showed as they were from the interpretation you gave those expressions.,お母様が示した表現そのものと、ご自身がその表現を解いておいた解釈を分けて答えてください。,请把母亲表现出的表达本身，与您对该表达作出的解释分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 직접 표현과 윤태성의 해석을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's direct expressions from Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.,事実追及。母の直接の表現とユン・テソンの解釈を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的直接表达与尹泰成的解释。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v3].text,"어머니의 의사 가운데 본인이 다른 가족에게 옮겨 준 표현이 있다면, 그 옮김 과정에서 빠진 부분이 있는지 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","If there was an expression of your mother's wishes that you conveyed to other family members, please identify as fact whether anything was omitted in that process.",お母様の意思のうち、ご自身が他の家族に伝えた表現があるなら、その伝達過程で抜けた部分があるかを事実関係として確認してください。,如果母亲的意愿中有您转达给其他家人的表达，请按事实关系指出在转达过程中是否有遗漏的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 직접 표현과 윤태성의 해석을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's direct expressions from Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.,事実追及。母の直接の表現とユン・テソンの解釈を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的直接表达与尹泰成的解释。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v4].text,어머니께서 본인 앞에서 한 말과 동생 앞에서 한 말이 다르다고 본인이 알고 있는 부분이 있는지 정리해 주십시오.,Please organize whether you know of any part where what your mother said in front of you differed from what she said in front of your brother.,お母様がご自身の前で言った言葉と、弟さんの前で言った言葉が異なるとご自身が知っている部分があるのか、整理してください。,请整理，您是否知道母亲在您面前说的话与在弟弟面前说的话存在不同的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니의 직접 표현과 윤태성의 해석을 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's direct expressions from Yoon Tae-seong's interpretation.,事実追及。母の直接の表現とユン・テソンの解釈を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的直接表达与尹泰成的解释。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-mother_voice-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 뜻에 대한 본인의 결론은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 직접 들은 어머니 표현부터 그대로 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, set aside your conclusion about Mother's Wishes, and first answer exactly the expressions you personally heard from your mother.",ユン・テソンさん、母の意思に関するご自身の結論は脇に置き、ご自身が直接聞いたお母様の表現から、そのまま答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请先把您关于母亲意愿的结论暂时放下，从您亲耳听到的母亲表达开始，如实回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 형의 당연시에 대한 윤정후 입장과 그 자리에서 본 어머니 표시를 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Jeong-hu's position toward the older brother's sense of entitlement from the signals he saw from his mother in that place.,事実追及。兄の当然視に対するユン・ジョンフの立場と、その場所で見た母の表示を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹正厚对哥哥理所当然感的立场，以及他在那个位置看到的母亲表示。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형이 장남으로서 당연하다고 보고 있던 몫에 대해 본인이 그 입장을 어떻게 받아들이고 있었는지 본인이 본 사실 위주로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, regarding the share your brother considered natural as the eldest son, please state mainly the facts of how you were accepting that position.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様が長男として当然だと見ていた取り分について、ご自身がその立場をどのように受け止めていたのか、ご自身が見た事実を中心にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，关于哥哥作为长子认为理所当然的份额，请以您所看到的事实为中心，说明您如何接受那个立场。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 형의 당연시에 대한 윤정후 입장과 그 자리에서 본 어머니 표시를 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Jeong-hu's position toward the older brother's sense of entitlement from the signals he saw from his mother in that place.,事実追及。兄の当然視に対するユン・ジョンフの立場と、その場所で見た母の表示を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹正厚对哥哥理所当然感的立场，以及他在那个位置看到的母亲表示。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v2].text,"본인이 그 입장에 동의해 행동한 자리와, 동의하지 않으면서도 부딪치지 않기 위해 침묵한 자리를 분리해 답해 주십시오.",Please separate the places where you acted in agreement with that position from the places where you did not agree but stayed silent to avoid a collision.,ご自身がその立場に同意して行動した場所と、同意していないのにぶつからないため沈黙した場所を分けて答えてください。,请把您同意那个立场并采取行动的位置，与您并不同意却为了避免冲突而沉默的位置分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 형의 당연시에 대한 윤정후 입장과 그 자리에서 본 어머니 표시를 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Jeong-hu's position toward the older brother's sense of entitlement from the signals he saw from his mother in that place.,事実追及。兄の当然視に対するユン・ジョンフの立場と、その場所で見た母の表示を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹正厚对哥哥理所当然感的立场，以及他在那个位置看到的母亲表示。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v3].text,"형이 당연시한 몫이 어머니의 의사와 일치한다고 본인이 본 자리가 있다면, 그 자리에서 어머니가 직접 보이신 표시를 사실관계만으로 답해 주십시오.","If there was a place where you saw the share your brother took for granted as matching your mother's wishes, please answer only as fact the signal your mother directly showed there.",お兄様が当然視した取り分が、お母様の意思と一致しているとご自身が見た場所があるなら、その場所でお母様が直接示した表示を、事実関係だけで答えてください。,如果您曾在某个位置认为哥哥理所当然看待的份额与母亲意愿一致，请只按事实关系回答母亲在那个位置直接表现出的信号。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 형의 당연시에 대한 윤정후 입장과 그 자리에서 본 어머니 표시를 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Jeong-hu's position toward the older brother's sense of entitlement from the signals he saw from his mother in that place.,事実追及。兄の当然視に対するユン・ジョンフの立場と、その場所で見た母の表示を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹正厚对哥哥理所当然感的立场，以及他在那个位置看到的母亲表示。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v4].text,형의 입장과 어머니의 의사가 갈렸을 때 본인이 어머니 쪽에서 들은 표현을 본인이 기억하는 그대로 정리해 주십시오.,"When your brother's position and your mother's wishes diverged, please organize exactly as you remember the expressions you heard from your mother's side.",お兄様の立場とお母様の意思が分かれた時、ご自身がお母様側で聞いた表現を、記憶している通りに整理してください。,当哥哥的立场与母亲的意愿发生分歧时，请按照您的记忆整理您在母亲那边听到的表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 형의 당연시에 대한 윤정후 입장과 그 자리에서 본 어머니 표시를 분리한다.,Fact pursuit. Separate Yoon Jeong-hu's position toward the older brother's sense of entitlement from the signals he saw from his mother in that place.,事実追及。兄の当然視に対するユン・ジョンフの立場と、その場所で見た母の表示を分離する。,事实追问。区分尹正厚对哥哥理所当然感的立场，以及他在那个位置看到的母亲表示。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-a_entitlement-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 입장에 대한 본인의 평가는 잠시 미뤄 두고, 그 자리에서 본인이 한 행동부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside for a moment your evaluation of your brother's position, and answer first what you did in that place.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の立場に対するご自身の評価はしばらく脇に置き、その場所でご自身がした行動から答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请先把您对哥哥立场的评价暂时放下，先回答您在那个位置所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 윤정후가 다듬은 자리와 그대로 둔 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate the places he refined under the justification of protection from the places he left unchanged.,事実追及。保護という名分でユン・ジョンフが整えた場所と、そのままにした場所を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分他以保护为名调整过的位置与保持原样的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호라는 명분으로 본인이 어머니 뜻을 다시 정리한 자리들을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order the places where you reorganized Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護という名分でご自身がお母様の意思を再び整理した場所を、時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明，您以保护为名重新整理母亲意愿的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 윤정후가 다듬은 자리와 그대로 둔 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate the places he refined under the justification of protection from the places he left unchanged.,事実追及。保護という名分でユン・ジョンフが整えた場所と、そのままにした場所を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分他以保护为名调整过的位置与保持原样的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v2].text,어머니께서 직접 표시하신 의사 그대로 둔 자리와 본인이 어머니 대신 다듬은 자리를 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the places you left exactly as your mother directly expressed her wishes from the places you refined on her behalf.,お母様が直接示した意思のままにした場所と、ご自身がお母様の代わりに整えた場所を分けて答えてください。,请把您按母亲直接表示的意愿保持原样的位置，与您代替母亲进行调整的位置分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 윤정후가 다듬은 자리와 그대로 둔 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate the places he refined under the justification of protection from the places he left unchanged.,事実追及。保護という名分でユン・ジョンフが整えた場所と、そのままにした場所を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分他以保护为名调整过的位置与保持原样的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v3].text,형은 본인의 보호 명분이 결국 통제로 작용했다고 봅니다. 본인이 직접 한 작업과 어머니께서 직접 부탁하신 작업을 사실관계만으로 짚어 주십시오.,"Your brother says that your justification of protection ultimately operated as control. Please identify, only as facts, the work you directly did and the work your mother directly requested.",お兄様は、ご自身の保護という名分が結局は統制として作用したと見ています。ご自身が直接した作業と、お母様が直接頼んだ作業を、事実関係だけで確認してください。,哥哥认为您的保护名义最终起到了控制作用。请只按事实关系指出您亲自做的工作，以及母亲直接请求的工作。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 윤정후가 다듬은 자리와 그대로 둔 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate the places he refined under the justification of protection from the places he left unchanged.,事実追及。保護という名分でユン・ジョンフが整えた場所と、そのままにした場所を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分他以保护为名调整过的位置与保持原样的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v4].text,"보호 명분을 본인이 어디까지 적용하기로 정해 두었는지, 정해 둔 한계와 실제 행동 사이의 차이를 정리해 주십시오.","Please organize how far you had decided to apply the justification of protection, and the difference between that limit and your actual actions.",保護という名分をご自身がどこまで適用すると決めていたのか、決めておいた限界と実際の行動との違いを整理してください。,请整理您曾决定把保护名义适用到什么程度，以及预先设定的界限与实际行动之间的差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 윤정후가 다듬은 자리와 그대로 둔 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu separate the places he refined under the justification of protection from the places he left unchanged.,事実追及。保護という名分でユン・ジョンフが整えた場所と、そのままにした場所を分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导尹正厚区分他以保护为名调整过的位置与保持原样的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-b_protection_control-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호의 정당성에 대한 평가는 잠시 미뤄 두고, 본인이 다듬은 자리와 그렇지 않은 자리부터 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside for a moment your evaluation of the legitimacy of protection, and first separate the places you refined from the places you did not.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護の正当性に対する評価はしばらく脇に置き、ご自身が整えた場所とそうではない場所から分けて答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请先把您对保护正当性的评价暂时放下，先把您调整过的位置与没有调整的位置分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤정후 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Jeong-hu answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・ジョンフ本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹正厚只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 한 행동과 형이 한 행동을 한 묶음으로 보지 말고, 본인이 한 행동만 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do not view what you did and what your brother did as one bundle. Please state only the actions you took, in chronological order.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身がした行動とお兄様がした行動を一括りに見ず、ご自身がした行動だけを時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请不要把您所做的行为和哥哥所做的行为看成一组，只按时间顺序说明您所做的行为。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤정후 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Jeong-hu answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・ジョンフ本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹正厚只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v2].text,본인이 직접 한 행동과 형이 한 행동을 본인이 알고 있는 범위에서 분리해 답해 주십시오.,"Please separate the actions you directly took from the actions your brother took, within what you know.",ご自身が直接した行動とお兄様がした行動を、ご自身が知っている範囲で分けて答えてください。,请在您知道的范围内，把您亲自做的行为与哥哥做的行为分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤정후 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Jeong-hu answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・ジョンフ本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹正厚只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v3].text,"두 사람의 행동이 한 결과로 모였다고 보더라도, 어느 시점의 어느 행동이 본인 몫인지 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","Even if the two people's actions gathered into one result, please identify as fact which action at which point was your own share.",二人の行動が一つの結果に集まったと見えるとしても、どの時点のどの行動がご自身の分なのか、事実関係として確認してください。,即便两个人的行为汇聚成一个结果，也请按事实关系指出，哪个时间点的哪个行为属于您本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤정후 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Jeong-hu answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・ジョンフ本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹正厚只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v4].text,"본인이 한 행동 가운데 형의 입장을 받아들이거나 견디기 위해 한 부분이 있다면, 그 시점을 정리해 주십시오.","If there was a part of your actions that you took in order to accept or endure your brother's position, please organize that point in time.",ご自身がした行動の中に、お兄様の立場を受け入れたり耐えたりするためにした部分があるなら、その時点を整理してください。,如果您所做的行为中有为了接受或忍受哥哥立场而做的部分，请整理那个时间点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 사람의 행동을 한 묶음으로 묶지 말고 윤정후 본인 몫만 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Do not bundle the two people's actions together; have Yoon Jeong-hu answer only his own share.,事実追及。二人の行動を一括りにせず、ユン・ジョンフ本人の分だけ答えさせる。,事实追问。不要把两个人的行为捆在一起，引导尹正厚只回答本人那一份。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-dual_responsibility-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 두 사람의 책임 배분에 대한 본인의 결론은 미뤄 두고, 본인이 한 행동의 사실관계부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside your conclusion about the distribution of responsibility between the two of you, and first answer the facts of what you did.",ユン・ジョンフさん、二人の責任配分に関するご自身の結論は脇に置き、ご自身がした行動の事実関係から答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请先把您关于两人责任分配的结论暂时放下，先回答您所做行为的事实关系。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 다시 정리한 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the procedure he reorganized under the justification of protection in units of his own actions. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。保護という名分で再整理した手続を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按本人行为单位回答其以保护为名重新整理的程序。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 뜻을 본인이 보호 명분으로 다시 정리한 시점과 그 절차를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order the point when you reorganized Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection and the procedure you used.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護という名分でご自身がお母様の意思を再び整理した時点と、その手続を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明，您以保护为名重新整理母亲意愿的时间点和程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 다시 정리한 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the procedure he reorganized under the justification of protection in units of his own actions. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。保護という名分で再整理した手続を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按本人行为单位回答其以保护为名重新整理的程序。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v2].text,어머니에게서 직접 들은 의사와 본인이 보호하는 마음에서 보태어 둔 해석을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate the wishes you heard directly from your mother from the interpretation you added out of a wish to protect her.,お母様から直接聞いた意思と、ご自身が保護する気持ちから上乗せしておいた解釈を分けて答えてください。,请把您直接从母亲那里听到的意愿，与您出于保护之心添加的解释分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 다시 정리한 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the procedure he reorganized under the justification of protection in units of his own actions. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。保護という名分で再整理した手続を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按本人行为单位回答其以保护为名重新整理的程序。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v3].text,"형의 해석과 본인의 해석이 갈리는 자리에서, 본인이 직접 한 절차만 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","At the place where your brother's interpretation and yours diverge, please identify only the procedures you directly carried out as matters of fact.",お兄様の解釈とご自身の解釈が分かれる場所で、ご自身が直接した手続だけを事実関係として確認してください。,在哥哥的解释与您的解释发生分歧的位置，请只按事实关系指出您亲自进行的程序。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 다시 정리한 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the procedure he reorganized under the justification of protection in units of his own actions. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。保護という名分で再整理した手続を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按本人行为单位回答其以保护为名重新整理的程序。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v4].text,두 형제가 함께 책임져야 할 부분과 본인이 단독으로 책임져야 할 부분을 미리 묶지 말고 사실 단위로 나눠 정리해 주십시오.,Please do not pre-bundle what the two brothers must bear together with what you must bear alone. Organize them separately in units of fact.,二人の兄弟が共に責任を負うべき部分と、ご自身が単独で責任を負うべき部分をあらかじめまとめず、事実単位で分けて整理してください。,请不要预先把兄弟二人共同负责的部分和您单独负责的部分捆在一起，而是按事实单位分开整理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 보호 명분으로 다시 정리한 절차를 윤정후 본인 행동 단위로 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정은 피한다.,Fact pursuit. Have Yoon Jeong-hu answer the procedure he reorganized under the justification of protection in units of his own actions. Avoid casting one side as the sole villain.,事実追及。保護という名分で再整理した手続を、ユン・ジョンフ本人の行動単位で答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定することは避ける。,事实追问。引导尹正厚按本人行为单位回答其以保护为名重新整理的程序。避免断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호 명분에 대한 평가는 잠시 미뤄 두고, 본인이 어머니 뜻을 어떻게 옮기고 어떻게 정리했는지부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside for a moment your evaluation of the justification of protection, and first answer how you conveyed and organized Mother's Wishes.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護という名分に対する評価はしばらく脇に置き、ご自身がお母様の意思をどのように伝え、どのように整理したのかから答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请先把您对保护名义的评价暂时放下，先回答您如何传达、如何整理母亲的意愿。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 표현과 윤정후의 다듬기를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's expressions from Yoon Jeong-hu's refining.,事実追及。母の表現とユン・ジョンフの整えを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的表达与尹正厚的调整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니께서 본인에게 직접 보이신 의사 가운데 본인이 정확히 기억하는 표현을 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please state in chronological order the expressions you accurately remember among the wishes your mother directly showed you.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様がご自身に直接示した意思のうち、ご自身が正確に記憶している表現を時系列でお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请按时间顺序说明，母亲直接向您表现出的意愿中，您准确记得的表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 표현과 윤정후의 다듬기를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's expressions from Yoon Jeong-hu's refining.,事実追及。母の表現とユン・ジョンフの整えを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的表达与尹正厚的调整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v2].text,어머니의 표현과 본인이 보호 명분으로 다듬은 표현을 분리해 답해 주십시오.,Please separate your mother's expressions from the expressions you refined under the justification of protection.,お母様の表現と、ご自身が保護という名分で整えた表現を分けて答えてください。,请把母亲的表达，与您以保护为名调整过的表达分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 표현과 윤정후의 다듬기를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's expressions from Yoon Jeong-hu's refining.,事実追及。母の表現とユン・ジョンフの整えを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的表达与尹正厚的调整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v3].text,"어머니의 의사 가운데 본인이 형에게 옮기지 않은 부분이 있다면, 옮기지 않기로 한 시점과 이유를 사실관계로 짚어 주십시오.","If there was a part of your mother's wishes that you did not convey to your brother, please identify as fact when you decided not to convey it and why.",お母様の意思のうち、ご自身がお兄様に伝えなかった部分があるなら、伝えないことにした時点と理由を事実関係として確認してください。,如果母亲的意愿中有您没有传达给哥哥的部分，请按事实关系指出您决定不传达的时间点和理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 표현과 윤정후의 다듬기를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's expressions from Yoon Jeong-hu's refining.,事実追及。母の表現とユン・ジョンフの整えを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的表达与尹正厚的调整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v4].text,"어머니께서 본인 앞에서 한 말과 형 앞에서 한 말이 다르다고 본인이 알고 있는 부분이 있다면, 그 차이를 정리해 주십시오.","If you know of any part where what your mother said in front of you differed from what she said in front of your brother, please organize that difference.",お母様がご自身の前で言った言葉と、お兄様の前で言った言葉が異なるとご自身が知っている部分があるなら、その違いを整理してください。,如果您知道母亲在您面前说的话与在哥哥面前说的话存在不同的部分，请整理这种差异。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어머니 표현과 윤정후의 다듬기를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Have him separate his mother's expressions from Yoon Jeong-hu's refining.,事実追及。母の表現とユン・ジョンフの整えを分けて答えさせる。,事实追问。引导其区分母亲的表达与尹正厚的调整。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-mother_voice-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 뜻을 본인이 어떻게 정리했는지에 대한 평가는 미뤄 두고, 본인이 직접 들은 어머니 표현부터 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, set aside your evaluation of how you organized Mother's Wishes, and first answer the expressions you personally heard from your mother.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思をご自身がどう整理したのかに対する評価は脇に置き、ご自身が直接聞いたお母様の表現から答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请先把您对自己如何整理母亲意愿的评价暂时放下，先回答您亲耳听到的母亲表达。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 장남 위치와 돌봄을 상속 권리로 받아들이게 된 본인 판단 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that came to accept the eldest-son position and care as inheritance rights.,動機探索。長男という位置と介護を相続の権利として受け止めるようになった本人の判断動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把长子位置与照护接受为继承权利的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 장남이라는 위치와 돌봄을 상속의 권리로 받아들이게 된 본인의 판단 과정을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please first state the process of your own judgment by which you came to accept the position of eldest son and the care you gave as rights to the inheritance.",ユン・テソンさん、長男という位置と介護を相続の権利として受け止めるようになったご自身の判断過程から先にお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请先说明您把长子位置和照护接受为继承权利的本人判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 장남 위치와 돌봄을 상속 권리로 받아들이게 된 본인 판단 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that came to accept the eldest-son position and care as inheritance rights.,動機探索。長男という位置と介護を相続の権利として受け止めるようになった本人の判断動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把长子位置与照护接受为继承权利的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v2].text,본인이 받아 마땅하다고 본 몫이 어머니의 명시된 뜻과 다를 수 있다는 가능성을 본인 안에서 어떻게 다뤘는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how you dealt within yourself with the possibility that the share you thought you deserved might differ from your mother's stated wishes.,ご自身が受けて当然だと見ていた取り分が、お母様の明示された意思と異なる可能性を、ご自身の中でどのように扱ったのか答えてください。,请回答，您如何在自己心里处理这样一种可能：您认为自己理应得到的份额，可能与母亲明确表示的意愿不同。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 장남 위치와 돌봄을 상속 권리로 받아들이게 된 본인 판단 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that came to accept the eldest-son position and care as inheritance rights.,動機探索。長男という位置と介護を相続の権利として受け止めるようになった本人の判断動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把长子位置与照护接受为继承权利的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v3].text,본인의 그 기대가 동생을 의심으로 옮기는 데에 어떻게 작용했는지 설명하십시오.,Please explain how that expectation of yours worked in moving you toward suspicion of your brother.,ご自身のその期待が、弟さんへの疑いへ移るうえでどのように作用したのか説明してください。,请说明，您的那份期待如何作用于您转向怀疑弟弟的过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 장남 위치와 돌봄을 상속 권리로 받아들이게 된 본인 판단 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that came to accept the eldest-son position and care as inheritance rights.,動機探索。長男という位置と介護を相続の権利として受け止めるようになった本人の判断動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把长子位置与照护接受为继承权利的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v4].text,"본인의 돌봄을 어머니에게 부담으로 돌릴 자격으로 만든 자리가 있었다면, 그 자리의 동기를 답하십시오.","If there was a place where you made your care into a qualification to return the burden to your mother, please answer the motive of that place.",ご自身の介護を、お母様へ負担として返す資格にした場所があるなら、その場所の動機を答えてください。,如果曾有一个位置，您把自己的照护变成了把负担还给母亲的资格，请回答那个位置的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 장남 위치와 돌봄을 상속 권리로 받아들이게 된 본인 판단 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that came to accept the eldest-son position and care as inheritance rights.,動機探索。長男という位置と介護を相続の権利として受け止めるようになった本人の判断動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把长子位置与照护接受为继承权利的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-a_entitlement-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인이 받아야 할 부분과 본인이 받고 싶었던 부분을 분리해 본인 선에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please separate, from your own side, the part you should receive from the part you wanted to receive.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身が受けるべき部分と、ご自身が受けたかった部分を分けて、ご本人の範囲でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请在本人范围内，把您应当得到的部分与您想要得到的部分分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동생의 보호 행위를 통제로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that defined his brother's protective act as control.,動機探索。弟の保護行為を統制と断定した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把弟弟的保护行为断定为控制的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생의 보호 행위를 통제로 단정한 본인의 판단 과정을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state the process of your own judgment by which you defined your brother's protective act as control.",ユン・テソンさん、弟さんの保護行為を統制と断定したご自身の判断過程をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请说明您把弟弟的保护行为断定为控制的本人判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동생의 보호 행위를 통제로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that defined his brother's protective act as control.,動機探索。弟の保護行為を統制と断定した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把弟弟的保护行为断定为控制的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v2].text,본인이 그 단정으로 지키고자 한 본인 자신의 자리가 무엇이었는지 답하십시오.,Please answer what position of your own you were trying to protect through that conclusion.,その断定によって、ご自身のどのような場所を守ろうとしていたのか答えてください。,请回答，您通过那种断定想要守住自己什么位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동생의 보호 행위를 통제로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that defined his brother's protective act as control.,動機探索。弟の保護行為を統制と断定した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把弟弟的保护行为断定为控制的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v3].text,동생의 보호와 본인이 두려워한 통제 가운데 본인이 직접 본 부분과 들어서 추정한 부분을 분리해 설명하십시오.,"Between your brother's protection and the control you feared, please separate and explain the parts you directly saw from the parts you inferred after hearing about them.",弟さんの保護とご自身が恐れた統制のうち、ご自身が直接見た部分と、聞いて推測した部分を分けて説明してください。,请在弟弟的保护和您所害怕的控制之间，把您亲眼看到的部分与听后推测的部分分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동생의 보호 행위를 통제로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that defined his brother's protective act as control.,動機探索。弟の保護行為を統制と断定した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把弟弟的保护行为断定为控制的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v4].text,본인이 그 단정을 통해 가족 안에서 본인의 위치를 다시 세우려 한 부분이 있었는지 답하십시오.,"Please answer whether there was a part where you tried, through that conclusion, to reestablish your position within the family.",その断定を通じて、家族の中でご自身の位置をもう一度立てようとした部分があったのか答えてください。,请回答，您是否有通过那种断定在家族中重新建立自己位置的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 동생의 보호 행위를 통제로 단정한 본인 판단의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his own judgment that defined his brother's protective act as control.,動機探索。弟の保護行為を統制と断定した本人判断の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答把弟弟的保护行为断定为控制的本人判断动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-b_protection_control-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 동생의 행위를 본인이 통제로 부르기 전에 본인이 먼저 묻기로 했어야 할 부분이 있었는지 본인 선에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, before you called your brother's act control, please state from your own side whether there was something you should first have asked.",ユン・テソンさん、弟さんの行為をご自身が統制と呼ぶ前に、先に尋ねるべきだった部分があったのか、ご本人の範囲でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，在您把弟弟的行为称为控制之前，是否有您本应先询问的部分，请在本人范围内说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 동생에게 옮긴 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he shifted his own responsibility onto his brother. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を弟へ移した場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任转移到弟弟身上的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 본인의 책임을 동생에게 옮긴 자리가 있다면, 그 옮김을 만든 본인의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there was a place where you shifted your responsibility onto your brother, please state the motive within you that created that shift.",ユン・テソンさん、ご自身の責任を弟さんへ移した場所があるなら、その移し替えを作ったご自身の動機をお話しください。,尹泰成先生，如果曾有您把自己的责任转移到弟弟身上的位置，请说明造成这种转移的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 동생에게 옮긴 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he shifted his own responsibility onto his brother. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を弟へ移した場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任转移到弟弟身上的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v2].text,본인이 한 일과 본인이 하지 않은 일을 분리해 답할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 답하십시오.,Please first answer the parts where you can separate what you did from what you did not do.,ご自身がしたことと、ご自身がしなかったことを分けて答えられる部分から先に答えてください。,请先回答那些您能够把自己做过的事与没有做过的事分开的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 동생에게 옮긴 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he shifted his own responsibility onto his brother. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を弟へ移した場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任转移到弟弟身上的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v3].text,"본인이 동생을 단정해 부른 자리가 본인 자신의 책임을 가려 준다고 본 부분이 있었다면, 그 판단의 이유를 설명하십시오.","If there was a part where you thought the place where you defined your brother in fixed terms covered your own responsibility, please explain the reason for that judgment.",ご自身が弟さんを断定して呼んだ場所が、ご自身の責任を隠してくれると見た部分があるなら、その判断の理由を説明してください。,如果曾有一个部分，您认为自己用断定的话称呼弟弟的位置能够遮住自己的责任，请说明这种判断的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 동생에게 옮긴 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he shifted his own responsibility onto his brother. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を弟へ移した場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任转移到弟弟身上的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v4].text,형으로서 본인이 가져왔던 자리가 동생의 책임만으로 보일 수 없게 만든 결과를 어디까지 인정할 수 있는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how far you can acknowledge the result that the position you had held as the older brother made it impossible to see this as only your brother's responsibility.,兄としてご自身が持ってきた場所が、弟さんの責任だけには見えない結果を作ったことを、どこまで認められるのか答えてください。,请回答，您能在多大程度上承认：您作为哥哥一直占有的位置，造成了此事无法只被看作弟弟责任的结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 동생에게 옮긴 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he shifted his own responsibility onto his brother. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を弟へ移した場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任转移到弟弟身上的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-dual_responsibility-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 결정 자리를 본인이 좁힌 부분을 본인 선에서 먼저 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please first separate, from your own side, any part where you narrowed your mother's place to decide.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の決定する場をご自身が狭めた部分を、ご本人の範囲で先に分けてお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请先在本人范围内分开说明，您是否有缩窄母亲决定位置的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 돌봄과 장남 위치가 상속 기대로 섞인 부분을 분리하지 않은 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for not separating the part where his care and eldest-son position mixed into inheritance expectations. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。本人の介護と長男の位置が相続への期待として混ざった部分を分けなかった本人の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答没有区分本人照护与长子位置混入继承期待这一部分的本人动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 뜻을 동생이 흩었다고 단정하면서, 본인의 돌봄과 장남 위치가 상속에 대한 기대로 섞인 부분을 분리하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, while concluding that your brother scattered Mother's Wishes, why did you not separate the part where your care and your eldest-son position mixed into expectations for inheritance?",ユン・テソンさん、母の意思を弟さんが散らしたと断定しながら、ご自身の介護と長男の位置が相続への期待として混ざった部分を分けなかった理由は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，您一边断定弟弟打散了母亲的意愿，一边没有区分自己的照护与长子位置混入继承期待的部分，这是为什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 돌봄과 장남 위치가 상속 기대로 섞인 부분을 분리하지 않은 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for not separating the part where his care and eldest-son position mixed into inheritance expectations. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。本人の介護と長男の位置が相続への期待として混ざった部分を分けなかった本人の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答没有区分本人照护与长子位置混入继承期待这一部分的本人动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v2].text,"본인이 받아 마땅하다고 본 부분과 어머니가 실제로 보인 뜻을 본인 안에서 분리해 본 적이 있는지, 있다면 그 결과를 답하십시오.","Please answer whether you have ever separated within yourself the part you thought you deserved from the wishes your mother actually showed, and if so, what the result was.",ご自身が受けて当然だと見た部分と、お母様が実際に示した意思を、ご自身の中で分けてみたことがあるのか、あるならその結果を答えてください。,请回答，您是否曾在自己心里把认为自己理应得到的部分与母亲实际表现出的意愿分开；如果有，请回答结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 돌봄과 장남 위치가 상속 기대로 섞인 부분을 분리하지 않은 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for not separating the part where his care and eldest-son position mixed into inheritance expectations. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。本人の介護と長男の位置が相続への期待として混ざった部分を分けなかった本人の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答没有区分本人照护与长子位置混入继承期待这一部分的本人动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v3].text,"본인 책임을 동생에게 옮긴 자리가 있다면, 그 옮김을 만든 본인의 동기를 설명하십시오.","If there was a place where you shifted your responsibility onto your brother, please explain the motive within you that created that shift.",ご自身の責任を弟さんへ移した場所があるなら、その移し替えを作ったご自身の動機を説明してください。,如果曾有您把自己的责任转移到弟弟身上的位置，请说明造成这种转移的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 돌봄과 장남 위치가 상속 기대로 섞인 부분을 분리하지 않은 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for not separating the part where his care and eldest-son position mixed into inheritance expectations. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。本人の介護と長男の位置が相続への期待として混ざった部分を分けなかった本人の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答没有区分本人照护与长子位置混入继承期待这一部分的本人动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v4].text,어머니의 마음을 본인이 직접 들은 부분과 본인이 정리해 옮긴 부분을 분리해 답하십시오.,Please separate and answer the parts of your mother's heart that you heard directly from the parts you organized and conveyed.,お母様の心をご自身が直接聞いた部分と、ご自身が整理して移した部分を分けて答えてください。,请把您直接听到的母亲心意，与您整理后转述的部分分开回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인의 돌봄과 장남 위치가 상속 기대로 섞인 부분을 분리하지 않은 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer his motive for not separating the part where his care and eldest-son position mixed into inheritance expectations. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。本人の介護と長男の位置が相続への期待として混ざった部分を分けなかった本人の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答没有区分本人照护与长子位置混入继承期待这一部分的本人动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-general-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 형으로서 본인이 어머니의 결정 자리를 좁힌 부분이 있었는지 본인 선에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please state from your own side whether there was any part where you, as the older brother, narrowed your mother's place to decide.",ユン・テソンさん、兄としてご自身がお母様の決定する場を狭めた部分があったのか、ご本人の範囲でお話しください。,尹泰成先生，请在本人范围内说明，您作为哥哥是否有缩窄母亲决定位置的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 해석 없이 옮길 수 있는 자리와 본인이 옮겨 적은 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the place where he can convey his mother's words without his own interpretation from the place he copied them over himself.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の解釈なしに伝えられる場所と、本人が書き移した場所を分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分能够不加本人解释地转达母亲话语的位置，与本人转写的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 실제 말을 본인의 해석 없이 그대로 옮길 수 있는 자리가 있었다면 먼저 그것을 말씀해 주시고, 본인이 옮겨 적은 자리가 있다면 그 옮김의 동기를 함께 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there is a place where you can convey your mother's actual words without your own interpretation, please state that first. If there is a place where you copied them over yourself, please also answer the motive behind that transfer.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の実際の言葉をご自身の解釈なしにそのまま伝えられる場所があるなら、まずそれをお話しください。ご自身が書き移した場所があるなら、その移し替えの動機も併せて答えてください。,尹泰成先生，如果有某个位置您能不加本人解释地照原样转达母亲的实际话语，请先说明；如果有您亲自转写的位置，也请一并回答这种转写的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 해석 없이 옮길 수 있는 자리와 본인이 옮겨 적은 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the place where he can convey his mother's words without his own interpretation from the place he copied them over himself.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の解釈なしに伝えられる場所と、本人が書き移した場所を分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分能够不加本人解释地转达母亲话语的位置，与本人转写的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v2].text,"어머니의 말을 본인이 형으로서 정리해 옮긴 자리가 있었다면, 그 정리를 본인이 한 동기를 답하십시오.","If there was a place where you, as the older brother, organized and conveyed your mother's words, please answer the motive that led you to make that organization.",お母様の言葉をご自身が兄として整理して伝えた場所があるなら、その整理をご自身がした動機を答えてください。,如果曾有您作为哥哥整理并转达母亲话语的位置，请回答您进行这种整理的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 해석 없이 옮길 수 있는 자리와 본인이 옮겨 적은 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the place where he can convey his mother's words without his own interpretation from the place he copied them over himself.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の解釈なしに伝えられる場所と、本人が書き移した場所を分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分能够不加本人解释地转达母亲话语的位置，与本人转写的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v3].text,"본인이 듣고 싶었던 말을 어머니의 말로 옮긴 부분이 있었다면, 그 옮김의 이유를 설명하십시오.","If there was a part where you transferred the words you wanted to hear into your mother's words, please explain the reason for that transfer.",ご自身が聞きたかった言葉を、お母様の言葉として移した部分があるなら、その移し替えの理由を説明してください。,如果曾有您把自己想听到的话转成母亲的话的部分，请说明这种转移的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 해석 없이 옮길 수 있는 자리와 본인이 옮겨 적은 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the place where he can convey his mother's words without his own interpretation from the place he copied them over himself.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の解釈なしに伝えられる場所と、本人が書き移した場所を分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分能够不加本人解释地转达母亲话语的位置，与本人转写的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v4].text,"어머니의 말을 본인이 받아들이지 않은 자리가 있다면, 그 거부의 동기는 무엇입니까.","If there was a place where you did not accept your mother's words, what was the motive behind that refusal?",お母様の言葉をご自身が受け入れなかった場所があるなら、その拒否の動機は何ですか。,如果曾有您没有接受母亲话语的位置，请问这种拒绝的动机是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 해석 없이 옮길 수 있는 자리와 본인이 옮겨 적은 자리를 분리해 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him separate the place where he can convey his mother's words without his own interpretation from the place he copied them over himself.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の解釈なしに伝えられる場所と、本人が書き移した場所を分けて答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其区分能够不加本人解释地转达母亲话语的位置，与本人转写的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-mother_voice-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니의 침묵을 본인의 동의로 읽은 부분이 있다면, 그 읽음을 본인 선에서 인정해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if there was a part where you read your mother's silence as consent to you, please acknowledge that reading from your own side.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の沈黙をご自身への同意として読んだ部分があるなら、その読み取りをご本人の範囲で認めてください。,尹泰成先生，如果曾有您把母亲的沉默解读为对自己的同意的部分，请在本人范围内承认这种解读。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 위치 인식을 본인이 어떻게 활용했는지 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision regarding how he used his brother's perception of his own position.,動機探索。兄の位置認識を本人がどのように利用したのか、その本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答本人如何利用哥哥的位置认知，以及该决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 그러한 위치 인식을 본인이 어떻게 읽고 계셨는지, 그 읽음이 본인 결정에 어떻게 작용했는지 답하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please answer how you were reading your brother's perception of that position and how that reading affected your decision.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様のそのような位置認識を、ご自身がどのように読んでいたのか、その読み取りがご自身の決定にどう作用したのか答えてください。,尹正厚先生，请回答您如何解读哥哥那样的位置认知，以及这种解读如何作用于您的决定。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 위치 인식을 본인이 어떻게 활용했는지 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision regarding how he used his brother's perception of his own position.,動機探索。兄の位置認識を本人がどのように利用したのか、その本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答本人如何利用哥哥的位置认知，以及该决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v2].text,형이 받아 마땅하다고 본 부분을 본인이 본인 선에서 조정하기로 한 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.,"Please state the motive behind your decision to adjust, on your own side, the part your brother believed he deserved.",お兄様が受けて当然だと見ていた部分を、ご自身の側で調整することにした動機をお話しください。,请说明您决定由自己这边调整哥哥认为理应得到的部分的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 위치 인식을 본인이 어떻게 활용했는지 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision regarding how he used his brother's perception of his own position.,動機探索。兄の位置認識を本人がどのように利用したのか、その本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答本人如何利用哥哥的位置认知，以及该决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v3].text,"본인이 형의 기대를 활용해 본인의 결정을 정당화한 자리가 있었다면, 그 정당화의 이유를 설명하십시오.","If there was a place where you used your brother's expectations to justify your own decision, please explain the reason for that justification.",お兄様の期待を利用してご自身の決定を正当化した場所があるなら、その正当化の理由を説明してください。,如果曾有您利用哥哥的期待来正当化自己决定的位置，请说明这种正当化的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 위치 인식을 본인이 어떻게 활용했는지 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision regarding how he used his brother's perception of his own position.,動機探索。兄の位置認識を本人がどのように利用したのか、その本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答本人如何利用哥哥的位置认知，以及该决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v4].text,형의 위치 인식이 본인의 결정을 더 쉽게 만들어 준 부분이 있었는지 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답하십시오.,Please answer within what you can know whether your brother's perception of his position made your decision easier.,お兄様の位置認識がご自身の決定をより容易にしてくれた部分があったのか、ご自身が分かる範囲で答えてください。,请在您能知道的范围内回答，哥哥的位置认知是否有让您的决定变得更容易的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 형의 위치 인식을 본인이 어떻게 활용했는지 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision regarding how he used his brother's perception of his own position.,動機探索。兄の位置認識を本人がどのように利用したのか、その本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答本人如何利用哥哥的位置认知，以及该决定的动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-a_entitlement-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 형의 기대에 대한 본인의 평가와 본인이 한 행위를 분리해 답할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first state the part where you can separate your evaluation of your brother's expectations from the act you took.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お兄様の期待に対するご自身の評価と、ご自身がした行為を分けて答えられる部分から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先说明您能够把自己对哥哥期待的评价与自己所做行为分开的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분 뒤에서 어머니 뜻을 그대로 두지 않기로 결정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to leave Mother's Wishes as they were behind the justification of protection.,動機探索。保護という名分の背後で母の意思をそのままにしておかないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在保护名义背后决定不让母亲意愿保持原样的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호라는 명분 뒤에서 어머니의 뜻을 그대로 두지 않기로 결정한 본인의 판단 과정을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first state the process of your judgment by which you decided not to leave Mother's Wishes as they were behind the justification of protection.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護という名分の背後でお母様の意思をそのままにしておかないことにしたご自身の判断過程から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先说明您在保护名义背后决定不让母亲的意愿保持原样的本人判断过程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분 뒤에서 어머니 뜻을 그대로 두지 않기로 결정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to leave Mother's Wishes as they were behind the justification of protection.,動機探索。保護という名分の背後で母の意思をそのままにしておかないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在保护名义背后决定不让母亲意愿保持原样的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v2].text,"본인이 그 결정을 본인 혼자 내린 자리가 무엇이었는지, 다른 사람과 함께 의논할 수도 있었는데 그렇게 하지 않은 이유를 답하십시오.","Please answer what place there was where you made that decision alone, and why you did not consult with others even though you could have done so.",ご自身がその決定を一人で下した場所が何だったのか、他の人と一緒に相談することもできたのにそうしなかった理由を答えてください。,请回答您独自做出那个决定的位置是什么，以及明明也可以与他人商量，却没有那样做的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분 뒤에서 어머니 뜻을 그대로 두지 않기로 결정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to leave Mother's Wishes as they were behind the justification of protection.,動機探索。保護という名分の背後で母の意思をそのままにしておかないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在保护名义背后决定不让母亲意愿保持原样的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v3].text,보호 명분이 본인에게 어떤 편의를 주었는지 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 설명하십시오.,Please explain within what you can know what convenience the justification of protection gave you.,保護という名分がご自身にどのような便宜を与えたのか、ご自身が分かる範囲で説明してください。,请在您能知道的范围内说明，保护这一名义给您带来了什么便利。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분 뒤에서 어머니 뜻을 그대로 두지 않기로 결정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to leave Mother's Wishes as they were behind the justification of protection.,動機探索。保護という名分の背後で母の意思をそのままにしておかないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在保护名义背后决定不让母亲意愿保持原样的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v4].text,본인이 보호한다고 한 대상이 실제로 보호받았는지를 본인이 어디까지 확인하려 했는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how far you tried to confirm whether the person or thing you said you were protecting was actually protected.,ご自身が保護すると言った対象が実際に保護されたのかを、ご自身がどこまで確認しようとしたのか答えてください。,请回答，对于您所说要保护的对象是否真的得到保护，您试图确认到什么程度。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분 뒤에서 어머니 뜻을 그대로 두지 않기로 결정한 본인의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision not to leave Mother's Wishes as they were behind the justification of protection.,動機探索。保護という名分の背後で母の意思をそのままにしておかないことにした本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答在保护名义背后决定不让母亲意愿保持原样的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-b_protection_control-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호의 이름과 본인이 한 행위를 분리해 본인 책임으로 인정할 수 있는 부분을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please separate the name of protection from the acts you took, and state the part you can acknowledge as your own responsibility.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護という名とご自身がした行為を分けて、ご自身の責任として認められる部分をお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把保护之名与您所做的行为分开，说明您能够承认为本人责任的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 보호 명분 뒤로 미룬 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he postponed his own responsibility behind the justification of protection. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を保護という名分の背後に先送りした場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任推到保护名义背后的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인의 책임을 보호 명분 뒤로 미룬 자리가 있다면, 그 미룸을 만든 본인의 동기를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was a place where you postponed your own responsibility behind the justification of protection, please state the motive within you that created that postponement.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身の責任を保護という名分の背後に先送りした場所があるなら、その先送りを作ったご自身の動機をお話しください。,尹正厚先生，如果曾有您把自己的责任推到保护名义背后的位置，请说明造成这种推迟的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 보호 명분 뒤로 미룬 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he postponed his own responsibility behind the justification of protection. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を保護という名分の背後に先送りした場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任推到保护名义背后的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v2].text,본인이 한 일과 본인이 미룬 일을 분리해 답할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 답하십시오.,Please first answer the parts where you can separate what you did from what you postponed.,ご自身がしたことと、ご自身が先送りしたことを分けて答えられる部分から先に答えてください。,请先回答那些您能够把自己做过的事与推迟的事分开的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 보호 명분 뒤로 미룬 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he postponed his own responsibility behind the justification of protection. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を保護という名分の背後に先送りした場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任推到保护名义背后的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v3].text,"본인이 형의 행동을 단정함으로써 본인의 행위를 가려 준다고 본 부분이 있었다면, 그 판단의 이유를 설명하십시오.","If there was a part where you thought defining your brother's actions in fixed terms covered your own conduct, please explain the reason for that judgment.",ご自身がお兄様の行動を断定することで、ご自身の行為を隠してくれると見た部分があるなら、その判断の理由を説明してください。,如果曾有一个部分，您认为通过断定哥哥的行为能够遮住自己的行为，请说明这种判断的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 보호 명분 뒤로 미룬 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he postponed his own responsibility behind the justification of protection. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を保護という名分の背後に先送りした場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任推到保护名义背后的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v4].text,보호의 이름이 형의 책임만 두드러지게 만든 결과를 본인이 어디까지 인정할 수 있는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how far you can acknowledge the result that the name of protection made only your brother's responsibility stand out.,保護という名が、お兄様の責任だけを目立たせる結果を作ったことを、ご自身がどこまで認められるのか答えてください。,请回答，您能在多大程度上承认：保护之名造成了只让哥哥的责任显得突出的结果。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인 책임을 보호 명분 뒤로 미룬 자리의 동기를 답하게 한다. 공동 책임 인정 흐름.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind the place where he postponed his own responsibility behind the justification of protection. Flow toward acknowledging shared responsibility.,動機探索。本人責任を保護という名分の背後に先送りした場所の動機を答えさせる。共同責任を認める流れ。,动机探查。引导其回答把本人责任推到保护名义背后的位置的动机。走向承认共同责任的流程。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-dual_responsibility-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인이 어머니 뜻을 다듬은 자리를 본인 선에서 먼저 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first separate, from your own side, the place where you refined Mother's Wishes.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思をご自身が整えた場所を、ご本人の範囲で先に分けてお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请先在本人范围内分开说明，您调整母亲意愿的位置。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 다듬은 본인 책임의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his responsibility for refining Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。保護という名分で母の意思を整えた本人責任の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答以保护为名调整母亲意愿的本人责任动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호 명분으로 어머니의 뜻을 본인이 다듬은 책임을 형에게 즉시 설명하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you not immediately explain to your brother the responsibility you bore for refining Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection?",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護という名分でお母様の意思をご自身が整えた責任を、お兄様にすぐ説明しなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，您为什么没有立即向哥哥说明，您以保护为名调整母亲意愿所承担的责任？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 다듬은 본인 책임의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his responsibility for refining Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。保護という名分で母の意思を整えた本人責任の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答以保护为名调整母亲意愿的本人责任动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v2].text,"본인이 어머니를 위한 결정이라고 부른 일이 본인 자신을 위한 결정이기도 했다면, 그 비율을 본인 선에서 답하십시오.","If the act you called a decision for your mother was also a decision for yourself, please answer that ratio from your own side.",ご自身がお母様のための決定と呼んだことが、ご自身のための決定でもあったなら、その比率をご本人の範囲で答えてください。,如果您称为为了母亲的决定，同时也是为了您自己的决定，请在本人范围内回答其中比例。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 다듬은 본인 책임의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his responsibility for refining Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。保護という名分で母の意思を整えた本人責任の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答以保护为名调整母亲意愿的本人责任动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v3].text,"본인이 어머니의 결정 자리를 가져온 자리가 있다면, 그 가져옴을 만든 본인의 동기를 설명하십시오.","If there was a place where you brought your mother's place to decide into your own hands, please explain the motive that created that taking.",お母様の決定する場をご自身が持ってきた場所があるなら、その持ち込みを作ったご自身の動機を説明してください。,如果曾有您把母亲的决定位置拿到自己手中的地方，请说明造成这种取得的本人动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 다듬은 본인 책임의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his responsibility for refining Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。保護という名分で母の意思を整えた本人責任の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答以保护为名调整母亲意愿的本人责任动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v4].text,"보호라는 명분이 본인의 위법성을 가려 준다고 본 부분이 있었다면, 그 판단의 이유를 답하십시오.","If there was a part where you thought the justification of protection covered your own illegality, please answer the reason for that judgment.",保護という名分がご自身の違法性を覆ってくれると見た部分があるなら、その判断の理由を答えてください。,如果曾有一个部分，您认为保护这一名义能够遮住自己的违法性，请回答这种判断的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 보호 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 다듬은 본인 책임의 동기를 답하게 한다. 한쪽 악역 단정 X.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his responsibility for refining Mother's Wishes under the justification of protection. Do not cast one side as the sole villain.,動機探索。保護という名分で母の意思を整えた本人責任の動機を答えさせる。一方を悪役と断定しない。,动机探查。引导其回答以保护为名调整母亲意愿的本人责任动机。不要断定某一方为恶人。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-general-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인의 동기와 본인이 한 행위를 분리해 본인 책임으로 인정할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first state the part you can acknowledge as your own responsibility by separating your motive from the act you took.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身の動機とご自身がした行為を分けて、ご自身の責任として認められる部分から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把本人的动机与本人所做的行为分开，先说明您能够承认为自己责任的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 판단으로 정리해 옮긴 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to organize and convey his mother's words through his own judgment.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の判断で整理して伝えた本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以本人判断整理并转达母亲话语的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 말을 본인의 판단으로 정리해 옮긴 자리가 있다면, 그 정리를 본인이 결정한 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was a place where you organized and conveyed your mother's words through your own judgment, what was the reason you decided to make that organization?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の言葉をご自身の判断で整理して伝えた場所があるなら、その整理をご自身が決定した理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，如果曾有您以本人判断整理并转达母亲话语的位置，您决定这样整理的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 판단으로 정리해 옮긴 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to organize and convey his mother's words through his own judgment.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の判断で整理して伝えた本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以本人判断整理并转达母亲话语的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v2].text,어머니가 한 말과 본인이 어머니에게서 듣고자 한 말을 본인 안에서 어떻게 분리하고 계셨는지 답하십시오.,Please answer how you were separating within yourself what your mother said from what you wanted to hear from her.,お母様が言った言葉と、ご自身がお母様から聞きたいと思った言葉を、ご自身の中でどのように分けていたのか答えてください。,请回答，您如何在自己心里区分母亲说过的话与您想从母亲那里听到的话。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 판단으로 정리해 옮긴 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to organize and convey his mother's words through his own judgment.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の判断で整理して伝えた本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以本人判断整理并转达母亲话语的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v3].text,"어머니의 말이 본인의 결정과 어긋난 자리가 있었다면, 그 자리에서 본인이 어떻게 처리했는지 설명하십시오.","If there was a place where your mother's words diverged from your own decision, please explain how you handled it there.",お母様の言葉がご自身の決定とずれた場所があるなら、その場所でご自身がどのように処理したのか説明してください。,如果曾有母亲的话与您的决定相抵触的位置，请说明您在那个位置如何处理。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 판단으로 정리해 옮긴 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to organize and convey his mother's words through his own judgment.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の判断で整理して伝えた本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以本人判断整理并转达母亲话语的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v4].text,"본인이 어머니의 침묵을 본인의 결정에 대한 동의로 옮긴 부분이 있다면, 그 옮김의 이유를 답하십시오.","If there was a part where you transferred your mother's silence into consent to your decision, please answer the reason for that transfer.",お母様の沈黙をご自身の決定への同意として移した部分があるなら、その移し替えの理由を答えてください。,如果曾有您把母亲的沉默转为对您决定的同意的部分，请回答这种转移的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 어머니의 말을 본인 판단으로 정리해 옮긴 본인 결정의 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive probe. Have him answer the motive behind his decision to organize and convey his mother's words through his own judgment.,動機探索。母の言葉を本人の判断で整理して伝えた本人決定の動機を答えさせる。,动机探查。引导其回答以本人判断整理并转达母亲话语的本人决定动机。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-mother_voice-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 마음과 본인의 판단을 분리해 본인 선에서 인정할 수 있는 부분을 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, please first state the part you can acknowledge from your own side by separating your mother's heart from your own judgment.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様のお気持ちとご自身の判断を分けて、ご本人の範囲で認められる部分から先にお話しください。,尹正厚先生，请把母亲的心意与您自己的判断分开，先说明您在本人范围内能够承认的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,family-01,paths[conditional].judge,"핵심 책임을 분리한 조건부 조정을 먼저 제시하겠습니다. 유서 작성 절차, 공증본과 자필 연습본의 차이, 장기간 돌봄과 계좌 흐름을 한 덩어리로 처리하지는 않겠습니다.","I will first present a conditional mediation that separates the core responsibilities. The will-drafting procedure, the difference between the notarized copy and the handwritten draft, and the long-running care and account trail will not be treated as one bundle.",まず、核心となる責任を切り分けた条件付き調停案を提示します。遺言書作成の手続き、公証本と自筆下書きの違い、長期の介護と口座の流れを一つの塊として扱うことはしません。,我先提出一份把核心责任分开的条件式调解方案。遗嘱制作程序、公证本与亲笔草稿的差异、长期照护和账户流水，不会被合并成一个问题处理。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,family-01,paths[fact_first].judge,"해결책보다 사실관계부터 정리하겠습니다. 유서 작성 절차, 자필 연습본과 공증본의 차이, 장기간 돌봄과 계좌 흐름의 순서부터 고정하겠습니다.","Before moving to a solution, I will organize the facts. We will first fix the order of the will-drafting procedure, the difference between the handwritten draft and the notarized copy, and the long-running care and account trail.",解決策に入る前に、まず事実関係を整理します。遺言書作成の手続き、自筆下書きと公証本の違い、長期の介護と口座の流れの順序から確定します。,在谈解决方案之前，先整理事实关系。遗嘱制作程序、亲笔草稿与公证本的差异、长期照护和账户流水的先后顺序，将先固定下来。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,family-01,paths[immediate].judge,정리된 쟁점을 기준으로 즉시 판단하겠습니다. 판결 단계로 넘어가겠습니다.,I will make an immediate judgment based on the issues as organized. We will move to the verdict stage.,整理された争点を基準に、ただちに判断します。判決段階へ進みます。,我将依据已经整理的争点立即作出判断。进入裁决阶段。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,family-01,paths[postpone].judge,확정 가능한 사실만 먼저 고정하고 나머지는 보류하겠습니다. 어머니 뜻을 누가 어떻게 이해했는지는 기록과 증언을 나눠 보겠습니다.,"I will first fix only the facts that can be confirmed and reserve the rest. We will separate records and testimony when examining who understood Mother's wishes, and how.",確定できる事実だけを先に固め、残りは保留します。母の意思を誰がどう理解していたのかは、記録と証言を分けて見ていきます。,先固定能够确认的事实，其余部分暂时保留。谁如何理解母亲的意愿，将分开记录与证言来审视。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v1].behaviorHint,"윤태성 책임이 중심에 놓이되, 윤정후의 문서 책임은 지워지지 않는 결말이다.","An ending centered on Yoon Tae-seong's responsibility, while Yoon Jeong-hu's responsibility for the document is not erased.",ユン・テソンの責任を中心に置きつつ、ユン・ジョンフの文書責任は消えない結末。,这是以尹泰成的责任为中心、但尹正厚的文件责任并未被抹去的结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v1].text,"판결 뒤 윤태성은 자신이 붙잡은 장남의 자리가 어머니 뜻을 제대로 듣는 데 방해가 되었음을 인정해야 했다. 윤정후가 문서를 손댄 책임은 별도로 남았지만, 태성의 전면 무효 주장과 동생에 대한 단정은 핵심 사실을 오래 가렸다. 재산 정산은 자필 연습본과 오래 도운 일을 확인하는 절차로 넘어갔고, 태성은 더 받아야 한다는 말보다 먼저 자신이 무엇을 당연시했는지 설명해야 했다. 두 형제의 대화는 사과보다 사실 확인에서 다시 시작됐다.","After the verdict, Yoon Tae-seong had to acknowledge that the place of the eldest son he had clung to had gotten in the way of properly hearing his mother's wishes. Yoon Jeong-hu's responsibility for touching the document remained separately, but Tae-seong's claim for full invalidation and his assumptions about his younger brother had long obscured the core facts. The property settlement moved on to a procedure for confirming the handwritten draft and the long period of help, and Tae-seong had to explain what he had taken for granted before saying he should receive more. The brothers' conversation began again from fact-checking rather than apology.",判決の後、ユン・テソンは、自分がつかんでいた長男の位置が母の意思を正しく聞く妨げになっていたことを認めなければならなかった。ユン・ジョンフが文書に手を加えた責任は別に残ったが、テソンの全面無効主張と弟への断定は、核心事実を長く覆い隠していた。財産清算は自筆下書きと長く助けたことを確認する手続きへ移り、テソンはもっと受け取るべきだという言葉より先に、自分が何を当然視していたのかを説明しなければならなかった。兄弟の対話は、謝罪より事実確認から再び始まった。,裁决之后，尹泰成必须承认，自己紧抓的长子位置妨碍了他正确听见母亲的意思。尹正厚动过文件的责任另行保留，但泰成的全面无效主张和对弟弟的断定，长期遮住了核心事实。财产结算转入确认亲笔草稿和长期帮助事项的程序，泰成在说自己应该得到更多之前，必须先说明自己把什么视为理所当然。兄弟之间的对话不是从道歉，而是从事实确认重新开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v2].behaviorHint,윤태성의 과잉 단정과 장남 당연시를 후일담 중심축으로 둔다.,The aftermath centers on Yoon Tae-seong's excessive certainty and assumption that his status as eldest son was self-evident.,ユン・テソンの過剰な断定と、長男であることを当然視する姿勢を後日談の中心軸に置く。,将尹泰成的过度断定和把长子身份视为理所当然，作为后日谈的中心轴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v2].text,"윤태성은 동생이 어머니를 이용했다는 말로 재판을 밀고 왔지만, 마지막에는 그 말이 자신의 상처와 체면에서 출발했다는 판정을 받아들여야 했다. 윤정후의 유서 개입은 위법으로 남았으나, 자기 몫을 줄인 방향과 오래 숨긴 도움이 드러나면서 태성의 공격은 힘을 잃었다. 이후 정산 과정에서 태성은 어머니 돈이라고 믿었던 그 돈의 출처를 다시 확인했고, 동생에게 돌려야 할 말과 돈을 따로 적어 내려갔다. 관계 회복은 즉시 오지 않았지만, 분노만으로는 더 갈 수 없다는 선은 분명해졌다.","Yoon Tae-seong had pushed the trial forward by saying his younger brother had used their mother, but at the end he had to accept the judgment that those words had started from his own wound and pride. Yoon Jeong-hu's involvement in the will remained unlawful, yet as the direction that reduced his own share and his long-hidden help were revealed, Tae-seong's attack lost force. In the later settlement process, Tae-seong checked again the source of the money he had believed was his mother's, and separately wrote down the words and money he had to return to his younger brother. Recovery of the relationship did not come immediately, but the line that they could go no further on anger alone became clear.",ユン・テソンは弟が母を利用したという言葉で裁判を押し進めてきたが、最後にはその言葉が自分の傷と体面から出発したという判断を受け入れなければならなかった。ユン・ジョンフの遺言書への関与は違法として残ったが、自分の取り分を減らす方向だったことと長く隠してきた支援が明らかになるにつれ、テソンの攻撃は力を失った。その後の清算過程で、テソンは母の金だと信じていたその金の出所を改めて確認し、弟に返すべき言葉と金を別々に書き下ろしていった。関係回復はすぐには訪れなかったが、怒りだけではこれ以上進めないという線は明確になった。,尹泰成一直用弟弟利用母亲这句话推进审理，但到最后，他必须接受这样的判断：那句话出发于自己的伤口和面子。尹正厚介入遗嘱仍然属于违法，但随着减少自己份额的方向和长期隐藏的帮助被揭开，泰成的攻击失去了力量。之后在结算过程中，泰成重新确认了自己以为是母亲的钱的来源，并把该还给弟弟的话和钱分别写了下来。关系恢复没有立刻到来，但只靠愤怒已经无法再走下去的界线变得明确。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v3].behaviorHint,법적 위조보다 윤태성의 해석 왜곡이 더 큰 후일담이다.,An aftermath in which Yoon Tae-seong's distorted interpretation weighs heavier than the legal forgery.,法的な偽造より、ユン・テソンの解釈の歪みがより大きく残る後日談。,这是比起法律上的伪造，更突出尹泰成解释扭曲的后日谈。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v3].text,"재판은 윤정후의 조작을 가볍게 보지 않았지만, 윤태성이 어머니의 말년을 자기 공로의 증거처럼 붙들어 온 책임을 더 크게 짚었다. 태성은 유산 비율이 모욕처럼 느껴졌다는 말 뒤에, 자신이 동생의 침묵을 곧바로 탐욕으로 읽은 이유를 인정했다. 남은 절차에서는 유서 효력과 오래된 자금 흐름금 정산이 분리됐고, 태성은 먼저 받은 도움의 실체를 확인하는 자리에 앉게 됐다. 그에게 판결은 패소보다 자기 기억을 다시 쓰는 일에 가까웠다.","The trial did not take Yoon Jeong-hu's manipulation lightly, but it more strongly pointed to Yoon Tae-seong's responsibility for holding on to their mother's final years as if they were evidence of his own merit. Behind Tae-seong's words that the inheritance ratio felt like an insult, he admitted why he had immediately read his younger brother's silence as greed. In the remaining procedure, the validity of the will and the settlement of long-standing fund flows were separated, and Tae-seong came to sit in a place where he had to confirm the substance of the help he had received first. For him, the verdict was closer to rewriting his own memory than to simply losing the case.",裁判はユン・ジョンフの操作を軽く見なかったが、母の晩年を自分の功績の証拠のようにつかんできたユン・テソンの責任をより大きく指摘した。テソンは相続比率が侮辱のように感じられたという言葉の裏で、自分が弟の沈黙をすぐに欲として読んだ理由を認めた。残る手続きでは遺言書の効力と古い資金の流れの清算が分離され、テソンは先に受けた支援の実体を確認する席に着くことになった。彼にとって判決は、敗訴より自分の記憶を書き直すことに近かった。,审理并没有轻看尹正厚的操纵，但更重地指出了尹泰成的责任：他把母亲晚年的时光紧抓成自己功劳的证据。泰成在说遗产比例像侮辱的背后，承认了自己为什么立刻把弟弟的沉默读成贪欲。剩余程序中，遗嘱效力和旧日资金流向结算被分开，泰成也坐到了确认自己先前得到的帮助实质的位置上。对他来说，裁决比起败诉，更像是重新书写自己的记忆。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v4].behaviorHint,감정 회복보다 안전한 거리와 절차적 조정을 강조한다.,It emphasizes safe distance and procedural adjustment more than emotional recovery.,感情の回復より、安全な距離と手続き上の調整を強調する。,比起情感恢复，更强调安全距离和程序性调整。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v4].text,"윤태성에게 가장 어려웠던 일은 동생을 용서하는 것이 아니라, 자신이 어머니 뜻을 이미 결론 내린 채 싸움을 시작했다는 사실을 보는 일이었다. 윤정후는 문서 책임을 피하지 않았고, 태성은 그 책임만으로 모든 문제를 닫을 수 없다는 판정을 받았다. 형제는 당분간 직접 연락을 줄이고, 변호인과 조정인을 통해 재산과 도운 내역을 맞추기로 했다. 차갑지만, 예전처럼 소리만 높이는 자리로 돌아가지는 않겠다는 최소한의 합의였다.","The hardest thing for Yoon Tae-seong was not forgiving his younger brother, but seeing the fact that he had begun the fight after already deciding what his mother's wishes were. Yoon Jeong-hu did not avoid responsibility for the document, and Tae-seong received the judgment that he could not close every issue with that responsibility alone. For the time being, the brothers decided to reduce direct contact and align the property and the history of help through attorneys and a mediator. It was cold, but it was the minimum agreement not to return to a place where they only raised their voices as before.",ユン・テソンにとって最も難しかったのは弟を許すことではなく、自分が母の意思をすでに結論づけたまま争いを始めたという事実を見ることだった。ユン・ジョンフは文書責任を避けず、テソンはその責任だけですべての問題を閉じることはできないという判断を受けた。兄弟は当分のあいだ直接の連絡を減らし、弁護人と調停人を通じて財産と支援の内訳を合わせることにした。冷たいが、以前のように声だけを荒らす場に戻らないための最低限の合意だった。,对尹泰成来说，最难的不是原谅弟弟，而是看见自己在已经给母亲的意思下结论之后才开始争斗的事实。尹正厚没有逃避文件责任，泰成也得到了这样的判断：不能只凭那份责任就关闭所有问题。兄弟俩暂时减少直接联系，决定通过辩护人和调解人核对财产和帮助明细。这很冷淡，却是最低限度的协议，表示他们不会回到过去那种只会提高声音的场合。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v5].behaviorHint,어머니 뜻을 두 형제가 어떻게 왜곡했는지 윤태성 중심으로 정리한다.,"It organizes how the two brothers distorted their mother's wishes, centered on Yoon Tae-seong.",母の意思を二人の兄弟がどのように歪めたのかを、ユン・テソン中心に整理する。,以尹泰成为中心，整理两兄弟如何扭曲了母亲的意思。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v5].text,"윤태성은 판결문을 읽는 동안 동생의 조작보다 자신의 확신이 더 오래 어머니를 가둬 두었을지 모른다는 문장에서 멈췄다. 어머니가 왜 그런 자필 연습본을 남겼는지 묻기 전에, 그는 장남이라는 이름으로 어떤 답을 미리 정해 두었는지 돌아보게 됐다. 윤정후의 책임 절차는 이어졌지만, 태성 역시 무효 주장으로 어머니의 남은 의사를 지운 부분을 바로잡아야 했다. 이 결말에서 형제에게 남은 숙제는 승패가 아니라, 어머니를 각자의 증거로 쓰지 않는 법을 배우는 일이었다.","While reading the written verdict, Yoon Tae-seong stopped at the sentence saying his own certainty may have kept his mother confined longer than his younger brother's manipulation did. Before asking why his mother had left such a handwritten draft, he came to look back on what answer he had already fixed under the name of eldest son. Yoon Jeong-hu's responsibility procedure continued, but Tae-seong also had to correct the part where he had erased their mother's remaining intent through the claim of invalidity. In this ending, the homework left to the brothers was not victory or defeat, but learning how not to use their mother as each person's evidence.",ユン・テソンは判決文を読むあいだ、弟の操作より自分の確信のほうが長く母を閉じ込めていたかもしれないという一文で止まった。母がなぜそのような自筆下書きを残したのかを問う前に、彼は長男という名でどんな答えを先に決めていたのかを振り返ることになった。ユン・ジョンフの責任手続きは続いたが、テソンもまた無効主張によって母の残した意思を消した部分を正さなければならなかった。この結末で兄弟に残った宿題は勝敗ではなく、母をそれぞれの証拠として使わない方法を学ぶことだった。,尹泰成读裁决书时，停在了一句话上：也许比起弟弟的操纵，自己的确信更长久地把母亲关了起来。在询问母亲为什么留下那样的亲笔草稿之前，他先回望了自己以长子之名预先定下了怎样的答案。尹正厚的责任程序继续进行，但泰成也必须纠正自己通过无效主张抹去母亲剩余意思的部分。在这个结局中，留给兄弟俩的功课不是胜负，而是学习不要把母亲当作各自的证据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v1].behaviorHint,윤정후의 위법 행위가 중심인 결말이다.,An ending centered on Yoon Jeong-hu's unlawful act.,ユン・ジョンフの違法行為が中心となる結末。,这是以尹正厚的违法行为为中心的结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v1].text,"판결은 윤정후가 유서를 직접 고친 책임을 가장 무겁게 보았다. 자기 몫을 줄인 조작이고 형을 지키려는 동기가 있었다 해도, 어머니가 남긴 자필 연습본을 당사자가 바꿔 제출한 사실은 절차상 그냥 넘길 수 없었다. 윤태성의 분노와 오해에도 이유가 있었고, 정후는 별도 책임 절차와 재산 정산을 받아들이기로 했다. 지키려던 비밀은 남았지만, 그 비밀을 지킨 방식까지 정당화되지는 않았다.","The verdict weighed most heavily Yoon Jeong-hu's responsibility for directly altering the will. Even if the manipulation reduced his own share and had a motive of protecting his older brother, the fact that an interested party changed and submitted the handwritten draft left by their mother could not simply be passed over procedurally. Yoon Tae-seong's anger and misunderstanding also had reasons, and Jeong-hu decided to accept a separate responsibility procedure and property settlement. The secret he tried to protect remained, but the way he protected that secret was not justified as well.",判決は、ユン・ジョンフが遺言書を直接直した責任を最も重く見た。自分の取り分を減らす操作であり、兄を守ろうとする動機があったとしても、母が残した自筆下書きを当事者が変えて提出した事実は手続き上そのまま見過ごせなかった。ユン・テソンの怒りと誤解にも理由があり、ジョンフは別途の責任手続きと財産清算を受け入れることにした。守ろうとした秘密は残ったが、その秘密を守った方法まで正当化されることはなかった。,裁决把尹正厚直接修改遗嘱的责任看得最重。即使那是减少自己份额的操纵，也有保护哥哥的动机，但当事人改动并提交母亲留下的亲笔草稿这一事实，在程序上无法就这样放过。尹泰成的愤怒和误解也有理由，正厚决定接受另行责任程序和财产结算。想要守住的秘密仍然存在，但守住那个秘密的方式并没有因此被正当化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v2].behaviorHint,윤정후의 침묵과 문서 개입을 함께 묶어 후일담을 만든다.,It builds the aftermath by tying together Yoon Jeong-hu's silence and his intervention in the document.,ユン・ジョンフの沈黙と文書への介入をともに結び、後日談を作る。,将尹正厚的沉默和文件介入合在一起，构成后日谈。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v2].text,"윤정후는 법정을 나오며 처음으로 자신의 침묵이 형을 지킨 것이 아니라 형에게 선택권을 빼앗은 일이었다고 받아들였다. 자필 연습본과 오래된 자금 흐름, 출생 비밀의 맥락은 모두 참작됐지만, 문서를 고친 행위와 그 뒤의 은폐는 판결의 중심 책임으로 남았다. 윤태성은 동생을 탐욕으로만 몰아간 부분을 돌아봐야 했지만, 적어도 조작 사실을 문제 삼은 것 자체는 정당하다는 판단을 받았다. 형제 관계는 당분간 회복보다 책임 이행을 먼저 지나가게 됐다.","As Yoon Jeong-hu left the courtroom, he accepted for the first time that his silence had not protected his older brother but had taken away his older brother's choice. The handwritten draft, the old flow of funds, and the context of the birth secret were all considered, but the act of altering the document and the concealment that followed remained the central responsibility in the verdict. Yoon Tae-seong had to look back on the part where he had driven his younger brother only as greedy, but at least his raising the manipulation itself as an issue was judged legitimate. For the time being, the brothers' relationship would pass through fulfillment of responsibility before recovery.",ユン・ジョンフは法廷を出ながら、初めて自分の沈黙が兄を守ったのではなく、兄から選択権を奪ったことだったと受け入れた。自筆下書きと古い資金の流れ、出生の秘密の文脈はすべて斟酌されたが、文書を直した行為とその後の隠蔽は判決の中心責任として残った。ユン・テソンは弟を欲だけで追い込んだ部分を振り返らなければならなかったが、少なくとも操作の事実そのものを問題にしたことは正当だという判断を受けた。兄弟関係は当分のあいだ、回復より責任履行を先に通ることになった。,尹正厚走出法庭时，第一次接受了自己的沉默不是保护哥哥，而是夺走了哥哥选择权这件事。亲笔草稿、旧日资金流向和出生秘密的脉络都被酌情考虑，但修改文件的行为以及之后的隐瞒，仍是裁决中的中心责任。尹泰成必须回望自己把弟弟只当成贪欲来逼迫的部分，但至少他质疑操纵事实本身得到了正当的判断。兄弟关系在一段时间内，将先经过责任履行，而不是恢复。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v3].behaviorHint,선의와 위법의 충돌을 윤정후 책임 우세로 정리한다.,It organizes the clash between good will and unlawfulness with Yoon Jeong-hu's responsibility prevailing.,善意と違法の衝突を、ユン・ジョンフの責任が優勢な形で整理する。,将善意与违法的冲突整理为尹正厚责任更重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v3].text,"재판관은 윤정후의 동기가 선의에 가까웠다는 점을 인정하면서도, 선의가 유서의 숫자를 바꿀 권한이 되지는 않는다고 정리했다. 정후는 자필 연습본을 보전하고 공증본 작성 경위를 공식 기록으로 남기며, 형에게는 필요한 범위 안에서만 숨은 사실을 설명하기로 했다. 윤태성은 그 설명을 곧바로 받아들이지 못했지만, 최소한 동생이 더 가지려 한 게 아니었다는 점은 더 부인하지 않았다. 판결 뒤의 시간은 사과보다 책임 문서를 쓰는 일에서 시작됐다.","The Judge acknowledged that Yoon Jeong-hu's motive was close to good will, but concluded that good will does not become authority to change the numbers in a will. Jeong-hu decided to preserve the handwritten draft, leave the circumstances of creating the notarized copy in the official record, and explain hidden facts to his older brother only within the necessary scope. Yoon Tae-seong could not accept that explanation immediately, but at least he no longer denied that his younger brother had not tried to take more. The time after the verdict began not with apology, but with writing documents of responsibility.",裁判官はユン・ジョンフの動機が善意に近かった点を認めながらも、善意が遺言書の数字を変える権限にはならないと整理した。ジョンフは自筆下書きを保全し、公証本作成の経緯を公式記録に残し、兄には必要な範囲内でのみ隠れた事実を説明することにした。ユン・テソンはその説明をすぐには受け入れられなかったが、少なくとも弟がもっと取ろうとしたわけではないという点はもう否定しなかった。判決後の時間は、謝罪より責任文書を書くことから始まった。,法官承认尹正厚的动机接近善意，但也整理为善意并不会成为改动遗嘱数字的权限。正厚决定保存亲笔草稿，把公证本制作经过留在正式记录中，并只在必要范围内向哥哥说明隐藏的事实。尹泰成没能立刻接受那个说明，但至少不再否认弟弟并不是想拿得更多。裁决之后的时间不是从道歉开始，而是从书写责任文件开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v4].behaviorHint,윤정후의 보호 명분이 실패한 방식에 초점을 둔다.,It focuses on the way Yoon Jeong-hu's justification of protection failed.,ユン・ジョンフの保護という名分が失敗した方式に焦点を当てる。,聚焦尹正厚以保护为名的理由是如何失败的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v4].text,"윤정후에게 남은 가장 큰 벌은 법적 책임만이 아니었다. 형이 무너질까 봐 숨겼다는 말이, 결국 형을 아무것도 모르는 사람으로 만든 선택이었다는 판단이 남았다. 법원은 유서 변경 효력을 엄격히 다시 보게 했고, 정후에게는 지원금과 가족 비밀을 섞지 않은 별도 설명 절차를 권했다. 윤태성은 여전히 상처를 입었지만, 이제 분노의 초점은 동생의 탐욕이 아니라 동생이 혼자 택한 방식으로 옮겨갔다.","The greatest punishment left to Yoon Jeong-hu was not only legal responsibility. The judgment remained that his words, saying he hid it because his older brother might collapse, had in the end been a choice that made his older brother a person who knew nothing. The court had the effect of the will change reviewed strictly again, and advised Jeong-hu to follow a separate explanation procedure that did not mix support funds with family secrets. Yoon Tae-seong was still hurt, but the focus of his anger now moved from his younger brother's greed to the method his younger brother had chosen alone.",ユン・ジョンフに残った最も大きな罰は、法的責任だけではなかった。兄が崩れるかもしれないから隠したという言葉が、結局は兄を何も知らない人にした選択だったという判断が残った。裁判所は遺言書変更の効力を厳格に改めて見るようにし、ジョンフには支援金と家族の秘密を混ぜない別途の説明手続きを勧めた。ユン・テソンはなお傷ついていたが、いまや怒りの焦点は弟の欲ではなく、弟が一人で選んだ方法へ移っていった。,留给尹正厚最大的惩罚并不只是法律责任。留下来的判断是，他说因为担心哥哥崩溃才隐瞒，最终却是把哥哥变成什么都不知道的人的选择。法院要求严格重新审视遗嘱变更的效力，并建议正厚进行不把支持金和家庭秘密混在一起的另行说明程序。尹泰成仍然受伤，但现在愤怒的焦点从弟弟的贪欲，转向了弟弟独自选择的方式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v5].behaviorHint,책임은 B에 두되 보호 맥락을 지우지 않는다.,It places responsibility on B while not erasing the protective context.,責任はBに置きつつ、保護の文脈は消さない。,将责任放在B身上，同时不抹去保护的脉络。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v5].text,"이 결론에서 윤정후는 가족을 지키려 했다는 말로 더는 문서 위조를 덮을 수 없었다. 어머니의 자필 연습본 의사를 알고도 숫자를 바꿨고, 형이 알아야 할 사정을 자신이 대신 재단했기 때문이다. 다만 판결은 그가 얻으려 한 이익이 아니라 막으려 한 파국을 함께 기록했다. 그래서 정후의 책임은 무거웠지만, 형제에게 남은 길은 단순한 단절이 아니라 제한된 공개와 재정산, 그리고 늦은 설명으로 이어졌다.","In this conclusion, Yoon Jeong-hu could no longer cover document forgery with the words that he had tried to protect his family. He had known his mother's intent in the handwritten draft yet changed the numbers, and he had judged in his older brother's place circumstances his older brother needed to know. However, the verdict recorded not only the benefit he tried to obtain, but also the catastrophe he tried to prevent. So Jeong-hu's responsibility was heavy, but the path left to the brothers led not to simple severance, but to limited disclosure, recalculation, and belated explanation.",この結論で、ユン・ジョンフは家族を守ろうとしたという言葉で、これ以上文書偽造を覆うことはできなかった。母の自筆下書きの意思を知っていながら数字を変え、兄が知るべき事情を自分が代わりに裁断したからだ。ただし判決は、彼が得ようとした利益ではなく、止めようとした破局もともに記録した。だからジョンフの責任は重かったが、兄弟に残った道は単純な断絶ではなく、限定された公開と再清算、そして遅れた説明へ続いた。,在这个结论中，尹正厚不能再用想要保护家人这句话掩盖文件伪造。因为他明知母亲亲笔草稿中的意思却改了数字，也替哥哥裁断了哥哥本该知道的情况。不过，裁决记录的不只是他试图获得的利益，也记录了他试图阻止的破局。因此正厚的责任沉重，但留给兄弟俩的道路不是简单断绝，而是走向有限公开、重新结算和迟来的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v1].behaviorHint,추가 절차를 요구하는 신중한 결말이다.,A cautious ending that requires additional procedures.,追加手続きを求める慎重な結末。,这是要求追加程序的谨慎结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v1].text,"재판관은 이 사건을 바로 끝낼 수 없다고 보았다. 유서 변경의 위법성, 어머니의 판단 능력, 자필 연습본의 효력, 장기간 도운 내역이 서로 다른 기준으로 확인되어야 했기 때문이다. 윤정후의 선의는 참작될 수 있어도 문서 절차를 대신할 수 없고, 윤태성의 분노도 판단 능력 문제를 곧바로 전면 무효로 만들 수 없었다. 두 형제는 추가 감정과 조정, 비공개 상담 절차를 순서대로 밟게 됐다.","The Judge saw that this case could not be ended immediately. The unlawfulness of the will change, the mother's capacity, the effect of the handwritten draft, and the long history of help each had to be confirmed by different standards. Yoon Jeong-hu's good will could be considered, but it could not replace the document procedure, and Yoon Tae-seong's anger could not immediately turn the capacity issue into full invalidation. The two brothers came to follow additional appraisal, mediation, and private counseling procedures in order.",裁判官は、この事件をすぐに終わらせることはできないと見た。遺言書変更の違法性、母の判断能力、自筆下書きの効力、長期間支援した内訳が、それぞれ異なる基準で確認されるべきだったからだ。ユン・ジョンフの善意は斟酌できても文書手続きの代わりにはならず、ユン・テソンの怒りも判断能力の問題をすぐに全面無効へ変えることはできなかった。二人の兄弟は追加鑑定と調停、非公開カウンセリング手続きを順番に踏むことになった。,法官认为，这个案件无法立刻结束。因为遗嘱变更的违法性、母亲的判断能力、亲笔草稿的效力以及长期帮助明细，都必须按照不同标准确认。尹正厚的善意可以酌情考虑，但不能替代文件程序；尹泰成的愤怒也不能立刻把判断能力问题变成全面无效。两兄弟将按顺序进行追加鉴定、调解和非公开咨询程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v2].behaviorHint,증거 보전과 단계별 절차를 강조한다.,It emphasizes preservation of evidence and step-by-step procedures.,証拠保全と段階別の手続きを強調する。,强调证据保全和分阶段程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v2].text,"판결은 결론보다 절차를 먼저 세웠다. 공증 경위는 다시 확인하고, 자필 연습본과 공증본은 별도로 보전하며, 오래된 자금 흐름금은 상속분과 섞지 않고 정산하도록 했다. 출생 비밀은 상속 다툼의 압박 속에서 즉시 공개하지 말고, 당사자를 지킬 장치를 둔 뒤 다루라는 권고가 붙었다. 잘못된 절차로 한 번 무너진 가족을, 또 다른 성급한 절차로 다시 무너뜨리지 말라는 뜻이었다.","The verdict set procedures before a conclusion. The circumstances of notarization would be checked again, the handwritten draft and the notarized copy would be preserved separately, and old fund flows would be settled without mixing them with inheritance shares. The recommendation added that the birth secret should not be disclosed immediately under the pressure of the inheritance dispute, but should be handled after safeguards for the parties were in place. It meant not to collapse again, through another rushed procedure, a family that had already collapsed once through a wrong procedure.",判決は結論より先に手続きを立てた。公証の経緯は改めて確認し、自筆下書きと公証本は別々に保全し、古い資金の流れは相続分と混ぜずに清算することになった。出生の秘密は相続争いの圧迫の中ですぐに公開せず、当事者を守る装置を置いた後に扱うよう勧告が付いた。誤った手続きで一度崩れた家族を、また別の性急な手続きで再び崩してはならないという意味だった。,裁决先于结论建立了程序。公证经过要重新确认，亲笔草稿和公证本要分别保全，旧日资金流向也不得与继承份额混在一起，而应另行结算。关于出生秘密，建议不要在继承争执的压力下立刻公开，而是在设置保护当事人的机制之后再处理。意思是，不能让已经因错误程序崩塌过一次的家人，再因另一个仓促程序再次崩塌。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v3].behaviorHint,절차 분리를 중심에 둔 후일담이다.,An aftermath centered on separating the procedures.,手続きの分離を中心に据えた後日談。,这是以程序分离为中心的后日谈。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v3].text,"윤정후가 문서를 고친 사실은 분명했지만, 그 사실만으로 모든 후속 결정을 한 번에 끝낼 수는 없었다. 재판관은 위조 책임과 재산 정산, 가족 비밀의 공개 문제를 분리했다. 윤태성에게도 동생을 탐욕으로만 단정한 주장과 실제 손해를 구분하라고 했다. 마지막 주문은 처벌보다 순서였다. 무엇을 먼저 확인하고, 무엇을 나중에 공개할지 정하지 않으면 같은 상처가 반복될 수 있다는 경고였다.","It was clear that Yoon Jeong-hu had altered the document, but that fact alone could not end all follow-up decisions at once. The Judge separated responsibility for forgery, property settlement, and the issue of disclosing the family secret. The Judge also told Yoon Tae-seong to distinguish between the claim that had judged his younger brother only as greedy and the actual harm. The final order was about sequence rather than punishment. It was a warning that the same wound could repeat if they did not decide what to confirm first and what to disclose later.",ユン・ジョンフが文書を直した事実は明らかだったが、その事実だけですべての後続判断を一度に終わらせることはできなかった。裁判官は、偽造責任と財産清算、家族の秘密の公開問題を分離した。ユン・テソンにも、弟を欲だけで断定した主張と実際の損害を区別するよう求めた。最後の注文は処罰より順序だった。何を先に確認し、何を後で公開するのかを決めなければ、同じ傷が繰り返されうるという警告だった。,尹正厚修改文件的事实是明确的，但不能只凭这个事实一次结束所有后续决定。法官分离了伪造责任、财产结算和家庭秘密公开问题。法官也要求尹泰成区分把弟弟只断定为贪欲的主张和实际损害。最后的命令比起处罚，更关乎顺序。这是一种警告：如果不决定先确认什么、之后公开什么，同样的伤口可能会重复。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v4].behaviorHint,민감 증거 취급과 열람 제한을 강조한다.,It emphasizes handling sensitive evidence and limiting access.,敏感な証拠の扱いと閲覧制限を強調する。,强调敏感证据处理和阅览限制。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v4].text,"법원은 어머니 일기장과 계좌 흐름이 감정적으로 강한 자료일수록 더 엄격히 다뤄야 한다고 봤다. 형제 중 누구도 그 자료를 상대를 무너뜨리는 무기로 쓰지 못하게, 열람 범위와 제출 순서가 따로 정해졌다. 유서 변경의 책임은 피할 수 없지만, 출생 비밀과 어머니의 말년 상태는 별도 보호 절차 없이 공개하지 않기로 했다. 이 결말은 시원한 판결보다 안전한 다음 단계를 택한 결말이었다.","The court saw that the more emotionally powerful the mother's diary and account flows were as materials, the more strictly they had to be handled. So that neither brother could use those materials as a weapon to destroy the other, the scope of access and order of submission were set separately. Responsibility for the will change could not be avoided, but the birth secret and the mother's condition in her final years would not be disclosed without a separate protective procedure. This ending chose a safe next step rather than a satisfying verdict.",裁判所は、母の日記帳と口座の流れが感情的に強い資料であるほど、より厳格に扱うべきだと見た。兄弟のどちらもその資料を相手を崩す武器として使えないよう、閲覧範囲と提出順序が別に定められた。遺言書変更の責任は避けられないが、出生の秘密と母の晩年の状態は別途の保護手続きなしに公開しないことになった。この結末はすっきりした判決より、安全な次の段階を選んだ結末だった。,法院认为，母亲日记本和账户流向越是情感上强烈的材料，就越应该严格处理。为了不让兄弟中的任何一方把这些材料当成击垮对方的武器，阅览范围和提交顺序被另行规定。遗嘱变更的责任无法逃避，但出生秘密和母亲晚年状态，没有另行保护程序就不公开。这个结局比起痛快的裁决，选择了安全的下一阶段。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v5].behaviorHint,후속 과제를 목록처럼 정리하는 절차 주의 결말이다.,A procedural-caution ending that organizes follow-up tasks like a list.,後続課題をリストのように整理する手続き注意の結末。,这是像清单一样整理后续课题的程序注意结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v5].text,"재판 뒤 형제에게 주어진 것은 완성된 화해가 아니라 숙제 목록이었다. 유서 효력 확인, 위조 책임 절차, 지원금 정산, 가족 상담, 비공개 열람 약속이 차례로 남았다. 윤태성은 더 받느냐보다 왜 그렇게 확신하고 주장했는지를 설명해야 했고, 윤정후는 왜 그 절차를 혼자 바꿨는지 책임 있게 말해야 했다. 판결은 두 사람에게 한 번에 끝내려 하지 말고, 순서를 지켜 다시 다루라고 경고했다.","After the trial, what was given to the brothers was not a completed reconciliation but a list of homework. Confirmation of the will's effect, the forgery responsibility procedure, settlement of support funds, family counseling, and a promise of private access remained in order. Yoon Tae-seong had to explain not whether he would receive more, but why he had been so certain and made such claims, and Yoon Jeong-hu had to speak responsibly about why he changed that procedure alone. The verdict warned the two not to try to finish everything at once, but to handle it again while keeping the proper sequence.",裁判の後、兄弟に与えられたものは完成した和解ではなく、宿題のリストだった。遺言書効力の確認、偽造責任手続き、支援金清算、家族カウンセリング、非公開閲覧の約束が順に残った。ユン・テソンはもっと受け取るかどうかより、なぜそこまで確信して主張したのかを説明しなければならず、ユン・ジョンフはなぜその手続きを一人で変えたのかを責任を持って話さなければならなかった。判決は二人に、一度に終わらせようとせず、順序を守って改めて扱うよう警告した。,审理之后，兄弟俩得到的不是完成的和解，而是一张功课清单。遗嘱效力确认、伪造责任程序、支持金结算、家庭咨询和非公开阅览承诺，依次留下。尹泰成必须说明的不是自己是否该得到更多，而是为什么那样确信并那样主张；尹正厚也必须负责任地说明为什么独自改变了那个程序。裁决警告两人不要试图一次结束，而要遵守顺序重新处理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v1].behaviorHint,민감 가족사를 보호하며 절차를 단순화하는 결말이다.,An ending that protects sensitive family history while simplifying the procedure.,敏感な家族史を保護しながら手続きを単純化する結末。,这是保护敏感家庭史同时简化程序的结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v1].text,"재판은 모든 사실을 공개 기록으로 밀어 넣지 않는 방식으로 마무리됐다. 유서 조작과 자필 연습본 비율은 필요한 범위에서 기록됐지만, 출생 비밀과 어머니 일기의 세부 내용은 별도 비공개 절차에 묶였다. 윤태성과 윤정후는 재산 정산보다 먼저, 어떤 진실을 누구에게까지 말할지 정하는 조정에 들어갔다. 지키는 일은 더 이상 문서를 고치는 방식이 아니라, 절차와 공개 범위를 정하는 방식으로 바뀌었다.","The trial ended in a way that did not push every fact into the public record. The will manipulation and the ratio in the handwritten draft were recorded within the necessary scope, but the birth secret and the details of the mother's diary were tied to a separate private procedure. Before the property settlement, Yoon Tae-seong and Yoon Jeong-hu entered mediation to decide which truths should be told and to whom. Protection was no longer a matter of altering documents, but of setting procedures and the scope of disclosure.",裁判は、すべての事実を公開記録へ押し込まない方式で締めくくられた。遺言書操作と自筆下書きの比率は必要な範囲で記録されたが、出生の秘密と母の日記の詳細内容は別途の非公開手続きに結びつけられた。ユン・テソンとユン・ジョンフは財産清算より先に、どの真実を誰にまで話すのかを定める調停に入った。守ることは、もはや文書を直す方式ではなく、手続きと公開範囲を定める方式へ変わった。,审理以不把所有事实都推进公开记录的方式结束。遗嘱操纵和亲笔草稿中的比例在必要范围内被记录，但出生秘密和母亲日记的细节被纳入另行非公开程序。在财产结算之前，尹泰成和尹正厚先进入调解，决定哪些真相要说、要说到谁那里。所谓保护不再是修改文件的方式，而变成了确定程序和公开范围的方式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v2].behaviorHint,비공개 공개 범위와 조정 절차를 강조한다.,It emphasizes the private scope of disclosure and mediation procedures.,非公開での公開範囲と調停手続きを強調する。,强调非公开的披露范围和调解程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v2].text,"결론은 단죄와 폭로 사이에서 멈췄다. 윤정후의 유서 개입은 인정됐고, 윤태성의 오해도 정리됐지만, 형의 정체성을 흔들 수 있는 내용은 법정 밖에서 조심스럽게 다루기로 했다. 두 사람은 자필 연습본과 계좌 흐름을 기준으로 재산 합의를 진행하고, 일기장 내용은 상담자와 대리인에게만 제한적으로 공개했다. 어머니가 숨기려 한 모든 것을 다시 숨기는 결말은 아니었지만, 한꺼번에 터뜨리는 결말도 아니었다.","The conclusion stopped between condemnation and exposure. Yoon Jeong-hu's involvement in the will was acknowledged, and Yoon Tae-seong's misunderstanding was also sorted out, but content that could shake the older brother's identity would be handled carefully outside the courtroom. The two proceeded with a property agreement based on the handwritten draft and account flows, and disclosed the diary's contents only in limited form to counselors and representatives. It was not an ending that hid again everything their mother had tried to hide, but it was not an ending that burst everything open at once either.",結論は断罪と暴露のあいだで止まった。ユン・ジョンフの遺言書介入は認められ、ユン・テソンの誤解も整理されたが、兄のアイデンティティを揺るがしうる内容は法廷の外で慎重に扱うことになった。二人は自筆下書きと口座の流れを基準に財産合意を進め、日記帳の内容はカウンセラーと代理人にだけ限定的に公開した。母が隠そうとしたすべてをまた隠す結末ではなかったが、一度に爆発させる結末でもなかった。,结论停在了定罪和揭露之间。尹正厚介入遗嘱得到承认，尹泰成的误解也被整理，但可能动摇哥哥身份认同的内容，决定在法庭之外谨慎处理。两人以亲笔草稿和账户流向为标准推进财产协议，日记本内容只有限地公开给咨询师和代理人。这不是把母亲试图隐藏的一切重新隐藏起来的结局，但也不是一次性全部炸开的结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v3].behaviorHint,상담·합의서 기반 보호 해결 후일담이다.,An aftermath based on counseling and agreements for a protective resolution.,カウンセリングと合意書に基づく保護的解決の後日談。,这是基于咨询和协议书的保护性解决后日谈。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v3].text,"윤태성은 모든 진실을 즉시 듣겠다는 요구를 잠시 멈췄고, 윤정후는 지키겠다는 이유로 혼자 판단하던 태도를 내려놓았다. 판결 후 두 형제는 재산 합의서와 비밀 취급 합의서를 따로 작성했다. 유서의 효력은 법적 기준으로 다시 보되, 출생 비밀은 당사자 동의와 상담 절차를 거쳐 단계적으로 다루기로 했다. 그 조심스러운 속도 덕분에 사건은 더 큰 가족 폭로로 번지지 않았다.","Yoon Tae-seong paused his demand to hear all truths immediately, and Yoon Jeong-hu set down the attitude of judging alone in the name of protection. After the verdict, the two brothers wrote a property agreement and a secret-handling agreement separately. The effect of the will would be reviewed again by legal standards, but the birth secret would be handled in stages through the party's consent and counseling procedures. Because of that cautious pace, the case did not spread into a larger family exposure.",ユン・テソンはすべての真実をすぐに聞きたいという要求をいったん止め、ユン・ジョンフは守るという理由で一人で判断してきた態度を下ろした。判決後、二人の兄弟は財産合意書と秘密取扱合意書を別々に作成した。遺言書の効力は法的基準で改めて見る一方、出生の秘密は当事者の同意とカウンセリング手続きを経て段階的に扱うことにした。その慎重な速度のおかげで、事件はより大きな家族の暴露へ広がらなかった。,尹泰成暂时停下了立刻听到所有真相的要求，尹正厚也放下了以保护为由独自判断的态度。裁决后，两兄弟分别起草了财产协议书和秘密处理协议书。遗嘱效力按法律标准重新审视，但出生秘密决定经过当事人同意和咨询程序分阶段处理。因为这种谨慎的速度，案件没有蔓延成更大的家庭揭露。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v4].behaviorHint,법적 판단과 사생활 보호를 동시에 둔다.,It places legal judgment and privacy protection together.,法的判断と私生活の保護を同時に置く。,同时放置法律判断和隐私保护。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v4].text,"법정의 마지막 권고는 간단했다. 유서의 잘못은 바로잡되, 가족의 가장 민감한 사정까지 공개 처벌처럼 다루지는 말라는 것이었다. 윤정후는 문서 책임을 지고, 윤태성은 동생의 지원과 어머니의 자필 연습본 뜻을 인정하는 선에서 절차를 정리했다. 출생 비밀은 공적 기록에서 최소한으로만 남았고, 두 형제는 그 내용을 가족 밖으로 옮기지 않겠다는 약속을 했다. 완전한 화해는 아니었지만, 더 큰 파괴를 막는 결말이었다.","The court's final recommendation was simple. Correct what was wrong with the will, but do not treat even the family's most sensitive circumstances like public punishment. Yoon Jeong-hu took responsibility for the document, and Yoon Tae-seong settled the procedure at the line of acknowledging his younger brother's support and their mother's intent in the handwritten draft. The birth secret remained only minimally in the public record, and the two brothers promised not to carry that content outside the family. It was not complete reconciliation, but it was an ending that prevented greater destruction.",法廷の最後の勧告は簡単だった。遺言書の誤りは正すが、家族の最も敏感な事情まで公開処罰のように扱ってはならないというものだった。ユン・ジョンフは文書責任を負い、ユン・テソンは弟の支援と母の自筆下書きの意思を認める線で手続きを整理した。出生の秘密は公的記録に最小限だけ残り、二人の兄弟はその内容を家族の外へ移さないと約束した。完全な和解ではなかったが、より大きな破壊を防ぐ結末だった。,法庭最后的建议很简单。遗嘱的错误要纠正，但不要把家人最敏感的情况也像公开处罚一样处理。尹正厚承担文件责任，尹泰成则在承认弟弟的支持和母亲亲笔草稿意思的界线上整理程序。出生秘密只最低限度地留在公开记录中，两兄弟也承诺不把这些内容带到家人之外。这不是完全和解，但却是防止更大破坏的结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v5].behaviorHint,절차적 보호와 당사자 자율을 함께 세운다.,It establishes procedural protection and the parties' autonomy together.,手続き上の保護と当事者の自律をともに立てる。,同时建立程序性保护和当事人自主。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v5].text,"판결 뒤 두 사람은 변호인 없이 마주 앉지 않기로 했다. 대신 조정인은 자필 연습본, 공증본, 계좌 흐름, 일기장 내용을 네 갈래로 나눠 공개 범위를 정리했다. 윤태성에게 필요한 진실은 숨기지 않되, 감당할 준비 없이 모든 세부를 던지지 않는 방식이었다. 윤정후에게도 그 절차는 편한 방패가 아니라, 더는 혼자 결정하지 않겠다는 약속으로 남았다.","After the verdict, the two decided not to sit face to face without attorneys. Instead, the mediator divided the handwritten draft, notarized copy, account flows, and diary contents into four branches and organized the scope of disclosure. It was a way of not hiding truths Yoon Tae-seong needed, while also not throwing every detail at him without preparation to bear it. For Yoon Jeong-hu as well, that procedure remained not as a comfortable shield, but as a promise that he would no longer decide alone.",判決の後、二人は弁護人なしで向かい合って座らないことにした。代わりに調停人は、自筆下書き、公証本、口座の流れ、日記帳の内容を四つに分けて公開範囲を整理した。ユン・テソンに必要な真実は隠さないが、受け止める準備なしにすべての詳細を投げつけない方式だった。ユン・ジョンフにとっても、その手続きは都合のいい盾ではなく、これ以上一人で決めないという約束として残った。,裁决之后，两人决定不在没有辩护人的情况下面对面坐下。取而代之，调解人把亲笔草稿、公证本、账户流向和日记本内容分成四条，整理公开范围。这是一种方式：不隐瞒尹泰成需要的真相，同时也不在他没有准备承受时把所有细节都扔给他。对尹正厚来说，这个程序也不是方便的盾牌，而是留下了不再独自决定的承诺。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v1].behaviorHint,가장 자연스러운 공동 책임 결말이다.,The most natural shared-responsibility ending.,最も自然な共同責任の結末。,最自然的共同责任结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v1].text,"판결이 끝난 뒤 두 형제는 바로 화해하지 못했다. 윤정후는 유서를 손댄 책임을, 윤태성은 장남이라는 이름으로 어머니 뜻을 자기 기준에 맞춰 읽은 책임을 각각 인정해야 했다. 자필 연습본, 오래된 자금 흐름, 출생 비밀은 한 문장으로 정리되지 않았고, 그래서 재산 정산도 관계 회복도 따로 시간을 두기로 했다. 두 사람은 처음으로 같은 사실 위에서 다투기 시작했다는 점만 달라져 있었다.","After the verdict ended, the two brothers could not reconcile right away. Yoon Jeong-hu had to acknowledge responsibility for touching the will, and Yoon Tae-seong had to acknowledge responsibility for reading their mother's wishes by his own standards under the name of eldest son. The handwritten draft, the old flow of funds, and the birth secret could not be summarized in one sentence, so the property settlement and relationship recovery were each left to take time separately. What had changed was only that the two had begun to argue for the first time on top of the same facts.",判決が終わった後、二人の兄弟はすぐには和解できなかった。ユン・ジョンフは遺言書に手を加えた責任を、ユン・テソンは長男という名で母の意思を自分の基準に合わせて読んだ責任を、それぞれ認めなければならなかった。自筆下書き、古い資金の流れ、出生の秘密は一文で整理されず、だから財産清算も関係回復も別々に時間を置くことにした。二人が初めて同じ事実の上で争い始めたという点だけが変わっていた。,裁决结束后，两兄弟并不能立刻和解。尹正厚必须承认动过遗嘱的责任，尹泰成也必须承认以长子之名按自己标准解读母亲意思的责任。亲笔草稿、旧日资金流向和出生秘密无法用一句话整理，所以财产结算和关系恢复都决定分别花时间推进。改变的只有一点：两人第一次开始站在同样的事实上争论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v2].behaviorHint,어머니의 숨겨진 마음을 후일담으로 확장한다.,It expands the aftermath through the mother's hidden feelings.,母の隠された思いを後日談へ拡張する。,将母亲隐藏的心意扩展为后日谈。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v2].text,"재판은 누구 하나만 나쁜 사람으로 세우지 않았다. 윤정후는 지키겠다는 이유로 어머니 뜻을 고쳐 썼고, 윤태성은 돌본 시간을 근거로 어머니 뜻을 이미 자기 편으로 해석했다. 두 사람은 서로 다른 방식으로 어머니를 있는 그대로 두지 못했다는 결론을 받아들였다. 이후 형제는 자필 연습본과 도운 내역을 기준으로 정산을 다시 하되, 출생 비밀의 공개 범위는 별도 절차에서 조심스럽게 정하기로 했다.","The trial did not set up only one person as the bad one. Yoon Jeong-hu rewrote his mother's wishes in the name of protecting someone, and Yoon Tae-seong had already interpreted his mother's wishes as being on his side based on the time he spent caring for her. The two accepted the conclusion that, in different ways, neither had let their mother remain as she was. Afterward, the brothers decided to redo the settlement based on the handwritten draft and the history of help, while carefully deciding the disclosure scope of the birth secret in a separate procedure.",裁判は誰か一人だけを悪い人として立てなかった。ユン・ジョンフは守るという理由で母の意思を書き換え、ユン・テソンは世話をした時間を根拠に母の意思をすでに自分の側へ解釈していた。二人は互いに異なる方法で母をありのままにしておけなかったという結論を受け入れた。その後、兄弟は自筆下書きと支援の内訳を基準に清算をやり直す一方、出生の秘密の公開範囲は別途の手続きで慎重に定めることにした。,审理没有把某一个人单独立为坏人。尹正厚以守护为由改写了母亲的意思，尹泰成则以照顾的时间为根据，早已把母亲的意思解读成站在自己这一边。两人接受了这样的结论：他们都以不同方式没能让母亲保持原本的样子。之后，兄弟俩决定以亲笔草稿和帮助明细为标准重新结算，而出生秘密的公开范围则在另行程序中谨慎决定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v3].behaviorHint,돈의 실체와 위조 책임을 함께 정리한다.,It organizes the substance of the money and the responsibility for forgery together.,金の実体と偽造責任をともに整理する。,同时整理金钱的实质和伪造责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v3].text,"윤태성은 동생이 더 가지려 했다는 의심을 내려놓아야 했고, 윤정후는 덜 가지려 했다는 이유만으로 문서를 고친 책임이 사라지지 않는다는 말을 받아들여야 했다. 판결 뒤 두 사람은 오래된 계좌 흐름을 처음부터 다시 보며, 어머니 돈이라고 믿은 것과 동생 돈이었던 것을 나눠 적었다. 그 작업은 화해라기보다 상처의 목록을 정확히 쓰는 일에 가까웠다. 그래도 예전처럼 모르는 사실 위에서 서로를 몰아붙이는 일은 줄어들었다.","Yoon Tae-seong had to let go of the suspicion that his younger brother had tried to take more, and Yoon Jeong-hu had to accept that responsibility for altering the document did not disappear merely because he had tried to take less. After the verdict, the two looked again at the old account flows from the beginning, and wrote separately what they had believed was their mother's money and what had been the younger brother's money. That work was closer to writing an accurate list of wounds than to reconciliation. Still, there were fewer moments when they pressed each other on top of facts they did not know, as they had before.",ユン・テソンは弟がもっと取ろうとしたという疑いを手放さなければならず、ユン・ジョンフは少なく取ろうとしたという理由だけで文書を直した責任が消えるわけではないという言葉を受け入れなければならなかった。判決の後、二人は古い口座の流れを最初から見直し、母の金だと信じていたものと弟の金だったものを分けて書いた。その作業は和解というより、傷の一覧を正確に書くことに近かった。それでも、以前のように知らない事実の上で互いを追い詰めることは減っていった。,尹泰成必须放下弟弟想拿得更多的怀疑，尹正厚也必须接受这样的说法：不能只因为自己想拿得更少，修改文件的责任就消失。裁决之后，两人从头重新查看旧日账户流向，把他们以为是母亲的钱和其实是弟弟的钱分开写下。那项工作与其说是和解，更接近准确写出伤口清单。即便如此，像过去那样站在不知道的事实上彼此逼迫的事，还是减少了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v4].behaviorHint,형제 관계의 거리 조정을 포함한 공동 책임 결말이다.,A shared-responsibility ending that includes adjustment of distance in the brothers' relationship.,兄弟関係の距離調整を含む共同責任の結末。,包含兄弟关系距离调整的共同责任结局。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v4].text,"결국 판결은 유서의 숫자보다 그 숫자를 둘러싼 침묵을 더 오래 남겼다. 태성은 어머니 곁에 있었다는 사실만으로 모든 뜻을 안다고 여긴 자신을 보게 됐고, 정후는 형을 보호한다며 형이 알아야 할 사실까지 막아 세운 자신을 보게 됐다. 두 형제는 합의 이혼처럼 끊어지는 관계가 아니라, 아주 제한된 가족으로 남는 길을 택했다. 제사와 재산 문제는 함께 처리하되, 서로의 삶에는 당분간 깊이 들어가지 않기로 했다.","In the end, the verdict left behind the silence around the numbers longer than the numbers in the will. Tae-seong came to see himself, who had believed that being beside his mother meant he knew all of her wishes, and Jeong-hu came to see himself, who had blocked even facts his older brother needed to know while claiming to protect him. The two brothers chose not a relationship severed like an agreed divorce, but a path of remaining family in a very limited way. They would handle memorial rites and property issues together, but decided not to enter deeply into each other's lives for the time being.",結局、判決は遺言書の数字より、その数字をめぐる沈黙をより長く残した。テソンは母のそばにいたという事実だけですべての意思を知っていると考えた自分を見つめ、ジョンフは兄を守ると言いながら兄が知るべき事実まで塞いだ自分を見つめることになった。二人の兄弟は協議離婚のように切れる関係ではなく、ごく限定された家族として残る道を選んだ。祭祀と財産問題は一緒に処理するが、互いの人生には当分深く入り込まないことにした。,最终，裁决留下的不是遗嘱里的数字，而是围绕那些数字的沉默，而且沉默停留得更久。泰成看见了那个只凭自己在母亲身边，就以为知道母亲所有意思的自己；正厚也看见了那个说着保护哥哥，却连哥哥应该知道的事实都挡住的自己。两兄弟选择的不是像协议离婚那样切断的关系，而是以非常有限的家人形式留下来的道路。祭祀和财产问题一起处理，但他们决定暂时不要深深进入彼此的人生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v5].behaviorHint,정서적 후일담과 절차 후속을 함께 담는다.,It contains both the emotional aftermath and procedural follow-up.,情緒的な後日談と手続き上の後続をともに含める。,同时包含情感后日谈和程序后续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v5].text,"재판 뒤 윤태성과 윤정후는 어머니를 두 번 잃은 사람들처럼 보였다. 한 번은 장례식에서, 또 한 번은 각자가 믿어 온 어머니의 뜻이 무너진 자리에서였다. 정후의 위조와 침묵, 태성의 단정과 상속 당연시는 모두 기록에 남았고, 어느 한쪽도 깨끗한 피해자로만 남지 못했다. 남은 절차는 재산을 나누는 일이면서 동시에, 어머니의 뜻을 더는 서로의 무기로 쓰지 않겠다는 약속을 세우는 일이었다.","After the trial, Yoon Tae-seong and Yoon Jeong-hu looked like people who had lost their mother twice. Once at the funeral, and once again in the place where each person's belief about their mother's wishes collapsed. Jeong-hu's forgery and silence, and Tae-seong's certainty and assumption that inheritance was his due, all remained in the record, and neither side could remain only as a clean victim. The remaining procedure was the work of dividing property and, at the same time, establishing a promise that they would no longer use their mother's wishes as weapons against each other.",裁判の後、ユン・テソンとユン・ジョンフは母を二度失った人たちのように見えた。一度は葬儀で、もう一度はそれぞれが信じてきた母の意思が崩れた場所でだった。ジョンフの偽造と沈黙、テソンの断定と相続を当然視した姿勢はすべて記録に残り、どちらか一方も清らかな被害者としてだけは残れなかった。残る手続きは財産を分けることであると同時に、母の意思をこれ以上互いの武器として使わないという約束を立てることだった。,审理之后，尹泰成和尹正厚看起来像是失去了母亲两次的人。一次是在葬礼上，另一次是在各自相信的母亲意思崩塌的地方。正厚的伪造和沉默、泰成的断定和把继承视为理所当然，都留在了记录中，任何一方都无法只作为干净的受害者留下。剩余程序既是分割财产的工作，同时也是建立承诺的工作：不再把母亲的意思当作彼此的武器。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v1].text,방문이 늘어난 건 맞습니다. 다만 형을 밀어내려던 게 아니라 어머니가 오래 버티기 어려워 서둘렀습니다.,It is true my visits increased. But I was not trying to push my brother out; I hurried because Mother could not hold out much longer.,訪問が増えたのは事実です。ただ、兄を押しのけようとしたのではなく、母が長く持ちこたえるのは難しいと思って急いだのです。,探望次数增加是真的。但我不是想把哥哥排除在外，而是觉得母亲撑不了太久，所以才着急。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v10].text,"재판관님, 질문을 피하진 않겠습니다. 서두른 건 맞지만 그 이유를 악의로만 보시면 곤란합니다.","Your Honor, I will not dodge the question. I did hurry, but it would be wrong to see the reason only as malice.",裁判官、質問を避けるつもりはありません。急いだのは事実ですが、その理由を悪意だけで見るのは困ります。,法官，我不会回避问题。我确实急了，但如果只把理由看成恶意，那就不对了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v2].text,종이를 읽어드린 일은 있습니다. 형이 오기 전에 끝내자는 말도 급한 마음에서 나온 말이었습니다.,I did read the paper to her. Saying we should finish before my brother came also came from an urgent state of mind.,その紙を読んで差し上げたことはあります。兄が来る前に終わらせようという言葉も、急ぐ気持ちから出たものでした。,我确实给她读过那张纸。说要在哥哥来之前结束，也是出于当时着急的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v3].text,그 시기엔 어머니 상태가 하루마다 달랐습니다. 그래서 길게 끌면 더 힘들어질 거라고 봤습니다.,"At that time, Mother's condition changed from day to day. I thought dragging it out would make things harder for her.",その時期、母の状態は日によって違っていました。長引かせれば、母にはもっとつらくなると思いました。,那段时间，母亲的状态每天都不一样。我觉得拖得越久，她会越难受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v4].text,형을 피하려 했다는 말은 과합니다. 저는 어머니가 지치기 전에 정리해야 한다고만 생각했습니다.,Saying I tried to avoid my brother is too much. I only thought we had to settle things before Mother was exhausted.,兄を避けようとしたという言い方は行き過ぎです。私は、母が疲れきる前に整理しなければならないと思っただけです。,说我想避开哥哥，太重了。我只是认为必须在母亲疲惫不堪之前把事情整理好。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v5].text,방문 기록만 보면 수상해 보일 수 있습니다. 그래도 그때 제 기준은 형이 아니라 어머니 상태였습니다.,"If you look only at the visit records, it may look suspicious. Still, my standard then was Mother's condition, not my brother.",訪問記録だけを見れば怪しく見えるかもしれません。それでも、あの時の私の基準は兄ではなく母の状態でした。,只看探望记录，确实可能显得可疑。但当时我的判断标准是母亲的状态，不是哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v6].text,제가 서둘렀다는 점은 인정합니다. 다만 누굴 배제하려고 판을 만든 건 아니었습니다.,I admit that I rushed. But I did not set the stage to exclude anyone.,私が急いだ点は認めます。ただ、誰かを排除するために場を作ったわけではありません。,我承认自己急了。但我不是为了排除谁才布置这个局面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v7].text,종이를 읽은 건 어머니가 요청하신 부분이었습니다. 그 자리에서 싸움이 생길까 조심한 건 맞습니다.,Reading the paper was something Mother asked me to do. It is true I was careful because a fight might break out there.,その紙を読んだのは、母に頼まれた部分でした。その場で争いが起きるのではないかと慎重になったのは事実です。,读那张纸是母亲要求我做的部分。我确实担心当场会起争执，所以很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v8].text,형이 오면 대화가 커질까 걱정한 건 사실입니다. 그렇다고 형을 속이려는 계획이었다고 보진 않습니다.,It is true I worried the conversation would escalate if my brother came. But I do not see it as a plan to deceive him.,兄が来れば話が大きくなるのではないかと心配したのは事実です。だからといって、兄をだます計画だったとは思いません。,我确实担心哥哥来了之后谈话会扩大。但我不认为那就是要欺骗哥哥的计划。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v9].text,"그날 말을 짧게 했습니다. 어머니가 더 흔들리기 전에 끝내자는 뜻이었고, 설명이 부족했습니다.","I spoke briefly that day. I meant to finish before Mother grew more shaken, and I did not explain enough.",その日は言葉を短くしました。母がさらに揺らぐ前に終わらせたいという意味で、説明は足りませんでした。,那天我说得很短。意思是在母亲更加动摇前结束，确实说明不足。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v1].text,형이 오기 전에 끝내려 한 건 맞습니다. 형이 자필 연습본과 숨겨 둔 이유까지 파고들까 두려웠습니다.,It is true I tried to finish before my brother came. I was afraid he would dig into the handwritten draft and the reasons it had been hidden.,兄が来る前に終わらせようとしたのは事実です。兄が自筆下書きとそれを隠していた理由まで掘り下げるのが怖かったのです。,我确实想在哥哥来之前结束。我害怕他会追问亲笔草稿，以及它被隐藏的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v10].text,결국 형이 오기 전이라는 말은 절차의 편의가 아니라 제가 감춘 진실의 문턱이었습니다.,"In the end, the words “before my brother comes” were not procedural convenience; they were the threshold of the truth I had hidden.",結局、「兄が来る前に」という言葉は手続き上の便宜ではなく、私が隠していた真実の入り口でした。,到头来，“在哥哥来之前”并不是程序上的方便，而是我隐藏的真相的门槛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v2].text,저는 어머니를 핑계로 형을 막았습니다. 다툼을 피한다는 말로 사실은 더 깊은 진실을 봉했습니다.,"I used Mother as an excuse to block my brother. I said I was avoiding a quarrel, but in truth I sealed a deeper truth.",私は母を口実にして兄を止めました。争いを避けると言いながら、実際にはもっと深い真実を封じました。,我以母亲为借口挡住了哥哥。嘴上说是避免争执，其实是封住了更深的真相。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v3].text,그날 제 급함은 어머니 상태만이 아니었습니다. 형이 끝까지 묻기 시작하면 유서보다 더 큰 가족사까지 닿을까 겁났습니다.,"My urgency that day was not only about Mother's condition. I was afraid that if my brother kept asking, it would reach a family history larger than the will.",あの日の焦りは、母の状態だけが理由ではありませんでした。兄が最後まで問い始めれば、遺言書より大きな家族史にまで届くのではないかと怖かったのです。,那天我的急迫不只是因为母亲的状态。我害怕哥哥如果追问到底，会触及比遗嘱更大的家族往事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v4].text,제가 형을 절차 밖에 둔 건 사실입니다. 형이 알면 무너질 이야기를 제가 대신 막는다고 착각했습니다.,It is true I kept my brother outside the procedure. I mistook it for blocking a story that would break him if he knew.,私が兄を手続きの外に置いたのは事実です。兄が知れば崩れてしまう話を、私が代わりに止めているのだと勘違いしていました。,我确实把哥哥挡在程序之外。我误以为自己是在替他挡下一个他知道后会崩溃的故事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v5].text,어머니가 힘들어하실까 봐라는 말은 반만 맞습니다. 나머지 반은 제가 감당하지 못한 비밀 때문입니다.,Saying I feared Mother would suffer is only half true. The other half was a secret I could not bear.,母がつらがるのではないかという言葉は半分だけ正しいです。残りの半分は、私が耐えられなかった秘密です。,说是怕母亲难受，只说对了一半。另一半，是我自己承受不了的秘密。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v6].text,"형이 들어오면 숫자의 이유를 물을 것이고, 그 끝에 제가 오래 숨긴 돈과 제 출생과 관련한 민감한 가족사가 같이 열릴까 봐 두려웠습니다.","I was afraid that if my brother came in, he would ask the reason for the numbers, and that would open both the money I had long hidden and a sensitive family matter tied to my birth.",兄が入れば数字の理由を尋ね、その先で私が長く隠してきた金と、私の出生に関わる敏感な家族史が一緒に開かれるのではないかと怖かったのです。,我害怕哥哥一进来就会追问数字的理由，而那最后会把我长期隐藏的钱，以及与我出生有关的敏感家事一起打开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v7].text,"재판관님, 저는 조용히 마치면 모두를 덜 다치게 할 수 있다고 믿었습니다. 그 믿음이 잘못이었습니다.","Your Honor, I believed that ending it quietly would hurt everyone less. That belief was wrong.",裁判官、静かに終えれば皆の傷を少なくできると信じていました。その信念が間違っていました。,法官，我曾以为安静结束就能让所有人少受伤。这个想法是错的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v8].text,형을 지키겠다는 명분으로 형의 알 권리도 막았습니다. 그날의 서두름은 제 선택이었습니다.,"Under the excuse of protecting my brother, I blocked his right to know. The haste that day was my choice.",兄を守るという名目で、兄の知る権利まで塞ぎました。あの日の急ぎは私の選択でした。,我以保护哥哥为名，也挡住了他的知情权。那天的仓促是我的选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v9].text,저는 어머니 뜻을 돕는다면서 형이 들어올 문을 닫았습니다. 그 책임을 피하지 않겠습니다.,"I said I was helping Mother's wishes, but I closed the door my brother should have entered through. I will not avoid that responsibility.",母の意思を助けると言いながら、兄が入るべき扉を閉じました。その責任から逃げません。,我说是在帮助母亲的意愿，却关上了哥哥本该进来的那扇门。我不会逃避这个责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].text,형이 오면 어머니가 먼저 긴장하셨습니다. 그래서 저는 공증 이야기를 길게 붙잡지 않으려 했습니다.,"When my brother came, Mother grew tense first. So I tried not to hold on to the notarization issue too long.",兄が来ると、母が先に緊張しました。だから私は公証の話を長く引っ張らないようにしました。,哥哥一来，母亲会先紧张起来。所以我不想把公证的话题拖太久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v10].text,어머니 상태와 형의 반응을 제가 먼저 계산했습니다. 그 계산이 절차를 흐리게 만든 점은 인정합니다.,I calculated Mother's condition and my brother's reaction ahead of time. I admit that calculation blurred the procedure.,母の状態と兄の反応を、私が先に計算しました。その計算が手続きを曇らせた点は認めます。,我先计算了母亲的状态和哥哥的反应。我承认，这种计算让程序变得不清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].text,그 말에는 형을 배제하려는 마음보다 충돌을 피하려는 마음이 컸습니다. 다만 그 방식은 제 책임입니다.,"In those words, I was driven more by a wish to avoid conflict than to exclude my brother. But the method was my responsibility.",その言葉には、兄を排除する気持ちより、衝突を避けたい気持ちのほうが大きくありました。ただし、その方法は私の責任です。,那句话里，比起排除哥哥，更多是想避开冲突。但那个做法是我的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].text,어머니가 형 앞에서는 말을 더 못 하셨습니다. 그래서 제가 조용할 때 마치자고 한 건 사실입니다.,Mother could not speak as well in front of my brother. So it is true that I said we should finish while things were quiet.,母は兄の前ではうまく話せませんでした。だから静かなうちに終えようと言ったのは事実です。,母亲在哥哥面前更说不出话。所以我确实说过，要趁安静的时候结束。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].text,형의 목소리가 커지면 어머니가 굳는 걸 여러 번 봤습니다. 그 기억 때문에 서두른 점은 인정합니다.,I had seen Mother freeze many times when my brother raised his voice. I admit I hurried because of that memory.,兄の声が大きくなると母が固まるのを何度も見ていました。その記憶のために急いだ点は認めます。,我多次见过哥哥一提高声音，母亲就僵住。因为这段记忆，我承认自己急了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].text,저는 형을 믿지 못했습니다. 형이 들어오면 비율보다 먼저 감정이 터질 거라고 봤습니다.,"I did not trust my brother. I thought that if he came in, emotion would erupt before the ratio could even be discussed.",私は兄を信じられませんでした。兄が入れば、比率より先に感情が爆発すると思っていました。,我不信任哥哥。我认为他一进来，情绪会先于比例问题爆发。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v6].text,형을 피한 게 전혀 아니라고는 못 하겠습니다. 다툼이 생기면 어머니가 감당하지 못할 것 같았습니다.,"I cannot say I was not avoiding my brother at all. If a fight began, I thought Mother could not bear it.",兄を避けていなかったとは全く言えません。争いが起きれば、母は耐えられないと思いました。,我不能说自己完全没有避开哥哥。如果发生争执，我觉得母亲承受不了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v7].text,종이를 읽어드리며 제가 진행을 잡았습니다. 그 선을 넘은 부분이 있다는 것도 이제는 압니다.,I took charge of the flow while reading the paper to Mother. I now know there were parts where I crossed a line.,紙を読んで差し上げながら、私が進行を握りました。その線を越えた部分があることも、今は分かっています。,我一边给母亲读那张纸，一边掌握了进程。现在我也知道，其中有越线的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v8].text,그때는 조용히 끝내는 게 어머니를 지키는 길이라고 믿었습니다. 지금 보니 형을 밖에 세운 꼴입니다.,"At the time, I believed ending it quietly was the way to protect Mother. Looking back now, I had left my brother outside.",その時は、静かに終わらせることが母を守る道だと信じていました。今見ると、兄を外に立たせた形です。,当时我相信安静结束就是保护母亲的方式。现在看，那等于是把哥哥挡在外面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v9].text,형에게 말하지 않고 움직인 건 맞습니다. 다만 그 침묵의 이유가 돈만은 아니었습니다.,It is true I moved without telling my brother. But the reason for that silence was not only money.,兄に言わずに動いたのは事実です。ただ、その沈黙の理由は金だけではありませんでした。,我确实没有告诉哥哥就行动了。但那份沉默的理由并不只是钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v1].text,어머니가 혼자 읽기 어려워하셔서 제가 곁에 있었습니다. 다만 모든 판단을 대신한 건 아닙니다.,"Mother had trouble reading alone, so I stayed beside her. But I did not make every judgment for her.",母は一人で読むのが難しかったので、私がそばにいました。ただ、すべての判断を代わりにしたわけではありません。,母亲一个人阅读有困难，所以我在旁边。但我并没有替她作所有判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v10].text,어머니 반응을 보며 맞춰 갔습니다. 그 과정이 지금 보니 너무 제 손에 가까웠습니다.,"I adjusted to Mother's reactions as we went. Looking back now, that process was too close to my own hands.",母の反応を見ながら合わせていきました。今見ると、その過程は私の手に近すぎました。,我是看着母亲的反应配合推进的。现在看来，这个过程太接近由我来操作了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v2].text,문장을 끊어 읽어드린 일은 있습니다. 그게 곧 제 결정이라고 말하기엔 아직 걸리는 부분이 있습니다.,"I did read the sentences in sections. Still, I hesitate to say that made it my decision.",文章を区切って読んで差し上げたことはあります。ただ、それがすぐ私の決定だったと言うには、まだ引っかかる部分があります。,我确实分段读给她听。但要说那就等于我的决定，我仍觉得还有保留。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v3].text,어머니가 묻는 대목을 다시 설명했습니다. 어디서 선을 넘었는지는 지금도 쉽게 단정하기 어렵습니다.,"I explained again the parts Mother asked about. Even now, it is not easy to say exactly where I crossed the line.",母が尋ねた箇所をもう一度説明しました。どこで線を越えたのか、今でも簡単には断定できません。,母亲问到的地方，我重新解释过。即使现在，也很难轻易断定我从哪里越了线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v4].text,도운 건 맞습니다. 하지만 그때 저는 어머니 뜻을 바꾼다고 생각하지 않았습니다.,I did help. But at the time I did not think I was changing Mother's wishes.,手伝ったのは事実です。しかしその時、母の意思を変えているとは思っていませんでした。,我确实帮了忙。但当时我并不认为自己是在改变母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v5].text,서류를 넘기고 손으로 짚어드렸습니다. 그 행동이 얼마나 큰 개입인지 늦게 알았습니다.,I turned the pages and pointed with my hand. I understood only late how large an intervention that action was.,書類をめくり、手で指して差し上げました。その行動がどれほど大きな介入だったのか、遅れて知りました。,我翻过文件，也用手指给她看。后来才明白，这个动作其实是很大的介入。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v6].text,제가 곁에 있었던 건 사실입니다. 어머니가 불안해하셔서 비켜서지 못했습니다.,"It is true I was beside her. Mother was anxious, and I could not step away.",私がそばにいたのは事実です。母が不安がっていて、離れることができませんでした。,我在她身边是事实。母亲很不安，我没法退开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v7].text,"혼자 두면 더 혼란스러워하실 것 같았습니다. 그래서 옆에 있었지만, 대신 정한다고 보진 않았습니다.","I thought leaving her alone would confuse her more. So I stayed beside her, but I did not see it as deciding for her.",一人にすればさらに混乱すると思いました。だからそばにいましたが、代わりに決めているとは見ていませんでした。,我觉得让她一个人会更混乱，所以待在旁边。但我不认为那是在替她决定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v8].text,읽어드린 것과 결정한 것 사이에 선이 있다고 믿었습니다. 그 선이 흐려진 건 인정합니다.,I believed there was a line between reading to her and deciding for her. I admit that line became blurred.,読んで差し上げることと決めることの間には線があると信じていました。その線が曖昧になったことは認めます。,我以为读给她听和替她决定之间有一条线。我承认，那条线变模糊了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|early].variants[dc-1-b-q2-early-v9].text,"재판관님, 제가 방관자였다고 말하진 않겠습니다. 다만 전부 제가 만든 판단도 아니었습니다.","Your Honor, I will not say I was only a bystander. But it was not entirely a judgment I created either.",裁判官、私が傍観者だったとは言いません。ただ、すべてが私の作った判断だったわけでもありません。,法官，我不会说自己只是旁观者。但也不是所有判断都是我制造出来的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v1].text,"어머니 뜻이 일부 남아 있었지만, 부족한 부분을 제 판단으로 메운 건 사실입니다.","Some of Mother's wishes remained, but it is true I filled the missing parts with my own judgment.",母の意思は一部残っていましたが、足りない部分を私の判断で埋めたのは事実です。,母亲的意愿有一部分仍然存在，但我用自己的判断填补了不足之处，这也是事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v10].text,끝까지 곁에 있던 사람이어서 더 조심했어야 했습니다. 그런데 제가 제일 많이 개입했습니다.,"Because I was the one beside her until the end, I should have been more careful. Instead, I intervened the most.",最後までそばにいた人間だからこそ、もっと慎重であるべきでした。それなのに、私が一番多く介入しました。,正因为我是一直陪在她身边的人，本该更加谨慎。可我反而介入得最多。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v2].text,저는 읽어드린 사람이 아니라 방향을 잡은 사람이었습니다. 그 순간부터 책임이 생겼습니다.,"I was not just the person who read it to her; I was the person who set the direction. From that moment, responsibility began.",私は読んで差し上げた人ではなく、方向を決めた人でした。その瞬間から責任が生じました。,我不是单纯读给她听的人，而是定下方向的人。从那一刻起，责任就产生了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v3].text,어머니가 망설일 때마다 제가 결론 쪽으로 끌고 갔습니다. 도움이라고 부르기엔 선을 넘었습니다.,"Whenever Mother hesitated, I pulled her toward a conclusion. That crossed the line of help.",母が迷うたびに、私が結論のほうへ引っ張りました。助けと呼ぶには線を越えていました。,母亲每次犹豫，我都把她往结论那边带。这已经越过了“帮助”的线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v4].text,판단 능력이 완전히 없었다고 말하진 않겠습니다. 다만 그 빈틈을 제가 붙잡았습니다.,I will not say Mother had completely lost capacity. But I seized on the gaps.,判断能力が完全になかったとは言いません。ただ、その隙間を私がつかみました。,我不会说母亲完全没有判断能力。但我抓住了其中的空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v5].text,"재판관님, 제가 어머니 의사를 확인했다기보다 제 방식으로 정리한 대목이 있습니다.","Your Honor, there are parts where I did not so much confirm Mother's intent as arrange it in my own way.",裁判官、私が母の意思を確認したというより、自分のやり方で整理した箇所があります。,法官，有些部分与其说是确认母亲的意思，不如说是我按自己的方式整理了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v6].text,그날의 문서는 어머니 뜻과 제 판단이 섞인 결과입니다. 섞이게 만든 사람은 저입니다.,The document that day was the result of Mother's wishes mixed with my judgment. I am the one who made them mix.,あの日の文書は、母の意思と私の判断が混ざった結果です。混ざるようにしたのは私です。,那天的文件是母亲意愿和我的判断混在一起的结果。让它们混在一起的人是我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v7].text,제가 멈췄어야 할 때 멈추지 않았습니다. 절차를 마친다는 이유로 대신 결정했습니다.,"I did not stop when I should have. Under the excuse of completing the procedure, I decided in her place.",止まるべき時に止まりませんでした。手続きを終えるという理由で、代わりに決めました。,我该停的时候没有停。以完成程序为由，我替她作了决定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v8].text,"어머니가 이해하신 부분만 남겨야 했는데, 저는 이해하지 못한 부분까지 진행했습니다.","I should have left only the parts Mother understood, but I proceeded even through the parts she did not understand.",母が理解した部分だけを残すべきでしたが、私は理解できていない部分まで進めました。,本该只留下母亲理解的部分，可我连她不理解的部分也推进了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|late].variants[dc-1-b-q2-late-v9].text,도움의 선을 넘었다는 걸 이제 인정합니다. 그 선을 흐린 책임은 제게 있습니다.,I now admit I crossed the line of help. The responsibility for blurring that line is mine.,助けの線を越えたことを今は認めます。その線を曖昧にした責任は私にあります。,我现在承认自己越过了帮助的线。把那条线弄模糊的责任在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v1].text,제가 문장을 읽고 순서를 잡았습니다. 어머니가 멈출 때마다 제가 다시 설명한 것도 맞습니다.,I read the sentences and set the order. It is also true that I explained again whenever Mother stopped.,私が文章を読み、順序を決めました。母が止まるたびに私がまた説明したことも事実です。,我读了句子，也安排了顺序。母亲每次停下时，我又重新解释，这也是事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v10].text,"재판관님, 어머니 의사가 사라진 건 아니나 제 개입도 분명히 남았습니다.","Your Honor, Mother's intent did not disappear, but my involvement also clearly remained.",裁判官、母の意思が消えたわけではありませんが、私の介入もはっきり残りました。,法官，母亲的意愿并没有消失，但我的介入也明确留下来了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v2].text,단순히 옆에 선 정도는 아니었습니다. 어느 부분을 봐야 하는지 제가 계속 짚었습니다.,It was not merely standing beside her. I kept pointing out which parts she should look at.,単にそばに立っていた程度ではありませんでした。どの部分を見るべきか、私がずっと指していました。,那不只是站在旁边。我一直指出她应该看哪些部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v3].text,"어머니 뜻이 남아 있었다고 믿었지만, 절차의 속도와 방향은 제가 많이 잡았습니다.","I believed Mother's wishes were still there, but I set much of the speed and direction of the procedure.",母の意思は残っていると信じていましたが、手続きの速度と方向は私がかなり握りました。,我相信母亲的意愿仍在，但程序的速度和方向很大程度上由我掌握。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v4].text,도움과 결정의 경계가 흐려졌습니다. 저는 그 흐림을 알면서도 멈추지 않았습니다.,The boundary between help and decision blurred. I knew it was blurred and still did not stop.,助けと決定の境界が曖昧になりました。私はその曖昧さを知りながら止まりませんでした。,帮助和决定之间的界线变模糊了。我知道它变模糊，却仍没有停下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v5].text,어머니가 고개를 끄덕이면 저는 그걸 동의로 받아들였습니다. 너무 쉽게 해석한 부분이 있습니다.,"When Mother nodded, I took it as consent. There were parts I interpreted too easily.",母がうなずくと、私はそれを同意として受け取りました。あまりに簡単に解釈した部分があります。,母亲点头时，我就把它当成同意。有些地方我解释得太轻易了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v6].text,제가 읽는 방식에 따라 어머니가 따라오셨습니다. 그러니 제 영향이 없었다고 할 수 없습니다.,Mother followed the way I read. So I cannot say my influence was absent.,私の読み方に合わせて母がついてきました。だから私の影響がなかったとは言えません。,母亲跟着我的读法走。所以我不能说自己没有影响。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v7].text,그날 저는 지키는 사람처럼 굴었지만 실제로는 진행자에 가까웠습니다. 그 점은 인정합니다.,"That day I acted like a protector, but in reality I was closer to a facilitator. I admit that.",あの日、私は守る人のように振る舞いましたが、実際には進行役に近かったのです。その点は認めます。,那天我表现得像是在保护她，但实际上更接近一个推动程序的人。这点我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v8].text,"어머니가 이해하신 부분도 있었지만, 제가 빈칸을 메운 부분도 있었습니다.","There were parts Mother understood, but there were also blanks I filled in.",母が理解した部分もありましたが、私が空白を埋めた部分もありました。,母亲理解的部分也有，但也有我填补空白的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q2-mid-v9].text,선은 제가 정해야 했는데 못 정했습니다. 도와드린다는 말로 계속 앞으로 밀었습니다.,"I should have set the line, but I failed to do so. I kept pushing forward under the word “help.”",線は私が引くべきでしたが、引けませんでした。手伝うという言葉で前へ押し続けました。,那条线本该由我划清，但我没有做到。我以“帮忙”为名继续往前推。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v1].text,최종 서류가 제 손을 거친 건 맞습니다. 다만 그걸 제 이익을 위한 숫자로만 보진 않았습니다.,It is true the final document passed through my hands. But I did not see those numbers only as something for my own benefit.,最終書類が私の手を経たのは事実です。ただ、その数字を私の利益のためだけのものとは見ていませんでした。,最终文件经过我的手是真的。但我并没有只把那些数字看成是为了我自己的利益。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v10].text,최종 제출은 제 책임입니다. 다만 그 책임의 이유까지 돈으로만 묶을 수는 없습니다.,The final submission is my responsibility. But the reason for that responsibility cannot be tied only to money.,最終提出は私の責任です。ただ、その責任の理由まで金だけに結びつけることはできません。,最终提交是我的责任。但这份责任的理由不能只和钱绑在一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v2].text,같은 날 문서가 달라진 사실을 모른 척할 수는 없습니다. 저는 그 변화를 가볍게 여기지 않았습니다.,I cannot pretend not to know that the document changed that day. I did not take that change lightly.,同じ日に文書が変わった事実を知らないふりはできません。私はその変化を軽く見ていませんでした。,我不能假装不知道同一天文件发生了变化。我并没有轻看那个变化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v3].text,다시 낸 서류에 제 판단이 들어간 건 인정합니다. 하지만 이유를 한 줄로 말하긴 어렵습니다.,I admit my judgment entered the document I resubmitted. But it is hard to explain the reason in one line.,出し直した書類に私の判断が入ったことは認めます。ですが、理由を一行で言うのは難しいです。,我承认重新提交的文件里有我的判断。但理由很难用一句话说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v4].text,제가 제출한 쪽이 마지막 문서였습니다. 그 사실 자체는 피하지 않겠습니다.,The document I submitted was the final one. I will not avoid that fact itself.,私が提出したものが最後の文書でした。その事実自体からは逃げません。,我提交的是最后的文件。这个事实本身我不会回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v5].text,원래 비율을 그대로 두는 게 더 큰 다툼을 부를 거라고 봤습니다. 그래서 손을 댔습니다.,I thought leaving the original ratio as it was would cause a larger fight. So I touched it.,元の比率をそのままにすれば、もっと大きな争いを呼ぶと思いました。だから手を加えました。,我觉得如果保留原来的比例，会引发更大的争执。所以我动了它。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v6].text,"재판관님, 제가 더 가지려고 낸 서류는 아닙니다. 그 정도는 분명히 말씀드리겠습니다.","Your Honor, the document I filed was not to take more for myself. That much I want to make clear.",裁判官、私が出した書類は、私がもっと取るためのものではありません。その点ははっきり申し上げます。,法官，我提交那份文件不是为了让自己多拿。这一点我要明确说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v7].text,공증본을 다시 낸 사람은 저입니다. 다만 그 선택은 욕심보다 두려움에 가까웠습니다.,I am the one who resubmitted the notarized copy. But that choice was closer to fear than greed.,公証本を出し直したのは私です。ただ、その選択は欲よりも恐れに近いものでした。,重新提交公证本的人是我。但那个选择比起贪心，更接近恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v8].text,문서가 바뀐 흐름에서 제가 빠져 있었다고 말하진 않겠습니다. 하지만 계산은 단순하지 않았습니다.,I will not say I was absent from the flow in which the document changed. But the calculation was not simple.,文書が変わった流れに私がいなかったとは言いません。しかし、計算は単純ではありませんでした。,我不会说自己不在文件变化的过程中。但其中的考虑并不简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v9].text,저는 그 숫자가 형에게 어떤 폭발을 만들지 먼저 떠올렸습니다. 그래서 다시 냈습니다.,I first thought of what kind of explosion those numbers would create for my brother. That is why I resubmitted it.,私はまず、その数字が兄にどんな爆発を起こすかを考えました。だから出し直しました。,我首先想到那些数字会让哥哥爆发成什么样。所以我重新提交了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v1].text,"제가 바꿨습니다. 어머니가 남긴 제 몫 90, 형 몫 10의 자필 연습본을 알고도 제 몫 60, 형 몫 40으로 낮춰 제출했습니다.","I changed it. Even knowing the handwritten draft gave me 90 and my brother 10, I submitted it reduced to 60 for me and 40 for him.",私が変えました。自筆下書きでは私の取り分が90、兄の取り分が10だと知りながら、私を60、兄を40に下げて提出しました。,是我改的。我明知亲笔草稿写的是我90、哥哥10，却把它降成我60、哥哥40后提交了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v10].text,"돈을 더 얻으려던 일은 아니었지만, 그래서 죄가 작아지는 건 아닙니다. 제가 고쳤습니다.","It was not done to get more money, but that does not make the offense smaller. I changed it.",金をもっと得るためではありませんでした。だからといって罪が小さくなるわけではありません。私が直しました。,这不是为了多拿钱，但也不会因此让罪责变小。是我改了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v2].text,그 문서는 제 책임입니다. 더 받기 위해서가 아니라 형이 자필 연습본을 보지 않게 하려 고쳤습니다.,"That document is my responsibility. I changed it not to receive more, but to keep my brother from seeing the handwritten draft.",その文書は私の責任です。もっと受け取るためではなく、兄に自筆下書きを見せないために直しました。,那份文件是我的责任。我修改它不是为了多拿，而是为了不让哥哥看到亲笔草稿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v3].text,어머니 뜻을 제 손으로 잘라냈습니다. 형을 지킨다는 명분이 있었지만 위법한 선택이었습니다.,"I cut down Mother's wishes with my own hands. I had the excuse of protecting my brother, but it was an unlawful choice.",私は母の意思を自分の手で切り落としました。兄を守るという名目はありましたが、違法な選択でした。,我亲手削掉了母亲的意愿。虽然有保护哥哥的名义，但那是违法的选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v4].text,"재판관님, 자필 연습본을 그대로 두면 제 출생과 관련한 민감한 가족사까지 열릴까 봐 두려웠습니다. 그래서 제 몫을 90에서 60으로 낮췄습니다.","Your Honor, I feared that if the handwritten draft remained as it was, a sensitive family matter tied to my birth would be opened as well. So I lowered my share from 90 to 60.",裁判官、自筆下書きをそのままにすれば、私の出生に関わる敏感な家族史まで開かれるのではないかと怖かったのです。だから私の取り分を90から60へ下げました。,法官，我害怕如果亲笔草稿照原样留下，与我出生有关的敏感家事也会被打开。所以我把自己的份额从90降到了60。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v5].text,저는 형이 감당할 수 있는 숫자를 제가 정할 권리가 있다고 착각했습니다. 그래서 문서를 고쳤습니다.,I mistakenly thought I had the right to decide what numbers my brother could bear. That is why I altered the document.,兄が受け止められる数字を私が決める権利があると勘違いしました。だから文書を直しました。,我误以为自己有权决定哥哥能承受什么数字。所以我改了文件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v6].text,제 몫을 줄였다는 사실이 책임을 없애진 않습니다. 어머니 뜻을 고친 사람은 저입니다.,The fact that I reduced my share does not erase responsibility. I am the one who changed Mother's wishes.,私の取り分を減らしたという事実は責任を消しません。母の意思を直したのは私です。,我减少了自己的份额，这并不能消除责任。改动母亲意愿的人是我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v7].text,"그날 마지막으로 서류를 낸 사람도, 자필 연습본을 막은 사람도 저였습니다. 변명하지 않겠습니다.","The person who filed the papers last that day was me, and the person who blocked the handwritten draft was also me. I will not make excuses.",あの日最後に書類を出した人も、自筆下書きを止めた人も私でした。言い訳はしません。,那天最后提交文件的人是我，挡住亲笔草稿的人也是我。我不辩解。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v8].text,형이 덜 다치게 하려 했다는 말로는 부족합니다. 제가 어머니 뜻에 손댄 건 사실입니다.,Saying I tried to spare my brother is not enough. It is true I touched Mother's wishes.,兄を少しでも傷つけないようにしたという言葉では足りません。私が母の意思に手を加えたのは事実です。,说我是想让哥哥少受伤，这还不够。事实是我动了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v9].text,"저는 제 몫 90, 형 몫 10인 자필 연습본의 이유가 드러나는 것을 막으려 제 몫 60, 형 몫 40이라는 거짓 안전선을 만들었습니다.","I created a false safety line of 60 for me and 40 for my brother to stop the reason for the handwritten draft—90 for me, 10 for him—from being exposed.",私は、私90・兄10という自筆下書きの理由が露わになるのを防ぐため、私60・兄40という偽の安全線を作りました。,我为了阻止“我90、哥哥10”的亲笔草稿理由被揭开，制造了“我60、哥哥40”的虚假安全线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"자필 연습본에서는 제 몫이 훨씬 컸고, 공증본에서는 제가 제 몫을 낮췄습니다. 그 판단은 제가 했습니다. 형이 자필 연습본을 견디지 못할 거라 봤습니다.","In the handwritten draft my share was much larger, and in the notarized copy I lowered it. That judgment was mine. I thought my brother could not withstand the handwritten draft.",自筆下書きでは私の取り分がずっと大きく、公証本では私が自分の取り分を下げました。その判断は私がしました。兄は自筆下書きに耐えられないと思いました。,亲笔草稿里我的份额大得多，而公证本里我降低了自己的份额。那个判断是我作的。我认为哥哥承受不了亲笔草稿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v10].text,공증 제출 전 제가 멈췄어야 했습니다. 하지만 자필 연습본의 이유가 열릴 뒤끝이 더 무서웠습니다.,I should have stopped before notarized submission. But I was more afraid of what would come after the reasons for the handwritten draft were opened.,公証提出の前に、私が止まるべきでした。けれど、自筆下書きの理由が開かれた後のことのほうが怖かったのです。,在提交公证前，我本该停下。但我更害怕亲笔草稿的理由被打开后的后果。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].text,제가 다시 낸 서류는 제 몫을 줄인 서류였습니다. 더 받기 위한 손질은 아니었습니다.,The document I resubmitted reduced my own share. It was not an edit to receive more.,私が出し直した書類は、私の取り分を減らす書類でした。より多く受け取るための手直しではありませんでした。,我重新提交的文件是减少自己份额的文件。那不是为了多拿而做的改动。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].text,자필 연습본을 그대로 내면 형이 상속보다 이유를 먼저 물을 거라고 봤습니다. 그래서 제 몫을 낮추는 쪽으로 바꿨습니다.,"If I submitted the handwritten draft as it was, I thought my brother would ask the reason before the inheritance itself. So I changed it in the direction of lowering my share.",自筆下書きをそのまま出せば、兄は相続より先に理由を尋ねると思いました。だから私の取り分を下げる方向に変えました。,如果照原样提交亲笔草稿，我觉得哥哥会先问理由，而不是继承本身。所以我把它改成降低自己份额的方向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].text,원래 숫자를 알면서도 낮췄습니다. 형이 모욕으로 받아들일 상황을 줄이려 했습니다.,I knew the original numbers and still lowered them. I was trying to reduce a situation my brother would take as an insult.,元の数字を知りながら下げました。兄が侮辱として受け取る状況を減らそうとしました。,我明知道原来的数字，却还是降低了。我想减少哥哥会觉得被羞辱的情况。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"재판관님, 저는 자필 연습본을 감췄습니다. 형이 그 비율의 이유까지 파고들까 두려웠습니다.","Your Honor, I hid the handwritten draft. I was afraid my brother would dig into the reason for that ratio.",裁判官、私は自筆下書きを隠しました。兄がその比率の理由まで掘り下げるのが怖かったのです。,法官，我隐藏了亲笔草稿。我害怕哥哥会追问那个比例的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v6].text,그 변경은 우연이 아닙니다. 제가 형이 받아들일 만한 선이라고 멋대로 정했습니다.,That change was not accidental. I arbitrarily decided the line my brother could accept.,その変更は偶然ではありません。私が、兄が受け入れられる線だと勝手に決めました。,那个变更不是偶然。我擅自决定了哥哥可以接受的界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v7].text,어머니 뜻을 몰라서 바꾼 게 아닙니다. 알고 있었기 때문에 오히려 위험하다고 생각했습니다.,"I did not change it because I did not know Mother's wishes. I knew them, and that made me think they were dangerous.",母の意思を知らなかったから変えたのではありません。知っていたからこそ、むしろ危ないと思いました。,我不是因为不知道母亲的意愿才改的。正因为知道，才反而觉得危险。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v8].text,제 몫을 줄이면 다툼이 작아질 거라고 착각했습니다. 그 착각이 문서를 바꿨습니다.,I thought reducing my share would make the conflict smaller. That mistake changed the document.,私の取り分を減らせば争いが小さくなると勘違いしました。その勘違いが文書を変えました。,我误以为减少自己的份额会让争执变小。这个误判改变了文件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v9].text,"형의 분노를 예상했고, 그 분노를 숫자로 눌러 보려 했습니다. 지금은 그게 잘못임을 압니다.",I expected my brother's anger and tried to press that anger down with numbers. Now I know that was wrong.,兄の怒りを予想し、その怒りを数字で抑えようとしました。今はそれが間違いだったと分かります。,我预料到哥哥会愤怒，想用数字压住那份愤怒。现在我知道那是错的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v1].text,막으려 한 건 형이 끝까지 파고드는 상황이었습니다. 그 끝이 어디로 갈지 저는 두려웠습니다.,What I tried to stop was my brother digging all the way in. I was afraid of where that would end.,私が止めようとしたのは、兄が最後まで掘り下げる状況でした。その先がどこへ行くのか怖かったのです。,我想阻止的是哥哥追问到底的情况。我害怕那会走到哪里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v10].text,저는 돈보다 설명을 막았습니다. 설명을 시작하면 멈출 수 없을 것 같았습니다.,"I blocked the explanation, not the money. Once the explanation started, I thought it could not be stopped.",私が止めたのは金ではなく説明でした。説明を始めれば止められないと思いました。,我挡住的不是钱，而是解释。我觉得解释一旦开始就停不下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v2].text,돈이 목적이었다면 제 몫을 낮추지 않았을 겁니다. 저는 다툼이 커지는 걸 막고 싶었습니다.,"If money had been my goal, I would not have lowered my share. I wanted to stop the fight from growing.",金が目的なら、私の取り分を下げなかったはずです。争いが大きくなるのを止めたかったのです。,如果目的是钱，我就不会降低自己的份额。我想阻止争执扩大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v3].text,자필 연습본대로 가면 형은 비율에서 멈추지 않을 사람입니다. 그 다음 질문이 무서웠습니다.,"If we followed the handwritten draft, my brother would not stop at the ratio. I was afraid of the next question.",自筆下書きどおりに進めば、兄は比率で止まらない人です。次の質問が怖かったのです。,如果照亲笔草稿走，哥哥不会停在比例上。我害怕下一个问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v4].text,제가 막으려 한 건 상속 싸움의 크기였습니다. 그 안에 더 깊은 사정이 얽혀 있었습니다.,What I tried to stop was the size of the inheritance fight. Deeper circumstances were tangled inside it.,私が止めようとしたのは相続争いの大きさでした。その中にはもっと深い事情が絡んでいました。,我想阻止的是继承争执的规模。里面还缠着更深的情况。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v5].text,형이 이유를 묻기 시작하면 어머니 말년 전체가 법정에 올라올 것 같았습니다.,"If my brother began asking why, Mother's entire final years would have been brought into court.",兄が理由を尋ね始めれば、母の晩年全体が法廷に上がると思いました。,如果哥哥开始追问理由，母亲整个晚年都会被带上法庭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v6].text,단순한 양보가 아니었습니다. 어떤 질문은 나오지 않게 해야 한다고 제가 판단했습니다.,It was not a simple concession. I decided that certain questions had to be kept from coming out.,単純な譲歩ではありませんでした。ある質問は出ないようにしなければならないと私が判断しました。,那不是单纯的让步。我判断有些问题不能被问出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v7].text,"재판관님, 저는 형의 분노가 어머니에게까지 돌아갈까 봐 겁났습니다.","Your Honor, I was afraid my brother's anger would turn back toward Mother.",裁判官、兄の怒りが母にまで向くのではないかと怖かったのです。,法官，我害怕哥哥的愤怒会转向母亲。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v8].text,그 숫자는 제게 안전장치처럼 보였습니다. 지금 생각하면 위험한 숨김이었습니다.,"Those numbers looked to me like a safety device. Thinking now, they were a dangerous concealment.",その数字は私には安全装置のように見えました。今思えば、危険な隠蔽でした。,那些数字在我看来像安全装置。现在想来，那是危险的隐瞒。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|early].variants[dc-2-b-q2-early-v9].text,자필 연습본이 드러나면 형이 자신만 밀려났다고 느낄 거라 봤습니다. 그 반응을 막고 싶었습니다.,"If the handwritten draft came out, I thought my brother would feel he alone had been pushed aside. I wanted to stop that reaction.",自筆下書きが出れば、兄は自分だけが押しのけられたと感じるだろうと思いました。その反応を止めたかったのです。,如果亲笔草稿暴露，我以为哥哥会觉得只有自己被排除在外。我想阻止这种反应。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v1].text,막으려 한 건 형이 그 사실을 알게 되는 일이었습니다. 돈보다 그 충격이 두려웠습니다.,What I tried to stop was my brother learning that fact. I feared that shock more than money.,私が止めようとしたのは、兄がその事実を知ることでした。金よりも、その衝撃が怖かったのです。,我想阻止的是哥哥知道那个事实。比起钱，我更害怕那种冲击。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v10].text,"막으려 했던 것은 결국 제 두려움이었습니다. 형이 무너질까 봐, 제가 진실을 전할 자신이 없었습니다.","What I tried to stop, in the end, was my own fear. I feared my brother would collapse, and I lacked the confidence to tell the truth.",結局、私が止めようとしたものは自分の恐れでした。兄が崩れるのが怖く、真実を伝える自信がありませんでした。,归根到底，我想阻止的是自己的恐惧。我怕哥哥崩溃，也没有把真相告诉他的信心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v2].text,"자필 연습본대로 두면 형은 왜 자신이 그렇게 적은지 묻고, 결국 자기 출생까지 마주할 수밖에 없었습니다.","If the handwritten draft stood, my brother would ask why he had so little, and eventually he would have to face his own birth.",自筆下書きのままなら、兄はなぜ自分がそんなに少ないのかを尋ね、結局は自分の出生と向き合わざるを得なかったでしょう。,如果亲笔草稿照原样存在，哥哥会问为什么自己那么少，最终也不得不面对自己的出生问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v3].text,"저는 오래 얽힌 돈과 어머니 일기, 제 출생과 관련한 민감한 사실이 한꺼번에 터질까 봐 제 몫을 90에서 60으로 낮췄습니다.","I lowered my share from 90 to 60 because I feared the long-entangled money, Mother's diary, and a sensitive fact tied to my birth would all burst out at once.",長く絡んだ金、母の日記、私の出生に関わる敏感な事実が一度に噴き出すのではないかと怖くて、私の取り分を90から60へ下げました。,我把自己的份额从90降到60，是因为害怕长期纠缠的钱、母亲日记以及与我出生有关的敏感事实会一次爆开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v4].text,형을 지키겠다는 명분으로 진실을 막았습니다. 그 과정에서 어머니 뜻도 제 손으로 막았습니다.,"In the name of protecting my brother, I blocked the truth. In that process, I also blocked Mother's wishes with my own hands.",兄を守るという名目で、真実を塞ぎました。その過程で、母の意思も私の手で塞ぎました。,我以保护哥哥为名挡住了真相。在这个过程中，我也亲手挡住了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v5].text,"재판관님, 돈을 지키려 한 게 아니라 형이 무너지는 장면을 피하려 한 겁니다. 그래도 위조는 위조입니다.","Your Honor, I was not trying to protect money; I was trying to avoid the sight of my brother collapsing. Still, forgery is forgery.",裁判官、金を守ろうとしたのではなく、兄が崩れる場面を避けようとしたのです。それでも、偽造は偽造です。,法官，我不是想守住钱，而是想避开哥哥崩溃的场面。即便如此，伪造就是伪造。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v6].text,제가 막은 건 상속 다툼이 아니라 형의 삶 전체를 흔들 사실이었습니다. 그 판단을 제가 할 권리는 없었습니다.,What I blocked was not an inheritance dispute but a fact that could shake my brother's whole life. I had no right to make that judgment.,私が止めたのは相続争いではなく、兄の人生全体を揺るがす事実でした。その判断を私がする権利はありませんでした。,我挡住的不是继承争执，而是可能动摇哥哥整个人生的事实。我没有权利替他作这个判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v7].text,형에게 덜 아픈 숫자를 골라 주겠다는 생각 자체가 오만했습니다. 그래서 이 자리까지 왔습니다.,The very idea that I would choose less painful numbers for my brother was arrogant. That is why we came this far.,兄にとって痛みの少ない数字を選んでやるという考え自体が傲慢でした。だからここまで来ました。,认为自己可以替哥哥选择没那么痛的数字，这个想法本身就是傲慢。所以才走到这里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v8].text,법정까지 오지 않게 하려 했다는 말은 맞습니다. 하지만 그 말이 문서를 고친 책임을 지우지는 못합니다.,It is true I tried to keep the matter from coming to court. But those words cannot erase my responsibility for changing the document.,法廷まで来ないようにしようとしたという言葉は事実です。しかし、その言葉が文書を直した責任を消すことはできません。,说我想避免走到法庭，这是事实。但这句话不能抹去我修改文件的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|late].variants[dc-2-b-q2-late-v9].text,"저는 형을 진실에서 떼어 놓으려 했고, 어머니의 마지막 뜻도 함께 떼어 냈습니다.","I tried to keep my brother away from the truth, and I took away Mother's final wishes with it.",私は兄を真実から遠ざけようとし、母の最後の意思も一緒に切り離しました。,我试图把哥哥和真相隔开，也一并割离了母亲最后的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v1].text,막으려 한 건 자필 연습본 비율의 이유였습니다. 형이 그걸 묻기 시작하면 제가 오래 숨긴 돈도 같이 열릴 수 있었습니다.,"What I tried to stop was the reason behind the handwritten draft's ratio. If my brother began asking about that, the money I had long hidden could also come out.",私が止めようとしたのは、自筆下書きの比率の理由でした。兄がそれを尋ね始めれば、私が長く隠してきた金も一緒に開かれる可能性がありました。,我想阻止的是亲笔草稿比例背后的理由。哥哥一旦开始追问，我长期隐藏的钱也可能一起被打开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v10].text,제가 막으려 한 건 형의 분노와 그 뒤의 질문이었습니다. 책임은 그때부터 이미 생겼습니다.,What I tried to stop was my brother's anger and the questions after it. Responsibility had already begun there.,私が止めようとしたのは兄の怒りと、その後の質問でした。責任はその時からすでに生じていました。,我想阻止的是哥哥的愤怒，以及愤怒之后的问题。责任从那时起就已经产生了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v2].text,저는 형이 왜 어머니가 제 쪽으로 그렇게 크게 기울었는지 묻게 될까 봐 두려웠습니다.,I feared my brother would ask why Mother had leaned so heavily toward me.,兄が、なぜ母が私の側へそこまで大きく傾いたのかを尋ねるのが怖かったのです。,我害怕哥哥会问，为什么母亲会那么明显地倾向我这一边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v3].text,돈이 아니라 질문을 막으려 했습니다. 그 질문은 어머니 기록과 제가 도운 돈으로 이어질 수밖에 없었습니다.,"I was trying to block the question, not the money. That question would inevitably lead to Mother's records and the money I had provided.",止めようとしたのは金ではなく質問でした。その質問は、母の記録と私が支援した金へつながるしかなかったからです。,我想挡住的不是钱，而是问题。那个问题必然会通向母亲的记录和我提供的钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v4].text,최종본은 형의 분노를 잠깐 늦추려는 제멋대로의 장치였습니다. 정당한 방법은 아니었습니다.,The final copy was my arbitrary device to delay my brother's anger for a while. It was not a lawful method.,最終本は、兄の怒りをしばらく遅らせようとする私の身勝手な装置でした。正当な方法ではありませんでした。,最终本是我擅自用来暂时延缓哥哥愤怒的装置。那不是正当方法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v5].text,형이 자필 연습본을 보면 자신이 버려졌다고 느낄 겁니다. 저는 그 감정이 더 깊은 사실로 번지는 걸 막으려 했습니다.,"If my brother saw the handwritten draft, he would feel abandoned. I tried to stop that feeling from spreading into deeper facts.",兄が自筆下書きを見れば、自分が捨てられたと感じるでしょう。私はその感情がさらに深い事実へ広がるのを止めようとしました。,哥哥如果看到亲笔草稿，会觉得自己被抛弃。我试图阻止这种情绪扩散到更深的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v6].text,어머니가 남긴 이유를 설명하려면 제가 감춘 돈까지 말해야 했습니다. 그걸 피하려 숫자를 고쳤습니다.,"To explain why Mother left the handwritten draft, I would have had to speak about the money I had hidden. I altered the numbers to avoid that.",母がその理由を残したことを説明するには、私が隠していた金まで話さなければなりませんでした。それを避けるために数字を変えました。,要解释母亲留下那个理由，就必须说到我隐藏的钱。我为了避开这一点才改了数字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v7].text,"재판관님, 저는 법정까지 오지 않게 하려고 했습니다. 그 과정에서 법을 어겼습니다.","Your Honor, I tried to keep it from coming to court. In the process, I broke the law.",裁判官、私は法廷まで来ないようにしようとしました。その過程で法を犯しました。,法官，我试图不让事情走到法庭。在这个过程中，我违法了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v8].text,"형을 달래려 했다고 말할 수 있지만, 사실은 형에게 필요한 설명을 막은 겁니다.","I can say I tried to calm my brother, but in truth I blocked the explanation he needed.",兄をなだめようとしたと言うことはできます。しかし実際には、兄に必要な説明を止めたのです。,我可以说自己是想安抚哥哥。但事实上，我挡住了他所需要的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q2-mid-v9].text,자필 연습본을 막으면 모두가 덜 다칠 거라고 믿었습니다. 그 믿음이 어머니 뜻을 다시 훼손했습니다.,I believed that blocking the handwritten draft would hurt everyone less. That belief damaged Mother's wishes again.,自筆下書きを止めれば皆が少しは傷つかずに済むと信じました。その信念が母の意思を再び傷つけました。,我相信挡住亲笔草稿能让所有人少受伤。这个信念再次伤害了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v1].text,제 돈이 어머니 쪽으로 들어간 건 맞습니다. 그 돈이 집안에 쓰인 것도 알고 있었습니다.,It is true my money went through Mother's side. I also knew that money was used for the household.,私の金が母のほうへ入ったのは事実です。その金が家のために使われたことも知っていました。,我的钱确实进了母亲那边。我也知道那些钱被用于家里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v10].text,도움이 있었다는 건 인정합니다. 다만 그걸 형에게 빚처럼 남기고 싶지 않았습니다.,I admit there was help. But I did not want it to remain to my brother like a debt.,支援があったことは認めます。ただ、それを兄への借りのように残したくありませんでした。,我承认有过帮助。但我不想让它以债的形式留给哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v2].text,그렇게 이어진 정황을 완전히 모른 척할 수는 없습니다. 다만 규모를 내세우고 싶지는 않았습니다.,I cannot completely pretend not to know the circumstances that continued that way. I simply did not want to put the scale forward.,そのように続いた事情を完全に知らないふりはできません。ただ、規模を前に出したくはありませんでした。,那样持续下来的情况，我不能完全装作不知道。只是我不想强调规模。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v3].text,제가 보낸 돈이 형 쪽 필요로 흘러간 적이 있습니다. 그걸 거래처럼 말하고 싶지 않았습니다.,There were times when money I sent flowed to my brother's needs. I did not want to speak of it like a transaction.,私が送った金が兄の必要へ流れたことがあります。それを取引のように話したくありませんでした。,我送的钱有时流向了哥哥的需要。我不想把它说得像交易一样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v4].text,어머니 통장을 거친 돈 중 제 몫이 섞인 건 사실입니다. 형에게 말하지 않았을 뿐입니다.,It is true that some of the money through Mother's account included my share. I just did not tell my brother.,母の通帳を経た金の中に私の分が混じっていたのは事実です。兄に言わなかっただけです。,经过母亲账户的钱里混有我的部分，这是事实。只是我没有告诉哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v5].text,돈의 출처가 단순히 어머니만은 아니었습니다. 그 정도는 이제 말씀드릴 수 있습니다.,The source of the money was not simply Mother. That much I can now tell you.,金の出所は単純に母だけではありませんでした。その程度は今申し上げられます。,钱的来源并不只是母亲。至少这一点我现在可以说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v6].text,"재판관님, 제가 도운 부분은 있습니다. 하지만 그걸 자랑처럼 세우고 싶지는 않았습니다.","Your Honor, there were parts where I helped. But I did not want to set that up like a boast.",裁判官、私が助けた部分はあります。しかし、それを自慢のように立てたくはありませんでした。,法官，我确实有帮忙的部分。但我不想把它摆出来像是在炫耀。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v7].text,형이 알면 고마움보다 모욕으로 받을까 봐 계속 덮었습니다.,I kept covering it up because I feared my brother would take it as humiliation rather than gratitude.,兄が知れば感謝より屈辱として受け取るのではないかと思い、ずっと覆っていました。,我一直遮掩，是怕哥哥知道后感到的不是感激，而是羞辱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v8].text,공장 쪽으로 간 돈도 일부는 제 쪽에서 시작됐습니다. 그 사실을 오래 숨겼습니다.,Some of the money that went to the factory also began on my side. I hid that fact for a long time.,工場のほうへ行った金の一部も、私の側から始まりました。その事実を長く隠しました。,流向工厂的钱也有一部分从我这边开始。我把这个事实藏了很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v9].text,그 돈을 제 이름으로 남기지 않은 건 의도적이었습니다. 형을 자극하고 싶지 않았습니다.,Leaving that money out of my name was intentional. I did not want to provoke my brother.,その金を私の名前で残さなかったのは意図的でした。兄を刺激したくありませんでした。,没有用我的名义留下那笔钱，是有意的。我不想刺激哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v1].text,"20년 넘게 매달 보냈고, 형 공장 위기 때 큰돈도 제가 메웠습니다. 형은 그걸 어머니 돈으로 알았습니다.","For more than twenty years I sent money every month, and when my brother's factory was in crisis, I covered a large amount as well. My brother believed it was Mother's money.",20年以上、毎月送り、兄の工場が危機の時には大きな金も私が補いました。兄はそれを母の金だと思っていました。,二十多年里我每月汇钱，哥哥工厂遇到危机时，大笔资金也是我补上的。哥哥以为那是母亲的钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v10].text,"정기 지원금과 사업장 자금의 상당 부분이 제 돈이었다는 점, 이제는 더 숨기지 않겠습니다.",I will no longer hide that a substantial part of the regular support and business funds was my money.,定期支援金と事業場資金の相当部分が私の金だったことを、もう隠しません。,定期支援金和事业资金中相当一部分是我的钱，这一点我不会再隐藏。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v2].text,"재판관님, 정기 지원금과 사업장 자금 상당수는 제 돈이었습니다. 저는 그 사실을 숨기도록 구조를 만들었습니다.","Your Honor, much of the regular support and business funds was my money. I built the structure that hid that fact.",裁判官、定期支援金と事業場資金の多くは私の金でした。私はその事実を隠す仕組みを作りました。,法官，定期支援金和事业资金中很多都是我的钱。我制造了隐藏这一事实的结构。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v3].text,제가 보낸 돈이 어머니 계좌를 거쳐 형에게 갔습니다. 우연이 아니라 제가 택한 방식이었습니다.,The money I sent went through Mother's account to my brother. It was not by chance; it was the method I chose.,私が送った金は、母の口座を通って兄へ行きました。偶然ではなく、私が選んだ方法でした。,我汇出的钱经过母亲的账户到了哥哥那里。这不是偶然，而是我选择的方式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v4].text,"형이 동생 돈으로 버텼다는 사실을 모르게 하려고, 어머니 이름을 앞에 세웠습니다.",I put Mother's name in front so my brother would not know he had been getting by on his younger brother's money.,兄が弟の金で持ちこたえていたと知らないように、母の名前を前に立てました。,为了不让哥哥知道自己是靠弟弟的钱撑过来的，我把母亲的名字放在了前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v5].text,그 도움은 한두 번에 그치지 않았습니다. 오랜 시간 형의 생활과 공장을 받친 흐름이었습니다.,That help did not happen only once or twice. It was a flow that supported my brother's life and factory for a long time.,その支援は一度や二度ではありません。長い間、兄の生活と工場を支えた流れでした。,那份帮助不是一两次。它是长期支撑哥哥生活和工厂的一股资金流。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v6].text,형이 알면 자존심보다 정체성이 먼저 흔들릴 거라 봤습니다. 그래서 끝까지 숨겼습니다.,"I thought that if my brother knew, his identity would shake before his pride. So I hid it until the end.",兄が知れば、誇りより先に自分の立場が揺らぐと思いました。だから最後まで隠しました。,我认为哥哥如果知道，先动摇的不是自尊，而是他的身份认同。所以我一直藏到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v7].text,"돈을 보낸 사람도 저이고, 그 돈의 출처를 흐린 사람도 저입니다. 그 책임을 인정합니다.","I am the one who sent the money, and I am also the one who blurred where it came from. I admit that responsibility.",金を送ったのも私で、その金の出所を曖昧にしたのも私です。その責任を認めます。,汇钱的人是我，把钱的来源弄模糊的人也是我。我承认这个责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v8].text,어머니가 도운 것처럼 보인 많은 돈의 뒤에 제가 있었습니다. 형은 그걸 알 기회가 없었습니다.,"Behind much of the money that looked like Mother's help, I was there. My brother had no chance to know that.",母が助けたように見えた多くの金の後ろに、私がいました。兄にはそれを知る機会がありませんでした。,许多看起来像母亲帮助的钱背后，其实有我在。哥哥没有机会知道这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v9].text,"저는 선의라고 믿었지만, 형이 진실을 알 권리까지 제가 막은 셈입니다.","I believed it was goodwill, but it also meant I blocked my brother's right to know the truth.",私は善意だと信じていましたが、兄が真実を知る権利まで私が塞いだことになります。,我相信那是善意，但这也等于我挡住了哥哥知道真相的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"오래 정기 지원금을 보냈고, 형 사업장 자금에도 제 돈이 섞였습니다. 어머니 이름으로 보이게 했습니다.","I sent regular support for a long time, and my money was mixed into my brother's business funds as well. I made it look like Mother's name.",長く定期支援金を送り、兄の事業場資金にも私の金が混じりました。母の名前で見えるようにしました。,我长期汇出定期支援金，哥哥的事业资金里也混有我的钱。我让它看起来像是母亲的名义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v10].text,제가 보낸 돈이 형을 받친 건 맞습니다. 다만 그 사실을 감춘 이유가 더 중요했습니다.,It is true the money I sent supported my brother. But the reason I hid that fact mattered more.,私が送った金が兄を支えたのは事実です。ただ、その事実を隠した理由のほうが重要でした。,我送的钱支撑了哥哥，这是事实。但我隐藏这个事实的理由更重要。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].text,상당수는 제 돈이었습니다. 형이 어머니가 돕는다고 믿도록 제가 그 구조를 그대로 뒀습니다.,A substantial part was my money. I left the structure as it was so my brother could believe Mother was helping him.,かなりの部分は私の金でした。兄が母に助けられていると信じられるよう、その構造をそのままにしました。,相当一部分是我的钱。我让这个结构维持下去，让哥哥相信是母亲在帮助他。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].text,형이 받아들이지 않을 걸 알고 설명을 미뤘습니다. 그래서 돈 문제를 혼자 안고 가려 했습니다.,"I knew my brother would not accept it, so I put off explaining. I tried to carry the money issue alone.",兄が受け入れないと分かっていて説明を先延ばしにしました。金の問題を一人で抱えていこうとしました。,我知道哥哥不会接受，所以推迟说明。我想一个人承担钱的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].text,형이 버틴 돈 중에는 제가 보낸 돈이 있었습니다. 저는 그 사실을 일부러 말하지 않았습니다.,"Among the money my brother lived on, some was money I sent. I deliberately did not tell him.",兄が持ちこたえた金の中には、私が送った金がありました。私はその事実をわざと言いませんでした。,哥哥撑下来的钱里有我汇出的部分。我是故意没有告诉他。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].text,어머니 통장을 통로로 둔 건 형의 체면 때문이었습니다. 직접 받으면 못 견딜 거라 봤습니다.,I used Mother's account as the passage because of my brother's pride. I thought he could not bear receiving it directly.,母の通帳を通路にしたのは、兄の体面のためでした。直接受け取れば耐えられないと思いました。,我把母亲的账户作为通道，是为了哥哥的体面。我觉得他无法承受直接接受我的钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v6].text,그 돈의 방향을 알고도 계속 보냈습니다. 형이 모르게 하는 게 더 낫다고 믿었습니다.,I knew the direction of that money and kept sending it. I believed it was better that my brother not know.,その金の方向を知りながら、送り続けました。兄が知らないほうがいいと信じていました。,我明知那笔钱的流向，还是继续汇。我相信哥哥不知道会比较好。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v7].text,정기 지원금만이 아니라 공장 위기 때 들어간 큰돈도 제 쪽에서 나간 적이 있습니다.,It was not only regular support; large sums sent during the factory crisis also came from my side at times.,定期支援金だけではなく、工場危機の時に入った大きな金も、私の側から出たことがあります。,不只是定期支援金，工厂危机时流入的大笔资金也有从我这边出去的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v8].text,저는 그 돈을 드러내면 형이 도움보다 굴욕을 먼저 느낄 거라고 생각했습니다.,"I thought if I revealed that money, my brother would feel humiliation before help.",その金を明らかにすれば、兄は支援より屈辱を先に感じると思いました。,我认为如果把那笔钱说出来，哥哥先感到的会是屈辱，而不是帮助。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v9].text,형이 모르던 도움이 꽤 오래 이어졌습니다. 그걸 어머니 도움처럼 남겨 둔 사람은 저입니다.,Help my brother did not know about continued for quite a long time. I am the one who left it looking like Mother's help.,兄が知らなかった支援はかなり長く続きました。それを母の支援のように残したのは私です。,哥哥不知道的帮助持续了很久。让它看起来像母亲帮助的人是我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v1].text,형에게 말하면 도움보다 모욕으로 남을 것 같았습니다. 그래서 어머니 이름 뒤에 숨겼습니다.,"If I told my brother, I thought it would remain as humiliation rather than help. So I hid behind Mother's name.",兄に言えば、支援よりも屈辱として残ると思いました。だから母の名前の後ろに隠しました。,如果告诉哥哥，我觉得那会留下的不是帮助，而是羞辱。所以我躲在母亲的名字后面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v10].text,그 침묵이 오래 갈수록 말할 수 없게 됐습니다. 처음부터 잘못된 숨김이었습니다.,"The longer that silence lasted, the harder it became to speak. It was a wrong concealment from the start.",その沈黙が長引くほど、言えなくなりました。最初から誤った隠し方でした。,沉默拖得越久，就越说不出口。从一开始，这就是错误的隐瞒。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v2].text,형은 체면을 먼저 보는 사람입니다. 제 돈이라고 알면 받지 않았을 겁니다.,"My brother is someone who puts pride first. If he knew it was my money, he would not have accepted it.",兄は体面を先に見る人です。私の金だと知れば受け取らなかったでしょう。,哥哥是先看体面的人。如果知道是我的钱，他不会接受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v3].text,말하지 않은 건 우위를 잡으려는 뜻이 아니었습니다. 형이 상처받을까 봐 피했습니다.,Not telling him was not meant to gain the upper hand. I avoided it because I thought he would be hurt.,言わなかったのは優位に立つためではありませんでした。兄が傷つくと思って避けました。,我不说，并不是想占上风。而是怕哥哥受伤，所以回避了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v4].text,그 돈이 형에게 빚처럼 느껴지지 않길 바랐습니다. 그래서 출처를 흐렸습니다.,I hoped that money would not feel like a debt to him. So I blurred its source.,その金が兄に借りのように感じられないことを望みました。だから出所を曖昧にしました。,我希望那笔钱对哥哥来说不要像债。所以我模糊了来源。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v5].text,어머니가 도와준 모양이면 형이 조금은 편하게 받을 수 있다고 생각했습니다.,"I thought if it looked like Mother's help, my brother could accept it a little more easily.",母が助けた形なら、兄が少しは楽に受け取れると思いました。,我觉得如果看起来是母亲帮的，哥哥会稍微更容易接受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v6].text,"재판관님, 저는 형 자존심을 먼저 생각했습니다. 그 판단이 옳았는지는 모르겠습니다.","Your Honor, I thought of my brother's pride first. I do not know whether that judgment was right.",裁判官、私は兄の自尊心を先に考えました。その判断が正しかったかは分かりません。,法官，我首先考虑的是哥哥的自尊。那个判断是否正确，我不知道。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v7].text,형에게 직접 말하는 순간 관계가 더 멀어질 것 같았습니다.,"The moment I told my brother directly, I thought our relationship would grow more distant.",兄に直接話した瞬間、関係がさらに遠ざかると思いました。,我觉得只要直接告诉哥哥，关系就会变得更远。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v8].text,고마워하라는 뜻으로 보낸 돈이 아니어서 더 말하지 않았습니다.,"I did not send the money to make him grateful, so I said even less.",感謝しろという意味で送った金ではなかったので、なおさら言いませんでした。,我汇钱不是为了让他感激，所以更没有说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|early].variants[dc-3-b-q2-early-v9].text,제가 먼저 말하지 않은 돈 문제가 있습니다. 아직 그 선택을 어떻게 설명해야 할지 모르겠습니다.,There is a money issue I did not speak of first. I still do not know how to explain that choice.,私が先に話さなかった金の問題があります。その選択をどう説明すべきか、まだ分かりません。,有一件钱的问题，是我没有先说出来的。我还不知道该如何解释这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v1].text,"형이 어머니 사랑으로 믿은 돈이 사실 제 돈이라는 걸 알면, 지난 삶 전체를 의심할까 두려웠습니다.","I was afraid that if my brother learned the money he believed was Mother's love was actually mine, he would doubt his entire past life.",兄が母の愛だと信じていた金が実は私の金だと知れば、これまでの人生全体を疑うのではないかと怖かったのです。,我害怕哥哥如果知道他以为是母亲爱意的钱其实是我的，会开始怀疑自己过去的一整段人生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v10].text,이제 인정합니다. 형의 자존심을 지킨다는 말로 형의 진실을 제가 오래 미뤘습니다.,"I admit it now. In the name of protecting my brother's pride, I postponed his truth for a long time.",今は認めます。兄の自尊心を守るという言葉で、兄の真実を長く先送りしました。,现在我承认。我用保护哥哥自尊的说法，把属于他的真相拖延了很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v2].text,"재판관님, 저는 형의 자존심이 아니라 정체성이 무너질까 봐 말하지 못했습니다.","Your Honor, I could not speak not because of my brother's pride, but because I feared his identity would collapse.",裁判官、私は兄の自尊心ではなく、兄のアイデンティティが崩れるのではないかと怖くて言えませんでした。,法官，我说不出口，不是因为哥哥的自尊，而是害怕他的身份认同会崩塌。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v3].text,돈의 출처를 밝히면 곧 그 사실의 이유까지 이어질 수 있었습니다. 그래서 더 숨겼습니다.,"If I revealed the source of the money, it could lead straight to the reason behind that fact. So I hid it even more.",金の出所を明かせば、その事実の理由にまでつながりかねませんでした。だからさらに隠しました。,如果揭开钱的来源，就会连到这个事实背后的原因。所以我更加隐瞒。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v4].text,형이 받은 도움을 사랑이 아니라 속임수로 느낄까 봐 겁났습니다. 그렇게 두려워하다가 20년 동안 말하지 못했습니다.,"I feared my brother would feel the help he received was deception, not love. Out of that fear, I could not speak for twenty years.",兄が受けた支援を愛ではなく欺きだと感じるのではないかと怖かったのです。その恐れのまま、20年間言えませんでした。,我害怕哥哥会把自己得到的帮助感受成欺骗，而不是爱。因为这种恐惧，我二十年都没能说出口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v5].text,"상대에게 알려지길 피하려 했다는 말은 맞지만, 형에게 진실을 고를 권리를 빼앗은 것도 맞습니다.","It is true that I tried to avoid the other side knowing, but it is also true that I took away my brother's right to choose the truth.",相手に知られるのを避けようとしたという言葉は正しいですが、兄が真実を選ぶ権利を奪ったのも正しいです。,我确实试图避免对方知道，但我也确实夺走了哥哥选择真相的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v6].text,어머니 이름으로 감춘 돈은 형을 보호한다는 명분이었고 동시에 제 비겁함이었습니다.,"The money hidden under Mother's name was my excuse of protecting my brother, and at the same time my cowardice.",母の名前で隠した金は、兄を守るという名目であり、同時に私の臆病さでした。,用母亲名义隐藏的钱，是我保护哥哥的名义，也同时是我的怯懦。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v7].text,저는 형이 동생 돈으로 버텼다는 사실을 견디지 못할 거라 단정했습니다. 그 단정이 잘못이었습니다.,I decided that my brother could not bear the fact that he had relied on his younger brother's money. That decision was wrong.,兄が弟の金で持ちこたえたという事実に耐えられないと、私が決めつけました。その決めつけが間違っていました。,我断定哥哥无法承受自己靠弟弟的钱撑下来的事实。这个断定是错的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v8].text,형이 평생 믿은 기반이 흔들릴까 봐 제가 대신 숨겼습니다. 그 대신 숨길 권리는 제게 없었습니다.,I hid it in his place because I feared the foundation he had believed in all his life would shake. I had no right to hide it for him.,兄が一生信じてきた基盤が揺らぐのではないかと思い、私が代わりに隠しました。代わりに隠す権利は私にはありませんでした。,我担心哥哥一生相信的基础会动摇，所以替他隐瞒。但我没有替他隐瞒的权利。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|late].variants[dc-3-b-q2-late-v9].text,20년 동안 말하지 않은 이유는 결국 두려움입니다. 형이 저를 미워하는 것보다 자신을 잃을까 봐 두려웠습니다.,The reason I did not speak for twenty years was fear. I was more afraid he would lose himself than that he would hate me.,20年間言わなかった理由は、結局は恐れです。兄が私を憎むことより、自分を失うことのほうが怖かったのです。,二十年没说的理由，归根到底是恐惧。比起哥哥恨我，我更怕他失去自己。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v1].text,형이 장남으로 버틴 자리를 제가 깨고 싶지 않았습니다. 그래서 제가 보낸 돈을 어머니 도움처럼 남겼습니다.,I did not want to break the place my brother had held as eldest son. So I left the money I sent looking like Mother's help.,兄が長男として支えてきた場所を私が壊したくありませんでした。だから私が送った金を母の支援のように残しました。,我不想打破哥哥作为长子支撑下来的位置。所以我把自己汇的钱留成像母亲的帮助。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v10].text,말하지 않은 이유는 형을 낮추고 싶지 않았기 때문입니다. 그 마음이 진실을 늦췄습니다.,I did not speak because I did not want to lower my brother. That feeling delayed the truth.,言わなかった理由は、兄を低く見せたくなかったからです。その気持ちが真実を遅らせました。,我不说，是因为不想让哥哥显得低人一等。这个心情拖延了真相。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v2].text,제가 보냈다고 말하면 형은 고마움보다 수치심을 느꼈을 겁니다. 그걸 피하려 했습니다.,"If I said I sent it, my brother would have felt shame before gratitude. I tried to avoid that.",私が送ったと言えば、兄は感謝より恥を感じたでしょう。それを避けようとしました。,如果说是我汇的，哥哥先感到的会是羞耻，而不是感激。我想避开这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v3].text,어머니도 형이 제 돈을 직접 받는 모양을 힘들어할 걸 아셨습니다. 그래서 조용히 둔 겁니다.,Mother also knew my brother would struggle with receiving my money directly. So we left it quiet.,母も、兄が私の金を直接受け取る形をつらく思うと知っていました。だから静かにしておいたのです。,母亲也知道哥哥会难以接受直接拿我的钱。所以我们就安静地放着。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v4].text,형 자존심을 지킨다는 말로 제 침묵을 합리화했습니다. 지금은 그 말도 완전하지 않다는 걸 압니다.,I rationalized my silence by saying I was protecting my brother's pride. Now I know that statement is not complete either.,兄の自尊心を守るという言葉で、自分の沈黙を合理化しました。今はその言葉も完全ではないと分かります。,我用保护哥哥自尊这句话合理化自己的沉默。现在我知道，这句话也不完整。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v5].text,형에게는 어머니가 돕는다는 믿음이 버팀목이었습니다. 제가 그 믿음을 일부러 건드리지 않았습니다.,"For my brother, the belief that Mother was helping him was a support. I deliberately did not touch that belief.",兄にとって、母が助けてくれているという信念は支えでした。私はその信念をわざと触りませんでした。,对哥哥来说，母亲在帮助自己的信念是一种支柱。我故意没有碰那个信念。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v6].text,돈의 출처를 말하려면 형이 살아온 장남의 자리까지 흔들릴 수 있다고 봤습니다.,"To speak of the source of the money, I thought, could shake the eldest-son position my brother had lived in.",金の出所を話すには、兄が生きてきた長男の場所まで揺らぎかねないと思いました。,我认为一旦说出钱的来源，连哥哥一直以来作为长子的立足点都会动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v7].text,"재판관님, 저는 체면을 지켜준다고 생각했지만 결국 형을 모른 채 두었습니다.","Your Honor, I thought I was preserving his pride, but in the end I left my brother ignorant.",裁判官、私は体面を守っていると思いましたが、結局は兄を知らないままにしました。,法官，我以为自己是在维护体面，但最后只是让哥哥一直不知道。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v8].text,형이 동생에게 의지했다는 사실을 받아들이기 어렵다고 봤습니다. 그래서 계속 숨겼습니다.,I thought my brother would find it hard to accept that he had relied on his younger brother. So I kept hiding it.,兄が弟に頼っていた事実を受け入れにくいと思いました。だから隠し続けました。,我觉得哥哥很难接受自己依靠了弟弟。所以我一直隐瞒。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q2-mid-v9].text,제가 가족을 도운 것이라고 믿고 싶었습니다. 하지만 숨긴 대가는 형이 치렀습니다.,I wanted to believe I was helping the family. But my brother paid the cost of what I hid.,私は家族を助けたのだと信じたかったのです。ですが、隠した代償は兄が払いました。,我想相信自己是在帮助家人。但我隐藏的代价由哥哥付出了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v1].text,그 사실은 말년 기록을 정리하다 알게 됐습니다. 처음엔 저도 잘못 읽은 줄 알았습니다.,"I learned that fact while organizing records from Mother's final years. At first, I thought I had read it wrong too.",その事実は母の晩年の記録を整理している時に知りました。最初は私も読み間違えたのだと思いました。,那个事实是我整理母亲晚年记录时知道的。一开始我也以为自己看错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v10].text,어머니가 숨긴 말을 제가 꺼내도 되는지 판단하지 못했습니다. 그래서 침묵했습니다.,I could not decide whether I was allowed to bring out the words Mother had hidden. So I stayed silent.,母が隠した言葉を私が出してよいのか判断できませんでした。だから沈黙しました。,我无法判断自己是否可以把母亲隐藏的话说出来。所以我沉默了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v2].text,어머니가 남긴 글을 보며 알게 됐습니다. 너무 무거워서 곧장 누구에게도 말하지 못했습니다.,"I learned it while reading what Mother left behind. It was too heavy, and I could not tell anyone immediately.",母が残した文章を見て知りました。あまりに重く、すぐに誰にも言えませんでした。,我是看着母亲留下的文字知道的。那太沉重了，我无法立刻告诉任何人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v3].text,정확한 날짜보다 기억나는 건 충격입니다. 그 기록을 본 뒤 저는 혼자 확인을 반복했습니다.,"What I remember more than the exact date is the shock. After seeing that record, I checked it alone again and again.",正確な日付より覚えているのは衝撃です。その記録を見た後、私は一人で何度も確認しました。,比起准确日期，我记得更清楚的是冲击。看过那份记录后，我一个人反复确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v4].text,어머니 자료를 정리하던 중에 알았습니다. 형에게 바로 건넬 수 있는 말이 아니었습니다.,I learned it while organizing Mother's materials. It was not something I could hand straight to my brother.,母の資料を整理している中で知りました。兄にすぐ渡せる言葉ではありませんでした。,我是整理母亲资料时知道的。这不是能马上交给哥哥的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v5].text,그 사실을 안 순간부터 유서 문제도 다르게 보였습니다. 하지만 입 밖에 낼 자신이 없었습니다.,"From the moment I learned that fact, the will issue looked different. But I did not have the courage to say it aloud.",その事実を知った瞬間から、遺言書の問題も違って見えました。ですが、口に出す自信がありませんでした。,知道那个事实的瞬间起，遗嘱问题也变得不同了。但我没有勇气说出口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v6].text,"재판관님, 제가 먼저 알고도 침묵한 건 맞습니다. 다만 그 침묵이 가볍진 않았습니다.","Your Honor, it is true I knew first and stayed silent. But that silence was not light.",裁判官、私が先に知って沈黙したのは事実です。ただ、その沈黙は軽いものではありませんでした。,法官，我先知道却沉默，这是事实。但那份沉默并不轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v7].text,기록 하나로 끝난 일이 아니었습니다. 앞뒤 사정이 맞물려 더는 모른 척하기 어려웠습니다.,"It was not something that ended with one record. The surrounding circumstances fit together, and I could no longer pretend not to know.",記録一つで終わることではありませんでした。前後の事情がかみ合い、もう知らないふりは難しくなりました。,这不是一份记录就结束的事。前后情况连在一起，我很难再装作不知道。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v8].text,그때 저는 형보다 먼저 알아버린 사람이 됐습니다. 그 자체가 너무 무거웠습니다.,"At that time, I became the person who knew before my brother did. That alone was too heavy.",その時、私は兄より先に知ってしまった人になりました。それだけであまりに重かったです。,那时，我成了比哥哥先知道的人。仅这一点就太沉重了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v9].text,혼자 감당하려 한 건 잘해서가 아닙니다. 누구에게 말해야 할지 몰라 멈춰 있었습니다.,I did not try to bear it alone because I was good at it. I stopped because I did not know whom to tell.,一人で抱えようとしたのは、うまくできるからではありません。誰に言えばいいのか分からず、止まっていました。,我想一个人承担，并不是因为我做得好。而是不知道该告诉谁，所以停住了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v1].text,제 출생과 관련한 민감한 사실은 어머니 말년 일기장을 정리하다 알게 됐습니다. 그 사실은 제가 함부로 꺼낼 수 없는 내용이었습니다.,I learned the sensitive fact tied to my birth while organizing Mother's diary from her final years. It was not something I could bring up carelessly.,私の出生に関わる敏感な事実は、母の晩年の日記帳を整理している時に知りました。その事実は、私がむやみに持ち出せる内容ではありませんでした。,与我出生有关的敏感事实，是我整理母亲晚年日记时知道的。那不是我可以随便说出口的内容。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v10].text,형이 친자가 아니라는 사실을 제가 먼저 알았습니다. 그 후의 모든 선택은 두려움에서 벗어나지 못했습니다.,I learned before my brother that he was not Father's biological son. Every choice after that could not escape fear.,兄が父の実子ではないという事実を、私が先に知りました。その後のすべての選択は恐れから抜け出せませんでした。,我先知道了哥哥不是父亲亲生儿子的事实。之后所有选择都没能摆脱恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v2].text,"재판관님, 저는 어머니 기록과 오래된 서류를 보고 제 출생과 관련한 민감한 사실을 확인했습니다. 그 뒤 혼자 숨겼습니다.","Your Honor, I confirmed a sensitive fact tied to my birth by reading Mother's records and old documents. After that, I hid it alone.",裁判官、私は母の記録と古い書類を見て、私の出生に関わる敏感な事実を確認しました。その後、一人で隠しました。,法官，我看了母亲的记录和旧文件，确认了与我出生有关的敏感事实。之后我一个人把它藏了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v3].text,처음엔 부정하고 싶었습니다. 하지만 기록들이 형이 아버지의 친자가 아니라는 사실로 이어졌습니다.,"At first, I wanted to deny it. But the records led to the fact that my brother was not Father's biological son.",最初は否定したいと思いました。ですが、記録は兄が父の実子ではないという事実へつながりました。,一开始我想否认。但那些记录指向了哥哥不是父亲亲生儿子的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v4].text,"그 비밀을 알게 된 순간, 유서의 제 몫 90과 제가 보낸 돈이 모두 한 줄로 연결돼 보였습니다.","The moment I learned that secret, the 90 share in the will and the money I had sent all seemed to connect in one line.",その秘密を知った瞬間、遺言書の私の取り分90と私が送った金がすべて一本の線でつながって見えました。,知道那个秘密的瞬间，遗嘱里我90的份额和我汇出的钱，全都像连成了一条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v5].text,저는 형이 그 사실을 들으면 장남으로 살아온 삶이 무너질 거라 단정했습니다. 그래서 말하지 않았습니다.,"I decided that if my brother heard that fact, the life he had lived as eldest son would collapse. So I did not tell him.",兄がその事実を聞けば、長男として生きてきた人生が崩れると私が決めつけました。だから言いませんでした。,我断定哥哥如果听到那个事实，他作为长子活过的人生会崩塌。所以我没有说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v6].text,어머니가 숨긴 그 사실을 제가 대신 지킨다고 착각했습니다. 결국 형에게서 알 권리를 빼앗았습니다.,"I mistook myself for the one protecting the fact Mother had hidden. In the end, I took away my brother's right to know.",母が隠したその事実を、私が代わりに守っていると勘違いしました。結局、兄から知る権利を奪いました。,我误以为自己是在替母亲守住那个被隐藏的事实。最终，我夺走了哥哥的知情权。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v7].text,그 사실을 안 뒤 저는 법정까지 오지 않게 하려 했습니다. 형이 여기서 그 말을 듣게 될까 봐 두려웠습니다.,"After learning that fact, I tried to keep it from coming to court. I was afraid my brother would hear those words here.",その事実を知った後、私は法廷まで来ないようにしようとしました。兄がここでその言葉を聞くのが怖かったのです。,知道那个事实后，我试图不让事情走到法庭。我害怕哥哥会在这里听到那句话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v8].text,형과 관련한 그 사실을 혼자 쥔 채 문서 처리까지 제 방식으로 밀어붙였습니다. 지키려 했다는 말로 덮을 수 없는 책임입니다.,"Holding that fact about my brother alone, I pushed the document handling in my own way. It is a responsibility that cannot be covered by saying I was trying to protect him.",兄に関わるその事実を一人で握ったまま、文書処理まで自分のやり方で押し進めました。守ろうとしたという言葉では覆えない責任です。,我一个人握着与哥哥有关的那个事实，还把文件处理也按自己的方式推进。这份责任不能用“想保护他”来遮盖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v9].text,"재판관님, 저는 어머니 일기장을 본 사람이고, 형에게 말하지 않은 사람입니다. 변명하지 않겠습니다.","Your Honor, I am the person who saw Mother's diary, and the person who did not tell my brother. I will not make excuses.",裁判官、私は母の日記帳を見た人であり、兄に言わなかった人です。言い訳はしません。,法官，我是看过母亲日记的人，也是没有告诉哥哥的人。我不辩解。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v1].text,제 뿌리에 관한 그 사실은 어머니 일기와 오래된 서류가 맞물리며 알게 됐습니다.,I learned that fact about my roots through Mother's diary and old documents fitting together.,私の根に関わるその事実は、母の日記と古い書類がかみ合って分かりました。,关于我根源的那个事实，是母亲日记和旧文件相互印证后让我知道的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v10].text,혼자 감당하려 했다는 말은 맞습니다. 하지만 그건 강함이 아니라 겁이었습니다.,"It is true I tried to bear it alone. But that was fear, not strength.",一人で抱えようとしたという言葉は事実です。けれど、それは強さではなく恐れでした。,我确实想一个人承受。但那不是坚强，而是害怕。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v2].text,말년 기록을 정리하다 형이 믿어 온 가족의 자리가 다를 수 있다는 사실을 확인했습니다.,"While organizing records from Mother's final years, I confirmed that the family position my brother had believed in might not be what he thought.",母の晩年の記録を整理する中で、兄が信じてきた家族の位置が違うかもしれないという事実を確認しました。,整理母亲晚年记录时，我确认了哥哥一直相信的家庭位置可能并非如此。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v3].text,어머니가 남긴 문장과 자료가 한 결론으로 이어졌습니다. 저는 그때부터 혼자 버티기 시작했습니다.,"Mother's sentences and the materials she left led to one conclusion. From then on, I began enduring it alone.",母が残した文章と資料は一つの結論へつながりました。私はその時から一人で耐え始めました。,母亲留下的文字和资料导向同一个结论。从那时起，我开始独自承受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v4].text,그 사실을 알자마자 형에게 말할 수 없었습니다. 유서 비율과 돈의 흐름까지 같이 설명해야 했기 때문입니다.,I could not tell my brother as soon as I learned it. I would also have had to explain the will ratio and the money trail.,その事実を知った直後、兄に言うことはできませんでした。遺言書の比率と金の流れまで一緒に説明しなければならなかったからです。,知道那个事实后，我无法立刻告诉哥哥。因为遗嘱比例和钱的流向也必须一起说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"재판관님, 단순한 소문이 아니었습니다. 어머니 기록이 형의 삶에 관한 무거운 사실을 가리켰습니다.","Your Honor, it was not a simple rumor. Mother's records pointed to a heavy fact about my brother's life.",裁判官、単なる噂ではありませんでした。母の記録は兄の人生に関わる重い事実を示していました。,法官，那不是简单的传言。母亲的记录指向了与哥哥人生有关的沉重事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v6].text,저는 형이 알면 상속 문제가 아니라 자기 삶을 다시 보게 될 거라고 봤습니다.,"I thought that if my brother knew, it would not be an inheritance issue but a reason to look at his own life again.",兄が知れば、相続問題ではなく自分の人生を見直すことになると思いました。,我认为哥哥如果知道，那就不只是继承问题，而是要重新看待自己的人生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v7].text,"그때부터 저는 돈과 유서, 어머니 말년을 한꺼번에 묶어 생각했습니다. 그래서 더 침묵했습니다.","From then on, I thought of money, the will, and Mother's final years all at once. So I stayed even more silent.",その時から私は、金と遺言書、母の晩年を一度に結びつけて考えました。だからさらに沈黙しました。,从那时起，我把钱、遗嘱和母亲晚年一起捆在脑子里想。所以更加沉默。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v8].text,형에게 말하지 않은 건 진실을 독점하려던 게 아닙니다. 감당할 방법을 못 찾은 겁니다.,I did not keep it from my brother because I wanted to monopolize the truth. I could not find a way to handle it.,兄に言わなかったのは、真実を独占しようとしたからではありません。受け止める方法を見つけられなかったのです。,我没有告诉哥哥，并不是想独占真相。而是找不到承受和处理的方法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v9].text,"그 사실을 알게 된 뒤 저는 어머니 뜻을 그대로 둘 용기도, 형에게 말할 용기도 없었습니다.","After learning that fact, I had neither the courage to leave Mother's wishes as they were nor the courage to tell my brother.",その事実を知った後、私は母の意思をそのままにする勇気も、兄に話す勇気もありませんでした。,知道那个事实之后，我既没有勇气保持母亲的意愿原样，也没有勇气告诉哥哥。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v1].text,형이 그 사실을 알면 견디기 어려울 거라고 봤습니다. 그래서 일이 법정으로 커지는 게 두려웠습니다.,I thought my brother could hardly bear it if he learned that fact. That is why I feared the matter growing into a court case.,兄がその事実を知れば耐え難いだろうと思いました。だから事が法廷へ大きくなるのが怖かったのです。,我觉得哥哥知道那个事实后会难以承受。所以我害怕事情扩大到法庭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v10].text,그때는 다투지 않게 하는 것이 형을 지키는 길이라고 믿었습니다. 지금은 그 믿음도 흔들립니다.,"At the time, I believed keeping us from fighting was the way to protect my brother. Now that belief is shaken too.",その時は、争わないようにすることが兄を守る道だと信じていました。今はその信念も揺らいでいます。,当时我相信不让我们争起来就是保护哥哥的方式。现在这个信念也动摇了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v2].text,상속 이야기가 길어질수록 더 깊은 말이 나올 수밖에 없었습니다. 저는 그걸 막고 싶었습니다.,"The longer the inheritance discussion continued, the deeper words would have to come out. I wanted to stop that.",相続の話が長引くほど、もっと深い言葉が出ざるを得ませんでした。私はそれを止めたかったのです。,继承的话题拖得越久，更深的话就必然会出来。我想阻止那一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v3].text,형이 몰라도 된다고 생각한 건 아닙니다. 다만 그 순간에 알게 되는 건 너무 잔인하다고 봤습니다.,I did not think my brother did not need to know. I only thought learning it at that moment would be too cruel.,兄が知らなくていいと思ったわけではありません。ただ、その瞬間に知るのはあまりに残酷だと思いました。,我不是认为哥哥可以不知道。只是觉得在那个时刻让他知道太残酷了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v4].text,법정에 오면 기록이 다 열립니다. 저는 그 과정이 형에게 너무 큰 상처가 될까 봐 겁났습니다.,"If we came to court, the records would all open. I feared that process would wound my brother too deeply.",法廷に来れば、記録がすべて開かれます。その過程が兄にあまりに大きな傷になるのではないかと怖かったのです。,如果来到法庭，记录都会被打开。我害怕这个过程会给哥哥造成太大的伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v5].text,"재판관님, 제 판단은 상대에게 알려지길 피하려는 쪽이었습니다. 하지만 그 판단을 제가 해도 되는지는 별개입니다.","Your Honor, my judgment leaned toward avoiding the other side finding out. Whether I had the right to make that judgment is another matter.",裁判官、私の判断は相手に知られるのを避ける方向でした。しかし、その判断を私がしてよいのかは別問題です。,法官，我的判断偏向于避免对方知道。但我是否可以作出这种判断，是另一回事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v6].text,그 사실 하나가 상속보다 큰 문제라는 걸 알았습니다. 그래서 조용히 끝내려 했습니다.,I knew that one fact was a larger issue than inheritance. So I tried to end it quietly.,その事実一つが相続より大きな問題だと分かりました。だから静かに終わらせようとしました。,我知道那个事实本身比继承更大。所以我想安静地结束。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v7].text,형에게 말할 방법을 찾지 못했습니다. 그래서 법정에 오지 않게 막는 쪽으로만 생각했습니다.,I could not find a way to tell my brother. So I only thought about blocking the case from reaching court.,兄に話す方法を見つけられませんでした。だから法廷に来ないように止めることだけを考えました。,我找不到告诉哥哥的方法。所以只想着不让事情来到法庭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v8].text,형이 준비 없이 듣게 될까 봐 두려웠습니다. 두려워서 선택지를 너무 좁게 봤습니다.,"I feared my brother would hear it before he was ready. Out of fear, I narrowed the options too much.",兄が準備のないまま聞くのではないかと怖かったのです。怖くて選択肢をあまりに狭く見ました。,我害怕哥哥会在没有准备的情况下听到。因为害怕，我把选择看得太窄了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|early].variants[dc-4-b-q2-early-v9].text,제가 막으려 한 건 판결 자체보다 그 과정에서 나올 말들이었습니다.,"What I tried to stop was not the verdict itself, but the words that would come out during the process.",私が止めようとしたのは判決そのものより、その過程で出てくる言葉でした。,我想阻止的不是判决本身，而是过程中会出现的那些话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v1].text,맞습니다. 형이 그 사실을 알면 삶의 기반이 무너질까 봐 법정까지 오지 않게 하려 했습니다.,Yes. I tried to keep the case from reaching court because I feared my brother's foundation in life would collapse if he learned that fact.,そのとおりです。兄がその事実を知れば人生の基盤が崩れるのではないかと怖くて、法廷まで来ないようにしようとしました。,是的。我担心哥哥知道那个事实后人生基础会崩塌，所以试图不让事情走到法庭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v10].text,"재판관님, 형의 삶을 지켜 주겠다는 생각이 형의 삶을 제가 멋대로 다루는 일이 됐습니다.","Your Honor, my thought that I was protecting my brother's life became an act of handling his life as I pleased.",裁判官、兄の人生を守ってやるという考えが、兄の人生を私が勝手に扱うことになりました。,法官，我以为是在保护哥哥的人生，结果却成了我擅自摆弄哥哥的人生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v2].text,"재판관님, 저는 형이 아버지의 친자가 아니라는 사실을 이 자리에서 듣게 될까 봐 모든 걸 막으려 했습니다.","Your Honor, I tried to block everything because I feared my brother would hear in this courtroom that he was not Father's biological son.",裁判官、兄が父の実子ではないという事実をこの場で聞くのではないかと怖くて、私はすべてを止めようとしました。,法官，我害怕哥哥会在这里听到自己不是父亲亲生儿子的事实，所以试图阻止一切。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v3].text,형을 지킨다는 이유로 유서를 고치고 돈의 출처도 숨겼습니다. 결국 법정에서 더 크게 터졌습니다.,"In the name of protecting my brother, I changed the will and hid the source of the money. In the end, it burst out even more painfully in court.",兄を守るという理由で遺言書を直し、金の出所も隠しました。結局、法廷でさらに大きく噴き出しました。,我以保护哥哥为由改了遗嘱，也隐藏了钱的来源。结果在法庭上更大地爆发了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v4].text,저는 형이 그 비밀을 알 권리보다 제 두려움을 앞세웠습니다. 그게 제 가장 큰 잘못입니다.,I put my fear ahead of my brother's right to know that secret. That is my greatest fault.,兄がその秘密を知る権利より、私の恐れを優先しました。それが私の最も大きな過ちです。,我把自己的恐惧放在了哥哥知道那个秘密的权利之前。这是我最大的错误。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v5].text,"민감한 가족사가 드러나지 않게 하려고 제 몫 90, 형 몫 10인 자필 연습본을 제 몫 60, 형 몫 40으로 낮췄습니다. 그 선택은 제가 했습니다.","To keep the sensitive family matter from coming out, I lowered the handwritten draft from 90 for me and 10 for my brother to 60 for me and 40 for him. That choice was mine.",敏感な家族史が明らかにならないよう、私90・兄10の自筆下書きを、私60・兄40へ下げました。その選択は私がしました。,为了不让敏感的家事暴露，我把亲笔草稿中我90、哥哥10的比例降成了我60、哥哥40。这个选择是我作的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v6].text,형이 무너질 거라는 판단을 제가 대신 내렸습니다. 형에게 물어볼 용기가 없었습니다.,I decided in my brother's place that he would collapse. I did not have the courage to ask him.,兄が崩れるだろうという判断を、私が代わりに下しました。兄に聞く勇気がありませんでした。,我替哥哥作出了“他会崩溃”的判断。我没有勇气问他。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v7].text,법정까지 가지 않게 하려 한 건 사실입니다. 형이 자기 뿌리를 법정 자료로 알게 될까 봐 겁났습니다.,It is true I tried to keep it from going to court. I feared my brother would learn about his roots through court materials.,法廷まで行かせまいとしたのは事実です。兄が自分の根を法廷資料で知ることになるのが怖かったのです。,我确实想避免走到法庭。我害怕哥哥会通过法庭资料知道自己的根源。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v8].text,그 비밀을 숨기려다 어머니 뜻도 형의 알 권리도 함께 가렸습니다. 이제는 인정합니다.,"While trying to hide that secret, I also covered Mother's wishes and my brother's right to know. I admit that now.",その秘密を隠そうとして、母の意思も兄の知る権利も一緒に覆いました。今は認めます。,为了隐藏那个秘密，我连母亲的意愿和哥哥的知情权也一起遮住了。现在我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|late].variants[dc-4-b-q2-late-v9].text,형을 지키겠다는 말로는 부족합니다. 저는 형이 알아야 할 가장 큰 사실을 제 손으로 늦췄습니다.,Saying I wanted to protect my brother is not enough. I delayed with my own hands the most important fact he needed to know.,兄を守りたかったという言葉では足りません。兄が知るべき最も大きな事実を、私の手で遅らせました。,说我想保护哥哥是不够的。我亲手推迟了他应当知道的最大事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"법정으로 오면 유서, 돈, 어머니 기록이 모두 열립니다. 형이 그 연결을 견디기 어렵다고 봤습니다.","If it came to court, the will, the money, and Mother's records would all open. I thought my brother could not endure that connection.",法廷に来れば、遺言書、金、母の記録がすべて開かれます。兄はそのつながりに耐えにくいと思いました。,如果来到法庭，遗嘱、钱和母亲记录都会被打开。我认为哥哥难以承受这条联系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v10].text,저는 형이 질문을 멈추길 바랐습니다. 질문이 계속되면 제가 감춘 모든 일이 드러날 테니까요.,"I wanted my brother to stop asking questions. If the questions continued, everything I had hidden would come out.",兄に質問を止めてほしいと思いました。質問が続けば、私が隠していたすべてが明らかになるからです。,我希望哥哥停止追问。如果问题继续，我隐藏的一切都会暴露。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v2].text,형이 그 사실을 알면 자신이 장남으로 살아온 시간을 의심할 거라고 생각했습니다.,"I thought that if my brother learned that fact, he would doubt the years he had lived as eldest son.",兄がその事実を知れば、長男として生きてきた時間を疑うだろうと思いました。,我认为哥哥知道那个事实后，会怀疑自己作为长子生活过的那些年。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v3].text,저는 형이 상속 비율보다 그 이유에 더 무너질 거라 봤습니다. 그래서 법정까지 막으려 했습니다.,I believed my brother would be broken more by the reason than by the inheritance ratio. So I tried to stop it from reaching court.,兄は相続比率よりもその理由に崩れるだろうと見ました。だから法廷まで止めようとしました。,我认为哥哥会被比例背后的理由击垮，而不是被继承比例本身。所以我想阻止它走到法庭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v4].text,"재판관님, 형을 지키겠다면서 결국 제가 진실의 순서를 정했습니다.","Your Honor, while saying I would protect my brother, I ended up deciding the order in which the truth would be told.",裁判官、兄を守ると言いながら、結局は私が真実の順序を決めました。,法官，我说是要保护哥哥，结果却由我决定了真相出现的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v5].text,그 사실이 드러나면 형은 어머니 사랑과 돈의 흐름까지 전부 다시 보게 될 겁니다. 그게 두려웠습니다.,"If that fact came out, my brother would have to reconsider Mother's love and the flow of money together. That frightened me.",その事実が明らかになれば、兄は母の愛と金の流れまで全部見直すことになります。それが怖かったのです。,如果那个事实暴露，哥哥就会连母亲的爱和钱的流向都全部重新审视。我害怕这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v6].text,저는 형에게 시간을 주는 대신 진실을 늦췄습니다. 그 선택이 옳았다고는 이제 못 말합니다.,"Instead of giving my brother time, I delayed the truth. I can no longer say that choice was right.",兄に時間を与える代わりに、真実を遅らせました。その選択が正しかったとは、もう言えません。,我没有给哥哥时间，而是拖延了真相。现在我不能再说这个选择是对的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v7].text,법정에 오지 않게 하려 한 건 맞습니다. 이유는 형이 받을 충격을 제가 감당하지 못했기 때문입니다.,It is true I tried to keep it from court. The reason was that I could not bear the shock my brother would receive.,法廷に来ないようにしようとしたのは事実です。理由は、兄が受ける衝撃を私が受け止められなかったからです。,我确实试图不让事情来到法庭。原因是我承受不了哥哥会受到的冲击。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v8].text,형이 알 권리보다 형이 무너지지 않는 모습을 먼저 골랐습니다. 그건 제 오만이었습니다.,I chose my brother not collapsing over his right to know. That was my arrogance.,兄の知る権利より、兄が崩れない姿を先に選びました。それは私の傲慢でした。,我把哥哥不崩溃的样子放在他的知情权之前。这是我的傲慢。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q2-mid-v9].text,상속 분쟁으로 포장하면 비밀이 묻힐 거라 생각했습니다. 하지만 숨김은 더 커졌습니다.,"I thought that if I wrapped it as an inheritance dispute, the secret would stay buried. But the concealment only grew larger.",相続紛争として包めば秘密は埋もれると思いました。ですが、隠し事はさらに大きくなりました。,我以为把它包装成继承纠纷，秘密就会被埋住。但隐瞒反而变得更大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,턱을 세우고도 말끝에서 잠깐 흔들린다.,"Even with his chin lifted, he wavers briefly at the end.",顎を上げていても、語尾で一瞬揺れる。,即使抬着下巴，句尾也短暂动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v1].text,장남이니 더 받아야 한다고 단순히 말한 건 아닙니다. 다만 제가 해 온 시간이 무시된 느낌은 컸습니다.,I did not simply say I should receive more because I am the eldest son. But it felt strongly as if the time I spent caring for her had been ignored.,長男だからもっと受け取るべきだと単純に言ったわけではありません。ただ、私がしてきた時間が無視された感じは強くありました。,我并不是简单地说自己是长子所以该多拿。但我确实强烈觉得自己付出的时间被忽视了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,시선을 내리지 않으려 애쓰며 답한다.,Answers while trying not to lower his gaze.,視線を落とさないよう努めながら答える。,努力不低下视线地回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v10].text,저는 제 몫을 먼저 생각했습니다. 그 마음이 없었다고 말하면 거짓말입니다.,I thought of my share first. It would be a lie to say that feeling was not there.,私は自分の取り分を先に考えました。その気持ちがなかったと言えば嘘になります。,我先想到的是自己的份额。如果说没有这种心情，那就是谎话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,목소리를 낮추려 하지만 억울함이 먼저 나온다.,"Tries to lower his voice, but grievance comes out first.",声を落とそうとするが、悔しさが先に出る。,试图压低声音，但委屈先冒出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v2].text,저는 어머니 곁을 지킨 시간이 있었습니다. 그 시간이 몫에 반영돼야 한다고 여긴 마음은 있습니다.,I spent time staying by Mother's side. I did feel that time should be reflected in my share.,私は母のそばを守ってきた時間がありました。その時間が取り分に反映されるべきだと思う気持ちはあります。,我有守在母亲身边的时间。我确实觉得那段时间应该反映在份额里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,손끝으로 책상을 누르며 방어적으로 답한다.,Presses the desk with his fingertips and answers defensively.,指先で机を押さえ、防御的に答える。,用指尖按着桌面，防御性地回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v3].text,동생 돈이었다는 말이 나와도 제가 억울하지 않은 건 아닙니다. 저는 제가 돌본 시간을 먼저 봤습니다.,"Even after hearing it was my brother's money, I did not stop feeling wronged. I first looked at the time I had cared for her.",弟の金だったという話が出ても、私が悔しくないわけではありません。私は自分が介護した時間を先に見ました。,即使听说那是弟弟的钱，我也不是不委屈。我先看见的是自己照顾母亲的时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,동생 쪽을 흘겨보고 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Glances sideways at his younger brother, then looks back at the Judge.",弟の方を横目で見て、また裁判官を見る。,斜眼看向弟弟，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v4].text,"재판관님, 제가 장남이라는 자리를 가볍게 여긴 적은 없습니다. 그래서 더 흔들렸습니다.","Your Honor, I have never taken the position of eldest son lightly. That is why I was shaken even more.",裁判官、私は長男という立場を軽く見たことはありません。だからこそ、より揺れました。,法官，我从没有轻看长子这个位置。所以才更加动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,분노를 누르지만 어깨에 힘이 남아 있다.,"Suppresses anger, but tension remains in his shoulders.",怒りを抑えるが、肩には力が残っている。,压住愤怒，但肩膀仍有力道。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v5].text,"더 받아야 한다고 우긴다기보다, 적게 남겨진 이유를 받아들이기 어려웠습니다.","It was less that I insisted I must receive more, and more that I could not accept why so little was left to me.",もっと受け取るべきだと押し通したというより、少なく残された理由を受け入れにくかったのです。,与其说我坚持自己必须多拿，不如说我很难接受为什么只留给我那么少。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,말을 세게 시작했다가 끝에서 조금 물러선다.,"Starts forcefully, then pulls back a little at the end.",強く話し始め、最後で少し退く。,开头说得很强，到结尾稍稍退让。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v6].text,제가 당연하게 여긴 부분이 있었을 수 있습니다. 하지만 그게 전부 욕심이었다고는 못 하겠습니다.,There may have been parts I took for granted. But I cannot say all of it was greed.,私が当然視していた部分はあったかもしれません。ですが、それがすべて欲だったとは言えません。,我可能有把某些事当成理所当然的部分。但不能说那全都是贪心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,자기 몫을 말할 때 숨이 짧아진다.,His breath shortens when he talks about his share.,自分の取り分を話す時、息が短くなる。,说到自己份额时呼吸变短。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v7].text,어머니를 모신 사람으로서 기대가 있었습니다. 그 기대를 완전히 부정하긴 어렵습니다.,"As the one who cared for Mother, I had expectations. It is hard to deny those expectations completely.",母を見てきた人間として、期待がありました。その期待を完全に否定するのは難しいです。,作为照顾母亲的人，我有期待。很难完全否认那份期待。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,오랜 돌봄을 떠올리며 표정이 굳는다.,His expression stiffens as he recalls years of care.,長い介護を思い出し、表情が固まる。,想起长期照护，表情变硬。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v8].text,"동생이 도왔다는 말을 듣고도, 제가 곁에 있었다는 사실이 사라지진 않는다고 생각했습니다.","Even after hearing my brother had helped, I thought the fact that I had stayed beside her did not disappear.",弟が助けていたと聞いても、私がそばにいた事実が消えるわけではないと思いました。,即使听到弟弟也帮过忙，我仍觉得自己在母亲身边这件事不会消失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,억울함을 앞세우다 스스로 문장을 고른다.,"Leads with grievance, then chooses his own sentence.",悔しさを先に出しながら、自分で文を選ぶ。,先带出委屈，又自己斟酌句子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v9].text,형이라는 자리와 돌본 시간이 제 마음속에서 섞여 있었습니다. 그 점은 인정합니다.,The position of older brother and the time I spent caring for her were mixed together in my mind. I admit that.,兄という立場と介護した時間が、私の心の中で混ざっていました。その点は認めます。,哥哥这个位置和照顾母亲的时间，在我心里混在了一起。这点我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 처음으로 목소리를 낮춘다.,"With head lowered, lowers his voice for the first time.",頭を下げたまま、初めて声を落とす。,低着头，第一次压低声音。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v1].text,"인정합니다. 저는 장남이라는 이유로 더 받을 자격이 있다고 믿었고, 어머니 뜻을 제 기준으로 읽었습니다.","I admit it. I believed that as the eldest son I deserved more, and I read Mother's wishes by my own standard.",認めます。私は長男という理由で、より受け取る資格があると信じ、母の意思を自分の基準で読みました。,我承认。我曾相信自己作为长子有资格多拿，并且用自己的标准解读母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,한참 침묵한 뒤 차분히 고백한다.,"After a long silence, confesses calmly.",しばらく沈黙した後、落ち着いて告白する。,长时间沉默后，平静坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v10].text,"이제 인정하겠습니다. 장남이라는 이름이 제게 권리처럼 느껴졌고, 그 마음이 판단을 흐렸습니다.","I will admit it now. The name of eldest son felt like a right to me, and that feeling clouded my judgment.",今は認めます。長男という名前が私には権利のように感じられ、その心が判断を曇らせました。,现在我承认。长子这个名分对我来说像一种权利，这种心情模糊了我的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,분노가 빠진 자리에서 부끄러움이 올라온다.,"Where anger fades, shame rises.",怒りが抜けた場所から恥ずかしさが上がる。,愤怒退去后，羞愧浮现。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v2].text,"재판관님, 저는 어머니를 모신 시간을 유산의 증거처럼 붙잡았습니다. 그 마음이 사건을 키웠습니다.","Your Honor, I held on to the time I cared for Mother as if it were proof for the inheritance. That feeling enlarged the case.",裁判官、私は母を看た時間を相続の証拠のように握りしめました。その気持ちが事件を大きくしました。,法官，我把照顾母亲的时间当成继承的证据一样紧抓着。这种心情把事情扩大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,손을 무릎 위에 모으고 천천히 인정한다.,Folds his hands on his knees and slowly admits it.,手を膝の上にそろえ、ゆっくり認める。,双手放在膝上，慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v3].text,동생이 숨겨 온 돈을 알고도 제 억울함만 먼저 봤습니다. 제 당연시도 책임입니다.,"Even after learning about the money my brother had hidden, I first looked only at my own grievance. My assumption of entitlement is also my responsibility.",弟が隠してきた金を知っても、私は先に自分の悔しさだけを見ました。私の当然視にも責任があります。,即使知道弟弟隐藏的钱，我首先看的还是自己的委屈。我的理所当然也有责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,동생 이름을 부르려다 재판관에게만 말한다.,"Starts to say his brother's name, then speaks only to the Judge.",弟の名前を呼ぼうとして、裁判官にだけ話す。,想叫弟弟的名字，却只对法官说话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v4].text,저는 어머니를 있는 그대로 보기보다 제 수고를 인정해 줄 사람으로 붙잡았습니다.,"Rather than seeing Mother as she was, I held on to her as someone who should recognize my effort.",私は母をありのまま見るより、自分の苦労を認めてくれる人として握りしめていました。,比起如实看待母亲，我把她抓成了应该承认我辛苦的人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,오래 버틴 자존심이 꺾인 듯 숨을 쉰다.,Breathes as if long-held pride has bent.,長く耐えていた自尊心が折れたように息をする。,像长期撑着的自尊被折断一样呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v5].text,장남 자리를 잃을까 두려워서 숫자에 더 매달렸습니다. 두려워서 동생을 악의로만 보게 됐습니다.,"I clung harder to the numbers because I feared losing the place of eldest son. Out of fear, I saw my brother only as malicious.",長男の場所を失うのが怖くて、数字にさらにしがみつきました。怖くて弟を悪意だけで見てしまいました。,我因为害怕失去长子的位置，才更加执着于数字。因为害怕，我只把弟弟看成恶意。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지고 시선이 손등에 머문다.,"His ending drops, and his gaze rests on the back of his hand.",語尾が低くなり、視線が手の甲に留まる。,句尾低下，视线停在手背上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v6].text,어머니 뜻을 묻기 전에 제 몫을 계산했습니다. 그게 제가 어머니를 이용한 방식입니다.,"Before asking what Mother wanted, I calculated my share. That is how I used Mother.",母の意思を尋ねる前に、自分の取り分を計算しました。それが、私が母を利用した形です。,在询问母亲意愿之前，我先计算了自己的份额。这就是我利用母亲的方式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,자기 책임을 말할 때 어깨가 내려간다.,His shoulders drop when he speaks of his own responsibility.,自分の責任を話す時、肩が落ちる。,说到自己的责任时肩膀垂下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v7].text,동생만 어머니를 바꾼 게 아닙니다. 저도 어머니 마음을 제 편의 증거로 쓰려 했습니다.,My brother was not the only one who changed Mother. I also tried to use Mother's heart as evidence for my side.,母を変えたのは弟だけではありません。私も母の心を自分に都合のよい証拠として使おうとしました。,改变母亲的不只是弟弟。我也试图把母亲的心意当成有利于自己的证据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,목이 잠기지만 문장을 끝까지 마친다.,"His throat tightens, but he finishes the sentence.",喉が詰まるが、文を最後まで言い切る。,嗓子发紧，但把句子说完。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v8].text,"제가 돌본 건 사실이지만, 그 사실로 더 받아야 한다고 밀어붙인 마음도 사실입니다.","It is true I cared for her, but it is also true I pushed with the feeling that I should receive more for it.",私が介護したのは事実ですが、その事実でより受け取るべきだと押し通した心も事実です。,我照顾过她是事实，但我也确实以此推动“自己应该多拿”的想法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,변명하려는 버릇을 누르고 인정으로 끝낸다.,Suppresses the habit of making excuses and ends with an admission.,言い訳しようとする癖を抑え、認める形で終える。,压住想辩解的习惯，以承认结束。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v9].text,"재판관님, 저는 어머니의 마지막 뜻보다 제 상처와 자존심을 먼저 세웠습니다.","Your Honor, I put my own hurt and pride ahead of Mother's final wishes.",裁判官、私は母の最後の意思より、自分の傷と自尊心を先に立てました。,法官，我把自己的伤和自尊放在了母亲最后的意愿之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,반박하려다 말을 삼키고 낮게 인정한다.,"Starts to object, swallows the words, and admits quietly.",反論しかけて言葉を飲み込み、低く認める。,想反驳又咽回话，低声承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].text,인정합니다. 장남이라는 이유로 어머니 재산에서 제 자리가 더 크다고 생각한 마음이 있었습니다.,I admit it. There was a part of me that thought my place in Mother's estate should be larger because I was the eldest son.,認めます。長男という理由で、母の財産における自分の場所がもっと大きいと思う気持ちがありました。,我承认。因为自己是长子，我心里曾觉得自己在母亲财产中的位置应该更大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,비난의 톤이 약해지며 자책이 섞인다.,"The blaming tone weakens, with self-reproach mixed in.",非難の調子が弱まり、自責が混じる。,责备的语气减弱，夹杂自责。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v10].text,저는 어머니 마음을 묻기보다 제 수고의 값을 먼저 따졌습니다. 그 점은 부끄럽습니다.,I asked the price of my own labor before asking Mother's heart. I am ashamed of that.,母の心を問うより、自分の苦労の値を先に考えました。その点は恥ずかしいです。,我没有先问母亲的心意，而是先计算自己辛苦的价值。这点让我羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,손바닥을 펴다 접으며 자존심을 누른다.,"Opens and closes his palm, suppressing his pride.",手のひらを開いて閉じ、自尊心を抑える。,摊开又合上手掌，压住自尊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].text,동생 돈이 섞였다는 걸 듣고도 처음엔 제 수고가 먼저 떠올랐습니다. 그만큼 제가 제 몫을 당연시했습니다.,"Even after hearing my brother's money was mixed in, I first thought of my own effort. That shows how much I took my share for granted.",弟の金が混じっていたと聞いても、最初に私の苦労が浮かびました。それほど私は自分の取り分を当然視していました。,即使听说其中混有弟弟的钱，我一开始想到的仍是自己的辛苦。这说明我把自己的份额当成理所当然到什么程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,목소리는 거칠지만 인정 대목은 피하지 않는다.,"His voice is rough, but he does not avoid the admission.",声は荒いが、認める部分は避けない。,声音粗硬，但不回避承认的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].text,"재판관님, 저는 모신 시간을 보상처럼 붙잡았습니다. 그래서 숫자가 모욕으로 느껴졌습니다.","Your Honor, I held on to the time I cared for her as compensation. That is why the numbers felt like an insult.",裁判官、私は介護した時間を補償のように握りしめました。だから数字が侮辱のように感じられました。,法官，我把照顾她的时间当成补偿一样紧抓着。所以那些数字让我觉得像羞辱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,동생을 보려다 시선을 바닥으로 내린다.,"Starts to look at his younger brother, then lowers his gaze to the floor.",弟を見ようとして、視線を床へ落とす。,想看向弟弟，却把视线落到地面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].text,제가 장남이라는 말을 앞세운 건 사실입니다. 그 말로 동생이 숨겨 둔 도움을 밀어낸 부분도 있습니다.,"It is true I put the word eldest son first. With that word, I also pushed aside the help my brother had hidden.",私が長男という言葉を前に出したのは事実です。その言葉で、弟が隠していた支援を押しのけた部分もあります。,我确实把长子这个词摆在前面。也正因为这个词，我排开了弟弟隐藏的帮助。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,장남이라는 말을 꺼내고 바로 멈칫한다.,"Says the words ""eldest son"" and immediately hesitates.",長男という言葉を出して、すぐにためらう。,说出“长子”后立刻犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].text,어머니 뜻보다 제 억울함을 먼저 세웠습니다. 그 안에 당연히 더 받아야 한다는 생각이 있었습니다.,I put my grievance ahead of Mother's wishes. Inside that was the thought that I naturally deserved more.,母の意思より自分の悔しさを先に立てました。その中には、当然もっと受け取るべきだという考えがありました。,我把自己的委屈放在母亲意愿之前。其中也有“我理所当然该多拿”的想法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,분노보다 혼란이 앞서 말속도가 늦어진다.,"Confusion comes before anger, and his speech slows.",怒りより混乱が先に立ち、話す速度が遅くなる。,混乱先于愤怒，说话速度放慢。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v6].text,돌본 일과 상속을 너무 붙여 봤습니다. 제가 한 일을 이유로 더 받을 자격을 확신했습니다.,I tied caregiving and inheritance too closely. I was certain my work entitled me to more.,介護と相続をあまりに結びつけて見ました。自分がしたことを理由に、より受け取る資格があると確信していました。,我把照顾和继承看得太紧密。我确信自己做过的事让我有资格多拿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 누르며 억울함을 정리한다.,Presses the edge of the desk while organizing his grievance.,机の角を押さえながら、悔しさを整理する。,按着桌角，整理自己的委屈。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v7].text,"동생이 도운 사실을 알기 전에도, 저는 제가 중심이라고 믿었습니다. 지금은 그 믿음이 흔들립니다.","Even before I knew my brother had helped, I believed I was the center. Now that belief is shaken.",弟が助けていた事実を知る前から、私は自分が中心だと信じていました。今はその信念が揺らいでいます。,在知道弟弟帮忙之前，我就相信自己是中心。现在这个信念动摇了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,반쯤 따지고 반쯤 인정하는 표정이다.,"His expression is half challenging, half admitting.",半分問い詰め、半分認める表情。,表情一半质问，一半承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v8].text,제가 더 받아야 한다는 마음이 없었다면 이렇게까지 분노하진 않았을 겁니다.,"If I had not felt I should receive more, I would not have been this angry.",私がもっと受け取るべきだという気持ちがなければ、ここまで怒ることはなかったでしょう。,如果我没有觉得自己应该多拿，就不会愤怒到这个程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,호흡을 고르고 자신의 마음을 다시 말한다.,Steadies his breath and states his feelings again.,呼吸を整え、自分の気持ちを改めて話す。,调整呼吸，再次说出自己的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v9].text,장남으로 산 시간이 제 권리라고 여긴 부분이 있습니다. 그걸 이제는 인정합니다.,There was a part of me that treated the years lived as eldest son as my right. I admit that now.,長男として生きた時間を自分の権利だと思っていた部分があります。今はそれを認めます。,我有一部分把作为长子生活的时间当成自己的权利。现在我承认这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v1].text,상대에게 알려지길 피하려 했다는 말이 책임을 없애진 않습니다. 다만 그때는 다른 길이 보이지 않았습니다.,"Saying I tried to avoid the other side finding out does not erase responsibility. At the time, though, I saw no other path.",相手に知られるのを避けようとしたという言葉が責任を消すわけではありません。ただ、その時は他の道が見えませんでした。,说我想避免对方知道，并不能消除责任。但当时我看不到别的路。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v10].text,제가 문서를 바꾼 사람이라는 점은 인정합니다. 이유가 있어도 책임은 남습니다.,"I admit that I am the one who changed the document. Even if there was a reason, the responsibility remains.",私が文書を変えた人間だという点は認めます。理由があっても責任は残ります。,我承认自己是改动文件的人。即使有理由，责任仍然存在。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v2].text,어머니 뜻을 그대로 두지 못한 점은 인정합니다. 하지만 그 이유가 제 이익만은 아니었습니다.,I admit I could not leave Mother's wishes as they were. But the reason was not only my own benefit.,母の意思をそのままにできなかった点は認めます。ただ、その理由が私の利益だけだったわけではありません。,我承认自己没能让母亲的意愿保持原样。但理由并不只是我的利益。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v3].text,제가 고친 책임을 피할 생각은 없습니다. 다만 그 선택의 배경도 함께 봐 주셨으면 합니다.,I do not intend to avoid responsibility for changing it. But I ask that the background of that choice be seen as well.,私が直した責任を避けるつもりはありません。ただ、その選択の背景もあわせて見てほしいです。,我无意回避自己修改文件的责任。但也希望能一并看到那个选择的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v4].text,"재판관님, 형을 위한다는 말로 모든 게 정리되지는 않는다는 걸 압니다.","Your Honor, I know that the words “for my brother” do not settle everything.",裁判官、兄のためという言葉だけですべてが整理されるわけではないと分かっています。,法官，我知道“为了哥哥”这句话不能解释一切。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v5].text,그 문서에 제 손이 닿았습니다. 그 사실은 상대에게 알려지길 피하려 했다는 설명으로 지워지지 않습니다.,My hand touched that document. That fact is not erased by saying I tried to avoid the other side finding out.,その文書に私の手が触れました。その事実は、相手に知られるのを避けようとしたという説明では消えません。,那份文件上有我的手。这个事实不能被“我想避免对方知道”的说明抹去。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v6].text,어머니 뜻을 건드린 건 무겁습니다. 저는 그 무게를 알면서도 당시엔 멈추지 못했습니다.,Touching Mother's wishes is serious. I knew that weight and still could not stop at the time.,母の意思に触れたことは重いです。その重さを知りながら、当時は止まれませんでした。,动了母亲的意愿是很重的事。我知道这份重量，却当时还是没有停下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v7].text,책임이 없어지는 건 아닙니다. 저는 다만 더 큰 상처를 피한다고 믿었습니다.,Responsibility does not disappear. I only believed I was avoiding a greater wound.,責任がなくなるわけではありません。私はただ、もっと大きな傷を避けていると信じていました。,责任不会消失。我只是相信自己是在避免更大的伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v8].text,상대에게 알려지길 피하려 했다는 말은 제 동기일 뿐입니다. 결과의 책임까지 사라지는 건 아닙니다.,Saying I tried to avoid the other side finding out is only my motive. It does not erase responsibility for the result.,相手に知られるのを避けようとしたという言葉は、私の動機にすぎません。結果の責任まで消えるわけではありません。,说我想避免对方知道，只是我的动机。它不能连结果责任也一起消除。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v9].text,그 선택이 옳았다고 단정하지 않겠습니다. 지금은 제가 한 일의 흠을 알고 있습니다.,I will not insist that choice was right. I now know the flaw in what I did.,その選択が正しかったと断定しません。今は私がしたことの傷を分かっています。,我不会断言那个选择是对的。现在我知道自己所做的事有伤痕。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v1].text,맞습니다. 상대에게 알려지길 피하려 했다는 이유가 어머니의 처음 적힌 비율 뜻을 고친 책임을 없애지 못합니다.,Yes. The reason of avoiding the other side finding out does not erase responsibility for changing the meaning of the ratio Mother first wrote.,そのとおりです。相手に知られるのを避けようとした理由は、母が最初に書いた比率の意味を変えた責任を消しません。,是的。避免对方知道这个理由，不能消除我改变母亲最初写下的比例含义的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v10].text,이제는 인정합니다. 이유가 깊을수록 책임이 사라지는 게 아니라 더 분명해집니다.,"I admit it now. The deeper the reason, the more clearly responsibility remains; it does not disappear.",今は認めます。理由が深いほど、責任は消えるのではなく、よりはっきりします。,现在我承认。理由越深，责任不是消失，而是变得更加明确。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v2].text,"재판관님, 저는 제 출생과 관련한 민감한 사실을 감추려 어머니 뜻을 제 방식으로 처리했습니다. 그 책임은 전부 제게 있습니다.","Your Honor, I handled Mother's wishes in my own way to hide a sensitive fact tied to my birth. That responsibility is entirely mine.",裁判官、私は私の出生に関わる敏感な事実を隠すため、母の意思を自分のやり方で処理しました。その責任はすべて私にあります。,法官，我为了隐藏与自己出生有关的敏感事实，用自己的方式处理了母亲的意愿。这个责任全在我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v3].text,지키려 했다는 말로 위조를 덮을 수 없습니다. 저는 어머니의 마지막 뜻을 제 판단으로 다시 썼습니다.,Saying I tried to protect him cannot cover forgery. I rewrote Mother's final wishes by my own judgment.,守ろうとしたという言葉で偽造を覆うことはできません。私は母の最後の意思を自分の判断で書き直しました。,说是为了保护他，不能遮盖伪造。我用自己的判断重写了母亲最后的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v4].text,형이 무너질까 봐 두려웠다는 사실과 제가 문서를 고쳤다는 사실은 둘 다 진실입니다.,"It is true that I feared my brother would collapse, and it is also true that I changed the document.",兄が崩れるのではないかと怖かった事実と、私が文書を変えた事実は、どちらも真実です。,我害怕哥哥会崩溃，这是真的；我改了文件，也是真的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v5].text,저는 선의를 이유로 남의 뜻을 손댔습니다. 그 선의가 저를 면책하지는 않습니다.,I touched someone else's wishes in the name of good faith. That good faith does not exempt me.,私は善意を理由に他人の意思に手を加えました。その善意は私を免責しません。,我以善意为理由动了别人的意愿。那份善意不能让我免责。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v6].text,"어머니의 자필 연습본을 제 몫 90, 형 몫 10에서 제 몫 60, 형 몫 40으로 바꾼 사람은 저입니다. 형을 위한 선택이었다 해도 잘못입니다.","I am the one who changed Mother's handwritten draft from 90 for me and 10 for my brother to 60 for me and 40 for him. Even if it was for my brother, it was wrong.",母の自筆下書きを、私90・兄10から私60・兄40へ変えたのは私です。兄のための選択だったとしても、誤りです。,把母亲亲笔草稿从我90、哥哥10改成我60、哥哥40的人是我。即使是为了哥哥，这也是错的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v7].text,"상대에게 알려지길 피하려다 형에게 필요한 진실도 늦췄고, 어머니 뜻도 훼손했습니다.","While trying to avoid the other side finding out, I delayed the truth my brother needed and damaged Mother's wishes.",相手に知られるのを避けようとして、兄に必要な真実も遅らせ、母の意思も損ないました。,为了避免对方知道，我拖延了哥哥需要的真相，也损害了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v8].text,"재판관님, 책임을 피하지 않겠습니다. 제가 지키려 한 선택은 법적으로도 관계적으로도 상처를 남겼습니다.","Your Honor, I will not avoid responsibility. The choice I made to protect him left wounds both legally and relationally.",裁判官、責任を避けません。私が守ろうとして選んだことは、法的にも関係的にも傷を残しました。,法官，我不会逃避责任。我以保护为名作出的选择，在法律上和关系上都留下了伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v9].text,저는 형 대신 판단했고 어머니 대신 문서를 고쳤습니다. 그 두 가지가 제 책임입니다.,I judged in my brother's place and changed the document in Mother's place. Those two things are my responsibility.,私は兄の代わりに判断し、母の代わりに文書を直しました。その二つが私の責任です。,我替哥哥作了判断，也替母亲改了文件。这两件事就是我的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].text,자필 연습본을 제가 고쳐 쓴 책임은 제게 있습니다. 상대에게 알려지길 피하려 했다는 말은 변명이 될 수 없습니다.,The responsibility for rewriting the handwritten draft is mine. Saying I tried to avoid the other side finding out cannot be an excuse.,自筆下書きを私が書き換えた責任は私にあります。相手に知られるのを避けようとしたという言葉は言い訳にはなりません。,改写亲笔草稿的责任在我。说我想避免对方知道，不能成为借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v10].text,저는 책임을 줄이려고 설명하는 게 아닙니다. 책임이 왜 생겼는지 끝까지 말하는 겁니다.,I am not explaining to reduce responsibility. I am saying to the end why that responsibility arose.,責任を軽くするために説明しているのではありません。責任がなぜ生じたのかを最後まで話しているのです。,我说明这些不是为了减轻责任，而是要把责任为何产生说到底。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].text,어머니 뜻을 제가 조정했습니다. 지키겠다는 명분이 있었지만 그 명분이 절차를 대신하진 않습니다.,"I adjusted Mother's wishes. I had the justification of protection, but that justification cannot replace procedure.",母の意思を私が調整しました。守るという名分はありましたが、その名分が手続きに代わることはありません。,我调整了母亲的意愿。虽然有保护的名义，但这个名义不能代替程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"재판관님, 형이 무너질까 봐 숫자를 낮췄습니다. 그래도 어머니 뜻을 손댄 사람은 저입니다.","Your Honor, I lowered the numbers because I feared my brother would collapse. Still, the person who touched Mother's wishes is me.",裁判官、兄が崩れるのが怖くて数字を下げました。それでも、母の意思に手を加えた人間は私です。,法官，我因为怕哥哥崩溃而降低了数字。即便如此，动了母亲意愿的人还是我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].text,형을 위해서였다는 설명은 가능합니다. 하지만 어머니가 남긴 뜻을 제가 고쳐 쓴 사실은 그대로입니다.,I can explain that it was for my brother. But the fact remains that I rewrote the wishes Mother left behind.,兄のためだったという説明は可能です。しかし、母が残した意思を私が書き換えた事実はそのままです。,我可以说明那是为了哥哥。但母亲留下的意愿被我改写，这个事实仍然存在。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].text,저는 선의를 앞세워 위법한 선택을 했습니다. 그 둘을 분리해서 보지 않겠습니다.,I made an unlawful choice in the name of good faith. I will not look at those two things as if they were separate.,私は善意を前に出して違法な選択をしました。その二つを切り離して見るつもりはありません。,我打着善意作出了违法的选择。我不会把这两者分开来看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v6].text,"형의 충격을 줄인다고 믿었지만, 어머니 의사까지 제가 줄여 버렸습니다.","I believed I was reducing my brother's shock, but I ended up reducing Mother's intent as well.",兄の衝撃を減らしていると信じていましたが、母の意思まで減らしてしまいました。,我以为自己是在减轻哥哥的冲击，结果连母亲的意愿也一起削减了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v7].text,제가 지키는 사람이 된 것처럼 굴었습니다. 그러나 어머니 뜻을 바꿀 권리는 없었습니다.,I acted as if I had become the protector. But I had no right to change Mother's wishes.,私は守る人になったかのように振る舞いました。しかし、母の意思を変える権利はありませんでした。,我表现得像自己成了保护者。但我没有权利改变母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v8].text,그 책임은 돈 때문이 아니어도 남습니다. 오히려 제가 판단을 대신했다는 점이 더 큽니다.,That responsibility remains even if it was not about money. What is greater is that I judged in someone else's place.,その責任は、金のためではなくても残ります。むしろ、私が代わりに判断した点のほうが大きいです。,这个责任即使不是为了钱也仍然存在。更大的问题反而是我替别人作了判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v9].text,상대에게 알려지길 피하려는 이유가 있었습니다. 하지만 그 이유가 법과 어머니 뜻보다 위에 설 수는 없습니다.,There was a reason to avoid the other side finding out. But that reason cannot stand above the law or Mother's wishes.,相手に知られるのを避けたい理由はありました。しかし、その理由が法と母の意思の上に立つことはできません。,确实有避免对方知道的理由。但这个理由不能站在法律和母亲意愿之上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v1].behaviorHint,대답 전 한 박자 멈추고 서류 끝을 본다.,Pauses one beat before answering and looks at the edge of the document.,答える前に一拍置き、書類の端を見る。,回答前停顿一拍，看向文件边缘。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v1].text,그 말이 완전히 틀렸다고는 못 하겠습니다. 형도 저도 어머니 뜻을 자기 방식으로 붙잡았습니다.,I cannot say those words are completely wrong. Both my brother and I held Mother's wishes in our own ways.,その言葉が完全に間違っているとは言えません。兄も私も、母の意思を自分のやり方で握りました。,我不能说那句话完全错。哥哥和我都以自己的方式抓住了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 담담하게 말하려 애쓴다.,Tries to speak calmly to the end.,最後まで淡々と話そうとする。,努力平静地说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v10].text,그 말 앞에서 바로 반박하지 못하겠습니다. 저부터 어머니 뜻을 고친 사람이니까요.,I cannot immediately deny that. I am the one who altered Mother's wishes first.,その言葉の前で、すぐ反論はできません。まず私が母の意思を変えた人間だからです。,面对这句话，我无法立刻反驳。因为首先是我改动了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v2].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리로 인정 범위를 먼저 자른다.,"In a low voice, first limits the scope of admission.",低い声で、まず認める範囲を切る。,用低声先限定承认范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v2].text,"저는 어머니를 지킨다고 생각했지만, 사실은 제 판단을 앞세운 부분이 있습니다.","I thought I was protecting Mother, but in truth there were parts where I put my own judgment first.",私は母を守っていると思っていましたが、実際には自分の判断を前に出した部分があります。,我以为自己是在保护母亲，但实际上有些部分是我把自己的判断放在了前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선을 오래 피하지 않지만 말끝은 닫는다.,"Does not avoid the gaze for long, but closes off the ending.",長く視線を避けはしないが、語尾は閉じる。,没有长久避开视线，但句尾收住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v3].text,"형은 형의 억울함으로, 저는 제 두려움으로 어머니 뜻을 다르게 읽었습니다.","My brother read Mother's wishes through his grievance, and I read them through my fear.",兄は兄の悔しさで、私は私の恐れで、母の意思を違うように読みました。,哥哥用他的委屈，我用我的恐惧，以不同方式解读了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v4].behaviorHint,손가락을 포개 쥔 채 조심스럽게 답한다.,Answers carefully with his fingers folded together.,指を重ねて握ったまま慎重に答える。,手指交叠握着，小心回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v4].text,"재판관님, 둘 다 어머니를 있는 그대로 두지 못했다는 말은 무겁지만 피하기 어렵습니다.","Your Honor, saying that neither of us left Mother as she was is heavy, but hard to avoid.",裁判官、二人とも母をありのままにはしておけなかったという言葉は重いですが、避けにくいです。,法官，说我们两人都没能让母亲保持原样，这句话很重，但难以回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤 핵심 단어만 피해 간다.,"Catches his breath, then avoids only the key word.",息を整えた後、核心の言葉だけを避ける。,调整呼吸后，只避开核心词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v5].text,저는 형을 막으려 했고 형은 자기 몫을 붙잡았습니다. 그 사이에서 어머니 뜻이 흔들렸습니다.,"I tried to block my brother, and my brother clung to his share. Between us, Mother's wishes were shaken.",私は兄を止めようとし、兄は自分の取り分を握りました。その間で母の意思が揺れました。,我试图挡住哥哥，哥哥则抓住自己的份额。在我们之间，母亲的意愿被动摇了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v6].behaviorHint,턱이 굳지만 목소리는 평평하게 유지한다.,"His jaw tightens, but his voice stays even.",顎はこわばるが、声は平らに保つ。,下颌绷紧，但声音保持平稳。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v6].text,제가 모든 책임을 혼자 진다고 해도 형의 당연시가 사라지는 건 아닙니다.,"Even if I take all responsibility alone, my brother's assumption of entitlement does not disappear.",私がすべての責任を一人で負うとしても、兄の当然視が消えるわけではありません。,即使我一个人承担所有责任，哥哥的理所当然也不会消失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 선을 긋는다.,Gives a small nod and draws the line again.,短くうなずき、また線を引く。,短促点头后，再次划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v7].text,형도 상처가 있었고 저도 두려움이 있었습니다. 둘 다 그 감정으로 어머니를 보았습니다.,"My brother had hurt, and I had fear. Both of us looked at Mother through those feelings.",兄には傷があり、私には恐れがありました。二人ともその感情で母を見ました。,哥哥有伤，我有恐惧。我们都透过这些情绪看母亲。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v8].behaviorHint,입술을 누른 뒤 필요한 사실만 꺼낸다.,"Presses his lips, then gives only the necessary facts.",唇を押さえた後、必要な事実だけを出す。,抿住嘴唇后，只说必要事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v8].text,"아직 한 문장으로 정리하긴 어렵지만, 어머니 뜻을 있는 그대로 둔 사람은 없었습니다.","It is still hard to put in one sentence, but no one left Mother's wishes untouched.",まだ一文で整理するのは難しいですが、母の意思をそのままにした人はいませんでした。,现在还很难用一句话整理，但没有人让母亲的意愿保持原样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v9].behaviorHint,감정은 누르고 문장 사이를 길게 둔다.,Suppresses emotion and leaves long gaps between sentences.,感情を抑え、文と文の間を長く取る。,压住情绪，在句子之间留出长停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|early].variants[dc-5-b-q2-early-v9].text,저는 지키려 했다고 말했고 형은 돌봤다고 말했습니다. 둘 다 어머니를 자기 말 안에 넣었습니다.,"I said I was protecting her, and my brother said he cared for her. Both of us put Mother inside our own words.",私は守ろうとしたと言い、兄は介護したと言いました。二人とも母を自分の言葉の中に入れました。,我说自己是在保护，哥哥说自己照顾过。我们两人都把母亲放进了自己的话里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v1].behaviorHint,눈을 한 번 감았다 뜨고 낮게 고백한다.,"Closes his eyes once, opens them, and confesses quietly.",一度目を閉じて開き、低く告白する。,闭眼又睁开，低声坦白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v1].text,"인정합니다. 형도 저도 어머니를 있는 그대로 두지 못했고, 어머니 뜻은 우리 손에서 두 번 왜곡됐습니다.","I admit it. Neither my brother nor I left Mother as she was, and Mother's wishes were distorted twice in our hands.",認めます。兄も私も母をありのままにはしておけず、母の意思は私たちの手で二度ゆがみました。,我承认。哥哥和我都没能让母亲保持原样，母亲的意愿在我们手中被扭曲了两次。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v10].behaviorHint,고개를 숙인 채 변명보다 책임을 앞세운다.,"With head lowered, puts responsibility before excuses.",頭を下げたまま、言い訳より責任を先に出す。,低着头，把责任放在辩解之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v10].text,이제는 인정하겠습니다. 우리 둘 모두 어머니의 마지막 뜻보다 각자의 두려움을 먼저 붙잡았습니다.,I will admit it now. Both of us held on to our own fears before Mother's final wishes.,今は認めます。私たち二人とも、母の最後の意思より各自の恐れを先につかみました。,现在我承认。我们两个人都把各自的恐惧放在了母亲最后的意愿之前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v2].behaviorHint,목소리가 마지막 문장에서 미세하게 갈라진다.,His voice cracks faintly in the final sentence.,最後の文で声がかすかに割れる。,声音在最后一句微微发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v2].text,"재판관님, 형은 장남의 권리로 어머니를 읽었고 저는 지키겠다는 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 고쳤습니다.","Your Honor, my brother read Mother through the right of eldest son, and I changed Mother's wishes under the excuse of protection.",裁判官、兄は長男の権利で母を読み、私は守るという名分で母の意思を変えました。,法官，哥哥用长子的权利解读母亲，而我以保护为名改变了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v3].behaviorHint,담담한 표정이 무너지지 않지만 숨이 길어진다.,"His calm expression does not break, but his breathing lengthens.",淡々とした表情は崩れないが、息が長くなる。,平静表情没有崩塌，但呼吸变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v3].text,"둘 다 어머니를 사랑한다고 말했지만, 결국 각자의 두려움을 어머니 뜻 위에 올렸습니다.","We both said we loved Mother, but in the end we placed our own fears on top of her wishes.",二人とも母を愛していると言いましたが、結局それぞれの恐れを母の意思の上に置きました。,我们都说爱母亲，但最终都把各自的恐惧放到了母亲意愿之上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v4].behaviorHint,더 숨기지 않겠다는 듯 문장을 끝까지 잇는다.,Carries the sentence to the end as if he will hide no more.,これ以上隠さないというように、文を最後までつなぐ。,像是不再隐瞒一样，把句子说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v4].text,"저는 형을 지킨다는 말로 어머니의 처음 적힌 비율을 바꿨고, 형은 돌봄의 시간으로 더 받을 권리를 믿었습니다.","I changed Mother's first written ratio in the name of protecting my brother, and my brother believed his years of care entitled him to more.",私は兄を守るという言葉で母が最初に書いた比率を変え、兄は介護した時間でより受け取る権利を信じました。,我以保护哥哥为名改变了母亲最初写下的比例，哥哥则因为照顾的时间相信自己有权多拿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v5].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보지 못한 채 책임을 인정한다.,Admits responsibility without being able to look toward his brother.,兄の方を見られないまま責任を認める。,无法看向哥哥，却承认责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v5].text,이 사건은 누가 더 나쁜가만의 문제가 아닙니다. 둘 다 어머니 뜻을 자기 방식으로 다룬 문제입니다.,This case is not only about who was worse. It is about both of us handling Mother's wishes in our own ways.,この事件は、誰がより悪いかだけの問題ではありません。二人とも母の意思を自分のやり方で扱った問題です。,这起案件不只是看谁更坏。问题在于我们两人都以自己的方式处理了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v6].behaviorHint,서류에서 손을 떼고 재판관을 똑바로 본다.,Takes his hands off the document and looks straight at the Judge.,書類から手を離し、裁判官をまっすぐ見る。,把手从文件上移开，直视法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v6].text,"저는 어머니 뜻을 법적으로 훼손했고, 형은 그 뜻을 자기 상처의 기준으로만 봤습니다.","I damaged Mother's wishes legally, and my brother saw those wishes only through the standard of his own hurt.",私は母の意思を法的に損ない、兄はその意思を自分の傷の基準でだけ見ました。,我在法律上损害了母亲的意愿，哥哥则只用自己受伤的标准来看待那份意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v7].behaviorHint,오래 참은 말을 한꺼번에 꺼내듯 이어 간다.,Continues as if releasing words long held back.,長くこらえていた言葉を一気に出すように続ける。,像一下说出压抑已久的话一样继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v7].text,"재판관님, 제가 한 일은 명확한 잘못이고, 형의 마음도 어머니 뜻을 있는 그대로 보지 못했습니다.","Your Honor, what I did is clearly wrong, and my brother's heart also failed to see Mother's wishes as they were.",裁判官、私がしたことは明確な誤りであり、兄の心も母の意思をありのまま見ることができませんでした。,法官，我做的事是明确的错误，哥哥的心也没能如实看见母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v8].behaviorHint,말끝이 낮아지지만 핵심은 흐리지 않는다.,"His ending falls low, but the core does not blur.",語尾は低くなるが、核心はぼかさない。,句尾低下，但核心不模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v8].text,어머니가 남긴 말은 우리 둘 사이에서 증거와 방패가 됐습니다. 그게 가장 아픈 부분입니다.,Mother's words became both evidence and a shield between us. That is the most painful part.,母が残した言葉は、私たちの間で証拠にも盾にもなりました。それが一番痛い部分です。,母亲留下的话在我们之间既成了证据，也成了盾牌。这是最痛的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v9].behaviorHint,침묵 뒤에 가장 무거운 사실을 놓는다.,"After a silence, places the heaviest fact on the record.",沈黙の後、最も重い事実を置く。,沉默之后说出最沉重的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|late].variants[dc-5-b-q2-late-v9].text,형을 탓하며 숨고 싶지 않습니다. 저도 어머니를 지킨다는 명분 안에 가둔 사람입니다.,I do not want to hide behind blaming my brother. I am also someone who trapped Mother inside the excuse of protection.,兄を責めて隠れたいとは思いません。私も母を守るという名分の中に閉じ込めた人間です。,我不想躲在责怪哥哥后面。我也是把母亲困在保护名义里的人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,말을 고르다 한 번 숨을 길게 내쉰다.,"Chooses his words, then lets out one long breath.",言葉を選び、一度長く息を吐く。,斟酌措辞后长长呼出一口气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"인정합니다. 형은 장남이라는 마음으로, 저는 지키겠다는 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 각자 비틀었습니다.","I admit it. My brother twisted Mother's wishes through the heart of eldest son, and I twisted them through the excuse of protection.",認めます。兄は長男という心で、私は守るという名分で、母の意思をそれぞれねじ曲げました。,我承认。哥哥以长子的心态，我以保护的名义，各自扭曲了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v10].behaviorHint,흔들림을 숨기려 자세를 곧게 세운다.,Straightens his posture to hide his wavering.,揺らぎを隠すように姿勢を正す。,挺直姿势，试图掩饰动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v10].text,"어머니를 지킨다고 말했지만, 사실 저는 어머니 뜻을 제가 감당할 수 있는 형태로 고쳤습니다.","I said I was protecting Mother, but in truth I changed her wishes into a form I could bear.",母を守ると言いましたが、実際には母の意思を私が耐えられる形に変えました。,我说是在保护母亲，但实际上是把母亲的意愿改成了我能承受的形式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,책상 모서리를 천천히 문지르며 답한다.,Answers while slowly rubbing the edge of the desk.,机の角をゆっくりなでながら答える。,一边慢慢摩挲桌角一边回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v2].text,형만 어머니를 이용한 것도 아니고 저만 희생한 것도 아닙니다. 둘 다 자기 방식으로 붙잡았습니다.,"It was not only my brother who used Mother, and it was not only I who sacrificed. We both held on in our own ways.",兄だけが母を利用したわけでも、私だけが犠牲になったわけでもありません。二人とも自分のやり方で握りました。,不是只有哥哥利用了母亲，也不是只有我作了牺牲。我们都用自己的方式抓住了她。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,핵심에 이르면 시선을 피하지 않는다.,Does not avert his eyes when he reaches the key point.,核心に至ると視線をそらさない。,说到核心时不回避视线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v3].text,"재판관님, 형은 몫을 당연시했고 저는 뜻을 고쳤습니다. 어느 쪽도 온전하지 않았습니다.","Your Honor, my brother took his share for granted, and I changed the wishes. Neither side was whole.",裁判官、兄は取り分を当然視し、私は意思を変えました。どちらも完全ではありませんでした。,法官，哥哥把份额当成理所当然，我则改动了意愿。哪一边都不完整。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,낮은 목소리지만 인정 대목은 또렷하다.,"His voice is low, but the admission is clear.",低い声だが、認める部分ははっきりしている。,声音很低，但承认的部分很清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v4].text,저는 선의를 말하지만 결과적으로 어머니 뜻을 제 손으로 배치했습니다. 형도 자기 상처로 그 뜻을 읽었습니다.,"I speak of good faith, but in the result I arranged Mother's wishes with my own hands. My brother also read those wishes through his hurt.",私は善意を語りますが、結果的に母の意思を自分の手で配置しました。兄も自分の傷でその意思を読みました。,我说的是善意，但结果上是我亲手安排了母亲的意愿。哥哥也用自己的伤来读那份意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 끊어 말하다가 이유에서 길어진다.,"Speaks in short fragments, then lengthens when giving the reason.",短く切って話し、理由のところで長くなる。,说话短促，到理由处变得更长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v5].text,둘 다 어머니를 사랑했다고 말할 수는 있습니다. 하지만 사랑이 뜻을 대신할 수는 없습니다.,We may both say we loved Mother. But love cannot replace her wishes.,二人とも母を愛していたと言うことはできます。しかし、愛が意思の代わりになることはありません。,我们两人都可以说爱母亲。但爱不能代替她的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v6].behaviorHint,형 쪽을 보려다 다시 재판관을 본다.,"Starts to look toward his brother, then looks back at the Judge.",兄の方を見ようとして、また裁判官を見る。,想看向哥哥，又重新看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v6].text,"형은 어머니를 자기 수고의 증거로 봤고, 저는 어머니를 형을 지키는 이유로 삼았습니다.","My brother saw Mother as proof of his labor, and I used Mother as the reason to protect my brother.",兄は母を自分の苦労の証拠として見て、私は母を兄を守る理由にしました。,哥哥把母亲看成自己辛苦的证明，而我把母亲当成保护哥哥的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두며 책임 단어를 피하지 않는다.,Keeps emotion down and does not avoid the word responsibility.,感情を抑えながら、責任という言葉を避けない。,压住情绪，不回避“责任”这个词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v7].text,어머니가 남긴 마음은 두 사람의 두려움과 자존심 사이에서 바뀌었습니다.,Mother's remaining heart changed between two people's fear and pride.,母が残した心は、二人の恐れと自尊心の間で変わりました。,母亲留下的心意在两个人的恐惧和自尊之间被改变了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v8].behaviorHint,문장 끝마다 잠깐 멈추며 범위를 조정한다.,Pauses at the end of each sentence to adjust the scope.,文末ごとに少し止まり、範囲を調整する。,每句话末尾短暂停顿，调整范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v8].text,제가 형을 탓하기만 할 수 없는 이유가 여기에 있습니다. 저도 어머니 뜻을 그대로 두지 못했습니다.,This is why I cannot only blame my brother. I also failed to leave Mother's wishes as they were.,私が兄を責めるだけではいられない理由はここにあります。私も母の意思をそのままにできませんでした。,这就是我不能只责怪哥哥的原因。我也没能让母亲的意愿保持原样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v9].behaviorHint,기록을 떠올리듯 날짜 대신 순서를 짚는다.,"Traces the sequence rather than dates, as if recalling the record.",記録を思い出すように、日付ではなく順序をたどる。,像回忆记录一样，不说日期而是梳理顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q2-mid-v9].text,형의 당연시와 제 조작이 서로 다른 방식으로 같은 결과를 냈습니다.,My brother's entitlement and my manipulation led to the same result in different ways.,兄の当然視と私の操作は、違う方法で同じ結果を生みました。,哥哥的理所当然和我的操纵，以不同方式造成了同一个结果。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 방문과 낭독을 인정하면서 개입 책임만 피하고 있습니다. 지금 선을 명확히 하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you acknowledge the visit and the reading, yet avoid only the responsibility for intervening. Draw the line clearly now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、訪問と読み上げは認めながら、介入の責任だけを避けています。今、その線を明確にしてください。,尹正厚先生，您承认探望和朗读，却只避开介入责任。现在请把界线说清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 상태를 단정했다가 일부 가능성을 인정했습니다. 왜 그렇게 밀어붙였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you were certain about Mother's condition, then admitted some possibility. Why did you push it that far?",ユン・テソンさん、母の状態を断定しておきながら、一部の可能性は認めました。なぜそこまで押し通したのですか。,尹泰成先生，您先断定母亲的状态，随后又承认部分可能性。为什么要那样强推？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 절차에 들어갔는지 아닌지 더 밝혀 주십시오. 본인 행동을 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, clarify whether this had entered a procedure or not. Speak calmly about your own actions.",ユン・ジョンフさん、手続きに入っていたのかどうか、さらに明らかにしてください。ご自身の行動を落ち着いて話してください。,尹正厚先生，请进一步说明这是否已经进入程序。请冷静说明您自己的行为。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v4].text,두 분 모두 기억을 자기 책임 밖으로 밀고 있습니다. 누가 어떤 말을 했는지 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.,Both of you are pushing the memory outside your own responsibility. State clearly who said what.,お二人とも、記憶を自分の責任の外へ押し出しています。誰が何を言ったのか、明確に話してください。,两位都在把记忆推到自己的责任之外。请明确说明是谁说了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 도움이라는 말로 대신 결정한 부분을 덮을 수 없습니다. 어디서 선을 넘었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the word ""help"" cannot cover the part where you decided in her place. Where did you cross the line?",ユン・ジョンフさん、「手助け」という言葉で、代わりに決めた部分を覆うことはできません。どこで一線を越えましたか。,尹正厚先生，不能用“帮助”这个词盖过您代为决定的部分。您是在哪里越过界线的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 처음엔 동석에 가까웠지만 지금은 유서 절차에 들어간 셈입니다. 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, at first it sounded close to sitting in, but now it amounts to entering the will procedure. Give the reason.",ユン・ジョンフさん、最初は同席に近い説明でしたが、今は遺言書手続きに入ったことになります。理由を答えてください。,尹正厚先生，起初听起来只是陪同在场，但现在等于是进入了遗嘱程序。请说明理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 전혀 판단 못 했다는 주장을 지금 일부 접고 있습니다. 왜 바뀌었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you are now partly retreating from the claim that Mother could not judge anything at all. Why did that change?",ユン・テソンさん、母がまったく判断できなかったという主張を、今は一部取り下げています。なぜ変わったのですか。,尹泰成先生，您现在部分收回了“母亲完全无法判断”的主张。为什么会改变？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 종이를 읽어드린 사실을 늦게 인정했습니다. 처음부터 말하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you admitted late that you read the paper to her. Why did you not say it from the beginning?",ユン・ジョンフさん、紙を読み上げた事実を遅れて認めました。なぜ最初から言わなかったのですか。,尹正厚先生，您很晚才承认曾把纸读给她听。为什么一开始不说？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v4].text,두 분 모두 자기에게 유리한 순간만 붙잡고 있습니다. 판단 능력과 개입 범위를 나누십시오.,Both of you are holding only the moments that favor you. Separate Mother's capacity to judge from the scope of intervention.,お二人とも、自分に有利な瞬間だけをつかんでいます。判断能力と介入の範囲を分けてください。,两位都只抓住对自己有利的片段。请把判断能力和介入范围分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 오기 전 끝내려 한 말의 의미를 계속 줄이고 있습니다. 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you keep minimizing what it meant to finish before Mr. Yoon Tae-seong arrived. Speak calmly.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが来る前に終えようとした意味を、あなたは小さく見せ続けています。落ち着いて話してください。,尹正厚先生，您一直在淡化“赶在尹泰成先生到来前完成”这件事的含义。请冷静说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 단순 방문에서 유서 대화 인정으로 입장이 바뀌었습니다. 어디까지가 사실입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your position has shifted from a simple visit to admitting a conversation about the will. How far is true?",ユン・ジョンフさん、単なる訪問から遺言書の話を認める立場へ変わりました。どこまでが事実ですか。,尹正厚先生，您的说法已从单纯探望变成承认谈过遗嘱。事实到哪里为止？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 전면 무효 주장과 일부 의사 인정 사이의 차이를 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, explain the difference between claiming total invalidity and acknowledging some intent.",ユン・テソンさん、全面無効の主張と一部の意思を認めることの差を説明してください。,尹泰成先生，请说明“主张全面无效”和“承认部分意愿”之间的差别。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 돕기만 했다는 말과 일정까지 챙겼다는 말은 다릅니다. 왜 달라졌습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, merely helping and managing the schedule are different things. Why did your account change?",ユン・ジョンフさん、手伝っただけという話と日程まで管理したという話は違います。なぜ変わったのですか。,尹正厚先生，只是帮忙和连日程都安排，并不是一回事。为什么说法变了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v4].text,"두 분, 어머니 판단을 두고 각자 말을 좁히고 있습니다. 기준을 명확히 해 주십시오.",Both of you are narrowing your words about Mother's judgment. State the standard clearly.,お二人とも、母の判断をめぐってそれぞれ言葉を狭めています。基準を明確にしてください。,两位都在围绕母亲的判断缩小自己的说法。请把标准说清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 방문 기록을 인정한 뒤 개입 의미를 낮추고 있습니다. 어디까지 인정합니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, after acknowledging the visit record, you are downplaying what the intervention meant. How much do you admit?",ユン・ジョンフさん、訪問記録を認めた後、介入の意味を軽く見せています。どこまで認めますか。,尹正厚先生，您承认探望记录后，又在降低介入的意义。您承认到什么程度？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 숫자를 직접 바꾼 사실을 늦게 내놓았습니다. 자필 연습본과 공증본 작성 이유를 지금 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you disclosed late that you changed the numbers yourself. Explain now why the handwritten draft and notarized copy were prepared.",ユン・ジョンフさん、数字を直接変えた事実を遅れて出しました。自筆下書きと公証本を作成した理由を今話してください。,尹正厚先生，您很晚才说出亲自改过数字。现在请说明亲笔草稿和公证本的制作理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨를 욕심으로만 몰아간 판단이 기록과 어긋납니다. 왜 그렇게 확신했습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the record conflicts with your judgment that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu acted only from greed. Why were you so certain?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんを欲だけで動いたと見た判断は記録と食い違います。なぜそこまで確信したのですか。,尹泰成先生，您把尹正厚先生断定为只因贪心行事，这与记录不符。您为什么如此确信？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호였다는 말로 위조 책임을 지울 수 없습니다. 어떤 선을 넘었는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, saying it was protection does not erase the responsibility for forgery. Answer what line you crossed.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護だったという言葉で偽造の責任を消すことはできません。どの一線を越えたのか答えてください。,尹正厚先生，说是保护不能抹去伪造责任。请回答您越过了哪条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v4].text,"두 분, 한쪽은 입장을 바꾸고 다른 한쪽은 단정했습니다. 누가 무엇을 왜곡했는지 명확히 말해 주십시오.","Both of you: one side changed position, the other made a firm assumption. Say clearly who distorted what.",お二人、一方は立場を変え、もう一方は断定しました。誰が何を歪めたのか、明確に話してください。,两位，一方改变了立场，另一方作出了断定。请明确说明谁扭曲了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 변경 방향이 선의였더라도 절차를 고친 건 본인입니다. 책임을 명확히 하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, even if the direction of the change was well meant, you were the one who changed the procedure. Make your responsibility clear.",ユン・ジョンフさん、変更の方向が善意だったとしても、手続きを変えたのは本人です。責任を明確にしてください。,尹正厚先生，即使变更方向出于善意，改动程序的人也是您。请明确责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 서류 제출자에서 변경 주체로 입장이 옮겨졌습니다. 왜 처음부터 말하지 않았습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your position has moved from submitting documents to being the person who made the change. Why did you not say so from the beginning?",ユン・ジョンフさん、書類の提出者から変更の主体へと立場が移りました。なぜ最初から言わなかったのですか。,尹正厚先生，您的位置已从文件提交者变成变更主体。为什么一开始不说？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨를 탐욕으로 단정한 뒤 자필 연습본 방향을 늦게 보셨습니다. 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you branded Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu as greedy, then only later saw the direction of the handwritten draft. What is the reason?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんを欲深いと決めつけた後、自筆下書きの方向を遅れて見ました。理由は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，您先把尹正厚先生断定为贪婪，后来才看到亲笔草稿的方向。原因是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본과 공증본을 모두 알고도 침묵했습니다. 그 침묵의 목적을 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you knew both the handwritten draft and the notarized copy, yet stayed silent. State the purpose of that silence.",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆下書きと公証本の両方を知りながら沈黙しました。その沈黙の目的を答えてください。,尹正厚先生，您明知亲笔草稿和公证本两者，却保持沉默。请回答这份沉默的目的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v4].text,두 분 모두 문서 결과만 앞세우고 동기는 늦게 말했습니다. 무엇을 먼저 숨겼는지 밝혀 주십시오.,Both of you put the document's result first and spoke of motive only later. Tell the court what each of you hid first.,お二人とも文書の結果だけを前に出し、動機は遅れて話しました。何を先に隠したのか明らかにしてください。,两位都先强调文件结果，之后才谈动机。请说明你们最先隐瞒了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어떤 사정이 있었더라도 문서가 달라진 책임은 남습니다. 그 판단을 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, whatever the circumstances, responsibility remains for the document having changed. Answer that judgment.",ユン・ジョンフさん、どんな事情があったとしても、文書が変わった責任は残ります。その判断を答えてください。,尹正厚先生，无论有什么情况，文件被改变的责任仍然存在。请回答您对此的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 제출만 했다는 말에서 숫자 변경 인정으로 입장이 바뀌었습니다. 어느 설명이 사실입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your position changed from merely submitting the document to admitting a change in the numbers. Which explanation is true?",ユン・ジョンフさん、提出しただけという話から数字変更の認めへと立場が変わりました。どちらの説明が事実ですか。,尹正厚先生，您的说法从只是提交变成承认改过数字。哪一种说明才是真实的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 더 가지려 했다는 판단을 자필 연습본 기록 뒤에도 유지하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, after the record of the handwritten draft, do you still maintain that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu was trying to take more?",ユン・テソンさん、自筆下書きの記録を見た後でも、ユン・ジョンフさんがより多く取ろうとしたという判断を維持しますか。,尹泰成先生，看过亲笔草稿记录后，您仍坚持尹正厚先生想拿得更多吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본과 공증본을 모두 알았다면 처음 설명이 부족했습니다. 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you knew both the handwritten draft and the notarized copy, your first explanation was insufficient. State the reason.",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆下書きと公証本の両方を知っていたなら、最初の説明は不十分でした。理由を話してください。,尹正厚先生，如果您知道亲笔草稿和公证本两者，那么最初的说明并不充分。请说明原因。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v4].text,"두 분, 같은 문서를 두고 탐욕과 보호라는 설명이 엇갈립니다. 근거를 나누어 말해 주십시오.",Both of you are explaining the same document as greed and as protection. Separate the grounds for each.,お二人は同じ文書を、欲と保護という別々の説明で語っています。それぞれの根拠を分けて話してください。,两位对同一份文件分别用贪心和保护来解释。请把各自的依据分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서가 달라진 과정과 그 책임을 함께 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain both how the document changed and your responsibility for it.",ユン・ジョンフさん、文書が変わった過程とその責任をあわせて説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请同时说明文件被改变的过程以及您的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 오랜 기간 이어진 돈의 성격을 계속 늦게 말하고 있습니다. 언제부터 누구 돈이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you keep delaying the nature of the money that continued for years. Since when, and whose money was it?",ユン・ジョンフさん、長年続いたお金の性質をずっと遅らせて話しています。いつから、誰のお金だったのですか。,尹正厚先生，您一直迟迟不说明多年持续的这笔钱的性质。从什么时候开始，那是谁的钱？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 도움이라고 믿은 말로 출처 확인을 피했습니다. 왜 묻지 않았습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you avoided checking the source by believing it was Mother's help. Why did you not ask?",ユン・テソンさん、母の援助だと信じることで出所の確認を避けました。なぜ聞かなかったのですか。,尹泰成先生，您相信那是母亲的帮助，从而避开了核实来源。为什么不问？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨의 체면을 이유로 본인 부담을 숨긴 선택이 지금 분쟁을 키웠습니다. 인정합니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, hiding your own burden for Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's pride has now enlarged the dispute. Do you acknowledge that?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの体面を理由に自分の負担を隠した選択が、今この争いを大きくしました。認めますか。,尹正厚先生，您以维护尹泰成先生的面子为由隐瞒自己的负担，如今扩大了争端。您承认吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v4].text,"두 분, 돈을 준 사람과 받은 사람이 모두 침묵했습니다. 그 결과를 서로에게 미루지 마십시오.",Both of you were silent: the person who gave the money and the person who received it. Do not shift the result onto each other.,お二人、渡した人も受け取った人も沈黙しました。その結果を互いに押しつけないでください。,两位，给钱的人和收钱的人都保持沉默。请不要把结果推给对方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 숨긴 지원이 윤태성 씨를 지켰다는 말만으로 충분하지 않습니다. 책임을 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, saying the hidden support protected Mr. Yoon Tae-seong is not enough. Answer for your responsibility.",ユン・ジョンフさん、隠した支援がユン・テソンさんを守ったという言葉だけでは足りません。責任を答えてください。,尹正厚先生，仅说隐瞒的帮助保护了尹泰成先生还不够。请回答您的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 효도 차원의 도움에서 오랜 송금으로 입장이 옮겨졌습니다. 핵심을 왜 빼셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your position moved from filial help to admitting long-running remittances. Why did you leave out the core point?",ユン・ジョンフさん、親孝行の援助から長年の送金を認める話へと立場が移りました。なぜ核心を抜いたのですか。,尹正厚先生，您的说法从孝顺性质的帮助变成承认长期汇款。为什么省略核心？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 도움을 받았다는 사실보다 누구 돈인지 묻지 않은 점이 중요합니다. 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, more important than the fact that you received help is that you did not ask whose money it was. Give the reason.",ユン・テソンさん、援助を受けた事実よりも、誰のお金かを聞かなかった点が重要です。理由を答えてください。,尹泰成先生，比起您得到帮助这一事实，更重要的是您没有问那是谁的钱。请说明理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인 돈이라는 핵심을 늦게 말해 윤태성 씨의 판단을 더 흔들었습니다. 왜 숨겼습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, by revealing late that it was your money, you shook Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's judgment even further. Why did you hide it?",ユン・ジョンフさん、自分のお金だという核心を遅れて話し、ユン・テソンさんの判断をさらに揺さぶりました。なぜ隠したのですか。,尹正厚先生，您很晚才说出那是自己的钱，进一步动摇了尹泰成先生的判断。为什么隐瞒？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v4].text,두 분 모두 체면 때문에 돈의 출처를 피했습니다. 그 침묵이 누구에게 이익이었습니까.,Both of you avoided the source of the money because of pride. Who benefited from that silence?,お二人とも、体面のためにお金の出所を避けました。その沈黙は誰の利益になりましたか。,两位都因面子避开了钱的来源。这份沉默对谁有利？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 장기간 지원을 숨긴 판단이 보호였는지 회피였는지 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state clearly whether hiding the long-term support was protection or avoidance.",ユン・ジョンフさん、長期間の支援を隠した判断が保護だったのか回避だったのか、明確に話してください。,尹正厚先生，请明确说明隐瞒长期帮助的判断，是保护还是回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 작은 도움에서 장기간 송금 인정으로 말이 커졌습니다. 어디까지가 사실입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your words grew from small help to admitting long-term remittances. How far is true?",ユン・ジョンフさん、小さな援助から長期送金の認めへと話が大きくなりました。どこまでが事実ですか。,尹正厚先生，您的说法从小小帮助扩大到承认长期汇款。事实到哪里为止？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 돈이라고 믿던 말에서 출처를 몰랐다는 인정으로 옮기셨습니다. 왜 그렇게 말씀하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you moved from saying you believed it was Mother's money to admitting you did not know the source. Why do you say that?",ユン・テソンさん、母のお金だと信じていたという話から、出所を知らなかったという認めへ移りました。なぜそう話すのですか。,尹泰成先生，您的说法从相信那是母亲的钱变成承认不知道来源。为什么这样说？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 정기적인 지원과 사업 쪽 자금 흐름까지 이어진다면 처음 설명이 너무 작았습니다. 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if regular support and business-related funds were both involved, your first explanation was too small. Explain why.",ユン・ジョンフさん、定期的な支援と事業側の資金の流れまで続いていたなら、最初の説明は小さすぎました。理由を話してください。,尹正厚先生，如果还涉及定期资助和事业方面的资金流，您最初的说明就太轻了。请说明原因。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v4].text,"두 분, 돈의 출처를 두고 기억이 달라졌습니다. 누가 왜 그렇게 판단했는지 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you changed your memory of the money's source. Summarize who judged what, and why.",お二人はお金の出所をめぐって記憶が変わりました。誰がなぜそう判断したのか整理してください。,两位关于钱的来源的记忆发生了变化。请整理是谁为什么那样判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 도움의 규모를 줄여 말한 이유가 윤태성 씨의 체면 때문이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, was the reason you understated the scale of the help Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's pride?",ユン・ジョンフさん、支援の規模を小さく話した理由はユン・テソンさんの体面だったのですか。,尹正厚先生，您把帮助规模说小，是因为尹泰成先生的面子吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨와 관련한 민감한 가족사를 알고도 법정까지 숨겼습니다. 보호라는 말로 끝낼 수 없습니다.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you knew sensitive family history about Mr. Yoon Tae-seong and still hid it until this court. This cannot end with the word ""protection.""",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに関わる繊細な家族史を知りながら、法廷まで隠しました。「保護」という言葉で終わらせることはできません。,尹正厚先生，您明知与尹泰成先生有关的敏感家族史，却一直隐瞒到法庭。不能用“保护”一词就结束。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 모른 채 살아온 분노만으로 판단하면 다시 사실을 놓칩니다. 지금 무엇을 인정합니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you judge only by the anger of having lived without knowing, you will miss the facts again. What do you acknowledge now?",ユン・テソンさん、知らずに生きてきた怒りだけで判断すれば、また事実を見失います。今、何を認めますか。,尹泰成先生，如果只凭“不知情地活到现在”的愤怒来判断，您会再次错过事实。现在您承认什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 유서를 고쳐 비밀을 막으려 한 판단이 분쟁을 만들었습니다. 책임을 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your decision to change the will to block the secret created this dispute. Answer for your responsibility.",ユン・ジョンフさん、秘密を防ぐために遺言書を変えようとした判断が、この争いを生みました。責任を答えてください。,尹正厚先生，您为了阻止秘密暴露而改动遗嘱的判断，造成了这场争端。请回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v4].text,"두 분, 숨김과 단정이 서로 단초가 됐습니다. 시간순으로 누가 먼저 무엇을 숨겼습니까.","Both of you: concealment and assumption became each other's trigger. In order, who hid what first?",お二人、隠したことと決めつけたことが互いのきっかけになりました。時間順に、誰が先に何を隠しましたか。,两位，隐瞒和断定互为导火索。请按时间顺序说明谁先隐瞒了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 책임 회피를 끊고 핵심 답변을 요구한다. 모순을 법정 기록으로 고정하는 톤이다.,The Judge cuts off avoidance of responsibility and demands a key answer. Tone fixes the contradiction in the court record.,裁判官が責任回避を断ち切り、核心の答えを求める。矛盾を法廷記録に固定するトーン。,法官切断逃避责任，要求核心回答。语气将矛盾固定为法庭记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵은 윤태성 씨를 지킨 게 아니라 의심을 키웠습니다. 그 판단을 지금 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your silence did not protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong; it deepened suspicion. Explain that judgment now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙はユン・テソンさんを守ったのではなく、疑いを大きくしました。その判断を今説明してください。,尹正厚先生，您的沉默没有保护尹泰成先生，而是加深了怀疑。现在请解释那项判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 출생 문제를 알고도 유서 문제로 덮어 두셨습니다. 왜 처음부터 말하지 않았습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you knew the birth issue and still covered it with the will issue. Why did you not say it from the start?",ユン・ジョンフさん、出生の問題を知りながら遺言書の問題で覆っていました。なぜ最初から言わなかったのですか。,尹正厚先生，您明知出生问题，却用遗嘱问题遮住了它。为什么一开始不说？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 숨겼다는 사실에 분노하면서도 그 이유를 들어야 합니다. 답을 받아들이겠습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, while you are angry that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu hid it, you must also hear why. Will you accept the answer?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが隠した事実に怒りながらも、その理由は聞かなければなりません。答えを受け入れられますか。,尹泰成先生，您因尹正厚先生隐瞒而愤怒，但也必须听他的理由。您能接受答案吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨의 삶을 지킨다는 판단이 서류 변경까지 이어졌습니다. 그 연결을 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your judgment that you were protecting Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's life led all the way to changing the document. Explain that link.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの人生を守るという判断が、書類の変更にまでつながりました。そのつながりを説明してください。,尹正厚先生，您认为是在保护尹泰成先生的人生，而这一路延伸到文件变更。请说明其中的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v4].text,두 분 모두 비밀 앞에서 책임을 갈라 말합니다. 누가 언제 무엇을 숨겼는지 답해 주십시오.,"Both of you split responsibility in front of the secret. Answer who hid what, and when.",お二人とも、秘密の前で責任を分けて話しています。誰がいつ何を隠したのか答えてください。,两位都在秘密面前切分责任。请回答谁在什么时候隐瞒了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 달라진 입장을 분명히 짚고 이유를 요구한다. 회피가 길어지지 않게 잡는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the changed position and demands the reason. Tone keeps evasion from dragging on.,裁判官が変わった立場を明確に指摘し、理由を求める。回避が長引かないよう押さえるトーン。,法官明确指出立场变化并要求理由。语气防止回避继续拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵이 보호였다고 하면서 윤태성 씨에게 더 큰 충격을 남겼습니다. 왜 버텼습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you say your silence was protection, yet it left Mr. Yoon Tae-seong with an even greater shock. Why did you hold out?",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙は保護だったと言いながら、ユン・テソンさんにはさらに大きな衝撃を残しました。なぜ耐え続けたのですか。,尹正厚先生，您说沉默是保护，却给尹泰成先生留下了更大的冲击。为什么一直撑着不说？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 모른다던 태도에서 어머니 기록과 침묵의 이유까지 드러났습니다. 어느 시점부터 알았습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your stance moved from not knowing to revealing Mother's record and the reason for your silence. Since when did you know?",ユン・ジョンフさん、知らないという態度から、母の記録と沈黙の理由まで明らかになりました。どの時点から知っていたのですか。,尹正厚先生，您的态度从说不知道，变成母亲记录和沉默理由都显露出来。您是从什么时候知道的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 유서 문제에서 숨겨진 가족사 문제로 입장이 흔들렸습니다. 지금 무엇이 더 큽니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, your position has wavered from the will issue to the hidden family history. What is greater now?",ユン・テソンさん、遺言書の問題から隠された家族史の問題へと立場が揺れています。今、何のほうが大きいですか。,尹泰成先生，您的立场从遗嘱问题动摇到隐藏家族史问题。现在什么更重要？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨를 지키려 했다는 말과 비밀을 숨긴 행동은 함께 보아야 합니다. 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, your words that you tried to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong and your act of hiding the secret must be seen together. Give the reason.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんを守ろうとしたという言葉と、秘密を隠した行動は一緒に見なければなりません。理由を話してください。,尹正厚先生，您说想保护尹泰成先生，以及您隐瞒秘密的行为，必须放在一起看。请说明理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v4].text,"두 분, 침묵과 폭로 사이에서 서로의 기억이 달라졌습니다. 시간순으로 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, between silence and disclosure, your memories diverged. Put them in chronological order.",お二人、沈黙と暴露の間で互いの記憶がずれました。時間順に整理してください。,两位，在沉默与揭露之间，你们彼此的记忆发生了偏差。请按时间顺序整理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말의 결이 달라진 지점을 조용히 짚는다. 스스로 정리할 여지를 남기는 톤이다.,The Judge quietly points out where the texture of the statement changed. Tone leaves room for self-organization.,裁判官が言葉の調子が変わった地点を静かに指摘する。自分で整理する余地を残すトーン。,法官安静指出话语质地发生变化的地方。语气留出自行整理的余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 기록을 본 뒤에도 아무 말 하지 않은 선택을 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain your choice to say nothing even after seeing Mother's record.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の記録を見た後にも何も言わなかった選択を説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明您看过母亲记录后仍然什么都不说的选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v1].text,"유서 사본, 방문기록, 최복순 씨 증언이 모두 윤정후 씨의 개입을 향합니다. 윤정후 씨, 문병이었는지 유서 절차였는지 지금 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","The will copy, visit record, and Choi Bok-sun's testimony all point to Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's involvement. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state clearly now whether this was a sickroom visit or a will procedure.",遺言書コピー、訪問記録、チェ・ボクスンさんの証言は、いずれもユン・ジョンフさんの関与を指しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、見舞いだったのか遺言書手続きだったのか、今はっきり話してください。,遗嘱副本、探访记录和崔福顺的证言都指向尹正厚先生的介入。尹正厚先生，现在请明确说明这是探病，还是遗嘱程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"윤정후 씨, 방문이 늘어난 기록과 종이를 읽어드린 증언을 더는 따로 떼어 볼 수 없습니다. 윤태성 씨를 피한 판단을 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the record of increased visits and the testimony that you read papers to her can no longer be viewed separately. Explain the judgment to avoid Mr. Yoon Tae-seong.",ユン・ジョンフさん、訪問が増えた記録と紙を読み上げた証言を、これ以上切り離して見ることはできません。ユン・テソンさんを避けた判断を説明してください。,尹正厚先生，探访增加的记录和您读纸给她听的证言，已经不能再分开看。请解释您避开尹泰成先生的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"최복순 씨가 들은 말과 방문기록이 맞물립니다. 윤정후 씨, 어머니를 도운 것인지 유서 과정을 끌고 간 것인지 선을 명확히 하십시오.","What Choi Bok-sun heard and the visit record fit together. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, draw the line: were you helping Mother, or leading the will process?",チェ・ボクスンさんが聞いた言葉と訪問記録がかみ合っています。ユン・ジョンフさん、母を助けたのか、遺言書の過程を引っ張ったのか、線を明確にしてください。,崔福顺听到的话与探访记录相互吻合。尹正厚先生，请把界线说清楚：您是在帮助母亲，还是在推动遗嘱过程？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"말년의 방문 흐름은 우연으로 보기 어렵습니다. 윤정후 씨, 유서 이야기를 윤태성 씨 없이 진행한 책임을 지금 말씀해 주십시오.","The pattern of visits in Mother's final years is hard to treat as coincidence. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state now your responsibility for discussing the will without Mr. Yoon Tae-seong.",晩年の訪問の流れは偶然とは見にくいものです。ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさん抜きで遺言書の話を進めた責任を今話してください。,母亲晚年的探访变化很难视为偶然。尹正厚先生，现在请说明您在没有尹泰成先生的情况下推进遗嘱谈话的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-hard-v5].text,"유서 사본 뒤에는 방문기록과 낭독 장면이 붙어 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 일에서 본인이 맡은 역할을 숨기지 말고 답해 주십시오.","Behind the will copy are the visit record and the scene of the reading. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do not hide the role you played in it; answer.",遺言書コピーの背後には、訪問記録と読み上げの場面があります。ユン・ジョンフさん、その件で自分が担った役割を隠さず答えてください。,遗嘱副本背后还有探访记录和朗读场面。尹正厚先生，请不要隐瞒您在其中承担的角色，回答问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"방문기록과 최복순 씨 증언을 나란히 보면 단순 문병으로 보기 어렵습니다. 윤정후 씨, 종이를 읽어드린 이유와 윤태성 씨를 피한 이유를 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Viewed together, the visit record and Choi Bok-sun's testimony make it difficult to call this a simple sickroom visit. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, separately explain why you read the paper to her and why you avoided Mr. Yoon Tae-seong.",訪問記録とチェ・ボクスンさんの証言を並べると、単なる見舞いとは見にくいものです。ユン・ジョンフさん、紙を読み上げた理由とユン・テソンさんを避けた理由を分けて話してください。,把探访记录和崔福顺的证言并列来看，很难说只是普通探病。尹正厚先生，请分别说明您读纸给她听的理由，以及避开尹泰成先生的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"유서 사본의 작성 시점과 말년 방문 증가, 요양보호사 증언이 같은 장면을 만들고 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 더 미루지 말고 경위를 말해 주십시오.","The timing of the will copy, the increase in final-years visits, and the caregiver's testimony form one scene. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, stop postponing it and explain the circumstances.",遺言書コピーの作成時点、晩年の訪問増加、介護職員の証言が一つの場面を作っています。ユン・ジョンフさん、これ以上先送りせず経緯を話してください。,遗嘱副本的制作时间、晚年探访增加和护理员证言，构成了同一个场景。尹正厚先生，请不要再拖延，说明经过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"윤정후 씨가 방문한 시기와 최복순 씨가 본 낭독 장면이 겹칩니다. 윤정후 씨, 어머니 뜻을 확인한 것인지 절차를 이끈 것인지 답해 주십시오.","The period when Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu visited overlaps with the reading scene Choi Bok-sun saw. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, answer whether you confirmed Mother's wishes or led the procedure.",ユン・ジョンフさんが訪問した時期と、チェ・ボクスンさんが見た読み上げの場面が重なります。ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思を確認したのか、手続きを導いたのか答えてください。,尹正厚先生探访的时期，与崔福顺看到的朗读场面重合。尹正厚先生，请回答您是在确认母亲的意愿，还是在主导程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].text,유서가 작성된 흐름은 문서 하나로 끝나지 않습니다. 방문기록과 증언이 윤정후 씨의 역할을 묻고 있습니다. 지금 설명해 주십시오.,The drafting of the will does not end with one document. The visit record and testimony are asking about Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's role. Explain now.,遺言書が作られた流れは、文書一つでは終わりません。訪問記録と証言がユン・ジョンフさんの役割を問うています。今説明してください。,遗嘱制作的流程不是一份文件就能结束。探访记录和证言正在追问尹正厚先生的角色。现在请说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 방문이 늘어난 이유를 효심으로만 말하기에는 종이 낭독 증언이 남아 있습니다. 윤태성 씨가 오기 전 끝내려 한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, it is not enough to explain the increased visits only as filial devotion when testimony remains that you read papers aloud. State why you tried to finish before Mr. Yoon Tae-seong came.",ユン・ジョンフさん、訪問が増えた理由を親孝行だけで説明するには、紙を読み上げたという証言が残っています。ユン・テソンさんが来る前に終えようとした理由を話してください。,尹正厚先生，仅用孝心解释探访增加，并不能解释留下的朗读纸张证言。请说明为什么要在尹泰成先生到来前结束。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v1].text,"유서 사본과 말년 방문기록, 최복순 씨의 음성증언을 함께 보면 방문이 늘어난 시기와 종이를 읽어드린 장면이 겹칩니다. 윤정후 씨, 왜 윤태성 씨가 오기 전에 마치려 했는지 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","Taken together, the will copy, final-years visit record, and Choi Bok-sun's voice testimony show that the timing of increased visits overlaps with the scene of reading papers. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, calmly explain why you tried to finish before Mr. Yoon Tae-seong arrived.",遺言書コピー、晩年の訪問記録、チェ・ボクスンさんの音声証言をあわせて見ると、訪問が増えた時期と紙を読み上げた場面が重なります。ユン・ジョンフさん、なぜユン・テソンさんが来る前に終えようとしたのか、落ち着いて話してください。,把遗嘱副本、晚年探访记录和崔福顺的语音证言一起看，探访增加的时期与读纸给她听的场面重合。尹正厚先生，请冷静说明为什么要在尹泰成先生到来前结束。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"방문기록은 윤정후 씨가 말년에 자주 들른 흐름을 보이고, 최복순 씨 증언은 종이를 읽어드린 장면을 보탭니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 순서를 설명해 주십시오.","The visit record shows that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu often stopped by in Mother's final years, and Choi Bok-sun's testimony adds the scene of reading papers aloud. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain that sequence.",訪問記録はユン・ジョンフさんが晩年によく立ち寄った流れを示し、チェ・ボクスンさんの証言は紙を読み上げた場面を補っています。ユン・ジョンフさん、その順序を説明してください。,探访记录显示尹正厚先生在母亲晚年频繁到访，崔福顺的证言又补上了朗读纸张的场面。尹正厚先生，请说明这个顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v3].text,"유서 사본만 보면 결과가 보이고, 방문기록과 요양보호사 증언을 붙이면 작성 과정이 보입니다. 윤정후 씨, 그때 윤태성 씨를 피하려 했습니까.","The will copy alone shows the result; adding the visit record and caregiver testimony shows the drafting process. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, were you trying to avoid Mr. Yoon Tae-seong then?",遺言書コピーだけを見れば結果が見え、訪問記録と介護職員の証言を合わせると作成過程が見えます。ユン・ジョンフさん、その時ユン・テソンさんを避けようとしましたか。,只看遗嘱副本能看到结果，加上探访记录和护理员证言，就能看到制作过程。尹正厚先生，当时您是否想避开尹泰成先生？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v4].text,"말년 방문이 늘어난 기록과 종이를 읽어드렸다는 증언이 한 결론으로 이어집니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 방문의 목적을 정리해 주십시오.","The record of increased final-years visits and the testimony that you read papers aloud lead to one conclusion. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, summarize the purpose of those visits.",晩年の訪問が増えた記録と紙を読み上げたという証言は、一つの結論へつながります。ユン・ジョンフさん、その訪問の目的を整理してください。,晚年探访增加的记录和朗读纸张的证言，指向一个结论。尹正厚先生，请整理那些探访的目的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"유서가 남은 시기와 윤정후 씨의 방문 흐름, 최복순 씨가 들은 말이 맞물립니다. 윤정후 씨, 왜 서둘렀는지 말씀해 주십시오.","The timing of the remaining will, Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's visit pattern, and what Choi Bok-sun heard fit together. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state why you hurried.",遺言書が残った時期、ユン・ジョンフさんの訪問の流れ、チェ・ボクスンさんが聞いた言葉がかみ合っています。ユン・ジョンフさん、なぜ急いだのか話してください。,留下遗嘱的时期、尹正厚先生的探访轨迹，以及崔福顺听到的话相互吻合。尹正厚先生，请说明为什么要赶。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니를 도왔다는 말만으로 방문기록과 낭독 증언을 덮을 수 없습니다. 어디서 선을 넘었는지 지금 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the word ""helped"" cannot cover the visit record and the reading testimony. State now where you crossed the line.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母を助けたという言葉だけでは、訪問記録と読み上げの証言を覆えません。どこで一線を越えたのか、今話してください。,尹正厚先生，不能只用“帮助母亲”来盖过探访记录和朗读证言。现在请说明您在哪里越过界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v2].text,"유서 결과와 방문 과정, 최복순 씨 증언이 윤정후 씨 판단을 가리킵니다. 대신 결정한 부분을 명확히 답해 주십시오.","The will's result, the visit process, and Choi Bok-sun's testimony all point to Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's judgment. Answer clearly what you decided in Mother's place.",遺言書の結果、訪問の過程、チェ・ボクスンさんの証言は、いずれもユン・ジョンフさんの判断を指しています。代わりに決めた部分を明確に答えてください。,遗嘱结果、探访过程和崔福顺的证言都指向尹正厚先生的判断。请明确回答您代为决定了哪一部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v3].text,"단순 도움이라면 왜 윤태성 씨가 오기 전 마치려 했는지가 설명돼야 합니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 책임을 지금 말해 주십시오.","If this was simple help, you must explain why you tried to finish before Mr. Yoon Tae-seong came. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state that responsibility now.",単純な手助けだったなら、なぜユン・テソンさんが来る前に終えようとしたのか説明されなければなりません。ユン・ジョンフさん、その責任を今話してください。,如果只是单纯帮忙，就必须解释为什么要在尹泰成先生到来前结束。尹正厚先生，现在请说明这份责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 기록은 곁에 선 사람이 아니라 방향을 잡은 사람을 묻고 있습니다. 본인 역할을 차분히 인정해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the record is asking not about someone standing beside Mother, but about someone setting the direction. Calmly acknowledge your role.",ユン・ジョンフさん、記録が問うているのは、そばに立った人ではなく、方向を決めた人です。ご自身の役割を落ち着いて認めてください。,尹正厚先生，记录追问的不是站在旁边的人，而是决定方向的人。请冷静承认您自己的角色。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the final-years papers combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以晚年纸页组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-hard-v5].text,"방문기록과 증언이 도움과 개입의 경계를 무너뜨리고 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 어머니 뜻에 본인 판단을 얼마나 얹었습니까.","The visit record and testimony are breaking down the boundary between help and intervention. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how much of your own judgment did you add to Mother's wishes?",訪問記録と証言が、手助けと介入の境界を崩しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思にご自身の判断をどれほど載せましたか。,探访记录和证言正在打破帮助与介入的界线。尹正厚先生，您在母亲意愿上加入了多少自己的判断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 방문기록과 낭독 증언을 보면 단순히 옆에 있었다는 설명은 부족합니다. 어디서부터 본인 판단이 들어갔는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the visit record and reading testimony make the explanation that you were simply beside her insufficient. State where your own judgment began.",ユン・ジョンフさん、訪問記録と読み上げの証言を見ると、単にそばにいたという説明では足りません。どこからご自身の判断が入ったのか話してください。,尹正厚先生，从探访记录和朗读证言来看，仅说您在旁边并不充分。请说明从哪里开始加入了您自己的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v2].text,"유서 사본의 결과와 말년 방문, 최복순 씨 증언을 붙이면 절차의 속도가 보입니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 속도를 누가 잡았습니까.","When the will copy's result is linked with final-years visits and Choi Bok-sun's testimony, the speed of the procedure becomes visible. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, who set that pace?",遺言書コピーの結果と晩年の訪問、チェ・ボクスンさんの証言を合わせると、手続きの速度が見えてきます。ユン・ジョンフさん、その速度を決めたのは誰ですか。,把遗嘱副本的结果、晚年探访和崔福顺的证言连起来看，程序的速度就显现出来。尹正厚先生，是谁掌握了这个速度？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v3].text,어머니 뜻이 남아 있었다 해도 윤정후 씨가 문장과 순서를 잡았다면 책임이 달라집니다. 그 경계를 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.,"Even if Mother's wishes remained, if Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu set the wording and order, the responsibility changes. Explain that boundary calmly.",母の意思が残っていたとしても、ユン・ジョンフさんが文と順序を整えたなら責任は変わります。その境界を落ち着いて話してください。,即使母亲的意愿仍在，如果尹正厚先生确定了文字和顺序，责任就会不同。请冷静说明这条界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v4].text,방문기록과 증언은 윤정후 씨가 단순 보호자가 아니라 절차 안에 있었다는 점을 묻습니다. 더 미루지 말고 답해 주십시오.,"The visit record and testimony ask whether Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu was not simply a protector, but inside the procedure itself. Stop postponing it and answer.",訪問記録と証言は、ユン・ジョンフさんが単なる保護者ではなく、手続きの中にいたのではないかを問うています。これ以上先送りせず答えてください。,探访记录和证言在追问，尹正厚先生是否不只是保护者，而是已经进入程序之中。请不要再拖延，回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the final-years papers combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出晚年纸页组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 도움이라고 말하려면 대신 결정하지 않은 지점이 있어야 합니다. 그 지점을 기록과 맞춰 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, to call it help, there must be a point where you did not decide in Mother's place. Explain that point against the record.",ユン・ジョンフさん、手助けと言うなら、代わりに決めていない地点がなければなりません。その地点を記録と照らして説明してください。,尹正厚先生，如果要说是帮助，就必须有一个您没有代为决定的地方。请结合记录说明这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v1].text,"유서 사본, 방문기록, 최복순 씨 증언을 함께 보면 어머니를 도운 부분과 대신 밀어붙인 부분을 나누어야 합니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 경계를 말씀해 주십시오.","Taken together, the will copy, visit record, and Choi Bok-sun's testimony require separating the part where you helped Mother from the part where you pushed in her place. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state that boundary.",遺言書コピー、訪問記録、チェ・ボクスンさんの証言をあわせて見ると、母を助けた部分と代わりに押し進めた部分を分ける必要があります。ユン・ジョンフさん、その境界を話してください。,把遗嘱副本、探访记录和崔福顺的证言一起看，必须区分您帮助母亲的部分和代她推进的部分。尹正厚先生，请说明这条界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v2].text,"방문기록은 자주 곁에 있었다는 점을 보이고, 증언은 문서를 읽어드린 방식을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 어디까지가 도움이었습니까.","The visit record shows you were often beside her, and the testimony shows how you read the document to her. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how far was it help?",訪問記録は頻繁にそばにいた点を示し、証言は文書を読み上げた方法を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、どこまでが手助けでしたか。,探访记录显示您经常在她身边，证言则显示您读文件给她听的方式。尹正厚先生，到哪里为止是帮助？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v3].text,"어머니가 혼자 읽기 어려웠다는 사정과 윤정후 씨가 절차를 서둘렀다는 정황이 함께 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 차분히 구분해 주십시오.","There is both the circumstance that Mother had difficulty reading alone and the indication that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu hurried the procedure. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, distinguish the two calmly.",母が一人で読むのが難しかった事情と、ユン・ジョンフさんが手続きを急がせた情況が共にあります。ユン・ジョンフさん、落ち着いて区別してください。,这里既有母亲难以独自阅读的情况，也有尹正厚先生催促程序的迹象。尹正厚先生，请冷静区分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v4].text,"최복순 씨 증언은 낭독 장면을, 방문기록은 반복된 접촉을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 도움과 개입의 차이를 설명해 주십시오.","Choi Bok-sun's testimony shows the reading scene, and the visit record shows repeated contact. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain the difference between help and intervention.",チェ・ボクスンさんの証言は読み上げの場面を、訪問記録は繰り返された接触を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、手助けと介入の違いを説明してください。,崔福顺的证言显示朗读场面，探访记录显示反复接触。尹正厚先生，请说明帮助与介入的差别。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 말년의 종이 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the final-years papers combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が晩年の紙コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出晚年纸页组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-1-b-q2-soft-v5].text,"유서 사본만으로는 결과가 보이고, 나머지 기록을 붙이면 과정이 보입니다. 윤정후 씨, 어머니 판단을 어디까지 존중했습니까.","The will copy alone shows the result, and the other records show the process. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how far did you respect Mother's judgment?",遺言書コピーだけでは結果が見え、他の記録を合わせると過程が見えます。ユン・ジョンフさん、母の判断をどこまで尊重しましたか。,单看遗嘱副本能看到结果，加上其他记录就能看到过程。尹正厚先生，您尊重母亲判断到什么程度？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v1].text,공증인 메모 기록과 자필 연습본이 윤정후 씨의 변경을 가리킵니다. 윤정후 씨 몫이 90에서 60으로 줄고 윤태성 씨에게 40이 남은 이유를 지금 말씀해 주십시오.,"The Notary's Memo Notes and the handwritten draft point to Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's change. Explain now why Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's share fell from 90 to 60, leaving 40 to Mr. Yoon Tae-seong.",公証人のメモ記録と自筆下書きは、ユン・ジョンフさんの変更を指しています。ユン・ジョンフさんの取り分が90から60へ減り、ユン・テソンさんに40が残った理由を今話してください。,公证人备忘记录和亲笔草稿都指向尹正厚先生的变更。现在请说明为什么尹正厚先生的份额从90降到60，并给尹泰成先生留下40。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"윤정후 씨, 더 가져가려 한 조작이 아니었다는 점은 기록이 보여 줍니다. 그렇다고 문서를 고친 책임이 사라지지는 않습니다. 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the record shows this was not manipulation to take more. But that does not erase the responsibility for changing the document. Answer why.",ユン・ジョンフさん、もっと取ろうとした操作ではなかったことは記録が示しています。だからといって文書を変えた責任が消えるわけではありません。理由を答えてください。,尹正厚先生，记录显示这并不是为了多拿而操纵。但这并不意味着改动文件的责任会消失。请说明理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"자필 연습본과 공증본의 방향은 분명합니다. 윤정후 씨, 본인 몫을 낮추면서까지 다시 낸 목적을 숨기지 말고 말씀해 주십시오.","The direction of the handwritten draft and the notarized copy is clear. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do not hide why you resubmitted it even while lowering your own share.",自筆下書きと公証本の方向は明確です。ユン・ジョンフさん、自分の取り分を下げてまで出し直した目的を隠さず話してください。,亲笔草稿和公证本的方向很明确。尹正厚先生，请不要隐瞒您为何即使降低自己的份额也要重新提交。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"공증인 메모의 순서와 자필 연습본이 같은 결론으로 갑니다. 윤정후 씨, 위조의 주체와 동기를 지금 명확히 하십시오.","The order in the Notary's Memo Notes and the handwritten draft lead to the same conclusion. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state clearly now who carried out the forgery and why.",公証人のメモ記録の順序と自筆下書きは、同じ結論へ向かっています。ユン・ジョンフさん、偽造の主体と動機を今明確にしてください。,公证人备忘记录中的顺序和亲笔草稿指向同一结论。尹正厚先生，现在请明确伪造主体和动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-hard-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 기록은 탐욕이 아니라 다른 숨김을 가리킵니다. 그 숨김 때문에 문서를 바꾼 사실을 인정하고 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the record points not to greed, but to another concealment. Admit that you changed the document because of that concealment and explain.",ユン・ジョンフさん、記録は欲ではなく別の隠し事を指しています。その隠し事のために文書を変えた事実を認め、説明してください。,尹正厚先生，记录指向的不是贪心，而是另一项隐瞒。请承认您因那项隐瞒而改动文件，并作说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"공증본과 자필 연습본을 함께 보면 윤정후 씨 몫이 90에서 60으로 줄고 윤태성 씨에게 40이 남았습니다. 윤정후 씨, 더 받으려 한 게 아니라면 무엇을 막으려 했습니까.","When the notarized copy and handwritten draft are viewed together, Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's share fell from 90 to 60 and 40 remained for Mr. Yoon Tae-seong. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you were not trying to receive more, what were you trying to prevent?",公証本と自筆下書きをあわせて見ると、ユン・ジョンフさんの取り分は90から60へ減り、ユン・テソンさんに40が残りました。ユン・ジョンフさん、もっと受け取ろうとしたのではないなら、何を防ごうとしたのですか。,把公证本和亲笔草稿一起看，尹正厚先生的份额从90降到60，尹泰成先生留下40。尹正厚先生，如果不是想多拿，您想阻止什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"공증인 메모와 서랍에서 나온 자필 연습본은 변경 주체를 묻고 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 다시 낸 이유를 피하지 말고 답해 주십시오.","The Notary's Memo Notes and the handwritten draft found in the drawer ask who made the change. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do not avoid why you submitted it again; answer.",公証人のメモ記録と引き出しから出た自筆下書きは、変更の主体を問うています。ユン・ジョンフさん、出し直した理由を避けずに答えてください。,公证人备忘记录和抽屉里找到的亲笔草稿都在追问变更主体。尹正厚先生，请不要回避重新提交的理由，回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"자필 연습본은 윤정후 씨에게 크게 기울었고 공증본은 그 몫을 낮췄습니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 방향을 알고도 왜 처음엔 말하지 않았습니까.","The handwritten draft leaned heavily toward Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, while the notarized copy lowered that share. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, knowing that direction, why did you not say it at first?",自筆下書きはユン・ジョンフさん側へ大きく傾き、公証本はその取り分を下げました。ユン・ジョンフさん、その方向を知りながら、なぜ最初は言わなかったのですか。,亲笔草稿明显偏向尹正厚先生，而公证本降低了那份份额。尹正厚先生，明知这个方向，为什么一开始不说？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"공증인 메모는 문서에 누가 손댔는지를, 자필 연습본은 무엇이 바뀌었는지를 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 경위를 답해 주십시오.","The Notary's Memo Notes show who touched the document, and the handwritten draft shows what changed. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, answer the circumstances.",公証人のメモ記録は誰が文書に手を加えたかを、自筆下書きは何が変わったかを示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、経緯を答えてください。,公证人备忘记录显示谁动过文件，亲笔草稿显示改了什么。尹正厚先生，请回答经过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본과 공증본을 모두 알았다면 침묵은 단순 실수가 아닙니다. 왜 윤정후 씨 몫을 줄인 서류를 냈습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you knew both the handwritten draft and the notarized copy, your silence was not a simple mistake. Why did you submit a document that reduced your share?",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆下書きと公証本をどちらも知っていたなら、沈黙は単なるミスではありません。なぜユン・ジョンフさんの取り分を減らした書類を出したのですか。,尹正厚先生，如果您知道亲笔草稿和公证本两者，沉默就不是单纯失误。为什么提交了降低自己份额的文件？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v1].text,"공증인 메모 기록과 어머니 자필 연습본을 맞대면 윤정후 씨 몫이 자필 연습본보다 공증본에서 줄었습니다. 윤정후 씨, 왜 그런 서류를 다시 냈습니까.","When the Notary's Memo Notes are set against Mother's handwritten draft, Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's share is lower in the notarized copy than in the handwritten draft. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you submit such a document again?",公証人のメモ記録と母の自筆下書きを照らすと、ユン・ジョンフさんの取り分は自筆下書きより公証本で減っています。ユン・ジョンフさん、なぜそのような書類を出し直したのですか。,把公证人备忘记录与母亲的亲笔草稿对照来看，尹正厚先生在公证本中的份额低于亲笔草稿。尹正厚先生，为什么重新提交这样的文件？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"공증인 메모 기록은 같은 날 문서가 달라진 흐름을 보이고, 자필 연습본은 처음 뜻을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 변경 경위를 말씀해 주십시오.","The Notary's Memo Notes show that the document changed on the same day, and the handwritten draft shows the first intent. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state how the change happened.",公証人のメモ記録は同じ日に文書が変わった流れを示し、自筆下書きは最初の意思を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、変更の経緯を話してください。,公证人备忘记录显示同一天文件发生变化，亲笔草稿显示最初意愿。尹正厚先生，请说明变更经过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v3].text,자필 연습본과 공증인 메모 기록은 윤정후 씨가 더 받으려 한 조작이 아니었음을 보여 줍니다. 그럼 왜 다시 제출했습니까.,The handwritten draft and Notary's Memo Notes show that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu was not manipulating it to receive more. Then why did you resubmit it?,自筆下書きと公証人のメモ記録は、ユン・ジョンフさんがもっと受け取ろうとして操作したわけではないことを示しています。では、なぜ出し直したのですか。,亲笔草稿和公证人备忘记录显示，尹正厚先生并不是为了多拿而操纵。那么为什么重新提交？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v4].text,"공증인 메모에는 두 문서의 순서가 남아 있고, 자필 연습본은 윤정후 씨 쪽에 더 크게 기운 뜻을 담고 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","The Notary's Memo Notes preserve the order of the two documents, and the handwritten draft contains a meaning that leaned more toward Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain why.",公証人のメモには二つの文書の順序が残っており、自筆下書きにはユン・ジョンフさん側へより大きく傾いた意思が含まれています。ユン・ジョンフさん、理由を説明してください。,公证人备忘记录中留下了两份文件的顺序，亲笔草稿则包含更偏向尹正厚先生的意思。尹正厚先生，请说明理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"어머니 서랍의 자필 연습본과 공증본을 함께 보면 변경 방향이 드러납니다. 윤정후 씨, 윤정후 씨 몫을 낮춘 판단부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Looking at Mother's handwritten draft from the drawer together with the notarized copy reveals the direction of the change. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, start by explaining the judgment that lowered your share.",母の引き出しの自筆下書きと公証本をあわせて見ると、変更の方向が明らかになります。ユン・ジョンフさん、まずユン・ジョンフさんの取り分を下げた判断から話してください。,把母亲抽屉里的亲笔草稿和公证本一起看，就能看出变更方向。尹正厚先生，请先说明降低自己份额的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 본인 몫을 줄였다는 말로 위조가 사라지지 않습니다. 공증인 메모와 자필 연습본이 남아 있습니다. 무엇을 막으려 했습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the fact that you reduced your own share does not make the forgery disappear. The Notary's Memo Notes and handwritten draft remain. What were you trying to prevent?",ユン・ジョンフさん、自分の取り分を減らしたという言葉で偽造が消えるわけではありません。公証人のメモ記録と自筆下書きが残っています。何を防ごうとしたのですか。,尹正厚先生，说您减少了自己的份额，并不会让伪造消失。公证人备忘记录和亲笔草稿仍在。您想阻止什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v2].text,공증인 메모와 자필 연습본은 윤정후 씨가 어머니 뜻을 직접 고쳤다는 점을 보여 줍니다. 보호라는 말의 대상을 지금 밝혀 주십시오.,The Notary's Memo Notes and handwritten draft show that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu directly changed Mother's wishes. State now who you meant to protect.,公証人のメモ記録と自筆下書きは、ユン・ジョンフさんが母の意思を直接変えたことを示しています。保護という言葉の対象を今明らかにしてください。,公证人备忘记录和亲笔草稿显示，尹正厚先生直接改动了母亲的意愿。现在请说明“保护”这个词指向谁。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v3].text,"돈이 목적이 아니었다면 더 무거운 숨김이 있었다는 뜻입니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 숨김을 말하지 않으면 책임 판단을 할 수 없습니다.","If money was not the purpose, that means there was a heavier concealment. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, unless you state that concealment, responsibility cannot be judged.",お金が目的ではなかったなら、より重い隠し事があったということです。ユン・ジョンフさん、その隠し事を話さなければ、責任の判断はできません。,如果目的不是钱，那就意味着存在更重的隐瞒。尹正厚先生，如果您不说明那项隐瞒，就无法判断责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 90에서 60으로 낮추고 윤태성 씨에게 40을 남긴 선택은 선의와 위법이 동시에 서는 지점입니다. 그 선을 넘은 이유를 지금 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, lowering the share from 90 to 60 and leaving 40 to Mr. Yoon Tae-seong is where good intent and illegality stand together. Answer now why you crossed that line.",ユン・ジョンフさん、90から60へ下げてユン・テソンさんに40を残した選択は、善意と違法が同時に立つ地点です。その線を越えた理由を今答えてください。,尹正厚先生，把份额从90降到60并给尹泰成先生留下40，是善意与违法同时存在的位置。现在请回答您为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the reduced-will combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以缩减遗嘱组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-hard-v5].text,"자필 연습본과 공증본의 차이는 명확합니다. 윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 무엇을 알까 봐 유서를 고쳤는지 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","The difference between the handwritten draft and notarized copy is clear. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state clearly what you feared Mr. Yoon Tae-seong would learn when you changed the will.",自筆下書きと公証本の違いは明確です。ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが何を知ることを恐れて遺言書を変えたのか、明確に話してください。,亲笔草稿和公证本的差异很明确。尹正厚先生，请明确说明您是怕尹泰成先生知道什么，才改动遗嘱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 자기 몫을 90에서 60으로 낮춘 사실은 선의처럼 보일 수 있지만 위조 책임은 그대로입니다. 무엇을 막으려 했는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, lowering your own share from 90 to 60 may look well meant, but responsibility for forgery remains. Answer what you tried to prevent.",ユン・ジョンフさん、自分の取り分を90から60へ下げた事実は善意に見えるかもしれませんが、偽造の責任はそのままです。何を防ごうとしたのか答えてください。,尹正厚先生，把自己的份额从90降到60或许看似善意，但伪造责任仍然存在。请回答您想阻止什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v2].text,"공증본과 자필 연습본을 대조하면 돈보다 더 큰 사정이 숨어 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 사정을 더 미루지 말고 말해 주십시오.","Comparing the notarized copy with the handwritten draft shows a circumstance larger than money. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, stop postponing it and speak.",公証本と自筆下書きを対照すると、お金より大きな事情が隠れています。ユン・ジョンフさん、これ以上先送りせず話してください。,对照公证本和亲笔草稿，可以看到比金钱更大的情况。尹正厚先生，请不要再拖延，说出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v3].text,변경 방향이 윤정후 씨에게 불리했다 해도 어머니 뜻을 고친 일입니다. 보호 명분이 있었다면 그 구체적 대상을 밝혀 주십시오.,"Even if the direction of the change was unfavorable to Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, it was still a change to Mother's wishes. If you had a protective reason, state its specific target.",変更の方向がユン・ジョンフさんに不利だったとしても、母の意思を変えたことに変わりはありません。保護の名分があったなら、その具体的な対象を明らかにしてください。,即使变更方向对尹正厚先生不利，那也仍然是改动母亲的意愿。如果有保护的理由，请说明具体保护对象。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v4].text,"자필 연습본을 그대로 두지 못한 이유가 돈이 아니라면, 윤정후 씨가 막으려 한 것은 윤태성 씨의 질문입니다. 그 끝에 무엇이 있었습니까.","If the reason you could not leave the handwritten draft as it was was not money, then what Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu tried to stop was Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's question. What lay at the end of that question?",自筆下書きをそのままにできなかった理由がお金でないなら、ユン・ジョンフさんが防ごうとしたのはユン・テソンさんの質問です。その先に何がありましたか。,如果无法保留亲笔草稿原样的理由不是钱，那么尹正厚先生想阻止的就是尹泰成先生的追问。那个追问的尽头有什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the reduced-will combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出缩减遗嘱组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증 기록은 위조를 묻고 자필 연습본은 동기를 묻습니다. 두 질문을 분리하지 말고 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the notarization record asks about forgery, and the handwritten draft asks about motive. Do not separate the two questions; answer them together.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証記録は偽造を問い、自筆下書きは動機を問います。二つの質問を切り離さず答えてください。,尹正厚先生，公证记录追问伪造，亲笔草稿追问动机。请不要把两个问题分开，回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v1].text,"공증본과 자필 연습본을 보면 변경은 윤정후 씨에게 유리한 방향만은 아니었습니다. 윤정후 씨, 돈이 아니었다면 무엇을 막으려 했습니까.","The notarized copy and handwritten draft show that the change was not only in Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's favor. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if it was not money, what were you trying to prevent?",公証本と自筆下書きを見ると、変更はユン・ジョンフさんに有利な方向だけではありませんでした。ユン・ジョンフさん、お金でないなら何を防ごうとしたのですか。,从公证本和亲笔草稿来看，变更并不只是朝有利于尹正厚先生的方向。尹正厚先生，如果不是钱，您想阻止什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v2].text,"자필 연습본과 공증본의 차이는 위조 책임과 보호 명분을 함께 묻게 합니다. 윤정후 씨, 그때 두려웠던 일을 말씀해 주십시오.","The difference between the handwritten draft and notarized copy raises both forgery responsibility and a protective reason. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state what you feared then.",自筆下書きと公証本の違いは、偽造の責任と保護の名分を同時に問わせます。ユン・ジョンフさん、その時恐れていたことを話してください。,亲笔草稿和公证本的差异，同时追问伪造责任和保护理由。尹正厚先生，请说明当时您害怕的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v3].text,"어머니 자필 연습본은 처음 뜻을, 공증본은 손댄 과정을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 사이에 무엇을 숨기려 했습니까.","Mother's handwritten draft shows the first intent, and the notarized copy shows the process that was touched. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what were you trying to hide between them?",母の自筆下書きは最初の意思を、公証本は手を加えた過程を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、その間で何を隠そうとしたのですか。,母亲的亲笔草稿显示最初意愿，公证本显示被改动的过程。尹正厚先生，您在两者之间想隐瞒什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v4].text,"윤정후 씨 몫이 줄어든 방향이라 해도 문서를 바꾼 건 사실입니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 책임을 지고 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Even if the change reduced Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's share, the fact remains that the document was altered. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, take that responsibility and explain why.",ユン・ジョンフさんの取り分が減る方向だったとしても、文書を変えた事実は残ります。ユン・ジョンフさん、その責任を負って理由を説明してください。,即使变更方向减少了尹正厚先生的份额，改动文件这一事实仍然存在。尹正厚先生，请承担这份责任并说明理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 줄인 유서 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the reduced-will combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が減らされた遺言書コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出缩减遗嘱组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-2-b-q2-soft-v5].text,"공증인 메모와 자필 연습본은 탐욕만으로는 설명되지 않는 변경을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 막으려 한 질문이 무엇이었습니까.","The Notary's Memo Notes and handwritten draft show a change that cannot be explained by greed alone. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what question were you trying to stop?",公証人のメモ記録と自筆下書きは、欲だけでは説明できない変更を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、どんな質問を防ごうとしたのですか。,公证人备忘记录和亲笔草稿显示的变更，无法仅用贪心解释。尹正厚先生，您想阻止什么问题？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v1].text,"자필 연습본과 계좌 흐름은 윤정후 씨가 오랫동안 집안을 떠받친 사실을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 왜 그 돈을 어머니 돈처럼 보이게 했습니까.","The handwritten draft and account trail show that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu supported the family for a long time. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you make that money look like Mother's?",自筆下書きと口座の流れは、ユン・ジョンフさんが長く家を支えていた事実を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、なぜそのお金を母のお金のように見せたのですか。,亲笔草稿和账户流水显示，尹正厚先生长期支撑着家里。尹正厚先生，为什么让那笔钱看起来像母亲的钱？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"윤정후 씨, 정기 지원금과 사업 자금의 출처를 제대로 설명하지 않은 일이 지금 유서 분쟁의 중심입니다. 언제부터 이어진 흐름인지 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the failure to explain the source of regular support and business funds is now at the center of the will dispute. State clearly when that flow began.",ユン・ジョンフさん、定期支援金と事業資金の出所をきちんと説明しなかったことが、今は遺言書争いの中心です。いつから続いた流れなのか、明確に話してください。,尹正厚先生，没有清楚说明定期资助和事业资金的来源，现在成为遗嘱纠纷的中心。请明确说明这条资金流从什么时候开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"계좌 흐름과 자필 연습본은 윤태성 씨가 몰랐던 돈의 구조를 드러냅니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 침묵의 책임을 답해 주십시오.","The account trail and handwritten draft reveal a money structure Mr. Yoon Tae-seong did not know. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, answer for the responsibility of that silence.",口座の流れと自筆下書きは、ユン・テソンさんが知らなかったお金の構造を明らかにします。ユン・ジョンフさん、その沈黙の責任を答えてください。,账户流水和亲笔草稿揭示了尹泰成先生不知道的资金结构。尹正厚先生，请回答这份沉默的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 돈의 출처를 밝히지 않으면 어머니 뜻도 제대로 판단할 수 없습니다. 송금 흐름을 차분히 말해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, without clarifying the source of the money, Mother's wishes cannot be judged properly either. Speak calmly about the remittance flow.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お金の出所を明らかにしなければ、母の意思も正しく判断できません。送金の流れを落ち着いて話してください。,尹正厚先生，如果不说明钱的来源，就无法正确判断母亲的意愿。请冷静说明汇款流水。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-hard-v5].text,"자필 연습본이 왜 그렇게 기울었는지는 계좌 흐름이 설명합니다. 윤정후 씨, 본인 부담을 숨긴 판단을 지금 인정해 주십시오.","The account trail explains why the handwritten draft leaned that way. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, now acknowledge the judgment to hide your own burden.",自筆下書きがなぜそのように傾いたのかは、口座の流れが説明しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、自分の負担を隠した判断を今認めてください。,亲笔草稿为什么那样偏向，账户流水已经作出说明。尹正厚先生，现在请承认您隐瞒自己负担的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].text,자필 연습본과 계좌 흐름을 붙이면 오랫동안 이어진 정기 지원금과 사업 자금 흐름이 보입니다. 왜 처음부터 말하지 않았습니까.,Putting the handwritten draft and account trail together shows long-running regular support and business funds. Why did you not say this from the beginning?,自筆下書きと口座の流れを合わせると、長く続いた定期支援金と事業資金の流れが見えます。なぜ最初から話さなかったのですか。,把亲笔草稿和账户流水放在一起，可以看到长期持续的定期资助和事业资金流。为什么一开始不说？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"어머니 통장을 거친 돈이 실제로는 윤정후 씨 돈이었다면 유서의 의미가 달라집니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 규모를 숨긴 이유를 답해 주십시오.","If the money that passed through Mother's account was actually Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's money, the meaning of the will changes. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, answer why you hid the scale.",母の通帳を経たお金が実際にはユン・ジョンフさんのお金だったなら、遺言書の意味は変わります。ユン・ジョンフさん、その規模を隠した理由を答えてください。,如果经过母亲账户的钱实际上是尹正厚先生的钱，遗嘱的意义就会改变。尹正厚先生，请回答为什么隐瞒规模。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"자필 연습본의 방향과 계좌 흐름은 따로 볼 수 없습니다. 윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 어머니 돈으로 믿게 둔 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","The direction of the handwritten draft and the account trail cannot be separated. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state why you let Mr. Yoon Tae-seong believe it was Mother's money.",自筆下書きの方向と口座の流れは、別々には見られません。ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに母のお金だと信じさせておいた理由を話してください。,亲笔草稿的方向和账户流水不能分开看。尹正厚先生，请说明为什么让尹泰成先生相信那是母亲的钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"정기 지원금과 사업 자금의 출처가 윤정후 씨라면, 어머니 뜻에도 근거가 있었습니다. 그 핵심을 왜 빼고 말했습니까.","If the source of the regular support and business funds was Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, then Mother's wishes had a basis. Why did you leave out that core point?",定期支援金と事業資金の出所がユン・ジョンフさんだったなら、母の意思にも根拠がありました。その核心をなぜ抜いて話したのですか。,如果定期资助和事业资金的来源是尹正厚先生，那么母亲的意愿也有依据。为什么省略这个核心？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 계좌 흐름은 작은 도움을 넘어선 흐름입니다. 자필 연습본과 맞물린 의미를 지금 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the account trail is more than a small favor. Explain now what it means when connected to the handwritten draft.",ユン・ジョンフさん、口座の流れは小さな援助を超えるものです。自筆下書きとつながる意味を今説明してください。,尹正厚先生，账户流水已经超出小小帮助。请说明它与亲笔草稿相连时的意义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v1].text,"어머니 서랍의 자필 연습본과 장기간 계좌 흐름을 함께 보면 어머니가 윤정후 씨 쪽에 크게 기운 이유가 보입니다. 윤정후 씨, 돈의 출처를 설명해 주십시오.","When Mother's handwritten draft from the drawer and the long-term account trail are viewed together, the reason Mother leaned heavily toward Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu becomes visible. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain the source of the money.",母の引き出しの自筆下書きと長期の口座の流れをあわせて見ると、母がユン・ジョンフさん側へ大きく傾いた理由が見えます。ユン・ジョンフさん、お金の出所を説明してください。,把母亲抽屉里的亲笔草稿和长期账户流水一起看，就能看出母亲明显偏向尹正厚先生的理由。尹正厚先生，请说明钱的来源。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"자필 연습본은 어머니의 마음을, 계좌 흐름은 그 마음의 근거를 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 정기 지원금과 사업 자금의 흐름을 말씀해 주십시오.","The handwritten draft shows Mother's feelings, and the account trail shows the basis for those feelings. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state the flow of regular support and business funds.",自筆下書きは母の気持ちを、口座の流れはその気持ちの根拠を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、定期支援金と事業資金の流れを話してください。,亲笔草稿显示母亲的心意，账户流水显示这份心意的依据。尹正厚先生，请说明定期资助和事业资金的流向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v3].text,"계좌 흐름에는 어머니 통장을 거친 돈이 남아 있고, 자필 연습본은 그 사정을 반영합니다. 윤정후 씨, 본인 돈이 어디까지였습니까.","The account trail contains money that passed through Mother's account, and the handwritten draft reflects that circumstance. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how much of it was your money?",口座の流れには母の通帳を経たお金が残っており、自筆下書きはその事情を反映しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、どこまでがご自身のお金でしたか。,账户流水中留下了经过母亲账户的钱，亲笔草稿反映了这一情况。尹正厚先生，其中到哪里为止是您的钱？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v4].text,어머니가 왜 윤정후 씨에게 더 남기려 했는지는 자필 연습본만으로 끝나지 않습니다. 계좌 흐름와 맞춰 설명해 주십시오.,Why Mother meant to leave more to Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu cannot be settled by the handwritten draft alone. Explain it against the account trail.,母がなぜユン・ジョンフさんにより多く残そうとしたのかは、自筆下書きだけでは終わりません。口座の流れと照らして説明してください。,母亲为什么想给尹正厚先生留下更多，不能只用亲笔草稿解释。请结合账户流水说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"자필 연습본과 계좌 흐름은 어머니 돈처럼 보였던 돈의 출처를 다시 묻게 합니다. 윤정후 씨, 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","The handwritten draft and account trail make the court ask again about the source of money that looked like Mother's. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, speak calmly.",自筆下書きと口座の流れは、母のお金のように見えたお金の出所を改めて問わせます。ユン・ジョンフさん、落ち着いて話してください。,亲笔草稿和账户流水让人重新追问，那些看似母亲的钱究竟来自哪里。尹正厚先生，请冷静说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 어머니 돈으로 믿게 둔 구조가 지금까지 이어졌습니다. 보호였다는 말만으로 충분하지 않습니다. 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the structure that let Mr. Yoon Tae-seong believe it was Mother's money continued until now. Saying it was protection is not enough. Answer why.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに母のお金だと信じさせた構造が今まで続きました。保護だったという言葉だけでは足りません。理由を答えてください。,尹正厚先生，让尹泰成先生一直相信那是母亲的钱的结构延续到现在。仅说是保护还不够。请说明理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v2].text,계좌 흐름과 자필 연습본은 윤정후 씨의 침묵이 유서 분쟁을 키웠다는 점을 보여 줍니다. 왜 이름을 숨겼는지 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.,The account trail and handwritten draft show that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's silence enlarged the will dispute. State clearly why you hid your name.,口座の流れと自筆下書きは、ユン・ジョンフさんの沈黙が遺言書争いを大きくしたことを示しています。なぜ名前を隠したのか、明確に話してください。,账户流水和亲笔草稿显示，尹正厚先生的沉默扩大了遗嘱纠纷。请明确说明为什么隐藏自己的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 체면을 지킨다는 선택이 사실을 가린 선택이기도 했습니다. 그 결과를 더는 윤태성 씨에게만 미루지 마십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the choice to preserve pride was also a choice to cover facts. Do not shift the result only onto Mr. Yoon Tae-seong any longer.",ユン・ジョンフさん、体面を守るという選択は、事実を隠す選択でもありました。その結果をこれ以上ユン・テソンさんだけに押しつけないでください。,尹正厚先生，维护面子的选择，同时也是遮盖事实的选择。请不要再把结果只推给尹泰成先生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v4].text,"돈의 출처를 숨긴 일은 윤태성 씨의 판단을 바꿨습니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 침묵이 보호였는지 회피였는지 지금 답해 주십시오.","Hiding the source of the money changed Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's judgment. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, answer now whether that silence was protection or avoidance.",お金の出所を隠したことは、ユン・テソンさんの判断を変えました。ユン・ジョンフさん、その沈黙が保護だったのか回避だったのか、今答えてください。,隐瞒钱的来源改变了尹泰成先生的判断。尹正厚先生，现在请回答那份沉默是保护还是回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the twenty-year money combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以20年资金组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-hard-v5].text,"자필 연습본과 계좌 흐름이 말하는 건 오래된 자금 흐름과 오래된 숨김입니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 둘을 함께 책임져야 합니다.","What the handwritten draft and account trail show is an old flow of money and an old concealment. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you must take responsibility for both.",自筆下書きと口座の流れが語るのは、古い資金の流れと古い隠し事です。ユン・ジョンフさん、その両方に責任を負わなければなりません。,亲笔草稿和账户流水所说明的，是长期的资金流和长期的隐瞒。尹正厚先生，您必须同时承担两者的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 어머니 돈으로 믿게 둔 선택은 단순 배려가 아닙니다. 계좌 흐름과 자필 연습본이 그 책임을 묻고 있습니다.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, letting Mr. Yoon Tae-seong believe it was Mother's money was not simple consideration. The account trail and handwritten draft are asking about that responsibility.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに母のお金だと信じさせた選択は、単なる配慮ではありません。口座の流れと自筆下書きがその責任を問うています。,尹正厚先生，让尹泰成先生相信那是母亲的钱，并不是单纯体贴。账户流水和亲笔草稿正在追问这份责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v2].text,"계좌 흐름은 도움을 숨긴 구조를 보여 주고, 자필 연습본은 어머니가 그 구조를 알고 있었음을 보입니다. 왜 계속 침묵했습니까.","The account trail shows a structure of hidden support, and the handwritten draft shows that Mother knew that structure. Why did you keep silent?",口座の流れは隠された支援の構造を示し、自筆下書きは母がその構造を知っていたことを示しています。なぜ沈黙し続けたのですか。,账户流水显示隐瞒帮助的结构，亲笔草稿显示母亲知道这个结构。为什么一直沉默？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v3].text,"윤태성 씨의 체면을 지키려 했다는 말이 사실이라면, 왜 그 체면을 유서 조작으로까지 이어 갔습니까.","If it is true that you were protecting Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's pride, why did that pride lead all the way to manipulating the will?",ユン・テソンさんの体面を守ろうとしたという言葉が本当なら、なぜその体面が遺言書操作にまでつながったのですか。,如果您说想维护尹泰成先生的面子是真的，为什么这份面子会一路延伸到遗嘱操纵？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v4].text,자필 연습본과 계좌 흐름이 맞물리면 윤정후 씨의 침묵은 보호이면서 왜곡이 됩니다. 무엇이 더 컸습니까.,"When the handwritten draft and account trail fit together, Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's silence becomes both protection and distortion. Which was greater?",自筆下書きと口座の流れがかみ合うと、ユン・ジョンフさんの沈黙は保護であり歪曲にもなります。どちらが大きかったのですか。,亲笔草稿和账户流水相互吻合时，尹正厚先生的沉默既是保护，也是歪曲。哪一边更大？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the twenty-year money combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出20年资金组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 오래된 자금 흐름을 말하지 않은 탓에 윤태성 씨는 어머니 뜻을 다르게 읽었습니다. 그 책임을 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, because you did not speak about the old money flow, Mr. Yoon Tae-seong read Mother's wishes differently. State your responsibility for that.",ユン・ジョンフさん、古い資金の流れを話さなかったために、ユン・テソンさんは母の意思を違う形で読みました。その責任を話してください。,尹正厚先生，因为您没有说明长期资金流，尹泰成先生才以不同方式理解了母亲的意愿。请说明您的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v1].text,"자필 연습본과 계좌 흐름을 함께 보면 윤태성 씨가 어머니 도움으로 믿은 돈의 다른 출처가 보입니다. 윤정후 씨, 왜 그 믿음을 그대로 두셨습니까.","Viewed together, the handwritten draft and account trail show another source for the money Mr. Yoon Tae-seong believed was Mother's help. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you leave that belief untouched?",自筆下書きと口座の流れをあわせて見ると、ユン・テソンさんが母の援助だと信じたお金の別の出所が見えます。ユン・ジョンフさん、なぜその信じ込みをそのままにしたのですか。,把亲笔草稿和账户流水一起看，可以看到尹泰成先生以为是母亲帮助的钱其实有另一个来源。尹正厚先生，为什么任由这个相信继续存在？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v2].text,"어머니 통장을 거친 돈이 윤정후 씨에게서 시작됐다면, 숨긴 것은 돈만이 아닙니다. 윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨의 체면을 먼저 생각했습니까.","If the money that passed through Mother's account began with Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, then money was not all you hid. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you think first of Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's pride?",母の通帳を経たお金がユン・ジョンフさんから始まったなら、隠したのはお金だけではありません。ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの体面を先に考えましたか。,如果经过母亲账户的钱始于尹正厚先生，那么您隐瞒的不只是钱。尹正厚先生，您是否先考虑了尹泰成先生的面子？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v3].text,"계좌 흐름와 자필 연습본은 윤정후 씨가 말하지 않은 지원을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 침묵이 누구를 위한 것이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","The account trail and handwritten draft show support that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu did not disclose. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, say who that silence was for.",口座の流れと自筆下書きは、ユン・ジョンフさんが話さなかった支援を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、その沈黙が誰のためだったのか話してください。,账户流水和亲笔草稿显示尹正厚先生没有说出的帮助。尹正厚先生，请说明那份沉默是为了谁。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v4].text,윤태성 씨가 어머니에게 도움받았다고 믿은 흐름 뒤에 윤정후 씨 돈이 있었습니다. 그 구조를 유지한 이유를 설명해 주십시오.,"Behind the flow Mr. Yoon Tae-seong believed was help from Mother, there was Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's money. Explain why you maintained that structure.",ユン・テソンさんが母からの援助だと信じた流れの背後には、ユン・ジョンフさんのお金がありました。その構造を維持した理由を説明してください。,在尹泰成先生以为是母亲帮助的资金流背后，有尹正厚先生的钱。请说明您维持这个结构的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 20년의 돈 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the twenty-year money combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が20年の金銭コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出20年资金组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-3-b-q2-soft-v5].text,"자필 연습본의 방향과 계좌 흐름을 붙이면 오래 숨긴 지원의 뜻이 보입니다. 윤정후 씨, 왜 이름을 남기지 않았습니까.","Putting the direction of the handwritten draft together with the account trail shows the meaning of support hidden for a long time. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you not leave your name?",自筆下書きの方向と口座の流れを合わせると、長く隠された支援の意味が見えます。ユン・ジョンフさん、なぜ名前を残さなかったのですか。,把亲笔草稿的方向和账户流水连起来看，就能看出长期隐藏的帮助的含义。尹正厚先生，为什么不留下自己的名字？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록은 윤태성 씨가 몰랐던 가족사를 윤정후 씨가 알고 있었음을 보여 줍니다. 언제부터 숨겼습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the account trail and Mother's records show that you knew family history Mr. Yoon Tae-seong did not. Since when did you hide it?",ユン・ジョンフさん、口座の流れと母の記録は、ユン・テソンさんが知らなかった家族史をあなたが知っていたことを示しています。いつから隠していたのですか。,尹正厚先生，账户流水和母亲记录显示，您知道尹泰成先生不知道的家族史。您从什么时候开始隐瞒？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"돈과 가족사를 함께 숨긴 일은 윤태성 씨의 판단을 바꿨습니다. 윤정후 씨, 혼자 감당했다는 말로 끝낼 수 없습니다. 답해 주십시오.","Hiding money and family history together changed Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's judgment. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, this cannot end with saying you bore it alone. Answer.",お金と家族史を一緒に隠したことは、ユン・テソンさんの判断を変えました。ユン・ジョンフさん、一人で背負ったという言葉では終われません。答えてください。,同时隐瞒金钱和家族史，改变了尹泰成先生的判断。尹正厚先生，不能用“独自承受”来结束。请回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"어머니 기록을 본 뒤에도 윤정후 씨는 침묵했고, 계좌 흐름도 숨겼습니다. 그 침묵의 시작을 지금 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Even after seeing Mother's records, Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu stayed silent, and he hid the account trail as well. State clearly now where that silence began.",母の記録を見た後も、ユン・ジョンフさんは沈黙し、口座の流れも隠しました。その沈黙の始まりを今明確に話してください。,即使看过母亲记录后，尹正厚先生仍保持沉默，也隐瞒了账户流水。现在请明确说明那份沉默从哪里开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 자료는 보호 명분보다 먼저 숨긴 사실을 보여 줍니다. 윤태성 씨에게 말하지 않은 이유를 차분히 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the materials show the hidden fact before they show any protective reason. Calmly answer why you did not tell Mr. Yoon Tae-seong.",ユン・ジョンフさん、資料は保護の名分より先に隠した事実を示しています。ユン・テソンさんに話さなかった理由を落ち着いて答えてください。,尹正厚先生，资料显示的首先是被隐瞒的事实，而不是保护理由。请冷静回答为什么没有告诉尹泰成先生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-hard-v5].text,계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록이 모두 윤정후 씨의 침묵을 가리킵니다. 그 침묵이 누구를 위한 것이었는지 지금 말해 주십시오.,The account trail and Mother's records both point to Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's silence. State now who that silence was for.,口座の流れと母の記録は、どちらもユン・ジョンフさんの沈黙を指しています。その沈黙が誰のためだったのか、今話してください。,账户流水和母亲记录都指向尹正厚先生的沉默。现在请说明那份沉默是为了谁。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록을 보면 윤태성 씨에게 말하지 않은 사정이 분명합니다. 왜 그 사실을 혼자만 붙들었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the account trail and Mother's records make clear that there was something you did not tell Mr. Yoon Tae-seong. Why did you hold that fact alone?",ユン・ジョンフさん、口座の流れと母の記録を見ると、ユン・テソンさんに話していない事情が明確です。なぜその事実を一人で抱えたのですか。,尹正厚先生，从账户流水和母亲记录来看，您没有告诉尹泰成先生的情况很明确。为什么独自抓着那个事实？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"어머니 기록은 가족사의 핵심을, 계좌 흐름은 윤정후 씨의 오래된 부담을 보여 줍니다. 그 둘을 왜 따로 숨겼습니까.","Mother's records show the core of the family history, and the account trail shows Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's long burden. Why did you hide the two separately?",母の記録は家族史の核心を、口座の流れはユン・ジョンフさんの古い負担を示しています。その二つをなぜ別々に隠したのですか。,母亲记录显示家族史的核心，账户流水显示尹正厚先生长期承担的负担。为什么把两者分开隐瞒？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v3].text,"돈을 보낸 흐름과 어머니 기록이 한 방향으로 이어집니다. 윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 알게 될까 두려웠던 지점을 말씀해 주십시오.","The money flow and Mother's records lead in one direction. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state the point you feared Mr. Yoon Tae-seong would discover.",お金を送った流れと母の記録は、一つの方向につながっています。ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが知ることを恐れた地点を話してください。,汇款流向和母亲记录指向同一方向。尹正厚先生，请说明您害怕尹泰成先生知道的地方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵의 이유를 말하려면 언제 알았는지부터 밝혀야 합니다. 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록 앞에서 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, to explain the reason for your silence, you must first state when you knew. Answer in front of the account trail and Mother's records.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙の理由を話すには、いつ知ったのかから明らかにしなければなりません。口座の流れと母の記録の前で答えてください。,尹正厚先生，要说明沉默的理由，必须先说明您是什么时候知道的。请面对账户流水和母亲记录作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"계좌 흐름와 어머니 기록이 함께 놓인 이상 단순히 말하기 어려웠다는 설명은 부족합니다. 윤정후 씨, 처음 숨긴 이유를 말해 주십시오.","Now that the account trail and Mother's records are both on the table, saying it was simply hard to speak is not enough. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state the first reason you hid it.",口座の流れと母の記録が一緒に置かれた以上、単に話しにくかったという説明では足りません。ユン・ジョンフさん、最初に隠した理由を話してください。,既然账户流水和母亲记录都已经摆在面前，仅说难以开口并不充分。尹正厚先生，请说明最初隐瞒的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v1].text,"장기간 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록을 함께 보면 윤정후 씨가 돈과 가족사를 함께 떠안은 흐름이 이어집니다. 윤정후 씨, 언제 그 사실을 알았습니까.","Taken together, the long-term account trail and Mother's records show the continuing pattern in which Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu carried both money and family history. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when did you learn that fact?",長期間の口座の流れと母の記録をあわせて見ると、ユン・ジョンフさんがお金と家族史を共に背負った流れが続いています。ユン・ジョンフさん、いつその事実を知りましたか。,把长期账户流水和母亲记录一起看，可以看到尹正厚先生同时承担金钱和家族史的过程一直延续。尹正厚先生，您是什么时候知道这个事实的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"계좌 흐름는 오래된 부담을, 어머니 기록은 숨겨진 가족사를 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 뒤 왜 혼자 감당했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","The account trail shows an old burden, and Mother's records show hidden family history. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state why you bore it alone afterward.",口座の流れは古い負担を、母の記録は隠された家族史を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、その後なぜ一人で背負ったのか話してください。,账户流水显示长期负担，母亲记录显示隐藏的家族史。尹正厚先生，请说明之后为什么独自承担。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v3].text,돈의 출처와 어머니 기록이 맞물리며 윤정후 씨의 침묵 이유가 드러납니다. 처음 알게 된 시점부터 설명해 주십시오.,"The source of the money and Mother's records fit together, revealing the reason for Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's silence. Explain from the moment you first learned it.",お金の出所と母の記録がかみ合い、ユン・ジョンフさんの沈黙の理由が現れます。最初に知った時点から説明してください。,钱的来源和母亲记录相互吻合，揭示了尹正厚先生沉默的理由。请从最初知道的时间点开始说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v4].text,"어머니 기록과 계좌 흐름을 함께 보면 침묵이 단순한 회피가 아니었음을 알 수 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 시작을 말씀해 주십시오.","When Mother's records and the account trail are viewed together, the silence was not simple avoidance. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state where it began.",母の記録と口座の流れをあわせて見ると、沈黙は単純な回避ではなかったことが分かります。ユン・ジョンフさん、その始まりを話してください。,把母亲记录和账户流水一起看，可以知道沉默并不是简单回避。尹正厚先生，请说明它从哪里开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록은 서로 다른 자료이지만 같은 부담을 가리킵니다. 그 부담을 언제부터 알고 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the account trail and Mother's records are different materials, but they point to the same burden. Since when did you know that burden?",ユン・ジョンフさん、口座の流れと母の記録は別々の資料ですが、同じ負担を指しています。その負担をいつから知っていましたか。,尹正厚先生，账户流水和母亲记录是不同资料，却指向同一份负担。您从什么时候开始知道这份负担？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 가족사의 핵심을 알게 될까 두려워 유서를 고쳤다면 보호와 위법이 함께 섭니다. 지금 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you changed the will out of fear that Mr. Yoon Tae-seong would learn the core of the family history, protection and illegality stand together. State it clearly now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが家族史の核心を知ることを恐れて遺言書を変えたなら、保護と違法が同時に立ちます。今明確に話してください。,尹正厚先生，如果您是害怕尹泰成先生知道家族史核心才改动遗嘱，那么保护与违法同时存在。现在请明确说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v2].text,"계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록은 유서 변경의 끝에 법정 회피가 있었다는 점을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 판단을 책임져야 합니다.","The account trail and Mother's records show that avoiding court stood at the end of the will change. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you must take responsibility for that judgment.",口座の流れと母の記録は、遺言書変更の先に法廷回避があったことを示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、その判断に責任を負わなければなりません。,账户流水和母亲记录显示，遗嘱变更的尽头是回避法庭。尹正厚先生，您必须为这项判断负责。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v3].text,"돈과 가족사가 드러날까 봐 문서를 바꿨다면, 윤정후 씨는 윤태성 씨의 알 권리도 막은 겁니다. 그 책임을 답해 주십시오.","If you changed the document because you feared the money and family history would be revealed, Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you also blocked Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's right to know. Answer for that responsibility.",お金と家族史が明らかになることを恐れて文書を変えたなら、ユン・ジョンフさんはユン・テソンさんの知る権利も止めたことになります。その責任を答えてください。,如果您是因为害怕金钱和家族史曝光才改动文件，那么尹正厚先生，您也阻止了尹泰成先生的知情权。请回答这份责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 법정에 오지 않게 하려던 선택이 결국 이 자리까지 왔습니다. 무엇을 숨기려 했는지 지금 말해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the choice meant to keep this from court has brought us here in the end. State now what you were trying to hide.",ユン・ジョンフさん、法廷に来させまいとした選択が、結局この場まで来ました。何を隠そうとしたのか、今話してください。,尹正厚先生，本想不让事情走到法庭的选择，最终把我们带到了这里。现在请说明您想隐瞒什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the hidden-reason combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以隐藏理由组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-hard-v5].text,계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록은 윤정후 씨의 보호 명분을 동시에 흔듭니다. 윤태성 씨에게 감춘 진실을 지금 밝혀 주십시오.,The account trail and Mother's records also shake Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's protective reason. State now the truth you hid from Mr. Yoon Tae-seong.,口座の流れと母の記録は、ユン・ジョンフさんの保護の名分を同時に揺さぶります。ユン・テソンさんに隠した真実を今明らかにしてください。,账户流水和母亲记录同时动摇了尹正厚先生的保护理由。现在请说明您向尹泰成先生隐瞒的真相。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 알게 될 진실이 두려워 유서 문제를 작게 보이게 한 겁니까. 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록 앞에서 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you make the will issue look smaller because you feared the truth Mr. Yoon Tae-seong would learn? Answer in front of the account trail and Mother's records.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが知ることになる真実を恐れて、遺言書問題を小さく見せたのですか。口座の流れと母の記録の前で答えてください。,尹正厚先生，您是否因为害怕尹泰成先生会知道的真相，才把遗嘱问题显得很小？请面对账户流水和母亲记录作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v2].text,"돈의 흐름과 어머니 기록을 보면 법정 회피가 단순한 다툼 회피가 아니었습니다. 윤정후 씨, 무엇을 막으려 했는지 말해 주십시오.","The money flow and Mother's records show that avoiding court was not simply avoiding a dispute. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state what you were trying to stop.",お金の流れと母の記録を見ると、法廷回避は単なる争い回避ではありませんでした。ユン・ジョンフさん、何を防ごうとしたのか話してください。,从资金流和母亲记录来看，回避法庭并不只是回避争吵。尹正厚先生，请说明您想阻止什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 유서 변경은 윤태성 씨가 자필 연습본의 이유를 묻지 않게 하려는 판단과 이어집니다. 그 연결을 인정합니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the will change connects to a judgment that would keep Mr. Yoon Tae-seong from asking why the handwritten draft existed. Do you acknowledge that link?",ユン・ジョンフさん、遺言書変更は、ユン・テソンさんが自筆下書きの理由を問わないようにする判断へつながっています。そのつながりを認めますか。,尹正厚先生，遗嘱变更与不让尹泰成先生追问亲笔草稿理由的判断相连。您承认这个关联吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v4].text,계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록이 함께 열리면 윤태성 씨의 삶 전체가 흔들릴 수 있었습니다. 그 우려 때문에 문서를 고쳤습니까.,"If the account trail and Mother's records were opened together, Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's entire life could have been shaken. Did you change the document because of that concern?",口座の流れと母の記録が一緒に開かれれば、ユン・テソンさんの人生全体が揺らぐ可能性がありました。その懸念のために文書を変えたのですか。,如果账户流水和母亲记录同时被打开，尹泰成先生整个人生的基础都可能动摇。您是因为这个担忧才改动文件的吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the hidden-reason combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出隐藏理由组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-mid-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 법정까지 가지 않게 하려 했다는 말은 곧 진실을 숨기겠다는 말이기도 합니다. 무엇이 먼저였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, saying you tried to keep this from going to court also means you tried to hide the truth. Which came first?",ユン・ジョンフさん、法廷まで行かないようにしたという言葉は、真実を隠すという言葉でもあります。どちらが先でしたか。,尹正厚先生，说想让事情不要走到法庭，也意味着想隐藏真相。哪一个在先？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v1].text,"계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록을 함께 보면 윤태성 씨가 알게 될 경우 삶의 기반이 흔들릴 수 있다는 우려가 보입니다. 윤정후 씨, 법정까지 막으려 했습니까.","Looking at the account trail and Mother's records together shows concern that Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's foundation in life could be shaken if he learned the truth. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you try to block it from reaching court?",口座の流れと母の記録をあわせて見ると、ユン・テソンさんが知った場合に人生の基盤が揺らぐかもしれないという懸念が見えます。ユン・ジョンフさん、法廷まで止めようとしましたか。,把账户流水和母亲记录一起看，可以看到如果尹泰成先生得知真相，他的人生基础可能动摇的担忧。尹正厚先生，您是否试图阻止它走到法庭？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v2].text,"오래된 돈의 흐름과 어머니 기록은 상속 문제가 가족사 문제로 번질 수 있음을 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 점이 두려웠습니까.","The old money flow and Mother's records show that the inheritance issue could spread into a family-history issue. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, were you afraid of that?",古いお金の流れと母の記録は、相続問題が家族史の問題へ広がり得ることを示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、その点が恐ろしかったのですか。,长期资金流和母亲记录显示，继承问题可能扩展为家族史问题。尹正厚先生，您害怕这一点吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v3].text,"어머니 기록과 계좌 흐름이 맞물리면 유서 문제가 더 깊은 질문으로 이어집니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 질문을 막으려 했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","When Mother's records and the account trail fit together, the will issue leads to a deeper question. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state whether you tried to stop that question.",母の記録と口座の流れがかみ合うと、遺言書の問題はより深い質問へつながります。ユン・ジョンフさん、その質問を防ごうとしたのか話してください。,母亲记录和账户流水相互吻合时，遗嘱问题会通向更深的问题。尹正厚先生，请说明您是否想阻止那个问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 자필 연습본의 이유를 파고들면 돈과 가족사가 함께 드러날 수 있었습니다. 그걸 막으려 했습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if Mr. Yoon Tae-seong dug into the reason for the handwritten draft, both money and family history could have come out. Were you trying to prevent that?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが自筆下書きの理由を掘り下げれば、お金と家族史が一緒に明らかになる可能性がありました。それを防ごうとしたのですか。,尹正厚先生，如果尹泰成先生深究亲笔草稿的理由，金钱和家族史可能一起浮出。您是想阻止这一点吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감춘 이유 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the hidden-reason combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が隠した理由コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出隐藏理由组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-4-b-q2-soft-v5].text,"계좌 흐름와 어머니 기록은 왜 유서 문제를 법정까지 보내고 싶지 않았는지 묻습니다. 윤정후 씨, 차분히 설명해 주십시오.","The account trail and Mother's records ask why you did not want the will issue to reach court. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain calmly.",口座の流れと母の記録は、なぜ遺言書問題を法廷まで送ってほしくなかったのかを問うています。ユン・ジョンフさん、落ち着いて説明してください。,账户流水和母亲记录在追问，为什么您不希望遗嘱问题走到法庭。尹正厚先生，请冷静说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록이 나온 뒤에도 모든 걸 윤정후 씨 책임으로만 돌릴 수 없습니다. 장남이라는 당연시를 지금 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, after the account trail and Mother's records have come out, you cannot place everything only on Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's responsibility. Answer now about what you took for granted as the eldest son.",ユン・テソンさん、口座の流れと母の記録が出た後でも、すべてをユン・ジョンフさんの責任だけに回すことはできません。長男として当然視したことを今答えてください。,尹泰成先生，在账户流水和母亲记录出现之后，您不能把一切都只归到尹正厚先生的责任上。现在请回答您作为长子视为理所当然的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v2].text,"유서 사본은 분노의 시작일 수 있지만, 계좌 흐름은 그 분노의 방향을 바꿉니다. 윤태성 씨, 왜 본인 몫을 당연하게 봤습니까.","The will copy may be the beginning of anger, but the account trail changes the direction of that anger. Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you regard your share as a given?",遺言書コピーは怒りの始まりかもしれませんが、口座の流れはその怒りの方向を変えます。ユン・テソンさん、なぜ自分の取り分を当然のものと見たのですか。,遗嘱副本也许是愤怒的起点，但账户流水改变了愤怒的方向。尹泰成先生，为什么您把自己的份额看作理所当然？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v3].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 뜻을 본인 돌봄의 보상처럼 읽은 부분이 있다면 그 역시 책임입니다. 세 자료 앞에서 인정할 건 인정해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you read Mother's wishes as a reward for your care, that too is a responsibility. In front of the three materials, acknowledge what must be acknowledged.",ユン・テソンさん、母の意思を自分の介護への報酬のように読んだ部分があるなら、それも責任です。三つの資料の前で、認めるべきことは認めてください。,尹泰成先生，如果您把母亲的意愿解读成对自己照护的回报，那同样是责任。面对三份资料，请承认该承认的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v4].text,계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록을 외면하면 윤태성 씨도 어머니 뜻을 자기 기준으로 바꾸어 읽는 겁니다. 지금 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.,"If you ignore the account trail and Mother's records, Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you too are reading Mother's wishes through your own standard. State it clearly now.",口座の流れと母の記録を見ないなら、ユン・テソンさんも母の意思を自分の基準で読み替えていることになります。今明確に話してください。,如果无视账户流水和母亲记录，尹泰成先生，您也是在按自己的标准改读母亲的意愿。现在请明确说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-hard-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 숨긴 책임과 별개로 본인의 단정도 분쟁을 키웠습니다. 장남이라는 기준을 내려놓을 수 있습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, apart from Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's responsibility for hiding things, your own assumptions also enlarged the dispute. Can you set aside the standard of being the eldest son?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが隠した責任とは別に、あなた自身の決めつけも争いを大きくしました。長男という基準を下ろすことはできますか。,尹泰成先生，尹正厚先生隐瞒的责任另当别论，您自己的断定也扩大了争端。您能放下长子这个标准吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].text,"윤태성 씨, 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록을 본 뒤에도 장남의 몫을 먼저 말한다면 판단 기준을 밝혀야 합니다. 왜 그렇게 확신했습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if after seeing the account trail and Mother's records you still speak first of the eldest son's share, you must state your standard for judgment. Why were you so certain?",ユン・テソンさん、口座の流れと母の記録を見た後でも長男の取り分を先に言うなら、判断基準を明らかにしなければなりません。なぜそこまで確信したのですか。,尹泰成先生，如果看到账户流水和母亲记录后，您仍先谈长子的份额，就必须说明判断标准。您为什么如此确信？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].text,"유서 사본만 붙들면 윤태성 씨의 상처가 보이지만, 계좌 흐름을 붙이면 윤정후 씨의 부담이 보입니다. 그 차이를 어떻게 받아들입니까.","If you hold only the will copy, Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's wound is visible; if you add the account trail, Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's burden is visible. How do you accept that difference?",遺言書コピーだけを握ればユン・テソンさんの傷が見えますが、口座の流れを合わせればユン・ジョンフさんの負担が見えます。その差をどう受け止めますか。,只抓住遗嘱副本，就能看见尹泰成先生的伤口；加上账户流水，就能看见尹正厚先生的负担。您如何接受这个差别？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].text,"어머니 기록과 돈의 출처가 드러난 뒤에는 장남이라는 이유만으로 설명되지 않습니다. 윤태성 씨, 본인 당연시를 인정합니까.","After Mother's records and the source of the money came out, the matter cannot be explained by being the eldest son alone. Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, do you acknowledge what you took for granted?",母の記録とお金の出所が明らかになった後は、長男という理由だけでは説明できません。ユン・テソンさん、自分の当然視を認めますか。,母亲记录和钱的来源显露之后，仅凭长子这一理由无法说明。尹泰成先生，您承认自己视为理所当然的心态吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 돌봄을 유산의 근거처럼 붙들었던 마음이 있었는지 묻겠습니다. 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록 앞에서 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, I ask whether you held on to caregiving as if it were the basis for inheritance. Answer in front of the account trail and Mother's records.",ユン・テソンさん、介護を遺産の根拠のように握っていた気持ちがあったのか、問います。口座の流れと母の記録の前で答えてください。,尹泰成先生，我要问，您是否把照护当成遗产依据一样抓着不放。请面对账户流水和母亲记录作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].text,"유서 사본, 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록이 함께 놓이면 어머니 뜻은 윤태성 씨 기준만으로 읽을 수 없습니다. 무엇을 인정합니까.","When the will copy, account trail, and Mother's records are placed together, Mother's wishes cannot be read only by Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's standard. What do you acknowledge?",遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録が一緒に置かれると、母の意思はユン・テソンさんの基準だけでは読めません。何を認めますか。,当遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录放在一起，母亲的意愿就不能只按尹泰成先生的标准来读。您承认什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v1].text,"변경된 유서 사본과 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록을 함께 보면 장남으로서 당연히 더 받아야 한다는 마음도 따져야 합니다. 윤태성 씨, 그 마음을 설명해 주십시오.","Looking at the changed will copy, account trail, and Mother's records together, the feeling that you should naturally receive more as the eldest son must also be examined. Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, explain that feeling.",変更された遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録をあわせて見ると、長男として当然もっと受け取るべきだという気持ちも問わなければなりません。ユン・テソンさん、その気持ちを説明してください。,把变更后的遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录一起看，作为长子理应多拿的心态也必须被审视。尹泰成先生，请说明这份心态。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v2].text,"유서 사본은 윤태성 씨의 상처를 보이지만, 계좌 흐름은 돈의 출처를 다시 묻게 합니다. 윤태성 씨, 장남이라는 기준을 어떻게 보십니까.","The will copy shows Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's wound, but the account trail makes the source of the money a question again. Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, how do you view the standard of being the eldest son?",遺言書コピーはユン・テソンさんの傷を示しますが、口座の流れはお金の出所を改めて問わせます。ユン・テソンさん、長男という基準をどう見ていますか。,遗嘱副本显示尹泰成先生的伤口，但账户流水让钱的来源重新成为问题。尹泰成先生，您怎么看长子这个标准？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v3].text,계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록을 붙이면 윤태성 씨가 몰랐던 사정이 보입니다. 그래도 본인 돌봄이 먼저였다고 보십니까.,"When the account trail and Mother's records are added, circumstances Mr. Yoon Tae-seong did not know become visible. Do you still believe your caregiving came first?",口座の流れと母の記録を合わせると、ユン・テソンさんが知らなかった事情が見えます。それでも自分の介護が先だったと見ますか。,加上账户流水和母亲记录，就能看到尹泰成先生不知道的情况。即便如此，您仍认为自己的照护优先吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v4].text,"유서 사본, 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록은 어머니 뜻을 서로 다르게 읽은 두 사람을 보여 줍니다. 윤태성 씨, 본인 기준을 말씀해 주십시오.","The will copy, account trail, and Mother's records show two people reading Mother's wishes differently. Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, state your standard.",遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録は、母の意思を互いに違って読んだ二人を示しています。ユン・テソンさん、ご自身の基準を話してください。,遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录显示，两个人以不同方式理解了母亲的意愿。尹泰成先生，请说明您的标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.a.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-a-q1-soft-v5].text,"윤태성 씨, 변경된 유서를 보고 느낀 억울함과 계좌 흐름이 보여 주는 사실을 함께 봐야 합니다. 장남이라는 마음을 정리해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, the unfairness you felt after seeing the changed will and the facts shown by the account trail must be viewed together. Sort out the feeling of being the eldest son.",ユン・テソンさん、変更された遺言書を見て感じた悔しさと、口座の流れが示す事実を一緒に見なければなりません。長男という気持ちを整理してください。,尹泰成先生，看到被更改遗嘱后感到的委屈，必须和账户流水显示的事实一起看。请整理长子这份心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 기록과 계좌 흐름이 이유를 보여 줘도 문서에 손댄 책임은 없어지지 않습니다. 그 책임을 지금 인정해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, even if Mother's records and the account trail show your reason, they do not erase responsibility for touching the document. Acknowledge that responsibility now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の記録と口座の流れが理由を示しても、文書に手を加えた責任は消えません。その責任を今認めてください。,尹正厚先生，即使母亲记录和账户流水显示了理由，也不会抹去动过文件的责任。现在请承认这份责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v2].text,"보호라는 말로 변경된 유서를 덮을 수 없습니다. 윤정후 씨, 세 자료 앞에서 어머니 뜻을 고친 사람으로 답해 주십시오.","The changed will cannot be covered by the word ""protection."" Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, in front of the three materials, answer as the person who changed Mother's wishes.",保護という言葉で変更された遺言書を覆うことはできません。ユン・ジョンフさん、三つの資料の前で、母の意思を変えた人として答えてください。,不能用“保护”这个词盖过被更改的遗嘱。尹正厚先生，请面对三份资料，以改动母亲意愿的人身份作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨를 지키려 했다는 이유가 위조의 선을 지워 주지는 않습니다. 무엇을 책임질 수 있는지 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the reason that you tried to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong does not erase the line of forgery. State clearly what you can take responsibility for.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんを守ろうとした理由が、偽造の線を消してくれるわけではありません。何に責任を取れるのか、明確に話してください。,尹正厚先生，您试图保护尹泰成先生的理由，并不能抹去伪造的界线。请明确说明您能承担什么责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v4].text,"계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록은 동기를 보탤 뿐입니다. 유서 사본은 결과를 말합니다. 윤정후 씨, 그 결과를 떠안아야 합니다.","The account trail and Mother's records only add motive. The will copy states the result. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, you must bear that result.",口座の流れと母の記録は動機を補うだけです。遺言書コピーは結果を語っています。ユン・ジョンフさん、その結果を引き受けなければなりません。,账户流水和母亲记录只是补充动机。遗嘱副本说明的是结果。尹正厚先生，您必须承担这个结果。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-hard-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 뜻은 보호 명분 아래 다시 쓰일 수 없습니다. 세 자료가 남긴 책임을 지금 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, Mother's wishes cannot be rewritten under the reason of protection. Answer now for the responsibility left by the three materials.",ユン・ジョンフさん、母の意思は保護の名分の下で書き直されてよいものではありません。三つの資料が残した責任を今答えてください。,尹正厚先生，母亲的意愿不能在保护名义下被重新书写。请回答三份资料留下的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본은 윤정후 씨 쪽에 90으로 기울었고 공증본은 윤정후 씨 60, 윤태성 씨 40으로 바뀌었습니다. 보호와 책임을 분리해 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, the handwritten draft leaned toward you at 90, and the notarized copy changed it to 60 for you and 40 for Mr. Yoon Tae-seong. Separate protection from responsibility and answer.",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆下書きはユン・ジョンフさん側に90で傾き、公証本はユン・ジョンフさん60、ユン・テソンさん40へ変わりました。保護と責任を分けて答えてください。,尹正厚先生，亲笔草稿偏向您为90，公证本变成您60、尹泰成先生40。请把保护和责任分开回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].text,"세 자료가 함께 놓이면 윤정후 씨의 선의만 볼 수도, 위조만 볼 수도 없습니다. 그래도 어머니 뜻을 고친 사람은 누구입니까.","When the three materials are placed together, we cannot look only at Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's good intent, nor only at forgery. Still, who changed Mother's wishes?",三つの資料が一緒に置かれると、ユン・ジョンフさんの善意だけを見ることも、偽造だけを見ることもできません。それでも、母の意思を変えた人は誰ですか。,三份资料放在一起，就不能只看尹正厚先生的善意，也不能只看伪造。即便如此，改动母亲意愿的人是谁？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].text,어머니 기록이 윤정후 씨의 두려움을 보여 주더라도 변경된 유서는 윤정후 씨의 행위입니다. 그 선을 명확히 하십시오.,"Even if Mother's records show Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's fear, the changed will is Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's act. Make that line clear.",母の記録がユン・ジョンフさんの恐れを示していても、変更された遺言書はユン・ジョンフさんの行為です。その線を明確にしてください。,即使母亲记录显示尹正厚先生的恐惧，被更改的遗嘱仍是尹正厚先生的行为。请把这条线说清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨를 지키려 한 이유가 있었다면 더더욱 절차를 왜 넘었는지 설명해야 합니다. 지금 말해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if there was a reason to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, you must explain even more why you crossed the procedure. Speak now.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんを守ろうとした理由があったなら、なおさらなぜ手続きを越えたのか説明しなければなりません。今話してください。,尹正厚先生，如果有保护尹泰成先生的理由，就更需要说明为什么越过程序。现在请说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"유서 사본, 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록이 한자리에서 묻고 있습니다. 윤정후 씨, 보호 명분이 위조 책임을 어디까지 줄인다고 보십니까.","The will copy, account trail, and Mother's records are asking in one place. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how far do you think the protective reason reduces responsibility for forgery?",遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録が一つの場で問うています。ユン・ジョンフさん、保護の名分が偽造責任をどこまで減らすと見ますか。,遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录在同一处追问。尹正厚先生，您认为保护理由能在多大程度上减轻伪造责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v1].text,"변경된 유서 사본과 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록을 함께 보면 윤정후 씨의 보호 명분과 유서 수정 책임이 함께 보입니다. 윤정후 씨, 둘을 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Viewed together, the changed will copy, account trail, and Mother's records show both Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's protective reason and his responsibility for revising the will. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, speak about them separately.",変更された遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録をあわせて見ると、ユン・ジョンフさんの保護の名分と遺言書修正の責任が共に見えます。ユン・ジョンフさん、二つを分けて話してください。,把被更改的遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录一起看，可以看到尹正厚先生的保护理由和修改遗嘱的责任。尹正厚先生，请分别说明两者。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v2].text,"어머니 기록과 계좌 흐름은 윤정후 씨의 이유를 보여 주지만, 유서 사본은 손댄 결과를 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 책임을 어떻게 보십니까.","Mother's records and the account trail show Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's reason, but the will copy shows the result of touching the document. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how do you see your responsibility?",母の記録と口座の流れはユン・ジョンフさんの理由を示しますが、遺言書コピーは手を加えた結果を示します。ユン・ジョンフさん、責任をどう見ていますか。,母亲记录和账户流水显示尹正厚先生的理由，但遗嘱副本显示动过文件的结果。尹正厚先生，您如何看待责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v3].text,"세 자료를 함께 보면 윤정후 씨가 왜 숨겼는지는 보이지만, 어머니 뜻을 고친 사실도 남습니다. 그 부분을 설명해 주십시오.","The three materials show why Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu hid it, but they also leave the fact that Mother's wishes were changed. Explain that part.",三つの資料をあわせて見ると、ユン・ジョンフさんがなぜ隠したのかは見えますが、母の意思を変えた事実も残ります。その部分を説明してください。,三份资料一起看，可以看见尹正厚先生为什么隐瞒，但改动母亲意愿的事实仍然存在。请说明这一部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v4].text,"계좌 흐름은 오래된 부담을, 어머니 기록은 보호하려 한 이유를, 유서 사본은 변경된 결과를 보여 줍니다. 윤정후 씨, 답해 주십시오.","The account trail shows an old burden, Mother's records show the reason for protection, and the will copy shows the changed result. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, answer.",口座の流れは古い負担を、母の記録は守ろうとした理由を、遺言書コピーは変更された結果を示しています。ユン・ジョンフさん、答えてください。,账户流水显示长期负担，母亲记录显示想要保护的理由，遗嘱副本显示被更改的结果。尹正厚先生，请回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q1-soft-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호하려 했다는 말과 문서를 고친 책임은 동시에 남습니다. 세 자료를 앞에 두고 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, both the statement that you tried to protect him and the responsibility for changing the document remain. With the three materials before you, speak calmly.",ユン・ジョンフさん、守ろうとしたという言葉と文書を変えた責任は同時に残ります。三つの資料を前にして、落ち着いて話してください。,尹正厚先生，您想保护他的说法和改动文件的责任同时存在。请面对三份资料，冷静说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v1].text,"두 분, 어머니 뜻은 한 사람의 분노나 한 사람의 보호 명분으로 다시 쓰일 수 없습니다. 세 자료 앞에서 각자 책임을 명확히 하십시오.","Both of you, Mother's wishes cannot be rewritten by one person's anger or one person's reason of protection. In front of the three materials, make each responsibility clear.",お二人、母の意思は一人の怒りや一人の保護の名分で書き直されるものではありません。三つの資料の前で、それぞれの責任を明確にしてください。,两位，母亲的意愿不能被一个人的愤怒或一个人的保护理由重新书写。请面对三份资料，明确各自责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v2].text,"유서 사본과 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록은 두 사람 모두에게 묻고 있습니다. 누가 무엇을 숨기고 무엇을 단정했는지 지금 답해 주십시오.","The will copy, account trail, and Mother's records are asking both of you. State now who hid what and who assumed what.",遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録は、お二人の双方に問うています。誰が何を隠し、何を断定したのか、今答えてください。,遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录正在追问两位。现在请回答谁隐瞒了什么，谁断定了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v3].text,"두 분, 한쪽은 어머니 뜻을 고쳤고 다른 한쪽은 어머니 뜻을 자기 몫으로 해석했습니다. 그 사실을 피하지 말고 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, one side changed Mother's wishes, and the other interpreted Mother's wishes as his own share. Do not avoid that fact; answer.",お二人、一方は母の意思を変え、もう一方は母の意思を自分の取り分として解釈しました。その事実を避けずに答えてください。,两位，一方改动了母亲的意愿，另一方把母亲的意愿解读成自己的份额。请不要回避这个事实，回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v4].text,세 자료가 남긴 결론은 분명합니다. 어머니를 위한다는 말로 서로의 책임을 지울 수 없습니다. 지금 각자 인정해 주십시오.,"The conclusion left by the three materials is clear. Saying it was for Mother cannot erase each person's responsibility. Each of you, acknowledge it now.",三つの資料が残した結論は明確です。母のためという言葉で互いの責任を消すことはできません。今それぞれ認めてください。,三份资料留下的结论很明确。不能用“为了母亲”来抹去彼此的责任。现在请各自承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 근거로 즉답을 요구한다. 회피를 끊는 톤이다.,The Judge demands an immediate answer based on the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone cuts off evasion.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを根拠に即答を求める。回避を断ち切るトーン。,法官以母亲意愿组合为依据要求立即回答。语气切断回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|hard].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-hard-v5].text,"두 분, 이 사건은 유산 액수만의 문제가 아닙니다. 어머니 뜻 위에 각자의 두려움을 올린 책임을 지금 말해 주십시오.","Both of you, this case is not only about the size of the inheritance. State now your responsibility for placing your own fear over Mother's wishes.",お二人、この事件は遺産の額だけの問題ではありません。母の意思の上にそれぞれの恐れを載せた責任を今話してください。,两位，本案并不只是遗产数额的问题。现在请说明你们把各自的恐惧压在母亲意愿之上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v1].text,"두 분, 세 자료는 윤정후 씨만의 잘못도 윤태성 씨만의 억울함도 아니라고 말합니다. 누가 어머니 뜻을 어떻게 비틀었습니까.","Both of you, the three materials say this is not only Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's fault and not only Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's grievance. Who twisted Mother's wishes, and how?",お二人、三つの資料は、これはユン・ジョンフさんだけの過ちでも、ユン・テソンさんだけの悔しさでもないと語っています。誰が母の意思をどのように歪めましたか。,两位，三份资料说明，这既不只是尹正厚先生的错误，也不只是尹泰成先生的委屈。是谁以何种方式扭曲了母亲的意愿？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v2].text,"유서 사본, 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록은 서로의 책임을 동시에 세웁니다. 두 분, 자기에게 불리한 부분부터 말해 주십시오.","The will copy, account trail, and Mother's records establish both people's responsibilities at the same time. Both of you, start with the part that is unfavorable to you.",遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録は、互いの責任を同時に立てています。お二人、自分に不利な部分から話してください。,遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录同时确立了两个人的责任。两位，请先说对自己不利的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v3].text,"윤태성 씨는 장남의 기준으로, 윤정후 씨는 보호의 명분으로 어머니 뜻을 읽었습니다. 두 분, 그 차이를 인정합니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong read Mother's wishes by the standard of being the eldest son, and Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu read them through the reason of protection. Both of you, do you acknowledge that difference?",ユン・テソンさんは長男の基準で、ユン・ジョンフさんは保護の名分で母の意思を読みました。お二人、その違いを認めますか。,尹泰成先生以长子的标准理解母亲的意愿，尹正厚先生以保护的理由理解母亲的意愿。两位，承认这个差别吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v4].text,"세 자료를 함께 보면 사랑과 통제가 함께 보입니다. 두 분, 어머니를 위한다는 말 뒤에 숨은 자기 기준을 밝혀 주십시오.","When the three materials are viewed together, both love and control become visible. Both of you, reveal the standard of your own hidden behind the words ""for Mother.""",三つの資料をあわせて見ると、愛と支配が共に見えます。お二人、母のためという言葉の後ろに隠れた自分の基準を明らかにしてください。,三份资料放在一起看，爱与控制都会显现。两位，请说明“为了母亲”这句话背后隐藏的自身标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보의 방향을 분명히 짚는다. 더 미루지 못하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly points out the direction of the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone leaves no room to postpone.,裁判官が母の意思コンボの方向を明確に指摘する。これ以上先送りできないようにするトーン。,法官明确指出母亲意愿组合的方向。语气让对方无法再拖延。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|mid].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-mid-v5].text,"두 분, 유서가 바뀐 책임과 유산을 당연시한 마음을 따로 떼어 판단할 수 없습니다. 각자 무엇을 인정합니까.","Both of you, the responsibility for the changed will and the feeling that the inheritance was yours by right cannot be judged separately. What does each of you acknowledge?",お二人、遺言書が変わった責任と遺産を当然視した気持ちは、切り離して判断できません。それぞれ何を認めますか。,两位，被更改遗嘱的责任和把遗产视为理所当然的心态，不能分开判断。你们各自承认什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v1].text,"변경된 유서 사본과 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록을 함께 보면 두 사람이 모두 어머니 뜻을 자기 방식으로 읽은 흐름이 이어집니다. 두 분, 차분히 답해 주십시오.","Looking at the changed will copy, account trail, and Mother's records together, the flow shows that both people read Mother's wishes in their own way. Both of you, answer calmly.",変更された遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録をあわせて見ると、二人がそれぞれ自分の方法で母の意思を読んだ流れが続いています。お二人、落ち着いて答えてください。,把被更改的遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录一起看，可以看到两个人都以自己的方式解读了母亲的意愿。两位，请冷静回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v2].text,"유서 사본은 결과를, 계좌 흐름은 숨겨진 부담을, 어머니 기록은 오래된 마음을 보여 줍니다. 두 분, 서로 무엇을 왜곡했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","The will copy shows the result, the account trail shows the hidden burden, and Mother's records show the old feelings. Both of you, state what each of you distorted.",遺言書コピーは結果を、口座の流れは隠された負担を、母の記録は古い思いを示しています。お二人、互いに何を歪めたのか話してください。,遗嘱副本显示结果，账户流水显示隐藏的负担，母亲记录显示长期的心意。两位，请说明彼此扭曲了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v3].text,"세 자료가 한자리에 놓이면 한쪽은 단정했고 다른 한쪽은 고쳤다는 구조가 보입니다. 두 분, 어머니 뜻을 어떻게 받아들였습니까.","When the three materials are placed together, the structure is visible: one side assumed, and the other changed. Both of you, how did you receive Mother's wishes?",三つの資料が一つの場に置かれると、一方は断定し、もう一方は変えたという構造が見えます。お二人、母の意思をどのように受け取りましたか。,三份资料放在一起，就能看到一种结构：一方作出断定，另一方进行了改动。两位，你们如何接受母亲的意愿？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v4].text,"어머니 뜻을 지킨다는 말이 서로 다른 방식으로 쓰였습니다. 유서 사본과 계좌 흐름, 어머니 기록을 함께 보고 답해 주십시오.","The words ""protecting Mother's wishes"" were used in different ways. Look at the will copy, account trail, and Mother's records together, then answer.",母の意思を守るという言葉が、互いに違う形で使われました。遺言書コピー、口座の流れ、母の記録をあわせて見て答えてください。,“守护母亲意愿”这句话被以不同方式使用。请把遗嘱副本、账户流水和母亲记录一起看后回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 어머니의 뜻 콤보를 차분히 제시한다. 증거의 연결을 먼저 설명하게 하는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly presents the Mother's Wishes combo. Tone first asks for the evidence links to be explained.,裁判官が母の意思コンボを落ち着いて提示する。証拠のつながりを先に説明させるトーン。,法官冷静提出母亲意愿组合。语气先要求说明证据之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q2|soft].variants[judgeec-dc-5-b-q2-soft-v5].text,"두 분, 유서 사본만 보면 분노가 보이고, 계좌 흐름과 어머니 기록까지 보면 오래된 침묵이 보입니다. 각자 책임을 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, the will copy alone shows anger; with the account trail and Mother's records, an old silence becomes visible. State each of your responsibilities.",お二人、遺言書コピーだけを見れば怒りが見えますが、口座の流れと母の記録まで見ると古い沈黙が見えます。それぞれの責任を話してください。,两位，只看遗嘱副本能看到愤怒；连同账户流水和母亲记录一起看，就能看到长期沉默。请说明各自责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추고 안쪽 정서를 끌어내는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little and draws out the feeling underneath.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げ、内側の感情を引き出す質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备，把内里的情绪引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그때 가장 먼저 지키고 싶었던 사람은 어머니였습니까, 윤태성 씨였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, at that moment, who were you trying to protect first: your mother or Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、その時まず守りたいと思ったのは、お母様でしたか、それともユン・テソンさんでしたか。,尹正厚先生，当时你最先想保护的人，是母亲，还是尹泰成先生？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추고 안쪽 정서를 끌어내는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little and draws out the feeling underneath.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げ、内側の感情を引き出す質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备，把内里的情绪引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 시기 어머니 모습을 떠올리면 먼저 드는 감정이 분노입니까, 불안입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you think back to your mother at that time, what comes first: anger or anxiety?",ユン・テソンさん、その時期のお母様の姿を思い返すと、最初に湧く感情は怒りですか、それとも不安ですか。,尹泰成先生，回想那段时间母亲的样子，你最先涌上来的情绪是愤怒，还是不安？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 말년의 어머니 방에 들어설 때 어떤 마음이 먼저 들었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when you entered your mother's room in her final years, what feeling came to you first?",ユン・ジョンフさん、晩年のお母様の部屋に入った時、最初にどんな気持ちが浮かびましたか。,尹正厚先生，走进晚年母亲的房间时，你最先感到的是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 방문기록을 볼 때 가장 아팠던 부분은 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you look at that visit record, what part hurts the most?",ユン・テソンさん、その訪問記録を見る時、何がいちばん痛みますか。,尹泰成先生，看着那份探访记录时，最让你痛的是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-1-v5].text,"두 분, 어머니 마지막 시간을 떠올릴 때 가장 무거운 장면을 말해 주십시오.","Both of you, when you think of your mother's final days, tell me the heaviest scene that remains.",お二人とも、お母様の最期の時間を思い返した時、いちばん重く残る場面を話してください。,两位，回想母亲最后的时间时，请说出最沉重地留在心里的那一幕。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 기억하게 만드는 질문이다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. The question makes them remember where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を思い出させる質問。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安。这个问题让人回想情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니가 흔들리는 모습을 보면서도 문서를 들이민 데 죄책감이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you feel guilty for presenting the document even while watching your mother waver?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様が揺れている姿を見ながらも書類を差し出したことに、罪悪感はありましたか。,尹正厚先生，看着母亲动摇，却仍把文件递上去，你对此有过罪疚感吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 기억하게 만드는 질문이다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. The question makes them remember where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を思い出させる質問。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安。这个问题让人回想情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 혹시 어머니가 정말 판단하지 못하실까 봐 무서웠던 순간이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there a moment when you were afraid your mother truly could no longer make judgments?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様が本当に判断できなくなっているのではないかと怖くなった瞬間はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，有没有哪个瞬间，你害怕母亲真的已经无法判断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨를 피했다는 말을 들을 때 어떤 감정이 올라옵니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what feeling rises in you when you hear that you avoided Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんを避けたと言われると、どんな感情が湧きますか。,尹正厚先生，听到别人说你在避开尹泰成先生时，你心里会涌起什么情绪？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 곁에서 밀려났다고 느낀 순간이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there a moment when you felt pushed away from your mother's side?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様のそばから押し出されたと感じた瞬間はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，有没有哪个瞬间，你觉得自己被推离了母亲身边？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-2-v5].text,"두 분, 같은 방을 두고 서로 다른 기억이 생긴 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me why the same room left you with such different memories.",お二人とも、同じ部屋をめぐってなぜそれぞれ違う記憶が生まれたのか、話してください。,两位，请说明为什么围绕同一个房间，会留下彼此不同的记忆。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계 붕괴를 무서워한 마음을 말하게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. This stage lets them speak about the fear of the relationship falling apart.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係が崩れることを怖がった気持ちを語らせる段階。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧。这一步让人说出害怕关系崩塌的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 알게 되면 일이 더 커질까 두려웠다는 뜻입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you mean you were afraid things would grow worse if Mr. Yoon Tae-seong found out?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが知れば事がさらに大きくなるのではないかと恐れていた、という意味ですか。,尹正厚先生，你的意思是，你害怕尹泰成先生知道后事情会变得更大吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계 붕괴를 무서워한 마음을 말하게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. This stage lets them speak about the fear of the relationship falling apart.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係が崩れることを怖がった気持ちを語らせる段階。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧。这一步让人说出害怕关系崩塌的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨를 의심하는 마음 뒤에 어머니를 지키지 못했다는 자책도 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, behind your suspicion of Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, was there also self-blame for not protecting your mother?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんを疑う気持ちの裏に、お母様を守れなかったという自責もありましたか。,尹泰成先生，在你怀疑尹正厚先生的背后，是否也有没能保护母亲的自责？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 도움과 개입 사이에서 죄책감을 느낀 순간이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, was there a moment when you felt guilty over the line between helping and intervening?",ユン・ジョンフさん、助けることと介入することの間で罪悪感を覚えた瞬間はありましたか。,尹正厚先生，在帮助与介入之间，你有没有感到过罪疚的瞬间？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨 침묵이 왜 더 큰 상처로 느껴졌습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's silence feel like a deeper wound?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんの沈黙は、なぜより大きな傷として感じられたのですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么尹正厚先生的沉默会让你感到更深的伤害？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-3-v5].text,"두 분, 어머니를 위한다는 말이 서로에게 어떻게 들렸는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer how the words ""for Mother"" sounded to each of you.",お二人とも、「お母様のため」という言葉が相手にはどう聞こえたのか、答えてください。,两位，请回答“为了母亲”这句话在彼此听来是什么样的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처 가운데 무엇이 더 크게 남는지 스스로 보게 하는 질문이다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. The question lets them see for themselves what remains larger: responsibility or hurt.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷のどちらがより大きく残っているのかを自分で見させる質問。,让人选择最沉重的情绪。这个问题让他们自己看清，责任与伤害之中哪一边留下得更重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금 더 무거운 것은 어머니 뜻을 붙들었다는 마음입니까, 윤태성 씨를 배제했다는 죄책감입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what weighs more on you now: the feeling that you held on to your mother's wishes, or the guilt of excluding Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、今より重いのは、お母様の意思を守ったという気持ちですか、それともユン・テソンさんを排除したという罪悪感ですか。,尹正厚先生，现在更沉重的是你守住了母亲意愿的心情，还是排除了尹泰成先生的罪疚感？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처 가운데 무엇이 더 크게 남는지 스스로 보게 하는 질문이다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. The question lets them see for themselves what remains larger: responsibility or hurt.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷のどちらがより大きく残っているのかを自分で見させる質問。,让人选择最沉重的情绪。这个问题让他们自己看清，责任与伤害之中哪一边留下得更重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 진실을 찾으려는 마음과 장남으로 남고 싶었던 마음 중 무엇이 더 컸습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, which was stronger: your wish to find the truth, or your wish to remain the eldest son?",ユン・テソンさん、真実を探したい気持ちと、長男であり続けたい気持ちでは、どちらが大きかったですか。,尹泰成先生，你想寻找真相的心，和想继续作为长子的心，哪一个更强？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금 가장 후회되는 것은 서두른 일입니까, 설명하지 않은 일입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what do you regret most now: rushing, or failing to explain?",ユン・ジョンフさん、今いちばん後悔しているのは、急いだことですか、それとも説明しなかったことですか。,尹正厚先生，现在你最后悔的是太过仓促，还是没有说明？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 뜻을 다 안다고 믿었던 마음을 지금 어떻게 보십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, how do you now see your belief that you understood all of your mother's wishes?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の意思をすべて分かっていると信じていた気持ちを、今はどう見ていますか。,尹泰成先生，你现在如何看待自己当时以为完全懂得母亲心意的想法？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy-approach-4-v5].text,"두 분, 어머니 앞에서 끝내 하지 못한 말을 지금 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, put into words what you could never say in front of your mother.",お二人とも、お母様の前で最後まで言えなかったことを、今整理して話してください。,两位，请整理一下现在才说得出口、当时在母亲面前始终没能说的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실부터 고정한다. 누가 언제 무엇을 봤는지 기초 순서를 세우는 질문이다.,"It fixes the surface facts first. The question establishes the basic sequence of who saw what, and when.",まず表面的な事実を固定する。誰がいつ何を見たのか、基本の順序を立てる質問。,先固定表面事实。这个问题用于建立谁在何时看见了什么的基本顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 유서가 작성되던 무렵 어머니를 얼마나 자주 찾아뵈었는지부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, begin by telling us how often you visited your mother around the time the will was written.",ユン・ジョンフさん、遺言書が作成された頃、お母様をどのくらいの頻度で訪ねていたのか、そこから話してください。,尹正厚先生，请先说明遗嘱制作前后，你多频繁去看望母亲。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실부터 고정한다. 누가 언제 무엇을 봤는지 기초 순서를 세우는 질문이다.,"It fixes the surface facts first. The question establishes the basic sequence of who saw what, and when.",まず表面的な事実を固定する。誰がいつ何を見たのか、基本の順序を立てる質問。,先固定表面事实。这个问题用于建立谁在何时看见了什么的基本顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 시기 어머니 상태가 평소와 달라졌다고 느낀 장면부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, begin with the scene that made you feel your mother's condition had changed from usual.",ユン・テソンさん、その時期にお母様の状態が普段と違うと感じた場面から話してください。,尹泰成先生，请先说说那段时间让你觉得母亲状态不同于平时的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증 전 어머니 방에 들른 날짜를 순서대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, list in order the dates you visited your mother's room before the notarization.",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証の前にお母様の部屋を訪ねた日付を、順番に話してください。,尹正厚先生，请按顺序说出公证前你去母亲房间的日期。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 판단이 흐렸다고 본 첫 장면은 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what was the first scene that made you think your mother's judgment was clouded?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の判断が鈍っていたと考えた最初の場面は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，最先让你觉得母亲判断变得模糊的是哪一幕？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-1-v5].text,"두 분, 유서 이야기가 처음 나온 시점을 각자 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, each of you should set out when the will first came up.",お二人とも、遺言書の話が最初に出た時点を、それぞれ整理してください。,两位，请各自整理遗嘱一事最初出现的时间点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 시점과 행동을 갈라 흔들리는 부분을 찾는다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates timing from action to find where the account wavers.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。時点と行動を切り分け、揺れている部分を探る。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分时间点与行为，寻找摇摆之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니께 유서 내용을 읽어드린 횟수와 그 이유는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how many times did you read the contents of the will to your mother, and why?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様に遺言書の内容を何回読み聞かせましたか。その理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，你给母亲读过几次遗嘱内容，理由是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 시점과 행동을 갈라 흔들리는 부분을 찾는다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates timing from action to find where the account wavers.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。時点と行動を切り分け、揺れている部分を探る。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分时间点与行为，寻找摇摆之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 요양보호사 교체와 공증 시점이 겹친다고 보신 근거는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what is your basis for saying the caregiver change overlapped with the notarization timing?",ユン・テソンさん、介護職員の交代と公証の時期が重なったと見る根拠は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，你认为护理员更换与公证时间重合，依据是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 종이를 읽어드린 날과 공증 일정은 어떻게 이어졌습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how did the day you read the paper to her lead into the notarization schedule?",ユン・ジョンフさん、紙を読み聞かせた日と公証の予定は、どのようにつながりましたか。,尹正厚先生，你读给她听那张纸的日子，与公证日程是如何衔接的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 방문기록 중 결정적이라고 본 날짜는 어느 날입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, which date in the visit records did you consider decisive?",ユン・テソンさん、訪問記録の中で決定的だと見た日付はどの日ですか。,尹泰成先生，探访记录中你认为决定性的是哪一天？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-2-v5].text,"두 분, 요양보호사가 바뀐 뒤 달라진 일을 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me what changed after the caregiver was replaced.",お二人とも、介護職員が替わった後に何が変わったのか、話してください。,两位，请说明护理员更换后发生了什么变化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정이 아니라 대상과 방식까지 말하게 만드는 단계다.,"It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. This stage makes them state not just assumptions, but the target and method.",核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく、対象と方法まで言わせる段階。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围。这一步要求说出对象和方式，而不只是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 유서 문구를 설명할 때 어머니가 직접 판단하고 답하셨는지 장면과 순서를 나눠 기억하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when you explained the wording of the will, do you remember whether your mother judged and answered for herself, scene by scene and in order?",ユン・ジョンフさん、遺言書の文言を説明した時、お母様が自分で判断し答えたのか、場面と順序に分けて覚えていますか。,尹正厚先生，你解释遗嘱措辞时，母亲是否是自己判断并回答的？请按场景和顺序回忆。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정이 아니라 대상과 방식까지 말하게 만드는 단계다.,"It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. This stage makes them state not just assumptions, but the target and method.",核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく、対象と方法まで言わせる段階。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围。这一步要求说出对象和方式，而不只是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니가 스스로 결정하기 어렵다고 보게 된 결정적 순간이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there a decisive moment when you came to think your mother could not decide for herself?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様が自分で決めるのは難しいと見るようになった決定的な瞬間はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，有没有一个决定性瞬间，让你认为母亲已经难以自行决定？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 돕는 일과 대신 정하는 일을 어디서 나누셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, where did you draw the line between helping and deciding in her place?",ユン・ジョンフさん、助けることと代わりに決めることを、どこで分けていましたか。,尹正厚先生，你把“帮助”和“替她决定”的界线划在哪里？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨 개입이라고 판단한 근거를 하나씩 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, state one by one the reasons you judged this to be Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's intervention.",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんの介入だと判断した根拠を、一つずつ話してください。,尹泰成先生，请逐一说明你判断这是尹正厚先生介入的依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-3-v5].text,"두 분, 도움과 개입의 경계를 각자 어떻게 보시는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer how each of you sees the boundary between help and intervention.",お二人とも、助けと介入の境界をそれぞれどう見ているのか、答えてください。,两位，请各自回答你们如何看待帮助与介入的界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,더는 돌릴 수 없도록 결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세우려는 질문이다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility so they can no longer turn away. The question tries to straighten out where fact and interpretation diverge.,これ以上そらせないよう、決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す質問。,追问决定性的理由与责任，让对方无法再回避。这个问题试图校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 뜻을 도운 것인지 판단을 끌고 간 것인지 지금 어떻게 구분하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how do you now distinguish between helping your mother's wishes and steering her judgment?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の意思を助けたのか、判断を引っ張ったのか、今どう区別しますか。,尹正厚先生，现在你如何区分自己是在帮助母亲表达意愿，还是在牵引她的判断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,더는 돌릴 수 없도록 결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세우려는 질문이다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility so they can no longer turn away. The question tries to straighten out where fact and interpretation diverge.,これ以上そらせないよう、決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す質問。,追问决定性的理由与责任，让对方无法再回避。这个问题试图校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 판단 능력이 없었다는 말씀과 어머니가 평소 윤정후 씨를 더 믿었다는 사정은 어떻게 함께 보십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, how do you reconcile your claim that she lacked capacity with the fact that your mother usually trusted Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu more?",ユン・テソンさん、判断能力がなかったというお話と、お母様が普段ユン・ジョンフさんをより信頼していた事情を、どう併せて見ますか。,尹泰成先生，你说母亲没有判断能力，但平时她更信任尹正厚先生，这两点你如何同时看待？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 오기 전에 마치려 한 판단을 지금 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain now the decision to finish before Mr. Yoon Tae-seong arrived.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが来る前に終えようとした判断を、今説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请现在解释为什么判断要在尹泰成先生到来前完成。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 전면 무효 주장에 본인의 분노가 섞였는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, tell me whether your anger was mixed into your claim that the entire will was invalid.",ユン・テソンさん、全面無効という主張に、ご自身の怒りが混じっていたのか話してください。,尹泰成先生，请说明你主张遗嘱全部无效时，是否掺入了自己的愤怒。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact-pursuit-4-v5].text,"두 분, 어머니 의사와 자녀 개입을 분리해 마지막으로 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, separate your mother's intent from the children's intervention and answer one last time.",お二人とも、お母様の意思と子どもたちの介入を切り分けて、最後に答えてください。,两位，请把母亲的意愿与子女的介入分开，最后回答一次。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,사실 자체보다 왜 바로 말하지 못했는지의 입구를 연다. 처음의 주저함을 자극하는 질문이다.,"It opens the way to why they could not speak immediately, rather than the fact itself. The question prods at the first hesitation.",事実そのものより、なぜすぐ言えなかったのかへの入口を開く。最初のためらいを刺激する質問。,它不是追问事实本身，而是打开“为什么不能立刻说”的入口，触及最初的犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 방문과 설명을 윤태성 씨에게 자연스럽게 말하지 못한 이유가 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, was there a reason you could not naturally tell Mr. Yoon Tae-seong about that visit and explanation?",ユン・ジョンフさん、その訪問と説明をユン・テソンさんに自然に話せなかった理由はありましたか。,尹正厚先生，你无法自然地把那次探访和说明告诉尹泰成先生，是有什么原因吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,사실 자체보다 왜 바로 말하지 못했는지의 입구를 연다. 처음의 주저함을 자극하는 질문이다.,"It opens the way to why they could not speak immediately, rather than the fact itself. The question prods at the first hesitation.",事実そのものより、なぜすぐ言えなかったのかへの入口を開く。最初のためらいを刺激する質問。,它不是追问事实本身，而是打开“为什么不能立刻说”的入口，触及最初的犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 왜 의학기록보다 윤정후 씨의 의도부터 더 의심하게 되셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you suspect Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's intent before the medical records?",ユン・テソンさん、なぜ医学記録より先にユン・ジョンフさんの意図を強く疑うようになったのですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么比起医学记录，你先更怀疑尹正厚先生的意图？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-1-v3].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 말년 방문이 갑자기 늘어난 이유를 차분히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, calmly explain why your visits increased so suddenly in her final years.",ユン・ジョンフさん、晩年の訪問が急に増えた理由を、落ち着いて話してください。,尹正厚先生，请冷静说明你在母亲晚年突然增加探访的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-1-v4].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 왜 방문 증가를 곧바로 조작 의심으로 읽으셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you immediately read the increased visits as grounds for suspicion of manipulation?",ユン・テソンさん、なぜ訪問の増加をすぐに操作の疑いとして受け取りましたか。,尹泰成先生，为什么你会立刻把探访次数增加理解为操纵嫌疑？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-1-v5].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-1-v5].text,"두 분, 서로를 의심하게 된 첫 계기를 장면과 순서를 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me the first moment you began to suspect each other, separating scene and sequence.",お二人とも、互いを疑うようになった最初のきっかけを、場面と順序に分けて話してください。,两位，请把彼此开始怀疑的第一个契机，按场景和顺序分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 선택의 부담을 한 단계 더 구체화하는 흐름이다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. The flow makes the burden of the choice one step more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。選択の重さを一段階具体化する流れ。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把选择的负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 오기 전에 끝내려 했다는 말이 나올 만큼 서두른 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why were you in such a rush that people say you tried to finish before Mr. Yoon Tae-seong arrived?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが来る前に終えようとしたと言われるほど急いだ理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，为什么你会急到让人说你想在尹泰成先生到来前结束？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 선택의 부담을 한 단계 더 구체화하는 흐름이다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. The flow makes the burden of the choice one step more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。選択の重さを一段階具体化する流れ。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把选择的负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 상태를 따져 묻기보다 윤정후 씨의 속셈을 먼저 보게 된 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you look first at Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's hidden motive instead of questioning your mother's condition?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の状態を問いただすより先に、なぜユン・ジョンフさんの腹積もりを見るようになったのですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么你没有先追问母亲状态，而是先看尹正厚先生的用心？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-2-v3].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨에게 먼저 알리지 않고 진행한 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you proceed without telling Mr. Yoon Tae-seong first?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに先に知らせず進めた理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，为什么你没有先告知尹泰成先生就推进了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-2-v4].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨를 믿지 못한 이유가 방문기록 때문만이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was the visit record the only reason you could not trust Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんを信じられなかった理由は、訪問記録だけでしたか。,尹泰成先生，你无法信任尹正厚先生，只是因为探访记录吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-2-v5].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-2-v5].text,"두 분, 그 시기에 대화를 피한 이유를 각자 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, each explain why you avoided conversation during that period.",お二人とも、その時期に対話を避けた理由をそれぞれ話してください。,两位，请各自说明那段时期为什么避开对话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 직접 건드린다. 말 바깥에 있던 불안을 꺼내게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on fear and pride inside the relationship. This stage draws out the anxiety that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に直接触れる。言葉の外にあった不安を引き出す段階。,直接触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的不安引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 뜻을 지킨다는 마음과 윤태성 씨를 피해야 한다는 마음 중 무엇이 더 컸습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, which was stronger: the wish to protect your mother's will, or the need to avoid Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の意思を守る気持ちと、ユン・テソンさんを避けなければならない気持ちでは、どちらが大きかったですか。,尹正厚先生，想守住母亲意愿的心，和必须避开尹泰成先生的心，哪一个更强？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 직접 건드린다. 말 바깥에 있던 불안을 꺼내게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on fear and pride inside the relationship. This stage draws out the anxiety that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に直接触れる。言葉の外にあった不安を引き出す段階。,直接触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的不安引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 말년에 돌보는 자리에서 밀려났다는 감정이 판단에 섞였다고 보십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, do you think the feeling of being pushed out of the caregiving role in her final years colored your judgment?",ユン・テソンさん、晩年に世話をする立場から押し出されたという感情が、判断に混じっていたと思いますか。,尹泰成先生，你认为自己在母亲晚年被挤出照护位置的情绪，是否掺进了你的判断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-3-v3].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 뜻을 확인하려 했다는 말 뒤에 어떤 부담이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what burden lay behind your statement that you were trying to confirm your mother's wishes?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の意思を確認しようとしたという言葉の裏には、どんな負担がありましたか。,尹正厚先生，你说是在确认母亲意愿，这句话背后有什么负担？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-3-v4].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 어머니를 움직였다고 확신한 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, explain why you became certain that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu had steered your mother.",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんがお母様を動かしたと確信した理由を説明してください。,尹泰成先生，请说明你为什么确信尹正厚先生左右了母亲。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-3-v5].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-3-v5].text,"두 분, 공증 전 침묵이 누구에게 어떤 부담을 줬는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me who bore what burden because of the silence before notarization.",お二人とも、公証前の沈黙が誰にどのような負担を与えたのか、話してください。,两位，请说明公证前的沉默给谁带来了怎样的负担。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘거나 단정했는지를 정면으로 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims straight at why they crossed that line or reached that conclusion.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのか、または断定したのかを正面から狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由。正面追问为什么越过那条线，或为什么作出断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니가 직접 판단하셨다고 보면서도 윤태성 씨를 밖에 두려 한 선택은 왜 필요했다고 보셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, even if you believed your mother judged for herself, why did you think it was necessary to keep Mr. Yoon Tae-seong outside?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様が直接判断されたと見ながらも、ユン・テソンさんを外に置く選択はなぜ必要だと考えたのですか。,尹正厚先生，即使你认为母亲是自己判断的，为什么你认为有必要把尹泰成先生排除在外？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘거나 단정했는지를 정면으로 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims straight at why they crossed that line or reached that conclusion.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのか、または断定したのかを正面から狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由。正面追问为什么越过那条线，或为什么作出断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 상태를 문제 삼는 일 안에 장남 자리에서 밀려날 두려움도 함께 있었던 건 아닙니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, wasn't your challenge to your mother's condition also tied to a fear of being pushed out of the eldest son's place?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の状態を問題にすることの中には、長男の立場から押し出される恐れもあったのではありませんか。,尹泰成先生，你质疑母亲状态这件事里，是否也有害怕从长子位置上被推开的恐惧？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-4-v3].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니를 돕는다는 명분으로 선을 넘었다면 왜 그랬습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you crossed the line under the justification of helping your mother, why did you do it?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様を助けるという名目で線を越えたのなら、なぜそうしたのですか。,尹正厚先生，如果你以帮助母亲为名越过了界线，为什么这么做？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-4-v4].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 돌봄의 자부심이 다른 가능성을 밀어냈는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, answer whether pride in caregiving pushed away other possibilities.",ユン・テソンさん、介護してきた自負が他の可能性を押しのけたのか、答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请回答，照护母亲的自豪感是否挤开了其他可能性。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-4-v5].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive-search-4-v5].text,"두 분, 그날의 선택이 어머니에게 어떤 부담이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me what burden that day's choice placed on your mother.",お二人とも、その日の選択がお母様にどのような負担だったのか、話してください。,两位，请说明那天的选择给母亲带来了怎样的负担。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추고 안쪽 정서를 끌어내는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little and draws out the feeling underneath.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げ、内側の感情を引き出す質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备，把内里的情绪引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 문서를 고치던 순간 가장 먼저 떠오른 사람이 누구였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, at the moment you altered that document, who came to mind first?",ユン・ジョンフさん、その書類を直していた瞬間、最初に誰が浮かびましたか。,尹正厚先生，修改那份文件的瞬间，你最先想到的是谁？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추고 안쪽 정서를 끌어내는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little and draws out the feeling underneath.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げ、内側の感情を引き出す質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备，把内里的情绪引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 공증본을 처음 봤을 때 가장 먼저 든 감정은 분노였습니까, 모멸감이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you first saw the notarized copy, what came first: anger or humiliation?",ユン・テソンさん、公証本を初めて見た時、最初に湧いた感情は怒りでしたか、それとも屈辱でしたか。,尹泰成先生，第一次看到公证副本时，你最先感到的是愤怒，还是屈辱？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본을 들고 있을 때 가장 먼저 떠오른 사람은 누구였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when you held the handwritten draft, who came to mind first?",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆の下書きを持っていた時、最初に誰が浮かびましたか。,尹正厚先生，拿着亲笔草稿时，你最先想到的是谁？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 작게 적힌 몫을 보는 순간 가장 먼저 무너진 마음은 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you saw the smaller share written there, what feeling collapsed first?",ユン・テソンさん、小さく書かれた取り分を見た瞬間、最初に崩れたのはどんな気持ちでしたか。,尹泰成先生，看到自己较小份额的瞬间，最先崩塌的是哪种心情？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-1-v5].text,"두 분, 그 문서가 각자에게 어떤 상처로 남았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me what kind of wound that document left with each of you.",お二人とも、その書類がそれぞれにどのような傷として残ったのか、話してください。,两位，请说明那份文件各自给你们留下了怎样的伤口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 기억하게 만드는 질문이다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. The question makes them remember where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を思い出させる質問。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安。这个问题让人回想情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 선택 뒤에 윤태성 씨를 지켜야 한다는 마음과 어머니 뜻을 거스른 두려움이 함께 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, behind that choice, were you carrying both a wish to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong and fear that you had gone against your mother's wishes?",ユン・ジョンフさん、その選択の裏には、ユン・テソンさんを守らなければという気持ちと、お母様の意思に背いたという恐れが同時にありましたか。,尹正厚先生，在那个选择背后，你是否同时有要保护尹泰成先生的心，以及违背母亲意愿的恐惧？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 기억하게 만드는 질문이다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. The question makes them remember where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を思い出させる質問。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安。这个问题让人回想情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 문서를 보는 순간 장남으로서 자리가 무너진다고 느끼셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, did you feel your place as eldest son collapse the moment you saw that document?",ユン・テソンさん、その書類を見た瞬間、長男としての自分の場所が崩れると感じましたか。,尹泰成先生，看到那份文件的瞬间，你是否觉得自己作为长子的位置崩塌了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본을 숨긴 뒤 윤태성 씨를 볼 때 어떤 감정이 들었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, after hiding the handwritten draft, what did you feel when you saw Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆の下書きを隠した後、ユン・テソンさんを見る時どんな感情がありましたか。,尹正厚先生，藏起亲笔草稿之后，你见到尹泰成先生时是什么感受？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 자필 연습본을 늦게 알게 된 일이 왜 더 큰 배신으로 느껴졌습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did learning about the handwritten draft late feel like an even greater betrayal?",ユン・テソンさん、自筆の下書きを遅れて知ったことが、なぜより大きな裏切りに感じられたのですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么很晚才知道亲笔草稿这件事，会让你觉得是更大的背叛？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-2-v5].text,"두 분, 같은 문서를 두고 서로 다르게 다친 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me why the same document hurt you in different ways.",お二人とも、同じ書類をめぐってなぜ違う形で傷ついたのか、話してください。,两位，请说明为什么围绕同一份文件，你们会以不同方式受伤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계 붕괴를 무서워한 마음을 말하게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. This stage lets them speak about the fear of the relationship falling apart.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係が崩れることを怖がった気持ちを語らせる段階。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧。这一步让人说出害怕关系崩塌的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 자필 연습본을 보면 끝까지 파고들까 두려웠다는 뜻입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you mean you were afraid Mr. Yoon Tae-seong would keep digging if he saw the handwritten draft?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが自筆の下書きを見れば最後まで掘り下げるのではないかと恐れていた、という意味ですか。,尹正厚先生，你的意思是，你害怕尹泰成先生看到亲笔草稿后会追查到底吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계 붕괴를 무서워한 마음을 말하게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. This stage lets them speak about the fear of the relationship falling apart.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係が崩れることを怖がった気持ちを語らせる段階。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧。这一步让人说出害怕关系崩塌的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 문서를 바꿨다는 사실보다 어머니 마음이 달랐을 수 있다는 점이 더 두려우셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, were you more afraid that your mother's feelings might have been different than that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu had changed the document?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが書類を変えた事実より、お母様の気持ちが違っていたかもしれない点の方が怖かったのですか。,尹泰成先生，比起尹正厚先生改了文件这一事实，你是否更害怕母亲的心意可能并不一样？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서가 달라진 사정을 바로 말하지 못한 데에는 두려움이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, was there fear behind your inability to speak immediately about why the document had changed?",ユン・ジョンフさん、書類が変わった事情をすぐ話せなかったことには、恐れがありましたか。,尹正厚先生，你没有立刻说出文件为何改变，背后是否有恐惧？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 줄였다는 말이 왜 곧바로 위로가 되지 않았습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did the statement that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu had reduced his own share not comfort you right away?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが自分の分を減らしたという言葉が、なぜすぐ慰めにならなかったのですか。,尹泰成先生，听到尹正厚先生减少了自己的份额，为什么没有立刻让你感到安慰？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-3-v5].text,"두 분, 숫자 뒤에 있던 체면과 두려움을 각각 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, speak separately about the pride and fear behind the numbers.",お二人とも、数字の裏にあった体面と恐れを、それぞれ話してください。,两位，请分别说出数字背后的体面与恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처 가운데 무엇이 더 크게 남는지 스스로 보게 하는 질문이다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. The question lets them see for themselves what remains larger: responsibility or hurt.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷のどちらがより大きく残っているのかを自分で見させる質問。,让人选择最沉重的情绪。这个问题让他们自己看清，责任与伤害之中哪一边留下得更重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금 더 무거운 것은 어머니 뜻을 고쳤다는 죄책감입니까, 윤태성 씨를 지키려 했다는 미련입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what is heavier now: the guilt of changing your mother's wishes, or the lingering attachment to having tried to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、今より重いのは、お母様の意思を変えた罪悪感ですか、それともユン・テソンさんを守ろうとした未練ですか。,尹正厚先生，现在更沉重的是修改母亲意愿的罪疚感，还是想保护尹泰成先生的执念？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처 가운데 무엇이 더 크게 남는지 스스로 보게 하는 질문이다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. The question lets them see for themselves what remains larger: responsibility or hurt.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷のどちらがより大きく残っているのかを自分で見させる質問。,让人选择最沉重的情绪。这个问题让他们自己看清，责任与伤害之中哪一边留下得更重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨를 용서 못 하는 마음과 자신이 외면당했다는 상처 중 무엇이 더 큽니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what is greater: the feeling that you cannot forgive Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, or the hurt of being left out?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんを許せない気持ちと、自分が外されたという傷では、どちらが大きいですか。,尹泰成先生，你无法原谅尹正厚先生的心情，和自己被排除的伤痛，哪一个更大？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금 더 무거운 것은 위조의 책임입니까, 윤태성 씨를 지키지 못한 마음입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what weighs more now: responsibility for the forgery, or the feeling that you failed to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、今より重いのは、偽造の責任ですか、それともユン・テソンさんを守れなかった気持ちですか。,尹正厚先生，现在更沉重的是伪造的责任，还是没能保护尹泰成先生的心情？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨 선의를 인정해도 남는 분노는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, even if you acknowledge Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's good intent, what anger still remains?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんの善意を認めてもなお残る怒りは何ですか。,尹泰成先生，即使承认尹正厚先生的善意，仍然留下的愤怒是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy-approach-4-v5].text,"두 분, 그 문서가 어머니 뜻을 얼마나 흐렸는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer how much that document blurred your mother's wishes.",お二人とも、その書類がお母様の意思をどれほど曇らせたのか、答えてください。,两位，请回答那份文件在多大程度上模糊了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실부터 고정한다. 누가 언제 무엇을 봤는지 기초 순서를 세우는 질문이다.,"It fixes the surface facts first. The question establishes the basic sequence of who saw what, and when.",まず表面的な事実を固定する。誰がいつ何を見たのか、基本の順序を立てる質問。,先固定表面事实。这个问题用于建立谁在何时看见了什么的基本顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 변경된 유서를 제출한 사실 자체는 인정하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you acknowledge the fact itself that you submitted the changed will?",ユン・ジョンフさん、変更された遺言書を提出した事実そのものは認めますか。,尹正厚先生，你承认自己提交了修改后的遗嘱这一事实本身吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실부터 고정한다. 누가 언제 무엇을 봤는지 기초 순서를 세우는 질문이다.,"It fixes the surface facts first. The question establishes the basic sequence of who saw what, and when.",まず表面的な事実を固定する。誰がいつ何を見たのか、基本の順序を立てる質問。,先固定表面事实。这个问题用于建立谁在何时看见了什么的基本顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 처음 공증본을 보고 어떤 점이 가장 이상하다고 느끼셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you first saw the notarized copy, what felt most strange?",ユン・テソンさん、最初に公証本を見た時、どの点がいちばんおかしいと感じましたか。,尹泰成先生，第一次看到公证副本时，你觉得最奇怪的是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 변경 서류를 다시 낸 사람인지부터 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state clearly first whether you were the person who resubmitted the changed papers.",ユン・ジョンフさん、変更された書類を再提出した人物なのか、まず明確に話してください。,尹正厚先生，请先明确说明，你是否是重新提交修改文件的人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 처음 본 문서와 이후 확인한 기록을 구분해 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, separate the document you first saw from the records you later confirmed.",ユン・テソンさん、最初に見た書類と、その後確認した記録を分けて話してください。,尹泰成先生，请区分你最初看到的文件和后来确认的记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-1-v5].text,"두 분, 자필 연습본과 공증본을 언제 처음 보았는지 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, set out when you first saw the handwritten draft and the notarized copy.",お二人とも、自筆の下書きと公証本をいつ初めて見たのか、整理してください。,两位，请整理你们最初看到亲笔草稿与公证副本的时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 시점과 행동을 갈라 흔들리는 부분을 찾는다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates timing from action to find where the account wavers.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。時点と行動を切り分け、揺れている部分を探る。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分时间点与行为，寻找摇摆之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 공증 당일 메모가 남은 경위는 어떻게 설명하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how do you explain the memo left on the day of notarization?",ユン・ジョンフさん、公証当日のメモが残った経緯をどう説明しますか。,尹正厚先生，你如何解释公证当天留下备忘记录的经过？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 시점과 행동을 갈라 흔들리는 부분을 찾는다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates timing from action to find where the account wavers.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。時点と行動を切り分け、揺れている部分を探る。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分时间点与行为，寻找摇摆之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 자기 몫을 늘리려 했다고 단정하신 근거는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what is your basis for concluding that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu tried to increase his own share?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが自分の取り分を増やそうとしたと断定した根拠は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，你断定尹正厚先生想增加自己份额，依据是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 같은 날 공증 절차 중에 누가 어떤 서류를 만졌습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, during the notarization procedure that day, who handled which papers?",ユン・ジョンフさん、同じ日の公証手続きの中で、誰がどの書類に触れましたか。,尹正厚先生，在当天的公证程序中，谁接触了哪些文件？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 문서의 결과만 보고 판단을 세운 부분이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there any part where you formed your judgment just by looking at the result of the document?",ユン・テソンさん、書類の結果だけを見て判断を立てた部分はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，你是否有仅凭文件结果就作出判断的部分？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-2-v5].text,"두 분, 같은 날 두 문서가 남은 순서를 맞춰 보겠습니다.","Both of you, let us put in order how two documents remained on the same day.",お二人とも、同じ日に二つの書類が残った順序を合わせてみましょう。,两位，我们来对齐同一天留下两份文件的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정이 아니라 대상과 방식까지 말하게 만드는 단계다.,"It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. This stage makes them state not just assumptions, but the target and method.",核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく、対象と方法まで言わせる段階。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围。这一步要求说出对象和方式，而不只是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 원래 문구와 바뀐 문구 가운데 직접 손댄 부분이 어디까지입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, between the original wording and the changed wording, exactly how far did you personally alter it?",ユン・ジョンフさん、元の文言と変わった文言のうち、ご自身が直接手を加えた部分はどこまでですか。,尹正厚先生，在原措辞与修改后措辞之间，你亲手改动到什么程度？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정이 아니라 대상과 방식까지 말하게 만드는 단계다.,"It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. This stage makes them state not just assumptions, but the target and method.",核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく、対象と方法まで言わせる段階。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围。这一步要求说出对象和方式，而不只是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 나중에 드러난 자필 연습본을 보고도 판단이 그대로였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, after seeing the handwritten draft that emerged later, did your judgment remain the same?",ユン・テソンさん、後から明らかになった自筆の下書きを見ても、判断は変わりませんでしたか。,尹泰成先生，看到后来出现的亲笔草稿后，你的判断仍然不变吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본에서 공증본으로 바뀐 과정에 직접 관여했습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, were you directly involved in the process by which the handwritten draft became the notarized copy?",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆の下書きから公証本へ変わった過程に、直接関わりましたか。,尹正厚先生，从亲笔草稿变为公证副本的过程中，你是否直接参与了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 자필 연습본을 본 뒤에도 탐욕이라고 본 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, after seeing the handwritten draft, why did you still see it as greed?",ユン・テソンさん、自筆の下書きを見た後も、なぜ貪欲だと見たのですか。,尹泰成先生，看到亲笔草稿之后，你为什么仍认为那是贪欲？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-3-v5].text,"두 분, 문서가 바뀐 방향과 책임을 따로 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, speak separately about the direction in which the document changed and the responsibility for it.",お二人とも、書類が変わった方向と責任を分けて話してください。,两位，请把文件改变的方向与责任分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,더는 돌릴 수 없도록 결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세우려는 질문이다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility so they can no longer turn away. The question tries to straighten out where fact and interpretation diverge.,これ以上そらせないよう、決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す質問。,追问决定性的理由与责任，让对方无法再回避。这个问题试图校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤정후 씨 몫을 줄인 조작이라고 해도 왜 위조라는 선을 넘었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, even if it was an alteration that reduced your own share, why did you cross the line into forgery?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・ジョンフさんの取り分を減らす操作だったとしても、なぜ偽造という線を越えたのですか。,尹正厚先生，就算那是减少你自己份额的修改，为什么你仍越过了伪造这条线？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,더는 돌릴 수 없도록 결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세우려는 질문이다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility so they can no longer turn away. The question tries to straighten out where fact and interpretation diverge.,これ以上そらせないよう、決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す質問。,追问决定性的理由与责任，让对方无法再回避。这个问题试图校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 문서를 바꾼 이유가 탐욕만은 아닐 수 있다는 가능성을 끝까지 배제한 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you completely rule out the possibility that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's reason for changing the document was not only greed?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが書類を変えた理由が貪欲だけではないかもしれない可能性を、なぜ最後まで排除したのですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么你始终排除尹正厚先生修改文件的理由不只是贪欲这一可能？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 문서가 달라진 과정에 본인이 관여한 부분은 어디까지 인정하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how much of your own involvement in the document's change do you acknowledge?",ユン・ジョンフさん、書類が変わった過程にご自身が関わった部分を、どこまで認めますか。,尹正厚先生，对于文件改变过程中的本人参与，你承认到什么程度？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 더 가지려 한 게 아니라는 기록을 어떻게 보십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, how do you view the record showing that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu was not trying to take more?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんがより多く取ろうとしたわけではないという記録を、どう見ますか。,尹泰成先生，对于显示尹正厚先生并非想多拿的记录，你怎么看？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact-pursuit-4-v5].text,"두 분, 자필 연습본과 공증본이 각자에게 어떤 의미였는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer what the handwritten draft and the notarized copy meant to each of you.",お二人とも、自筆の下書きと公証本がそれぞれにとってどんな意味を持ったのか、答えてください。,两位，请回答亲笔草稿与公证副本对你们各自意味着什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,사실 자체보다 왜 바로 말하지 못했는지의 입구를 연다. 처음의 주저함을 자극하는 질문이다.,"It opens the way to why they could not speak immediately, rather than the fact itself. The question prods at the first hesitation.",事実そのものより、なぜすぐ言えなかったのかへの入口を開く。最初のためらいを刺激する質問。,它不是追问事实本身，而是打开“为什么不能立刻说”的入口，触及最初的犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본을 그대로 두지 못한 가장 직접적인 이유는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what was the most direct reason you could not leave the handwritten draft as it was?",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆の下書きをそのままにできなかった最も直接的な理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，你无法让亲笔草稿保持原样，最直接的理由是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,사실 자체보다 왜 바로 말하지 못했는지의 입구를 연다. 처음의 주저함을 자극하는 질문이다.,"It opens the way to why they could not speak immediately, rather than the fact itself. The question prods at the first hesitation.",事実そのものより、なぜすぐ言えなかったのかへの入口を開く。最初のためらいを刺激する質問。,它不是追问事实本身，而是打开“为什么不能立刻说”的入口，触及最初的犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 왜 공증본을 보자마자 조작 의도부터 단정하셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you assume manipulative intent as soon as you saw the notarized copy?",ユン・テソンさん、公証本を見た途端、なぜ操作の意図を断定したのですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么一看到公证副本，你就先断定有操纵意图？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-1-v3].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 자필 연습본을 그대로 두면 안 된다고 판단한 첫 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what was your first reason for deciding the handwritten draft could not be left as it was?",ユン・ジョンフさん、自筆の下書きをそのままにしてはいけないと判断した最初の理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，你最初判断亲笔草稿不能保持原样的理由是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-1-v4].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 문서를 보자마자 윤정후 씨 의도부터 단정한 이유가 있습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there a reason you assumed Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's intent as soon as you saw the document?",ユン・テソンさん、書類を見た途端、ユン・ジョンフさんの意図を断定した理由はありますか。,尹泰成先生，你一看到文件就断定尹正厚先生的意图，是有什么原因吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-1-v5].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-1-v5].text,"두 분, 문서보다 먼저 떠오른 의심이 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me what suspicion came to mind before the document itself.",お二人とも、書類より先に浮かんだ疑いは何だったのか、話してください。,两位，请说出比文件本身更先浮现的怀疑是什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 선택의 부담을 한 단계 더 구체화하는 흐름이다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. The flow makes the burden of the choice one step more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。選択の重さを一段階具体化する流れ。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把选择的负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨에게 자필 연습본을 바로 보여 줄 수 없었던 부담이 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what burden kept you from showing Mr. Yoon Tae-seong the handwritten draft right away?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに自筆の下書きをすぐ見せられなかった負担は何でしたか。,尹正厚先生，是什么负担让你无法马上把亲笔草稿给尹泰成先生看？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 선택의 부담을 한 단계 더 구체화하는 흐름이다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. The flow makes the burden of the choice one step more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。選択の重さを一段階具体化する流れ。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把选择的负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 유서 문제를 따지면서도 자필 연습본의 경위는 늦게 보신 이유가 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, while contesting the will, was there a reason you looked into the circumstances of the handwritten draft only late?",ユン・テソンさん、遺言書の問題を問いただしながらも、自筆の下書きの経緯を遅れて見た理由はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，你一边追究遗嘱问题，一边却很晚才看亲笔草稿的经过，是有什么原因吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-2-v3].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨에게 자필 연습본을 바로 보이지 못한 부담을 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain the burden that kept you from showing Mr. Yoon Tae-seong the handwritten draft right away.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに自筆の下書きをすぐ見せられなかった負担を説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明你无法马上把亲笔草稿给尹泰成先生看的负担。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-2-v4].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 자필 연습본의 경위를 늦게 본 이유가 분노 때문이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, did anger make you look at the circumstances of the handwritten draft only late?",ユン・テソンさん、自筆の下書きの経緯を遅れて見た理由は、怒りのためでしたか。,尹泰成先生，你很晚才看亲笔草稿的经过，是因为愤怒吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-2-v5].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-2-v5].text,"두 분, 자필 연습본이 숨겨진 동안 관계가 어떻게 더 나빠졌는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer how the relationship worsened while the handwritten draft was hidden.",お二人とも、自筆の下書きが隠されている間、関係がどうさらに悪くなったのか答えてください。,两位，请回答亲笔草稿被隐藏期间，关系是如何进一步恶化的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 직접 건드린다. 말 바깥에 있던 불안을 꺼내게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on fear and pride inside the relationship. This stage draws out the anxiety that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に直接触れる。言葉の外にあった不安を引き出す段階。,直接触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的不安引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤정후 씨 몫을 줄이는 방식까지 택한 데 죄책감과 보호 본능이 함께 있었던 겁니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, in choosing even to reduce your own share, were guilt and a protective instinct both at work?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ご自身の取り分を減らす方法まで選んだことには、罪悪感と保護本能がともにあったのですか。,尹正厚先生，甚至选择减少自己份额的方式，其中是否同时有罪疚感和保护本能？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 직접 건드린다. 말 바깥에 있던 불안을 꺼내게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on fear and pride inside the relationship. This stage draws out the anxiety that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に直接触れる。言葉の外にあった不安を引き出す段階。,直接触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的不安引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 이 문제를 유산 다툼으로만 붙들면 자신도 덜 흔들린다고 느끼셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, did holding on to this as an inheritance dispute make you feel less shaken?",ユン・テソンさん、この問題を遺産争いとしてだけ捉えている方が、ご自身も揺れずにいられると感じましたか。,尹泰成先生，如果只把这个问题抓成遗产纠纷，你是否觉得自己也能少受动摇？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-3-v3].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 그런 변경까지 감수하게 된 이유는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what made you accept even that change?",ユン・ジョンフさん、そこまでの変更を引き受けることになった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，是什么理由让你连那样的修改也愿意承受？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-3-v4].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨 행동을 이익만으로 읽어야 했던 마음이 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there a feeling that made you need to read Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's action only as self-interest?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんの行動を利益だけで読まなければならない気持ちがありましたか。,尹泰成先生，你是否有一种必须把尹正厚先生的行为只解读为利益的心情？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-3-v5].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-3-v5].text,"두 분, 위조의 책임과 동기를 따로 놓고 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, speak about responsibility for the forgery and motive separately.",お二人とも、偽造の責任と動機を切り分けて話してください。,两位，请把伪造责任和动机分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘거나 단정했는지를 정면으로 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims straight at why they crossed that line or reached that conclusion.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのか、または断定したのかを正面から狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由。正面追问为什么越过那条线，或为什么作出断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 위조라는 걸 알면서도 밀어붙인 이유를 선의라는 말 말고 다시 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain again why you pushed ahead despite knowing it was forgery, without relying on the word good intent.",ユン・ジョンフさん、それが偽造だと知りながら押し進めた理由を、善意という言葉ではなく改めて説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请不要只说善意，重新说明你明知那是伪造仍推进的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘거나 단정했는지를 정면으로 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims straight at why they crossed that line or reached that conclusion.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのか、または断定したのかを正面から狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由。正面追问为什么越过那条线，或为什么作出断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨를 욕심 많은 사람으로 세워야만 버틸 수 있었던 이유가 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there a reason you had to cast Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu as a greedy person in order to endure it?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんを欲深い人間として立てなければ耐えられなかった理由はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，你是否必须把尹正厚先生塑造成贪婪的人，自己才能撑住？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-4-v3].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호하려는 이유가 있었다 해도 왜 절차를 넘었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, even if there was a reason to protect him, why did you step beyond the procedure?",ユン・ジョンフさん、守ろうとする理由があったとしても、なぜ手続きを越えたのですか。,尹正厚先生，即使有想保护他的理由，为什么你仍越过了程序？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-4-v4].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 분노가 윤정후 씨의 보호 명분까지 지웠는지 답해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, answer whether anger erased even Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's reason of protection.",ユン・テソンさん、怒りがユン・ジョンフさんの保護という名分まで消してしまったのか、答えてください。,尹泰成先生，请回答，愤怒是否连尹正厚先生“保护”的理由也抹去了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-4-v5].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive-search-4-v5].text,"두 분, 문서를 고친 이유와 그 결과를 마지막으로 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, finally organize why the document was changed and what resulted from it.",お二人とも、書類を直した理由とその結果を最後に整理してください。,两位，请最后整理修改文件的原因及其结果。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추고 안쪽 정서를 끌어내는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little and draws out the feeling underneath.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げ、内側の感情を引き出す質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备，把内里的情绪引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 돈을 보낼 때마다 가장 먼저 떠오른 사람은 어머니였습니까, 윤태성 씨였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, each time you sent that money, who came to mind first: your mother or Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、そのお金を送るたびに、最初に浮かんだのはお母様でしたか、それともユン・テソンさんでしたか。,尹正厚先生，每次汇出那笔钱时，你最先想到的是母亲，还是尹泰成先生？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추고 안쪽 정서를 끌어내는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little and draws out the feeling underneath.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げ、内側の感情を引き出す質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备，把内里的情绪引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 시절 도움을 받던 자신을 떠올리면 가장 먼저 드는 감정은 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you think of yourself receiving help back then, what feeling comes first?",ユン・テソンさん、あの頃助けを受けていた自分を思い返すと、最初にどんな感情が浮かびますか。,尹泰成先生，回想那时接受帮助的自己，你最先感到的是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 돈을 보낼 때마다 가장 먼저 떠오른 사람은 어머니였습니까, 윤태성 씨였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, each time you sent money, who came to mind first: your mother or Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お金を送るたびに、最初に浮かんだのはお母様でしたか、それともユン・テソンさんでしたか。,尹正厚先生，每次汇钱时，你最先想到的是母亲，还是尹泰成先生？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 시절 도움을 받던 자신을 떠올리면 어떤 감정이 듭니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you think of yourself receiving help back then, what do you feel?",ユン・テソンさん、あの頃助けを受けていた自分を思い返すと、どんな感情が湧きますか。,尹泰成先生，回想那时接受帮助的自己，你有什么感受？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-1-v5].text,"두 분, 돈이 아니라 마음으로 남은 빚이 무엇인지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me what debt remained in your hearts, not in money.",お二人とも、お金ではなく心に残った借りが何なのか、話してください。,两位，请说说留下的不是金钱，而是心里的哪种债。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 기억하게 만드는 질문이다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. The question makes them remember where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を思い出させる質問。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安。这个问题让人回想情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 모른 채 지나가는 걸 보면서 서운함보다 안도감이 더 컸습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when you saw Mr. Yoon Tae-seong pass through life without knowing, was relief greater than hurt?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが知らないまま過ぎていくのを見ながら、寂しさより安堵の方が大きかったですか。,尹正厚先生，看着尹泰成先生在不知情的情况下走过那些日子，比起委屈，你是否更感到安心？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 기억하게 만드는 질문이다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. The question makes them remember where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を思い出させる質問。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安。这个问题让人回想情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 돈이 정말 윤정후 씨 손에서 왔을 수도 있다고 들으면 먼저 드는 감정은 미안함입니까, 분노입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you hear that the money may truly have come from Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what comes first: apology or anger?",ユン・テソンさん、そのお金が本当にユン・ジョンフさんの手から来たものかもしれないと聞いた時、最初に浮かぶのは申し訳なさですか、それとも怒りですか。,尹泰成先生，如果听说那笔钱真的可能来自尹正厚先生，你最先感到的是歉意，还是愤怒？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 모른 채 지나갈 때 안도감과 서운함 중 무엇이 컸습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when Mr. Yoon Tae-seong passed by without knowing, which was greater: relief or hurt?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが知らないまま過ぎていく時、安堵と寂しさではどちらが大きかったですか。,尹正厚先生，当尹泰成先生在不知情中度过时，安心和委屈哪一个更大？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨 돈일 수 있다는 말에 먼저 드는 감정은 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what feeling comes first when you hear that it may have been Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's money?",ユン・テソンさん、それがユン・ジョンフさんのお金だったかもしれないという言葉に、最初に浮かぶ感情は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，听到那可能是尹正厚先生的钱时，你最先出现的情绪是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-2-v5].text,"두 분, 도움을 주고도 말하지 못한 시간의 무게를 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, speak about the weight of the time when help was given but not spoken of.",お二人とも、助けを与えながらも言えなかった時間の重さを話してください。,两位，请说说给了帮助却无法说出口的那段时间有多重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계 붕괴를 무서워한 마음을 말하게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. This stage lets them speak about the fear of the relationship falling apart.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係が崩れることを怖がった気持ちを語らせる段階。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧。这一步让人说出害怕关系崩塌的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 오래 숨긴 이유가 체면 때문입니까, 윤태성 씨의 삶을 무너뜨릴까 봐서입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you hide it for so long because of pride, or because you feared Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's life would collapse?",ユン・ジョンフさん、長く隠した理由は体面のためでしたか、それともユン・テソンさんの人生が崩れるのを恐れたためでしたか。,尹正厚先生，你长期隐瞒，是为了体面，还是害怕尹泰成先生的人生会崩塌？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계 붕괴를 무서워한 마음을 말하게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. This stage lets them speak about the fear of the relationship falling apart.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係が崩れることを怖がった気持ちを語らせる段階。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧。这一步让人说出害怕关系崩塌的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨에게 빚진 사람이 될까 봐 받아들이기 어려운 마음도 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there also a feeling that made it hard to accept because you would become indebted to Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんに借りを負う人間になるのが嫌で受け入れ難い気持ちもありましたか。,尹泰成先生，你是否也因为可能变成欠尹正厚先生的人，而难以接受？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 오래 숨긴 이유가 윤태성 씨의 자존심 때문이었다고 보십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you see Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's pride as the reason you hid it for so long?",ユン・ジョンフさん、長く隠した理由はユン・テソンさんの自尊心のためだったと見ていますか。,尹正厚先生，你认为长期隐瞒的理由，是为了尹泰成先生的自尊吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨에게 빚진 사람이 될까 봐 받아들이기 어렵습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, is it hard to accept because you might become indebted to Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんに借りを負う人間になるのが嫌で、受け入れ難いのですか。,尹泰成先生，你是否因为可能变成欠尹正厚先生的人，所以难以接受？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-3-v5].text,"두 분, 고마움이 분노로 바뀐 순간이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer whether there was a moment when gratitude turned into anger.",お二人とも、感謝が怒りに変わった瞬間があったのか、答えてください。,两位，请回答是否有感激转为愤怒的瞬间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처 가운데 무엇이 더 크게 남는지 스스로 보게 하는 질문이다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. The question lets them see for themselves what remains larger: responsibility or hurt.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷のどちらがより大きく残っているのかを自分で見させる質問。,让人选择最沉重的情绪。这个问题让他们自己看清，责任与伤害之中哪一边留下得更重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금 더 무거운 것은 도움을 숨긴 죄책감입니까, 윤태성 씨를 끝내 보호하지 못했다는 허무감입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what is heavier now: guilt for hiding the help, or emptiness because you ultimately could not protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、今より重いのは、助けを隠した罪悪感ですか、それともユン・テソンさんを最後まで守れなかった虚しさですか。,尹正厚先生，现在更沉重的是隐瞒帮助的罪疚感，还是最终没能保护尹泰成先生的空虚感？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처 가운데 무엇이 더 크게 남는지 스스로 보게 하는 질문이다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. The question lets them see for themselves what remains larger: responsibility or hurt.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷のどちらがより大きく残っているのかを自分で見させる質問。,让人选择最沉重的情绪。这个问题让他们自己看清，责任与伤害之中哪一边留下得更重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 진실을 알고 싶은 마음과 끝까지 모른 척하고 싶은 마음 중 무엇이 더 큽니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, which is stronger: the wish to know the truth, or the wish to keep pretending not to know?",ユン・テソンさん、真実を知りたい気持ちと、最後まで知らないふりをしたい気持ちでは、どちらが大きいですか。,尹泰成先生，想知道真相的心，和想一直假装不知道的心，哪一个更强？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금 더 무거운 건 숨긴 죄책감입니까, 보호하지 못한 허무감입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what is heavier now: guilt for hiding it, or emptiness because you could not protect him?",ユン・ジョンフさん、今より重いのは、隠した罪悪感ですか、それとも守れなかった虚しさですか。,尹正厚先生，现在更沉重的是隐瞒的罪疚感，还是没能保护的空虚感？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 진실을 알고 싶은 마음과 피하고 싶은 마음 중 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, which is it: wanting to know the truth, or wanting to avoid it?",ユン・テソンさん、真実を知りたい気持ちと避けたい気持ちでは、どちらですか。,尹泰成先生，你是想知道真相，还是想躲开真相？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy-approach-4-v5].text,"두 분, 이 돈이 남긴 상처와 책임을 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, separate the hurt this money left from the responsibility it created.",お二人とも、このお金が残した傷と責任を切り分けて話してください。,两位，请把这笔钱留下的伤害与责任分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실부터 고정한다. 누가 언제 무엇을 봤는지 기초 순서를 세우는 질문이다.,"It fixes the surface facts first. The question establishes the basic sequence of who saw what, and when.",まず表面的な事実を固定する。誰がいつ何を見たのか、基本の順序を立てる質問。,先固定表面事实。这个问题用于建立谁在何时看见了什么的基本顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니께 정기적인 지원이 있었던 사실은 인정하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you admit there was regular support for your mother?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様への定期的な支援があった事実は認めますか。,尹正厚先生，你承认曾定期支援母亲吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실부터 고정한다. 누가 언제 무엇을 봤는지 기초 순서를 세우는 질문이다.,"It fixes the surface facts first. The question establishes the basic sequence of who saw what, and when.",まず表面的な事実を固定する。誰がいつ何を見たのか、基本の順序を立てる質問。,先固定表面事实。这个问题用于建立谁在何时看见了什么的基本顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 공장 위기 때 어머니 명의로 들어온 돈의 출처를 당시 어떻게 이해하고 계셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, during the factory crisis, how did you understand the source of the money that came in under your mother's name?",ユン・テソンさん、工場の危機の時、お母様名義で入ったお金の出どころを当時どう理解していましたか。,尹泰成先生，工厂危机时，以母亲名义进来的钱，你当时如何理解它的来源？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 통장으로 들어간 돈의 출처를 처음부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, tell us from the beginning where the money entering your mother's account came from.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の通帳に入ったお金の出どころを、最初から話してください。,尹正厚先生，请从头说明进入母亲账户的钱来自哪里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 돈이라고 믿은 근거는 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what made you believe it was your mother's money?",ユン・テソンさん、それがお母様のお金だと信じた根拠は何でしたか。,尹泰成先生，你相信那是母亲的钱，依据是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-1-v5].text,"두 분, 정기적인 지원과 사업 쪽 자금 흐름을 구분해 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, separate the regular support from the funds that moved toward the business.",お二人とも、定期的な支援と事業側の資金の流れを分けて話してください。,两位，请把定期支援与流向生意那边的资金分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 시점과 행동을 갈라 흔들리는 부분을 찾는다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates timing from action to find where the account wavers.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。時点と行動を切り分け、揺れている部分を探る。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分时间点与行为，寻找摇摆之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 송금이 시작된 시점과 끊기지 않은 기간을 장면과 순서를 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, tell us, by scene and sequence, when those transfers began and how long they continued without interruption.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その送金が始まった時点と途切れず続いた期間を、場面と順序に分けて話してください。,尹正厚先生，请按场景和顺序说明那些汇款从什么时候开始，又持续了多久未曾中断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 시점과 행동을 갈라 흔들리는 부분을 찾는다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates timing from action to find where the account wavers.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。時点と行動を切り分け、揺れている部分を探る。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分时间点与行为，寻找摇摆之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 큰돈이 정말 어머니 개인 돈이라고만 믿게 된 근거가 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, did you have grounds to believe that large sum was truly only your mother's personal money?",ユン・テソンさん、その大金が本当にお母様個人のお金だけだと信じる根拠はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，你有什么依据相信那笔大钱真的只是母亲个人的钱？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 매달 이어진 지원과 사업 쪽 자금이 같은 흐름인지 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain whether the monthly support and the business funds were part of the same flow.",ユン・ジョンフさん、毎月続いた支援と事業側の資金が同じ流れなのか、説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明每月持续的支援和生意方面的资金是否属于同一条流向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 큰돈이 들어온 해에 출처를 묻지 않은 이유가 있습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you not ask about the source in the year that large sum came in?",ユン・テソンさん、大金が入ってきた年に、なぜ出どころを尋ねなかったのですか。,尹泰成先生，那笔大钱进来的那一年，你为什么没有询问来源？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-2-v5].text,"두 분, 돈이 들어온 시기와 사용처를 순서대로 맞춰 보겠습니다.","Both of you, let us match the timing of the money coming in with where it was used.",お二人とも、お金が入った時期と使い道を順番に合わせてみましょう。,两位，我们按顺序核对那笔钱进来的时间和用途。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정이 아니라 대상과 방식까지 말하게 만드는 단계다.,"It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. This stage makes them state not just assumptions, but the target and method.",核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく、対象と方法まで言わせる段階。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围。这一步要求说出对象和方式，而不只是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨 공장으로 건너간 돈까지 본인 돈이 섞여 있었다는 말씀입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, are you saying your own money was mixed in even with the money that went to Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's factory?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの工場に渡ったお金にも、ご自身のお金が混じっていたということですか。,尹正厚先生，你是说，就连转到尹泰成先生工厂的钱里，也混有你自己的钱吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정이 아니라 대상과 방식까지 말하게 만드는 단계다.,"It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. This stage makes them state not just assumptions, but the target and method.",核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく、対象と方法まで言わせる段階。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围。这一步要求说出对象和方式，而不只是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 지금 돌아보면 그 돈의 일부가 윤정후 씨 돈일 수도 있다는 정황을 전혀 못 보셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, looking back now, did you see no signs at all that part of that money might have been Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's?",ユン・テソンさん、今振り返ると、そのお金の一部がユン・ジョンフさんのお金だった可能性を示す状況は、まったく見えませんでしたか。,尹泰成先生，现在回头看，那笔钱的一部分可能是尹正厚先生的钱，你当时完全没有看见任何迹象吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨 공장에 들어간 돈까지 본인 부담이었다는 점을 인정합니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you acknowledge that even the money that entered Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's factory was your burden?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの工場に入ったお金までご自身の負担だった点を認めますか。,尹正厚先生，你承认连进入尹泰成先生工厂的钱也是由你承担的吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 돈이 윤정후 씨 돈이었다면 기존 판단이 어떻게 달라집니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if that money was Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's, how does your earlier judgment change?",ユン・テソンさん、そのお金がユン・ジョンフさんのお金だったなら、これまでの判断はどう変わりますか。,尹泰成先生，如果那笔钱是尹正厚先生的钱，你原先的判断会如何改变？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-3-v5].text,"두 분, 어머니 돈처럼 보인 흐름과 실제 출처를 나눠 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer separately about the flow that looked like your mother's money and the actual source.",お二人とも、お母様のお金のように見えた流れと実際の出どころを分けて答えてください。,两位，请把看似母亲的钱的流向与实际来源分开回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,더는 돌릴 수 없도록 결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세우려는 질문이다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility so they can no longer turn away. The question tries to straighten out where fact and interpretation diverge.,これ以上そらせないよう、決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す質問。,追问决定性的理由与责任，让对方无法再回避。这个问题试图校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 오랜 기간 그 사실을 윤태성 씨에게 숨긴 이유까지 포함해 돈의 성격을 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, clearly state the nature of the money, including why you hid that fact from Mr. Yoon Tae-seong for so long.",ユン・ジョンフさん、長い間その事実をユン・テソンさんに隠した理由まで含めて、お金の性格を明確に話してください。,尹正厚先生，请连同你为何长期向尹泰成先生隐瞒这一事实，明确说明那笔钱的性质。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,더는 돌릴 수 없도록 결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세우려는 질문이다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility so they can no longer turn away. The question tries to straighten out where fact and interpretation diverge.,これ以上そらせないよう、決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す質問。,追问决定性的理由与责任，让对方无法再回避。这个问题试图校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 도움의 출처를 잘못 알고도 어머니가 자신만 믿었다고 더 굳히신 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you harden your belief that your mother trusted only you, even while misunderstanding the source of that help?",ユン・テソンさん、その助けの出どころを誤って知りながらも、お母様が自分だけを信じていたとさらに固めた理由は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，在误解那份帮助来源的情况下，你为什么更加认定母亲只信任你？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 오랜 기간 말하지 않은 선택의 책임을 어떻게 보십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how do you view your responsibility for choosing not to speak for so long?",ユン・ジョンフさん、長い間言わなかった選択の責任をどう見ていますか。,尹正厚先生，你如何看待自己长期不说这一选择的责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 도움받은 사실을 알았다면 상속 주장이 달라졌습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, if you had known you had received that help, would your inheritance claim have changed?",ユン・テソンさん、助けを受けていた事実を知っていたなら、相続の主張は変わりましたか。,尹泰成先生，如果你知道自己接受过帮助，你的继承主张会改变吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact-pursuit-4-v5].text,"두 분, 숨겨진 지원이 관계를 어떻게 바꿨는지 마지막으로 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer one last time how the hidden support changed the relationship.",お二人とも、隠された支援が関係をどう変えたのか、最後に答えてください。,两位，请最后回答，隐藏的支援如何改变了你们的关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,사실 자체보다 왜 바로 말하지 못했는지의 입구를 연다. 처음의 주저함을 자극하는 질문이다.,"It opens the way to why they could not speak immediately, rather than the fact itself. The question prods at the first hesitation.",事実そのものより、なぜすぐ言えなかったのかへの入口を開く。最初のためらいを刺激する質問。,它不是追问事实本身，而是打开“为什么不能立刻说”的入口，触及最初的犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 송금을 효도라는 이름으로만 두고 끝까지 밝히지 않은 이유는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you leave those transfers under the name of filial duty and never disclose them to the end?",ユン・ジョンフさん、その送金を親孝行という名のままにして、最後まで明かさなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，你为什么一直把那些汇款只放在“孝顺”的名义下，直到最后都不说出来？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,사실 자체보다 왜 바로 말하지 못했는지의 입구를 연다. 처음의 주저함을 자극하는 질문이다.,"It opens the way to why they could not speak immediately, rather than the fact itself. The question prods at the first hesitation.",事実そのものより、なぜすぐ言えなかったのかへの入口を開く。最初のためらいを刺激する質問。,它不是追问事实本身，而是打开“为什么不能立刻说”的入口，触及最初的犹豫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 돈이라고 믿는 편이 마음이 덜 흔들렸던 겁니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was it less unsettling for you to believe it was your mother's money?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様のお金だと信じている方が、気持ちが揺れにくかったのですか。,尹泰成先生，相信那是母亲的钱，会让你的心比较不动摇吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-1-v3].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 돈을 보내면서도 이름을 남기지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you send the money without leaving your name?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お金を送りながらも名前を残さなかった理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，你汇钱却不留下自己的名字，原因是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-1-v4].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-1-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 도움이라고 믿는 편이 더 편했던 이유가 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there a reason it was easier to believe the help came from your mother?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の助けだと信じる方が楽だった理由はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，相信那是母亲的帮助，对你来说更轻松，是有什么原因吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-1-v5].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-1-v5].text,"두 분, 돈의 출처를 묻지 않고 지나간 이유를 각자 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, each tell me why you passed by without asking where the money came from.",お二人とも、お金の出どころを尋ねずに過ぎた理由を、それぞれ話してください。,两位，请各自说明为什么没有追问那笔钱的来源。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 선택의 부담을 한 단계 더 구체화하는 흐름이다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. The flow makes the burden of the choice one step more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。選択の重さを一段階具体化する流れ。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把选择的负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨의 사업이 무너질 때도 본인 이름을 감춘 채 돈을 돌린 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you route the money while hiding your name even when Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's business was collapsing?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの事業が崩れそうな時も、ご自身の名前を隠したままお金を回した理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，即使尹泰成先生的事业快要崩溃，你为什么仍隐藏自己的名字把钱转过去？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 선택의 부담을 한 단계 더 구체화하는 흐름이다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. The flow makes the burden of the choice one step more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。選択の重さを一段階具体化する流れ。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把选择的负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 뒤에서 감당했을 가능성을 왜 한 번도 먼저 묻지 않으셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did you never once ask first about the possibility that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu was bearing it from behind?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが裏で引き受けていた可能性を、なぜ一度も先に尋ねなかったのですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么你从未主动问过，尹正厚先生是否可能在背后承担？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-2-v3].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨에게 말하면 무슨 일이 생긴다고 두려워하셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what did you fear would happen if you told Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに話したら何が起こると恐れていましたか。,尹正厚先生，你害怕告诉尹泰成先生后会发生什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-2-v4].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-2-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨 도움을 인정하면 무엇이 무너진다고 느끼십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, what do you feel would collapse if you acknowledged Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's help?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんの助けを認めると何が崩れると感じますか。,尹泰成先生，如果承认尹正厚先生的帮助，你觉得什么会崩塌？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-2-v5].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-2-v5].text,"두 분, 체면과 고마움 사이에서 피한 말이 무엇인지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer what words you avoided between pride and gratitude.",お二人とも、体面と感謝の間で避けてきた言葉は何か、答えてください。,两位，请回答在体面与感谢之间，你们避开的是什么话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 직접 건드린다. 말 바깥에 있던 불안을 꺼내게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on fear and pride inside the relationship. This stage draws out the anxiety that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に直接触れる。言葉の外にあった不安を引き出す段階。,直接触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的不安引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 도움을 줬다는 사실보다 윤태성 씨가 알았을 때 무너질 장면이 더 두려우셨던 겁니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, was the thought of Mr. Yoon Tae-seong collapsing when he found out more frightening than the fact that you had helped?",ユン・ジョンフさん、助けたという事実より、ユン・テソンさんが知った時に崩れる場面の方が怖かったのですか。,尹正厚先生，比起自己提供帮助这一事实，你是否更害怕尹泰成先生知道后崩溃的场面？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 직접 건드린다. 말 바깥에 있던 불안을 꺼내게 하는 단계다.,It touches directly on fear and pride inside the relationship. This stage draws out the anxiety that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に直接触れる。言葉の外にあった不安を引き出す段階。,直接触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的不安引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 사랑을 증명하고 싶은 마음이 돈의 출처를 보는 눈까지 가렸던 건 아닙니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, did your wish to prove your mother's love blind you even to the source of the money?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の愛を証明したい気持ちが、お金の出どころを見る目まで曇らせたのではありませんか。,尹泰成先生，你想证明母亲爱的心，是否连看清钱的来源的眼睛也遮住了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-3-v3].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 지원을 숨긴 일이 윤태성 씨를 보호한 것이라고 보십니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you see hiding the support as a way of protecting Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、支援を隠したことはユン・テソンさんを守ったことだと見ていますか。,尹正厚先生，你认为隐藏支援是在保护尹泰成先生吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-3-v4].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-3-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 사랑을 증명하려는 마음이 돈의 출처를 가렸습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, did your wish to prove your mother's love hide the source of the money from view?",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の愛を証明しようとする気持ちが、お金の出どころを隠しましたか。,尹泰成先生，你想证明母亲爱的心，是否遮住了钱的来源？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-3-v5].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-3-v5].text,"두 분, 도움을 숨긴 이유와 모른 척한 이유를 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, separately state why one hid the help and why the other pretended not to know.",お二人とも、助けを隠した理由と、知らないふりをした理由を分けて話してください。,两位，请把隐藏帮助的理由和装作不知道的理由分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘거나 단정했는지를 정면으로 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims straight at why they crossed that line or reached that conclusion.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのか、または断定したのかを正面から狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由。正面追问为什么越过那条线，或为什么作出断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 숨김이 결국 윤태성 씨를 더 세게 다치게 할 수도 있다는 걸 알면서도 버틴 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, tell me why you endured the concealment even while knowing it might wound Mr. Yoon Tae-seong more deeply in the end.",ユン・ジョンフさん、隠すことが結局ユン・テソンさんをより深く傷つけるかもしれないと知りながら、耐え続けた理由を話してください。,尹正厚先生，明知隐瞒最终可能让尹泰成先生受更重的伤，你为什么仍撑了下来？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘거나 단정했는지를 정면으로 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims straight at why they crossed that line or reached that conclusion.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのか、または断定したのかを正面から狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由。正面追问为什么越过那条线，或为什么作出断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨를 이용하는 사람으로만 봐야 본인도 버틸 수 있었던 이유가 있었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was there a reason you had to see Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu only as someone using you in order to endure it yourself?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんを利用する人としてだけ見なければ、ご自身も耐えられなかった理由はありましたか。,尹泰成先生，你是否只有把尹正厚先生看成利用你的人，自己才能撑住？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-4-v3].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 숨김이 더 큰 상처가 될 줄 알면서도 버틴 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did you endure the concealment even though you knew it would become a deeper wound?",ユン・ジョンフさん、隠すことがより大きな傷になると知りながら、耐えた理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，明知道隐瞒会变成更大的伤口，你为什么仍撑了下来？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-4-v4].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-4-v4].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨를 의심해야 본인이 버틸 수 있었던 겁니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, did you have to suspect Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu in order to keep yourself standing?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんを疑わなければ、ご自身が耐えられなかったのですか。,尹泰成先生，你是否必须怀疑尹正厚先生，自己才能撑住？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-4-v5].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive-search-4-v5].text,"두 분, 오래된 돈이 지금의 분쟁으로 돌아온 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer why old money has returned as the dispute before us now.",お二人とも、古いお金が今の争いとして戻ってきた理由を答えてください。,两位，请回答，为什么旧日的钱会以现在这场纷争的形式回到眼前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 문장을 처음 읽었을 때 가장 먼저 떠오른 사람은 누구였습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when you first read that sentence, who came to mind first?",ユン・ジョンフさん、その一文を初めて読んだ時、最初に誰が浮かびましたか。,尹正厚先生，第一次读到那句话时，你最先想到的是谁？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 자신만 몰랐다는 말을 들었을 때 무엇이 먼저 무너졌습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, when you heard that only you had not known, what collapsed first?",ユン・テソンさん、自分だけが知らなかったと聞いた時、最初に何が崩れましたか。,尹泰成先生，听到只有自己不知道时，最先崩塌的是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 기록을 닫은 뒤 어떤 마음으로 윤태성 씨를 보셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, after closing your mother's record, what did you feel when you looked at Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の記録を閉じた後、どんな気持ちでユン・テソンさんを見ましたか。,尹正厚先生，合上母亲的记录后，你是以怎样的心情看着尹泰成先生的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v4].text,"두 분, 오래된 가족의 말이 지금 어떤 상처로 돌아왔는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me what wound the old words of this family have become now.",お二人とも、古い家族の言葉が今どんな傷となって戻ってきたのか、話してください。,两位，请说明家族中那些旧日的话，如今以怎样的伤口回来了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,판단보다 감정의 첫 반응을 묻는다. 방어를 조금 낮추는 질문이다.,It asks for the first emotional reaction rather than a judgment. The question lowers their defenses a little.,判断ではなく感情の最初の反応を尋ねる。防御を少し下げる質問。,不问判断，而问最初的情绪反应。这个问题会稍微降低防备。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-1-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵이 시작된 날의 감정을 지금 말할 수 있습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, can you now speak about the feeling on the day the silence began?",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙が始まった日の感情を、今話すことはできますか。,尹正厚先生，现在你能说出沉默开始那天的情绪吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 알게 될까 봐 두려웠던 장면을 떠올려 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, recall and describe the scene you feared Mr. Yoon Tae-seong might come to know.",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが知ってしまうかもしれないと恐れた場面を思い出して話してください。,尹正厚先生，请回想并说明你害怕尹泰成先生会知道的那一幕。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 말하지 않은 시간이 왜 모욕처럼 느껴집니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why does the time Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu spent without speaking feel like an insult?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが言わなかった時間は、なぜ侮辱のように感じられますか。,尹泰成先生，尹正厚先生不说出来的那段时间，为什么让你感觉像一种羞辱？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨를 속인 마음과 지킨 마음 중 무엇이 더 무겁습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, which weighs more: the heart that deceived Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, or the heart that tried to protect him?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんを欺いた気持ちと守った気持ちでは、どちらがより重いですか。,尹正厚先生，欺骗尹泰成先生的心，和保护他的心，哪一个更重？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v4].text,"두 분, 말하지 않은 사람과 듣지 못한 사람의 상처를 나눠 보겠습니다.","Both of you, let us separate the wound of the one who did not speak from the wound of the one who did not hear.",お二人とも、言わなかった人の傷と、聞けなかった人の傷を分けてみましょう。,两位，我们来区分没有说出口的人所受的伤，以及没有听到的人所受的伤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,죄책감과 불안을 시간의 흐름 안에서 묻는다. 감정이 커진 지점을 찾는다.,It asks about guilt and anxiety within the flow of time. It looks for the point where the emotion grew stronger.,罪悪感と不安を時間の流れの中で尋ねる。感情が大きくなった地点を探る。,在时间流中询问罪疚感和不安，寻找情绪变强的节点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-2-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 두려움을 혼자 떠안은 순간을 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain the moment when you bore your mother's fear alone.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の恐れを一人で背負った瞬間を説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明你独自承担母亲恐惧的那个瞬间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨의 삶을 지킨다는 말이 스스로에게 위로가 되었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did telling yourself you were protecting Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's life comfort you?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの人生を守るという言葉は、ご自身への慰めになりましたか。,尹正厚先生，“守住尹泰成先生的人生”这句话，是否成了你给自己的安慰？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 출생 문제보다 가족으로서 믿음이 깨진 점이 더 아픕니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, is the breaking of trust as family more painful than the matter of birth?",ユン・テソンさん、出生の問題より、家族としての信頼が壊れたことの方が痛いですか。,尹泰成先生，比起出生问题，作为家人的信任破裂是否更让你痛？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 진실을 숨기며 윤태성 씨를 볼 때 죄책감이 들지 않았습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you feel no guilt when you looked at Mr. Yoon Tae-seong while hiding the truth?",ユン・ジョンフさん、真実を隠しながらユン・テソンさんを見る時、罪悪感はありませんでしたか。,尹正厚先生，你一边隐藏真相一边看着尹泰成先生时，难道没有罪疚感吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v4].text,"두 분, 가족이라는 이름이 각자에게 무엇을 요구했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me what the name family demanded of each of you.",お二人とも、家族という名がそれぞれに何を求めたのか、話してください。,两位，请说明“家人”这个名字分别要求你们承担了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,사실 뒤에 눌려 있던 두려움을 직접 건드린다. 관계의 균열을 보게 한다.,It touches directly on the fear pressed down behind the facts. It makes them look at the fracture in the relationship.,事実の背後に押し込められていた恐れに直接触れる。関係の亀裂を見せる。,直接触及事实背后被压住的恐惧，让人看见关系中的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-3-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 비밀이 돈보다 무거웠던 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain why that secret was heavier than money.",ユン・ジョンフさん、その秘密がお金より重かった理由を説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明为什么那个秘密比钱更沉重。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금 가장 후회되는 건 숨겨 온 사정입니까, 문서가 달라진 과정입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what do you regret most now: the circumstances you hid, or the process by which the document changed?",ユン・ジョンフさん、今いちばん後悔しているのは、隠してきた事情ですか、それとも書類が変わった過程ですか。,尹正厚先生，现在你最后悔的是一直隐藏的内情，还是文件被改变的过程？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 알고 난 뒤에도 윤태성 씨가라는 자리를 붙잡고 싶은 마음이 있습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, even after learning it, do you still want to hold on to the place called Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・テソンさん、知った後でも、ユン・テソンであるという場所をつかんでいたい気持ちはありますか。,尹泰成先生，即使知道之后，你是否仍想抓住“尹泰成”这个位置？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨를 지키려던 침묵이 결국 윤태성 씨를 다치게 했다는 걸 인정합니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you admit that the silence meant to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong ended up hurting him?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんを守ろうとした沈黙が、結局ユン・テソンさんを傷つけたことを認めますか。,尹正厚先生，你承认原本想保护尹泰成先生的沉默，最终伤害了他吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v4].text,"두 분, 진실을 아는 일과 서로를 지키는 일이 왜 갈라졌는지 말해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me why knowing the truth and protecting each other split apart.",お二人とも、真実を知ることと互いを守ることが、なぜ分かれてしまったのか話してください。,两位，请说明为什么知道真相与保护彼此会分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,가장 무거운 감정을 선택하게 만든다. 책임과 상처를 스스로 보게 한다.,It makes them choose the heaviest emotion. It lets them see responsibility and hurt for themselves.,いちばん重い感情を選ばせる。責任と傷を自分で見させる。,让人选择最沉重的情绪，让他们自己看见责任与伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy-approach-4-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 이제는 윤태성 씨에게 직접 설명해야 할 감정이 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what feeling must you now explain directly to Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、今となってはユン・テソンさんに直接説明しなければならない感情は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，现在你必须直接向尹泰成先生说明的是什么情绪？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 기록을 처음 본 시점부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, begin with when you first saw your mother's record.",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の記録を初めて見た時点から話してください。,尹正厚先生，请从你第一次看到母亲记录的时间点说起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 어머니 기록 이야기를 처음 들은 순간을 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, explain the moment you first heard about your mother's record.",ユン・テソンさん、お母様の記録の話を初めて聞いた瞬間を説明してください。,尹泰成先生，请说明你第一次听到母亲记录一事的瞬间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 아버지에 관한 문장을 언제부터 알고 계셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, since when have you known the sentence about the father?",ユン・ジョンフさん、父親に関するその一文をいつから知っていましたか。,尹正厚先生，关于父亲的那句话，你从什么时候开始知道？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v4].text,"두 분, 그 사실을 알게 된 순서를 각자 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, each set out the order in which you learned that fact.",お二人とも、その事実を知った順序をそれぞれ整理してください。,两位，请各自整理知道那个事实的先后顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,표면 사실을 고정한다. 시점과 행위의 기초를 다시 세우는 질문이다.,It fixes the surface facts. The question rebuilds the basics of timing and action.,表面的な事実を固定する。時点と行為の基礎をもう一度組み立てる質問。,固定表面事实，重新建立时间点与行为的基础。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-1-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 기록을 본 뒤 누구에게도 말하지 않은 기간이 얼마입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how long did you tell no one after seeing your mother's record?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の記録を見た後、誰にも話さなかった期間はどれくらいですか。,尹正厚先生，看到母亲记录之后，你有多久没有告诉任何人？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 내용을 알고도 윤태성 씨에게 알리지 않은 첫 이유는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what was the first reason you did not tell Mr. Yoon Tae-seong even after knowing that content?",ユン・ジョンフさん、その内容を知りながらユン・テソンさんに知らせなかった最初の理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，你知道那项内容后仍没有告诉尹泰成先生，最初的理由是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨가 오래 숨겼다는 말을 어떻게 받아들이셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, how did you take the statement that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu had hidden it for so long?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんが長く隠していたという言葉をどう受け止めましたか。,尹泰成先生，你如何接受尹正厚先生长期隐瞒这件事？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니가 가장 두려워한 윤태성 씨의 반응은 무엇이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what reaction from Mr. Yoon Tae-seong did your mother fear the most?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様が最も恐れていたユン・テソンさんの反応は何でしたか。,尹正厚先生，母亲最害怕尹泰成先生作出怎样的反应？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v4].text,"두 분, 침묵이 시작된 시점과 유서 문제가 엮인 시점을 나눠 보겠습니다.","Both of you, let us separate when the silence began from when the will issue became entangled with it.",お二人とも、沈黙が始まった時点と遺言書の問題が絡んだ時点を分けてみましょう。,两位，我们把沉默开始的时间点，与遗嘱问题牵连进来的时间点分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,정황을 이루는 세부 조각으로 좁혀 묻는다. 순서와 행동을 갈라 확인한다.,It narrows the question to the details that make up the circumstances. It separates sequence from action and checks them.,状況を形づくる細部へ絞って尋ねる。順序と行動を切り分けて確認する。,把问题收窄到构成情境的细节，拆分顺序与行为来确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-2-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 비밀을 지키는 일이 언제부터 서류 문제와 이어졌습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when did keeping the secret become connected to the paperwork issue?",ユン・ジョンフさん、秘密を守ることはいつから書類の問題とつながりましたか。,尹正厚先生，守住秘密这件事从什么时候开始与文件问题连在一起？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨의 정체성이 무너질까 봐 침묵했다는 점을 인정합니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, do you admit you kept silent because you feared Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's identity would collapse?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの自己認識が崩れることを恐れて沈黙した点を認めますか。,尹正厚先生，你承认自己是害怕尹泰成先生的身份认同崩塌，所以选择沉默吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 유서보다 숨김 자체가 더 아프게 느껴진 이유는 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did the concealment itself feel more painful than the will?",ユン・テソンさん、遺言書より隠されていたこと自体の方が痛く感じられた理由は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么比起遗嘱，隐瞒这件事本身更让你感到痛？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 기록 내용을 알고 난 뒤 자필 연습본을 어떻게 보셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, after learning the contents of your mother's record, how did you view the handwritten draft?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の記録の内容を知った後、自筆の下書きをどう見ましたか。,尹正厚先生，知道母亲记录的内容后，你如何看待亲笔草稿？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v4].text,"두 분, 민감한 가족사와 상속 비율을 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, separate the sensitive family history from the inheritance ratio.",お二人とも、敏感な家族事情と相続比率を切り分けて話してください。,两位，请把敏感的家庭往事与继承比例分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,핵심 장면과 실제 개입 범위를 직접 겨눈다. 추정 대신 방식을 말하게 한다.,It aims directly at the key scene and the actual scope of intervention. It makes them speak about method instead of assumption.,核心場面と実際の介入範囲を直接狙う。推測ではなく方法を語らせる。,直接瞄准关键场景与实际介入范围，让人说出方式而不是推测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-3-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 알게 되면 법정까지 갈 거라고 판단한 근거가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what made you think Mr. Yoon Tae-seong would take it all the way to court if he found out?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが知れば法廷まで行くと判断した根拠は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，你判断尹泰成先生知道后会闹到法庭，依据是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 법정에 오기 전에 막으려다 오히려 위조 책임을 만든 것입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you create responsibility for forgery by trying to stop this before it reached court?",ユン・ジョンフさん、法廷に来る前に止めようとして、かえって偽造責任を作ったのですか。,尹正厚先生，你是否因为想在走到法庭前阻止，反而造成了伪造责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 그 가족사보다 윤정후 씨가 알고 있었다는 사실이 더 컸습니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, was the fact that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu knew bigger to you than that family history itself?",ユン・テソンさん、その家族事情そのものより、ユン・ジョンフさんが知っていたという事実の方が大きかったのですか。,尹泰成先生，比起那段家庭往事本身，尹正厚先生早已知道这一事实，对你来说是否更重大？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨의 삶을 지키려는 판단이 왜 유서를 고치는 행동으로 갔습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, why did your judgment to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's life turn into changing the will?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの人生を守ろうとする判断が、なぜ遺言書を直す行動に向かったのですか。,尹正厚先生，想保护尹泰成先生人生的判断，为什么会走向修改遗嘱的行为？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v4].text,"두 분, 비밀을 지키려 한 일과 진실을 숨긴 책임을 따로 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer separately about trying to keep the secret and responsibility for hiding the truth.",お二人とも、秘密を守ろうとしたことと、真実を隠した責任を分けて答えてください。,两位，请把想守住秘密这件事，与隐藏真相的责任分开回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,결정적 이유와 책임을 묻는다. 사실과 해석이 갈라지는 지점을 바로 세운다.,It asks for the decisive reason and responsibility. It straightens out where fact and interpretation diverge.,決定的な理由と責任を尋ねる。事実と解釈が分かれる地点を正す。,追问决定性的理由与责任，校正事实与解读分开的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact-pursuit-4-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 그 침묵이 윤태성 씨를 더 크게 다치게 할 수 있다는 걸 언제 아셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, when did you realize that your silence could hurt Mr. Yoon Tae-seong even more deeply?",ユン・ジョンフさん、その沈黙がユン・テソンさんをより大きく傷つける可能性があると、いつ分かりましたか。,尹正厚先生，你什么时候意识到，那份沉默可能会让尹泰成先生受到更大的伤害？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v1].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 기록을 본 뒤 가장 먼저 숨기겠다고 마음먹은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, after seeing your mother's record, why did you first decide to hide it?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の記録を見た後、まず隠そうと心に決めた理由は何ですか。,尹正厚先生，看到母亲的记录后，你最先决定隐瞒的理由是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v2].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 왜 자신만 빠졌다고 느끼셨는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, tell me why you felt only you had been left out.",ユン・テソンさん、なぜ自分だけが外されたと感じたのか話してください。,尹泰成先生，请说明为什么你觉得只有自己被排除在外。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v3].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니 부탁이었습니까, 본인의 판단이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, was it your mother's request, or your own judgment?",ユン・ジョンフさん、それはお母様の頼みでしたか、それともご自身の判断でしたか。,尹正厚先生，那是母亲的请求，还是你自己的判断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v4].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v4].text,"두 분, 비밀이 가족 안에서 어떻게 굳어졌는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell me how the secret hardened inside the family.",お二人とも、その秘密が家族の中でどのように固まっていったのか、話してください。,两位，请说明那个秘密是如何在家里固定下来的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v5].behaviorHint,사실 뒤의 첫 이유를 묻는다. 방어를 낮추고 선택의 입구를 연다.,It asks for the first reason behind the facts. It lowers defenses and opens the way into the choice.,事実の背後にある最初の理由を尋ねる。防御を下げ、選択の入口を開く。,询问事实背后的第一个理由，降低防备，打开进入选择动机的入口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-1-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 처음 침묵한 순간의 판단을 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain the judgment you made at the first moment of silence.",ユン・ジョンフさん、最初に沈黙した瞬間の判断を説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明你最初选择沉默那一刻的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v1].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨에게 말하면 무엇이 무너진다고 보셨습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, what did you think would collapse if you told Mr. Yoon Tae-seong?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんに話したら何が崩れると見ていましたか。,尹正厚先生，你认为如果告诉尹泰成先生，会有什么崩塌？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v2].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 윤정후 씨 침묵을 배신으로 느낀 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, why did Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's silence feel like betrayal?",ユン・テソンさん、ユン・ジョンフさんの沈黙を裏切りだと感じた理由は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，为什么你会把尹正厚先生的沉默感受成背叛？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v3].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 어머니의 두려움과 본인 두려움 중 무엇이 더 컸습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, which was stronger: your mother's fear or your own?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お母様の恐れとご自身の恐れでは、どちらが大きかったですか。,尹正厚先生，母亲的恐惧和你自己的恐惧，哪一个更强？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v4].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v4].text,"두 분, 숨기는 쪽과 모르는 쪽의 두려움을 각각 말해 주십시오.","Both of you, each speak about the fear of the side that hid it and the side that did not know.",お二人とも、隠す側と知らない側の恐れを、それぞれ話してください。,两位，请分别说出隐瞒一方的恐惧与不知情一方的恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v5].behaviorHint,숨김과 의심이 커진 직접 원인을 묻는다. 부담을 더 구체화한다.,It asks for the direct cause that made concealment and suspicion grow. It makes the burden more concrete.,隠し事と疑いが大きくなった直接の原因を尋ねる。負担をさらに具体化する。,询问隐瞒与怀疑变大的直接原因，把负担进一步具体化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-2-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨의 자존심을 지킨다는 판단이 정말 가능하다고 믿었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you truly believe you could protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's pride by making that judgment?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんの自尊心を守るという判断が、本当に可能だと信じていましたか。,尹正厚先生，你真的相信通过那样判断，可以保护尹泰成先生的自尊吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v1].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 민감한 가족 사정과 유서 변경 판단이 어떻게 연결됩니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, how do the sensitive family circumstances connect to the decision to change the will?",ユン・ジョンフさん、敏感な家族事情と遺言書変更の判断は、どうつながりますか。,尹正厚先生，敏感的家庭内情与修改遗嘱的判断，是如何连接的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v2].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 장남이라는 믿음이 흔들릴까 두려운 마음을 인정하십니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, do you admit you were afraid your belief that you were the eldest son would be shaken?",ユン・テソンさん、長男だという信念が揺らぐことへの恐れを認めますか。,尹泰成先生，你承认自己害怕“长子”这个信念被动摇吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v3].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 돈 문제가 아니라 윤태성 씨의 삶이 흔들리지 않게 막으려 했다는 설명입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, are you saying this was not about money, but about trying to keep Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's life from being shaken?",ユン・ジョンフさん、お金の問題ではなく、ユン・テソンさんの人生が揺らがないように防ごうとしたという説明ですか。,尹正厚先生，你的解释是，这不是钱的问题，而是想防止尹泰成先生的人生被动摇吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v4].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v4].text,"두 분, 재산 다툼과 정체성 문제를 어디서부터 혼동했는지 답해 주십시오.","Both of you, answer where you began to confuse the property dispute with the identity issue.",お二人とも、財産争いと自己認識の問題を、どこから混同したのか答えてください。,两位，请回答你们从哪里开始混淆了财产纷争与身份问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v5].behaviorHint,관계 안쪽의 공포와 체면을 건드린다. 말 바깥의 이유를 꺼내게 한다.,It touches on fear and pride inside the relationship. It draws out the reasons that sat outside the words.,関係の内側にある恐れと体面に触れる。言葉の外にある理由を引き出す。,触及关系内部的恐惧与体面，把话语之外的理由引出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-3-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 윤태성 씨가 끝까지 파고들 것을 예상하고 숫자를 낮춘 것입니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, did you lower the number because you expected Mr. Yoon Tae-seong to dig until the end?",ユン・ジョンフさん、ユン・テソンさんが最後まで掘り下げると予想して、数字を下げたのですか。,尹正厚先生，你是否预料尹泰成先生会追查到底，所以降低了数字？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v1].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v1].text,"윤정후 씨, 보호라는 이유로 법적 선을 넘은 판단을 설명해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain the judgment that crossed the legal line in the name of protection.",ユン・ジョンフさん、保護という理由で法的な線を越えた判断を説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请解释你以保护为由越过法律界线的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v2].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v2].text,"윤태성 씨, 숨김의 동기를 들어도 책임 추궁을 늦출 수 없는 이유가 무엇입니까.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, even after hearing the motive for the concealment, why can you not delay pressing responsibility?",ユン・テソンさん、隠した動機を聞いても責任追及を遅らせられない理由は何ですか。,尹泰成先生，即使听到隐瞒的动机，你为什么仍不能推迟追究责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v3].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v3].text,"윤정후 씨, 침묵이 윤태성 씨를 지키는 길이라고 믿은 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, state the grounds on which you believed silence was the way to protect Mr. Yoon Tae-seong.",ユン・ジョンフさん、沈黙がユン・テソンさんを守る道だと信じた根拠を話してください。,尹正厚先生，请说明你相信沉默就是保护尹泰成先生的依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v4].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v4].text,"두 분, 선의와 위법이 부딪힌 지점을 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, clearly state where good intent and illegality collided.",お二人とも、善意と違法がぶつかった地点を明確に話してください。,两位，请明确说出善意与违法发生冲突的地点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v5].behaviorHint,핑계가 아니라 선택의 이유를 묻는다. 왜 그 선을 넘었는지 겨눈다.,"It asks for the reason behind the choice, not an excuse. It aims at why they crossed that line.",言い訳ではなく選択の理由を尋ねる。なぜその線を越えたのかを狙う。,不是问借口，而是问选择的理由，瞄准为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive-search-4-v5].text,"윤정후 씨, 끝내 말하지 않는 선택이 누구를 위한 것이었습니까.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, who was the choice to keep silent until the end for?",ユン・ジョンフさん、最後まで言わないという選択は誰のためのものでしたか。,尹正厚先生，最终选择不说出来，是为了谁？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人崔福顺。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v1].text,"최복순 씨, 들어오십시오. 윤정후 씨가 어머니에게 문서를 읽어드린 장면과 그 말을 바로 확인하겠습니다.","Ms. Choi Bok-sun, please come in. We will directly confirm the scene where Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu read the document to his mother and what was said there.",チェ・ボクスンさん、お入りください。ユン・ジョンフさんがお母様に書類を読み聞かせた場面と、その言葉をただちに確認します。,崔福顺女士，请进来。我们将直接确认尹正厚先生给母亲读文件的场景和他说过的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人崔福顺。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v2].text,최복순 씨의 증언을 듣겠습니다. 말년 유서 작성 과정에서 윤정후 씨가 어디까지 관여했는지 명확히 묻겠습니다.,We will hear Ms. Choi Bok-sun's testimony. I will clearly ask how far Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu was involved in the will-making process in her final years.,チェ・ボクスンさんの証言を聞きます。晩年の遺言書作成過程で、ユン・ジョンフさんがどこまで関与したのか明確に尋ねます。,我们将听取崔福顺女士的证言。我会明确询问尹正厚先生在晚年遗嘱制作过程中介入到什么程度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人崔福顺。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v3].text,"최복순 씨, 어머니 방에서 본 일을 시간순으로 말씀해 주셔야 합니다. 방문과 낭독의 경계를 확인하겠습니다.","Ms. Choi Bok-sun, you must tell us in order what you saw in the mother's room. We will confirm the boundary between visits and reading aloud.",チェ・ボクスンさん、お母様の部屋で見たことを時系列で話していただきます。訪問と読み聞かせの境界を確認します。,崔福顺女士，请按时间顺序说出你在母亲房间里看到的事。我们将确认探访与朗读文件之间的界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人崔福顺。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v4].text,최복순 씨를 부르겠습니다. 이 증언은 어머니 판단과 윤정후 씨 개입을 가르는 핵심입니다.,I will call Ms. Choi Bok-sun. This testimony is key to separating the mother's judgment from Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's intervention.,チェ・ボクスンさんを呼びます。この証言は、お母様の判断とユン・ジョンフさんの介入を分ける核心です。,我会传唤崔福顺女士。这份证言是区分母亲判断与尹正厚先生介入的关键。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人崔福顺。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgew-w-1-hard-v5].text,"최복순 씨, 지금부터 유서 작성 직전의 장면을 차분히 확인하겠습니다.","Ms. Choi Bok-sun, from now on we will calmly confirm the scene just before the will was written.",チェ・ボクスンさん、これから遺言書作成直前の場面を落ち着いて確認します。,崔福顺女士，现在我们会冷静确认遗嘱制作前的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Choi Bok-sun's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要崔福顺作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v1].text,최복순 씨의 직접 증언을 듣겠습니다. 윤정후 씨의 방문과 종이 낭독이 단순 도움인지 따져 보겠습니다.,We will hear Ms. Choi Bok-sun's direct testimony. We will examine whether Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's visits and paper reading were simple assistance.,チェ・ボクスンさんの直接証言を聞きます。ユン・ジョンフさんの訪問と紙の読み聞かせが単なる手助けだったのか、確かめます。,我们将听取崔福顺女士的直接证言，核实尹正厚先生的探访和朗读纸张是否只是单纯帮助。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Choi Bok-sun's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要崔福顺作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v2].text,양쪽 진술이 갈리는 만큼 최복순 씨의 기억을 확인해야 합니다. 어머니 방에서 실제로 본 일을 묻겠습니다.,"Because the two sides' statements diverge, we must confirm Ms. Choi Bok-sun's memory. We will ask what she actually saw in the mother's room.",双方の陳述が割れている以上、チェ・ボクスンさんの記憶を確認する必要があります。お母様の部屋で実際に見たことを尋ねます。,既然双方陈述分歧，我们必须确认崔福顺女士的记忆。我们会询问她在母亲房间里实际看到的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Choi Bok-sun's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要崔福顺作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v3].text,최복순 씨를 부르겠습니다. 윤태성 씨가 오기 전 마치려 했다는 말의 맥락을 확인하겠습니다.,I will call Ms. Choi Bok-sun. We will confirm the context of the statement that it should be finished before Mr. Yoon Tae-seong arrived.,チェ・ボクスンさんを呼びます。ユン・テソンさんが来る前に終えようとしたという言葉の文脈を確認します。,我会传唤崔福顺女士，确认“在尹泰成先生到来前结束”这句话的语境。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Choi Bok-sun's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要崔福顺作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v4].text,방문기록만으로는 부족합니다. 최복순 씨가 본 장면을 통해 개입 범위를 확인하겠습니다.,"The visit records alone are not enough. Through the scene Ms. Choi Bok-sun saw, we will confirm the scope of intervention.",訪問記録だけでは不十分です。チェ・ボクスンさんが見た場面を通して、介入の範囲を確認します。,仅凭探访记录还不够。我们将通过崔福顺女士看到的场景，确认介入范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Choi Bok-sun's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要崔福顺作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgew-w-1-mid-v5].text,최복순 씨의 증언으로 말년 방문과 유서 절차가 어디서 겹쳤는지 짚겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Choi Bok-sun's testimony, we will pinpoint where the final-years visits and the will procedure overlapped.",チェ・ボクスンさんの証言によって、晩年の訪問と遺言書手続きがどこで重なったのかを指摘します。,通过崔福顺女士的证言，我们将指出晚年探访与遗嘱程序在哪些地方重叠。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人崔福顺。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v1].text,최복순 씨를 부르겠습니다. 말년 방문이 늘어난 시기와 종이를 읽어드린 장면을 차분히 확인하겠습니다.,I will call Ms. Choi Bok-sun. We will calmly confirm when the final-years visits increased and the scene where the paper was read aloud.,チェ・ボクスンさんを呼びます。晩年の訪問が増えた時期と、紙を読み聞かせた場面を落ち着いて確認します。,我会传唤崔福顺女士。我们将冷静确认晚年探访增加的时期，以及朗读纸张的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人崔福顺。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v2].text,최복순 씨의 기억을 듣겠습니다. 윤정후 씨가 어머니에게 문서를 읽어드린 경위를 먼저 확인하겠습니다.,"We will hear Ms. Choi Bok-sun's memory. First, we will confirm how Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu came to read the document to his mother.",チェ・ボクスンさんの記憶を聞きます。まず、ユン・ジョンフさんがお母様に書類を読み聞かせた経緯を確認します。,我们将听取崔福顺女士的记忆。首先确认尹正厚先生给母亲读文件的经过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人崔福顺。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v3].text,전 요양보호사 최복순 씨를 부르겠습니다. 어머니 방에서 본 장면과 들은 말을 순서대로 묻겠습니다.,I will call former caregiver Choi Bok-sun. We will ask in order about the scene she saw in the mother's room and the words she heard.,元介護職員のチェ・ボクスンさんを呼びます。お母様の部屋で見た場面と聞いた言葉を、順番に尋ねます。,我会传唤前护理员崔福顺女士。我们会按顺序询问她在母亲房间里看到的场景和听到的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人崔福顺。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v4].text,최복순 씨의 증언이 필요합니다. 방문기록과 낭독 장면이 어떻게 이어졌는지 확인하겠습니다.,Ms. Choi Bok-sun's testimony is needed. We will confirm how the visit record connects to the scene of reading aloud.,チェ・ボクスンさんの証言が必要です。訪問記録と読み聞かせの場面がどうつながるのか確認します。,需要崔福顺女士作证。我们将确认探访记录与朗读场景如何衔接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 최복순 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Choi Bok-sun. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がチェ・ボクスン証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人崔福顺。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgew-w-1-soft-v5].text,최복순 씨를 통해 말년 유서 작성 과정의 기초 사실을 확인하겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Choi Bok-sun, we will confirm the basic facts of the will-making process in the mother's final years.",チェ・ボクスンさんを通じて、晩年の遺言書作成過程の基礎事実を確認します。,我们将通过崔福顺女士，确认母亲晚年遗嘱制作过程的基础事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人金英秀。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v1].text,"김영수 씨, 들어오십시오. 같은 날 공증 기록의 순서와 문서에 손댄 사람을 바로 확인하겠습니다.","Mr. Kim Yeong-su, please come in. We will directly confirm the sequence in the notarization records from that day and who handled the document.",キム・ヨンスさん、お入りください。同じ日の公証記録の順序と、書類に触れた人物をただちに確認します。,金英秀先生，请进来。我们将直接确认当天公证记录的顺序，以及接触文件的人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人金英秀。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v2].text,김영수 씨의 기록 증언이 필요합니다. 유서가 어떻게 바뀌었고 누가 다시 냈는지 명확히 묻겠습니다.,Mr. Kim Yeong-su's record testimony is needed. We will clearly ask how the will changed and who resubmitted it.,キム・ヨンスさんの記録証言が必要です。遺言書がどう変わり、誰が再提出したのかを明確に尋ねます。,需要金英秀先生的记录证言。我们会明确询问遗嘱如何改变，以及是谁重新提交的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人金英秀。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v3].text,"김영수 씨, 공증인 메모 기록의 순서를 차분히 말씀해 주셔야 합니다.","Mr. Kim Yeong-su, you must calmly tell us the sequence shown in the notary's memo notes.",キム・ヨンスさん、公証人のメモ記録に残る順序を落ち着いて話していただきます。,金英秀先生，请冷静说明公证人备忘记录中的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人金英秀。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v4].text,김영수 씨를 부르겠습니다. 이 증언은 유서 조작의 주체를 가르는 핵심입니다.,I will call Mr. Kim Yeong-su. This testimony is key to separating who was responsible for manipulating the will.,キム・ヨンスさんを呼びます。この証言は、遺言書操作の主体を分ける核心です。,我会传唤金英秀先生。这份证言是区分遗嘱操纵主体的关键。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人金英秀。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgew-w-2-hard-v5].text,"김영수 씨, 두 문서가 왜 같은 날 남았는지 지금 확인하겠습니다.","Mr. Kim Yeong-su, we will now confirm why two documents remained from the same day.",キム・ヨンスさん、二つの書類がなぜ同じ日に残ったのか、今確認します。,金英秀先生，我们现在确认为什么同一天留下了两份文件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Kim Yeong-su's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要金英秀作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v1].text,김영수 씨의 증언을 듣겠습니다. 같은 날 공증 기록이 남은 이유와 문서에 손댄 사람을 명확히 확인하겠습니다.,We will hear Mr. Kim Yeong-su's testimony. We will clearly confirm why the notarization record remained that day and who handled the document.,キム・ヨンスさんの証言を聞きます。同じ日の公証記録が残った理由と、書類に触れた人物を明確に確認します。,我们将听取金英秀先生的证言，明确确认当天为何留下公证记录，以及是谁接触了文件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Kim Yeong-su's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要金英秀作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v2].text,공증인 메모 기록이 쟁점입니다. 김영수 씨를 불러 공증 당일 절차와 어머니 상태를 따져 보겠습니다.,The notary's memo notes are at issue. We will call Mr. Kim Yeong-su and examine the procedure that day and the mother's condition.,公証人のメモ記録が争点です。キム・ヨンスさんを呼び、公証当日の手続きとお母様の状態を確かめます。,公证人备忘记录是争点。我们将传唤金英秀先生，核对公证当天的程序与母亲状态。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Kim Yeong-su's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要金英秀作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v3].text,김영수 씨를 부르겠습니다. 자필 연습본과 공증본 사이에 누가 어떤 서류를 다시 냈는지 확인하겠습니다.,I will call Mr. Kim Yeong-su. We will confirm who resubmitted which papers between the handwritten draft and the notarized copy.,キム・ヨンスさんを呼びます。自筆の下書きと公証本の間で、誰がどの書類を再提出したのか確認します。,我会传唤金英秀先生。我们将确认从亲笔草稿到公证副本之间，谁重新提交了哪些文件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Kim Yeong-su's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要金英秀作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v4].text,공증 기록만큼 정확한 자료가 필요합니다. 김영수 씨의 업무상 기억을 듣겠습니다.,We need records as precise as the notarization record. We will hear Mr. Kim Yeong-su's work memory.,公証記録ほど正確な資料が必要です。キム・ヨンスさんの業務上の記憶を聞きます。,我们需要像公证记录一样准确的资料。将听取金英秀先生基于工作的记忆。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Kim Yeong-su's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要金英秀作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgew-w-2-mid-v5].text,김영수 씨의 증언으로 유서 변경이 추측인지 기록인지 가르겠습니다.,"Through Mr. Kim Yeong-su's testimony, we will separate whether the change to the will is speculation or record.",キム・ヨンスさんの証言で、遺言書変更が推測なのか記録なのかを分けます。,通过金英秀先生的证言，我们将区分遗嘱变更是推测还是记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone first identifies the issue his testimony reaches.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人金英秀。语气先说明他的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v1].text,김영수 씨를 부르겠습니다. 같은 날 공증인 메모의 순서와 절차 기록을 차분히 확인하겠습니다.,I will call Mr. Kim Yeong-su. We will calmly confirm the sequence in the notary's memo from that day and the procedural record.,キム・ヨンスさんを呼びます。同じ日の公証人メモの順序と手続き記録を落ち着いて確認します。,我会传唤金英秀先生。我们将冷静确认当天公证人备忘记录的顺序与程序记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone first identifies the issue his testimony reaches.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人金英秀。语气先说明他的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v2].text,공증인 메모 담당 김영수 씨의 기록을 듣겠습니다. 공증 당일 어머니 상태와 절차 진행을 확인하겠습니다.,"We will hear the record from Mr. Kim Yeong-su, who handled the notary's memo. We will confirm the mother's condition and the progress of the procedure that day.",公証人メモ担当のキム・ヨンスさんの記録を聞きます。公証当日のお母様の状態と手続きの進行を確認します。,我们将听取负责公证人备忘记录的金英秀先生的记录，确认公证当天母亲的状态和程序推进情况。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone first identifies the issue his testimony reaches.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人金英秀。语气先说明他的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v3].text,김영수 씨를 통해 공증 과정의 공증인 메모와 문서에 손댄 사람을 확인하겠습니다.,"Through Mr. Kim Yeong-su, we will confirm the notary's memo from the notarization process and who handled the document.",キム・ヨンスさんを通じて、公証過程の公証人メモと書類に触れた人物を確認します。,我们将通过金英秀先生，确认公证过程中的公证人备忘记录以及接触文件的人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone first identifies the issue his testimony reaches.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人金英秀。语气先说明他的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v4].text,김영수 씨의 업무 기록이 필요합니다. 두 문서가 남은 경위를 먼저 묻겠습니다.,Mr. Kim Yeong-su's work records are needed. We will first ask why the two documents remained.,キム・ヨンスさんの業務記録が必要です。二つの書類が残った経緯をまず尋ねます。,需要金英秀先生的工作记录。我们会先询问两份文件留下的经过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 김영수 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Kim Yeong-su. The tone first identifies the issue his testimony reaches.,裁判官がキム・ヨンス証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人金英秀。语气先说明他的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgew-w-2-soft-v5].text,김영수 씨를 부르겠습니다. 공증 기록이 유서 변경의 순서를 어떻게 보여 주는지 확인하겠습니다.,I will call Mr. Kim Yeong-su. We will confirm how the notarization record shows the sequence of the will's change.,キム・ヨンスさんを呼びます。公証記録が遺言書変更の順序をどう示しているのか確認します。,我会传唤金英秀先生。我们将确认公证记录如何显示遗嘱变更的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Park Sun-ae. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人朴顺爱。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v1].text,"박순애 씨, 들어오십시오. 어머니가 말한 송금과 사업 자금의 출처를 바로 확인하겠습니다.","Ms. Park Sun-ae, please come in. We will directly confirm the transfers the mother mentioned and the source of the business funds.",パク・スネさん、お入りください。お母様が話した送金と事業資金の出どころをただちに確認します。,朴顺爱女士，请进来。我们将直接确认母亲提到的汇款以及事业资金的来源。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Park Sun-ae. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人朴顺爱。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v2].text,박순애 씨의 증언을 듣겠습니다. 윤정후 씨 지원이 어머니 뜻에 어떤 영향을 줬는지 명확히 묻겠습니다.,We will hear Ms. Park Sun-ae's testimony. I will clearly ask how Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's support affected the mother's wishes.,パク・スネさんの証言を聞きます。ユン・ジョンフさんの支援がお母様の意思にどんな影響を与えたのか、明確に尋ねます。,我们将听取朴顺爱女士的证言。我会明确询问尹正厚先生的支援如何影响母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Park Sun-ae. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人朴顺爱。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v3].text,"박순애 씨, 어머니에게서 들은 돈 이야기와 두 아들에 관한 말을 차분히 말씀해 주셔야 합니다.","Ms. Park Sun-ae, you must calmly speak about the money you heard from the mother and what she said about her two sons.",パク・スネさん、お母様から聞いたお金の話と二人の息子に関する言葉を、落ち着いて話していただきます。,朴顺爱女士，请冷静说出你从母亲那里听到的钱的事，以及她关于两个儿子说过的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Park Sun-ae. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人朴顺爱。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v4].text,박순애 씨를 부르겠습니다. 이 증언은 어머니 뜻과 숨겨진 지원을 가르는 핵심입니다.,I will call Ms. Park Sun-ae. This testimony is key to separating the mother's wishes from the hidden support.,パク・スネさんを呼びます。この証言は、お母様の意思と隠された支援を分ける核心です。,我会传唤朴顺爱女士。这份证言是区分母亲意愿与隐藏支援的关键。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 즉시 소환한다. 정황 해석을 멈추고 기록을 세우는 톤이다.,The Judge immediately summons witness Park Sun-ae. The tone stops circumstantial interpretation and establishes the record.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人をただちに召喚する。状況解釈を止め、記録を立てるトーン。,法官立即传唤证人朴顺爱。语气停止情境解读，转而确立记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgew-w-3-hard-v5].text,"박순애 씨, 송금과 어머니의 속마음에 관한 증언을 지금 확인하겠습니다.","Ms. Park Sun-ae, we will now confirm your testimony about the transfers and the mother's true feelings.",パク・スネさん、送金とお母様の本心に関する証言を今確認します。,朴顺爱女士，我们现在确认你关于汇款和母亲内心想法的证言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Park Sun-ae's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がパク・スネ証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要朴顺爱作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v1].text,박순애 씨의 증언이 필요합니다. 어머니가 윤정후 씨의 지원과 윤태성 씨 공장 문제를 어떻게 말했는지 확인하겠습니다.,Ms. Park Sun-ae's testimony is needed. We will confirm what the mother said about Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu's support and Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's factory issue.,パク・スネさんの証言が必要です。お母様がユン・ジョンフさんの支援とユン・テソンさんの工場問題をどう話していたのか確認します。,需要朴顺爱女士作证。我们将确认母亲如何谈到尹正厚先生的支援和尹泰成先生的工厂问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Park Sun-ae's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がパク・スネ証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要朴顺爱作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v2].text,계좌 흐름만으로는 어머니의 마음을 다 알 수 없습니다. 박순애 씨를 불러 들은 말을 확인하겠습니다.,The account trail alone cannot tell us all of the mother's heart. We will call Ms. Park Sun-ae and confirm what she heard.,口座の流れだけでは、お母様の気持ちをすべて知ることはできません。パク・スネさんを呼び、聞いた言葉を確認します。,仅凭账户流水无法完全了解母亲的心意。我们会传唤朴顺爱女士，确认她听到的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Park Sun-ae's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がパク・スネ証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要朴顺爱作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v3].text,"박순애 씨를 부르겠습니다. 어머니가 돈의 출처를 알고 있었는지, 윤태성 씨에게 어떻게 말했는지 묻겠습니다.",I will call Ms. Park Sun-ae. We will ask whether the mother knew the source of the money and how she spoke to Mr. Yoon Tae-seong.,パク・スネさんを呼びます。お母様がお金の出どころを知っていたのか、ユン・テソンさんにどう話していたのか尋ねます。,我会传唤朴顺爱女士。我们将询问母亲是否知道钱的来源，以及她如何对尹泰成先生说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Park Sun-ae's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がパク・スネ証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要朴顺爱作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v4].text,박순애 씨의 기억으로 어머니 뜻과 오래된 자금 흐름의 연결을 따져 보겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Park Sun-ae's memory, we will examine the connection between the mother's wishes and the old flow of funds.",パク・スネさんの記憶で、お母様の意思と古い資金の流れのつながりを確かめます。,我们将通过朴顺爱女士的记忆，核对母亲意愿与旧日资金流向之间的联系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증언의 필요성을 분명히 제시한다. 갈린 진술을 정리하는 톤이다.,The Judge clearly presents why Park Sun-ae's testimony is needed. The tone organizes conflicting statements.,裁判官がパク・スネ証言の必要性を明確に示す。割れた陳述を整理するトーン。,法官明确提出需要朴顺爱作证。语气用于整理相互分歧的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgew-w-3-mid-v5].text,박순애 씨 증언은 돈의 출처와 어머니의 속마음을 함께 확인할 열쇠입니다.,Ms. Park Sun-ae's testimony is the key to confirming both the source of the money and the mother's true feelings.,パク・スネさんの証言は、お金の出どころとお母様の本心をともに確認する鍵です。,朴顺爱女士的证言，是同时确认资金来源和母亲内心想法的关键。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Park Sun-ae. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人朴顺爱。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v1].text,박순애 씨를 부르겠습니다. 어머니가 말한 송금과 윤태성 씨 사업 자금 이야기를 차분히 확인하겠습니다.,I will call Ms. Park Sun-ae. We will calmly confirm the transfers the mother mentioned and the funds for Mr. Yoon Tae-seong's business.,パク・スネさんを呼びます。お母様が話した送金とユン・テソンさんの事業資金の話を落ち着いて確認します。,我会传唤朴顺爱女士。我们将冷静确认母亲提到的汇款和尹泰成先生事业资金的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Park Sun-ae. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人朴顺爱。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v2].text,박순애 씨의 기억을 듣겠습니다. 어머니가 두 아들에 관해 어떤 속마음을 말했는지 확인하겠습니다.,We will hear Ms. Park Sun-ae's memory. We will confirm what feelings the mother expressed about her two sons.,パク・スネさんの記憶を聞きます。お母様が二人の息子について、どんな本心を話したのか確認します。,我们将听取朴顺爱女士的记忆，确认母亲对两个儿子说过怎样的心里话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Park Sun-ae. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人朴顺爱。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v3].text,어머니의 오래된 친구 박순애 씨를 부르겠습니다. 정기 지원금과 사업 자금 이야기를 순서대로 묻겠습니다.,"I will call Park Sun-ae, an old friend of the mother. We will ask in order about the regular support and the business funds.",お母様の古い友人であるパク・スネさんを呼びます。定期支援金と事業資金の話を順番に尋ねます。,我会传唤母亲的老朋友朴顺爱女士。我们将按顺序询问定期支援金和事业资金的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Park Sun-ae. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人朴顺爱。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v4].text,박순애 씨 증언을 통해 어머니가 알고 있던 돈의 흐름과 마음을 확인하겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Park Sun-ae's testimony, we will confirm the money flow the mother knew about and her feelings.",パク・スネさんの証言を通じて、お母様が知っていたお金の流れと気持ちを確認します。,我们将通过朴顺爱女士的证言，确认母亲知道的资金流向和她的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 박순애 증인을 차분히 부른다. 증언이 닿는 쟁점을 먼저 밝히는 톤이다.,The Judge calmly calls witness Park Sun-ae. The tone first identifies the issue her testimony reaches.,裁判官がパク・スネ証人を落ち着いて呼ぶ。証言が届く争点を先に明らかにするトーン。,法官平静地传唤证人朴顺爱。语气先说明她的证言涉及的争点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgew-w-3-soft-v5].text,박순애 씨를 부르겠습니다. 계좌 흐름이 어머니의 말과 어떻게 맞물리는지 확인하겠습니다.,I will call Ms. Park Sun-ae. We will confirm how the account trail lines up with the mother's words.,パク・スネさんを呼びます。口座の流れがお母様の言葉とどうかみ合うのか確認します。,我会传唤朴顺爱女士。我们将确认账户流水如何与母亲的话相互衔接。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v1].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v1].text,조건을 둔다면 먼저 자필 연습본과 공증본의 책임을 분리해 주십시오. 제가 장남이라 당연하다고 여긴 마음도 그다음 보겠습니다.,"If we are setting conditions, first separate responsibility for the handwritten draft and the notarized copy. Then I will look at the part of me that assumed I was entitled because I am the eldest son.",条件を置くなら、まず自筆の下書きと公証本の責任を分けてください。私が長男だから当然だと思い込んだ気持ちは、その次に見ます。,如果要设条件，请先把亲笔草稿和公证副本的责任分开。之后我会再看自己因为是长子就理所当然的心态。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v10].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v10].text,조건부로 가겠습니다. 다만 제 동생이 선의라는 말로 모든 침묵을 덮는다면 저는 받아들이기 어렵습니다.,"I will proceed conditionally. But if my brother covers every silence with the word good intent, I will have trouble accepting it.",条件付きで進みます。ただし、弟が善意という言葉ですべての沈黙を覆うなら、私は受け入れ難いです。,我会有条件地接受。但如果我弟弟用“善意”这个词盖过所有沉默，我很难接受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v2].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v2].text,조건부라면 받아들이겠습니다. 제 동생의 서류 책임이 흐려지지 않는다는 전제가 필요합니다.,"If it is conditional, I will accept it. I need the premise that my brother's responsibility for the papers will not be blurred.",条件付きなら受け入れます。弟の書類責任が曖昧にされないという前提が必要です。,如果是有条件的，我会接受。但前提是我弟弟对文件的责任不能被模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v3].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v3].text,"나눠 보자는 말씀이면, 숨겨진 돈 흐름과 유서 절차를 먼저 구분해야 합니다. 그래야 제 분노도 줄일 수 있습니다.","If you mean to separate the issues, then the hidden money flow and the will procedure must be distinguished first. Only then can my anger lessen.",分けて見るということなら、隠されたお金の流れと遺言書の手続きをまず区別しなければなりません。そうしてこそ、私の怒りも和らげられます。,如果您是说分开来看，那就必须先区分隐藏的资金流向和遗嘱程序。这样我的愤怒才可能减轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v4].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v4].text,조건을 세운다면 저는 제가 돌본 일을 전부 권리로 읽은 부분을 보겠습니다. 대신 문서 변경 책임은 선명해야 합니다.,"If we are setting conditions, I will look at the part where I read all the care I gave as a right. But responsibility for the document change must remain clear.",条件を立てるなら、私が世話したことをすべて権利として読んだ部分を見ます。その代わり、書類変更の責任は明確でなければなりません。,如果要设条件，我会看自己把照护全部理解成权利的部分。但文件变更责任必须清楚。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v5].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v5].text,조건부 정리는 가능합니다. 다만 지키겠다는 이유만으로 어머니 뜻을 고친 일이 가벼워지면 안 됩니다.,A conditional organization is possible. But changing my mother's wishes cannot become lighter just because the reason was protection.,条件付きの整理は可能です。ただし、守るためだったという理由だけで、お母様の意思を変えたことが軽くなってはいけません。,可以有条件地整理。但不能因为理由是“想守护”，修改母亲意愿这件事就变轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v6].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v6].text,"조건을 나누면 따르겠습니다. 저는 제 상속 당연시를 말하되, 제 동생의 침묵도 따로 책임져야 합니다.","If the conditions are separated, I will follow them. I will speak about taking my inheritance for granted, but my brother's silence must be held separately responsible too.",条件を分けるなら従います。私は自分が相続を当然視したことを話しますが、弟の沈黙も別に責任を負うべきです。,如果把条件分开，我会遵从。我会说自己把继承视为理所当然的部分，但我弟弟的沉默也要另行承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v7].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v7].text,조건부라면 먼저 사실 순서를 세워 주십시오. 누가 언제 무엇을 고쳤는지부터 놓고 제 마음을 보겠습니다.,"If you are setting conditions, first establish the factual sequence. I will look at my feelings after we set down who changed what, and when.",条件を立てるなら、まず事実の順序を立ててください。誰がいつ何を直したのかを置いてから、自分の気持ちを見ます。,如果您要设条件，请先建立事实顺序。先摆清谁在何时改了什么，再看我的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v8].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v8].text,"그 방식이라면 가능합니다. 제가 몰랐던 지원을 인정하더라도, 서류를 고친 일까지 넘어갈 수는 없습니다.","That approach is possible. Even if I acknowledge the support I did not know about, I cannot overlook the fact that the papers were altered.",その方式なら可能です。私が知らなかった支援を認めたとしても、書類を直したことまで見過ごすことはできません。,这种方式可以。即使我承认自己不知道的支援，也不能连修改文件这件事都放过去。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v9].behaviorHint,조건을 세우며 목소리를 낮추지만 말끝에는 힘이 남는다.,"The voice lowers as conditions are set, but strength remains at the end of the sentence.",条件を立てながら声を落とすが、語尾には力が残る。,提出条件时压低声音，但句尾仍留有力度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v9].text,조건을 둔다면 감정과 절차를 분리해야 합니다. 저는 제 감정을 보겠지만 절차 잘못은 남겨야 합니다.,"If we are setting conditions, emotion and procedure must be separated. I will look at my feelings, but the procedural wrong must remain.",条件を置くなら、感情と手続きを分けるべきです。私は自分の感情を見ますが、手続き上の誤りは残さなければなりません。,如果设条件，就必须分开情绪和程序。我会看自己的情绪，但程序错误必须保留下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v1].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v1].text,조건부로 가는 건 괜찮습니다. 대신 제가 문서를 손댄 책임과 형이 몰랐던 돈 흐름을 같이 봐야 합니다.,Proceeding conditionally is fine. But my responsibility for touching the document and the money flow my brother did not know about must be viewed together.,条件付きで進むのは構いません。ただし、私が書類に手を加えた責任と、兄が知らなかったお金の流れを一緒に見なければなりません。,有条件地推进可以。但我动过文件的责任，以及哥哥不知道的资金流向，必须一起看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v10].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v10].text,"조건을 나눈다면 받겠습니다. 제가 감춘 돈, 고친 문서, 형의 당연시를 각각 따져야 합니다.","If the conditions are separated, I will accept that. The money I hid, the document I changed, and my brother's sense of entitlement must each be examined.",条件を分けるなら受け入れます。私が隠したお金、直した書類、兄の当然視をそれぞれ確かめるべきです。,如果把条件分开，我会接受。我隐瞒的钱、改过的文件、哥哥的理所当然，都必须分别审视。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v2].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v2].text,조건을 둔다면 저는 책임을 피하지 않겠습니다. 다만 더 가져가려 했다는 단정은 먼저 거둬 주셔야 합니다.,"If conditions are set, I will not avoid responsibility. But the assumption that I tried to take more must be withdrawn first.",条件を置くなら、私は責任を避けません。ただし、より多く取ろうとしたという断定は先に取り下げてください。,如果设条件，我不会逃避责任。但请先撤回我想多拿的断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v3].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v3].text,조건부라면 가능하겠습니다. 형이 장남이라는 말로 모든 몫을 당연시한 부분도 같이 올라와야 합니다.,"If it is conditional, I can accept it. My brother's assumption that every share was his because he was the eldest son must be raised as well.",条件付きなら可能です。兄が長男という言葉であらゆる取り分を当然視した部分も、一緒に上げるべきです。,如果是有条件的，可以。哥哥用“长子”这句话把所有份额都视为理所当然的部分，也必须一起提上来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v4].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v4].text,나눠 보자는 말씀이면 받아들이겠습니다. 제가 숨긴 이유와 숨긴 결과를 따로 보셔야 합니다.,"If you mean to separate the issues, I will accept it. You must look separately at why I hid it and at the result of my hiding it.",分けて見るということなら受け入れます。私が隠した理由と、隠した結果を別々に見ていただく必要があります。,如果您是说分开来看，我接受。请分别看我隐瞒的理由和隐瞒造成的结果。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v5].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v5].text,"조건이 필요하다면 그렇게 하겠습니다. 문서의 잘못은 제 몫이고, 돈의 출처는 별도 사실입니다.","If conditions are needed, I will do that. The fault in the document is mine, and the source of the money is a separate fact.",条件が必要ならそうします。書類の誤りは私の責任で、お金の出どころは別の事実です。,如果需要条件，我会照做。文件上的错误是我的责任，钱的来源是另一项事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v6].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v6].text,조건부 정리라면 좋습니다. 형이 모욕으로 느낀 마음과 제가 숨긴 지원을 한 덩어리로 만들면 안 됩니다.,A conditional organization would be good. My brother's feeling of humiliation and the support I hid must not be made into one lump.,条件付きの整理ならよいと思います。兄が侮辱と感じた気持ちと、私が隠した支援を一つの塊にしてはいけません。,有条件地整理很好。哥哥感到受辱的心情，和我隐瞒的支援，不能混成一件事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v7].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v7].text,조건을 세우신다면 저는 먼저 문서 책임을 인정하겠습니다. 그다음 왜 그런 선택을 했는지 말씀드리겠습니다.,"If you set conditions, I will first acknowledge responsibility for the document. Then I will explain why I made that choice.",条件を立てるなら、私はまず書類の責任を認めます。その次に、なぜそういう選択をしたのか話します。,如果您设条件，我会先承认文件责任。然后再说明为什么作出那样的选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v8].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v8].text,그 방식이면 피하지 않겠습니다. 다만 형이 모르는 가족 안쪽 사정은 조심스럽게 다뤄 주십시오.,"With that approach, I will not avoid it. But please handle the inner family circumstances my brother does not know with care.",その方式なら逃げません。ただし、兄の知らない家族の内側の事情は慎重に扱ってください。,如果是这种方式，我不会回避。但哥哥不知道的家庭内部情况，请谨慎处理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v9].behaviorHint,"담담하게 선을 긋고, 형 쪽을 보지 않은 채 답한다.",He calmly draws a line and answers without looking toward his older brother.,淡々と線を引き、兄の方を見ないまま答える。,他平静地划清界线，不看哥哥那边就回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v9].text,조건부로 가겠습니다. 사실을 밝히되 형이 무너지는 방식으로 한꺼번에 던지지는 말아 주십시오.,"I will proceed conditionally. Reveal the facts, but please do not throw them all at my brother at once in a way that breaks him.",条件付きで進みます。事実は明らかにしても、兄が崩れる形で一度に投げつけないでください。,我会有条件地接受。可以揭示事实，但请不要用会让哥哥崩溃的方式一下子全扔给他。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v1].text,사실부터 보겠습니다. 자필 연습본이 무엇이었고 누가 어떤 문서를 냈는지 먼저 정리해야 합니다.,I will look at the facts first. We must first organize what the handwritten draft was and who submitted which document.,事実から見ます。自筆の下書きが何だったのか、誰がどの書類を出したのかをまず整理する必要があります。,我先看事实。必须先整理亲笔草稿是什么，以及谁提交了哪份文件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v10].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v10].text,먼저 사실을 보십시오. 누가 어머니를 어떻게 읽었는지 드러나면 제 책임도 피하지 않겠습니다.,"Look at the facts first. If it becomes clear who read my mother in what way, I will not avoid my responsibility either.",まず事実を見てください。誰がお母様をどのように読んだのかが明らかになれば、私の責任も避けません。,请先看事实。如果能看清是谁如何解读了母亲，我也不会逃避自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v2].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v2].text,"좋습니다. 제 감정은 뒤로 두고, 방문 기록과 공증 기록부터 맞춰 보겠습니다.",Good. I will set my feelings aside and match the visit records with the notarization records first.,いいでしょう。私の感情は後に置き、訪問記録と公証記録から合わせてみます。,好。我的情绪先放一边，先对照探访记录和公证记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v3].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v3].text,사실을 먼저 세우겠습니다. 제가 장남이라 느낀 억울함은 그다음 판단해도 됩니다.,I will establish the facts first. My grievance about being the eldest son can be judged afterward.,先に事実を立てます。私が長男として感じた悔しさは、その次に判断しても構いません。,先确立事实。我作为长子的委屈，之后再判断也可以。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v4].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v4].text,먼저 기록을 보겠습니다. 어머니 뜻과 제 동생 손이 닿은 부분을 분리해야 합니다.,I will look at the records first. We must separate my mother's wishes from the part my brother touched.,まず記録を見ます。お母様の意思と、弟の手が触れた部分を分けなければなりません。,我先看记录。必须把母亲的意愿和我弟弟碰过的部分分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v5].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v5].text,"그 방식이면 따르겠습니다. 돈이 어디서 나왔는지, 유서가 어떻게 바뀌었는지부터 봐야 합니다.","With that approach, I will follow. We need to look first at where the money came from and how the will changed.",その方式なら従います。お金がどこから出たのか、遺言書がどう変わったのかから見る必要があります。,如果是这种方式，我会遵从。要先看钱从哪里来，遗嘱又是如何改变的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v6].text,사실 먼저라면 좋습니다. 제가 화낸 이유보다 실제로 무엇이 남았는지가 우선입니다.,"If facts come first, that is good. What actually remains comes before why I got angry.",事実を先にするならよいです。私が怒った理由より、実際に何が残っているかが先です。,如果先看事实，那很好。比起我为什么生气，实际留下了什么更优先。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v7].text,먼저 서류와 돈 흐름을 놓겠습니다. 그래야 제가 몰랐던 부분도 억지로 밀어내지 않겠습니다.,I will lay out the papers and money flow first. Then I will not force away the parts I did not know.,まず書類とお金の流れを置きます。そうすれば、私が知らなかった部分も無理に押しのけません。,我会先摆出文件和资金流向。这样我也不会硬把自己不知道的部分推开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v8].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v8].text,사실부터 확인하겠습니다. 제 동생을 탓하기 전에 어머니 뜻이 어떤 경로로 바뀌었는지 봐야 합니다.,"I will confirm the facts first. Before blaming my brother, we need to see through what route my mother's wishes changed.",事実から確認します。弟を責める前に、お母様の意思がどの経路で変わったのかを見るべきです。,我先确认事实。在责怪弟弟之前，要先看母亲的意愿是经过什么路径改变的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v9].behaviorHint,감정을 눌러 두고 기록을 향해 턱을 짧게 움직인다.,He holds down his emotions and gives a short motion of his chin toward the record.,感情を抑え、記録の方へ短く顎を動かす。,他压住情绪，朝记录的方向短促地点了点下巴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v9].text,좋습니다. 감정은 많지만 기록은 하나씩 봐야 합니다. 그 순서라면 저도 따르겠습니다.,"Good. I have many feelings, but records must be looked at one by one. If that is the order, I will follow it.",いいでしょう。感情は多いですが、記録は一つずつ見るべきです。その順序なら私も従います。,好。情绪很多，但记录要一项一项看。如果是这个顺序，我也会遵从。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v1].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v1].text,저도 사실부터 보는 게 맞습니다. 문서의 순서와 돈의 출처를 먼저 놓아야 감정이 덜 흔들립니다.,"I also think it is right to start with the facts. We must set down the order of the documents and the source of the money first, so emotions shake less.",私も事実から見るのが正しいと思います。書類の順序とお金の出どころを先に置いてこそ、感情が揺れにくくなります。,我也认为先看事实是对的。必须先摆清文件顺序和钱的来源，情绪才不至于太动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v10].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v10].text,좋습니다. 감정보다 순서를 먼저 보십시오. 그 다음에 제가 왜 그 순서를 숨겼는지 말씀드리겠습니다.,"Good. Look at the order before the emotions. After that, I will explain why I hid that order.",いいでしょう。感情より順序を先に見てください。その次に、私がなぜその順序を隠したのか話します。,好。请先看顺序，不要先看情绪。之后我会说明自己为什么隐藏那个顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v2].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v2].text,기록부터 보겠습니다. 제가 손댄 부분과 제가 숨긴 지원을 따로 세워야 합니다.,I will look at the records first. We must set apart the part I touched and the support I hid.,記録から見ます。私が手を加えた部分と、私が隠した支援を別々に立てるべきです。,我先看记录。必须把我动过的部分和我隐藏的支援分别立起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v3].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v3].text,사실 먼저라면 동의합니다. 형이 모른 돈 흐름과 자필 연습본의 방향을 같이 봐야 합니다.,"If facts come first, I agree. We need to look together at the money flow my brother did not know about and the direction of the handwritten draft.",事実を先にするなら同意します。兄が知らなかったお金の流れと、自筆の下書きの方向を一緒に見る必要があります。,如果先看事实，我同意。哥哥不知道的资金流向和亲笔草稿的方向，要一起看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v4].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v4].text,"좋습니다. 제가 왜 숨겼는지는 나중에 말하더라도, 무엇을 숨겼는지는 먼저 정리하겠습니다.","Good. Even if I explain later why I hid it, I will first organize what I hid.",いいでしょう。なぜ隠したのかは後で話すとしても、何を隠したのかは先に整理します。,好。就算稍后再说为什么隐瞒，也要先整理我隐瞒了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v5].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v5].text,먼저 자료를 보겠습니다. 그래야 지키려 했다는 말이 변명인지 맥락인지 판단할 수 있습니다.,I will look at the materials first. Only then can you judge whether my claim that I meant to protect him is an excuse or context.,まず資料を見ます。そうしてこそ、守ろうとしたという言葉が言い訳なのか文脈なのか判断できます。,我先看资料。这样才能判断“想保护”这句话是借口还是背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v6].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v6].text,"사실부터 가겠습니다. 서류를 바꾼 책임은 제게 있고, 그 배경도 기록으로 확인해야 합니다.","I will start with the facts. Responsibility for changing the papers is mine, and the background must also be confirmed through records.",事実から行きます。書類を変えた責任は私にあり、その背景も記録で確認する必要があります。,先看事实。改文件的责任在我，背景也必须通过记录确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v7].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v7].text,저도 동의합니다. 형이 느낀 모욕과 실제 돈 흐름은 분리해서 봐야 합니다.,I agree as well. My brother's humiliation and the actual money flow must be viewed separately.,私も同意します。兄が感じた侮辱と実際のお金の流れは、分けて見るべきです。,我也同意。哥哥感到的屈辱和实际资金流向必须分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v8].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v8].text,기록을 먼저 세우겠습니다. 제 침묵 때문에 흐려진 부분을 자료로 다시 묶어야 합니다.,I will establish the record first. The parts blurred by my silence must be bound together again through the materials.,記録を先に立てます。私の沈黙で曇った部分を、資料でもう一度結び直す必要があります。,我先建立记录。因我沉默而模糊的部分，必须用资料重新连起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v9].behaviorHint,표정은 그대로지만 자료를 바라보는 시선이 오래 머문다.,"His expression stays the same, but his gaze lingers on the materials.",表情は変わらないが、資料を見つめる視線が長く留まる。,表情没有变化，但看着资料的视线停留得很久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v9].text,사실 우선이면 말하겠습니다. 제가 고친 숫자와 오래 감춘 돈은 따로지만 이어져 있습니다.,"If facts come first, I will speak. The number I changed and the money I hid for so long are separate, but connected.",事実優先なら話します。私が直した数字と長く隠したお金は別々ですが、つながっています。,如果先看事实，我会说。我改过的数字和长期隐瞒的钱是分开的，但彼此相连。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v1].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v1].text,지금 정리하셔도 됩니다. 다만 유서를 손댄 책임과 제가 장남이라 당연히 더 받아야 한다고 여긴 마음은 따로 봐주십시오.,You may organize this now. But please view separately the responsibility for touching the will and my assumption that I deserved more because I was the eldest son.,今整理していただいて構いません。ただし、遺言書に手を加えた責任と、私が長男だから当然多く受け取るべきだと思った気持ちは、別に見てください。,现在整理也可以。但请把动过遗嘱的责任，和我因为是长子就理所当然认为该多拿的心态分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v10].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v10].text,"지금 정리한다면 따르겠습니다. 저는 장남이라는 말로 버틴 부분을, 제 동생은 문서를 손댄 부분을 각각 봐야 합니다.","If you are organizing this now, I will follow. You need to look separately at the part where I held on to being the eldest son, and the part where my brother touched the document.",今整理するなら従います。私は長男という言葉で踏ん張った部分を、弟は書類に手を加えた部分を、それぞれ見なければなりません。,如果现在整理，我会遵从。必须分别看我用“长子”这句话撑住自己的部分，以及我弟弟动过文件的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v2].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v2].text,오늘 결론을 내셔도 됩니다. 제 동생의 문서 책임과 제가 어머니 뜻을 제 편으로만 읽은 책임은 같이 놓되 섞지 말아 주십시오.,"You may reach a conclusion today. Please place my brother's document responsibility alongside my responsibility for reading my mother's wishes only in my favor, but do not mix them.",今日結論を出していただいても構いません。弟の書類責任と、私がお母様の意思を自分の味方にだけ読んだ責任は、並べて置きつつ混ぜないでください。,今天作出结论也可以。请把我弟弟的文件责任和我只按有利于自己的方式解读母亲意愿的责任并排放置，但不要混在一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v3].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v3].text,바로 판단하셔도 됩니다. 저는 제 몫이 줄었다는 분노와 동생이 숨긴 사실을 한꺼번에 몰아붙인 점은 인정하겠습니다.,You may judge now. I will admit that my anger over my reduced share and the facts my brother hid were pushed together all at once.,すぐ判断していただいても構いません。自分の取り分が減った怒りと、弟が隠した事実を一気にぶつけた点は認めます。,现在判断也可以。我承认，我把份额减少的愤怒和弟弟隐藏的事实一口气压在一起了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v4].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v4].text,"지금 끝을 잡으신다면, 유서 절차의 잘못과 제가 돌본 일을 보상처럼 붙든 마음을 각각 기록해 주십시오.","If you take hold of the ending now, please record separately the wrong in the will procedure and the feeling with which I held on to my caregiving as if it were compensation.",今終わりをつかむなら、遺言書手続きの誤りと、私が世話したことを補償のようにつかんだ気持ちを、それぞれ記録してください。,如果现在要收束，请分别记录遗嘱程序的错误，以及我把照护母亲这件事当作补偿抓住的心态。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v5].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v5].text,"결론으로 가도 됩니다. 제 동생이 서류를 바꾼 일은 분명하지만, 저 역시 어머니 뜻을 제 기준으로만 읽었습니다.","You may move to a conclusion. My brother clearly changed the papers, but I also read my mother's wishes only by my own standard.",結論に進んでも構いません。弟が書類を変えたことは明らかですが、私もお母様の意思を自分の基準でだけ読みました。,可以走向结论。我弟弟改了文件是明确的，但我也只按自己的标准解读了母亲的意愿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v6].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v6].text,바로 정리하신다면 저는 받아들이겠습니다. 대신 제가 몰랐던 돈 흐름까지 유산 욕심 하나로 덮지는 말아 주십시오.,"If you organize this now, I will accept it. But please do not cover even the money flow I did not know about with one word: inheritance greed.",すぐ整理するなら受け入れます。ただし、私が知らなかったお金の流れまで、遺産欲しさの一言で覆わないでください。,如果现在整理，我会接受。但请不要把我不知道的资金流向也全部用“贪图遗产”一句话盖过去。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v7].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v7].text,"오늘 결정하셔도 됩니다. 저는 분노가 컸고, 제 동생은 숨긴 게 컸습니다. 어느 쪽도 한 줄로 끝낼 수 없습니다.","You may decide today. My anger was large, and my brother's concealment was large. Neither side can be finished in one line.",今日決めていただいても構いません。私の怒りは大きく、弟の隠し事も大きかった。どちらも一行で終わらせることはできません。,今天决定也可以。我的愤怒很大，弟弟的隐瞒也很大。哪一方都不能用一句话结束。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v8].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v8].text,"지금 판단하셔도 됩니다. 제 상처와 제 동생의 책임을 나란히 보되, 한쪽 말로 다른 쪽을 지우지는 말아 주십시오.","You may judge now. Please view my hurt and my brother's responsibility side by side, without letting one side's words erase the other.",今判断していただいても構いません。私の傷と弟の責任を並べて見て、一方の言葉で他方を消さないでください。,现在判断也可以。请并排看我的伤痛和弟弟的责任，不要用一边的话抹去另一边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v9].behaviorHint,단호하게 말하지만 마지막에는 어머니 쪽으로 시선이 꺾인다.,"He speaks firmly, but at the end his gaze breaks toward his mother.",断固として話すが、最後には視線がお母様の方へ折れる。,他说得很坚决，但最后视线还是转向母亲那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v9].text,바로 마무리하셔도 됩니다. 다만 어머니를 누가 어떻게 자기 뜻으로 읽었는지까지 남겨 주셨으면 합니다.,"You may wrap this up now. But I hope the record keeps who read my mother into whose meaning, and how.",すぐ締めくくっていただいても構いません。ただし、お母様を誰がどう自分の意思として読んだのかまで残してほしいです。,现在收尾也可以。但希望记录里也留下，是谁以什么方式把母亲解读成自己的意思。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v1].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v1].text,결론을 내리셔도 피하지 않겠습니다. 다만 문서를 고친 책임과 형을 지키려 했다는 이유를 함께 기록해 주십시오.,"Even if you reach a conclusion, I will not avoid it. But please record both my responsibility for changing the document and the reason that I tried to protect my brother.",結論を出されても逃げません。ただし、書類を直した責任と、兄を守ろうとした理由を一緒に記録してください。,即使作出结论，我也不会回避。但请同时记录我修改文件的责任和我想保护哥哥的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v10].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v10].text,"바로 결정하셔도 됩니다. 저는 문서를 건드린 사람이고, 동시에 오래 떠받친 사실도 숨긴 사람입니다.","You may decide now. I am the person who touched the document, and also the person who hid the fact that I had supported them for a long time.",すぐ決めていただいても構いません。私は書類に手を加えた人間であり、同時に長く支えてきた事実を隠した人間です。,现在决定也可以。我是动过文件的人，同时也是长期支撑却隐瞒事实的人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v2].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v2].text,"지금 정리하셔도 됩니다. 제가 잘못한 일은 분명하지만, 더 가져가려던 흐름으로만 읽히면 사실이 다시 닫힙니다.","You may organize this now. What I did wrong is clear, but if it is read only as a flow of trying to take more, the facts will close again.",今整理していただいても構いません。私の過ちは明らかですが、より多く取ろうとした流れとしてだけ読まれるなら、事実はまた閉じてしまいます。,现在整理也可以。我做错的事很明确，但如果只被解读成想多拿，事实又会被关上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v3].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v3].text,바로 판단하신다면 받겠습니다. 대신 오래 숨긴 돈과 문서의 방향을 함께 봐야 제 책임도 정확해집니다.,"If you judge now, I will accept it. But the money hidden for so long and the direction of the document must be viewed together for my responsibility to be accurate.",すぐ判断されるなら受け入れます。ただし、長く隠したお金と書類の方向を一緒に見てこそ、私の責任も正確になります。,如果现在判断，我会接受。但只有一起看长期隐瞒的钱和文件的方向，我的责任才会准确。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v4].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v4].text,"오늘 결론을 내셔도 됩니다. 저는 선을 넘었고, 그 선을 넘은 이유까지 말할 준비가 되어 있습니다.","You may reach a conclusion today. I crossed a line, and I am ready to speak about why I crossed it.",今日結論を出していただいても構いません。私は線を越えましたし、その線を越えた理由まで話す準備ができています。,今天作出结论也可以。我越过了界线，也已经准备好说明自己为什么越过那条线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v5].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v5].text,지금 끝을 잡으신다면 피하지 않겠습니다. 형이 몰랐던 지원과 어머니 뜻을 제가 고친 일을 같이 올려 주십시오.,"If you take hold of the ending now, I will not avoid it. Please place together the support my brother did not know about and the fact that I changed my mother's wishes.",今終わりをつかむなら逃げません。兄が知らなかった支援と、お母様の意思を私が変えたことを一緒に上げてください。,如果现在要收束，我不会回避。请把哥哥不知道的支援，以及我修改母亲意愿这件事一起提上来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v6].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v6].text,"바로 정리하셔도 됩니다. 지키려 했다는 말이 책임을 없애진 않지만, 욕심으로만 남는 것도 사실이 아닙니다.","You may organize it now. Saying I meant to protect him does not erase responsibility, but leaving only greed behind is not the truth either.",すぐ整理していただいても構いません。守ろうとしたという言葉は責任をなくしませんが、欲だけが残るのも事実ではありません。,现在整理也可以。“想保护”这句话不能消除责任，但只留下贪欲也不是事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v7].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v7].text,결론으로 가셔도 됩니다. 제가 숨긴 일과 형이 당연하게 여긴 몫을 둘 다 놓고 봐야 합니다.,You may move to a conclusion. We must look at both what I hid and the share my brother took for granted.,結論に進んでも構いません。私が隠したことと、兄が当然と見なした取り分を、両方置いて見るべきです。,可以走向结论。必须同时看我隐瞒的事，以及哥哥视为理所当然的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v8].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v8].text,지금 판단하신다면 받아들이겠습니다. 제가 고친 숫자와 그 뒤에 숨은 두려움을 같이 보셔야 합니다.,"If you judge now, I will accept it. You must look at the number I changed and the fear hidden behind it.",今判断されるなら受け入れます。私が直した数字と、その裏に隠れた恐れを一緒に見ていただく必要があります。,如果现在判断，我会接受。请一并看我改过的数字以及背后隐藏的恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v9].behaviorHint,짧게 고개를 끄덕이고 낮은 목소리로 책임을 받아든다.,He gives a short nod and accepts responsibility in a low voice.,短くうなずき、低い声で責任を受け取る。,他短促地点头，用低沉的声音承担责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v9].text,오늘 정리해도 괜찮습니다. 더 말하지 않는 쪽으로 도망치지 않고 제 책임을 말하겠습니다.,It is all right to organize this today. I will not run away into saying nothing more; I will speak about my responsibility.,今日整理しても構いません。これ以上言わない方向へ逃げず、自分の責任を話します。,今天整理也可以。我不会再逃向不说话，而会说出自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v1].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v1].text,조금 미루는 건 받아들이겠습니다. 지금은 제 동생 얼굴만 봐도 말이 세게 나와 사실을 놓칠까 걱정됩니다.,"I will accept a short delay. Right now, just seeing my brother's face makes my words too sharp; I worry I will miss the facts.",少し先に延ばすことは受け入れます。今は弟の顔を見るだけで言葉が強くなり、事実を見落とすのではと心配です。,我可以接受稍微推迟。现在只要看到弟弟的脸，我的话就会变重，担心自己会错过事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v10].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v10].text,미루셔도 됩니다. 다만 이 멈춤이 서로 덮는 시간이 아니라 사실을 정리하는 시간이었으면 합니다.,"You may delay it. But I hope this pause is time to organize the facts, not time for us to cover for each other.",延ばしても構いません。ただし、この停止が互いに覆い隠す時間ではなく、事実を整理する時間であってほしいです。,可以推迟。但希望这个暂停不是彼此遮掩的时间，而是整理事实的时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v2].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v2].text,시간을 두자는 말씀이면 따르겠습니다. 다만 보류가 문서 책임을 흐리는 시간이 되면 안 됩니다.,"If you mean to take time, I will follow. But the hold must not become time that blurs responsibility for the document.",時間を置くということなら従います。ただし、保留が書類責任を曖昧にする時間になってはいけません。,如果是说留出时间，我会遵从。但搁置不能变成模糊文件责任的时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v3].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v3].text,잠깐 멈추겠습니다. 제 분노가 앞서면 어머니 뜻보다 제 상처만 크게 말할 것 같습니다.,"I will stop for a moment. If my anger comes first, I think I will speak more about my own hurt than my mother's wishes.",少し止まります。私の怒りが先に立てば、お母様の意思より自分の傷ばかり大きく話してしまいそうです。,我先停一下。如果愤怒走在前面，我可能会把自己的伤说得比母亲的意愿还大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v4].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v4].text,"미루는 건 가능하지만, 자료 정리는 바로 해 주십시오. 시간이 지나도 자필 연습본과 공증본은 사라지면 안 됩니다.","A delay is possible, but please organize the materials right away. Even with time, the handwritten draft and notarized copy must not disappear.",延期は可能ですが、資料の整理はすぐにしてください。時間が経っても、自筆の下書きと公証本は消えてはいけません。,可以推迟，但资料请立刻整理。即使时间过去，亲笔草稿和公证副本也不能消失。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v5].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v5].text,조금 뒤로 미루겠습니다. 지금 결론을 내리면 저도 제 몫 이야기만 반복할 것 같습니다.,"I will put it off a little. If we reach a conclusion now, I think I will only repeat my share again.",少し後ろに延ばします。今結論を出せば、私も自分の取り分の話だけを繰り返しそうです。,我会稍微往后推。如果现在下结论，我可能只会反复说自己的份额。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v6].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v6].text,시간이 필요하다는 건 압니다. 다만 제 동생 침묵이 다시 방패가 되지 않게 해 주십시오.,I understand that time is needed. But please make sure my brother's silence does not become a shield again.,時間が必要だということは分かります。ただし、弟の沈黙がまた盾にならないようにしてください。,我知道需要时间。但请不要让弟弟的沉默再次变成盾牌。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v7].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v7].text,멈추겠습니다. 제 장남 자존심이 아직 너무 올라와 있어서 차분한 판단이 어렵습니다.,I will stop. My eldest-son pride is still too stirred up for calm judgment.,止まります。長男としての自尊心がまだ強く出すぎていて、冷静な判断が難しいです。,我先停下。我的长子自尊还太强地浮上来，难以冷静判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v8].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v8].text,잠시 보류하는 건 받아들이겠습니다. 대신 돈 흐름과 유서 절차는 따로 보관해 주십시오.,I will accept a temporary hold. But please keep the money flow and the will procedure separately.,しばらく保留することは受け入れます。その代わり、お金の流れと遺言書の手続きは別々に保管してください。,我接受暂时搁置。但请把资金流向和遗嘱程序分开保存。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v9].behaviorHint,분노를 삼키며 손끝을 탁자 위에 가만히 세운다.,He swallows his anger and holds his fingertips still on the table.,怒りを飲み込み、指先を卓上にじっと立てる。,他咽下愤怒，把指尖静静抵在桌面上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v9].text,조금 시간을 두겠습니다. 지금은 제가 어머니를 위한 말인지 제 체면을 위한 말인지 구분하기 어렵습니다.,"I will take a little time. Right now, it is hard to tell whether I am speaking for my mother or for my own pride.",少し時間を置きます。今は自分の言葉がお母様のためなのか、自分の体面のためなのか区別しにくいです。,我会留一点时间。现在我很难分清自己说的话是为了母亲，还是为了自己的体面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v1].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v1].text,잠깐 멈추는 게 필요합니다. 지금 더 말하면 형이 받아들이기 전에 상처부터 입을 것 같습니다.,"We need to stop for a moment. If I say more now, I think my brother will be hurt before he can accept it.",少し止まる必要があります。今これ以上話せば、兄が受け入れる前に傷つくと思います。,需要暂时停一下。现在再说下去，哥哥可能还没来得及接受，就先受伤了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v10].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v10].text,시간을 두겠습니다. 다만 이 보류가 형이 모르는 지원을 다시 덮는 시간은 아니어야 합니다.,I will take time. But this hold must not be time that covers again the support my brother did not know about.,時間を置きます。ただし、この保留が兄の知らない支援をまた覆い隠す時間であってはいけません。,我会留出时间。但这个搁置不能变成再次掩盖哥哥不知道的支援的时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v2].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v2].text,시간을 두겠습니다. 제가 숨긴 사실을 한꺼번에 꺼내면 사실보다 충격이 먼저 남을 수 있습니다.,"I will take time. If I bring out the hidden facts all at once, the shock may remain before the facts do.",時間を置きます。隠した事実を一度に出せば、事実より衝撃が先に残るかもしれません。,我会留出时间。如果把隐藏的事实一次全说出来，留下的可能先是冲击，而不是事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v3].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v3].text,보류하는 데 동의합니다. 다만 그 시간이 제가 다시 입을 닫는 이유가 되면 안 됩니다.,I agree to hold it. But that time must not become a reason for me to close my mouth again.,保留に同意します。ただし、その時間が私がまた口を閉ざす理由になってはいけません。,我同意搁置。但这段时间不能成为我再次闭口不言的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v4].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v4].text,조금 늦추는 게 맞겠습니다. 돈 흐름과 문서 순서를 차분히 묶어야 형도 들을 수 있습니다.,It would be right to slow down a little. We need to calmly bind the money flow and the document sequence so my brother can hear it.,少し遅らせるのが正しいでしょう。お金の流れと書類の順序を落ち着いて結び直さなければ、兄も聞くことができません。,稍微放慢是对的。必须冷静整理资金流向和文件顺序，哥哥才能听进去。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v5].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v5].text,멈추겠습니다. 지금은 제가 무슨 말을 해도 형에게 변명처럼 들릴 수 있습니다.,"I will stop. Right now, whatever I say may sound like an excuse to my brother.",止まります。今は私が何を言っても、兄には言い訳のように聞こえるかもしれません。,我先停下。现在不管我说什么，在哥哥听来都可能像借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v6].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v6].text,시간을 두자는 말에 따르겠습니다. 하지만 어머니 뜻을 고친 책임은 피하지 않겠습니다.,I will follow your suggestion to take time. But I will not avoid responsibility for changing my mother's wishes.,時間を置くという言葉に従います。しかし、お母様の意思を変えた責任は避けません。,我会遵从留出时间的安排。但我不会逃避修改母亲意愿的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v7].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v7].text,잠시 보류하겠습니다. 형이 모르는 사정은 속도보다 순서가 더 중요합니다.,I will hold for now. The circumstances my brother does not know require sequence more than speed.,ひとまず保留します。兄の知らない事情は、速度より順序が重要です。,我先暂时搁置。哥哥不知道的事情，比起速度，更重要的是顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v8].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v8].text,조금 미루면 좋겠습니다. 제가 오래 숨긴 일은 한 번에 말할수록 더 거칠어집니다.,"I would like to delay a little. The longer I have hidden something, the rougher it becomes if I say it all at once.",少し延ばした方がいいと思います。長く隠したことは、一度に話すほど荒くなります。,稍微推迟会比较好。我长期隐瞒的事，说得越一次性，就越粗暴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v9].behaviorHint,숨을 고르고 긴 침묵 뒤에 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"He catches his breath and, after a long silence, says only what is necessary.",息を整え、長い沈黙の後に必要な言葉だけを出す。,他调整呼吸，在长久沉默后只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v9].text,"멈추겠습니다. 제 침묵이 길었던 만큼, 밝히는 일도 순서 없이 하면 안 됩니다.","I will stop. Because my silence was long, revealing it without sequence would also be wrong.",止まります。私の沈黙が長かった分、明かすことも順序なしにしてはいけません。,我先停下。正因为我的沉默太久，揭示它也不能没有顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v1].text,카드의 마지막 질문이 열린다. 이제 핵심을 찌를 수 있다.,The card's final question opens. Now you can strike at the core.,カードの最後の質問が開く。これで核心を突くことができる。,案件卡的最后问题开启。现在可以直击核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v2].text,가려진 질문이 드러난다. 우회보다 정면이 필요하다.,"The hidden question is revealed. This calls for a direct approach, not a detour.",隠れていた質問が現れる。迂回ではなく正面が必要だ。,被遮住的问题显现出来。现在需要正面切入，而不是绕行。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v3].text,도전의 문턱이 넘어간다. 깊은 질문을 던질 때다.,The threshold of the challenge has been crossed. It is time to ask the deeper question.,挑戦の門を越えた。深い質問を投げる時だ。,挑战的门槛已被跨过。该提出更深的问题了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v4].text,카드가 제 몫을 한다. 숨은 동기를 직접 겨눌 수 있다.,The card does its part. A hidden motive can now be targeted directly.,カードが役目を果たす。隠れた動機を直接狙える。,案件卡发挥了作用。现在可以直接瞄准隐藏动机。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v5].text,막혔던 질문이 열린다. 이제 말의 안쪽으로 들어간다.,The blocked question opens. Now we go inside the words.,塞がっていた質問が開く。これから言葉の内側へ入る。,被堵住的问题开启。现在要进入话语的内侧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v1].text,두 증거가 맞물리며 가려진 그림이 드러난다.,"Two pieces of evidence interlock, revealing the obscured picture.",二つの証拠がかみ合い、隠れていた絵が現れる。,两项证据咬合在一起，显露出被遮住的图像。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v2].text,흩어진 자료가 한 줄로 이어지며 의미가 선명해진다.,"The scattered materials connect into one line, and their meaning grows clear.",散らばっていた資料が一本の線につながり、意味が鮮明になる。,分散的资料连成一条线，意义变得清晰。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v3].text,증거들이 겹치며 숨은 동기가 앞으로 나온다.,"The evidence overlaps, bringing the hidden motive forward.",証拠が重なり、隠れた動機が前に出る。,证据相互重叠，隐藏动机浮到前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v4].text,따로 보이던 기록이 한 결론으로 이어진다.,Records that looked separate now lead to one conclusion.,別々に見えた記録が、一つの結論へつながる。,看似分散的记录，连接到了同一个结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v5].text,자료 두 장이 만나며 오래 닫힌 문이 열린다.,"Two pages of material meet, and a long-closed door opens.",二枚の資料が出会い、長く閉じていた扉が開く。,两页资料相遇，一扇久闭的门打开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v1].text,새 자료가 열린다. 사건의 빈칸이 넓어진다.,New material opens. The blank space in the case grows wider.,新しい資料が開く。事件の空白が広がる。,新资料开启。案件中的空白变得更宽。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v2].text,가려졌던 증거가 올라온다. 흐름을 다시 볼 수 있다.,Hidden evidence comes up. The flow can be viewed again.,隠れていた証拠が上がる。流れをもう一度見られる。,被遮住的证据浮现。可以重新审视流向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v3].text,새 물증이 손에 들어온다. 다음 질문이 달라진다.,A new piece of physical evidence is in hand. The next question changes.,新しい物証が手に入る。次の質問が変わる。,新的物证到手。下一步问题会发生变化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v4].text,잠긴 자료가 풀린다. 의심의 방향이 좁혀진다.,Locked material is released. The direction of suspicion narrows.,閉じられていた資料が解かれる。疑いの方向が絞られる。,上锁的资料被解开。怀疑的方向收窄。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v5].text,새 기록이 열린다. 오래 빈칸이던 지점이 흔들린다.,A new record opens. A long-empty point begins to shake.,新しい記録が開く。長く空白だった地点が揺らぎ始める。,新记录开启。长期空白的节点开始动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v1].text,이 자료는 아직 맞은 자리가 아니다. 다른 입장에서 더 울린다.,This material is not in the right place yet. It will resonate more strongly from another position.,この資料はまだ置くべき場所にない。別の立場でより強く響く。,这份资料还没有放在合适的位置。换到另一方立场会更有回响。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v2].text,증거가 빗나갔다. 맞는 상대를 찾으면 말이 달라진다.,"The evidence missed its mark. Find the right person, and the words will change.",証拠が外れた。合う相手を見つければ、言葉が変わる。,证据用错了对象。找到合适的对方，话语会改变。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v3].text,지금은 힘이 약하다. 다른 맥락에 놓아야 날이 선다.,It is weak for now. Place it in another context and its edge will sharpen.,今は力が弱い。別の文脈に置けば切れ味が出る。,现在力度不够。放到另一个语境里，锋芒会变强。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v4].text,자료가 제자리를 찾지 못했다. 제시 순서를 다시 보자.,The material has not found its place. Reconsider the order of presentation.,資料が収まる場所を見つけていない。提示の順序を見直そう。,资料还没有找到自己的位置。重新看一下出示顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v5].text,반응이 얕다. 이 증거는 다른 문과 이어져 있다.,The reaction is shallow. This evidence connects to another door.,反応が浅い。この証拠は別の扉につながっている。,反应很浅。这项证据连着另一扇门。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v1].text,양측 진술 사이에 갈라진 지점이 보인다.,A split appears between the two sides' statements.,双方の陳述の間に割れ目が見える。,双方陈述之间出现了裂口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v2].text,앞뒤가 벌어진다. 재판관이 그 틈을 짚는다.,The front and back pull apart. The Judge points to the gap.,前後が開く。裁判官がその隙間を指摘する。,前后开始裂开。法官指出那道缝隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v3].text,말의 순서가 어긋난다. 모순이 질문으로 바뀐다.,The order of the words slips. Contradiction turns into a question.,言葉の順序がずれる。矛盾が質問に変わる。,话语的顺序错位。矛盾变成了问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v4].text,같은 사실을 두고 답이 엇갈린다. 균열이 열린다.,The answers conflict over the same fact. A crack opens.,同じ事実をめぐって答えが食い違う。亀裂が開く。,围绕同一事实，回答相互矛盾。裂缝打开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v5].text,숨긴 틈이 드러난다. 재판관의 추궁이 깊어진다.,The hidden gap is revealed. The Judge's pressure deepens.,隠れていた隙間が現れる。裁判官の追及が深まる。,隐藏的缝隙显现。法官的追问加深。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v1].text,같은 질문이 맴돈다. 다른 틈을 찾아야 한다.,The same question circles. Another gap must be found.,同じ質問が巡っている。別の隙間を探さなければならない。,同样的问题在原地打转。必须寻找另一处缝隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v2].text,이미 닫힌 대답이다. 방향을 바꾸면 새 말이 열린다.,"That answer is already closed. Change direction, and new words may open.",その答えはもう閉じている。方向を変えれば新しい言葉が開く。,这个回答已经关闭。换个方向，新的话语或许会开启。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v3].text,반복된 추궁에 말문이 굳는다. 다른 자료가 필요하다.,Repeated pressure hardens the witness's words. Another piece of material is needed.,繰り返された追及で口が固まる。別の資料が必要だ。,反复追问让对方闭紧了嘴。需要另一份资料。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v4].text,같은 자리만 두드리고 있다. 질문의 결을 바꿔야 한다.,You are knocking at the same spot. The texture of the question must change.,同じ場所ばかり叩いている。質問の質感を変えなければならない。,一直在敲同一个位置。必须改变提问的质感。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v5].text,대답이 제자리다. 다른 쟁점에서 실마리를 찾아야 한다.,The answer is in the same place. Find a clue from another issue.,答えが元の場所に留まっている。別の争点から糸口を探すべきだ。,回答停在原地。应该从另一个争点寻找线索。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v1].text,눌러 둔 표정이 무너지며 말의 결이 바뀐다.,"The held-down expression breaks, and the texture of speech changes.",押し殺していた表情が崩れ、言葉の質感が変わる。,被压住的表情崩开，话语的质感改变。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v2].text,감정의 층이 바뀐다. 대답이 더 깊어진다.,The emotional layer shifts. The answer grows deeper.,感情の層が変わる。答えがより深くなる。,情绪层次发生变化。回答变得更深。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v3].text,참아 온 마음이 올라오며 목소리가 달라진다.,"A long-held feeling rises, and the voice changes.",こらえてきた気持ちが上がり、声が変わる。,一直忍着的心情浮上来，声音发生变化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v4].text,분노가 가라앉고 다른 상처가 말을 잡는다.,"Anger settles, and another wound takes hold of the words.",怒りが静まり、別の傷が言葉をつかむ。,愤怒沉下来，另一处伤口抓住了话语。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v5].text,평정이 흔들린다. 이제 숨은 이유가 가까워진다.,Composure wavers. The hidden reason is closer now.,平静が揺らぐ。隠れた理由が近づいている。,平静开始动摇。隐藏的理由已经更近。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v1].text,마음의 문턱이 낮아진다. 더 깊은 말이 나온다.,The threshold of the heart lowers. Deeper words come out.,心の敷居が下がる。より深い言葉が出てくる。,心里的门槛降低。更深的话语浮现出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v2].text,경계가 조금 풀린다. 숨긴 말이 입가에 걸린다.,The guard loosens a little. Hidden words hover at the lips.,警戒が少しほどける。隠していた言葉が口元まで来る。,戒备稍微松开。隐藏的话到了嘴边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v3].text,재판관을 향한 믿음이 조심스레 말문을 연다.,Trust in the Judge cautiously opens the way to speak.,裁判官への信頼が、慎重に言葉の入口を開く。,对法官的信任，小心地打开了话口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v4].text,닫힌 표정이 누그러지며 다음 진술이 붙는다.,"The closed expression softens, and the next statement follows.",閉じていた表情が和らぎ、次の陳述が続く。,紧闭的表情缓和下来，下一段陈述接了上来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v5].text,버티던 마음이 한 발 물러나며 문이 열린다.,"The heart that had been holding out takes one step back, and a door opens.",踏ん張っていた心が一歩退き、扉が開く。,一直撑着的心退后一步，门随之打开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v1].text,국면이 넘어간다. 방금 믿은 사실도 다시 봐야 한다.,The phase shifts. Even the facts just accepted must be seen again.,局面が移る。今信じた事実も見直すべきだ。,局面转换。刚刚相信的事实也必须重新审视。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v2].text,사건의 결이 바뀐다. 이전 대답을 새 눈으로 보자.,The texture of the case changes. Look at the earlier answers with new eyes.,事件の質感が変わる。以前の答えを新しい目で見よう。,案件的纹理改变。用新的眼光看之前的回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v3].text,새 국면이 열린다. 숨은 쟁점이 앞으로 나온다.,A new phase opens. The hidden issue comes forward.,新しい局面が開く。隠れていた争点が前に出る。,新局面开启。隐藏的争点浮到前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v4].text,흐름이 꺾인다. 이제 감정보다 구조를 봐야 한다.,The flow bends. Now the structure matters more than emotion.,流れが折れる。これからは感情より構造を見るべきだ。,流程出现转折。现在比起情绪，更要看结构。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v5].text,판이 달라진다. 같은 증거도 다른 뜻으로 읽힌다.,The board changes. The same evidence now reads differently.,盤面が変わる。同じ証拠も別の意味で読まれる。,盘面改变。同一证据也会被读出不同含义。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v1].text,증인을 불러야 할 지점이 또렷해진다.,The point where a witness must be called becomes clear.,証人を呼ぶべき地点がはっきりする。,需要传唤证人的节点变得清晰。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v2].text,이제 기록 밖 목소리가 필요한 순간이 온다.,The moment comes when a voice outside the record is needed.,記録の外にある声が必要な瞬間が来る。,需要记录之外声音的时刻到来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v3].text,증언 없이는 빈칸이 남는다. 소환의 때다.,"Without testimony, a blank remains. It is time to summon.",証言なしでは空白が残る。召喚の時だ。,没有证言就会留下空白。该传唤了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v4].text,말로 확인해야 할 장면이 또렷하게 떠오른다.,The scene that must be confirmed in words comes clearly into view.,言葉で確認すべき場面がはっきり浮かび上がる。,必须用话语确认的场景清楚浮现。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v5].text,재판관이 증인을 부를 이유를 붙잡는다.,The Judge grasps the reason to call a witness.,裁判官が証人を呼ぶ理由をつかむ。,法官抓住了传唤证人的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v1].text,증인이 문 앞에 섰다. 빈칸을 말로 메울 수 있다.,A witness is at the door. A blank can be filled with words.,証人が扉の前に立つ。空白を言葉で埋められる。,证人站在门前。空白可以用言语填补。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v2].text,새 증언이 들어온다. 기록 밖 기억을 들을 수 있다.,New testimony comes in. A memory outside the record can be heard.,新しい証言が入る。記録の外の記憶を聞ける。,新证言进入。可以听到记录之外的记忆。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v3].text,증인을 부를 수 있다. 자료 사이의 틈이 좁아진다.,A witness can be called. The gap between the materials narrows.,証人を呼べる。資料の間の隙間が狭まる。,可以传唤证人。资料之间的缝隙缩小。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v4].text,새 목소리가 열린다. 사건의 오래된 장면이 돌아온다.,A new voice opens. An old scene in the case returns.,新しい声が開く。事件の古い場面が戻ってくる。,新的声音开启。案件中旧日的场景回来了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v5].text,증언의 길이 열린다. 말 못 한 순서를 확인할 수 있다.,The path to testimony opens. The unspoken sequence can be confirmed.,証言への道が開く。語られなかった順序を確認できる。,证言之路开启。可以确认未说出口的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v1].behaviorHint,두 손을 모으고 본 장면만 조심스럽게 말한다.,She gathers both hands and carefully speaks only about what she saw.,両手をそろえ、見た場面だけを慎重に話す。,她双手拢在一起，只谨慎说出自己看到的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v1].text,작은아들분이 형님 오시기 전에 마무리하자는 취지로 말한 건 들었습니다. 어머님이 다툼을 겁내셨습니다.,I did hear the younger son say something to the effect of finishing before his older brother came. Their mother was afraid of conflict.,次男の方が、お兄様が来る前に終わらせようという趣旨で話したのは聞きました。お母様は争いを怖がっていました。,我听到小儿子说过类似“在哥哥来之前结束”的话。母亲害怕争吵。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v10].behaviorHint,말을 고르며 재판관 쪽만 바라본다.,She chooses her words and looks only toward the Judge.,言葉を選びながら、裁判官の方だけを見る。,她斟酌着措辞，只看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v10].text,"재판관님, 저는 제 책임을 피하려는 게 아니라 본 대로 말합니다. 그날 도움과 개입이 섞여 있었습니다.","Judge, I am not trying to avoid my responsibility; I am saying what I saw. That day, help and intervention were mixed together.",裁判官、私は自分の責任を避けようとしているのではなく、見たままを話しています。その日、手助けと介入は混ざっていました。,法官，我不是想逃避自己的责任，而是在说我看到的事。那天，帮助和介入是混在一起的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v2].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬으며 날짜보다 분위기를 먼저 설명한다.,She searches her memory and explains the atmosphere before the dates.,記憶をたどりながら、日付より先に雰囲気を説明する。,她一边回想，一边先说明气氛而不是日期。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v2].text,제가 본 바로는 작은아들분이 종이를 읽어드리고 서명 순서까지 도왔습니다. 어머님은 그날 많이 지쳐 보였습니다.,"From what I saw, the younger son read the paper to her and even helped with the signing order. Their mother looked very tired that day.",私が見た限りでは、次男の方が紙を読み聞かせ、署名の順序まで手伝っていました。その日のお母様はかなり疲れて見えました。,就我看到的情况，小儿子把纸读给她听，还帮到签署顺序。母亲那天看起来很疲惫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v3].behaviorHint,자기 책임으로 번질까 조심하며 말끝을 낮춘다.,"She lowers her voice at the end of each sentence, wary it may lead back to her own responsibility.",自分の責任に及ぶのを恐れるように、語尾を低くする。,她担心牵连到自己的责任，说到句尾时声音压低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v3].text,큰아들분 이야기가 나오면 어머님 표정이 굳었습니다. 그래서 작은아들분이 빨리 끝내려 한 듯했습니다.,"When the older son came up, their mother's face stiffened. So it seemed the younger son was trying to finish quickly.",長男の方の話が出ると、お母様の表情が固まりました。だから次男の方が早く終わらせようとしているように見えました。,一提到大儿子，母亲的表情就僵住了。所以小儿子像是想尽快结束。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v4].behaviorHint,어머님 상태를 떠올리며 천천히 고개를 끄덕인다.,She slowly nods as she recalls the mother's condition.,お母様の状態を思い出しながら、ゆっくりとうなずく。,她想起母亲的状态，慢慢点头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v4].text,"작은아들분이 어머님 뜻을 아예 무시했다고 보긴 어렵지만, 진행을 잡은 건 분명했습니다.","It would be hard to say the younger son ignored their mother's wishes altogether, but it was clear that he controlled the process.",次男の方がお母様の意思をまったく無視したとは言いにくいです。ただ、進行を握っていたのは確かでした。,很难说小儿子完全无视母亲的意思，但过程由他掌握，这一点很明确。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v5].behaviorHint,확신하는 부분과 모르는 부분을 분리해 답한다.,She separates what she is certain of from what she does not know.,確信している部分と知らない部分を分けて答える。,她把确定的部分和不知道的部分分开回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v5].text,그날 종이는 그냥 메모가 아니라 유서 쪽 문서로 보였습니다. 제가 묻지는 못했습니다.,The paper that day looked less like a simple note and more like a will-related document. I was not able to ask.,その日の紙はただのメモではなく、遺言書に関わる書類のように見えました。私は尋ねることができませんでした。,那天的纸不像普通便条，更像是遗嘱方面的文件。我没能询问。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v6].behaviorHint,요양보호사답게 관찰한 장면만 짧게 정리한다.,"As a caregiver, she briefly summarizes only what she observed.",介護職員らしく、観察した場面だけを短く整理する。,她像护理员一样，只简短整理自己观察到的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v6].text,"어머님은 어느 대목에서는 알아듣는 듯했고, 어느 대목에서는 작은아들분 설명에 의지했습니다.","Their mother seemed to understand some parts, and in other parts she relied on the younger son's explanation.",お母様は、ある箇所では理解しているように見え、別の箇所では次男の方の説明に頼っていました。,母亲有些地方像是听懂了，有些地方则依赖小儿子的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v7].behaviorHint,불필요한 판단을 피하며 손을 무릎 위에 모은다.,She avoids unnecessary judgment and folds her hands on her knees.,余計な判断を避け、両手を膝の上にそろえる。,她避免多余判断，把双手放在膝上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v7].text,요양보호사 교체 뒤 제가 빠진 부분이 있습니다. 그래도 제가 본 장면만큼은 작은아들분 개입이 컸습니다.,"After the caregiver was changed, there are parts I was not present for. Still, in the scenes I did see, the younger son's involvement was significant.",介護職員が替わった後、私が抜けている部分があります。それでも私が見た場面に限れば、次男の方の関与は大きかったです。,护理员更换之后，有些部分我不在场。即便如此，就我看到的场景而言，小儿子的介入很大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v8].behaviorHint,어머님 반응을 말할 때 표정이 잠시 굳는다.,Her expression briefly hardens when she speaks of the mother's reaction.,お母様の反応を話す時、表情が一瞬こわばる。,说到母亲的反应时，她的表情短暂僵住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v8].text,큰아들분이 오면 목소리가 커질 거라 어머님이 걱정하신 적이 있습니다. 작은아들분도 그걸 알고 있었습니다.,Their mother once worried that the older son's voice would get loud if he came. The younger son knew that too.,長男の方が来ると声が大きくなるだろうと、お母様が心配されたことがあります。次男の方もそれを知っていました。,母亲曾担心大儿子一来声音就会变大。小儿子也知道这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v9].behaviorHint,책임 소재가 나오자 시선을 낮추고 조심한다.,"When responsibility comes up, she lowers her gaze and grows cautious.",責任の所在が出ると、視線を落として慎重になる。,一提到责任归属，她垂下视线，变得谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v9].text,문서를 읽고 넘기는 속도는 작은아들분이 정했습니다. 어머님이 완전히 주도했다고 말하긴 어렵습니다.,The younger son set the pace for reading and turning the documents. It is hard to say their mother led everything entirely.,書類を読んでめくる速さは、次男の方が決めていました。お母様が完全に主導していたとは言いにくいです。,文件朗读和翻页的速度由小儿子决定。很难说母亲完全主导了过程。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v1].behaviorHint,두 손을 모으고 본 장면만 조심스럽게 말한다.,She gathers both hands and carefully speaks only about what she saw.,両手をそろえ、見た場面だけを慎重に話す。,她双手拢在一起，只谨慎说出自己看到的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v1].text,종이를 읽어드리는 장면은 봤습니다. 어머님이 따라 듣다가 중간에 멈추신 날도 있었습니다.,I saw him reading the paper to her. There were days when their mother listened along and then stopped midway.,紙を読み聞かせる場面は見ました。お母様が聞きながら、途中で止まった日もありました。,我看见过他把纸读给她听。母亲也有一边听、一边中途停下来的日子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v10].behaviorHint,말을 고르며 재판관 쪽만 바라본다.,She chooses her words and looks only toward the Judge.,言葉を選びながら、裁判官の方だけを見る。,她斟酌着措辞，只看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v10].text,방문과 종이가 연결돼 보이는 장면은 있었습니다. 다만 제가 그 일의 책임을 판단하긴 어렵습니다.,There were scenes that made the visits and the papers seem connected. But it is hard for me to judge responsibility for that matter.,訪問と紙がつながって見える場面はありました。ただ、その件の責任を私が判断するのは難しいです。,有些场景看起来把探访和那些纸联系在一起。不过，要我判断那件事的责任很难。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v2].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬으며 날짜보다 분위기를 먼저 설명한다.,She searches her memory and explains the atmosphere before the dates.,記憶をたどりながら、日付より先に雰囲気を説明する。,她一边回想，一边先说明气氛而不是日期。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v2].text,작은아들분이 문장을 끊어 읽고 어머님 반응을 살피는 모습은 기억납니다. 제가 판단한 건 아닙니다.,I remember the younger son reading the sentences in parts and watching their mother's reaction. That was not my judgment.,次男の方が文を区切って読み、お母様の反応を見る姿は覚えています。私が判断したわけではありません。,我记得小儿子把句子断开来读，并观察母亲的反应。这不是我的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v3].behaviorHint,자기 책임으로 번질까 조심하며 말끝을 낮춘다.,"She lowers her voice at the end of each sentence, wary it may lead back to her own responsibility.",自分の責任に及ぶのを恐れるように、語尾を低くする。,她担心牵连到自己的责任，说到句尾时声音压低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v3].text,서류 같은 종이를 몇 번 봤습니다. 다만 제가 그 내용을 확인할 위치는 아니었습니다.,I saw papers that looked like documents several times. But I was not in a position to check their contents.,書類のような紙は何度か見ました。ただ、その内容を確認できる立場ではありませんでした。,我几次看见像文件一样的纸。不过我不在能确认内容的位置上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v4].behaviorHint,어머님 상태를 떠올리며 천천히 고개를 끄덕인다.,She slowly nods as she recalls the mother's condition.,お母様の状態を思い出しながら、ゆっくりとうなずく。,她想起母亲的状态，慢慢点头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v4].text,어머님이 고개를 끄덕이실 때도 있었고 멍하실 때도 있었습니다. 그래서 단정은 조심스럽습니다.,"There were times when their mother nodded, and times when she seemed dazed. So I am careful about drawing conclusions.",お母様がうなずく時もあり、ぼんやりしている時もありました。ですから断定には慎重です。,母亲有时会点头，有时也会发愣。所以我不敢轻易断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v5].behaviorHint,확신하는 부분과 모르는 부분을 분리해 답한다.,She separates what she is certain of from what she does not know.,確信している部分と知らない部分を分けて答える。,她把确定的部分和不知道的部分分开回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v5].text,그 무렵 진행이 빨라진 느낌은 있었습니다. 교체 문제까지 제 책임처럼 보일까 봐 조심스럽습니다.,It did feel like things moved faster around that time. I am cautious because I do not want the caregiver change to look like my responsibility too.,その頃、進行が早まった感じはありました。交代の件まで私の責任のように見られるかと思い、慎重になっています。,那段时间确实有种进展加快的感觉。我担心连更换护理员的问题也像是我的责任，所以很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v6].behaviorHint,요양보호사답게 관찰한 장면만 짧게 정리한다.,"As a caregiver, she briefly summarizes only what she observed.",介護職員らしく、観察した場面だけを短く整理する。,她像护理员一样，只简短整理自己观察到的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v6].text,작은아들분이 서두르는 기색은 있었습니다. 하지만 제가 보기엔 어머님을 재촉한다기보다 불안해 보였습니다.,"The younger son did seem to be in a hurry. But to me, he looked anxious rather than as if he were pressuring their mother.",次男の方に急ぐ気配はありました。ただ、私にはお母様を急かしているというより、不安そうに見えました。,小儿子确实有着急的样子。但在我看来，与其说催促母亲，不如说他显得不安。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v7].behaviorHint,불필요한 판단을 피하며 손을 무릎 위에 모은다.,She avoids unnecessary judgment and folds her hands on her knees.,余計な判断を避け、両手を膝の上にそろえる。,她避免多余判断，把双手放在膝上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v7].text,큰아들분이 오시면 분위기가 세질까 걱정하는 말투를 들은 적은 있습니다. 정확한 뜻은 모릅니다.,"I did hear a tone of worry that if the older son came, the mood might become forceful. I do not know the exact meaning.",長男の方が来ると雰囲気が強くなるのではと心配するような口ぶりを聞いたことはあります。正確な意味は分かりません。,我听过有人用担心的语气说，大儿子来了气氛可能会变强硬。准确意思我不知道。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v8].behaviorHint,어머님 반응을 말할 때 표정이 잠시 굳는다.,Her expression briefly hardens when she speaks of the mother's reaction.,お母様の反応を話す時、表情が一瞬こわばる。,说到母亲的反应时，她的表情短暂僵住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v8].text,읽어드린 종이가 중요한 문서였을 수는 있습니다. 저는 요양보호사라 내용 판단은 하지 않았습니다.,"The paper read to her may have been an important document. I was a caregiver, so I did not judge its contents.",読み聞かせていた紙は重要な書類だったのかもしれません。私は介護職員なので、内容の判断はしませんでした。,读给她听的那张纸可能是重要文件。我是护理员，没有判断内容。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v9].behaviorHint,책임 소재가 나오자 시선을 낮추고 조심한다.,"When responsibility comes up, she lowers her gaze and grows cautious.",責任の所在が出ると、視線を落として慎重になる。,一提到责任归属，她垂下视线，变得谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v9].text,어머님 컨디션이 좋을 때를 골라 뭔가 정리하려는 모습은 있었습니다. 저는 지켜본 사람입니다.,There were times when he seemed to choose days when their mother was in good condition to arrange something. I was only watching.,お母様の体調がよい時を選んで、何かを整理しようとしている様子はありました。私は見守っていた人間です。,他有时像是挑母亲状态好的时候整理什么。我只是旁观的人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v1].behaviorHint,두 손을 모으고 본 장면만 조심스럽게 말한다.,She gathers both hands and carefully speaks only about what she saw.,両手をそろえ、見た場面だけを慎重に話す。,她双手拢在一起，只谨慎说出自己看到的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v1].text,작은아들분이 자주 오신 건 맞습니다. 어머님이 그분을 보고 조금 편해 보인 날도 있었습니다.,"It is true the younger son visited often. On some days, their mother seemed a little at ease when she saw him.",次男の方がよく来られたのは確かです。お母様がその方を見ると、少し安心したように見えた日もありました。,小儿子常来是真的。也有些日子，母亲看到他会显得稍微安心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v10].behaviorHint,말을 고르며 재판관 쪽만 바라본다.,She chooses her words and looks only toward the Judge.,言葉を選びながら、裁判官の方だけを見る。,她斟酌着措辞，只看向法官。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v10].text,어머님이 피곤해하시는 날도 있었고 또렷한 날도 있었습니다. 저는 그 정도만 기억합니다.,There were days when their mother was tired and days when she was clear. That is as much as I remember.,お母様が疲れている日も、はっきりしている日もありました。私が覚えているのはその程度です。,母亲有疲惫的日子，也有清醒的日子。我记得的只有这些。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v2].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬으며 날짜보다 분위기를 먼저 설명한다.,She searches her memory and explains the atmosphere before the dates.,記憶をたどりながら、日付より先に雰囲気を説明する。,她一边回想，一边先说明气氛而不是日期。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v2].text,제가 본 범위에서는 방문이 잦았습니다. 다만 세세한 날짜까지는 지금 바로 말하기 어렵습니다.,"Within the range I saw, the visits were frequent. But it is hard for me to state the detailed dates right now.",私が見た範囲では、訪問は多かったです。ただ、細かい日付までは今すぐ申し上げにくいです。,就我看到的范围，探访很频繁。不过具体日期现在很难马上说清。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v3].behaviorHint,자기 책임으로 번질까 조심하며 말끝을 낮춘다.,"She lowers her voice at the end of each sentence, wary it may lead back to her own responsibility.",自分の責任に及ぶのを恐れるように、語尾を低くする。,她担心牵连到自己的责任，说到句尾时声音压低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v3].text,작은아들분이 조용히 다녀가신 날이 여러 번 있었습니다. 큰소리 나는 분위기는 아니었습니다.,There were several days when the younger son came and went quietly. It was not an atmosphere of raised voices.,次男の方が静かに来て帰られた日が何度もありました。大声がする雰囲気ではありませんでした。,小儿子安静来去的日子有好几次。不是那种会有大声争吵的气氛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v4].behaviorHint,어머님 상태를 떠올리며 천천히 고개를 끄덕인다.,She slowly nods as she recalls the mother's condition.,お母様の状態を思い出しながら、ゆっくりとうなずく。,她想起母亲的状态，慢慢点头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v4].text,어머님 방에 종이가 놓여 있던 건 기억납니다. 내용까지 제가 살핀 건 아닙니다.,I remember paper being placed in their mother's room. I did not look closely at the contents.,お母様の部屋に紙が置かれていたことは覚えています。内容まで私が見たわけではありません。,我记得母亲房间里放着纸。至于内容，我没有细看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v5].behaviorHint,확신하는 부분과 모르는 부분을 분리해 답한다.,She separates what she is certain of from what she does not know.,確信している部分と知らない部分を分けて答える。,她把确定的部分和不知道的部分分开回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v5].text,말년에는 어머님 상태가 날마다 달랐습니다. 그래서 누가 왔는지보다 분위기만 기억납니다.,"In her later years, their mother's condition changed day by day. So I remember the atmosphere more than who came.",晩年のお母様の状態は日によって違いました。だから誰が来たかより、雰囲気を覚えています。,晚年时母亲的状态每天都不一样。所以比起谁来了，我更记得气氛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v6].behaviorHint,요양보호사답게 관찰한 장면만 짧게 정리한다.,"As a caregiver, she briefly summarizes only what she observed.",介護職員らしく、観察した場面だけを短く整理する。,她像护理员一样，只简短整理自己观察到的场景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v6].text,작은아들분이 오면 어머님이 안심하시는 듯한 날이 있었습니다. 그 이상은 조심스럽습니다.,"There were days when their mother seemed relieved when the younger son came. Beyond that, I must be careful.",次男の方が来ると、お母様が安心されたように見える日がありました。それ以上は慎重に申し上げたいです。,有些日子，小儿子一来，母亲像是安心了。再往上说我得谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v7].behaviorHint,불필요한 판단을 피하며 손을 무릎 위에 모은다.,She avoids unnecessary judgment and folds her hands on her knees.,余計な判断を避け、両手を膝の上にそろえる。,她避免多余判断，把双手放在膝上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v7].text,저는 본 것만 말씀드리겠습니다. 방문이 늘어난 흐름은 있었지만 판단은 재판관님 몫입니다.,"I will speak only to what I saw. There was a pattern of more frequent visits, but judgment is for you, Judge.",私が見たことだけを申し上げます。訪問が増える流れはありましたが、判断は裁判官にお任せします。,我只说我看到的事。探访确实有增加的趋势，但判断是法官的职责。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v8].behaviorHint,어머님 반응을 말할 때 표정이 잠시 굳는다.,Her expression briefly hardens when she speaks of the mother's reaction.,お母様の反応を話す時、表情が一瞬こわばる。,说到母亲的反应时，她的表情短暂僵住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v8].text,그 무렵 방 안에서 낮은 목소리로 대화하는 장면을 본 적은 있습니다.,"Around that time, I did see them speaking in low voices inside the room.",その頃、部屋の中で低い声で会話している場面を見たことはあります。,那段时间，我见过他们在房间里低声交谈。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v9].behaviorHint,책임 소재가 나오자 시선을 낮추고 조심한다.,"When responsibility comes up, she lowers her gaze and grows cautious.",責任の所在が出ると、視線を落として慎重になる。,一提到责任归属，她垂下视线，变得谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v9].text,요양보호사 교체 일은 제가 함부로 말하기 어렵습니다. 다만 방문 자체는 잦았습니다.,It is hard for me to speak freely about the caregiver change. But the visits themselves were frequent.,介護職員の交代について、私が軽々しく話すのは難しいです。ただ、訪問自体は多かったです。,护理员更换的事，我很难随便说。不过探访本身确实频繁。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v1].behaviorHint,기록을 기준으로 삼아 업무적으로 답한다.,"He answers professionally, using the record as his basis.",記録を基準に、業務的に答える。,他以记录为准，用事务性口吻回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v1].text,"처음 공증본은 처음 적힌 비율이었고, 다시 들어온 최종본은 60대40이었습니다. 최종 제출자는 윤정후 씨였습니다.","The first notarized version reflected the initial ratio, and the final version that came in again was 60:40. The final submitter was Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu.",最初の公証本は最初に記された比率で、再び持ち込まれた最終本は60対40でした。最終提出者はユン・ジョンフ氏でした。,最初的公证版本是最初写下的比例，再次送来的最终版本是60:40。最终提交人是尹正厚先生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v10].behaviorHint,절차 책임을 피하려다 다시 사실로 돌아온다.,"He tries to avoid procedural responsibility, then returns to the facts.",手続き上の責任を避けようとしてから、再び事実に戻る。,他试图避开程序责任，又回到事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v10].text,기록만 보면 윤정후 씨가 자기 몫을 줄이는 방향으로 문서를 바꿔 냈다는 점이 분명합니다.,"Looking only at the record, it is clear that Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu changed the document in a direction that reduced his own share.",記録だけを見ると、ユン・ジョンフ氏が自分の取り分を減らす方向に書類を変更して提出したことは明らかです。,只看记录，可以明确看出尹正厚先生把文件改成了减少自己份额的方向再提交。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v2].behaviorHint,절차상 표현을 고르며 조심스럽게 말한다.,He chooses procedural wording and speaks cautiously.,手続き上の表現を選びながら、慎重に話す。,他斟酌程序性的措辞，谨慎开口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v2].text,기록상 처음 적힌 자필 연습본과 60대40 공증본이 같은 날 남아 있습니다. 두 번째를 낸 사람은 서류 제출자분입니다.,"According to the record, the first handwritten draft and the 60:40 notarized version remain from the same day. The person who submitted the second document was the document submitter.",記録上、最初に記された自筆の下書きと60対40の公証本が同じ日に残っています。二つ目を提出したのは書類提出者の方です。,记录显示，最初写下的亲笔草稿和60:40公证版本都留在同一天。提交第二份文件的人就是文件提交人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v3].behaviorHint,책임 문제가 번질까 문장마다 선을 긋는다.,"He draws a line with each sentence, wary the issue of responsibility may spread.",責任問題が広がるのを恐れ、一文ごとに線を引く。,他担心责任问题扩大，每句话都划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v3].text,저는 당시 비율 변경 사유를 충분히 확인하지 못했습니다. 지금 보면 절차상 빈틈이 있었습니다.,"I did not sufficiently confirm the reason for the ratio change at the time. Looking at it now, there was a procedural gap.",当時、比率変更の理由を十分に確認できませんでした。今見ると、手続き上の空白がありました。,当时我没有充分确认比例变更的理由。现在看来，程序上确实有空隙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v4].behaviorHint,공증 메모를 떠올리듯 손끝으로 순서를 짚는다.,"As if recalling the notary's memo, he marks the sequence with his fingertips.",公証人のメモを思い出すように、指先で順序をたどる。,他像是在回想公证人的备忘记录，用指尖数着顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v4].text,"첫 문서는 윤정후 씨 몫이 훨씬 컸고, 두 번째는 그 몫이 줄었습니다. 그래서 단순 탐욕으로 보긴 어렵습니다.","The first document gave Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu a much larger share, while the second reduced that share. That makes it hard to view it as simple greed.",最初の書類ではユン・ジョンフ氏の取り分がはるかに大きく、二つ目ではその取り分が減っています。だから単純な欲と見るのは難しいです。,第一份文件中尹正厚先生的份额大得多，第二份则减少了那部分。所以很难看成单纯的贪心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v5].behaviorHint,감정을 넣지 않고 확인된 내용만 말한다.,"He states only confirmed details, without emotion.",感情を交えず、確認された内容だけを話す。,他不带情绪，只说已确认的内容。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v5].text,최종본 접수 때 큰아들분의 별도 확인은 없었습니다. 저희 쪽 확인이 부족했다는 지적은 피하기 어렵습니다.,"At the time the final version was received, there was no separate confirmation with the older son. It is hard to avoid the criticism that our side did not check enough.",最終本を受け付けた時、長男の方への別途確認はありませんでした。私どもの確認が不足していたという指摘は避けにくいです。,最终版本受理时，没有另行向大儿子确认。说我们这边确认不足，这一点很难回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v6].behaviorHint,본인 확인 부족 대목에서 잠깐 숨을 고른다.,He briefly steadies his breath at the point about insufficient identity confirmation.,本人確認不足のくだりで、一瞬息を整える。,说到本人确认不足时，他短暂调整呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v6].text,공증 기록에는 절차 메모 시간이 남아 있습니다. 어머니 상태와 진행 방식의 주의점이 명확합니다.,The notary record contains the times of the procedural memos. The points of caution about the mother's condition and the method of proceeding are clear.,公証記録には手続きメモの時刻が残っています。お母様の状態と進行方法に関する注意点は明確です。,公证记录中留下了程序备忘的时间。关于母亲状态和推进方式的注意事项很明确。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v7].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 말할 때 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,His voice lowers further when he speaks of the differences between the documents.,書類の違いを話す時、声がさらに低くなる。,谈到文件差异时，他的声音更低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v7].text,"윤정후 씨가 문서를 다시 제출했고, 그 뒤 60대40 서류가 보관본으로 남았습니다.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu resubmitted the document, and afterward the 60:40 document remained as the retained copy.",ユン・ジョンフ氏が書類を再提出し、その後、60対40の書類が保管本として残りました。,尹正厚先生重新提交了文件，此后60:40文件作为存档副本留下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v8].behaviorHint,업무 범위를 강조하며 세부를 정리한다.,He emphasizes the scope of his work and sorts out the details.,業務範囲を強調しながら、細部を整理する。,他强调自己的工作范围，并整理细节。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v8].text,저는 업무적으로 처리했지만 자필 연습본이 남은 이상 변경 사실은 부정하기 어렵습니다.,"I handled it as part of my work, but as long as the handwritten draft remains, it is hard to deny that a change occurred.",私は業務として処理しましたが、自筆の下書きが残っている以上、変更があった事実は否定しにくいです。,我是按业务处理的，但既然亲笔草稿留下来了，就很难否认发生过变更。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v9].behaviorHint,재판관 질문을 듣고 기록 쪽으로 시선을 내린다.,"Hearing the Judge's question, he lowers his gaze toward the record.",裁判官の質問を聞き、記録の方へ視線を落とす。,听到法官的问题，他把视线落向记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v9].text,"재판관님, 절차상 문서의 진정한 의사 확인이 충분했는지는 저도 자신 있게 말하기 어렵습니다.","Judge, I cannot confidently say that the true intent behind the document was sufficiently confirmed as a matter of procedure.",裁判官、手続き上、書類の真意確認が十分だったかどうかは、私も自信を持って言いにくいです。,法官，程序上是否充分确认了文件中的真实意思，我也很难自信地说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v1].behaviorHint,기록을 기준으로 삼아 업무적으로 답한다.,"He answers professionally, using the record as his basis.",記録を基準に、業務的に答える。,他以记录为准，用事务性口吻回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v1].text,처음 들어온 문서와 다시 들어온 문서의 비율은 달랐습니다. 처음 것이 더 한쪽으로 기울어 있었습니다.,The ratios in the first document and the document that came in again were different. The first one was more heavily tilted to one side.,最初に入った書類と再び入った書類では、比率が違っていました。最初の方がより一方に偏っていました。,最初送来的文件和后来再次送来的文件比例不同。第一份更明显偏向一边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v10].behaviorHint,절차 책임을 피하려다 다시 사실로 돌아온다.,"He tries to avoid procedural responsibility, then returns to the facts.",手続き上の責任を避けようとしてから、再び事実に戻る。,他试图避开程序责任，又回到事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v10].text,"두 서류가 같은 날 들어온 건 맞고, 최종본을 낸 사람은 서류 제출자분이었습니다.","It is true that both documents came in on the same day, and the person who submitted the final version was the document submitter.",二つの書類が同じ日に入ったのは確かで、最終本を提出したのは書類提出者の方でした。,两份文件是在同一天送来的，这没错；提交最终版本的人就是文件提交人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v2].behaviorHint,절차상 표현을 고르며 조심스럽게 말한다.,He chooses procedural wording and speaks cautiously.,手続き上の表現を選びながら、慎重に話す。,他斟酌程序性的措辞，谨慎开口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v2].text,두 번째 서류가 더 균형 잡힌 모양이었습니다. 다만 제가 의사 내용을 판단한 건 아닙니다.,The second document appeared more balanced. But I was not the one judging the intent behind it.,二つ目の書類の方が、より均衡の取れた形に見えました。ただ、意思の内容を判断したのは私ではありません。,第二份文件看起来更平衡。不过我并没有判断其中意思的内容。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v3].behaviorHint,책임 문제가 번질까 문장마다 선을 긋는다.,"He draws a line with each sentence, wary the issue of responsibility may spread.",責任問題が広がるのを恐れ、一文ごとに線を引く。,他担心责任问题扩大，每句话都划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v3].text,최종 접수된 건 다시 제출된 서류였습니다. 절차상 저는 제출자 확인 중심으로 처리했습니다.,"The document finally received was the one resubmitted. Procedurally, I handled it mainly by confirming the submitter.",最終的に受け付けたのは再提出された書類でした。手続き上、私は提出者確認を中心に処理しました。,最终受理的是重新提交的文件。程序上，我主要围绕提交人确认来处理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v4].behaviorHint,공증 메모를 떠올리듯 손끝으로 순서를 짚는다.,"As if recalling the notary's memo, he marks the sequence with his fingertips.",公証人のメモを思い出すように、指先で順序をたどる。,他像是在回想公证人的备忘记录，用指尖数着顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v4].text,기록상 공증 전후 메모의 주의점이 다릅니다. 그 차이가 중요하다는 건 뒤늦게 알았습니다.,The record shows different caution points in the memos before and after notarization. I only later understood that the difference mattered.,記録上、公証前後のメモで注意点が異なります。その違いが重要だと後になって分かりました。,记录上，公证前后的备忘注意事项不同。我后来才知道那个差异很重要。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v5].behaviorHint,감정을 넣지 않고 확인된 내용만 말한다.,"He states only confirmed details, without emotion.",感情を交えず、確認された内容だけを話す。,他不带情绪，只说已确认的内容。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v5].text,서류 제출자분이 마지막 문서를 다시 냈습니다. 제가 그 사유를 깊게 확인하진 않았습니다.,The document submitter brought the final document again. I did not examine the reason deeply.,書類提出者の方が最後の書類を再び提出しました。私はその理由を深く確認していません。,文件提交人重新提交了最后那份文件。我没有深入确认理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v6].behaviorHint,본인 확인 부족 대목에서 잠깐 숨을 고른다.,He briefly steadies his breath at the point about insufficient identity confirmation.,本人確認不足のくだりで、一瞬息を整える。,说到本人确认不足时，他短暂调整呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v6].text,공증 절차는 문서와 신분 확인을 기준으로 움직였습니다. 그 안쪽 의사까지 제가 검증하긴 어려웠습니다.,The notarization procedure moved on the basis of documents and identity confirmation. It was difficult for me to verify the intent inside it.,公証手続きは書類と本人確認を基準に進みました。その内側の意思まで私が検証するのは難しかったです。,公证程序是以文件和身份确认为基础推进的。里面的意思很难由我来核验。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v7].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 말할 때 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,His voice lowers further when he speaks of the differences between the documents.,書類の違いを話す時、声がさらに低くなる。,谈到文件差异时，他的声音更低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v7].text,처음 문서가 그대로 남아 있어 차이가 보입니다. 사무실 책임 문제가 될까 조심스럽습니다.,"The first document remains as it was, so the difference can be seen. I am cautious because it may become an issue of the office's responsibility.",最初の書類がそのまま残っているので、差異が見えます。事務所の責任問題になるかもしれず、慎重に申し上げています。,第一份文件原样留下，所以能看出差异。我担心会变成办公室责任问题，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v8].behaviorHint,업무 범위를 강조하며 세부를 정리한다.,He emphasizes the scope of his work and sorts out the details.,業務範囲を強調しながら、細部を整理する。,他强调自己的工作范围，并整理细节。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v8].text,비율이 바뀐 것은 기록으로 남아 있습니다. 다만 당시엔 단순 정정처럼 처리됐습니다.,"The change in ratio remains in the record. At the time, however, it was handled like a simple correction.",比率が変わったことは記録に残っています。ただ、当時は単純な訂正のように処理されました。,比例变更在记录中留下了。不过当时是按简单更正来处理的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v9].behaviorHint,재판관 질문을 듣고 기록 쪽으로 시선을 내린다.,"Hearing the Judge's question, he lowers his gaze toward the record.",裁判官の質問を聞き、記録の方へ視線を落とす。,听到法官的问题，他把视线落向记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v9].text,큰아들분에게 따로 확인한 절차는 기억나지 않습니다. 그 부분은 제게도 부담스럽습니다.,I do not remember a separate procedure confirming it with the older son. That part weighs on me as well.,長男の方に別途確認した手続きは覚えていません。その部分は私にとっても負担です。,我不记得有另行向大儿子确认的程序。那部分对我来说也有负担。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v1].behaviorHint,기록을 기준으로 삼아 업무적으로 답한다.,"He answers professionally, using the record as his basis.",記録を基準に、業務的に答える。,他以记录为准，用事务性口吻回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v1].text,그 접수 건은 기억합니다. 같은 날 같은 제출자분이 다시 오신 일은 흔하지 않습니다.,I remember that filing. It is unusual for the same submitter to come back on the same day.,その受付件は覚えています。同じ日に同じ提出者の方が再び来られることは珍しいです。,我记得那次受理。同一天同一位提交人再次前来，并不常见。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v10].behaviorHint,절차 책임을 피하려다 다시 사실로 돌아온다.,"He tries to avoid procedural responsibility, then returns to the facts.",手続き上の責任を避けようとしてから、再び事実に戻る。,他试图避开程序责任，又回到事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v10].text,당시 확인 절차가 충분했는지는 별도로 봐야 합니다. 일단 두 번 들어온 건 맞습니다.,"Whether the confirmation procedure at the time was sufficient needs to be reviewed separately. For now, it is true that the documents came in twice.",当時の確認手続きが十分だったかは別途見る必要があります。ひとまず、二度入ったのは確かです。,当时确认程序是否充分，需要另行审视。至少，确实送来了两次。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v2].behaviorHint,절차상 표현을 고르며 조심스럽게 말한다.,He chooses procedural wording and speaks cautiously.,手続き上の表現を選びながら、慎重に話す。,他斟酌程序性的措辞，谨慎开口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v2].text,공증인 메모 기록에는 어머니 상태와 절차 진행이 함께 남아 있습니다. 세부는 메모를 봐야 합니다.,The notary's memo notes contain both the mother's condition and how the procedure moved forward. The details would have to be checked in the memo.,公証人のメモ記録には、お母様の状態と手続きの進行がともに残っています。詳細はメモを見る必要があります。,公证人备忘记录里同时留下了母亲的状态和程序推进情况。细节需要看备忘记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v3].behaviorHint,책임 문제가 번질까 문장마다 선을 긋는다.,"He draws a line with each sentence, wary the issue of responsibility may spread.",責任問題が広がるのを恐れ、一文ごとに線を引く。,他担心责任问题扩大，每句话都划清界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v3].text,서류 제출자분이 다시 방문한 건 맞습니다. 당시엔 절차대로 접수했다고 기억합니다.,It is true that the document submitter visited again. I remember receiving it according to procedure at the time.,書類提出者の方が再び訪問したのは確かです。当時は手続きどおり受け付けたと記憶しています。,文件提交人再次来访是真的。我记得当时是按程序受理的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v4].behaviorHint,공증 메모를 떠올리듯 손끝으로 순서를 짚는다.,"As if recalling the notary's memo, he marks the sequence with his fingertips.",公証人のメモを思い出すように、指先で順序をたどる。,他像是在回想公证人的备忘记录，用指尖数着顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v4].text,하루 안에 문서가 바뀌어 들어온 사례라 제 기억에 남아 있습니다.,"Because the document changed and came in within a single day, it stayed in my memory.",一日のうちに書類が変わって入ってきた事例なので、記憶に残っています。,因为是在一天之内文件变更后又送来的例子，所以我记得。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v5].behaviorHint,감정을 넣지 않고 확인된 내용만 말한다.,"He states only confirmed details, without emotion.",感情を交えず、確認された内容だけを話す。,他不带情绪，只说已确认的内容。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v5].text,큰아들분은 그 자리에는 없었던 것으로 기억합니다. 다만 저는 접수 창구 기준으로 말씀드립니다.,I remember that the older son was not there. But I am speaking from the standpoint of the reception desk.,長男の方はその場にいなかったと記憶しています。ただし、私は受付窓口の基準で申し上げています。,我记得大儿子当时不在场。不过我是以受理窗口的角度来说的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v6].behaviorHint,본인 확인 부족 대목에서 잠깐 숨을 고른다.,He briefly steadies his breath at the point about insufficient identity confirmation.,本人確認不足のくだりで、一瞬息を整える。,说到本人确认不足时，他短暂调整呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v6].text,저희 사무실에는 같은 절차에 대한 공증인 메모가 남아 있습니다. 그 정도는 알 수 있습니다.,Our office has the notary's memo notes for the same procedure. That much can be known.,私どもの事務所には、同じ手続きに関する公証人のメモ記録が残っています。その程度は分かります。,我们办公室留有关于同一程序的公证人备忘记录。至少这一点可以知道。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v7].behaviorHint,문서 차이를 말할 때 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,His voice lowers further when he speaks of the differences between the documents.,書類の違いを話す時、声がさらに低くなる。,谈到文件差异时，他的声音更低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v7].text,기록을 보면 일반적인 접수 흐름과 조금 다릅니다. 그 이상은 단정하지 않겠습니다.,"Looking at the record, it differs somewhat from an ordinary reception flow. I will not state more than that as fact.",記録を見ると、一般的な受付の流れとは少し違います。それ以上は断定しません。,看记录，它和一般受理流程略有不同。除此之外我不作断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v8].behaviorHint,업무 범위를 강조하며 세부를 정리한다.,He emphasizes the scope of his work and sorts out the details.,業務範囲を強調しながら、細部を整理する。,他强调自己的工作范围，并整理细节。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v8].text,제출자분 표정이 급해 보였던 건 기억납니다. 내용 판단은 제 업무 밖이라고 봤습니다.,I remember that the submitter's expression looked urgent. I considered judging the contents to be outside my duties.,提出者の方の表情が急いでいるように見えたのは覚えています。内容の判断は私の業務外だと考えていました。,我记得提交人的表情看起来很急。内容判断我认为不在我的工作范围内。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v9].behaviorHint,재판관 질문을 듣고 기록 쪽으로 시선을 내린다.,"Hearing the Judge's question, he lowers his gaze toward the record.",裁判官の質問を聞き、記録の方へ視線を落とす。,听到法官的问题，他把视线落向记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v9].text,공증 절차상 접수와 공증인 메모는 남아 있습니다. 저는 그 기록에 근거해 답하겠습니다.,"Under the notarization procedure, the reception record and the notary's memo remain. I will answer based on those records.",公証手続き上、受付と公証人のメモは残っています。私はその記録に基づいて答えます。,公证程序上，受理记录和公证人备忘都留下了。我会根据这些记录回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v1].behaviorHint,태성이 쪽을 감싸려다 재판관 눈치를 본다.,"She tries to shield Tae-seong's side, then watches the Judge's reaction.",テソン側をかばおうとしてから、裁判官の顔色を見る。,她想护着泰成一边，又观察法官的脸色。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v1].text,어머님은 정후가 20년 가까이 매달 돈을 보내줬다고 하셨습니다. 태성이 공장 위기 때도 정후 돈이 들어갔다고 들었습니다.,Their mother said Jeong-hu had been sending money every month for nearly twenty years. I heard that Jeong-hu's money also went in when Tae-seong's factory was in trouble.,お母様は、ジョンフが20年近く毎月お金を送ってくれていたとおっしゃっていました。テソンの工場が危ない時にも、ジョンフのお金が入ったと聞きました。,母亲说，正厚将近二十年来每个月都汇钱。泰成的工厂出现危机时，我也听说正厚的钱进去了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v10].behaviorHint,끝내 말해야 한다는 듯 낮게 고백한다.,"She confesses quietly, as if she has no choice but to say it.",ついに言うしかないというように、低く告白する。,她低声坦白，像是终于不得不说出口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v10].text,"핵심만 말하면, 태성이가 어머니 돈으로 믿은 그 도움의 상당 부분은 정후가 보낸 돈이라고 들었습니다.","To put it plainly, I heard that a substantial part of the help Tae-seong believed came from his mother was actually money sent by Jeong-hu.",要点だけ言えば、テソンが母のお金だと信じていた援助の相当部分は、ジョンフが送ったお金だと聞きました。,简单说，我听说泰成以为是母亲给的那些帮助，其中相当一部分其实是正厚汇来的钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v2].behaviorHint,어머님 이야기에 감정이 올라와 목이 잠긴다.,"Emotion rises as she speaks of their mother, and her throat tightens.",お母様の話になると感情がこみ上げ、声が詰まる。,说到母亲时情绪涌上来，嗓子哽住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v2].text,"정후가 어머니 통장으로 돈을 넣고, 그 돈이 태성이 쪽으로 간다는 말을 어머님께 들었습니다.","Their mother told me that Jeong-hu put money into her account, and that money then went toward Tae-seong's side.",ジョンフがお母様の口座にお金を入れ、そのお金がテソンの方へ行くと、お母様から聞きました。,我听母亲说，正厚把钱打进她的账户，那笔钱再转到泰成那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v3].behaviorHint,정후를 말할 때는 조심하고 태성이를 말할 때는 부드러워진다.,She is careful when speaking of Jeong-hu and softens when speaking of Tae-seong.,ジョンフのことを話す時は慎重に、テソンのことを話す時は柔らかくなる。,说到正厚时她很谨慎，说到泰成时则变得柔和。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v3].text,어머님은 태성이가 알면 자존심이 무너질 거라며 그 돈의 출처를 숨기고 싶어 하셨습니다.,"Their mother wanted to hide the source of the money, saying Tae-seong's pride would collapse if he found out.",お母様は、テソンが知れば自尊心が崩れると言い、そのお金の出所を隠したがっていました。,母亲说泰成如果知道，自尊心会崩塌，所以想隐藏那笔钱的来源。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v4].behaviorHint,자기 책임으로 번질까 손수건을 만지작거린다.,"She fiddles with a handkerchief, afraid the responsibility may turn toward her.",自分の責任に及ぶのを恐れ、ハンカチをいじる。,她担心责任牵连到自己，摆弄着手帕。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v4].text,저는 태성이 편이라 더 말하기 싫었습니다. 그래도 정후가 오래 도왔다는 말은 어머님 입에서 직접 들었습니다.,"I was on Tae-seong's side, so I did not want to say more. Still, I heard directly from their mother that Jeong-hu had helped for a long time.",私はテソン側だったので、これ以上話したくありませんでした。それでも、ジョンフが長く助けていたという話は、お母様の口から直接聞きました。,我是站在泰成这边的，所以不想多说。可是，正厚长期帮忙这件事，我是直接从母亲口中听到的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v5].behaviorHint,친구로 들은 말이라며 계속 선을 긋는다.,"She keeps drawing a line, saying it was something she heard as a friend.",友人として聞いた話だと言いながら、何度も線を引く。,她不断划清界线，说那是以朋友身份听来的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v5].text,공장 돈 이야기도 들었습니다. 어머님은 태성이가 자기 힘으로 버틴 줄 알게 두고 싶어 하셨습니다.,I also heard about the factory money. Their mother wanted Tae-seong to believe he had held on by his own strength.,工場のお金の話も聞きました。お母様は、テソンが自分の力で持ちこたえたと思わせておきたがっていました。,工厂那笔钱的事我也听说了。母亲希望泰成以为自己是靠自己的力量撑过来的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v6].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬다 말끝을 흐리고 다시 정정한다.,"She searches her memory, trails off, then corrects herself.",記憶をたどり、語尾を濁してから言い直す。,她一边回想，一边把话尾含糊过去，又重新纠正。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v6].text,어머님은 정후에게 미안해하면서도 태성이가 다칠까 봐 말을 못 한다고 하셨습니다.,"Their mother said she felt sorry to Jeong-hu, but could not speak because she feared Tae-seong would be hurt.",お母様はジョンフに申し訳なく思いながらも、テソンが傷つくのが怖くて話せないとおっしゃっていました。,母亲说她对正厚感到抱歉，但怕泰成受伤，所以说不出口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v7].behaviorHint,태성이가 다칠까 봐 한 박자 늦게 답한다.,"She answers a beat late, worried Tae-seong may be hurt.",テソンが傷つくのを恐れ、一拍遅れて答える。,她怕泰成受伤，慢了一拍才回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v7].text,"아버지 일처럼 더 깊은 이야기도 스쳐 나왔지만, 저는 그걸 제 입으로 단정하고 싶지 않았습니다.","There were also deeper remarks, like the matter with their father, but I did not want to state that as fact in my own words.",お父様の件のような、もっと深い話もかすめました。ただ、私はそれを自分の口で断定したくありませんでした。,也有像父亲那件事一样更深的话题一闪而过，但我不想由自己嘴里断定。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v8].behaviorHint,어머님 말을 떠올리며 시선이 흔들린다.,Her eyes waver as she recalls their mother's words.,お母様の言葉を思い出し、視線が揺れる。,她想起母亲的话，眼神动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v8].text,"재판관님, 제가 숨긴 건 맞습니다. 태성이가 받을 충격과 제 책임이 두려워 말을 돌렸습니다.","Judge, it is true that I hid it. I was afraid of the shock Tae-seong would receive and of my own responsibility, so I turned the subject aside.",裁判官、私が隠したのは事実です。テソンが受ける衝撃と自分の責任が怖くて、話をそらしました。,法官，我确实隐瞒了。我害怕泰成受到的冲击，也害怕自己的责任，所以把话带偏了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v9].behaviorHint,감정과 책임 회피가 섞인 표정으로 답한다.,She answers with an expression mixed with emotion and avoidance of responsibility.,感情と責任逃れが混ざった表情で答える。,她带着情绪和逃避责任交织的表情回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v9].text,"어머님은 두 아들을 모두 걱정했습니다. 태성이는 자존심, 정후는 혼자 짊어진 돈 때문에요.","Their mother worried about both sons. Tae-seong, because of his pride; Jeong-hu, because of the money he had borne alone.",お母様は二人の息子をどちらも心配していました。テソンは自尊心のことで、ジョンフは一人で背負ったお金のことで。,母亲担心两个儿子。泰成是因为自尊，正厚是因为他独自背负的钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v1].behaviorHint,태성이 쪽을 감싸려다 재판관 눈치를 본다.,"She tries to shield Tae-seong's side, then watches the Judge's reaction.",テソン側をかばおうとしてから、裁判官の顔色を見る。,她想护着泰成一边，又观察法官的脸色。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v1].text,어머님이 정후가 오래 돈을 보내준다고 하신 적은 있습니다. 저는 그 말을 남에게 옮기고 싶지 않았습니다.,Their mother did say that Jeong-hu had sent money for a long time. I did not want to pass that on to others.,お母様が、ジョンフは長くお金を送ってくれていると言ったことはあります。私はその話を他人に伝えたくありませんでした。,母亲确实说过正厚长期汇钱。我不想把这话转述给别人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v10].behaviorHint,끝내 말해야 한다는 듯 낮게 고백한다.,"She confesses quietly, as if she has no choice but to say it.",ついに言うしかないというように、低く告白する。,她低声坦白，像是终于不得不说出口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v10].text,"제가 알고도 모른 척한 부분이 있습니다. 태성이가 다칠까 봐, 또 제 말이 책임이 될까 봐 그랬습니다.","There are parts I knew but pretended not to know. I did that because I feared Tae-seong would be hurt, and because my words might become my responsibility.",知っていながら知らないふりをした部分があります。テソンが傷つくのが怖く、また私の言葉が責任になるかもしれないと思ったからです。,有些部分我知道，却装作不知道。因为怕泰成受伤，也怕我的话会变成责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v2].behaviorHint,어머님 이야기에 감정이 올라와 목이 잠긴다.,"Emotion rises as she speaks of their mother, and her throat tightens.",お母様の話になると感情がこみ上げ、声が詰まる。,说到母亲时情绪涌上来，嗓子哽住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v2].text,태성이 공장 일이 어려울 때 정후 돈이 들어갔다는 말을 들었습니다. 직접 본 장부는 아닙니다.,I heard that Jeong-hu's money went in when Tae-seong's factory was in trouble. I did not see the ledger myself.,テソンの工場が苦しい時にジョンフのお金が入ったと聞きました。帳簿を直接見たわけではありません。,我听说泰成的工厂困难时，正厚的钱进去了。我没有亲眼看到账簿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v3].behaviorHint,정후를 말할 때는 조심하고 태성이를 말할 때는 부드러워진다.,She is careful when speaking of Jeong-hu and softens when speaking of Tae-seong.,ジョンフのことを話す時は慎重に、テソンのことを話す時は柔らかくなる。,说到正厚时她很谨慎，说到泰成时则变得柔和。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v3].text,정후가 어머님을 통해 태성이를 도왔다는 얘기는 있었습니다. 저는 어머님 말씀으로만 압니다.,There was talk that Jeong-hu helped Tae-seong through their mother. I know it only from what their mother said.,ジョンフがお母様を通してテソンを助けたという話はありました。私はお母様の言葉でしか知りません。,有说法是正厚通过母亲帮助泰成。我只知道母亲这样说过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v4].behaviorHint,자기 책임으로 번질까 손수건을 만지작거린다.,"She fiddles with a handkerchief, afraid the responsibility may turn toward her.",自分の責任に及ぶのを恐れ、ハンカチをいじる。,她担心责任牵连到自己，摆弄着手帕。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v4].text,태성이가 알면 자존심 상할 거라고 어머님이 걱정하셨습니다. 그래서 저도 말을 아꼈습니다.,Their mother worried that Tae-seong would be wounded in his pride if he found out. So I also held back.,テソンが知れば自尊心を傷つけるだろうと、お母様は心配していました。だから私も言葉を控えました。,母亲担心泰成知道后自尊心会受伤。所以我也少说了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v5].behaviorHint,친구로 들은 말이라며 계속 선을 긋는다.,"She keeps drawing a line, saying it was something she heard as a friend.",友人として聞いた話だと言いながら、何度も線を引く。,她不断划清界线，说那是以朋友身份听来的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v5].text,돈 이야기는 들었지만 제가 확인한 건 아닙니다. 괜히 제가 아는 척하면 일이 커질까 봐 조심했습니다.,"I heard about the money, but I did not confirm it myself. I was careful because if I acted like I knew too much, the matter might grow.",お金の話は聞きましたが、私が確認したわけではありません。下手に知ったふりをすれば事が大きくなると思い、慎重にしました。,钱的事我听说了，但不是我亲自确认的。我怕自己装作知道会把事情闹大，所以很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v6].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬다 말끝을 흐리고 다시 정정한다.,"She searches her memory, trails off, then corrects herself.",記憶をたどり、語尾を濁してから言い直す。,她一边回想，一边把话尾含糊过去，又重新纠正。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v6].text,"어머님은 태성이가 무너질까 봐 걱정하셨고, 정후가 뒤에서 돕는다는 말도 하셨습니다.","Their mother worried Tae-seong might collapse, and she also said Jeong-hu was helping from behind.",お母様はテソンが崩れてしまうのではと心配し、ジョンフが裏で助けているとも話していました。,母亲担心泰成会垮掉，也说过正厚在背后帮忙。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v7].behaviorHint,태성이가 다칠까 봐 한 박자 늦게 답한다.,"She answers a beat late, worried Tae-seong may be hurt.",テソンが傷つくのを恐れ、一拍遅れて答える。,她怕泰成受伤，慢了一拍才回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v7].text,정후를 두둔하려는 건 아닙니다. 다만 어머님은 정후가 돈을 챙겼다고 말씀하셨습니다.,I am not trying to defend Jeong-hu. But their mother did say that Jeong-hu had looked after the money.,ジョンフをかばおうとしているわけではありません。ただ、お母様はジョンフがお金を面倒見ていたとおっしゃっていました。,我不是想替正厚说话。只是母亲说过，正厚一直在照应那笔钱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v8].behaviorHint,어머님 말을 떠올리며 시선이 흔들린다.,Her eyes waver as she recalls their mother's words.,お母様の言葉を思い出し、視線が揺れる。,她想起母亲的话，眼神动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v8].text,태성이에게 바로 말해 주고 싶지 않았습니다. 제가 말하면 친구로서 선을 넘는 것 같았습니다.,"I did not want to tell Tae-seong right away. If I said it, it felt like I would be crossing a line as his friend.",テソンにすぐ話したくはありませんでした。私が言えば、友人として一線を越えるように思えました。,我不想马上告诉泰成。我来说的话，像是作为朋友越过了界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v9].behaviorHint,감정과 책임 회피가 섞인 표정으로 답한다.,She answers with an expression mixed with emotion and avoidance of responsibility.,感情と責任逃れが混ざった表情で答える。,她带着情绪和逃避责任交织的表情回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v9].text,"어머님이 숨긴 이야기가 돈만은 아닌 듯했지만, 저는 그 부분은 일부러 깊이 묻지 않았습니다.","It felt as though the story their mother hid was not only about money, but I deliberately did not ask deeply about that part.",お母様が隠していた話はお金だけではないように感じましたが、私はその部分をあえて深く尋ねませんでした。,我感觉母亲隐瞒的事不只是钱，但那部分我故意没有深问。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v1].behaviorHint,태성이 쪽을 감싸려다 재판관 눈치를 본다.,"She tries to shield Tae-seong's side, then watches the Judge's reaction.",テソン側をかばおうとしてから、裁判官の顔色を見る。,她想护着泰成一边，又观察法官的脸色。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v1].text,어머님은 태성이 걱정을 자주 하셨습니다. 정후 이야기도 나오긴 했지만 저는 태성이 쪽 마음이 더 쓰였습니다.,"Their mother often worried about Tae-seong. Jeong-hu came up too, but my heart leaned more toward Tae-seong's side.",お母様はテソンのことをよく心配していました。ジョンフの話も出ましたが、私はテソン側の気持ちの方が気になりました。,母亲经常担心泰成。也提到过正厚，但我更挂心泰成那边的感受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v10].behaviorHint,끝내 말해야 한다는 듯 낮게 고백한다.,"She confesses quietly, as if she has no choice but to say it.",ついに言うしかないというように、低く告白する。,她低声坦白，像是终于不得不说出口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v10].text,"재판관님, 저는 친구로 들은 이야기만 압니다. 그래도 어머님 걱정이 가볍지는 않았습니다.","Judge, I only know what I heard as a friend. Still, their mother's worry was not light.",裁判官、私は友人として聞いた話だけを知っています。それでも、お母様の心配は軽いものではありませんでした。,法官，我只知道作为朋友听来的话。即便如此，母亲的担忧并不轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v2].behaviorHint,어머님 이야기에 감정이 올라와 목이 잠긴다.,"Emotion rises as she speaks of their mother, and her throat tightens.",お母様の話になると感情がこみ上げ、声が詰まる。,说到母亲时情绪涌上来，嗓子哽住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v2].text,두 아들 이야기가 나오면 어머님 얼굴이 복잡해졌습니다. 저는 오래된 친구로 그런 분위기를 기억합니다.,"When the two sons came up, their mother's face became complicated. As an old friend, I remember that mood.",二人の息子の話が出ると、お母様の表情は複雑になりました。私は古い友人として、その雰囲気を覚えています。,一提到两个儿子，母亲的脸色就变得复杂。作为老朋友，我记得那种气氛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v3].behaviorHint,정후를 말할 때는 조심하고 태성이를 말할 때는 부드러워진다.,She is careful when speaking of Jeong-hu and softens when speaking of Tae-seong.,ジョンフのことを話す時は慎重に、テソンのことを話す時は柔らかくなる。,说到正厚时她很谨慎，说到泰成时则变得柔和。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v3].text,태성이가 상처받을까 봐 어머님이 말을 아끼신 적은 있습니다. 자세한 건 조심스럽습니다.,There were times when their mother held back because she feared Tae-seong would be hurt. I must be careful about the details.,テソンが傷つくのを恐れて、お母様が言葉を控えたことはあります。詳しいことは慎重に申し上げたいです。,母亲曾因为怕泰成受伤而少说。细节我必须谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v4].behaviorHint,자기 책임으로 번질까 손수건을 만지작거린다.,"She fiddles with a handkerchief, afraid the responsibility may turn toward her.",自分の責任に及ぶのを恐れ、ハンカチをいじる。,她担心责任牵连到自己，摆弄着手帕。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v4].text,정후가 조용히 챙긴다는 말은 들은 적 있습니다. 다만 저는 직접 본 사람은 아닙니다.,I have heard that Jeong-hu quietly took care of things. But I did not see it myself.,ジョンフが静かに面倒を見ているという話は聞いたことがあります。ただ、私は直接見た人間ではありません。,我听说过正厚在默默照顾。不过我不是亲眼看到的人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v5].behaviorHint,친구로 들은 말이라며 계속 선을 긋는다.,"She keeps drawing a line, saying it was something she heard as a friend.",友人として聞いた話だと言いながら、何度も線を引く。,她不断划清界线，说那是以朋友身份听来的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v5].text,어머님이 돈 이야기와 자식 이야기를 섞어 하신 날들이 있었습니다. 금액은 말하지 않겠습니다.,There were days when their mother spoke of money and children together. I will not state the amount.,お母様がお金の話と子どもの話を混ぜて話した日がありました。金額は申し上げません。,母亲有些日子会把钱的事和孩子的事混在一起说。金额我不会说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v6].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬다 말끝을 흐리고 다시 정정한다.,"She searches her memory, trails off, then corrects herself.",記憶をたどり、語尾を濁してから言い直す。,她一边回想，一边把话尾含糊过去，又重新纠正。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v6].text,저는 태성이를 어릴 때부터 봐서 마음이 기웁니다. 그래서 더 조심해서 말씀드리겠습니다.,"I have known Tae-seong since he was young, so my heart leans toward him. That is why I will speak all the more carefully.",私はテソンを幼い頃から見てきたので、気持ちが傾きます。だからこそ、より慎重に申し上げます。,我从泰成小时候就看着他，所以心会偏向他。正因如此，我会更加谨慎地说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v7].behaviorHint,태성이가 다칠까 봐 한 박자 늦게 답한다.,"She answers a beat late, worried Tae-seong may be hurt.",テソンが傷つくのを恐れ、一拍遅れて答える。,她怕泰成受伤，慢了一拍才回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v7].text,어머님은 정후가 무심한 아이는 아니라고 하셨습니다. 그 말이 기억납니다.,Their mother said Jeong-hu was not a heartless child. I remember those words.,お母様は、ジョンフは無情な子ではないとおっしゃっていました。その言葉を覚えています。,母亲说正厚不是无情的孩子。我记得这句话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v8].behaviorHint,어머님 말을 떠올리며 시선이 흔들린다.,Her eyes waver as she recalls their mother's words.,お母様の言葉を思い出し、視線が揺れる。,她想起母亲的话，眼神动摇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v8].text,"태성이가 모르는 일이 많다는 식의 말씀은 있었지만, 저는 그때 깊이 캐묻지 않았습니다.","Their mother said things suggesting there was much Tae-seong did not know, but I did not press her deeply at the time.",テソンが知らないことが多い、というようなお話はありましたが、私はその時深く聞き出しませんでした。,母亲说过类似泰成不知道的事很多这样的话，但我当时没有深问。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v9].behaviorHint,감정과 책임 회피가 섞인 표정으로 답한다.,She answers with an expression mixed with emotion and avoidance of responsibility.,感情と責任逃れが混ざった表情で答える。,她带着情绪和逃避责任交织的表情回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,family-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v9].text,두 형제 사이에 어머님이 숨긴 말이 있다는 느낌은 받았습니다. 확정해서 말하긴 어렵습니다.,I felt that there were words their mother had hidden between the two brothers. It is hard to state that with certainty.,二人の兄弟の間に、お母様が隠した言葉があるようには感じました。確定して話すのは難しいです。,我感觉两个兄弟之间有母亲隐藏的话。但很难确定地说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[0].system.text,"치매 말기의 어머니가 남긴 유서 사본에는 차남 윤정후 60퍼센트, 장남 윤태성 40퍼센트가 적혀 있다. 어머니를 모시고 살았던 윤태성은 이 비율을 받아들일 수 없다며 재판을 신청했다.","The copy of the will left by their mother in late-stage dementia states 60 percent for the younger son, Yoon Jeong-hu, and 40 percent for the older son, Yoon Tae-seong. Yoon Tae-seong, who lived with and cared for his mother, filed for trial, saying he could not accept that ratio.",認知症末期の母が残した遺言書の写しには、次男ユン・ジョンフ60％、長男ユン・テソン40％と記されている。母を世話して同居していたユン・テソンは、この比率を受け入れられないとして裁判を申し立てた。,患有晚期痴呆的母亲留下的遗嘱副本中写着：小儿子尹正厚60%，大儿子尹泰成40%。一直照顾并与母亲同住的尹泰成表示无法接受这一比例，申请了审判。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[33].system.text,"60대 40 유서 사본, 요양원 방문기록, 전 요양보호사 음성증언까지 공개됐다. 윤정후는 어머니를 자주 찾은 사실은 인정하지만, 말년의 판단을 흔들었다는 의혹은 부인한다. 이제 심문을 통해 어머니가 정말 스스로 판단할 수 있었는지 확인해야 한다.","The 60:40 Will Copy, care home visit record, and Former Caregiver Audio Testimony have all been disclosed. Yoon Jeong-hu admits that he often visited his mother, but denies the suspicion that he swayed her judgment in her later years. The questioning must now confirm whether their mother was truly able to judge for herself.",60対40遺言書コピー、介護施設の訪問記録、元介護職員の音声証言まで公開された。ユン・ジョンフは母を頻繁に訪ねた事実は認めているが、晩年の判断を揺さぶったという疑惑は否定している。これから尋問を通じて、母が本当に自分で判断できたのかを確認しなければならない。,60:40遗嘱副本、疗养院探访记录、前护理员语音证言都已公开。尹正厚承认曾频繁探望母亲，但否认动摇母亲晚年判断的嫌疑。现在必须通过询问确认，母亲是否真的能够自主判断。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_ask_b].text,"윤정후 씨, 자주 찾아간 이유를 직접 설명하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, explain directly why you visited so often.",ユン・ジョンフさん、頻繁に訪ねた理由を直接説明してください。,尹正厚先生，请直接说明您频繁探望的理由。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_calm].text,양측 모두 진정하십시오. 순서대로 듣겠습니다.,"Both sides, please calm down. I will hear you in order.",双方とも落ち着いてください。順番に聞きます。,双方都请冷静。我会按顺序听取。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_hear_a].text,"윤태성 씨, 그렇게 의심하게 된 근거를 더 말씀하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Tae-seong, please say more about what led you to suspect that.",ユン・テソンさん、そのように疑うようになった根拠をもう少し話してください。,尹泰成先生，请再说明您这样怀疑的依据。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_move_on].text,"태도 평가는 접고, 확인된 사실부터 보겠습니다.",Set aside the assessment of attitude; we will begin with confirmed facts.,態度の評価は置いて、確認された事実から見ます。,先放下对态度的评价，从已确认的事实开始看。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_press_b].text,"윤정후 씨, 지금처럼 짧게 답하면 의심만 커집니다. 분명하게 말씀하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if you keep answering this briefly, suspicion will only grow. Speak clearly.",ユン・ジョンフさん、今のように短く答えるだけでは疑いが深まるだけです。はっきり話してください。,尹正厚先生，如果您继续这样简短回答，只会让怀疑加深。请说清楚。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_protect_b].text,"윤정후 씨, 바로 답하기 어렵다면 천천히 정리해서 말씀하십시오.","Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu, if it is difficult to answer right away, take your time and organize your thoughts.",ユン・ジョンフさん、すぐ答えるのが難しければ、ゆっくり整理して話してください。,尹正厚先生，如果现在难以回答，请慢慢整理后再说。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_defer].text,"지금은 단정하지 말고, 이 부분은 심문에서 확인하겠습니다.",Do not draw a conclusion now; I will confirm this point in questioning.,今は断定せず、この部分は尋問で確認します。,现在先不要断定，这部分将在询问中确认。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_evidence_first].text,우선 공개된 증거부터 차례로 보겠습니다.,"First, we will examine the disclosed evidence in order.",まず、公開された証拠から順に見ます。,首先按顺序查看已公开的证据。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,family-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_state_first].text,"비율보다 먼저, 말년의 어머니 상태를 각자 어떻게 봤는지 듣겠습니다.","Before the ratio, I will hear how each side viewed the mother's condition in her later years.",比率より先に、晩年のお母様の状態をそれぞれどう見ていたのかを聞きます。,在比例之前，先听听各方如何看待母亲晚年的状态。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-1].description,윤정후가 어머니에게 종이를 읽어드리고 형이 오기 전 마치려 한 정황을 분리해 본다.,Separate the circumstances in which Yoon Jeong-hu read the paper to his mother and tried to finish before his brother arrived.,ユン・ジョンフが母に紙を読み聞かせ、兄が来る前に終わらせようとした状況を切り分けて見る。,分开查看尹正厚把纸读给母亲听，并试图在哥哥到来前结束的情形。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-1].label,종이를 읽어드린 장면,Scene of Reading the Paper,紙を読み聞かせた場面,读纸的场景,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-2].description,동기가 무엇이든 어머니 문서에 손댄 책임을 확인한다.,"Confirm responsibility for handling the mother's document, regardless of motive.",動機が何であれ、母の書類に手を加えた責任を確認する。,无论动机是什么，都确认动过母亲文件的责任。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-2].label,위조 책임,Responsibility for Forgery,偽造責任,伪造责任,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-3].description,돈을 말하지 않은 침묵이 보호였는지 기만이었는지 확인한다.,Confirm whether the silence about the money was protection or deception.,お金を語らなかった沈黙が、保護だったのか欺きだったのかを確認する。,确认没有说出钱的沉默，是保护还是欺骗。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-3].label,형의 체면과 침묵,The Older Brother's Pride and Silence,兄の面子と沈黙,哥哥的体面与沉默,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-4].description,민감한 가족 사정이 유서 변경 판단과 어떻게 이어졌는지 묻는다.,Ask how the sensitive family circumstances connected to the judgment behind the will change.,敏感な家族事情が、遺言書変更の判断とどうつながったのかを問う。,询问敏感的家庭情况如何与遗嘱变更判断相连。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-4].label,유서 변경과 연결,Connection to the Will Change,遺言書変更とのつながり,与遗嘱变更的关联,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-5].description,한쪽 악역 구도가 아니라 서로 다른 방식의 책임을 함께 정리한다.,"Sort out the brothers' different forms of responsibility together, not as a one-sided villain structure.",一方だけを悪役にする構図ではなく、異なる形の責任を合わせて整理する。,不是单方恶人结构，而是一起整理双方不同形式的责任。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,family-01,angles[d-5].label,두 형제의 공동 책임,Shared Responsibility of the Two Brothers,二人の兄弟の共同責任,两兄弟的共同责任,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-paper-reading].behaviorHint,조심스럽게,cautiously,慎重に,谨慎地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-paper-reading].question,문서를 읽어주는 장면을 본 적 있습니까?,Have you ever seen a scene where a document was read to her?,書類を読み聞かせる場面を見たことはありますか。,您见过把文件读给她听的场景吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-paper-reading].testimony,"네, 종이 읽어드리는 건 몇 번 봤습니다. 그 장면만 놓고 보면 저도 좀 신경 쓰이긴 했어요.","Yes, I saw papers being read to her a few times. Looking only at that scene, it did make me a bit uneasy too.",はい、紙を読み聞かせるところは何度か見ました。その場面だけで見ると、私も少し気になりました。,是的，我见过几次把纸读给她听。只看那个场景，我也有点在意。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-paper-reading].topic,문서를 읽어주는 장면을 묻는다,Ask about the scene where a document was read to her,書類を読み聞かせる場面を尋ねる,询问把文件读给她听的场景,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-visit-comfort].behaviorHint,담담하게,calmly,淡々と,平静地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-visit-comfort].question,둘째 아들이 찾아오면 어머니 반응이 어땠습니까?,How did the mother react when the second son visited?,次男が訪ねてくると、母の反応はどうでしたか。,二儿子来探望时，母亲反应如何？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-visit-comfort].testimony,그분 오시면 표정이 조금 풀리긴 했어요. 그래서 저는 처음엔 반가운 사람인가 보다 했습니다.,"When he came, her expression did soften a little. So at first I thought he must be someone she was glad to see.",その方が来ると、表情が少し和らぎました。だから私は最初、会えてうれしい人なのだろうと思いました。,那位一来，她的表情确实会稍微放松。所以我一开始以为他是她想见的人。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-visit-comfort].topic,둘째 아들 방문 때 반응을 묻는다,Ask about the mother's reaction when the second son visited,次男の訪問時の反応を尋ねる,询问二儿子来访时的反应,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-before-brother-arrives].behaviorHint,신중하게 고르며,choosing carefully,慎重に選びながら,谨慎斟酌地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-before-brother-arrives].question,"종이를 읽어드리던 날, 윤정후 씨가 따로 한 말이 있었습니까?","On the day he read the paper to her, did Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu say anything separately?",紙を読み聞かせていた日、ユン・ジョンフさんが別に何か言ったことはありましたか。,读纸给她听的那天，尹正厚先生另外说过什么吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-before-brother-arrives].testimony,"있었습니다. 윤정후 씨가 “형님 오시기 전에 마무리하자”고 했어요. 다만 그 말은 욕심이라기보다, 그날 또 큰소리 날까 봐 조심하는 느낌에 가까웠습니다.","Yes. Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu said, “Let's finish before my older brother arrives.” But it felt less like greed and more like caution, as if he feared voices would rise again that day.",ありました。ユン・ジョンフさんが「兄さんが来る前に終わらせよう」と言いました。ただ、その言葉は欲というより、その日また大きな声が出るのを避けようとする感じに近かったです。,有。尹正厚先生说过：“在哥哥来之前结束吧。”不过那句话与其说是贪心，不如说更像是担心那天又会有大声争吵而小心。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-before-brother-arrives].topic,마무리하자는 말의 맥락을 묻는다,Ask the context of the remark about finishing,終わらせようという言葉の文脈を尋ねる,询问“结束吧”这句话的语境,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-clarity-fluctuation].behaviorHint,사실만 정리하듯,as if organizing only the facts,事実だけを整理するように,像是在整理事实,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-clarity-fluctuation].question,반가워했다는 것과 판단이 가능했다는 건 다른 문제입니다. 상태는 어땠습니까?,Being glad to see someone and being capable of judgment are different matters. What was her condition?,喜んでいたことと、判断が可能だったことは別問題です。状態はどうでしたか。,高兴见到对方和能够判断是两回事。她的状态如何？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-clarity-fluctuation].testimony,"맞습니다. 어떤 날은 제 질문에도 또박또박 답했고, 어떤 날은 손을 잡아도 멍하셨습니다. 늘 또렷했다고는 못 하겠어요.","That is right. Some days she answered my questions clearly, and some days she seemed dazed even when I held her hand. I cannot say she was always clear.",その通りです。ある日は私の質問にもはっきり答え、ある日は手を握ってもぼんやりしていました。いつもはっきりしていたとは言えません。,没错。有些日子她能清楚回答我的问题，有些日子即使握住她的手也发愣。不能说她一直清醒。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-clarity-fluctuation].topic,상태가 일정했는지 묻는다,Ask whether her condition was consistent,状態が一定だったのかを尋ねる,询问状态是否稳定,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d3-avoid-conflict].behaviorHint,조심스럽지만 분명하게,cautious but clear,慎重だがはっきりと,谨慎但明确地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d3-avoid-conflict].question,"증인 기준으로 답하십시오. 그 과정은 어머니를 몰아간 장면이었습니까, 다툼을 피하려는 장면이었습니까?","Answer from your standpoint as a witness. Was that process a scene of driving the mother into something, or a scene of avoiding conflict?",証人の立場から答えてください。その過程は、母を追い込む場面でしたか。それとも争いを避けようとする場面でしたか。,请从证人的角度回答。那个过程是在逼迫母亲，还是在避免争吵？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d3-avoid-conflict].testimony,"제가 옆에서 본 바로는 다툼을 피하려는 쪽이었습니다. 형님이 오시면 실제로 말소리가 커졌고, 그때마다 어머님이 어깨를 움츠리셨어요. 그래서 저는 둘째 아들이 어머니를 이용했다기보다, 겁먹지 않게 끝내려 한 걸로 봤습니다.","From what I saw beside them, it was closer to avoiding conflict. When the older brother came, voices really did get louder, and each time their mother hunched her shoulders. So I saw the second son less as using his mother and more as trying to finish before she became frightened.",私がそばで見た限りでは、争いを避ける方でした。お兄様が来ると実際に声が大きくなり、そのたびにお母様は肩をすくめていました。だから私は、次男が母を利用したというより、怖がらせないよう終わらせようとしたのだと見ました。,就我在旁边看到的情况，更接近于避免争吵。哥哥一来，声音确实会变大，每次母亲都会缩起肩膀。所以我觉得二儿子与其说利用母亲，不如说是想在她害怕之前结束。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d3-avoid-conflict].topic,그 과정의 실제 분위기를 묻는다,Ask about the actual atmosphere of the process,その過程の実際の雰囲気を尋ねる,询问那个过程的实际气氛,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-document-balance].behaviorHint,차분하게,calmly,落ち着いて,冷静地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-document-balance].question,처음 가져온 서류와 다시 가져온 서류의 인상이 달랐습니까?,Did the first document brought in and the document brought in again give different impressions?,最初に持ち込まれた書類と、再び持ち込まれた書類の印象は違いましたか。,最初带来的文件和后来再次带来的文件，印象有不同吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-document-balance].testimony,"달랐습니다. 처음 것은 한쪽으로 많이 기운 느낌이었고, 다시 낸 것은 그보다 조금 균형 잡혀 보였어요.","They did. The first one felt heavily tilted to one side, and the one submitted again looked a little more balanced.",違いました。最初のものはかなり一方に偏っている印象で、出し直されたものはそれより少し均衡が取れて見えました。,有不同。第一份感觉很偏向一边，重新提交的那份看起来比它稍微平衡一些。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-document-balance].topic,두 서류의 인상을 묻는다,Ask about the impression of the two documents,二つの書類の印象を尋ねる,询问两份文件的印象,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-two-visits].behaviorHint,업무적으로 정확하게,professionally and precisely,業務的に正確に,业务性而准确地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-two-visits].question,그날 같은 사람이 두 번 찾아온 일이 있었습니까?,Did the same person come to the office twice that day?,その日、同じ人が二度訪ねてきたことはありましたか。,那天同一个人来过两次吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-two-visits].testimony,"네, 같은 분이 같은 날 두 번 오셔서 기억합니다. 흔한 일은 아닙니다.","Yes. The same person came twice on the same day, so I remember it. It is not common.",はい。同じ方が同じ日に二度来られたので覚えています。よくあることではありません。,是的。同一个人在同一天来了两次，所以我记得。这并不常见。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-two-visits].topic,같은 날 두 번 온 사실을 묻는다,Ask whether the same person came twice on the same day,同じ日に二度来た事実を尋ねる,询问同一天来过两次的事实,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-ratio-change].behaviorHint,분명하게,clearly,はっきりと,明确地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-ratio-change].question,그 차이를 숫자로 설명하십시오. 어떻게 바뀌었습니까?,Explain that difference in numbers. How did it change?,その違いを数字で説明してください。どう変わりましたか。,请用数字说明那个差异。是如何改变的？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-ratio-change].testimony,"첫 서류는 윤정후 90, 윤태성 10이었고, 두 번째는 윤정후 60, 윤태성 40으로 바뀌었습니다. 숫자만 보면 자기 몫을 줄여서 다시 낸 셈이었습니다.","The first document was Yoon Jeong-hu 90 and Yoon Tae-seong 10. The second changed to Yoon Jeong-hu 60 and Yoon Tae-seong 40. Looking only at the numbers, he had resubmitted it after reducing his own share.",最初の書類はユン・ジョンフ90、ユン・テソン10で、二つ目はユン・ジョンフ60、ユン・テソン40に変わっていました。数字だけを見ると、自分の取り分を減らして出し直したことになります。,第一份文件是尹正厚90、尹泰成10，第二份变成尹正厚60、尹泰成40。只看数字，就是减少了自己的份额后重新提交。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-ratio-change].topic,비율이 어떻게 바뀌었는지 묻는다,Ask how the ratio changed,比率がどう変わったのかを尋ねる,询问比例如何变化,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-same-submitter].behaviorHint,기억이 선명하다는 듯,as if the memory is clear,記憶が鮮明であるかのように,像是记忆很清晰,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-same-submitter].question,두 번 다 누가 접수창구에 섰습니까?,Who stood at the reception desk both times?,二度とも誰が受付窓口に立ちましたか。,两次都是谁站在受理窗口？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-same-submitter].testimony,두 번 다 윤정후 씨가 접수창구에 서셨습니다. 서류를 도로 챙겨갔다가 다시 가져오신 것도 그분이었습니다.,Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu stood at the reception desk both times. He was also the one who took the documents back and brought them again.,二度ともユン・ジョンフさんが受付窓口に立ちました。書類をいったん持ち帰り、また持ってこられたのもその方です。,两次都是尹正厚先生站在受理窗口。把文件拿回去后又带回来的人也是他。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-same-submitter].topic,누가 다시 제출했는지 묻는다,Ask who resubmitted it,誰が再提出したのかを尋ねる,询问是谁重新提交的,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d3-benefit-direction].behaviorHint,신중하지만 또렷하게,cautious but distinct,慎重だが明瞭に,谨慎但清楚地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d3-benefit-direction].question,그 변경을 보고 증인께서는 누구 이익 쪽으로 움직인 수정이라고 판단했습니까?,"When you saw that change, whose interest did you think the revision moved toward?",その変更を見て、証人は誰の利益の方向に動いた修正だと判断しましたか。,看到那个变更时，证人认为那是朝谁的利益方向进行的修改？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d3-benefit-direction].testimony,"적어도 자기 몫을 늘리려는 수정은 아니었습니다. 접수창구에서 본 결과만 놓고 말하면, 윤정후 씨가 자기 비율을 90에서 60으로 낮춘 문서를 다시 낸 겁니다. 그래서 저는 그날의 수정이 탐욕 쪽이라기보다, 형이 받을 충격을 좀 줄여보려는 조정처럼 보였습니다.","At least it was not a revision meant to increase his own share. Speaking only from what I saw at the reception desk, Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu resubmitted a document lowering his ratio from 90 to 60. So to me, that day's revision looked less like greed and more like an adjustment to reduce the shock his brother would receive.",少なくとも、自分の取り分を増やす修正ではありませんでした。受付窓口で見た結果だけで言えば、ユン・ジョンフさんが自分の比率を90から60に下げた書類を出し直したのです。だから私は、その日の修正は欲というより、兄が受ける衝撃を少し減らそうとする調整のように見えました。,至少那不是为了增加自己份额的修改。只从受理窗口看到的结果来说，尹正厚先生重新提交了把自己比例从90降到60的文件。所以在我看来，那天的修改与其说是贪心，不如说像是想稍微减轻哥哥受到的冲击的一种调整。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d3-benefit-direction].topic,수정이 누구 이익 방향이었는지 묻는다,Ask whose interest the revision moved toward,修正が誰の利益の方向だったのかを尋ねる,询问修改朝谁的利益方向变化,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-living-support].behaviorHint,차분히 떠올리며,recalling calmly,落ち着いて思い出しながら,平静回想地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-living-support].question,어머니가 정기적으로 들어오는 돈에 대해 하신 말이 있었습니까?,Did the mother say anything about money coming in regularly?,母は定期的に入ってくるお金について何か話していましたか。,母亲有没有说过定期进来的钱？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-living-support].testimony,돈 걱정을 오래 하셨습니다. 그래도 작은아들이 달마다 보내주는 돈이 있어서 버틴다고 하신 적은 있어요.,"She worried about money for a long time. Still, she once said she was getting by because the younger son sent money every month.",お金の心配は長くしていました。それでも、次男が毎月送ってくれるお金があるから持ちこたえている、と言ったことはあります。,她长期担心钱。不过她说过，因为小儿子每个月寄来的钱，才能撑下去。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-living-support].topic,정기 지원금 사정을 묻는다,Ask about the regular support money,定期支援金の事情を尋ねる,询问定期支援金的情况,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-secret-burden].behaviorHint,낮게 말하며,speaking low,低く話しながら,低声地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-secret-burden].question,어머니가 큰아들이 몰라야 한다고 한 일이 있었습니까?,Did the mother say there was something the older son must not know?,母は、長男が知らないでいなければならないことがあると言っていましたか。,母亲有没有说过，有件事大儿子不能知道？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-secret-burden].testimony,있었습니다. 어떤 일은 그 아들이 끝까지 몰라야 한다고 몇 번 말씀하셨어요. 말할 때마다 표정이 많이 무거웠습니다.,"Yes. She said several times that some matter had to remain unknown to that son until the end. Each time she said it, her expression was very heavy.",ありました。あることは、その息子が最後まで知らないでいなければならないと何度かおっしゃいました。そう話すたびに、表情はとても重かったです。,有。她说过好几次，有件事那个儿子必须到最后都不知道。每次说起时，她的表情都很沉重。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-secret-burden].topic,큰아들이 몰라야 한다는 말을 묻는다,Ask about the remark that the older son must not know,長男が知らないでいなければならないという言葉を尋ねる,询问“大儿子不能知道”的话,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-money-nature].behaviorHint,분명히 기억나는 부분만 짚으며,pointing only to what she clearly remembers,はっきり覚えている部分だけを指摘しながら,只指出清楚记得的部分,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-money-nature].question,그 돈이 어떤 성격이라고 들었습니까? 누가 누구를 돕는 돈이었습니까?,What did you hear that money was for? Who was helping whom with it?,そのお金はどういう性質のものだと聞きましたか。誰が誰を助けるお金でしたか。,您听说那笔钱是什么性质？是谁在帮助谁的钱？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-money-nature].testimony,윤정후 씨가 어머니 통장으로 달마다 보내는 돈이라고 들었습니다. 그리고 3억원이 나갈 때는 “태성이 공장 쪽으로 보내는 돈”이라고 어머니가 직접 말씀하셨어요.,"I heard it was money Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu sent every month to his mother's account. And when ₩300 million went out, their mother said directly that it was “money being sent toward Tae-seong's factory.”",ユン・ジョンフさんがお母様の口座に毎月送っていたお金だと聞きました。そして3億ウォンが出ていく時には、「テソンの工場の方へ送るお金」だとお母様が直接おっしゃいました。,我听说那是尹正厚先生每个月汇到母亲账户的钱。还有3亿韩元转出去时，母亲亲口说那是“送到泰成工厂那边的钱”。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-money-nature].topic,그 돈의 성격을 묻는다,Ask about the nature of that money,そのお金の性質を尋ねる,询问那笔钱的性质,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-secret-reason].behaviorHint,조심스럽게,cautiously,慎重に,谨慎地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-secret-reason].question,큰아들이 몰라야 한다고 한 이유를 들은 게 있습니까?,Did you hear why the older son had to be kept from knowing?,長男が知らないでいなければならない理由を聞いたことはありますか。,您听过为什么不能让大儿子知道吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-secret-reason].testimony,"어머니가 정확한 말은 아끼셨지만, “태성이는 그 사실 알면 사람 무너진다”고 했어요. 그리고 “정후가 그 짐을 혼자 진다”는 말도 했습니다.","Their mother avoided exact words, but she said, “If Tae-seong learns that fact, it will break him.” She also said, “Jeong-hu is carrying that burden alone.”",お母様は正確な言葉を避けましたが、「テソンはその事実を知れば崩れてしまう」と言っていました。そして「ジョンフがその荷を一人で背負っている」とも話しました。,母亲没有说得很明确，但她说过：“泰成如果知道那个事实，人会垮掉。”还说过：“正厚一个人背着那个负担。”,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-secret-reason].topic,왜 숨겨야 한다고 했는지 묻는다,Ask why it had to be hidden,なぜ隠さなければならなかったのかを尋ねる,询问为什么必须隐瞒,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d3-why-kept-secret].behaviorHint,"무겁게, 그러나 흔들림 없이","heavily, but without wavering",重く、しかし揺らがずに,沉重但不动摇地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d3-why-kept-secret].question,"증인이 들은 말을 종합하면, 윤정후 씨가 왜 그 비밀을 숨겼다고 보십니까?","Considering everything you heard, why do you think Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu hid that secret?",証人が聞いたことを総合すると、ユン・ジョンフさんはなぜその秘密を隠したのだと思いますか。,综合证人听到的话，您认为尹正厚先生为什么隐藏那个秘密？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d3-why-kept-secret].testimony,"유산 더 받으려고 숨긴 사람 말투가 아니었습니다. 어머니가 먼저 “태성이는 끝까지 몰라야 한다”고 붙잡았고, 윤정후 씨는 그 말대로 형이 무너지지 않게 막는 쪽이었어요. 그래서 저는 이 집안의 중심이 돈다툼보다 출생 비밀과 죄책감에 더 가까웠다고 봅니다.","It was not the tone of a person hiding it to receive more inheritance. Their mother was the first to insist, “Tae-seong must never know,” and Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu was acting to keep his brother from collapsing, just as she asked. So I saw the center of this family as closer to a birth secret and guilt than to a fight over money.",遺産を多く受け取るために隠した人の口ぶりではありませんでした。お母様が先に「テソンには最後まで知らせてはいけない」と引き留め、ユン・ジョンフさんはその言葉どおり、兄が崩れないように防ぐ側でした。だから私は、この家の中心はお金争いより、出生の秘密と罪悪感に近いものだと見ています。,那不是为了多拿遗产而隐瞒的人的语气。母亲先抓着他说“泰成必须到最后都不知道”，尹正厚先生则是照那句话，站在防止哥哥崩溃的一边。所以我认为这个家的中心，比起争钱，更接近于出生秘密和罪恶感。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/family-01.ts,family-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d3-why-kept-secret].topic,윤정후 씨가 왜 비밀을 숨겼는지 묻는다,Ask why Mr. Yoon Jeong-hu hid the secret,ユン・ジョンフさんがなぜ秘密を隠したのかを尋ねる,询问尹正厚先生为什么隐藏秘密,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
