case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.meta.sourceLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].meta.sourceLabel,송다은 측,Song Da-eun's Side,ソン・ダウン側,宋多恩一方,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.meta.stageLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].meta.stageLabel,초기 공개,Initial Disclosure,初期開示,初步公开,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
