case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].name,최수민→예비신랑 연락 기록,Choi Su-min → Fiancé Contact Logs,チェ・スミン→婚約者の連絡記録,崔秀敏→未婚夫联系记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.a.implication,집착으로 보이는 첫인상을 확인한다.,Confirm the first impression that the contact looked obsessive.,執着に見える第一印象を確認する。,确认其看起来像执着联系的第一印象。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 연락 기록을 보고 어떤 생각이 들었습니까?,What did you think when you saw these contact logs?,この連絡記録を見て、どう思いましたか？,你看到这份联系记录时有什么想法？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.b.implication,연락 의도를 설명할 기회를 준다.,Give an opportunity to explain the intent behind the contact.,連絡の意図を説明する機会を与える。,给予解释联系意图的机会。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].partyContext.b.questionAngle,왜 이렇게까지 연락했는지 설명해 주십시오.,Please explain why you contacted him this persistently.,なぜここまで連絡したのか説明してください。,请说明为什么联系到这种程度。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.surfaceDescription,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].surfaceDescription,최수민 씨가 예비신랑에게 보낸 연락 기록이 존재한다.,There are contact logs from Choi Su-min to the fiancé.,チェ・スミン氏が婚約者に送った連絡記録が存在する。,存在崔秀敏发给未婚夫的联系记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
