case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,다은 관련 사유와 과거 반복 암시 확인,Confirm reasons related to Da-eun and hints of past repetition,ダウン関連の理由と過去の反復の示唆を確認,确认与多恩有关的理由及旧事重演的暗示,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_established_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,연락 의도를 경고 가능성까지 놓고 판단한다.,"Judge the intent behind the contact, including the possibility that it was a warning.",警告だった可能性も含めて、連絡の意図を判断する。,结合其可能是警告的情况，判断联系意图。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_excerpt_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,발신 횟수와 부재중 중심으로 보임,Shows mainly outgoing-call counts and missed calls,発信回数と不在着信を中心に見える,主要显示拨出次数和未接记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_original_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,일부 문자 원문으로 사적 연락 오해를 낮춤,Some original texts reduce the likelihood of a private-contact misunderstanding,一部のメッセージ原文により、私的な連絡という誤解が弱まる,部分短信原文降低了私人联系的误解可能,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.v3DepthPlan_stub_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].v3DepthPlan[stub].summary,연락 기록 존재만 보임,Only the existence of contact logs is shown,連絡記録の存在のみが見える,仅显示存在联系记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
