case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerData.log.pages_2_.rows_12_.typeLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerData.log.pages[2].rows[12].typeLabel,발신,Outgoing,発信,拨出,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerData.log.pages_2_.rows_13_.duration,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerData.log.pages[2].rows[13].duration,"""차단하셨나 봐요. 다은이를 끌어들이고 싶지 않았는데 미안해요""","""I guess you blocked me. I’m sorry—I didn’t want to drag Da-eun into this.""",「ブロックされたみたいですね。ダウンを巻き込みたくなかったのに、すみません」,“看来你把我拉黑了。对不起，我本来不想把多恩牵扯进来的。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerData.log.pages_2_.rows_13_.target,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerData.log.pages[2].rows[13].target,김태윤,Kim Tae-yun,キム・テユン,金泰允,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
