case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerData.log.pages_2_.rows_2_.duration,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerData.log.pages[2].rows[2].duration,"""지난번에 제게 선 넘는 농담을 한 걸 따지려는 게 아니에요. 다른 얘기예요""","""I’m not trying to confront you about the inappropriate joke you made to me last time. This is about something else.""",「前に私へ一線を越えた冗談を言った件を問いただしたいわけではありません。別の話です」,“我不是要追究你上次对我开过越界玩笑的事。这是另一件事。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
