case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.1.log.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.1.log.note,1쪽은 발신 횟수와 부재중 중심의 발췌다. 이 단계만으로는 최수민이 예비신랑에게 반복 연락한 사실만 보인다.,"Page 1 is an excerpt focused on outgoing-call counts and missed calls. At this stage, it only shows that Choi Su-min repeatedly contacted the fiancé.",1ページ目は、発信回数と不在着信を中心にした抜粋だ。この段階だけでは、チェ・スミンが婚約者に繰り返し連絡した事実だけが見える。,第1页是以拨出次数和未接记录为主的摘录。仅凭这一阶段，只能看出崔秀敏曾反复联系未婚夫。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
