case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.2.log.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.2.log.note,"2쪽은 일부 원문을 복원한다. 최수민이 태윤과의 사적인 문제를 따지려는 연락은 아닌 듯하지만, 정확한 목적은 아직 봉인되어 있다.","Page 2 restores some of the original text. Choi Su-min’s contact does not seem to be about confronting Tae-yun over a private matter, but the exact purpose remains sealed.",2ページ目では原文の一部が復元される。チェ・スミンがテユンとの私的な問題を問いただそうとした連絡ではなさそうだが、正確な目的はまだ封印されている。,第2页恢复了部分原文。崔秀敏的联系似乎并不是为了追问她与泰允之间的私人问题，但准确目的仍被封存。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.2.log.pages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.2.log.pages[0].label,1쪽 발신 빈도,Page 1: Outgoing Frequency,1ページ：発信頻度,第1页：拨出频率,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.2.log.pages_0_.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.2.log.pages[0].note,1쪽은 발신 횟수와 부재중 중심의 발췌다. 이 단계만으로는 최수민이 예비신랑에게 반복 연락한 사실만 보인다.,"Page 1 is an excerpt focused on outgoing-call counts and missed calls. At this stage, it only shows that Choi Su-min repeatedly contacted the fiancé.",1ページ目は、発信回数と不在着信を中心にした抜粋だ。この段階だけでは、チェ・スミンが婚約者に繰り返し連絡した事実だけが見える。,第1页是以拨出次数和未接记录为主的摘录。仅凭这一阶段，只能看出崔秀敏曾反复联系未婚夫。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
