case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.3.log.pages_1_.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.3.log.pages[1].note,"2쪽은 일부 원문을 복원한다. 최수민이 태윤과의 사적인 문제를 따지려는 연락은 아닌 듯하지만, 정확한 목적은 아직 봉인되어 있다.","Page 2 restores some of the original text. Choi Su-min’s contact does not seem to be about confronting Tae-yun over a private matter, but the exact purpose remains sealed.",2ページ目では原文の一部が復元される。チェ・スミンがテユンとの私的な問題を問いただそうとした連絡ではなさそうだが、正確な目的はまだ封印されている。,第2页恢复了部分原文。崔秀敏的联系似乎并不是为了追问她与泰允之间的私人问题，但准确目的仍被封存。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
