case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.3.log.pages_1_.title,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.3.log.pages[1].title,최수민→예비신랑 연락 기록,Choi Su-min → Fiancé Contact Logs,チェ・スミン→婚約者の連絡記録,崔秀敏→未婚夫联系记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.3.log.pages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.3.log.pages[2].label,3쪽 다은 관련 사유,Page 3: Reason Related to Da-eun,3ページ：ダウン関連の理由,第3页：与多恩有关的理由,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-1_.viewerDataByStage.3.log.pages_2_.note,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-1].viewerDataByStage.3.log.pages[2].note,"3쪽 전체 원문에서는 “다은이 관련 이야기”, “예전에 같은 일” 같은 문구가 반복된다. 연락 의도는 예비신랑과 수민 사이의 감정 문제가 아니라 다른 사안으로 보인다.","Across the full original text on Page 3, phrases like “a matter related to Da-eun” and “the same thing happened before” repeat. The intent behind the contact appears to involve another issue, not an emotional matter between the fiancé and Su-min.",3ページ目の原文全体では、「ダウンに関する話」「以前にも同じことがあった」といった文言が繰り返される。連絡の意図は、婚約者とスミンの感情問題ではなく別の事案に見える。,第3页完整原文中反复出现“与多恩有关的事”“以前也发生过同样的事”等表述。联系意图看起来不是未婚夫与秀敏之间的感情问题，而是另有事项。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
