case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].description,"송다은이 '수민이가 또 내 남자한테 연락한다'고 올렸고, 몇몇 친구들이 최수민을 비난한 내용.","Song Da-eun posted, “Su-min is contacting my man again,” and several friends criticized Choi Su-min.",ソン・ダウンが「スミンがまた私の男に連絡している」と投稿し、何人かの友人がチェ・スミンを非難した内容。,宋多恩发出“秀敏又联系我的男人了”的内容，几名朋友随后批评了崔秀敏。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.check_metadata,"두 번째 페이지에서 공통 친구들이 직접 확인 전 발언에 동조하고, 일부는 확인 필요성을 제기했음이 보인다.","Page 2 shows mutual friends agreeing with the claim before direct confirmation, while some raise the need to verify it.",2ページ目では、共通の友人たちが直接確認する前の発言に同調し、一部は確認の必要性を指摘していることが見える。,第二页显示，共同朋友在直接确认前附和了该发言，也有人提出需要确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.request_original,"단톡방 첫 페이지에서 송다은이 최수민의 연락을 ""또 내 남자에게 연락""으로 단정하며 올린 정황이 확인된다.","The first page of the group chat confirms that Song Da-eun posted Choi Su-min’s contact as “contacting my man again,” presenting it as a settled conclusion.",グループチャットの1ページ目で、ソン・ダウンがチェ・スミンの連絡を「また私の男に連絡」と決めつけて投稿した状況が確認される。,群聊第一页显示，宋多恩将崔秀敏的联系定性为“又联系我的男人”，并这样发到了群里。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].investigationResults.restore_context,세 번째 페이지의 원본 대조로 송다은이 최수민에게 직접 묻기 전에 단톡방에 먼저 공유했다는 시간 순서가 확인된다.,Comparison with the original text on Page 3 confirms the timeline: Song Da-eun shared it in the group chat before asking Choi Su-min directly.,3ページ目の原文照合により、ソン・ダウンがチェ・スミンに直接尋ねる前にグループチャットへ先に共有したという時間順が確認される。,通过第三页原文对照，可以确认时间顺序：宋多恩在直接询问崔秀敏之前，先分享到群聊。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
