case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[1].label,확산대조,Spread Check,拡散照合,传播核对,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
