case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].investigationStages[2].label,책임추궁,Accountability Check,責任追及,责任追问,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
