case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerData.chat.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerData.chat.messages[1].text,"다은아, 수민이가 왜 연락했는지는 확인한 거야? 혹시 태윤이가 먼저 연락한 건 아니고?","Da-eun, did you check why Su-min contacted him? Are you sure Tae-yun didn’t contact her first?",ダウン、スミンがなぜ連絡したのか確認したの？ もしかしてテユンが先に連絡したんじゃないの？,多恩，你确认过秀敏为什么联系他了吗？会不会是泰允先联系她的？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
