case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerData.chat.pages_0_.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerData.chat.pages[0].messages[1].text,얘들아 나 진짜 손 떨려. 방금 태윤이 폰 알림을 봤는데 수민이 이름이 계속 떠 있었어.,"Guys, my hands are actually shaking. I just saw Tae-yun’s phone notifications, and Su-min’s name kept popping up.",みんな、私ほんとに手が震えてる。さっきテユンのスマホ通知を見たんだけど、スミンの名前がずっと出てたの。,姐妹们，我手真的在抖。我刚看到泰允手机的通知，秀敏的名字一直跳出来。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
