case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerData.chat.pages_0_.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerData.chat.pages[0].messages[2].text,나한테는 아무 말도 안 해놓고 왜 내 예비신랑한테만 연락하는지 모르겠어.,She didn’t say anything to me. I don’t know why she’s only contacting my fiancé.,私には何も言わないで、どうして私の婚約者にだけ連絡するのかわからない。,她什么都没跟我说，却只联系我的未婚夫，我真不知道为什么。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
