case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerData.chat.pages_1_.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[2].text,수민이는 선 넘는 걸 본인이 잘 모르는 것 같아. 예전에도 분위기 이상하게 만들었잖아.,I don’t think Su-min realizes when she crosses the line. She made things weird before too.,スミンは、自分が一線を越えていることにあまり気づいていないみたい。前にも空気を変にしたじゃない。,秀敏好像不太知道自己什么时候越界。以前也把气氛弄得很怪。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
