case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerData.chat.pages_1_.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[3].text,나도 그래서 더 화가 나. 이번에는 그냥 넘어가면 안 될 것 같아.,That’s why I’m even angrier. I don’t think we can just let it slide this time.,だから私も余計に腹が立つ。今回はそのまま流しちゃいけないと思う。,所以我才更生气。这次不能就这么算了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
