case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerData.chat.pages_1_.messages_7_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[7].text,그래도 직접 확인은 해야 하지 않아? 캡처만으로는 앞뒤를 모르잖아.,"Still, shouldn’t you confirm it directly? A screenshot alone doesn’t show the full context.",それでも直接確認はした方がいいんじゃない？ スクリーンショットだけでは前後がわからないでしょ。,但还是应该直接确认吧？光凭截图不知道前因后果。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
