case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.1.chat.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.1.chat.messages[3].text,"잠깐, 정확히 무슨 내용이었는데?","Wait, what exactly was it about?",待って、正確にはどんな内容だったの？,等一下，具体是什么内容？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
