case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[1].text,아 걔 진짜 또 그래? 결혼 준비하는 사람한테 왜 그러는 거야.,Is she seriously doing that again? Why would she do that to someone preparing for marriage?,え、あの子また本当にそうなの？ 結婚準備してる人にどうしてそんなことするの。,啊，她真的又这样？为什么要对一个在准备结婚的人这样？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
