case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[4].text,"태윤이는 별거 아니라고 하는데, 나는 그 말도 못 믿겠어.","Tae-yun says it’s nothing, but I can’t believe that either.",テユンは大したことじゃないって言うけど、その言葉も信じられない。,泰允说没什么，但我连这话也信不了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
