case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_6_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[6].text,아직. 지금 말 걸면 또 피해자처럼 굴 것 같아서 먼저 너희한테 말한 거야.,"Not yet. If I talk to her now, I think she’ll act like the victim again, so I told you first.",まだ。今話しかけたらまた被害者みたいに振る舞いそうだから、先にみんなに話したの。,还没有。现在去问她，她可能又会装成受害者，所以我先告诉你们。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_7_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[7].sender,하은,Ha-eun,ハウン,夏恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_7_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[7].text,그래도 직접 확인은 해야 하지 않아? 캡처만으로는 앞뒤를 모르잖아.,"Still, shouldn’t you confirm it directly? A screenshot alone doesn’t show the full context.",それでも直接確認はした方がいいんじゃない？ スクリーンショットだけでは前後がわからないでしょ。,但还是应该直接确认吧？光凭截图不知道前因后果。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
