case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_8_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[8].text,근데 이미 다은이가 이 정도로 불안하면 수민이도 조심했어야지.,"But if Da-eun is already this anxious, Su-min should have been more careful too.",でも、ダウンがここまで不安になっているなら、スミンも気をつけるべきだったよ。,可是多恩都这么不安了，秀敏也应该更谨慎一点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
