case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_9_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[9].text,맞아. 나는 지금 수민이가 또 내 사람한테 붙는 것처럼 느껴져.,"Right. Right now, it feels like Su-min is going after my man again.",そう。今はスミンがまた私の人に近づいているように感じる。,对。我现在感觉秀敏又在贴近我的人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
