case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_1_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[1].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[1].text,얘들아 나 진짜 손 떨려. 방금 태윤이 폰 알림을 봤는데 수민이 이름이 계속 떠 있었어.,"Guys, my hands are actually shaking. I just saw Tae-yun’s phone notifications, and Su-min’s name kept popping up.",みんな、私ほんとに手が震えてる。さっきテユンのスマホ通知を見たんだけど、スミンの名前がずっと出てたの。,姐妹们，我手真的在抖。我刚看到泰允手机的通知，秀敏的名字一直跳出来。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_2_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[2].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[2].text,나한테는 아무 말도 안 해놓고 왜 내 예비신랑한테만 연락하는지 모르겠어.,She didn’t say anything to me. I don’t know why she’s only contacting my fiancé.,私には何も言わないで、どうして私の婚約者にだけ連絡するのかわからない。,她什么都没跟我说，却只联系我的未婚夫，我真不知道为什么。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_3_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[3].sender,친구 1,Friend 1,友人1,朋友1,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[3].text,"잠깐, 정확히 무슨 내용이었는데?","Wait, what exactly was it about?",待って、正確にはどんな内容だったの？,等一下，具体是什么内容？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
