case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[4].text,통화 기록도 있고 문자도 여러 번이야. 그냥 안부 수준으로 보이진 않았어.,There were call logs and several texts. It didn’t look like a simple check-in.,通話記録もあるし、メッセージも何度もある。ただの近況確認には見えなかった。,有通话记录，也有好几条短信。看起来不像只是问候。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_5_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[5].sender,친구 2,Friend 2,友人2,朋友2,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[5].text,너한테 먼저 말 안 한 건 좀 이상하긴 하다.,It is a little strange that she didn’t tell you first.,あなたに先に言わなかったのは、少しおかしいね。,没有先告诉你，确实有点奇怪。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_6_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[6].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_6_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[6].text,예전에도 이런 식으로 사람 곤란하게 만든 적 있잖아. 나만 예민한 거 아니지?,"She’s put people in awkward positions like this before. I’m not the only one being sensitive, right?",前にもこういう形で人を困らせたことがあるでしょ。私だけが過敏なわけじゃないよね？,她以前也这样让别人为难过吧。不是只有我太敏感，对吧？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_7_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[7].sender,친구 1,Friend 1,友人1,朋友1,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
