case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[1].text,아 걔 진짜 또 그래? 결혼 준비하는 사람한테 왜 그러는 거야.,Is she seriously doing that again? Why would she do that to someone preparing for marriage?,え、あの子また本当にそうなの？ 結婚準備してる人にどうしてそんなことするの。,啊，她真的又这样？为什么要对一个在准备结婚的人这样？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_2_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[2].sender,유진,Yu-jin,ユジン,宥珍,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[2].text,수민이는 선 넘는 걸 본인이 잘 모르는 것 같아. 예전에도 분위기 이상하게 만들었잖아.,I don’t think Su-min realizes when she crosses the line. She made things weird before too.,スミンは、自分が一線を越えていることにあまり気づいていないみたい。前にも空気を変にしたじゃない。,秀敏好像不太知道自己什么时候越界。以前也把气氛弄得很怪。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_3_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[3].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[3].text,나도 그래서 더 화가 나. 이번에는 그냥 넘어가면 안 될 것 같아.,That’s why I’m even angrier. I don’t think we can just let it slide this time.,だから私も余計に腹が立つ。今回はそのまま流しちゃいけないと思う。,所以我才更生气。这次不能就这么算了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_4_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[4].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[4].text,"태윤이는 별거 아니라고 하는데, 나는 그 말도 못 믿겠어.","Tae-yun says it’s nothing, but I can’t believe that either.",テユンは大したことじゃないって言うけど、その言葉も信じられない。,泰允说没什么，但我连这话也信不了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
