case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[5].text,그럼 수민이한테 직접 물어봤어?,Then did you ask Su-min directly?,じゃあ、スミンには直接聞いたの？,那你直接问秀敏了吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
