case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_1_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[1].sender,김세라,Kim Se-ra,キム・セラ,金世罗,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[1].text,"다은아, 수민이가 왜 연락했는지는 확인한 거야? 혹시 태윤이가 먼저 연락한 건 아니고?","Da-eun, did you check why Su-min contacted him? Are you sure Tae-yun didn’t contact her first?",ダウン、スミンがなぜ連絡したのか確認したの？ もしかしてテユンが先に連絡したんじゃないの？,多恩，你确认过秀敏为什么联系他了吗？会不会是泰允先联系她的？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_10_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[10].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_10_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[10].text,응. 근데 지금은 수민이가 선 넘은 게 맞다고 생각해.,"Yeah. But right now, I think Su-min really did cross the line.",うん。でも今は、スミンが一線を越えたのは確かだと思う。,嗯。但现在我觉得秀敏确实越界了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_2_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[2].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[2].text,아직 수민이한테 직접 묻진 않았어. 물어보면 또 오해라고 할 게 뻔하니까.,"I haven’t asked Su-min directly yet. If I ask, she’ll obviously say it’s another misunderstanding.",まだスミンには直接聞いてない。聞いたら、また誤解だって言うに決まってるから。,我还没直接问秀敏。因为一问，她肯定又会说是误会。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_3_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[3].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[3].text,그래도 이건 너희가 알아야 할 것 같아서 먼저 올린 거야. 나 혼자 예민한 사람 되기 싫어.,"Still, I thought you all should know, so I posted it first. I don’t want to be the only one who looks oversensitive.",でも、これはみんなも知っておくべきだと思って先に上げたの。私だけが神経質な人みたいになるのは嫌だから。,可是我觉得你们也该知道，所以先发上来了。我不想一个人被当成太敏感。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_4_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[4].sender,소연,So-yeon,ソヨン,素妍,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[4].text,직접 확인 전이면 말은 조금 조심해야 할 것 같아. 단정해서 퍼지면 돌이키기 어렵잖아.,"If you haven’t checked directly yet, you should be careful with your words. Once it spreads as a conclusion, it’s hard to take back.",直接確認する前なら、言い方には少し気をつけた方がいいと思う。決めつけて広がったら取り返しがつかないでしょ。,如果还没直接确认，说话还是要谨慎一点。一旦被当成定论传开，就很难挽回了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_5_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[5].sender,하은,Ha-eun,ハウン,夏恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[5].text,근데 이미 방 분위기는 수민이가 잘못한 걸로 가고 있어.,But the mood in the chat is already turning toward “Su-min did something wrong.”,でも、もうグループの空気はスミンが悪いって方向に流れてるよ。,可是群里的气氛已经在往“秀敏做错了”的方向走了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_6_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[6].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_6_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[6].text,내가 괜히 말한 건 아니야. 수민이는 예전에도 비슷한 일에서 끝까지 설명 안 했어.,I didn’t say this for no reason. Su-min refused to explain to the end in a similar situation before too.,私が理由もなく言ったわけじゃない。スミンは前にも似たような件で最後まで説明しなかった。,我不是无缘无故这么说。秀敏以前遇到类似的事，也一直没有解释到最后。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_7_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[7].sender,김세라,Kim Se-ra,キム・セラ,金世罗,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_7_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[7].text,그 예전 일이랑 이번 연락이 같은 일인지는 따로 봐야 하지 않을까.,Shouldn’t we look separately at whether that old incident and this contact are really the same thing?,その昔の件と今回の連絡が同じことなのかは、別に見た方がいいんじゃない？,那件旧事和这次联系是不是同一回事，不该分开看吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_8_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[8].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_8_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[8].text,나는 지금 결혼 앞두고 또 이런 얘기 듣는 게 너무 지쳐. 태윤이한테는 내가 먼저 정리하라고 할게.,I’m exhausted hearing this again right before my wedding. I’ll tell Tae-yun to handle it first.,結婚を控えて、またこんな話を聞くのは本当に疲れる。テユンには私から先に整理するよう言う。,马上要结婚了又听到这种事，我真的很累。我会先让泰允把这件事处理好。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_9_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[9].sender,유진,Yu-jin,ユジン,宥珍,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_9_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[9].text,알겠어. 다만 나중에 사실이 다르면 방에 정정도 해야 해.,"Okay. But if the facts turn out to be different later, you need to correct it in the chat too.",わかった。ただ、後で事実が違ったら、グループにも訂正を入れないといけないよ。,明白。但如果之后事实不一样，也必须在群里更正。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
