case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_0_.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[0].messages[4].text,통화 기록도 있고 문자도 여러 번이야. 그냥 안부 수준으로 보이진 않았어.,There were call logs and several texts. It didn’t look like a simple check-in.,通話記録もあるし、メッセージも何度もある。ただの近況確認には見えなかった。,有通话记录，也有好几条短信。看起来不像只是问候。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
