case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[5].text,그럼 수민이한테 직접 물어봤어?,Then did you ask Su-min directly?,じゃあ、スミンには直接聞いたの？,那你直接问秀敏了吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_6_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[6].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_6_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[6].text,아직. 지금 말 걸면 또 피해자처럼 굴 것 같아서 먼저 너희한테 말한 거야.,"Not yet. If I talk to her now, I think she’ll act like the victim again, so I told you first.",まだ。今話しかけたらまた被害者みたいに振る舞いそうだから、先にみんなに話したの。,还没有。现在去问她，她可能又会装成受害者，所以我先告诉你们。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_7_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[7].sender,하은,Ha-eun,ハウン,夏恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_7_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[7].text,그래도 직접 확인은 해야 하지 않아? 캡처만으로는 앞뒤를 모르잖아.,"Still, shouldn’t you confirm it directly? A screenshot alone doesn’t show the full context.",それでも直接確認はした方がいいんじゃない？ スクリーンショットだけでは前後がわからないでしょ。,但还是应该直接确认吧？光凭截图不知道前因后果。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_8_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[8].sender,유진,Yu-jin,ユジン,宥珍,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_8_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[8].text,근데 이미 다은이가 이 정도로 불안하면 수민이도 조심했어야지.,"But if Da-eun is already this anxious, Su-min should have been more careful too.",でも、ダウンがここまで不安になっているなら、スミンも気をつけるべきだったよ。,可是多恩都这么不安了，秀敏也应该更谨慎一点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_9_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[9].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_9_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[9].text,맞아. 나는 지금 수민이가 또 내 사람한테 붙는 것처럼 느껴져.,"Right. Right now, it feels like Su-min is going after my man again.",そう。今はスミンがまた私の人に近づいているように感じる。,对。我现在感觉秀敏又在贴近我的人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
