case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.meta.stageLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.stageLabel,3단계 — 전체 대화 공개,Stage 3 — Full Conversation Disclosed,3段階 — 会話全体を公開,第3阶段——公开完整对话,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-2_.viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-2].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,보통,Normal,普通,普通,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].description,"최수민이 그 일은 자신이 정리하겠다는 말만 남기고 설명을 피했고, 송다은은 그 일에 얽히면 사람이 달라진다는 취지로 답한 기록.","A record in which Choi Su-min avoided explaining and only said she would handle the matter herself, while Song Da-eun replied to the effect that people change when they get involved in that matter.",チェ・スミンが、その件は自分が整理するとだけ言って説明を避け、ソン・ダウンはその件に関わると人が変わるという趣旨で返した記録。,记录显示，崔秀敏只留下“那件事我会自己处理”的话并回避说明，宋多恩则回应称一旦卷入那件事，人就会变。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationResults.check_metadata,이 대화 직후 두 사람은 연락이 끊겼고 약 2년간 만나지 않았다.,"Immediately after this conversation, the two lost contact and did not meet for about two years.",この会話の直後、二人は連絡が途絶え、約2年間会わなかった。,这次对话之后，两人立刻断了联系，约两年没有见面。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationResults.request_original,"최수민이 그 일은 자신이 정리하겠다는 말만 남겼고, 송다은은 그 일에 얽히면 사람이 달라진다는 취지로 답했다.","Choi Su-min only said she would handle the matter herself, and Song Da-eun replied to the effect that people change when they get involved in that matter.",チェ・スミンはその件は自分が整理するとだけ言い、ソン・ダウンはその件に関わると人が変わるという趣旨で返した。,崔秀敏只说那件事会由自己处理，宋多恩则回应称一旦卷入那件事，人就会变。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationResults.restore_context,과거 대화만으로는 돈 문제의 상대와 책임 소재가 아직 분리되지 않는다. 추가 기록과 대조해야 한다.,The past conversation alone does not yet separate the other party in the money issue from where responsibility lies. It must be compared with additional records.,過去の会話だけでは、金銭問題の相手と責任の所在はまだ切り分けられない。追加記録と照合する必要がある。,仅凭过去的对话，仍无法区分金钱问题的相对方与责任归属。必须与追加记录对照。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[0].label,대화확인,Conversation Check,会話確認,对话确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[0].question.text,손절 직전 대화 원문을 확인해 주십시오.,Please check the original conversation from just before the fallout.,絶交直前の会話原文を確認してください。,请确认决裂前的对话原文。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[1].label,맥락대조,Context Check,文脈照合,语境核对,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[1].question.text,돈 문제 뒤 연락이 끊긴 순서를 대조해 주십시오.,Please compare the order in which contact broke off after the money issue.,金銭問題の後、連絡が途絶えた順序を照合してください。,请对照金钱问题之后联系中断的顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,대화 전후를 보면 돈 문제 언급과 손절 시점을 함께 볼 수 있습니다.,Looking before and after the conversation shows both the mention of the money issue and the timing of the fallout.,会話の前後を見ると、金銭問題への言及と絶交の時点をあわせて確認できます。,查看对话前后，可以同时看到金钱问题的提及与决裂时间点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[2].label,침묵추궁,Silence Check,沈黙追及,沉默追问,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[2].question.text,왜 끝까지 그 일을 말하지 않았습니까?,Why did you never speak about that matter to the end?,なぜ最後までその件を話さなかったのですか？,为什么到最后都没有说出那件事？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,맥락을 대조하면 숨긴 돈 문제의 상대를 물을 수 있습니다.,Comparing the context makes it possible to ask who the hidden money issue involved.,文脈を照合すれば、隠された金銭問題の相手を問うことができます。,对照语境后，可以追问被隐瞒的金钱问题涉及谁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
