case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.a.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.a.implication,송다은이 확인 없이 단정한 패턴을 드러낸다.,Reveal Song Da-eun’s pattern of reaching conclusions without checking.,ソン・ダウンが確認せず決めつけるパターンを明らかにする。,揭示宋多恩未经确认就下定论的模式。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 대화 이후 최수민에게 다시 물어본 적이 있습니까?,Did you ever ask Choi Su-min again after this conversation?,この会話の後、チェ・スミンに改めて尋ねたことはありますか？,这次对话之后，你有没有再问过崔秀敏？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.b.implication,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.b.implication,최수민의 침묵 동기를 확인한다.,Confirm Choi Su-min’s motive for staying silent.,チェ・スミンが沈黙した動機を確認する。,确认崔秀敏保持沉默的动机。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].partyContext.b.questionAngle,왜 그 일의 책임 소재를 끝까지 말하지 않았습니까?,Why did you never say who was responsible for that matter?,なぜその件の責任の所在を最後まで話さなかったのですか？,为什么到最后都没有说出那件事的责任归属？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
