case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.v3DepthPlan_context_.summary,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,최수민이 숨긴 돈 문제의 상대를 암시한다.,It hints at who was involved in the money issue Choi Su-min hid.,チェ・スミンが隠した金銭問題の相手を示唆する。,暗示崔秀敏隐瞒的金钱问题涉及谁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
