case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.chat.messages_3_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.chat.messages[3].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.chat.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.chat.messages[3].text,그만해. 우리 아빠 이름까지 꺼내서 네 돈 문제를 정당화하지 마.,Stop it. Don’t bring up my dad’s name to justify your money problem.,やめて。私の父の名前まで出して、自分の金の問題を正当化しないで。,够了。不要连我爸的名字都搬出来，为你的钱的问题找借口。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
