case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.chat.pages_1_.messages_1_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[1].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
