case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.chat.pages_2_.messages_2_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.chat.pages[2].messages[2].sender,알 수 없는 상대,Unknown Contact,不明な相手,未知对象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerData.chat.pages_2_.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerData.chat.pages[2].messages[2].text,"협박이 아니야. 아버지한테 빌려준 돈이 있었고, 네가 알면 상처받을까 봐 숨겼어.","It’s not a threat. I had lent your father money, and I hid it because I thought you’d be hurt if you found out.",脅しじゃない。あなたのお父さんに貸したお金があって、あなたが知ったら傷つくと思って隠したの。,这不是威胁。我借过钱给你父亲，因为怕你知道后受伤，所以才瞒着你。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
