case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.1.chat.pages_0_.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.1.chat.pages[0].messages[1].text,"다은아, 갑자기 연락해서 미안해. 바로 말하기가 좀 어려워서 몇 번을 썼다 지웠어.","Da-eun, I’m sorry for contacting you out of the blue. It was hard to say directly, so I wrote and deleted it several times.",ダウン、急に連絡してごめん。すぐに言うのが少し難しくて、何度も書いては消した。,多恩，突然联系你，对不起。有些话很难直接说出口，我写了又删了好几次。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
