case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[1].text,돈? 갑자기 왜 돈 얘기를 해? 나한테 뭘 뒤집어씌우려는 거야?,Money? Why are you suddenly talking about money? What are you trying to pin on me?,金？ 急にどうして金の話をするの？ 私に何をなすりつけるつもり？,钱？怎么突然说起钱了？你想把什么扣到我头上？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
