case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_2_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[2].sender,알 수 없는 상대,Unknown Contact,不明な相手,未知对象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[2].text,네 돈을 말하는 게 아니야. 네가 오해할까 봐 더 말을 못 꺼냈어.,I’m not talking about your money. I couldn’t say more because I was afraid you’d misunderstand.,あなたの金の話じゃない。あなたが誤解するかと思って、それ以上言い出せなかった。,我说的不是你的钱。我怕你误会，所以没能再说下去。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
