case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_4_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[4].sender,알 수 없는 상대,Unknown Contact,不明な相手,未知对象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[4].text,말하면 네가 바로 다치게 될 사람 얘기가 나와서 그랬어. 그래서 내가 먼저 막아보려고 했어.,"Because if I told you, it would involve someone whose name would hurt you immediately. So I tried to stop it first.",話したら、あなたがすぐ傷つく相手の話が出てくるから。だから私が先に止めようとした。,因为一说出口，就会牵扯到一个会马上伤到你的人。所以我才想先挡下来。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
