case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[2].text,무슨 일인데 이렇게 뜸을 들여.,What is it? Why are you dragging it out like this?,何なの、そんなにもったいぶって。,到底什么事，你这么吞吞吐吐的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
