case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_0_.messages_6_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[0].messages[6].text,내 주변? 무슨 뜻인데.,Around me? What do you mean?,私の周り？ どういう意味？,我身边？什么意思？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
