case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_3_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[3].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[3].text,그럼 왜 내 앞에서는 아무 일 없는 척했는데? 이제 와서 돈 문제라고 하면 내가 뭘 믿어.,"Then why did you act like nothing was wrong in front of me? If you call it a money issue now, what am I supposed to believe?",じゃあ、どうして私の前では何もないふりをしたの？ 今さら金の問題だと言われても、何を信じればいいの。,那你为什么在我面前装作什么都没发生？现在才说是钱的问题，你让我相信什么？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
