case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages_1_.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.pages[1].messages[5].text,그런 식으로 책임 피하지 마. 돈 얘기 꺼내는 순간 네가 이상해 보여.,"Don’t dodge responsibility like that. The moment you bring up money, you look suspicious.",そうやって責任から逃げないで。金の話を持ち出した瞬間、あなたの方がおかしく見える。,不要用这种方式逃避责任。你一提钱的问题，看起来奇怪的就是你。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
