case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_0_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[0].text,"다은아, 네 아버지와 관련된 일이야. 그래서 더 조심스러웠어.","Da-eun, it has to do with your father. That’s why I was even more careful.",ダウン、あなたのお父さんに関わることなの。だから余計に慎重になった。,多恩，这件事和你父亲有关。所以我才更加谨慎。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
