case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.messages[1].text,우리 아빠를 왜 끌어들여? 그걸로 나 협박하려는 거야?,Why are you dragging my dad into this? Are you trying to threaten me with that?,なんで私の父を巻き込むの？ それで私を脅すつもり？,为什么把我爸牵扯进来？你是想拿这个威胁我吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
