case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_0_.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[0].messages[3].text,네가 들으면 기분 나쁠 얘기일 수도 있어서 망설였어. 그래도 그냥 묻어두면 더 이상해질 것 같아.,"I hesitated because it might be upsetting for you to hear. But if I just bury it, things will get even stranger.",あなたが聞いたら嫌な気分になる話かもしれなくて迷った。でも、このまま伏せておくともっとおかしくなりそう。,我犹豫是因为你听了可能会不舒服。但如果就这样埋着不说，事情会变得更奇怪。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
