case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_0_.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[0].messages[4].text,또 애매하게 말하지 말고 정확히 말해.,Don’t be vague again. Say it clearly.,また曖昧に言わないで、はっきり言って。,别又说得含含糊糊，讲清楚。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
