case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_0_.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[0].messages[5].text,"나도 정리가 다 된 건 아닌데, 네 주변에서 생긴 일이라 너한테는 말해야 할 것 같아.","I haven’t sorted it all out either, but it happened around you, so I think I need to tell you.",私も全部整理できているわけじゃないけど、あなたの周りで起きたことだから、あなたには話すべきだと思う。,我也还没有完全理清，但这是发生在你身边的事，我觉得应该告诉你。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
