case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_1_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[1].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[1].text,돈? 갑자기 왜 돈 얘기를 해? 나한테 뭘 뒤집어씌우려는 거야?,Money? Why are you suddenly talking about money? What are you trying to pin on me?,金？ 急にどうして金の話をするの？ 私に何をなすりつけるつもり？,钱？怎么突然说起钱了？你想把什么扣到我头上？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_1_.time,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[1].time,오후 9:48,9:48 PM,午後9時48分,晚上9:48,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_2_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[2].sender,알 수 없는 상대,Unknown Contact,不明な相手,未知对象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_2_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[2].text,네 돈을 말하는 게 아니야. 네가 오해할까 봐 더 말을 못 꺼냈어.,I’m not talking about your money. I couldn’t say more because I was afraid you’d misunderstand.,あなたの金の話じゃない。あなたが誤解するかと思って、それ以上言い出せなかった。,我说的不是你的钱。我怕你误会，所以没能再说下去。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_2_.time,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[2].time,오후 9:49,9:49 PM,午後9時49分,晚上9:49,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_3_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[3].sender,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[3].text,그럼 왜 내 앞에서는 아무 일 없는 척했는데? 이제 와서 돈 문제라고 하면 내가 뭘 믿어.,"Then why did you act like nothing was wrong in front of me? If you call it a money issue now, what am I supposed to believe?",じゃあ、どうして私の前では何もないふりをしたの？ 今さら金の問題だと言われても、何を信じればいいの。,那你为什么在我面前装作什么都没发生？现在才说是钱的问题，你让我相信什么？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_3_.time,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[3].time,오후 9:50,9:50 PM,午後9時50分,晚上9:50,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_4_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[4].sender,알 수 없는 상대,Unknown Contact,不明な相手,未知对象,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_1_.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[1].messages[4].text,말하면 네가 바로 다치게 될 사람 얘기가 나와서 그랬어. 그래서 내가 먼저 막아보려고 했어.,"Because if I told you, it would involve someone whose name would hurt you immediately. So I tried to stop it first.",話したら、あなたがすぐ傷つく相手の話が出てくるから。だから私が先に止めようとした。,因为一说出口，就会牵扯到一个会马上伤到你的人。所以我才想先挡下来。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
