case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_2_.messages_4_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[2].messages[4].text,미안해. 그래도 네가 오해한 채로 끝나는 건 싫었어.,I’m sorry. But I didn’t want it to end with you misunderstanding me.,ごめん。でも、あなたが誤解したまま終わるのは嫌だった。,对不起。但我不想让事情在你误会的情况下结束。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
