case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-3_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_2_.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-3].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[2].messages[5].text,됐어. 더 연락하지 마. 차단할게.,Enough. Don’t contact me again. I’m blocking you.,もういい。これ以上連絡しないで。ブロックする。,够了。别再联系我。我会拉黑你。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
