case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.description,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].description,예비신랑과 최수민 사이에 사적인 표현이 오간 메시지 기록. 접근 방향과 대응 방식은 추가 확인이 필요하다.,A record of private messages exchanged between the fiancé and Choi Su-min. Who initiated the approach and how it was handled require further confirmation.,婚約者とチェ・スミンの間で私的な表現が交わされたメッセージ記録。接近の方向と対応の仕方は追加確認が必要だ。,未婚夫与崔秀敏之间出现私人化表述的消息记录。接近方向和应对方式还需要进一步确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationResults.check_metadata,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationResults.check_metadata,두 번째 페이지에서 김태윤이 다은이에게 말하기 애매한 부탁과 비공개 대화를 암시해 미심쩍은 흐름이 보인다.,"Page 2 shows a suspicious flow, as Kim Tae-yun hints at a request that is awkward to tell Da-eun about and at a private conversation.",2ページ目では、キム・テユンがダウンに話しにくい依頼と非公開の会話をほのめかし、不審な流れが見える。,第二页显示，金泰允暗示了难以告诉多恩的请求和私下对话，形成可疑走向。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationResults.request_original,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationResults.request_original,첫 페이지에서는 센터 상담과 운동 이야기처럼 보이는 일상 대화만 확인된다.,Page 1 only shows an everyday conversation that looks like a discussion about a center consultation and exercise.,1ページ目では、センター相談と運動の話に見える日常会話だけが確認される。,第一页只确认到看似关于中心咨询和运动的日常对话。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationResults.restore_context,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationResults.restore_context,세 번째 페이지의 늦은 밤 메시지에서 김태윤이 술을 마신 상태로 한 잔을 제안하고 최수민이 거절한 정황이 확인된다.,"The late-night messages on Page 3 confirm that Kim Tae-yun, while drunk, suggested another drink and Choi Su-min refused.",3ページ目の深夜メッセージで、キム・テユンが酒を飲んだ状態で一杯を提案し、チェ・スミンが拒んだ状況が確認される。,第三页深夜消息确认，金泰允在饮酒状态下提议再喝一杯，而崔秀敏拒绝了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_0_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[0].label,초기대화,Initial Conversation,初期会話,初始对话,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_0_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[0].question.text,첫 대화가 어떤 내용이었는지 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm what the first conversation was about.,最初の会話がどのような内容だったのか確認してください。,请确认最初的对话是什么内容。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_1_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[1].label,부탁정황,Request Context,依頼の状況,请求情况,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_1_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[1].question.text,비공개로 부탁하려 한 흐름이 있었는지 확인해 주십시오.,Please confirm whether there was a flow toward making a request privately.,非公開で依頼しようとする流れがあったのか確認してください。,请确认是否存在试图私下提出请求的走向。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_1_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,대화를 더 보면 김태윤이 다은이에게 말하기 애매하다는 식으로 말을 돌린 흔적이 보입니다.,"Viewing more of the conversation shows traces of Kim Tae-yun talking around the subject, saying it would be awkward to tell Da-eun.",会話をさらに見ると、キム・テユンがダウンに話しにくいという形で言葉を濁した痕跡が見えます。,继续查看对话，可以看到金泰允以“不方便对多恩说”为由绕开话题的痕迹。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_2_.label,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[2].label,선 넘김확인,Line-Crossing Check,越線確認,越界确认,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_2_.question.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[2].question.text,늦은 밤 메시지에서 선을 넘은 사람이 누구인지 따져 주십시오.,Please determine who crossed the line in the late-night messages.,深夜メッセージで一線を越えたのが誰なのか判断してください。,请判断深夜消息中越界的人是谁。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.investigationStages_2_.unlockHint,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,마지막 페이지를 보면 술자리 뒤 이어진 문구와 최수민의 거절 답장이 함께 확인됩니다.,The final page shows the wording that followed the drinking session together with Choi Su-min’s reply refusing it.,最後のページを見ると、酒席の後に続いた文言とチェ・スミンの拒絶返信をあわせて確認できます。,查看最后一页，可以同时确认酒局后接续的措辞与崔秀敏的拒绝回复。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
