case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.name,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].name,예비신랑의 선 넘는 메시지와 최수민의 거절 답장,Fiancé's Overstepping Message and Choi Su-min's Rejection,婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとチェ・スミンの拒絶返信,未婚夫越界留言与崔秀敏拒绝回复,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
