case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.a.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.a.questionAngle,이 메시지를 본 적이 있습니까?,Have you seen this message before?,このメッセージを見たことがありますか？,你见过这条消息吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
