case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.partyContext.b.questionAngle,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].partyContext.b.questionAngle,이 메시지를 왜 송다은에게 바로 보여주지 않았습니까?,Why didn’t you show this message to Song Da-eun right away?,なぜこのメッセージをすぐソン・ダウンに見せなかったのですか？,为什么没有马上把这条消息给宋多恩看？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
