case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.1.chat.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.1.chat.messages[1].text,"수민 씨, 다은이가 요즘 필라테스 예약이 어렵다던데 맞아요?","Su-min, Da-eun said Pilates reservations are hard to get these days. Is that true?",スミンさん、ダウンが最近ピラティスの予約が取りにくいと言っていたんですが、本当ですか？,秀敏，多恩说最近普拉提很难预约，是真的吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
