case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages_1_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[1].text,"수민 씨, 혹시 다은이한테 바로 말하기 애매한 거 하나만 물어봐도 돼요?","Su-min, can I ask you one thing that’s awkward to bring up with Da-eun directly?",スミンさん、ダウンに直接言いにくいことを一つだけ聞いてもいいですか？,秀敏，我可以问你一件不太方便直接跟多恩说的事吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
