case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_2_.messages_3_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[2].messages[3].sender,최수민,Choi Su-min,チェ・スミン,崔秀敏,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_2_.messages_3_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[2].messages[3].text,"태윤 씨, 지금 시간도 그렇고 이런 연락은 불편합니다.","Tae-yun, considering the hour, this kind of message makes me uncomfortable.",テユンさん、今の時間もそうですし、こういう連絡は困ります。,泰允先生，现在这个时间，加上这种联系，让我很不舒服。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
