case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_2_.messages_5_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[2].messages[5].text,다은이 예비신랑이잖아요. 저는 이런 식으로 만나지 않습니다.,You’re Da-eun’s fiancé. I don’t meet people this way.,あなたはダウンの婚約者でしょう。私はこういう形では会いません。,你是多恩的未婚夫。我不会以这种方式见面。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
