case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_2_.messages_6_.sender,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[2].messages[6].sender,김태윤,Kim Tae-yun,キム・テユン,金泰允,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_2_.messages_6_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[2].messages[6].text,너무 선 긋지 말고. 원래 너 같은 스타일 좋아했거든.,Don’t draw such a hard line. I’ve always liked your type.,そんなに線を引かないで。もともと君みたいなタイプが好きだったんだ。,别把界线划得这么清。我本来就喜欢你这种类型。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
