case_surface_content_src_data_cases_generated_friend-01_evidence_e-4_.viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages_2_.messages_7_.text,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-4].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[2].messages[7].text,그만하세요. 이 대화는 남겨두겠습니다.,Stop. I’m keeping this conversation.,やめてください。この会話は残しておきます。,请停止。我会保留这段对话。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
