,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.nodes[stmt-a-accusation].label,"송다은의 발언 ""수민이가 또 내 남자한테 연락한다""",Song Da-eun’s statement: “Su-min is contacting my man again.”,ソン・ダウンの発言「スミンがまた私の男に連絡する」,宋多恩表示：“秀敏又联系我的男人了。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.nodes[stmt-b-silence].label,"최수민의 발언 ""제가 그냥 참았어야 했는데""",Choi Su-min’s statement: “I should have just kept quiet.”,チェ・スミンの発言「私はただ我慢しなければならなかった」,崔秀敏表示：“我本来应该忍受的。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
