,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.nodes[w-3-angle].label,w-3 오미경 증언 축,w-3 Oh Mi-gyeong Testimony Angle,w-3 オミギョン証言軸,w-3 吴美京作证祝贺,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-1].discoveryText,"연락 기록과 단톡방 캡처를 대조하면, 최수민의 연락 사실이 확인도 없이 '집착'으로 프레이밍된 과정이 보인다.",Comparing the contact logs with the group chat screenshot shows how Choi Su-min’s contact was framed as “obsession” before it was verified.,連絡記録とグループチャットキャプチャを対照すると、チェ・スミンの連絡事実が確認もなく'執着'でフレーミングされた過程が見られる。,比较联系记录和群聊截图，我们可以看到崔秀敏的联系是如何在未经确认的情况下被定性为“痴迷”的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-10].discoveryText,"""또 내 남자한테 연락한다""는 단정과 ""참았어야 했는데""라는 자책을 나란히 놓으면, 같은 사건을 전혀 다르게 겪고 있다는 점이 드러난다.","Set the claim “she’s contacting my man again” beside “I should have kept quiet,” and it becomes clear that the same incident was experienced in completely different ways.",「また私の男に連絡する」という断定と「我慢しなければならなかったのに」という自責を並べておけば、同じ事件を全く違うように経験しているという点が明らかになる。,如果你将“我再次联系我的男人”的断言与“我应该忍住”的自责放在一起，很明显，你正在经历完全不同的同一事件。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-2].discoveryText,"연락 기록과 예비신랑의 선 넘는 메시지를 대조해본 결과, 선을 넘은 건 예비신랑이었던 것으로 보인다. 새로운 증인에게 관련 사실을 묻도록 하자.","After comparing the contact logs with the fiancé’s overstepping message, it appears the fiancé was the one who crossed the line. Ask the new witness about the related facts.",連絡記録と婚約者の線を越えるメッセージを対照してみた結果、線を超えたのは婚約者だったようだ。新しい証人に関連する事実を尋ねるようにしましょう。,对照联系记录和未婚夫的越界留言，看来是未婚夫越界了。我们向新证人询问相关事实。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-3].discoveryText,송다은 아버지가 예비신랑에게 보낸 문자와 과거 최수민에게 보낸 차용증과 일부 상환 흐름이 거의 동일하다.,The text Song Da-eun’s father sent to the fiancé closely matches the past IOU sent to Choi Su-min and the partial repayment pattern.,ソン・ダウンは父が婚約者に送ったメッセージと過去チェ・スミンに送った借用書と一部返済の流れがほぼ同じだ。,宋多恩父亲发给未婚夫的短信和过去发给崔秀敏的欠条在部分还款流程上几乎一模一样。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-4].discoveryText,"예비신랑의 접근과 대조표를 합치면, 최수민의 연락이 경고였다는 결론이 강화된다.","The fiancé’s approach, read together with the comparison chart, strengthens the conclusion that Choi Su-min’s contact was a warning.",婚約者の接近と対照表を合わせれば、チェ・スミンの連絡が警告だったという結論が強化される。,将未婚夫的做法与比较结合起来，强化了崔秀敏的接触是一种警告的结论。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-5].discoveryText,송다은의 '또 내 남자한테 연락한다'는 발언이 단톡방에서 어떻게 확산됐는지 경로가 확인된다.,The route by which Song Da-eun’s “she’s contacting my man again” remark spread through the group chat is confirmed.,ソン・ダウンの「また、私の男に連絡する」という発言がグループチャットでどのように拡散したのかが確認される。,宋多恩的“我又联系我的男人了”的评论在群聊中的传播路径已经确定。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-6].discoveryText,과거 카톡과 대조표를 합치면 두 시점 모두 말이 끊긴 순서가 반복됩니다. 누가 먼저 단정했고 누가 침묵했는지는 심문으로 확인해야 합니다.,The old KakaoTalk chat and the comparison chart show the same break in communication at both points. Questioning must confirm who judged first and who stayed silent.,過去のカカオトークと対照表を合わせると、両方の時点で話題が切れた順序が繰り返されます。誰が最初に断定し、誰が沈黙したのかを尋問する必要があります。,如果将过去 KakaoTalk 和资产负债表结合起来，两次都会重复语音中断的顺序。必须通过审讯来确定谁先做出决定，谁保持沉默。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-7].discoveryText,"과거 카톡의 '돈 문제' 언급과 과거 송금 기록을 대조하면, 손절의 진짜 원인이 변심이 아니라 차용금 미상환 문제였다는 사실이 드러난다.","Comparing the old KakaoTalk mention of “money problems” with the past transfer records reveals that the real reason for the fallout was unpaid borrowed money, not a change of heart.",過去のカトクの「お金問題」の言及と過去の送金記録を対照すれば、絶交の本当の原因が変心ではなく、借用金未償還問題だったという事実が明らかになる。,将KakaoTalk过去提到的“资金问题”与过去汇款记录进行比较，发现断交的真正原因不是改变主意，而是借入资金不归还的问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-8].discoveryText,"수민이 '참았어야 했다'는 말과 예비신랑 메시지를 대조해본 결과, 선을 넘은 건 예비신랑이었던 것으로 보인다. 새로운 증인에게 관련 사실을 묻도록 하자.",Comparing Su-min’s “I should have kept quiet” with the fiancé’s message suggests that the fiancé was the one who crossed the line. Ask the new witness about the related facts.,スミンが「我慢しなければならなかった」という言葉と婚約者メッセージを対照してみた結果、線を越えたのは婚約者だったと見られる。新しい証人に関連する事実を尋ねるようにしましょう。,对比Sumin的“我应该忍耐”的话和未婚夫的留言，看来是未婚夫越界了。我们向新证人询问相关事实。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,combinationLab.recipes[combine-9].discoveryText,"수민이 참으려 했다는 말과 다은 아버지의 문자를 합치면, 현재 연락이 단순한 사적 접촉만은 아닐 가능성이 보입니다. 돈 문제의 실제 상대와 목적은 심문에서 확인해야 합니다.","Taken together, Su-min’s attempt to stay silent and the text from Da-eun’s father suggest the current contact may not have been merely personal. Questioning must confirm the actual counterparty and purpose of the money issue.",スミンが我慢しようとした言葉と、父親のメッセージを合わせると、現在の連絡が単純な私的接触だけではない可能性が見られます。お金の問題の実際の相手と目的は尋問で確認する必要があります。,结合秀敏试图克制的话和多恩父亲的短信来看，目前的联系很可能不仅仅是私人联系。审讯时必须查明金钱问题的实际当事人和目的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,context.caseName,손절한 절친,Ex-Best Friend Who Cut Ties,絶交した親友,断交的挚友,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,context.description,"손절한 전 절친이 내 예비신랑에게 계속 연락한다. 결혼 3주 전, 그 장면만 보면 누구라도 친구가 선을 넘었다고 생각한다.","My former best friend keeps contacting my fiancé after cutting ties with me. Three weeks before the wedding, anyone seeing only that would think she had crossed the line.",紛失した元親友は、私の婚約者に連絡し続けています。 結婚式の3週間前、現場を見た人は誰でも、自分の友人が一線を越えたと思っていました。,与我分手的前最好的朋友继续联系我的未婚夫。光是看到婚礼前三周的那一幕，任何人都会认为这位朋友已经越界了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,context.triggerAmplifier,초반에는 최수민의 9일간 연락 기록과 송다은의 단톡방 발언이 겹치며 최수민이 집착하는 사람으로 보인다. 그러나 예비신랑의 선 넘는 메시지와 송다은 아버지의 돈 접근 패턴이 드러나면서 사건의 중심은 집착이 아니라 반복되는 침묵과 낙인으로 뒤집힌다.,"At first, Choi Su-min’s nine-day contact record and Song Da-eun’s group chat remarks make Su-min look obsessive. But once the fiancé’s overstepping message and Song Da-eun’s father’s money pattern surface, the case turns away from obsession and toward repeated silence and stigma.",当初、チェ・スミンの9日間の接触記録とソン・ダウンのグループチャットの接触記録は重複しており、チェ・スミンは執着しているように見える。 しかし、婚約者のオーバーザトップメッセージとソン・ダウンの父親のお金へのアプローチが明らかになるにつれて、イベントの中心は強迫観念によってではなく、繰り返される沈黙とスティグマによって逆転されます。,一开始，崔秀敏9天的联系记录和宋多恩在群聊里的评论重叠，让人觉得崔秀敏是一个痴迷的人。然而，随着未婚夫过分的信息和宋多恩父亲获取金钱的模式被揭露，案件的焦点不再是痴迷，而是反复的沉默和耻辱。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-1].judgmentStatement,최수민의 연락은 집착이 아니라 경고였으나 방식의 적절성은 별도 판단이 필요하다.,"Choi Su-min’s contact was a warning, not obsession, but the appropriateness of her method must be judged separately.",チェ・スミンの接触は警告であり、強迫観念ではなかったが、その方法の妥当性は別の判断を必要とする。,崔秀敏的接触是一种警告，而不是一种执念，但方法是否恰当需要单独判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-1].mediationLink,연락의 의도와 방식의 적절성,Intent of the contact and appropriateness of the method,連絡の意図と方法の関連性,意图和联系方法的适当性,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-1].name,9일간의 연락 의도,Intent Behind Nine Days of Contact,9日間の連絡意図,9天联系的意图,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-1].truthDescription,"최수민은 예비신랑에게 9일간 연락했다. 집착이 아니라 송다은 아버지의 돈 접근 패턴을 경고하려 했지만, 직접 말할 길이 없었다.","Choi Su-min contacted the fiancé for nine days. She was trying to warn him about Song Da-eun’s father’s money pattern, not obsess over him, but she had no direct way to say it.",チェ・スミンは、9日間、婚約者に連絡を取りました。 ソンは執着するのではなく、父親の金銭接近パターンを警告しようとしましたが、それを直接言う方法はありませんでした。,崔秀敏与未婚夫联系了9天。宋多恩并没有沉迷其中，而是试图警告父亲他获取金钱的方式，但没有办法直接说出来。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.defer,연락의 실체를 판단할 근거가 부족하다. 유보한다.,There is not enough basis to determine the nature of the contact. Defer judgment.,問い合わせの現実を判断するのに十分な証拠がありません。一時停止します。,没有足够的证据来确定接触的真实性质。我保留它。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.partial,"최수민이 연락한 건 맞지만, 집착인지 다른 의도인지는 불분명하다.","Choi Su-min did make contact, but it is unclear whether it was obsession or another intent.",チェ・スミンが彼に連絡を取ったが、彼が執着していたのか、それとも他の意図を持っていたのかは不明である。,崔秀敏确实联系了他，但不清楚是痴迷还是其他意图。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.truth,최수민은 송다은 아버지의 돈 접근 패턴을 경고하려 예비신랑에게 연락했다.,Choi Su-min contacted the fiancé to warn him about Song Da-eun’s father’s money pattern.,チェ・スミンは、彼の父親の金銭接近パターンについて彼に警告するために、将来の新郎に連絡しました。,崔秀敏联系了她的未婚夫，警告她宋多恩父亲接近钱财的模式。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-1].verdictOptions.wrong,최수민이 예비신랑에게 집착하며 반복적으로 연락한 것이다.,Choi Su-min repeatedly contacted the fiancé out of obsession.,チェ・スミンは婚約者に夢中になり、何度も彼に連絡を取った。,崔秀敏对她的未婚夫很痴迷，并多次与她联系。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].judgmentStatement,예비신랑이 먼저 선을 넘었고 최수민은 거절한 쪽이었다.,"The fiancé crossed the line first, and Choi Su-min was the one who refused.",新郎は先に一線を越え、チェ・スミンは拒否した。,未婚夫第一个冲过终点线，崔秀敏拒绝了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].mediationLink,예비신랑의 접근과 최수민의 대응,The fiancé’s approach and Choi Su-min’s response,婚約者のアプローチとチェ・スミンの対応,未婚夫的接近和崔秀敏的回应,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].name,예비신랑의 선 넘는 접근,Fiancé’s Overstepping Approach,婚約者の踏み越えた接近,未婚夫越界接近,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].truthDescription,"예비신랑이 먼저 최수민에게 선 넘는 메시지를 보냈고, 최수민은 거절했다. 최수민이 이후 연락한 건 이 상황의 연장선이었다.","The fiancé sent Choi Su-min an overstepping message first, and Choi Su-min refused. Her later contact was an extension of that situation.",新郎候補は最初にチェ・スミンに一線を越えたメッセージを送ったが、チェは拒否した。 チェ・スミンのその後の接触は、この状況の延長であった。,未婚夫首先给崔秀敏发了一条越界的信息，被崔秀敏拒绝了。崔秀敏后来的接触就是这种情况的延伸。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,어느 쪽 심문이든 d-1에서 연락 의도의 균열이 드러나면 예비신랑의 접근이 드러남,"In either side’s questioning, if d-1 reveals a crack in the intent behind the contact, the fiancé’s approach is revealed.",どちらの尋問でも、d -1の接触意図の亀裂が明らかになり、将来の新郎のアプローチが明らかになる,在任何一次审讯中，如果 d-1 中的沟通意图出现裂痕，未婚夫的接近方式就会被揭露。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,양측 중 어느 쪽이든 d-1 S3 이상 도달 시 해금,Unlocks when either side reaches d-1 S3 or higher.,いずれかの側がd-1 S3以上に到達すると解禁,任一方达到d-1 S3以上时解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.defer,선후 관계를 가리기 어렵다. 유보한다.,The sequence is difficult to determine. Defer judgment.,選挙後の関係を隠すのは難しい。中断する。,很难确定先后关系。我保留它。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.partial,"양쪽 다 연락이 있었지만, 누가 선을 넘었는지는 애매하다.","Both sides had contact, but it is unclear who crossed the line.",両陣営は接触していたが、誰が一線を越えたのかは曖昧だった。,双方都有接触，但尚不清楚谁越界了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.truth,"예비신랑이 먼저 선 넘는 메시지를 보냈고, 최수민은 거절했다.","The fiancé sent an overstepping message first, and Choi Su-min refused.",新郎候補は最初に一線を越えたメッセージを送ったが、チェ・スミンはそれを拒否した。,未婚夫先发了一条越界的信息，崔秀敏拒绝了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-2].verdictOptions.wrong,"최수민이 먼저 예비신랑에게 접근했고, 예비신랑은 피해자다.","Choi Su-min approached the fiancé first, and the fiancé is the victim.",チェ・スミンは最初に新郎候補に近づき、新郎候補が被害者となった。,崔秀敏先接近未婚夫，未婚夫才是受害者。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].judgmentStatement,송다은 아버지의 돈 접근 패턴은 과거와 현재가 같았다.,Song Da-eun’s father’s money pattern was the same in the past and present.,ソン・ダウン父の金銭接近パターンは過去と現在が同じだった。,宋多恩父亲接近钱财的模式过去和现在都是一样的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].mediationLink,송다은 아버지의 돈 접근 패턴,Song Da-eun’s Father’s Money Pattern,ソン・ダウンの父の金銭接近パターン,宋多恩父亲接近钱财的模式,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].name,아버지의 돈 접근 패턴,Father’s Money Pattern,父の金銭接近パターン,父亲接近钱财的模式,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].truthDescription,"송다은 아버지가 예비신랑에게 돈 얘기를 꺼내고 있었고, 최수민은 과거에 같은 패턴을 당한 적이 있어 예비신랑에게 경고하려 했다.","Song Da-eun’s father was bringing up money with the fiancé, and Choi Su-min tried to warn the fiancé because she had experienced the same pattern in the past.",ソン・ダウンは父が婚約者にお金の話を取り出していたし、チェ・スミンは過去に同じパターンに遭ったことがあって婚約者に警告しようとした。,宋多恩父亲正在向她的未婚夫谈论金钱问题，崔秀敏试图警告她的未婚夫，因为她过去也经历过同样的情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,d-2에서 예비신랑의 접근이 확인된 뒤 최수민이 경고 이유를 밝히면 송다은 아버지 패턴 부상,"After d-2 confirms the fiancé’s approach, if Choi Su-min explains why she warned him, Song Da-eun’s father’s pattern emerges.",d-2で婚約者の接近が確認された後、チェ・スミンが警告理由を明らかにすると、ソン・ダウンの父親パターンの怪我,在d-2中确认了未婚夫的接近后，当崔秀敏说出警告原因时，宋多恩父亲模式受到了伤害。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,양측 중 어느 쪽이든 d-2 S3 이상 도달 시 해금,Unlocks when either side reaches d-2 S3 or higher.,いずれかの側がd-2 S3以上に到達すると解禁,任一方达到d-2 S3以上时解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].verdictOptions.defer,대화의 실체를 확인할 수 없다. 유보한다.,The substance of the conversation cannot be confirmed. Defer judgment.,会話の実体を確認できない。留保する。,谈话内容的真实性无法得到证实。我保留它。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].verdictOptions.partial,돈 이야기가 오간 것 같지만 구체적 내용은 확인이 안 된다.,"It appears money was discussed, but the details are not confirmed.",お金の話が来たようだが、具体的な内容は確認できない。,好像是讨论过钱的事，但具体细节无法确认。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].verdictOptions.truth,"송다은 아버지가 예비신랑에게 돈을 빌려달라고 접근했고, 최수민은 과거 같은 패턴을 겪은 적이 있다.","Song Da-eun’s father approached the fiancé to borrow money, and Choi Su-min had experienced the same pattern before.",ソン・ダウンは父が婚約者にお金を貸してほしいと近づき、チェ・スミンは過去のようなパターンを経験したことがある。,宋多恩父亲向她的未婚夫借钱，崔秀敏过去也经历过同样的情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-3].verdictOptions.wrong,송다은 아버지는 예비신랑에게 인사차 안부를 전했을 뿐이다.,Song Da-eun’s father merely checked in with the fiancé as a greeting.,ソン・ダウンは父親は婚約者に挨拶車の安否を伝えただけだ。,宋多恩父亲只向未婚夫打了声招呼。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].judgmentStatement,과거 손절의 원인은 송다은 아버지의 차용금 미상환과 최수민의 침묵이었다.,The old fallout was caused by Song Da-eun’s father’s unpaid loan and Choi Su-min’s silence.,過去の絶交の原因はソン・ダウン父の借用金未償還とチェ・スミンの沈黙だった。,过去断交的原因是宋多恩父亲不偿还贷款和崔秀敏的沉默。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].mediationLink,과거 손절의 이유,Why the Old Friendship Ended,過去の絶交理由,旧日决裂的理由,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].name,과거 손절의 이유,Why the Old Friendship Ended,過去の絶交理由,旧日决裂的理由,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].truthDescription,과거 손절의 진짜 원인은 송다은 아버지가 최수민에게 몇백만 원 단위로 세 차례 돈을 빌린 뒤 일부만 갚고 연락을 끊은 일이었다. 최수민은 송다은에게 말하면 아버지 문제를 들춰야 해서 차마 말하지 못하고 악역을 자처했다.,"The real reason for the old fallout was that Song Da-eun’s father borrowed several million won from Choi Su-min three times, repaid only part of it, then cut off contact. Choi Su-min could not bring herself to tell Song Da-eun because it would expose her father’s issue, so she accepted the role of the villain.",過去の絶交の本当の原因はソン・ダウンの父がチェ・スミンに数百万ウォン単位で3回お金を借りた後、一部だけ返済して連絡を切ったことだった。チェ・スミンはソン・ダウンに話すと、父の問題を聞かなければならず、言わず悪役を自処した。,过去断交的真正原因是宋多恩父亲向崔秀敏借了3次数百万韩元的钱，然后只偿还了一部分并断绝了联系。崔秀敏不忍心告诉宋多恩，因为他必须向父亲提起这件事，所以他称自己为恶棍。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,송다은 아버지의 현재 패턴이 확인된 뒤 과거에도 같은 일이 있었다는 사실 부상,"Once Song Da-eun’s father’s current pattern is confirmed, the fact that the same thing happened in the past emerges.",ソン・ダウンの父親の現在のパターンが確認された後、過去にも同じことがあったという事実,宋多恩父亲现在的模式被确认后，发现过去也发生过同样的事情。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,양측 중 어느 쪽이든 d-3 S3 이상 도달 시 해금,Unlocks when either side reaches d-3 S3 or higher.,いずれかの側がd-3 S3以上に到達すると解禁,任一方达到d-3 S3以上时解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].verdictOptions.defer,손절의 진짜 원인을 가리기 어렵다. 유보한다.,The real reason for cutting ties is difficult to determine. Defer judgment.,絶交の本当の原因を選びにくい。留保する。,很难确定断交的真正原因。我保留它。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].verdictOptions.partial,"손절에 돈 문제가 얽혀 있었지만, 정확한 경위는 알 수 없다.","Money was involved in the fallout, but the exact circumstances are unclear.",絶交にお金の問題が絡まっていたが、正確な経緯は分からない。,断交涉及资金问题，但具体情况不明。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].verdictOptions.truth,송다은 아버지가 최수민에게 돈을 빌린 뒤 일부만 갚고 연락을 끊은 일이 원인이었다. 최수민은 차마 말 못하고 악역을 자처했다.,"The cause was that Song Da-eun’s father borrowed money from Choi Su-min, repaid only part of it, and cut off contact. Choi Su-min could not bring herself to speak and took on the villain’s role.",ソン・ダウンは父がチェ・スミンにお金を借りた後、一部だけ返済して連絡を切ったことが原因だった。チェ・スミンは言わず悪役を自処した。,原因是宋多恩父亲向崔秀敏借了钱，只偿还了一部分，然后就不再联系了。崔秀敏不忍再说什么，宣称自己是恶棍。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-4].verdictOptions.wrong,과거 손절은 최수민이 변심해서 일방적으로 끊은 것이다.,The old fallout happened because Choi Su-min changed her mind and cut ties unilaterally.,過去の絶交はチェ・スミンが変心して一方的に切ったものだ。,以前，崔秀敏改变了主意，单方面断绝了分手。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].judgmentStatement,먼저 단정하고 공개한 쪽의 책임이 더 크지만 침묵으로 반복을 허용한 쪽도 책임이 있다.,"The side that judged and publicized the matter first bears greater responsibility, but the side whose silence allowed the pattern to repeat also bears responsibility.",まず断定して公開した方の責任がより大きいが、沈黙で繰り返しを許可した方も責任がある。,最先决定并公开的一方责任更大，但允许沉默重复的一方也有责任。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].mediationLink,성급한 단정과 명예훼손,Hasty judgment and defamation,急いだ断定と名誉毀損,草率的结论和诽谤,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].name,단톡방 매도와 명예훼손,Group Chat Smear and Defamation,グループチャットでの決めつけと名誉毀損,群聊抹黑与名誉损害,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].truthDescription,"송다은이 확인 없이 단톡방에서 최수민을 매도했고, 최수민은 또 악역을 자처하는 구조가 반복됐다. 두 사람 모두 확인 전에 단정한 책임이 있다.","Song Da-eun smeared Choi Su-min in the group chat without checking, and the structure in which Choi Su-min took the villain’s role repeated. Both bear responsibility for judging before verifying.",ソン・ダウンが確認せずにグループチャットでチェ・スミンを売り、チェ・スミンはまた悪役を自処する仕組みが繰り返された。両者とも確認前に断定した責任がある。,重复了宋多恩在群聊中未经证实地批评崔秀敏、崔秀敏自称是坏人的结构。他们双方都有责任在确认之前确定。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].v3UnlockPlan.authoredRule,송다은 아버지 패턴과 과거 차용금 미상환가 모두 드러난 뒤 현재 명예훼손 구조 부상,"After Song Da-eun’s father’s pattern and the old unpaid loan both emerge, the current defamation structure surfaces.",ソン・ダウンの父親のパターンと過去の借用金の未払いの両方が明らかになった後、現在の名誉毀損構造が浮上しました,宋多恩目前因父亲的行为和过去未偿还的贷款被揭露而因诽谤案而受伤。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].v3UnlockPlan.runtimeRule,양측 중 어느 쪽이든 d-3 S3 + d-4 S3 도달 시 해금,Unlocks when either side reaches d-3 S3 + d-4 S3.,両側のいずれかd-3 S3 + d-4 S3到達時解禁,当任何一方达到 d-3 S3 + d-4 S3 时解锁,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].verdictOptions.defer,누가 먼저 명예를 훼손했는지 판단하기 어렵다. 유보한다.,It is difficult to determine who damaged the other’s reputation first. Defer judgment.,誰が最初に名誉を毀損したかを判断するのは難しい。留保する。,很难确定谁先诽谤。我保留它。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].verdictOptions.partial,양쪽 모두 상대를 단정한 부분이 있다.,Both sides made judgments about the other.,両方とも相手を断定した部分がある。,双方都有部分对对方的冒昧。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].verdictOptions.truth,"송다은이 확인 없이 단톡방에서 최수민을 매도했고, 최수민은 또 악역이 되는 구조가 반복됐다.","Song Da-eun smeared Choi Su-min in the group chat without checking, and the structure in which Choi Su-min became the villain repeated.",ソン・ダウンが確認せずにグループチャットでチェ・スミンを売り、チェ・スミンはまた悪役となる仕組みが繰り返された。,宋多恩在群聊中批评崔秀敏未经证实，崔秀敏成为反派的结构被重复。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,disputes[d-5].verdictOptions.wrong,최수민이 먼저 예비신랑에게 접근해서 스스로 명예를 무너뜨렸다.,Choi Su-min approached the fiancé first and damaged her own reputation.,チェ・スミンが先に婚約者に接近して自ら名誉を崩した。,崔秀敏率先接近未婚夫，毁了他的名誉。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.angry,최수민!,Choi Su-min!,チェ・スミン！,崔苏民！,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.toJudge,제 전 친구,My former friend,私の元友達,我的前朋友,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.callTerms.toPartner,수민아,Su-min,スミン,秀敏,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.dailyRoutine,"쇼핑몰 CS 업무를 마치면 예비신랑과 결혼 준비를 하고, 공통 친구 단톡방에 일상을 올리며 관계를 유지한다.","After completing CS work at the shopping mall, I prepare for marriage with my fiancé and maintain a relationship by posting about my daily life in a group chat with mutual friends.",ショッピングモールでCSの仕事を終えると、婚約者と結婚する準備をし、共通の友人であるグループチャットで日常生活を上げることで関係を維持しています。,在商场完成CS工作后，我准备与我的未婚夫结婚，并通过在与共同朋友的群聊中发布我的日常生活来维持关系。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.fear,아버지의 진짜 모습이 드러나는 것을 가장 두려워한다.,He is most afraid of his father's true face being revealed.,彼は父親の本当の自分を明らかにすることを最も恐れています。,他最怕父亲的真面目被揭露。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.name,송다은,Song Da-eun,ソン・ダウン,宋多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.occupation,온라인 쇼핑몰 CS 직원,Online shopping mall customer service employee,オンラインショップCS担当,网店客服人员,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[0],아버지의 돈 문제,Father’s money issue,父親のお金の問題,父亲的金钱问题,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[1],과거 손절의 진짜 이유,The real reason the old friendship ended,過去のストップロスの本当の理由,过去断交的真正原因,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.sensitivePoints[2],확인 없이 단톡방에 올린 일,Posting in the group chat without verifying,確認なしにDantok Roomにアップロードされました,未经确认就发布在群聊,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.speechStyle,결론부터 말하고 그 안에 근거를 끼워 넣는다. 상대가 반박하면 이미 끝난 얘기를 다시 꺼내며 맥락을 자기 쪽으로 좁힌다.,"Start with the conclusion and include evidence within it. When the other person retorts, you bring up what has already been said and narrow the context to yourself.",結論から始めて、その中に論理的根拠を挿入します。 相手が反論すると、すでに終わったストーリーを取り戻し、自分の方向にコンテキストを絞り込みます。,从结论开始，并在其中包含证据。当对方反驳时，你会提出已经说过的话，并将上下文缩小到自己的范围内。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[0].pattern,상대 말이 끝나기 전에 '그러니까 결국~'으로 결론을 먼저 내려버린다.,"Before the other person has finished speaking, they conclude with ‘So in the end~’.",相手が話を終える前に、最初に「だから最後に〜」で結論を出します。,对方还没说完，就以‘所以到底~’结束。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[1].pattern,'예전에도 그랬잖아'라며 과거 사례를 현재 판단의 근거로 가져온다.,"They bring past cases as the basis for current judgment, saying, ‘You’ve done that before.’",「以前はそうだった」と彼は言い、現在の判決の根拠として過去の事件を取り上げた。,他们将过去案例作为当前判断的基础，并说：“你以前就这么做过。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyA.verbalTells[2].pattern,불리한 지점이 나오면 '그건 지금 얘기가 아니다'라며 범위를 좁힌다.,"When an unfavorable point comes up, we narrow the scope by saying, ‘That’s not what we’re talking about now.’",不利な点が出てくると、彼は範囲を狭め、「それは私が言っていることではありません」と言います。,当不利的点出现时，我们会缩小范围，说：“这不是我们现在讨论的。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.callTerms.angry,송다은!,Song Da-eun!,ソン・ダウン！,宋多恩！,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.callTerms.toJudge,다은이,Da-eun,ダウン,多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.callTerms.toPartner,다은아,Da-eun,ダウン,多恩,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.dailyRoutine,"필라테스 수업을 마치면 혼자 정리하고, 공통 친구들과의 연락은 점점 줄었다. 예비신랑에게 연락할 때도 카페에서 혼자 문자를 보냈다.","After finishing Pilates class, I cleaned things up on my own, and my contact with common friends gradually decreased. When I contacted my fiancé, I sent a text message alone at a cafe.",ピラティスのクラスを終えたとき、私は一人で掃除をしましたが、共通の友人との接触はますます少なくなりました。 新郎候補に連絡しても、カフェで一人でメールしていました。,普拉提课结束后，我就自己收拾东西，和普通朋友的接触也逐渐减少。当我联系我的准丈夫时，我独自在一家咖啡馆发了一条短信。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.fear,송다은에게 아버지의 진실을 말하면 친구가 아버지를 돈을 갚지 않은 사람으로 봐야 한다는 것을 알기에 끝까지 말하지 못한다.,"He knows that if he tells Song Da-eun the truth about his father, his friend will view him as someone who did not pay back the money, so he cannot tell it to the end.",ソン・ダウンに最後まで話すことができないのは、私が彼に父の真実を話せば、私の友人は私の父を返済していない人として見るべきだと知っているからです。,他知道，如果他告诉宋多恩关于他父亲的真相，他的朋友会认为他是没有还钱的人，所以他不能说到底。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.name,최수민,Choi Su-min,チェ・スミン,崔秀敏,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.occupation,필라테스 강사,Pilates instructor,ピラティス講師,普拉提教练,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[0],송다은 아버지의 차용금 미상환 피해,Harm from Song Da-eun’s father’s unpaid loan,ソン・ダウンの借金未払い損害,宋多恩父亲未偿还贷款造成的断交,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[1],예비신랑이 먼저 선을 넘은 사실,The fact that the fiancé crossed the line first,将来の新郎が最初に一線を越えたという事実,事实是未婚夫先跨过界线,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.sensitivePoints[2],또 악역이 된 현재 상황,The current situation of becoming the villain again,悪化している現状も,再次成为反派的现状,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.speechStyle,감정을 눌러 담고 사실만 나열한다. 정작 가장 아픈 이야기를 할 때 목소리가 더 평평해진다.,"Suppress your emotions and list only the facts. When I tell the most painful story, my voice becomes flatter.",あなたの感情をタップして、事実のみをリストしてください。 一番辛い話をすると、声が平らになります。,抑制你的情绪，只列出事实。当我讲述最痛苦的故事时，我的声音变得平淡。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[0].pattern,가장 아픈 이야기를 할 때 오히려 톤이 더 평평해지고 감정이 사라진다.,"When talking about the most painful stories, the tone becomes flatter and emotion disappears.",一番痛い話をすると、口調が平らになり、感情が消えてしまいます。,当谈论最痛苦的故事时，语气变得平淡，情感消失。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[1].pattern,'제가 그냥 참았어야 했는데'라며 책임을 먼저 가져가 상대의 추궁을 무력화한다.,"He neutralizes the other person's questioning by taking responsibility first, saying, 'I should have just endured it.'",「我慢しておくべきだった」と彼は言った。最初に責任を取り、相手の尋問を無効にした。,他先承担责任，平息了对方的质疑，他说：“我应该忍受的。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.partyB.verbalTells[2].pattern,핵심 인물의 행동을 직접 말하지 않고 '그쪽 상황이 있었다'로 에둘러 말한다.,"Instead of directly mentioning the actions of key characters, they say it indirectly by saying, ‘There was a situation there.’",主要な人々の行動について直接話す代わりに、彼は「そこには状況がありました」と言いました。,他们没有直接提及关键人物的行为，而是间接地说，“那里有一个情况。”,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-1].description,최수민이 예비신랑에게 9일간 연락한 사실이 단톡방에서 '집착'으로 프레이밍됐다.,The fact that Choi Su-min contacted her fiancé for 9 days was framed as 'obsession' in the group chat.,チェ・スミンが新郎候補と9日間連絡を取ったという事実は、グループチャットでは「強迫観念」として捉えられていた。,崔秀敏与未婚夫联系了9天，在群聊中被指责为“痴迷”。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-1].distortionDirection,송다은은 연락의 의도를 확인하지 않고 과거 손절 때와 같은 패턴으로 단정했다.,Review this point in the record.,ソン・ダウンは接触の意図を確認しなかったが、以前と同じパターンを主張した。,宋多恩没有确认接触的意图，断定与过去模式相同。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-2].description,"과거 손절의 진짜 원인은 송다은 아버지의 차용금 미상환이었으나, 최수민은 송다은에게 말하지 못하고 악역을 자처했다.","The real cause of the loss in the past was Song Da-eun's father's non-repayment of a loan, but Choi Su-min was unable to tell Song Da-eun and declared himself a villain.",過去のストップロスの本当の原因は、ソン・ダウンの父親の未払いのローンでしたが、チェ・スミンはソン・ダウンに伝えず、ひどく行動しました。,过去断交的真正原因是宋多恩父亲不偿还贷款，但崔秀敏无法告诉宋多恩，并宣称自己是恶棍。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-2].distortionDirection,송다은은 최수민이 돈 때문에 변심한 것으로 기억하고 있다.,Review this point in the record.,ソン・ダウンは、チェ・スミンがお金のために変身したことを覚えています。,宋多恩记得崔秀敏因为金钱而改变了主意。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-3].description,예비신랑이 먼저 최수민에게 선 넘는 메시지를 보냈고 최수민은 거절했다. 이후 최수민의 연락은 이 상황의 연장선이었다.,"The fiancé first sent a message that crossed the line to Choi Su-min, and Choi Su-min rejected it. Choi Su-min's subsequent contact was an extension of this situation.",新郎候補は最初にチェ・スミンに一線を越えたメッセージを送ったが、チェは拒否した。 チェ・スミンのその後の接触は、この状況の延長であった。,未婚夫首先给崔秀敏发了一条越界的信息，被崔秀敏拒绝了。崔秀敏随后的接触就是这种情况的延伸。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-3].distortionDirection,송다은은 이 사실 자체를 모른다.,Review this point in the record.,ソン・ダウンはこの事実を知らなかった。,宋多恩自己并不知道这个事实。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-4].description,송다은이 확인 없이 단톡방에서 최수민을 매도했고 공통 친구들이 동조했다.,"Song Da-eun criticized Choi Su-min in the group chat without confirmation, and their mutual friends agreed.",ソン・ダウンはグループチャットでチェ・スミンを確証なしに売り渡し、共通の友人たちは同情的だった。,宋多恩在群聊中批评了崔秀敏，但没有得到证实，他们共同的朋友也同意了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.relationshipLedger[ledger-4].distortionDirection,송다은은 '사실을 알린 것'이라 생각하지만 실제로는 확인 없는 단정이었다.,Review this point in the record.,ソン・ダウンは「本当のことを言った」と思っていたが、実際には確証のない主張だった。,宋多恩以为自己是在“报道真相”，但实际上，这只是未经证实的假设。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].knowledgeScope,단톡방에서 송다은의 글을 보고 최수민을 비난하는 데 동조했다. 나중에 찜찜한 마음이 들었다.,"After seeing Song Da-eun's post in the group chat, I agreed with criticizing Choi Su-min. I felt uneasy afterward.",グループチャットでソン・ダウンのポストを見たとき、私はチェ・スミンを非難して彼に同情しました。 その後、不安を感じました。,看到群聊里宋多恩的帖子后，我同意批评崔秀敏。事后我感到不安。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].name,김세라,Kim Se-ra,キム・セラ,金世罗,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].surfaceKnowledge,단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다.,He is a mutual friend witness who knows the atmosphere of the group chat and the circumstances of Song Da-eun's first remark.,私はダントクルームの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の言葉を知っている一般的な友人の目撃者です。,他是共同的朋友和见证人，知道群聊的气氛和宋多恩第一次说话的情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
