,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].witnessProfile.relationToA,고등학교 때부터 친구다.,They have been friends since high school.,私は高校時代からの友達です。,我们从高中起就是朋友。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].witnessProfile.relationToB,송다은을 통해 알게 된 사이다.,She knows her through Song Da-eun.,ソン・ダウンから学んだサイダー。,我是通过宋多恩认识他的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-1].witnessProfile.speechStyle,솔직하게 말하되 자기가 동조한 부분은 살짝 줄여서 말한다.,She speaks honestly but slightly downplays the part where she joined in.,彼は正直に話したが、同情していた部分が少し減っていた。,诚实一点，但稍微淡化你同意的部分。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].knowledgeScope,"예비신랑의 회사 후배로, 예비신랑이 최수민에게 먼저 접근한 사실을 알고 있다.","As a junior at the fiancé's company, I know that the fiancé approached Choi Su-min first.",予定されている新郎の後輩として、予定されている新郎が最初にチェ・スミンに近づいたことを知っています。,作为未婚夫公司的后辈，我知道未婚夫首先接触的是崔秀敏。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].name,박준혁,Park Jun-hyeok,パク・ジュンヒョク,朴俊赫,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].surfaceKnowledge,예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다.,He is a third-party witness who knows the behavior patterns of the fiancé.,私は、将来の新郎の行動パターンを知っている第三者の目撃者です。,他是第三方见证人，了解未婚夫的行为模式。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
