,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].witnessProfile.relationToA,모르는 사이다.,They do not know each other.,知らない間だ。,我们互不认识。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].witnessProfile.relationToB,예비신랑을 통해 한두 번 본 적 있다.,He has seen her once or twice through the fiancé.,婚約者を通して一度か二度それを見たことがあります。,我通过我的未婚夫见过一两次。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-2].witnessProfile.speechStyle,사실 위주로 간결하게 말하며 불필요한 판단은 삼간다.,"He speaks concisely, sticks to facts, and avoids unnecessary judgment.",実際、簡潔に話し、不要な判断は控えましょう。,说话要简洁，注重事实，避免做出不必要的判断。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].knowledgeScope,"동네 분식집 사장으로, 과거에 송다은 아버지가 최수민에게 돈을 빌리러 온 것을 봤다. 최수민이 울면서 가게에 온 적이 있다.","As the owner of a local snack bar, I saw Song Da-eun's father come to borrow money from Choi Su-min in the past. Choi Su-min once came to the store crying.",地元のレストランのオーナーであるソン・ダウンは、父親が過去にチェ・スミンからお金を借りに来たことを見ました。 チェ・スミンは泣きながら店にやってきた。,作为当地一家小吃店的老板，我过去看到宋多恩父亲来向崔秀敏借钱。崔秀敏曾经哭着来到商店。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].name,오미경,Oh Mi-gyeong,オ・ミギョン,吴美京,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].surfaceKnowledge,과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다.,He is a third-party witness who witnessed money transactions between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min in the past.,過去には、ソンは父親とチェ・スミンとの間の金銭取引を目撃した第三者の証人です。,他是过去目睹宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间金钱交易的第三方证人。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
