,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.occupation,분식집 사장,Snack bar owner,軽食店の店主,小吃店老板,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.relationToA,송다은 아버지를 동네에서 본 적 있다.,She has seen Song Da-eun’s father around the neighborhood.,ソン・ダウンは近所で父親に会っていた。,我在附近看到了宋多恩父亲。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.relationToB,가게 단골이다.,He is a regular at the shop.,私は店の常連でした。,我是商店的常客。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,duo.socialGraph[w-3].witnessProfile.speechStyle,정을 담아 말하되 본 것은 정확하게 전달한다.,She speaks with warmth but reports exactly what she saw.,彼は熱狂的に言ったが、彼が見たものを正確に伝えた。,说话要真诚，但要准确表达你所看到的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].description,송다은 아버지와 예비신랑 사이에 부탁성 문자가 오간 기록. 단계별 원문을 대조해야 금전 요구와 비밀 요청 여부가 보인다.,A record of request-like texts exchanged between Song Da-eun’s father and the fiancé. The staged originals must be compared to see whether there was a money request and a request for secrecy.,ソン・ダウン父と婚約者の間に頼みのメッセージが五刊記録。段階別原文を照合しなければ金銭要求と秘密要求かどうかが見られる。,宋多恩父亲和她的未婚夫之间交换的请求短信记录。只有每一步对比原文，才能看出是否有索要金钱或保密的要求。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.check_metadata,두 번째 페이지에서 금전성 부탁처럼 보이는 흐름이 드러난다. 다만 금액과 정확한 목적은 아직 봉인되어 있다.,"The second page reveals a flow that looks like a money-related request, but the amount and exact purpose remain sealed.",2ページ目で金銭性のお願いのように見える流れが現れます。ただし、金額と正確な目的はまだ封印されている。,在第二页上，显示了一个看似财务请求的流程。但具体金额和具体用途仍处于保密状态。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.request_original,첫 페이지에서는 결혼 준비 안부와 조심스러운 부탁 예고만 확인된다. 돈 문제인지 개인적 상담인지 아직 단정하기 어렵다.,The first page only confirms a wedding-preparation check-in and a cautious hint of a request. It is still hard to say whether it concerns money or a personal consultation.,最初のページでは結婚準備の安否と慎重な頼み予告だけ確認される。お金の問題なのか個人的な相談なのか、まだ断定しにくい。,第一页上只确认了婚礼准备工作和仔细的请求通知。目前还很难确定是金钱问题还是个人咨询问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationResults.restore_context,"세 번째 페이지에서 금액, 사업 자금 명목, 다은에게 말하지 말라는 문구가 드러나며 최수민이 예비신랑에게 연락한 이유를 다시 물어볼 근거가 생긴다.","The third page reveals the amount, the stated business-fund purpose, and the instruction not to tell Da-eun, giving grounds to ask again why Choi Su-min contacted the fiancé.",3ページ目で金額、事業資金名目、ダウンに言ってはいけないというフレーズが現れ、チェ・スミンが婚約者に連絡した理由を再び尋ねる根拠が生じる。,第三页透露了金额、商业基金的名称以及告诉多恩不要告诉的一句话，让我们有理由再次询问崔秀敏为何联系她的未婚夫。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[0].label,부탁확인,Request Check,お願い確認,确认请求,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[0].question.text,부탁 예고 문구의 원본성을 확인해 주십시오.,Please verify the originality of the request-foreshadowing wording.,お願い予告文具の原本性をご確認ください。,请检查请求通知的原创性。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].label,금전대조,Money Comparison,金銭対照,金钱比较,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].question.text,부탁이 돈 문제로 이어지는지 대조해 주십시오.,Please compare whether the request leads to a money issue.,お願いがお金の問題につながるかどうかをご確認ください。,检查这种恩惠是否会导致金钱问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,문자 원문을 더 보면 부탁의 성격이 금전 문제인지 확인할 수 있습니다.,Viewing more of the original text can confirm whether the request was financial in nature.,メッセージの原文をさらに見ると、お願いの性格が金銭的な問題かどうかを確認できます。,如果您进一步查看原文，您可以确定请求的性质是否是财务方面的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].label,비밀요청,Confidential Request,秘密の要求,秘密请求,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].question.text,금액과 비밀 요청이 최수민의 경고와 어떻게 이어지는지 따져 주십시오.,Please examine how the amount and confidentiality request connect to Choi Su-min’s warning.,金額と秘密の要求がチェ・スミンの警告にどのようにつながるかを調べてください。,请考虑金额和保密要求与崔秀敏的警告有何联系。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,마지막 페이지를 확인하면 최수민이 왜 예비신랑에게 직접 연락했는지 물을 수 있습니다.,Checking the final page allows you to ask why Choi Su-min contacted the fiancé directly.,最後のページをチェックすると、チェ・スミンが婚約者に直接連絡した理由を尋ねることができます。,如果你看最后一页，你可能会问崔秀敏为什么直接联系未婚夫。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
