,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].name,송다은 아버지와 예비신랑의 문자,Texts Between Song Da-eun’s Father and the Fiancé,ソン・ダウンの父と婚約者のメッセージ,宋多恩父亲与未婚夫的短信,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.a.implication,송다은이 아버지의 요청 내용을 어디까지 알고 있었는지 확인한다.,Confirm how much Song Da-eun knew about her father’s request.,ソン・ダウンが父の要請内容をどこまで知っていたかを確認する。,我们了解宋多恩对她父亲的要求了解多少。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.a.questionAngle,아버지가 예비신랑에게 사적인 부탁을 한 사실을 알고 있었습니까?,Did you know your father made a private request to your fiancé?,父が婚約者にプライベートなお願いをした事実を知っていましたか？,你知道你父亲要求你丈夫帮忙吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.b.implication,최수민의 경고 동기를 확인한다.,Confirm Choi Su-min’s motive for warning him.,チェ・スミンの警告動機を確認する。,我们确认崔秀敏的警告动机。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].partyContext.b.questionAngle,이 문자 흐름을 어떻게 알게 되었고 왜 경고하려 했습니까?,"How did you learn about this text flow, and why did you try to warn him?",このメッセージの流れをどのように知り、なぜ警告しようとしましたか？,您是如何发现此短信流的？为什么要警告您？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
