,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.messages[2].text,2달이면 갚을 수 있어. 사업 자금이 급해서 그래.,I can pay it back in two months. I just need urgent business funds.,2か月あれば返せる。事業資金が急ぎなんだ。,两个月就能还。只是生意资金很急。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
