,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.messages[4].text,다은이한테는 아직 말하지 마. 걱정시키기 싫으니까.,Don’t tell Da-eun yet. I don’t want to worry her.,ダウンにはまだ言わないでくれ。心配させたくないから。,先别告诉多恩。我不想让她担心。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
