,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[0].sender,송○○,Song ○○,ソン○○,宋○○,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[0].text,어제 말한 건 그냥 개인 부탁이야. 결혼 전에 잠깐만 도와주면 바로 정리할 수 있어.,"What I mentioned yesterday was just a personal favor. If you help me briefly before the wedding, I can settle it right away.",昨日話したのは、ただの個人的な頼みだ。結婚前に少しだけ助けてくれれば、すぐ片づけられる。,昨天说的只是个人请求。婚前稍微帮一下，我马上就能处理好。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[1].sender,김태○,Kim Tae-○,キム・テ○,金泰○,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[1].text,도와드린다는 게 돈 말씀인가요?,"By “help,” do you mean money?",助けるというのは、お金のことですか？,您说的帮忙，是指钱吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[2].sender,송○○,Song ○○,ソン○○,宋○○,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[2].text,크게 부담 줄 생각은 없어. 급한 데만 막으면 금방 돌려줄 수 있다.,"I don’t intend to burden you much. I just need to cover the urgent part, and I can return it soon.",大きな負担をかけるつもりはない。急ぎの分だけ塞げば、すぐ返せる。,我不想给你太大负担。只要先堵上急用，很快就能还。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[3].sender,김태○,Kim Tae-○,キム・テ○,金泰○,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
