,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[4].sender,송○○,Song ○○,ソン○○,宋○○,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[1].messages[4].text,걱정할까 봐 아직은 안 했다. 괜히 일 키우고 싶지 않아서 그래.,"Not yet, because she might worry. I don’t want to make this bigger than it needs to be.",心配すると思って、まだ話していない。余計に事を大きくしたくないんだ。,怕她担心，所以还没说。我不想无端把事情闹大。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
