,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[2].messages[0].sender,송다은 아버지,Song Da-eun’s father,ソン・ダウンの父,宋多恩父亲,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[2].messages[0].text,사위 될 사람이면 이 정도는 믿어야지. 3천만 원만 잠깐 도와줘.,"If you’re going to be my son-in-law, you should trust me this much. Just help me with ₩30M for a short while.","婿になる人なら、このくらいは信じてくれ。3,000万ウォンだけ少し助けてくれ。",要成为女婿的人，这点总该相信吧。暂时帮我3000万韩元。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
