,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerData.chat.pages[2].messages[1].text,3천만 원은 바로 결정하기 어렵습니다.,₩30M is difficult to decide right away.,"3,000万ウォンはすぐには決められません。",3000万韩元很难马上决定。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
