,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[0].text,어제 말한 건 그냥 개인 부탁이야. 결혼 전에 잠깐만 도와주면 바로 정리할 수 있어.,"What I mentioned yesterday was just a personal favor. If you help me briefly before the wedding, I can settle it right away.",昨日話したのは、ただの個人的な頼みだ。結婚前に少しだけ助けてくれれば、すぐ片づけられる。,昨天说的只是个人请求。婚前稍微帮一下，我马上就能处理好。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
