,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[1].text,도와드린다는 게 돈 말씀인가요?,"By “help,” do you mean money?",助けるというのは、お金のことですか？,您说的帮忙，是指钱吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[2].sender,송○○,Song ○○,ソン○○,宋○○,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerDataByStage.2.chat.messages[2].text,크게 부담 줄 생각은 없어. 급한 데만 막으면 금방 돌려줄 수 있다.,"I don’t intend to burden you much. I just need to cover the urgent part, and I can return it soon.",大きな負担をかけるつもりはない。急ぎの分だけ塞げば、すぐ返せる。,我不想给你太大负担。只要先堵上急用，很快就能还。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
