,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[0].messages[1].text,"네, 아버님. 다은이랑 잘 준비하고 있습니다.","Yes, sir. Da-eun and I are preparing well.",はい、お父様。ダウンと一緒に準備しています。,是的，伯父。我和多恩正在好好准备。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
