,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[0].messages[4].sender,송○○,Song ○○,ソン○○,宋○○,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerDataByStage.3.chat.pages[0].messages[4].text,아직 다은이한테 말하기는 애매해서. 시간 괜찮을 때 짧게 통화할 수 있나?,It is still awkward to tell Da-eun. Could we have a brief call when you have time?,まだダウンに話すには微妙でね。都合のいい時に少し電話できるか？,现在还不太方便告诉多恩。你有空时能简短通个电话吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
