,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-5].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,보통,Medium,通常,普通,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].description,최수민이 송다은 아버지에게 몇백만 원 단위로 세 차례 보낸 송금 기록과 차용증. 일부 상환 뒤 연락이 끊긴 흐름이 쟁점이다.,Transfer records and an IOU showing that Choi Su-min sent Song Da-eun’s father several million won three times. The issue is the flow in which contact stopped after partial repayment.,チェ・スミンがソン・ダウン父に数百万ウォン単位で３回送った送金記録と借用書。一部返済後連絡が切れた流れが争点だ。,崔秀敏向宋多恩父亲发送了3次百万韩元的汇款和欠条记录。问题是部分还款后失去联系。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.check_metadata,"차용증과 일부 상환 내역이 붙어 있지만, 두 차례 소액 상환 뒤 추가 상환과 연락이 끊긴다.","The IOU and partial repayment details are attached, but after two small repayments, further repayment and contact stop.",借用書と一部の返済内訳がついているが、２回少額の返済後、追加の返済と連絡が切れる。,附有欠条和部分还款明细，但两次小额还款后，进一步还款和联系就断绝了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.request_original,최수민 계좌에서 송씨 성 수취인에게 몇백만 원 단위 송금이 세 차례 이체된 내역이 확인된다.,The records confirm three transfers of several million won each from Choi Su-min’s account to a recipient with the surname Song.,チェ・スミン口座でソン氏性受取人に数百万ウォン単位送金が３回振り込まれた内訳が確認される。,据证实，崔秀敏的账户上曾有3次向宋某的收款人转账数百万韩元的资金。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationResults.restore_context,상환이 끊긴 시점과 과거 손절 직전 카톡을 함께 보면 최수민이 송다은에게 말하지 못한 이유를 물어볼 근거가 생긴다.,Reading the point where repayment stopped together with the KakaoTalk chat just before the old fallout gives grounds to ask why Choi Su-min could not tell Song Da-eun.,返済が切れた時点と過去の絶交直前にカトクを一緒に見るとチェ・スミンがソン・ダウンに話せなかった理由を尋ねる根拠が生じる。,如果我们看看过去还款被切断的时间和断交前的KakaoTalk消息，我们就有理由问为什么崔秀敏没有告诉宋多恩。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[0].label,송금확인,Transfer Check,送金確認,确认汇款,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[0].question.text,세 차례 송금이 실제로 나간 내역입니까?,Are these records of three actual outgoing transfers?,３回送金が実際に出てきた履歴ですか？,这三笔转账真的完成了吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].label,상환대조,Repayment Comparison,返済対照,还款比较,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].question.text,차용증과 일부 상환 내역을 대조해 주십시오.,Please compare the IOU with the partial repayment records.,借用書と一部の返済履歴を対照してください。,请将部分还款详情与欠条进行比较。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,이체 내역을 더 보면 차용증과 일부 상환 기록이 함께 보입니다.,Viewing more of the transfer details shows the IOU and partial repayment records together.,振替履歴をさらに見ると、借入証と一部の返済記録が一緒に見えます。,如果你进一步查看转账记录，你会看到一张欠条和一些还款记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].label,침묵추궁,Silence Questioning,沈黙追宮,无声的询问,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].question.text,상환이 끊긴 뒤 최수민이 왜 침묵했는지 물어 주십시오.,Please ask why Choi Su-min stayed silent after repayment stopped.,返済が終わった後、チェ・スミンがなぜ沈黙したのか尋ねてください。,请问崔秀敏在还款被切断后为何保持沉默？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,상환이 끊긴 흐름을 대조하면 과거 손절의 이유를 물을 수 있습니다.,Comparing the flow after repayment stopped allows you to ask why the old friendship ended.,返済が切れた流れを照合すると、過去の手折りの理由を尋ねることができます。,通过对比还款中断的流程，我们可以询问过去断交的原因。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
