,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].name,과거 송금 기록과 차용증,Past Transfers and IOU,過去の送金記録と借用書,过往转账记录与借条,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].partyContext.a.implication,송다은이 아버지의 과거 자금 문제를 몰랐음을 확인한다.,Confirm that Song Da-eun did not know about her father’s past money issue.,ソン・ダウンが父親の過去の資金問題を知らなかったことを確認する。,据证实，宋多恩并不知道父亲过去经济问题。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].partyContext.a.questionAngle,아버지가 최수민 씨에게 돈을 빌린 적이 있다는 사실을 알고 있었습니까?,Did you know your father had borrowed money from Ms. Choi Su-min?,父がチェ・スミンさんにお金を借りたことがあることを知っていましたか？,你知道你父亲曾经向崔秀敏借过钱吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].partyContext.b.implication,침묵의 대가를 확인한다.,Confirm the cost of the silence.,沈黙の対価を確認する。,看看沉默的代价。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].partyContext.b.questionAngle,왜 이 사실을 송다은 씨에게 끝까지 숨겼습니까?,Why did you hide this from Ms. Song Da-eun until the end?,なぜこの事実をソン・ダウンさんに最後まで隠したのですか？,为什么到最后才向宋多恩隐瞒这个事实呢？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].surfaceDescription,과거 최수민 씨와 송다은 씨 아버지 사이의 송금 기록이 존재한다.,There are past transfer records between Ms. Choi Su-min and Ms. Song Da-eun’s father.,過去、チェ・スミン氏とソン・ダウン氏の父親との間の送金記録が存在する。,崔秀敏和宋多恩父亲之间过去有汇款记录。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].surfaceName,과거 송금 기록,Past Transfer Records,過去の送金記録,过往转账记录,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[context].summary,일부 상환 뒤 연락이 끊긴 시점과 손절 시점 대조,Compare the point when contact stopped after partial repayment with the point of the fallout.,一部の返済後に連絡が切れた時点と損切時点の対照,对比部分还款后切断联系的时间点和丢失的时间点。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[established].summary,과거 금전 문제의 반복 가능성을 판단한다.,Assess the possibility that a past money issue repeated.,過去の金銭問題の繰り返し可能性を判断する。,确定过去金钱问题重复发生的可能性。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[excerpt].summary,세 차례 이체 금액과 일자만 보임,Only the amounts and dates of three transfers are visible.,3回の振替金額と日付のみが表示されます,仅显示三笔转账金额和日期。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-6].v3DepthPlan[original].summary,차용증과 일부 상환 내역을 함께 확인한다.,Check the IOU and partial repayment records together.,借用書と一部の返済履歴を併せて確認する。,检查贷款证明和部分还款详情。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
