,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].description,"과거와 현재의 돈 부탁 문구, 연락 단절 시점, 단톡방 반응을 나란히 정리한 대조표.","A comparison chart that lays out past and present money-request wording, the point when contact stopped, and group chat reactions side by side.",過去と現在のお金のお願い文句、連絡断の時点、グループチャット反応を並べてまとめた対照表。,过去和现在的金钱请求、联系被切断的时间点以及群聊回复的对比表。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.check_metadata,두 시점 사이에 최수민이 말 대신 혼자 끊고 사라진 타이밍이 정확히 겹친다.,"At both points, the timing exactly overlaps: Choi Su-min cut things off alone and disappeared instead of speaking.",2つの時点の間にチェ・スミンが馬の代わりに一人で壊れて消えたタイミングが正確に重なる。,这两点之间的时间恰好重叠，崔秀敏挂断电话并消失而不是说话。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.request_original,과거 최수민에게 보낸 문구와 현재 예비신랑에게 보낸 문구가 거의 동일하다.,The wording sent to Choi Su-min in the past is almost identical to the wording sent to the fiancé now.,過去チェ・スミンに送ったフレーズと現在の婚約者に送ったフレーズはほぼ同じだ。,过去发给崔秀敏的短信和发给现在未婚夫的短信几乎一模一样。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationResults.restore_context,과거와 현재의 돈 부탁 방식과 최수민의 침묵 시점이 반복된다. 낙인이 만들어진 순서를 따져볼 수 있다.,The way money was requested and the timing of Choi Su-min’s silence repeat across past and present. This allows the order in which stigma was formed to be examined.,過去と現在のお金お願い方式とチェ・スミンの沈黙の時点が繰り返される。烙印が作られた順序を見てみることができる。,过去和现在的要钱方式和崔秀敏的沉默不断重复。可以检查柱头产生的顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[0].label,패턴확인,Pattern Check,パターン確認,检查图案,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[0].question.text,과거와 현재 문구가 같은 흐름입니까?,Do the past and present wordings follow the same flow?,過去と現在のフレーズは同じ流れですか？,过去和现在的短语是否处于同一流程？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].label,시점대조,Timing Comparison,視点対照,视点对比,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].question.text,최수민이 사라진 시점까지 함께 대조해 주십시오.,Please compare the point when Choi Su-min disappeared as well.,チェ・スミンが消えた時点まで一緒に対照してください。,请一起比较一下崔秀敏失踪之前的情况。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[1].unlockHint,"대조표를 더 보면 과거와 현재의 문구, 금액, 침묵 시점이 나란히 보입니다.","A closer look at the comparison chart shows the past and present wording, amounts, and timing of silence side by side.",対照表をさらに見ると、過去と現在のフレーズ、金額、沈黙の視点が並んで見えます。,仔细观察资产负债表，可以并排看到过去和现在的短语、金额和沉默时刻。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].label,낙인추궁,Stigma Questioning,烙印追宮,污名化,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].question.text,누가 먼저 최수민을 잘못된 사람으로 몰았습니까?,Who first framed Choi Su-min as the one at fault?,誰が最初にチェ・スミンを間違った人に運転したのですか？,是谁首先指责崔秀敏认错人的？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].investigationStages[2].unlockHint,패턴을 대조하면 이번 사건에서 낙인이 생긴 순서를 물을 수 있습니다.,Comparing the patterns lets you ask the order in which the stigma formed in this case.,パターンを照合すると、今回の事件で烙印が生じた順番を尋ねることができます。,通过对比这些模式，我们可以了解这种情况下耻辱出现的顺序。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
