,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].partyContext.a.implication,송다은 아버지의 반복 패턴을 직면하게 한다.,Make Song Da-eun face her father’s repeated pattern.,ソン・ダウンは父の繰り返しパターンに直面する。,宋多恩被迫面对父亲的重复模式。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
