,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].partyContext.b.implication,반복되는 침묵 구조를 확인한다.,Confirm the repeating structure of silence.,繰り返し沈黙の構造を確認してください。,检查重复的无声结构。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].partyContext.b.questionAngle,이번에도 혼자 막으려 한 이유가 같습니까?,Was your reason for trying to stop it alone the same this time?,今回も一人で止めようとした理由は同じですか？,这次你独自阻止的理由也是一样吗？,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
