,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.stageLabel,3단계 — 전체 패턴 대조,Stage 3 — Full Pattern Comparison,第3段階 — 全体パターン対照,第3阶段 — 整体模式对照,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,evidence[e-7].viewerDataByStage.3.meta.trustLabel,보통,Medium,通常,普通,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,meta.anchorTruth,"최수민은 예비신랑을 꼬시려 한 게 아니라 경고하려 했고, 그보다 오래전에는 송다은 아버지에게 당한 일을 말하지 못한 채 스스로 악역이 되었다.","Choi Su-min was not trying to seduce the fiancé; she was trying to warn him. Long before that, unable to speak about what Song Da-eun’s father had done to her, she became the villain herself.",チェ・スミンは新郎にいちゃつこうとはしなかったが、彼に警告しようとしたが、そのずっと前に、ソン・ダウンは父親に何が起こったのかを伝えることができずに、自分自身が悪役になった。,崔秀敏并没有试图勾引准新娘，而是试图警告她，而在此之前，她自己也成为了恶棍，无法告诉宋多恩父亲发生了什么事。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,meta.emotionalBait,"손절한 전 절친이 내 예비신랑에게 계속 연락한다. 결혼 3주 전, 그 장면만 보면 누구라도 친구가 선을 넘었다고 생각한다.","My former best friend keeps contacting my fiancé after cutting ties with me. Three weeks before the wedding, anyone seeing only that would think she had crossed the line.",紛失した元親友は、私の婚約者に連絡し続けています。 結婚式の3週間前、現場を見た人は誰でも、自分の友人が一線を越えたと思っていました。,与我分手的前最好的朋友继续联系我的未婚夫。光是看到婚礼前三周的那一幕，任何人都会认为这位朋友已经越界了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,meta.resolutionDilemma,"최수민의 침묵이 매번 보호에서 비롯됐다 해도, 결과적으로 더 큰 오해와 낙인을 만들었다. 송다은의 성급한 단정은 잔인했지만 아버지의 진실을 모른 채 반응한 것이기도 하다.","Even if Choi Su-min’s silence came from protection each time, it ultimately created greater misunderstanding and stigma. Song Da-eun’s hasty judgment was cruel, but it was also a reaction made without knowing the truth about her father.",たとえチェ・スミンの沈黙が毎回保護から来たとしても、それはより大きな誤解とスティグマをもたらしました。 宋の慌てた主張は残酷だったが、父親の真実を知らずに反応した。,即使崔秀敏每次的沉默都是出于保护，但最终却造成了更大的误解和耻辱。宋多恩仓促的决定很残酷，但这也是在不了解父亲真相的情况下的反应。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,meta.title,손절한 절친,Ex-Best Friend Who Cut Ties,絶交した親友,断交的挚友,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,solutions.과거청산[0],"송다은 아버지의 과거 차용금 미상환과 현재 돈 접근 패턴을 사실로 확인하고, 최수민의 침묵이 보호에서 비롯됐음을 인정한다.","Confirm as fact Song Da-eun’s father’s past unpaid loan and current money pattern, and acknowledge that Choi Su-min’s silence came from a desire to protect.",ソン・ダウンは父親の過去の借用金未償還と現在の金銭接近パターンを事実として確認し、チェ・スミンの沈黙が保護から始まったことを認める。,宋多恩证实了父亲不偿还过去贷款和目前的资金获取模式的事实，并承认崔秀敏的沉默是出于保护。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,solutions.과거청산[1],"송다은은 아버지 문제를 직면하되, 최수민에게 과거 피해에 대한 사과의 기회를 마련한다.",Song Da-eun faces her father’s issue while giving Choi Su-min a chance to receive an apology for the past harm.,ソン・ダウンは父の問題に直面するが、チェ・スミンに過去の被害に対する謝罪の機会を設ける。,宋多恩面临父亲的问题，但却提供了一个机会，为过去伤害向崔秀敏道歉。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,solutions.명예회복[0],단톡방에서의 일방적 매도에 대해 송다은이 공통 친구들에게 정정 메시지를 보낸다.,Song Da-eun sends the mutual friends a correction about the one-sided smear in the group chat.,グループチャットでの一方的な売り上げについて、ソン・ダウンは共通の友人に訂正メッセージを送ります。,宋多恩向她共同的朋友就群聊中的单方面推销行为发出了纠正信息。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,solutions.명예회복[1],최수민도 혼자 막으려 하지 말고 신뢰할 수 있는 경로를 통해 소통하는 방식을 약속한다.,Choi Su-min also promises not to try to stop things alone and to communicate through a trustworthy channel.,チェ・スミンも一人で止めようとせず、信頼できる経路を通じてコミュニケーションする方法を約束する。,崔秀敏还承诺通过值得信赖的渠道进行沟通，而不是试图独自阻止。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,solutions.연락의도확인[0],"최수민의 연락이 집착이 아니라 경고였음을 양측이 인정하고, 방식의 적절성은 별도로 논의한다.","Both sides acknowledge that Choi Su-min’s contact was a warning, not obsession, and discuss the appropriateness of her method separately.",チェ・スミンの連絡が執着ではなく警告だったことを両側が認め、方式の適切性は別途議論する。,双方均承认崔秀敏的接触是一种警告，而非痴迷，具体方式的适当性将另行讨论。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,solutions.연락의도확인[1],예비신랑의 선 넘는 접근은 송다은에게도 공유하여 결혼 전에 신뢰를 재확인하는 기회로 삼는다.,"Share the fiancé’s overstepping approach with Song Da-eun as well, using it as a chance to reaffirm trust before the wedding.",婚約者の善以上のアプローチはソン・ダウンにも共有し、結婚前に信頼を再確認する機会とする。,宋多恩也分享了未婚夫过分的做法，宋多恩以此为契机，在婚前重申了信任。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,truthTable[t-1].fact,최수민의 연락은 집착이 아니라 송다은 아버지의 돈 접근을 경고하려는 것이었다.,"Choi Su-min’s contact was meant to warn about Song Da-eun’s father’s money approach, not obsession.",チェ・スミンの連絡は執着ではなく、ソン・ダウンは父親のお金の接近を警告しようとしたものだった。,崔秀敏的联系并不是痴迷，而是试图警告宋多恩她父亲有权获取金钱。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,truthTable[t-2].fact,예비신랑이 먼저 최수민에게 선 넘는 메시지를 보냈고 최수민은 거절했다.,"The fiancé first sent Choi Su-min an overstepping message, and Choi Su-min refused.",婚約者が先にチェ・スミンに善を超えたメッセージを送り、チェ・スミンは拒絶した。,未婚夫首先给崔秀敏发了一条越界的信息，被崔秀敏拒绝了。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,truthTable[t-3].fact,송다은 아버지는 과거 최수민에게도 돈을 빌린 뒤 일부만 갚았다.,Song Da-eun’s father also borrowed money from Choi Su-min in the past and repaid only part of it.,ソン・ダウンは父親は過去チェ・スミンにもお金を借りた後、一部だけ返済した。,宋多恩父亲以前向崔秀敏借过钱，只还了一部分。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,truthTable[t-4].fact,과거 손절은 최수민의 변심이 아니라 송다은 아버지의 차용금 미상환 때문이었다.,"The old fallout was caused by Song Da-eun’s father’s unpaid loan, not Choi Su-min changing her mind.",過去の絶交はチェ・スミンの変心ではなく、ソン・ダウンは父親の借用金未償還のためだった。,过去断交并不是因为崔秀敏改变主意，而是因为宋多恩父亲的贷款没有偿还。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,truthTable[t-5].fact,송다은이 확인 없이 단톡방에서 최수민을 먼저 매도했다.,Song Da-eun smeared Choi Su-min first in the group chat without verifying.,ソン・ダウンが確認せずにグループチャットでチェ・スミンを先に売った。,宋多恩在没有得到确认的情况下，在群聊中首次出卖了崔秀敏。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
