,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[0],최수민의 연락은 집착이 아니라 경고 목적이었다.,"Choi Su-min’s contact was for warning, not obsession.",チェ・スミンの連絡は執着ではなく警告目的だった。,崔秀敏的接触不是为了痴迷，而是为了警告。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[1],예비신랑이 먼저 최수민에게 선 넘는 접근을 했다.,The fiancé made the overstepping approach to Choi Su-min first.,婚約者が先にチェ・スミンに善を超えたアプローチをした。,未婚夫首先越过界限，接近崔秀敏。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[2],송다은 아버지의 돈 접근 패턴은 과거와 현재가 같다.,Song Da-eun’s father’s money pattern is the same in the past and present.,ソン・ダウン父の金銭接近パターンは過去と現在が同じだ。,宋多恩父亲接近钱财的模式过去和现在都是一样的。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[3],과거 손절의 진짜 원인은 송다은 아버지의 차용금 미상환이었다.,The real reason for the old fallout was Song Da-eun’s father’s unpaid loan.,過去の絶交の本当の原因はソン・ダウンの父親の借用金未償還だった。,过去断交的真正原因是宋多恩父亲没有偿还贷款。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,v3Design.officialRecordRecommendations[4],송다은이 확인 없이 단톡방에서 최수민을 먼저 매도했다.,Song Da-eun smeared Choi Su-min first in the group chat without verifying.,ソン・ダウンが確認せずにグループチャットでチェ・スミンを先に売った。,宋多恩在没有得到确认的情况下，在群聊中首次出卖了崔秀敏。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-6].risk,송다은 아버지의 차용금 미상환 사실을 너무 일찍 열면 송다은의 감정 폭발로 심문이 중단될 수 있다.,"If the unpaid loan by Song Da-eun’s father is opened too early, Song Da-eun’s emotional reaction may halt questioning.",これを早く開きすぎると尋問が乱れる可能性がある。,过早打开此项可能会打断询问。,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-6].targets[0],구체적 송금 금액,Specific transfer amounts,具体的な送金額,具体转账金额,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,case_surface_content,src/data/cases/generated,friend-01,v3Design.sensitiveSealTargets[e-6].targets[1],송다은 아버지 실명,Song Da-eun’s father’s real name,ソン・ダウンの父の実名,宋多恩父亲真实姓名,"Case metadata, character profile, dispute, evidence, solution, or evidence-viewer surface text. Party dialogue scripts are not included here."
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 우회 연락이 송다은에게 안긴 배신감을 정면으로 인정한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 친구가 본인에게 직접 말하지 않고 예비신랑에게만 연락했다는 사실이 그 자체로 깊은 배신감이었을 겁니다. 그 배신감이 본인 안에서 어떤 결론으로 이어졌는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, before we reach any conclusion, please describe how being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé felt to you at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、結論に入る前に、当時本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことがご本人にどう感じられたのかを述べてください。,宋多恩女士，在进入结论之前，请说明当时自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事带给你的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 우회로 인한 정보 차단의 결을 본인 입장에서 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v2].text,"본인이 건너뛰어졌다는 사실이 본인을 어떻게 흔들었는지, 그 흔들림 때문에 친구의 어떤 말이 더 이상 들리지 않았는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, separate what you felt then from what you believe now, and explain the part of being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé that weighed on you most.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分け、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことの中で最も重かった点を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开，说明自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事中最压在你心上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 직접 물을 기회를 놓친 망설임을 인정 가능한 형태로 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v3].text,"우회 연락의 이유를 본인이 친구에게 직접 물을 기회는 있었는지, 묻지 않은 쪽이 있었다면 그 망설임을 결론 없이 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, you do not need to decide the meaning here. Please start with the moment when being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé first became difficult for you.",ソン・ダウンさん、ここで意味を断定する必要はありません。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことが最初に重くなった時点から話してください。,宋多恩女士，这里不需要直接判定意义。请从自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事最初让你难以承受的时刻说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 정보 단절 동안 형성된 본인의 시나리오를 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v4].text,"본인이 거치지 않은 9일 동안 본인 안에서 어떤 시나리오가 만들어졌는지, 그 흐름 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, describe the sequence of feelings around being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé without adding a final judgment.",ソン・ダウンさん、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことをめぐる感情の流れを、最終判断を加えずに説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明围绕自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事产生的情绪顺序，不要加入最终判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. ""친구가 나 대신 그를 택했다""는 결정적 감각을 부드럽게 끌어낸다.","Empathy approach. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-bypass_da_eun-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 친구가 본인이 아니라 예비신랑을 택했다고 느낀 그 순간을, 단정이 아니라 그날의 감각으로만 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, if there was hesitation or hurt around being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé, state it in your own words and keep it to what you experienced.",ソン・ダウンさん、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことについて迷いや傷つきがあったなら、経験した範囲に限ってご自身の言葉で述べてください。,宋多恩女士，如果你对自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事有过犹豫或受伤，请限于自己的经历，用自己的话说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 결혼 직전 의심자의 충격을 인정하되, 의심을 단정하지 않고 첫 인지 순간의 감각만 끌어낸다.","Empathy approach. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 결혼을 앞둔 시점에 친구가 예비신랑에게 9일 동안 전화 6번, 문자 11번을 남긴 기록을 처음 봤을 때의 마음이 가볍지 않았을 겁니다. 그 무게를 인정하면서, 그날 그 기록이 본인에게 어떻게 다가왔는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, before we reach any conclusion, please describe how the nine-day record of calls and messages felt to you at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、結論に入る前に、当時9日間の通話とメッセージ記録がご本人にどう感じられたのかを述べてください。,宋多恩女士，在进入结论之前，请说明当时9天通话和短信记录带给你的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 새벽 알림이 키운 추측을 인정하면서 본인이 본 사실과 짐작을 분리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v2].text,"9일 사이 부재중과 새벽 시간대가 섞인 기록을 본인이 어디까지 직접 확인했고 어디부터는 추측으로 메웠는지, 그 경계를 단정 없이 구분해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, separate what you felt then from what you believe now, and explain the part of the nine-day record of calls and messages that weighed on you most.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分け、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録の中で最も重かった点を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开，说明9天通话和短信记录中最压在你心上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 의심이 굳어 가는 동안 직접 확인을 미룬 본인의 흐름을 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v3].text,"9일이라는 길이가 본인에게 어떤 무게로 다가왔는지, 그 무게 때문에 친구에게 직접 묻는 절차를 미룬 부분이 있다면 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, you do not need to decide the meaning here. Please start with the moment when the nine-day record of calls and messages first became difficult for you.",ソン・ダウンさん、ここで意味を断定する必要はありません。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録が最初に重くなった時点から話してください。,宋多恩女士，这里不需要直接判定意义。请从9天通话和短信记录最初让你难以承受的时刻说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 단정 직전의 감각을 끌어내고, 결론까지 가지 않게 막는다.","Empathy approach. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v4].text,"한밤중에 울린 친구의 연락 알림을 처음 본 그 순간의 느낌을, 단정이 아니라 그날 본인 안에서 일어난 감각의 결대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, describe the sequence of feelings around the nine-day record of calls and messages without adding a final judgment.",ソン・ダウンさん、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録をめぐる感情の流れを、最終判断を加えずに説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明围绕9天通话和短信记录产生的情绪顺序，不要加入最终判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 의심이 굳어진 결정적 한 장면을 그 감각 그대로 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-contact_timeline-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 9일 기록 가운데 본인의 의심을 가장 빨리 굳혔던 한 장면을 단정 없이 말씀해 주십시오. 그때 그 장면이 본인에게 무엇처럼 보였는지 함께 풀어 주시면 됩니다.","Ms. Song Da-eun, if there was hesitation or hurt around the nine-day record of calls and messages, state it in your own words and keep it to what you experienced.",ソン・ダウンさん、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録について迷いや傷つきがあったなら、経験した範囲に限ってご自身の言葉で述べてください。,宋多恩女士，如果你对9天通话和短信记录有过犹豫或受伤，请限于自己的经历，用自己的话说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 모호한 문구가 키운 불안을 인정하고, 추궁으로 굳어진 본인의 흐름을 끌어낸다.","Empathy approach. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v1].text,"송다은 씨, ""꼭 할 말이 있다""는 문구만 반복되고 정작 무슨 말인지 보이지 않는 상황이 본인을 더 불안하게 했을 겁니다. 그 불안이 본인 안에서 어떤 식으로 추궁 쪽으로 굳어졌는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, before we reach any conclusion, please describe how how you read the wording of the messages felt to you at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、結論に入る前に、当時メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかがご本人にどう感じられたのかを述べてください。,宋多恩女士，在进入结论之前，请说明当时你如何解读短信措辞带给你的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 호감 결여가 오히려 의심을 키운 역설을 본인 시점에서 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v2].text,"호감이 담긴 표현은 없는데 그래서 더 미심쩍게 보였던 마음이 있었다면, 어떤 한 문장이 그 감각을 가장 빠르게 만들었는지 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, separate what you felt then from what you believe now, and explain the part of how you read the wording of the messages that weighed on you most.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分け、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかの中で最も重かった点を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开，说明你如何解读短信措辞中最压在你心上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 직접 본 문구와 전해 들은 해석의 혼재를 본인이 인정할 공간을 연다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v3].text,"본인이 직접 읽은 문장과 예비신랑에게서 전해 들은 부분을 분리하기 어려웠다면, 그 어려움 자체를 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, you do not need to decide the meaning here. Please start with the moment when how you read the wording of the messages first became difficult for you.",ソン・ダウンさん、ここで意味を断定する必要はありません。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかが最初に重くなった時点から話してください。,宋多恩女士，这里不需要直接判定意义。请从你如何解读短信措辞最初让你难以承受的时刻说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 결론을 막고 모호한 문구가 만든 위협감만 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v4].text,"결혼 직전 친구의 모호한 문자가 본인에게 어떤 위협으로 보였는지, 단정 없이 그날의 감각만 풀어 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, describe the sequence of feelings around how you read the wording of the messages without adding a final judgment.",ソン・ダウンさん、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかをめぐる感情の流れを、最終判断を加えずに説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明围绕你如何解读短信措辞产生的情绪顺序，不要加入最终判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 의도 해석의 빈칸을 본인이 어떻게 메웠는지 인정하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-message_intent-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 문구의 빠진 의도를 본인이 어떤 식으로 메우려 했는지, 그 추정을 어디까지 사실처럼 받아들였는지 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, if there was hesitation or hurt around how you read the wording of the messages, state it in your own words and keep it to what you experienced.",ソン・ダウンさん、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかについて迷いや傷つきがあったなら、経験した範囲に限ってご自身の言葉で述べてください。,宋多恩女士，如果你对你如何解读短信措辞有过犹豫或受伤，请限于自己的经历，用自己的话说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v1].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 결혼을 앞둔 불안 때문에 무응답의 의미를 돌아보기 어려웠는지에 대해 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, before we reach any conclusion, please describe how the lack of response and the repeated contact felt to you at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、結論に入る前に、当時無応答と連絡の反復がご本人にどう感じられたのかを述べてください。,宋多恩女士，在进入结论之前，请说明当时未回应与反复联系带给你的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v2].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 무응답과 반복의 이유를 지금 다시 보면 어떤 감정이 앞서는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, separate what you felt then from what you believe now, and explain the part of the lack of response and the repeated contact that weighed on you most.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分け、無応答と連絡の反復の中で最も重かった点を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开，说明未回应与反复联系中最压在你心上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v3].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v3].text,"송다은 씨, 그때 말하지 못했거나 보지 못했던 부분을 솔직히 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, you do not need to decide the meaning here. Please start with the moment when the lack of response and the repeated contact first became difficult for you.",ソン・ダウンさん、ここで意味を断定する必要はありません。無応答と連絡の反復が最初に重くなった時点から話してください。,宋多恩女士，这里不需要直接判定意义。请从未回应与反复联系最初让你难以承受的时刻说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v4].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v4].text,"송다은 씨, 당시 감정과 지금의 판단을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, describe the sequence of feelings around the lack of response and the repeated contact without adding a final judgment.",ソン・ダウンさん、無応答と連絡の反復をめぐる感情の流れを、最終判断を加えずに説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明围绕未回应与反复联系产生的情绪顺序，不要加入最终判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v5].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-a-unanswered_escalation-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 이 쟁점이 본인에게 가장 부담스러운 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, if there was hesitation or hurt around the lack of response and the repeated contact, state it in your own words and keep it to what you experienced.",ソン・ダウンさん、無応答と連絡の反復について迷いや傷つきがあったなら、経験した範囲に限ってご自身の言葉で述べてください。,宋多恩女士，如果你对未回应与反复联系有过犹豫或受伤，请限于自己的经历，用自己的话说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 우회 결정의 무게를 인정하되, 연락 목적 단정은 미룬다.","Empathy approach. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 가장 먼저 말해야 했을 친구를 건너뛴 일이 본인에게도 무겁게 남아 있을 겁니다. 친구가 아니라 예비신랑이라는 우회 경로를 택한 그 결정의 결을, 결론은 미루고 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, before we reach any conclusion, please describe how why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly felt to you at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、結論に入る前に、当時ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由がご本人にどう感じられたのかを述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，在进入结论之前，请说明当时你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由带给你的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 직접 말하지 못한 두려움의 결만 끌어내고 S5 진실은 보호한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v2].text,송다은 씨에게 직접 말하기 어려웠던 사정이 있었다면 결론까지 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 그때 어떤 두려움이 더 컸는지만 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, separate what you felt then from what you believe now, and explain the part of why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly that weighed on you most.",チェ・スミンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分け、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由の中で最も重かった点を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开，说明你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由中最压在你心上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 우회 방식이 만든 결과를 본인 입으로 안고 있는지 확인한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v3].text,우회를 택한 본인의 판단이 결과적으로 친구를 더 의심에 가두었다는 점을 본인은 어떻게 받아들이고 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, you do not need to decide the meaning here. Please start with the moment when why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly first became difficult for you.",チェ・スミンさん、ここで意味を断定する必要はありません。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由が最初に重くなった時点から話してください。,崔秀敏女士，这里不需要直接判定意义。请从你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由最初让你难以承受的时刻说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인이 짊어진 무게의 비대칭을 인정 가능한 형태로 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v4].text,"본인이 대신 짊어진 무게가 있었다면 그 무게를 친구에게 끝까지 나누지 않은 이유를, 공개 가능한 범위에서 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, describe the sequence of feelings around why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly without adding a final judgment.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由をめぐる感情の流れを、最終判断を加えずに説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明围绕你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由产生的情绪顺序，不要加入最终判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 보호 의도와 오해된 결과의 간격을 본인 언어로 정리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-bypass_da_eun-v5].text,"친구를 보호하려는 의도가 있었다면 그 의도와 우회 방식이 만든 오해 사이의 간격을 본인이 어떻게 정리하고 있는지, 결론까지 풀지 말고 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, if there was hesitation or hurt around why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly, state it in your own words and keep it to what you experienced.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由について迷いや傷つきがあったなら、経験した範囲に限ってご自身の言葉で述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，如果你对你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由有过犹豫或受伤，请限于自己的经历，用自己的话说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 우회 연락을 이어 간 본인의 무게를 인정하되, 연락 목적 단정은 미룬다.","Empathy approach. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 친구의 결혼을 앞두고 그 예비신랑에게 9일 동안 반복 연락을 시도해야 했던 그 시간이 본인에게도 가볍지 않았을 겁니다. 그 시간 가운데 가장 마음이 무거웠던 지점을 결론 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, before we reach any conclusion, please describe how the order and purpose of the nine-day contact felt to you at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、結論に入る前に、当時9日間の連絡の順序と目的がご本人にどう感じられたのかを述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，在进入结论之前，请说明当时9天联系的顺序与目的带给你的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 응답 없는 다음 날의 결정 동력을 단정 없이 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v2].text,"답이 끊긴 다음 날에도 다시 전화를 건 그 순간 본인 안에서 무엇이 손을 움직였는지, 공개 가능한 범위에서 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, separate what you felt then from what you believe now, and explain the part of the order and purpose of the nine-day contact that weighed on you most.",チェ・スミンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分け、9日間の連絡の順序と目的の中で最も重かった点を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开，说明9天联系的顺序与目的中最压在你心上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 새벽 시도의 부담을 인정하되, 연락 목적 단정은 막는다.","Empathy approach. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v3].text,"새벽 시간대 연락이 본인에게도 부담이었을 텐데 그 시간을 골라 시도한 사정이 있다면, 결론까지 풀 필요는 없고 그날의 상황 결로만 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, you do not need to decide the meaning here. Please start with the moment when the order and purpose of the nine-day contact first became difficult for you.",チェ・スミンさん、ここで意味を断定する必要はありません。9日間の連絡の順序と目的が最初に重くなった時点から話してください。,崔秀敏女士，这里不需要直接判定意义。请从9天联系的顺序与目的最初让你难以承受的时刻说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 멈추지 못한 본인의 상태를 본인 언어로 정리하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v4].text,부재중이 6번 쌓이는 동안에도 본인을 멈추지 못한 그 상태를 본인은 지금 어떻게 정리하고 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, describe the sequence of feelings around the order and purpose of the nine-day contact without adding a final judgment.",チェ・スミンさん、9日間の連絡の順序と目的をめぐる感情の流れを、最終判断を加えずに説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明围绕9天联系的顺序与目的产生的情绪顺序，不要加入最终判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 직접 대면 대신 우회를 택한 본인의 시간을 본인 시점에서 말하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-contact_timeline-v5].text,"친구를 직접 만나 말하지 못한 채 통화와 문자에만 매달린 9일이 본인에게는 어떤 시간이었는지, 단정 없이 그 결로 풀어 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, if there was hesitation or hurt around the order and purpose of the nine-day contact, state it in your own words and keep it to what you experienced.",チェ・スミンさん、9日間の連絡の順序と目的について迷いや傷つきがあったなら、経験した範囲に限ってご自身の言葉で述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，如果你对9天联系的顺序与目的有过犹豫或受伤，请限于自己的经历，用自己的话说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v1].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 단어 선택의 무거움을 인정하되, 연락 목적은 단정하지 않는다.","Empathy approach. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 호감 한 줄 끼워 넣지 못하고 ""꼭 할 말이 있다""만 반복해 보낸 본인의 어려움이 있었을 겁니다. 무엇이 본인을 그렇게 단어를 골라 쓰게 했는지, 결론은 미루고 그 이유의 결만 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, before we reach any conclusion, please describe how what you meant by the message wording felt to you at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、結論に入る前に、当時メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかがご本人にどう感じられたのかを述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，在进入结论之前，请说明当时你通过短信措辞想表达什么带给你的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 핵심을 적지 못한 본인의 답답함을 진실 누설 없이 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v2].text,"정작 가장 중요한 말은 적지 못한 채 신호만 남긴 본인의 답답함을, 공개 가능한 범위에서 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, separate what you felt then from what you believe now, and explain the part of what you meant by the message wording that weighed on you most.",チェ・スミンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分け、メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかの中で最も重かった点を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开，说明你通过短信措辞想表达什么中最压在你心上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 오해 가능성을 알고도 보낸 우선순위를 본인 시점에서 끌어낸다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v3].text,"그 문자가 오해를 살 줄 알면서도 예비신랑에게 보낸 그 순간, 본인 안에서 가장 우선순위였던 것이 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, you do not need to decide the meaning here. Please start with the moment when what you meant by the message wording first became difficult for you.",チェ・スミンさん、ここで意味を断定する必要はありません。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかが最初に重くなった時点から話してください。,崔秀敏女士，这里不需要直接判定意义。请从你通过短信措辞想表达什么最初让你难以承受的时刻说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 짐작과 결정 사이의 거리를 본인이 인정하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v4].text,"본인이 보낸 문구가 송다은 씨에게 어떻게 읽힐지 짐작은 했는지, 그 짐작과 그래도 보낸 결정 사이의 거리를 결론 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, describe the sequence of feelings around what you meant by the message wording without adding a final judgment.",チェ・スミンさん、メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかをめぐる感情の流れを、最終判断を加えずに説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明围绕你通过短信措辞想表达什么产生的情绪顺序，不要加入最终判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v5].behaviorHint,"공감 접근. 직접 말하지 못한 사정의 무게만 끌어내고, S5 진실은 보호한다.","Empathy approach. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-message_intent-v5].text,직접 말하지 못한 사정이 있었다면 그 사정을 결론까지 풀 필요는 없습니다. 다만 그 사정이 본인에게 어떤 무게였는지만이라도 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, if there was hesitation or hurt around what you meant by the message wording, state it in your own words and keep it to what you experienced.",チェ・スミンさん、メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかについて迷いや傷つきがあったなら、経験した範囲に限ってご自身の言葉で述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，如果你对你通过短信措辞想表达什么有过犹豫或受伤，请限于自己的经历，用自己的话说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v1].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 확인해야 한다는 압박과 방식이 과했다는 부담에 대해 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, before we reach any conclusion, please describe how why the contact continued despite no response felt to you at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、結論に入る前に、当時応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由がご本人にどう感じられたのかを述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，在进入结论之前，请说明当时没有回应时仍继续联系的理由带给你的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v2].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v2].text,"최수민 씨, 무응답과 반복의 이유를 지금 다시 보면 어떤 감정이 앞서는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, separate what you felt then from what you believe now, and explain the part of why the contact continued despite no response that weighed on you most.",チェ・スミンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分け、応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由の中で最も重かった点を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开，说明没有回应时仍继续联系的理由中最压在你心上的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v3].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v3].text,"최수민 씨, 그때 말하지 못했거나 보지 못했던 부분을 솔직히 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, you do not need to decide the meaning here. Please start with the moment when why the contact continued despite no response first became difficult for you.",チェ・スミンさん、ここで意味を断定する必要はありません。応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由が最初に重くなった時点から話してください。,崔秀敏女士，这里不需要直接判定意义。请从没有回应时仍继续联系的理由最初让你难以承受的时刻说起。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v4].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 당시 감정과 지금의 판단을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, describe the sequence of feelings around why the contact continued despite no response without adding a final judgment.",チェ・スミンさん、応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由をめぐる感情の流れを、最終判断を加えずに説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明围绕没有回应时仍继续联系的理由产生的情绪顺序，不要加入最终判断。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v5].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Empathy approach. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Acknowledge the emotional pressure, then draw out the point without turning it into a conclusion.",共感アプローチ。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。感情の圧力を認めつつ、結論にせず要点を引き出す。,共情接近。聚焦未回应与反复联系。承认情绪压力，但不把它直接变成结论，先引出要点。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-b-unanswered_escalation-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 이 쟁점이 본인에게 가장 부담스러운 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, if there was hesitation or hurt around why the contact continued despite no response, state it in your own words and keep it to what you experienced.",チェ・スミンさん、応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由について迷いや傷つきがあったなら、経験した範囲に限ってご自身の言葉で述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，如果你对没有回应时仍继续联系的理由有过犹豫或受伤，请限于自己的经历，用自己的话说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자신에게 닿은 연락 기록의 유무를 시점별로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 같은 기간 본인 휴대전화에 최수민 씨로부터 온 연락이 있었는지 시점별로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, please identify what in being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé you directly confirmed and what came later by explanation or assumption.",ソン・ダウンさん、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことのうち直接確認した部分と、後から説明や推測で知った部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请把自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事中你直接确认的部分，以及后来通过说明或推测得知的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자신에게 닿은 연락 기록의 유무를 시점별로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v2].text,직접 받은 연락과 다른 사람을 거쳐 전해 들은 연락을 구분해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, answer in order. Which parts of being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé are supported by records, and which parts remain your interpretation?",ソン・ダウンさん、順を追って答えてください。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことのどこが記録で確認でき、どこが解釈に残っていますか。,宋多恩女士，请按顺序回答。自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事中哪些有记录支持，哪些仍属于你的解读？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자신에게 닿은 연락 기록의 유무를 시점별로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v3].text,"""나에게는 한 번도 연락 안 했다""는 본인 발언과 통화·문자 기록이 어긋나는 구간이 있는지 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, keep this to the record. Tell the court what you saw, what you heard, and what you still dispute about being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録に基づいて答えてください。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことについて見たこと、聞いたこと、なお争う点を述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请限于记录回答。关于自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事，你看到了什么、听到了什么、仍争议什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자신에게 닿은 연락 기록의 유무를 시점별로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v4].text,그 9일 안에 본인 주변에서 최수민 씨가 본인을 찾으려 했다는 이야기를 들은 사람이 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, separate direct knowledge from later understanding as you explain being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé.",ソン・ダウンさん、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことを説明する際、直接知っていることと後から理解したことを分けてください。,宋多恩女士，说明自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事时，请分清直接知道的事和后来才理解的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 자신에게 닿은 연락 기록의 유무를 시점별로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-bypass_da_eun-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 본인에게 직접 연락이 없었다는 부분에 대해 아직 확인하지 않은 경로가 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, state how this point connects to your earlier statement, using only the confirmed facts around being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé.",ソン・ダウンさん、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことについて確認済みの事実だけを使い、これまでの陳述とどうつながるかを述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请只使用自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事周围已确认的事实，说明它如何连接到你之前的陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은이 본 기록과 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 9일 동안의 발신 횟수와 시간대를 어디서 어떤 기록으로 확인했는지 시점 순서로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, please identify what in the nine-day record of calls and messages you directly confirmed and what came later by explanation or assumption.",ソン・ダウンさん、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録のうち直接確認した部分と、後から説明や推測で知った部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请把9天通话和短信记录中你直接确认的部分，以及后来通过说明或推测得知的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은이 본 기록과 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v2].text,그 기록 중 본인이 직접 본 항목과 다른 사람의 말로 들은 항목을 구분해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, answer in order. Which parts of the nine-day record of calls and messages are supported by records, and which parts remain your interpretation?",ソン・ダウンさん、順を追って答えてください。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録のどこが記録で確認でき、どこが解釈に残っていますか。,宋多恩女士，请按顺序回答。9天通话和短信记录中哪些有记录支持，哪些仍属于你的解读？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은이 본 기록과 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v3].text,부재중 11건이라는 수치와 본인이 단톡방에 올린 표현 사이에 차이가 있다면 어떤 부분이 다른지 짚어 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, keep this to the record. Tell the court what you saw, what you heard, and what you still dispute about the nine-day record of calls and messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録に基づいて答えてください。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録について見たこと、聞いたこと、なお争う点を述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请限于记录回答。关于9天通话和短信记录，你看到了什么、听到了什么、仍争议什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은이 본 기록과 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v4].text,그 시간표를 가장 먼저 본 사람이 누구이고 본인은 어느 시점에 어떤 형태로 받아 봤는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, separate direct knowledge from later understanding as you explain the nine-day record of calls and messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録を説明する際、直接知っていることと後から理解したことを分けてください。,宋多恩女士，说明9天通话和短信记录时，请分清直接知道的事和后来才理解的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은이 본 기록과 추정을 분리해 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-contact_timeline-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 발신 시간대 중 아직 본인이 직접 확인하지 않은 구간이 있다면 어디인지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, state how this point connects to your earlier statement, using only the confirmed facts around the nine-day record of calls and messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録について確認済みの事実だけを使い、これまでの陳述とどうつながるかを述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请只使用9天通话和短信记录周围已确认的事实，说明它如何连接到你之前的陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 문구와 전해 들은 요약을 분리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 본인이 본 문자 중 의도를 가늠한 근거가 된 표현이 무엇이었는지 시점 순서로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, please identify what in how you read the wording of the messages you directly confirmed and what came later by explanation or assumption.",ソン・ダウンさん、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかのうち直接確認した部分と、後から説明や推測で知った部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请把你如何解读短信措辞中你直接确认的部分，以及后来通过说明或推测得知的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 문구와 전해 들은 요약을 분리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v2].text,본인이 직접 읽은 원문과 다른 사람에게 전해 들은 요약을 구분해 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, answer in order. Which parts of how you read the wording of the messages are supported by records, and which parts remain your interpretation?",ソン・ダウンさん、順を追って答えてください。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかのどこが記録で確認でき、どこが解釈に残っていますか。,宋多恩女士，请按顺序回答。你如何解读短信措辞中哪些有记录支持，哪些仍属于你的解读？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 문구와 전해 들은 요약을 분리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v3].text,본인이 단톡방에서 옮겨 적은 표현과 실제 문자 원문 사이에 어긋나는 부분이 있는지 짚어 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, keep this to the record. Tell the court what you saw, what you heard, and what you still dispute about how you read the wording of the messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録に基づいて答えてください。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかについて見たこと、聞いたこと、なお争う点を述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请限于记录回答。关于你如何解读短信措辞，你看到了什么、听到了什么、仍争议什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 문구와 전해 들은 요약을 분리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v4].text,그 문자 원문을 본인 외에 누가 같이 봤고 그 사람들의 해석이 본인과 같았는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, separate direct knowledge from later understanding as you explain how you read the wording of the messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかを説明する際、直接知っていることと後から理解したことを分けてください。,宋多恩女士，说明你如何解读短信措辞时，请分清直接知道的事和后来才理解的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 본 문구와 전해 들은 요약을 분리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-message_intent-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 본인이 의도라고 단정한 문자 외에 아직 확인하지 않은 메시지가 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, state how this point connects to your earlier statement, using only the confirmed facts around how you read the wording of the messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかについて確認済みの事実だけを使い、これまでの陳述とどうつながるかを述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请只使用你如何解读短信措辞周围已确认的事实，说明它如何连接到你之前的陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 반복 연락 중 실제 응답이 없었던 구간과 본인이 직접 확인한 구간에 대해 기록 기준으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, please identify what in the lack of response and the repeated contact you directly confirmed and what came later by explanation or assumption.",ソン・ダウンさん、無応答と連絡の反復のうち直接確認した部分と、後から説明や推測で知った部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请把未回应与反复联系中你直接确认的部分，以及后来通过说明或推测得知的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 무응답과 반복의 이유에 관해 확인한 부분과 추정한 부분을 구분해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, answer in order. Which parts of the lack of response and the repeated contact are supported by records, and which parts remain your interpretation?",ソン・ダウンさん、順を追って答えてください。無応答と連絡の反復のどこが記録で確認でき、どこが解釈に残っていますか。,宋多恩女士，请按顺序回答。未回应与反复联系中哪些有记录支持，哪些仍属于你的解读？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
