,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v3].text,"송다은 씨, 반복 연락 중 실제 응답이 없었던 구간과 본인이 직접 확인한 구간이 이 쟁점에서 어떤 의미인지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, keep this to the record. Tell the court what you saw, what you heard, and what you still dispute about the lack of response and the repeated contact.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録に基づいて答えてください。無応答と連絡の反復について見たこと、聞いたこと、なお争う点を述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请限于记录回答。关于未回应与反复联系，你看到了什么、听到了什么、仍争议什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v4].text,"송다은 씨, 무응답과 반복의 이유에서 본인이 직접 확인한 사실과 나중에 알게 된 사실을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, separate direct knowledge from later understanding as you explain the lack of response and the repeated contact.",ソン・ダウンさん、無応答と連絡の反復を説明する際、直接知っていることと後から理解したことを分けてください。,宋多恩女士，说明未回应与反复联系时，请分清直接知道的事和后来才理解的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-a-unanswered_escalation-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 이 부분이 기존 진술과 어떻게 이어지는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, state how this point connects to your earlier statement, using only the confirmed facts around the lack of response and the repeated contact.",ソン・ダウンさん、無応答と連絡の反復について確認済みの事実だけを使い、これまでの陳述とどうつながるかを述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请只使用未回应与反复联系周围已确认的事实，说明它如何连接到你之前的陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은 쪽으로 시도한 통로를 기록 기준으로 답하게 한다. 우회 동기는 묻지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 같은 기간 송다은 씨 본인에게 직접 연락하거나 만나려 한 시도가 있었는지 시점별로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, please identify what in why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly you directly confirmed and what came later by explanation or assumption.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由のうち直接確認した部分と、後から説明や推測で知った部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请把你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由中你直接确认的部分，以及后来通过说明或推测得知的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은 쪽으로 시도한 통로를 기록 기준으로 답하게 한다. 우회 동기는 묻지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v2].text,송다은 씨에게 보낸 연락과 예비신랑에게 보낸 연락을 횟수 기준으로 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, answer in order. Which parts of why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly are supported by records, and which parts remain your interpretation?",チェ・スミンさん、順を追って答えてください。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由のどこが記録で確認でき、どこが解釈に残っていますか。,崔秀敏女士，请按顺序回答。你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由中哪些有记录支持，哪些仍属于你的解读？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은 쪽으로 시도한 통로를 기록 기준으로 답하게 한다. 우회 동기는 묻지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v3].text,송다은 씨에게 직접 말하려 했다고 본인이 한 진술과 실제 발신 기록이 어긋나는 부분이 있다면 어느 시점인지 짚어 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, keep this to the record. Tell the court what you saw, what you heard, and what you still dispute about why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録に基づいて答えてください。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由について見たこと、聞いたこと、なお争う点を述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请限于记录回答。关于你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由，你看到了什么、听到了什么、仍争议什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은 쪽으로 시도한 통로를 기록 기준으로 답하게 한다. 우회 동기는 묻지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v4].text,"본인 외에 송다은 씨에게 대신 말을 전해 줄 수 있는 사람이 있었는지, 그 사람에게 부탁한 적이 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, separate direct knowledge from later understanding as you explain why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由を説明する際、直接知っていることと後から理解したことを分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，说明你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由时，请分清直接知道的事和后来才理解的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 송다은 쪽으로 시도한 통로를 기록 기준으로 답하게 한다. 우회 동기는 묻지 않는다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-bypass_da_eun-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨 쪽으로 시도한 연락 경로 중 아직 기록에 남지 않은 것이 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, state how this point connects to your earlier statement, using only the confirmed facts around why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由について確認済みの事実だけを使い、これまでの陳述とどうつながるかを述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请只使用你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由周围已确认的事实，说明它如何连接到你之前的陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 발신 시각·횟수·응답을 기록 기준으로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 9일 동안 예비신랑에게 건 전화와 보낸 문자를 발신 시각 순서대로 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, please identify what in the order and purpose of the nine-day contact you directly confirmed and what came later by explanation or assumption.",チェ・スミンさん、9日間の連絡の順序と目的のうち直接確認した部分と、後から説明や推測で知った部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请把9天联系的顺序与目的中你直接确认的部分，以及后来通过说明或推测得知的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 발신 시각·횟수·응답을 기록 기준으로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v2].text,그중 직접 통화로 이어진 건과 부재중에 그친 건을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, answer in order. Which parts of the order and purpose of the nine-day contact are supported by records, and which parts remain your interpretation?",チェ・スミンさん、順を追って答えてください。9日間の連絡の順序と目的のどこが記録で確認でき、どこが解釈に残っていますか。,崔秀敏女士，请按顺序回答。9天联系的顺序与目的中哪些有记录支持，哪些仍属于你的解读？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 발신 시각·횟수·응답을 기록 기준으로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v3].text,단톡방에서 알려진 횟수와 본인 발신 기록이 어긋나는 지점이 있다면 어느 항목인지 설명해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, keep this to the record. Tell the court what you saw, what you heard, and what you still dispute about the order and purpose of the nine-day contact.",チェ・スミンさん、記録に基づいて答えてください。9日間の連絡の順序と目的について見たこと、聞いたこと、なお争う点を述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请限于记录回答。关于9天联系的顺序与目的，你看到了什么、听到了什么、仍争议什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 발신 시각·횟수·응답을 기록 기준으로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v4].text,발신 직후 상대로부터 어떤 응답이 있었고 본인은 그 응답을 받고 다음 연락까지 얼마를 기다렸는지 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, separate direct knowledge from later understanding as you explain the order and purpose of the nine-day contact.",チェ・スミンさん、9日間の連絡の順序と目的を説明する際、直接知っていることと後から理解したことを分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，说明9天联系的顺序与目的时，请分清直接知道的事和后来才理解的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 발신 시각·횟수·응답을 기록 기준으로 정리하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-contact_timeline-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 9일 안에 아직 기록으로 확인되지 않은 발신이 더 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, state how this point connects to your earlier statement, using only the confirmed facts around the order and purpose of the nine-day contact.",チェ・スミンさん、9日間の連絡の順序と目的について確認済みの事実だけを使い、これまでの陳述とどうつながるかを述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请只使用9天联系的顺序与目的周围已确认的事实，说明它如何连接到你之前的陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 실제 작성한 문구의 원문을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 9일 동안 보낸 문자에서 호감 표현이 아니라 ""할 말이 있다""는 식으로 적은 문구가 어떤 것이었는지 순서대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, please identify what in what you meant by the message wording you directly confirmed and what came later by explanation or assumption.",チェ・スミンさん、メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかのうち直接確認した部分と、後から説明や推測で知った部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请把你通过短信措辞想表达什么中你直接确认的部分，以及后来通过说明或推测得知的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 실제 작성한 문구의 원문을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v2].text,그 문자 중 직접 작성한 것과 다른 글에서 인용한 것을 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, answer in order. Which parts of what you meant by the message wording are supported by records, and which parts remain your interpretation?",チェ・スミンさん、順を追って答えてください。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかのどこが記録で確認でき、どこが解釈に残っていますか。,崔秀敏女士，请按顺序回答。你通过短信措辞想表达什么中哪些有记录支持，哪些仍属于你的解读？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 실제 작성한 문구의 원문을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v3].text,단톡방에 떠도는 요약과 본인이 실제로 적은 원문이 다른 부분이 있다면 어떤 단어가 다른지 짚어 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, keep this to the record. Tell the court what you saw, what you heard, and what you still dispute about what you meant by the message wording.",チェ・スミンさん、記録に基づいて答えてください。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかについて見たこと、聞いたこと、なお争う点を述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请限于记录回答。关于你通过短信措辞想表达什么，你看到了什么、听到了什么、仍争议什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 실제 작성한 문구의 원문을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v4].text,"그 문구를 적을 때 함께 본 사람이 있었는지, 본인 외 누구에게 그 표현을 보여 준 적이 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, separate direct knowledge from later understanding as you explain what you meant by the message wording.",チェ・スミンさん、メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかを説明する際、直接知っていることと後から理解したことを分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，说明你通过短信措辞想表达什么时，请分清直接知道的事和后来才理解的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 실제 작성한 문구의 원문을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on what you meant by the message wording. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかに焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦你通过短信措辞想表达什么。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-message_intent-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 문자 원문 중 아직 공개되지 않은 표현이 더 남아 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, state how this point connects to your earlier statement, using only the confirmed facts around what you meant by the message wording.",チェ・スミンさん、メッセージ文面で何を伝えようとしたかについて確認済みの事実だけを使い、これまでの陳述とどうつながるかを述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请只使用你通过短信措辞想表达什么周围已确认的事实，说明它如何连接到你之前的陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 답을 받지 못해 다시 연락한 구간과 본인이 과하게 밀어붙인 구간에 대해 기록 기준으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, please identify what in why the contact continued despite no response you directly confirmed and what came later by explanation or assumption.",チェ・スミンさん、応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由のうち直接確認した部分と、後から説明や推測で知った部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请把没有回应时仍继续联系的理由中你直接确认的部分，以及后来通过说明或推测得知的部分分开。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v2].text,"최수민 씨, 무응답과 반복의 이유에 관해 확인한 부분과 추정한 부분을 구분해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, answer in order. Which parts of why the contact continued despite no response are supported by records, and which parts remain your interpretation?",チェ・スミンさん、順を追って答えてください。応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由のどこが記録で確認でき、どこが解釈に残っていますか。,崔秀敏女士，请按顺序回答。没有回应时仍继续联系的理由中哪些有记录支持，哪些仍属于你的解读？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v3].text,"최수민 씨, 답을 받지 못해 다시 연락한 구간과 본인이 과하게 밀어붙인 구간이 이 쟁점에서 어떤 의미인지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, keep this to the record. Tell the court what you saw, what you heard, and what you still dispute about why the contact continued despite no response.",チェ・スミンさん、記録に基づいて答えてください。応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由について見たこと、聞いたこと、なお争う点を述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请限于记录回答。关于没有回应时仍继续联系的理由，你看到了什么、听到了什么、仍争议什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 무응답과 반복의 이유에서 본인이 직접 확인한 사실과 나중에 알게 된 사실을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, separate direct knowledge from later understanding as you explain why the contact continued despite no response.",チェ・スミンさん、応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由を説明する際、直接知っていることと後から理解したことを分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，说明没有回应时仍继续联系的理由时，请分清直接知道的事和后来才理解的事。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,"Fact pursuit. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Keep the answer tied to records, sequence, and what was directly confirmed.",事実追及。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。記録、順序、直接確認した事実に答えを結びつける。,事实追问。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把回答限定在记录、顺序和直接确认的事实内。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-b-unanswered_escalation-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 이 부분이 기존 진술과 어떻게 이어지는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, state how this point connects to your earlier statement, using only the confirmed facts around why the contact continued despite no response.",チェ・スミンさん、応答がない中で連絡が続いた理由について確認済みの事実だけを使い、これまでの陳述とどうつながるかを述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请只使用没有回应时仍继续联系的理由周围已确认的事实，说明它如何连接到你之前的陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 묻지 않고 다른 통로에 의존한 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 그 9일 동안 최수민 씨에게 직접 ‘무슨 일이냐’고 물어보지 않은 본인의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, explain why you responded as you did when faced with being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé.",ソン・ダウンさん、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに直面したとき、なぜその対応を選んだのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，面对自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事时，你为什么选择那样回应？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 묻지 않고 다른 통로에 의존한 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v2].text,예비신랑의 설명을 우선 받아들이고 최수민 씨에게는 묻지 않기로 한 판단이 어디에서 시작됐는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, what choice did you make at that point, and what reason did you give yourself at the time?",ソン・ダウンさん、その時点でどの選択をし、当時ご自身にどんな理由を与えていましたか。,宋多恩女士，在那个时间点你做了什么选择，当时给自己的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 묻지 않고 다른 통로에 의존한 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v3].text,본인 입에서 직접 확인하기 부담스러웠던 부분이 있었다면 무엇을 피하고 싶었는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, separate the reason you can admit now from the part you still contest, and answer regarding being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé.",ソン・ダウンさん、今認められる理由とまだ争う部分を分け、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことについて答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请把现在可以承认的理由和仍有争议的部分分开，就自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 묻지 않고 다른 통로에 의존한 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v4].text,예비신랑과 친구 사이의 일이라는 점이 본인의 직접 확인을 어떻게 미루게 만들었는지 설명해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, if your judgment narrowed at that moment, explain what made it narrow without adding a conclusion.",ソン・ダウンさん、その時点で判断が狭まったなら、結論を加えず何がそうさせたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，如果当时你的判断开始收窄，请不要加入结论，只说明是什么让它收窄。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 묻지 않고 다른 통로에 의존한 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-bypass_da_eun-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 직접 통화 한 번이면 끝났을 일을 단톡방으로 가져가게 된 본인 쪽 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, tell the court what you were trying to protect or avoid when dealing with being bypassed while the contact went to your fiancé.",ソン・ダウンさん、本人を通さず婚約者へ連絡が行ったことに向き合う中で、何を守り、何を避けようとしていたのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，处理自己被绕开、联系却转向未婚夫这件事时，你想保护什么，又想避开什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 연락 횟수만으로 단정에 닿은 본인 쪽 부담을 답하게 한다. 확인 요청/차용금 미상환 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 9일이라는 숫자가 본인 안에서 결론으로 굳어진 시점이 언제였는지, 그렇게 단정으로 끌고 간 본인 쪽 부담이 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, explain why you responded as you did when faced with the nine-day record of calls and messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に直面したとき、なぜその対応を選んだのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，面对9天通话和短信记录时，你为什么选择那样回应？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 연락 횟수만으로 단정에 닿은 본인 쪽 부담을 답하게 한다. 확인 요청/차용금 미상환 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v2].text,발신 횟수만으로 의심을 굳히기까지 본인이 거쳤어야 했던 확인 단계를 굳이 건너뛴 이유는 무엇입니까.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, what choice did you make at that point, and what reason did you give yourself at the time?",ソン・ダウンさん、その時点でどの選択をし、当時ご自身にどんな理由を与えていましたか。,宋多恩女士，在那个时间点你做了什么选择，当时给自己的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 연락 횟수만으로 단정에 닿은 본인 쪽 부담을 답하게 한다. 확인 요청/차용금 미상환 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v3].text,결혼 3주 전이라는 시기가 그 시간표를 받아들이는 방식에 어떤 영향을 줬는지 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, separate the reason you can admit now from the part you still contest, and answer regarding the nine-day record of calls and messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、今認められる理由とまだ争う部分を分け、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録について答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请把现在可以承认的理由和仍有争议的部分分开，就9天通话和短信记录回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 연락 횟수만으로 단정에 닿은 본인 쪽 부담을 답하게 한다. 확인 요청/차용금 미상환 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v4].text,본인 안에서 그 횟수를 ‘집착’으로 부르기로 결정한 순간이 있다면 그 직전에 어떤 생각이 먼저 떠올랐는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, if your judgment narrowed at that moment, explain what made it narrow without adding a conclusion.",ソン・ダウンさん、その時点で判断が狭まったなら、結論を加えず何がそうさせたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，如果当时你的判断开始收窄，请不要加入结论，只说明是什么让它收窄。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 연락 횟수만으로 단정에 닿은 본인 쪽 부담을 답하게 한다. 확인 요청/차용금 미상환 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on the nine-day record of calls and messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦9天通话和短信记录。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-contact_timeline-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그 시간표를 다른 식으로 해석할 수 있다는 가능성을 차단한 이유가 무엇이었는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, tell the court what you were trying to protect or avoid when dealing with the nine-day record of calls and messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、9日間の通話とメッセージ記録に向き合う中で、何を守り、何を避けようとしていたのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，处理9天通话和短信记录时，你想保护什么，又想避开什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인이 본 단어와 단정 결론 사이의 자기 해석 과정을 답하게 한다. 의도 진실은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 본인이 본 문구 중 어느 표현이 ‘꼭 만나야 한다’ 쪽으로 의미를 잡게 만들었는지, 그렇게 잡은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, explain why you responded as you did when faced with how you read the wording of the messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに直面したとき、なぜその対応を選んだのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，面对你如何解读短信措辞时，你为什么选择那样回应？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인이 본 단어와 단정 결론 사이의 자기 해석 과정을 답하게 한다. 의도 진실은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v2].text,그 문구에 다른 해석이 가능했음에도 한쪽으로만 받아들인 본인의 판단 과정을 설명해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, what choice did you make at that point, and what reason did you give yourself at the time?",ソン・ダウンさん、その時点でどの選択をし、当時ご自身にどんな理由を与えていましたか。,宋多恩女士，在那个时间点你做了什么选择，当时给自己的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인이 본 단어와 단정 결론 사이의 자기 해석 과정을 답하게 한다. 의도 진실은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v3].text,확인되지 않은 부분을 비워둔 채로 의도를 단정하게 된 본인 안의 어떤 부담이 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, separate the reason you can admit now from the part you still contest, and answer regarding how you read the wording of the messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、今認められる理由とまだ争う部分を分け、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかについて答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请把现在可以承认的理由和仍有争议的部分分开，就你如何解读短信措辞回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인이 본 단어와 단정 결론 사이의 자기 해석 과정을 답하게 한다. 의도 진실은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v4].text,그 문구를 처음 본 직후 본인이 가장 먼저 떠올린 사람이나 사건이 무엇이었기에 그쪽으로 의미를 굳혔는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Song Da-eun, if your judgment narrowed at that moment, explain what made it narrow without adding a conclusion.",ソン・ダウンさん、その時点で判断が狭まったなら、結論を加えず何がそうさせたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，如果当时你的判断开始收窄，请不要加入结论，只说明是什么让它收窄。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 본인이 본 단어와 단정 결론 사이의 자기 해석 과정을 답하게 한다. 의도 진실은 열지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on how you read the wording of the messages. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你如何解读短信措辞。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-message_intent-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그 문구의 의도를 본인이 직접 묻기보다 다른 사람의 요약으로 정리한 이유는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song Da-eun, tell the court what you were trying to protect or avoid when dealing with how you read the wording of the messages.",ソン・ダウンさん、メッセージ文面をどう読み取ったかに向き合う中で、何を守り、何を避けようとしていたのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，处理你如何解读短信措辞时，你想保护什么，又想避开什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v1].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 무응답 가능성을 보지 않고 연락 횟수를 먼저 문제 삼은 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, explain why you responded as you did when faced with the lack of response and the repeated contact.",ソン・ダウンさん、無応答と連絡の反復に直面したとき、なぜその対応を選んだのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，面对未回应与反复联系时，你为什么选择那样回应？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v2].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 무응답과 반복의 이유에서 그 판단이 어디서 시작됐는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, what choice did you make at that point, and what reason did you give yourself at the time?",ソン・ダウンさん、その時点でどの選択をし、当時ご自身にどんな理由を与えていましたか。,宋多恩女士，在那个时间点你做了什么选择，当时给自己的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v3].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v3].text,"송다은 씨, 무응답 가능성을 보지 않고 연락 횟수를 먼저 문제 삼은 이유가 당시 판단에 어떤 영향을 줬는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, separate the reason you can admit now from the part you still contest, and answer regarding the lack of response and the repeated contact.",ソン・ダウンさん、今認められる理由とまだ争う部分を分け、無応答と連絡の反復について答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请把现在可以承认的理由和仍有争议的部分分开，就未回应与反复联系回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v4].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v4].text,"송다은 씨, 이 선택을 하게 된 이유와 그때 놓친 부분을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, if your judgment narrowed at that moment, explain what made it narrow without adding a conclusion.",ソン・ダウンさん、その時点で判断が狭まったなら、結論を加えず何がそうさせたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，如果当时你的判断开始收窄，请不要加入结论，只说明是什么让它收窄。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v5].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 무응답과 반복의 이유 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive search. Focus on the lack of response and the repeated contact. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。無応答と連絡の反復に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦未回应与反复联系。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-a-unanswered_escalation-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 같은 상황에서 다른 선택을 하지 못한 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song Da-eun, tell the court what you were trying to protect or avoid when dealing with the lack of response and the repeated contact.",ソン・ダウンさん、無応答と連絡の反復に向き合う中で、何を守り、何を避けようとしていたのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，处理未回应与反复联系时，你想保护什么，又想避开什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 통로 대신 우회를 택한 본인의 판단을 답하게 한다. 연락 목적은 단정하지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨에게 먼저 말하지 않고 예비신랑에게 가는 길을 택한 본인의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, explain why you responded as you did when faced with why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に直面したとき、なぜその対応を選んだのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，面对你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由时，你为什么选择那样回应？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 통로 대신 우회를 택한 본인의 판단을 답하게 한다. 연락 목적은 단정하지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v2].text,직접 통화로 풀 수 있었던 일을 굳이 우회한 결과를 본인이 어떻게 감수했는지 설명하십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, what choice did you make at that point, and what reason did you give yourself at the time?",チェ・スミンさん、その時点でどの選択をし、当時ご自身にどんな理由を与えていましたか。,崔秀敏女士，在那个时间点你做了什么选择，当时给自己的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 통로 대신 우회를 택한 본인의 판단을 답하게 한다. 연락 목적은 단정하지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v3].text,그 시점에 송다은 씨에게 차마 꺼내지 못한 부분이 있었다면 무엇을 망설였는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, separate the reason you can admit now from the part you still contest, and answer regarding why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly.",チェ・スミンさん、今認められる理由とまだ争う部分を分け、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由について答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，请把现在可以承认的理由和仍有争议的部分分开，就你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由回答。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 통로 대신 우회를 택한 본인의 판단을 답하게 한다. 연락 목적은 단정하지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v4].text,예비신랑이라는 통로가 본인이 보기에 가장 빠르거나 안전하다고 판단된 근거가 무엇이었는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, if your judgment narrowed at that moment, explain what made it narrow without adding a conclusion.",チェ・スミンさん、その時点で判断が狭まったなら、結論を加えず何がそうさせたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，如果当时你的判断开始收窄，请不要加入结论，只说明是什么让它收窄。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 직접 통로 대신 우회를 택한 본인의 판단을 답하게 한다. 연락 목적은 단정하지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-bypass_da_eun-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 우회가 송다은 씨에게 어떻게 비칠지 알면서도 그쪽을 택한 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, tell the court what you were trying to protect or avoid when dealing with why you contacted the fiancé instead of Song Da-eun directly.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウン本人ではなく婚約者に連絡した理由に向き合う中で、何を守り、何を避けようとしていたのか述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，处理你没有直接联系宋多恩而联系未婚夫的理由时，你想保护什么，又想避开什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-contact_timeline-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 거절 신호 뒤에도 연락을 이어간 본인의 이유와 망설임을 답하게 한다. 연락 목적는 단정하지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-contact_timeline-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 응답이 거의 없는 상태에서도 9일 동안 연락을 멈추지 않은 본인의 판단을 어떤 마음으로 이어갔는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi Su-min, explain why you responded as you did when faced with the order and purpose of the nine-day contact.",チェ・スミンさん、9日間の連絡の順序と目的に直面したとき、なぜその対応を選んだのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，面对9天联系的顺序与目的时，你为什么选择那样回应？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-contact_timeline-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 거절 신호 뒤에도 연락을 이어간 본인의 이유와 망설임을 답하게 한다. 연락 목적는 단정하지 않는다.,Motive search. Focus on the order and purpose of the nine-day contact. Ask why the choice was made while separating motive from proven facts.,動機確認。9日間の連絡の順序と目的に焦点を当てる。動機と確認済み事実を分けて、選択の理由を尋ねる。,动机确认。聚焦9天联系的顺序与目的。把动机与已确认事实分开，追问其选择理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-b-contact_timeline-v2].text,한 번 시도해 안 됐을 때 바로 멈추지 않고 다시 거는 쪽을 택한 이유는 무엇입니까.,"Ms. Choi Su-min, what choice did you make at that point, and what reason did you give yourself at the time?",チェ・スミンさん、その時点でどの選択をし、当時ご自身にどんな理由を与えていましたか。,崔秀敏女士，在那个时间点你做了什么选择，当时给自己的理由是什么？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
