judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-protective_silence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-protective_silence-v4].text,"그 시기 본인 주변에서 손절 사정을 알 만한 사람이 있었는지, 그쪽에 확인하지 않은 이유는 어떤 사실로 정리되는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",ソン・ダウンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-protective_silence-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-protective_silence-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 손절 후 재확인 시도와 청취 경로를 사실관계로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the silence meant to protect someone. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、守るための沈黙の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从出于保护的沉默的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-protective_silence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-protective_silence-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 손절 후 본인이 지금까지 직접 확인해 본 적 없는 부분이 어디인지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",ソン・ダウンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 손절 직전 카톡 흐름과 그 후 재확인 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 손절 직전 카톡에서 ""내가 정리하겠다""는 말이 오간 시점과 그 뒤로 연락이 끊긴 시각을 순서대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, state when you first learned of the gap in the messages before the old fallout and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",ソン・ダウンさん、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
