judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v2].text,그 사이 본인이 최수민 씨에게 다시 확인했던 횟수와 응답이 없던 횟수를 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, separate what you personally verified about the gap in the messages before the old fallout from what you inferred.",ソン・ダウンさん、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您对旧日决裂前聊天中的空白亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
