judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v4].text,"그 시기 본인이 가족 중 누군가에게 손절 이유를 물어본 적이 있는지, 그 답을 어디까지 들었는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",ソン・ダウンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
