judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-severance_chat_gap-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그때 빈 채로 넘어간 카톡 중 본인이 아직 다시 열어 보지 않은 부분이 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",ソン・ダウンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 알고 있는 돈 흐름의 직접 인지와 전언을 분리하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 본인 아버지가 과거에 누군가에게 송금받거나 돈을 빌린 사실을 본인이 알게 된 시점과 경로를 순서대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, state when you first learned of the transfer and repayment records and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",ソン・ダウンさん、送金と返済記録を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知转账与还款记录的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 알고 있는 돈 흐름의 직접 인지와 전언을 분리하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v2].text,본인이 직접 본 영수증·계좌 내역과 누군가에게 들은 이야기만으로 알고 있는 부분을 구분해 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, separate what you personally verified about the transfer and repayment records from what you inferred.",ソン・ダウンさん、送金と返済記録について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您对转账与还款记录亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 알고 있는 돈 흐름의 직접 인지와 전언을 분리하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v3].text,"""돈 거래는 없었다""는 본인 측 설명과 가족 통장이나 지인 진술 사이에 어긋남이 있다면 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what the transfer and repayment records means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",ソン・ダウンさん、この争点において送金と返済記録が何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请以记录为准说明转账与还款记录在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
