judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v4].text,"그 시기 본인 가족 중 돈 관련 이야기를 같이 들은 사람이 있는지, 그 사람의 기억이 본인과 같은지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",ソン・ダウンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 본인이 알고 있는 돈 흐름의 직접 인지와 전언을 분리하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-a-transfer_repayment-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 본인이 아직 직접 확인하지 못한 거래 기록이 남아 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",ソン・ダウンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 차용증의 무게 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the weight of the IOU. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、借用書の重さの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从借条的分量的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 차용증 작성 시점과 일부 상환이 끊긴 시점에 대해 기록 기준으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state when you first learned of the weight of the IOU and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",チェ・スミンさん、借用書の重さを初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知借条的分量的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
