judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v2].text,"최수민 씨, 차용증의 무게에 관해 확인한 부분과 추정한 부분을 구분해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate what you personally verified about the weight of the IOU from what you inferred.",チェ・スミンさん、借用書の重さについて本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您对借条的分量亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 차용증의 무게 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the weight of the IOU. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、借用書の重さの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从借条的分量的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v3].text,"최수민 씨, 차용증 작성 시점과 일부 상환이 끊긴 시점이 이 쟁점에서 어떤 의미인지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what the weight of the IOU means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点において借用書の重さが何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请以记录为准说明借条的分量在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
