judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 차용증의 무게에서 본인이 직접 확인한 사실과 나중에 알게 된 사실을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",チェ・スミンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 차용증의 무게 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the weight of the IOU. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、借用書の重さの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从借条的分量的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-loan_document_weight-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 이 부분이 기존 진술과 어떻게 이어지는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",チェ・スミンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어디까지 말했고 어디서 멈췄는지 시점 순으로 답하게 한다. 보호 동기는 별도로 다룬다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the silence meant to protect someone. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、守るための沈黙の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从出于保护的沉默的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 손절을 전후해 송다은 씨에게 사정을 어디까지 말했고 어느 문장에서 멈췄는지 시점 순서로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state when you first learned of the silence meant to protect someone and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",チェ・スミンさん、守るための沈黙を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知出于保护的沉默的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어디까지 말했고 어디서 멈췄는지 시점 순으로 답하게 한다. 보호 동기는 별도로 다룬다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the silence meant to protect someone. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、守るための沈黙の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从出于保护的沉默的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v2].text,그때 직접 말한 부분과 끝내 입에 올리지 않은 부분을 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, separate what you personally verified about the silence meant to protect someone from what you inferred.",チェ・スミンさん、守るための沈黙について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您对出于保护的沉默亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어디까지 말했고 어디서 멈췄는지 시점 순으로 답하게 한다. 보호 동기는 별도로 다룬다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the silence meant to protect someone. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、守るための沈黙の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从出于保护的沉默的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v3].text,"""다 말했다""고 본인이 한 진술과 카톡에 남은 마지막 문구가 어긋나는 지점이 있다면 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what the silence meant to protect someone means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点において守るための沈黙が何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请以记录为准说明出于保护的沉默在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어디까지 말했고 어디서 멈췄는지 시점 순으로 답하게 한다. 보호 동기는 별도로 다룬다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the silence meant to protect someone. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、守るための沈黙の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从出于保护的沉默的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v4].text,"그 시기 본인 사정을 알고 있던 다른 사람이 있었는지, 그 사람에게는 어디까지 말했는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",チェ・スミンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 어디까지 말했고 어디서 멈췄는지 시점 순으로 답하게 한다. 보호 동기는 별도로 다룬다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the silence meant to protect someone. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、守るための沈黙の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从出于保护的沉默的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-protective_silence-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그때 멈춘 문장 중 지금까지도 송다은 씨에게 전해지지 않은 부분이 남아 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",チェ・スミンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. '정리하겠다' 발언 후 침묵 구간의 시점과 형태를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v1].text,"최수민 씨, ""내가 정리하겠다""는 메시지를 본인이 어느 단계에서 보냈고 그 뒤 송다은 씨에게 마지막으로 보낸 메시지가 무엇이었는지 시점 순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state when you first learned of the gap in the messages before the old fallout and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",チェ・スミンさん、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. '정리하겠다' 발언 후 침묵 구간의 시점과 형태를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v2].text,그 메시지 이후 본인이 보낸 연락과 받기만 하고 답하지 않은 연락을 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, separate what you personally verified about the gap in the messages before the old fallout from what you inferred.",チェ・スミンさん、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您对旧日决裂前聊天中的空白亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
