judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-b-severance_chat_gap-v3].text,"""그쪽이 먼저 끊었다""는 송다은 씨의 기억과 본인 단말에 남은 마지막 응답 기록이 어긋나는 부분이 있다면 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what the gap in the messages before the old fallout means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点において過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白が何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请以记录为准说明旧日决裂前聊天中的空白在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
