judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-severance_chat_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-severance_chat_gap-v4].text,그 카톡 흐름을 다른 방식으로 해석할 수 있었음에도 한쪽으로 닫아 둔 본인의 판단을 답하십시오.,"Ms. Song, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",ソン・ダウンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-severance_chat_gap-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-severance_chat_gap-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 손절 직전 빈칸을 다시 묻지 않은 회피 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-severance_chat_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-severance_chat_gap-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그 빈칸을 그대로 둔 채 시간을 흘려보낸 본인 쪽 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",ソン・ダウンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 송금·상환을 따져보지 않은 회피 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 그 시기 본인 가까이에 오갔던 돈의 흐름을 본인이 직접 확인하지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the transfer and repayment records.",ソン・ダウンさん、送金と返済記録についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您围绕转账与还款记录作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 송금·상환을 따져보지 않은 회피 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v2].text,상환이 어디까지 이뤄졌는지 본인이 끝까지 묻지 않기로 한 결정 과정을 설명하십시오.,"Ms. Song, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the transfer and repayment records.",ソン・ダウンさん、送金と返済記録をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请回答您在转账与还款记录上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
