judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-a-transfer_repayment-v3].text,그 돈이 본인 쪽에서 시작됐는지 다른 쪽이 정리했는지를 본인이 흐릿하게 둔 이유를 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
