judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-protective_silence-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-protective_silence-v4].text,악역으로 보일 걸 알면서도 침묵을 택한 본인의 판단이 어디에서 시작됐는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Choi, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",チェ・スミンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-protective_silence-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-protective_silence-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 악역을 자처한 본인의 보호 동기와 감수한 손해를 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환 확정은 열지 않는다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the silence meant to protect someone. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、守るための沈黙の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从出于保护的沉默的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-protective_silence-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-protective_silence-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 침묵을 그 뒤로도 풀지 못하게 만든 본인 쪽 사정을 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",チェ・スミンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 문장을 멈춘 본인의 망설임을 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환/원인 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v1].text,"최수민 씨, ‘내가 정리하겠다’에서 그 다음 말을 본인이 끊고 멈춘 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the gap in the messages before the old fallout.",チェ・スミンさん、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您围绕旧日决裂前聊天中的空白作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 문장을 멈춘 본인의 망설임을 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환/원인 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v2].text,그 자리에서 본인이 끝내 적지 못한 단어가 있다면 무엇을 두려워해서 멈췄는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the gap in the messages before the old fallout.",チェ・スミンさん、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，请回答您在旧日决裂前聊天中的空白上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 문장을 멈춘 본인의 망설임을 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환/원인 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v3].text,송다은 씨에게 그 문장을 다 보여주지 않기로 한 본인의 판단을 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 문장을 멈춘 본인의 망설임을 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환/원인 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v4].text,그 멈춤 뒤에 손절을 받아들이기로 한 본인의 선택이 어디에서 시작됐는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Choi, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",チェ・スミンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 문장을 멈춘 본인의 망설임을 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환/원인 단정은 열지 않는다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the gap in the messages before the old fallout. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、過去の絶交前のメッセージの空白の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从旧日决裂前聊天中的空白的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-severance_chat_gap-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 빈칸이 송다은 씨에게 본인을 어떻게 보이게 할지 알면서도 채우지 않은 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",チェ・スミンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손해를 본인이 떠안은 동기를 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그 송금과 상환의 어긋남을 본인이 송다은 씨에게 그때 곧장 알리지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the transfer and repayment records.",チェ・スミンさん、送金と返済記録についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您围绕转账与还款记录作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손해를 본인이 떠안은 동기를 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v2].text,본인이 받아내야 할 부분을 끝까지 받지 않고 그쪽 손해를 본인이 떠안은 본인 쪽 동기를 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the transfer and repayment records.",チェ・スミンさん、送金と返済記録をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，请回答您在转账与还款记录上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손해를 본인이 떠안은 동기를 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v3].text,그 돈을 두고 본인이 입을 다문 결과로 누구를 보호하려 한 것인지 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손해를 본인이 떠안은 동기를 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v4].text,그 흐름을 분명히 글로 남기지 않은 본인의 망설임이 어디에서 시작됐는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Choi, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",チェ・スミンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 손해를 본인이 떠안은 동기를 답하게 한다. 차용금 미상환 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the transfer and repayment records. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、送金と返済記録の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从转账与还款记录的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-b-transfer_repayment-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 본인이 그 손해를 떠안으면서 무엇을 잃지 않으려 한 것인지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",チェ・スミンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 단톡방 게시 직전의 충동을 인정하고 그 직전 본인이 회피하고자 했던 감각을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 결혼 직전의 상처가 단톡방 글로 먼저 터져 나온 일은 본인에게도 충동의 결과였을 겁니다. 그 감정을 인정하면서, 글을 올리기 직전 본인이 가장 먼저 사라지길 바란 감각이 무엇이었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please describe what feeling comes first when you face the first group chat post.",ソン・ダウンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿に向き合うとき最初に浮かぶ感情を話してください。,宋多恩女士，面对最初的群聊发言时，请说明最先出现的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 미확인 게시 결정의 결과를 본인 시점에서 정리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v2].text,"친구에게 직접 확인하지 않고 글을 올린 결정이 결과적으로 어떤 영향을 키웠는지, 본인 입장에서 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, looking at the first group chat post again now, what feeling comes first?",ソン・ダウンさん、今あらためて最初のグループチャット投稿を見ると、どの感情が先に立ちますか。,宋多恩女士，现在重新看最初的群聊发言，最先浮现的是什么情绪？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인이 적은 문장 가운데 후회하는 한 줄을 본인이 직접 짚게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v3].text,"처음 올린 문장과 그 뒤 본인이 덧붙인 문장 가운데 후회하는 표현이 있다면, 그 표현을 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain honestly what you could not say or could not see at that time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時言えなかったこと、見えていなかったことを率直に説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请坦率说明当时没能说出口或没能看见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 게시 중단 가능 순간과 그 미실행 이유를 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v4].text,"그 글을 올리던 손이 본인을 멈추게 한 순간이 있었는지, 있었다면 왜 멈추지 못했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, separate what you felt then from how you judge it now.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 두 두려움 가운데 본인을 더 움직인 쪽을 본인이 직접 비교하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-first_groupchat_post-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 본인이 가장 두려웠던 것이 친구의 행동이었는지 본인의 결혼이 흔들리는 일이었는지, 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please tell the court why this issue weighs so heavily on you.",ソン・ダウンさん、この争点がご自身に重くのしかかる理由を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这个争点为什么对您如此沉重。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동조 분위기의 압도성을 인정하고 본인의 멈춤 가능 순간을 짚게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 친구들이 본인의 글을 받아 격해진 분위기는 본인에게도 압도적이었을 겁니다. 그 분위기 속에서 본인이 멈출 수 있었던 한 순간이 있었다면, 그 순간을 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please describe what feeling comes first when you face the way the group chat pile-on spread.",ソン・ダウンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れに向き合うとき最初に浮かぶ感情を話してください。,宋多恩女士，面对群聊中附和扩散的过程时，请说明最先出现的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동조 가속 중 본인 마음의 흐름을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v2].text,"동조가 빠르게 번지는 동안 본인의 마음이 어디로 흘렀는지, 결론 없이 그 흐름을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, looking at the way the group chat pile-on spread again now, what feeling comes first?",ソン・ダウンさん、今あらためてグループチャットで同調が広がった流れを見ると、どの感情が先に立ちますか。,宋多恩女士，现在重新看群聊中附和扩散的过程，最先浮现的是什么情绪？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인의 자기 제동 미실행 장면과 차단 요인을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v3].text,"""내가 더 말렸어야 했다""고 느끼는 장면이 있었는지, 있었다면 그때 무엇이 본인을 막았는지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain honestly what you could not say or could not see at that time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時言えなかったこと、見えていなかったことを率直に説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请坦率说明当时没能说出口或没能看见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 동조 수용 시 본인의 안도와 부담을 분리하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v4].text,"동조에 안도한 부분과 부담스러웠던 부분을 분리해서, 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, separate what you felt then from how you judge it now.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 분위기를 키운 본인의 한마디를 본인이 직접 짚게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-pile_on_spread-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 본인의 한마디가 분위기를 더 키운 순간이 있었다면, 그 한마디를 단정 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please tell the court why this issue weighs so heavily on you.",ソン・ダウンさん、この争点がご自身に重くのしかかる理由を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这个争点为什么对您如此沉重。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 단정에 대한 송다은의 거부감을 인정하고 두 사건 연결 시도 여부를 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 같은 일이 반복된다는 말이 본인에게는 다시 단정당하는 느낌일 수 있습니다. 그 감정을 인정하면서, 본인이 과거와 현재 두 사건을 같은 그림으로 이어 본 적이 있는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please describe what feeling comes first when you face the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain.",ソン・ダウンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図に向き合うとき最初に浮かぶ感情を話してください。,宋多恩女士，面对反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架时，请说明最先出现的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복된 선단정 가능성에 대한 송다은의 수용 범위를 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2].text,"본인이 두 번 모두 친구를 먼저 단정한 쪽이었다는 가능성을 어디까지 받아들일 수 있는지, 솔직히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, looking at the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain again now, what feeling comes first?",ソン・ダウンさん、今あらためてスミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図を見ると、どの感情が先に立ちますか。,宋多恩女士，现在重新看反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架，最先浮现的是什么情绪？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인의 자기 점검 지점을 본인이 직접 짚게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v3].text,"두 사건 사이에 본인이 다르게 했어야 했다고 느끼는 한 지점이 있다면, 단정 없이 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain honestly what you could not say or could not see at that time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時言えなかったこと、見えていなかったことを率直に説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请坦率说明当时没能说出口或没能看见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 친구의 반복 악역화 평가에 대한 본인 청취 감각을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v4].text,"친구가 두 번 다 악역으로 남았다는 평가가 본인에게는 어떻게 들리는지, 그 감각을 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, separate what you felt then from how you judge it now.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 인정의 어려움 그대로를 본인이 풀게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 본인이 반복을 인정하기 어려운 부분이 있다면 그 어려움 자체를, 단정 없이 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please tell the court why this issue weighs so heavily on you.",ソン・ダウンさん、この争点がご自身に重くのしかかる理由を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这个争点为什么对您如此沉重。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v1].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 공개 이후 최수민이 설명할 자리를 잃었다는 점을 지금 어떻게 느끼는지에 대해 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please describe what feeling comes first when you face the public accusation made without verification.",ソン・ダウンさん、確認なしに公開した判断に向き合うとき最初に浮かぶ感情を話してください。,宋多恩女士，面对未经确认就公开定论时，请说明最先出现的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v2].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 확인 없는 공개을 지금 다시 보면 어떤 감정이 앞서는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, looking at the public accusation made without verification again now, what feeling comes first?",ソン・ダウンさん、今あらためて確認なしに公開した判断を見ると、どの感情が先に立ちますか。,宋多恩女士，现在重新看未经确认就公开定论，最先浮现的是什么情绪？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v3].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v3].text,"송다은 씨, 그때 말하지 못했거나 보지 못했던 부분을 솔직히 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please explain honestly what you could not say or could not see at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時言えなかったこと、見えていなかったことを率直に説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请坦率说明当时没能说出口或没能看见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v4].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v4].text,"송다은 씨, 당시 감정과 지금의 판단을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please separate what you felt then from how you judge it now.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v5].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-a-verification_gap-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 이 쟁점이 본인에게 가장 부담스러운 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please explain why this issue weighs most heavily on you.",ソン・ダウンさん、この争点がご自身にとって最も重い理由を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这个争点为什么对您来说最沉重。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 평판 피해자의 무력감을 정면 인정하고 침묵의 결을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 단톡방에서 본인이 확인 없이 단정되는 글을 본 그 순간은 변명조차 무의미하게 느껴졌을 겁니다. 그 침묵의 결을 단정 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, please describe what feeling comes first when you face the first group chat post.",チェ・スミンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿に向き合うとき最初に浮かぶ感情を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，面对最初的群聊发言时，请说明最先出现的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 즉시 반박 미실행의 두려움을 본인 시점에서 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v2].text,"본인이 곧바로 반박하지 못한 사정이 있었다면, 그 사정이 어떤 두려움에서 비롯됐는지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, looking at the first group chat post again now, what feeling comes first?",チェ・スミンさん、今あらためて最初のグループチャット投稿を見ると、どの感情が先に立ちますか。,崔秀敏女士，现在重新看最初的群聊发言，最先浮现的是什么情绪？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 첫 인지 시 본인 안의 첫 붕괴 지점을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v3].text,"그 글을 처음 본 순간 본인 안에서 가장 먼저 무너진 부분이 무엇이었는지, 단정 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain honestly what you could not say or could not see at that time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時言えなかったこと、見えていなかったことを率直に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请坦率说明当时没能说出口或没能看见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 친구 보호 판단이 본인 반박을 묶은 결을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v4].text,"즉시 반박하면 친구를 더 다치게 한다고 판단했다면, 그 판단이 본인을 어떻게 묶어 두었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate what you felt then from how you judge it now.",チェ・スミンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반박 지연이 본인 입지를 좁힌 감각만 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-first_groupchat_post-v5].text,"본인이 반박을 미룬 시간이 길어질수록 본인의 자리가 좁아졌다는 감각이 있다면, 그 감각만이라도 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, please tell the court why this issue weighs so heavily on you.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点がご自身に重くのしかかる理由を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这个争点为什么对您如此沉重。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 일방향 비난 속 무력감을 정면 인정하고 가장 힘든 한 장면을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 친구들의 비난이 한 방향으로 쏟아지는 자리에서 본인이 무엇을 어떻게 말해도 닿지 않는다는 감각이 있었을 겁니다. 그 시간 동안 본인이 가장 어렵게 견딘 한 장면을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, please describe what feeling comes first when you face the way the group chat pile-on spread.",チェ・スミンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れに向き合うとき最初に浮かぶ感情を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，面对群聊中附和扩散的过程时，请说明最先出现的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 확산 속도와 해명 속도의 격차가 만든 무력감을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v2].text,"동조가 번지는 속도와 본인의 해명 속도 가운데 어느 쪽이 더 본인을 무력하게 했는지, 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, looking at the way the group chat pile-on spread again now, what feeling comes first?",チェ・スミンさん、今あらためてグループチャットで同調が広がった流れを見ると、どの感情が先に立ちますか。,崔秀敏女士，现在重新看群聊中附和扩散的过程，最先浮现的是什么情绪？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 부분 해명 기회와 미실행 이유를 본인이 인정 가능한 형태로 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v3].text,"본인이 일부 친구에게라도 사실을 알릴 수 있었던 기회가 있었는지, 있었다면 왜 잡지 못했는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain honestly what you could not say or could not see at that time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時言えなかったこと、見えていなかったことを率直に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请坦率说明当时没能说出口或没能看见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 비난의 결정적 표현을 본인 시점에서 짚게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v4].text,"비난의 무게가 어느 표현에서 가장 컸는지, 단정 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate what you felt then from how you judge it now.",チェ・スミンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반박 가정 시의 추가 피해 추정을 본인 시점에서 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-pile_on_spread-v5].text,"본인이 그 자리에서 반박했더라면 누구를 더 다치게 했을 거라고 보았는지, 결론 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, please tell the court why this issue weighs so heavily on you.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点がご自身に重くのしかかる理由を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这个争点为什么对您如此沉重。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 악역화의 자리 자체를 정면 인정하고 그 재발 순간만 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 두 번 모두 본인이 악역으로 남는 자리는 누구라도 무너질 수 있는 위치입니다. 그 감정을 인정하면서, 본인이 같은 자리를 다시 받게 된 그 순간을 결론 없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, please describe what feeling comes first when you face the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain.",チェ・スミンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図に向き合うとき最初に浮かぶ感情を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，面对反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架时，请说明最先出现的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 침묵의 두려움 결을 본인 시점에서 끌어내고 책임 비율 단정은 보류한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2].text,"본인이 두 번 다 침묵으로 그 구조를 허용한 부분이 있다면, 어떤 두려움이 그 침묵을 만들었는지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, looking at the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain again now, what feeling comes first?",チェ・スミンさん、今あらためてスミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図を見ると、どの感情が先に立ちますか。,崔秀敏女士，现在重新看反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架，最先浮现的是什么情绪？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 악역화에 대한 본인 내적 독백의 결을 끌어낸다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3].text,"""또 내가 악역인가""라는 말이 본인 안에서 어떤 형태로 떠올랐는지, 그 결을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain honestly what you could not say or could not see at that time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時言えなかったこと、見えていなかったことを率直に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请坦率说明当时没能说出口或没能看见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 본인의 자기 갱신 지점을 본인이 짚게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4].text,"본인이 다음번에는 다르게 하겠다고 다짐할 수 있는 부분이 있다면, 단정 없이 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate what you felt then from how you judge it now.",チェ・スミンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5].behaviorHint,공감 접근. 반복 자리에서 본인에게 가장 무거웠던 표현 한 줄을 본인이 직접 짚게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 같은 자리에 다시 선 본인에게 가장 무거웠던 표현 하나를, 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, please tell the court why this issue weighs so heavily on you.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点がご自身に重くのしかかる理由を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这个争点为什么对您如此沉重。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v1].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 확인 없이 공개된 말을 봤을 때의 감정에 대해 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, please describe what feeling comes first when you face the public accusation made without verification.",チェ・スミンさん、確認なしに公開した判断に向き合うとき最初に浮かぶ感情を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，面对未经确认就公开定论时，请说明最先出现的感受。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v2].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v2].text,"최수민 씨, 확인 없는 공개을 지금 다시 보면 어떤 감정이 앞서는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, looking at the public accusation made without verification again now, what feeling comes first?",チェ・スミンさん、今あらためて確認なしに公開した判断を見ると、どの感情が先に立ちますか。,崔秀敏女士，现在重新看未经确认就公开定论，最先浮现的是什么情绪？,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v3].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v3].text,"최수민 씨, 그때 말하지 못했거나 보지 못했던 부분을 솔직히 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain honestly what you could not say or could not see at that time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時言えなかったこと、見えていなかったことを率直に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请坦率说明当时没能说出口或没能看见的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v4].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 당시 감정과 지금의 판단을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate what you felt then from how you judge it now.",チェ・スミンさん、当時の感情と今の判断を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把当时的情绪和现在的判断分开说明。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v5].behaviorHint,사정 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Empathy approach. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,共感的アプローチ。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,共情式切入。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-empathy_approach-b-verification_gap-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 이 쟁점이 본인에게 가장 부담스러운 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, please tell the court why this issue weighs so heavily on you.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点がご自身に重くのしかかる理由を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这个争点为什么对您如此沉重。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 게시 원문·시각과 사전 확인 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 단톡방에 처음 올린 문장의 원문과 게시 시각을 그대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, state when you first learned of the first group chat post and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",ソン・ダウンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知最初的群聊发言的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 게시 원문·시각과 사전 확인 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v2].text,그 글을 올리기 전에 최수민 씨에게 직접 확인한 횟수와 답을 받지 못한 횟수를 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, separate what you personally verified about the first group chat post from what you inferred.",ソン・ダウンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您对最初的群聊发言亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 게시 원문·시각과 사전 확인 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v3].text,"""충분히 확인하고 올렸다""는 본인 진술과 단톡방 게시 시각·연락 기록 사이에 어긋남이 있다면 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what the first group chat post means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",ソン・ダウンさん、この争点において最初のグループチャット投稿が何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请以记录为准说明最初的群聊发言在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 게시 원문·시각과 사전 확인 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v4].text,그 글을 올리기 전에 누구에게 어디까지 의논했고 그 사람의 의견이 본인 결정에 어떻게 반영됐는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",ソン・ダウンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 게시 원문·시각과 사전 확인 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-first_groupchat_post-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그때 올린 글 외에 본인이 단톡방에 추가로 적은 문장이 있다면 어떤 것인지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",ソン・ダウンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 동조 댓글에 본인이 추가로 답한 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 본인 글이 올라간 뒤 친구들이 동조 댓글을 단 순서와 그중 본인이 따로 답한 횟수를 시점 순서로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, state when you first learned of the way the group chat pile-on spread and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",ソン・ダウンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れを初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知群聊中附和扩散的过程的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 동조 댓글에 본인이 추가로 답한 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v2].text,본인이 직접 단 답과 다른 친구의 말에 동조만 누른 경우를 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, separate what you personally verified about the way the group chat pile-on spread from what you inferred.",ソン・ダウンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れについて本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您对群聊中附和扩散的过程亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 동조 댓글에 본인이 추가로 답한 횟수를 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v3].text,"""확산은 친구들이 한 일이다""라는 본인 진술과 본인이 올린 추가 답글 횟수 사이에 차이가 있다면 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what the way the group chat pile-on spread means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",ソン・ダウンさん、この争点においてグループチャットで同調が広がった流れが何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请以记录为准说明群聊中附和扩散的过程在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
