judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v4].text,그 동조에 가장 적극적으로 호응한 친구가 누구이고 본인이 그 친구에게 따로 보낸 메시지가 있다면 어떤 내용이었는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",ソン・ダウンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
