judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-pile_on_spread-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그 단톡방 흐름 중 본인이 지금 보면 사실과 다르게 보이는 부분이 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",ソン・ダウンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 과거 단정 발언과 이번 발언의 같음·다름을 사실 차원에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 과거 손절 때 본인이 단톡방이나 친구들 사이에서 최수민 씨에 대해 먼저 정리해 말한 적이 있는지 그 시점부터 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, state when you first learned of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",ソン・ダウンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
