judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2].text,그때 본인이 직접 한 발언과 다른 친구의 말에 동조만 한 부분을 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, separate what you personally verified about the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain from what you inferred.",ソン・ダウンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您对反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
