judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v4].text,과거에도 본인이 먼저 단정한 적이 있다면 그 자리에 같이 있던 친구가 누구이고 그 친구의 기억이 본인 기억과 같은지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",ソン・ダウンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
