judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 과거와 이번 발언 중 본인이 아직 정정하지 않은 부분이 있다면 어떤 것인지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",ソン・ダウンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민에게 직접 확인하기 전에 단톡방에 올린 시점과 문장에 대해 기록 기준으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, state when you first learned of the public accusation made without verification and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",ソン・ダウンさん、確認なしに公開した判断を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知未经确认就公开定论的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 확인 없는 공개에 관해 확인한 부분과 추정한 부분을 구분해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, separate what you personally verified about the public accusation made without verification from what you inferred.",ソン・ダウンさん、確認なしに公開した判断について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您对未经确认就公开定论亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v3].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민에게 직접 확인하기 전에 단톡방에 올린 시점과 문장이 이 쟁점에서 어떤 의미인지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what the public accusation made without verification means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",ソン・ダウンさん、この争点において確認なしに公開した判断が何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请以记录为准说明未经确认就公开定论在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
