judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v4].text,"송다은 씨, 확인 없는 공개에서 본인이 직접 확인한 사실과 나중에 알게 된 사실을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",ソン・ダウンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,宋多恩女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-a-verification_gap-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 이 부분이 기존 진술과 어떻게 이어지는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",ソン・ダウンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 글을 본 시각과 단톡방 응답 시점을 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 단톡방에 송다은 씨의 그 글이 올라온 시각과 본인이 그 글을 처음 본 시각을 순서대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state when you first learned of the first group chat post and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",チェ・スミンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知最初的群聊发言的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 글을 본 시각과 단톡방 응답 시점을 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v2].text,본인이 직접 읽고 안 부분과 다른 친구가 캡처로 전해 준 부분을 구분해 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, separate what you personally verified about the first group chat post from what you inferred.",チェ・スミンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您对最初的群聊发言亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
