judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v3].text,"""바로 반박했다""는 진술이 있다면 그 진술과 실제 본인이 단톡방에 답을 올린 시각이 어긋나는지 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what the first group chat post means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点において最初のグループチャット投稿が何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请以记录为准说明最初的群聊发言在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
