judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v4].text,그 글을 본 직후 본인이 누구에게 가장 먼저 사정을 말했고 그 사람이 같은 단톡방에 있었는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",チェ・スミンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
