judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-first_groupchat_post-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 글에 대해 본인이 지금까지 단톡방에 직접 올리지 않은 응답이 남아 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",チェ・スミンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 동조 시점에 보낸 응답과 침묵 구간을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 친구들의 동조 댓글이 올라간 시각과 본인이 그 단톡방에서 응답하거나 응답하지 않은 시점을 순서대로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state when you first learned of the way the group chat pile-on spread and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",チェ・スミンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れを初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知群聊中附和扩散的过程的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 동조 시점에 보낸 응답과 침묵 구간을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v2].text,그 시기 본인이 단톡방에 직접 답한 부분과 개인 메시지로만 답한 부분을 나눠 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, separate what you personally verified about the way the group chat pile-on spread from what you inferred.",チェ・スミンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れについて本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您对群聊中附和扩散的过程亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 동조 시점에 보낸 응답과 침묵 구간을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v3].text,"본인이 ""처음부터 가만있었다""고 한다면 그 진술과 단톡방 또는 개인 메시지에 남은 본인 응답이 어긋나는 부분이 있는지 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what the way the group chat pile-on spread means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点においてグループチャットで同調が広がった流れが何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请以记录为准说明群聊中附和扩散的过程在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 동조 시점에 보낸 응답과 침묵 구간을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v4].text,"그 동조 가운데 본인에게 따로 사정을 물어 온 친구가 있었는지, 있었다면 어디까지 답했는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",チェ・スミンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 동조 시점에 보낸 응답과 침묵 구간을 시점 순으로 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-pile_on_spread-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 단톡방 흐름 중 지금까지도 어느 친구에게도 정정해 주지 않은 부분이 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",チェ・スミンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 두 시기에 어디까지 말하고 어디서 멈췄는지 답하게 한다. 악역 구조 확정은 보류한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 과거 손절 때 친구들 앞에서 본인이 사정을 어느 단계까지 말했고 어느 부분에서 멈췄는지 시점 순서로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state when you first learned of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",チェ・スミンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
