judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2].text,"그때 직접 말한 부분과 침묵으로 둔 부분, 이번에 말한 부분과 멈춘 부분을 나눠 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate what you personally verified about the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain from what you inferred.",チェ・スミンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您对反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
