judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3].text,"""과거와 이번은 다르다""는 본인 진술과 두 시기에 본인이 친구들에게 보낸 답의 길이·내용이 어긋나는 지점이 있다면 짚어 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点においてスミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図が何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请以记录为准说明反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
