judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4].text,"두 시기 모두 본인 사정을 알고 있던 사람이 있었는지, 그 사람에게는 어디까지 말했는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",チェ・スミンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
