judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 과거와 이번을 통틀어 지금까지도 본인이 정정하지 않은 사실이 있다면 어디인지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",チェ・スミンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
