judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 단톡방 공개 전에 직접 설명할 기회가 있었는지와 공개 이후 해명 시점에 대해 기록 기준으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state when you first learned of the public accusation made without verification and what you confirmed directly, based on the record.",チェ・スミンさん、確認なしに公開した判断を初めて知った時点と直接確認した資料を、記録に基づいて述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请依据记录说明您最初得知未经确认就公开定论的时间，以及直接确认过的资料。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v2].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v2].text,"최수민 씨, 확인 없는 공개에 관해 확인한 부분과 추정한 부분을 구분해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate what you personally verified about the public accusation made without verification from what you inferred.",チェ・スミンさん、確認なしに公開した判断について本人が確認した部分と推測した部分を分けてください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您对未经确认就公开定论亲自确认的部分和推定的部分。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v3].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v3].text,"최수민 씨, 단톡방 공개 전에 직접 설명할 기회가 있었는지와 공개 이후 해명 시점이 이 쟁점에서 어떤 의미인지 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what the public accusation made without verification means for this issue, using the record as your basis.",チェ・スミンさん、この争点において確認なしに公開した判断が何を意味するのか、記録を基準に説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请以记录为准说明未经确认就公开定论在这个争点中意味着什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v4].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 확인 없는 공개에서 본인이 직접 확인한 사실과 나중에 알게 된 사실을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, distinguish the facts you directly confirmed from those you learned later.",チェ・スミンさん、直接確認した事実と後から知った事実を分けて話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请区分您直接确认的事实和后来得知的事实。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v5].behaviorHint,사실 추궁. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Fact pursuit. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,事実追及。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,事实追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-fact_pursuit-b-verification_gap-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 이 부분이 기존 진술과 어떻게 이어지는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain how this point connects to your previous statement.",チェ・スミンさん、この部分がこれまでの陳述とどうつながるのかを話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明这一部分如何接续此前陈述。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 확인 대신 공개 자리를 택한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다. 명예훼손 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨에게 직접 묻기 전에 단톡방에 먼저 글을 올린 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the first group chat post.",ソン・ダウンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您围绕最初的群聊发言作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 확인 대신 공개 자리를 택한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다. 명예훼손 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v2].text,그 글을 사적으로 한 사람에게 묻는 대신 여러 친구가 보는 자리에 올린 본인의 동기를 설명하십시오.,"Ms. Song, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the first group chat post.",ソン・ダウンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请回答您在最初的群聊发言上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 확인 대신 공개 자리를 택한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다. 명예훼손 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v3].text,공개 단정이 본인에게 어떤 점에서 더 안전하거나 편하게 보였는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 확인 대신 공개 자리를 택한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다. 명예훼손 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v4].text,그 글이 친구들 반응과 결합해 빠르게 굳어질 걸 본인은 어느 정도 짐작하고 올렸는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Song, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",ソン・ダウンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 직접 확인 대신 공개 자리를 택한 본인 동기를 답하게 한다. 명예훼손 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-first_groupchat_post-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그 자리에서 본인이 가장 듣고 싶었던 답이 무엇이었기에 글을 그런 형태로 올린 것인지 그 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",ソン・ダウンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 동조 흐름을 놓아둔 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 친구들이 본인 쪽 글에 따라붙기 시작했을 때 그 흐름을 멈추지 않은 본인의 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the way the group chat pile-on spread.",ソン・ダウンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れについてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您围绕群聊中附和扩散的过程作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 동조 흐름을 놓아둔 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v2].text,동조가 늘어날수록 본인 안에서 굳어지는 결론이 있었다면 그 강도가 본인의 추가 발언에 어떻게 영향을 줬는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the way the group chat pile-on spread.",ソン・ダウンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れをめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请回答您在群聊中附和扩散的过程上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 동조 흐름을 놓아둔 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v3].text,한쪽으로 기우는 분위기를 본인이 그대로 둔 결정 과정을 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 동조 흐름을 놓아둔 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v4].text,그 자리에서 동조를 누그러뜨릴 수 있는 한마디를 본인이 굳이 하지 않은 이유를 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",ソン・ダウンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 송다은이 동조 흐름을 놓아둔 본인 동기를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-pile_on_spread-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그 흐름이 최수민 씨에게 어떤 결과를 가져올지 짐작하면서도 막지 않은 본인 쪽 사정을 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",ソン・ダウンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 시기 모두 단정에 먼저 선 송다은의 본인 부담을 답하게 한다. 반복 구조 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 과거에도 그리고 지금도 본인이 친구를 한쪽으로 단정하는 자리에 먼저 서게 된 본인 쪽 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain.",ソン・ダウンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您围绕反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 시기 모두 단정에 먼저 선 송다은의 본인 부담을 답하게 한다. 반복 구조 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v2].text,두 시기 모두 본인이 확인보다 결론을 먼저 잡는 길을 택한 본인의 결정 과정을 설명하십시오.,"Ms. Song, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain.",ソン・ダウンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请回答您在反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
