judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v3].text,그렇게 단정해 두는 쪽이 본인에게 어떤 점에서 더 견디기 쉬운지 솔직히 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
