judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v4].text,한 친구가 같은 위치에 두 번 놓이는 모습을 본인이 보면서도 멈추지 못한 이유를 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Song, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",ソン・ダウンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 두 시기 모두 단정에 먼저 선 송다은의 본인 부담을 답하게 한다. 반복 구조 단정은 보류한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-repeat_villain_frame-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 단정 대신 다시 묻기로 했을 때 본인이 흔들릴까 봐 두려워한 부분이 있다면 어디까지 이야기할 수 있는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",ソン・ダウンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v1].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v1].text,"송다은 씨, 직접 확인보다 단톡방 공개를 먼저 선택한 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the public accusation made without verification.",ソン・ダウンさん、確認なしに公開した判断についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您围绕未经确认就公开定论作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
