judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 확인 없는 공개에서 그 판단이 어디서 시작됐는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the public accusation made without verification.",ソン・ダウンさん、確認なしに公開した判断をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请回答您在未经确认就公开定论上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v3].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v3].text,"송다은 씨, 직접 확인보다 단톡방 공개를 먼저 선택한 이유가 당시 판단에 어떤 영향을 줬는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",ソン・ダウンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v4].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v4].text,"송다은 씨, 이 선택을 하게 된 이유와 그때 놓친 부분을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",ソン・ダウンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,宋多恩女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v5].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Song to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。ソン・ダウンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导宋多恩女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-a-verification_gap-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 같은 상황에서 다른 선택을 하지 못한 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",ソン・ダウンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 즉시 반박하지 않은 본인의 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그 글을 본 직후 본인이 그 자리에서 반박하지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the first group chat post.",チェ・スミンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您围绕最初的群聊发言作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 즉시 반박하지 않은 본인의 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v2].text,공개적으로 정정을 요구했을 때 본인이 잃거나 더 다칠 수 있다고 본 부분이 무엇이었는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the first group chat post.",チェ・スミンさん、最初のグループチャット投稿をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，请回答您在最初的群聊发言上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 즉시 반박하지 않은 본인의 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v3].text,본인이 즉시 입을 열지 않기로 한 결정에 어떤 망설임이 있었는지 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 즉시 반박하지 않은 본인의 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v4].text,그 글이 그대로 굳어가는 동안 본인이 끝내 꺼내지 못한 말이 있다면 무엇을 피하려 한 결과였는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Choi, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",チェ・スミンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 즉시 반박하지 않은 본인의 이유를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the first group chat post. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、最初のグループチャット投稿の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从最初的群聊发言的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-first_groupchat_post-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 침묵이 본인을 어떤 모습으로 보이게 할지 알면서도 그쪽을 택한 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",チェ・スミンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 침묵을 유지한 본인의 보호 동기와 감수한 위험을 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 친구들이 본인을 두고 한쪽으로 몰아갈 때 그 자리에서 즉시 답하지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the way the group chat pile-on spread.",チェ・スミンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れについてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您围绕群聊中附和扩散的过程作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 침묵을 유지한 본인의 보호 동기와 감수한 위험을 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v2].text,그 분위기에 끼어들었을 때 본인이 추가로 잃을 수 있다고 본 부분이 무엇이었는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the way the group chat pile-on spread.",チェ・スミンさん、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れをめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，请回答您在群聊中附和扩散的过程上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 침묵을 유지한 본인의 보호 동기와 감수한 위험을 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v3].text,그 침묵으로 본인이 보호하려 한 대상이 있다면 누구였고 그 결과 본인은 무엇을 감수했는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
