judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v4].text,그 며칠간 본인이 끝내 보내지 않고 지운 답이 있다면 무엇을 두려워해서 보내지 않았는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Choi, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",チェ・スミンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 침묵을 유지한 본인의 보호 동기와 감수한 위험을 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the way the group chat pile-on spread. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、グループチャットで同調が広がった流れの角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从群聊中附和扩散的过程的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-pile_on_spread-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 침묵이 길어질수록 본인에게 불리해진다는 것을 본인은 어느 정도 알면서도 그렇게 한 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",チェ・スミンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 악역 자리를 다시 받아들인 최수민의 보호 동기와 감수한 손해를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 과거와 현재 모두 본인이 악역으로 보이는 자리를 굳이 부정하지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain.",チェ・スミンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您围绕反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 악역 자리를 다시 받아들인 최수민의 보호 동기와 감수한 손해를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v2].text,그 자리를 본인이 받아들이는 쪽으로 갈 때 보호하려던 대상이 누구였는지 본인이 알 수 있는 범위에서 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain.",チェ・スミンさん、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，请回答您在反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 악역 자리를 다시 받아들인 최수민의 보호 동기와 감수한 손해를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v3].text,본인이 끝까지 풀어 설명하지 않은 결과로 본인 쪽이 떠안은 손해를 어떻게 정리하는지 답해 주십시오.,"Ms. Choi, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 악역 자리를 다시 받아들인 최수민의 보호 동기와 감수한 손해를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v4].text,두 번째에는 다른 길로 갈 수 있었을 텐데 같은 길을 택한 본인의 망설임이 어디에서 시작됐는지 답하십시오.,"Ms. Choi, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",チェ・スミンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5].behaviorHint,동기 탐색. 악역 자리를 다시 받아들인 최수민의 보호 동기와 감수한 손해를 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the repeated framing of Su-min as the villain. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、スミンを繰り返し悪役にした構図の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从反复把秀敏推成反面角色的框架的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-repeat_villain_frame-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 그 자리에 다시 서기로 한 본인의 결정이 송다은 씨에게 어떻게 비칠지 알면서도 그렇게 한 이유를 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",チェ・スミンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v1_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v1].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v1_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 확인 없는 공개가 있었는데도 바로 반박하지 못한 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you chose to act as you did regarding the public accusation made without verification.",チェ・スミンさん、確認なしに公開した判断についてそのように動いた理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您围绕未经确认就公开定论作出那种选择的理由。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v2_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v2].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v2_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v2].text,"최수민 씨, 확인 없는 공개에서 그 판단이 어디서 시작됐는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, answer what you were trying to protect or avoid in relation to the public accusation made without verification.",チェ・スミンさん、確認なしに公開した判断をめぐって何を守ろうとし、何を避けようとしたのか答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，请回答您在未经确认就公开定论上想保护什么、避免什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v3_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v3].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v3_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v3].text,"최수민 씨, 확인 없는 공개가 있었는데도 바로 반박하지 못한 이유가 당시 판단에 어떤 영향을 줬는지 답해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, within what you know, explain the reason you did not say more at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、当時それ以上話さなかった理由を、分かる範囲で説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请在您所知范围内说明当时没有继续说下去的原因。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v4_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v4].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v4_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 이 선택을 하게 된 이유와 그때 놓친 부분을 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state where the hesitation behind that choice began.",チェ・スミンさん、その選択の迷いがどこから始まったのか述べてください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明那个选择背后的犹豫从哪里开始。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v5_.behaviorHint,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v5].behaviorHint,동기 확인. 확인 없는 공개 각도에서 답하게 한다.,Motive inquiry. Guide Ms. Choi to answer from the angle of the public accusation made without verification. Keep the tone controlled and do not force a premature conclusion.,動機確認。チェ・スミンさんに、確認なしに公開した判断の角度から答えさせる。口調は抑え、早すぎる結論を強要しない。,动机追问。引导崔秀敏女士从未经确认就公开定论的角度作答。保持语气克制，不强行导向过早结论。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
judge_question_script_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_judgeQuestions_d-5_.variants_judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v5_.text,judge_question_script,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,judgeQuestions[d-5].variants[judgeq-d-5-motive_search-b-verification_gap-v5].text,"최수민 씨, 같은 상황에서 다른 선택을 하지 못한 이유를 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what you were afraid to lose by keeping that position.",チェ・スミンさん、その立場を保つことで何を失わないようにしたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明您维持那个立场时害怕失去什么。,Judge-authored interrogation question or judge behavior hint.
mediation_judge_line_src_data_dialogues_mediation_friend-01_paths_conditional_.judge,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,friend-01,paths[conditional].judge,"핵심 책임을 분리한 조건부 조정을 먼저 제시하겠습니다. 9일간의 연락 의도, 예비신랑 메시지의 뉘앙스, 과거 손절과 아버지 관련 문자를 한 덩어리로 처리하지는 않겠습니다.","I will first present a conditional mediation that separates the core responsibilities. The intent behind the nine days of contact, the nuance of the fiancé's messages, the old fallout, and the father-related texts will not be treated as one bundle.",核心となる責任を切り分けた条件付きの調停案を先に示します。9日間の連絡意図、婚約者のメッセージのニュアンス、過去の絶交、父に関するメッセージを一つの塊として扱うことはしません。,我会先提出一份将核心责任分开的条件式调解方案。9天联系的意图、未婚夫留言的语气、旧日决裂以及与父亲有关的短信，不会被合并成一件事处理。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
mediation_judge_line_src_data_dialogues_mediation_friend-01_paths_fact_first_.judge,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,friend-01,paths[fact_first].judge,"해결책보다 사실관계부터 정리하겠습니다. 9일간의 연락, 예비신랑 메시지, 과거 손절 경위가 각각 어디서 이어지는지부터 고정하겠습니다.","Before discussing a remedy, I will first settle the facts. We will fix where the nine days of contact, the fiancé's messages, and the circumstances of the old fallout connect to one another.",解決策より先に、事実関係を整理します。9日間の連絡、婚約者のメッセージ、過去の絶交の経緯がそれぞれどこでつながるのかを先に固定します。,比起解决方案，先整理事实关系。9天的联系、未婚夫的留言、旧日决裂的经过分别从哪里接上，先固定下来。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
mediation_judge_line_src_data_dialogues_mediation_friend-01_paths_immediate_.judge,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,friend-01,paths[immediate].judge,정리된 쟁점을 기준으로 즉시 판단하겠습니다. 판결 단계로 넘어가겠습니다.,I will decide immediately on the issues as organized. We will move to the judgment phase.,整理された争点を基準に、直ちに判断します。判決段階に進みます。,我将依据整理后的争点立即判断。进入判决阶段。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
mediation_judge_line_src_data_dialogues_mediation_friend-01_paths_postpone_.judge,mediation_judge_line,src/data/dialogues/mediation,friend-01,paths[postpone].judge,확정 가능한 사실만 먼저 고정하고 나머지는 보류하겠습니다. 과거 손절 경위와 아버지 관련 문제는 기록과 당사자 설명을 나눠 보겠습니다.,"I will first fix only the facts that can be established and reserve the rest. For the old fallout and the father-related issues, I will separate the records from the parties' explanations.",まず確定可能な事実だけを固定し、残りは保留します。過去の絶交経緯と父に関する問題は、記録と当事者の説明を分けて見ます。,先固定能够确认的事实，其余部分暂时保留。旧日决裂的经过和父亲相关问题，将把记录与当事人的说明分开来看。,Mediation path judge line. Party a/b mediation dialogue entries are excluded.
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_a_primary_fault_.variants_a_primary_fault-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v1].text,"판결 뒤 가장 먼저 움직여야 한 사람은 송다은이었다. 연락 기록만 보고 최수민을 집착으로 못 박고, 확인 없이 친구들 앞에 이름을 올린 책임이 더 크게 남았다. 최수민의 침묵도 문제였지만, 그 침묵을 확인할 기회를 닫아 버린 사람은 다은이었다. 다은은 공개 정정과 사과를 남겼고, 두 사람의 관계는 화해보다 먼저 사실을 바로 세우는 단계에 들어갔다.","After the verdict, the person who had to move first was Song Da-eun. Based only on contact logs, she had branded Choi Su-min as obsessive and put her name before friends without confirmation, and that responsibility remained heavier. Choi Su-min's silence was also a problem, but the person who closed the chance to confirm that silence was Da-eun. Da-eun left a public correction and apology, and the two entered a stage of setting the facts straight before reconciliation.",判決の後、最初に動かなければならなかったのはソン・ダウンだった。連絡記録だけを見てチェ・スミンを執着と決めつけ、確認なしに友人たちの前で名前を挙げた責任がより大きく残った。チェ・スミンの沈黙も問題だったが、その沈黙を確認する機会を閉ざした人はダウンだった。ダウンは公開訂正と謝罪を残し、二人の関係は和解より先に事実を正す段階に入った。,裁决之后，最先必须行动的人是宋多恩。她只看联系记录就把崔秀敏钉成执着，并在没有确认的情况下把名字摆到朋友们面前，这份责任留下得更重。崔秀敏的沉默也是问题，但关闭确认那份沉默机会的人是多恩。多恩留下了公开更正和道歉，两人的关系进入了先于和解、先把事实摆正的阶段。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_a_primary_fault_.variants_a_primary_fault-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v2].text,"재판 이후 다은은 예비신랑의 말과 기록 일부만 믿고 결론을 낸 책임을 받아들였다. 아버지의 돈 접근과 예비신랑의 선 넘은 메시지가 함께 드러나자, 수민을 먼저 악역으로 세운 장면이 더 무겁게 남았다. 수민은 직접 말하지 않은 책임을 인정했지만, 다은의 공개 낙인은 별도의 정정이 필요했다. 둘은 예전 친구로 돌아가기보다, 먼저 잘못된 소문을 거두는 일부터 시작했다.","After the trial, Da-eun accepted responsibility for reaching a conclusion by trusting only her fiancé's words and part of the record. When her father's approach to money and the fiancé's overstepping messages were revealed together, the scene where Su-min had first been made the villain remained heavier. Su-min acknowledged responsibility for not speaking directly, but Da-eun's public stigma required a separate correction. Rather than return to being old friends, the two began with withdrawing the wrong rumors.",裁判の後、ダウンは婚約者の言葉と記録の一部だけを信じて結論を出した責任を受け入れた。父の金銭接近と婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージが一緒に明らかになると、スミンを先に悪役にした場面がより重く残った。スミンは直接話さなかった責任を認めたが、ダウンの公開の烙印には別途の訂正が必要だった。二人は昔の友人に戻るより、まず誤った噂を取り下げることから始めた。,审理之后，多恩接受了只相信未婚夫的话和部分记录就下结论的责任。当父亲接近钱财的问题和未婚夫越界的留言一起揭开时，先把秀敏立成反派的场面留下得更重。秀敏承认自己没有直接开口的责任，但多恩的公开污名需要另行更正。两人没有先回到过去的朋友，而是从收回错误传闻开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_a_primary_fault_.variants_a_primary_fault-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v3].text,"결론은 다은의 성급한 단정에 더 큰 책임을 두었다. 최수민이 예비신랑에게 연락한 방식은 불안정했지만, 그 연락의 목적은 유혹이 아니라 경고에 가까웠다. 다은은 아버지 이야기를 피하고 싶어 수민의 설명 가능성까지 닫았고, 그 결과 단톡방 낙인이 먼저 퍼졌다. 판결 뒤 다은은 정정문을 올렸지만, 수민이 그 사과를 곧바로 받아들이지는 못했다.","The conclusion placed greater responsibility on Da-eun's hasty assumption. The way Choi Su-min contacted the fiancé was unstable, but the purpose of that contact was closer to warning than temptation. Da-eun wanted to avoid the story about her father, so she even closed off the possibility of Su-min's explanation, and as a result the group chat stigma spread first. After the verdict, Da-eun posted a correction, but Su-min could not accept that apology right away.",結論はダウンの性急な断定により大きな責任を置いた。チェ・スミンが婚約者に連絡した方式は不安定だったが、その連絡の目的は誘惑ではなく警告に近かった。ダウンは父の話を避けたくて、スミンの説明可能性まで閉ざし、その結果グループチャットの烙印が先に広がった。判決の後、ダウンは訂正文を上げたが、スミンはその謝罪をすぐには受け入れられなかった。,结论把更大的责任放在多恩的仓促断定上。崔秀敏联系未婚夫的方式并不稳定，但那次联系的目的更接近警告，而不是诱惑。多恩因为想避开父亲的故事，连秀敏解释的可能性都关闭了，结果群聊污名先一步扩散。裁决之后，多恩发布了更正文，但秀敏没能立刻接受那份道歉。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_a_primary_fault_.variants_a_primary_fault-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v4].text,"다은에게 내려진 결론은 단순한 사과 요구가 아니었다. 확인하지 않은 기록을 사람의 의도로 바꿔 말했고, 그 말을 공개된 자리에서 확정한 책임이 컸다. 수민이 오래 침묵한 이유는 잘못된 방식이었지만, 그 침묵의 배경에는 다은이 감당하기 어려운 가족사가 있었다. 이후 다은은 예비신랑과 아버지의 문제를 각각 따로 확인했고, 수민에게는 더 늦기 전에 직접 사과했다.","The conclusion given to Da-eun was not a simple demand for apology. She had turned an unconfirmed record into a person's intent, and she had finalized those words in a public place, so her responsibility was great. Su-min's reason for remaining silent was a wrong method, but behind that silence was a family history that Da-eun would have found hard to bear. Afterward, Da-eun separately confirmed the issues involving her fiancé and her father, and apologized directly to Su-min before it was any later.",ダウンに下された結論は、単純な謝罪要求ではなかった。確認していない記録を人の意図に変えて語り、その言葉を公開された場で確定した責任が大きかった。スミンが長く沈黙した理由は誤った方式だったが、その沈黙の背景にはダウンが受け止めにくい家族史があった。その後、ダウンは婚約者と父の問題をそれぞれ別に確認し、これ以上遅くなる前にスミンへ直接謝罪した。,给多恩的结论并不是简单要求道歉。她把未经确认的记录改说成一个人的意图，又在公开场合把那些话定了下来，这份责任很大。秀敏长期沉默的理由是一种错误方式，但那份沉默背后有多恩难以承受的家庭史。之后，多恩分别确认了未婚夫和父亲的问题，并在更晚之前直接向秀敏道歉。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_a_primary_fault_.variants_a_primary_fault-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[a_primary_fault].variants[a_primary_fault-v5].text,"판결은 다은이 믿고 싶었던 이야기와 실제 기록 사이의 틈을 짚었다. 그녀는 결혼 직전의 불안을 이유로 최수민을 먼저 위험한 사람으로 만들었고, 공통 친구들의 시선까지 그 방향으로 끌고 갔다. 최수민의 대응도 서툴렀지만, 다은의 공개 매도는 회복하기 어려운 상처를 남겼다. 후일담은 화해가 아니라 정정, 사과, 그리고 다시는 확인 없이 이름을 올리지 않겠다는 약속으로 시작됐다.","The verdict pointed to the gap between the story Da-eun wanted to believe and the actual records. She made Choi Su-min into a dangerous person first on the grounds of anxiety before marriage, and pulled even the eyes of mutual friends in that direction. Choi Su-min's response was also clumsy, but Da-eun's public smear left a wound difficult to repair. The aftermath began not with reconciliation, but with correction, apology, and a promise never again to put someone's name up without confirmation.",判決は、ダウンが信じたかった話と実際の記録との間の隙間を指摘した。彼女は結婚直前の不安を理由にチェ・スミンを先に危険な人にし、共通の友人たちの視線までその方向へ引っ張っていった。チェ・スミンの対応も不器用だったが、ダウンの公開の決めつけは回復しにくい傷を残した。後日談は和解ではなく、訂正、謝罪、そして二度と確認なしに名前を挙げないという約束から始まった。,裁决指出了多恩想相信的故事与实际记录之间的缝隙。她以结婚前夕的不安为由，先把崔秀敏变成危险的人，甚至把共同朋友们的视线也拉向那个方向。崔秀敏的应对也笨拙，但多恩的公开抹黑留下了难以恢复的伤口。后日谈不是从和解开始，而是从更正、道歉，以及再也不未经确认就把名字摆上去的承诺开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_b_primary_fault_.variants_b_primary_fault-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v1].text,"판결은 최수민의 의도가 유혹은 아니었다고 보면서도, 방식의 책임을 더 무겁게 보았다. 다은에게 직접 말하지 못했다는 사정이 있었지만, 예비신랑에게 반복적으로 닿으려 한 선택은 오해를 키웠다. 다은의 공개 발언은 잘못이었으나, 그 전에 수민이 남긴 빈칸이 너무 컸다는 결론이었다. 두 사람은 정정과 사과를 나누었지만, 수민은 앞으로 어떤 경고도 혼자 우회하지 않겠다고 기록으로 남겼다.","The verdict saw that Choi Su-min's intent had not been temptation, but weighed the responsibility for her method more heavily. There were circumstances that kept her from speaking directly to Da-eun, but the choice to repeatedly try to reach the fiancé grew the misunderstanding. Da-eun's public statement was wrong, but the conclusion was that before it, the blank Su-min had left was too large. The two exchanged correction and apology, but Su-min left in the record that from now on she would not bypass any warning alone.",判決はチェ・スミンの意図が誘惑ではなかったと見ながらも、方式の責任をより重く見た。ダウンに直接言えなかった事情はあったが、婚約者へ繰り返し届こうとした選択は誤解を大きくした。ダウンの公開発言は誤りだったが、その前にスミンが残した空白があまりに大きかったという結論だった。二人は訂正と謝罪を交わしたが、スミンは今後どんな警告も一人で迂回しないと記録に残した。,裁决认为崔秀敏的意图并不是诱惑，但更重地看待她方式上的责任。虽然有无法直接对多恩开口的情况，但反复试图联系未婚夫的选择扩大了误会。多恩的公开发言是错误的，但结论是，在那之前秀敏留下的空白太大。两人交换了更正和道歉，但秀敏在记录中留下，今后任何警告都不会再独自绕行。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_b_primary_fault_.variants_b_primary_fault-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v2].text,"이 결말에서는 수민의 침묵과 우회가 핵심 책임으로 정리됐다. 예비신랑의 메시지와 아버지의 돈 접근이 사실이어도, 수민이 설명을 끝까지 미루며 연락만 반복한 방식은 다은을 더 불안하게 만들었다. 다은은 성급히 퍼뜨린 말을 거두어야 했지만, 처음부터 사실을 보여 주지 않은 수민의 책임이 더 컸다. 재판 뒤 수민은 피해 사실과 경고 이유를 공식 기록으로 남겼고, 다은은 그제야 자신이 오해한 지점을 알게 됐다.","In this ending, Su-min's silence and detour were organized as the core responsibility. Even if the fiancé's messages and the father's approach to money were true, Su-min's method of delaying the explanation to the end and only repeating contact made Da-eun more anxious. Da-eun had to withdraw the words she had spread hastily, but Su-min's responsibility for not showing the facts from the beginning was greater. After the trial, Su-min left the facts of harm and the reason for warning in an official record, and only then did Da-eun learn where she had misunderstood.",この結末では、スミンの沈黙と迂回が核心責任として整理された。婚約者のメッセージと父の金銭接近が事実であっても、スミンが説明を最後まで先送りし、連絡だけを繰り返した方式はダウンをさらに不安にさせた。ダウンは性急に広めた言葉を取り下げなければならなかったが、最初から事実を示さなかったスミンの責任のほうが大きかった。裁判の後、スミンは被害事実と警告の理由を公式記録に残し、ダウンはその時になって自分が誤解した地点を知ることになった。,在这个结局中，秀敏的沉默和绕行被整理为核心责任。即使未婚夫的留言和父亲接近钱财一事都属实，秀敏把说明一直拖到最后、只反复联系的方式让多恩更加不安。多恩必须收回自己仓促散布的话，但秀敏从一开始没有拿出事实的责任更大。审理之后，秀敏把受害事实和警告理由留在正式记录中，多恩这才知道自己误解的位置。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_b_primary_fault_.variants_b_primary_fault-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v3].text,"판결은 최수민이 진실을 알고도 너무 오래 혼자 막으려 한 점을 크게 보았다. 보호하려는 마음이 있었다 해도, 그 보호가 다은에게는 집착과 침묵으로만 보였다. 다은의 단톡방 발언은 정정 대상이지만, 수민이 직접 설명할 길을 스스로 닫은 책임이 더 컸다. 두 사람은 친구 관계를 회복하기보다, 다시는 서로 대신 판단하지 않겠다는 선을 세우는 데 머물렀다.","The verdict took seriously the fact that Choi Su-min had known the truth but tried to block it alone for too long. Even if she had a wish to protect, to Da-eun that protection appeared only as obsession and silence. Da-eun's group chat remarks were subject to correction, but Su-min's responsibility for closing off the path to explain directly was greater. The two remained at the point of drawing a line that they would never again judge for each other, rather than recovering the friendship.",判決は、チェ・スミンが真実を知りながらあまりに長く一人で防ごうとした点を大きく見た。守ろうとする気持ちがあったとしても、その保護はダウンには執着と沈黙にしか見えなかった。ダウンのグループチャットでの発言は訂正対象だが、スミンが直接説明する道を自ら閉ざした責任のほうが大きかった。二人は友人関係を回復するより、二度と互いの代わりに判断しないという線を立てるところにとどまった。,裁决重视的是，崔秀敏明知真相，却太久地试图独自阻挡。即使她有想保护的心意，那种保护在多恩看来也只像执着和沉默。多恩在群聊中的发言需要更正，但秀敏自己关闭直接说明道路的责任更大。两人没有走到恢复朋友关系，而是停留在划下界线：再也不替彼此判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_b_primary_fault_.variants_b_primary_fault-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v4].text,"수민은 자신이 악역으로 남으면 다은이 덜 다칠 거라고 믿었지만, 판결은 그 판단을 가장 큰 문제로 보았다. 예비신랑에게 경고하려는 목적은 이해됐지만, 반복 연락과 늦은 설명은 다은이 최악의 결론을 내리게 만들었다. 다은도 공개 낙인을 사과했으나, 수민은 침묵으로 사건의 방향을 방치한 책임을 받아들여야 했다. 후일담은 조심스러운 거리두기와 공식 기록 정리로 이어졌다.","Su-min believed that if she remained the villain, Da-eun would be hurt less, but the verdict saw that judgment as the biggest problem. The purpose of warning the fiancé was understandable, but repeated contact and a late explanation led Da-eun to the worst conclusion. Da-eun also apologized for the public stigma, but Su-min had to accept responsibility for leaving the direction of the case unattended through silence. The aftermath led to cautious distance and organization of the official record.",スミンは自分が悪役として残ればダウンがそれほど傷つかないと信じていたが、判決はその判断を最も大きな問題と見た。婚約者に警告しようとする目的は理解されたが、繰り返しの連絡と遅い説明はダウンに最悪の結論を出させた。ダウンも公開の烙印を謝罪したが、スミンは沈黙によって事件の方向を放置した責任を受け入れなければならなかった。後日談は慎重な距離置きと公式記録の整理へ続いた。,秀敏相信，只要自己留下来当反派，多恩就会少受一点伤，但裁决把这个判断看作最大的问题。想警告未婚夫的目的可以理解，但反复联系和迟来的说明，让多恩得出了最坏的结论。多恩也为公开污名道歉，但秀敏必须接受自己用沉默放任案件方向发展的责任。后日谈延伸为谨慎保持距离和整理正式记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_b_primary_fault_.variants_b_primary_fault-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[b_primary_fault].variants[b_primary_fault-v5].text,"이 판결에서 수민은 피해자이면서도 이번 오해를 키운 주된 당사자로 남았다. 과거 피해를 말하지 못한 이유는 이해되지만, 현재의 경고까지 같은 방식으로 숨기면서 다은에게는 확인할 실마리가 사라졌다. 다은의 분노는 지나쳤지만, 수민의 반복된 침묵은 그 분노가 자랄 자리를 만들었다. 재판 뒤 수민은 다은에게 진실을 한 번에 던지기보다, 자료와 순서를 갖춰 설명하는 법을 배워야 했다.","In this verdict, Su-min remained both a victim and the main person who grew this misunderstanding. The reason she could not speak about past harm was understandable, but by hiding even the current warning in the same way, the clue Da-eun could confirm disappeared. Da-eun's anger went too far, but Su-min's repeated silence created the space where that anger could grow. After the trial, Su-min had to learn how to explain to Da-eun with materials and sequence, rather than throwing the truth at her all at once.",この判決で、スミンは被害者でありながら今回の誤解を大きくした主な当事者として残った。過去の被害を言えなかった理由は理解できるが、現在の警告まで同じ方式で隠したことで、ダウンには確認する手がかりが消えた。ダウンの怒りは行き過ぎていたが、スミンの繰り返された沈黙はその怒りが育つ場所を作った。裁判の後、スミンはダウンに真実を一度に投げつけるのではなく、資料と順序を整えて説明する方法を学ばなければならなかった。,在这个裁决中，秀敏既是受害者，也是扩大这次误会的主要当事人。她无法说出过去受害的理由可以理解，但连现在的警告也用同样方式隐藏，使多恩失去了可以确认的线索。多恩的愤怒过了头，但秀敏反复的沉默为那份愤怒提供了生长的位置。审理之后，秀敏必须学习的不是一次性把真相扔给多恩，而是备好资料和顺序来说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_procedural_caution_.variants_procedural_caution-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v1].text,"재판관은 판결 직후 감정적 확산을 멈추는 절차를 먼저 지시했다. 단톡방 발언은 정정하고, 예비신랑의 메시지와 아버지의 돈 접근은 별도 자료로 분리해 확인해야 했다. 수민의 과거 피해는 소문이 아니라 기록으로 남겨야 했고, 다은은 그 기록을 자기 분노의 반박으로만 받아들이지 말아야 했다. 관계 회복은 그다음 문제였다.","Immediately after the verdict, the Judge first directed a procedure to stop emotional spread. The group chat remarks had to be corrected, and the fiancé's messages and the father's approach to money had to be separated into separate materials for confirmation. Su-min's past harm had to be left as a record, not as a rumor, and Da-eun had to not accept that record only as a rebuttal to her own anger. Recovery of the relationship was the next issue.",裁判官は判決直後、感情的な拡散を止める手続きを先に指示した。グループチャットでの発言は訂正し、婚約者のメッセージと父の金銭接近は別々の資料として分けて確認しなければならなかった。スミンの過去の被害は噂ではなく記録として残すべきであり、ダウンはその記録を自分の怒りへの反論としてだけ受け取ってはならなかった。関係回復はその次の問題だった。,法官在裁决刚结束后，首先指示了停止情绪扩散的程序。群聊发言要更正，未婚夫的留言和父亲接近钱财的问题则必须分成另行资料来确认。秀敏过去的受害不能作为传闻，而必须作为记录留下；多恩也不能只把那份记录当成对自己愤怒的反驳来接受。关系恢复是之后的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_procedural_caution_.variants_procedural_caution-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v2].text,"절차 주의 판결은 두 사람에게 더 말하기보다 먼저 정리하라고 요구했다. 누가 먼저 선을 넘었는지, 누가 공개적으로 낙인을 만들었는지, 돈 요구가 어디까지 이어졌는지를 각각 따로 확인해야 했다. 한꺼번에 사과와 폭로를 섞으면 또 다른 오해가 생길 수 있기 때문이었다. 판결 뒤 두 사람은 상담과 자료 정리를 병행하며, 공통 친구들에게는 정정된 사실만 전달했다.","The procedural-caution verdict required the two to organize first rather than say more. They had to separately confirm who crossed the line first, who publicly created the stigma, and how far the demand for money had continued. That was because mixing apology and exposure all at once could create another misunderstanding. After the verdict, the two proceeded with counseling and organizing materials in parallel, and delivered only the corrected facts to their mutual friends.",手続き注意の判決は、二人にさらに話すより先に整理するよう求めた。誰が先に一線を越えたのか、誰が公開の場で烙印を作ったのか、金銭要求がどこまで続いたのかを、それぞれ別に確認しなければならなかった。一度に謝罪と暴露を混ぜれば、また別の誤解が生まれうるからだった。判決の後、二人はカウンセリングと資料整理を並行し、共通の友人には訂正された事実だけを伝えた。,程序注意裁决要求两人先整理，而不是说更多话。谁先越界、谁公开制造了污名、金钱要求延续到哪里，都必须分别确认。因为如果一次性把道歉和揭露混在一起，可能又会产生新的误会。裁决之后，两人并行进行咨询和资料整理，只向共同朋友传达更正后的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_procedural_caution_.variants_procedural_caution-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v3].text,"재판관은 이번 사건이 명예훼손, 금전 피해, 결혼 관계의 신뢰 문제로 갈라질 수 있다고 보았다. 그래서 다은에게는 공개 발언의 정정 순서를, 수민에게는 피해 사실을 공식화하는 절차를 요구했다. 예비신랑의 행동은 다은이 따로 확인해야 할 문제로 남았다. 친구 사이의 감정만으로는 더 이상 사건을 정리할 수 없다는 결론이었다.","The Judge saw that this case could split into defamation, financial harm, and trust issues in the marriage relationship. So the Judge required Da-eun to follow an order for correcting her public remarks, and required Su-min to follow a procedure for formalizing the facts of harm. The fiancé's conduct remained an issue Da-eun had to confirm separately. The conclusion was that the case could no longer be organized by feelings between friends alone.",裁判官は、今回の事件が名誉毀損、金銭被害、結婚関係の信頼問題へ分かれうると見た。そのためダウンには公開発言を訂正する順序を、スミンには被害事実を公式化する手続きを求めた。婚約者の行動は、ダウンが別に確認すべき問題として残った。友人同士の感情だけでは、もはや事件を整理できないという結論だった。,法官认为，这次事件可能分成名誉损害、金钱受害以及婚姻关系的信任问题。因此，法官要求多恩按照顺序更正公开发言，也要求秀敏走程序把受害事实正式化。未婚夫的行为仍是多恩需要另行确认的问题。结论是，不能再只凭朋友之间的感情整理这个事件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_procedural_caution_.variants_procedural_caution-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v4].text,"판결 이후 가장 중요한 것은 누가 더 불쌍한가가 아니라, 같은 일이 다시 번지지 않게 막는 절차였다. 다은은 친구들 앞에서 만든 표현을 바로잡고, 수민은 경고와 피해 사실을 증거 순서대로 남겨야 했다. 아버지와 예비신랑의 문제는 별도 당사자 확인 없이는 더 퍼뜨리지 않도록 했다. 두 사람 모두에게 필요한 건 감정의 결론보다 확인의 순서였다.","After the verdict, what mattered most was not who was more pitiful, but the procedure to keep the same thing from spreading again. Da-eun had to correct the expressions she had made in front of friends, and Su-min had to leave the warning and the facts of harm in the order of evidence. The issues involving the father and the fiancé were not to be spread further without separate confirmation by the parties. What both of them needed was the order of confirmation rather than an emotional conclusion.",判決後に最も重要だったのは、誰がよりかわいそうかではなく、同じことが再び広がらないよう防ぐ手続きだった。ダウンは友人たちの前で作った表現を正し、スミンは警告と被害事実を証拠の順序どおりに残さなければならなかった。父と婚約者の問題は、別途当事者確認なしにこれ以上広げないようにした。二人に必要だったのは感情の結論ではなく、確認の順序だった。,裁决之后最重要的不是谁更可怜，而是阻止同样的事情再次扩散的程序。多恩要纠正自己在朋友们面前制造的表述，秀敏则必须按证据顺序留下警告和受害事实。父亲和未婚夫的问题，在没有另行当事人确认之前，不得继续扩散。两人需要的不是情绪的结论，而是确认的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_procedural_caution_.variants_procedural_caution-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[procedural_caution].variants[procedural_caution-v5].text,"재판관은 두 사람의 화해를 서두르지 않았다. 먼저 단톡방 정정, 연락 기록의 해석, 예비신랑 메시지 확인, 과거 송금 기록 정리를 순서대로 하라고 했다. 특히 가족 문제는 공개 사과문에 섞지 말고 별도 절차로 다루어야 했다. 그 주의가 지켜질 때만, 다은과 수민은 판결 이후에도 서로를 다시 설명할 최소한의 공간을 남길 수 있었다.","The Judge did not rush the two toward reconciliation. First, the Judge told them to proceed in order with the group chat correction, interpretation of contact records, confirmation of the fiancé's messages, and organization of past transfer records. In particular, family issues were not to be mixed into a public apology statement, but handled through a separate procedure. Only when that caution was kept could Da-eun and Su-min leave even after the verdict a minimum space to explain each other again.",裁判官は二人の和解を急がなかった。まずグループチャットの訂正、連絡記録の解釈、婚約者メッセージの確認、過去の送金記録の整理を順番に行うよう求めた。特に家族問題は公開謝罪文に混ぜず、別途の手続きで扱うべきだとした。その注意が守られる時にだけ、ダウンとスミンは判決後も互いをもう一度説明する最低限の空間を残すことができた。,法官没有催促两人和解。法官要求她们先按顺序进行群聊更正、联系记录解读、未婚夫留言确认和过去转账记录整理。尤其是家庭问题，不要混进公开道歉文，而要通过另行程序处理。只有遵守这一注意事项时，多恩和秀敏在裁决之后仍能留下再次说明彼此的最低限度空间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_protective_resolution_.variants_protective_resolution-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v1].text,"재판관은 모든 사실을 공개하기보다 필요한 범위에서 바로잡는 방식을 택했다. 다은의 단톡방 발언은 정정하되, 아버지의 과거 돈 문제는 당사자와 필요한 절차 안에서만 다루도록 했다. 수민은 더 이상 혼자 악역을 감당하지 말고 피해 기록을 남기기로 했다. 두 사람은 서로의 가족사를 소문으로 만들지 않는 조건 아래, 조심스럽게 사건을 마무리했다.","The Judge chose a method of correcting only within the necessary scope rather than making every fact public. Da-eun's group chat remarks would be corrected, but her father's old money issue would be handled only with the parties and within the necessary procedures. Su-min decided not to bear the villain role alone anymore, and to leave a record of harm. The two cautiously closed the case under the condition that they would not turn each other's family histories into rumors.",裁判官は、すべての事実を公開するより、必要な範囲で正す方式を選んだ。ダウンのグループチャットでの発言は訂正するが、父の過去の金銭問題は当事者と必要な手続きの中だけで扱うようにした。スミンはこれ以上一人で悪役を引き受けず、被害記録を残すことにした。二人は互いの家族史を噂にしないという条件の下で、慎重に事件を締めくくった。,法官选择的不是公开所有事实，而是在必要范围内纠正的方式。多恩的群聊发言要更正，但父亲过去的钱财问题只在当事人和必要程序中处理。秀敏决定不再独自承担反派角色，而是留下受害记录。两人在不把彼此家庭史变成传闻的条件下，谨慎地结束了事件。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_protective_resolution_.variants_protective_resolution-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v2].text,"보호 해결의 결론은 책임을 덮는 것이 아니었다. 다은은 공개 낙인을 거두고, 수민은 경고의 이유를 필요한 사람에게만 정확히 설명하기로 했다. 예비신랑의 메시지와 아버지의 돈 접근은 각각 따로 확인하되, 공통 친구들 앞에서 세부 가족사를 퍼뜨리지는 않았다. 상처를 더 키우지 않기 위해, 두 사람은 사실과 사생활을 분리하는 방식으로 절차를 줄였다.","The conclusion of the protective resolution was not to cover over responsibility. Da-eun withdrew the public stigma, and Su-min decided to explain the reason for her warning accurately only to the people who needed to know. The fiancé's messages and the father's approach to money would each be confirmed separately, but the detailed family history would not be spread before mutual friends. To keep the wounds from growing further, the two reduced the procedure by separating facts from privacy.",保護的解決の結論は、責任を覆い隠すことではなかった。ダウンは公開の烙印を取り下げ、スミンは警告の理由を必要な人にだけ正確に説明することにした。婚約者のメッセージと父の金銭接近はそれぞれ別に確認するが、共通の友人たちの前で細かな家族史を広めることはしなかった。傷をこれ以上大きくしないため、二人は事実と私生活を分ける方式で手続きを減らした。,保护性解决的结论并不是掩盖责任。多恩收回公开污名，秀敏则决定只向需要知道的人准确说明警告的理由。未婚夫的留言和父亲接近钱财的问题各自另行确认，但不会在共同朋友面前散布详细家庭史。为了不让伤口继续扩大，两人以区分事实和私生活的方式减少程序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_protective_resolution_.variants_protective_resolution-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v3].text,"판결 뒤 두 사람은 서로를 다시 친구라고 부르기보다, 서로를 더 망가뜨리지 않는 방법부터 골랐다. 다은은 확인 없는 글을 정정했고, 수민은 과거 피해를 비공개 기록으로 남겼다. 아버지의 문제는 별도 확인 절차로 넘기고, 예비신랑의 행동도 다은이 직접 마주하기로 했다. 공개적 폭로 대신 제한된 정리로 끝낸 것은, 남은 삶까지 사건으로 만들지 않기 위한 선택이었다.","After the verdict, rather than call each other friends again, the two first chose a way not to damage each other further. Da-eun corrected the unverified post, and Su-min left the past harm as a private record. The father's issue was sent to a separate confirmation procedure, and Da-eun decided to face the fiancé's conduct directly as well. Ending it through limited organization instead of public exposure was a choice to keep the rest of their lives from becoming part of the case.",判決の後、二人は互いを再び友人と呼ぶより、互いをこれ以上壊さない方法から選んだ。ダウンは確認のない投稿を訂正し、スミンは過去の被害を非公開記録として残した。父の問題は別途の確認手続きへ送り、婚約者の行動もダウンが直接向き合うことにした。公開の暴露ではなく限定された整理で終えたことは、残る人生まで事件にしないための選択だった。,裁决之后，两人不是重新称彼此为朋友，而是先选择了不再进一步毁掉彼此的方法。多恩更正了未经确认的帖子，秀敏把过去的受害作为非公开记录留下。父亲的问题移交给另行确认程序，未婚夫的行为也由多恩决定直接面对。没有选择公开揭露，而是以有限整理结束，是为了不让剩下的人生也变成案件。,"P0 fix. EN/JA/ZH-CN 3개 모두 한국어 4번째 문장(""...남은 삶까지 사건으로 만들지 않기 위한 선택이었다"") 절단. EN에는 추가로 중국어 '整理' 잔류. KR 4문장 전체 의미를 살려 EN/JA/ZH-CN 모두 완전 재번역. friend-01 aftermath 마무리 emotional beat이라 톤 보존 중요."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_protective_resolution_.variants_protective_resolution-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v4].text,"이 결말에서 재판관은 두 사람 모두에게 말의 범위를 정하라고 했다. 다은은 수민을 집착으로 단정한 표현을 거두고, 수민은 왜 경고하려 했는지 다은에게만 차분히 설명했다. 가족의 돈 문제는 필요한 법적 기록으로 남기되, 친구들 사이의 흥밋거리로 흘러가지 않게 막았다. 보호는 침묵이 아니라, 어디까지 말하고 어디부터 절차로 넘길지 정하는 일이 되었다.","In this ending, the Judge told both people to set the scope of their words. Da-eun withdrew the expression that had labeled Su-min as obsessive, and Su-min calmly explained only to Da-eun why she had tried to warn her. The family's money issue was left as a necessary legal record, but they blocked it from flowing into gossip among friends. Protection became not silence, but the work of deciding how far to speak and from where to hand matters over to procedure.",この結末で、裁判官は二人の双方に言葉の範囲を定めるよう言った。ダウンはスミンを執着と断定した表現を取り下げ、スミンはなぜ警告しようとしたのかをダウンにだけ落ち着いて説明した。家族の金銭問題は必要な法的記録として残す一方で、友人たちの間の興味本位な話へ流れていかないよう防いだ。保護は沈黙ではなく、どこまで話し、どこから手続きへ渡すのかを定めることになった。,在这个结局中，法官要求两人都确定自己言语的范围。多恩收回了把秀敏断定为执着的表述，秀敏也只向多恩平静说明自己为什么想要警告。家人的钱财问题作为必要的法律记录留下，但被阻止流成朋友之间的谈资。保护不再是沉默，而是决定说到哪里、从哪里开始交给程序的工作。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_protective_resolution_.variants_protective_resolution-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[protective_resolution].variants[protective_resolution-v5].text,"후일담은 조용한 합의로 이어졌다. 다은은 수민의 명예를 회복할 최소한의 정정문을 냈고, 수민은 다은의 가족사를 더 넓게 공개하지 않았다. 대신 두 사람은 예비신랑의 메시지와 아버지의 돈 접근을 각각 필요한 사람에게만 확인시키기로 했다. 이 결말은 감정의 승리가 아니라, 더 이상 서로의 약점을 무기로 쓰지 않겠다는 보호선이었다.","The aftermath led to a quiet agreement. Da-eun issued the minimum correction needed to restore Su-min's honor, and Su-min did not disclose Da-eun's family history more widely. Instead, the two decided to have the fiancé's messages and the father's approach to money confirmed only by the necessary people. This ending was not a victory of emotion, but a protective line that they would no longer use each other's weaknesses as weapons.",後日談は静かな合意へ続いた。ダウンはスミンの名誉を回復するための最低限の訂正文を出し、スミンはダウンの家族史をより広く公開しなかった。その代わり、二人は婚約者のメッセージと父の金銭接近を、それぞれ必要な人にだけ確認してもらうことにした。この結末は感情の勝利ではなく、これ以上互いの弱点を武器として使わないという保護線だった。,后日谈走向了安静的协议。多恩发布了恢复秀敏名誉所需的最低限度更正文，秀敏也没有把多恩的家庭史更广泛地公开。取而代之，两人决定把未婚夫的留言和父亲接近钱财的问题分别只让必要的人确认。这个结局不是情绪的胜利，而是一条保护线：不再把彼此的弱点当作武器。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_shared_fault_.variants_shared_fault-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v1].text,"판결 뒤 다은과 수민은 서로가 만든 상처를 같은 테이블 위에 올려야 했다. 다은은 확인 없이 단톡방에서 최수민을 매도했고, 수민은 또 혼자 악역을 감당하는 방식으로 오해를 키웠다. 예비신랑의 선 넘은 메시지와 아버지의 돈 접근이 드러나도, 둘 중 누구도 완전히 깨끗해지지는 않았다. 두 사람은 가까운 친구로 돌아가기보다, 먼저 사실을 정정하고 남은 관계를 천천히 정리하기로 했다.","After the verdict, Da-eun and Su-min had to place the wounds they had made on the same table. Da-eun smeared Choi Su-min in the group chat without confirmation, and Su-min grew the misunderstanding again by bearing the villain role alone. Even when the fiancé's overstepping messages and the father's approach to money were revealed, neither of the two became completely clean. Rather than return to being close friends, the two decided first to correct the facts and slowly sort out the remaining relationship.",判決の後、ダウンとスミンは互いが作った傷を同じテーブルの上に置かなければならなかった。ダウンは確認なしにグループチャットでチェ・スミンを決めつけ、スミンはまた一人で悪役を引き受ける方式で誤解を大きくした。婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージと父の金銭接近が明らかになっても、二人のどちらも完全にきれいにはならなかった。二人は親しい友人へ戻るより、まず事実を訂正し、残った関係をゆっくり整理することにした。,裁决之后，多恩和秀敏必须把彼此造成的伤口摆到同一张桌上。多恩未经确认就在群聊中抹黑崔秀敏，秀敏也再次用独自承担反派的方式扩大了误会。即使未婚夫越界的留言和父亲接近钱财的问题被揭开，两人中也没有谁变得完全清白。两人决定不先回到亲近朋友，而是先更正事实，再慢慢整理剩下的关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_shared_fault_.variants_shared_fault-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v2].text,"재판 이후 남은 결론은 한 사람의 악의보다 반복된 방식의 문제였다. 다은은 오래된 불신을 근거처럼 써서 수민을 먼저 낙인찍었고, 수민은 보호라는 이름으로 필요한 설명을 계속 미뤘다. 그 사이 예비신랑의 행동과 아버지의 돈 문제가 뒤늦게 드러나며 사건은 더 크게 뒤집혔다. 후일담은 화해의 장면이 아니라, 서로의 책임을 문장으로 남기는 장면에 가까웠다.","The conclusion left after the trial was less one person's malice than a problem in repeated ways of acting. Da-eun used old distrust like evidence and branded Su-min first, while Su-min kept delaying the explanation needed in the name of protection. In the meantime, the fiancé's conduct and the father's money issue were revealed late, turning the case over more dramatically. The aftermath was not a scene of reconciliation, but closer to a scene of leaving each person's responsibility in sentences.",裁判後に残った結論は、一人の悪意よりも繰り返された方式の問題だった。ダウンは古い不信を根拠のように使って先にスミンに烙印を押し、スミンは保護という名で必要な説明をずっと先送りした。そのあいだに婚約者の行動と父の金銭問題が遅れて明らかになり、事件はより大きく覆った。後日談は和解の場面ではなく、互いの責任を文章として残す場面に近かった。,审理之后留下的结论，与其说是一个人的恶意，不如说是反复出现的方式出了问题。多恩把旧日不信当成根据一样使用，先给秀敏贴上污名；秀敏则以保护为名，不断推迟必要的说明。在这期间，未婚夫的行为和父亲的钱财问题迟迟揭开，使案件发生了更大的翻转。后日谈不是和解的场面，更接近把彼此的责任写成句子的场面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_shared_fault_.variants_shared_fault-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v3].text,"둘은 모두 맞는 말과 잘못된 방식을 동시에 가지고 있었다. 수민의 연락은 경고였지만 방식이 거칠었고, 다은의 불안은 이해되지만 공개 매도는 선을 넘었다. 과거 손절의 진짜 이유가 드러난 뒤에도, 상처가 곧 면책이 되지는 않았다. 판결 뒤 두 사람은 정정과 사과를 나누었고, 친구로 돌아갈지 조용히 멀어질지는 시간을 두고 보기로 했다.","Both of them had right words and wrong methods at the same time. Su-min's contact was a warning, but the method was rough, and Da-eun's anxiety was understandable, but the public smear crossed the line. Even after the true reason for the old cutting ties was revealed, a wound did not immediately become immunity. After the verdict, the two exchanged correction and apology, and decided to wait and see whether they would return to being friends or quietly grow distant.",二人はどちらも、正しい言葉と誤った方式を同時に持っていた。スミンの連絡は警告だったが方式が荒く、ダウンの不安は理解できるが公開の決めつけは一線を越えた。過去の絶交の本当の理由が明らかになった後でも、傷がすぐ免責になるわけではなかった。判決の後、二人は訂正と謝罪を交わし、友人に戻るのか静かに遠ざかるのかは時間を置いて見ることにした。,两人都同时有正确的话和错误的方式。秀敏的联系是警告，但方式粗糙；多恩的不安可以理解，但公开抹黑越过了界线。即使过去断交的真正理由被揭开，伤口也不会立刻变成免责。裁决之后，两人交换了更正和道歉，至于是回到朋友，还是安静地疏远，她们决定留给时间观察。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_shared_fault_.variants_shared_fault-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v4].text,"공동 책임 판결은 다은과 수민 모두에게 불편한 결말이었다. 다은은 수민의 의도를 묻기 전에 이미 결론을 냈고, 수민은 말하지 않는 방식으로 같은 오해가 반복되게 했다. 아버지의 돈 접근과 예비신랑의 메시지는 사건의 진짜 방향을 밝혔지만, 그 사실이 두 사람의 선택을 지워 주지는 못했다. 이후 두 사람은 공통 친구들에게 정정된 사실을 알리고, 더 이상의 추측은 멈추기로 했다.","The shared-responsibility verdict was an uncomfortable ending for both Da-eun and Su-min. Da-eun had already reached a conclusion before asking about Su-min's intent, and Su-min let the same misunderstanding repeat through her way of not speaking. The father's approach to money and the fiancé's messages revealed the true direction of the case, but that fact could not erase the choices the two had made. Afterward, the two told their mutual friends the corrected facts and decided to stop further speculation.",共同責任の判決は、ダウンとスミンの双方にとって居心地の悪い結末だった。ダウンはスミンの意図を尋ねる前にすでに結論を出し、スミンは話さない方式で同じ誤解が繰り返されるようにした。父の金銭接近と婚約者のメッセージは事件の本当の方向を明らかにしたが、その事実が二人の選択を消してくれることはなかった。その後、二人は共通の友人たちに訂正された事実を知らせ、これ以上の推測は止めることにした。,共同责任裁决对多恩和秀敏来说都是不舒服的结局。多恩在询问秀敏的意图之前就已经下了结论，秀敏也用不说的方式让同样的误会反复发生。父亲接近钱财和未婚夫的留言揭示了案件的真正方向，但那个事实并不能抹去两人的选择。之后，两人把更正后的事实告诉共同朋友，并决定停止更多猜测。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_aftermath_.entries_shared_fault_.variants_shared_fault-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[aftermath].entries[shared_fault].variants[shared_fault-v5].text,"판결이 끝나도 다은과 수민 사이에는 쉽게 봉합되지 않는 빈칸이 남았다. 다은은 확인 없는 공개 발언의 책임을, 수민은 침묵으로 낙인을 반복시킨 책임을 받아들였다. 둘은 서로를 완전히 용서하지 못했지만, 적어도 상대가 왜 그렇게 움직였는지는 더 이상 한 문장으로 단정하지 않게 됐다. 그 후일담은 회복과 이별 사이, 아주 느린 정리의 시작이었다.","Even after the verdict ended, a blank that could not easily be mended remained between Da-eun and Su-min. Da-eun accepted responsibility for her unverified public remarks, and Su-min accepted responsibility for letting the stigma repeat through silence. They could not completely forgive each other, but at least they no longer summed up why the other had moved that way in a single sentence. Their aftermath was the beginning of a very slow sorting-out, somewhere between recovery and farewell.",判決が終わっても、ダウンとスミンの間には簡単には縫い合わせられない空白が残った。ダウンは確認のない公開発言の責任を、スミンは沈黙で烙印を繰り返させた責任を受け入れた。二人は互いを完全には許せなかったが、少なくとも相手がなぜそう動いたのかを、もう一文で断定しなくなった。その後日談は回復と別れの間にある、とても遅い整理の始まりだった。,即使裁决结束，多恩和秀敏之间仍留下了无法轻易缝合的空白。多恩接受了未经确认就公开发言的责任，秀敏也接受了用沉默让污名反复出现的责任。两人没能完全原谅彼此，但至少不再用一句话断定对方为什么那样行动。她们的后日谈是恢复与告别之间，一场非常缓慢整理的开始。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤에도 결론부터 붙잡는다.,"Even after steadying her breath, she holds on to the conclusion first.",息を整えた後も、まず結論にしがみつく。,即使调整呼吸后，她仍先抓住结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v1].text,기록을 보자마자 집착이라고 받아들였습니다. 왜 그랬는지 묻기 전에 결론부터 세웠습니다.,"As soon as I saw the records, I took it as obsession. I reached my conclusion before asking why.",記録を見た瞬間、執着だと受け取りました。なぜそうしたのかを聞く前に、結論を先に立てました。,我一看到记录，就把它当成了执着。还没问为什么，就先下了结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,예전 기억을 끌어오듯 턱에 힘이 들어간다.,Her jaw tightens as if an old memory has been pulled forward.,昔の記憶を引き寄せるように、顎に力が入る。,像是把旧记忆拉了回来，下颌绷紧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v10].text,먼저 확인했다면 달랐을 수 있습니다. 하지만 그때 저는 숫자만 붙들었습니다.,"It might have been different if I had checked first. But back then, I clung only to the numbers.",先に確認していれば違ったかもしれません。でも当時の私は数字だけを見ていました。,如果先去确认，结果也许会不同。但当时我只盯着次数。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,시선이 기록 쪽으로 떨어졌다가 다시 올라온다.,"Her eyes fall to the record, then lift again.",視線が記録へ落ち、それからまた上がる。,视线落到记录上，又重新抬起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v2].text,기록을 보자마자 집착이라고 받아들였습니다. 맥락을 기다릴 여유가 없었습니다.,I read the contact records as obsession before asking why. I did not leave room for context.,理由を聞く前に、連絡記録を執着だと読んでしまいました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,还没问原因，我就把联系记录读成了执着。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,말끝을 단단히 세우지만 손끝이 흔들린다.,"She keeps the ends of her sentences firm, but her fingertips tremble.",語尾は固く締めるが、指先が震える。,句尾说得很硬，指尖却在发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v3].text,전화와 문자가 이어진 것만 보고 결론을 냈습니다. 그때는 그게 전부처럼 보였습니다.,I read the contact records as obsession before asking why. The order I chose was wrong.,理由を聞く前に、連絡記録を執着だと読んでしまいました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,还没问原因，我就把联系记录读成了执着。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,분노를 눌러 담으며 빠르게 답한다.,"She answers quickly, holding anger down.",怒りを押し込めながら早口で答える。,压着怒意，快速回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v4].text,수민 씨 설명을 듣기 전에 제 마음속에서는 이미 선을 넘은 사람으로 정리됐습니다.,I read the contact records as obsession before asking why. Fear moved before verification.,理由を聞く前に、連絡記録を執着だと読んでしまいました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,还没问原因，我就把联系记录读成了执着。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,예전 기억을 끌어오듯 턱에 힘이 들어간다.,Her jaw tightens as if an old memory has been pulled forward.,昔の記憶を引き寄せるように、顎に力が入る。,像是把旧记忆拉了回来，下颌绷紧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v5].text,연락이 많다는 사실 하나에 제가 너무 빨리 의미를 붙였습니다. 인정합니다.,I gave meaning too quickly to the single fact that there were many contacts. I admit that.,連絡が多いという一点に、私は早く意味をつけすぎました。認めます。,我只凭联系很多这一点，就太快赋予了意义。这一点我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤에도 결론부터 붙잡는다.,"Even after steadying her breath, she holds on to the conclusion first.",息を整えた後も、まず結論にしがみつく。,即使调整呼吸后，她仍先抓住结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v6].text,그때는 횟수가 곧 의도라고 생각했습니다. 지금 보니 너무 단정이 빨랐습니다.,I read the contact records as obsession before asking why. I avoided the harder question.,理由を聞く前に、連絡記録を執着だと読んでしまいました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,还没问原因，我就把联系记录读成了执着。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,시선이 기록 쪽으로 떨어졌다가 다시 올라온다.,"Her eyes fall to the record, then lift again.",視線が記録へ落ち、それからまた上がる。,视线落到记录上，又重新抬起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v7].text,왜 그랬는지보다 얼마나 했는지가 먼저 눈에 들어왔습니다. 그래서 못 박았습니다.,I read the contact records as obsession before asking why. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,理由を聞く前に、連絡記録を執着だと読んでしまいました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,还没问原因，我就把联系记录读成了执着。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,말끝을 단단히 세우지만 손끝이 흔들린다.,"She keeps the ends of her sentences firm, but her fingertips tremble.",語尾は固く締めるが、指先が震える。,句尾说得很硬，指尖却在发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v8].text,저는 연락 기록을 보자마자 예전 기억까지 끌어왔습니다. 그래서 더 세게 판단했습니다.,I read the contact records as obsession before asking why. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,理由を聞く前に、連絡記録を執着だと読んでしまいました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,还没问原因，我就把联系记录读成了执着。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,분노를 눌러 담으며 빠르게 답한다.,"She answers quickly, holding anger down.",怒りを押し込めながら早口で答える。,压着怒意，快速回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|early].variants[dc-1-a-q1-early-v9].text,그 기록 앞에서 수민 씨 사정을 들을 생각보다 제 불안이 먼저 올라왔습니다.,I read the contact records as obsession before asking why. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,理由を聞く前に、連絡記録を執着だと読んでしまいました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,还没问原因，我就把联系记录读成了执着。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,어깨 힘이 빠지고 목소리가 낮아진다.,"Her shoulders loosen, and her voice drops.",肩の力が抜け、声が低くなる。,肩膀松下来，声音也低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v1].text,저는 연락 의도를 확인하지 않고 수민 씨를 위험한 사람으로 만들었습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. I saw it that way first.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 버티던 결론을 내려놓는다.,She lets go of the conclusion she had been clinging to.,最後まで抱えていた結論を手放す。,放下了坚持到最后的结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v10].text,제가 먼저 못 박은 프레임 때문에 뒤늦은 진실도 변명처럼 보이게 됐습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,반박하려다 멈추고 천천히 인정한다.,"She starts to object, stops, and slowly admits it.",反論しかけて止まり、ゆっくり認める。,想反驳，却停住，然后慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v2].text,제 결론이 먼저였고 증거는 나중에 끼워 넣었습니다. 그 책임은 제게 있습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. I did not leave room for context.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,후회가 먼저 올라와 문장 사이가 길어진다.,"Regret rises first, stretching the pauses between sentences.",後悔が先に込み上げ、文と文の間が長くなる。,后悔先涌上来，句子之间的停顿变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v3].text,수민 씨가 경고하려 했을 가능성을 닫아 버렸습니다. 제가 악역을 먼저 정했습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. The order I chose was wrong.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,시선을 떨군 채 자기 책임을 붙든다.,"With her eyes lowered, she holds on to her own responsibility.",視線を落としたまま、自分の責任を受け止める。,垂下视线，抓住自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v4].text,예전 상처를 핑계로 이번 일도 같은 줄로 묶었습니다. 너무 성급했습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. Fear moved before verification.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,끝까지 버티던 결론을 내려놓는다.,She lets go of the conclusion she had been clinging to.,最後まで抱えていた結論を手放す。,放下了坚持到最后的结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v5].text,확인보다 분노를 택했습니다. 그래서 수민 씨가 설명할 자리를 제가 빼앗았습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. I admit the part that was mine.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,어깨 힘이 빠지고 목소리가 낮아진다.,"Her shoulders loosen, and her voice drops.",肩の力が抜け、声が低くなる。,肩膀松下来，声音也低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v6].text,제가 본 기록은 전부가 아니었습니다. 그런데 저는 전부처럼 말했습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. I avoided the harder question.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,반박하려다 멈추고 천천히 인정한다.,"She starts to object, stops, and slowly admits it.",反論しかけて止まり、ゆっくり認める。,想反驳，却停住，然后慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v7].text,친구들에게 말하기 전에 당사자에게 물었어야 했습니다. 그 순서를 제가 망쳤습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,후회가 먼저 올라와 문장 사이가 길어진다.,"Regret rises first, stretching the pauses between sentences.",後悔が先に込み上げ、文と文の間が長くなる。,后悔先涌上来，句子之间的停顿变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v8].text,수민 씨를 믿지 않은 마음이 판단을 끌고 갔습니다. 그걸 이제 인정합니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,시선을 떨군 채 자기 책임을 붙든다.,"With her eyes lowered, she holds on to her own responsibility.",視線を落としたまま、自分の責任を受け止める。,垂下视线，抓住自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|late].variants[dc-1-a-q1-late-v9].text,저는 불안을 사실처럼 말했습니다. 그 말이 수민 씨 평판을 흔들었습니다.,I admit that I framed Su-min before verifying the purpose of the contact. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,連絡の目的を確認する前に、スミンを決めつけたことを認めます。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我承认，还没确认联系目的，就先给秀敏定了性。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,인정한 직후 곧바로 자기 이유를 덧붙인다.,"Right after admitting it, she adds her own reason.",認めた直後に、自分の理由を付け加える。,刚承认完，又马上补上自己的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v1].text,단톡방에 올린 것도 그 결론 때문입니다. 확인보다 공개가 먼저였다는 건 압니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. I saw it that way first.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,표정은 굳어 있지만 호흡이 흔들린다.,"Her face stays rigid, but her breathing shakes.",表情は固いが、呼吸が揺れる。,表情僵硬，呼吸却在发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v10].text,수민 씨에게 묻는 순서를 건너뛰고 사람들 판단부터 끌어들였습니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,부끄러움을 감추려 말의 속도를 높인다.,She speaks faster to hide her shame.,恥ずかしさを隠すように早口になる。,为了掩饰羞愧，说话速度加快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v2].text,제가 화난 마음으로 친구들에게 먼저 말했습니다. 수민 씨에게 직접 묻지는 않았습니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. I did not leave room for context.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,방어와 후회가 한 문장 안에서 부딪힌다.,Defense and regret collide in a single sentence.,防御と後悔が一つの文の中でぶつかる。,辩解与后悔在一句话里相撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v3].text,"사실을 알린다고 믿었지만, 제가 본 건 기록이고 퍼뜨린 건 해석이었습니다.",I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. The order I chose was wrong.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,눈을 피한 채 단톡방 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"Avoiding eye contact, she brings up the group chat.",目をそらしたままグループチャットの話を出す。,避开视线，提起群聊的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v4].text,그때는 모두가 알아야 한다고 여겼습니다. 지금 보니 제가 먼저 낙인을 붙였습니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. Fear moved before verification.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,표정은 굳어 있지만 호흡이 흔들린다.,"Her face stays rigid, but her breathing shakes.",表情は固いが、呼吸が揺れる。,表情僵硬，呼吸却在发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v5].text,연락 기록만 보고 친구들 앞에서 수민 씨 이름을 세웠습니다. 그건 제가 한 일입니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. I admit the part that was mine.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,인정한 직후 곧바로 자기 이유를 덧붙인다.,"Right after admitting it, she adds her own reason.",認めた直後に、自分の理由を付け加える。,刚承认完，又马上补上自己的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v6].text,저는 단톡방에 올리면 제 불안이 정당해질 거라고 생각했습니다. 그래서 서둘렀습니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. I avoided the harder question.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,부끄러움을 감추려 말의 속도를 높인다.,She speaks faster to hide her shame.,恥ずかしさを隠すように早口になる。,为了掩饰羞愧，说话速度加快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v7].text,수민 씨가 변명할 틈을 주지 않았습니다. 제가 먼저 분위기를 만들었습니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,방어와 후회가 한 문장 안에서 부딪힌다.,Defense and regret collide in a single sentence.,防御と後悔が一つの文の中でぶつかる。,辩解与后悔在一句话里相撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v8].text,기록이 있으니 틀리지 않다고 믿었습니다. 하지만 의도까지 검증한 건 아니었습니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,눈을 피한 채 단톡방 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"Avoiding eye contact, she brings up the group chat.",目をそらしたままグループチャットの話を出す。,避开视线，提起群聊的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-a-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-a-q1-mid-v9].text,제 분노가 친구들 말까지 불러왔습니다. 그 시작이 제 글이었다는 건 인정합니다.,I brought that conclusion into the group chat before checking with Su-min. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,スミンに確認する前に、その結論をグループチャットへ持ち込みました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,还没向秀敏确认，我就把那个结论带进了群聊。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v1].text,감정 때문은 아니었습니다. 다만 지금 바로 전부 말하기 어려운 내용이었습니다.,It was not because of romantic feelings. It was simply something I could not say all at once right then.,感情が理由ではありませんでした。ただ、その場ですぐ全部を話すのが難しい内容でした。,不是因为感情。只是那些内容当时很难马上全部说出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v10].text,전하려던 말은 경고에 가까웠습니다. 다만 누구 이름을 쉽게 꺼낼 수 없었습니다.,What I meant to deliver was closer to a warning. I just could not easily say whose name was involved.,伝えようとしていたのは、警告に近い言葉でした。ただ、誰の名前なのかを簡単には口にできませんでした。,我想传达的更接近警告。只是我没法轻易说出涉及谁的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v2].text,꼭 알려야 할 일이 있었습니다. 호감이나 미련으로 보실 일은 아닙니다.,"The contact was closer to a warning, not private feelings. I did not leave room for context.",その連絡は私的な感情ではなく、警告に近いものでした。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,那次联系更接近警告，不是私情。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v3].text,제가 연락한 이유는 사적인 감정이 아니었습니다. 그 말만은 분명히 하겠습니다.,"The contact was closer to a warning, not private feelings. The order I chose was wrong.",その連絡は私的な感情ではなく、警告に近いものでした。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,那次联系更接近警告，不是私情。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v4].text,그 사람에게 넘어가면 안 되는 말이 있었습니다. 그래서 계속 닿으려 했습니다.,"The contact was closer to a warning, not private feelings. Fear moved before verification.",その連絡は私的な感情ではなく、警告に近いものでした。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,那次联系更接近警告，不是私情。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v5].text,집착이라면 이렇게 피하지 않았을 겁니다. 저는 전해야 할 사실이 있었습니다.,"The contact was closer to a warning, not private feelings. I admit the part that was mine.",その連絡は私的な感情ではなく、警告に近いものでした。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,那次联系更接近警告，不是私情。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v6].text,"다은이에게 바로 꺼낼 수 없는 얘기라, 그 사람에게 먼저 말하려 했습니다.","The contact was closer to a warning, not private feelings. I avoided the harder question.",その連絡は私的な感情ではなく、警告に近いものでした。 より難しい問いを避けました。,那次联系更接近警告，不是私情。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v7].text,제가 보기엔 놓치면 안 되는 흐름이 있었습니다. 그걸 설명하려고 했습니다.,"The contact was closer to a warning, not private feelings. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",その連絡は私的な感情ではなく、警告に近いものでした。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,那次联系更接近警告，不是私情。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v8].text,연락 모양이 나쁜 건 압니다. 그래도 마음을 고백하려던 건 아니었습니다.,"The contact was closer to a warning, not private feelings. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",その連絡は私的な感情ではなく、警告に近いものでした。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,那次联系更接近警告，不是私情。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|early].variants[dc-1-b-q1-early-v9].text,그때는 한 번만 들어 달라는 생각뿐이었습니다. 이유는 가볍지 않았습니다.,"The contact was closer to a warning, not private feelings. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",その連絡は私的な感情ではなく、警告に近いものでした。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,那次联系更接近警告，不是私情。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v1].text,다은이 아버지가 같은 방식으로 돈을 꺼낼까 봐 경고하려 했습니다.,I tried to warn him because I feared Da-eun's father might bring up money the same way again.,ダウンの父が同じ形でお金の話を持ち出すのではないかと思い、警告しようとしました。,我是担心多恩的父亲会用同样的方式开口要钱，所以想提醒他。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v10].text,제가 멈추지 못한 건 같은 피해가 반복될까 봐였습니다. 그게 전하려던 핵심입니다.,I was trying to warn that Da-eun's father might repeat the same money approach. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,ダウンの父が同じ金銭接近を繰り返すかもしれないと警告しようとしていました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我是在提醒，多恩的父亲也许会重复同样的接近钱财方式。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v2].text,예전에 제가 당한 흐름과 닮았습니다. 그래서 결혼 전에 멈추게 하고 싶었습니다.,I was trying to warn that Da-eun's father might repeat the same money approach. I did not leave room for context.,ダウンの父が同じ金銭接近を繰り返すかもしれないと警告しようとしていました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我是在提醒，多恩的父亲也许会重复同样的接近钱财方式。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v3].text,"다은이에게 아버지를 나쁘게 보게 만들까 봐, 예비신랑에게만 말하려 했습니다.",I was trying to warn that Da-eun's father might repeat the same money approach. The order I chose was wrong.,ダウンの父が同じ金銭接近を繰り返すかもしれないと警告しようとしていました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我是在提醒，多恩的父亲也许会重复同样的接近钱财方式。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v4].text,제가 숨긴 건 감정이 아니라 상처였습니다. 그 돈 문제를 또 보게 될까 두려웠습니다.,I was trying to warn that Da-eun's father might repeat the same money approach. Fear moved before verification.,ダウンの父が同じ金銭接近を繰り返すかもしれないと警告しようとしていました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我是在提醒，多恩的父亲也许会重复同样的接近钱财方式。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v5].text,그분의 접근이 반복된다고 판단했습니다. 그래서 제 평판이 망가져도 연락했습니다.,I was trying to warn that Da-eun's father might repeat the same money approach. I admit the part that was mine.,ダウンの父が同じ金銭接近を繰り返すかもしれないと警告しようとしていました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我是在提醒，多恩的父亲也许会重复同样的接近钱财方式。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v6].text,전하고 싶던 말은 분명했습니다. 결혼 자금 쪽으로 손이 뻗을 수 있으니 조심하라는 말이었습니다.,I was trying to warn that Da-eun's father might repeat the same money approach. I avoided the harder question.,ダウンの父が同じ金銭接近を繰り返すかもしれないと警告しようとしていました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我是在提醒，多恩的父亲也许会重复同样的接近钱财方式。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v7].text,다은이 아버지 일을 제 입으로 꺼내면 다은이가 무너질까 봐 끝까지 돌아갔습니다.,I was trying to warn that Da-eun's father might repeat the same money approach. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,ダウンの父が同じ金銭接近を繰り返すかもしれないと警告しようとしていました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我是在提醒，多恩的父亲也许会重复同样的接近钱财方式。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v8].text,제가 악역이 되는 쪽이 낫다고 생각했습니다. 하지만 그 침묵이 오해를 키웠습니다.,I was trying to warn that Da-eun's father might repeat the same money approach. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,ダウンの父が同じ金銭接近を繰り返すかもしれないと警告しようとしていました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我是在提醒，多恩的父亲也许会重复同样的接近钱财方式。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|late].variants[dc-1-b-q1-late-v9].text,연락은 경고였습니다. 다만 제가 정직한 방식으로 말하지 못해 기록만 나쁘게 남았습니다.,"The contact was a warning. But because I could not say it honestly, only the record looked bad.",連絡は警告でした。ただ、私が正直な形で話せなかったせいで、記録だけが悪く残りました。,联系本来是警告。只是我没能用诚实的方式说出来，最后只留下了不好的记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v1].text,다은이 아버지 쪽 얘기였습니다. 결혼 앞두고 그냥 넘기기 어려운 흐름이 보였습니다.,It concerned Da-eun's father. I saw a pattern that was hard to ignore with the wedding coming up.,ダウンの父に関する話でした。結婚を前に、見過ごしにくい流れが見えました。,那是关于多恩父亲的事。婚礼在即，我看到了一种很难就这样放过的走向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v10].text,그 연락은 좋아한다는 말이 아니라 조심하라는 말이었습니다. 그 차이가 큽니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v2].text,그분이 예비신랑에게 돈 이야기를 꺼내는 것 같았습니다. 그래서 막으려 했습니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. I did not leave room for context.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v3].text,다은이 아버지 건으로 말해야 했습니다. 제 기억과 너무 비슷한 순서였습니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. The order I chose was wrong.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v4].text,예비신랑이 알아야 할 돈 문제가 있었습니다. 다은이에게 바로 말할 용기가 없었습니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. Fear moved before verification.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v5].text,그분의 부탁이 단순하지 않다고 봤습니다. 그래서 예비신랑에게 먼저 닿으려 했습니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. I admit the part that was mine.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v6].text,다은이 아버지라는 이름을 꺼내는 순간 일이 무너질까 봐 계속 망설였습니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. I avoided the harder question.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 より難しい問いを避けました。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v7].text,돈 얘기가 결혼 준비와 엮이는 걸 봤습니다. 제가 본 적 있는 흐름이었습니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v8].text,예전에 겪은 일이 떠올랐습니다. 그래서 그 사람에게 조심하라고 말하려 했습니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-1-b-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-1-b-q1-mid-v9].text,다은이에게 말하면 아버지 얘기가 됩니다. 그래서 예비신랑에게 우회했습니다.,"It concerned Da-eun's father, and I could not say it directly to Da-eun before the wedding. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",ダウンの父に関することで、結婚前のダウンに直接言えませんでした。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,那是关于多恩父亲的事，我没法在婚前直接告诉多恩。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v1].text,그 대화를 바로 보여주면 다은이가 더 크게 흔들릴 거라고 생각했습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. I saw it that way first.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v10].text,보여주는 순간 제 의도까지 더럽게 읽힐까 봐 입을 닫았습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v2].text,저 혼자 정리하면 끝날 줄 알았습니다. 그래서 캡처를 바로 내밀지 않았습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. I did not leave room for context.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v3].text,그걸 보여주는 순간 결혼이 무너질 수 있다고 봤습니다. 그래서 미뤘습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. The order I chose was wrong.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v4].text,다은이에게 말하면 제 말부터 의심받을 것 같았습니다. 그래서 들고만 있었습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. Fear moved before verification.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v5].text,제가 보여주면 제가 끼어든 사람처럼 보일까 봐 겁났습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. I admit the part that was mine.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v6].text,그 대화를 꺼내는 것 자체가 또 다른 상처가 될 거라고 생각했습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. I avoided the harder question.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v7].text,제 손으로 다은이 믿음을 깨는 사람이 되고 싶지 않았습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v8].text,바로 말했어야 했다는 건 압니다. 그때는 제가 감당하면 된다고 봤습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|early].variants[dc-2-b-q1-early-v9].text,저는 그 내용을 크게 만들고 싶지 않았습니다. 조용히 막고 싶었습니다.,I hid the conversation because I thought showing it would hurt Da-eun more. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,見せればダウンがもっと傷つくと思い、その会話を隠しました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我以为拿出那段对话会让多恩更受伤，所以藏了起来。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v1].text,접촉의 선후가 달랐고 저는 분명히 선을 그었습니다. 그런데도 바로 말하지 못했습니다.,"By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. I saw it that way first.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v10].text,제가 감당하면 끝날 거라고 믿었습니다. 그 믿음이 이번에도 틀렸습니다.,"By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v2].text,"원본을 내밀면 제가 억울함은 풀렸겠지만, 다은이는 더 크게 다쳤을 겁니다.","By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. I did not leave room for context.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v3].text,제가 침묵해서 선후가 뒤집혔습니다. 그 책임까지 피하진 않겠습니다.,"By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. The order I chose was wrong.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v4].text,"다은이를 지킨다고 생각했지만, 결국 저도 다은이도 더 나쁜 자리로 갔습니다.","By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. Fear moved before verification.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v5].text,보여줬다면 오해가 빨리 풀렸을 수 있습니다. 제가 겁내서 그 기회를 놓쳤습니다.,"By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. I admit the part that was mine.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v6].text,"접촉의 선후가 달랐다는 점을 바로 밝히지 않아, 제가 먼저 접근한 사람처럼 남았습니다.","By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. I avoided the harder question.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 より難しい問いを避けました。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v7].text,저는 다은이가 상처받는 장면을 피하고 싶었습니다. 하지만 피한 만큼 의심은 커졌습니다.,"By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v8].text,제 결백보다 다은이 충격을 먼저 생각했습니다. 그 판단이 결국 모두를 속였습니다.,"By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|late].variants[dc-2-b-q1-late-v9].text,바로 공개하지 않은 이유는 보호였습니다. 하지만 결과는 침묵으로 인한 오해였습니다.,"By staying silent, I let the order of contact look reversed; that is also my responsibility. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",沈黙したため、連絡の順序が逆に見えるままになりました。その責任も私にあります。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,因为沉默，我让联系的先后看起来被倒置了，这也是我的责任。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v1].text,"그쪽에서 사적인 말을 꺼낸 건 맞습니다. 저는 거절했고, 더 번지지 않게 하려 했습니다.","The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. I saw it that way first.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v10].text,제 결백을 보이자고 다은이 결혼을 바로 흔드는 선택을 못 했습니다.,"The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v2].text,커피를 보자는 식의 말이 있었습니다. 바로 말하면 다은이가 무너질까 봐 망설였습니다.,"The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. I did not leave room for context.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v3].text,저는 선을 그었습니다. 그런데 그걸 보여주면 다은이는 저까지 같이 볼까 두려웠습니다.,"The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. The order I chose was wrong.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v4].text,"대화 원본은 제게 유리했지만, 다은이에게는 잔인한 자료라고 생각했습니다.","The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. Fear moved before verification.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v5].text,예비신랑 쪽 말이 가벼운 농담으로 끝날지 확신이 없었습니다. 그래서 먼저 막으려 했습니다.,"The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. I admit the part that was mine.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v6].text,제가 그 대화를 꺼내면 결혼을 깨려는 사람으로 보일까 봐 참았습니다.,"The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. I avoided the harder question.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v7].text,예비신랑의 말투가 선을 넘었다고 느꼈습니다. 그래도 다은이에게 바로 말하지 못했습니다.,"The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v8].text,거절한 기록은 있었습니다. 하지만 그 기록을 내미는 방식도 폭력이 될 수 있다고 봤습니다.,"The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-2-b-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-2.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-2-b-q1-mid-v9].text,다은이가 제 말을 믿어 줄 거라는 확신이 없었습니다. 그래서 증거를 들고도 숨었습니다.,"The fiancé had crossed a line, and I rejected him, but I hesitated to show Da-eun. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",婚約者は線を越え、私は拒みましたが、ダウンに見せることをためらいました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,未婚夫越了界，我也拒绝了他，但我犹豫着没有给多恩看。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤에도 결론부터 붙잡는다.,"Even after steadying her breath, she holds on to the conclusion first.",息を整えた後も、まず結論にしがみつく。,即使调整呼吸后，她仍先抓住结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v1].text,문구가 비슷하다고 해서 바로 같은 일이라고 볼 수는 없다고 생각했습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. I saw it that way first.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,예전 기억을 끌어오듯 턱에 힘이 들어간다.,Her jaw tightens as if an old memory has been pulled forward.,昔の記憶を引き寄せるように、顎に力が入る。,像是把旧记忆拉了回来，下颌绷紧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v10].text,그 대조를 보면서도 저는 일단 가족 쪽을 믿고 싶었습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,시선이 기록 쪽으로 떨어졌다가 다시 올라온다.,"Her eyes fall to the record, then lift again.",視線が記録へ落ち、それからまた上がる。,视线落到记录上，又重新抬起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v2].text,아버지 말투가 겹친다는 건 인정합니다. 그래도 저는 오해일 수 있다고 봤습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. I did not leave room for context.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,말끝을 단단히 세우지만 손끝이 흔들린다.,"She keeps the ends of her sentences firm, but her fingertips tremble.",語尾は固く締めるが、指先が震える。,句尾说得很硬，指尖却在发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v3].text,비슷한 표현이 있다고 해서 수민 씨 말이 전부 맞는 건 아니라고 버텼습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. The order I chose was wrong.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,분노를 눌러 담으며 빠르게 답한다.,"She answers quickly, holding anger down.",怒りを押し込めながら早口で答える。,压着怒意，快速回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v4].text,저는 아버지를 그렇게 의심하고 싶지 않았습니다. 그래서 먼저 막았습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. Fear moved before verification.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,예전 기억을 끌어오듯 턱에 힘이 들어간다.,Her jaw tightens as if an old memory has been pulled forward.,昔の記憶を引き寄せるように、顎に力が入る。,像是把旧记忆拉了回来，下颌绷紧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v5].text,겹치는 부분이 보여도 가족 일이라 쉽게 받아들이지 못했습니다.,"Even when I saw the overlaps, I could not accept them easily because it involved my family.",重なる部分が見えても、家族のことだったので簡単には受け入れられませんでした。,即使看到了重合之处，因为是家里的事，我也没法轻易接受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤에도 결론부터 붙잡는다.,"Even after steadying her breath, she holds on to the conclusion first.",息を整えた後も、まず結論にしがみつく。,即使调整呼吸后，她仍先抓住结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v6].text,그 문구가 불편하긴 했습니다. 하지만 저는 바로 인정할 준비가 안 됐습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. I avoided the harder question.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 より難しい問いを避けました。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,시선이 기록 쪽으로 떨어졌다가 다시 올라온다.,"Her eyes fall to the record, then lift again.",視線が記録へ落ち、それからまた上がる。,视线落到记录上，又重新抬起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v7].text,저는 수민 씨가 예전 일까지 끌어온다고 생각했습니다. 그래서 밀어냈습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,말끝을 단단히 세우지만 손끝이 흔들린다.,"She keeps the ends of her sentences firm, but her fingertips tremble.",語尾は固く締めるが、指先が震える。,句尾说得很硬，指尖却在发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v8].text,같은 말처럼 보여도 상황이 다르다고 믿고 싶었습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,분노를 눌러 담으며 빠르게 답한다.,"She answers quickly, holding anger down.",怒りを押し込めながら早口で答える。,压着怒意，快速回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|early].variants[dc-3-a-q1-early-v9].text,아버지 얘기가 나오면 판단이 흐려졌습니다. 그래서 오해라는 말에 기대었습니다.,"Even seeing the overlap, I wanted to believe it was a misunderstanding because it involved my father. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",重なりが見えても、父のことなので誤解だと信じたかったのです。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,即使看见重合，因为牵涉父亲，我还是想相信那只是误会。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,어깨 힘이 빠지고 목소리가 낮아진다.,"Her shoulders loosen, and her voice drops.",肩の力が抜け、声が低くなる。,肩膀松下来，声音也低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v1].text,이제는 단순 오해라고만 말하기 어렵습니다. 제가 보지 않으려 한 부분이 있었습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. I saw it that way first.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 버티던 결론을 내려놓는다.,She lets go of the conclusion she had been clinging to.,最後まで抱えていた結論を手放す。,放下了坚持到最后的结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v10].text,이제는 오해라는 말만으로 덮을 수 없습니다. 제가 외면한 대가가 큽니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,반박하려다 멈추고 천천히 인정한다.,"She starts to object, stops, and slowly admits it.",反論しかけて止まり、ゆっくり認める。,想反驳，却停住，然后慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v2].text,아버지 문구가 과거와 겹친다는 사실을 제가 너무 늦게 받아들였습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. I did not leave room for context.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,후회가 먼저 올라와 문장 사이가 길어진다.,"Regret rises first, stretching the pauses between sentences.",後悔が先に込み上げ、文と文の間が長くなる。,后悔先涌上来，句子之间的停顿变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v3].text,수민 씨 말이 불편하다는 이유로 밀어냈습니다. 그 불편함이 진실을 가렸습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. The order I chose was wrong.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,시선을 떨군 채 자기 책임을 붙든다.,"With her eyes lowered, she holds on to her own responsibility.",視線を落としたまま、自分の責任を受け止める。,垂下视线，抓住自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v4].text,가족을 믿고 싶어서 기록을 좁게 봤습니다. 그 선택이 사건을 키웠습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. Fear moved before verification.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,끝까지 버티던 결론을 내려놓는다.,She lets go of the conclusion she had been clinging to.,最後まで抱えていた結論を手放す。,放下了坚持到最后的结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v5].text,저는 아버지 문제를 피하려고 수민 씨를 더 쉽게 의심했습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. I admit the part that was mine.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,어깨 힘이 빠지고 목소리가 낮아진다.,"Her shoulders loosen, and her voice drops.",肩の力が抜け、声が低くなる。,肩膀松下来，声音也低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v6].text,오해라고 말하면 제가 버틸 수 있었습니다. 하지만 기록은 그렇게 간단하지 않습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. I avoided the harder question.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,반박하려다 멈추고 천천히 인정한다.,"She starts to object, stops, and slowly admits it.",反論しかけて止まり、ゆっくり認める。,想反驳，却停住，然后慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v7].text,같은 문구를 보고도 저는 확인하지 않았습니다. 그 책임은 제게 있습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,후회가 먼저 올라와 문장 사이가 길어진다.,"Regret rises first, stretching the pauses between sentences.",後悔が先に込み上げ、文と文の間が長くなる。,后悔先涌上来，句子之间的停顿变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v8].text,수민 씨가 예전 일을 말하지 못한 이유를 제가 듣지 않으려 했습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,시선을 떨군 채 자기 책임을 붙든다.,"With her eyes lowered, she holds on to her own responsibility.",視線を落としたまま、自分の責任を受け止める。,垂下视线，抓住自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|late].variants[dc-3-a-q1-late-v9].text,제가 지키고 싶던 가족 이미지 때문에 수민 씨의 경고를 늦게 봤습니다.,I can no longer cover it with the word misunderstanding; I looked away from the record too long. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,もう誤解という言葉だけでは覆えません。私は記録から長く目を背けました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我已经不能只用误会来盖过去；我回避记录太久了。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,인정한 직후 곧바로 자기 이유를 덧붙인다.,"Right after admitting it, she adds her own reason.",認めた直後に、自分の理由を付け加える。,刚承认完，又马上补上自己的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v1].text,아버지 부탁이 반복된다는 말이 마음에 걸렸습니다. 그래도 인정하기가 무서웠습니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. I saw it that way first.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,표정은 굳어 있지만 호흡이 흔들린다.,"Her face stays rigid, but her breathing shakes.",表情は固いが、呼吸が揺れる。,表情僵硬，呼吸却在发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v10].text,저는 증거보다 가족이라는 단어를 먼저 붙잡았습니다. 그래서 늦게 봤습니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,부끄러움을 감추려 말의 속도를 높인다.,She speaks faster to hide her shame.,恥ずかしさを隠すように早口になる。,为了掩饰羞愧，说话速度加快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v2].text,문구가 겹친 건 봤습니다. 그런데 그걸 받아들이면 제가 믿은 것들이 흔들립니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. I did not leave room for context.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,방어와 후회가 한 문장 안에서 부딪힌다.,Defense and regret collide in a single sentence.,防御と後悔が一つの文の中でぶつかる。,辩解与后悔在一句话里相撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v3].text,제가 아버지 쪽 설명을 먼저 찾았습니다. 수민 씨 말은 나중으로 밀었습니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. The order I chose was wrong.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,눈을 피한 채 단톡방 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"Avoiding eye contact, she brings up the group chat.",目をそらしたままグループチャットの話を出す。,避开视线，提起群聊的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v4].text,비슷한 표현 앞에서도 저는 가족 문제라고 축소했습니다. 그게 편했습니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. Fear moved before verification.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,표정은 굳어 있지만 호흡이 흔들린다.,"Her face stays rigid, but her breathing shakes.",表情は固いが、呼吸が揺れる。,表情僵硬，呼吸却在发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v5].text,"아버지의 부탁이 이상하다는 걸 느꼈지만, 수민 씨를 믿는 쪽으로 가지 못했습니다.","The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. I admit the part that was mine.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,인정한 직후 곧바로 자기 이유를 덧붙인다.,"Right after admitting it, she adds her own reason.",認めた直後に、自分の理由を付け加える。,刚承认完，又马上补上自己的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v6].text,그때도 이번에도 저는 돈 얘기를 제대로 보지 않았습니다. 보기가 싫었습니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. I avoided the harder question.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,부끄러움을 감추려 말의 속도를 높인다.,She speaks faster to hide her shame.,恥ずかしさを隠すように早口になる。,为了掩饰羞愧，说话速度加快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v7].text,수민 씨가 왜 그랬는지보다 아버지가 왜 그런 말을 했는지를 피했습니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,방어와 후회가 한 문장 안에서 부딪힌다.,Defense and regret collide in a single sentence.,防御と後悔が一つの文の中でぶつかる。,辩解与后悔在一句话里相撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v8].text,문구가 맞물리는 걸 보면서도 저는 오해라는 말로 시간을 끌었습니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,눈을 피한 채 단톡방 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"Avoiding eye contact, she brings up the group chat.",目をそらしたままグループチャットの話を出す。,避开视线，提起群聊的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-a-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-a-q1-mid-v9].text,아버지를 의심하면 제 결혼까지 흔들릴 것 같아서 바로 닫아 버렸습니다.,"The repeated wording bothered me, but accepting it would shake my family and my marriage. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",繰り返される文言は気になりましたが、受け入れれば家族も結婚も揺らぐと思いました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,重复的措辞让我在意，但一旦接受，家人和婚姻都会被动摇。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v1].text,비슷한 흐름을 봤습니다. 그래서 그냥 지나치기 어려웠습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. I saw it that way first.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v10].text,누군가 먼저 확인해야 한다고 봤습니다. 그래서 제가 그 역할을 맡았습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v2].text,제가 예전에 본 순서와 닮아 있었습니다. 그걸 혼자 넘길 수 없었습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. I did not leave room for context.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v3].text,"확정해서 말할 수는 없었지만, 위험한 느낌이 너무 컸습니다.",I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. The order I chose was wrong.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v4].text,그 부탁이 가볍지 않다고 느꼈습니다. 그래서 제가 먼저 움직였습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. Fear moved before verification.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v5].text,다은이에게 바로 말하기엔 너무 무거운 내용이었습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. I admit the part that was mine.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v6].text,제가 틀릴 수도 있다고 생각했습니다. 그래서 더 조심하다가 혼자 막으려 했습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. I avoided the harder question.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v7].text,그 말투와 순서가 낯설지 않았습니다. 그게 저를 급하게 만들었습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v8].text,다은이가 듣기 전에 멈추게 할 수 있으면 된다고 생각했습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|early].variants[dc-3-b-q1-early-v9].text,처음엔 제 기억이 과한 건지 스스로도 의심했습니다. 그래도 넘기지 못했습니다.,I saw a similar pattern and could not simply let it pass. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,似た流れを見て、ただ見過ごすことはできませんでした。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我看到了相似的模式，没法就这样放过去。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v1].text,같은 패턴이라고 봤습니다. 다은이 아버지가 또 돈을 꺼내려 한다고 판단했습니다.,"I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. I saw it that way first.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v10].text,결국 저는 보호를 핑계로 또 혼자 결정했습니다. 그 점까지 인정합니다.,"I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v2].text,제가 과거에 겪은 일이 반복될까 봐 예비신랑에게 경고했습니다.,"I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. I did not leave room for context.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v3].text,다은이 아버지의 부탁이 단순한 부탁이 아니라 돈을 끌어내는 흐름이라는 걸 알고 있었습니다.,"I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. The order I chose was wrong.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v4].text,"그렇게 이어진 정황을 본 순간, 이번에도 누군가 돈을 잃을 수 있다고 생각했습니다.","I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. Fear moved before verification.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v5].text,제가 진실을 숨기면 같은 일이 반복될 수 있었습니다. 그래서 멈추려 했습니다.,"I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. I admit the part that was mine.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v6].text,"혼자 막는 방식은 틀렸지만, 그 위험을 못 본 척할 수는 없었습니다.","I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. I avoided the harder question.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v7].text,"다은이에게 아버지의 실체를 말하지 못해, 예비신랑에게 경고하는 길을 택했습니다.","I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v8].text,과거와 현재의 문구가 겹쳤습니다. 제게는 우연으로 보기 어려웠습니다.,"I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|late].variants[dc-3-b-q1-late-v9].text,제가 악역이 되더라도 반복만은 막고 싶었습니다. 그게 연락의 이유였습니다.,"I judged it as the same pattern and warned the fiancé, though deciding alone was wrong. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",同じパターンだと判断して婚約者に警告しましたが、一人で決めたことは誤りでした。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我判断这是同样的模式，所以提醒未婚夫；但独自作决定本身是错的。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v1].text,다은이 아버지의 돈 부탁이 예전과 닮았습니다. 그래서 혼자 막으려 했습니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. I saw it that way first.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v10].text,반복되는 듯한 흐름을 보자 제 몸이 먼저 굳었습니다. 그래서 연락했습니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v2].text,결혼 앞두고 돈 얘기가 나오니 예전 일이 떠올랐습니다. 저는 그걸 무시하지 못했습니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. I did not leave room for context.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v3].text,다은이가 상처받을 걸 알고 설명을 미뤘습니다. 그래서 예전 돈 문제를 혼자 안고 가려 했습니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. The order I chose was wrong.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v4].text,다은이에게 말하면 아버지 이야기가 됩니다. 그래서 예비신랑 쪽에서 끊으려 했습니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. Fear moved before verification.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v5].text,제가 먼저 다은이에게 꺼내면 상처만 커질 것 같았습니다. 그래서 우회했습니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. I admit the part that was mine.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v6].text,돈 부탁이 다시 보였는데도 다은이에게 말하지 못했습니다. 그래서 예비신랑에게 우회했습니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. I avoided the harder question.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v7].text,그분의 문구가 예전과 겹쳤습니다. 그래서 이번에도 제가 나서야 한다고 봤습니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v8].text,다은이를 보호하려다 또 혼자 판단했습니다. 그게 제 나쁜 습관입니다.,"Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-3-b-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-3-b-q1-mid-v9].text,"사실을 바로 말할 용기는 없고, 막아야 한다는 압박만 컸습니다.","Da-eun's father's money request resembled what I had seen before, so I tried to stop it alone. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",ダウンの父の金銭の頼みは以前見た流れに似ていたので、一人で止めようとしました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,多恩父亲的金钱请求像我以前见过的流程，所以我想独自阻止。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤에도 결론부터 붙잡는다.,"Even after steadying her breath, she holds on to the conclusion first.",息を整えた後も、まず結論にしがみつく。,即使调整呼吸后，她仍先抓住结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v1].text,그때는 수민 씨가 말을 피한다고만 봤습니다. 돈 문제의 속을 확인하지 않았습니다.,"Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. I saw it that way first.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,예전 기억을 끌어오듯 턱에 힘이 들어간다.,Her jaw tightens as if an old memory has been pulled forward.,昔の記憶を引き寄せるように、顎に力が入る。,像是把旧记忆拉了回来，下颌绷紧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v10].text,"확인하면 더 불편한 답이 나올까 봐, 변심이라는 말로 멈췄습니다.","Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,시선이 기록 쪽으로 떨어졌다가 다시 올라온다.,"Her eyes fall to the record, then lift again.",視線が記録へ落ち、それからまた上がる。,视线落到记录上，又重新抬起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v2].text,무슨 돈인지 묻기 전에 제가 먼저 변했다고 결론 냈습니다.,"Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. I did not leave room for context.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,말끝을 단단히 세우지만 손끝이 흔들린다.,"She keeps the ends of her sentences firm, but her fingertips tremble.",語尾は固く締めるが、指先が震える。,句尾说得很硬，指尖却在发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v3].text,"수민 씨가 설명을 안 한다고 생각했고, 저는 더 캐묻지 않았습니다.","Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. The order I chose was wrong.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,분노를 눌러 담으며 빠르게 답한다.,"She answers quickly, holding anger down.",怒りを押し込めながら早口で答える。,压着怒意，快速回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v4].text,그때 저는 상처받은 쪽이라고만 느꼈습니다. 그래서 확인을 멈췄습니다.,"Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. Fear moved before verification.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,예전 기억을 끌어오듯 턱에 힘이 들어간다.,Her jaw tightens as if an old memory has been pulled forward.,昔の記憶を引き寄せるように、顎に力が入る。,像是把旧记忆拉了回来，下颌绷紧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v5].text,"돈 문제가 있다는 말은 들었지만, 끝까지 따라가 보지 않았습니다.","Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. I admit the part that was mine.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤에도 결론부터 붙잡는다.,"Even after steadying her breath, she holds on to the conclusion first.",息を整えた後も、まず結論にしがみつく。,即使调整呼吸后，她仍先抓住结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v6].text,제가 먼저 손을 놓았습니다. 묻는 게 더 무서웠던 것도 사실입니다.,"Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. I avoided the harder question.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 より難しい問いを避けました。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,시선이 기록 쪽으로 떨어졌다가 다시 올라온다.,"Her eyes fall to the record, then lift again.",視線が記録へ落ち、それからまた上がる。,视线落到记录上，又重新抬起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v7].text,수민 씨가 달라졌다는 해석이 쉬웠습니다. 그래서 그쪽으로 정리했습니다.,"Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,말끝을 단단히 세우지만 손끝이 흔들린다.,"She keeps the ends of her sentences firm, but her fingertips tremble.",語尾は固く締めるが、指先が震える。,句尾说得很硬，指尖却在发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v8].text,무슨 일인지 묻기보다 예전처럼 끝났다고 생각했습니다.,"Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,분노를 눌러 담으며 빠르게 답한다.,"She answers quickly, holding anger down.",怒りを押し込めながら早口で答える。,压着怒意，快速回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|early].variants[dc-4-a-q1-early-v9].text,저는 그때도 제 결론이 빠른 사람이었습니다. 돈 문제도 그렇게 덮었습니다.,"Back then, I only thought Su-min was avoiding me and did not check the money issue. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",当時はスミンが話を避けているとだけ見て、金銭問題の中身を確認しませんでした。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,当时我只觉得秀敏在回避我，没有确认金钱问题的内情。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,어깨 힘이 빠지고 목소리가 낮아진다.,"Her shoulders loosen, and her voice drops.",肩の力が抜け、声が低くなる。,肩膀松下来，声音也低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v1].text,수민 씨를 변심으로 단정한 건 제가 확인을 포기했기 때문입니다.,I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. I saw it that way first.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 버티던 결론을 내려놓는다.,She lets go of the conclusion she had been clinging to.,最後まで抱えていた結論を手放す。,放下了坚持到最后的结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v10].text,이제는 인정합니다. 손절의 빈칸을 제가 너무 쉽게 상대 탓으로 채웠습니다.,I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,반박하려다 멈추고 천천히 인정한다.,"She starts to object, stops, and slowly admits it.",反論しかけて止まり、ゆっくり認める。,想反驳，却停住，然后慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v2].text,돈 문제의 실체를 묻지 않은 채 친구를 잃었다고만 믿었습니다.,I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. I did not leave room for context.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,후회가 먼저 올라와 문장 사이가 길어진다.,"Regret rises first, stretching the pauses between sentences.",後悔が先に込み上げ、文と文の間が長くなる。,后悔先涌上来，句子之间的停顿变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v3].text,제가 아버지 문제를 피하면서 수민 씨에게 책임을 더 얹었습니다.,I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. The order I chose was wrong.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,시선을 떨군 채 자기 책임을 붙든다.,"With her eyes lowered, she holds on to her own responsibility.",視線を落としたまま、自分の責任を受け止める。,垂下视线，抓住自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v4].text,"그때 끝까지 물었다면, 수민 씨가 혼자 악역이 되지는 않았을 겁니다.",I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. Fear moved before verification.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,끝까지 버티던 결론을 내려놓는다.,She lets go of the conclusion she had been clinging to.,最後まで抱えていた結論を手放す。,放下了坚持到最后的结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v5].text,저는 알아야 할 질문을 하지 않았습니다. 그래서 과거 손절도 틀리게 기억했습니다.,I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. I admit the part that was mine.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,어깨 힘이 빠지고 목소리가 낮아진다.,"Her shoulders loosen, and her voice drops.",肩の力が抜け、声が低くなる。,肩膀松下来，声音也低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v6].text,변심이라는 결론이 편해서 붙잡았습니다. 사실은 제가 확인을 두려워했습니다.,I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. I avoided the harder question.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,반박하려다 멈추고 천천히 인정한다.,"She starts to object, stops, and slowly admits it.",反論しかけて止まり、ゆっくり認める。,想反驳，却停住，然后慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v7].text,"수민 씨가 왜 침묵했는지 듣지 않은 채, 저는 떠난 사람으로만 만들었습니다.",I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,후회가 먼저 올라와 문장 사이가 길어진다.,"Regret rises first, stretching the pauses between sentences.",後悔が先に込み上げ、文と文の間が長くなる。,后悔先涌上来，句子之间的停顿变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v8].text,제 상처를 앞세워 돈 문제의 진짜 이유를 덮었습니다. 그게 잘못이었습니다.,I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,시선을 떨군 채 자기 책임을 붙든다.,"With her eyes lowered, she holds on to her own responsibility.",視線を落としたまま、自分の責任を受け止める。,垂下视线，抓住自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|late].variants[dc-4-a-q1-late-v9].text,아버지를 지키려는 마음이 수민 씨를 더 외롭게 만들었습니다.,I blamed Su-min for the blank in the old fallout because I gave up verifying it. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,確認を諦めたため、過去の絶交の空白をスミンのせいにしました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,因为我放弃确认，才把旧日决裂里的空白归咎于秀敏。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,인정한 직후 곧바로 자기 이유를 덧붙인다.,"Right after admitting it, she adds her own reason.",認めた直後に、自分の理由を付け加える。,刚承认完，又马上补上自己的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v1].text,아버지와 돈이라는 단어가 같이 나오는 게 싫었습니다. 그래서 확인을 피했습니다.,"I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. I saw it that way first.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,표정은 굳어 있지만 호흡이 흔들린다.,"Her face stays rigid, but her breathing shakes.",表情は固いが、呼吸が揺れる。,表情僵硬，呼吸却在发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v10].text,그때도 저는 불편한 질문을 미뤘습니다. 그래서 오해가 굳었습니다.,"I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,부끄러움을 감추려 말의 속도를 높인다.,She speaks faster to hide her shame.,恥ずかしさを隠すように早口になる。,为了掩饰羞愧，说话速度加快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v2].text,"수민 씨가 뭔가 숨긴다는 느낌은 있었지만, 제가 끝까지 묻지 않았습니다.","I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. I did not leave room for context.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,방어와 후회가 한 문장 안에서 부딪힌다.,Defense and regret collide in a single sentence.,防御と後悔が一つの文の中でぶつかる。,辩解与后悔在一句话里相撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v3].text,돈 문제를 제대로 확인하면 가족 얘기가 될까 봐 겁났습니다.,"I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. The order I chose was wrong.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,눈을 피한 채 단톡방 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"Avoiding eye contact, she brings up the group chat.",目をそらしたままグループチャットの話を出す。,避开视线，提起群聊的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v4].text,저는 수민 씨가 변한 거라고 믿는 게 편했습니다. 그래서 질문을 줄였습니다.,"I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. Fear moved before verification.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,표정은 굳어 있지만 호흡이 흔들린다.,"Her face stays rigid, but her breathing shakes.",表情は固いが、呼吸が揺れる。,表情僵硬，呼吸却在发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v5].text,그때 확인하지 않은 제 책임이 있습니다. 다만 받아들일 준비가 안 됐습니다.,"I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. I admit the part that was mine.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,인정한 직후 곧바로 자기 이유를 덧붙인다.,"Right after admitting it, she adds her own reason.",認めた直後に、自分の理由を付け加える。,刚承认完，又马上补上自己的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v6].text,"수민 씨가 떠난 이유를 알고 싶다면서도, 정작 돈 얘기는 피했습니다.","I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. I avoided the harder question.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,부끄러움을 감추려 말의 속도를 높인다.,She speaks faster to hide her shame.,恥ずかしさを隠すように早口になる。,为了掩饰羞愧，说话速度加快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v7].text,"끝날 결혼이라고 믿었고, 그 믿음이 저를 무리한 선택 쪽으로 밀었습니다.","I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,방어와 후회가 한 문장 안에서 부딪힌다.,Defense and regret collide in a single sentence.,防御と後悔が一つの文の中でぶつかる。,辩解与后悔在一句话里相撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v8].text,저는 손절의 빈칸을 제 방식으로 채웠습니다. 사실 확인은 하지 않았습니다.,"I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,눈을 피한 채 단톡방 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"Avoiding eye contact, she brings up the group chat.",目をそらしたままグループチャットの話を出す。,避开视线，提起群聊的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-a-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-a-q1-mid-v9].text,수민 씨를 원망하는 쪽이 아버지를 의심하는 쪽보다 쉬웠습니다.,"I avoided the uncomfortable questions about my father and money, so the misunderstanding hardened. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",父とお金に関する不快な質問を避けたため、誤解が固まりました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我回避了关于父亲和钱的难堪问题，误会因此固定下来。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v1].text,그 말을 하면 다은이가 너무 다칠 거라고 생각했습니다. 그래서 못 했습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. I saw it that way first.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v10].text,제가 참으면 다은이는 모른 채 지낼 수 있다고 생각했습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v2].text,돈 이야기를 꺼내는 순간 다은이 아버지를 말해야 했습니다. 그래서 다은이에게 말하지 못했습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. I did not leave room for context.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v3].text,제가 당한 일보다 다은이가 받을 충격이 먼저 떠올랐습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. The order I chose was wrong.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v4].text,말하면 제 상처가 아니라 다은이 가족 문제가 됩니다. 그래서 입을 닫았습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. Fear moved before verification.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v5].text,그때는 제가 멀어지면 끝날 거라고 생각했습니다. 잘못된 판단이었습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. I admit the part that was mine.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v6].text,다은이에게 아버지 얘기를 꺼낼 용기가 없었습니다. 그래서 제가 나쁜 쪽이 됐습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. I avoided the harder question.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 より難しい問いを避けました。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v7].text,돈을 잃은 일보다 친구가 무너지는 장면이 더 무서웠습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v8].text,제가 말하면 다은이가 제 말을 미워할 것 같았습니다. 그래서 피했습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|early].variants[dc-4-b-q1-early-v9].text,사실을 꺼내는 것보다 조용히 사라지는 게 덜 잔인하다고 믿었습니다.,I did not tell Da-eun because the money issue would force me to name her father. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,金銭問題を話せばダウンの父の名を出すことになるため、言えませんでした。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,只要说起钱，就必须说到多恩的父亲，所以我没能告诉她。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v1].text,투자라며 받아 간 돈을 돌려받지 못했습니다. 그래도 다은이에게 아버지가 그런 일을 했다고 말하지 못했습니다.,"I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. I saw it that way first.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v10].text,이제는 인정합니다. 보호라는 이름으로 필요한 진실을 너무 오래 묻었습니다.,"I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v2].text,그 일을 말하면 다은이가 아버지를 의심해야 합니다. 저는 그 일을 감당하지 못했습니다.,"I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. I did not leave room for context.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v3].text,"제가 피해자였다는 말을 숨기고, 차라리 변심한 친구처럼 남았습니다.","I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. The order I chose was wrong.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v4].text,그 침묵이 다은이를 지키는 줄 알았습니다. 하지만 저를 악역으로 남긴 침묵이었습니다.,"I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. Fear moved before verification.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v5].text,"사실을 숨긴 건 다은이를 보호하려는 마음이었지만, 결국 더 큰 낙인을 만들었습니다.","I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. I admit the part that was mine.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v6].text,제가 돈을 잃은 일보다 다은이가 아버지를 잃는 장면이 더 두려웠습니다.,"I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. I avoided the harder question.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 より難しい問いを避けました。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v7].text,말하지 않으면 끝날 줄 알았습니다. 그런데 그 침묵이 이번 사건까지 이어졌습니다.,"I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v8].text,저는 다은이 아버지 일을 숨기며 스스로 나쁜 사람이 되는 길을 택했습니다.,"I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|late].variants[dc-4-b-q1-late-v9].text,"그때 진실을 말하지 않아 다은이는 저를 오해했고, 저는 그 오해를 감당했습니다.","I did not recover the money taken in the name of investment, yet I still could not tell Da-eun the truth about her father. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",投資名目で持っていかれたお金は戻りませんでした。それでも父がそうしたとダウンに言えませんでした。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,以投资名义拿走的钱我没有收回来，但我还是没法告诉多恩她父亲做了那样的事。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v1].text,다은이 아버지가 제 돈을 가져간 일은 맞습니다. 그래도 다은이에게 말하지 못했습니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. I saw it that way first.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v10].text,저는 제 상처를 숨기면 우정도 덜 망가질 줄 알았습니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v2].text,그분이 돈을 갚지 않았다는 사실을 말하면 다은이에게 아버지가 무너집니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. I did not leave room for context.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v3].text,저는 피해를 말하면 친구까지 잃는다고 생각했습니다. 그래서 손절 쪽을 택했습니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. The order I chose was wrong.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v4].text,다은이가 아버지를 어떻게 보게 될지 겁났습니다. 그래서 제가 변한 사람처럼 남았습니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. Fear moved before verification.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v5].text,제 돈 문제를 꺼내면 다은이 가족의 문제까지 열립니다. 그걸 감당하지 못했습니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. I admit the part that was mine.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v6].text,"그때 말했어야 했지만, 다은이 얼굴을 떠올리면 입이 떨어지지 않았습니다.","Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. I avoided the harder question.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v7].text,제가 나쁜 친구로 남는 게 차라리 낫다고 생각했습니다. 지금은 그게 틀렸다는 걸 압니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v8].text,돈을 돌려받는 것보다 다은이를 덜 다치게 하는 쪽을 골랐습니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-4-b-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-4-b-q1-mid-v9].text,그 선택이 보호라고 믿었습니다. 사실은 모두에게 설명할 기회를 빼앗았습니다.,"Da-eun’s father did take my money, but I thought hiding my wound would damage the friendship less. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",ダウンの父が私のお金を取ったのは事実ですが、傷を隠せば友情の被害も少ないと思いました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,多恩的父亲确实拿走了我的钱，但我以为把伤藏起来，友情就会少受点损害。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤에도 결론부터 붙잡는다.,"Even after steadying her breath, she holds on to the conclusion first.",息を整えた後も、まず結論にしがみつく。,即使调整呼吸后，她仍先抓住结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v1].text,단톡방에 먼저 올린 건 맞습니다. 그때는 제가 너무 화가 나 있었습니다.,"It is true that I posted in the group chat first. At the time, I was too angry.",先にグループチャットへ投稿したのは事実です。当時、私はあまりにも怒っていました。,先发到群聊里的是我。那时候我太生气了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,예전 기억을 끌어오듯 턱에 힘이 들어간다.,Her jaw tightens as if an old memory has been pulled forward.,昔の記憶を引き寄せるように、顎に力が入る。,像是把旧记忆拉了回来，下颌绷紧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v10].text,그 기록을 보고 화가 나서 바로 공유했습니다. 너무 빨랐습니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,시선이 기록 쪽으로 떨어졌다가 다시 올라온다.,"Her eyes fall to the record, then lift again.",視線が記録へ落ち、それからまた上がる。,视线落到记录上，又重新抬起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v2].text,수민 씨에게 묻기 전에 친구들에게 말했습니다. 잘한 순서는 아니었습니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. I did not leave room for context.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,말끝을 단단히 세우지만 손끝이 흔들린다.,"She keeps the ends of her sentences firm, but her fingertips tremble.",語尾は固く締めるが、指先が震える。,句尾说得很硬，指尖却在发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v3].text,제가 먼저 공개한 건 인정합니다. 기록을 보자마자 막아야 할 일로 단정했습니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. The order I chose was wrong.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,분노를 눌러 담으며 빠르게 답한다.,"She answers quickly, holding anger down.",怒りを押し込めながら早口で答える。,压着怒意，快速回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v4].text,분노가 먼저였고 확인은 뒤로 밀렸습니다. 그 점은 부정하지 않겠습니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. Fear moved before verification.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,예전 기억을 끌어오듯 턱에 힘이 들어간다.,Her jaw tightens as if an old memory has been pulled forward.,昔の記憶を引き寄せるように、顎に力が入る。,像是把旧记忆拉了回来，下颌绷紧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v5].text,수민 씨 이름을 사람들 앞에 올린 건 제 행동입니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. I admit the part that was mine.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,숨을 고른 뒤에도 결론부터 붙잡는다.,"Even after steadying her breath, she holds on to the conclusion first.",息を整えた後も、まず結論にしがみつく。,即使调整呼吸后，她仍先抓住结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v6].text,그 순간에는 사실 확인보다 제 불안을 알리는 게 급했습니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. I avoided the harder question.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,시선이 기록 쪽으로 떨어졌다가 다시 올라온다.,"Her eyes fall to the record, then lift again.",視線が記録へ落ち、それからまた上がる。,视线落到记录上，又重新抬起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v7].text,저는 혼자 감당하기 싫어서 단톡방에 적었습니다. 그게 시작이었습니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,말끝을 단단히 세우지만 손끝이 흔들린다.,"She keeps the ends of her sentences firm, but her fingertips tremble.",語尾は固く締めるが、指先が震える。,句尾说得很硬，指尖却在发抖。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v8].text,제가 쓴 말이 사람들 반응을 불렀습니다. 처음부터 계산한 건 아니었습니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,분노를 눌러 담으며 빠르게 답한다.,"She answers quickly, holding anger down.",怒りを押し込めながら早口で答える。,压着怒意，快速回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|early].variants[dc-5-a-q1-early-v9].text,수민 씨에게 직접 묻는 게 무서웠습니다. 그래서 친구들부터 찾았습니다.,"I did post in the group chat first, before checking the facts with Su-min. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",事実をスミンに確認する前に、私が先にグループチャットへ投稿しました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,还没向秀敏核实事实，我就先发到了群聊。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,어깨 힘이 빠지고 목소리가 낮아진다.,"Her shoulders loosen, and her voice drops.",肩の力が抜け、声が低くなる。,肩膀松下来，声音也低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v1].text,저는 수민 씨 평판이 무너질 걸 알면서도 글을 올렸습니다. 그건 제 책임입니다.,I posted it even though I knew Ms. Choi's reputation could collapse. That is my responsibility.,チェ・スミンさんの評判が崩れると分かっていながら投稿しました。それは私の責任です。,我明知道崔秀敏女士的名誉可能会因此崩塌，还是发了那段话。这是我的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,끝까지 버티던 결론을 내려놓는다.,She lets go of the conclusion she had been clinging to.,最後まで抱えていた結論を手放す。,放下了坚持到最后的结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v10].text,이제는 인정합니다. 분노를 먼저 퍼뜨리고 사실은 나중에 찾았습니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,반박하려다 멈추고 천천히 인정한다.,"She starts to object, stops, and slowly admits it.",反論しかけて止まり、ゆっくり認める。,想反驳，却停住，然后慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v2].text,사실 확인보다 분노를 먼저 선택했습니다. 그래서 낙인이 먼저 생겼습니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. I did not leave room for context.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,후회가 먼저 올라와 문장 사이가 길어진다.,"Regret rises first, stretching the pauses between sentences.",後悔が先に込み上げ、文と文の間が長くなる。,后悔先涌上来，句子之间的停顿变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v3].text,그 글로 수민 씨는 사람들 앞에서 이미 죄인처럼 보였습니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. The order I chose was wrong.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,시선을 떨군 채 자기 책임을 붙든다.,"With her eyes lowered, she holds on to her own responsibility.",視線を落としたまま、自分の責任を受け止める。,垂下视线，抓住自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v4].text,제가 먼저 공개하지 않았다면 수민 씨에게 설명할 시간이 있었을 겁니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. Fear moved before verification.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,끝까지 버티던 결론을 내려놓는다.,She lets go of the conclusion she had been clinging to.,最後まで抱えていた結論を手放す。,放下了坚持到最后的结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v5].text,단톡방을 제 분노의 증거판처럼 썼습니다. 그게 가장 부끄럽습니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. I admit the part that was mine.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,어깨 힘이 빠지고 목소리가 낮아진다.,"Her shoulders loosen, and her voice drops.",肩の力が抜け、声が低くなる。,肩膀松下来，声音也低了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v6].text,저는 수민 씨를 직접 마주하기보다 여럿의 판단 뒤에 숨었습니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. I avoided the harder question.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,반박하려다 멈추고 천천히 인정한다.,"She starts to object, stops, and slowly admits it.",反論しかけて止まり、ゆっくり認める。,想反驳，却停住，然后慢慢承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v7].text,확인 없이 사람을 규정했습니다. 그 말이 돌아오지 않는 상처가 됐습니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,후회가 먼저 올라와 문장 사이가 길어진다.,"Regret rises first, stretching the pauses between sentences.",後悔が先に込み上げ、文と文の間が長くなる。,后悔先涌上来，句子之间的停顿变长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v8].text,수민 씨가 왜 침묵했는지 듣기도 전에 저는 사람들 앞에서 결론을 냈습니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,시선을 떨군 채 자기 책임을 붙든다.,"With her eyes lowered, she holds on to her own responsibility.",視線を落としたまま、自分の責任を受け止める。,垂下视线，抓住自己的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|late].variants[dc-5-a-q1-late-v9].text,제 글이 시작이었습니다. 친구들의 비난도 그 뒤에 붙었습니다.,"I spread anger before finding the facts, and the stigma came first. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",事実を探す前に怒りを広げたため、烙印が先に生まれました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我先扩散了愤怒，才去找事实，所以污名先形成了。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,인정한 직후 곧바로 자기 이유를 덧붙인다.,"Right after admitting it, she adds her own reason.",認めた直後に、自分の理由を付け加える。,刚承认完，又马上补上自己的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v1].text,사실 확인보다 공개가 먼저였습니다. 그 순서가 수민 씨를 더 몰아넣었습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. I saw it that way first.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,표정은 굳어 있지만 호흡이 흔들린다.,"Her face stays rigid, but her breathing shakes.",表情は固いが、呼吸が揺れる。,表情僵硬，呼吸却在发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v10].text,분노를 먼저 퍼뜨린 게 맞습니다. 그 뒤에야 사실을 따지려 했습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,부끄러움을 감추려 말의 속도를 높인다.,She speaks faster to hide her shame.,恥ずかしさを隠すように早口になる。,为了掩饰羞愧，说话速度加快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v2].text,저는 분노를 정리하지 않고 사람들에게 던졌습니다. 친구들이 따라붙었습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. I did not leave room for context.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,방어와 후회가 한 문장 안에서 부딪힌다.,Defense and regret collide in a single sentence.,防御と後悔が一つの文の中でぶつかる。,辩解与后悔在一句话里相撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v3].text,수민 씨가 해명하기 전부터 분위기를 만들었습니다. 그 책임은 저에게 있습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. The order I chose was wrong.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,눈을 피한 채 단톡방 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"Avoiding eye contact, she brings up the group chat.",目をそらしたままグループチャットの話を出す。,避开视线，提起群聊的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v4].text,단톡방에서는 제 말이 곧 기준처럼 됐습니다. 그걸 제가 이용한 면이 있습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. Fear moved before verification.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,표정은 굳어 있지만 호흡이 흔들린다.,"Her face stays rigid, but her breathing shakes.",表情は固いが、呼吸が揺れる。,表情僵硬，呼吸却在发颤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v5].text,제가 먼저 올린 말 때문에 수민 씨는 변명하는 사람으로 밀렸습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. I admit the part that was mine.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,인정한 직후 곧바로 자기 이유를 덧붙인다.,"Right after admitting it, she adds her own reason.",認めた直後に、自分の理由を付け加える。,刚承认完，又马上补上自己的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v6].text,"확인 없이 올렸고, 친구들 반응을 보면서도 바로 멈추지 않았습니다.","Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. I avoided the harder question.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,부끄러움을 감추려 말의 속도를 높인다.,She speaks faster to hide her shame.,恥ずかしさを隠すように早口になる。,为了掩饰羞愧，说话速度加快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v7].text,그때는 제 편을 확인받고 싶었습니다. 그래서 더 세게 적었습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,방어와 후회가 한 문장 안에서 부딪힌다.,Defense and regret collide in a single sentence.,防御と後悔が一つの文の中でぶつかる。,辩解与后悔在一句话里相撞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v8].text,제가 퍼뜨린 건 사실만이 아니었습니다. 제 해석과 분노도 같이 퍼졌습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,눈을 피한 채 단톡방 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"Avoiding eye contact, she brings up the group chat.",目をそらしたままグループチャットの話を出す。,避开视线，提起群聊的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.a.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-a-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.a.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-a-q1-mid-v9].text,수민 씨에게 직접 묻는 것보다 사람들 반응으로 확신을 얻으려 했습니다.,"Public posting came before verification, and that pushed Su-min further into the corner. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",確認より公開が先になり、それがスミンをさらに追い込みました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,公开早于确认，这把秀敏进一步逼到了角落。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v1].text,제가 말하면 또 다른 사람이 무너질 것 같았습니다. 그래서 버텼습니다.,"I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. I saw it that way first.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v10].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v10].text,"이번엔 참으면 안 된다는 걸 알면서도, 몸이 먼저 닫혔습니다.","I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v2].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v2].text,"악역이 되는 게 익숙해서가 아니라, 그게 덜 아플 거라고 생각했습니다.","I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. I did not leave room for context.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v3].text,설명하면 더 큰 상처가 열릴 거라 봤습니다. 그래서 끝까지 참았습니다.,"I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. The order I chose was wrong.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v4].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v4].text,제가 나쁘게 보이면 적어도 다은이는 당장 덜 다칠 거라고 믿었습니다.,"I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. Fear moved before verification.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v5].behaviorHint,평평한 톤으로 말하지만 턱이 굳는다.,"She speaks in an even tone, but her jaw stiffens.",平らな声で話すが、顎が固くなる。,语气平稳，下颌却绷住。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v5].text,이번에도 제 입을 닫는 쪽이 조용히 끝나는 길이라고 생각했습니다.,"This time too, I thought keeping my mouth shut was the way to end it quietly.",今回も、自分が口を閉ざすほうが静かに終わらせる道だと思っていました。,这一次，我也以为闭上嘴才是安静收场的办法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 지운 목소리로 필요한 말만 꺼낸다.,"In a flattened voice, she says only what is necessary.",感情を消した声で必要なことだけを言う。,用抹去情绪的声音，只说必要的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v6].text,제 얘기만으로 끝나지 않습니다. 결국 다은이 가족 얘기가 됩니다. 그래서 더 말하지 못했습니다.,"I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. I avoided the harder question.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v7].behaviorHint,대답 전 짧게 숨을 멈춘다.,She briefly holds her breath before answering.,答える前に短く息を止める。,回答前短暂屏住呼吸。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v7].text,제가 해명하는 순간 오래 묻어 둔 일이 같이 나옵니다. 그게 두려웠습니다.,"I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 아래로 내려간 채 문장을 끊는다.,Her gaze drops as she cuts her sentence short.,視線を下げたまま文を切る。,视线向下，句子也断开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v8].text,말하면 제 억울함은 풀리겠지만 다은이 상처가 커질 것 같았습니다.,"I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. I understand now that silence was also a choice.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v9].behaviorHint,손끝을 붙잡고 핵심 이름은 피한다.,She grips her fingertips and avoids the central name.,指先を握り、核心の名前を避ける。,攥着指尖，避开核心名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_early_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-early-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|early].variants[dc-5-b-q1-early-v9].text,다시 낙인이 찍히는 건 알았습니다. 그래도 진실을 꺼내는 게 더 무서웠습니다.,"I thought staying silent would hurt fewer people, so I endured it alone again. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.",黙っていれば傷つく人が少ないと思い、また一人で耐えました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我以为沉默能让受伤的人少一点，所以又一个人撑着。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v1].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v1].text,제가 침묵해서 같은 낙인이 반복됐습니다. 보호하려던 선택이 오히려 모두를 다치게 했습니다.,My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. I saw it that way first.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v10].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v10].text,제가 참으면 된다는 생각이 가장 큰 실수였습니다. 침묵도 선택이었습니다.,My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v2].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v2].text,다은이 아버지의 일을 숨기느라 저를 또 나쁜 사람으로 남겼습니다.,My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. I did not leave room for context.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v3].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v3].text,제가 더 빨리 말했어야 했습니다. 그래야 단톡방의 결론도 멈출 수 있었습니다.,My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. The order I chose was wrong.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v4].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v4].text,보호라는 이름으로 진실을 늦췄습니다. 그 침묵도 제 책임입니다.,My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. Fear moved before verification.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v5].behaviorHint,오래 눌러 둔 말을 낮게 꺼낸다.,"She brings out words long pressed down, in a low voice.",長く押し込めていた言葉を低く出す。,低声说出压了很久的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v5].text,"저는 두 번 다 혼자 감당하려 했고, 두 번 다 오해를 키웠습니다.",My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. I admit the part that was mine.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v6].behaviorHint,가장 아픈 대목에서 오히려 목소리가 평평해진다.,Her voice goes flatter at the most painful part.,最も痛い箇所で、かえって声が平らになる。,在最痛的地方，声音反而变得平直。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v6].text,"다은이를 지킨다고 믿었지만, 사실은 다은이가 판단할 기회를 뺏었습니다.",My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. I avoided the harder question.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v7].behaviorHint,숨이 한 번 꺾인 뒤 끝까지 말한다.,"After one broken breath, she speaks to the end.",一度息が折れた後、最後まで話す。,呼吸一顿之后，还是说到最后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v7].text,이번에도 악역을 자처하면 끝날 줄 알았습니다. 하지만 낙인은 더 넓게 번졌습니다.,My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v8].behaviorHint,시선이 흔들리다 한 점에 멈춘다.,"Her gaze wavers, then fixes on one point.",視線が揺れ、一点で止まる。,视线晃动，最后停在一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v8].text,제가 말하지 않아 다은이는 같은 프레임을 반복했습니다. 그렇게 이어진 정황을 제가 끊지 못했습니다.,My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v9].behaviorHint,자기 침묵의 대가를 인정하며 고개를 숙인다.,"She lowers her head, acknowledging the cost of her silence.",自分の沈黙の代償を認め、頭を下げる。,承认自己沉默的代价，低下头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_late_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-late-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|late].variants[dc-5-b-q1-late-v9].text,진실을 숨긴 대가가 제 평판으로 돌아왔습니다. 이제는 피하지 않겠습니다.,My silence made the same stigma repeat; trying to protect her hurt everyone instead. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,私の沈黙が同じ烙印を繰り返させました。守ろうとした選択が、かえって皆を傷つけました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我的沉默让同样的污名再次重复。想保护她的选择，反而伤到了所有人。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v1].text,다은이 아버지 얘기를 꺼내면 다은이가 무너질까 봐 제가 나쁜 사람으로 남았습니다.,I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. I saw it that way first.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 私は先にそう見てしまいました。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 我先把它看成了那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v10].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v10].text,다은이가 받을 충격을 핑계로 제 설명을 접었습니다. 결국 모두를 속인 셈입니다.,I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. I cannot turn that into a clean excuse.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 それをきれいな言い訳にはできません。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 我不能把这变成干净的借口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v2].text,예전에도 그렇게 버텼고 이번에도 같은 선택을 했습니다. 잘한 건 아닙니다.,I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. I did not leave room for context.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 文脈を入れる余地を残しませんでした。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 我没有给背景留下余地。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v3].text,저를 욕하는 말보다 다은이가 아버지를 보는 눈이 바뀌는 게 더 무서웠습니다.,I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. The order I chose was wrong.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 私が選んだ順序が間違っていました。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 我选择的顺序错了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v4].text,제가 침묵하면 낙인은 제게 붙습니다. 그래도 그게 다은이를 지킨다고 믿었습니다.,I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. Fear moved before verification.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 確認より先に恐れが動きました。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 恐惧先于确认动了起来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,잠깐 멈춘 뒤 가족 이야기를 꺼낸다.,"After a brief pause, she brings up family.",少し止まってから家族の話を出す。,短暂停顿后，提起家人的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v5].text,"단톡방 말이 번지는 걸 봤지만, 반박하려면 과거까지 열어야 했습니다.",I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. I admit the part that was mine.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 自分の分の責任は認めます。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 属于我的责任，我承认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v6].behaviorHint,우회하던 이름을 조심스럽게 꺼낸다.,She cautiously says the name she had been avoiding.,避けていた名前を慎重に口にする。,小心说出一直绕开的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v6].text,다은이에게 아버지와 얽힌 돈 문제를 말할 용기가 없었습니다. 그래서 또 늦었습니다.,I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. I avoided the harder question.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 より難しい問いを避けました。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 我避开了更难的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v7].behaviorHint,말이 길어질수록 목소리가 더 낮아진다.,"The longer she speaks, the lower her voice gets.",話が長くなるほど声が低くなる。,话说得越长，声音越低。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v7].text,저는 제 상처를 설명하기보다 다은이 가족을 감추는 쪽을 골랐습니다.,I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. That choice made the misunderstanding larger.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 その選択が誤解を大きくしました。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 那个选择让误会变大了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v8].behaviorHint,책임을 먼저 가져가며 설명을 이어간다.,"She takes responsibility first, then continues explaining.",先に責任を引き受けてから説明を続ける。,先把责任揽过来，再继续解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v8].text,"그 선택이 반복을 만든다는 걸 알면서도, 그때는 멈출 힘이 없었습니다.",I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. I understand now that silence was also a choice.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 沈黙も選択だったと今は分かります。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 现在我知道，沉默也是一种选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v9].behaviorHint,상처를 드러내지 않으려 표정을 지운다.,She wipes expression from her face to hide the wound.,傷を見せまいとして表情を消す。,为了不露出伤口，抹去了表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_dossier_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_dc-5-b-q1-mid-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[dossier].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[dc-5-b-q1-mid-v9].text,"악역이 되는 게 익숙해서가 아니라, 다은이가 아버지를 그렇게 보게 되는 게 더 무서웠습니다.",I stayed the villain because I feared Da-eun would collapse if I brought up her father. The record was not as simple as I wanted it to be.,ダウンの父の話を出せば彼女が崩れると思い、私は悪役のままでいました。 記録は、私が望んだほど単純ではありませんでした。,我害怕提起多恩的父亲会让她崩溃，所以选择继续当反面角色。 记录并不像我希望的那样简单。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 의도를 감춘 채 반복해서 연락한 책임을 피할 수 없습니다. 핵심을 답하십시오.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Answer the core point directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 자료를 확인하지 않고 사람부터 규정했습니다. 왜 그렇게 확신했습니까.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Answer the core point directly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v3].text,"두 분, 경고와 낙인을 모두 보겠습니다. 누가 무엇을 숨기고 단정했는지 답하십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Answer the core point directly.",お二人、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 선의였다는 말만으로 반복해 연락하며 준 압박은 사라지지 않습니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Answer the core point directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_hard_.variants_judgec-d-1-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|hard].variants[judgec-d-1-hard-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 집착이라는 결론을 먼저 세운 이유를 지금 명확히 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Answer the core point directly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_mid_.variants_judgec-d-1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_mid_.variants_judgec-d-1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 목적을 숨기고 연락만 인정하면 의심이 커집니다. 왜 처음부터 말하지 않았습니까.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Explain the choice now.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_mid_.variants_judgec-d-1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_mid_.variants_judgec-d-1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 확인 없이 집착으로 못 박은 판단을 계속 유지할 근거가 있습니까.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Explain the choice now.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
