non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_mid_.variants_judgec-d-1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v3].text,"두 분, 숨긴 이유와 먼저 붙인 해석이 충돌합니다. 각각 바로 답하십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Explain the choice now.",お二人、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
