non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_mid_.variants_judgec-d-1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 경고였다는 설명이 맞다면 반복해서 연락한 방식도 설명해야 합니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Explain the choice now.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_mid_.variants_judgec-d-1-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_mid_.variants_judgec-d-1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|mid].variants[judgec-d-1-mid-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 불안이 컸다는 말로 확인하지 않은 단정을 덮을 수 없습니다.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Explain the choice now.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 처음엔 안부라 하셨지만 지금은 경고 목적을 인정하십니다. 왜 달라졌습니까.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 집착이라고 단정한 주장과 경고 가능성이 함께 남았습니다. 판단 근거를 다시 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
