non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v3].text,"두 분, 같은 연락을 집착과 경고로 나눠 읽었습니다. 빠진 설명부터 정리하십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",お二人、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 특별한 뜻이 없다는 말에서 전해야 할 말이 있었다는 입장으로 바뀌었습니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到联系记录、警告说法与执着污名，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-1_soft_.variants_judgec-d-1-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-1|soft].variants[judgec-d-1-soft-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 횟수만 보던 판단에 다른 맥락이 들어왔습니다. 왜 받아들이기 어렵습니까.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the contact records, the warning claim, and the stigma of obsession. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、連絡記録、警告という説明、執着という烙印を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于联系记录、警告说法与执着污名。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_hard_.variants_judgec-d-2-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_hard_.variants_judgec-d-2-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그때의 기록을 숨긴 선택이 오해를 키웠습니다. 책임을 피하지 마십시오.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Answer the core point directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_hard_.variants_judgec-d-2-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_hard_.variants_judgec-d-2-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 잘못을 보지 않은 채 상대를 몰았습니다. 근거를 답하십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Answer the core point directly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_hard_.variants_judgec-d-2-hard-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_hard_.variants_judgec-d-2-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v3].text,"두 분, 선을 넘은 사람과 침묵한 사람을 분리해 판단하겠습니다. 사실만 말씀해 주십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Answer the core point directly.",お二人、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
