non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_hard_.variants_judgec-d-2-hard-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 보호하려는 침묵이었다 해도 절차를 흐린 책임은 남습니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Answer the core point directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
