non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_hard_.variants_judgec-d-2-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|hard].variants[judgec-d-2-hard-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑을 방어하느라 선후를 밀어낸 것인지 명확히 답하십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Answer the core point directly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_mid_.variants_judgec-d-2-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_mid_.variants_judgec-d-2-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 거절한 사람이라면 왜 바로 보이지 않았습니까. 그 판단을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Explain the choice now.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
