non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_mid_.variants_judgec-d-2-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 첫 접근을 외면한 채 최수민 씨만 탓한 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Explain the choice now.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
