non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_mid_.variants_judgec-d-2-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_mid_.variants_judgec-d-2-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 침묵이 오해를 키운 사실까지 함께 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Explain the choice now.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_mid_.variants_judgec-d-2-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_mid_.variants_judgec-d-2-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|mid].variants[judgec-d-2-mid-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 믿고 싶은 설명이 자료보다 앞선 건 아닌지 답하십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Explain the choice now.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 처음엔 짧은 대화라 하셨지만 지금은 거절 사실을 말합니다. 빠진 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑을 믿고 싶었던 마음과 자료가 어긋납니다. 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v3].text,"두 분, 누가 먼저 경계를 넘었는지에 대한 말이 달라졌습니다. 시간순으로 정리하십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",お二人、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 거절한 기록을 숨긴 이유가 사건을 더 어렵게 만들었습니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-2_soft_.variants_judgec-d-2-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-2|soft].variants[judgec-d-2-soft-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 일부 캡처로 세운 판단이 전체 기록 앞에서 흔들리고 있습니다.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the fiancé's overstepping message and Su-min's silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、婚約者の踏み越えたメッセージとスミンの沈黙を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于未婚夫越界留言与秀敏的沉默。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 비슷한 구조을 봤다는 말로 혼자 판단한 책임까지 덮을 수 없습니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Answer the core point directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 가족을 감싸려고 자료를 밀어냈다면 그 판단도 책임입니다.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Answer the core point directly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v3].text,"두 분, 현재 돈을 요구한 흐름과 과거 흐름을 분리할 수 없습니다. 사실대로 답하십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Answer the core point directly.",お二人、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
