non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 경고가 필요했다면 왜 송다은 씨에게 사실을 열지 않았습니까.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Answer the core point directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_hard_.variants_judgec-d-3-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|hard].variants[judgec-d-3-hard-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 문제를 사건 밖으로 밀어낸 이유를 명확히 답하십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Answer the core point directly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 같은 일이 반복된다고 봤다면 왜 혼자 막는 방식을 다시 택했습니까.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Explain the choice now.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 같은 문구가 드러나도 오해라고만 보는 이유를 설명하십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Explain the choice now.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v3].text,"두 분, 돈을 요구한 흐름과 경고 연락의 시점이 겹칩니다. 각자 숨긴 이유를 답하십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Explain the choice now.",お二人、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨에게 말하지 않은 판단이 현재 연락을 더 의심스럽게 만들었습니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Explain the choice now.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_mid_.variants_judgec-d-3-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|mid].variants[judgec-d-3-mid-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지에게 불리한 자료를 외면한 마음을 바로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Explain the choice now.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_soft_.variants_judgec-d-3-soft-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_soft_.variants_judgec-d-3-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 단순한 우려라던 말이 반복 패턴으로 바뀌었습니다. 근거를 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_soft_.variants_judgec-d-3-soft-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_soft_.variants_judgec-d-3-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 부탁과 예비신랑 연락이 겹칩니다. 계속 별개로 보십니까.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
