non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_soft_.variants_judgec-d-3-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v3].text,"두 분, 돈을 빌려 달라는 말의 현재 기록과 과거 기억이 만나는 지점을 정리해 주십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",お二人、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
