non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_soft_.variants_judgec-d-3-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,The Judge narrows the contradiction to the father's money approach and the repeated pattern and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.,裁判官は矛盾を父の金銭接近と反復するパターンに絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-3_soft_.variants_judgec-d-3-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-3|soft].variants[judgec-d-3-soft-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 가족 이야기라며 밀어낸 부분이 사건 안으로 들어왔습니다.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the father's money approach and the repeated pattern. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、父の金銭接近と反復するパターンを中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于父亲接近钱财与反复出现的模式。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_hard_.variants_judgec-d-4-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_hard_.variants_judgec-d-4-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 침묵으로 보호했다는 말은 낙인을 키운 책임까지 지우지 못합니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Answer the core point directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_hard_.variants_judgec-d-4-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_hard_.variants_judgec-d-4-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 묻지 않고 악역을 만든 책임을 더는 피할 수 없습니다.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Answer the core point directly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_hard_.variants_judgec-d-4-hard-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 회피를 끊고 모순의 핵심을 기준 사실로 좁힌다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_hard_.variants_judgec-d-4-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v3].text,"두 분, 과거 투자 명목 피해와 손절의 순서를 기준 사실로 보겠습니다. 차분히 답하십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Answer the core point directly.",お二人、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
