non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_hard_.variants_judgec-d-4-hard-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 스스로 악역이 된 선택이 상대를 보호한 결론만 낳지는 않았습니다.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Answer the core point directly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
