non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_hard_.variants_judgec-d-4-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|hard].variants[judgec-d-4-hard-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 문제 앞에서 왜 최수민 씨 말문부터 닫았는지 답하십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Answer the core point directly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。核心を直接答えてください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请直接回答核心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
