non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_mid_.variants_judgec-d-4-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 피해를 숨긴 선의가 오해를 만들었습니다. 그 선택을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Explain the choice now.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_mid_.variants_judgec-d-4-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 빠진 설명과 바뀐 입장을 분리해 바로 답하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_mid_.variants_judgec-d-4-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지의 진실을 몰랐더라도 확인하지 않은 단정은 남습니다.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Explain the choice now.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
