non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_mid_.variants_judgec-d-4-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|mid].variants[judgec-d-4-mid-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 손절의 원인을 최수민 씨 변심으로 굳힌 이유를 설명하십시오.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Explain the choice now.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。その選択を今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。现在请说明这个选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 변심처럼 보였던 손절이 돈을 잃은 피해와 이어집니다. 왜 끝내 말하지 못했습니까.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨를 변심으로 단정한 기억이 자료 앞에서 흔들립니다. 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v3].text,"두 분, 과거 손절의 이유와 지금의 오해가 연결됩니다. 빠진 사실을 정리하십시오.","both of you, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",お二人、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,两位，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 보호하려던 침묵이 다른 낙인이 된 지점을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",チェ・スミンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,崔秀敏女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 진술이 달라진 지점을 낮은 압박으로 정리하게 한다.,"The Judge narrows the contradiction to the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence and requires a direct answer without revealing more than the record supports.",裁判官は矛盾を過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償に絞り、記録が支える範囲で直接答えさせる。,法官将矛盾缩小到旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价，要求在记录支持范围内直接作答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_contradiction_.entries_d-4_soft_.variants_judgec-d-4-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_contradiction].entries[d-4|soft].variants[judgec-d-4-soft-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 묻지 않은 채 결론낸 책임을 어디까지 인정하십니까.","Ms. Song, the record now turns on the old fallout, the transfer records, and the cost of silence. Set out the missing explanation calmly.",ソン・ダウンさん、記録は今、過去の絶交、送金記録、沈黙の代償を中心に動いています。抜けている説明を落ち着いて整理してください。,宋多恩女士，现在记录的关键在于旧日决裂、转账记录与沉默的代价。请冷静整理缺失的说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,"연락 기록의 겉모습과 단톡방 낙인을 함께 놓아, 확인 전 단정과 연락 목적을 동시에 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot. It asks about turning contact records into a public stigma while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことを問う。,将联系记录与群聊截图并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问把联系记录变成公开污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v1].text,"연락 기록만으로 목적을 단정했고, 단톡방 캡처로 그 단정을 퍼뜨렸습니다. 송다은 씨, 책임을 답하십시오.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Song, this bears on turning contact records into a public stigma. Answer the responsibility directly.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到把联系记录变成公开污名。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,"연락 기록의 겉모습과 단톡방 낙인을 함께 놓아, 확인 전 단정과 연락 목적을 동시에 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot. It asks about turning contact records into a public stigma while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことを問う。,将联系记录与群聊截图并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问把联系记录变成公开污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v2].text,"기록에는 연락이 있을 뿐이고, 단톡방에는 송다은 씨의 결론이 있습니다. 왜 사람부터 규정했습니까.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Song, this bears on turning contact records into a public stigma. Answer the responsibility directly.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到把联系记录变成公开污名。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,"연락 기록의 겉모습과 단톡방 낙인을 함께 놓아, 확인 전 단정과 연락 목적을 동시에 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot. It asks about turning contact records into a public stigma while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことを問う。,将联系记录与群聊截图并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问把联系记录变成公开污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v3].text,"연락 기록과 단톡방 캡처를 함께 보면, 접촉 사실을 공개 낙인으로 바꾼 지점이 보입니다. 송다은 씨, 확인하지 않은 선택을 설명하십시오.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Song, this bears on turning contact records into a public stigma. Answer the responsibility directly.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到把联系记录变成公开污名。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,"연락 기록의 겉모습과 단톡방 낙인을 함께 놓아, 확인 전 단정과 연락 목적을 동시에 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot. It asks about turning contact records into a public stigma while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことを問う。,将联系记录与群聊截图并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问把联系记录变成公开污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v4].text,"연락 기록과 단톡방 캡처를 함께 보면, 순서는 분명합니다. 연락을 본 뒤 먼저 몰아붙인 사람은 송다은 씨입니다. 답하십시오.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Song, this bears on turning contact records into a public stigma. Answer the responsibility directly.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到把联系记录变成公开污名。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,"연락 기록의 겉모습과 단톡방 낙인을 함께 놓아, 확인 전 단정과 연락 목적을 동시에 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot. It asks about turning contact records into a public stigma while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことを問う。,将联系记录与群聊截图并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问把联系记录变成公开污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-hard-v5].text,"연락 기록과 단톡방 캡처를 함께 보면, 횟수를 근거로 사람을 집착으로 몰았습니다. 단톡방까지 번진 그 판단을 지금 책임 있게 말씀해 주십시오.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Song, this bears on turning contact records into a public stigma. Answer the responsibility directly.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到把联系记录变成公开污名。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,"연락 기록의 겉모습과 단톡방 낙인을 함께 놓아, 확인 전 단정과 연락 목적을 동시에 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot. It asks about turning contact records into a public stigma while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことを問う。,将联系记录与群聊截图并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问把联系记录变成公开污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-mid-v1].text,"연락 기록은 횟수를 보여주지만, 단톡방 캡처는 송다은 씨가 그 횟수에 이름을 붙인 과정을 보여줍니다. 왜 그렇게 단정했습니까.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Song, this bears on turning contact records into a public stigma. Explain the choice and its order.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到把联系记录变成公开污名。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
