non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-mid-v5].text,"연락 기록과 단톡방 캡처를 함께 보면, 집착이라는 결론이 먼저 움직였습니다. 송다은 씨, 그 결론을 계속 유지하십니까.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Song, this bears on turning contact records into a public stigma. Explain the choice and its order.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到把联系记录变成公开污名。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
