non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.a.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.a.q1-soft-v1].text,"연락 기록은 이어진 접촉을, 단톡방 캡처는 그 접촉이 바로 낙인으로 번진 과정을 보여줍니다. 송다은 씨, 확인 전에 결론을 세운 이유를 말씀하십시오.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Song, this bears on turning contact records into a public stigma. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは連絡記録を公開の烙印に変えたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到把联系记录变成公开污名。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
