non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,"연락 기록의 겉모습과 단톡방 낙인을 함께 놓아, 확인 전 단정과 연락 목적을 동시에 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot. It asks about the purpose of the contact and the silence around it while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、連絡目的とその周囲の沈黙を問う。,将联系记录与群聊截图并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问联系目的及其周围的沉默。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
