non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-mid-v1].text,"연락 기록만 보면 의심이 생기지만, 단톡방 캡처를 함께 보면 오해가 커진 과정도 보입니다. 최수민 씨, 목적을 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Choi, this bears on the purpose of the contact and the silence around it. Explain the choice and its order.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは連絡目的とその周囲の沈黙に関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到联系目的及其周围的沉默。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
