non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v1].text,"연락 기록은 방식의 문제를, 단톡방 캡처는 그 방식이 어떻게 오해로 굳었는지를 보여줍니다. 최수민 씨, 전하려던 말을 설명하십시오.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Choi, this bears on the purpose of the contact and the silence around it. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは連絡目的とその周囲の沈黙に関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到联系目的及其周围的沉默。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
