non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v3].text,"연락의 겉모습과 공개된 오해를 함께 보겠습니다. 최수민 씨, 감정이 아니라 경고였다는 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Choi, this bears on the purpose of the contact and the silence around it. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは連絡目的とその周囲の沈黙に関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到联系目的及其周围的沉默。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
