non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v4].text,"연락 기록과 단톡방 캡처를 함께 보면, 기록은 반복을 남겼고, 캡처는 최수민 씨가 어떤 이름으로 불렸는지를 남겼습니다. 왜 그 방식을 택했습니까.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Choi, this bears on the purpose of the contact and the silence around it. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは連絡目的とその周囲の沈黙に関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到联系目的及其周围的沉默。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,"연락 기록의 겉모습과 단톡방 낙인을 함께 놓아, 확인 전 단정과 연락 목적을 동시에 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot. It asks about the purpose of the contact and the silence around it while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、連絡目的とその周囲の沈黙を問う。,将联系记录与群聊截图并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问联系目的及其周围的沉默。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-1.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-1.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-1.b.q1-soft-v5].text,"연락 기록과 단톡방 반응이 함께 있습니다. 최수민 씨, 꼭 전하려던 위험이 무엇이었습니까.","We will look at the Contact Logs and the Group Chat Screenshot together. Ms. Choi, this bears on the purpose of the contact and the silence around it. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",連絡記録とグループチャットのスクリーンショットを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは連絡目的とその周囲の沈黙に関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把联系记录与群聊截图合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到联系目的及其周围的沉默。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,"연락 기록과 예비신랑 메시지를 함께 놓아, 먼저 선을 넘은 쪽과 최수민 씨의 침묵 책임을 분리하는 카드다.",Card combining the Fiancé's Message and Su-min's rejection reply. It asks about hiding the rejection record while the fiancé crossed a line while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,婚約者のメッセージとスミンの拒絶返信を組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、婚約者が線を越えた中で拒絶記録を隠したことを問う。,将未婚夫留言与秀敏的拒绝回复并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问未婚夫越界时隐藏拒绝记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v1].text,"연락 기록만으로는 부족합니다. 예비신랑 메시지가 먼저 넘은 선을 보여줍니다. 최수민 씨, 숨긴 책임을 답하십시오.","We will look at the Fiancé's Message and Su-min's rejection reply together. Ms. Choi, this bears on hiding the rejection record while the fiancé crossed a line. Answer the responsibility directly.",婚約者のメッセージとスミンの拒絶返信を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは婚約者が線を越えた中で拒絶記録を隠したことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把未婚夫留言与秀敏的拒绝回复合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到未婚夫越界时隐藏拒绝记录。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,"연락 기록과 예비신랑 메시지를 함께 놓아, 먼저 선을 넘은 쪽과 최수민 씨의 침묵 책임을 분리하는 카드다.",Card combining the Fiancé's Message and Su-min's rejection reply. It asks about hiding the rejection record while the fiancé crossed a line while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,婚約者のメッセージとスミンの拒絶返信を組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、婚約者が線を越えた中で拒絶記録を隠したことを問う。,将未婚夫留言与秀敏的拒绝回复并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问未婚夫越界时隐藏拒绝记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v2].text,"연락 기록과 예비신랑 메시지를 함께 보면, 거절 기록을 감춘 선택이 오해를 만들었습니다. 최수민 씨, 왜 송다은 씨에게 바로 보이지 않았습니까.","We will look at the Fiancé's Message and Su-min's rejection reply together. Ms. Choi, this bears on hiding the rejection record while the fiancé crossed a line. Answer the responsibility directly.",婚約者のメッセージとスミンの拒絶返信を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは婚約者が線を越えた中で拒絶記録を隠したことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把未婚夫留言与秀敏的拒绝回复合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到未婚夫越界时隐藏拒绝记录。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
