non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-hard-v5].text,"반복 연락의 설명은 예비신랑 메시지 없이는 성립하지 않습니다. 최수민 씨, 왜 핵심을 감췄습니까.","We will look at the Fiancé's Message and Su-min's rejection reply together. Ms. Choi, this bears on hiding the rejection record while the fiancé crossed a line. Answer the responsibility directly.",婚約者のメッセージとスミンの拒絶返信を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは婚約者が線を越えた中で拒絶記録を隠したことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把未婚夫留言与秀敏的拒绝回复合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到未婚夫越界时隐藏拒绝记录。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
