non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-soft-v4].text,"연락의 양만 보던 장면에 예비신랑의 메시지가 들어왔습니다. 최수민 씨, 그때 어떻게 선을 그었습니까.","We will look at the Fiancé's Message and Su-min's rejection reply together. Ms. Choi, this bears on hiding the rejection record while the fiancé crossed a line. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",婚約者のメッセージとスミンの拒絶返信を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは婚約者が線を越えた中で拒絶記録を隠したことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把未婚夫留言与秀敏的拒绝回复合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到未婚夫越界时隐藏拒绝记录。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,"연락 기록과 예비신랑 메시지를 함께 놓아, 먼저 선을 넘은 쪽과 최수민 씨의 침묵 책임을 분리하는 카드다.",Card combining the Fiancé's Message and Su-min's rejection reply. It asks about hiding the rejection record while the fiancé crossed a line while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,婚約者のメッセージとスミンの拒絶返信を組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、婚約者が線を越えた中で拒絶記録を隠したことを問う。,将未婚夫留言与秀敏的拒绝回复并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问未婚夫越界时隐藏拒绝记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-2.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-2.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-2.b.q1-soft-v5].text,"연락 기록과 예비신랑 메시지를 함께 보면, 최수민 씨가 먼저 유혹한 그림은 흔들립니다. 침묵한 이유를 차분히 말씀하십시오.","We will look at the Fiancé's Message and Su-min's rejection reply together. Ms. Choi, this bears on hiding the rejection record while the fiancé crossed a line. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",婚約者のメッセージとスミンの拒絶返信を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは婚約者が線を越えた中で拒絶記録を隠したことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把未婚夫留言与秀敏的拒绝回复合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到未婚夫越界时隐藏拒绝记录。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 흐름을 함께 놓아, 돈을 빌려 달라는 방식이 반복됐는지 확인하는 카드다.",Card combining the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages. It asks about rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,対照表と父に関するメッセージを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことを問う。,将对照表与父亲相关短信并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v1].text,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 기록이 같은 흐름을 보입니다. 송다은 씨, 오해라는 말로 덮지 마십시오.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Answer the responsibility directly.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 흐름을 함께 놓아, 돈을 빌려 달라는 방식이 반복됐는지 확인하는 카드다.",Card combining the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages. It asks about rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,対照表と父に関するメッセージを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことを問う。,将对照表与父亲相关短信并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v2].text,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 기록을 함께 보면, 반복된 부탁이 드러났습니다. 송다은 씨, 아버지 문제를 사건 밖으로 밀 수 없습니다.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Answer the responsibility directly.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
