non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v3].text,"지금과 과거가 맞물렸습니다. 송다은 씨, 가족을 감싸느라 자료를 밀어낸 판단을 답하십시오.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Answer the responsibility directly.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
