non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-hard-v5].text,"문자와 송금 기록이 경고의 근거를 세웁니다. 송다은 씨, 왜 먼저 상대를 몰아붙였습니까.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Answer the responsibility directly.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 흐름을 함께 놓아, 돈을 빌려 달라는 방식이 반복됐는지 확인하는 카드다.",Card combining the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages. It asks about rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,対照表と父に関するメッセージを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことを問う。,将对照表与父亲相关短信并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-mid-v1].text,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 기록이 같은 방식의 부탁을 보여줍니다. 송다은 씨, 오해라는 주장을 유지하십니까.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Explain the choice and its order.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
