non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-mid-v5].text,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 기록을 함께 보면, 반복된 방식을 가리킵니다. 송다은 씨, 아버지를 의심하지 않으려 한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Explain the choice and its order.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
