non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v1].text,"송다은 씨 아버지의 현재 문자와 과거 송금 기록을 함께 보겠습니다. 송다은 씨, 여전히 단순한 부탁으로 보십니까.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
