non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 흐름을 함께 놓아, 돈을 빌려 달라는 방식이 반복됐는지 확인하는 카드다.",Card combining the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages. It asks about rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,対照表と父に関するメッセージを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことを問う。,将对照表与父亲相关短信并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v4].text,"지금의 문자와 과거의 송금이 나란히 놓였습니다. 송다은 씨, 최수민 씨의 경고 가능성을 어떻게 보십니까.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 흐름을 함께 놓아, 돈을 빌려 달라는 방식이 반복됐는지 확인하는 카드다.",Card combining the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages. It asks about rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,対照表と父に関するメッセージを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことを問う。,将对照表与父亲相关短信并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.a.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.a.q1-soft-v5].text,"현재 부탁과 과거 피해가 한 결론으로 이어집니다. 송다은 씨, 판단을 차분히 말씀하십시오.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Song, this bears on rejecting the overlap in the father's money pattern. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは父の金銭パターンの重なりを退けたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到拒绝承认父亲金钱模式中的重合。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 흐름을 함께 놓아, 돈을 빌려 달라는 방식이 반복됐는지 확인하는 카드다.",Card combining the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages. It asks about trying to block the repeated money pattern alone while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,対照表と父に関するメッセージを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことを問う。,将对照表与父亲相关短信并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-hard-v1].text,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 기록은 같은 흐름을 보여줍니다. 최수민 씨, 그걸 숨긴 채 연락한 책임을 답하십시오.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Choi, this bears on trying to block the repeated money pattern alone. Answer the responsibility directly.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
