non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-hard-v5].text,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 기록을 함께 보면, 반복을 봤다는 말만으로 혼자 판단한 책임까지 사라지지 않습니다. 최수민 씨, 핵심을 답하십시오.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Choi, this bears on trying to block the repeated money pattern alone. Answer the responsibility directly.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
