non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-mid-v4].text,"현재의 부탁과 과거의 송금이 이어지면, 연락의 목적도 달라집니다. 최수민 씨, 왜 공개하지 않았습니까.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Choi, this bears on trying to block the repeated money pattern alone. Explain the choice and its order.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
