non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-mid-v5].text,"문자와 송금 기록이 반복된 방식을 세웁니다. 최수민 씨, 그걸 보고도 왜 혼자 판단했습니까.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Choi, this bears on trying to block the repeated money pattern alone. Explain the choice and its order.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 흐름을 함께 놓아, 돈을 빌려 달라는 방식이 반복됐는지 확인하는 카드다.",Card combining the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages. It asks about trying to block the repeated money pattern alone while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,対照表と父に関するメッセージを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことを問う。,将对照表与父亲相关短信并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v1].text,"송다은 씨 아버지의 현재 문자와 과거 송금 기록을 함께 보겠습니다. 최수민 씨, 같은 방식이라고 본 이유를 말씀하십시오.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Choi, this bears on trying to block the repeated money pattern alone. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
