non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v2].text,"현재의 돈을 빌려 달라는 말과 과거의 송금 흐름이 나란히 놓여 있습니다. 최수민 씨, 왜 경고해야 한다고 봤습니까.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Choi, this bears on trying to block the repeated money pattern alone. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
