non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,"현재 문자와 과거 송금 흐름을 함께 놓아, 돈을 빌려 달라는 방식이 반복됐는지 확인하는 카드다.",Card combining the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages. It asks about trying to block the repeated money pattern alone while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,対照表と父に関するメッセージを組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことを問う。,将对照表与父亲相关短信并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-3.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-3.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-3.b.q1-soft-v5].text,"현재 문자와 과거 돈 흐름이 한 결론으로 이어집니다. 최수민 씨, 왜 이번에도 혼자 막으려 했습니까.","We will look at the Comparison Chart and the father-related messages together. Ms. Choi, this bears on trying to block the repeated money pattern alone. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",対照表と父に関するメッセージを合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは反復する金銭パターンを一人で止めようとしたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把对照表与父亲相关短信合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到试图独自阻止反复出现的金钱模式。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-4.a.q1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4.a.q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,"과거 카톡과 송금 기록을 함께 놓아, 손절의 이유가 변심이 아니라 투자 명목 피해와 침묵이었음을 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the old KakaoTalk chat and the past transfer records. It asks about filling the old fallout with blame before checking the money flow while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,過去のカカオトークと過去の送金記録を組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、金銭の流れを確認する前に過去の絶交を責めで埋めたことを問う。,将过去的KakaoTalk与过往转账记录并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问在确认钱款流向前用责怪填补旧日决裂。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-4.a.q1-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4.a.q1-hard-v1].text,"과거 카톡과 송금 기록이 변심 판단을 무너뜨립니다. 송다은 씨, 확인하지 않은 책임을 답하십시오.","We will look at the old KakaoTalk chat and the past transfer records together. Ms. Song, this bears on filling the old fallout with blame before checking the money flow. Answer the responsibility directly.",過去のカカオトークと過去の送金記録を合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは金銭の流れを確認する前に過去の絶交を責めで埋めたことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把过去的KakaoTalk与过往转账记录合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到在确认钱款流向前用责怪填补旧日决裂。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
