non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-4.a.q1-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4.a.q1-soft-v4].text,"과거 카톡과 송금 기록을 함께 보면, 손절을 변심이 아닌 다른 이유로 읽게 합니다. 송다은 씨, 차분히 답하십시오.","We will look at the old KakaoTalk chat and the past transfer records together. Ms. Song, this bears on filling the old fallout with blame before checking the money flow. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",過去のカカオトークと過去の送金記録を合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは金銭の流れを確認する前に過去の絶交を責めで埋めたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把过去的KakaoTalk与过往转账记录合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到在确认钱款流向前用责怪填补旧日决裂。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
