non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-4.a.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-4.a.q1-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.a.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4.a.q1-soft-v5].text,"과거 대화와 송금 기록이 이어집니다. 송다은 씨, 왜 최수민 씨를 먼저 변한 사람으로 봤습니까.","We will look at the old KakaoTalk chat and the past transfer records together. Ms. Song, this bears on filling the old fallout with blame before checking the money flow. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",過去のカカオトークと過去の送金記録を合わせて見ます。ソン・ダウンさん、これは金銭の流れを確認する前に過去の絶交を責めで埋めたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把过去的KakaoTalk与过往转账记录合在一起看。宋多恩女士，这关系到在确认钱款流向前用责怪填补旧日决裂。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-4.b.q1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4.b.q1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,"과거 카톡과 송금 기록을 함께 놓아, 손절의 이유가 변심이 아니라 투자 명목 피해와 침묵이었음을 묻는 카드다.",Card combining the old KakaoTalk chat and the past transfer records. It asks about hiding the old financial harm and remaining the villain while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,過去のカカオトークと過去の送金記録を組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、過去の金銭被害を隠して悪役のまま残ったことを問う。,将过去的KakaoTalk与过往转账记录并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问隐藏旧日金钱受害并留下反面角色。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_hard_.variants_judgecombo-dc-4.b.q1-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|hard].variants[judgecombo-dc-4.b.q1-hard-v1].text,"과거 카톡과 송금 기록은 손절의 실제 원인을 가리킵니다. 최수민 씨, 숨긴 책임을 답하십시오.","We will look at the old KakaoTalk chat and the past transfer records together. Ms. Choi, this bears on hiding the old financial harm and remaining the villain. Answer the responsibility directly.",過去のカカオトークと過去の送金記録を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは過去の金銭被害を隠して悪役のまま残ったことに関わります。責任を直接答えてください。,我们把过去的KakaoTalk与过往转账记录合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到隐藏旧日金钱受害并留下反面角色。请直接回答责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
