non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-4.b.q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-4.b.q1-mid-v5].text,"과거 카톡과 송금 기록을 함께 보면, 손절의 빈칸이 채워졌습니다. 최수민 씨, 왜 피해를 말하는 대신 혼자 사라졌습니까.","We will look at the old KakaoTalk chat and the past transfer records together. Ms. Choi, this bears on hiding the old financial harm and remaining the villain. Explain the choice and its order.",過去のカカオトークと過去の送金記録を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは過去の金銭被害を隠して悪役のまま残ったことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把过去的KakaoTalk与过往转账记录合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到隐藏旧日金钱受害并留下反面角色。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
