non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-4.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-4.b.q1-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-4.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-4.b.q1-soft-v2].text,"손절 직전의 끊긴 말과 과거 송금 기록을 함께 보겠습니다. 최수민 씨, 변심이 아니라면 무엇이 있었습니까.","We will look at the old KakaoTalk chat and the past transfer records together. Ms. Choi, this bears on hiding the old financial harm and remaining the villain. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",過去のカカオトークと過去の送金記録を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは過去の金銭被害を隠して悪役のまま残ったことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把过去的KakaoTalk与过往转账记录合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到隐藏旧日金钱受害并留下反面角色。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
