non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-mid-v4].text,"단톡방 캡처와 대조표를 함께 보면, 침묵도 책임이라는 질문을 만듭니다. 최수민 씨, 또 말하지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","We will look at the Group Chat Screenshot and the Comparison Chart together. Ms. Choi, this bears on letting silence and stigma move together again. Explain the choice and its order.",グループチャットのスクリーンショットと対照表を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは沈黙と烙印をまた一緒に動かしたことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把群聊截图与对照表合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到再次让沉默与污名一起推进。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
