non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_mid_.variants_judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|mid].variants[judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-mid-v5].text,"공개된 오해와 반복된 침묵이 한 결론으로 이어집니다. 최수민 씨, 바로 답하십시오.","We will look at the Group Chat Screenshot and the Comparison Chart together. Ms. Choi, this bears on letting silence and stigma move together again. Explain the choice and its order.",グループチャットのスクリーンショットと対照表を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは沈黙と烙印をまた一緒に動かしたことに関わります。その選択と順序を説明してください。,我们把群聊截图与对照表合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到再次让沉默与污名一起推进。请说明选择及其先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v1].behaviorHint,"단톡방 캡처와 대조표를 함께 놓아, 먼저 낙인찍은 순서와 반복된 침묵의 책임을 정리하는 카드다.",Card combining the Group Chat Screenshot and the Comparison Chart. It asks about letting silence and stigma move together again while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,グループチャットのスクリーンショットと対照表を組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、沈黙と烙印をまた一緒に動かしたことを問う。,将群聊截图与对照表并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问再次让沉默与污名一起推进。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v1].text,"단톡방 캡처는 낙인이 번진 장면을, 대조표는 같은 침묵이 반복된 흐름을 보여줍니다. 최수민 씨, 왜 끝까지 혼자 버텼습니까.","We will look at the Group Chat Screenshot and the Comparison Chart together. Ms. Choi, this bears on letting silence and stigma move together again. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",グループチャットのスクリーンショットと対照表を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは沈黙と烙印をまた一緒に動かしたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把群聊截图与对照表合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到再次让沉默与污名一起推进。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
