non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v3].text,"캡처에는 오해의 결과가, 대조표에는 그 오해가 반복된 방식이 남아 있습니다. 최수민 씨, 차분히 답하십시오.","We will look at the Group Chat Screenshot and the Comparison Chart together. Ms. Choi, this bears on letting silence and stigma move together again. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",グループチャットのスクリーンショットと対照表を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは沈黙と烙印をまた一緒に動かしたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把群聊截图与对照表合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到再次让沉默与污名一起推进。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
