non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v4].text,"단톡방 캡처와 대조표를 함께 보면, 보면 침묵과 낙인이 함께 움직입니다. 최수민 씨, 왜 말하지 못했습니까.","We will look at the Group Chat Screenshot and the Comparison Chart together. Ms. Choi, this bears on letting silence and stigma move together again. Answer calmly, without forcing a conclusion beyond the record.",グループチャットのスクリーンショットと対照表を合わせて見ます。チェ・スミンさん、これは沈黙と烙印をまた一緒に動かしたことに関わります。記録を超える結論に急がず、落ち着いて答えてください。,我们把群聊截图与对照表合在一起看。崔秀敏女士，这关系到再次让沉默与污名一起推进。请冷静回答，不要超出记录强行下结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,"단톡방 캡처와 대조표를 함께 놓아, 먼저 낙인찍은 순서와 반복된 침묵의 책임을 정리하는 카드다.",Card combining the Group Chat Screenshot and the Comparison Chart. It asks about letting silence and stigma move together again while keeping the inquiry limited to the record.,グループチャットのスクリーンショットと対照表を組み合わせるカード。記録の範囲に限って、沈黙と烙印をまた一緒に動かしたことを問う。,将群聊截图与对照表并置的卡牌。在记录范围内追问再次让沉默与污名一起推进。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_evidence_combo_.entries_dc-5.b.q1_soft_.variants_judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_evidence_combo].entries[dc-5.b.q1|soft].variants[judgecombo-dc-5.b.q1-soft-v5].text,"단톡방 낙인과 대조표의 반복 흐름을 보겠습니다. 최수민 씨, 이번에도 혼자 감당한 마음을 말씀하십시오.","We will look at the group chat stigma and the repeated pattern shown in the Comparison Chart. Ms. Choi, explain what led you to bear it alone again.",グループチャットでの烙印と対照表に示された反復の流れを見ます。チェ・スミンさん、今回も一人で抱えた思いを話してください。,我们来看群聊污名与对照表中的反复脉络。崔秀敏女士，请说明这次仍然独自承担的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그 연락을 보내는 동안 가장 두려웠던 점이 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, what frightened you most while you were sending those messages?",チェ・スミンさん、その連絡を送っている間、何をいちばん恐れていましたか。,崔秀敏女士，发出那些联系时，你最害怕的是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 기록을 본 순간 무엇이 가장 먼저 무너졌습니까.","Ms. Song, when you saw the record, what was the first thing that fell apart for you?",ソン・ダウンさん、記録を見た瞬間、まず何が崩れましたか。,宋多恩女士，看到记录的那一刻，你最先崩塌的是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v3].text,"두 분, 연락 하나가 왜 이렇게 크게 번졌는지 감정부터 말해 보십시오.","Both of you, start with the emotions behind why a single thread of contact grew this large.",お二人とも、ひとつの連絡がなぜここまで大きく広がったのか、まず感情から話してください。,两位，请先从情绪说起：为什么一次联系会发展到这个地步？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 오해받을 걸 알면서도 보낸 마음을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what drove you to send them even knowing you could be misunderstood.",チェ・スミンさん、誤解されると分かっていても送った気持ちを説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你明知会被误解却仍然联系的心情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 결혼 앞에서 그 일이 왜 그렇게 크게 다가왔습니까.","Ms. Song, why did this feel so serious with the wedding approaching?",ソン・ダウンさん、結婚を前にして、その件がなぜそれほど大きく感じられたのですか。,宋多恩女士，婚礼在即，这件事为什么让你感到如此严重？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 말할수록 더 나빠질까 봐 눌렀던 감정을 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, tell us what feelings you held back because speaking might make things worse.",チェ・スミンさん、話すほど悪くなるのではないかと思って抑え込んだ感情を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说说你因为怕越说越糟而压下的情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 불안이 분노로 바뀐 순간을 떠올려 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, recall the moment your anxiety turned into anger, and tell us about it.",ソン・ダウンさん、不安が怒りに変わった瞬間を思い出して話してください。,宋多恩女士，请回想并说明不安转为愤怒的那一刻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v3].text,"두 분, 서로에게 기대하지 못한 지점을 차분히 설명하십시오.","Both of you, calmly explain where each of you could no longer rely on the other.",お二人とも、互いに何を期待できなくなったのか、落ち着いて説明してください。,两位，请冷静说明你们各自无法再期待对方的地方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨에게 바로 가지 못한 상처를 말해 보십시오.","Ms. Choi, tell us about the hurt that kept you from going directly to Ms. Song.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんのもとへ直接行けなかった傷について話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说说是什么伤害让你无法直接找宋多恩女士。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 예전 불신이 이번 판단을 흔든 정도를 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, explain how much old distrust affected your judgment this time.",ソン・ダウンさん、以前からの不信が今回の判断をどの程度揺らしたのか話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明过去的不信任在多大程度上影响了这次判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 경고하려는 마음과 악역이 될 두려움이 어떻게 부딪혔습니까.","Ms. Choi, how did the urge to warn her collide with the fear of becoming the villain?",チェ・スミンさん、警告したい気持ちと悪役になる怖さは、どうぶつかりましたか。,崔秀敏女士，想要警告的心情和害怕成为坏人的恐惧，是如何冲突的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 상대의 경고 가능성을 들었을 때 어떤 감정이 먼저 왔습니까.","Ms. Song, when you heard it might have been a warning, what emotion came first?",ソン・ダウンさん、相手の連絡が警告だった可能性を聞いた時、最初にどんな感情が来ましたか。,宋多恩女士，当你听到那可能是警告时，最先涌上的是什么情绪？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v3].text,"두 분, 서로를 믿지 못한 시간이 이번 연락에 어떻게 붙었습니까.","Both of you, how did the time spent not trusting each other attach itself to this contact?",お二人とも、互いを信じられなかった時間が、今回の連絡にどう結びついたのか話してください。,两位，请说明彼此无法信任的那段时间，如何附着到了这次联系上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 침묵이 반복될 걸 알면서도 왜 버텼습니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you keep holding on even knowing the silence would repeat?",チェ・スミンさん、沈黙が繰り返されると分かっていながら、なぜ持ちこたえたのですか。,崔秀敏女士，明知沉默会反复，为什么还是坚持了下去？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 틀렸을 수 있다는 생각을 왜 받아들이기 어려웠습니까.","Ms. Song, why was it hard to accept that you might have been wrong?",ソン・ダウンさん、自分が間違っていたかもしれないという考えを、なぜ受け入れにくかったのですか。,宋多恩女士，为什么你很难接受自己可能判断错了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 좋은 의도였어도 상대가 상처받은 책임을 보십니까.","Ms. Choi, even if your intent was good, do you see your responsibility for the hurt caused?",チェ・スミンさん、善意だったとしても、相手が傷ついたことへの責任は見えていますか。,崔秀敏女士，即使出发点是好的，你是否看到自己对造成伤害的责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 확인하지 않은 단정이 만든 상처를 지금 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Song, how do you now view the hurt created by a conclusion you did not verify?",ソン・ダウンさん、確認しないまま下した断定が作った傷を、今どう見ていますか。,宋多恩女士，你现在如何看待未经确认的定论造成的伤害？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v3].text,"두 분, 서로의 두려움이 사실 확인을 막은 지점을 말씀하십시오.","Both of you, tell us where your fears blocked fact-checking.",お二人とも、互いの怖れが事実確認を妨げた地点を話してください。,两位，请说出你们各自的恐惧在哪些地方阻碍了事实确认。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 보호하려던 침묵이 낙인을 키운 사실을 인정하십니까.","Ms. Choi, do you admit that the silence meant to protect her made the stigma grow?",チェ・スミンさん、守るための沈黙が烙印を大きくした事実を認めますか。,崔秀敏女士，你是否承认，为了保护而保持的沉默反而扩大了污名？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-empathy_approach-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 집착으로 이름 붙인 뒤 되돌리기 어려웠던 이유는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, why was it so hard to step back after naming it obsession?",ソン・ダウンさん、執着という名前をつけた後、なぜ引き返しにくかったのですか。,宋多恩女士，把它定名为执着之后，为什么难以收回？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 며칠 동안 이어진 연락이 무엇을 전하려던 것이었는지 먼저 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, first tell us what you were trying to convey through the contact that continued for several days.",チェ・スミンさん、数日にわたって続いた連絡で何を伝えようとしていたのか、まず話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请先说明那几天持续联系究竟想传达什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 그 연락을 처음 본 시점과 반응을 정리해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, organize when you first saw the contact and how you reacted.",ソン・ダウンさん、その連絡を初めて見た時点と反応を整理してください。,宋多恩女士，请整理你最初看到这些联系的时间点和反应。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v3].text,"두 분, 연락이 이어진 순서와 첫 반응을 시간순으로 맞춰 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, align the order of the contact and the first reactions in chronological order.",お二人とも、連絡が続いた順序と最初の反応を時系列で合わせて話してください。,两位，请按时间顺序对齐联系的经过和最初反应。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 전화와 문자가 반복된 순서를 장면과 순서를 나눠 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate the scenes and the sequence of the repeated calls and texts.",チェ・スミンさん、電話とメッセージが繰り返された順序を、場面と順序に分けて説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把反复电话和短信的顺序按场景和先后分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 기록을 확인한 뒤 어떤 조치를 먼저 했습니까.","Ms. Song, after confirming the record, what action did you take first?",ソン・ダウンさん、記録を確認した後、最初にどんな対応を取りましたか。,宋多恩女士，确认记录后，你最先采取了什么行动？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 왜 송다은 씨가 아니라 예비신랑에게 먼저 연락했습니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you contact the fiancé first instead of Ms. Song?",チェ・スミンさん、なぜソン・ダウンさんではなく婚約者に先に連絡したのですか。,崔秀敏女士，你为什么没有先找宋多恩女士，而是先联系了未婚夫？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 연락 횟수 말고 집착이라고 본 근거가 더 있었는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, besides the number of contacts, did you have any other basis for calling it obsession?",ソン・ダウンさん、連絡回数以外に、執着だと見た根拠がほかにありましたか。,宋多恩女士，除了联系次数之外，你还有其他理由认为那是执着吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v3].text,"두 분, 연락 내용과 해석이 갈린 지점을 따로 정리해 주십시오.","Both of you, separately organize the content of the contact and where your interpretations diverged.",お二人とも、連絡の内容と解釈が分かれた地点を分けて整理してください。,两位，请分别整理联系内容和你们解读分歧的地方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 답이 없는데도 다시 연락한 이유를 확인된 사실만으로 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you contacted him again despite no reply, using only confirmed facts.",チェ・スミンさん、返事がないのに再び連絡した理由を、確認された事実だけで話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请只依据已确认事实说明：没有回复却再次联系的理由是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 상대에게 직접 묻기 전에 확인한 자료가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, what materials did you check before asking the other person directly?",ソン・ダウンさん、相手に直接尋ねる前に、どんな資料を確認しましたか。,宋多恩女士，在直接询问对方之前，你确认过哪些资料？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그 연락이 경고였다는 근거를 기록에 맞춰 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain against the record why you say that contact was a warning.",チェ・スミンさん、その連絡が警告だったという根拠を、記録に沿って説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请对照记录说明你称那次联系为警告的依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 호감 표현이 없다는 자료를 보고도 왜 단정했습니까.","Ms. Song, why did you still conclude that way after seeing material with no expression of romantic interest?",ソン・ダウンさん、好意の表現がない資料を見ても、なぜ断定したのですか。,宋多恩女士，看到资料中没有好感表达后，你为什么仍然下了定论？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v3].text,"두 분, 연락의 겉모습과 실제 목적을 구분해 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, distinguish the outward appearance of the contact from its actual purpose.",お二人とも、連絡の見た目と実際の目的を分けて話してください。,两位，请区分联系的表象和实际目的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 예비신랑에게 꼭 전하려던 핵심을 직접 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, directly explain the core point you needed to deliver to the fiancé.",チェ・スミンさん、婚約者にどうしても伝えようとした核心を直接説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请直接说明你一定要传达给未婚夫的核心内容。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 연락 기록만으로 결론을 세운 과정을 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, explain the process by which you formed a conclusion from the contact log alone.",ソン・ダウンさん、連絡記録だけで結論を立てた過程を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你仅凭联系记录得出结论的过程。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 경고였더라도 왜 반복 연락이라는 방식을 택했습니까.","Ms. Choi, even if it was a warning, why did you choose repeated contact as the method?",チェ・スミンさん、警告だったとしても、なぜ繰り返し連絡するという方法を選んだのですか。,崔秀敏女士，即使那是警告，为什么选择了反复联系这种方式？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 확인하기 전에 집착이라고 못 박은 책임을 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Song, how do you view your responsibility for declaring it obsession before checking?",ソン・ダウンさん、確認する前に執着だと決めつけた責任をどう見ていますか。,宋多恩女士，你如何看待自己在确认前就认定为执着的责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v3].text,"두 분, 연락 의도와 방식의 책임을 각각 나누어 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, separate the responsibility for intent from the responsibility for method.",お二人とも、連絡の意図と方法の責任をそれぞれ分けて話してください。,两位，请分别说明联系意图的责任和方式上的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 보호하려다 오해를 키운 선택을 어떻게 설명하십니까.","Ms. Choi, how do you explain the choice that was meant to protect her but increased misunderstanding?",チェ・スミンさん、守ろうとして誤解を大きくした選択を、どう説明しますか。,崔秀敏女士，你如何解释那个本想保护却加深误解的选择？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-fact_pursuit-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그 연락을 다른 뜻으로 읽을 가능성을 언제 닫았습니까.","Ms. Song, when did you close off the possibility that the contact meant something else?",ソン・ダウンさん、その連絡を別の意味で読む可能性を、いつ閉じましたか。,宋多恩女士，你是在什么时候关闭了把那次联系理解为其他含义的可能？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 연락을 시작하게 만든 첫 판단이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Choi, what was the first judgment that made you start contacting him?",チェ・スミンさん、連絡を始めるきっかけになった最初の判断は何でしたか。,崔秀敏女士，促使你开始联系的最初判断是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 그 연락을 보고 왜 바로 위협으로 받아들였습니까.","Ms. Song, why did you take that contact as an immediate threat?",ソン・ダウンさん、その連絡を見て、なぜすぐ脅威として受け止めたのですか。,宋多恩女士，你看到那些联系后，为什么立刻把它视为威胁？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v3].text,"두 분, 첫 감정과 첫 행동 사이의 이유를 각각 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, each explain the reason between your first emotion and first action.",お二人とも、最初の感情と最初の行動の間にあった理由を、それぞれ話してください。,两位，请分别说明从最初情绪到最初行动之间的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 연락을 멈추지 못하게 한 마음을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what feeling kept you from stopping the contact.",チェ・スミンさん、連絡を止められなかった気持ちを説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明是什么心情让你无法停止联系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 결혼 앞 불안이 판단에 얼마나 들어갔습니까.","Ms. Song, how much did your anxiety before the wedding enter into your judgment?",ソン・ダウンさん、結婚前の不安は判断にどの程度入り込みましたか。,宋多恩女士，婚前的不安在多大程度上进入了你的判断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 직접 말하지 않고 우회한 이유를 명확히 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, state clearly why you took an indirect route instead of speaking directly.",チェ・スミンさん、直接言わずに迂回した理由を明確に話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请明确说明你为什么没有直接说，而是选择绕开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 확인보다 차단과 공개가 먼저 된 이유는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, why did blocking and publicizing come before verification?",ソン・ダウンさん、確認より先に遮断と公開が来た理由は何ですか。,宋多恩女士，为什么拉黑和公开先于确认？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v3].text,"두 분, 말하지 않은 이유와 묻지 않은 이유를 각각 설명하십시오.","Both of you, explain separately why one of you did not speak and the other did not ask.",お二人とも、言わなかった理由と尋ねなかった理由を、それぞれ説明してください。,两位，请分别说明没有说出口的理由和没有询问的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 오해를 예상하면서도 연락한 판단을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the judgment behind contacting him while expecting a misunderstanding.",チェ・スミンさん、誤解を予想しながらも連絡した判断を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你明知会被误解却仍然联系的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 과거 손절 기억이 이번 판단을 왜 앞질렀습니까.","Ms. Song, why did the memory of cutting ties in the past outrun your judgment this time?",ソン・ダウンさん、過去の絶交の記憶が、なぜ今回の判断を先取りしたのですか。,宋多恩女士，过去断交的记忆为什么先于这次判断起了作用？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 경고라는 목적을 처음부터 밝히지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you not state from the start that the purpose was a warning?",チェ・スミンさん、警告が目的だと最初から明かさなかった理由は何ですか。,崔秀敏女士，你为什么一开始没有说明目的是警告？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 반복 연락만으로 마음의 방향까지 단정한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain why repeated contact alone led you to decide the direction of her feelings.",ソン・ダウンさん、繰り返された連絡だけで相手の気持ちの方向まで断定した理由を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你为什么仅凭反复联系就断定了对方的心意方向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v3].text,"두 분, 같은 기록을 정반대로 읽게 만든 마음을 나눠 말씀하십시오.","Both of you, tell us what state of mind made you read the same record in opposite ways.",お二人とも、同じ記録を正反対に読ませた気持ちを分けて話してください。,两位，请说明是什么心境让你们把同一份记录读成了完全相反的意思。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨에게 직접 말하면 안 된다고 본 이유를 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you believed you could not speak directly to Ms. Song.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんに直接話してはいけないと見た理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你为什么认为不能直接告诉宋多恩女士。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 상대의 설명 가능성을 왜 끝까지 낮게 보셨습니까.","Ms. Song, why did you keep giving so little weight to the possibility of the other person's explanation?",ソン・ダウンさん、相手に説明の可能性があることを、なぜ最後まで低く見たのですか。,宋多恩女士，为什么你始终很低估对方可能有解释的可能？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 보호하려는 판단이 왜 또 혼자 감당하는 방식이 됐습니까.","Ms. Choi, why did your judgment to protect her again turn into carrying it alone?",チェ・スミンさん、守ろうという判断が、なぜまた一人で抱える形になったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，为什么“想保护她”的判断又变成了你独自承担？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 불안이 커질수록 왜 결론부터 세우셨습니까.","Ms. Song, as your anxiety grew, why did you put the conclusion first?",ソン・ダウンさん、不安が大きくなるほど、なぜ結論を先に立てたのですか。,宋多恩女士，为什么不安越大，你越先设定结论？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v3].text,"두 분, 경고와 낙인이 서로를 키운 과정을 솔직히 말씀하십시오.","Both of you, speak honestly about how warning and stigma fed each other.",お二人とも、警告と烙印が互いを大きくした過程を率直に話してください。,两位，请坦率说明警告和污名如何相互放大。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 선의였다는 말로 방식의 책임까지 덮을 수 있습니까.","Ms. Choi, can the words 'good intentions' cover responsibility for the method as well?",チェ・スミンさん、善意だったという言葉で、方法の責任まで覆えますか。,崔秀敏女士，仅凭“善意”这个说法，能连方式上的责任也遮盖过去吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-1_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-1|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-1-motive_search-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 집착 프레임을 붙든 심리를 지금 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, please explain now the mindset that kept holding on to the obsession frame.",ソン・ダウンさん、執着というフレームを握り続けた心理を、今説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请现在说明你一直抓住“执着”框架的心理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그 메시지를 받았을 때 느낀 불쾌감을 말해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, tell us the discomfort you felt when you received that message.",チェ・スミンさん、そのメッセージを受け取った時に感じた不快感を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说说你收到那条信息时感到的不快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 메시지를 보는 일이 왜 힘들었습니까.","Ms. Song, why was it hard to look at your fiancé's messages?",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者のメッセージを見ることが、なぜつらかったのですか。,宋多恩女士，查看未婚夫的信息为什么让你如此难受？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v3].text,"두 분, 같은 대화가 각자에게 남긴 충격을 먼저 말씀하십시오.","Both of you, first tell us the shock that the same conversation left on each of you.",お二人とも、同じ会話がそれぞれに残した衝撃を、まず話してください。,两位，请先说明同一段对话分别给你们留下了怎样的冲击。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 친구의 예비신랑에게 그런 말을 들은 마음은 어땠습니까.","Ms. Choi, how did it feel to hear words like that from your friend's fiancé?",チェ・スミンさん、友人の婚約者からそのような言葉を聞いて、どんな気持ちでしたか。,崔秀敏女士，听到朋友的未婚夫说那样的话，你是什么心情？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 믿고 있던 관계가 흔들린 감정을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Song, explain the feeling of a relationship you trusted starting to shake.",ソン・ダウンさん、信じていた関係が揺らいだ感情を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你信任的关系开始动摇时的感受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 거절하고도 말하지 못한 압박을 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the pressure you felt after refusing him yet being unable to speak.",チェ・スミンさん、拒んだのに話せなかった圧力を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你拒绝之后却无法说出口的压力。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑을 의심해야 하는 상황이 왜 받아들이기 어려웠습니까.","Ms. Song, why was it hard to accept a situation where you had to suspect your fiancé?",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者を疑わなければならない状況を、なぜ受け入れにくかったのですか。,宋多恩女士，为什么你难以接受必须怀疑未婚夫的处境？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v3].text,"두 분, 서로에게 말하지 못한 부끄러움이 어디서 생겼습니까.","Both of you, where did the shame you could not tell each other come from?",お二人とも、互いに言えなかった恥ずかしさは、どこから生まれましたか。,两位，你们彼此无法说出口的羞耻感从何而来？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨가 받을 상처를 걱정한 마음이 판단에 들어갔습니까.","Ms. Choi, did concern for the hurt Ms. Song would suffer enter into your judgment?",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんが受ける傷を心配する気持ちは、あなたの判断に入りましたか。,崔秀敏女士，担心宋多恩女士会受伤的心情，是否影响了你的判断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨를 탓하는 게 더 쉬웠던 이유가 있었습니까.","Ms. Song, was there a reason it was easier to blame Ms. Choi?",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんを責めるほうが楽だった理由はありましたか。,宋多恩女士，你是否有理由觉得责怪崔秀敏女士更容易？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 거절한 사람이 오히려 의심받는 상황을 어떻게 견뎠습니까.","Ms. Choi, how did you endure being suspected when you were the one who refused?",チェ・スミンさん、拒んだ側でありながら疑われる状況を、どう耐えましたか。,崔秀敏女士，你明明是拒绝的一方，却反而被怀疑，是如何承受的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 선후가 바뀌는 순간 느낀 혼란을 말해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, tell us about the confusion you felt when the order of events seemed to flip.",ソン・ダウンさん、先後が逆転する瞬間に感じた混乱を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说说先后顺序被颠倒时你感到的混乱。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v3].text,"두 분, 믿음이 깨지는 방향을 서로 다르게 본 이유가 무엇입니까.","Both of you, why did you see the breaking of trust in different directions?",お二人とも、信頼が壊れる方向を互いに違って見た理由は何ですか。,两位，你们为什么从不同方向理解信任破裂这件事？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 억울함보다 침묵을 택한 감정을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the feeling that made you choose silence over resentment.",チェ・スミンさん、悔しさより沈黙を選んだ感情を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明是什么情绪让你选择沉默而不是申冤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 잘못을 보며 자신을 탓한 부분이 있습니까.","Ms. Song, did any part of you blame yourself while seeing your fiancé's wrongdoing?",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者の過ちを見ながら、自分を責めた部分はありましたか。,宋多恩女士，看到未婚夫的过错时，你是否有过责怪自己的部分？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 침묵이 스스로를 더 불리하게 만든 사실을 언제 보셨습니까.","Ms. Choi, when did you realize your silence had made you even more vulnerable?",チェ・スミンさん、沈黙が自分をさらに不利にした事実に、いつ気づきましたか。,崔秀敏女士，你是什么时候意识到沉默让自己更加不利的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨를 먼저 의심한 마음을 지금 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Song, how do you now view the heart that suspected Ms. Choi first?",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんを先に疑った気持ちを、今どう見ていますか。,宋多恩女士，你现在如何看待自己先怀疑崔秀敏女士的心理？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v3].text,"두 분, 상처를 피하려다 더 큰 오해를 만든 지점을 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell us where trying to avoid hurt created a larger misunderstanding.",お二人とも、傷を避けようとして、より大きな誤解を作った地点を話してください。,两位，请说说你们为了避免伤害而造成更大误会的地方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 좋은 의도만으로 숨긴 책임이 줄어든다고 보십니까.","Ms. Choi, do you think good intentions reduce your responsibility for hiding it?",チェ・スミンさん、善意だけで隠した責任が軽くなると思いますか。,崔秀敏女士，你认为仅凭善意，隐瞒的责任就会减轻吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-empathy_approach-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 믿고 싶은 결론을 붙든 대가를 인정하십니까.","Ms. Song, do you acknowledge the cost of holding on to the conclusion you wanted to believe?",ソン・ダウンさん、信じたい結論を握り続けた代償を認めますか。,宋多恩女士，你是否承认自己抓住想相信的结论所付出的代价？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 예비신랑과 따로 닿은 첫 대화를 시간순으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, first state when the fiancé's message arrived and how you responded.",チェ・スミンさん、婚約者のメッセージが届いた時点と、あなたの返答をまず話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请先说明未婚夫的信息在何时发来，以及你如何回应。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 대화 원본을 언제 처음 보셨습니까.","Ms. Song, tell us exactly what you confirmed in the message record.",ソン・ダウンさん、メッセージ記録で何を確認したのか、正確に話してください。,宋多恩女士，请准确说明你在信息记录中确认到了什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v3].text,"두 분, 누가 먼저 사적인 말을 꺼냈는지 자료에 맞춰 정리하십시오.","Both of you, first align the order of the fiancé's messages and Ms. Choi's refusal.",お二人とも、婚約者のメッセージとチェ・スミンさんの拒絶の順序を、まず合わせてください。,两位，请先对齐未婚夫的信息和崔秀敏女士拒绝的先后顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 첫 메시지를 받은 뒤 바로 어떤 답을 했습니까.","Ms. Choi, was there any wording in the record that could be read as showing interest?",チェ・スミンさん、記録の中に好意の表現と読める文言はありましたか。,崔秀敏女士，记录中是否有可以被解读为好感的措辞？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 설명과 자료가 다른 지점을 보셨습니까.","Ms. Song, on what basis did you believe your fiancé's explanation first?",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者の説明を先に信じた根拠は何でしたか。,宋多恩女士，你先相信未婚夫解释的依据是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 부담스러운 말이 오갔을 때 어떻게 선을 그었는지 차분히 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, at what point did you make your refusal clear?",チェ・スミンさん、拒絶の意思をどの時点で明確にしましたか。,崔秀敏女士，你是在什么时候明确表达拒绝的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 일부 캡처만 보고 선후를 판단한 과정이 있습니까.","Ms. Song, which part of the conversation first made you think Ms. Choi was at fault?",ソン・ダウンさん、どの会話部分で先にチェ・スミンさんの責任だと見たのですか。,宋多恩女士，是哪一部分对话让你先认为崔秀敏女士有责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v3].text,"두 분, 접근한 사람과 거절한 사람을 기록에 맞춰 나누십시오.","Both of you, compare the message sequence and the emotional judgment separately.",お二人とも、メッセージの順序と感情的判断を分けて照らし合わせてください。,两位，请分别对照信息顺序和情绪判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 거절 뒤에도 기록을 바로 공개하지 않은 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain whether your contact was connected to the earlier refusal.",チェ・スミンさん、あなたの連絡が先の拒絶とつながっていたのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你的联系是否与之前的拒绝有关。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑에게 따로 확인한 내용을 사실만 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, tell us the point at which you may have misread Ms. Choi's refusal.",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんの拒絶を読み違えた可能性のある地点を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你可能误读崔秀敏女士拒绝的地方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 대화의 선후가 먼저 넘은 경계를 자료로 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain what in the record supports that you refused first.",チェ・スミンさん、先に拒絶したという点を記録のどこが裏づけるのか説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明记录中哪些地方支持你先拒绝这一点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 말이 사건 해석을 바꾸는 지점을 보십니까.","Ms. Song, why did you overlook the signs that the contact began from the fiancé's side?",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者側から始まった流れを示す点を、なぜ見落としましたか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么忽略了联系由未婚夫一方开始的迹象？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v3].text,"두 분, 유혹한 사람과 거절한 사람의 자리를 다시 정리하십시오.","Both of you, organize where the first approach and the first refusal each occurred.",お二人とも、最初の接近と最初の拒絶がそれぞれどこにあったのか整理してください。,两位，请整理最初接近和最初拒绝分别发生在何处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 그 거절이 이후 연락과 어떻게 이어졌습니까.","Ms. Choi, state the connection between the fiancé's approach and your later warning.",チェ・スミンさん、婚約者の接近とその後の警告のつながりを話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明未婚夫的接近与你之后警告之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨가 먼저 접근했다는 판단을 무엇으로 세웠습니까.","Ms. Song, after confirming the order, do you still see Ms. Choi as the one who crossed the line?",ソン・ダウンさん、順序を確認しても、チェ・スミンさんを線を越えた側だと見ますか。,宋多恩女士，确认先后顺序后，你仍然认为崔秀敏女士是越界的一方吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 거절한 뒤에도 왜 조용히 넘기지 못했는지 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, why did you still keep silent even after the record showed the refusal?",チェ・スミンさん、拒絶の記録があるのに、それでもなぜ沈黙を守ったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，明明有拒绝记录，为什么仍然保持沉默？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 선후관계가 바뀌면 책임 판단도 바뀐다고 보십니까.","Ms. Song, how do you view the fact that you took the contact as an affair sign before checking the sequence?",ソン・ダウンさん、先後を確認する前に連絡を浮気の兆候として受け取った事実を、どう見ていますか。,宋多恩女士，你如何看待自己在确认顺序前就把联系视为暧昧信号这件事？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v3].text,"두 분, 예비신랑의 행동과 최수민 씨의 대응을 분리해 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, distinguish the fact of the refusal from responsibility for the misunderstanding.",お二人とも、拒絶の事実と誤解の責任を分けて話してください。,两位，请区分拒绝的事实和造成误会的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 바로 알리지 않은 선택이 오해를 키운 점을 보십니까.","Ms. Choi, why was the warning method unclear even if you had refused?",チェ・スミンさん、拒絶していたとしても、警告の方法が不明確だった理由は何ですか。,崔秀敏女士，即使你已经拒绝，为什么警告的方式仍不明确？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-fact_pursuit-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑을 믿고 싶었던 마음이 자료 해석에 들어갔습니까.","Ms. Song, can you accept that your fiancé's message came before Ms. Choi's contact?",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者のメッセージがチェ・スミンさんの連絡より先だったことを受け入れられますか。,宋多恩女士，你能接受未婚夫的信息早于崔秀敏女士的联系这一点吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 첫 사적인 메시지를 받았을 때 어떤 판단을 했습니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you decide that the fiancé's message had to be stopped?",チェ・スミンさん、婚約者のメッセージを止めなければならないと判断した理由は何ですか。,崔秀敏女士，你为什么判断必须阻止未婚夫的信息？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 말보다 최수민 씨를 먼저 의심한 이유는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, why did you suspect Ms. Choi before your fiancé's words?",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者の言葉より先にチェ・スミンさんを疑った理由は何ですか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么先怀疑崔秀敏女士，而不是未婚夫的话？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v3].text,"두 분, 선을 넘었다고 본 기준을 각자 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, each state the standard by which you saw a line being crossed.",お二人とも、何を基準に線を越えたと見たのか、それぞれ話してください。,两位，请各自说明你们认定越界的标准是什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 그 대화를 바로 끊어야 한다고 본 이유는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you believe that conversation had to be cut off right away?",チェ・スミンさん、その会話をすぐ断つべきだと見た理由は何ですか。,崔秀敏女士，你为什么认为那段对话必须马上切断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑 설명을 더 믿게 된 마음을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Song, explain why your heart leaned toward believing your fiancé's explanation.",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者の説明をより信じるようになった気持ちを説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你为什么更倾向相信未婚夫的解释。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 거절한 사람인데도 왜 먼저 밝히지 못했습니까.","Ms. Choi, if you were the one who refused, why could you not reveal it first?",チェ・スミンさん、拒んだ側なのに、なぜ先に明かせなかったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，如果你是拒绝的一方，为什么无法先说出来？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 일부 정황만으로 최수민 씨 책임을 크게 본 이유는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, why did you weigh Ms. Choi's responsibility so heavily from only partial circumstances?",ソン・ダウンさん、一部の状況だけで、なぜチェ・スミンさんの責任を大きく見たのですか。,宋多恩女士，为什么你仅凭部分情况就把崔秀敏女士的责任看得很重？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v3].text,"두 분, 침묵과 신뢰가 선후 판단을 어떻게 흐렸는지 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, explain how silence and trust blurred the judgment of who came first.",お二人とも、沈黙と信頼が先後の判断をどう曇らせたのか話してください。,两位，请说明沉默与信任如何模糊了先后判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨에게 바로 보여주지 못한 두려움을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the fear that kept you from showing Ms. Song immediately.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんにすぐ見せられなかった怖さを説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明是什么恐惧让你无法立刻给宋多恩女士看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑을 방어하려는 마음이 있었는지 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, tell us whether you had a desire to defend your fiancé.",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者を守りたい気持ちがあったのか話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你是否有想要维护未婚夫的心理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 먼저 선을 넘은 사람이 드러나면 왜 사건이 달라집니까.","Ms. Choi, why does the case change if the person who crossed the line first is revealed?",チェ・スミンさん、先に線を越えた人が明らかになると、なぜ事件は変わるのですか。,崔秀敏女士，如果先越界的人被揭示出来，为什么案件会不同？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 그 사실을 늦게 보게 된 이유를 스스로 설명하십시오.","Ms. Song, explain to yourself why you came to see that fact late.",ソン・ダウンさん、その事実を見るのが遅れた理由を、自分で説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请自己说明为什么你迟迟才看到那个事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v3].text,"두 분, 누가 관계의 경계를 먼저 흔들었는지 판단 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, state the basis for judging who first shook the boundary of the relationship.",お二人とも、誰が先に関係の境界を揺らしたのか、その判断根拠を話してください。,两位，请说明判断谁先动摇关系边界的依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 거절 사실을 숨긴 판단이 누구를 보호하려 한 겁니까.","Ms. Choi, who were you trying to protect by hiding the refusal?",チェ・スミンさん、拒絶の事実を隠した判断は、誰を守ろうとしたのですか。,崔秀敏女士，你隐瞒拒绝事实的判断，是为了保护谁？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 믿고 싶은 사람과 의심한 사람을 왜 나눠 보셨습니까.","Ms. Song, why did you divide the person you wanted to believe from the person you suspected?",ソン・ダウンさん、信じたい人と疑った人を、なぜ分けて見たのですか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么把想相信的人和怀疑的人分开看待？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 보호하려는 침묵이 왜 또 오해의 근거가 됐습니까.","Ms. Choi, why did the silence meant to protect her become evidence for another misunderstanding?",チェ・スミンさん、守ろうとした沈黙が、なぜまた誤解の根拠になったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，为什么本想保护她的沉默又成了误解的依据？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 예비신랑의 잘못을 보는 순간 무엇이 가장 두려웠습니까.","Ms. Song, when you saw your fiancé's fault, what frightened you most?",ソン・ダウンさん、婚約者の過ちを見る瞬間、何がいちばん怖かったのですか。,宋多恩女士，看到未婚夫的过错时，你最害怕的是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v3].text,"두 분, 선후가 뒤집힌 뒤 각자 책임을 어떻게 받아들이십니까.","Both of you, how do you each accept responsibility after the order was overturned?",お二人とも、先後が逆転した後、それぞれの責任をどう受け止めますか。,两位，先后顺序被颠倒后，你们各自如何接受责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 그때의 입장보다 숨긴 사실이 커진 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why the hidden fact became larger than your position at the time.",チェ・スミンさん、その時の立場より、隠した事実のほうが大きくなった理由を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明为什么你隐瞒的事实比当时的立场变得更重要。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-2_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-2|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-2-motive_search-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 상대를 의심해 결혼 불안을 덮은 건 아닌지 답하십시오.","Ms. Song, answer whether you used suspicion of the other person to cover anxiety about the wedding.",ソン・ダウンさん、相手を疑うことで結婚への不安を覆ったのではないか、答えてください。,宋多恩女士，请回答：你是否用怀疑对方来掩盖对婚姻的焦虑？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 같은 돈을 빌려 달라는 말을 다시 봤을 때 어떤 감정이 올라왔습니까.","Ms. Choi, when you saw the same request to borrow money again, what feeling rose in you?",チェ・スミンさん、同じようにお金を貸してほしいという言葉を再び見た時、どんな感情が湧きましたか。,崔秀敏女士，当你再次看到同样借钱的话时，心里升起了什么情绪？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 이야기가 사건 중심에 들어온 느낌을 말해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, tell us how it felt to have your father brought into the center of the case.",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の話が事件の中心に入ってきた感覚を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说说父亲的事情进入案件中心时，你是什么感受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v3].text,"두 분, 가족 문제를 꺼내는 데 생긴 두려움을 각각 설명하십시오.","Both of you, each explain the fear that came with raising a family matter.",お二人とも、家族の問題を持ち出すことに生じた怖さを、それぞれ説明してください。,两位，请分别说明提起家庭问题时产生的恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 그 문자를 보고 과거 기억이 어떻게 되살아났습니까.","Ms. Choi, how did that text message bring back memories of the past?",チェ・スミンさん、そのメッセージを見て、過去の記憶はどうよみがえりましたか。,崔秀敏女士，那条短信如何唤起了你的过去记忆？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지를 의심하는 질문이 왜 아프게 들립니까.","Ms. Song, why does a question that suspects your father sound painful to you?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様を疑う質問が、なぜ痛く聞こえるのですか。,宋多恩女士，质疑你父亲的问题为什么让你听起来如此刺痛？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨에게 상처 줄까 봐 삼킨 말이 무엇이었습니까.","Ms. Choi, what words did you swallow because you feared hurting Ms. Song?",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんを傷つけるのではないかと思って飲み込んだ言葉は何でしたか。,崔秀敏女士，因为怕伤害宋多恩女士，你吞下了哪些话？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지와 예비신랑 사이 돈 얘기를 듣고 무엇이 무너졌습니까.","Ms. Song, what fell apart when you heard about money between your father and your fiancé?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様と婚約者の間のお金の話を聞いて、何が崩れましたか。,宋多恩女士，听到父亲和未婚夫之间的钱的问题时，你心里什么崩塌了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v3].text,"두 분, 가족을 지키려는 마음이 서로에게 어떤 상처를 냈습니까.","Both of you, what wounds did the wish to protect family leave on each other?",お二人とも、家族を守ろうとする気持ちは、互いにどんな傷を残しましたか。,两位，想要保护家人的心情给彼此留下了怎样的伤害？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 다시 같은 장면을 본 두려움을 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the fear of seeing the same scene happen again.",チェ・スミンさん、同じ場面を再び見た怖さを説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明再次看到相同情形时的恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨 경고를 받아들이기 어려운 마음을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, tell us why it is hard to accept Ms. Choi's warning.",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんの警告を受け入れにくい気持ちを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说说你为什么难以接受崔秀敏女士的警告。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 과거 피해 기억이 이번 판단을 얼마나 밀어붙였습니까.","Ms. Choi, how much did the memory of past harm push this judgment forward?",チェ・スミンさん、過去の被害の記憶は、今回の判断をどの程度押し進めましたか。,崔秀敏女士，过去受害的记忆在多大程度上推动了这次判断？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 같은 문구가 반복된다는 말을 듣고 어떤 수치심이 생겼습니까.","Ms. Song, what shame came up when you heard that the same wording had repeated?",ソン・ダウンさん、同じ文言が繰り返されていると聞いて、どんな恥ずかしさが生じましたか。,宋多恩女士，听到同样措辞反复出现时，你产生了怎样的羞耻感？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v3].text,"두 분, 돈 문제를 말하는 순간 관계가 깨질까 봐 두려웠습니까.","Both of you, were you afraid the relationship would break the moment money came up?",お二人とも、お金の問題を口にした瞬間、関係が壊れるのではないかと怖かったのですか。,两位，一提到钱的问题，你们是否害怕关系会破裂？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨 아버지 이야기를 꺼내야 하는 고통을 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the pain of having to raise the matter of Ms. Song's father.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんのお父様の話を持ち出さなければならない苦しさを説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明不得不提起宋多恩父亲的痛苦。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지의 책임을 듣는 일이 왜 분노로 먼저 나왔습니까.","Ms. Song, why did hearing your father's responsibility come out first as anger?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の責任を聞くことが、なぜまず怒りとして出てきたのですか。,宋多恩女士，听到父亲的责任时，为什么最先表现为愤怒？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 보호하려는 침묵이 또 오해를 만든 사실을 받아들이십니까.","Ms. Choi, do you accept that the silence meant to protect her again created misunderstanding?",チェ・スミンさん、守るための沈黙がまた誤解を作った事実を受け入れますか。,崔秀敏女士，你是否接受为了保护而沉默，却再次造成误解这一事实？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 가족을 지키려다 최수민 씨 말을 밀어낸 점을 보십니까.","Ms. Song, do you see how trying to protect your family pushed away Ms. Choi's words?",ソン・ダウンさん、家族を守ろうとしてチェ・スミンさんの言葉を押しのけた点は見えていますか。,宋多恩女士，你是否看到自己为了保护家人而推开了崔秀敏女士的话？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v3].text,"두 분, 이번 돈 문제에서 서로에게 남긴 상처를 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell us the wounds this money issue left on each other.",お二人とも、今回のお金の問題で互いに残した傷を話してください。,两位，请说说这次钱的问题给彼此留下了哪些伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 비슷한 구조 앞에서 혼자 버틴 대가를 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Choi, how do you view the cost of enduring the same structure alone again?",チェ・スミンさん、似た構造の前で一人で耐えた代償をどう見ていますか。,崔秀敏女士，你如何看待自己在相似结构面前独自承受的代价？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-empathy_approach-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지의 문제와 본인 책임을 함께 볼 수 있습니까.","Ms. Song, can you look at your father's problem and your own responsibility together?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の問題とご自身の責任を一緒に見ることはできますか。,宋多恩女士，你能同时看见父亲的问题和自己的责任吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그 무렵 가족 쪽에서 돈 이야기가 오갔다는 사실을 언제 알았습니까.","Ms. Choi, when did you learn that money was being discussed on the family side around that time?",チェ・スミンさん、その頃、家族側でお金の話が出ていた事実をいつ知りましたか。,崔秀敏女士，你是什么时候知道那段时间家人那边谈到了钱？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지가 예비신랑에게 돈 얘기를 꺼낸 사실을 아셨습니까.","Ms. Song, did you know that your father had brought up money with your fiancé?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様が婚約者にお金の話を持ち出した事実を知っていましたか。,宋多恩女士，你知道你父亲曾向未婚夫提钱的事吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v3].text,"두 분, 돈 이야기가 나온 시점과 최수민 씨의 연락 시점을 나란히 정리하십시오.","Both of you, place the timing of the money talk and Ms. Choi's contact side by side.",お二人とも、お金の話が出た時点とチェ・スミンさんの連絡時点を並べて整理してください。,两位，请把钱的问题出现的时间点和崔秀敏女士联系的时间点并列整理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 현재 문자에서 어떤 문구가 과거를 떠올리게 했습니까.","Ms. Choi, which wording in the current texts reminded you of the past?",チェ・スミンさん、現在のメッセージのどの文言が過去を思い出させましたか。,崔秀敏女士，现在的短信中哪些措辞让你想起了过去？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 그 돈을 빌려 달라는 말이 결혼 준비와 어떻게 맞물렸습니까.","Ms. Song, how did the request to borrow that money connect with wedding preparations?",ソン・ダウンさん、そのお金を貸してほしいという言葉は、結婚準備とどう絡みましたか。,宋多恩女士，借那笔钱的话与婚礼准备是如何交织的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 현재의 돈을 빌려 달라는 말과 과거 경험이 닮았다고 본 근거를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you saw the current request to borrow money as resembling your past experience.",チェ・スミンさん、現在のお金を貸してほしいという話と過去の経験が似ていると見た根拠を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你认为当前借钱请求与过去经历相似的依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 부탁을 단순한 도움으로 본 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, why did you see your father's request as simple help?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の頼みを単なる助け合いと見た理由は何ですか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么把父亲的请求只看作普通帮忙？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v3].text,"두 분, 돈을 빌려 달라는 말과 경고 연락이 겹친 시점을 자료에 맞춰 말씀하십시오.","Both of you, match the point where the money request and the warning contact overlapped to the materials.",お二人とも、お金を貸してほしいという話と警告の連絡が重なった時点を、資料に沿って話してください。,两位，请根据资料说明借钱的话与警告联系重叠的时间点。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 예비신랑에게 경고해야 한다고 판단한 시점을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, state when you decided you had to warn the fiancé.",チェ・スミンさん、婚約者に警告しなければならないと判断した時点を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你是在什么时候判断必须警告未婚夫的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 문자와 최수민 씨 연락을 따로 본 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, explain why you viewed your father's text and Ms. Choi's contact separately.",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様のメッセージとチェ・スミンさんの連絡を別々に見た理由を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你为什么把父亲的短信和崔秀敏女士的联系分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 반복되는 돈을 빌려 달라는 말의 순서를 과거와 현재로 나눠 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, separate the repeated request to borrow money into past and present, and explain the order.",チェ・スミンさん、繰り返されたお金を貸してほしいという話の順序を、過去と現在に分けて説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请把反复出现的借钱请求按过去和现在分开说明顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 같은 문구가 반복된다는 자료를 어떻게 받아들이십니까.","Ms. Song, how do you receive the material showing the same wording repeated?",ソン・ダウンさん、同じ文言が繰り返されているという資料をどう受け止めますか。,宋多恩女士，你如何看待显示同样措辞重复出现的资料？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v3].text,"두 분, 현재 부탁이 과거 패턴과 겹치는 부분을 정리하십시오.","Both of you, organize where the current request overlaps with the past pattern.",お二人とも、現在の頼みが過去のパターンと重なる部分を整理してください。,两位，请整理当前请求与过去模式重叠的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 과거 경험이 이번 연락의 직접 근거였습니까.","Ms. Choi, was your past experience the direct basis for this contact?",チェ・スミンさん、過去の経験は今回の連絡の直接の根拠でしたか。,崔秀敏女士，过去经历是否是你这次联系的直接依据？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지의 돈을 요구한 흐름을 지금도 오해라고 보십니까.","Ms. Song, do you still see the flow of your father's money request as a misunderstanding?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様がお金を求めた流れを、今も誤解だと見ていますか。,宋多恩女士，你现在仍然认为父亲索要钱款的过程是误会吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 결혼을 앞둔 돈이 위험할 수 있다고 본 판단을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you judged that money before a wedding could be dangerous.",チェ・スミンさん、結婚を前にしたお金が危険になり得ると見た判断を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你为什么认为婚礼前的那笔钱可能有风险。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지의 반복 패턴이 드러난 뒤 책임을 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Song, how do you view responsibility after your father's repeated pattern was revealed?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の反復パターンが明らかになった後、責任をどう見ていますか。,宋多恩女士，父亲反复的模式显露后，你如何看待责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v3].text,"두 분, 가족 문제와 예비신랑 연락이 만난 지점을 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell us where the family problem and the contact with the fiancé met.",お二人とも、家族の問題と婚約者への連絡が交わった地点を話してください。,两位，请说明家庭问题和联系未婚夫这件事在哪里交汇。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 과거와 같은 흐름을 보고도 혼자 막으려 한 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, why did you try to stop it alone even after seeing the same flow as the past?",チェ・スミンさん、過去と同じ流れを見ても、なぜ一人で止めようとしたのですか。,崔秀敏女士，看到与过去相同的流程后，为什么仍想独自阻止？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-fact_pursuit-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 가족을 지키려는 마음이 사실 확인을 막았습니까.","Ms. Song, did the wish to protect your family block fact-checking?",ソン・ダウンさん、家族を守りたい気持ちが事実確認を妨げましたか。,宋多恩女士，保护家人的心情是否阻碍了事实确认？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그 돈 이야기가 단순한 부탁이 아니라고 느낀 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you feel that the money talk was not a simple request?",チェ・スミンさん、そのお金の話が単なる頼みではないと感じた理由は何ですか。,崔秀敏女士，你为什么觉得那笔钱的事并不是单纯请求？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 부탁을 의심하기 어려웠던 마음을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, tell us why it was hard to suspect your father's request.",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の頼みを疑いにくかった気持ちを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说说你为什么难以怀疑父亲的请求。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v3].text,"두 분, 가족과 결혼이 얽히며 판단이 흔들린 이유를 설명하십시오.","Both of you, explain why your judgment shook as family and marriage became intertwined.",お二人とも、家族と結婚が絡み合う中で判断が揺れた理由を説明してください。,两位，请说明家庭与婚姻交织时，你们判断动摇的原因。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 같은 흐름이 반복된다고 본 심리적 근거를 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, state the emotional basis for seeing the same flow repeated.",チェ・スミンさん、同じ流れが繰り返されていると見た心理的根拠を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你认为相同流程正在重复的心理依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 문제를 사건 밖으로 밀어낸 이유가 있습니까.","Ms. Song, was there a reason you pushed your father's issue outside the case?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の問題を事件の外へ押し出した理由はありますか。,宋多恩女士，你是否有理由把父亲的问题排除在案件之外？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 왜 이번에도 혼자 먼저 막아야 한다고 판단했습니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you decide that you had to block it alone again this time?",チェ・スミンさん、なぜ今回も一人で先に止めなければならないと判断したのですか。,崔秀敏女士，为什么你判断这一次也必须自己先挡住？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 돈을 빌려 달라는 말을 가족 간 도움으로만 보려 한 이유는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, why did you try to see the request for money only as help within the family?",ソン・ダウンさん、お金を貸してほしいという話を、なぜ家族内の助け合いとしてだけ見ようとしたのですか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么试图把借钱的话只看作家人之间的帮忙？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v3].text,"두 분, 돈 문제를 말하지 않거나 듣지 않은 이유를 각각 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, each explain why you did not speak of the money issue or did not hear it.",お二人とも、お金の問題を言わなかった理由、または聞かなかった理由をそれぞれ話してください。,两位，请分别说明为什么没有说出或没有听进钱的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 예비신랑에게 경고하면 송다은 씨가 상처받을 걸 알았습니까.","Ms. Choi, did you know Ms. Song would be hurt if you warned the fiancé?",チェ・スミンさん、婚約者に警告すればソン・ダウンさんが傷つくと分かっていましたか。,崔秀敏女士，你是否知道警告未婚夫会让宋多恩女士受伤？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지에게 불리한 자료를 왜 늦게 보려 하셨습니까.","Ms. Song, why did you delay looking at material unfavorable to your father?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様に不利な資料を、なぜ遅れて見ようとしたのですか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么迟迟不愿看对父亲不利的资料？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 반복 패턴을 알아보고도 왜 공개보다 우회를 택했습니까.","Ms. Choi, after recognizing the repeated pattern, why did you choose a detour over disclosure?",チェ・スミンさん、反復パターンに気づいていながら、なぜ公開より迂回を選んだのですか。,崔秀敏女士，认出反复模式后，为什么选择绕开而不是公开？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 같은 문구 앞에서도 왜 오해라는 결론을 지키려 했습니까.","Ms. Song, even before the same wording, why did you try to hold to the conclusion that it was a misunderstanding?",ソン・ダウンさん、同じ文言を前にしても、なぜ誤解だという結論を守ろうとしたのですか。,宋多恩女士，面对相同措辞，你为什么仍试图维持“这是误会”的结论？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v3].text,"두 분, 경고하려는 마음과 가족을 감싸는 마음이 어디서 부딪혔습니까.","Both of you, where did the wish to warn collide with the wish to shield family?",お二人とも、警告しようとする気持ちと家族をかばう気持ちは、どこでぶつかりましたか。,两位，想要警告的心情和想要维护家人的心情在哪里发生了冲突？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 과거 피해를 떠올린 순간의 판단을 설명해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the judgment you made the moment your past harm came back to you.",チェ・スミンさん、過去の被害を思い出した瞬間の判断を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明想起过去受害那一刻你做出的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지를 의심하지 않으려 한 마음을 솔직히 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, honestly tell us why you tried not to suspect your father.",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様を疑わないようにした気持ちを、率直に話してください。,宋多恩女士，请坦率说明你为什么不愿怀疑父亲。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 또 악역이 될 것을 알면서 혼자 막은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you stop it alone while knowing you would become the villain again?",チェ・スミンさん、また悪役になると分かっていて、なぜ一人で止めたのですか。,崔秀敏女士，明知自己会再次成为坏人，为什么仍然独自阻止？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 가족을 지키려다 다른 사람의 경고를 밀어낸 건 아닙니까.","Ms. Song, did you push away another person's warning while trying to protect your family?",ソン・ダウンさん、家族を守ろうとして、他人の警告を押しのけたのではありませんか。,宋多恩女士，你是否为了保护家人而推开了别人的警告？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v3].text,"두 분, 돈을 빌려 달라는 흐름이 반복됐다는 점을 인정한 뒤 각자 숨긴 이유를 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, after acknowledging that the request for money repeated, each state why you hid what you hid.",お二人とも、お金を貸してほしいという流れが繰り返されたことを認めたうえで、それぞれ隠した理由を話してください。,两位，请在承认借钱流程重复后，各自说明隐瞒的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 과거를 덮은 선택이 현재 경고를 더 거칠게 만들었습니까.","Ms. Choi, did your choice to cover up the past make the current warning harsher?",チェ・スミンさん、過去を覆った選択が、現在の警告をより荒くしましたか。,崔秀敏女士，掩盖过去的选择是否让这次警告变得更激烈？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-3_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-3|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-3-motive_search-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지의 책임과 본인의 단정을 어떻게 나누십니까.","Ms. Song, how do you separate your father's responsibility from your own conclusion?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の責任とご自身の断定を、どう分けますか。,宋多恩女士，你如何区分父亲的责任和你自己的断定？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 그때 돈 문제를 혼자 안고 있던 감정을 말해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, tell us what it felt like to carry that money problem alone back then.",チェ・スミンさん、あの時お金の問題を一人で抱えていた感情を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说说当时独自背负钱的问题时的感受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 손절당했다고 느낀 순간의 상처를 설명하십시오.","Ms. Song, explain the hurt you felt when you believed you had been cut off.",ソン・ダウンさん、絶交されたと感じた瞬間の傷を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你觉得自己被断交那一刻受到的伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v3].text,"두 분, 말하지 못한 사람과 듣지 못한 사람의 상처를 나눠 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, separate the hurt of the person who could not speak and the person who could not hear.",お二人とも、言えなかった人と聞けなかった人の傷を分けて話してください。,两位，请分别说明无法说出口的人和未能听见的人的伤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨 아버지 일을 꺼내기 어려웠던 마음은 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, what made it difficult to bring up Ms. Song's father's matter?",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんのお父様の件を持ち出しにくかった気持ちは何でしたか。,崔秀敏女士，是什么心情让你难以提起宋多恩父亲的事？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨가 멀어졌다고 느낀 두려움을 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, tell us about the fear you felt when Ms. Choi seemed to be pulling away.",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんが遠ざかったと感じた怖さを話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说说你感到崔秀敏女士疏远时的恐惧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 피해자인데도 숨은 사람으로 남은 고통을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the pain of being the victim yet remaining the one hidden away.",チェ・スミンさん、被害者でありながら隠れた人として残った苦しさを説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明明明是受害者却只能隐藏起来的痛苦。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 이야기가 나오자 왜 분노가 먼저 올라왔습니까.","Ms. Song, why did anger rise first when your father's story came up?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の話が出た時、なぜ怒りが先に上がったのですか。,宋多恩女士，父亲的事情被提起时，为什么愤怒最先涌上来？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v3].text,"두 분, 서로를 지키려다 서로를 잃은 지점을 말해 주십시오.","Both of you, tell us where trying to protect each other made you lose each other.",お二人とも、互いを守ろうとして互いを失った地点を話してください。,两位，请说说你们试图保护彼此却失去彼此的地方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨가 받을 충격을 떠올리며 참은 감정을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, tell us what you held back while thinking of the shock Ms. Song would feel.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんが受ける衝撃を思ってこらえた感情を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说说你想到宋多恩女士会受冲击而忍下的情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 배신으로 믿었던 시간이 지금 어떻게 느껴집니까.","Ms. Song, how does the time you believed it was betrayal feel to you now?",ソン・ダウンさん、裏切りだと信じていた時間は、今どう感じられますか。,宋多恩女士，那段你一直以为是背叛的时间，现在让你感觉如何？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 가장 아픈 사실을 평평하게 말하게 된 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you come to speak the most painful fact in such a flat voice?",チェ・スミンさん、いちばん痛い事実を淡々と話すようになった理由は何ですか。,崔秀敏女士，为什么你会用如此平静的方式说出最痛的事实？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨가 악역을 자처했다는 말이 어떻게 들립니까.","Ms. Song, how does it sound to hear that Ms. Choi chose to be the villain?",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんが悪役を引き受けたという言葉は、どう聞こえますか。,宋多恩女士，听到崔秀敏女士自愿承担坏人角色这句话，你是什么感受？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v3].text,"두 분, 보호라는 이름으로 생긴 상처를 각자 인정하십니까.","Both of you, do you each acknowledge the wounds created in the name of protection?",お二人とも、保護という名の下で生まれた傷を、それぞれ認めますか。,两位，你们是否都承认以保护之名造成的伤害？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 침묵이 송다은 씨에게 다른 상처가 된 사실을 보십니까.","Ms. Choi, do you see that your silence became a different wound for Ms. Song?",チェ・スミンさん、沈黙がソン・ダウンさんに別の傷となった事実は見えていますか。,崔秀敏女士，你是否看到沉默给宋多恩女士造成了另一种伤害？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 확인하지 않은 결론이 최수민 씨를 얼마나 밀어냈습니까.","Ms. Song, how far did your unchecked conclusion push Ms. Choi away?",ソン・ダウンさん、確認しない結論がチェ・スミンさんをどれほど遠ざけましたか。,宋多恩女士，未经确认的结论把崔秀敏女士推开了多远？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 침묵이 결국 더 큰 손해로 돌아온 순간을 언제 보셨습니까.","Ms. Choi, when did you see that your silence had finally returned as a greater loss?",チェ・スミンさん、沈黙が結局より大きな損失として戻った瞬間を、いつ見ましたか。,崔秀敏女士，你是什么时候发现沉默最终变成了更大的损失？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지를 지키려는 마음과 친구를 잃은 상처를 함께 보십니까.","Ms. Song, can you look at both the wish to protect your father and the hurt of losing a friend?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様を守りたい気持ちと友人を失った傷を、合わせて見ることはできますか。,宋多恩女士，你能同时看见想保护父亲的心情和失去朋友的伤吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v3].text,"두 분, 과거의 보호와 단정이 지금 관계에 남긴 값을 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, state the price that past protection and past conclusions have left on this relationship.",お二人とも、過去の保護と断定が、今の関係に残した代価を話してください。,两位，请说明过去的保护和定论给现在这段关系留下的代价。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 악역으로 남는 선택을 더는 반복하지 않겠다고 말할 수 있습니까.","Ms. Choi, can you say you will no longer repeat the choice to remain the villain?",チェ・スミンさん、悪役として残る選択をもう繰り返さないと言えますか。,崔秀敏女士，你能说自己不会再重复留下来当坏人的选择吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 감정의 압력을 인정하되 책임의 지점을 놓치지 않는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge acknowledges the emotional pressure without losing sight of responsibility. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は感情の圧力を認めつつ、責任の所在を見失わない。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官承认情绪压力，但不放过责任所在。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_empathy_approach_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|empathy_approach|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-empathy_approach-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨에게 묻지 않은 시간을 어떻게 책임지겠습니까.","Ms. Song, how will you take responsibility for the time you did not ask Ms. Choi?",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんに尋ねなかった時間をどう責任として受け止めますか。,宋多恩女士，对于那段没有询问崔秀敏女士的时间，你要如何负责？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 과거 손절 직전 돈 문제가 어떻게 시작됐습니까.","Ms. Choi, how did the money issue begin just before the old break?",チェ・スミンさん、過去の絶交直前、お金の問題はどのように始まりましたか。,崔秀敏女士，过去断交前的钱的问题是如何开始的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 그때 최수민 씨가 말한 돈 문제를 어떻게 이해했습니까.","Ms. Song, how did you understand the money issue Ms. Choi mentioned back then?",ソン・ダウンさん、その時チェ・スミンさんが話したお金の問題を、どう理解しましたか。,宋多恩女士，当时你是如何理解崔秀敏女士提到的钱的问题的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v3].text,"두 분, 손절로 이어진 마지막 대화를 시간순으로 정리하십시오.","Both of you, organize the last conversation that led to cutting ties in chronological order.",お二人とも、絶交につながった最後の会話を時系列で整理してください。,两位，请按时间顺序整理导致断交的最后一次对话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송금 기록이 생긴 경위를 사실대로 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, state truthfully how the transfer record came to exist.",チェ・スミンさん、送金記録ができた経緯を事実どおり話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请如实说明转账记录是如何产生的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨가 변심했다고 본 근거를 다시 말해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, state again the basis for believing Ms. Choi had changed.",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんが変わったと見た根拠をもう一度話してください。,宋多恩女士，请重新说明你认为崔秀敏女士变心的依据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 돈을 돌려받지 못한 뒤 왜 송다은 씨에게 말하지 못했습니까.","Ms. Choi, after you did not get the money back, why could you not tell Ms. Song?",チェ・スミンさん、お金を返してもらえなかった後、なぜソン・ダウンさんに言えなかったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，没能拿回钱之后，为什么你无法告诉宋多恩女士？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 확인하지 않고 변심으로 단정한 지점을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Song, explain where you concluded it was a change of heart without checking.",ソン・ダウンさん、確認しないまま心変わりだと断定した地点を説明してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你在哪个地方未经确认就断定是对方变心。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v3].text,"두 분, 말하지 않은 사실과 묻지 않은 사실을 나눠 정리하십시오.","Both of you, separate the facts that were not told from the facts that were not asked about.",お二人とも、言わなかった事実と尋ねなかった事実を分けて整理してください。,两位，请区分整理没有说出的事实和没有询问的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 아버지와의 돈 거래를 숨긴 기간을 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Choi, tell us how long you hid the money dealings with her father.",チェ・スミンさん、お父様とのお金のやり取りを隠していた期間を話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你隐瞒与她父亲之间金钱往来的时间有多长。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 손절의 이유를 돈 때문이라고만 본 과정이 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, what led you to see the reason for cutting ties only as money?",ソン・ダウンさん、絶交の理由をお金のためだとだけ見た過程は何でしたか。,宋多恩女士，你是如何把断交原因仅仅理解为钱的问题的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 과거 손절의 실제 원인이 투자 명목의 돈 피해였다는 말입니까.","Ms. Choi, are you saying the real cause of the old break was financial harm under the name of investment?",チェ・スミンさん、過去の絶交の実際の原因は投資名目のお金の被害だった、ということですか。,崔秀敏女士，你是说过去断交的真正原因，是以投资名义造成的金钱损害吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 송금 흐름의 출처가 손절 원인이라는 자료를 어떻게 보십니까.","Ms. Song, how do you view the material showing the source of the transfers as the cause of the break?",ソン・ダウンさん、送金の流れの出所が絶交原因だという資料を、どう見ていますか。,宋多恩女士，你如何看待显示转账来源就是断交原因的资料？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v3].text,"두 분, 과거 송금과 침묵이 현재 오해로 이어진 순서를 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, state the sequence by which past transfers and silence led to the present misunderstanding.",お二人とも、過去の送金と沈黙が現在の誤解につながった順序を話してください。,两位，请说明过去转账与沉默如何按顺序导致了现在的误会。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨에게 아버지 일을 말하지 않은 선택을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain your choice not to tell Ms. Song about her father.",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんにお父様のことを話さなかった選択を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请解释你没有告诉宋多恩女士其父亲之事的选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨를 악역으로 본 기억을 다시 검토해 주십시오.","Ms. Song, reconsider your memory of seeing Ms. Choi as the villain.",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんを悪役として見た記憶を、もう一度検討してください。,宋多恩女士，请重新审视你把崔秀敏女士看作坏人的记忆。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 보호하려던 침묵이 왜 더 큰 낙인이 됐습니까.","Ms. Choi, why did the silence meant to protect her become a larger stigma?",チェ・スミンさん、守ろうとした沈黙が、なぜより大きな烙印になったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，为什么本想保护她的沉默变成了更大的污名？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지의 진실을 몰랐더라도 확인하지 않은 책임을 보십니까.","Ms. Song, even if you did not know the truth about your father, do you see your responsibility for not checking?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の真実を知らなかったとしても、確認しなかった責任は見えていますか。,宋多恩女士，即使你不知道父亲的真相，是否也看见自己没有确认的责任？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v3].text,"두 분, 과거 손절의 진짜 비용을 각자 어떻게 받아들이십니까.","Both of you, how do you each accept the true cost of the old break?",お二人とも、過去の絶交の本当の代価を、それぞれどう受け止めますか。,两位，你们各自如何接受过去断交的真实代价？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 스스로 악역이 된 선택을 지금도 보호라고 보십니까.","Ms. Choi, do you still see choosing to become the villain yourself as protection?",チェ・スミンさん、自ら悪役になった選択を、今も保護だと見ていますか。,崔秀敏女士，你现在仍然认为自己成为坏人的选择是一种保护吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 확인 가능한 사실과 시간순서를 먼저 고정한다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge first fixes the verifiable facts and chronology. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官はまず確認可能な事実と時系列を固定する。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官先固定可确认的事实和时间顺序。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_fact_pursuit_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|fact_pursuit|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-fact_pursuit-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨의 침묵을 변심으로 단정한 책임을 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, state your responsibility for deciding that Ms. Choi's silence meant she had changed.",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんの沈黙を心変わりだと断定した責任を話してください。,宋多恩女士，请说明你把崔秀敏女士的沉默断定为变心的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 돈 문제가 생겼을 때 왜 관계를 끊는 선택으로 갔습니까.","Ms. Choi, when the money problem arose, why did you move toward cutting off the relationship?",チェ・スミンさん、お金の問題が起きた時、なぜ関係を断つ選択に向かったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，钱的问题发生时，为什么你走向了切断关系的选择？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨가 달라졌다고 확신한 마음의 근거는 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, what was the emotional basis for being sure Ms. Choi had changed?",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんが変わったと確信した気持ちの根拠は何でしたか。,宋多恩女士，你确信崔秀敏女士变了的心理依据是什么？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v3].text,"두 분, 손절을 선택하거나 받아들인 이유를 각각 말씀하십시오.","Both of you, each state why you chose cutting ties or accepted it.",お二人とも、絶交を選んだ理由、または受け入れた理由をそれぞれ話してください。,两位，请分别说明你们选择断交或接受断交的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 설명하지 않으면 오해받을 걸 알면서 왜 멈췄습니까.","Ms. Choi, knowing you would be misunderstood without explanation, why did you stop?",チェ・スミンさん、説明しなければ誤解されると分かっていて、なぜ止まったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，明知不解释会被误解，为什么你还是停下了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 1 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 1.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 1を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 1 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_1_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|1].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-1-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨에게 끝까지 묻지 않은 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Song, why did you never ask Ms. Choi until the end?",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんに最後まで尋ねなかった理由は何ですか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么直到最后都没有问崔秀敏女士？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 송다은 씨가 아버지를 다르게 보게 될까 봐 두려웠습니까.","Ms. Choi, were you afraid Ms. Song would come to see her father differently?",チェ・スミンさん、ソン・ダウンさんがお父様を違って見るようになることが怖かったのですか。,崔秀敏女士，你是否害怕宋多恩女士会以不同眼光看待父亲？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 돈 문제를 듣고도 왜 상대 변심으로 결론냈습니까.","Ms. Song, after hearing the money issue, why did you still conclude the other person had changed?",ソン・ダウンさん、お金の問題を聞いても、なぜ相手の心変わりだと結論づけたのですか。,宋多恩女士，听到钱的问题之后，为什么仍然得出对方变心的结论？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v3].text,"두 분, 가족을 지키려는 마음과 친구를 믿는 마음이 어디서 끊겼습니까.","Both of you, where did the wish to protect family and the wish to trust a friend break apart?",お二人とも、家族を守りたい気持ちと友人を信じる気持ちは、どこで切れましたか。,两位，想保护家人的心情和信任朋友的心情在哪里断开了？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 피해를 말하는 대신 악역이 된 이유를 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why you became the villain instead of speaking about the harm.",チェ・スミンさん、被害を話す代わりに悪役になった理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你为什么没有说出受害，而是选择成为坏人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 2 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 2.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 2を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 2 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_2_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|2].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-2-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지 문제를 묻지 않은 선택이 편한 결론이었습니까.","Ms. Song, was choosing not to ask about your father's issue an easier conclusion?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様の問題を尋ねないという選択は、楽な結論でしたか。,宋多恩女士，不去询问父亲问题的选择，是否是更容易的结论？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 투자 명목의 피해를 말하면 송다은 씨가 무너진다고 본 이유가 무엇입니까.","Ms. Choi, why did you think Ms. Song would collapse if you spoke of the investment-related harm?",チェ・スミンさん、投資名目の被害を話せばソン・ダウンさんが崩れると見た理由は何ですか。,崔秀敏女士，你为什么认为如果说出投资名义造成的受害，宋多恩女士会崩溃？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨의 침묵을 왜 보호가 아니라 배신으로 읽었습니까.","Ms. Song, why did you read Ms. Choi's silence as betrayal rather than protection?",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんの沈黙を、なぜ保護ではなく裏切りとして読んだのですか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么把崔秀敏女士的沉默解读为背叛，而不是保护？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v3].text,"두 분, 말하지 않은 선의와 확인하지 않은 단정이 어떻게 겹쳤습니까.","Both of you, how did unspoken goodwill and unchecked conclusions overlap?",お二人とも、言わなかった善意と確認しなかった断定は、どう重なりましたか。,两位，未说出口的善意和未经确认的定论是如何重叠的？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 진실보다 송다은 씨의 상처를 먼저 본 판단을 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain the judgment that placed Ms. Song's hurt before the truth.",チェ・スミンさん、真実よりソン・ダウンさんの傷を先に見た判断を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明你把宋多恩女士的伤害置于真相之前的判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 3 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 3.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 3を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 3 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_3_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|3].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-3-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 아버지를 향한 믿음이 최수민 씨 말을 막았습니까.","Ms. Song, did your trust in your father block Ms. Choi's words?",ソン・ダウンさん、お父様への信頼が、チェ・スミンさんの言葉を妨げましたか。,宋多恩女士，对父亲的信任是否挡住了崔秀敏女士的话？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v1].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v1].text,"최수민 씨, 끝까지 숨긴 선택이 결국 누구를 보호했다고 보십니까.","Ms. Choi, who do you think was ultimately protected by your choice to hide it to the end?",チェ・スミンさん、最後まで隠した選択は、結局誰を守ったと思いますか。,崔秀敏女士，你认为自己隐瞒到底的选择，最终保护了谁？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v2].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v2].text,"송다은 씨, 모르는 채 상처받은 점과 단정한 책임을 함께 보십니까.","Ms. Song, can you look together at the hurt of not knowing and the responsibility of concluding?",ソン・ダウンさん、知らないまま傷ついた点と断定した責任を、合わせて見ることはできますか。,宋多恩女士，你能同时看见自己在不知情中受伤的部分，以及下定论的责任吗？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v3].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v3].text,"두 분, 과거 침묵이 현재 낙인을 만든 이유를 정면으로 말씀해 주십시오.","Both of you, face directly why past silence created the present stigma.",お二人とも、過去の沈黙が現在の烙印を作った理由を正面から話してください。,两位，请正面说明过去的沉默为什么造成了现在的污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v4].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v4].text,"최수민 씨, 악역을 자처한 방식이 반복된 이유를 설명하십시오.","Ms. Choi, explain why the pattern of making yourself the villain repeated.",チェ・スミンさん、悪役を自ら引き受けるやり方が繰り返された理由を説明してください。,崔秀敏女士，请说明为什么自愿承担坏人角色的方式反复出现。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v5].behaviorHint,재판관이 행동 뒤의 판단과 숨긴 이유를 좁혀 묻는다. depth 4 기준으로 질문 강도를 조절한다.,The judge narrows the question to the judgment behind the act and the reason that was hidden. Adjust the question intensity for depth 4.,裁判官は行動の裏にある判断と隠した理由へ問いを絞る。depth 4を基準に質問の強度を調整する。,法官把问题收束到行为背后的判断和隐藏的理由上。按 depth 4 调整提问强度。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_question_.entries_d-4_motive_search_4_.variants_judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_question].entries[d-4|motive_search|4].variants[judgeq-d-4-motive_search-4-v5].text,"송다은 씨, 최수민 씨를 잃게 만든 결론을 왜 그렇게 빨리 믿었습니까.","Ms. Song, why did you so quickly believe the conclusion that made you lose Ms. Choi?",ソン・ダウンさん、チェ・スミンさんを失わせた結論を、なぜそんなに早く信じたのですか。,宋多恩女士，你为什么那么快就相信了那个让你失去崔秀敏女士的结论？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v1].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v1].text,"김세라 씨, 들어오십시오. 단톡방에서 누가 먼저 낙인을 붙였는지 답하십시오.","Ms. Kim Se-ra, come in. Answer who first attached the stigma in the group chat.",キム・セラさん、入ってください。グループチャットで最初に烙印を押したのが誰か答えてください。,金世罗女士，请进来。请回答群聊里是谁先贴上了污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v2].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v2].text,김세라 씨를 즉시 소환합니다. 동조를 줄여 말하면 판단이 흐려집니다.,"Call Ms. Kim Se-ra immediately. If she downplays her agreement with it, the judgment will blur.",キム・セラさんを直ちに召喚します。同調を小さく言えば、判断が曇ります。,立即传唤金世罗女士。如果轻描淡写自己的附和，判断就会变得模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v3].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v3].text,"단톡방의 몰아세움은 핵심 쟁점입니다. 김세라 씨, 본인 역할까지 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","The group chat's pile-on is a central issue. Ms. Kim Se-ra, state your own role clearly as well.",グループチャットでの責め立ては核心争点です。キム・セラさん、ご自身の役割まで明確に話してください。,群聊里的围攻是核心争点。金世罗女士，请连你自己的角色也明确说清。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v4].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v4].text,"김세라 씨, 송다은 씨 편이라는 점과 증언의 사실을 분리해 답하십시오.","Ms. Kim Se-ra, separate the fact that you are on Ms. Song's side from the facts of your testimony.",キム・セラさん、ソン・ダウンさん側であることと証言の事実を分けて答えてください。,金世罗女士，请把你站在宋多恩女士一边这一点，与证言事实分开回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v5].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-1-hard-v5].text,"더는 전언으로 넘기지 않겠습니다. 김세라 씨, 단톡방 순서를 직접 말씀해 주십시오.","I will not leave this to hearsay any longer. Ms. Kim Se-ra, state the group chat sequence directly.",これ以上、伝聞で済ませません。キム・セラさん、グループチャットの順序を直接話してください。,不能再用传闻带过。金世罗女士，请直接说明群聊里的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v1].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v1].text,김세라 씨를 소환합니다. 본인이 동조한 부분까지 사실대로 말해야 합니다.,"Call Ms. Kim Se-ra. She must tell the truth, including the part where she joined in.",キム・セラさんを召喚します。ご本人が同調した部分まで、事実どおり話さなければなりません。,传唤金世罗女士。她必须如实说明，包括自己附和的部分。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v2].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v2].text,단톡방 최초 발언이 갈립니다. 김세라 씨의 직접 증언이 필요합니다.,The first statement in the group chat is disputed. We need Ms. Kim Se-ra's direct testimony.,グループチャットの最初の発言が食い違っています。キム・セラさんの直接証言が必要です。,群聊里的最初发言存在分歧。需要金世罗女士的直接证言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v3].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v3].text,"김세라 씨, 들어오십시오. 송다은 씨와 가까운 관계라도 순서를 말해야 합니다.","Ms. Kim Se-ra, come in. Even if you are close to Ms. Song, you must state the sequence.",キム・セラさん、入ってください。ソン・ダウンさんと親しい関係でも、順序は話さなければなりません。,金世罗女士，请进来。即使你与宋多恩女士关系亲近，也必须说明顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v4].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v4].text,김세라 씨 증언으로 단톡방의 공개 낙인 과정을 바로 확인하겠습니다.,"With Ms. Kim Se-ra's testimony, I will immediately confirm how the public stigma formed in the group chat.",キム・セラさんの証言で、グループチャットにおける公開の烙印の過程を直ちに確認します。,将通过金世罗女士的证言，立即确认群聊中公开污名形成的过程。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
