non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-1-mid-v5].text,김세라 씨를 부르겠습니다. 부끄러운 동조가 있었다면 그 부분도 말해야 합니다.,"I will call Ms. Kim Se-ra. If there was shameful agreement, she must say that part as well.",キム・セラさんを呼びます。恥ずべき同調があったなら、その部分も話さなければなりません。,我将传唤金世罗女士。如果有令人羞愧的附和，那部分也必须说出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
