non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v1].text,김세라 씨를 부르겠습니다. 단톡방에서 누가 먼저 말했는지 듣겠습니다.,I will call Ms. Kim Se-ra. We will hear who spoke first in the group chat.,キム・セラさんを呼びます。グループチャットで誰が先に話したのかを聞きます。,我将传唤金世罗女士。我们要听清群聊里是谁先开口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v2].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v2].text,김세라 씨의 증언으로 단톡방 분위기와 최초 발언을 확인하겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Kim Se-ra's testimony, I will confirm the group chat atmosphere and the first statement.",キム・セラさんの証言で、グループチャットの雰囲気と最初の発言を確認します。,将通过金世罗女士的证言确认群聊气氛和最初发言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v3].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v3].text,공통 친구 김세라 씨를 소환하겠습니다. 동조가 어떻게 번졌는지 보겠습니다.,"I will call the mutual friend, Ms. Kim Se-ra. We will see how the agreement with the accusation spread.",共通の友人キム・セラさんを召喚します。同調がどのように広がったのか見ます。,我将传唤共同朋友金世罗女士。我们要看附和是如何扩散的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v4].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v4].text,김세라 씨에게 묻겠습니다. 송다은 씨 발언 뒤 친구들이 어떻게 반응했습니까.,"I will ask Ms. Kim Se-ra. After Ms. Song's statement, how did the friends react?",キム・セラさんに尋ねます。ソン・ダウンさんの発言の後、友人たちはどう反応しましたか。,我将询问金世罗女士。宋多恩女士发言后，朋友们如何反应？,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v5].behaviorHint,김세라: 단톡방 분위기와 송다은의 최초 발언 경위를 아는 공통 친구 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=자신도 최수민을 비난하는 데 가담한 것이 부끄럽다.,Kim Se-ra: A mutual-friend witness who knows the group chat atmosphere and how Song Da-eun first framed the issue. hiddenAgenda=She is ashamed that she also joined in criticizing Choi Su-min.,キム・セラ：グループチャットの雰囲気とソン・ダウンの最初の発言の経緯を知る共通の友人証人。hiddenAgenda=自分もチェ・スミンを非難することに加わったのを恥じている。,金世罗：了解群聊气氛和宋多恩最初发言经过的共同朋友证人。hiddenAgenda=她也参与了指责崔秀敏，因此感到羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-1_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-1-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-1|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-1-soft-v5].text,김세라 씨를 통해 단톡방 분위기와 동조의 순서를 살피겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Kim Se-ra, I will examine the group chat atmosphere and the order of agreement.",キム・セラさんを通じて、グループチャットの雰囲気と同調の順序を見ます。,将通过金世罗女士审视群聊气氛和附和的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v1].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v1].text,"박준혁 씨, 들어오십시오. 예비신랑과의 직장 관계를 이유로 밝혀 주십시오.","Mr. Park Jun-hyeok, come in. Testify despite your workplace relationship with the fiancé.",パク・ジュンヒョクさん、入ってください。婚約者との職場関係があっても、明らかにしてください。,朴俊赫先生，请进来。即使与你和未婚夫的职场关系有关，也请说明事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v2].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v2].text,박준혁 씨를 즉시 소환합니다. 누가 먼저 접근했는지 명확히 답해야 합니다.,Call Mr. Park Jun-hyeok immediately. He must answer clearly who approached first.,パク・ジュンヒョクさんを直ちに召喚します。誰が先に接近したのか、明確に答えなければなりません。,立即传唤朴俊赫先生。他必须明确回答是谁先接近的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v3].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v3].text,"예비신랑의 첫 메시지가 핵심입니다. 박준혁 씨, 본 사실만 말씀해 주십시오.","The fiancé's first message is central. Mr. Park Jun-hyeok, state only what you saw.",婚約者の最初のメッセージが核心です。パク・ジュンヒョクさん、見た事実だけを話してください。,未婚夫的第一条信息是核心。朴俊赫先生，请只说你看到的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v4].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v4].text,"박준혁 씨, 불편한 증언이어도 예비신랑 연락의 선후관계에 필요한 사실을 빠짐없이 말씀해 주십시오.","Mr. Park Jun-hyeok, even if the testimony is uncomfortable, state every fact needed to establish the order of the fiancé's contact.",パク・ジュンヒョクさん、不都合な証言でも、婚約者の連絡の先後関係に必要な事実は漏れなく話してください。,朴俊赫先生，即使证言令人不适，也请完整说明判断未婚夫联系先后所需的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v5].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-2-hard-v5].text,"더는 추측으로 보지 않겠습니다. 박준혁 씨, 선후관계를 직접 증언하십시오.","I will no longer treat this as speculation. Mr. Park Jun-hyeok, testify directly to the order of events.",これ以上、推測として扱いません。パク・ジュンヒョクさん、先後関係を直接証言してください。,不能再当作推测处理。朴俊赫先生，请直接证言先后关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v1].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v1].text,박준혁 씨를 소환합니다. 직장 관계가 불편해도 사실은 분리해 말해야 합니다.,"Call Mr. Park Jun-hyeok. Even if the workplace relationship is uncomfortable, he must separate it from the facts.",パク・ジュンヒョクさんを召喚します。職場関係が不都合でも、事実は分けて話さなければなりません。,传唤朴俊赫先生。即使职场关系尴尬，也必须把它与事实分开说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v2].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v2].text,예비신랑의 접근이 쟁점입니다. 박준혁 씨의 직접 증언이 필요합니다.,The fiancé's approach is at issue. We need Mr. Park Jun-hyeok's direct testimony.,婚約者の接近が争点です。パク・ジュンヒョクさんの直接証言が必要です。,未婚夫的接近是争点。需要朴俊赫先生的直接证言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v3].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v3].text,"박준혁 씨, 들어오십시오. 대화의 선후가 뒤집혔는지 확인하겠습니다.","Mr. Park Jun-hyeok, come in. I will confirm whether the order of the conversation has been reversed.",パク・ジュンヒョクさん、入ってください。会話の先後が逆転しているのか確認します。,朴俊赫先生，请进来。我要确认对话的先后是否被颠倒了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v4].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v4].text,박준혁 씨 증언으로 예비신랑 연락의 선후관계를 더 미루지 않고 보겠습니다.,"With Mr. Park Jun-hyeok's testimony, I will not delay reviewing the order of the fiancé's contact any longer.",パク・ジュンヒョクさんの証言で、婚約者の連絡の先後関係をこれ以上先送りせず確認します。,将通过朴俊赫先生的证言，不再拖延对未婚夫联系先后的审视。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v5].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-2-mid-v5].text,박준혁 씨를 부르겠습니다. 조심스러운 태도보다 본 사실이 중요합니다.,I will call Mr. Park Jun-hyeok. What he saw matters more than a cautious attitude.,パク・ジュンヒョクさんを呼びます。慎重な態度より、見た事実が重要です。,我将传唤朴俊赫先生。相比谨慎态度，他看到的事实更重要。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v1].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v1].text,박준혁 씨를 부르겠습니다. 예비신랑의 첫 접근을 사실로 가리겠습니다.,I will call Mr. Park Jun-hyeok. We will determine the fiancé's first approach from the facts.,パク・ジュンヒョクさんを呼びます。婚約者の最初の接近を事実で見極めます。,我将传唤朴俊赫先生。我们将以事实判明未婚夫的第一次接近。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v2].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v2].text,박준혁 씨 증언으로 예비신랑의 평소 행동과 메시지 경위를 듣겠습니다.,"Through Mr. Park Jun-hyeok's testimony, we will hear the fiancé's usual behavior and how the messages arose.",パク・ジュンヒョクさんの証言で、婚約者の普段の行動とメッセージの経緯を聞きます。,将通过朴俊赫先生的证言，了解未婚夫平时的行为和信息往来经过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v3].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v3].text,회사 후배 박준혁 씨를 소환하겠습니다. 선을 넘은 대화의 배경을 보겠습니다.,"I will call Mr. Park Jun-hyeok, a junior colleague. We will examine the background to the conversation that crossed the line.",会社の後輩パク・ジュンヒョクさんを召喚します。線を越えた会話の背景を見ます。,我将传唤公司后辈朴俊赫先生。我们要看越界对话的背景。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v4].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v4].text,박준혁 씨에게 묻겠습니다. 직장 관계와 별개로 본 사실만 말해 주십시오.,"I will ask Mr. Park Jun-hyeok. Apart from the workplace relationship, state only what you saw.",パク・ジュンヒョクさんに尋ねます。職場関係とは別に、見た事実だけを話してください。,我将询问朴俊赫先生。请撇开职场关系，只说你看到的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v5].behaviorHint,박준혁: 예비신랑의 행동 패턴을 아는 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=예비신랑과의 직장 관계가 불편해질까 봐 조심한다.,Park Jun-hyeok: A third-party witness who knows the fiancé's behavior pattern. hiddenAgenda=He is cautious because his workplace relationship with the fiancé may become uncomfortable.,パク・ジュンヒョク：婚約者の行動パターンを知る第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=婚約者との職場関係が気まずくなることを恐れて慎重になっている。,朴俊赫：了解未婚夫行为模式的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=担心与未婚夫的职场关系变得尴尬，因此很谨慎。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-2_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-2-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-2|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-2-soft-v5].text,박준혁 씨를 통해 예비신랑 연락의 선후관계를 차분히 확인하겠습니다.,"Through Mr. Park Jun-hyeok, I will calmly confirm the order of the fiancé's contact.",パク・ジュンヒョクさんを通じて、婚約者の連絡の先後関係を落ち着いて確認します。,将通过朴俊赫先生冷静确认未婚夫联系的先后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v1].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v1].text,"오미경 씨, 들어오십시오. 과거 돈 거래와 손절 원인을 명확히 말씀해 주십시오.","Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong, come in. State clearly the past money dealings and the cause of the break.",オ・ミギョンさん、入ってください。過去のお金のやり取りと絶交の原因を明確に話してください。,吴美京女士，请进来。请明确说明过去的金钱往来和断交原因。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v2].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v2].text,오미경 씨를 즉시 소환합니다. 친분보다 목격한 사실이 판단 기준입니다.,"Call Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong immediately. Judgment rests on what she witnessed, not on closeness.",オ・ミギョンさんを直ちに召喚します。親しさではなく、目撃した事実が判断基準です。,立即传唤吴美京女士。判断依据是她目击的事实，而不是亲近关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v3].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v3].text,"과거 투자 명목 피해와 침묵이 핵심입니다. 오미경 씨, 본 장면을 빠짐없이 답하십시오.","The past investment-related harm and silence are central. Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong, answer fully about the scene you saw.",過去の投資名目の被害と沈黙が核心です。オ・ミギョンさん、見た場面を漏れなく答えてください。,过去以投资名义造成的损害和沉默是核心。吴美京女士，请完整回答你看到的场面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v4].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v4].text,"오미경 씨, 최수민 씨 편이라는 시선을 넘어 사실만 증언해야 합니다.","Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong, you must testify only to facts, beyond the impression that you are on Ms. Choi's side.",オ・ミギョンさん、チェ・スミンさん側だという視線を越えて、事実だけを証言しなければなりません。,吴美京女士，请超越“站在崔秀敏女士一边”的视线，只证言事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v5].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_hard_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-hard-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|hard].variants[judgewitness-w-3-hard-v5].text,"더는 과거 손절을 추측으로 두지 않겠습니다. 오미경 씨, 직접 말씀해 주십시오.","I will not leave the old break to speculation any longer. Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong, speak directly.",過去の絶交をこれ以上推測のままにはしません。オ・ミギョンさん、直接話してください。,不能再让过去断交停留在推测中。吴美京女士，请直接说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v1].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v1].text,오미경 씨를 소환합니다. 송다은 씨 아버지와 최수민 씨 사이 돈 거래를 듣겠습니다.,Call Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong. We will hear about the money dealings between Ms. Song's father and Ms. Choi.,オ・ミギョンさんを召喚します。ソン・ダウンさんのお父様とチェ・スミンさんの間のお金のやり取りを聞きます。,传唤吴美京女士。我们将听取宋多恩女士父亲与崔秀敏女士之间的金钱往来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
