non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v2].text,과거 손절의 원인이 갈립니다. 오미경 씨의 직접 증언이 필요합니다.,The cause of the old break is disputed. We need Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong's direct testimony.,過去の絶交の原因が食い違っています。オ・ミギョンさんの直接証言が必要です。,过去断交的原因存在分歧。需要吴美京女士的直接证言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v3].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v3].text,"오미경 씨, 들어오십시오. 최수민 씨가 울며 찾아온 경위를 말해 주십시오.","Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong, come in. Tell us how Ms. Choi came to you in tears.",オ・ミギョンさん、入ってください。チェ・スミンさんが泣きながら訪ねてきた経緯を話してください。,吴美京女士，请进来。请说明崔秀敏女士哭着来找你的经过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v4].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v4].text,오미경 씨 증언으로 투자 명목 피해와 침묵의 이유를 보겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong's testimony, we will examine the investment-related harm and the reason for the silence.",オ・ミギョンさんの証言で、投資名目の被害と沈黙の理由を見ます。,将通过吴美京女士的证言审视以投资名义造成的损害和沉默理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v5].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_mid_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-mid-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|mid].variants[judgewitness-w-3-mid-v5].text,오미경 씨를 부르겠습니다. 정은 있더라도 본 사실을 기준으로 말해야 합니다.,"I will call Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong. Even if she has affection for Ms. Choi, she must speak based on what she saw.",オ・ミギョンさんを呼びます。情があっても、見た事実を基準に話さなければなりません。,我将传唤吴美京女士。即使有情分，也必须以所见事实为准发言。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v1].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v1].text,오미경 씨를 부르겠습니다. 과거 돈 거래를 본 내용을 듣겠습니다.,I will call Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong. We will hear what she saw of the past money dealings.,オ・ミギョンさんを呼びます。過去のお金のやり取りについて見た内容を聞きます。,我将传唤吴美京女士。我们将听取她所见的过去金钱往来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v2].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v2].text,오미경 씨 증언으로 손절 전 돈 문제가 실제 있었는지 살피겠습니다.,"With Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong's testimony, we will examine whether there truly was a money issue before the break.",オ・ミギョンさんの証言で、絶交前のお金の問題が実際にあったのかを見ます。,将通过吴美京女士的证言审视断交前是否确实存在钱的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v3].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v3].text,분식집 사장 오미경 씨를 소환하겠습니다. 과거 송금 전후의 장면을 보겠습니다.,"I will call Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong, the snack shop owner. We will examine the scene before and after the past transfer.",軽食店の店主オ・ミギョンさんを召喚します。過去の送金前後の場面を見ます。,我将传唤小吃店老板吴美京女士。我们要看过去转账前后的场面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v4].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v4].text,오미경 씨에게 묻겠습니다. 최수민 씨와 가까워도 본 사실만 말해 주십시오.,"I will ask Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong. Even if she is close to Ms. Choi, she must state only what she saw.",オ・ミギョンさんに尋ねます。チェ・スミンさんと近しくても、見た事実だけを話してください。,我将询问吴美京女士。即使她与崔秀敏女士关系亲近，也请只说所见事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v5].behaviorHint,오미경: 과거 송다은 아버지와 최수민 사이의 돈 거래를 목격한 제3자 증인이다. hiddenAgenda=없음.,Oh Mi-gyeong: A third-party witness who saw the past money dealings between Song Da-eun's father and Choi Su-min. hiddenAgenda=None.,オ・ミギョン：過去にソン・ダウンの父とチェ・スミンの間のお金のやり取りを目撃した第三者証人。hiddenAgenda=なし。,吴美京：目击过宋多恩父亲与崔秀敏之间过去金钱往来的第三方证人。hiddenAgenda=无。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_judge_witness_summon_.entries_w-3_soft_.variants_judgewitness-w-3-soft-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[judge_witness_summon].entries[w-3|soft].variants[judgewitness-w-3-soft-v5].text,오미경 씨를 통해 과거 손절 원인을 차분히 확인하겠습니다.,"Through Ms. Oh Mi-gyeong, I will calmly confirm the cause of the old break.",オ・ミギョンさんを通じて、過去の絶交原因を落ち着いて確認します。,将通过吴美京女士冷静确认过去断交的原因。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v1].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v1].text,조건부로 가려면 수민이가 왜 저에게 직접 말하지 않았는지부터 명확히 해야 합니다. 그래야 제 공개 책임도 제대로 받아들이겠습니다.,"If we go with conditions, we first need to make clear why Su-min did not tell me directly. Only then can I fully accept my responsibility for making it public.",条件付きで進めるなら、スミンがなぜ私に直接言わなかったのかを先に明らかにする必要があります。そうして初めて、私の公開した責任もきちんと受け入れられます。,如果要走附条件的处理，必须先弄清秀敏为什么没有直接告诉我。这样我才能真正接受自己公开的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v10].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v10].text,조건을 붙여 마무리하려면 서로의 잘못을 분리해야 합니다. 제 공개와 수민이의 침묵을 한쪽으로만 몰면 안 됩니다.,"To finish this with conditions, we have to separate each person's fault. My public disclosure and Su-min's silence cannot be pushed all to one side.",条件を付けて終えるなら、互いの過ちを分けなければなりません。私の公開とスミンの沈黙を、どちらか一方だけに押しつけてはいけません。,如果要附条件收尾，就必须区分彼此的过错。不能把我的公开和秀敏的沉默都推到某一边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v2].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v2].text,"저도 조건을 받아들일 수 있습니다. 대신 연락이 경고였다는 말만으로 끝내지 말고, 그 경고를 왜 제 밖으로 돌렸는지 밝혀야 합니다.",I can accept conditions too. But we cannot end by simply saying the contact was a warning; we need to know why that warning went around me.,私も条件は受け入れられます。ただ、連絡が警告だったという言葉だけで終わらせず、その警告をなぜ私の外へ回したのか明らかにする必要があります。,我也可以接受条件。但不能只用“那是警告”来结束，必须弄清为什么那个警告绕开了我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v3].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v3].text,"조건을 붙인다면 먼저 순서를 세워야 합니다. 제가 단정한 책임을 인정하되, 수민이가 침묵으로 키운 오해도 함께 적어야 합니다.","If conditions are attached, the order must come first. I will admit responsibility for my conclusion, but the misunderstanding Su-min's silence enlarged must be written down as well.",条件を付けるなら、まず順序を立てるべきです。私が断定した責任は認めますが、スミンの沈黙が大きくした誤解も一緒に記録しなければなりません。,如果要附条件，必须先理清顺序。我承认自己下定论的责任，但秀敏的沉默扩大了误会，这一点也必须写进去。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v4].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v4].text,저는 사과와 정정까지 생각할 수 있습니다. 다만 수민이가 또 혼자 막겠다는 식으로 끝나면 같은 일이 반복됩니다.,"I can consider an apology and a correction. But if this ends with Su-min trying to block everything alone again, the same thing will repeat.",謝罪と訂正まで考えられます。ただ、スミンがまた一人で止めるという形で終わるなら、同じことが繰り返されます。,我可以考虑道歉和更正。但如果最后还是秀敏又想独自挡住一切，同样的事还会重演。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v5].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v5].text,조건부 해결이라면 제가 단톡방 일을 정리하겠습니다. 대신 수민이도 예비신랑에게 간 이유와 방식을 차분히 설명해야 합니다.,"If this is a conditional resolution, I will address the group chat. In return, Su-min must calmly explain why and how she went to the fiancé.",条件付きの解決なら、グループチャットの件は私が整理します。その代わり、スミンもなぜ婚約者に行ったのか、その理由と方法を落ち着いて説明しなければなりません。,如果是附条件解决，我会整理群聊的事。但秀敏也必须冷静说明她为什么找未婚夫，以及采取那种方式的理由。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v6].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v6].text,받아들이겠습니다. 하지만 아버지 얘기만 제 책임으로 남기고 수민이의 우회 연락을 선의로만 정리하면 저는 납득하기 어렵습니다.,"I will accept it. But if only my father's issue remains as my responsibility and Su-min's indirect contact is treated only as goodwill, I cannot accept that.",受け入れます。ただ、お父さんの話だけが私の責任として残り、スミンの迂回連絡が善意だけで整理されるなら、私は納得しにくいです。,我会接受。但如果只把父亲的问题留作我的责任，而把秀敏绕开的联系只归为善意，我很难接受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v7].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v7].text,조건을 세운다면 공개 정정은 할 수 있습니다. 대신 수민이가 왜 저를 건너뛰었는지는 끝까지 따져야 합니다.,"If conditions are set, I can make a public correction. But why Su-min bypassed me must be examined to the end.",条件を立てるなら、公開の訂正はできます。ただ、スミンがなぜ私を飛ばしたのかは最後まで問うべきです。,如果设定条件，我可以公开更正。但秀敏为什么绕过我，必须追问到底。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v8].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v8].text,조건부라면 제 성급한 단정은 인정하겠습니다. 다만 수민이도 보호라는 말 뒤에 숨어 같은 구조를 만들었다는 점을 봐야 합니다.,"If this is conditional, I will admit my hasty conclusion. But we must also see that Su-min hid behind the word protection and created the same structure again.",条件付きなら、私の早すぎた断定は認めます。ただ、スミンも保護という言葉の後ろに隠れて同じ構図を作った点を見る必要があります。,如果是附条件处理，我承认自己仓促下定论。但也必须看到秀敏躲在“保护”这个说法后面，又制造了同样的结构。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v9].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_a_.variants_mediation-conditional-a-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|a].variants[mediation-conditional-a-v9].text,제가 먼저 낙인찍은 건 조건 없이 인정할 수 있습니다. 그래도 수민이에게도 다시는 혼자 버티지 않는 조건이 필요합니다.,"I can admit without condition that I was the first to stigmatize her. Even so, Su-min also needs a condition that she will not endure things alone again.",私が先に烙印を押したことは、条件なしに認められます。それでもスミンにも、二度と一人で耐えないという条件が必要です。,我可以无条件承认是我先贴上污名。但秀敏也需要一个条件：不能再独自硬撑。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v1].text,조건부로 가는 건 괜찮습니다. 대신 다은이가 확인 없이 제 이름을 사람들 앞에 올린 일부터 정정해야 제가 더 말할 수 있습니다.,I am fine with going conditional. But first Da-eun must correct the fact that she put my name before people without checking; only then can I say more.,条件付きで進むのは構いません。ただ、ダウンが確認もせず私の名前を人前に出したことから訂正してくれなければ、私はこれ以上話せません。,走附条件处理可以。但多恩必须先更正她没有确认就把我的名字摆到众人面前这件事，我才能继续说下去。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v10].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v10].text,조건부라면 저는 더 숨기지 않겠습니다. 그 대신 경고였다는 이유를 집착으로 다시 덮지 않는 조건이 필요합니다.,"If this is conditional, I will not hide any more. In return, I need a condition that the reason of warning will not be covered over again as obsession.",条件付きなら、私はもう隠しません。その代わり、警告だったという理由をまた執着で覆わないという条件が必要です。,如果是附条件，我不会再隐瞒。相应地，需要一个条件：不能再把“那是警告”的理由盖成执着。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v2].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v2].text,조건을 붙인다면 좋습니다. 다만 예비신랑 쪽 대화와 돈 부탁 흐름을 먼저 세워야 연락 의도도 제대로 판단됩니다.,"Conditions are fine. But the conversation from the fiancé's side and the flow of the money request must be set out first, so the intent of my contact can be judged properly.",条件を付けるなら構いません。ただ、婚約者側の会話とお金の頼みの流れを先に立ててこそ、連絡の意図も正しく判断できます。,附条件可以。但必须先理清未婚夫那边的对话和借钱请求的流程，才能正确判断我联系的意图。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v3].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v3].text,"저도 조건을 받아들이겠습니다. 대신 제 침묵만 문제 삼기 전에, 왜 다은이에게 바로 말할 수 없었는지 들어 주셔야 합니다.","I will accept conditions too. But before making only my silence the problem, you need to hear why I could not tell Da-eun right away.",私も条件を受け入れます。ただ、私の沈黙だけを問題にする前に、なぜダウンにすぐ言えなかったのか聞いていただく必要があります。,我也接受条件。但在只追究我的沉默之前，必须先听我为什么无法立刻告诉多恩。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v4].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v4].text,조건부 해결이라면 저는 연락 방식의 책임을 인정하겠습니다. 대신 다은이도 집착이라는 낙인을 거두는 조치를 해야 합니다.,"If this is a conditional resolution, I will admit responsibility for the way I contacted him. In return, Da-eun must take action to withdraw the stigma of obsession.",条件付きの解決なら、私は連絡の方法の責任を認めます。その代わり、ダウンも執着という烙印を取り下げる措置を取るべきです。,如果是附条件解决，我承认联系方式上的责任。但多恩也必须采取措施，撤回“执着”这个污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v5].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v5].text,받아들이겠습니다. 다만 아버지의 돈 접근과 과거 손절 이유를 덮은 채로 사과만 요구하면 또 같은 오해가 남습니다.,"I will accept it. But if you demand only an apology while covering over the father's money approach and the reason for the old break, the same misunderstanding will remain.",受け入れます。ただ、お父さんの金銭接近と過去の絶交理由を覆ったまま謝罪だけを求めるなら、また同じ誤解が残ります。,我会接受。但如果遮盖父亲接近钱财和过去断交的原因，只要求道歉，同样的误会还会留下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v6].text,"조건을 세우려면 먼저 사실 순서가 필요합니다. 누가 먼저 선을 흐렸고, 누가 먼저 공개했는지를 같이 봐주십시오.","To set conditions, the order of facts must come first. Please look together at who blurred the line first and who made it public first.",条件を立てるには、まず事実の順序が必要です。誰が先に線を曖昧にし、誰が先に公開したのかを一緒に見てください。,要设定条件，必须先有事实顺序。请同时看清是谁先模糊了界线，又是谁先公开了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v7].text,저는 조건부로 사과할 수 있습니다. 연락을 반복한 방식은 제 책임입니다. 대신 다은이도 확인 없이 단정한 책임을 인정해야 합니다.,I can apologize conditionally. The repeated contact was my responsibility. But Da-eun must also admit responsibility for concluding without checking.,私は条件付きで謝れます。連絡を繰り返した方法は私の責任です。その代わり、ダウンも確認なしに断定した責任を認めるべきです。,我可以附条件道歉。反复联系的方式是我的责任。但多恩也必须承认未经确认就下定论的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v8].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v8].text,조건을 붙여도 됩니다. 다만 제가 악역으로 남아야 했던 이유까지 열어야 그 조건이 오래갑니다.,You may attach conditions. But those conditions will last only if they also open up why I had to remain the villain.,条件を付けても構いません。ただ、私が悪役として残らなければならなかった理由まで開いてこそ、その条件は長く続きます。,可以附条件。但只有把我为什么必须留下来当坏人的原因也揭开，这些条件才会持久。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v9].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_conditional_b_.variants_mediation-conditional-b-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[conditional|b].variants[mediation-conditional-b-v9].text,"저도 마무리를 원합니다. 대신 다은이가 제 침묵만 보지 말고, 자신이 만든 공개 낙인까지 바로잡아야 합니다.",I also want this to end. But Da-eun must not look only at my silence; she must also correct the public stigma she created.,私も終わらせたいです。ただ、ダウンは私の沈黙だけを見るのではなく、自分が作った公開の烙印まで正さなければなりません。,我也想收尾。但多恩不能只看我的沉默，也必须纠正她制造的公开污名。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v1].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v1].text,"사실부터 보겠습니다. 연락 횟수, 예비신랑 쪽 대화, 제가 사람들 앞에 올린 순서까지 먼저 맞춰야 합니다.","Let's look at the facts first: the number of contacts, the fiancé-side conversation, and the order in which I posted it in front of people.",まず事実を見ます。連絡回数、婚約者側の会話、私が人前に出した順序まで、先に合わせるべきです。,先看事实吧。联系次数、未婚夫那边的对话，以及我在人前公开的顺序，都必须先对齐。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v10].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v10].text,사실을 먼저 세워 주십시오. 저는 제 해석을 나중에 붙이겠습니다. 먼저 순서와 기록을 봐야 합니다.,Please establish the facts first. I will attach my interpretation later. We need to see the sequence and the records first.,事実を先に立ててください。私の解釈は後から付けます。まず順序と記録を見るべきです。,请先确立事实。我的解读可以之后再说。必须先看顺序和记录。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v2].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v2].text,그렇게 가는 게 낫습니다. 감정부터 말하면 제가 또 결론을 낼 것 같습니다. 자료 순서대로 봐주십시오.,"That way is better. If we start with emotions, I think I will reach a conclusion again. Please look at the materials in order.",そのほうがよいです。感情から話すと、私はまた結論を出してしまいそうです。資料の順序どおりに見てください。,这样更好。如果先谈情绪，我可能又会先得出结论。请按资料顺序看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v3].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v3].text,사실을 먼저 세우겠습니다. 다만 아버지 얘기까지 한꺼번에 밀어 넣으면 저는 또 방어부터 할 수 있습니다.,"I will set out the facts first. But if my father's issue is pushed in all at once, I may start defending myself again.",事実を先に立てます。ただ、お父さんの話まで一度に押し込まれると、私はまた防御から入るかもしれません。,我会先摆事实。但如果把父亲的问题也一下子塞进来，我可能又会先开始防御。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v4].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v4].text,저도 사실부터 보는 데 동의합니다. 수민이 연락이 왜 이어졌는지와 제가 언제 공개했는지를 나눠 봐야 합니다.,I agree that we should start with facts. We need to separate why Su-min's contact continued from when I made it public.,私も事実から見ることに同意します。スミンの連絡がなぜ続いたのかと、私がいつ公開したのかを分けて見るべきです。,我也同意先看事实。必须分开看秀敏的联系为什么持续，以及我是在什么时候公开的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v5].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v5].text,"먼저 자료를 보겠습니다. 제가 본 기록이 전부였는지, 그 앞뒤에 무엇이 있었는지 확인해야 합니다.","I will look at the materials first. I need to confirm whether the record I saw was all there was, and what came before and after it.",先に資料を見ます。私が見た記録がすべてだったのか、その前後に何があったのか確認しなければなりません。,我先看资料。必须确认我看到的记录是否就是全部，以及前后还有什么。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v6].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v6].text,사실 순서가 필요합니다. 제가 단정한 순간과 수민이가 숨긴 이유를 섞지 말고 차례대로 봐주십시오.,We need the order of facts. Please do not mix the moment I concluded with Su-min's reasons for hiding; look at them one by one.,事実の順序が必要です。私が断定した瞬間とスミンが隠した理由を混ぜず、順番に見てください。,需要事实顺序。请不要把我下定论的瞬间和秀敏隐瞒的理由混在一起，请逐一看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v7].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v7].text,"감정으로는 더 못 갑니다. 연락 기록과 단톡방 시작점, 예비신랑 메시지를 먼저 놓고 말하겠습니다.","We cannot go any further on emotion. I will speak after we first place the contact log, the group chat starting point, and the fiancé's messages.",感情だけではこれ以上進めません。連絡記録とグループチャットの始点、婚約者のメッセージを先に置いてから話します。,不能再靠情绪往下走。请先摆出联系记录、群聊起点和未婚夫的信息，我再说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v8].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v8].text,"저도 사실부터 정리하겠습니다. 그래야 제가 어디서 틀렸는지, 어디까지는 이해받을 수 있는지 볼 수 있습니다.",I will organize the facts too. Only then can I see where I was wrong and how far I can be understood.,私も事実から整理します。そうしてこそ、自分がどこで間違ったのか、どこまでは理解され得るのか見えます。,我也会先整理事实。这样才能看清我错在哪里，哪些地方还能被理解。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v9].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_a_.variants_mediation-fact_first-a-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|a].variants[mediation-fact_first-a-v9].text,"그 방식이 낫습니다. 아버지 문제는 무섭지만, 자료가 먼저 놓이면 제가 피할 명분도 줄어듭니다.","That method is better. My father's issue is frightening, but once the materials are placed first, I will have fewer excuses to avoid it.",その方法がよいです。お父さんの問題は怖いですが、資料が先に置かれれば、私が避ける口実も減ります。,这种方式更好。父亲的问题让我害怕，但资料先摆出来，我逃避的理由也会减少。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v1].text,"사실부터 가겠습니다. 연락 기록만 보지 말고, 예비신랑 쪽 대화와 돈 부탁 흐름을 같은 순서에 놓아야 합니다.",Let's start with the facts. Do not look only at the contact log; the fiancé-side conversation and the money-request flow must be placed in the same sequence.,事実から進みます。連絡記録だけを見ず、婚約者側の会話とお金の頼みの流れを同じ順序に置くべきです。,先从事实开始。不要只看联系记录，未婚夫那边的对话和借钱请求的流程也必须放在同一顺序里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v10].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v10].text,"좋습니다. 연락 기록, 예비신랑 메시지, 과거 돈 문제, 단톡방 순서까지 차례대로 보겠습니다.","Good. We will look in order at the contact log, the fiancé's messages, the past money issue, and the group chat sequence.",よいです。連絡記録、婚約者のメッセージ、過去のお金の問題、グループチャットの順序まで、順番に見ます。,好。联系记录、未婚夫的信息、过去的钱的问题、群聊顺序，都按顺序看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v2].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v2].text,동의합니다. 제 감정보다 기록이 먼저입니다. 그래야 제가 왜 우회했는지 설명할 수 있습니다.,I agree. The record comes before my feelings. Only then can I explain why I took the indirect route.,同意します。私の感情より記録が先です。そうしてこそ、私がなぜ迂回したのか説明できます。,我同意。记录先于我的情绪。这样我才能解释为什么我选择绕开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v3].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v3].text,"사실을 먼저 보겠습니다. 연락 횟수, 메시지 문구, 과거 송금 흐름이 붙어야 제 의도가 보입니다.","I will look at the facts first. The number of contacts, message wording, and past transfer flow must be connected for my intent to be seen.",事実を先に見ます。連絡回数、メッセージの文言、過去の送金の流れがつながってこそ、私の意図が見えます。,我会先看事实。联系次数、信息措辞、过去转账流程必须连起来，才能看见我的意图。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v4].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v4].text,그렇게 해주십시오. 제가 한 말보다 자료가 먼저 나와야 다은이도 덜 방어할 수 있습니다.,Please do it that way. The materials need to come before my words so Da-eun can be less defensive too.,そうしてください。私の言葉より資料が先に出てこそ、ダウンも少し防御を下げられます。,请这样做。资料必须先于我的话出现，多恩也才能少一些防御。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v5].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v5].text,"사실부터 세우면 좋겠습니다. 예비신랑 대화가 어떻게 시작됐고, 그 뒤 돈 이야기가 어떻게 붙었는지 봐야 합니다.",I would like to establish the facts first. We need to see how the fiancé's conversation began and how the money talk followed.,事実を先に立てたいです。婚約者の会話がどのように始まり、その後お金の話がどう続いたのかを見るべきです。,我希望先确立事实。必须看未婚夫的对话如何开始，之后钱的话题又如何接上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v6].text,저도 사실 우선에 동의합니다. 제가 왜 다은이에게 바로 못 갔는지는 자료가 맞춰진 뒤 말하겠습니다.,I agree with putting facts first. I will explain why I could not go straight to Da-eun after the materials are aligned.,私も事実優先に同意します。なぜダウンにすぐ行けなかったのかは、資料が合った後で話します。,我也同意事实优先。为什么我无法直接找多恩，等资料对齐后我会说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v7].text,기록을 먼저 보겠습니다. 단톡방에서 제 이름이 언제 먼저 올라갔는지도 함께 봐주십시오.,I will look at the records first. Please also examine when my name first came up in the group chat.,記録を先に見ます。グループチャットで私の名前がいつ先に上がったのかも、一緒に見てください。,我先看记录。请也一起看清我的名字是什么时候先出现在群聊里的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v8].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v8].text,감정은 뒤에 두겠습니다. 연락이 경고였는지 판단하려면 현재와 과거의 돈 부탁 문구가 같이 있어야 합니다.,"I will put emotion aside. To judge whether the contact was a warning, the current and past money-request wording must be together.",感情は後に置きます。連絡が警告だったのか判断するには、現在と過去のお金の頼みの文言が一緒になければなりません。,我会把情绪放在后面。要判断联系是否是警告，必须把现在和过去借钱请求的措辞放在一起。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v9].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_fact_first_b_.variants_mediation-fact_first-b-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[fact_first|b].variants[mediation-fact_first-b-v9].text,사실부터 놓아 주십시오. 제가 감추려 한 게 아니라 어떤 순서를 두려워했는지 그때 설명하겠습니다.,"Please lay out the facts first. I will then explain not what I was trying to hide, but what sequence I was afraid of.",事実を先に置いてください。その時、私が何を隠そうとしたのではなく、どんな順序を恐れていたのか説明します。,请先摆出事实。到那时，我会说明我不是想隐藏什么，而是害怕怎样的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v1].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v1].text,"지금 정리하셔도 됩니다. 다만 제가 연락 의도를 확인하지 않고 먼저 몰아간 부분과, 수민이가 끝까지 숨긴 부분은 따로 봐주셨으면 합니다.",You may organize it now. But please separate the part where I pushed ahead without checking the contact intent from the part where Su-min hid everything until the end.,今整理していただいても構いません。ただ、私が連絡の意図を確認せず先に押し進めた部分と、スミンが最後まで隠した部分は分けて見てほしいです。,现在整理也可以。但请把我没确认联系意图就先推进的部分，和秀敏一直隐瞒到最后的部分分开看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v10].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v10].text,지금 판단해 주십시오. 저는 제가 본 조각만 믿었습니다. 그래도 수민이의 침묵이 오해를 더 키운 지점은 남겨야 합니다.,"Please judge it now. I believed only the pieces I saw. Still, the way Su-min's silence deepened the misunderstanding must remain.",今判断してください。私は自分が見た断片だけを信じました。それでも、スミンの沈黙が誤解をさらに大きくした点は残すべきです。,请现在判断。我只相信了自己看到的碎片。即便如此，秀敏的沉默进一步扩大误会这一点也必须留下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v2].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v2].text,결론을 오늘 내도 괜찮습니다. 저는 제가 단정한 책임을 피하지 않겠습니다. 대신 수민이가 왜 제게 직접 말하지 않았는지도 함께 봐주십시오.,You may reach a conclusion today. I will not avoid responsibility for my conclusion. But you must also look at why Su-min did not tell me directly.,今日結論を出しても構いません。私は自分が断定した責任を避けません。その代わり、スミンがなぜ私に直接言わなかったのかも一緒に見てください。,今天下结论也可以。我不会逃避自己下定论的责任。但也请一起看秀敏为什么没有直接告诉我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v3].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v3].text,바로 판단하셔도 됩니다. 제가 사람들 앞에 먼저 퍼뜨린 건 제 책임입니다. 다만 그 침묵이 어떻게 여기까지 오게 했는지도 남겨야 합니다.,You may judge it now. It was my responsibility that I spread it before people first. But we must also record how that silence let matters reach this point.,すぐ判断していただいても構いません。私が人前で先に広めたのは私の責任です。ただ、その沈黙がどうここまで事を運んだのかも残すべきです。,现在判断也可以。我先在人前扩散，是我的责任。但那份沉默如何让事情走到这里，也必须留下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v4].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v4].text,"지금 결론을 내리셔도 됩니다. 연락을 집착으로만 본 제 판단은 흔들렸지만, 수민이가 우회한 방식도 상처를 키웠습니다.","You may conclude it now. My judgment that saw the contact only as obsession has been shaken, but Su-min's indirect method also deepened the hurt.",今結論を出しても構いません。連絡を執着だけだと見た私の判断は揺らぎましたが、スミンの迂回した方法も傷を大きくしました。,现在下结论也可以。我把联系只看成执着的判断已经动摇，但秀敏绕开的方式也加深了伤害。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v5].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v5].text,오늘 정리한다면 제 잘못도 적어 주십시오. 확인보다 공개가 빨랐습니다. 하지만 수민이가 설명을 미룬 시간도 같이 봐야 합니다.,"If you organize it today, please include my fault too. Disclosure came before verification. But you must also see the time Su-min delayed explaining.",今日整理するなら、私の過ちも書いてください。確認より公開が早かったです。ですが、スミンが説明を先送りした時間も一緒に見るべきです。,如果今天整理，请也写下我的过错。公开早于确认。但也必须一起看秀敏拖延解释的那段时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v6].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v6].text,더 끌지 않아도 됩니다. 저는 제가 너무 빨리 결론 낸 걸 인정하겠습니다. 대신 연락 방식의 책임까지 한꺼번에 덮지는 말아 주십시오.,You do not have to drag this out. I will admit I reached a conclusion too quickly. But please do not cover over responsibility for the contact method all at once.,これ以上引き延ばさなくても構いません。私が早すぎる結論を出したことは認めます。ただ、連絡方法の責任まで一気に覆わないでください。,不用再拖下去。我承认自己太快下了结论。但请不要把联系方式上的责任一并遮盖掉。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v7].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v7].text,"지금 끝내는 쪽도 받아들이겠습니다. 다만 아버지 문제와 예비신랑 문제를 한 덩어리로 섞으면 제 책임도, 수민이 책임도 흐려집니다.","I will accept ending it now too. But if my father's issue and the fiancé's issue are mixed into one lump, both my responsibility and Su-min's will become blurred.",今終わらせることも受け入れます。ただ、お父さんの問題と婚約者の問題を一つの塊に混ぜると、私の責任もスミンの責任も曖昧になります。,现在结束我也接受。但如果把父亲的问题和未婚夫的问题混成一团，我的责任和秀敏的责任都会变得模糊。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v8].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v8].text,바로 정리하셔도 됩니다. 제가 먼저 낙인을 만든 건 맞습니다. 그래도 수민이가 또 혼자 막으려 한 선택도 따로 판단해 주십시오.,"You may organize it immediately. I did create the stigma first. Still, please judge separately Su-min's choice to try to stop it alone again.",すぐ整理していただいても構いません。私が先に烙印を作ったのは事実です。それでも、スミンがまた一人で止めようとした選択も別に判断してください。,可以马上整理。是我先制造了污名。但秀敏又想独自阻止的选择，也请单独判断。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v9].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_a_.variants_mediation-immediate-a-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|a].variants[mediation-immediate-a-v9].text,오늘 결론이 필요하다면 듣겠습니다. 저는 단톡방에 먼저 올린 책임을 피하지 않겠습니다. 다만 왜 제게 말하지 않았는지도 물어야 합니다.,"If a conclusion is needed today, I will hear it. I will not avoid responsibility for posting in the group chat first. But you still must ask why she did not tell me.",今日結論が必要なら聞きます。グループチャットに先に上げた責任は避けません。ただ、なぜ私に言わなかったのかも問うべきです。,如果今天需要结论，我会听。我不会逃避自己先发到群聊的责任。但也必须问她为什么没有告诉我。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v1].text,바로 정리하셔도 괜찮습니다. 연락한 방식은 제 책임입니다. 다만 그 연락이 유혹이 아니라 경고였다는 축은 명확히 남겨 주십시오.,"You may organize it now. The way I contacted him was my responsibility. But please make clear that the contact was a warning, not a temptation.",すぐ整理していただいて構いません。連絡した方法は私の責任です。ただ、その連絡が誘惑ではなく警告だったという軸は明確に残してください。,现在整理也可以。联系的方式是我的责任。但请明确留下这一点：那次联系是警告，不是诱惑。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v10].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v10].text,결론을 내셔도 괜찮습니다. 저는 제 방식의 책임을 지겠습니다. 대신 단톡방 낙인과 과거 돈 문제를 따로 떼지 말아 주십시오.,You may reach a conclusion. I will take responsibility for my method. But please do not separate the group chat stigma from the past money issue.,結論を出しても構いません。私は自分の方法の責任を負います。ただ、グループチャットの烙印と過去のお金の問題を切り離さないでください。,可以下结论。我会承担方式上的责任。但请不要把群聊污名和过去的钱的问题分开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v2].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v2].text,오늘 결론을 내셔도 됩니다. 제가 다은이에게 직접 말하지 못한 건 잘못입니다. 그래도 먼저 낙인찍힌 순서까지 함께 봐야 합니다.,You may conclude it today. It was wrong that I could not tell Da-eun directly. But the order in which I was stigmatized first must be seen as well.,今日結論を出しても構いません。ダウンに直接言えなかったのは私の過ちです。それでも、先に烙印を押された順序まで一緒に見るべきです。,今天下结论也可以。我没能直接告诉多恩，是我的错。但我先被贴上污名的顺序也必须一起看。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v3].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v3].text,"지금 판단하셔도 저는 피하지 않겠습니다. 연락을 반복한 건 맞지만, 다은이 아버지의 돈 접근을 막으려 했다는 이유는 빠지면 안 됩니다.","I will not avoid judgment now. I did contact him repeatedly, but the reason that I was trying to stop Da-eun's father's money approach must not be left out.",今判断されても逃げません。連絡を繰り返したのは事実ですが、ダウンのお父さんの金銭接近を止めようとした理由は抜けてはいけません。,现在判断我也不会逃避。我确实反复联系了，但试图阻止多恩父亲接近钱财这个理由不能被拿掉。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v4].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v4].text,바로 끝내도 됩니다. 제가 우회한 방식은 좋지 않았습니다. 다만 예비신랑 쪽 대화와 돈 부탁 흐름이 먼저 정리되어야 합니다.,"You may end it now. My indirect method was not good. Still, the fiancé-side conversation and the money-request flow must be organized first.",すぐ終わらせても構いません。私の迂回した方法はよくありませんでした。ただ、婚約者側の会話とお金の頼みの流れを先に整理するべきです。,现在结束也可以。我绕开的方式不好。但未婚夫那边的对话和借钱请求的流程必须先整理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v5].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v5].text,오늘 정리해 주십시오. 저는 침묵의 책임을 인정합니다. 대신 다은이가 확인 없이 사람들 앞에 제 이름을 올린 책임도 남겨 주십시오.,"Please organize it today. I admit responsibility for my silence. In return, please also leave Da-eun's responsibility for putting my name before people without checking.",今日整理してください。私は沈黙の責任を認めます。その代わり、ダウンが確認なしに人前で私の名前を出した責任も残してください。,请今天整理。我承认沉默的责任。但也请留下多恩未经确认就在众人面前提起我名字的责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v6].text,지금 결론을 받아들이겠습니다. 제가 악역으로 버티려 한 건 잘못입니다. 그래도 그 시작이 보호였다는 맥락은 지워지면 안 됩니다.,"I will accept the conclusion now. It was wrong to hold out as the villain. Still, the context that it began as protection must not be erased.",今結論を受け入れます。悪役として耐えようとしたのは間違いでした。それでも、その始まりが保護だったという文脈は消されてはいけません。,我接受现在的结论。一直撑着当坏人是错的。但它的起点是保护，这个脉络不能被抹掉。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v7].text,바로 판단하셔도 됩니다. 저는 연락을 멈추지 못했습니다. 하지만 그 이유가 감정이 아니라 반복되는 돈 문제였다는 점은 보셔야 합니다.,You may judge it now. I could not stop contacting him. But you must see that the reason was not emotion; it was a repeated money problem.,すぐ判断していただいて構いません。私は連絡を止められませんでした。ですが、その理由が感情ではなく、繰り返されるお金の問題だった点は見てください。,现在判断也可以。我没能停止联系。但请看到，理由不是感情，而是反复出现的钱的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v8].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v8].text,오늘 끝낼 수 있습니다. 다만 겉으로 보인 연락 횟수만으로 제 의도를 다시 집착으로 묶지는 말아 주십시오.,We can end it today. But please do not bind my intent again as obsession based only on the visible number of contacts.,今日終えることはできます。ただ、表に見えた連絡回数だけで、私の意図をまた執着として縛らないでください。,今天可以结束。但请不要只凭表面上的联系次数，就再次把我的意图归结为执着。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v9].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_immediate_b_.variants_mediation-immediate-b-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[immediate|b].variants[mediation-immediate-b-v9].text,지금 정리하셔도 됩니다. 제가 설명을 늦춘 탓은 있습니다. 하지만 그 침묵이 다은이를 지키려는 선택이었다는 점도 같이 봐야 합니다.,You may organize it now. I was late in explaining. But please also see that the silence was a choice meant to protect Da-eun.,今整理していただいても構いません。私が説明を遅らせた責任はあります。ですが、その沈黙がダウンを守ろうとした選択だった点も一緒に見てください。,现在整理也可以。我确实解释得太晚。但也请一起看到，那份沉默是为了保护多恩的选择。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v1].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v1].text,시간을 두는 건 필요할 수 있습니다. 다만 그 사이 수민이가 또 혼자 정리하겠다고 움직이면 저는 다시 의심하게 됩니다.,"Taking time may be necessary. But if Su-min moves during that time to settle everything alone again, I will start suspecting her again.",時間を置くことは必要かもしれません。ただ、その間にスミンがまた一人で整理しようと動けば、私はまた疑ってしまいます。,留出时间可能是必要的。但如果这期间秀敏又想独自整理，我会再次怀疑她。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v10].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v10].text,"시간을 두되 기준은 남겨야 합니다. 연락 금지, 추가 공개 금지, 증거 대조는 지금 정해야 합니다.","We can take time, but the standards must remain. No contact, no further public disclosure, and evidence comparison must be set now.",時間を置くとしても、基準は残すべきです。連絡禁止、追加公開禁止、証拠照合は今決めなければなりません。,可以留出时间，但标准必须留下。禁止联系、禁止继续公开、证据对照，现在就要定下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v2].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v2].text,잠깐 미루는 건 괜찮습니다. 지금은 아버지 얘기까지 한꺼번에 올라와서 제가 차분히 말하기 어렵습니다.,"I can accept a brief delay. Right now, my father's issue has come up all at once, and it is hard for me to speak calmly.",少し先送りするのは構いません。今はお父さんの話まで一度に上がってきて、落ち着いて話しにくいです。,暂时推迟可以。现在父亲的问题一下子全冒出来，我很难冷静说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v3].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v3].text,보류한다면 먼저 연락과 공개를 멈추는 기준을 세워야 합니다. 그냥 시간을 주면 또 말이 엇갈릴 것 같습니다.,"If we put this on hold, we first need standards that stop contact and public disclosure. If we only give time, the words may cross again.",保留するなら、まず連絡と公開を止める基準を立てるべきです。ただ時間を与えるだけでは、また言葉が食い違うと思います。,如果暂缓，必须先设定停止联系和公开的标准。只是给时间的话，话又会错位。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v4].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v4].text,시간을 두자는 말은 이해합니다. 하지만 단톡방 정정과 예비신랑 쪽 사실 확인은 미루지 않았으면 합니다.,I understand taking time. But I do not want the group chat correction and verification of the fiancé-side facts to be delayed.,時間を置くという話は理解します。ただ、グループチャットの訂正と婚約者側の事実確認は先送りしないでほしいです。,我理解需要时间。但群聊更正和未婚夫那边事实的确认，不希望被推迟。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v5].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v5].text,조금 쉬어야 할 것 같습니다. 다만 제가 틀렸다는 쪽으로만 급히 굳히지는 말아 주십시오. 아직 마음이 따라가지 못합니다.,I think I need to rest a little. But please do not rush to solidify only the idea that I was wrong. My heart has not caught up yet.,少し休む必要がありそうです。ただ、私が間違っていたという方向だけに急いで固めないでください。まだ気持ちが追いついていません。,我可能需要稍微休息一下。但请不要急着只把结论定成我错了。我的心还没有跟上。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v6].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v6].text,미루는 쪽도 받아들이겠습니다. 대신 보류가 수민이 침묵을 다시 선의로만 덮는 시간이 되면 안 됩니다.,I will accept postponement too. But the hold must not become time that covers Su-min's silence only as goodwill again.,先送りすることも受け入れます。ただ、保留がスミンの沈黙をまた善意だけで覆う時間になってはいけません。,推迟我也接受。但暂缓不能变成再次把秀敏的沉默只包装成善意的时间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v7].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v7].text,시간이 필요합니다. 저는 아버지 얘기를 바로 받아들일 준비가 안 됐습니다. 그래도 사실 확인은 멈추면 안 됩니다.,"I need time. I am not ready to accept my father's story immediately. Still, fact-checking must not stop.",時間が必要です。お父さんの話をすぐ受け入れる準備はできていません。それでも、事実確認は止めてはいけません。,我需要时间。我还没准备好立刻接受父亲的事。但事实确认不能停。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v8].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v8].text,잠깐 멈추겠습니다. 다만 그 사이에도 제가 먼저 퍼뜨린 부분과 수민이가 숨긴 부분은 따로 정리해 두셨으면 합니다.,"I will pause for a moment. But even during that time, please separately organize the part I spread first and the part Su-min hid.",いったん止まります。ただ、その間も、私が先に広めた部分とスミンが隠した部分は分けて整理しておいてください。,我先暂停一下。但这期间，也请把我先扩散的部分和秀敏隐瞒的部分分开整理。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v9].behaviorHint,결론부터 세우려는 습관을 누르고 책임을 분리해 말한다.,She holds back the habit of starting from a conclusion and speaks by separating responsibility.,結論から立てようとする癖を抑え、責任を分けて話す。,压住先下结论的习惯，分开责任来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_a_.variants_mediation-postpone-a-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|a].variants[mediation-postpone-a-v9].text,"오늘 결론을 미룬다면, 제가 공개한 말의 정정 범위부터 임시로 정해 주십시오. 더 번지는 건 막아야 합니다.","If today's conclusion is delayed, please at least set a temporary scope for correcting what I made public. We need to stop it from spreading further.",今日の結論を延ばすなら、私が公開した言葉の訂正範囲から暫定的に決めてください。これ以上広がるのは止めなければなりません。,如果今天推迟结论，请先临时确定我公开言论的更正范围。必须阻止它继续扩散。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v1].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v1].text,시간을 두는 건 저도 필요합니다. 다은이가 아버지 이야기를 한 번에 받아들이기 어렵다는 건 압니다.,I also need time. I know it is hard for Da-eun to take in her father's story all at once.,時間を置くことは私にも必要です。ダウンがお父さんの話を一度に受け入れにくいことは分かります。,我也需要时间。我知道多恩很难一下子接受父亲的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v10].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v10].text,잠시 뒤로 미루겠습니다. 대신 그 돈 접근과 과거 손절의 연결만큼은 흐리지 말아 주십시오.,I will put this off for a moment. But please do not blur the link between that money approach and the old break.,少し後ろに送ります。ただ、その金銭接近と過去の絶交のつながりだけは曖昧にしないでください。,我可以暂时往后推。但请不要模糊那次接近钱财和过去断交之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v2].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v2].text,잠깐 멈추는 데 동의합니다. 다만 그 사이 제 연락이 다시 집착으로만 퍼지지 않게 정리해 주십시오.,I agree to pause briefly. But please organize things so my contact does not spread again only as obsession during that time.,いったん止めることに同意します。ただ、その間に私の連絡がまた執着だけとして広がらないよう整理してください。,我同意暂时停下。但请整理清楚，避免这期间我的联系又只被当成执着传开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v3].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v3].text,"보류하더라도 증거 순서는 남겨야 합니다. 연락 기록, 예비신랑 대화, 돈 부탁 흐름이 따로 흩어지면 또 오해가 됩니다.","Even if we put this on hold, the evidence sequence must remain. If the contact log, fiancé conversation, and money-request flow scatter again, it will become another misunderstanding.",保留しても、証拠の順序は残すべきです。連絡記録、婚約者の会話、お金の頼みの流れがばらばらになれば、また誤解になります。,即使暂缓，证据顺序也必须留下。联系记录、未婚夫对话、借钱请求流程如果再次散开，就会变成新的误会。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v4].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v4].text,시간이 필요합니다. 제가 말한 과거 일도 가볍게 꺼낼 수 있는 내용이 아니었습니다.,I need time. The past matter I mentioned was not something I could bring up lightly.,時間が必要です。私が話した過去の件も、軽く持ち出せる内容ではありませんでした。,我需要时间。我提到的过去的事，也不是能轻易说出口的内容。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v5].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v5].text,"미루는 건 괜찮습니다. 대신 다은이가 단톡방 쪽 공개를 멈추고, 저도 예비신랑에게 더 연락하지 않는 기준이 필요합니다.","I am fine with postponing. But we need standards: Da-eun stops public disclosure in the group chat, and I make no further contact with the fiancé.",先送りは構いません。ただ、ダウンがグループチャット側の公開を止め、私も婚約者にこれ以上連絡しないという基準が必要です。,推迟可以。但需要标准：多恩停止在群聊公开，我也不再联系未婚夫。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v6].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v6].text,"잠깐 쉬어야 할 것 같습니다. 제가 버티던 말들이 한꺼번에 나와서, 지금은 차분히 설명하기 어렵습니다.","I think I need to rest. Everything I had been holding back came out at once, so I cannot explain calmly right now.",少し休む必要がありそうです。耐えていた言葉が一度に出てきて、今は落ち着いて説明するのが難しいです。,我可能需要休息一下。我一直撑着的话一下子全说出来了，现在很难冷静说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v7].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v7].text,보류에 동의합니다. 다만 이 시간이 책임을 흐리는 쪽으로 쓰이면 안 됩니다. 사실 대조는 계속되어야 합니다.,I agree to putting it on hold. But this time must not be used to blur responsibility. The comparison of facts must continue.,保留に同意します。ただ、この時間が責任を曖昧にする方向に使われてはいけません。事実の照合は続けるべきです。,我同意暂缓。但这段时间不能被用来模糊责任。事实对照必须继续。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v8].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v8].text,시간을 두겠습니다. 하지만 제가 또 악역으로 남는 보류라면 받아들이기 어렵습니다.,"I will take time. But if this hold leaves me as the villain again, I cannot accept it.",時間を置きます。ただ、私がまた悪役として残る保留なら受け入れにくいです。,我会留出时间。但如果这个暂缓又让我继续当坏人，我很难接受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v9].behaviorHint,감정을 누른 채 사실의 순서와 침묵의 이유를 분리해 말한다.,She keeps her emotions down and separates the order of facts from the reason for the silence.,感情を抑えたまま、事実の順序と沈黙の理由を分けて話す。,压住情绪，把事实顺序和沉默理由分开来说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_mediation_.entries_postpone_b_.variants_mediation-postpone-b-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[mediation].entries[postpone|b].variants[mediation-postpone-b-v9].text,"오늘 멈춘다면, 제 침묵의 이유와 다은이의 공개 책임을 임시 기록으로라도 남겨 주십시오.","If we stop today, please leave at least a temporary record of why I stayed silent and Da-eun's responsibility for making it public.",今日止めるなら、私の沈黙の理由とダウンの公開責任を、暫定記録としてでも残してください。,如果今天先停下，请至少把我的沉默理由和多恩的公开责任作为临时记录留下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_dossier_challenge_cleared_.variants_sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v1].text,카드의 질문을 넘기자 가려진 맥락이 열린다.,"When the card's question is cleared, the hidden context opens.",カードの問いを越えると、隠れていた文脈が開く。,越过卡牌的问题后，被遮住的脉络打开了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_dossier_challenge_cleared_.variants_sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v2].text,쟁점 카드가 통과되며 말의 무게가 바뀐다.,"As the issue card passes, the weight of the statements changes.",争点カードが通過し、言葉の重みが変わる。,争点卡通过后，话语的重量发生了变化。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_dossier_challenge_cleared_.variants_sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v3].text,묶인 증거가 한쪽 진술을 다시 흔든다.,The linked evidence shakes one side's statement again.,結びついた証拠が、片方の陳述を再び揺らす。,被串联起来的证据再次动摇了一方的陈述。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_dossier_challenge_cleared_.variants_sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v4].text,카드의 틈을 지나 숨은 이유가 올라온다.,"Through a gap in the card, a hidden reason rises to the surface.",カードの隙間を抜けて、隠れた理由が浮かび上がる。,穿过卡牌的缝隙，隐藏的理由浮出水面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_dossier_challenge_cleared_.variants_sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[dossier|challenge_cleared].variants[sys-dossier-challenge_cleared-v5].text,도전이 풀리며 다음 진실에 닿을 길이 생긴다.,"The challenge opens, creating a path toward the next truth.",挑戦が解け、次の真実へ届く道が生まれる。,挑战被解开，通往下一层真相的路出现了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_judge_combo_trigger_.variants_sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v1].text,두 증거가 맞물리며 숨은 그림이 올라온다.,"Two pieces of evidence interlock, and the hidden picture rises.",二つの証拠がかみ合い、隠れた絵が浮かび上がる。,两项证据咬合，隐藏的图景浮现出来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_judge_combo_trigger_.variants_sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v2].text,따로 있던 기록이 한 결론으로 이어진다.,Separate records connect into one conclusion.,別々にあった記録が、一つの結論へつながる。,分散的记录连接成一个结论。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_judge_combo_trigger_.variants_sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v3].text,증거 둘이 겹치자 가려진 순서가 보인다.,"As two pieces of evidence overlap, the hidden order becomes visible.",二つの証拠が重なり、隠れていた順序が見える。,两项证据重叠后，被遮住的顺序显现了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_judge_combo_trigger_.variants_sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v4].text,흩어진 조각이 하나의 장면으로 붙는다.,Scattered pieces join into a single scene.,散らばった欠片が一つの場面につながる。,零散的碎片拼成了一个场面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_judge_combo_trigger_.variants_sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|judge_combo_trigger].variants[sys-evidence-judge_combo_trigger-v5].text,두 자료가 만나 사건의 안쪽을 연다.,Two materials meet and open the inside of the case.,二つの資料が出会い、事件の内側を開く。,两份资料相遇，打开了案件的内里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_new_unlock_.variants_sys-evidence-new_unlock-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v1].text,새 증거가 열리며 진술의 빈칸이 움직인다.,"New evidence opens, and the blank in the statements shifts.",新たな証拠が開き、陳述の空白が動く。,新证据开启，陈述中的空白开始移动。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_new_unlock_.variants_sys-evidence-new_unlock-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v2].text,새 물증이 판 위로 올라온다.,A new physical clue rises onto the board.,新たな物証が盤上に上がる。,新的物证登上了局面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_new_unlock_.variants_sys-evidence-new_unlock-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v3].text,증거 하나가 닫힌 말을 다시 흔든다.,One piece of evidence shakes a closed statement again.,一つの証拠が、閉ざされた言葉を再び揺らす。,一项证据再次撼动了封闭的说法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_new_unlock_.variants_sys-evidence-new_unlock-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v4].text,가려진 자료가 다음 질문의 길을 연다.,A hidden material opens the way to the next question.,隠れていた資料が、次の問いへの道を開く。,被遮住的资料为下一个问题打开道路。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_new_unlock_.variants_sys-evidence-new_unlock-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|new_unlock].variants[sys-evidence-new_unlock-v5].text,새 기록이 서로의 말 사이에 놓인다.,A new record is placed between their words.,新たな記録が、互いの言葉の間に置かれる。,新的记录被放在双方话语之间。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_trap_notice_.variants_sys-evidence-trap_notice-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v1].text,초반 그림이 한 방향으로 너무 빠르게 굳는다.,The early picture is hardening in one direction too quickly.,序盤の絵が、一方向へあまりにも早く固まりつつある。,开局的图景正过快地向一个方向定型。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_trap_notice_.variants_sys-evidence-trap_notice-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v2].text,겉모습만 따르면 핵심 이유가 밀릴 수 있다.,"If we follow appearances alone, the key reason may be pushed aside.",見た目だけを追えば、核心の理由が押しやられるかもしれない。,如果只顺着表象走，核心理由可能会被挤到一边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_trap_notice_.variants_sys-evidence-trap_notice-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v3].text,보이는 기록만으로 결론이 기울고 있다.,The visible record alone is tilting the conclusion.,見える記録だけで、結論が傾きつつある。,仅凭可见记录，结论正在倾斜。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_trap_notice_.variants_sys-evidence-trap_notice-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v4].text,첫인상이 사건의 안쪽을 가릴 수 있다.,The first impression may hide the inside of the case.,第一印象が、事件の内側を隠してしまうかもしれない。,第一印象可能遮住案件的内里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_evidence_trap_notice_.variants_sys-evidence-trap_notice-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[evidence|trap_notice].variants[sys-evidence-trap_notice-v5].text,이 조합은 누군가를 너무 쉽게 악역으로 만든다.,This combination makes someone a villain too easily.,この組み合わせは、誰かをあまりにも簡単に悪役にしてしまう。,这种组合太容易把某个人变成坏人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_judge_contradiction_trigger_.variants_sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_t,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v1].text,양측 진술의 갈라진 틈을 재판관이 짚는다.,The judge points to the split between the two sides' statements.,裁判官が、両者の陳述の割れ目を指摘する。,法官指出双方陈述之间的裂缝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_judge_contradiction_trigger_.variants_sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_t,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v2].text,말이 어긋난 지점에 재판관의 질문이 꽂힌다.,The judge's question strikes the point where the words diverged.,言葉が食い違った地点に、裁判官の問いが突き刺さる。,法官的问题刺入话语错位之处。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_judge_contradiction_trigger_.variants_sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_t,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v3].text,서로 다른 설명 사이로 모순이 고개를 든다.,"Between different explanations, a contradiction raises its head.",異なる説明の間から、矛盾が顔を出す。,在不同解释之间，矛盾抬起了头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_judge_contradiction_trigger_.variants_sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_t,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v4].text,앞뒤가 맞지 않는 말이 재판관 앞에 멈춘다.,Words that do not fit front to back stop before the judge.,前後が合わない言葉が、裁判官の前で止まる。,前后对不上的话语停在法官面前。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_judge_contradiction_trigger_.variants_sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_t,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|judge_contradiction_trigger].variants[sys-interrogation-judge_contradiction_trigger-v5].text,진술의 빈틈이 드러나고 추궁이 시작된다.,"A gap in the statement appears, and the questioning begins.",陳述の隙間が現れ、追及が始まる。,陈述的空隙显现，追问开始了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_repeat_warning_.variants_sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v1].text,같은 질문이 반복되자 진술이 더 닫힌다.,"As the same question repeats, the statement closes even more.",同じ質問が繰り返され、陳述はさらに閉じていく。,同样的问题反复出现，陈述反而更加封闭。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_repeat_warning_.variants_sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v2].text,비슷한 추궁이 이어지면 새 말이 나오기 어렵다.,"If similar pressure continues, new words will be hard to draw out.",似た追及が続けば、新しい言葉は出にくくなる。,类似的追问继续下去，就很难出现新的说法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_repeat_warning_.variants_sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v3].text,한쪽으로만 몰면 상대는 방어만 굳힌다.,"If one side is driven too hard, the other will only harden in defense.",一方にだけ追い込めば、相手は防御を固めるだけだ。,如果只把一方逼得太紧，对方只会更加防御。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_repeat_warning_.variants_sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v4].text,질문을 바꾸면 숨은 이유가 다시 열릴 수 있다.,Changing the question may open the hidden reason again.,問いを変えれば、隠れた理由が再び開くかもしれない。,换一个问题，隐藏的理由或许会再次打开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_interrogation_repeat_warning_.variants_sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[interrogation|repeat_warning].variants[sys-interrogation-repeat_warning-v5].text,반복보다 다른 증거를 붙이는 쪽이 낫다.,It is better to attach different evidence than to repeat the same line.,繰り返すより、別の証拠を結びつけるほうがよい。,与其重复，不如接上另一项证据。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_emotion_phase_shift_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v1].text,버티던 표정이 무너지고 말끝이 달라진다.,"The expression that held firm collapses, and the end of the words changes.",持ちこたえていた表情が崩れ、言葉の末尾が変わる。,强撑着的表情崩塌，话尾也变了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_emotion_phase_shift_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v2].text,감정을 누르던 힘이 한순간 느슨해진다.,The force holding back emotion loosens for a moment.,感情を抑えていた力が、一瞬ゆるむ。,压住情绪的力量一瞬间松动了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_emotion_phase_shift_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v3].text,분노 뒤에 숨은 두려움이 앞으로 나온다.,The fear hidden behind anger comes forward.,怒りの後ろに隠れていた怖れが前に出る。,藏在愤怒背后的恐惧浮到了前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_emotion_phase_shift_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v4].text,평평하던 목소리 끝이 처음으로 흔들린다.,The end of the flat voice trembles for the first time.,平らだった声の末尾が、初めて揺れる。,一直平稳的声音尾端第一次颤动。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_emotion_phase_shift_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|emotion_phase_shift_trigger].variants[sys-meta-emotion_phase_shift_trigger-v5].text,상처가 올라오며 진술의 온도가 바뀐다.,"The hurt rises, and the temperature of the statement changes.",傷が浮かび上がり、陳述の温度が変わる。,伤口浮起，陈述的温度变了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_rapport_milestone_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v1].text,신뢰가 쌓이며 닫힌 말이 조금 더 열린다.,"Trust builds, and closed words open a little further.",信頼が積み重なり、閉じた言葉が少しだけさらに開く。,信任积累起来，封闭的话语稍稍打开了一些。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_rapport_milestone_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v2].text,상대의 경계가 낮아지고 진술이 깊어진다.,"The other party's guard lowers, and the statement deepens.",相手の警戒が下がり、陳述が深まる。,对方的戒备降低，陈述变得更深。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_rapport_milestone_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v3].text,버티던 말끝이 재판관 앞에서 풀리기 시작한다.,Words that had been holding out begin to loosen before the judge.,持ちこたえていた言葉の末尾が、裁判官の前でほどけ始める。,一直强撑着的话尾开始在法官面前松开。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_rapport_milestone_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v4].text,조심스러운 신뢰가 다음 고백을 밀어 올린다.,Cautious trust pushes up the next confession.,慎重な信頼が、次の告白を押し上げる。,谨慎的信任推动了下一次吐露。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_meta_rapport_milestone_trigger_.variants_sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[meta|rapport_milestone_trigger].variants[sys-meta-rapport_milestone_trigger-v5].text,닫혀 있던 이유가 조금 더 밖으로 나온다.,A reason that had been closed off comes a little farther outside.,閉ざされていた理由が、もう少し外へ出てくる。,一直封闭的理由又向外露出了一些。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_phase_transition_.variants_sys-phase-transition-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v1].text,심문이 다음 국면으로 넘어간다.,The interrogation moves into the next phase.,尋問が次の局面へ移る。,审问进入下一个局面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_phase_transition_.variants_sys-phase-transition-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v2].text,판의 무게가 다른 쪽으로 옮겨 간다.,The weight of the board shifts to the other side.,盤の重みが別の側へ移っていく。,局面的重量移向另一边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_phase_transition_.variants_sys-phase-transition-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v3].text,지금까지의 말이 새 국면을 밀어 연다.,Everything said so far pushes open a new phase.,これまでの言葉が、新たな局面を押し開く。,迄今为止的话语推开了新的局面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_phase_transition_.variants_sys-phase-transition-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v4].text,쟁점들이 모여 다음 판단의 문을 연다.,The issues gather and open the door to the next judgment.,争点が集まり、次の判断の扉を開く。,争点汇聚，打开通往下一步判断的门。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_phase_transition_.variants_sys-phase-transition-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[phase|transition].variants[sys-phase-transition-v5].text,흩어진 진술이 하나의 방향으로 정리된다.,Scattered statements settle into one direction.,散らばった陳述が、一つの方向へ整理される。,分散的陈述整理成一个方向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_judge_summon_trigger_.variants_sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v1].text,재판관이 증인을 불러 빈칸을 메우려 한다.,The judge is about to call a witness to fill the blank.,裁判官が証人を呼び、空白を埋めようとしている。,法官准备传唤证人来填补空白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_judge_summon_trigger_.variants_sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v2].text,목격자의 말이 필요한 순간이 온다.,The moment has come when a witness's words are needed.,目撃者の言葉が必要な瞬間が来る。,需要目击者发言的时刻到了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_judge_summon_trigger_.variants_sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v3].text,재판관의 시선이 판 밖의 증인에게 향한다.,The judge's gaze turns to a witness outside the board.,裁判官の視線が、盤の外にいる証人へ向かう。,法官的视线转向局面之外的证人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_judge_summon_trigger_.variants_sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v4].text,남은 공백을 두고 증인 소환이 결정된다.,"With the remaining gap in view, the witness summons is decided.",残った空白を前に、証人召喚が決まる。,面对剩余空白，证人传唤被决定了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_judge_summon_trigger_.variants_sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|judge_summon_trigger].variants[sys-witness-judge_summon_trigger-v5].text,증인의 기억이 이제 심문 안으로 들어온다.,The witness's memory now enters the interrogation.,証人の記憶が、今、尋問の中へ入る。,证人的记忆现在进入审问之中。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_new_available_.variants_sys-witness-new_available-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v1].text,새 증인이 판의 빈칸을 들고 들어온다.,A new witness enters carrying the board's blank.,新たな証人が、盤の空白を抱えて入ってくる。,新的证人带着局面的空白走进来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_new_available_.variants_sys-witness-new_available-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v2].text,밖에 있던 목격자가 이제 불려올 수 있다.,The witness who stood outside can now be called.,外にいた目撃者が、今呼び出される。,原本在外的目击者现在可以被传唤。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_new_available_.variants_sys-witness-new_available-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v3].text,증인의 말이 남은 공백을 흔들 준비를 한다.,The witness's words are ready to shake the remaining gap.,証人の言葉が、残った空白を揺らす準備をしている。,证人的话语准备撼动剩下的空白。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_new_available_.variants_sys-witness-new_available-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v4].text,새 목격자가 쟁점의 뒤편을 열 수 있다.,A new witness may open the back side of the issue.,新たな目撃者が、争点の裏側を開くかもしれない。,新的目击者可能打开争点的背面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_system_message_.entries_witness_new_available_.variants_sys-witness-new_available-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[system_message].entries[witness|new_available].variants[sys-witness-new_available-v5].text,증인 한 명이 오래 닫힌 장면에 다가온다.,One witness approaches a scene long kept closed.,一人の証人が、長く閉ざされていた場面へ近づいていく。,一名证人正在接近一个长期封闭的场面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v1].behaviorHint,망설임 끝에 단톡방 순서를 또렷하게 밝힌다.,"After hesitating, she clearly states the group chat sequence.",迷った末に、グループチャットの順序をはっきり明かす。,犹豫之后，清楚说出群聊的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v1].text,"다은이가 먼저 수민 씨를 문제 삼는 글을 올렸고, 저희가 확인 없이 몰아갔습니다.","Da-eun was the first to post something making Su-min the problem, and we pushed her without checking.",ダウンが先にスミンさんを問題にする投稿をして、私たちは確認もせずに責め立てました。,多恩先发了把秀敏当成问题的内容，我们没有确认就一起逼了上去。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v10].behaviorHint,수민 씨에게 미안한 기색이 드러난다.,Her guilt toward Su-min shows.,スミンさんへの申し訳なさが表に出る。,露出对秀敏的歉意。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v10].text,"저는 다은이를 위한다고 생각했지만, 결과적으로 수민 씨를 몰아세우는 데 함께했습니다.","I thought I was standing up for Da-eun, but in the end I helped corner Su-min.",私はダウンのためだと思っていましたが、結果的にはスミンさんを追い詰める側に加わりました。,我当时以为是在替多恩着想，但结果上，我也参与了逼迫秀敏。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v2].behaviorHint,자신도 책임이 있음을 낮게 인정한다.,She quietly admits she bears responsibility too.,自分にも責任があることを、低い声で認める。,低声承认自己也有责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v2].text,저도 수민 씨를 비난했습니다. 정확히 알지 못하면서 다은이 편이라는 이유로 말했습니다.,"I criticized Su-min too. I did it because I was on Da-eun's side, without knowing clearly.",私もスミンさんを非難しました。正確に知らないまま、ダウンの味方だからという理由で言いました。,我也责怪了秀敏。明明不清楚事实，却因为站在多恩这边而那样说了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v3].behaviorHint,다은이 편향을 내려놓으려 애쓴다.,She tries to set aside her bias toward Da-eun.,ダウン寄りの見方を下ろそうと努める。,努力放下对多恩一方的偏向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v3].text,그 방에서는 수민 씨가 해명할 자리도 없이 이미 선 넘은 사람처럼 정리됐습니다.,"In that room, Su-min had no chance to explain; she was already treated like someone who had crossed the line.",あの部屋では、スミンさんが弁明する場もないまま、すでに一線を越えた人のように整理されていました。,在那个群里，秀敏连解释的机会都没有，就已经被当成越界的人了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v4].behaviorHint,비난이 번진 장면을 차분히 설명한다.,She calmly explains how the blame spread.,非難が広がった場面を落ち着いて説明する。,冷静说明指责扩散的场面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v4].text,"제가 기억하는 순서는 다은이 글이 먼저였고, 그다음 친구들 비난이 붙었습니다.","The order I remember is that Da-eun's post came first, then the friends' criticism attached to it.",私が覚えている順序では、ダウンの投稿が先で、その後に友人たちの非難が付きました。,我记得的顺序是，多恩的发言在先，随后朋友们的指责跟了上来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v5].behaviorHint,수민 씨에게 미안한 기색이 드러난다.,Her guilt toward Su-min shows.,スミンさんへの申し訳なさが表に出る。,露出对秀敏的歉意。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v5].text,수민 씨에게 직접 들은 건 없었습니다. 그런데도 저희가 공개적으로 판단했습니다.,"I had not heard anything directly from Su-min. Even so, we judged her publicly.",スミンさんから直接聞いたことはありませんでした。それでも、私たちは公の場で判断しました。,我没有直接听秀敏说过。即便如此，我们还是公开地判断了她。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v6].behaviorHint,망설임 끝에 단톡방 순서를 또렷하게 밝힌다.,"After hesitating, she clearly states the group chat sequence.",迷った末に、グループチャットの順序をはっきり明かす。,犹豫之后，清楚说出群聊的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v6].text,"다은이가 많이 화났고, 저는 그 감정에 편승했습니다. 지금은 부끄럽습니다.","Da-eun was very angry, and I went along with that emotion. I am ashamed now.",ダウンがとても怒っていて、私はその感情に乗りました。今は恥ずかしいです。,多恩当时很生气，我也顺着那股情绪走了。现在觉得羞愧。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v7].behaviorHint,자신도 책임이 있음을 낮게 인정한다.,She quietly admits she bears responsibility too.,自分にも責任があることを、低い声で認める。,低声承认自己也有责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v7].text,처음 글이 올라온 뒤 분위기가 빨리 험해졌습니다. 저도 멈추게 하지 못했습니다.,"After the first post went up, the atmosphere turned harsh quickly. I could not stop it either.",最初の投稿が上がってから、雰囲気はすぐ険しくなりました。私も止められませんでした。,最初那条发出来后，气氛很快变得尖锐。我也没能阻止。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v8].behaviorHint,다은이 편향을 내려놓으려 애쓴다.,She tries to set aside her bias toward Da-eun.,ダウン寄りの見方を下ろそうと努める。,努力放下对多恩一方的偏向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v8].text,"사실 확인 없이 이름을 올린 건 다은이가 먼저였고, 저희도 그 책임에서 자유롭지 않습니다.","Da-eun was the first to put her name out there without checking, and we are not free of that responsibility either.",確認なしに名前を出したのはダウンが先で、私たちもその責任から自由ではありません。,没有确认就把名字发出来的是多恩在先，我们也不能说自己没有责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v9].behaviorHint,비난이 번진 장면을 차분히 설명한다.,She calmly explains how the blame spread.,非難が広がった場面を落ち着いて説明する。,冷静说明指责扩散的场面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_full_.variants_w-1-full-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|full].variants[w-1-full-v9].text,수민 씨 평판이 그 방에서 먼저 무너졌습니다. 그 시작을 제가 봤습니다.,Su-min's reputation collapsed first in that room. I saw the beginning of it.,スミンさんの評判は、あの部屋で先に崩れました。その始まりを私は見ました。,秀敏的名声是先在那个群里崩掉的。我看到了开头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v1].behaviorHint,부끄러운 대목에서 시선이 옆으로 샌다.,Her gaze slips sideways at the shameful part.,恥ずかしい箇所で視線が横へそれる。,说到羞愧之处时，视线偏向一旁。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v1].text,"다은이가 먼저 연락 기록 얘기를 올렸고, 저도 수민 씨를 곱게 보지 않는 말을 했습니다.","Da-eun first posted about the contact records, and I also said things that looked unkindly on Su-min.",ダウンが先に連絡記録の話を上げて、私もスミンさんをよく思わない言葉を言いました。,多恩先提起联系记录，我也说了不怎么好看待秀敏的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v10].behaviorHint,동조한 부분을 인정하며 어깨가 내려간다.,Her shoulders drop as she admits where she joined in.,同調した部分を認め、肩が落ちる。,承认自己附和的部分，肩膀垂了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v10].text,"저도 책임을 줄이고 싶지만, 그때 비난이 커지는 데 보탠 건 사실입니다.","I want to reduce my responsibility too, but it is true that I added to the blame growing back then.",私も責任を小さく言いたいです。でも、あの時非難が大きくなるのに加わったのは事実です。,我也想把自己的责任说小一点，但那时我确实助长了指责。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v2].behaviorHint,자기 책임을 작게 말하려다 다시 고친다.,"She starts to minimize her responsibility, then corrects herself.",自分の責任を小さく言いかけて、言い直す。,差点把自己的责任说小，又改口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v2].text,"제가 직접 욕을 크게 한 건 아니지만, 분위기에 맞춰 동조한 건 맞습니다.","I did not loudly curse her myself, but it is true that I joined the mood and agreed.",私が直接大きく悪口を言ったわけではありません。でも、雰囲気に合わせて同調したのは事実です。,我不是亲口大声骂她的人，但确实顺着气氛附和了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v3].behaviorHint,다은이를 감싸려다 사실을 덧붙인다.,"She tries to shield Da-eun, then adds the facts.",ダウンをかばおうとしてから、事実を付け加える。,试图维护多恩，又补充事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v3].text,수민 씨에게 확인한 사람은 없었습니다. 다은이 글을 보고 다들 반응했습니다.,No one checked with Su-min. Everyone reacted after seeing Da-eun's post.,スミンさんに確認した人はいませんでした。みんなダウンの投稿を見て反応しました。,没有人向秀敏确认。大家都是看了多恩的发言后做出反应。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v4].behaviorHint,수민 씨 이름에서 목소리가 작아진다.,Her voice lowers at Su-min's name.,スミンさんの名前で声が小さくなる。,提到秀敏的名字时，声音变小。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v4].text,저도 다은이 편이라 생각해서 수민 씨를 의심하는 쪽으로 말했습니다.,"I also thought I was on Da-eun's side, so I spoke in a way that suspected Su-min.",私もダウンの味方だと思っていたので、スミンさんを疑う方向で話しました。,我也觉得自己是站在多恩这边，所以说话时偏向怀疑秀敏。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v5].behaviorHint,동조한 부분을 인정하며 어깨가 내려간다.,Her shoulders drop as she admits where she joined in.,同調した部分を認め、肩が落ちる。,承认自己附和的部分，肩膀垂了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v5].text,다은이가 올린 뒤 친구들이 따라붙었습니다. 저도 그중 하나였습니다.,"After Da-eun posted it, the friends followed. I was one of them.",ダウンが上げた後、友人たちが続きました。私もその一人でした。,多恩发出后，朋友们就跟了上去。我也是其中之一。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v6].behaviorHint,부끄러운 대목에서 시선이 옆으로 샌다.,Her gaze slips sideways at the shameful part.,恥ずかしい箇所で視線が横へそれる。,说到羞愧之处时，视线偏向一旁。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v6].text,"수민 씨가 해명하기 전인데도, 저희는 이미 나쁜 사람처럼 얘기했습니다.","Even before Su-min could explain, we were already talking about her like she was a bad person.",スミンさんが弁明する前なのに、私たちはもう悪い人のように話していました。,秀敏还没来得及解释，我们就已经把她当坏人一样谈论了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v7].behaviorHint,자기 책임을 작게 말하려다 다시 고친다.,"She starts to minimize her responsibility, then corrects herself.",自分の責任を小さく言いかけて、言い直す。,差点把自己的责任说小，又改口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v7].text,"제가 부끄러운 건, 확실히 모르면서도 다은이 말을 거든 부분입니다.",What shames me is that I backed Da-eun's words even though I did not know for sure.,私が恥ずかしいのは、確かに知らないのにダウンの言葉に加勢した部分です。,让我羞愧的是，我并不确定，却还是帮腔了多恩的话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v8].behaviorHint,다은이를 감싸려다 사실을 덧붙인다.,"She tries to shield Da-eun, then adds the facts.",ダウンをかばおうとしてから、事実を付け加える。,试图维护多恩，又补充事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v8].text,"단톡방에서는 다은이 말이 먼저 기준이 됐고, 저도 거기에 기대어 말했습니다.","In the group chat, Da-eun's words became the standard first, and I leaned on them when I spoke.",グループチャットでは、ダウンの言葉が先に基準になり、私もそこに寄りかかって話しました。,在群聊里，多恩的话先成了标准，我说话时也依靠了那个标准。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v9].behaviorHint,수민 씨 이름에서 목소리가 작아진다.,Her voice lowers at Su-min's name.,スミンさんの名前で声が小さくなる。,提到秀敏的名字时，声音变小。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_partial_.variants_w-1-partial-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|partial].variants[w-1-partial-v9].text,나중에 보니 수민 씨에게 직접 물어본 사람이 없었습니다. 그게 마음에 걸립니다.,"Looking back, no one asked Su-min directly. That still weighs on me.",後から見ると、スミンさんに直接尋ねた人はいませんでした。それが気にかかっています。,后来想想，没有人直接问过秀敏。这让我一直放不下。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v1].behaviorHint,다은이 쪽을 의식하며 말을 낮춘다.,"She lowers her voice, conscious of Da-eun's side.",ダウン側を意識し、声を落とす。,顾及多恩那边，压低了声音。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v1].text,단톡방 분위기가 한쪽으로 쏠린 건 맞습니다. 저도 그 안에 있었습니다.,It is true the group chat leaned to one side. I was in it too.,グループチャットの雰囲気が一方に傾いたのは事実です。私もその中にいました。,群聊气氛确实偏向了一边。我也在里面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v10].behaviorHint,손을 모은 채 조심스럽게 증언한다.,She testifies carefully with her hands clasped.,手を組んだまま、慎重に証言する。,双手合拢，谨慎作证。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v10].text,"그때는 저도 수민 씨 사정을 몰라서, 단정이 너무 쉽게 나왔습니다.","Back then I did not know Su-min's situation either, so conclusions came too easily.",あの時は私もスミンさんの事情を知らなかったので、断定があまりにも簡単に出ました。,那时候我也不知道秀敏的情况，所以定论来得太容易了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v2].behaviorHint,자기 동조를 줄여 말하려다 멈칫한다.,"She tries to shrink her own agreement, then falters.",自分の同調を小さく言おうとして、ためらう。,试图缩小自己的附和，又停顿下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v2].text,처음엔 다은이 말만 보고 다들 놀랐습니다. 저도 바로 좋게 보진 못했습니다.,At first everyone was surprised just by Da-eun's words. I did not see Su-min kindly right away either.,最初はダウンの言葉だけを見て、みんな驚きました。私もすぐにはスミンさんをよく見られませんでした。,一开始大家只看多恩的话就都很震惊。我也没有马上好好看待秀敏。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v3].behaviorHint,단정은 피하지만 표정에 찜찜함이 남는다.,"She avoids certainty, but unease remains on her face.",断定は避けるが、表情に気まずさが残る。,避免下定论，但表情里仍有不安。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v3].text,수민 씨 얘기가 나오자 방 분위기가 금방 차가워졌습니다.,"Once Su-min came up, the room's mood cooled quickly.",スミンさんの話が出ると、部屋の雰囲気はすぐ冷たくなりました。,秀敏的事一提出来，群里的气氛很快冷了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v4].behaviorHint,말끝을 흐리며 단톡방 분위기를 떠올린다.,She trails off while recalling the group chat mood.,言葉尻を濁しながら、グループチャットの雰囲気を思い出す。,话尾含糊，回想群聊气氛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v4].text,그날 대화가 조용히 확인하는 분위기는 아니었습니다. 감정이 먼저였습니다.,That day's conversation was not a quiet fact-checking mood. Emotion came first.,その日の会話は、静かに確認する雰囲気ではありませんでした。感情が先でした。,那天的对话不是安静核实的气氛。情绪先走在了前面。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v5].behaviorHint,손을 모은 채 조심스럽게 증언한다.,She testifies carefully with her hands clasped.,手を組んだまま、慎重に証言する。,双手合拢，谨慎作证。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v5].text,"저도 정확히 다 본 건 아니었지만, 다은이가 많이 화난 건 기억합니다.","I had not seen everything accurately either, but I remember Da-eun was very angry.",私も正確にすべてを見たわけではありませんが、ダウンがかなり怒っていたのは覚えています。,我也不是准确看到了全部，但我记得多恩当时很生气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v6].behaviorHint,다은이 쪽을 의식하며 말을 낮춘다.,"She lowers her voice, conscious of Da-eun's side.",ダウン側を意識し、声を落とす。,顾及多恩那边，压低了声音。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v6].text,수민 씨 이름이 올라오자 다들 이미 결론 난 것처럼 반응했습니다.,"When Su-min's name came up, everyone reacted as if the conclusion had already been reached.",スミンさんの名前が上がると、みんなもう結論が出たかのように反応しました。,秀敏的名字一出现，大家就像已经下了结论一样反应。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v7].behaviorHint,자기 동조를 줄여 말하려다 멈칫한다.,"She tries to shrink her own agreement, then falters.",自分の同調を小さく言おうとして、ためらう。,试图缩小自己的附和，又停顿下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v7].text,"단톡방에서 누가 먼저 세게 말했는지는 조심스럽지만, 분위기는 분명 쏠렸습니다.","I have to be careful about who spoke strongly first in the group chat, but the mood clearly tilted.",グループチャットで誰が先に強く言ったかは慎重に言うべきですが、雰囲気は明らかに傾いていました。,群聊里是谁先说得很重，我说起来要谨慎，但气氛确实偏了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v8].behaviorHint,단정은 피하지만 표정에 찜찜함이 남는다.,"She avoids certainty, but unease remains on her face.",断定は避けるが、表情に気まずさが残る。,避免下定论，但表情里仍有不安。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v8].text,제가 보기엔 사실 확인보다 서로 맞장구치는 말이 더 빨랐습니다.,"To me, people agreeing with each other came faster than fact-checking.",私から見ると、事実確認より互いに相槌を打つ言葉のほうが早かったです。,在我看来，彼此附和的话比事实确认来得更快。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v9].behaviorHint,말끝을 흐리며 단톡방 분위기를 떠올린다.,She trails off while recalling the group chat mood.,言葉尻を濁しながら、グループチャットの雰囲気を思い出す。,话尾含糊，回想群聊气氛。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-1_vague_.variants_w-1-vague-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-1|vague].variants[w-1-vague-v9].text,다은이 편을 드는 말이 많았습니다. 저도 그 흐름을 바로 막지는 못했습니다.,There were many words taking Da-eun's side. I did not stop that flow right away either.,ダウンの味方をする言葉が多かったです。私もその流れをすぐには止められませんでした。,替多恩说话的人很多。我也没能马上阻止那股流向。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v1].behaviorHint,선후관계를 분명히 말하고 더는 피하지 않는다.,He states the order clearly and stops avoiding it.,先後関係をはっきり話し、これ以上避けない。,明确说出先后关系，不再回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v1].text,"김태윤 씨가 먼저 몰래 커피를 보자는 식으로 접근했고, 최수민 씨는 선을 그었습니다.","Kim Tae-yun approached first, saying something like they should get coffee secretly, and Choi Su-min drew a line.",キム・テユンさんが先に、こっそりコーヒーでもという形で接近し、チェ・スミンさんは線を引きました。,金泰允先生先以偷偷喝咖啡之类的方式接近，崔秀敏女士划清了界线。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v10].behaviorHint,판단은 줄이고 본 순서를 정확히 말한다.,He reduces judgment and states the order he saw precisely.,判断を抑え、見た順序を正確に話す。,减少判断，准确说出自己看到的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v10].text,"그분이 모를 수는 있지만, 김태윤 씨가 피해자처럼만 말할 상황은 아닙니다.","She may not know it, but this is not a situation where Kim Tae-yun can speak only as if he were the victim.",あの方は知らないかもしれませんが、キム・テユンさんが被害者のようにだけ話せる状況ではありません。,那位或许不知道，但这不是金泰允先生可以只以受害者口吻来说的情况。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v2].behaviorHint,직장 관계보다 사실을 우선해 답한다.,He answers with facts before the workplace relationship.,職場関係より事実を優先して答える。,优先事实，而不是职场关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v2].text,제가 본 바로는 김태윤 씨가 먼저 사적인 표현을 보냈습니다. 최수민 씨는 받아주지 않았습니다.,"From what I saw, Kim Tae-yun sent personal wording first. Choi Su-min did not accept it.",私が見た限りでは、キム・テユンさんが先に私的な表現を送りました。チェ・スミンさんは受け入れていません。,据我看到的，金泰允先生先发了私人意味的话。崔秀敏女士没有接受。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v3].behaviorHint,예비신랑의 표현을 차분히 정리한다.,He calmly organizes the fiancé's wording.,婚約者の表現を落ち着いて整理する。,冷静整理未婚夫的措辞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v3].text,이상형이라는 말까지 나온 건 김태윤 씨 쪽입니다. 최수민 씨가 먼저 유혹한 흐름은 아니었습니다.,The word 'ideal type' came from Kim Tae-yun's side too. It was not a flow where Choi Su-min seduced him first.,理想のタイプという言葉まで出したのはキム・テユンさん側です。チェ・スミンさんが先に誘惑した流れではありませんでした。,“理想型”那种话也是金泰允先生那边说出来的。不是崔秀敏女士先诱惑他的流程。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v4].behaviorHint,거절 흐름까지 빠짐없이 설명한다.,He explains the refusal flow without leaving anything out.,拒絶の流れまで漏れなく説明する。,连拒绝的流程也完整说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v4].text,그 대화 순서는 분명합니다. 김태윤 씨의 가벼운 접근이 먼저였고 거절이 뒤따랐습니다.,"The order of that conversation is clear. Kim Tae-yun's light approach came first, and the refusal followed.",その会話の順序ははっきりしています。キム・テユンさんの軽い接近が先で、拒絶が後に続きました。,那段对话的顺序很清楚。金泰允先生轻率接近在先，拒绝在后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v5].behaviorHint,판단은 줄이고 본 순서를 정확히 말한다.,He reduces judgment and states the order he saw precisely.,判断を抑え、見た順序を正確に話す。,减少判断，准确说出自己看到的顺序。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v5].text,"회사 사람이라 말하기 불편하지만, 김태윤 씨가 선을 넘은 쪽이었다고 봅니다.","It is uncomfortable to say this about someone from work, but I think Kim Tae-yun was the one who crossed the line.",会社の人なので言いにくいですが、キム・テユンさんのほうが線を越えた側だったと思います。,因为是公司的人，说起来不舒服，但我认为金泰允先生才是越界的一方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v6].behaviorHint,선후관계를 분명히 말하고 더는 피하지 않는다.,He states the order clearly and stops avoiding it.,先後関係をはっきり話し、これ以上避けない。,明确说出先后关系，不再回避。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v6].text,최수민 씨 연락은 뒤에 이어진 일입니다. 처음 문을 연 쪽은 김태윤 씨였습니다.,Choi Su-min's contact came later. The one who opened the door first was Kim Tae-yun.,チェ・スミンさんの連絡はその後のことです。最初に扉を開いたのはキム・テユンさんでした。,崔秀敏女士的联系是后来的事。先打开那扇门的是金泰允先生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v7].behaviorHint,직장 관계보다 사실을 우선해 답한다.,He answers with facts before the workplace relationship.,職場関係より事実を優先して答える。,优先事实，而不是职场关系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v7].text,캡처에는 최수민 씨가 거리를 두는 답이 남아 있었습니다. 김태윤 씨 말이 더 문제였습니다.,The screenshots showed Choi Su-min giving distance. Kim Tae-yun's words were more of the problem.,スクリーンショットには、チェ・スミンさんが距離を置く返事が残っていました。キム・テユンさんの言葉のほうが問題でした。,截图里留下了崔秀敏女士保持距离的回复。金泰允先生的话更有问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v8].behaviorHint,예비신랑의 표현을 차분히 정리한다.,He calmly organizes the fiancé's wording.,婚約者の表現を落ち着いて整理する。,冷静整理未婚夫的措辞。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v8].text,단순 농담이라 하기엔 몰래 만나자는 뉘앙스가 있었습니다. 저는 그걸 봤습니다.,"It had the nuance of asking to meet secretly, more than a simple joke. I saw that.",単なる冗談というには、こっそり会おうというニュアンスがありました。私はそれを見ました。,那里面有偷偷见面的语气，不像只是玩笑。我看到了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v9].behaviorHint,거절 흐름까지 빠짐없이 설명한다.,He explains the refusal flow without leaving anything out.,拒絶の流れまで漏れなく説明する。,连拒绝的流程也完整说明。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_full_.variants_w-2-full-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|full].variants[w-2-full-v9].text,"김태윤 씨가 먼저 분위기를 흐렸고, 최수민 씨는 거절했습니다. 그게 제가 아는 사실입니다.","Kim Tae-yun disturbed the mood first, and Choi Su-min refused. That is the fact as I know it.",キム・テユンさんが先に雰囲気を乱し、チェ・スミンさんは拒みました。それが私の知る事実です。,金泰允先生先扰乱了气氛，崔秀敏女士拒绝了。这就是我知道的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v1].behaviorHint,절차적으로 본 사실만 나열하려 한다.,He tries to list only the facts procedurally.,手続き的に、見た事実だけを並べようとする。,试图按程序只列出所见事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v1].text,김태윤 씨가 먼저 사적인 말을 꺼낸 정황이 있습니다. 저는 그걸 농담으로만 보진 않았습니다.,There are circumstances showing Kim Tae-yun brought up private words first. I did not see it as just a joke.,キム・テユンさんが先に私的な言葉を持ち出した状況があります。私はそれを冗談だけとは見ませんでした。,有情况显示金泰允先生先说出了私人性质的话。我没有只把它看作玩笑。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v10].behaviorHint,확인한 캡처 범위만 조심스럽게 밝힌다.,He cautiously states only the range of screenshots he confirmed.,確認したスクリーンショットの範囲だけを慎重に明かす。,谨慎说明自己确认过的截图范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v10].text,최수민 씨가 거절한 흐름도 있었습니다. 적어도 유혹한 쪽으로만 보긴 어렵습니다.,There was also a flow where Choi Su-min refused. At least it is hard to see her only as the one who tempted him.,チェ・スミンさんが拒絶した流れもありました。少なくとも、誘惑した側だけとして見るのは難しいです。,也有崔秀敏女士拒绝的流程。至少很难只把她看作诱惑的一方。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v2].behaviorHint,예비신랑 책임을 말하며 목소리가 낮아진다.,His voice lowers as he speaks of the fiancé's responsibility.,婚約者側の責任を語り、声が低くなる。,说到未婚夫的责任时，声音低了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v2].text,커피를 보자는 식의 말이 있었다고 들었습니다. 회사 관계 때문에 조심스럽지만 사실입니다.,"I heard there was talk like asking to get coffee. I am cautious because of the workplace relationship, but it is true.",コーヒーを誘うような言葉があったと聞きました。会社関係があるので慎重ですが、事実です。,我听说有约咖啡之类的话。因为有公司关系，我说得很谨慎，但这是真的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v3].behaviorHint,회사 관계가 불편한 듯 말을 고른다.,He chooses his words as if the workplace relationship makes him uneasy.,会社関係が気まずいように、言葉を選ぶ。,像是因职场关系感到不适，斟酌用词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v3].text,그분이 최수민 씨에게 선을 넘는 메시지를 보낸 걸 본 적이 있습니다.,I have seen him send a message to Choi Su-min that crossed the line.,その方がチェ・スミンさんに、線を越えるメッセージを送ったのを見たことがあります。,我见过那个人给崔秀敏女士发过越界的信息。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v4].behaviorHint,농담이라는 표현 앞에서 고개를 젓는다.,He shakes his head at the word 'joke'.,冗談という表現の前で首を振る。,听到“玩笑”这个说法时摇头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v4].text,제가 본 캡처에는 김태윤 씨 쪽 말이 먼저 가벼웠습니다. 최수민 씨는 불편해 보였습니다.,"In the screenshot I saw, Kim Tae-yun's words were light first. Choi Su-min looked uncomfortable.",私が見たスクリーンショットでは、キム・テユンさん側の言葉が先に軽かったです。チェ・スミンさんは不快そうでした。,我看到的截图里，金泰允先生那边的话先显得轻浮。崔秀敏女士看起来很不舒服。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v5].behaviorHint,확인한 캡처 범위만 조심스럽게 밝힌다.,He cautiously states only the range of screenshots he confirmed.,確認したスクリーンショットの範囲だけを慎重に明かす。,谨慎说明自己确认过的截图范围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v5].text,"김태윤 씨가 장난이라고 말했지만, 상대가 받아들이기엔 사적인 표현이었습니다.","Kim Tae-yun called it a joke, but for the other person to receive it, it was personal wording.",キム・テユンさんは冗談だと言いましたが、相手が受け取るには私的な表現でした。,金泰允先生说那是玩笑，但对对方来说，那是私人性质的表达。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v6].behaviorHint,절차적으로 본 사실만 나열하려 한다.,He tries to list only the facts procedurally.,手続き的に、見た事実だけを並べようとする。,试图按程序只列出所见事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v6].text,"최수민 씨가 먼저 접근했다기보다, 김태윤 씨가 여지를 준 대화가 있었습니다.","Rather than Choi Su-min approaching first, there was a conversation in which Kim Tae-yun left room for it.",チェ・スミンさんが先に近づいたというより、キム・テユンさんが余地を与えた会話がありました。,与其说崔秀敏女士先接近，不如说有一段是金泰允先生留下余地的对话。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v7].behaviorHint,예비신랑 책임을 말하며 목소리가 낮아진다.,His voice lowers as he speaks of the fiancé's responsibility.,婚約者側の責任を語り、声が低くなる。,说到未婚夫的责任时，声音低了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v7].text,"저는 회사 후배라 크게 말하긴 어렵지만, 김태윤 씨 쪽 책임이 없다고는 못 합니다.","As a junior colleague, it is hard for me to speak strongly, but I cannot say Kim Tae-yun's side has no responsibility.",会社の後輩として大きくは言いにくいですが、キム・テユンさん側に責任がないとは言えません。,作为公司后辈，我不太好把话说重，但不能说金泰允先生那边没有责任。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v8].behaviorHint,회사 관계가 불편한 듯 말을 고른다.,He chooses his words as if the workplace relationship makes him uneasy.,会社関係が気まずいように、言葉を選ぶ。,像是因职场关系感到不适，斟酌用词。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v8].text,그분이 몰래 보자는 뉘앙스를 만든 건 사실입니다. 저는 그게 선을 넘었다고 봤습니다.,It is true that he created the nuance of meeting secretly. I saw that as crossing the line.,その方がこっそり会うようなニュアンスを作ったのは事実です。私はそれを線を越えたと見ました。,那个人确实制造了偷偷见面的语气。我认为那是越界。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v9].behaviorHint,농담이라는 표현 앞에서 고개를 젓는다.,He shakes his head at the word 'joke'.,冗談という表現の前で首を振る。,听到“玩笑”这个说法时摇头。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_partial_.variants_w-2-partial-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|partial].variants[w-2-partial-v9].text,이상형이라는 식의 표현도 있었습니다. 그걸 단순 농담으로 넘기긴 어렵습니다.,There was also wording like 'ideal type'. It is hard to dismiss that as a simple joke.,理想のタイプというような表現もありました。それを単純な冗談で済ませるのは難しいです。,也有“理想型”之类的说法。很难把那当成单纯玩笑带过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v1].behaviorHint,회사 관계를 의식해 말수를 줄인다.,"He speaks less, conscious of the workplace relationship.",会社関係を意識し、口数を減らす。,顾及职场关系，话变少了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v1].text,회사에서 김태윤 씨가 최수민 씨 얘기를 몇 번 꺼낸 건 들었습니다.,"At work, I heard Kim Tae-yun bring up Choi Su-min a few times.",会社でキム・テユンさんがチェ・スミンさんの話を何度か出したのは聞きました。,我在公司听过金泰允先生几次提到崔秀敏女士。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v10].behaviorHint,기억나는 범위만 짧게 답한다.,"He answers briefly, only within what he remembers.",覚えている範囲だけを短く答える。,只在记得的范围内简短回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v10].text,제가 아는 범위에서는 단순히 한쪽이 들이댄 일로만 보이지 않습니다.,"Within what I know, it does not look like a matter of only one side pushing in.",私の知る範囲では、単純に片方だけが言い寄ったことには見えません。,在我知道的范围内，这不像只是单方面纠缠的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v2].behaviorHint,불필요한 판단은 삼가며 사실만 고른다.,He avoids unnecessary judgment and chooses only facts.,不要な判断は避け、事実だけを選ぶ。,避免不必要的判断，只挑事实说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v2].text,둘 사이에 사적인 연락이 있었다는 말은 회사에서 지나가며 들었습니다.,I heard in passing at work that there had been private contact between the two.,二人の間に私的な連絡があったという話は、会社で通りがかりに聞きました。,我在公司偶然听说过两人之间有私人联系。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v3].behaviorHint,예비신랑 쪽 눈치를 보듯 잠시 멈춘다.,"He pauses briefly, as if watching the fiancé's side.",婚約者側を気にするように、しばらく止まる。,像是在顾忌未婚夫那边，短暂停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v3].text,"제가 판단할 일은 아니지만, 김태윤 씨 쪽 말투가 가볍게 들린 적은 있습니다.","It is not for me to judge, but there were times when Kim Tae-yun's tone sounded light.",私が判断することではありませんが、キム・テユンさん側の口調が軽く聞こえたことはあります。,这不是我该判断的事，但金泰允先生那边的语气确实有听起来轻浮的时候。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v4].behaviorHint,말투는 건조하지만 긴장이 남아 있다.,"His tone is dry, but tension remains.",口調は乾いているが、緊張が残っている。,语气干涩，但仍带着紧张。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v4].text,그분이 최수민 씨를 불편하게 만들 수 있는 말을 한 분위기는 있었습니다.,There was an atmosphere where he had said things that could make Choi Su-min uncomfortable.,その方がチェ・スミンさんを不快にさせかねないことを言った雰囲気はありました。,有过那个人说出可能让崔秀敏女士不舒服的话的氛围。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v5].behaviorHint,기억나는 범위만 짧게 답한다.,"He answers briefly, only within what he remembers.",覚えている範囲だけを短く答える。,只在记得的范围内简短回答。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v5].text,저는 직접 모든 대화를 본 건 아닙니다. 다만 먼저 관심을 보인 쪽은 회사 쪽으로 들었습니다.,I did not see every conversation directly. But I heard the first interest came from the company side.,私はすべての会話を直接見たわけではありません。ただ、先に関心を示したのは会社側だと聞きました。,我没有直接看过所有对话。但我听说先表现出兴趣的是公司那边。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v6].behaviorHint,회사 관계를 의식해 말수를 줄인다.,"He speaks less, conscious of the workplace relationship.",会社関係を意識し、口数を減らす。,顾及职场关系，话变少了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v6].text,"김태윤 씨가 장난처럼 말한 내용이 있었고, 저는 그게 조금 걸렸습니다.","Kim Tae-yun said something like a joke, and it bothered me a little.",キム・テユンさんが冗談のように言った内容があり、私はそれが少し引っかかりました。,金泰允先生说过像玩笑一样的话，我有点在意。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v7].behaviorHint,불필요한 판단은 삼가며 사실만 고른다.,He avoids unnecessary judgment and chooses only facts.,不要な判断は避け、事実だけを選ぶ。,避免不必要的判断，只挑事实说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v7].text,최수민 씨가 먼저 매달렸다는 식으로만 보기는 어렵다고 생각합니다.,I do not think it can be seen only as Choi Su-min clinging to him first.,チェ・スミンさんが先にすがったという形だけで見るのは難しいと思います。,我认为很难只看成崔秀敏女士先纠缠了他。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v8].behaviorHint,예비신랑 쪽 눈치를 보듯 잠시 멈춘다.,"He pauses briefly, as if watching the fiancé's side.",婚約者側を気にするように、しばらく止まる。,像是在顾忌未婚夫那边，短暂停顿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v8].text,회사 후배 입장이라 말을 아끼고 싶습니다. 그래도 이상한 기류는 있었습니다.,"As a junior colleague, I want to be careful with my words. Still, there was an odd current.",会社の後輩という立場なので言葉を控えたいです。それでも、妙な空気はありました。,作为公司后辈，我想少说一些。但确实有奇怪的气流。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v9].behaviorHint,말투는 건조하지만 긴장이 남아 있다.,"His tone is dry, but tension remains.",口調は乾いているが、緊張が残っている。,语气干涩，但仍带着紧张。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-2_vague_.variants_w-2-vague-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-2|vague].variants[w-2-vague-v9].text,김태윤 씨가 최수민 씨를 너무 편하게 부른다고 느낀 적은 있습니다.,There were times when I felt Kim Tae-yun called Choi Su-min too casually.,キム・テユンさんがチェ・スミンさんをあまりに気安く呼んでいると感じたことはあります。,我曾觉得金泰允先生称呼崔秀敏女士太随意。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v1].behaviorHint,수민이가 겪은 일을 분명하게 증언한다.,She testifies clearly to what Su-min went through.,スミンが経験したことをはっきり証言する。,明确证言秀敏经历过的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v1].text,"그 집 아버지가 투자 명목으로 수민이 돈을 가져갔고, 제대로 돌려주지 않았습니다.",That family's father took Su-min's money under the name of investment and did not properly pay it back.,あの家のお父さんが投資名目でスミンのお金を持っていき、きちんと返しませんでした。,那家的父亲以投资名义拿走了秀敏的钱，却没有好好还回来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v10].behaviorHint,감정이 흔들려도 본 사실은 유지한다.,"Even if her emotions shake, she holds to what she saw.",感情が揺れても、見た事実は保つ。,即使情绪动摇，也坚持自己看到的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v10].text,수민이를 변심한 사람으로만 보면 안 됩니다. 그 아이는 말 못 할 피해를 안고 물러났습니다.,You should not see Su-min only as someone who changed her mind. That child stepped back carrying harm she could not speak of.,スミンを心変わりした人としてだけ見てはいけません。あの子は言えない被害を抱えて身を引きました。,不能只把秀敏看成变心的人。那孩子是背着无法说出口的伤害退开的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v2].behaviorHint,돈 문제와 손절의 연결을 차분히 밝힌다.,She calmly reveals the link between the money issue and the break.,お金の問題と絶交のつながりを落ち着いて明かす。,冷静说明钱的问题与断交之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v2].text,수민이가 피해를 본 뒤에도 그 집 딸에게 말하지 못했습니다. 아버지 얘기가 되니까요.,"Even after Su-min was hurt, she could not tell that family's daughter. It would become about her father.",スミンは被害を受けた後も、あの家の娘さんには言えませんでした。お父さんの話になってしまうからです。,秀敏受害之后也没能告诉那家的女儿。因为那会变成她父亲的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v3].behaviorHint,그 집 아버지 일을 숨김없이 말한다.,She speaks without hiding anything about that family's father.,あの家のお父さんのことを隠さずに話す。,毫不隐瞒地说出那家父亲的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v3].text,"과거 손절은 수민이가 변해서가 아니라, 그 돈 문제를 말하지 못해 생긴 일이었습니다.","The old break happened not because Su-min changed, but because she could not speak about that money problem.",過去の絶交は、スミンが変わったからではなく、そのお金の問題を話せなかったために起きたことでした。,过去的断交不是因为秀敏变了，而是因为她没能说出那个钱的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v4].behaviorHint,수민이가 왜 침묵했는지 또렷하게 설명한다.,She clearly explains why Su-min stayed silent.,スミンがなぜ沈黙したのか、はっきり説明する。,清楚解释秀敏为什么沉默。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v4].text,수민이는 돈을 잃고도 그 집 딸이 상처받을까 봐 자기 혼자 나쁜 사람이 됐습니다.,"Even after losing the money, Su-min made herself the bad person alone because she was afraid that family's daughter would be hurt.",スミンはお金を失っても、あの家の娘さんが傷つくのではないかと思い、自分一人で悪い人になりました。,秀敏丢了钱之后，还是担心那家女儿会受伤，于是独自成了坏人。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v5].behaviorHint,감정이 흔들려도 본 사실은 유지한다.,"Even if her emotions shake, she holds to what she saw.",感情が揺れても、見た事実は保つ。,即使情绪动摇，也坚持自己看到的事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v5].text,"제가 아는 사실은 분명합니다. 수민이는 그 집 아버지 일 때문에 울었고, 말하지 못했습니다.","What I know is clear. Su-min cried because of that family's father, and she could not speak of it.",私が知っている事実ははっきりしています。スミンはあの家のお父さんの件で泣き、話せませんでした。,我知道的事实很清楚。秀敏因为那家父亲的事哭了，却说不出口。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v6].behaviorHint,수민이가 겪은 일을 분명하게 증언한다.,She testifies clearly to what Su-min went through.,スミンが経験したことをはっきり証言する。,明确证言秀敏经历过的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v6].text,그 집 딸이 몰랐을 수는 있습니다. 하지만 수민이가 당한 돈 문제는 실제로 있었습니다.,That family's daughter may not have known. But the money problem Su-min suffered was real.,あの家の娘さんは知らなかったかもしれません。けれど、スミンが受けたお金の問題は実際にありました。,那家的女儿可能不知道。但秀敏遭遇的钱的问题是真实存在的。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v7].behaviorHint,돈 문제와 손절의 연결을 차분히 밝힌다.,She calmly reveals the link between the money issue and the break.,お金の問題と絶交のつながりを落ち着いて明かす。,冷静说明钱的问题与断交之间的关联。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v7].text,수민이가 끊은 게 아니라 버티다 못해 물러난 겁니다. 아버지 문제를 감추느라 그랬습니다.,"Su-min did not cut things off; she endured until she could not, then stepped back. She was hiding the father issue.",スミンが切ったのではなく、耐えきれずに身を引いたのです。お父さんの問題を隠すためでした。,不是秀敏主动切断，而是撑不住才退开。那是为了隐瞒父亲的问题。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v8].behaviorHint,그 집 아버지 일을 숨김없이 말한다.,She speaks without hiding anything about that family's father.,あの家のお父さんのことを隠さずに話す。,毫不隐瞒地说出那家父亲的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v8].text,그 돈 문제가 이번 일까지 이어졌다고 봅니다. 수민이는 같은 일이 반복될까 봐 겁낸 겁니다.,I believe that money problem continued into this case. Su-min was afraid the same thing would happen again.,そのお金の問題が今回の件までつながったと思います。スミンは同じことが繰り返されるのを怖がったのです。,我认为那个钱的问题延续到了这次事件。秀敏害怕同样的事会再次发生。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v9].behaviorHint,수민이가 왜 침묵했는지 또렷하게 설명한다.,She clearly explains why Su-min stayed silent.,スミンがなぜ沈黙したのか、はっきり説明する。,清楚解释秀敏为什么沉默。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_full_.variants_w-3-full-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|full].variants[w-3-full-v9].text,그 집 아버지의 부탁은 단순한 안부가 아니었습니다. 수민이는 그 뒤 오래 무너졌습니다.,That family's father's request was not a simple hello. Su-min was broken for a long time after it.,あの家のお父さんの頼みは、単なる安否確認ではありませんでした。その後、スミンは長く崩れていました。,那家父亲的请求不是简单寒暄。秀敏之后很长一段时间都崩溃着。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v1].behaviorHint,돈 이야기를 꺼내며 표정이 어두워진다.,Her face darkens as she brings up the money.,お金の話を切り出し、表情が暗くなる。,提起钱的事时，表情暗了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v1].text,그 집 아버지가 수민이에게 돈 부탁을 한 적이 있습니다. 투자라는 말도 들었습니다.,That family's father once asked Su-min for money. I also heard the word investment.,あの家のお父さんがスミンにお金を頼んだことがあります。投資という言葉も聞きました。,那家的父亲曾向秀敏开口要钱。我也听到过投资这个说法。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v10].behaviorHint,정이 묻어나도 과장은 피한다.,"Affection shows, but she avoids exaggeration.",情はにじむが、誇張は避ける。,带着感情，但避免夸张。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v10].text,수민이가 돈을 돌려받지 못했다는 말까지 들었습니다. 그래서 손절이 그렇게 됐습니다.,I even heard that Su-min did not get the money back. That is how the break happened.,スミンがお金を返してもらえなかったという話まで聞きました。だから絶交はああなったのです。,我甚至听说秀敏没有拿回钱。所以断交才会变成那样。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v2].behaviorHint,수민이를 감싸지만 본 사실은 또렷하게 말한다.,"She protects Su-min, but states the facts clearly.",スミンをかばいながらも、見た事実ははっきり話す。,虽然维护秀敏，但清楚说出事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v2].text,수민이가 돈 때문에 힘들어했습니다. 그래도 그 집 딸에게는 말 못 하겠다고 했습니다.,"Su-min was struggling because of the money. Even so, she said she could not tell that family's daughter.",スミンはお金のことで苦しんでいました。それでも、あの家の娘さんには言えないと言っていました。,秀敏因为钱的事很痛苦。可她还是说不能告诉那家的女儿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v3].behaviorHint,그 집 딸을 조심스럽게 언급한다.,She mentions that family's daughter carefully.,あの家の娘さんに慎重に触れる。,谨慎提到那家的女儿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v3].text,"제가 본 건 그 집 아버지가 수민이를 찾아온 일과, 이후 수민이가 울던 모습입니다.","What I saw was that family's father coming to Su-min, and Su-min crying afterward.",私が見たのは、あの家のお父さんがスミンを訪ねてきたことと、その後スミンが泣いていた姿です。,我看到的是那家的父亲来找秀敏，以及之后秀敏哭泣的样子。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v4].behaviorHint,수민이가 울던 장면에서 말이 느려진다.,Her speech slows at the scene of Su-min crying.,スミンが泣いていた場面で言葉が遅くなる。,说到秀敏哭泣的场面时，语速慢了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v4].text,수민이는 그 집 딸이 아버지 문제로 다칠까 봐 말을 못 한다고 했습니다.,Su-min said she could not speak because that family's daughter might be hurt by her father's issue.,スミンは、あの家の娘さんがお父さんの問題で傷つくかもしれないから話せないと言っていました。,秀敏说，因为那家的女儿可能会因父亲的问题受伤，所以自己不能说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v5].behaviorHint,정이 묻어나도 과장은 피한다.,"Affection shows, but she avoids exaggeration.",情はにじむが、誇張は避ける。,带着感情，但避免夸张。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v5].text,돈이 오갔다는 건 수민이 입에서 들었습니다. 갚아지지 않아 많이 힘들어했습니다.,I heard from Su-min herself that money had changed hands. She was in a lot of pain because it was not repaid.,お金が行き来したことは、スミンの口から聞きました。返してもらえず、かなり苦しんでいました。,钱确实有往来，是秀敏亲口说的。因为没还回来，她很痛苦。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v6].behaviorHint,돈 이야기를 꺼내며 표정이 어두워진다.,Her face darkens as she brings up the money.,お金の話を切り出し、表情が暗くなる。,提起钱的事时，表情暗了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v6].text,"그 집 아버지가 부탁을 했고, 수민이는 거절을 잘 못 했던 것 같습니다.","That family's father made a request, and Su-min seems to have been bad at refusing.",あの家のお父さんが頼み、スミンは断るのがうまくできなかったようです。,那家的父亲提出了请求，秀敏似乎不太会拒绝。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v7].behaviorHint,수민이를 감싸지만 본 사실은 또렷하게 말한다.,"She protects Su-min, but states the facts clearly.",スミンをかばいながらも、見た事実ははっきり話す。,虽然维护秀敏，但清楚说出事实。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v7].text,수민이는 자기 억울함보다 그 집 딸이 받을 충격을 더 걱정했습니다.,Su-min worried more about the shock that family's daughter would feel than about her own unfairness.,スミンは自分の悔しさより、あの家の娘さんが受ける衝撃を心配していました。,秀敏比起自己的委屈，更担心那家女儿会受到的冲击。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v8].behaviorHint,그 집 딸을 조심스럽게 언급한다.,She mentions that family's daughter carefully.,あの家の娘さんに慎重に触れる。,谨慎提到那家的女儿。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v8].text,"저는 수민이가 변심해서 끊은 게 아니라, 말 못 할 돈 문제에 눌렸다고 봤습니다.","I saw Su-min not as someone who changed and cut ties, but as someone crushed by a money problem she could not talk about.",私はスミンが心変わりして切ったのではなく、言えないお金の問題に押しつぶされたのだと見ていました。,我认为秀敏不是变心才断开，而是被无法说出口的钱的问题压住了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v9].behaviorHint,수민이가 울던 장면에서 말이 느려진다.,Her speech slows at the scene of Su-min crying.,スミンが泣いていた場面で言葉が遅くなる。,说到秀敏哭泣的场面时，语速慢了下来。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_partial_.variants_w-3-partial-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|partial].variants[w-3-partial-v9].text,"그 집 딸에게 말하면 아버지 얘기가 되니, 수민이가 입을 닫았던 겁니다.","If she told that family's daughter, it would become a story about the father, so Su-min closed her mouth.",あの家の娘さんに話せばお父さんの話になるので、スミンは口を閉ざしたのです。,如果告诉那家的女儿，就会变成她父亲的问题，所以秀敏闭上了嘴。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v1_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v1].behaviorHint,수민이를 걱정하는 눈빛으로 천천히 말한다.,"She speaks slowly, with worried eyes for Su-min.",スミンを心配する目でゆっくり話す。,带着担心秀敏的眼神，慢慢说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v1_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v1].text,수민이가 예전에 많이 힘들어한 건 봤습니다. 그 집 딸하고 틀어진 뒤였습니다.,I saw that Su-min had a very hard time before. It was after she fell out with that family's daughter.,スミンが昔かなりつらそうだったのは見ました。あの家の娘さんとこじれた後でした。,我看见过秀敏以前很难受。那是在她和那家的女儿闹僵之后。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v10_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v10].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬으며 감정을 누른다.,She searches her memory while holding back emotion.,記憶をたどりながら感情を抑える。,一边回忆，一边压住情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v10_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v10].text,수민이가 먼저 사람을 버린 것처럼만 말하기엔 제가 본 장면이 있습니다.,I saw something that makes it hard to say Su-min was the one who threw people away first.,スミンが先に人を捨てたとだけ言うには、私が見た場面があります。,要说秀敏是先抛下别人的人，我看到的场面让我很难这样说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v2_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v2].behaviorHint,정이 섞인 말투지만 본 것만 말하려 애쓴다.,"Her tone carries affection, but she tries to speak only to what she saw.",情の混じる口調だが、見たことだけを話そうとする。,语气带着感情，但努力只说自己看到的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v2_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v2].text,동네에서 그 집 아버지를 본 적은 있습니다. 그 뒤 수민이가 가게에 온 적도 있고요.,"I did see that family's father in the neighborhood. After that, Su-min came to the shop too.",町内であの家のお父さんを見たことはあります。その後、スミンが店に来たこともありました。,我在附近见过那家的父亲。之后秀敏也来过店里。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v3_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v3].behaviorHint,그 집 쪽 얘기에서 잠시 한숨을 쉰다.,She sighs briefly at talk of that family.,あの家の話で、しばらくため息をつく。,说到那家时，短暂叹气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v3_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v3].text,"자세한 돈 이야기는 조심스럽지만, 수민이가 그 일로 울었던 건 기억합니다.","I have to be careful with the detailed money talk, but I remember Su-min crying over that matter.",詳しいお金の話は慎重になりますが、スミンがその件で泣いていたことは覚えています。,具体的钱的事我说起来要谨慎，但我记得秀敏因为那件事哭过。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v4_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v4].behaviorHint,수민이 이름을 부드럽게 낮춰 말한다.,She lowers Su-min's name softly.,スミンの名前をやわらかく低く呼ぶ。,轻轻低声说出秀敏的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v4_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v4].text,수민이가 그냥 변한 아이는 아니었습니다. 뭔가 크게 눌린 얼굴이었습니다.,Su-min was not a child who simply changed. Her face looked like something had pressed heavily on her.,スミンはただ変わった子ではありませんでした。何かに大きく押しつぶされた顔でした。,秀敏不是单纯变了的孩子。她的表情像被什么重重压住了。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v5_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v5].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬으며 감정을 누른다.,She searches her memory while holding back emotion.,記憶をたどりながら感情を抑える。,一边回忆，一边压住情绪。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v5_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v5].text,그 집 쪽 일로 수민이가 마음고생을 한 건 제가 봤습니다.,I saw Su-min suffer over something from that family's side.,あの家の側のことで、スミンが心を痛めていたのを私は見ました。,我看见过秀敏因为那家那边的事而痛苦。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v6_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v6].behaviorHint,수민이를 걱정하는 눈빛으로 천천히 말한다.,"She speaks slowly, with worried eyes for Su-min.",スミンを心配する目でゆっくり話す。,带着担心秀敏的眼神，慢慢说。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v6_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v6].text,"저는 수민이 편이라기보다, 그때 본 얼굴을 잊지 못합니다.",It is not that I am just on Su-min's side. I cannot forget the face I saw back then.,私はスミンの味方というより、あの時見た顔を忘れられないのです。,我不是说自己偏向秀敏，而是忘不了那时看到的表情。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v7_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v7].behaviorHint,정이 섞인 말투지만 본 것만 말하려 애쓴다.,"Her tone carries affection, but she tries to speak only to what she saw.",情の混じる口調だが、見たことだけを話そうとする。,语气带着感情，但努力只说自己看到的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v7_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v7].text,그 집 딸은 모를 수 있습니다. 하지만 수민이는 혼자 많이 버텼습니다.,That family's daughter may not have known. But Su-min endured a great deal alone.,あの家の娘さんは知らなかったかもしれません。でも、スミンは一人でたくさん耐えました。,那家的女儿可能不知道。但秀敏一个人承受了很多。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v8_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v8].behaviorHint,그 집 쪽 얘기에서 잠시 한숨을 쉰다.,She sighs briefly at talk of that family.,あの家の話で、しばらくため息をつく。,说到那家时，短暂叹气。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v8_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v8].text,가게에 와서도 수민이가 말을 다 못 하고 울었습니다. 이유가 가볍진 않아 보였습니다.,"Even when she came to the shop, Su-min could not say everything and cried. The reason did not look light.",店に来ても、スミンは全部は話せずに泣きました。理由は軽く見えませんでした。,她来店里时，也没能把话说完就哭了。理由看起来并不轻。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v9_.behaviorHint,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v9].behaviorHint,수민이 이름을 부드럽게 낮춰 말한다.,She lowers Su-min's name softly.,スミンの名前をやわらかく低く呼ぶ。,轻轻低声说出秀敏的名字。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
non_party_scripted_text_src_data_scriptedText_friend-01_channels_witness_.entries_w-3_vague_.variants_w-3-vague-v9_.text,non_party_scripted_text,src/data/scriptedText,friend-01,channels[witness].entries[w-3|vague].variants[w-3-vague-v9].text,그 집 아버지와 수민이 사이에 돈 이야기가 있었다는 정도는 알고 있습니다.,I know at least that there was money talk between that family's father and Su-min.,あの家のお父さんとスミンの間にお金の話があったという程度は知っています。,我至少知道，那家的父亲和秀敏之间有过钱的事。,"Scripted text channel without party a/b as speaker: system, judge, witness, dossier, mediation, aftermath, and milestone copy."
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_0_.system.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[0].system.text,"결혼을 3주 앞둔 송다은. 손절한 전 친구 최수민이 최근 9일 동안 예비신랑에게 전화 6번, 문자 11번을 보냈다. 송다은은 이를 집착으로 보고 재판을 신청했다.","Song Da-eun is three weeks from her wedding. Her former friend Choi Su-min, whom she cut ties with, has called her fiancé 6 times and sent him 11 text messages over the past 9 days. Song Da-eun sees it as obsession and has applied for trial.",結婚を3週間後に控えたソン・ダウン。絶交した元友人チェ・スミンが、最近9日間で婚約者に電話6回、メッセージ11回を送っていた。ソン・ダウンはこれを執着と見て、裁判を申し立てた。,距离婚礼还有三周的宋多恩。已断交的前朋友崔秀敏在最近9天内给她的未婚夫打了6次电话、发了11条短信。宋多恩将此视为执着，并申请了审判。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_33_.system.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[33].system.text,"예비신랑 연락 기록, 공통 친구 단톡방 캡처, 과거 손절 직전 카톡까지 공개됐다. 최수민은 연락 사실은 인정하지만 의도는 집착이 아니었다고만 말한다. 이제 심문을 통해 그 연락이 정말 선을 넘은 집착이었는지, 아니면 다른 이유가 있었는지 가려야 한다.","The fiancé's contact logs, screenshots from the mutual-friends group chat, and even the KakaoTalk messages from just before the old break have been revealed. Choi Su-min admits she made the contact, but says only that the intent was not obsession. Now the interrogation must determine whether the contact truly crossed the line into obsession, or whether there was another reason.",婚約者の連絡記録、共通の友人グループチャットのスクリーンショット、過去の絶交直前のカカオトークまで公開された。チェ・スミンは連絡した事実は認めるが、意図は執着ではなかったとだけ話す。これから尋問を通じて、その連絡が本当に一線を越えた執着だったのか、それとも別の理由があったのかを見極めなければならない。,未婚夫的联系记录、共同朋友群聊截图，甚至过去断交前夕的KakaoTalk记录都已公开。崔秀敏承认联系过，但只说意图并非执着。现在必须通过审问分辨，那些联系究竟是真的越线执着，还是另有原因。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c1_.choice_c1_ask_b_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_ask_b].text,"최수민 씨, 왜 연락했는지 직접 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, state directly why you contacted him.",チェ・スミンさん、なぜ連絡したのか直接話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请直接说明你为什么联系他。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c1_.choice_c1_calm_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_calm].text,양측 모두 진정하십시오. 순서대로 듣겠습니다.,"Both sides, calm down. I will hear you in order.",双方とも落ち着いてください。順番に聞きます。,双方都请冷静。我会按顺序听取。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c1_.choice_c1_check_a_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c1].choice[c1_check_a].text,"송다은 씨, 그렇게 판단한 근거를 더 확인하겠습니다.","Ms. Song, I will further confirm the basis for that judgment.",ソン・ダウンさん、そのように判断した根拠をさらに確認します。,宋多恩女士，我会进一步确认你这样判断的依据。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c2_.choice_c2_ask_past_a_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_ask_past_a].text,"송다은 씨, 예전 손절 경위를 조금 더 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Song, tell us a little more about how the old break happened.",ソン・ダウンさん、以前の絶交の経緯をもう少し話してください。,宋多恩女士，请再多说明一点过去断交的经过。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c2_.choice_c2_give_time_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_give_time].text,"최수민 씨, 바로 말하기 어렵다면 정리해서 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, if it is hard to speak immediately, organize your thoughts and answer.",チェ・スミンさん、すぐ話すのが難しければ、整理してから話してください。,崔秀敏女士，如果现在难以开口，请整理后再说。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c2_.choice_c2_press_b_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c2].choice[c2_press_b].text,"최수민 씨, 숨기지 말고 왜 연락했는지 분명히 말씀하십시오.","Ms. Choi, do not hide it. State clearly why you contacted him.",チェ・スミンさん、隠さず、なぜ連絡したのか明確に話してください。,崔秀敏女士，请不要隐瞒，明确说明为什么联系他。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c3_.choice_c3_current_first_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_current_first].text,현재 연락의 성격부터 보겠습니다.,We will first examine the nature of the current contact.,まず現在の連絡の性質から見ます。,先看当前联系的性质。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c3_.choice_c3_past_first_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_past_first].text,과거 손절부터 정리하겠습니다.,We will first organize the old break.,まず過去の絶交から整理します。,先整理过去断交的问题。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
phase_dialogue_judge_choice_src_data_dialogues_phase1_friend-01_dialogues_c3_.choice_c3_separate_.text,phase_dialogue_judge_choice,src/data/dialogues/phase1,friend-01,dialogues[c3].choice[c3_separate].text,과거와 현재를 섞지 말고 각각 듣겠습니다.,"We will hear the past and the present separately, without mixing them.",過去と現在を混ぜず、それぞれ聞きます。,不要混淆过去和现在，我会分别听取。,Phase 1 system narration and judge choice text. Party a/b dialogue entries are excluded.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-1_.description,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-1].description,"연락 횟수가 늘어난 이유가 집착인지, 답이 없어 확인 요청이 반복된 것인지 구분한다.","Distinguish whether the increase in contact was obsession, or repeated attempts to confirm because there was no answer.",連絡回数が増えた理由が執着なのか、返事がなく確認の依頼が繰り返されたのかを切り分ける。,区分联系次数增加是出于执着，还是因为没有回应而反复请求确认。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-1_.label,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-1].label,무응답과 반복의 이유,No Response and Repetition,無応答と反復の理由,无回应与反复的理由,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-2_.description,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-2].description,예비신랑이 최수민에게 다은 몰래 부탁하거나 사적으로 끌고 간 흐름을 확인한다.,"Confirm whether the fiancé secretly asked Choi Su-min for something behind Da-eun's back, or drew her into a private exchange.",婚約者がダウンに隠れてチェ・スミンに頼みごとをしたり、私的なやり取りへ引き込んだ流れを確認する。,确认未婚夫是否背着多恩私下请求崔秀敏，或把她带入私人交流。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-2_.label,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-2].label,비공개 부탁의 압박,Pressure of a Private Request,非公開の頼みによる圧力,私下请求的压力,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-3_.description,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-3].description,송다은이 아버지의 부탁을 가족 일로만 보고 마음에 걸리는 대목을 늦게 본 과정을 확인한다.,"Confirm how Song Da-eun treated her father's request as only a family matter, and only later saw the parts that bothered her.",ソン・ダウンが父の頼みを家族のこととしてだけ見て、気にかかる部分を遅れて見た過程を確認する。,确认宋多恩如何只把父亲的请求看作家事，并迟迟才看到让人在意的部分。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-3_.label,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-3].label,아버지 문제를 외면한 지점,Avoiding the Father's Issue,父の問題を避けた地点,回避父亲问题的地方,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-4_.description,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-4].description,"호의인지 차용인지, 차용증과 일부 상환이 최수민의 침묵과 손절 이유를 어떻게 뒷받침하는지 확인한다.","Confirm whether it was goodwill or a loan, and how the IOU and partial repayment support Choi Su-min's silence and the reason for cutting ties.",好意なのか借入なのか、借用書と一部返済がチェ・スミンの沈黙と絶交理由をどう裏づけるのか確認する。,确认那是好意还是借款，以及借条和部分偿还如何支撑崔秀敏的沉默与断交理由。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-4_.label,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-4].label,차용증의 무게,Weight of the IOU,借用書の重み,借条的分量,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-5_.description,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-5].description,"송다은이 최수민에게 확인하기 전에 단톡방에 올렸는지, 공개 이후 바로잡을 기회가 있었는지 확인한다.","Confirm whether Song Da-eun posted in the group chat before checking with Choi Su-min, and whether there was a chance to correct it after disclosure.",ソン・ダウンがチェ・スミンに確認する前にグループチャットへ投稿したのか、公開後に正す機会があったのかを確認する。,确认宋多恩是否在向崔秀敏求证前就发到群聊，以及公开后是否有机会更正。,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
question_angle_catalog_src_data_scriptedAngles_friend-01_angles_d-5_.label,question_angle_catalog,src/data/scriptedAngles,friend-01,angles[d-5].label,확인 없는 공개,Public Without Verification,確認なしの公開,未经确认的公开,Free interrogation angle label/description/keywords.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d1-chat-mood_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-chat-mood].behaviorHint,머쓱해하며 솔직하게,awkward but honest,気まずそうに正直に,尴尬但诚实,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d1-chat-mood_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-chat-mood].question,그 캡처가 올라온 직후 단톡방 분위기가 어떻게 흘렀습니까?,How did the group chat atmosphere change right after that screenshot was posted?,そのスクリーンショットが上がった直後、グループチャットの雰囲気はどう流れましたか。,那张截图发出来后，群聊气氛是怎么变化的？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d1-chat-mood_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-chat-mood].testimony,처음엔 다들 놀랐어요. 연락 횟수만 보이니까 솔직히 저도 그분이 선 넘은 줄 알았습니다.,"At first everyone was shocked. Since only the number of contacts was visible, honestly, I also thought that person had crossed the line.",最初はみんな驚きました。連絡回数だけが見えていたので、正直、私もその人が一線を越えたのだと思いました。,一开始大家都很震惊。因为只看得到联系次数，说实话，我当时也以为那个人越界了。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d1-chat-mood_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-chat-mood].topic,단톡방 분위기를 묻는다,Ask about the group chat atmosphere,グループチャットの雰囲気を尋ねる,询问群聊气氛,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d1-frame-wording_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-frame-wording].behaviorHint,기억을 더듬으며,searching memory,記憶を探りながら,一边回忆一边说,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d1-frame-wording_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-frame-wording].question,송다은 씨가 그 캡처를 올릴 때 어떤 식으로 설명했습니까?,How did Ms. Song Da-eun describe the screenshot when she posted it?,ソン・ダウンさんはそのスクリーンショットを上げる時、どのように説明しましたか。,宋多恩女士发那张截图时，是怎么说明的？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d1-frame-wording_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-frame-wording].testimony,"그냥 기록만 올린 게 아니라, 예전에도 비슷했다는 식으로 말이 번졌습니다. 그래서 분위기가 더 한쪽으로 기울었어요.",She did not simply post the record. The talk spread as if something similar had happened before. That made the atmosphere lean even more to one side.,ただ記録だけを上げたのではなく、以前にも似たことがあったという感じで話が広がりました。それで雰囲気がさらに一方に傾きました。,她不是单纯上传记录，而是把话说成以前也发生过类似的事。所以气氛更偏向一边了。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d1-frame-wording_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d1-frame-wording].topic,처음 붙은 말의 방향을 묻는다,Ask about the first framing words,最初についた言葉の方向を尋ねる,询问最初定性的说法,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d2-blame-spread_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-blame-spread].behaviorHint,답답해하며,frustrated,もどかしそうに,感到憋闷,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d2-blame-spread_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-blame-spread].question,그 말이 붙은 뒤 비난은 얼마나 빨리 번졌습니까?,"After that label attached to her, how quickly did the blame spread?",その言葉がついた後、非難はどれくらい早く広がりましたか。,贴上那个说法后，指责扩散得有多快？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d2-blame-spread_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-blame-spread].testimony,"거의 몇 분 안 걸렸어요. 송다은 씨가 “수민이가 또 내 남자한테 연락한다”고 올리자, 바로 “결혼 앞두고 왜 저러냐”는 말이 쏟아졌습니다.","It barely took a few minutes. Once Ms. Song Da-eun posted, ""Su-min is contacting my man again,"" comments like ""Why is she doing that before a wedding?"" poured out immediately.",ほとんど数分もかかりませんでした。ソン・ダウンさんが「スミンがまた私の男に連絡している」と上げると、すぐに「結婚を控えてなぜそんなことをするのか」という言葉があふれました。,几乎没过几分钟。宋多恩女士发出“秀敏又联系我男人”之后，马上就有人说“都快结婚了，她为什么这样”。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d2-blame-spread_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-blame-spread].topic,비난이 번진 속도를 묻는다,Ask how fast the blame spread,非難が広がった速さを尋ねる,询问指责扩散速度,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d2-no-one-checked_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-no-one-checked].behaviorHint,미안해하며,apologetic,申し訳なさそうに,带着歉意,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d2-no-one-checked_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-no-one-checked].question,그 뒤에 최수민 씨에게 직접 사정을 물은 사람이 있었습니까?,"After that, did anyone ask Ms. Choi Su-min directly what had happened?",その後、チェ・スミンさんに直接事情を聞いた人はいましたか。,之后有人直接问过崔秀敏女士事情经过吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d2-no-one-checked_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-no-one-checked].testimony,없었습니다. 다들 캡처 보고 바로 편을 갈랐어요. 저도 그때는 분위기에 눌려서 따로 연락을 못 했습니다.,No. Everyone chose sides right after seeing the screenshot. I was also pressed by the atmosphere and did not contact her separately.,いませんでした。みんなスクリーンショットを見てすぐに立場を決めました。私もその時は雰囲気に押されて、別に連絡できませんでした。,没有。大家看了截图就立刻站队了。我当时也被气氛压住，没有另外联系她。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d2-no-one-checked_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d2-no-one-checked].topic,직접 확인한 사람이 있었는지 묻는다,Ask whether anyone checked directly,直接確認した人がいたか尋ねる,询问是否有人直接确认,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d3-first-conclusion_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d3-first-conclusion].behaviorHint,미안함을 담아 단호하게,"firm, with apology",申し訳なさを込めて断固と,带着歉意但坚定,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d3-first-conclusion_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d3-first-conclusion].question,증인 기준으로 답하십시오. 그날 누가 먼저 결론을 만들어 버렸습니까?,Answer from your own perspective. Who made the conclusion first that day?,証人の基準で答えてください。その日、誰が先に結論を作ってしまいましたか。,请按证人的判断回答。那天是谁先制造了结论？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d3-first-conclusion_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d3-first-conclusion].testimony,"순서가 분명했습니다. 송다은 씨가 먼저 “또 그랬다”는 식으로 단정했고, 그 말이 단톡방 기준이 돼버렸어요. 최수민 씨 쪽 얘기는 아무도 듣지 않았습니다.","The order was clear. Ms. Song Da-eun first framed it as ""she did it again,"" and that became the standard in the group chat. No one listened to Ms. Choi Su-min’s side.",順序ははっきりしていました。ソン・ダウンさんが先に「またやった」という形で断定し、その言葉がグループチャットの基準になってしまいました。チェ・スミンさん側の話は誰も聞きませんでした。,顺序很清楚。宋多恩女士先用“她又那样了”的方式下了定论，那句话就成了群聊里的标准。没有人听崔秀敏女士那边的说法。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w1-d3-first-conclusion_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w1-d3-first-conclusion].topic,누가 먼저 결론을 만들었는지 묻는다,Ask who created the conclusion first,誰が先に結論を作ったか尋ねる,询问谁先制造结论,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d1-after-work-talk_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-after-work-talk].behaviorHint,조심스럽게,cautiously,慎重に,谨慎地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d1-after-work-talk_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-after-work-talk].question,회식 자리 뒤에 선배가 최수민 씨 이야기를 꺼낸 적이 있습니까?,"After the company dinner, did your senior ever bring up Ms. Choi Su-min?",会食の後、先輩がチェ・スミンさんの話を出したことはありますか。,公司聚餐之后，你的前辈提起过崔秀敏女士吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d1-after-work-talk_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-after-work-talk].testimony,"네, 그분 얘길 한 적 있습니다. 처음엔 그냥 호감 정도로 가볍게 말하는 줄 알았어요.","Yes, he mentioned her. At first I thought he was just casually saying he found her attractive.",はい、その方の話をしたことがあります。最初は、ただ好感を軽く口にしているのだと思いました。,有，他提过她。一开始我以为他只是轻描淡写地说有好感。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d1-after-work-talk_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-after-work-talk].topic,회식 뒤 언급을 묻는다,Ask about remarks after the company dinner,会食後の言及を尋ねる,询问聚餐后的提及,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d1-contact-reaction_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-contact-reaction].behaviorHint,눈치를 보며,watching the room,様子をうかがいながら,看着周围气氛,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d1-contact-reaction_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-contact-reaction].question,연락 문제가 불거진 뒤 선배 반응은 어땠습니까?,"After the contact issue came up, how did your senior react?",連絡問題が表に出た後、先輩の反応はどうでしたか。,联系问题曝光后，你的前辈反应如何？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d1-contact-reaction_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-contact-reaction].testimony,"겉으로는 귀찮다는 식이었어요. 그런데 억울해서 화내는 사람보다는, 들켜서 불편해하는 쪽에 더 가까워 보였습니다.","Outwardly, he acted annoyed. But he seemed less like someone angry from unfairness and more like someone uncomfortable because he had been caught.",表向きは面倒くさそうにしていました。でも、不当で怒っている人というより、見つかって居心地が悪い人に近く見えました。,表面上他装作很烦。但他看起来不像是因为委屈而生气，更像是被发现后不自在。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d1-contact-reaction_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d1-contact-reaction].topic,문제 뒤 반응을 묻는다,Ask about his reaction after the contact issue,問題後の反応を尋ねる,询问联系问题后的反应,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d2-flirt-remark_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-flirt-remark].behaviorHint,못마땅해하며,disapproving,不快そうに,不赞同地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d2-flirt-remark_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-flirt-remark].question,"호감이라고 하셨는데, 구체적으로 어떤 말을 했습니까?",You said he showed interest. What exactly did he say?,好感と言いましたが、具体的にどんなことを言いましたか。,你说他有好感，具体他说了什么？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d2-flirt-remark_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-flirt-remark].testimony,"선배가 “그 필라테스 하는 분 괜찮더라”, “다은이 몰래 커피 한 번 보자고 하면 이상하냐” 이런 말을 했습니다. 약혼한 사람이 할 말은 아니었어요.","He said things like, ""That Pilates woman is nice,"" and ""Would it be weird if I asked her to get coffee without Da-eun knowing?"" It was not something an engaged man should say.",先輩は「あのピラティスをしている人、いいよな」「ダウンに内緒でコーヒーでも誘ったら変かな」などと言いました。婚約している人が言うことではありませんでした。,他说过“那个练普拉提的女生不错啊”“不让多恩知道，约她喝一次咖啡会不会很奇怪”之类的话。那不是订婚的人该说的话。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d2-flirt-remark_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-flirt-remark].topic,구체적으로 어떤 말을 했는지 묻는다,Ask exactly what he said,具体的に何を言ったか尋ねる,询问具体说过什么,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d2-why-looked-caught_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-why-looked-caught].behaviorHint,작게 한숨 쉬며,with a small sigh,小さくため息をつきながら,轻轻叹气,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d2-why-looked-caught_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-why-looked-caught].question,"왜 그렇게 보였는지, 들은 말을 기준으로 설명하십시오.","Explain why he looked that way, based on what you heard.",なぜそう見えたのか、聞いた言葉を基準に説明してください。,请根据你听到的话说明，为什么你会这样看。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d2-why-looked-caught_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-why-looked-caught].testimony,선배가 저한테 “괜히 내가 먼저 건드렸다가 일 커졌다”는 식으로 툭 말한 적이 있어요. 그래서 저는 최수민 씨 연락이 갑자기 시작된 건 아니라고 봤습니다.,"He once said to me, almost offhand, ""I made it worse by touching it first."" That is why I do not think Ms. Choi Su-min’s contact suddenly began out of nowhere.",先輩が私に「余計にこっちから触って事が大きくなった」とぽろっと言ったことがあります。だから私は、チェ・スミンさんの連絡が突然始まったわけではないと思いました。,他曾经随口对我说过：“是我先去碰，才把事情弄大了。”所以我认为，崔秀敏女士的联系并不是突然从无到有开始的。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d2-why-looked-caught_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d2-why-looked-caught].topic,왜 들킨 사람처럼 보였는지 묻는다,Ask why he looked caught,なぜ見つかった人のように見えたか尋ねる,询问为什么像被抓到的人,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d3-rejection-ignored_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d3-rejection-ignored].behaviorHint,불쾌했던 기억을 꺼내며,recalling an unpleasant memory,不快だった記憶を取り出しながら,说起令人不快的记忆,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d3-rejection-ignored_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d3-rejection-ignored].question,증인 판단이 아니라 본 장면으로 답하십시오. 선배가 먼저 선을 넘었다고 볼 정황이 있었습니까?,"Answer based on what you saw, not your judgment. Was there a circumstance showing your senior crossed the line first?",証人の判断ではなく、見た場面で答えてください。先輩が先に一線を越えたと見られる事情はありましたか。,不要说判断，请按你看到的场面回答。有没有情况显示你的前辈先越界？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d3-rejection-ignored_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d3-rejection-ignored].testimony,"있었습니다. 선배가 휴대폰을 보여주면서 “친구 남자친구니까 이러지 말라네” 하고 웃어넘긴 적이 있어요. 거절 답장을 받고도 “한 번쯤은 넘어오겠지”라고 했습니다. 제가 본 건 최수민 씨 집착이 아니라, 선배 쪽의 가벼운 들이댐이었습니다.","Yes. He once showed me his phone and laughed, saying, ""She says I should not do this because I am her friend’s boyfriend."" Even after receiving a rejection, he said, ""She will come around at least once."" What I saw was not Ms. Choi Su-min’s obsession, but his light, pushy approach.",ありました。先輩が携帯を見せながら、「友達の彼氏だからやめろってさ」と笑い流したことがあります。拒絶の返信を受けても、「一度くらいはこっちに来るだろう」と言っていました。私が見たのはチェ・スミンさんの執着ではなく、先輩側の軽い押しでした。,有。他曾经给我看手机，笑着说：“她说我是朋友的男朋友，所以不能这样。”收到拒绝回复后，他还说“总有一次会过来的吧”。我看到的不是崔秀敏女士的执着，而是前辈那边轻率的靠近。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w2-d3-rejection-ignored_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w2-d3-rejection-ignored].topic,거절 뒤에도 선을 넘었는지 묻는다,Ask whether he crossed the line after being rejected,拒絶後も一線を越えたか尋ねる,询问被拒后是否仍越界,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d1-crying-scene_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-crying-scene].behaviorHint,조심스럽게 회상하며,recalling cautiously,慎重に回想しながら,谨慎回想,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d1-crying-scene_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-crying-scene].question,"몇 년 전 카페에서 그날, 최수민 씨 상태가 어땠습니까?","At the cafe a few years ago, what was Ms. Choi Su-min’s condition that day?",数年前、カフェでその日、チェ・スミンさんの状態はどうでしたか。,几年前在咖啡店那天，崔秀敏女士是什么状态？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d1-crying-scene_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-crying-scene].testimony,젊은 손님 한 분이 대화 끝나고 혼자 남아서 한참 울었어요. 그냥 서운해서 우는 얼굴은 아니었습니다.,A young customer stayed alone after the conversation and cried for a long time. It did not look like a face crying just from hurt feelings.,若いお客様が一人、会話が終わった後に残って長く泣いていました。ただ寂しくて泣く顔ではありませんでした。,有位年轻客人谈话结束后一个人留下来哭了很久。那不是单纯因为难过而哭的表情。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d1-crying-scene_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-crying-scene].topic,그날 손님 상태를 묻는다,Ask about the customer’s condition that day,その日の客の状態を尋ねる,询问当天客人的状态,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d1-money-pressure_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-money-pressure].behaviorHint,찜찜해하며,uneasy,釈然としない様子で,感到不舒服,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d1-money-pressure_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-money-pressure].question,"그 자리 대화 분위기는 부탁에 가까웠습니까, 압박에 가까웠습니까?",Did the conversation at that table sound closer to a request or to pressure?,その場の会話はお願いに近かったですか、それとも圧迫に近かったですか。,那次对话的气氛更像请求，还是更像施压？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d1-money-pressure_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-money-pressure].testimony,"처음엔 부탁처럼 들렸는데, 들을수록 거절 못 하게 몰아붙이는 쪽에 가까웠어요. 돈 얘기라는 건 알겠더라고요.","At first it sounded like a request, but the more I listened, the more it felt like he was cornering her so she could not refuse. I could tell it was about money.",最初はお願いのように聞こえましたが、聞けば聞くほど断れないように追い込む側に近かったです。お金の話だということは分かりました。,一开始听起来像请求，但越听越像把人逼到不能拒绝。我能听出来是在说钱。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d1-money-pressure_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d1-money-pressure].topic,대화 분위기를 묻는다,Ask about the tone of the conversation,会話の雰囲気を尋ねる,询问对话气氛,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d2-father-identity_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-father-identity].behaviorHint,난처해하며,awkward,困ったように,为难地,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d2-father-identity_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-father-identity].question,그 중년 남성이 누구였는지 나중에 알게 됐습니까?,Did you later find out who that middle-aged man was?,その中年男性が誰だったか、後で分かりましたか。,你后来知道那个中年男人是谁了吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d2-father-identity_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-father-identity].testimony,"나중에 동네에서 듣고 알았습니다. 송다은 씨 아버님이더라고요. 며칠 뒤 제가 다은 씨한테 그날 일 괜찮았냐고 묻자, “수민이랑 끝냈다”는 말만 짧게 했습니다.","I later heard in the neighborhood that he was Ms. Song Da-eun’s father. A few days later I asked Da-eun if that day was all right, and she only said briefly, ""I ended things with Su-min.""",後で近所で聞いて分かりました。ソン・ダウンさんのお父様でした。数日後、私がダウンさんにその日は大丈夫だったか尋ねると、「スミンとは終わらせた」とだけ短く言いました。,后来我在附近听说了。他是宋多恩女士的父亲。几天后我问多恩那天还好吗，她只短短地说了一句：“我和秀敏结束了。”,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d2-father-identity_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-father-identity].topic,그 남성이 누구였는지 묻는다,Ask who the man was,その男性が誰だったか尋ねる,询问那个男人是谁,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d2-overheard-phrase_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-overheard-phrase].behaviorHint,낮게 말하며,speaking quietly,低い声で,低声说,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d2-overheard-phrase_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-overheard-phrase].question,울기 전에 어떤 말이 오갔는지 들은 게 있습니까?,Did you hear what was said before she started crying?,泣く前にどんな言葉が交わされたか、聞いたことはありますか。,她哭之前，你听到他们说了什么吗？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d2-overheard-phrase_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-overheard-phrase].testimony,네. 그 남성분이 “이번만 막아주면 금방 갚겠다”고 했습니다. 그 젊은 분은 “저한테 왜 또 그러세요”라고 했고요. 한두 번 있었던 일 같지 않았습니다.,"Yes. The man said, ""If you cover this just this once, I will pay you back soon."" The young woman said, ""Why are you doing this to me again?"" It did not sound like it had happened only once or twice.",はい。その男性が「今回だけ防いでくれればすぐ返す」と言いました。その若い方は「なぜまた私にそんなことをするんですか」と言っていました。一度や二度のことではなさそうでした。,听到了。那个男人说：“这次你只要帮我挡一下，我很快还你。”那个年轻人说：“你为什么又这样对我？”听起来不像只有一两次。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d2-overheard-phrase_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d2-overheard-phrase].topic,울기 전 들은 말을 묻는다,Ask what was said before she cried,泣く前に聞いた言葉を尋ねる,询问她哭前听到的话,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d3-breakup-cause_.behaviorHint,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d3-breakup-cause].behaviorHint,신중하지만 단호하게,careful but firm,慎重だが断固として,谨慎但坚定,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d3-breakup-cause_.question,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d3-breakup-cause].question,"그날 장면을 기준으로 보면, 과거 손절 원인은 무엇에 더 가까워 보였습니까?","Based on what you saw that day, what did the cause of the earlier break look closer to?",その日の場面を基準に見ると、過去の絶縁原因は何に近く見えましたか。,以那天的场面来看，过去断交的原因更接近什么？,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d3-breakup-cause_.testimony,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d3-breakup-cause].testimony,"제가 본 건 친구 변심이 아니라 돈 문제였습니다. 송다은 씨 아버님이 최수민 씨를 다그쳤고, 최수민 씨는 다은 씨에게 말도 못 한 채 혼자 무너졌어요. 그 뒤에 관계가 끊긴 거라면, 먼저 금을 낸 쪽은 친구가 아니라 어른 쪽에 더 가까웠습니다.","What I saw was not a friend changing her mind, but a money problem. Ms. Song Da-eun’s father pressed Ms. Choi Su-min, and Ms. Choi Su-min fell apart alone without being able to tell Da-eun. If the relationship broke after that, the first crack came closer from the adult, not from the friend.",私が見たのは友人の心変わりではなく、お金の問題でした。ソン・ダウンさんのお父様がチェ・スミンさんを責め、チェ・スミンさんはダウンさんに言えないまま一人で崩れていました。その後に関係が切れたのなら、先にひびを入れたのは友人ではなく大人の側に近かったです。,我看到的不是朋友变心，而是钱的问题。宋多恩女士的父亲逼迫崔秀敏女士，崔秀敏女士无法告诉多恩，一个人崩溃了。如果之后关系断了，那么先制造裂痕的更像是大人那边，而不是朋友。,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
witness_testimony_src_data_witnessTestimonyData_friend-01.ts_friend-01_witnessTestimony_w3-d3-breakup-cause_.topic,witness_testimony,src/data/witnessTestimonyData/friend-01.ts,friend-01,witnessTestimony[w3-d3-breakup-cause].topic,과거 손절 원인을 묻는다,Ask about the cause of the earlier break,過去の絶縁原因を尋ねる,询问过去断交的原因,Witness topic/question/testimony/behavior hint. These are not character A/B dialogue lines.
