ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.skip,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.skip,건너뛰기,Skip,スキップ,跳过,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.slide.conflict.body,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.slide.conflict.body,"감정과 기록, 침묵과 변명, 계산과 오해가 서로 다른 얼굴을 드러냅니다.","Emotions and records, silence and excuses, calculation and misunderstanding each reveal a different face.",感情と記録、沈黙と言い訳、計算と誤解が、それぞれ別の顔を見せます。,情感与记录、沉默与辩解、计算与误会，会展现出不同面孔。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.slide.conflict.title,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.slide.conflict.title,옳고 그름 보다 어긋난 진실에 집중하세요.,"Focus on misaligned truths, not simply right and wrong.",正しさよりも、食い違う真実に目を向けましょう。,请关注错位的真相，而不只是对错。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.slide.digitalCourt.body,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.slide.digitalCourt.body,"질문, 증거, 판단을 연결하며 서로 다른 진실을 가려내는 모의 재판 게임입니다.","A mock-trial deduction game where questions, evidence, and judgment connect to reveal conflicting truths.",問い、証拠、判断をつなぎ、食い違う真実を見極める模擬裁判ゲームです。,这是一款将讯问、证据与判断连接起来，辨明不同真相的模拟法庭推理游戏。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.slide.digitalCourt.title,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.slide.digitalCourt.title,현대판 솔로몬이 되어 갈등을 해결해주세요.,Become a modern Solomon and resolve each conflict.,現代のソロモンとなり、争いを解きほぐしましょう。,成为现代所罗门，解决每一场冲突。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.slide.interrogation.body,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.slide.interrogation.body,"중요한 것은 정보의 양이 아니라, 파편화 된 단서의 연결입니다.","What matters is not the volume of information, but how the fragmented clues connect.",重要なのは情報の量ではなく、断片化した手がかりのつながりです。,重要的不是信息数量，而是碎片线索之间的连接。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.slide.interrogation.title,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.slide.interrogation.title,"질문하고, 증거를 제시하고, 흐름에 집중해주세요.","Ask questions, present evidence, and stay focused on the flow.",問い、証拠を示し、流れを見極めましょう。,发问、出示证据，并把握审理的走向。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.slide.ready.body,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.slide.ready.body,원하는 사건을 선택하여 지금 바로 재판을 시작할 수 있습니다.,Choose a case and begin the trial right away.,事件を選べば、すぐに裁判を始められます。,选择想要的案件，即可立即开始审判。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_home.ts_pc.home.intro.slide.ready.title,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/home.ts,,pc.home.intro.slide.ready.title,첫 사건이 당신을 기다리고 있습니다!,Your first case is waiting.,最初の事件があなたを待っています。,第一个案件正在等待你。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
