ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.actions.view.evidence.subtitle,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.actions.view.evidence.subtitle,"증거 제시, 조사, 감정, 증인 호출을 한곳에서 처리합니다.","Handle evidence presentation, investigation, appraisal, and witness calls in one place.",証拠提示、調査、鑑定、証人呼び出しを一か所で処理します。,在一处处理出示证据、调查、鉴定和证人呼叫。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
