ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.actions.view.question.subtitle,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.actions.view.question.subtitle,"현재 쟁점 기준 질문, 자유질문, 보조 선택을 제어합니다.","Control questions based on the current issue, free questions, and support choices.",現在の争点に基づく質問、自由質問、補助選択を操作します。,控制基于当前争议点的提问、自由提问和辅助选项。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
