ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.action.motive,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.action.motive,동기 탐색,Motive Probe,動機探索,动机探查,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.affectFlattening.hint,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.affectFlattening.hint,감정 표현이 희미합니다. 공감 접근이나 동기 탐색으로 이면을 들어내세요.,Their emotional expression is faint. Use Empathy Approach or Motive Probe to draw out what lies beneath.,感情表現が薄いです。共感アプローチや動機探索で内面を引き出してください。,情绪表达很淡。用共情接近或动机探查引出内心。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.affectFlattening.label,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.affectFlattening.label,감정 둔화,Flattened Affect,感情鈍化,情感钝化,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.avoidant.hint,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.avoidant.hint,답변을 흐리고 절차로 비껴갑니다. 사실 추궁으로 구체성을 끌어내세요.,They blur their answers and hide behind procedure. Use Press for Facts to draw out specifics.,答えをぼかし、手続きへ逃げます。事実追及で具体性を引き出してください。,会模糊回答并转向程序。用事实追问把具体内容拉出来。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.avoidant.label,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.avoidant.label,회피형,Avoidant,回避型,回避型,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.close,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.close,닫기,Close,閉じる,关闭,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.coldLogic.hint,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.coldLogic.hint,감정 없이 사실만 말합니다. 공감 접근으로 균열을 만들어 보세요.,"They state only facts, without emotion. Use Empathy Approach to create a crack.",感情を出さず事実だけを述べます。共感アプローチでほころびを作ってください。,几乎不带情绪，只说事实。用共情接近制造破绽。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.coldLogic.label,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.coldLogic.label,냉정 논리,Cold Logic,冷静論理,冷静逻辑,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.confrontational.hint,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.confrontational.hint,방어적으로 반격합니다. 공감 접근으로 긴장을 먼저 낮춰주세요.,They counter defensively. Use Empathy Approach to lower tension first.,防御的に反撃します。共感アプローチでまず緊張を下げてください。,会防御性反击。先用共情接近降低紧张。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
