ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.archetype.prematureSummary.hint,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.archetype.prematureSummary.hint,결론부터 요약합니다. 사실 추궁으로 흐름을 붙들어 두세요.,They start with the conclusion. Use Press for Facts to keep the sequence in view.,結論から要約します。事実追及で流れをつかんでください。,会先从结论开始概括。用事实追问抓住经过。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
