ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.court.resource.court.desc,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.court.resource.court.desc,무리한 압박과 절차 혼선을 버티는 힘입니다. 판결 안정성에도 영향을 줍니다.,This is the strength to withstand heavy pressure and procedural confusion. It also affects verdict stability.,強い圧力や手続きの混乱を受け止める力です。判決の安定性にも影響します。,用于承受过度压迫和程序混乱，也会影响裁决稳定性。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
