ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.record.unresolved.noJudgment,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.record.unresolved.noJudgment,"{dispute}: 아직 판단 기록이 없습니다. 당사자 진술, 증거 제시, 증인 심문 중 하나로 기준을 세워야 합니다.","{dispute}: no judgment has been recorded yet. Establish a basis through party statements, evidence presentation, or witness questioning.",{dispute}: まだ判断記録がありません。当事者陳述、証拠提示、証人尋問のいずれかで基準を立ててください。,{dispute}: 尚无判断记录。请通过当事人陈述、出示证据或证人询问建立依据。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.record.unresolved.partialJudgment,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.record.unresolved.partialJudgment,{dispute}: 내 판단은 기록됐지만 진실파악은 {stage}/5입니다. 반대 진술이나 추가 증거로 검증해야 합니다.,"{dispute}: your judgment is recorded, but Truth Progress is {stage}/5. Verify with opposing testimony or additional evidence.",{dispute}: 自分の判断は記録されていますが、真相把握は{stage}/5です。反対陳述や追加証拠で検証が必要です。,{dispute}: 你的判断已记录，但真相掌握为 {stage}/5。需要用相反陈述或追加证据验证。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
