ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.contradictionTip,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.contradictionTip,쟁점마다 별도로 누적됩니다. 최대 5/5에 도달하면 결정적 모순으로 자백을 끌어냅니다.,"Tracked separately for each issue. At 5/5, it becomes a decisive contradiction that can draw out a confession.",争点ごとに別々に蓄積されます。最大5/5に達すると決定的矛盾となり、自白を引き出します。,每个争议点单独累计。达到 5/5 后会成为决定性矛盾并引出坦白。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
