ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.emotion.defensiveDesc,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.emotion.defensiveDesc,방어가 견고합니다. 사실 추궁으로 구체적인 상황 파악을 시도해보세요.,Their guard is firm. Use Fact Pursuit to pin down the concrete situation.,防御が固い状態です。事実追及で具体的な状況を確認してください。,对方防备很强。使用事实追问来确认具体情况。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.emotion.resigned,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.emotion.resigned,체념,Resigned,諦観,认命,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.emotion.resignedDesc,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.emotion.resignedDesc,자백이 예상됩니다. 모든 심문 액션이 각각 효과적이니 적극 공략해보세요.,A confession is likely. Every questioning action can be effective now.,自白が見込まれます。各尋問アクションが有効に働きます。,可能即将坦白。各类询问行动此时都可能有效。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.emotion.shaken,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.emotion.shaken,동요,Shaken,動揺,动摇,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
