ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage0Desc,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage0Desc,사실 자체를 부인합니다. 모순이 거의 없어 공략이 어렵습니다.,They deny the fact itself. There are few contradictions to exploit.,事実そのものを否認します。矛盾が少なく攻略は困難です。,否认事实本身。几乎没有可利用的矛盾。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage1,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage1,일부 인정,Partial Admission,一部認定,部分承认,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage1Desc,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage1Desc,사소한 부분만 인정합니다. 핵심은 여전히 숨깁니다.,They admit only minor details while still hiding the core.,些細な部分だけ認め、核心はまだ隠します。,只承认细枝末节，核心仍被隐藏。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage2,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage2,핑계,Excuse,言い訳,借口,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage2Desc,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage2Desc,인정하되 정황과 이유를 들어 해명합니다.,"They admit part of it, then explain it away through circumstances or reasons.",一部を認めつつも、状況や理由で説明しようとします。,承认一部分，但用情况或理由解释过去。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
