ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage4,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage4,감정적,Emotional,感情的,情绪化,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage4Desc,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage4Desc,논리가 무너지고 감정이 앞섭니다. 자백 직전입니다.,Logic breaks down and emotion takes over. This is just before confession.,論理が崩れ、感情が前に出ます。自白直前です。,逻辑崩塌，情绪占据上风。接近坦白。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage5,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage5,자백,Confession,自白,坦白,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStage5Desc,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStage5Desc,사실을 그대로 인정합니다. 구체적인 정보가 모두 공개됩니다.,They admit the facts as they are. Specific information is fully revealed.,事実をそのまま認めます。具体的な情報がすべて公開されます。,如实承认事实。具体信息全部公开。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
