ui_i18n_message_src_i18n_messages_layout.ts_pc.right.drawer.lieStagesTip,ui_i18n_message,src/i18n/messages/layout.ts,,pc.right.drawer.lieStagesTip,"사실 추궁, 증거 제시, 공감 접근 등 액션의 효과로 단계가 상승합니다.","Fact Pursuit, evidence presentation, Empathy Approach, and similar actions raise the stage.",事実追及、証拠提示、共感アプローチなどの効果で段階が上がります。,事实追问、出示证据、共情接近等行动会推动真相进度上升。,"UI, system, panel, tooltip, or control label from i18n message bundle."
