,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/layout/Tutorial.tsx,,line:28,"하단에서 대상(민준/서연)을 선택하고, 질문 유형과 쟁점을 골라 질문하세요. 비활성화된 선택지는 현재 의미 없는 조합입니다.","Select a target (Min-jun/Seo-yeon) at the bottom, then choose a question type and issue. Disabled options are combinations that currently have no effect.",下部で対象（ミンジュン／ソヨン）を選び、質問タイプと争点を選んで質問してください。無効な選択肢は、現時点では意味のない組み合わせです。,请在底部选择对象（民俊/瑞妍），再选择提问类型和争议点进行提问。灰掉的选项表示当前没有意义的组合。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/layout/Tutorial.tsx,,line:35,증거 제시,Present Evidence,証拠提示,出示证据,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/layout/Tutorial.tsx,,line:36,확보한 증거를 대상에게 제시하면 거짓말이 붕괴됩니다. 증거 탭에서 4축 정보(신뢰도/완전성/출처/정당성)를 확인하세요.,"Present secured evidence to the target to break down lies. Check the Evidence tab for four-axis details: reliability, completeness, source, and legitimacy.",確保した証拠を対象に提示すると、嘘が崩れます。証拠タブで4軸情報（信頼度／完全性／出所／正当性）を確認してください。,向对象出示已取得的证据，可击破谎言。请在证据页查看四项信息：可信度、完整性、来源、正当性。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/layout/Tutorial.tsx,,line:43,재심문 & 신뢰 루트,Re-examination & Trust Route,再尋問＆信頼ルート,再审问与信任路线,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/layout/Tutorial.tsx,,line:44,"신뢰 탭에서 비공개 진술 보호, 감정 안정화를 사용해보세요. 압박만으로는 나오지 않는 진실이 있습니다.",Use private statement protection and emotional stabilization in the Trust tab. Some truths will not surface through pressure alone.,信頼タブで非公開供述の保護や感情の安定化を使ってみましょう。圧迫だけでは出てこない真実があります。,可在信任页使用私密陈述保护和情绪稳定。有些真相仅靠施压不会浮现。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/layout/Tutorial.tsx,,line:51,판결 진입,Proceed to Verdict,判決へ進む,进入判决,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/layout/Tutorial.tsx,,line:52,"바로 판결할 수도 있고, 조건부 조정이나 일부 보류를 선택할 수도 있습니다. 미확정 쟁점이 있으면 더 심리할 수 있습니다.","You can issue a verdict now, choose conditional mediation, or defer part of the case. If any issue remains unresolved, you may examine it further.",すぐ判決を出すことも、条件付き調整や一部保留を選ぶこともできます。未確定の争点があれば、さらに審理できます。,你可以直接作出判决，也可以选择有条件调解或部分保留。若仍有未确定争议点，可继续审理。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
