,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/layout/Tutorial.tsx,,line:60,사실 인정 → 책임 배분 → 해결책 선택. 위법 증거를 판결 근거로 쓰면 권위 점수가 떨어집니다.,Find the facts → assign responsibility → choose a remedy. Using illegal evidence as grounds for a verdict will lower your Authority score.,事実認定 → 責任配分 → 解決策選択。違法な証拠を判決根拠に使うと、権威スコアが下がります。,认定事实 → 分配责任 → 选择解决方案。若将违法证据作为判决依据，权威分数会下降。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
