,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/pc/pcUiLabels.ts,,line:13,직접 충돌을 피하고 다른 맥락으로 비켜 가려는 성향입니다. 사실 확인 질문에 상대적으로 민감합니다.,A tendency to avoid direct conflict and sidestep into another context. Relatively sensitive to fact-checking questions.,直接衝突を避け、別の文脈へそらそうとする傾向です。事実確認の質問に比較的敏感です。,倾向于避开直接冲突，转向其他语境。对事实确认类问题相对敏感。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/pc/pcUiLabels.ts,,line:14,갈등 자체를 피하려하고 불편한 자리가 생기면 말을 줄이거나 결론부터 내리려는 경향이 있습니다.,"Tends to avoid conflict itself; when an uncomfortable scene arises, they speak less or jump straight to conclusions.",葛藤そのものを避け、不快な場になると口数を減らしたり結論から出そうとする傾向があります。,倾向于回避冲突本身；一旦出现不舒服的场面，就减少发言或先下结论。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/pc/pcUiLabels.ts,,line:15,지적을 받으면 공격적으로 반응하며 주도권을 빼앗기지 않으려는 성향입니다.,"When challenged, they react aggressively and try not to lose control.",指摘を受けると攻撃的に反応し、主導権を奪われまいとする傾向です。,被指出问题时会攻击性反应，并试图不失去主导权。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/pc/pcUiLabels.ts,,line:16,억울함과 상처를 앞세워 자신의 책임을 희석하려는 경향이 있습니다.,Tends to foreground grievance and hurt to dilute their own responsibility.,悔しさや傷を前面に出し、自分の責任を薄めようとする傾向があります。,倾向于把委屈和伤害摆在前面，以淡化自己的责任。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/pc/pcUiLabels.ts,,line:17,"감정보다 숫자, 순서, 기록을 앞세워 논리적으로 방어하려는 타입입니다.","A type that defends logically by putting numbers, sequence, and records ahead of emotion.",感情より数字、順序、記録を前面に出して論理的に防御しようとするタイプです。,比起情绪，更倾向于用数字、顺序和记录进行逻辑防御的类型。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
,hardcoded_source_literal,src/components/pc/pcUiLabels.ts,,line:18,"감정보다 숫자, 순서, 기록을 앞세워 논리적으로 방어하려는 타입입니다.","A type that defends logically by putting numbers, sequence, and records ahead of emotion.",感情より数字、順序、記録を前面に出して論理的に防御しようとするタイプです。,比起情绪，更倾向于用数字、顺序和记录进行逻辑防御的类型。,Visible Korean/CJK source literal outside i18n/data. Review whether it should move into i18n or remain developer-only.
